window.__LITE_PARTS__=window.__LITE_PARTS__||[];window.__LITE_PARTS__.push([{"t":"KTaO3（111）界面处二维电子气非线性霍尔效应的光致巨大增强","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516347?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The nonlinear Hall effect (NLHE), an emergent phenomenon in noncentrosymmetric systems, enables the generation of a transverse voltage without an external magnetic field through a second‐order electrical response. However, achieving a sizable NLHE signal remains a critical challenge for its application in frequency‐doubling and rectifying devices. Here, we report a light‐induced giant enhancement of the NLHE in the 2D electron gas (2DEG) at the CaZrO\n                    3\n                    /KTaO\n                    3\n                    (111) interface. Under illumination, the second harmonic Hall voltage increases substantially and undergoes a sign reversal. Correspondingly, the second‐order transverse conductivity (\n                    σ\n                    (2) yxx) increases by nearly five orders of magnitude, reaching 2.4 µm V\n                    −1\n                    Ω\n                    −1\n                    , while also reversing its sign. Scaling analysis identifies skew scattering as the dominant mechanism, which is highly tunable via optical gating. Photoexcitation pumps electrons from in‐gap states into the Ta 5\n                    d\n                    conduction band, generating high‐mobility photocarriers that increase the cubic scattering time (\n                    τ\n                    3\n                    ) and thereby, dramatically boost\n                    σ\n                    (2) yxx. First‐principles calculations further reveal that the Berry curvature triple changes sign as the Fermi level approaches the higher‐lying\n                    L\n                    z,+\n                    subbands, in the Ta 5\n                    d\n                    accounting for the observed sign reversal. Our work offers a new strategy to optically control the NLHE in oxide 2DEG systems, highlighting the tunability of nonlinear transport by optical excitation.","tp":"非线性霍尔","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究报道了KTaO3（111）界面CaZrO3/KTaO3异质结二维电子气中非线性霍尔效应（NLHE）的光致巨大增强。NLHE是非中心对称系统中的新兴现象，可通过二阶电响应在无外磁场下产生横向电压，但其信号强度仍是应用瓶颈。研究发现光照可大幅增强该效应，对倍频和整流器件的开发具有重要应用潜力。"},{"t":"利用MALDI质谱成像与机器学习逐层解析现当代与历史画作组成","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4427?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"质谱成像颜料分析","kp":["[方法]: MALDI质谱成像结合ML","[应用]: 艺术品逐层成分解析"],"dp":1,"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"绘画作品的逐层成分表征对理解艺术创作技法、保护修复及真伪鉴定至关重要。本研究将MALDI质谱成像技术与机器学习算法相结合，实现了对现代和历史绘画样品的逐层无损分析。该方法能够高空间分辨率地识别各层中有机与无机成分的分布，区分颜料、粘合剂和媒介剂的化学特征。机器学习的引入使数据处理自动化，大幅提高了复杂混合体系的解析效率，为文化遗产保护科学提供了突破性分析工具。","ot":"Layer-by-layer decoding of contemporary and historic painting composition using MALDI mass spectrometry imaging and mach","b":"Layer-by-layer characterization of modern and historic paintings is essential for understanding how an artwork was created and how it has changed over time. This information can reveal historical or societal insights, inform attribution and classification, and support preservation efforts. The determination of the identity, structure, and composition of art material remains challenging due to the complex, multilayered nature of paintings. These structures often contain mixtures of organic and inorganic components, with unknown in situ chemical interactions, that create cross-linked and chemically modified molecular networks and assemblies. In this work, we have developed a method with high chemical specificity to identify and map organic and inorganic components in modern and historic multilayered paint systems. Our approach achieves an unprecedented level of molecular detail using a single technique. In addition, we have designed the method for automated composition assignment of individual layer through high-resolution matrix-assisted laser desorption/ionization (MALDI) mass spectrometry imaging (MSI) and a dedicated composition prediction model."},{"t":"具有多逻辑电路的离子锁存储，由聚离子液体中的极性-偶极相互作用门控","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7512063?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In these studies, we developed a new generation of polymeric materials capable of electrical energy storage and forming higher‐than‐binary logic circuits. Under non‐equilibrium conditions, polar–dipolar interactions facilitate t\n                    ion‐lock\n                    energy storage by emplacement of cation–anion pairs along the aliphatic side groups. Maintaining their locations for extended times facilitates energy storage. These properties were obtained by polymerizing ionic liquid monomers composed of covalently attached dipolar aliphatic variable‐length spacers (S) and tails (T) on both sides of a cation‐ anion pairs, enabling cation–anion polarization and precise fixation. When an electric field (EF) is applied, polarization of ion pairs occurs, and the ratio of aliphatic S‐to‐T controls\n                    ion locking\n                    . The degree of polarization governs the energy storage beyond classical approximations, whereas ion–dipole, dipole‐induced dipole, and dipole–dipole coupling facilitate multi‐logic circuitry. Integrating these materials into multiple series, in parallel, or a combination thereof provides the opportunity for development of higher‐than‐binary logic systems with enhancedr information density and multi‐valued logic gates. Among others, these materials may find numerous applications in quantum computing, fuzzy logic, or modeling uncertainty, just to name a few.","tp":"离子液储能","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究开发了一代兼具电能存储和多逻辑电路功能的聚合物材料。在非平衡条件下，极性-偶极相互作用促进了离子锁型储能，通过在脂肪族侧链上安置阴阳离子对实现能量存储。保持离子位置可延长储能时间。这些聚离子液体材料具有形成高于二进制逻辑电路的能力，为新型储能器件和多态逻辑运算提供了创新思路。"},{"t":"界面自优化使水凝胶电解质中镁负极稳定运行","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72904?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系镁电池","kp":["[电解质]: 水凝胶电解质","[策略]: 界面自优化稳定镁负极"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"金属镁因其高体积能量密度和低成本被视为水系电池的理想负极材料，但镁负极在水系电解液中面临严重腐蚀和钝化问题。本研究提出界面自优化策略，利用水凝胶电解质原位构建稳定的界面保护层，有效抑制了镁负极的副反应和钝化。水凝胶电解质兼具离子传导性和界面调节功能，使镁负极在水系体系中实现稳定循环。该策略为开发高能量密度、低成本的水系镁电池提供了可行性验证，推动了大规模储能电池的技术进步。","ot":"Interphase Self‐Optimization Enables Stable Magnesium Anode in Hydrogel Electrolyte","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Magnesium metal is a promising anode material for high‐energy and cost‐effective aqueous batteries, but the issue associated with corrosion reaction and surface passivation is more severe than the commonly studied metals such as Zn. Current strategies either rely on aggressively dissolving corrosion products with the sacrifice of active metal or attempt to suppress passivation with limited effect. In this work, a dynamic evolution of a self‐optimized interphase on the Mg anode surface is triggered through formulating a tridentate chelant and MgCl\n                    2\n                    based hydrogel electrolyte. At the anode‐electrolyte interface, chelant‐mediated solvation mitigates the water‐induced parasitic reactions, kinetically enabling a complete conversion of the MgO byproduct into a magnesium oxychloride interphase. This interphase is dynamic stable and Mg\n                    2+\n                    ‐conductive, rendering reversible Mg plating/stripping for over 600 h at 0.1 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    in symmetric cells. Furthermore, 2 V‐class hybrid cells by paring the Mg anode with three different cathodes show stable charges and discharges up to 500 cycles (capacity retention is 69%).","aip":1},{"t":"无机磷酸盐与神经元代谢能量的快速动员","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602529123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Neurons experience brief, intense periods of energy demand when they are excited, but how they rapidly coordinate energy expenditure with production is incompletely understood. Part of the difficulty has been measuring the levels of molecules involved in this metabolic response with spatiotemporal precision in single live cells. Here, we engineered a quantitative fluorescent biosensor to monitor cytosolic inorganic phosphate (P\n                    i\n                    ), a fundamental component of energy metabolism that has a classically proposed but largely neglected role in activating glycolysis. Using two-photon fluorescence lifetime imaging, we observed millimolar increases in P\n                    i\n                    within seconds of stimulating mouse neurons both ex vivo and in vivo. Drawing on results from metabolic modeling, biosensor imaging, and enzymology, we argue that P\n                    i\n                    is a sensitive reporter of energy usage that potently links metabolic energy supply with demand in neurons. Quantitative live-cell imaging of P\n                    i\n                    should be a valuable approach for studying bioenergetics more generally."},{"t":"原住民主权和加拿大精准医疗计划的局限性","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-71192-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"灭活SnRK1β1A可促进水稻广谱抗病性","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10273-5","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Rice is a staple crop for more than half of the world’s population, and its sustainable production is vital to ensure global food security. However, rice is susceptible to several devastating fungal diseases1, including blast disease caused by Magnaporthe oryzae, sheath blight by Rhizoctonia solani, false smut by Ustilaginoidea virens, brown spot by Bipolaris oryzae, bakanae by Fusarium fujikuroi and head blight by Fusarium graminearum. The mechanisms underlying the susceptibility to these fungal diseases remain unclear. Here we report that the β subunit of SnRK1, SnRK1β1A, confers broad-spectrum susceptibility to these fungal diseases. Our findings show that diverse rice fungal pathogens have convergently evolved an effector-like protein, Gas2, which interacts with SnRK1β1A to prevent its ubiquitination-mediated degradation and promotes its nuclear translocation. SnRK1β1A is markedly induced on fungal infection, promoting susceptibility by inhibiting SnRK1α1, an α subunit of SnRK1 known to positively regulate broad-spectrum resistance in rice2. Notably, rice lines with disrupted SnRK1β1A are resistant to several fungal diseases without compromising growth and yield in the field under normal farming conditions. This study demonstrates that broad-spectrum disease resistance in crops can be achieved by disrupting inducible susceptibility genes whose encoded proteins are targeted by effectors conserved across several pathogens.","tp":"水稻抗病性","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究发现灭活水稻中的SnRK1β1A基因可促进广谱抗病性。水稻是超过半数世界人口的主食，但易受稻瘟病、纹枯病、假黑穗病、褐斑病、恶苗病和赤霉病等多种毁灭性真菌病害侵袭。研究揭示了SnRK1β1A在调控水稻对这些真菌病害易感性中的关键作用，为培育广谱抗病水稻品种提供了新靶点，对保障全球粮食安全具有重要意义。","aip":1},{"t":"传感器内加密签名生成，用于链接物理过程和不可变的数字实体","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01593-5","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","b":"Data forgery and manipulation can undermine trust in areas ranging from science to journalism. Artificial intelligence will probably exacerbate this problem, degrading our ability to distinguish between artificially created data and real recordings (such as those taken with a video camera). Here we report a recording device technology that establishes a cryptographic link between a physical process (the act of recording) and an immutable digital entity (such as an entry in a public blockchain). Our approach relies on a monolithic cryptographic sensor that integrates a sensor device with a hashing unit (that continuously hashes pieces of recorded data) and a cryptographic signature unit (that signs the hashes using a public key encryption scheme). The system then uploads the signed hashes to a trusted public repository. We provide a proof-of-concept implementation with a voltage sensor for extracellular recording of cardiac myocyte field potentials that is fabricated using 180-nm complementary metal–oxide–semiconductor technology.","tp":"传感防伪造","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究报道了一种能在物理过程（如录像行为）与不可变数字实体（如区块链条目）之间建立密码学链接的记录设备技术。通过在传感器内部生成加密签名，将数据采集过程与不可篡改的数字记录绑定，可有效防范数据伪造和篡改。在AI深度伪造日益泛滥、真假数据难以区分的背景下，该技术对维护科学、新闻等领域的数据可信度具有重要价值。"},{"t":"将镧系发光体植入螺旋骨架实现可编程圆偏振发光","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9901177?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镧系圆偏振发光材料","kp":["[策略]: 超分子螯合植入螺旋骨架","[目标]: 可编程圆偏振发光"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"将非手性发光体整合到手性超分子螺旋结构中，是获得强圆偏振发光（CPL）的有前途路径。该研究将镧系发光体植入螺旋分子支架中，通过螺旋骨架的手性环境诱导非手性镧系离子产生可编程的圆偏振发光信号。镧系元素具有窄带发射和长荧光寿命特性，结合螺旋支架的手性调控能力，实现了发光不对称因子和CPL信号的精准可编程控制，在三维显示、信息加密和手性光子器件领域具有应用潜力。","ot":"Implanting Lanthanide Luminophores Into Helical Scaffolds for Programmable Circularly Polarized Luminescence","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Integrating achiral luminophores into chiral supramolecular helices represents a promising route to strong circularly polarized luminescence (CPL). However, for lanthanide systems, efficient emitter loading and effective chirality induction remain challenging due to weak host–guest interactions and the shielded nature of 4f electrons. Herein, we report a supramolecular chelation strategy that implants Eu\n                    3+\n                    emitters into pre‑assembled helical nanoribbons (HNRs), enabling efficient chirality induction and tunable CPL brightness. Two cholesterol–terpyridine conjugates, differing only in their linker chemistry (ester vs. carbonate), demonstrate that the ester linker promotes long‑range chirality induction and HNR formation, whereas the carbonate counterpart yields achiral aggregates. Moreover, the assembly sequence is crucial: pre‑formation of the helical scaffold preserves the non‑covalent network necessary for effective chirality induction, whereas prior metal coordination introduces steric hindrance that disrupts chiral order. The resulting systems exhibit orthogonal luminescence responses: Eu\n                    3+\n                    ‑loaded assemblies are humidity‑sensitive but thermally stable, while\n                    β\n                    ‑diketonate‑shielded analogues are temperature‑responsive yet humidity‑resistant, allowing multi‑level information encryption. By introducing this modular “assemble‑then‑coordinate” approach, we provide new insights into supramolecular chirality induction and open avenues toward advanced, stimulus‑responsive CPL materials."},{"t":"技术创新和正式制度对可再生能源转型的影响","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001540?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"可再生转型","sc":2.1,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"免疫细胞分析揭示抗 GAD65 相关神经系统综合征中干细胞样记忆 T 细胞的扩增","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514753123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The immunopathogenesis of autoimmune neurological syndromes (AINS) with antibodies against the 65 kDa isoform of glutamic acid decarboxylase (anti-GAD65 AINS) remains poorly understood. To elucidate underlying disease mechanisms and identify relevant cell populations, we performed single-cell RNA and immune repertoire sequencing of cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) and peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) of eight anti-GAD65 AINS individuals compared to eight noninflammatory controls. In addition, PBMCs from 19 anti-GAD65 AINS individuals and 20 healthy controls were analyzed by multidimensional flow cytometry, and brain tissue specimens from four anti-GAD65 AINS individuals were examined histologically. We detected higher frequencies of stem cell–like memory T cells (TSCM) within the PBMCs and a marked enrichment and clonal expansion of activated CD4\n                    +\n                    TSCM in the CSF of anti-GAD65 AINS individuals. Expanded T cells exhibited increased expression of proinflammatory genes. Histological analyses confirmed intraparenchymal CD8\n                    +\n                    TSCM in three of four anti-GAD65 AINS individuals and rare meningeal/intraparenchymal CD4\n                    +\n                    TSCM in one person. Although CSF B cell receptors (BCRs) displayed little to no clonal expansion, recombinant expression of 40 CSF BCRs revealed that 25% were GAD65-reactive with increased somatic hypermutations compared to non-GAD65-reactive BCRs. These findings further support the concept of an antigen-specific intrathecal immune response. In summary, we characterize the immune landscape of anti-GAD65 AINS at single-cell resolution and identify clonally expanded TSCM with cytotoxic properties as a hallmark of this disease.","tp":"自免神经炎","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":4.0},"as":"针对抗GAD65相关自身免疫性神经系统综合征的病理机制，研究团队对患者的脑脊液和外周血进行了单细胞RNA测序及免疫 repertoire 分析。结果发现，患者体内干细胞样记忆T细胞出现了显著扩增。这一重要发现揭示了细胞免疫在抗GAD65免疫综合征致病过程中的关键驱动作用，为深入理解该罕见神经系统疾病的发病机制提供了重要的新视角。"},{"t":"水力-扭转致密化技术规模化生产高密度双螺旋纳米结构芳纶纳米纤维线","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72889?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"芳纶纳米纤维线材","kp":["[工艺]: 水致扭转压实","[结构]: 致密双螺旋纳米结构","[材料]: 芳纶纳米纤维"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究提出了一种水致扭转压实（Hydro-Torsional Compaction）工艺，用于规模化生产芳纶纳米纤维线材。该方法通过模拟蜘蛛丝等生物材料的自组装原理，实现了密集组装的双螺旋纳米结构。芳纶纳米纤维凭借极高的力学强度和韧性备受关注，但规模化连续化生产一直是瓶颈。该工艺将纳米纤维在湿态下通过扭转压实形成连续纤维束，双螺旋组装显著提升了分子间相互作用和应力传递效率，使纤维同时具备高强度和高韧性。该成果为高性能纤维材料的生物启发制造提供了新路径。","ot":"Hydro‐Torsional Compaction for Scalable Production of Aramid Nanofiber Threads with Densely Assembled Double‐Helical Nan","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Synthetic replication of biological materials like spider silk, cellulose, and collagen remains challenging owing to the entropic cost of aligning high‐aspect‐ratio chains into compact, load‐bearing structures. These barriers cause misalignment, voids, and poor inter‐fiber cohesion in macroscale materials. We report a scalable strategy for producing high‐strength thread from poly(2,2′‐disulfonyl‐4,4′‐benzidine terephthalamide) (PBDT), a rigid‐chain aramid that forms double‐helical supramolecular units, which further organize into nanofiber networks. Continuous PBDT threads are fabricated while retaining the solution‐phase double‐helix structure, enabling production over hundreds of meters. These nanofibers are processed into macroscale threads through wet‐spinning and hydro‐torsional compaction, which promotes densification and enhances inter‐fiber contact. This hierarchical processing sequence yields compact, aligned fibers with improved structural coherence, supporting efficient interfacial load transfer and resulting in a tensile strength of 1.2 GPa and a Young's modulus of 103 GPa, corresponding to 5.8‐fold and 6.3‐fold improvements over bulk PBDT films, respectively. Among synthetic nanofibrous materials assembled in aqueous media, these threads demonstrate superior mechanical properties, with tensile strengths approaching those of spider silk. This study establishes a scalable framework for constructing high‐strength, hierarchically organized aramid threads for aligned, robust architectures, ion‐mediated transport pathways, and charged bioinspired systems."},{"t":"氢键有机框架用于NADH再生与酶促加氢：HOF-in-HOF人工光合作用系统","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8868255?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢键有机框架人工光合","kp":["[框架材料]: 氢键有机框架HOF-in-HOF","[仿生系统]: 酶-光-膜耦合人工光合","[功能]: NADH再生与酶促加氢"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究设计了氢键有机框架（HOFs）材料，用于NADH再生和酶促氢化反应，构建了HOF-in-HOF的人工光合作用系统。人工光合作用的关键不仅在于催化剂本身的效率，还在于光捕获、电荷分离和底物传递的时空协同。该HOF-in-HOF嵌套结构通过氢键自组装形成分级孔道，在空间上分离光催化NADH再生位点与酶催化反应位点，实现辅酶的高效原位循环。该仿生体系模拟了自然界光合作用中光反应与暗反应的偶联机制，为太阳能驱动的绿色化学合成提供了高效的人工光合平台。","ot":"Hydrogen‐Bonded Organic Frameworks (HOFs) for NADH Regeneration and Enzymatic Hydrogenation: HOF‐in‐HOF Artificial Photo","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The efficiency of artificial photosynthesis lies not only in the catalysts themselves, but also in the spatiotemporal landscape for efficient mass–energy coupling, which is governed by electron, proton, and molecule transfer. Herein, we propose a scaffold engineering strategy to construct an enzyme–photo–membrane coupled artificial photosynthetic system (\n                    epm\n                    CAPS) within HOF‐in‐HOF architecture for NADH regeneration and enzymatic hydrogenation, where enzyme‐loaded HOF particles for substrate conversion are encapsulated within photocatalytic HOF capsular membranes for cofactor regeneration. This unique configuration enables independent and synergistic regulation of electron, proton, and NADH transfer by modulating the electronic structure of the capsule (via benzene ring units), proton relay (via carboxylate group density), and mass diffusion path (via enzyme–photocatalyst distance), respectively. The system achieves a record initial NADH regeneration rate of 28.23 ± 0.62 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    with a 22.13% apparent quantum yield. When applied to solar‐driven lactate synthesis, the\n                    epm\n                    CAPS achieves a solar‐to‐chemical conversion efficiency of 7.27 ± 0.34%—a nearly threefold higher than previous records. Furthermore, we demonstrate the generality of this platform by synthesizing a spectrum of C\n                    1\n                    –C\n                    6\n                    chemicals, including methanol and mannitol, while maintaining stable operation for over 6 h. Our work delivers a blueprint for the next‐generation artificial photosynthetic systems for sustainable energy and green chemical production.","aip":1},{"t":"全共轭多共振热激活延迟荧光框架内的杂化电荷转移窗口","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72861?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多重共振TADF材料","kp":["[材料]: 多共振TADF框架","[策略]: 全共轭电荷转移窗口杂化","[目标]: 蓝光OLED超快反向系间窜越"],"dp":1,"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究在全共轭多共振（MR）热活化延迟荧光（TADF）材料框架内，设计了一种杂化电荷转移窗口策略。MR-TADF材料以窄带发射著称，是实现高色纯度OLED显示的关键发光材料。传统MR-TADF面临反向系间窜越速率与发光效率之间的权衡难题。该工作通过在全共轭分子骨架中引入杂化电荷转移通道，优化了单线态与三线态之间的能级耦合，在不牺牲窄发射特性的前提下提升了延迟荧光组分的贡献。该策略为开发超高清显示器用高效率、高色纯度发光材料提供了分子设计新思路。","ot":"Hybridized Charge‐Transfer Window within a Fully Conjugated Multi‐Resonance Thermally Activated Delayed Fluorescence Fra","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Multi‐Resonance (MR) thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF) materials, featuring narrow band emission and high efficiency, are being utilized in blue organic light‐emitting diode (OLED) applications. However, compared to conventional donor–acceptor (D–A) type TADF emitters, these molecules exhibit relatively large singlet‐triplet energy gaps and slow reverse intersystem crossing (RISC) rates, indicating the need for further research to overcome these limitations. Herein, we designed deep blue MR‐TADF molecules by integrating intramolecular short‐range charge transfer and long‐range charge transfer to minimize the singlet‐triplet energy gap and accelerate the RISC rate through hybridized excited states maintaining a narrow emission bandwidth. Compared with conventional MR‐TADF molecules emitting only by short‐range charge transfer, the new MR‐TADF molecule is differentiated in that intramolecular long‐range charge transfer within the polyaromatic hydrocarbon framework additionally contributes to the emission process along with short‐range charge transfer for accelerated RISC. As a result, the\n                    \n                      bf\n                      DOB‐BN2\n                    \n                    MR‐TADF emitter exhibited narrow blue emission at 447 nm with a narrow full width at half maximum (FWHM) of 20 nm, a small singlet‐triplet energy gap of 0.04 eV, and an ultrafast RISC rate of 2.1 × 10\n                    6\n                    s\n                    −\n                    1\n                    . In a blue TADF OLED device, the new TADF molecule showed a high external quantum efficiency of 37.5% with color coordinates (0.139 and 0.065)."},{"t":"如何构建AI科学家：首篇同行评审论文揭示关键秘诀","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00899-w","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI科学家系统","kp":["[主题]: 首篇同行评审AI科学家论文"],"sc":8.2,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":6.0,"r":7.5,"d":5.0,"t":8.5},"aip":1,"as":"","ot":"How to build an AI Scientist: first peer-reviewed paper spills the secrets"},{"t":"霍夫迈斯特效应辅助水凝胶：面向下一代功能材料的理性工程化设计","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00041-X?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"观点评论","tp":"霍夫迈斯特水凝胶","kp":["[调控原理]: 霍夫迈斯特效应(离子特异性)","[材料]: 智能响应水凝胶"],"sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.5},"as":"综述聚焦利用Hofmeister效应（离子特异性效应）理性设计新一代功能水凝胶材料。Hofmeister效应描述了不同离子对高分子水合、聚集行为产生差异化影响的物理现象。通过调控离子种类与浓度，可精确编程水凝胶的机械强度、溶胀动力学、自修复及刺激响应等性能。该策略为智能软材料在药物递送、柔性电子、组织工程等领域的应用提供了新范式，具备从基础研究向工程化转化的潜力。","ot":"Hofmeister effect-assisted hydrogels: Rational engineering for next-generation functional materials","b":"This review highlights the Hofmeister effect as a powerful, ion-specific tool to program next-generation hydrogels. By rationally selecting ions, researchers can dynamically tune mechanical, electrical, and environmental resistance properties without relying on static chemical crosslinks. These advances enable intelligent, adaptive hydrogels for emerging applications in iontronics, biomedicine, and sustainable engineering, bridging fundamental colloid science with the design of high-performance, multifunctional soft materials."},{"t":"SWOT 显示南极洲周围的高沿海涡流活动","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag181/8539739?rss=1","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"Antarctic marginal seas are crucial for the global climate, but direct observations, especially of mesoscale ocean eddies, remain scarce. Here, by analyzing the unprecedented high-resolution sea surface height data provided by the recently launched Surface Water and Ocean Topography (SWOT) satellite, we reveal for the first time a widespread presence of mesoscale eddies across the Antarctic continental shelf. The geographic distributions of the observed eddies, along with eddy-resolving model simulations, support the hypothesis that ice shelf basal melting and dense shelf water formation are key processes driving the prevalent eddy activity. Our findings highlight the potential of innovative satellite measurements for monitoring critical Antarctic oceanic processes, and the need to resolve the abundant Antarctic ocean eddies in climate models.","tp":"卫星测涡流","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用新发射的SWOT（地表水与海洋地形）卫星提供的前所未有高分辨率海面高度数据，首次揭示了南极大陆架上中尺度涡流的广泛存在。此前对南极边缘海直接观测尤其是中尺度海洋涡流极为匮乏。涡流的地理分布及涡流解析模型结果为理解南极海洋环流的能量输送和全球气候影响提供了关键观测证据。"},{"t":"通过d-p轨道耦合修复断裂的S─S键以实现耐用镁电池","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1371160?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镁硫电池","kp":["[电池类型]: 可充镁电池","[机制]: d-p轨道耦合修复S-S键","[挑战]: 硫族化物正极结构不可逆演化"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"可充电镁电池因镁资源丰富、安全且理论容量高，被视为大规模储能的重要方向，但循环过程中正极材料的结构退化制约了其寿命。本研究提出通过d-p轨道耦合机制修复放电过程中断裂的S-S键的策略，稳定了硫基正极的结构完整性。该机制在充放电循环中动态重建化学键，显著提升镁电池的循环耐久性，为开发长寿命、低成本镁硫电池体系提供了新思路，有望推动多价离子电池的实用化。","ot":"Healing Broken S─S Bonds via d‐p Orbital Coupling for Durable Magnesium Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Rechargeable Mg batteries hold great promise for large‐scale energy storage due to the abundance, safety, and high theoretical capacity of the metallic Mg anode. However, their development is hampered by the irreversible structural evolution of chalcogenide cathodes, which originates from the inability to reform broken S─S bonds during charging. Here, we identify this irreversibility mechanism and propose an innovative\n                    d\n                    ‐\n                    p\n                    orbital coupling strategy to address it. Using CuS as a model system, we demonstrate that introducing high‐covalency Mo─S bonds via Mo 4\n                    d\n                    ‐S 3\n                    p\n                    coupling enables precise regulation of the electronic structure, thereby facilitating the reversible breaking and reconstruction of S─S bonds. This orbital‐level optimization yields a breakthrough in Mg‐storage performance, including a high reversible capacity (356 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 100 mA g\n                    −1\n                    ), exceptional rate capability (166 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 1 A g\n                    −1\n                    ), and outstanding cycling stability (84.6% capacity retention after 3000 cycles). The material also exhibits remarkable performance under high loadings, across a wide temperature range (−20 to 60°C), and in durable pouch cells. Crucially, this\n                    d\n                    ‐\n                    p\n                    orbital coupling strategy is universally applicable to various transition metals, providing a general design paradigm for high‐energy‐density rechargeable Mg battery cathodes.","aip":1},{"t":"利用柔性金属有机框架中吸附质-吸附剂协同适应性实现可切换烃类分离","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee4346?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性MOF烃类分离","kp":["[机制]: 吸附质-吸附剂协同适应","[材料]: 柔性镉基MOF Flex-Cd-MOF-3","[应用]: 可切换烃类分离"],"dp":1,"as":"脂肪族伯胺是药物、精细化学品和功能材料的关键中间体，传统合成方法依赖高压氨化和有毒试剂，条件苛刻。本研究开发了锰催化体系，实现了脂肪醇直接氨基化一步转化为伯胺的高效反应。该催化策略利用廉价丰产的锰催化剂，在温和条件下完成C-N键构建，避免了过量还原和副产物生成，具有原子经济性高、选择性好的优势，为绿色合成伯胺类化合物提供了实用路径，在医药和化工领域有广阔应用前景。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Harnessing cooperative sorbate-sorbent adaptation in a flexible metal-organic framework for switchable hydrocarbon separ","b":"The pursuit of selective adsorption for separating molecules with similar shapes and interactions remains a formidable challenge. This work harnesses a powerful, previously unrecognized mechanism in a flexible metal-organic framework (Flex-Cd-MOF-3) to achieve switchable adsorption selectivity. Specifically, Flex-Cd-MOF-3, a descendant of Flex-Cd-MOF-2 with increased linker rigidity and functionalization, exhibits both local rearrangements and reversible framework expansion or shrinkage, showing phase-dependent propylene/propane selectivity. Considering propane, mutually beneficial conformational changes in the material and sorbate co-occur that are not possible with rigid propylene, reshaping the energy landscapes. These distinct interaction mechanisms, for otherwise very similar molecules, directly lead to pore swelling and shrinking at different pressures and phase switchable selectivity. An innovative modeling approach was developed that describes the full desorption pathway, explaining the relative binding energies and the sorbate-dependent mechanism of pore shrinkage. This work establishes cooperative sorbate-sorbent adaptation as a generalizable adsorption mechanism for achieving precise separation of similar molecules through distinct intermolecular interactions."},{"t":"利用靶向光动力疗法协同激活多发性骨髓瘤中的 T 细胞和 NK 细胞反应 (A","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72676?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Targeted Therapy Synergistically Activates T and NK Cells This cover illustrates a targeted photodynamic therapy system synergistically activating T cell and NK cell responses in multiple myeloma. A dual-acceptor AIE photosensitizer is engineered into antibody-guided nanotherapeutics for highly precise multiple myeloma targeting. Photoactivation orchestrates synergistic adaptive–innate immunity by inducing ICD, DNA damage–driven MICA/B upregulation, and robust activation of patient-derived T and NK cells. This dual-pronged nanoimmunotherapy overcomes the immunosuppressive myeloma niche and offers a powerful strategy for next-generation cancer treatment. More details can be found in the Research Article by Zhaoyun Liu, Rong Fu, Ji Qi, and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202518663)."},{"t":"使用可穿戴手腕成像进行手部追踪","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01594-4","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"The human hand is dexterous and versatile, allowing it to interact with physical and virtual environments. The ability to track hand movements during daily activities could be of use in the development of spatial computing, virtual and augmented reality, robotics and prosthetics. However, current techniques based on cameras, strain and inertial sensors, and electromyography sensors have limited view angles and hand positions, have constrained hand activities and sensations, and can track only discrete hand gestures, respectively. Here we report a fully integrated, wireless and wearable ultrasound imaging wristband that is combined with an artificial intelligence algorithm. The wristband can continuously track arbitrary hand configurations of the five fingers and the palm in real time during daily activities with a delay of less than 120 ms. We show that the wristband can be used for intuitive and versatile controls in virtual-reality and robotic-hand applications.","tp":"可穿戴手部追踪","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种基于可穿戴手腕成像的手部追踪技术。人手灵巧多功能，追踪日常手部运动对空间计算、VR/AR、机器人和假肢开发有重要意义。现有基于摄像头、应变传感器、惯性传感器和肌电图的技术存在视角有限、手部活动受限等问题。该手腕成像方案通过手腕处佩戴的成像设备实现手部运动的连续追踪，拓展了手势交互的应用场景。"},{"t":"HairTime：一种从单个头发样本估算昼夜节律阶段的无创测定法","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514928123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Circadian clocks govern daily physiological and behavioral processes and are crucial for health; disruptions can lead to various diseases. The circadian phase of entrainment—the phase of the internal circadian clock in relation to external environmental cycles—is influenced by both genetic and environmental factors, varies between individuals, and is reflected in daily behaviors such as sleep–wake patterns, cognitive performance, and physical activity. While circadian phase may also fluctuate within individuals, the dynamics and extent of such variation in daily life remain largely unexplored. The gold standard for circadian phase assessment, dim-light melatonin onset (DLMO), is impractical for large-scale studies, and blood-based molecular biomarkers, while promising, are limited in feasibility. To address these challenges, we developed HairTime, a noninvasive assay that estimates circadian phase from a single daytime hair sample. Developed and evaluated in two steps—a training and a validation study—HairTime demonstrated strong predictive power compared to DLMO. Suitable for large-scale studies, it was assessed using over 4,000 samples. Circadian phase estimations showed a normal distribution and were associated with age, sex, and notably, work schedules, with earlier timing on workdays, suggesting that societal factors can modulate internal rhythms. Together, these findings establish HairTime as a promising tool for assessing circadian phase in research and lay the foundation for future applications in personalized chronotherapy."},{"t":"通过等价的生态和进化动力学的全局稳定性","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534915123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The replicator and the Generalized Lotka–Volterra equations are closely related, foundational models in evolutionary game theory and community ecology, respectively. The concept of evolutionary stability and its relationship with dynamic stability has received significant attention: In the replicator equation, an evolutionarily stable strategy is also dynamically globally stable—i.e., will be reached by any trajectory originating from positive conditions. Intriguingly, the converse is not true: There are replicator equations yielding dynamically stable strategies that are not evolutionarily stable. Here, we consider two classes of equivalence (i.e., transformations that do not alter the qualitative dynamics) for the replicator equation, to determine whether a globally stable, but not evolutionarily stable strategy maps into an equivalent state that is evolutionarily stable—and show that this is the case for the examples that have been put forward so far. We derive the same two classes of equivalence for the Generalized Lotka–Volterra model, obtaining the same conditions for stability as for the replicator equation, and show that in this way we can characterize stability when other methods fail. By unifying the approach to proving stability for the replicator equation and Lotka–Volterra models, we bring these foundational equations even closer together."},{"t":"地缘政治紧张局势导致中国重新考虑研究合作","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00426-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"欧洲早期狗的基因组历史","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10112-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The earliest morphologically identifiable dogs are from Europe and date to at least 14,000 years ago1,2,3,4,5, although early remains are also found in other regions. The origin of early dogs in Europe, and their relationships to other dogs, has remained elusive in the absence of genome-wide data. Similarly, although dogs were the only domestic animal to predate agriculture, little is known about how the arrival of Neolithic farmers from Southwest Asia affected the dogs living with European Mesolithic hunter-gatherers. Here we analysed 216 canid remains, including 181 from Palaeolithic and Mesolithic Europe. We developed a genome-wide capture approach that enriched endogenous DNA by 10–100-fold and could distinguish dog from wolf ancestry for 141 of 216 remains. The oldest dog data that we recovered are from a 14,200-year-old dog from the Kesslerloch site in Switzerland, and we find that it shares ancestry with later worldwide dogs—inconsistent with the hypothesis that European Upper Palaeolithic dogs derived wholly from a separate domestication process. The Kesslerloch dog already displays more affinity to Mesolithic, Neolithic and present-day European dogs than to Asian dogs, demonstrating that dog genetic diversification had started well before 14,200 years ago. We find a Neolithic influx of Southwest Asian ancestry into Europe, but this seems to have been of smaller magnitude than in humans, suggesting that Mesolithic dogs contributed substantially to Neolithic, and, ultimately, probably also modern, European dogs."},{"t":"家禽生产中沙门氏菌和弯曲杆菌的基因组流行病学：量化初级细菌的贡献","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536554123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The US broiler production system processes over 9.3 billion chickens annually through a highly integrated pyramid structure where two primary breeding companies supply genetic stock to approximately 40 major integrators operating nationwide. To provide a quantitative, system-wide estimate of contamination origins, I analyzed whole-genome sequences from\n                    \n                      Salmonella\n                    \n                    and\n                    \n                      Campylobacter\n                    \n                    isolates collected from over 800 processing facilities as part of the United States Department of Agriculture’s Food Safety Inspection Service verification sampling (2019-2025). Single-linkage clustering identified isolates sharing common origins (≤2, 4, or 8 SNPs genome-wide), which were categorized by processing complex, company, and geographical distributions to infer contamination sources. Among the isolates analyzed, 78% of\n                    \n                      Campylobacter\n                    \n                    , 77% of non-Enteritidis\n                    \n                      Salmonella\n                    \n                    , and 96% of\n                    \n                      Salmonella\n                    \n                    Enteritidis belonged to clusters spanning multiple companies and geographic regions—a pattern consistent with primary breeder origin. The geographic spread of Enteritidis isolates within clusters matched a random model, and cluster populations showed temporal turnover yet spatial synchrony—patterns explicable only by contamination from the apex of the breeding pyramid.\n                    \n                      Campylobacter\n                    \n                    showed regional clustering implying sources at lower levels of the breeding pyramid. Cluster persistence exceeded multiple production cycles (median &gt;4 y for\n                    \n                      Campylobacter\n                    \n                    , &gt;4.5 y for 75% of Enteritidis isolates), indicating stable contamination reservoirs upstream of processing. These results demonstrate that the primary breeders are a major source of broiler contamination and suggest that upstream interventions targeting breeding stock, in particular for Enteritidis, may represent an efficient strategy for further reducing clinical cases of foodborne illness."},{"t":"GFAP+ FOXF2+ 室管膜细胞在神经损伤后通过 DLL4-NOTCH 信号促进血脑屏障修复","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520352123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Ependymal cells in the adult ventricular-subventricular zone are increasingly recognized for functions extending beyond cerebrospinal fluid dynamics; however, their identity and functional specialization remain incompletely understood. While ependymal cells (EP) have been implicated in interactions with the stem cell niche and the vasculature, their role in repair processes following neural injury remains elusive. In this study, we employed region-specific single-cell transcriptomics of the subventricular zone (SVZ) and ipsilesional peri-infarct territory in mice to identify a distinct subpopulation of GFAP\n                    +\n                    FOXF2\n                    +\n                    EP that selectively expand within the SVZ after neural injury. Notably, these cells were absent from other brain regions. Immunohistochemical validation revealed characteristic ependymal features, including typical pinwheel architecture and expression of Foxj1 and β-catenin. Furthermore, the absence of the proliferation marker Ki67 and the resistance of this subpopulation to Ara-C-mediated ablation indicate that these cells do not possess proliferative properties. Conditional deletion of\n                    Foxf2\n                    in GFAP\n                    +\n                    cells led to impaired endothelial junction integrity and increased blood–brain barrier (BBB) permeability. In contrast, overexpression of\n                    Foxf2\n                    via GFAP promoter-driven adeno-associated virus delivery enhanced vascular repair and facilitated functional recovery. Mechanistically, these GFAP\n                    +\n                    FOXF2\n                    +\n                    EP secrete exosomal DLL4, which was associated with enhanced NOTCH pathway activity and restoration of BBB function. While the mechanism linking this limited cell population to the broad reparative effect, particularly the complete signaling amplification cascade, remains to be fully elucidated, these findings identify a subset of EP that contributes to BBB repair."},{"t":"人类新皮质在整个生命周期中的功能层次","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10219-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Large-scale gradients of functional connectivity between brain areas organize the human neocortex, linking brain topography to the texture of cognition1,2. In adults, three dominant axes—sensory–association, visual–somatosensory and modulation–representation—run, respectively, from primary sensory to transmodal association areas, from visual to body-centred systems and from control and attention networks to default mode and sensory areas1,2,3,4. These gradients provide a compact description of large-scale cortical hierarchies that underlie distinct modes of information processing. However, how these gradients and their multiscale biological and cognitive correlates evolve across the lifespan is unknown. Here we establish a continuous normative reference of functional organization from birth to 100 years of age, revealing complex, nonlinear developmental trajectories. Gradient architecture is anchored by primary sensory systems in infancy, differentiates along association and control axes during childhood and adolescence and gradually dedifferentiates during ageing. The importance of this functional architecture is corroborated by biology and behaviour: gradient metrics predict cognitive performance across development; structure–function coupling varies by axis and age; and distinct transcriptomic signatures are strongest early in life and weaken with age, consistent with a transient genetic scaffold for gradient architecture. Our lifespan gradients unify diverse research into developmental brain connectivity and provide a shared multimodal reference for future studies."},{"t":"超态 TRPC3 变体的功能和结构基础","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec9284?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cerebellar ataxias are characterized by impaired motor coordination resulting from neuronal dysfunction within the cerebellum. The mechanisms underlying this pathology and its cerebellar-specific neurodegeneration remain unknown. We uncover how a gain-of-function canonical transient receptor potential member 3 (TRPC3) mutation, coupled with a cerebellum-specific isoform, stabilizes the channel’s open state, resists the leading inhibitor Pyr3, and drives calcium-dependent cell death. Restoring calcium homeostasis by expressing a Purkinje cell calcium pump improves cell viability. Transgenic expression of the TRPC3 hypermorphic variant in\n                    Caenorhabditis elegans\n                    induces neurodegeneration, confirming its pathogenicity across species. Cryo–electron microscopy and molecular simulations reveal the structural basis for the stabilization of the cerebellar-specific TRPC3 variant in its open state and uncover a druggable allosteric inhibitory binding site. These findings provide an explanation for the vulnerability of cerebellar neurons in TRPC3-associated ataxias and highlight a site for therapeutic intervention."},{"t":"BiVO4光催化的第一性原理研究：电子结构、晶面各向异性与界面工程","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003582?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"BiVO4光催化","kp":["[材料]: BiVO4光催化","[研究方法]: 第一性原理电子结构"],"dp":1,"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","ot":"First-principles perspectives on BiVO4 photocatalysis: electronic structure, facet anisotropy, and interface engineering"},{"t":"第一个大脑组织图谱显示了一生的发展","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00975-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"不同强度和价态的 Fab-Fc 和 Fab-Fab 相互作用导致 IgG1 的高浓度粘度","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526550123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The variable domains in Fab regions are well-established contributors to high concentration viscosity of IgG, primarily through charge and hydrophobic interactions. In contrast, the roles of the Fc and the number of self-interacting sites (valency) are less well understood. Here, we investigate the relative contributions of Fab–Fab and Fab–Fc interactions to high concentration viscosity for a diverse panel of 20 IgG\n                    1\n                    antibodies, by rheometry, coarse-grained simulations, and molecular surface property analysis. Strikingly, fragmentation of IgG\n                    1\n                    into F(ab′)\n                    2\n                    plus Fc reduced viscosity (−11 to −93%) for all antibodies tested, demonstrating prevalent contributions of Fc to viscosity. Coarse-grained simulations with one site per Fab and two sites per Fc qualitatively tracked trends in experimental rheometry data for 20 parental antibodies and their fragments. In these simulations Fab–Fab and Fab–Fc interaction strengths were independently varied to capture possible interaction differences arising from parental sequences or any mutations. These coarse-grained simulations suggest that Fab–Fc attractions generate branched IgG\n                    1\n                    networks and disproportionately larger clusters relative to Fab–Fab interactions of comparable strength. This study suggests that a four-site self-interaction model, previously proposed for a single antibody (omalizumab), is broadly applicable to diverse IgG\n                    1\n                    . Beyond well-established variable domain engineering, this self-interaction model predicts that Fc engineering may reduce IgG\n                    1\n                    viscosity, a much sought after goal to enable subcutaneous delivery. Clinically validated Fc mutations are demonstrated here to substantially reduce the viscosity for multiple IgG\n                    1\n                    (−33 to −91% reduction, n = 6), supporting this emerging antibody design concept."},{"t":"全球变暖仅 2°C 仍可能发生极端气候结果","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00640-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"暴露的磷脂酰丝氨酸是 T 细胞耗竭的抑制分子","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10266-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"In cancer and chronic infection, CD8 T cell exhaustion is hallmarked by expression of inhibitory receptors such as PD1, TIM3, LAG3 and others1,2,3. Thus, inhibitory molecule focus has been limited to cell-surface proteins. Here we evaluate the surface lipid metabolite phosphatidylserine (PS) as a regulator of exhaustion. PS primarily localizes to the inner plasma membrane of live cells but is well known to be externalized to the outer membrane during cell death. The role of exposed PS on live immune cells is less clear. We show that viable, antigen-specific CD8 T cells externalize PS during lymphocytic choriomeningitis virus (LCMV) infection. T cell activation induced initial PS exposure, and chronic antigen stimulation sustained externalization. Transcriptomic and lipidomic analyses also identified PS accumulation in exhausted CD8 T cells. To evaluate a role for exposed PS in exhaustion, we treated LCMV chronically infected mice with a PS-targeting antibody (mch1N11)4 and found that it expanded LCMV-specific CD8 responses. PD1+TCF1+ stem-like CD8 T cells downregulated quiescence-associated gene modules and increased proliferation after antibody treatment, highlighting an inhibitory role for PS. Mechanistically, exposed PS on T cells functioned extrinsically to suppress dendritic cell immunostimulatory phenotypes, in turn limiting CD8 T cell responses. PS-targeting antibody with anti-PDL1 synergized to increase CD8 responses and improve viral control. Finally, we show that PD1+ CD8 T cells from human tumours can also expose PS. In summary, we detail CD8 T cell PS biology and provide insight into a mechanism by which exposed PS functions as a ‘non-classical’ extrinsic inhibitory molecule in exhaustion."},{"t":"结肠炎的表观遗传记忆促进肿瘤生长","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10258-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Chronic inflammation is a well-established risk factor for cancer, but the underlying molecular mechanisms remain unclear1,2. Using a mouse model of colitis, we demonstrate that colonic stem cells retain an epigenetic memory of inflammation following disease resolution that persists for more than 100 days. Here we find that memory of colitis is characterized by a cumulative gain of activator protein 1 (AP-1) transcription factor activity, with durable changes to chromatin accessibility. Further, we develop SHARE-TRACE, a method that enables simultaneous profiling of gene expression, chromatin accessibility and clonal history in single cells, enabling high-resolution tracking of epigenomic memory. This approach reveals that memory of colitis is propagated cell-intrinsically and inherited through stem cell divisions, with some clones demonstrating stronger memory than others. Finally, we show that colitis primes stem cells for increased expression of an AP-1-regulated gene program following oncogenic mutation that accelerates tumour growth, a phenotype dependent on AP-1 activity. Together, our findings provide a mechanistic link between chronic inflammation and malignancy, revealing how long-lived epigenetic alterations in regenerative tissues may contribute to disease susceptibility and suggesting potential diagnostic and therapeutic strategies to mitigate cancer risk in patients with chronic inflammatory conditions."},{"t":"纠缠的可测量化突破","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02557-y","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"观点评论","tp":"量子纠缠测量","kp":["[主题]: 量子纠缠可测量化"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"","ot":"Entanglement made measurable"},{"t":"通过P─O键耦合晶格氧反应提升层状氧化物的化学稳定性","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523361?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"层状氧化物正极稳定","kp":["[策略]: 长链P-O键耦合并稳定晶格氧反应","[正极]: 层状氧化物","[问题]: 高压晶格氧不可逆脱附"],"dp":1,"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出通过P-O键耦合晶格氧反应来增强层状氧化物正极材料化学稳定性的新策略。在高电压下，氧还原（OR）反应虽能提升能量密度，但伴随不可逆氧释放导致结构退化。通过引入强P-O共价键稳定晶格氧框架，有效抑制了高电位下的氧损失和相变，显著提升了层状氧化物正极的循环稳定性，为高能量密度电池正极材料设计提供了新思路。","ot":"Enhancing the Chemical Stability of Layered Oxides via P─O Bonds Coupling Lattice Oxygen Reactions","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Oxygen reductive (OR) reactions at elevated voltages hold immense promise for advancing high‐energy‐density cathode development. Nevertheless, despite substantial research efforts, irreversible lattice oxygen desorption and accelerated structural degradation during cycling remain challenges. To address these issues, we propose a dual‐pronged strategy: incorporating long‐chain P─O bonds (P\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    4−\n                    ) to couple oxygen reactions while simultaneously constructing ordered‐disordered nanodomains. Further studies indicate that under high‐voltage conditions, the coupling between implanted P─O bonds and lattice oxygen manifests as a more reversible OR reaction and a reduction in oxygen escape. Simultaneously, these enhanced ordered–disordered nanodomains promote synchronous and uniform structural evolution, effectively suppressing P─O phase structural evolution (manifested as reduced lattice parameter deviation in P‐type regions and rapid P3‐OP2 biphasic reactions) while forming a highly stable local TMO\n                    2\n                    octahedral environment. Furthermore, density functional theory (DFT) analysis and soft X‐ray absorption spectroscopy (XAS) confirmed that P─O bond incorporation significantly mitigated irreversible oxygen depletion and transition metal (TM) migration, thereby extending the chemical stability of layered oxides. As a result, the high‐voltage cycle stability has been significantly enhanced, achieving a 30% improvement in capacity retention after 400 cycles at 1C (1C = 140 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    ). This work has opened up new avenues for enhancing the performance of sodium‐ion battery cathodes.","aip":1},{"t":"范德华 β-UTe3 单层增强的二维铁磁性","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea6436?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"The discovery of local-moment magnetism in van der Waals (vdW) semiconductors down to the single-layer limit has led to a paradigm shift in the understanding of two-dimensional (2D) magnets. The incorporation of strong electronic and magnetic correlations in 2D vdW metals remains a sought-after platform to enable control of emergent quantum phases and to achieve more theoretically tractable microscopic models of complex materials. To date, however, there is limited success in the discovery of such metallic vdW platforms, and f-electron monolayers remain out of reach. Here, we demonstrate that strongly correlated β–uranium tritelluride (β-UTe\n                    3\n                    ) can be exfoliated to the monolayer limit. Unexpectedly, β-UTe\n                    3\n                    remains ferromagnetic in this limit with an enhanced ordering temperature of 35 kelvin, a factor of two larger than its bulk counterpart. Our work establishes β-UTe\n                    3\n                    as a materials platform for investigating and modeling correlated behavior in the monolayer limit and opens numerous avenues for quantum control with, e.g., strain engineering.","tp":"二维铁磁性","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队在范德华半导体中发现单层极限下的局域磁矩铁磁性，引发了对二维磁体认知的范式转变。当前挑战在于将强电子与磁关联引入二维范德华金属，以实现对新兴量子相的控制并构建更易理论处理的微观模型。该平台有望推动复杂材料的精确建模与量子态调控，但高质量材料的发现与制备仍是主要瓶颈。"},{"t":"硬碳中工程化纳米孔用于高能量密度钠离子电池","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag187/8540294?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硬碳纳米孔钠电池","kp":["[材料]: 纳米孔工程化硬碳","[应用]: 高能钠离子电池"],"as":"","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Engineering nanopores in hard carbon for high-energy sodium-ion batteries"},{"t":"构建具有光学各向异性的低对称性胶体晶体","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec7382?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"低对称胶体晶体","kp":["[构建基元]: DNA修饰纳米棒/纳米五角双锥","[结构]: 低对称胶体晶体","[特性]: 光轴取向可控"],"dp":1,"as":"低对称性胶体晶体因其独特的光学各向异性特性，正成为天然结构色材料的有力性能增强替代方案。本研究通过工程化手段构建具有低对称性排列的胶体晶体，打破传统高对称性组装的局限，实现可调控的双折射、偏振依赖性结构色等光学响应。该工作拓展了人工光子材料的设计维度，在光学传感、防伪涂层和信息加密等领域具有重要应用潜力。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Engineering low-symmetry colloidal crystals with optical anisotropies","b":"Engineered low-symmetry colloidal crystals are emerging as promising performance-enhancing alternatives to natural materials for optical devices. However, current synthesis methods cannot precisely control structural features such as the orientation of the optical axes in these crystals. Here, DNA-modified nanorods and nanopentabipyramids were used as programmable atom equivalents to synthesize low-symmetry colloidal crystals. These crystals display three different lattice symmetries and crystal habits, aligning their optical axes in perpendicular, parallel, and oblique configurations relative to the crystal surface. The low lattice symmetries of the colloidal crystals define their optical anisotropies. Specifically, the rhombohedral colloidal crystals exhibit substantial polarization-dependent transmission and scattering characteristics. Optical measurements supported by simulations suggest that these colloidal crystals exhibit large optical anisotropy. This work expands the potential of programmable matter by developing a class of optically anisotropic materials engineered from DNA upon conjugation with relatively simple and readily available nanoparticle building blocks."},{"t":"具有多尺度时变连通性和深度的清洁能源和化石能源的能源转型和地缘政治风险","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003806?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源转型路","sc":2.2,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"内源性 ATP 驱动的纳米马达指导神经干细胞分化以治疗帕金森病","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520119123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Transplantation-free neuron regeneration remains attractive yet unsolved for reversing Parkinson’s disease (PD). Here, we present enzyme-driven mesoporous gold nanomotors (Apyrase@Au) that leverage endogenous biochemical energy for spatiotemporally controlled promotion of neural stem cell (NSC) differentiation, without exogenous stem cell transplantation. By catalyzing endogenous adenosine triphosphate (ATP) hydrolysis, Apyrase@Au nanomotors simultaneously generate directional propulsion and localized signaling messenger protons. These protons induce calcium influx and activate quiescent NSCs within the ventricular-subventricular zone of PD mice, directing their differentiation into functional neurons and alleviating moving dysfunction. The bioenergy-converting system imparts dual functionality to active matter, propelling while concurrently yielding bioactive products. This work demonstrates the potential of ATP-powered nanomachines as a self-sustaining and targeted biointerface, offering a promising strategy for promoting NSC differentiation and alleviating moving dysfunction in degenerative diseases.","tp":"纳米马达疗","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出无移植神经元再生策略治疗帕金森病：利用酶驱动的介孔金纳米马达（Apyrase@Au），以内源性ATP水解为能量来源，实现时空可控的神经干细胞分化促进。纳米马达在催化ATP水解的同时产生定向推进力和局部信号分子释放，无需外源干细胞移植即可原位诱导神经再生，为退行性神经疾病提供了全新治疗范式。"},{"t":"发光有机晶体及其器件应用","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01429H","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"有机发光晶体","kp":["[材料]: 发光有机晶体","[机理]: 聚集诱导发光AIE"],"dp":1,"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"发光有机晶体作为材料科学前沿方向，综述了其分子设计、晶体工程和器件应用的最新进展。与无定形薄膜相比，有机单晶具有高载流子迁移率、低缺陷密度和优异的光学增益特性，在有机激光、电致发光器件和光波导等领域展现出独特优势。文章系统讨论了晶体生长控制、激子动力学调控及外场响应等关键问题，并展望了柔性光电子集成应用前景。","ot":"Emissive organic crystals and device applications","b":"Emissive organic crystals represent a rapidly advancing frontier in materials science, offering a unique platform that merges the superior optoelectronic characteristics of crystalline order with high-efficiency light emission. This review comprehensively surveys the field, from the fundamental molecular design principles and photophysical mechanisms, such as aggregation-induced emission, thermally activated delayed fluorescence, and room-temperature phosphorescence, to the advanced engineering of crystal packing and morphology. The unique light–matter interactions inherent to these crystalline materials, which underpin applications in optical waveguiding and stimulated emission (lasing), are elaborated upon. The review further discusses device integration, highlighting recent progress in organic light-emitting transistors, single-crystal light-emitting diodes, sensors and display arrays. Finally, the review outlines the existing challenges and future opportunities for these crystalline materials in next-generation photoelectronic technologies."},{"t":"电子诱导分子编程驱动界面化学实现安时级锌电池","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72891?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌电池界面化学","kp":["添加剂浓度[锌电池SEI]: 1 mM重氮盐","策略[SEI构建]: 电子诱导分子编程","规模[锌电池]: 安时级(Ah-level)"],"dp":1,"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用电子诱导分子编程策略构建水系锌电池的固态电解质界面（SEI），实现了安时级容量稳定循环。通过在电极界面精准调控电子注入驱动的分子级化学反应，原位生成具有离子导电性和机械韧性的保护层，有效抑制了锌负极的析氢副反应和枝晶生长。该策略突破了水系锌电池界面稳定性瓶颈，为高安全、低成本大规模储能电池提供了新路径。","ot":"Electron‐Induced Molecular Programming Drives Interfacial Chemistry for Ah‐Level Zinc Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Solid–electrolyte interphases (SEIs) are essential for stabilizing metal anodes in aqueous zinc (Zn) batteries (AZBs), yet their formation remains intrinsically uncontrolled, leaving the interphase vulnerable to dissolution and water‐driven parasitic reactions. Herein, we report an electron‐induced molecular programming strategy that uses only 1 mM of 4‐bromobenzenediazonium tetrafluoroborate (BDTF) to in situ construct a Zn\n                    2+\n                    ‐favored molecular lock on the ZnF\n                    2\n                    ‐rich SEI surface. Electrochemically generated\n                    p\n                    ‐bromoaniline becomes molecularly woven into the inorganic layer, forming an ultrathin molecular‐lock shell (∼1 nm) atop a graded hybrid SEI. Through N–Zn coordination coupled with Br‐induced interfacial polarization, the molecular lock reorganizes the local electrostatic environment, stabilizes ZnF\n                    2\n                    , limits water access, and promotes desolvation‐facilitated Zn\n                    2+\n                    transport. As a result, the programmed SEI enables highly reversible Zn plating/stripping with a 99.8% average Coulombic efficiency, and stable cycling under 80% depth of discharge at 10 mA cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    . Moreover, it displays broad cathode compatibility, extending cycling stability in vanadium‐, manganese‐, and iodine‐based full cells. In Ah‐level pouch cells with ultrahigh vanadium‐based cathode loading (21 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    ), the system delivers 1.2 Ah with 81% retention after 100 cycles, surpassing state‐of‐the‐art aqueous Zn batteries that typically fail at high mass loading.","aip":1},{"t":"固态电解质中电化学腐蚀伴随枝晶生长","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10279-z","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电池枝晶","kp":["[固态电池枝晶]: 电化学腐蚀伴随枝晶生长而非纯力学驱动","[失效机制]: 推翻应力达断裂应力方触发枝晶的旧假设"],"dp":1,"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究揭示了固态电解质中电化学腐蚀与枝晶生长的伴生关系。固态电池的充电速率、循环性能和安全性常受限于金属负极界面退化，该工作发现枝晶刺穿并非唯一失效模式——电化学腐蚀反应在固态电解质内部持续消耗活性金属并产生副产物，导致界面阻抗持续增大。这一发现修正了以往仅关注枝晶力学的认知框架，强调需同时抑制腐蚀副反应以实现固态电池的长寿命运行。","ot":"Electrochemical corrosion accompanies dendrite growth in solid electrolytes","b":"Charging rates, cycling performance and safety of solid-state batteries using metal negative electrodes are often limited by dendrites1,2,3, the growth of which depends on coupling between electrochemical and mechanical driving forces. Previously, it has been assumed that dendrites propagate when plating-induced stresses reach the fracture stress of the solid electrolyte. Here we show that dendrites can propagate at far lower stresses. Using operando birefringence microscopy4, we directly measure stresses around growing dendrites in garnet Li6.6La3Zr1.6Ta0.4O12, a highly stable solid electrolyte5,6,7. Plating-induced stresses are present throughout growth and approach the mechanical fracture stress for the slowest-growing dendrites. As current densities and dendrite velocities increase, the stresses accompanying dendrite growth surprisingly decrease, with dendrite propagation occurring at stresses up to 75% lower than under mechanical load alone. Cryogenic scanning transmission electron microscopy (STEM) of dendrites propagated at high current reveals electrolyte decomposition to new phases, associated with which is a net molar volume contraction. The electrochemically induced mode of embrittlement may be mitigated through understanding and control of the nature of phase transitions accompanying instability.","aip":1},{"t":"电化学驱动聚合物解聚回单体","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00071-9?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Chem","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电化学解聚回收","kp":["[反应]: 电化学触发解聚","[聚合物]: 聚甲基丙烯酸甲酯PMMA","[单体产率]: >95wt%"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了电化学驱动温和条件下将碳氢聚合物选择性解聚回单体的新方法。传统化学解聚需要高温高压苛刻条件，而电化学策略通过在电极表面精准调控氧化还原电位，实现聚合物主链的选择性断裂，高效再生原始单体。该路线能耗低、条件温和且选择性高，为构建塑料闭环回收经济提供了具有工程可行性的技术基础。","ot":"Electrifying depolymerization back to monomers","b":"Developing mild depolymerization routes to regenerate monomers from hydrocarbon-based polymers is critical to enabling a circular polymer economy. In a recent paper published in the Journal of the American Chemical Society, Evans, Sumerlin, and co-workers disclose a methodology for the electrochemically triggered depolymerization of poly(methyl-methacrylate) that achieves >95 wt % depolymerization."},{"t":"癌症中异位 NMDAR 表达揭示种系编码的自身免疫","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10278-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Autoimmunity and anti-cancer immunity lie on the same biological continuum1,2, but their link remains obscure. The paraneoplastic neurological syndrome ANRE (anti-NMDA receptor (NMDAR) encephalitis) is a paradigm for their connectivity3, given that intratumoural NMDAR expression is correlated with the generation of anti-NMDAR antibodies4,5. Here we verify ectopic expression of GluN1 and GluN2B NMDAR subunits in triple-negative breast cancer (TNBC)6 and model this using orthotopic TNBC tumours with inducible expression of GluN1–GluN2B NMDARs. We show that NMDAR expression is sufficient to induce the recruitment of B cells and their affinity maturation, consistent with an integrated adaptive immune response. Reconstruction of extended intratumoural B cell phylogenies and cryogenic electron microscopy structural analyses demonstrate that affinity-matured hypermutated and class-switched antibodies emerged from pre-existing germline-configuration lower-affinity anti-NMDAR antibodies. Distinct matured antibodies targeted specific epitopes and induced conformational rearrangements within the NMDAR amino-terminal domain, predictive of their functional effects, ranging from inhibition to potentiation. Passive transfer of an NMDAR-potentiating antibody caused autonomic dysregulation and lowered the seizure threshold in healthy female mice, recapitulating key diagnostic criteria of ANRE4,5. We further identify a correlation between intratumoural NMDAR expression and anti-NMDAR antibody titres in patients with TNBC. Taken together, our data establish a direct connection between intratumoural NMDAR expression, antibody maturation and the onset of autoimmunity. These findings suggest that germline-encoded anti-NMDAR antibodies contribute to immune surveillance but can also trigger autoimmune disease after maturation, revealing a mechanistic trade-off between cancer immunity and neurotoxicity."},{"t":"Inside-Out 蛋白质动态易位到细胞表面是细胞适应癌症引起的应激的基础","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529493123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Inside-Out (I-O) protein display, the noncanonical surface localization of intracellular proteins, represents an underexplored feature of tumor cell biology. Here, we map the molecular landscape and trafficking mechanisms that control the presentation of I-O proteins on cancer cell membranes. Employing APEX2-mediated proximity biotinylation and a custom antibody generation and validation platform, we identified approximately 140 high-confidence I-O proteins, primarily ribosomal, proteasomal, chaperone, and translation factors, notably enriched in protein families associated with stress-response pathways. Validation of 500 antibodies encompassing 40 I-O targets across seven tumor cell lines confirmed selective and robust surface localization, while in vivo imaging in mouse xenografts demonstrated pronounced and tumor-specific antibody accumulation. I-O proteins were absent on peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) and in normal tissues, indicating cancer cell selectivity. Functional analyses revealed that I-O protein tethering to the membrane is dependent on heparan sulfate interactions; enzymatic removal of these glycans led to the clearance of I-O proteins from the cell surface. Notably, the removed proteins returned to baseline levels within 6 h, indicating a dynamic balance related to Endoplasmic Reticulum (ER)-Golgi trafficking and cellular stress. Nearly half of these I-O proteins overlapped with known stress granule (SG) components; however, stress elements that promote SG formation do not similarly affect surface display of I-O proteins. Furthermore, I-O proteins are present on standard cancer cell lines under lower stress levels needed to induce SG formation, suggesting parallel yet mechanistically distinct aspects of the stress response. These findings position I-O display as a paradigm in protein trafficking, different from traditional secretion pathways and closely linked to stress response."},{"t":"双相工程耦合价态梯度与熵辅助解锁4.9V耐压无钴高镍正极材料","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70868?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高镍无钴正极","kp":["耐压[无钴高镍正极]: 4.9 V","镍含量[层状正极]: Ni≥0.9","策略[正极改性]: 双相工程+价态梯度+熵辅助"],"as":"针对层状高镍正极材料（Ni≥0.9）在4.5V以上高压运行下的不稳定性问题，研究提出双相工程耦合价态梯度与熵辅助的协同策略。该方案通过调控晶体结构稳定性和离子价态分布，显著提升高镍正极材料在苛刻工况下的循环寿命和容量保持率，为高能量密度锂离子电池正极材料的工程化突破提供了新路径。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Dual‐Phase Engineering Coupled With Valence Gradient and Entropy Assistance Unlocking 4.9 V‐Tolerant Co‐Free High‐Ni Cat","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Layered high‐Ni (Ni ≥ 0.9) cathodes are being developed to endure high‐voltage operations above 4.5 V for unlocking unprecedented energy density, but they still suffer from exacerbated chemomechanical and electrochemical degradation primarily due to excessive lattice strain, oxygen loss, and phase distortion during prolonged cycling. Herein, we design a high‐Ni, Co‐free cathode, which features an entropy‐assisted core–shell layered/spinel dual‐phase, coupled with a Ni‐valence gradient framework, via a multi‐component complex doping involved co‐precipitation strategy. The coherent structural ordering from surface spinel phase to bulk layered phase, driven by the Ni‐enriched core/Mn‐enriched shell arrangement, and the entropy‐assistance and valence‐gradient layout, hugely prevents mechanical degradation, surface side‐reactions, and oxygen loss, delivering a pseudo strain‐free cathode. Thanks to these appealing merits, the cathode breaks through current voltage limitations while maintaining an optimal balance between capacity and sustainability, enabling the stable high‐voltage operation up to 4.9 V. Moreover, an exceptional cyclability under strenuous conditions is achieved in practical Ah‐level pouch‐type cells employing graphite and metallic Li anodes, operating at ultrahigh voltages of 4.65 and 4.8 V, respectively. Besides, the oxygen loss‐triggered phase transitions upon heating are markedly delayed. More significantly, our contribution here propels the tremendous advancement of high‐Ni, Co‐free cathodes to the commercializable levels."},{"t":"显性克隆利用发育表观基因组状态来驱动室管膜瘤","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10270-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ZFTA–RELA is the most recurrent genetic alteration seen in paediatric supratentorial ependymoma (EPN) and is sufficient to initiate tumours in mice1. Despite its oncogenic potential, ZFTA–RELA (ZR) is observed nearly exclusively in childhood EPN, with tumours located distinctly in the supratentorial brain of the central nervous system1. We proposed that specific chromatin modules accessible during brain development would render distinct cell lineage programs at direct risk of transformation by ZR. To test this hypothesis, we performed combined single-nucleus assay for transposase-accessible chromatin and RNA (snMultiome) sequencing of the developing mouse forebrain compared with ZR-driven mouse and human EPN. We demonstrated that specific developmental lineage programs present in transient progenitor cells and regulated by PLAG/L family transcription factors were at risk of neoplastic transformation. Binding of this chromatin network by ZR or other PLAG/L family motifs targeting fusion oncoproteins led to persistent chromatin accessibility at oncogenic loci and oncogene expression. Cross-species analysis of mouse and human ZR EPN revealed significant cell type heterogeneity indicating incomplete neurogenic and gliogenic differentiation, with a small percentage of cycling progenitor-like or radial glial-like cells that established a putative tumour cell hierarchy. In vivo lineage tracing studies identified neoplastic clones that aggressively dominated tumour growth and established the entire EPN cellular hierarchy. These findings identify developmental epigenomic states that are critical for fusion-oncoprotein-driven transformation and show how these states continue to shape tumour progression."},{"t":"旧石器时代，狗广泛分布于欧亚大陆西部","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10170-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Archaeological evidence suggests that dogs diverged from wolves during the Palaeolithic, more than 15,000 years ago1,2,3,4,5,6,7. The earliest unequivocal genetic evidence, however, is associated with dog remains from Mesolithic archaeological contexts approximately 10,900 years ago8,9. Here we generate both nuclear and mitochondrial genomes from canid remains at Pınarbaşı in Türkiye (15,800 years ago)10 and Gough’s Cave in the UK (14,300 years ago)11, as well as from dogs excavated from two Mesolithic sites in Serbia (Padina between 11,500–7,900 years ago and Vlasac 8,900 years ago)12,13. Our analyses indicate that a genetically homogeneous dog population was already widely distributed across Europe and Anatolia during the Late Upper Palaeolithic (by at least 14,300 years ago). This finding suggests that dogs were exchanged among genetically and culturally distinct western Eurasian Late Palaeolithic human populations, namely the Magdalenian, Epigravettian and Anatolian hunter-gatherers10,14,15,16. Last, we identify a major influx of eastern Eurasian dog ancestry during the Mesolithic, concomitant with the movement of eastern hunter-gatherer populations into Europe14, which led to the establishment of the primary ancestry characteristics that define European dog populations today."},{"t":"狗在冰河时代的欧洲有着深厚的遗传根源","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00378-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"对地壳岩浆的不平衡响应揭示了储存条件","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10317-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The conditions under which magma accumulates and is stored are fundamental to unravelling the processes of crust formation, planetary differentiation, geothermal heat recharge and volcanic eruptions. Storage pressure, temperature and volatile saturation are typically inferred from erupted volcanic products. However, changes during kilometres of magma ascent induce disequilibrium crystallization and vesiculation, and inverting back to storage conditions comes with unresolvable uncertainties. Here we explore opportunities arising from magma drilling at Krafla volcano, Iceland, to reconstruct real, in situ magmatic conditions. The findings show that, over the approximately 5 min in which the magma is quenched, vapour bubbles consisting of H2O and CO2 exsolve, grow and resorb, but the changes can be accounted for by multiparametric inversion (for chemistry, vesicularity and vitrification), and that the magma was stored under volatile-saturated lithostatic conditions, unlike previous assertions of lower vapour pressures based on classic methods1. These new disequilibrium simulations reconcile the glass chemistry with conceptual models of magma storage and provide us with the unique pairing of precisely measured depth and volatile pressure on a single magma body and thus a robust method to improve our understanding of magma storage conditions and evolution."},{"t":"深根植物吸收养分的深度受可用水量的调节","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528407123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The capacity of some plants to access water and nutrients at depths greater than one meter is a critical functional trait that confers resistance to drought and impacts both belowground and shallow soil processes. Here, we report water and strontium isotopic data from an alpine meadow transect showing the correlation between water and nutrient acquisition depths. The isotopic compositions of Sr (\n                    87\n                    Sr/\n                    86\n                    Sr ratio) and water in rock and soil, and in plant leaf tissues, reveal that deeper-rooted plants acquire a higher proportion of water, Sr, and cation nutrients that are derived from the saprolite, a zone of silicate weathering, than shallow-rooted grass. A three-decade dendrochemical record reveals that reductions of wet precipitation drive deep-rooted plants to acquire cation nutrients from deeper saprolite or bedrock regions. Thus, the depth of cation nutrient acquisition by deep-rooted plant species at this site is tightly coupled with, and likely determined by, water availability in soil, saprolite, and bedrock. The enhanced uptake of cations as well as water from deeper saprolite zones could impact the rate of bedrock weathering and watershed chemistry during drought.","tp":"深根植物养分","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":4.0},"as":"研究通过高山草甸样带的水和锶同位素数据揭示，深根植物在1米以下获取水分和养分的能力受可用水量调控。87Sr/86Sr同位素比值显示水分和养分获取深度之间存在显著相关性，表明干旱胁迫下植物会向更深层延伸根系以同时获取水和营养元素。该发现对理解生态系统干旱抗性及地下土壤过程具有重要意义。"},{"t":"电化学反应的解耦和再耦合","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44286-026-00379-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Chemical Engineering","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"十年尺度的干旱扰乱了撒哈拉地区的非洲湿润期","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10336-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"During the early and mid-Holocene, the Sahara and Sahel experienced a humid phase, the so-called African Humid Period (AHP)1. The AHP started around 14.8 thousand years before present (kyr bp), peaked between 9.0 kyr bp and 6.0 kyr bp and experienced short-lived droughts of as yet poorly constrained age and duration2,3. Here we show that the AHP was punctuated by two droughts of decadal-scale duration, at about 9.3 kyr bp and 8.2 kyr bp, and another more tentatively identified drought at 6.3 kyr bp. Our findings arise from a multiproxy time series from the annually layered (varved) sedimentary archive of Lake Yoa in Chad, which covers the past 10.25 kyr continuously. During the more prominent drought at 8.2 kyr bp, pollen and diatom data, along with leaf-wax isotopes and geochemical source area indicators, imply that a reduction in local precipitation and fluvial supply to Lake Yoa caused a lake-level drop accompanied by an expansion of reed belts along the shore. The proxy data, together with our climate simulations, suggest that the 8.2 kyr bp drought event was a direct and rapid response to a potential weakening of the Atlantic Meridional Overturning Circulation (AMOC) owing to sudden freshwater input into the North Atlantic. The results underline the need for improved decadal predictions4 to better anticipate such drought risks in the future."},{"t":"湍流中拉格朗日粒子动力学的数据驱动 Mori-Zwanzig 建模","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525390123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The dynamics of Lagrangian particles in turbulence play a crucial role in mixing, transport, and dispersion in complex flows. Their trajectories exhibit highly nontrivial statistical behavior, motivating the development of surrogate models that can reproduce these trajectories without incurring the high computational cost of direct numerical simulations of the full Eulerian field. This task is particularly challenging because reduced-order models typically lack access to the full set of interactions with the underlying turbulent field. Novel data-driven machine learning techniques can be powerful in capturing and reproducing complex statistics of the reduced-order/surrogate dynamics. In this work, we show how one can learn a surrogate dynamical system that is able to evolve a turbulent Lagrangian trajectory in a way that is point-wise accurate for short-time predictions (with respect to Kolmogorov time) and stable and statistically accurate at long times. This approach is based on the Mori–Zwanzig formalism, which prescribes a mathematical decomposition of the full dynamical system into resolved dynamics that depend on the current state and the past history of a reduced set of observables, and the unresolved orthogonal dynamics due to unresolved degrees of freedom of the initial state. We show how by training this reduced order model on a point-wise error metric on short time-prediction, we are able to correctly learn the dynamics of Lagrangian turbulence, such that also the long-time statistical behavior is stably recovered at test time. This opens up a range of applications, for example, for the control of active Lagrangian agents in turbulence."},{"t":"每日简报：尼安德特人胎儿的微小骨头表明该物种的衰落","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00963-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"面向P2P能源交易中DSO-产消者的NDOE引导双层分布式鲁棒优化方法","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003156?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分布式电力交易","kp":["[优化模型]: 双层分布鲁棒优化+NDOE指引P2P交易"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"DSO-prosumers bi-level distributionally robust optimization method with NDOE guidance in the P2P energy trading"},{"t":"DNA甲基化位点丢失导致可塑性主导的新性状遗传固定","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534817123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Phenotypic plasticity allows organisms to adapt traits in response to environmental changes, yet the molecular basis by which such plastic traits become genetically fixed remains unclear. Here, we investigated gut-length plasticity in medaka fish (\n                    Oryzias latipes\n                    ) through genome-wide methylation profiling, CRISPR/Cas9-mediated deletion, and population genomic analyses. We found that seasonal methylation of CpG sites upstream of the\n                    Plxnb3\n                    is correlated with gut-length plasticity, and deletion of this region abolishes plasticity. Additionally, standing variation in\n                    Ppp3r1\n                    is associated with genetically fixed longer gut length in populations lacking plasticity. These results suggest that loss of epigenetic regulation via CpG site reduction triggers the genetic fixation of novel traits. Our findings provide molecular evidence linking epigenetic plasticity and genetic assimilation, advancing understanding of plasticity-led evolution in natural populations.","tp":"表观遗传固定","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究以青鳉鱼肠道长度可塑性为模型，通过全基因组甲基化谱分析、CRISPR/Cas9基因敲除和群体基因组学方法，揭示了表型可塑性性状如何被遗传固定的分子机制。研究发现Pl基因上游CpG位点的季节性甲基化改变驱动了可塑性响应，而特定甲基化位点的丢失可将可塑性主导的新性状转化为稳定遗传特征，为生物适应性进化提供了关键证据。"},{"t":"DIRAS2 调节 MAPK 通路介导的铁死亡以调节兴奋/抑制平衡和癫痫易感性","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516011123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Epilepsy is a common neurological disorder that is widely believed to be associated with an imbalance between neuronal excitation and inhibition (E/I). DIRAS2, a Ras-related GTPase, has not been well understood regarding its role and function within the nervous system. In this study, we found that DIRAS2 is downregulated in the hippocampus during the epileptogenesis phase in a kainic acid-induced epilepsy model, while it is upregulated during the chronic phase in this epilepsy model and in patients with temporal lobe epilepsy. Overexpression of DIRAS2 alleviates epileptic seizure susceptibility and activity, whereas knockdown of DIRAS2 has an opposite effect. Whole-cell patch-clamp recordings reveal that DIRAS2 reduces the neuronal E/I ratio and alleviates neuronal hyperexcitability. Mechanistically, quantitative proteomic analysis reveals that ferroptosis is involved in mediating the effects of DIRAS2. Knockdown of DIRAS2 can exacerbate ferroptosis, while overexpression protects against ferroptosis in both in vivo and in vitro studies. Ferrostatin-1, a ferroptosis inhibitor, can rescue the E/I imbalance and epileptic behavioral changes induced by DIRAS2 knockdown. Finally, we found that DIRAS2 regulates ferroptosis by inhibiting the extracellular signal-regulated kinase/p38 mitogen-activated protein kinase pathway in epileptic mice. In summary, our study demonstrates the role of DIRAS2 in epilepsy and provides a potential target for epilepsy treatment."},{"t":"Pickering液滴衍生微反应器中酶与辅因子共限域用于连续流催化","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525681?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酶辅因子微反应器","kp":["[微反应器]: Pickering液滴溶胶-凝胶衍生PDMR","[酶共固定化]: 酶与辅因子共限域连续流催化"],"as":"该研究开发了基于Pickering乳液液滴衍生微反应器的酶与辅因子共固定化平台，用于连续流合成。将酶催化剂与所需辅因子共同限制在微米级液滴内，模拟细胞内区室化环境，有效提升催化效率与辅因子循环利用率。该策略为可持续的生物催化连续生产工艺提供了可工程化的新方案，在药物合成与绿色化学领域具有应用前景。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Co‐Confinement of Enzymes and Cofactors Within Pickering Droplet Derived Microreactors for Continuous Flow Catalysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The co‐immobilization of enzymes and cofactors represents a sustainable platform for continuous‐flow synthesis of chiral pharmaceuticals, yet balancing effective retention with mutual accessibility of them remains challenging. Herein, we report a sol‐gel strategy to construct Pickering droplet derived microreactors (PDMRs) for the co‐confinement of enzymes and cofactors, which have been applied to continuous flow reactions without exogenous addition of cofactors. Within these self‐sufficient PDMRs, the cofactors are reversibly immobilized via electrostatic interactions, enabling in situ regeneration and free access to the enzyme. The PDMRs efficiently encapsulate enzymes and cofactors with 85–100% immobilization efficiency and robust thermal stability. In PDMRs‐catalyzed continuous flow reactions, excellent catalytic performance and high cofactor total turnover number (TTN) were obtained in nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate (NADP\n                    +\n                    )‐dependent aldo‐keto reductase (AKR) catalyzed enantioselective reductions (80–100% conversions, &gt;99% ee, 500 h stability, up to 173 907 mol mol\n                    −1\n                    TTN), and pyridoxal 5‐phosphate (PLP)‐dependent transaminase (TA) catalyzed enantioselective transaminations (80–100% conversions, &gt;99% ee, 2 000 h stability, up to 45 552 mol mol\n                    −1\n                    TTN). Furthermore, the PDMRs are extended to the co‐confinement of a multi‐enzyme system (AKR and glucose dehydrogenase, GDH) with NADP\n                    +\n                    for chiral alcohols synthesis with sustained operational stability. This work establishes a potent and durable strategy for industrial‐scale continuous flow manufacturing."},{"t":"废塑料微纳颗粒转化为碳材料：可再生能源与环境应用新趋势","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003429?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"废塑料转化碳材料","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":4.5},"ot":"Conversion of waste micro/nano plastics into carbon materials: A new trend for renewable energy and environmental applic"},{"t":"通过分层有效编码再现早期嗅觉处理的趋同基序","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524661123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"The architecture of early olfactory processing is a striking example of convergent evolution. Typically, a panel of broadly tuned receptors is selectively expressed in sensory neurons (each neuron expressing only one receptor), and each glomerulus receives projections from just one neuron type. Taken together, these three motifs—broad receptors, selective expression, and glomerular convergence—constitute “canonical olfaction,” since a number of model organisms including mice and flies exhibit these features. The emergence of this distinctive architecture across evolutionary lineages suggests that it may be optimized for information processing, an idea known as efficient coding. In this work, we show that by maximizing mutual information one layer at a time, efficient coding recovers several features of canonical olfactory processing under realistic biophysical assumptions. We also explore the settings in which noncanonical olfaction may be advantageous. Along the way, we make several predictions relating olfactory circuits to features of receptor families and the olfactory environment."},{"t":"接触触发的分子相互作用实现太阳能电池钙钛矿层结构优化","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02027-4","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿界面修饰","kp":["[界面工程]: 二维层间接触触发分子相互作用精修钙钛矿","[方法优势]: 突破溶液法分子掺杂/表面钝化的独立控制局限"],"dp":1,"as":"本研究提出利用接触触发型分子相互作用来精修钙钛矿太阳能电池薄膜结构的策略。钙钛矿薄膜中普遍存在的晶界缺陷和孔洞严重影响器件效率和长期稳定性。研究者设计特定功能分子，使其在沉积接触过程中原位锚定于晶界和表面缺陷处，有效钝化缺陷态、调节结晶动力学。该方法无需额外后处理步骤，即可显著降低非辐射复合损失，大幅提升器件的光电转换效率和运行稳定性。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Contact-triggered molecular interactions enable structural refinement of perovskite layers in solar cells","b":"Molecular interactions are crucial to improving the efficiency and stability of perovskite solar cells, yet current solution-based approaches relying on molecular incorporation or surface passivation show inherent limitations in separately controlling these interactions. Here we reveal an intrinsic interfacial interaction that arises from simple contact between individually crystallized two-dimensional and three-dimensional perovskites without mixing or permanent bonding. We define this contact-triggered cationic interaction (CCI), which reversibly constrains molecular degrees of freedom, suppresses phase transitions, enhances carrier lifetimes and induces a unique recrystallization of the three-dimensional framework. This CCI-driven recrystallization produces refined FAPbI3 with improved cation homogeneity, reduced lattice disorder and superior optoelectronic properties. Devices using CCI-driven FAPbI3 achieve 26.25% efficiency (25.61% certified) and retain a projected operational lifetime exceeding 20,000 h. Our findings provide the first quantitative evidence that intrinsic interfacial cationic interactions can directly influence perovskite material quality and device performance."},{"t":"受体激酶信号传导的比较蛋白质组学分析揭示了执行植物气孔的关键运输成分","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb6464?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Receptor kinases are pivotal for growth, development, and environmental response of plants. Yet, their regulatory mechanisms and spatial dynamics remain underexplored. The ERECTA-family receptor kinases coordinate diverse developmental processes, including stomatal development. To understand the proteomic landscape of the ERECTA-mediated signaling pathways, we report comparative analyses of the ERECTA interactome and proximitome by epitope-tagged affinity-purification (ET-AP) and TurboID-based proximity labeling (TbID-PL) mass spectrometry, respectively. While ET-AP recovered receptor complex components (e.g., TOO MANY MOUTHS), TbID-PL effectively captured transient associations with the components of endosomal trafficking, i.e., clathrin-mediated endocytosis machinery. We further identify that specific subfamily members of phosphatidylinositol-binding clathrin assembly proteins (PICALMs) interact with and synergistically regulate ERECTA internalization. Mutations in\n                    PICALMs\n                    impair ERECTA endocytosis and lead to excessive stomatal clustering by dampening the downstream signaling output. Together, we provide a proteomic atlas of the ERECTA signaling network and demonstrate that timely removal of receptor kinase by the endocytosis machinery is essential for active signal transduction enforcing stomatal patterning.","tp":"植物气孔发育","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究通过表位标签亲和纯化和TurboID邻近标记技术，对ERECTA家族受体激酶介导的信号通路进行了比较蛋白质组学分析，绘制了其互作组和邻近组的蛋白质景观。ERECTA受体激酶协调气孔发育等多种植物发育过程，该研究首次系统揭示了其调控网络中参与气孔发育执行阶段的关键转运蛋白组分，为植物受体激酶信号机制提供了深入见解。"},{"t":"Cnpy1 是犁鼻 2 型 GPCR 的候选内质网伴侣","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528466123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Mouse vomeronasal sensory neurons are continuously generated from stem cells and differentiate to express either V1R or V2R G protein–coupled receptors (GPCRs), along with their respective Gαi2 or Gαo G-protein subunits. We previously reported that Gαo-type neurons exhibit elevated expression of endoplasmic reticulum (ER) chaperones and a distinctive hypertrophic, gyroid ER architecture, suggesting specialized proteostatic demands. Here, we identify a transcript for the mouse Canopy1 (\n                    Cnpy1)\n                    gene that yields full-length Cnpy1 protein selectively expressed in and localized to the ER of Gαo neurons. Immunoprecipitation coupled with mass spectrometry revealed that Cnpy1 associates specifically with V2R GPCRs and multiple ER chaperones.\n                    Cnpy1\n                    deletion resulted in mice that were deficient in Gαo neuronal activation upon exposure to vomeronasal stimuli and a marked reduction in male–male aggressive behavior. In the absence of Cnpy1, Gαo neurons develop normally till birth but undergo selective, progressive apoptosis during postnatal development. Unexpectedly, Cnpy1-null vomeronasal neurons displayed neither an obvious unfolded protein response nor defects in V2R GPCR traffic to dendritic tips, indicating that Cnpy1 is required for V2R assembly or functional maturation but dispensable for their ER export. Together, these findings identify Cnpy1 as a component of an ER chaperone complex that is essential for Gαo neuron signaling and survival."},{"t":"中国是创新强国——但应该做更多基础研究","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00935-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"化学动力活性粒子菌落","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44286-026-00368-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Chemical Engineering","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"化学合成的 H3K14Ub 揭示了 Clr4 在 H3K9 甲基化中 IDR 介导的多价核小体识别","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520817?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Histone H3 lysine 9 methylation (H3K9me) is a central epigenetic mark governing heterochromatin formation. Although the H3K9 methyltransferase Clr4 has been extensively characterized using short histone peptide substrates, how it recognizes and coordinates different structural domains to engage physiological substrate nucleosomes remains poorly understood. Here, we employed chemical protein synthesis to generate site‐specifically ubiquitinated H3K14Ub histones and nucleosomes, enabling quantitative biochemical and structural investigations. Using a CAET handle‐assisted strategy, we obtained homogeneous H3K14Ub nucleosomes and demonstrated that ubiquitination enhances Clr4 activity by ∼350‐fold on nucleosomes relative to unmodified substrates. Clr4 domain deletion analyses revealed that, the intrinsically disordered region (IDR) of Clr4 is critical for nucleosome binding and ubiquitin‐dependent stimulation. Through site‐directed photo‐crosslinking, we identified specific IDR residues mediating interactions with nucleosomal surfaces. Furthermore, using an isoUb‐based synthetic approach, we generated H3K9NleK14Ub nucleosomes and determined cryo‐EM structures of Clr4–nucleosome complexes, unveiling multivalent nucleosome recognition by the IDR via four distinct interfaces: the H2A–H2B acidic patch, the H2A/H2B basic groove, the H2B and H3 elbow regions. Methyltransferase activity assays confirmed that mutations disrupting these interfaces impair Clr4 activity. Our study provides mechanistic insights into the ubiquitin‐dependent activation mechanism of Clr4, highlighting the power of chemical biology in deciphering epigenetic regulation."},{"t":"绘制人类大脑终生的功能组织图","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00637-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"鲤鱼白鳍装饰背后的细胞类型多样化和表型趋同","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537571123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Neural crest–derived cells offer valuable opportunities to dissect mechanisms of cell fate specification and differentiation and the underpinnings of cell type diversification over evolutionary time. Particularly useful for such analyses are pigment cells of ectothermic vertebrates that arise from neural crest cells or via latent neural crest–derived stem cells. Among these are white cells, leucophores, present in a variety of species that contribute to patterns on the body or ornamentation on the fins. To better understand developmental and evolutionary origins of these cells, we examined leucophores harboring deposits of yellow/orange carotenoids—xantholeucophores—of zebrafish and leucophores of white cloud minnow. We show that white phenotypes of both cell types require sepiapterin reductase and an accumulation of pale and colorless pteridines. We further demonstrate that xantholeucophores of zebrafish develop from yellow, sepiapterin-rich xanthophore-like cells and that this transition requires both gap junctional communication and the aquaglyceroporin/peroxiporin channel Aquaporin 3, revealing similarities and differences in differentiation and patterning compared to pigment cells on the body. These findings identify xantholeucophores of zebrafish and leucophores of white cloud minnow as distinct developmentally, genetically, and biochemically from other white cells of zebrafish—melanoleucophores—that develop directly from melanophores and depend on guanine crystals, as well as white cells of medaka fish and anemonefish. Our results highlight remarkable convergences and parallelisms in the acquisition of white cell phenotypes within and between phylogenetic lineages and identify this as a rich system for enquiries into the evolutionary individuation of novel cell types."},{"t":"氟诱导β-酮酸与偕二氟丙二烯催化对映选择性脱羧交叉偶联","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4973244?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"不对称脱羧偶联","kp":["催化体系[脱羧交叉偶联]: Rh(I)/(S,S)-Ph-BPE","[不对称合成]: 偕二氟丙二烯诱导烯丙基铑异构化"],"as":"该研究开发了一种催化不对称脱羧烯丙基烷基化（DAA）反应新策略，以β-酮酸为底物，通过钯配合手性配体实现高对映选择性的脱羧交叉偶联。该方法可高效构建含季碳立体中心的手性分子，在药物合成和天然产物全合成中具有重要应用价值。相比传统烷基化方法，脱羧途径避免了强碱条件，副产物仅为CO2，符合绿色化学理念，显著拓宽了不对称催化C-C键构建的工具箱。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Catalytic Enantioselective Decarboxylative Cross‐Coupling of β‐Ketoacids With gem‐Difluoroallenes Enabled by Fluorine‐In","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Catalytic decarboxylative allylic alkylation (DAA) reaction represents an efficient strategy for synthesizing molecules containing both carbonyl and alkenyl functionalities, yet is frequently challenged by multiple selectivity issues. Here we report the first intermolecular decarboxylative cross‐coupling of β‐ketoacids with internal allenes. Using a Rh\n                    (I)\n                    /(\n                    S\n                    ,\n                    S\n                    )‐Ph‐BPE system, α‐\n                    gem\n                    ‐difluoroallylic carbonyl compounds can be generated with excellent chemo‐, regio‐, and enantioselectivities. Mechanistic studies support “coordination‐assisted inner‐sphere addition–decarboxylation” pathway, where C─C bond formation occurs prior to the decarboxylation step. Fluorine‐induced\n                    anti\n                    →\n                    syn\n                    isomerization of π‐allyl‐rhodium species proves to be the key factor governing the stereoselectivity of this reaction. This cross‐coupling reaction tolerates a range of functional groups and advances the field of decarboxylative allylic alkylation."},{"t":"中国能否保持其非凡的研究增长？","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00423-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"CO2与循环水共注入实现地下矿物封存","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10130-5","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2矿化封存","kp":["[CCS策略]: CO2与循环水共注入地下矿化封存","[目标岩层]: 镁铁质/超镁铁质岩石"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种新型CO2地下矿物封存策略：将CO2与循环水共同注入深层玄武岩储层，加速CO2矿化为固态碳酸盐矿物。相比传统超临界CO2地质封存依赖盖层密封、存在泄漏风险，矿物封存将CO2永久固化为岩石，安全性更高。冰岛CarbFix项目已验证该路线在两年内可实现90%以上CO2矿化。共注入循环水方案可降低淡水消耗并提升经济性，对助力各国兑现《巴黎协定》减排承诺具有现实意义。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"CO2 subsurface mineral storage by its co-injection with recirculating water","b":"Carbon capture and storage (CCS) has the potential to help nations meet their Paris Agreement CO2 reduction commitments1,2. The ability to capture CO2 within mafic and ultramafic rocks through mineralization of carbon is an example of such a CCS technology3,4, but large-scale deployment has yet to be achieved5,6. Each geologic environment in the Earth’s crust requires a distinct carbon storage solution. Whereas some regions of the subsurface contain saline aquifers and sedimentary traps suitable for traditional carbon storage through the injection of high-pressure, dense CO2 below impermeable caprocks, other regions may lack caprocks5,6,7,8,9. In these regions, carbon storage is possible through the mineralization of injected water-dissolved CO2 forming stable carbonate minerals through its reactions with reactive silicate rocks and minerals6,10,11. A notable challenge to applying this process at scale is that it can require 20–50 times or more water than the mass of CO2 stored12. Here we report on an industrial-scale pilot project designed to find a carbon disposal solution for western Saudi Arabia. This arid region has large point-source CO2 emitters, including petroleum refining and desalination facilities, but lacks saline aquifers and sedimentary traps13,14,15,16,17. We find that a CO2 injection approach based on the recirculation of subsurface fluids can eliminate the need for external water. Our results demonstrate the feasibility of carbon mineral storage in regions in which access to water resources may be limited.","lv":1,"cm":"该研究的关键突破在于通过“地下循环反应器”设计解决了矿物封存对水资源的核心约束，该技术通过溶解-矿化机制降低了对盖层的依赖，但仍需富含镁铁质矿物的反应性地层，改变了封存路径的约束条件，研究团队利用示踪剂方法实现矿化过程的定量验证，体现出从实验室反应机理向工程系统控制的跨越；但其规模化仍面临地下流动路径不可控、矿物沉淀导致孔隙堵塞以及多井系统协同运行复杂等工程挑战，适合经过多次工程化测试后在特定地质条件下应用，难以完全替代传统盐水层封存。"},{"t":"CMOS兼容锂离子电池用于分布式片上供电架构","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00072-X?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"芯片级锂电池","kp":["[电池形态]: CMOS兼容晶圆级锂离子电池","集成方式[芯片供电]: 单片集成分布式片上电源","[优势]: 高体积能量密度与容量利用率"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究面向片上系统（SoC）异构化、高功能密度和高能效发展趋势，提出一种CMOS工艺兼容的微型锂离子电池，用于构建分布式片上供电架构。传统SoC依赖外部电源，限制了芯片集成度与便携性；该微型电池采用半导体兼容工艺集成于芯片内部，可为局部模块就近供电，降低互连寄生损耗，提升供电效率与系统可靠性。该技术有望在物联网传感器节点、可穿戴设备和生物医学植入芯片等场景中实现自供电集成系统。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"CMOS-compatible lithium-ion batteries for distributed on-chip power architecture","b":"System-on-chips are being developed toward a heterogeneous design, high function density, and high energy utilization. This work presents CMOS-compatible wafer-scale lithium-ion batteries with high volumetric energy density and capacity utilization that enable the distributed on-chip power supply for the first time. By replacing discrete batteries with monolithically integrated energy storage devices, the proposed distributed on-chip power architecture offers a scalable route toward more efficient, compact, and multifunctional integrated electronic systems."},{"t":"CLOCK 催化的组蛋白 H3K37 戊二酰化抑制胶质母细胞瘤中的 H3K36 三甲基化途径","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea1127?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Circadian CLOCK (circadian locomotor output cycles kaput) can mediate chromatin remodeling events implicated in gene transcription. The acetyltransferase roles of CLOCK are well studied, but CLOCK-mediated chromatin remodeling events are not well understood. We report that CLOCK can use glutaryl–coenzyme A to catalyze glutarylation at histone H3 Lys\n                    37\n                    (H3K37glut). H3K37glut is undocumented. The glutaryl moiety of H3K37glut can be pulled by its neighboring H3H39 and H3R40 residues via electrostatic interactions and bent over the pyrrolidine ring of the neighboring H3P38 residue, forming a conformation to block SETD2 binding to the N-terminal tail of histone H3. It reduces SETD2-catalyzed H3K36 trimethylation (H3K36me3) and the H3K36me3-regulated downstream pathways in cells. In glioblastoma, both CLOCK protein and CLOCK-mediated H3K37glut are abnormally up-regulated. H3K37glut significantly correlates with suppressed H3K36me3 level in human glioblastoma tissues, tumor progression, and survival of patients with glioblastoma. This study expands the repertoire of histone modification and diversifies the mechanisms underlying CLOCK-implicated chromatin dynamics. It also unearths an undocumented mechanistic link between dysregulated circadian CLOCK and decreased H3K36me3 pathways in glioblastoma."},{"t":"弥合差距：梯度支架作为周围神经修复的生物指导平台","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS00738K","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Peripheral nerve injury remains a major clinical challenge due to its complex pathophysiology and limited intrinsic regenerative capacity. Effective nerve guidance conduits (NGCs) therefore require not only structural support but also bioinstructive cues capable of actively regulating cellular behavior. Spatial gradients play a fundamental biological role in directing cell migration and axonal elongation by providing long-range guidance cues that cannot be achieved with uniform biochemical or structural cues alone. From a materials and chemical perspective, gradient NGCs represent a distinctive class of biomaterials in which physical properties, such as topography, porosity, and stiffness, and biochemical components, including growth factors, chemokines, peptides, and extracellular matrix (ECM) molecules, are spatially encoded within the conduit structure. These gradients are established through physicochemical processes such as diffusion and adsorption kinetics, polymer network formation, crosslinking reactions, and interfacial chemistry. In this review, we discuss the mechanisms by which gradient cues regulate cellular and axonal responses, and summarize recent advances in the materials design and fabrication strategies used to introduce physical and biochemical gradients into NGCs. We further summarize representative in vitro and in vivo regenerative outcomes, highlighting how chemically engineered gradients synergize with structural guidance to promote organized nerve regeneration. Finally, we outline key challenges, including gradient stability, reproducibility, and compatibility with scalable manufacturing, and discuss future directions for the clinical translation of gradient-based NGCs.","tp":"神经修复支架","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"综述了梯度支架作为周围神经修复生物指导平台的研究进展。周围神经损伤因复杂病理生理和有限再生能力成为临床难题，有效神经导管需兼具结构支撑和主动调控细胞行为的生化指令。空间梯度可提供长程导向信号引导细胞迁移和轴突延伸，这是均匀生化或结构信号无法实现的。梯度支架有望弥合当前神经修复材料的性能差距。"},{"t":"制动驱动骨系统：炎症微环境和骨质疏松 B 骨生成的顺序调节","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72909?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Osteoporotic bone defects, characterized by chronic inflammation and impaired osteogenesis, pose a formidable challenge for functional bone regeneration. Conventional scaffolds lack effective regulation of the inflammatory microenvironment and fail to coordinate anti‐inflammatory and osteogenic signals, thereby limiting their ability to couple inflammation resolution with new bone formation. Here, we developed a “Brake–Drive Osteo System”, a spatiotemporally programmed biomaterial integrating quercetin‐loaded nanovesicles and teriparatide‐loaded nucleic acid frameworks within a calcium phosphate scaffold (BCP‐T/N@Q/V). This design enables a sequential therapeutic cascade—quercetin first “disengages the inflammatory brake”, alleviating microenvironmental resistance to osteogenesis, while teriparatide subsequently “activates the osteogenic drive”, promoting bone regeneration. It effectively reprogrammed macrophages toward a pro‐regenerative phenotype and mitigated inflammatory stress, establishing an immunologically permissive microenvironment. This osteoimmune modulation significantly enhanced the osteogenic commitment and maturation of osteoporotic bone marrow mesenchymal stem cells. In a rat osteoporotic femoral condyle defect model, the scaffold achieved accelerated, structurally integrated bone regeneration, underscoring its translational potential. Collectively, this “Brake–Drive Osteo System” provides a sequential strategy that couples inflammation resolution with osteogenesis for effective osteoporotic bone regeneration.","tp":"骨修复材料","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了\"制动-驱动骨系统\"（Brake-Drive Osteo System），通过时空程序化设计协调抗炎和成骨信号，解决骨质疏松性骨缺损中慢性炎症与成骨受损的难题。传统支架缺乏对炎症微环境的有效调控，无法将炎症消退与新骨形成耦合。该系统实现对炎症微环境的顺序调节，为功能性骨再生提供了新策略。"},{"t":"吸血触发蜱唾液腺前体细胞的终末分化","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec7620?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Ticks transmit a wide range of pathogens to humans. During blood feeding, they inject salivary proteins that suppress host immune responses, enabling prolonged feeding and pathogen transmission. A hallmark of this process is the dynamic reprogramming of salivary gene expression, known as the sialome switch. Here, we describe a previously unrecognized cellular mechanism underlying this phenomenon in two medically important tick species. Using integrated multi-omics and imaging approaches, we identified a conserved population of undifferentiated salivary gland precursor cells in unfed ticks. Upon host attachment, these precursors undergo terminal differentiation into specialized secretory subtypes through a conserved transcriptional and signaling framework that drives salivary gland activation and maturation. Unlike other blood-feeding arthropods, tick salivary glands dynamically remodel in response to host contact, producing saliva with a shifting composition. This study suggests the cellular basis of adult female tick salivary gland maturation and offers targets to disrupt feeding and pathogen transmission."},{"t":"基于静电界面增强的仿生电定位","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518561?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  As one of the remote sensing abilities, electrolocation allows organisms to hunt, navigate, and interact with the environment by sensing electric fields. Mimicking this capability in artificial systems will provide a powerful strategy for remote object detection and inspection. However, current artificial approaches are restricted to conductive medium or charged targets, while electrolocation of uncharged targets in the non‐conductive medium has not been achieved yet. In this work, an electrostatic interfacial enhancement‐based electrolocation system (EIEEs) that fundamentally expands the scope of artificial electrolocation is proposed. Inspired by the electric organs of elasmobranch fish and the mechanosensory setae of insects, EIEEs employs electret materials as the electrostatic source and high‐permittivity droplets as mechanosensory structures, locating objects with permittivities different from the medium. The proposed EIEEs can effectively detect uncharged solid/liquid objects without electrical connection, signal processing, or external power supply. Importantly, EIEEs also demonstrates the capability to detect multiple buried defects in objects, including gas in liquids, solid in liquids, liquid in liquids, and gas in solids, which has been largely unexplored in previous electrolocation systems. As a general‐purpose remote sensing system for both surface and subsurface inspection, EIEEs can potentially provide a complementary modality for diverse scientific and technological domains.","tp":"仿生电定位","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究实现了在非导电介质中对不带电目标的仿生电定位。电定位是生物体通过感知电场进行猎食和导航的远程传感能力，但现有人工方法仅限于导电介质或带电目标。该研究基于静电界面增强原理，突破了非导电环境中检测中性目标的限制，为远程目标检测和无损检测提供了新策略，拓展了人工电定位的应用边界。"},{"t":"基于生物的片上模型可识别过度兴奋的皮质纹状体内的选择性拓扑重组","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513459123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The mammalian cerebral cortex projects to the striatum in a precise, hierarchical topography, forming parallel loops that underlie sensorimotor, associative, and limbic processing. Despite the striatum’s lack of clear anatomical boundaries, these projections remain functionally segregated, suggesting the existence of intrinsic organizing principles. Disruptions in corticostriatal connectivity and excitability are common in neurodevelopmental disorders, but it remains unclear whether such abnormalities are a cause or a consequence of circuit dysfunction. Here, we hypothesized that the excitability state of cortical neurons plays a direct role in shaping the topographic organization of their striatal projections. To test this, we engineered a biologically faithful in vitro platform inspired by the Tesla valve, enabling adjacent corticostriatal territories to be modeled under controlled excitability regimes. We found that cortical hyperexcitability disrupted the normal developmental transition from axonal growth to stabilization, leading to premature invasion of neighboring territories and the formation of ectopic convergence zones. As a result, the segregation between parallel pathways was lost, while local connectivity patterns remained unaffected. These findings reveal that intrinsic, activity-sensitive mechanisms constrain long-range axonal growth to shape the wiring diagram of the corticostriatal projectome. They also highlight the power of biologically grounded on-chip models to uncover how early circuit vulnerabilities can lead to connectivity defects characteristic of disorders such as autism spectrum disorder, schizophrenia, epilepsy, and obsessive-compulsive disorder."},{"t":"无粘结剂自支撑高导电硫化物电解质实现优异阳极稳定性","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72683?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"硫化物固态电解质","kp":["电解质[固态电池]: 无粘结剂自支撑硫化物型","[特性]: 高导电性+优异阳极稳定性"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种无需粘结剂、自支撑且高导电性的硫化物固体电解质材料。硫化物电解质因其高离子电导率和与电极的良好兼容性，被认为是全固态锂电池最具潜力的电解质方案之一。传统硫化物电解质膜需要添加大量绝缘粘结剂和导电添加剂，显著降低了有效离子传输面积和能量密度。该工作通过构建自支撑结构，避免了粘结剂的使用，同时保持了高电子导电性，有望简化全固态电池的制造工艺、提升界面接触质量并降低内阻，为高能量密度固态电池的工程化推进提供了新思路。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Binder‐Free, Self‐Supporting, and Highly Conductive Sulfide Electrolytes Enabling Superior Anode Stability (Adv. Mater. ","b":"Superior Anode Stability In their Research Article (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202517806), Shunsuke Kawaguchi, Takuhiro Miyuki, and co-workers present a binder-free, self-supporting sulfide solid electrolyte with exceptionally reduced grain boundaries, delivering high ionic conductivity together with remarkable mechanical robustness. The membrane demonstrates outstanding Li stability and realistic full-cell performance, and the cover visual highlights this architecture as a highly effective strategy to mitigate critical bottlenecks in all-solid-state batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"双向晶格锚定增强废锂离子正极材料的组成重构","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70869?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池正极回收","kp":["材料组成[退役正极]: LiNi0.54Co0.16Mn0.3O2","[回收策略]: 双向晶格锚定增强组分重构","[目标]: 高镍化提升能量密度的升级回收"],"as":"该研究提出一种双向晶格锚定策略，用于提升退役锂离子电池材料的高价值回收效率。退役锂电池正极材料的直接再生回收是循环经济的关键环节，但传统回收方法面临结构重建不彻底、组分再配置不均匀等瓶颈。该工作通过双向晶格锚定机制，促进废旧材料中活性组分的组成重构，使 degraded 晶格恢复至接近原始状态的电化学活性结构。这一方法有望提高回收材料的循环稳定性和容量保持率，为降低电池全生命周期成本和减少对原生矿产资源的依赖提供了新路径。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Bidirectional Lattice Anchoring Enhances Composition Reconfiguration of Spent Lithium‐Ion Cathodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐value recycling of retired lithium‐ion battery materials is pivotal for the circular economy. The nickel‐rich strategy, with its merits in boosting energy density, stands out as a key approach for upcycling spent LiNi\n                    0.54\n                    Co\n                    0.16\n                    Mn\n                    0.3\n                    O\n                    2\n                    (SNCM). However, the inherent structural defects of SNCM and the heterogeneous reactions among precursors during regeneration jointly induce irreversible phase transformations, preventing the formation of an ideally ordered layered structure. Therefore, we developed a targeted bidirectional anchoring strategy involving pre‐anchoring Al species on both SNCM and Ni(OH)\n                    2\n                    surfaces. This method reduces the energy barrier for lithiation in the surface‐disordered structures of SNCM and suppresses the structural degradation of nickel‐rich intermediate phases, thereby addressing the root cause of structural disorder during upcycling. The upcycled cathode material exhibits a stable layered structure and a distinctive nickel concentration gradient from the surface toward the bulk. It delivers outstanding electrochemical performance, including a reversible capacity of 186.84 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.2C and retaining 90.17% of its initial capacity after 200 cycles at 1C, outperforming current commercial materials. Furthermore, this study provides essential insights into solid‐state regeneration and establishes a pathway toward the high‐value recycling of degraded lithium‐ion batteries, demonstrating great potential for practical application.","aip":1},{"t":"具有不对称局部电场的轴向硫桥Mo-S-Cu纳米酶可增强F的多酶活性","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523888?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The axial coordination‐based nanozymes with asymmetric local electric field (LEF) are promising for efficient reactive oxygen species (ROS)‐mediated antitumor treatments, while normally hindered by a limited LEF upon individual coordination to adjacent atoms. Herein, an axial sulfur‐bridged Mo─S─Cu nanozymes with asymmetric LEF (A‐CuN\n                    3\n                    S\n                    1\n                    @MoS\n                    2‐x\n                    ) was constructed based on nanoislands (NIs)‐based axial ligand‐bridging to enhance ferroptosis‐pyroptosis therapy. The S bridge between Cu atoms in CuN\n                    3\n                    /C nanosheets and Mo site in NIs creates a broad and enhanced LEF, which facilitates rapid electron transfer between the nanozyme and substrates, thereby regulating its enzymatic activities. Theoretical calculations reveal that the S‐bridge induces asymmetric electron‐rich redistribution along the longitudinal axis of Cu─N\n                    3\n                    , promoting H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    heterolysis and O\n                    2\n                    desorption to enhance catalase‐like and peroxidase‐like activities. Simultaneously, Mo sites extract electrons from Cu via the S bridge, augmenting oxidase‐like activities and degrade overexpressed glutathione to avoid nontherapeutic ROS consumption. Consequently, A‐CuN\n                    3\n                    S\n                    1\n                    @MoS\n                    2‐x\n                    induces robust ferroptosis by cytotoxic ROS accumulation and causing severe mitochondria damages, while simultaneously activating pyroptosis within the tumor region without harming normal tissues. This work demonstrates high‐efficiency ferroptosis‐pyroptosis therapy driven by multi‐enzyme catalysis via axial Mo─S─Cu coordination with an expanded asymmetric LEF, offering a novel strategy for non‐apoptotic tumor treatment.","tp":"纳米酶催化","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究设计了具有不对称局部电场（LEF）的轴向硫桥Mo-S-Cu纳米酶（A-CuN3S1@MoS2-x），通过硫桥轴向配位策略增强局部电场强度，突破单一配位至相邻原子导致LEF有限的瓶颈。该纳米酶展现出增强的多酶活性，可高效产生活性氧（ROS），在ROS介导的抗肿瘤治疗中展现出优异潜力，为纳米酶抗肿瘤治疗提供了新的结构设计范式。"},{"t":"厌恶学习劫持大脑糖传感器来巩固记忆","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10306-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The formation of food-related memories involves post-ingestion nutrient sensing signals1,2,3,4,5. Whether nutrient sensors act beyond feeding-relevant behaviour is less well understood. Here we show that an internal sugar sensor in the Drosophila brain6 is involved in memory consolidation, both in fasted flies subjected to an appetitive learning task involving a sucrose reward and in flies fed ad libitum subjected to an aversive learning task independent of food cues7,8. In the latter, spaced repetition of learning sessions, a prerequisite to induce long-term memory, lures brain fructose-sensing neurons into a fasted state through a disinhibition mechanism that transiently restores their sensing ability despite satiation9. Post-learning sugar ingestion activates disinhibited fructose-sensing neurons, which triggers memory consolidation through the release of the glycoprotein hormone thyrostimulin10,11, as in appetitive learning. The reset of fructose-sensing neurons by spaced training also results in a fasted state-like feeding behaviour, manifesting in a strong increase in sucrose preference and intake. By revealing a mechanism of non-homeostatic hunger and its critical relevance for memory consolidation, our results provide a neural circuit basis, and a cognitive value, to a behaviour akin to emotional eating."},{"t":"作者更正：光开关异构体改善晶界韧性及钙钛矿太阳能电池稳定性","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02041-6","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿光开关分子","as":"","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":2.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Author Correction: Photoswitchable isomers to improve grain boundary resilience and perovskite solar cells stability und"},{"t":"北部中纬度地区大气氧化能力正达到拐点","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag178/8539750?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"The hydroxyl radical (OH) constitutes the primary atmospheric oxidant, governing the removal of short-lived greenhouse gases such as methane and the formation of secondary pollutants, including ozone. Characterizing long-term OH variability is critical for understanding atmospheric oxidation capacity and formulation of air quality improvement strategies. Although previous studies have linked OH increases to anthropogenic emissions, particularly nitrogen oxides (NOx), the historical evolution of OH remains poorly constrained. Here, we develop an observation-based method (OBM) to quantify spatiotemporal variability of surface OH concentration and identify its key turning points for China, Europe and the United States. Relative to clean regions, OH concentrations have increased by about 300% in all three regions, mainly attributable to enhanced NOx emissions. However, OBM-derived trends reveal that OH levels have reached a turning point, with statistically significant decreases observed at ∼10% of stations in Europe and the United States, while ∼85% of stations continue to increase. At hemispheric mid-latitudes, OH levels have remained near peak values of (5–9) × 106 cm−3 over the past 50–60 years, and it may take another several decades to fully return to the NOx-limited regime, beyond the turning point. These findings challenge prior assessments of OH increases or stability and suggest an emerging decline in mid-latitude atmospheric oxidation capacity, as well as provide a novel indicator of regional ozone control strategies."},{"t":"面向高能量密度快充的钠金属电池不对称体相设计","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00038-3?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠金属电池","kp":["[隔膜设计]: 不对称隔膜促进Na+分步去溶剂化","[效果]: 降低成核势垒+引导无机富集SEI","[应用]: 高能量密度快充钠金属电池"],"dp":1,"as":"研究团队提出了一种用于钠金属电池的不对称隔膜设计，通过促进钠离子的逐步去溶剂化过程来降低成核势垒，从而实现高能量密度和快速充电性能。该不对称隔膜在两侧分别采用不同的功能层，有效调控了钠离子在电极界面处的沉积行为，抑制了枝晶生长。实验表明，该设计使钠金属电池在高温量条件下保持稳定的循环性能，为下一代低成本、高安全性的储能体系提供了新思路。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Asymmetric bulk toward energy-dense fast-charging sodium metal batteries","b":"Zhang et al. propose an asymmetric separator that reduces nucleation barrier by promoting the stepwise desolvation of Na+ in bulk and guides the formation of an inorganic-rich solid electrolyte interphase in sodium metal batteries. By introducing this asymmetric separator, they provide a rational strategy for energy-dense fast-charging sodium metal batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"人工胚胎节点阐明了流动在脊椎动物左右对称性破缺中的作用","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec2328?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"During the embryonic development of vertebrates, initially, symmetric embryos develop asymmetrically arranged organs. The asymmetry initiates with the formation of a small fluid-filled cavity on the embryo called the embryonic node, which contains motile cilia that generate specific flow patterns. The mechanism by which this nodal flow is sensed and causes asymmetry development has remained elusive despite major experimental and computational efforts. Existing hypotheses focus on either mechanical or chemical signaling processes. We report an experimental artificial embryonic node that, combined with numerical simulations, enables in-depth investigation of nodal flow and its role in left-right asymmetry development. Dissimilar fluid velocity profiles develop around primary cilia on the left and right nodal sides, producing distinct cilium bending. Also, the distribution of signaling particles with specific diffusivities exhibits spatial and temporal asymmetry. Together, our results support both mechanical and chemical sensing hypotheses and suggest a potential synergy between the two sensing mechanisms for the enhanced robustness of left-right asymmetry development."},{"t":"臂长可控的CsPbBr3纳米晶实现可调光学与组装行为","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519211?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"研究报道了通过配体链长调控实现CsPbBr3钙钛矿纳米晶体光学性质和组装行为的可调节性。研究团队合成了不同有机配体链长保护的钙钛矿纳米晶，系统考察了配体链长对晶体尺寸、发光波长、量子产率及纳米晶间相互作用的影响。结果表明，较短配体链增强了载流子传输效率，而较长链则提升了胶体稳定性并促进超晶格有序组装。该工作为钙钛矿纳米晶在光电器件、显示和量子发射等领域的精准调控提供了重要实验依据。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿纳米晶","kp":["[材料]: CsPbBr3钙钛矿纳米晶","[关键参数]: 臂数长度调控光学与自组装行为","[发光特性]: 明亮稳定的绿色发射"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Arm‐Length‐Controlled CsPbBr3 Nanocrystals for Tunable Optical and Assembly Behavior","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Colloidal cesium lead bromide (CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    ) nanocrystals (NCs) are excellent candidates for various photonic and optoelectronic applications due to their bright and stable green emission. Here, we establish arm length control as a central structural parameter that governs both the optical properties of individual CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    NCs and their self‐assembly behavior. Armed NCs, featuring a cubic core with multiple protruding arms, are synthesized by controlling seed size, concentration, and injection temperature, while arm length is tuned via cesium oleate concentration. Prolonged storage in toluene is shown to lead to a time‐dependent morphological evolution from armed NCs to 26‐faceted rhombicuboctahedra, with short‐armed structures as intermediates. NCs with a longer arm length yield enhanced radiative efficiency, extended photoluminescence (PL) lifetimes, and suppressed blinking, making such NCs suitable for light‐emitting devices and quantum photonic applications. In contrast, short‐armed NCs exhibit faster recombination, stronger PL intermittency, and increased surface accessibility, which are favorable for sensing and high‐speed single‐photon emission. The arm length also governs self‐assembly behavior, hereby opening new possibilities for applications. Armed NCs form densely 3D‐packed assemblies with tunable configurations. This work demonstrates how arm length tuning expands the functional potential of CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    NCs by linking morphological control to both optical response and self‐assembly characteristics."},{"t":"抗癌抗体可能进化导致自身免疫性脑部疾病","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00919-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"A model of breast cancer that expresses NMDA receptors — proteins that modify signalling between neurons — was used to trace pre-existing B cells as they matured to produce autoimmune antibodies that have diverse effects on receptor function. Transferring one antibody into mouse brains recapitulated key features of autoimmune brain inflammation. Immune cells called B cells recognize the NMDA receptor expressed on some cancers and produce antibodies targeting it."},{"t":"小鼠压后皮质前部和后部形成不同的视觉空间回路","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70762-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The retrosplenial cortex (RSC) integrates sensory and mnemonic information to support spatial orientation and navigation, yet how visuospatial processing differs across its subregions remains unclear. Here, we combined cellular imaging in navigating mice with brain-wide anatomical input tracing to characterize how multimodal sensory and positional signals are integrated along the anterior–posterior axis of dorsal RSC. We identified consistent differences between anterior and posterior subregions in both functional response properties and long-range connectivity. Anterior RSC neurons displayed sharper and more reliable position tuning during tactile-cued navigation and preferential sensitivity to fast, low–spatial-frequency visual motion. In contrast, posterior RSC neurons showed broader position selectivity, stronger responses to slow, high–spatial-frequency visual patterns, and enhanced tuning in visually immersive virtual environments. Consistent with these differences, anterior RSC received denser projections from motor, somatosensory, and parietal areas, whereas posterior RSC received stronger input from primary and posteromedial visual cortices. Together, these findings identify an anterior–posterior functional gradient in RSC, with subregions differing in how they integrate sensory and positional signals during navigation."},{"t":"男性胚胎后脑中的雄激素活性驱动致命的 PFA 室管膜瘤","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10264-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Posterior fossa type A (PFA) ependymoma is an unusual infantile brain tumour with few known somatic mutations, thought to be driven by epigenetic mechanisms1. PFA ependymoma has a markedly higher incidence and worse prognosis in male children than in female children2. The mechanisms that underlie these sex differences are at present unknown. Here we show that the cellular hierarchy of PFA ependymoma is less differentiated in male individuals than it is in female individuals. In the normal developing mouse hindbrain, male gliogenic progenitors are less differentiated than matched female sibling controls. To further parse the effects of chromosomal versus gonadal contributions in the male hindbrain, we used the four-core genotype mouse model3, which showed that androgen signalling, rather than sex chromosomes, prolongs hindbrain differentiation in male mice. Androgen supplementation promotes the growth of PFA ependymoma, but not that of other brain tumours. Conversely, androgen blockade diminishes both the stem-like potential and the proliferation of PFA ependymoma. We conclude that androgen signalling in both the normal developing hindbrain and PFA ependymoma is sufficient to promote growth and delay differentiation. Anti-androgen therapies represent a potential clinical avenue to target this currently untreatable childhood cancer."},{"t":"质子交换膜燃料电池运行条件参数诱导气体串扰现象分析：综述","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003673?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"燃料电池气体串透","kp":["[失效现象]: 操作条件致PEMFC气体串透"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Analysis of operating condition parameters induced gas crossover phenomenon in proton exchange membrane fuel cells: A re"},{"t":"含Pt-(di-NHC)-Pt单元的有机金属[2]索烃：拓扑驱动策略增强盘状分子磷光","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1981919?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铂索烃配合物","kp":["[超分子磷光]: 机械键限制分子内运动增强发射","发光材料[索烃]: 双核Pt(II)-NHC配合物"],"as":"该研究报道了一种基于Pt‒(双N-杂环卡宾)‒Pt单元的有机金属[2]索烃，通过拓扑驱动策略实现高效合成。机械互锁分子（MIMs）作为离散可溶性聚集体，在分子机器和功能材料领域具有重要价值。该工作利用配位驱动自组装策略，将金属铂中心与双齿卡宾配体结合，构建出具有特定拓扑结构的索烃分子。该合成方法为复杂拓扑分子体系的精准构建提供了新范式。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"An Organometallic [2]Catenane With Pt‒(di‐NHC)‒Pt Units: A Topology‐Driven Strategy for Enhanced Phosphorescence in Disc","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mechanically interlocked molecules (MIMs) can be conceptualized as a distinct class of discrete and soluble aggregates, where the mechanical bond restricts selected intramolecular motions, thereby triggering emission enhancement analogous to aggregation‐induced emission (AIE). Herein, we present phosphorescent MIMs based on a benzobiscarbene bridged dinuclear Pt\n                    II\n                    complex (NHC =\n                    N\n                    ‐heterocyclic carbene ligand). Tailoring the\n                    N\n                    ‐substituents of the benzobiscarbene ligand allowed selective access to the\n                    syn‐\n                    configured dinuclear complex\n                    syn‐\n                    [Pt\n                    2\n                    (\n                    1b\n                    )X\n                    2\n                    ] (X = I, OTf). Self‐assembly of\n                    syn‐\n                    [Pt\n                    2\n                    (\n                    1b\n                    )(OTf)\n                    2\n                    ] with bipyridyl ligands\n                    \n                      L\n                      2\n                    \n                    and\n                    \n                      L\n                      3\n                    \n                    yielded two discrete MIMs: the Borromean rings [\n                    2‐BRs\n                    ](OTf)\n                    12\n                    stabilized by π···π interactions and the [2]catenane [\n                    3b‐IL\n                    ](OTf)\n                    4\n                    , generated and stabilized by solvophobic effects. While the π···π interactions in the Borromean rings lead to severe phosphorescence quenching, the solvophobically assembled [2]catenane effectively circumvents such quenching, while simultaneously restricting intramolecular rotations and vibrations. Consequently, the [2]catenane displays a drastic phosphorescence enhancement compared to the Borromean rings."},{"t":"以双(二氟硼)-8-咪唑二吡咯甲烷为核心的电子受体用于短波红外光电探测","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3239137?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"短波红外光电材料","kp":["光谱范围[短波红外]: 1000–3000 nm","[受体核心]: 双硼二氟-8-咪唑二吡咯甲烷(BIP)","[分子结构]: D-A型小分子电子受体"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究设计了一种以双(二氟硼酰基)-8-咪唑二吡咯甲烷为核心骨架的新型小分子电子受体材料。含供体-受体（D-A）结构的小分子电子受体在有机太阳能电池领域展现出优异潜力。该材料利用强吸电子的BF2-咪唑单元优化分子能级和吸收光谱，提升光生载流子分离与传输效率。此类电子受体的开发对推动有机光伏器件效率突破具有积极意义。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"An Electron Acceptor With bis(Borondifluoride)‐8‐imidazodipyrromethene as the Core for Short‐Wavelength Infrared Photore","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Small‐molecule electron acceptors with donor–acceptor (D–A) structures have emerged as attractive materials for organic optoelectronics, yet achieving strong absorption in the short‐wavelength infrared (SWIR, 1000–3000 nm) region remains a fundamental challenge. Here, a resonant N—B←N unit, bis(borondifluoride)‐8‐imidazodipyrromethene (BIP), is introduced as a new electron‐deficient core for constructing D–A type SWIR acceptors. Incorporation of the BIP unit induces a pronounced bathochromic shift of 255 nm and affords an ultranarrow optical bandgap of 0.86 eV, with thin‐film absorption extending to 1450 nm. The resulting acceptor, BIP‐M1, exhibits a high molar extinction coefficient of 3.8 × 10\n                    5\n                    M\n                    −\n                    1\n                    cm\n                    −\n                    1\n                    and an exceptionally small Stokes shift of 0.054 eV, indicative of its strong SWIR absorption capability and suppressed nonradiative losses. Photodiode‐type organic photodetectors based on BIP‐M1 enable sensitive photoresponse over a broad spectral range from 300 to 1400 nm, delivering a responsivity of 0.18 A W\n                    −\n                    1\n                    and a specific detectivity of 3.93 × 10\n                    11\n                    Jones at 1200 nm, together with an ultralow Urbach energy of 19.19 meV. This study identifies resonant N—B←N units as powerful structural motifs for small bandgap molecular design and establishes BIP‐based small molecular acceptors as a promising platform for next‐generation SWIR optoelectronics."},{"t":"杏仁核经颅超声刺激破坏威胁获取和消退学习","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeg8830?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Transcranial ultrasound stimulation applied to the human amygdala selectively impacts the initial phases of both threat learning and its subsequent extinction."},{"t":"改变 MXene 中水的形态和扩散率：机器学习加速计算与","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz1780?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Nanoconfined water exhibits unique properties compared to bulk water due to limited quantities, frustrated hydrogen bonding, and surface interactions, which are fundamental for energy storage and transport applications. We integrate machine learning–accelerated ab initio molecular dynamics with x-ray diffraction (XRD) and inelastic neutron scattering (INS) to systematically analyze the thermodynamic and dynamic behavior of water confined between functionalized (-F, -O, and -OH) two-dimensional (2D) Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    MXene layers. As water intercalates between layers, the interlayer spacing exhibits layer-dependent staging characteristics. The water polarization can be flipped by the count and morphology of intercalated molecules interacting with MXene surface groups, resulting in varying electrostatic potential profiles. On the basis of interfacial electrostatic potential, hydrogen bond lifetime, and molecular orientation, we establish a linear combination of exponential model describing water diffusivity. These computational insights align well with experimental x-ray and neutron measurements, suggesting strategies for tuning water morphology and transport by tailoring MXene surface chemistry and water content for electrochemical energy storage and nanofluidic applications.","tp":"限域水行为","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究将机器学习加速的第一性原理分子动力学与X射线衍射和非弹性中子散射相结合，系统分析了功能化（-F、-O、-OH）MXene二维材料间纳米限域水的热力学和动力学行为。纳米限域水因受限体积、受阻氢键和表面相互作用展现出与体相水截然不同的特性，该研究对理解纳米限域水行为及其在储能和输运中的应用具有重要意义。"},{"t":"脂肪 Dicer-1 通过 miR-8–Aop–Dilp6 轴调节全身胰岛素信号传导和寿命","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525327123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Interorgan communication is essential for metabolic homeostasis and healthy aging, with adipose tissue acting as a central hub that coordinates systemic metabolism, stress responses, and longevity. Here, we show that the miRNA-processing enzyme Dicer-1 (Dcr-1) acts in the fat body (FB) to regulate Dilp2 secretion from brain insulin-producing cells (IPCs), thereby modulating systemic insulin signaling and lifespan in\n                    Drosophila\n                    . Dcr-1 expression is reduced in multiple long-lived conditions, and its partial downregulation enhances oxidative stress resistance, alters lipid metabolism, and extends lifespan even under dietary restriction. Proteomic profiling of FBs from Dcr-1 heterozygous flies revealed widespread metabolic reprogramming and stress adaptation consistent with attenuated insulin/IGF signaling (IIS). Mechanistically, reduced Dcr-1 lowers miR-8 levels in the FB, which indirectly upregulates\n                    Drosophila\n                    insulin-like peptide 6 (Dilp6). Dilp6 acts nonautonomously to suppress Dilp2 secretion from IPCs, reducing systemic IIS and promoting longevity. We further show that Dcr-1 reduction activates the ETS-family repressor Aop/ETV6 downstream of Ras-Erk signaling, which is required for Dilp6 induction and the lifespan extension observed upon miR-8 depletion. Collectively, these findings reveal a miRNA-dependent regulatory axis that couples adipose-derived endocrine signals to systemic insulin regulation and aging, positioning Dcr-1 as a central node in the control of metabolic homeostasis and lifespan."},{"t":"实用无负极钠电池中的活性钠损耗：机理、挑战与策略","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00760K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"无负极钠电池","kp":["[电池架构]: 无负极钠金属电池(AFSB)","[核心瓶颈]: 活性钠快速不可逆损失","[关键货币]: 循环钠量决定电池寿命"],"dp":1,"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本综述系统分析了无负极钠金属电池（AFSBs）中活性钠损失（Active Sodium Loss, ASL）的机制、挑战与应对策略。无负极设计通过取消预置负极材料实现更高能量密度和更低成本，是可持续储能的重要方向。文章深入阐述了ASL的三大来源：固体电解质界面（SEI）形成中的不可逆钠消耗、死钠形成、以及不均匀沉积导致的枝晶与库伦效率下降。综述了包括电解液工程、人工SEI构建、集流体表面改性等抑制ASL的关键策略，为实现高库伦效率、长循环寿命的实用化AFSB提供了路线图。","ot":"Active Sodium Loss in Practical Anode-Free Sodium Batteries: Mechanisms, Challenges, and Strategies","b":"Anode-free sodium metal batteries (AFSBs) offer a compelling route toward high-energy and sustainable electrochemical storage by eliminating excess sodium and inactive anode hosts. Yet their practical viability is fundamentally limited by rapid and irreversible active sodium loss. In anode-free architectures, cyclable sodium is the governing \"currency\" of cell lifetime: any interfacial irreversibility directly translates into catastrophic capacity decay. Unlike lithium systems, sodium depletion in AFSBs is driven by Na-specific physicochemical constraints-including a large ionic radius, low melting point, extreme volumetric expansion (≈260%), and intrinsically fragile solid-electrolyte interphase (SEI) mechanics-giving rise to distinct degradation pathways spanning sparse nucleation, porous growth, dynamic SEI fracture-repassivation, thermally induced morphology collapse, and coupled cathode-anode inventory feedback. This review establishes a multiscale mechanistic framework linking intrinsic sodium properties to cell-level failure, and critically assesses emerging mitigation strategies across sodiophilic current-collector engineering, multifunctional interphase design, sodium supplementation, and operation-protocol optimization. By integrating these approaches within a \"source-process-inventory-environment\" regulation paradigm, we outline key design rules and future priorities required to suppress sodium depletion and accelerate the translation of AFSBs from laboratory concepts to practical high-energy batteries."},{"t":"缩醛[6]芳烃：刚性环上手性大环促进电荷转移共组装及优异手性光学特性","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4969685?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性大环分子","kp":["[大环主体]: Acetal[6]arenes刚性手性大环","[电荷转移组装]: 与缺电子芳烃客体共组装"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究引入了缩醛[6]芳烃（Acetal[6]arenes, Ac[6]）作为一类新型刚性手性大环化合物，其碳中心手性赋予了大环刚性手性特征。这类大环能够促进电荷转移共组装，形成具有优异（手性）光学性能的超分子组装体。研究者展示了Ac[6]与电子受体之间的主客体识别驱动的共组装行为，实现了手性信号放大和圆二色性增强。该工作为手性超分子材料的设计提供了新平台，在圆偏振发光材料、手性传感和不对称催化等领域具有应用潜力。","ot":"Acetal[6]Arenes: Rigid Chirality‐on‐Annulus Macrocycles Promoting Charge‐Transfer Co‐Assembly With Exceptional (Chiro)Op","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Acetal[6]arenes (\n                    Ac[6]\n                    ) are introduced as a new class of rigid chiral macrocyclic arenes in which carbon‐centered chirality is embedded in a trioxabicyclo[3.3.1]nonane motif at macrocyclic waist.\n                    Ac[6]\n                    efficiently forms charge‐transfer (CT) complexes with electron‐deficient aromatic guests in both solution and the solid state. Single‐crystal x‐ray diffraction reveals that guest molecules bind to the outer surface of\n                    Ac[6]\n                    through well‐defined stacking interactions. In contrast, the corresponding acyclic bis‐acetal precursors show no complexation behavior, indicating that the rigid macrocyclic topology suppresses ring‐unit flipping and significantly enhances interfacial π–π interactions. The resulting solid‐state complexes exhibit dual emission at CT band (prompt fluorescence and TADF). Notably, complexes derived from enantiopure\n                    Ac[6]\n                    display intense circular dichroism (CD) and circularly polarized luminescence (CPL). The associated dissymmetry factors (\n                    \n                      g\n                      abs\n                    \n                    and\n                    \n                      g\n                      lum\n                    \n                    ) even exceed intrinsic\n                    Ac[6]\n                    values, indicating highly efficient chiral transfer.\n                    Ac[6]\n                    shows robust guest‐capture capability, forming CT complexes not only via solution co‐crystallization but also through simple physical mixing and even gas‐phase guest uptake. By exploiting time‐dependent capture kinetics and multicolor optoelectronic properties, we developed applications for optical sensing and time‐encoded encryption. These results establish macrocyclization of rigid chirality‐on‐annulus units as a powerful strategy for creating functional supramolecular CT materials with emergent chiroptical and optoelectronic properties."},{"t":"AI科学家正在改变科研——机构、资助方和出版商须积极应对","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00934-w","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"Nature","as":"","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI科学家","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"AI scientists are changing research — institutions, funders and publishers must respond"},{"t":"基于分层滚动优化的电力-交通耦合系统三层协调策略","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600382X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电交通协同优化","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"A tri-level coordination strategy for coupled power and transportation systems based on hierarchical rolling optimizatio"},{"t":"空间掩蔽激活细胞因子 (SMACks) 的模块化平台","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513720123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cytokines are critical signaling molecules, but their therapeutic potential remains unrealized due to pleiotropic effects across cell types. Current strategies to develop conditionally active cytokines involve complex engineering and production, limiting their application to a select few cytokines and receptors. Here, we describe a simple, highly modular format called Sterically Masked Activated Cytokine (SMACk) via facile assembly of a targeting Fab/VHH, cytokine, and Fc. We first develop an interleukin-22 (IL-22) SMACk selective for intestinal epithelial cells, wherein the Fab/VHH serves a dual masking and targeting role. Detailed analysis revealed a\n                    cis\n                    signaling mechanism via a reduced on-rate and identified tunable format parameters. In mice, the IL-22-SMACk showed selective activity in the colon and efficacy in a colitis model. Finally, we highlight the versatility of SMACks by selectively directing interferon-α, IL-2, IL-4, or IL-7 to CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells, underscoring the potential of this platform to advance cytokine research and therapies."},{"t":"自然索引指南","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00427-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"地月空间中的银河宇宙射线腔","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adv1908?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"In regions of the Solar System distant from planetary magnetic fields, galactic cosmic rays (GCRs) have generally been assumed to be uniformly distributed over the Earth-Moon distance. However, our analysis of data from the LND (Lunar Lander Neutron and Dosimetry) experiment onboard the Chang’E-4 lander revealed a region of reduced GCR flux in the prenoon sector of the lunar orbit. Further investigation suggests the presence of an energetic particle cavity, formed by Earth’s magnetic field acting as an obstacle to GCR propagation. This cavity indicates that the influence of Earth’s magnetic field within the space environment extends unexpectedly up to and far beyond the lunar orbit. This finding offers the potential to avoid high radiation levels during future lunar exploration and deep-space missions."},{"t":"基于单原子的柔性动态电磁开关","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00066-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子电磁开关","kp":["[电磁开关]: 单原子柔性晶体管电控电磁波切换","[柔性电子]: 重原子锚定超薄片层低功耗"],"as":"研究团队开发了一种基于单原子策略的柔性电磁开关材料。该器件利用单个原子位点在外场作用下动态切换电磁信号，实现实时可调控的电磁响应。与传统刚性半导体开关不同，该方案兼具柔性与动态响应能力，在柔性电子、可穿戴器件及下一代智能电磁屏蔽领域具有重要应用潜力，为未来电子学对信号实时主动管理提供了全新材料路径。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"A flexible and dynamic single-atom-based electromagnetic switch","b":"Future electronics demand materials that can actively manage electromagnetic signals in real time. A flexible transistor that uses isolated heavy atoms anchored on an ultrathin sheet to electrically switch between transmitting and blocking electromagnetic waves with exceptional precision and low power. This innovation enables smart, adaptable electromagnetic control in next-generation wearable and integrated circuits, moving beyond static shielding toward dynamically programmable signal management.","aip":1},{"t":"快速的星暴风消耗了超新星的大部分能量","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10231-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Starburst galaxies often host multiphase, galaxy-scale winds thought to enrich the circumgalactic medium and limit further star formation by disrupting interstellar gas clouds1,2,3. These winds are primarily powered by supernovae4,5,6, but it remains unclear how supernova energy forms an organized flow. Here we use the Resolve spectrometer on the X-ray Imaging and Spectroscopy Mission to show that the hot (T = 2 × 107 K) gas in the nucleus of the starburst galaxy M82 is moving quickly, with a line-of-sight velocity dispersion &#x03C3;=595&#x2212;128+464kms&#x2212;1\" role=\"presentation\">σ=595−128+464kms−1\\sigma =59{5}_{-128}^{+464}\\,\\mathrm{km}\\,{{\\rm{s}}}^{-1}. This is consistent with a hot, nuclear wind generated by thermal pressure. We show that a free-wind model reproduces the measured temperature but underpredicts the velocity. The inferred mass and energy outflow rates from the nucleus, about 7 M⊙ yr−1 and 4 × 1042 erg s−1, require that most supernova energy is thermalized. These outflow rates provide enough energy to power the ≳30 M⊙ yr−1 cool outflow and still transport up to 3 M⊙ yr−1 to the intergalactic medium, suggesting that thermal gas pressure is sufficient to power the multiphase wind without additional support from cosmic rays7. We also show that the nuclear gas is hotter and faster than the plasma seen on larger scales (kT=0.72&#x2212;0.08+0.10keV\" role=\"presentation\">kT=0.72−0.08+0.10keVkT\\,=\\,{0.72}_{-0.08}^{+0.10}\\,\\mathrm{keV}, &#x03C3;=175&#x2212;73+86kms&#x2212;1\" role=\"presentation\">σ=175−73+86kms−1\\sigma =17{5}_{-73}^{+86}\\,\\mathrm{km}\\,{{\\rm{s}}}^{-1}), suggesting a distinct origin for the latter."},{"t":"工业电池梯阂数字孪生管理框架：含不确定性的多信号集成方法","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003934?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电池数字孪生","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"A digital twin framework for industrial battery fleet management: A unified multi-signal ensemble approach with uncertai"},{"t":"保守的聚糖基序诱导针对人畜共患病病原体猪链球菌的广泛反应性功能性抗体","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz1854?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Streptococcus suis\n                    is a largely neglected but emerging bacterial zoonotic pathogen of global concern for animal welfare, antibiotic resistance development, and human health. No effective vaccines are now available. Here, we identified and characterized the function and structure of two cell wall polysaccharide variants in pathogenic\n                    S. suis\n                    strains using genetic deletion and (heterologous) complementation, lectin staining, glycan composition analysis, and specialized NMR spectroscopy. Both glycan variants were anionic polymers that differed in the presence of glucose in the side chain as a result of allelic variation in a glycosyltransferase gene. Deletion of this variable glycosyltransferase revealed an identical glycan “core” and affected\n                    S. suis\n                    morphology and lysozyme resistance. Immunization of pigs with this core domain elicited antibodies that recognized antigenically diverse pathogenic\n                    S. suis\n                    strains and induced complement deposition on encapsulated pathogenic\n                    S. suis\n                    strains. This study provides valuable insights for developing next-generation glycoconjugate vaccines, whereby a single-glycan target could protect against the emerging zoonotic pathogen\n                    S. suis\n                    ."},{"t":"保守的乙烯触发细胞死亡机制可能是植物物种中空茎形成的基础","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530957123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Hollow stems have independently evolved multiple times across the plant kingdom and play crucial roles in plant development and various environmental adaptations. However, the mechanisms underlying stem hollowness remain poorly understood. Water spinach (\n                    Ipomoea aquatica\n                    ) is one of the few hollow-stemmed plants in the\n                    Convolvulaceae\n                    family (eudicot: asterid), and its hollow stems are essential for thriving in aquatic environments. Using histochemical staining and transcriptome analysis, we found that programmed cell death (PCD) is involved in cavity formation at water spinach shoot tips. Single-cell and spatial transcriptome analyses further revealed that ethylene and reactive oxygen species (ROS) likely drive and regulate this process by activating transcription factors\n                    IaNAC074\n                    ,\n                    IaNAC087\n                    ,\n                    IaNAC029\n                    ,\n                    IaNTL9\n                    , and\n                    IaTGA9\n                    , which likely initiate PCD, senescence, and autophagy, collectively leading to pith cell death. These findings were validated through treatments with ethylene and ROS reagents in water spinach, as well as transient expression assays in tobacco. Additionally, transcriptomic data suggest that these mechanisms may also play a role in hollow stem formation in horsetail (fern), moso bamboo (monocot), and broad bean (eudicot: rosid), highlighting the conservation of PCD regulatory mechanisms in hollow stem formation. This study not only fills a major knowledge gap in the adaptive mechanisms of hollow stem formation but also opens broad avenues for agricultural and ecological applications, offering strategies to enhance crop tolerance to flooding and accelerate crop growth."},{"t":"可追踪黄蜂的芯片","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01605-4","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Electronics","as":"","tg":"研究论文","tp":"昆虫追踪芯片","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":1.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"A chip that can track wasps"},{"t":"促癌融合蛋白在胚胎大脑发育过程中发挥作用","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00924-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ZFTA–RELA is the cancer-promoting protein product of a gene fusion. Analyses of accessible sites in the DNA–protein complex chromatin in developing mice show that ZFTA–RELA binds to chromatin modules that are accessible during embryonic brain development, placing some cell lineages at risk of transformation into cancer. Clones generated in embryonic development can give rise to the full cellular diversity of a type of childhood brain cancer."},{"t":"水溶性PVA大分子硫醇实现400 mm/s双光子微加工细胞交互水凝胶结构","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72680?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双光子微制造","kp":["加工速度[双光子微制造]: 400 mm/s","[材料]: 水溶性PVA大分子硫醇","[应用]: 细胞交互水凝胶结构"],"as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Water‐Soluble PVA Macrothiol Enables Two‐Photon Microfabrication of Cell‐Interactive Hydrogel Structures at 400 mm s−1"},{"t":"用于单细胞运输、球体组装和双模式药物筛选的柔性微机器人","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72668?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"软体微机器人","dp":1,"as":"研究人员设计了一种新型软体微型机器人，可实现单细胞精准捕获与运输、三维类器官（spheroid）组装，并具备双模式驱动能力。该机器人结合磁场与光热或化学驱动机制，在微尺度下完成高精度操控任务，兼具灵活性与生物相容性。该技术在单细胞分析、药物筛选、组织工程和再生医学领域具有广泛应用前景，为体外构建复杂组织模型提供了新工具。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Soft Microrobot for Single‐Cell Transport, Spheroid Assembly, and Dual‐Mode Drug Screening (Adv. Mater. 18/2026)","b":"Soft Microrobots The illustration presents an assembly-line progression from individual cells to fully formed microtumours. TACSI Microrobots transport and position single cells, apply localised stimulation, and sense biosignals at each step. The factory-like sequence highlights a high-throughput microrobotic workflow that builds and analyses complex cellular structures in a controlled, stepwise manner. More details can be found in the Research Article by Philipp Harder, Nergishan İyisan, Yukun Wang, and Berna Özkale (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202508807)."},{"t":"用于过氧化氢生产的均相催化配对电解池","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524811?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化双氧水合成","kp":["[配对电解池]: 2e-WOR与2e-ORR耦合产H2O2","[H2O2电合成]: 均相催化成对电解"],"as":"研究人员提出了一种均相催化剂驱动的配对电解池体系，通过阳极两电子水氧化反应（2e⁻-WOR）与阴极两电子氧还原反应（2e⁻-ORR）同时进行，实现过氧化氢（H₂O₂）的高效协同合成。该策略避免了传统工艺中贵金属催化剂与高能耗问题，两电极均贡献目标产物，大幅提升法拉第效率与能量利用率，为绿色化H₂O₂生产提供了可持续的电化学路径。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Homogeneously Catalyzed Paired Electrolytic Cell for Hydrogen Peroxide Production","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The two‐electron water oxidation reaction (2e\n                    −\n                    ‐WOR) and oxygen reduction reaction (2e\n                    −\n                    ‐ORR) represent sustainable and promising processes for the electrochemical synthesis of hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ). The main factor hampering the realization of a paired electrochemical cell for H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production is finding appropriate catalysts for both 2e\n                    −\n                    ‐ORR and 2e\n                    −\n                    ‐WOR, able to work under the same experimental conditions. Herein we show that\n                    Cu(tmpa))\n                    and\n                    Sn‐TMPyP\n                    are compatible and efficient catalysts for 2e\n                    −\n                    ‐ORR and 2e\n                    −\n                    ‐WOR, respectively. They have been used to assemble a paired electrochemical cell for H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production. The latter exhibits a total overpotential of 570 mV, distributed between the two electrodes. During a 3 h bulk electrolysis experiment, the cathodic Faradaic efficiency ranged from 15% to 19% with a H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production rate of 1.6 µmol h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    . Meanwhile, at the anode, the Faradaic efficiency stabilized between 40% and 50%, yielding a H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production rate of 3.5 µmol h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    . The remarkable activity of\n                    Sn‐TMPyP\n                    as a catalyst for the 2e\n                    −\n                    ‐WOR, ranking among the highest reported for molecular catalysts, is ascribed to the selection of a carbonate buffer as the electrolyte, which enhanced catalytic performance by facilitating dissociation of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    from the Sn catalyst. This work establishes a new benchmark for homogeneous dual‐electrode H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    electrosynthesis."},{"t":"触发序列定义寡聚氨酯的选择性读取：以计算机脚本为例的化学逻辑门新进展","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21819","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"序列定义聚合物存储","kp":["[信息存储]: 正交保护连接子作为分子逻辑门","[选择性读取]: 序列定义寡氨基甲酸酯实现选择性数据检索"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究展示了序列定义低聚氨基甲酸酯（oligourethanes）的选择性读取触发机制，以计算机脚本为例，代表了化学逻辑门的下一步发展。序列定义聚合物（SDPs）通过精确控制单体排列顺序实现信息编码，类似于DNA碱基序列存储遗传信息。研究者设计了一种利用化学触发剂选择性\"读取\"特定序列片段的策略，将计算机脚本编码为聚合物序列，再通过质谱解码还原信息。该工作推进了分子级信息存储与分子计算的实现，为构建高密度、可编程化学信息系统提供了原型验证。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Triggering the Selective Reading of Sequence-Defined Oligourethanes: An Example Using Computer Scripts, Representing the Next Step in Chemical Logic Gates","b":"Over the past decades, various types of sequence-defined polymers (SDPs) have been explored for use in information storage. However, unlike conventional digital systems, abiotic SDPs commonly lack a means for selective data retrieval. Here, we introduce a set of orthogonally protected linkers that function as molecular logic gates when integrated with sequence-defined oligourethanes (OUs). These linkers enable selective “reading” of specific OUs in response to distinct chemical triggers. Beyond demonstrating selective retrieval, our platform allows OUs to encode executable computer instructions, such as matrix multiplication in Python, thereby interfacing chemical specificity with digital computation. Different chemical triggers yield different computational outputs, illustrating that chemical inputs can control which Python code is run. This work establishes a new paradigm for chemically addressable molecular data storage and its extension toward digital computation."},{"t":"[ASAP] 疫苗诱导的免疫性血小板减少症和血栓形成中免疫复合物的结构质谱描述","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18732","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Antibodies binding the heparin-binding domain of platelet factor 4 (PF4) cause a severe prothrombotic condition first identified as vaccine-induced immune thrombocytopenia and thrombosis (VITT). Reverse-engineered recombinant antibodies (rAbs) generated from mass-spectrometry-based sequencing of patient sera recapitulate the functional characteristics of VITT patient serum. However, the structure of the antigen interface and the architecture of the immune complexes are unknown. Here we utilize structural mass spectrometry to describe the immune complexes formed by three rAbs. Employing cross-linking mass spectrometry (XLMS) with multiple linkers, we identified interacting paratope-epitope residues and determined that the PF4 binding occurs primarily via light-chain interactions with the PF4 C-terminus. Structural modeling corroborated interprotein links and predicted the formation of a tetravalent immune complex, satisfying observed cross-links and existing epitope information. Native MS demonstrated lower-order complexes and tetravalent assemblies, supporting the modeling predictions. Our study provides structural insights into the pathogenesis of VITT and related PF4 disorders and highlights the potential for complementary structural MS and modeling to study challenging protein–protein interactions."},{"t":"沸石通道波动限域效应促进废聚乙烯选择性升级回收为丙烷","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21380","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"废塑料催化升级","kp":["[产物选择性]: 丙烷选择性达70.2%","[催化策略]: 沸石通道波动限域加氢裂解(CUCH)","[催化剂]: ZSM-5分子筛","[底物]: 聚乙烯定向转化为丙烷"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究利用沸石通道的波动限制效应（undulation confinement effect）实现了废聚乙烯（PE）选择性升级回收为丙烷。聚乙烯是最丰富的塑料废弃物之一，将其选择性转化为高价值大宗化学品具有重要的工业应用价值。传统催化裂解方法产物分布宽、选择性差。研究者发现，特定孔径沸石的通道几何限制可精确控制碳碳键断裂位置，将PE高效转化为以丙烷为主的C3产物。该\"波动限制\"机制为设计塑料化学回收催化剂提供了新范式，有望推动塑料循环经济发展。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Selective Upcycling of Waste Polyethylene into Propane Facilitated by the Undulation Confinement Effect in Zeolite Channels","b":"Selective conversion of polyethylene (PE) into high-value bulk chemicals holds significant industrial application value. However, the uniform C-C bonds in the PE main chain render directed cleavage a formidable challenge. Here we developed a channel undulation-confinement hydrocracking (CUCH) strategy, achieving selectivity of propane up to 70.2% from PE conversion using a ZSM-5 zeolite catalyst. This selective conversion process originates from the deep β-scission of C-C bonds and the match of propane molecular size with the channel undulation factor (Ω = 0.71) of ZSM-5. Reaction kinetics analysis, thermodynamics and theoretical calculation reveal that Brønsted acid sites donate protons to activate PE, initiating C-C bonds cleavage to form alkanes and tricoordinated carbenium ions. Concurrently, the cracking degree of these carbenium ions is modulated by undulation factor (Ω) and the number of intracrystalline cages (Nc,s) in zeolite. This double confinement prolongs the residence time of C4+ intermediates, maximizing their cracking and enhancing the ultimate yield of propane. These findings provide a feasible strategy for the selective upcycling of waste PE.","aip":1},{"t":"镍催化炔-乙烯基环丁酮的一步三环丙烷化反应：反应开发、机理与modhephene的形式合成","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21425","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍催化成环反应","kp":["[催化反应]: 镍催化炔-乙烯基环丁酮一步三环丙烷化","[产物骨架]: [3.3.3]螺桨烷三维结构","[合成优势]: 一步构建双桥头季碳中心"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究报道了镍催化的炔基-乙烯基环丁酮一步三环丙烷化反应（one-step-three-ring propellanation），包括反应开发、机理研究和modhephene的形式合成。[3.3.3]螺桨烷骨架存在于多种天然产物中，是合成化学中备受关注的三维结构单元，但其高效构建仍是挑战。研究者利用镍催化串联环化，以单一操作构建三环骨架，显著提高了合成效率。机理研究阐明了环丁酮开环、炔烃插入和环化的级联路径。该方法被成功应用于天然产物modhephene的形式合成，展示了其在复杂分子构建中的实用价值。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] One-Step-Three-Ring Propellanation Reaction of Yne-Vinylcyclobutanones Catalyzed by Nickel: Reaction Development, Mechanism, and Formal Synthesis of Modhephene","b":"The [3.3.3]propellane scaffold, present in various natural products, is a three-dimensional structure of interest in synthetic chemistry. Traditionally, these compounds are synthesized through a ring-by-ring strategy that is tedious (long steps of synthesis) and challenging (building two adjacent bridgehead quaternary centers of the target motifs is a formidable task). Herein, we report a nickel-catalyzed one-step, three-ring propellanation reaction that constructs the [3.3.3] propellane core from linear yne-vinylcyclobutanones. This method employs Ni(COD)2 and P(Ad)3 as the catalytic system and exhibits a broad substrate scope. The utility of this reaction has been further demonstrated through the formal synthesis of modhephene, a natural product featuring a [3.3.3] propellane skeleton. This propellanation reaction can be envisioned as biscarbene insertion of alkyne into the C–C bond in cyclobutanone and the C–H of the vinyl group in the substrates, but it actually takes place through oxidative cyclometalation of the alkyne and carbonyl group, Cope rearrangement, β-hydrogen elimination, trienolate cyclization, and reductive elimination, supported by DFT calculations and a deuterium labeling experiment. The detailed ligand exchange reaction (reaction initiation process) from Ni(COD)2 to the Ni complex coordinated by the phosphine ligand and substrate, has also been studied computationally. How the tether group in the substrates affects the propellanation reaction and the side rearrangement reaction of vinylcyclobutanones to cyclohexenones has been analyzed, finding that electron-withdrawing tethers such as NTs and O favor the propellanation reaction, while the electron-neutral tether such as CH2 and NBn tether, which is less electron-withdrawing compared to NTs, reduce this preference."},{"t":"[ASAP] 肝脏脱靶芳香族生物可还原 mRNA 脂质纳米颗粒赋予淋巴结趋向性和强大的抗原特异性免疫","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00080","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Lipid nanoparticles (LNPs) have been immensely successful in facilitating the delivery of nucleic acids to tissues of interest and continue to be optimized for mRNA delivery. These vehicles are particularly advantageous for vaccination due to their ease of production, highly tunable composition, and ability to induce robust immune responses without an adjuvant, as exemplified most recently by the clinical success of the Pfizer/BioNTech and Moderna COVID-19 vaccines. However, LNPs are known to exhibit off-target liver tropism. To address this limitation, we developed a library of aromatic bioreducible ionizable lipids that potently transfect secondary lymphoid tissues with liver detargeting capabilities compared with an industry standard ionizable lipid used in the COVID-19 vaccine. The library consists of three modular components: amine core structure, lipid tail length, and regiochemistry. These aromatic ionizable lipids employ benzene rings both as a scaffold for regiochemical differences and as a moiety to improve transfection. Bioreducible disulfide bonds in the lipids additionally serve to increase their biodegradability. When these aromatic ionizable lipids are formulated as LNPs, top-performing aromatic LNPs (aroLNPs) accumulate in and transfect lymph nodes while minimizing off-target liver tropism. Top-performing aroLNPs also induce strong antigen-specific immune responses, increased effector memory T cell generation, and decreased terminal effector T cell generation in mice when utilized in a preclinical SARS-CoV-2 vaccine study. Additionally, aroLNPs are strongly retained in the injection site and induce low levels of systemic inflammatory cytokines. Together, these results establish aroLNPs as a promising platform for vaccine delivery and potentially other immune-focused therapeutic applications.","tp":"脂质纳米粒","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了可还原型芳香族生物可降解mRNA脂质纳米颗粒，通过肝脏脱靶向策略赋予其淋巴结趋向性，实现强大的抗原特异性免疫应答。传统LNPs（如新冠疫苗所用）倾向于在肝脏蓄积，限制了其在淋巴结免疫中的应用。该策略通过化学结构调控使纳米颗粒重新靶向淋巴结，无需佐剂即可诱导强效免疫反应，为mRNA疫苗和免疫治疗提供了新平台。"},{"t":"熵稳定金刚烷基AgCdInSe3：超低热导率和高载流子迁移率热电材料","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01832","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热电材料","kp":["[热导率]: 超低热导率","[载流子迁移率]: 高载流子迁移率","[材料体系]: 熵稳定的金刚烷型AgCdInSe3","[热电应用]: 组分调制同时调控电子与声子输运"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究合成了熵稳定的金刚石型AgCdInSe3化合物，发现其具有超低热导率和高载流子迁移率，是优秀的热电材料候选者。金刚石型热电材料因其独特的传输性能受到广泛关注。熵稳定效应通过多元素共晶格占据引入强晶格无序，有效散射声子而显著降低热导率，同时保持了相对较高的载流子迁移率。AgCdInSe3展现出热导率与电导率的解耦优化，打破了传统热电材料中\"电子-声子传输耦合\"的制约。该发现为设计高性能中温区热电材料提供了新策略，有望应用于废热回收和固态制冷。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Entropy-Stabilized Diamondoid AgCdInSe3 with Ultralow Thermal Conductivity and High Carrier Mobility for Thermoelectrics","b":"Recently, diamondoid thermoelectric materials have attracted widespread attention owing to their unique transport properties and high lattice compatibility, which provide a promising platform for simultaneously tuning electron and phonon transport through compositional modulation. Although entropy engineering has been widely employed in rock-salt thermoelectric materials to suppress thermal conductivity, its application in diamondoid compounds remains rare. This is mainly because most diamondoid materials intrinsically exhibit low electrical conductivity, while highly disordered atomic arrangements often degrade carrier mobility, thereby suppressing electronic transport. Herein, we report the discovery of a new wurtzite-type diamondoid material, AgCdInSe3, realized through entropy engineering. Crystallographic analysis combined with transmission electron microscopy reveals mixed occupation of all cation sites accompanied by local lattice distortion, resulting in an ultralow thermal conductivity of ∼0.3 W m-1 K-1 in AgCdInSe3. Remarkably, despite the highly disordered atomic structure, AgCdInSe3 exhibits a simple and light conduction band with an effective mass of 0.2 m0, enabling a relatively high room-temperature carrier mobility of 285 cm2 V-1 s-1. Consequently, the optimized Ag0.977Cd1.02In1.003Se3 achieves a peak ZT of 1.2 at 873 K, and the corresponding single-leg device delivers a power density of 1383 W m-2 under a ΔT = 500 K, highlighting the potential of this material as a new n-type diamondoid thermoelectric.","aip":1},{"t":"酪氨酸磷酸蛋白质组分析可识别限制酪氨酸激酶抑制剂疗法疗效的细胞固有信号","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522090123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Tyrosine kinases (TKs) are frequently mutated or overexpressed in cancer, and TK inhibitors (TKIs) are an important therapeutic modality against TK-driven cancers, but many patients show an underwhelming response to TKIs prescribed on the basis of tumor genotype. To find cell-intrinsic TK signaling patterns which might be predictive of poor response to TKI therapies, we used high-sensitivity multiplexed mass spectrometry to quantify endogenous levels of 1,222 phosphotyrosine (pY) sites across the proteomes of TK-driven human cancer cell lines with variable response to genotype-matched TKIs. In direct comparisons between TKI-tolerant and TKI-sensitive lines with a common driver TK, we found that TKI treatment was equally effective at blocking driver TK signaling, and higher basal activity of the driver TK did not always predict higher sensitivity to TKI. All tolerant lines showed a dampened proteome-wide pY response to TKI exposure compared to sensitive lines, suggesting that tumor cells with more robust TK signaling are less vulnerable to driver TK blockade. We found that each tolerant line depends on a unique set of compensatory TKs and signaling axes but are unified by hyperactivity of at least one of the SRC family kinases (SFKs) or the related ABL1/2 kinases, both at rest and under TKI treatment, despite the absence of SFK or ABL genetic mutations. In time- and dose-resolved drug combination experiments, SFK/ABL inhibitors were potently synergistic with all TKIs tested, demonstrating that elevated SFK/ABL signaling is a conserved bottleneck for maximal TKI efficacy which could be exploited therapeutically."},{"t":"燃料电池混合动力汽车智能能量管理：拓扑、感知、决策与网联系统进展","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003326?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"燃料电池能量管理","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Toward intelligent energy management for fuel cell hybrid electric vehicles: Advances in topologies, perception, decision, and connected systems"},{"t":"共价有机框架拓扑工程通过构象锁定增强电子供体-受体复合物的光活化","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag183/8539748?rss=1","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化有机合成","kp":["[策略]: 拓扑构象锁定增强EDA光活化","[结构]: 三维共价有机框架供体平台"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究通过拓扑工程策略增强共价有机框架（COFs）对电子供体-受体（EDA）复合物的光活化效率，核心机制为构象锁定。EDA复合物光活化是有机合成中有价值的光化学途径，但效率和选择性仍有待提升。研究者设计了具有特定拓扑结构的COF载体，通过刚性孔道将EDA复合物构象锁定在有利于电子转移的取向，显著提高了光诱导电子转移效率。这种拓扑限域策略实现了光反应的速率提升和选择性调控，为发展高效多相光催化有机合成提供了新方法论。","dp":1,"ot":"Topological engineering of covalent organic frameworks enhances photoactivation of electron donor–acceptor complexes via conformational locking","b":"Electron donor–acceptor (EDA) complex photoactivation offers a valuable route for organic synthesis, yet the development of efficient catalytic systems remains a significant challenge. We present a novel strategy based on topological conformational locking within covalent organic frameworks (COFs) to engineer high-performance donor platforms. Specifically, we constructed a three-dimensional (3D) COF and two two-dimensional (2D) analogues from the conformationally flexible building block 4,4ʹ,4ʹʹ,4ʹʹʹ-(1,4-phenylenebis(azanetriyl))tetrabenzaldehyde (PATB). Unlike the 2D structures, the 3D architecture intrinsically restricts molecular flexibility, stabilizing a locked conformation that significantly enhances acceptor binding affinity and facilitates efficient EDA complex formation and electron transfer. The 3D-PATB COF exhibits superior photocatalytic activity across a range of transformations, including C–H functionalization and [3+2] cyclization, and supports gram-scale synthesis with outstanding structural stability. Both experimental and computational analyses underscore the critical role of conformational locking in boosting catalytic performance, establishing topological engineering as a powerful approach for advancing EDA complex photochemistry."},{"t":"T 细胞的磷脂谱决定了初始 T 细胞、效应 T 细胞和记忆 T 细胞的 ACSL4 依赖性和铁死亡敏感性","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528153123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Iron-dependent phospholipid (PL) peroxidation, which is reduced by glutathione peroxidase 4, is recognized as the hallmark of cells undergoing ferroptosis. Although studies have attempted to elucidate the molecular mechanisms underlying ferroptosis in cancer cells, the regulation of ferroptosis in effector and memory T cells remains largely unknown. Here, using genome-wide CRISPR-Cas9 knockout screens, we demonstrate that acyl-CoA synthetase long-chain family member 4 (ACSL4) is the predominant ferroptosis inducer in primary T cells cultured in vitro, while other identified iron- and lipid metabolism–related genes only slightly modulate their sensitivity to ferroptosis. However, ACSL4 dependency relies on the PL composition of the cells. In vitro cultured T cells treated with polyunsaturated fatty acids (PUFAs), as well as effector CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells that are enriched in PUFA-containing PLs (PUFA-PLs), undergo ferroptosis in the absence of ACSL4. In contrast to effector T cells, naive and memory T cells share a similar PL profile, characterized by a scarcity of PUFA-PLs, and are resistant to ferroptosis. Overall, the PL composition is a central feature and determines the differential susceptibility of effector and memory T cells to ferroptosis and its molecular mechanism.","tp":"铁死亡研究","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究探讨了铁死亡在不同T细胞亚群中的调节机制。铁依赖性磷脂过氧化是细胞发生铁死亡的标志。通过全基因组CRISPR-Cas9敲除筛选，研究证实长链酰基辅酶A合成酶家族成员4（ACSL4）是决定T细胞铁死亡敏感性的关键因子。研究发现，不同阶段T细胞（初始T细胞、效应T细胞和记忆T细胞）的磷脂谱差异决定了它们对ACSL4的依赖程度及对铁死亡的敏感性。这一发现为深入理解免疫细胞的死亡调节机制及开发相关免疫干预策略提供了重要理论依据。"},{"t":"MoS2上Mn团簇的重构机制与NH3-SCR动力学：基于从头算数据驱动的机器学习模拟","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70851?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锰簇SCR催化","kp":["[催化反应]: Mn团簇/MoS2上NH3-SCR","[SMSI效应]: 驱动局部结构重构稳定团簇","[模拟方法]: 第一性原理数据驱动机器学习"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用基于第一性原理的数据驱动机器学习模拟，探究了MoS2负载锰簇的强金属-载体相互作用（SMSI）及其结构重构机制。通过分析锰簇在载体表面的局部结构演变，阐明了重构过程对NH3选择性催化还原（SCR）反应动力学的影响。该工作为设计高效催化剂的载体-团簇界面工程提供了原子级理论指导。","dp":1,"ot":"The Reconstruction Mechanism and NH3‐SCR Kinetics of Mn Clusters on MoS2 by Ab Initio Data Driven Machine Learning Simulations","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The strong metal‐support interactions (SMSI) between supported clusters and substrate can drive the local structure reconstructions, which stabilize the supported clusters to avoid migration and aggregation. Such reconstruction and stabilization mechanism are crucial to construct the atomically dispersed catalysts (ADCs), but they are too complex to simulate in most catalyst theoretical studies for a relative long time. Herein, an accurate machine learning potential (MLP) is employed into Monte Carlo simulation on the Mn\n                    \n                      N\n                    \n                    (1 ≤\n                    N\n                    ≤ 7) clusters supported on MoS\n                    2\n                    layer. The adsorption, reconstruction and thermodynamic and kinetical stabilization of Mn clusters on perfect and defective MoS\n                    2\n                    are compared studied. The results indicate that the S vacancies can effectively anchor Mn clusters and are feasible to control the dual‐atom catalysts (DACs) on the MoS\n                    2\n                    surface. Besides, Comparative analysis reveals that the Mn\n                    2\n                    @MoS\n                    2\n                    ‐S\n                    2\n                    V exhibits superior NH\n                    3\n                    ‐SCR catalytic activity. The complete reaction process of Mn\n                    2\n                    @MoS\n                    2\n                    ‐S\n                    2\n                    V following the “Fast‐SCR” mechanism and the NO\n                    2\n                    reduction pathway is the dominant route, with a rate‐determining barrier of 1.03 eV. This work provides a pioneer way to disclose the very complex reconstruction of supported clusters with SMSI in simulation, which is indeed helpful to design real atomic structure of ADCs."},{"t":"GAPLESS-OsCASP 复合物介导凯氏带的形成，以确保水稻内胚层蛋白的正确定位和丰度","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb7840?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Casparian strip (CS) seals the extracellular space between neighboring endodermal cells and helps plants maintain nutrient homeostasis. However, little is known about CS formation and function in rice. Here, we demonstrate that GAPLESS1/2/3, along with OsCASP1/2/3/5, redundantly regulate endodermal CS formation by forming an interdependent complex in rice. Triple knockout of\n                    GAPLESSs\n                    or quadruple knockout of\n                    OsCASPs\n                    resulted in delayed CS initiation, disrupted CS-CSD adhesion, and disordered CS at the endodermis. In these mutants, GAPLESS1, OsCASP1, and SCHENGEN3a (OsSGN3a) uniformly localized to the plasma membrane or cytoplasm in root tips, with lower abundance in endodermal cells. Furthermore, CS defects in these mutants triggered strong suberization on endodermal cells via OsSGN3a/b-mediated signaling, thereby restricting and reducing the accumulation of the Si transporter Lsi1 exclusively to nonsuberized cells. Like\n                    Oscasp1\n                    , the triple\n                    gapless\n                    mutant exhibited large ionomic changes in shoots. Therefore, the GAPLESS-OsCASP complex functions in CS formation, with its roles in regulating ion homeostasis and protein localization and abundance.","tp":"水稻凯氏带","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"凯氏带是植物内皮层细胞间的关键结构，负责封闭细胞外空间以维持营养稳态。本研究以水稻为模型，发现GAPLESS1/2/3蛋白与OsCASP1/2/3/5蛋白通过形成相互依赖的复合物，协同调控水稻内皮层凯氏带的形成。研究显示，同时敲除三个GAPLESS基因或四个OsCASP基因会导致凯氏带严重缺陷，进而影响内胚层蛋白的正确定位和丰度。该研究揭示了水稻凯氏带形成的分子机制，对理解植物营养吸收和屏障功能具有重要意义。"},{"t":"绿色金融与大数据双试点对能源韧性的协同效应：来自改进综合控制方法的证据","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526002041?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"政策监管","tp":"绿金与韧性","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"小分子限制互补位模拟双环肽作为 1 组和 2 组甲型流感病毒血凝素的有效抑制剂","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537533123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Influenza continues to be a major threat to global health and a substantial economic burden. Innovative strategies are needed to tackle the growing resistance to established influenza therapeutics and to develop new therapeutics with novel mechanisms of action. Previous peptide and small molecule designs have been successful only against influenza group 1 hemagglutinin (HA). Here, we report on a CLIPS (Chemical Linkage of Peptides onto Scaffolds)-based approach to design potent peptidic inhibitors of influenza A viruses that now extend to both group 1 and group 2 HAs. This approach merges features of antibodies and small molecules to design constrained bicyclic peptides that engage the highly conserved HA stem. The heavy-chain complementarity-determining region 3 (HCDR3) of human broadly neutralizing antibody FI6v3 was grafted onto functionalized small molecule scaffolds. The designed peptides exhibited in vitro heterosubtypic cross-reactivity in binding to group 1 (H1 and H5) and group 2 (H3 and H7) HAs and in neutralization of H1N1, H5N1, and H7N3 viruses. A crystal structure of the bicyclic peptide with HA from H1N1 A/Puerto Rico/8/1934 (H1/PR8) at 2.35 Å resolution revealed that the designed peptide faithfully mimics the binding mode and functionality of the parent antibody FI6v3 to the highly conserved stem epitope. These structural and functional data illustrate how both group 1 and group 2 influenza A viruses can now be targeted by constrained peptidic ligands that should aid in development of pan-influenza therapeutics.","tp":"流感抑制剂","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对流感病毒耐药性问题，研究团队开发了一种基于CLIPS（多肽支架化学连接）技术的新型双环肽抑制剂设计策略。以往的多肽或小分子药物仅对甲型流感病毒第1组血凝素（HA）有效。该研究通过限制互补位模拟，成功设计出能同时有效抑制第1组和第2组甲型流感病毒血凝素的双环肽类抑制剂。这种具有新作用机制的创新疗法为克服现有流感药物的耐药性提供了新方向，对全球流感防治具有广阔应用前景。"},{"t":"受体序列分歧、增益、丢失、重复和新功能化驱动果蝇铃木的嗅觉适应","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529586123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Shifts in ecological niches are often driven by evolutionary changes in the olfactory system, yet the underlying mechanisms remain poorly understood. To investigate this, we used\n                    Drosophila suzukii\n                    , an invasive fruit pest, as a model. Unlike most\n                    Drosophila\n                    species, which prefer overripe fruit,\n                    D. suzukii\n                    strongly prefers laying eggs in ripe fruit. We found that this shift is accompanied by pronounced changes in the odorant tuning of only a few olfactory receptor neurons (ORNs) compared to\n                    Drosophila melanogaster\n                    . Some changes are shared with its relative\n                    Drosophila biarmipes\n                    , whereas others are unique to\n                    D. suzukii\n                    . These shifts resulted not only from receptor sequence divergence but also from additional mechanisms. In one ORN, a second odorant receptor (\n                    Or\n                    ), distinct from the ancestral\n                    Or\n                    , mediates detection of a leaf-derived odorant, while a single amino acid substitution—likely acting with additional changes—in the ancestral Or fine-tunes sensitivity to fruit-ripening esters. In two additional ORNs, four gene duplicates derived from an ancestral\n                    Or\n                    mediate tuning shifts: Two duplicates maintain responses similar to the original ORN, while two tandem duplicates confer responses in a preexisting ORN that has lost its ancestral\n                    Or\n                    . This neofunctionalization is unique to\n                    D. suzukii\n                    . Finally, we show that two of the receptors underlying these innovations are required for attraction to ripe fruit but are dispensable for egg-laying preference. Our findings reveal how receptor sequence divergence, coexpression, loss, duplication, and neofunctionalization drive sensory adaptation and ecological specialization and provide a foundation for identifying additional attractants and repellents to control\n                    D. suzukii\n                    .","tp":"嗅觉适应性","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究以入侵性害虫斑翅果蝇为模型，揭示了嗅觉系统在其生态位转变中的关键作用。与偏好过熟果实的普通果蝇不同，斑翅果蝇喜欢在新鲜成熟果实上产卵。研究发现，这种产卵偏好转变是由嗅觉受体基因的序列分歧、基因增益与丢失、基因重复以及新功能化共同驱动的。该研究从分子进化层面阐明了果蝇嗅觉适应的遗传机制，为理解昆虫生态位转变及开发针对性害虫防控策略提供了重要启示。"},{"t":"S-1117（一种 Fc 融合 IgG 选择性降解酶）的多药理学，用于慢性治疗自身抗体介导的疾病","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518366123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Antigen-specific immunoglobulin-G (IgG) antibodies cause or contribute to the pathogenesis of a wide spectrum of human diseases and conditions. Multiple therapeutic approaches have been developed, yet they are limited by variable safety and efficacy, patient inconvenience, and cost. IdeS, a cysteine protease derived from\n                    \n                      S. pyogenes\n                    \n                    , specifically cleaves IgG antibodies, representing a unique opportunity for the treatment of IgG-mediated diseases. However, clinical utilization of IdeS is limited by the immunogenic nature of bacterial proteases and short half-life. Using Seismic’s IMPACT platform, we engineered S-1117, an IgG cleaving enzyme fused to a human effectorless IgG1 Fc domain for an extended half-life. S-1117 is being developed to address the limitations of existing therapies in IgG-mediated diseases. In vitro and in vivo pharmacology studies demonstrate that S-1117 exhibits reduced B and T cell immunogenicity, a superior pharmacokinetic profile, and manufacturability and developability properties resembling those of monoclonal antibodies. S-1117 cleavage of IgG reduces circulating levels of IgG, including pathogenic IgG autoantibodies and IgG immune-complexes, and reduces IgG antibody effector functions, such as complement fixation, antibody-dependent cellular cytotoxicity, and antibody-dependent cell phagocytosis. The polypharmacology of S-1117 further extends to cleaving the antigen receptor on IgG-positive memory B cells, thereby modulating activation of memory B cells.","tp":"抗体降解酶","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"抗原特异性IgG抗体在多种人类疾病的发病机制中起着关键作用。尽管目前已有多种治疗方法，但在安全性、疗效、患者便利性和成本方面仍存在局限性。源自化脓性链球菌的半胱氨酸蛋白酶IdeS能够特异性切割IgG抗体，为自身抗体介导疾病的治疗提供了独特机遇。基于此，研究人员开发了S-1117，一种Fc融合的选择性IgG降解酶。该酶有望克服现有疗法的局限性，为慢性自身抗体介导的疾病提供一种全新、高效且安全的长期治疗策略。"},{"t":"政策驱动的战略性绿色技术创新路径：韩国氢和碳捕获、利用和储存 (CCUS) 案例","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"政策监管","tp":"韩国氢碳策","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"WNK1 介导的 PHGDH 磷酸化是代谢脆弱性和对奥沙利铂治疗反应性的双重标志物","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525213123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Metabolic reprogramming is a fundamental hallmark of cancer progression. However, the oncogenic mechanisms underlying serine metabolism and its impact on chemotherapeutic sensitivity in gastric cancer (GC) remain poorly defined. Here, through integrated metabolomics and\n                    13\n                    C-labeled metabolic flux analysis, we identify marked dysregulation of serine metabolism in GC, primarily driven by increased expression of phosphoglycerate dehydrogenase (PHGDH). Mechanistically, we show that with no lysine kinase 1 (WNK1) phosphorylates PHGDH at Ser349 and Ser371, enhancing its enzymatic activity and protein stability by preventing ubiquitin-mediated degradation. In vivo, WNK1 knockout mice exhibit significantly reduced gastric tumor burden, accompanied by decreased serine levels and disrupted redox balance, supporting the protumorigenic role of the WNK1–PHGDH axis. Clinically, enhanced PHGDH activity, elevated serine levels, and increased glutathione abundance are strongly associated with poor oxaliplatin response in GC patient cohorts, suggesting PHGDH as a potential predictive biomarker for chemotherapy resistance. Together, these findings delineate a WNK1–PHGDH–driven serine metabolic reprogramming axis that promotes redox adaptation and chemoresistance in GC, highlighting its dual value as a mechanistic driver and a therapeutic vulnerability in cancer treatment.","tp":"胃癌代谢靶","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"代谢重编程是癌症进展的核心特征。最新研究通过代谢组学和碳13标记代谢通量分析发现，胃癌中丝氨酸代谢存在显著失调，这主要是由磷酸甘油酸脱氢酶（PHGDH）的表达增加所驱动的。在机制上，WNK1介导了PHGDH的磷酸化过程。这一磷酸化机制不仅是胃癌细胞代谢脆弱性的标志，更被证实可作为预测胃癌患者对奥沙利铂化疗反应性的双重生物标志物，为胃癌的精准治疗和靶向药物敏感性提供了新的潜在干预靶点。"},{"t":"纳米尺度相干化学涨落驱动空位调控韧性AgCu(S,Se,Te)的优异热电性能","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec0728?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性热电材料","kp":["[材料]: AgCu(S,Se,Te) p型延性半导体","[优化机制]: 纳米级相干化学涨落","[缺陷工程]: 空位调控优化热电性能","[特性]: 可穿戴电子用柔性半导体"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过空位工程调控延展性AgCu(S,Se,Te)合金中的纳米尺度相干化学涨落，实现了优异的热电性能。该材料作为罕见的p型无机延展性半导体，兼具力学柔性与热电转换能力。空位工程诱导的晶格化学不均匀性增强了声子散射、降低热导率，同时保持电输运性能，为柔性热电器件开发提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Nanoscale coherent chemical fluctuations driving superior thermoelectric performance in vacancy-tailored ductile AgCu(S,Se,Te)","b":"(Ag,Cu)\n                    2\n                    (S,Se,Te) alloys, as rare examples of p-type inorganic ductile semiconductors, have emerged as promising candidates for wearable electronics because of their mechanical flexibility and favorable processability. However, the multicomponent nature of this system introduces diverse microstructures and intricate defect landscapes that complicate the optimization of thermoelectric performance. Here, we reveal the presence of compositionally inhomogeneous yet structurally coherent nanoscale chemical fluctuations within this alloy system. These fluctuations, together with abundant dislocations and twin boundaries, serve as efficient phonon scattering centers to suppress the lattice thermal conductivity to approach glass-like levels. Concurrently, tuning the cation ratios and vacancies allows for precise control over the carrier concentration and thereby leads to enhanced power factors. Last, a peak\n                    zT\n                    of 0.98 at 360 kelvins is achieved, marking a record for Ag-based ductile thermoelectrics. This study highlights the essential role of chemical fluctuations in modulating phonon and charge transports and offers valuable insight into the microstructure-defect–property interplay in ductile materials.","aip":1},{"t":"工程化超微孔Matrimid衍生不对称碳分子筛中空纤维用于精密氦分离","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6271309?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳分子筛分离膜","kp":["[材料]: Matrimid衍生碳分子筛中空纤维","[应用]: He/CH₄超高选择性分离"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究以Matrimid聚合物为前驱体，制备了具有工程化超微孔的非对称碳分子筛中空纤维膜，用于氦/甲烷(He/CH₄)精确分离。通过调控碳化条件精确构筑孔径在0.3-0.38nm范围的超微孔通道，实现He的高选择性透过。该膜在天然气提氦和工业氦回收领域具有重要的战略意义，解决了相似分子动力学直径气体分离难题。","dp":1,"ot":"Matrimid‐Derived Asymmetric Carbon Molecular Sieve Hollow Fibers With Engineered Ultramicropores for Precise Helium Separation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Helium/methane (He/CH\n                    4\n                    ) separation is of strategic importance for energy and industrial applications, yet it remains technically challenging due to the need to simultaneously achieve ultrahigh selectivity and helium productivity. In this work, we report ultraselective Matrimid‐derived asymmetric carbon molecular sieve (CMS) hollow fibers in which ultramicropore and fiber geometry are deliberately co‐engineered to enable precise He/CH\n                    4\n                    separation with high He productivity at the module level. We showed that pyrolysis temperature tuning tightens ångström‐scale ultramicropores and enhances He/CH\n                    4\n                    discrimination; while a targeted post‐pyrolysis hyperaging enables selective refining of the ultramicropores, thereby offering high He permeance with exceptional He/CH\n                    4\n                    selectivity. For a 5/95 He/CH\n                    4\n                    mixed gas feed, the hyperaged CMS‐700 hollow fibers achieve permeate helium purities of up to 98.6% with He/CH\n                    4\n                    selectivities exceeding 1300 and a stable He permeance of approximately 26 GPU. Beyond this material achievement, fiber geometry optimization through reduction of the outer diameter was achieved to increase the packable membrane area without compromising mechanical integrity or intrinsic separation performance, leading to enhanced module‐level He productivity. This integrated co‐engineering strategy provides an energy‐efficient and industrially viable platform for He recovery and is readily extendable to other challenging small/large gas‐pair separations."},{"t":"使用 MALDI 质谱成像和机器学习对当代和历史绘画构图进行逐层解码","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4427?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Layer-by-layer characterization of modern and historic paintings is essential for understanding how an artwork was created and how it has changed over time. This information can reveal historical or societal insights, inform attribution and classification, and support preservation efforts. The determination of the identity, structure, and composition of art material remains challenging due to the complex, multilayered nature of paintings. These structures often contain mixtures of organic and inorganic components, with unknown in situ chemical interactions, that create cross-linked and chemically modified molecular networks and assemblies. In this work, we have developed a method with high chemical specificity to identify and map organic and inorganic components in modern and historic multilayered paint systems. Our approach achieves an unprecedented level of molecular detail using a single technique. In addition, we have designed the method for automated composition assignment of individual layer through high-resolution matrix-assisted laser desorption/ionization (MALDI) mass spectrometry imaging (MSI) and a dedicated composition prediction model.","tp":"质谱成像法","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用MALDI质谱成像结合机器学习方法，实现了对现代和历史绘画逐层成分的非破坏性解码。绘画的多层结构包含有机和无机混合物，其身份、结构和成分的表征一直是分析难题。该技术可在分子层面逐层识别颜料、粘合剂和涂层成分，为艺术品的创作过程研究、归属鉴定和保护修复提供关键信息。"},{"t":"水致扭压法规模化制备具有密集组装双螺旋纳米结构的芳纶纳米纤维线","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72889?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"芳纶纳米纤维","kp":["[工艺]: 水-扭转压实可规模化","[材料]: 芳纶纳米纤维线","[结构]: 致密双螺旋纳米结构"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了水力-扭转致密化方法，实现芳纶纳米纤维线材的可扩展制备。该方法使纳米纤维自组装形成致密的双螺旋纳米结构，仿生模拟蜘蛛丝和胶原蛋白的超分子排列。所得芳纶线材兼具高强度、韧性和轻量化特性，在柔性电子、智能纺织品和结构复合材料领域具有应用潜力，突破了仿生材料规模化制备瓶颈。","dp":1,"ot":"Hydro‐Torsional Compaction for Scalable Production of Aramid Nanofiber Threads with Densely Assembled Double‐Helical Nanostructures","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Synthetic replication of biological materials like spider silk, cellulose, and collagen remains challenging owing to the entropic cost of aligning high‐aspect‐ratio chains into compact, load‐bearing structures. These barriers cause misalignment, voids, and poor inter‐fiber cohesion in macroscale materials. We report a scalable strategy for producing high‐strength thread from poly(2,2′‐disulfonyl‐4,4′‐benzidine terephthalamide) (PBDT), a rigid‐chain aramid that forms double‐helical supramolecular units, which further organize into nanofiber networks. Continuous PBDT threads are fabricated while retaining the solution‐phase double‐helix structure, enabling production over hundreds of meters. These nanofibers are processed into macroscale threads through wet‐spinning and hydro‐torsional compaction, which promotes densification and enhances inter‐fiber contact. This hierarchical processing sequence yields compact, aligned fibers with improved structural coherence, supporting efficient interfacial load transfer and resulting in a tensile strength of 1.2 GPa and a Young's modulus of 103 GPa, corresponding to 5.8‐fold and 6.3‐fold improvements over bulk PBDT films, respectively. Among synthetic nanofibrous materials assembled in aqueous media, these threads demonstrate superior mechanical properties, with tensile strengths approaching those of spider silk. This study establishes a scalable framework for constructing high‐strength, hierarchically organized aramid threads for aligned, robust architectures, ion‐mediated transport pathways, and charged bioinspired systems."},{"t":"用于NADH再生和酶促加氢的氢键有机框架：面向太阳能-化学能转化的HOF嵌套人工光合系统","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8868255?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"HOF人工光合作用","kp":["[系统架构]: 酶-光-膜耦合HOF-in-HOF人工光合体系","[应用]: NADH再生与酶催化加氢","[调控维度]: 电子/质子/分子传递时空耦合"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究构建了氢键有机框架(HOFs)驱动的HOF-in-HOF人工光合系统，用于NADH再生和酶催化加氢反应。该系统通过HOFs框架的空间限域效应优化光催化辅酶再生效率，将太阳能高效转化为化学能。HOF-in-HOF分级结构提供了优化的电子转移路径和酶固定环境，实现了太阳能到化学能的高效转化，为绿色合成化学提供了新范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Hydrogen‐Bonded Organic Frameworks (HOFs) for NADH Regeneration and Enzymatic Hydrogenation: HOF‐in‐HOF Artificial Photosynthetic System for Solar‐to‐Chemical Conversion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The efficiency of artificial photosynthesis lies not only in the catalysts themselves, but also in the spatiotemporal landscape for efficient mass–energy coupling, which is governed by electron, proton, and molecule transfer. Herein, we propose a scaffold engineering strategy to construct an enzyme–photo–membrane coupled artificial photosynthetic system (\n                    epm\n                    CAPS) within HOF‐in‐HOF architecture for NADH regeneration and enzymatic hydrogenation, where enzyme‐loaded HOF particles for substrate conversion are encapsulated within photocatalytic HOF capsular membranes for cofactor regeneration. This unique configuration enables independent and synergistic regulation of electron, proton, and NADH transfer by modulating the electronic structure of the capsule (via benzene ring units), proton relay (via carboxylate group density), and mass diffusion path (via enzyme–photocatalyst distance), respectively. The system achieves a record initial NADH regeneration rate of 28.23 ± 0.62 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    with a 22.13% apparent quantum yield. When applied to solar‐driven lactate synthesis, the\n                    epm\n                    CAPS achieves a solar‐to‐chemical conversion efficiency of 7.27 ± 0.34%—a nearly threefold higher than previous records. Furthermore, we demonstrate the generality of this platform by synthesizing a spectrum of C\n                    1\n                    –C\n                    6\n                    chemicals, including methanol and mannitol, while maintaining stable operation for over 6 h. Our work delivers a blueprint for the next‐generation artificial photosynthetic systems for sustainable energy and green chemical production."},{"t":"全共轭多共振热激活延迟荧光框架内的杂化电荷转移窗口实现超快反向系间窜越和高效深蓝光发射","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72861?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多共振TADF材料","kp":["[材料]: 全共轭多共振TADF框架","[策略]: 杂化电荷转移窗口","[目标]: 超快反向系间窜越(RISC)","[应用]: 蓝光OLED"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究设计了全共轭的多重共振(MR)热激活延迟荧光(TADF)框架，在框架内构建杂化电荷转移窗口，实现超快反向系间窜越和高效深蓝光发射。MR-TADF材料具有窄带发射特征，通过电荷转移窗口优化单线态-三线态耦合，显著提升激子利用率。该材料在深蓝光OLED器件中实现了高外量子效率，推动了高色纯度显示技术发展。","dp":1,"ot":"Hybridized Charge‐Transfer Window within a Fully Conjugated Multi‐Resonance Thermally Activated Delayed Fluorescence Framework for Ultrafast Reverse Intersystem Crossing and High‐Efficiency in Deep‐Blue Organic Light‐Emitting Diodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Multi‐Resonance (MR) thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF) materials, featuring narrow band emission and high efficiency, are being utilized in blue organic light‐emitting diode (OLED) applications. However, compared to conventional donor–acceptor (D–A) type TADF emitters, these molecules exhibit relatively large singlet‐triplet energy gaps and slow reverse intersystem crossing (RISC) rates, indicating the need for further research to overcome these limitations. Herein, we designed deep blue MR‐TADF molecules by integrating intramolecular short‐range charge transfer and long‐range charge transfer to minimize the singlet‐triplet energy gap and accelerate the RISC rate through hybridized excited states maintaining a narrow emission bandwidth. Compared with conventional MR‐TADF molecules emitting only by short‐range charge transfer, the new MR‐TADF molecule is differentiated in that intramolecular long‐range charge transfer within the polyaromatic hydrocarbon framework additionally contributes to the emission process along with short‐range charge transfer for accelerated RISC. As a result, the\n                    \n                      bf\n                      DOB‐BN2\n                    \n                    MR‐TADF emitter exhibited narrow blue emission at 447 nm with a narrow full width at half maximum (FWHM) of 20 nm, a small singlet‐triplet energy gap of 0.04 eV, and an ultrafast RISC rate of 2.1 × 10\n                    6\n                    s\n                    −\n                    1\n                    . In a blue TADF OLED device, the new TADF molecule showed a high external quantum efficiency of 37.5% with color coordinates (0.139 and 0.065)."},{"t":"利用柔性金属有机框架中吸附质-吸附剂的协同适应性实现可切换烃类分离","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee4346?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性MOF烃类分离","kp":["[材料]: Flex-Cd-MOF-3柔性MOF","[机制]: 吸附质-吸附剂协同适应","[功能]: 可切换烃类分离选择性"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用柔性金属有机框架(MOF)中吸附质-吸附剂协同适应性，实现了烃类气体的可切换分离。柔性MOF在客体分子诱导下发生结构相变，对不同尺寸和形状的烃分子表现出门控选择性吸附。通过调控温度和压力条件可实现分离模式的切换，为乙烯/乙烷、丙烯/丙烷等相似烃类的高效分离提供了节能型替代方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Harnessing cooperative sorbate-sorbent adaptation in a flexible metal-organic framework for switchable hydrocarbon separation","b":"The pursuit of selective adsorption for separating molecules with similar shapes and interactions remains a formidable challenge. This work harnesses a powerful, previously unrecognized mechanism in a flexible metal-organic framework (Flex-Cd-MOF-3) to achieve switchable adsorption selectivity. Specifically, Flex-Cd-MOF-3, a descendant of Flex-Cd-MOF-2 with increased linker rigidity and functionalization, exhibits both local rearrangements and reversible framework expansion or shrinkage, showing phase-dependent propylene/propane selectivity. Considering propane, mutually beneficial conformational changes in the material and sorbate co-occur that are not possible with rigid propylene, reshaping the energy landscapes. These distinct interaction mechanisms, for otherwise very similar molecules, directly lead to pore swelling and shrinking at different pressures and phase switchable selectivity. An innovative modeling approach was developed that describes the full desorption pathway, explaining the relative binding energies and the sorbate-dependent mechanism of pore shrinkage. This work establishes cooperative sorbate-sorbent adaptation as a generalizable adsorption mechanism for achieving precise separation of similar molecules through distinct intermolecular interactions."},{"t":"利用靶向光动力疗法协同激活多发性骨髓瘤中的 T 细胞和 NK 细胞反应（Adv. Mater. 18/2026）","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72676?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Targeted Therapy Synergistically Activates T and NK Cells This cover illustrates a targeted photodynamic therapy system synergistically activating T cell and NK cell responses in multiple myeloma. A dual-acceptor AIE photosensitizer is engineered into antibody-guided nanotherapeutics for highly precise multiple myeloma targeting. Photoactivation orchestrates synergistic adaptive–innate immunity by inducing ICD, DNA damage–driven MICA/B upregulation, and robust activation of patient-derived T and NK cells. This dual-pronged nanoimmunotherapy overcomes the immunosuppressive myeloma niche and offers a powerful strategy for next-generation cancer treatment. More details can be found in the Research Article by Zhaoyun Liu, Rong Fu, Ji Qi, and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202518663).","tp":"光动力疗法","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究开发了一种用于多发性骨髓瘤的靶向光动力疗法系统，旨在协同激活T细胞和自然杀伤（NK）细胞反应。该系统利用双受体聚集诱导发光（AIE）光敏剂，并将其制备成抗体引导的纳米治疗药物，从而实现对骨髓瘤的精准靶向。在光激活下，该系统通过诱导免疫原性细胞死亡（ICD）、引发DNA损伤上调MICA/B分子，并强效激活患者来源的T细胞与NK细胞，成功重塑并协同增强了机体的适应性免疫与天然免疫反应，展现出显著的抗肿瘤潜力。"},{"t":"家禽生产中沙门氏菌和弯曲杆菌的基因组流行病学：量化初级种鸡的贡献","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536554123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The US broiler production system processes over 9.3 billion chickens annually through a highly integrated pyramid structure where two primary breeding companies supply genetic stock to approximately 40 major integrators operating nationwide. To provide a quantitative, system-wide estimate of contamination origins, I analyzed whole-genome sequences from\n                    \n                      Salmonella\n                    \n                    and\n                    \n                      Campylobacter\n                    \n                    isolates collected from over 800 processing facilities as part of the United States Department of Agriculture’s Food Safety Inspection Service verification sampling (2019-2025). Single-linkage clustering identified isolates sharing common origins (≤2, 4, or 8 SNPs genome-wide), which were categorized by processing complex, company, and geographical distributions to infer contamination sources. Among the isolates analyzed, 78% of\n                    \n                      Campylobacter\n                    \n                    , 77% of non-Enteritidis\n                    \n                      Salmonella\n                    \n                    , and 96% of\n                    \n                      Salmonella\n                    \n                    Enteritidis belonged to clusters spanning multiple companies and geographic regions—a pattern consistent with primary breeder origin. The geographic spread of Enteritidis isolates within clusters matched a random model, and cluster populations showed temporal turnover yet spatial synchrony—patterns explicable only by contamination from the apex of the breeding pyramid.\n                    \n                      Campylobacter\n                    \n                    showed regional clustering implying sources at lower levels of the breeding pyramid. Cluster persistence exceeded multiple production cycles (median &gt;4 y for\n                    \n                      Campylobacter\n                    \n                    , &gt;4.5 y for 75% of Enteritidis isolates), indicating stable contamination reservoirs upstream of processing. These results demonstrate that the primary breeders are a major source of broiler contamination and suggest that upstream interventions targeting breeding stock, in particular for Enteritidis, may represent an efficient strategy for further reducing clinical cases of foodborne illness."},{"t":"不同强度和价态的 Fab-Fc 和 Fab-Fab 相互作用导致 IgG1 抗体的高浓度粘度","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526550123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The variable domains in Fab regions are well-established contributors to high concentration viscosity of IgG, primarily through charge and hydrophobic interactions. In contrast, the roles of the Fc and the number of self-interacting sites (valency) are less well understood. Here, we investigate the relative contributions of Fab–Fab and Fab–Fc interactions to high concentration viscosity for a diverse panel of 20 IgG\n                    1\n                    antibodies, by rheometry, coarse-grained simulations, and molecular surface property analysis. Strikingly, fragmentation of IgG\n                    1\n                    into F(ab′)\n                    2\n                    plus Fc reduced viscosity (−11 to −93%) for all antibodies tested, demonstrating prevalent contributions of Fc to viscosity. Coarse-grained simulations with one site per Fab and two sites per Fc qualitatively tracked trends in experimental rheometry data for 20 parental antibodies and their fragments. In these simulations Fab–Fab and Fab–Fc interaction strengths were independently varied to capture possible interaction differences arising from parental sequences or any mutations. These coarse-grained simulations suggest that Fab–Fc attractions generate branched IgG\n                    1\n                    networks and disproportionately larger clusters relative to Fab–Fab interactions of comparable strength. This study suggests that a four-site self-interaction model, previously proposed for a single antibody (omalizumab), is broadly applicable to diverse IgG\n                    1\n                    . Beyond well-established variable domain engineering, this self-interaction model predicts that Fc engineering may reduce IgG\n                    1\n                    viscosity, a much sought after goal to enable subcutaneous delivery. Clinically validated Fc mutations are demonstrated here to substantially reduce the viscosity for multiple IgG\n                    1\n                    (−33 to −91% reduction, n = 6), supporting this emerging antibody design concept."},{"t":"具有多尺度时变连通性和深度学习预测的清洁能源和化石能源的能源转型和地缘政治风险","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003806?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"能源转型预测","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.5},"as":""},{"t":"双相工程耦合价态梯度与熵辅助解锁4.9V耐高压无钴高镍正极","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70868?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高镍正极材料","kp":["耐压[无钴高镍正极]: 4.9 V","[镍含量]: Ni ≥ 0.9","[策略]: 双相工程+价态梯度+熵辅助","[问题]: 晶格应变、氧损失、相畸变"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究通过双相工程耦合价态梯度和熵辅助策略，开发了耐受4.9V高压的无钴高镍(Ni≥0.9)层状正极材料。高镍正极虽提升能量密度，但在高压下结构不稳定。双相工程在颗粒内部构筑组分梯度，熵辅助稳定晶格结构，协同抑制不可逆相变和氧释放。该策略使无钴高镍正极在高电压(>4.5V)下保持优异循环稳定性，推动高能量密度锂电发展。","dp":1,"ot":"Dual‐Phase Engineering Coupled With Valence Gradient and Entropy Assistance Unlocking 4.9 V‐Tolerant Co‐Free High‐Ni Cathodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Layered high‐Ni (Ni ≥ 0.9) cathodes are being developed to endure high‐voltage operations above 4.5 V for unlocking unprecedented energy density, but they still suffer from exacerbated chemomechanical and electrochemical degradation primarily due to excessive lattice strain, oxygen loss, and phase distortion during prolonged cycling. Herein, we design a high‐Ni, Co‐free cathode, which features an entropy‐assisted core–shell layered/spinel dual‐phase, coupled with a Ni‐valence gradient framework, via a multi‐component complex doping involved co‐precipitation strategy. The coherent structural ordering from surface spinel phase to bulk layered phase, driven by the Ni‐enriched core/Mn‐enriched shell arrangement, and the entropy‐assistance and valence‐gradient layout, hugely prevents mechanical degradation, surface side‐reactions, and oxygen loss, delivering a pseudo strain‐free cathode. Thanks to these appealing merits, the cathode breaks through current voltage limitations while maintaining an optimal balance between capacity and sustainability, enabling the stable high‐voltage operation up to 4.9 V. Moreover, an exceptional cyclability under strenuous conditions is achieved in practical Ah‐level pouch‐type cells employing graphite and metallic Li anodes, operating at ultrahigh voltages of 4.65 and 4.8 V, respectively. Besides, the oxygen loss‐triggered phase transitions upon heating are markedly delayed. More significantly, our contribution here propels the tremendous advancement of high‐Ni, Co‐free cathodes to the commercializable levels."},{"t":"废弃微/纳塑料转化为碳材料：可再生能源与环境应用新趋势","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003429?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"废塑料资源化","kp":["[资源化]: 废弃微/纳塑料转化为碳材料"],"sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Conversion of waste micro/nano plastics into carbon materials: A new trend for renewable energy and environmental applications"},{"t":"受体激酶信号传导的比较蛋白质组学分析揭示了促进植物气孔发育的关键运输成分","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb6464?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Receptor kinases are pivotal for growth, development, and environmental response of plants. Yet, their regulatory mechanisms and spatial dynamics remain underexplored. The ERECTA-family receptor kinases coordinate diverse developmental processes, including stomatal development. To understand the proteomic landscape of the ERECTA-mediated signaling pathways, we report comparative analyses of the ERECTA interactome and proximitome by epitope-tagged affinity-purification (ET-AP) and TurboID-based proximity labeling (TbID-PL) mass spectrometry, respectively. While ET-AP recovered receptor complex components (e.g., TOO MANY MOUTHS), TbID-PL effectively captured transient associations with the components of endosomal trafficking, i.e., clathrin-mediated endocytosis machinery. We further identify that specific subfamily members of phosphatidylinositol-binding clathrin assembly proteins (PICALMs) interact with and synergistically regulate ERECTA internalization. Mutations in\n                    PICALMs\n                    impair ERECTA endocytosis and lead to excessive stomatal clustering by dampening the downstream signaling output. Together, we provide a proteomic atlas of the ERECTA signaling network and demonstrate that timely removal of receptor kinase by the endocytosis machinery is essential for active signal transduction enforcing stomatal patterning."},{"t":"氟诱导烯丙基铑异构化促进的β-酮酸与偕二氟联烯催化对映选择性脱羧交叉偶联","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4973244?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"不对称催化偶联","kp":["[催化体系]: Rh(I)/(S,S)-Ph-BPE","[反应类型]: β-酮酸与gem-二氟丙二烯脱羧交叉偶联","[关键机制]: 氟诱导烯丙基铑异构化"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了催化不对称脱羧交叉偶联新反应，实现了β-酮酸与gem-二氟丙二烯的对映选择性烷基化。关键创新在于利用氟诱导的烯丙基铑异构化策略，高效构建含氟手性中心。该方法为合成多氟取代的手性分子提供了高效途径，在药物化学和材料科学中具有重要应用潜力。","dp":1,"ot":"Catalytic Enantioselective Decarboxylative Cross‐Coupling of β‐Ketoacids With gem‐Difluoroallenes Enabled by Fluorine‐Induced Allylrhodium Isomerization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Catalytic decarboxylative allylic alkylation (DAA) reaction represents an efficient strategy for synthesizing molecules containing both carbonyl and alkenyl functionalities, yet is frequently challenged by multiple selectivity issues. Here we report the first intermolecular decarboxylative cross‐coupling of β‐ketoacids with internal allenes. Using a Rh\n                    (I)\n                    /(\n                    S\n                    ,\n                    S\n                    )‐Ph‐BPE system, α‐\n                    gem\n                    ‐difluoroallylic carbonyl compounds can be generated with excellent chemo‐, regio‐, and enantioselectivities. Mechanistic studies support “coordination‐assisted inner‐sphere addition–decarboxylation” pathway, where C─C bond formation occurs prior to the decarboxylation step. Fluorine‐induced\n                    anti\n                    →\n                    syn\n                    isomerization of π‐allyl‐rhodium species proves to be the key factor governing the stereoselectivity of this reaction. This cross‐coupling reaction tolerates a range of functional groups and advances the field of decarboxylative allylic alkylation."},{"t":"制动驱动骨系统：炎症微环境和成骨作用的顺序调节，促进骨质疏松性骨缺损的再生","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72909?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Osteoporotic bone defects, characterized by chronic inflammation and impaired osteogenesis, pose a formidable challenge for functional bone regeneration. Conventional scaffolds lack effective regulation of the inflammatory microenvironment and fail to coordinate anti‐inflammatory and osteogenic signals, thereby limiting their ability to couple inflammation resolution with new bone formation. Here, we developed a “Brake–Drive Osteo System”, a spatiotemporally programmed biomaterial integrating quercetin‐loaded nanovesicles and teriparatide‐loaded nucleic acid frameworks within a calcium phosphate scaffold (BCP‐T/N@Q/V). This design enables a sequential therapeutic cascade—quercetin first “disengages the inflammatory brake”, alleviating microenvironmental resistance to osteogenesis, while teriparatide subsequently “activates the osteogenic drive”, promoting bone regeneration. It effectively reprogrammed macrophages toward a pro‐regenerative phenotype and mitigated inflammatory stress, establishing an immunologically permissive microenvironment. This osteoimmune modulation significantly enhanced the osteogenic commitment and maturation of osteoporotic bone marrow mesenchymal stem cells. In a rat osteoporotic femoral condyle defect model, the scaffold achieved accelerated, structurally integrated bone regeneration, underscoring its translational potential. Collectively, this “Brake–Drive Osteo System” provides a sequential strategy that couples inflammation resolution with osteogenesis for effective osteoporotic bone regeneration."},{"t":"基于生物的片上模型可识别过度兴奋的皮质纹状体网络内的选择性拓扑重组","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513459123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The mammalian cerebral cortex projects to the striatum in a precise, hierarchical topography, forming parallel loops that underlie sensorimotor, associative, and limbic processing. Despite the striatum’s lack of clear anatomical boundaries, these projections remain functionally segregated, suggesting the existence of intrinsic organizing principles. Disruptions in corticostriatal connectivity and excitability are common in neurodevelopmental disorders, but it remains unclear whether such abnormalities are a cause or a consequence of circuit dysfunction. Here, we hypothesized that the excitability state of cortical neurons plays a direct role in shaping the topographic organization of their striatal projections. To test this, we engineered a biologically faithful in vitro platform inspired by the Tesla valve, enabling adjacent corticostriatal territories to be modeled under controlled excitability regimes. We found that cortical hyperexcitability disrupted the normal developmental transition from axonal growth to stabilization, leading to premature invasion of neighboring territories and the formation of ectopic convergence zones. As a result, the segregation between parallel pathways was lost, while local connectivity patterns remained unaffected. These findings reveal that intrinsic, activity-sensitive mechanisms constrain long-range axonal growth to shape the wiring diagram of the corticostriatal projectome. They also highlight the power of biologically grounded on-chip models to uncover how early circuit vulnerabilities can lead to connectivity defects characteristic of disorders such as autism spectrum disorder, schizophrenia, epilepsy, and obsessive-compulsive disorder."},{"t":"无粘结剂、自支撑、高导电硫化物电解质实现优异负极稳定性（Adv. Mater. 18/2026）","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72683?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硫化物固态电解质","kp":["[电解质]: 无粘结剂自支撑硫化物电解质","[特性]: 高离子电导率"],"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究报道了一种无粘结剂、自支撑且高导电性的硫化物固态电解质，显著提升了固态电池负极界面稳定性。硫化物电解质因高离子导电率被视为全固态电池候选材料，但与负极界面兼容性差。无粘结剂设计消除了非活性组分，优化界面接触，为实现高稳定性的全固态锂电池提供了新方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Binder‐Free, Self‐Supporting, and Highly Conductive Sulfide Electrolytes Enabling Superior Anode Stability (Adv. Mater. 18/2026)","b":"Superior Anode Stability In their Research Article (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202517806), Shunsuke Kawaguchi, Takuhiro Miyuki, and co-workers present a binder-free, self-supporting sulfide solid electrolyte with exceptionally reduced grain boundaries, delivering high ionic conductivity together with remarkable mechanical robustness. The membrane demonstrates outstanding Li stability and realistic full-cell performance, and the cover visual highlights this architecture as a highly effective strategy to mitigate critical bottlenecks in all-solid-state batteries."},{"t":"具有不对称局部电场的轴向硫桥Mo-S-Cu纳米酶可增强多酶活性，用于铁死亡-焦亡治疗","d":"2026-03-26","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523888?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The axial coordination‐based nanozymes with asymmetric local electric field (LEF) are promising for efficient reactive oxygen species (ROS)‐mediated antitumor treatments, while normally hindered by a limited LEF upon individual coordination to adjacent atoms. Herein, an axial sulfur‐bridged Mo─S─Cu nanozymes with asymmetric LEF (A‐CuN\n                    3\n                    S\n                    1\n                    @MoS\n                    2‐x\n                    ) was constructed based on nanoislands (NIs)‐based axial ligand‐bridging to enhance ferroptosis‐pyroptosis therapy. The S bridge between Cu atoms in CuN\n                    3\n                    /C nanosheets and Mo site in NIs creates a broad and enhanced LEF, which facilitates rapid electron transfer between the nanozyme and substrates, thereby regulating its enzymatic activities. Theoretical calculations reveal that the S‐bridge induces asymmetric electron‐rich redistribution along the longitudinal axis of Cu─N\n                    3\n                    , promoting H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    heterolysis and O\n                    2\n                    desorption to enhance catalase‐like and peroxidase‐like activities. Simultaneously, Mo sites extract electrons from Cu via the S bridge, augmenting oxidase‐like activities and degrade overexpressed glutathione to avoid nontherapeutic ROS consumption. Consequently, A‐CuN\n                    3\n                    S\n                    1\n                    @MoS\n                    2‐x\n                    induces robust ferroptosis by cytotoxic ROS accumulation and causing severe mitochondria damages, while simultaneously activating pyroptosis within the tumor region without harming normal tissues. This work demonstrates high‐efficiency ferroptosis‐pyroptosis therapy driven by multi‐enzyme catalysis via axial Mo─S─Cu coordination with an expanded asymmetric LEF, offering a novel strategy for non‐apoptotic tumor treatment.","tp":"纳米酶抗肿瘤","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究设计了具有不对称局部电场的轴向硫桥Mo-S-Cu纳米酶（A-CuN3S1@MoS2-x），通过硫桥轴向配位策略增强局部电场强度，突破单一配位导致LEF有限的瓶颈。该纳米酶展现出增强的多酶活性，通过同时诱导铁死亡和焦亡双重细胞死亡途径，实现高效抗肿瘤治疗，为纳米酶介导的联合肿瘤治疗提供了新策略。"},{"t":"作者更正：光开关异构体改善晶界韧性与光循环下钙钛矿太阳能电池稳定性","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02041-6","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿太阳电池","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":2.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Author Correction: Photoswitchable isomers to improve grain boundary resilience and perovskite solar cells stability under light cycling"},{"t":"质子交换膜燃料电池中运行条件参数诱导气体串扰现象分析：综述","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003673?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"质子交换膜燃料电池","kp":["[问题]: PEMFC气体串透现象","[研究]: 操作条件参数对串透的影响"],"sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Analysis of operating condition parameters induced gas crossover phenomenon in proton exchange membrane fuel cells: A review"},{"t":"含Pt-(di-NHC)-Pt单元的有机金属[2]索烃：拓扑驱动策略增强离散聚集体磷光发射","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1981919?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"拓扑磷光分子","kp":["[分子设计]: 苯并双碳烯桥连双核Pt(II)配合物","[拓扑策略]: 机械键限制分子内运动增强磷光","[聚集体类型]: 离散型可溶性机械互锁分子"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用Pt-(二-N杂环卡宾)-Pt单元构建了一种有机金属[2]索烃，通过拓扑驱动策略增强离散聚集体中的磷光发射。机械互锁分子（MIMs）作为一类独特的离散可溶聚集体，其拓扑结构可调控发光性质。该设计利用索烃的机械键限制分子内运动，抑制非辐射衰减，从而提升磷光量子效率，为高效发光材料设计提供新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"An Organometallic [2]Catenane With Pt‒(di‐NHC)‒Pt Units: A Topology‐Driven Strategy for Enhanced Phosphorescence in Discrete Aggregates","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mechanically interlocked molecules (MIMs) can be conceptualized as a distinct class of discrete and soluble aggregates, where the mechanical bond restricts selected intramolecular motions, thereby triggering emission enhancement analogous to aggregation‐induced emission (AIE). Herein, we present phosphorescent MIMs based on a benzobiscarbene bridged dinuclear Pt\n                    II\n                    complex (NHC =\n                    N\n                    ‐heterocyclic carbene ligand). Tailoring the\n                    N\n                    ‐substituents of the benzobiscarbene ligand allowed selective access to the\n                    syn‐\n                    configured dinuclear complex\n                    syn‐\n                    [Pt\n                    2\n                    (\n                    1b\n                    )X\n                    2\n                    ] (X = I, OTf). Self‐assembly of\n                    syn‐\n                    [Pt\n                    2\n                    (\n                    1b\n                    )(OTf)\n                    2\n                    ] with bipyridyl ligands\n                    \n                      L\n                      2\n                    \n                    and\n                    \n                      L\n                      3\n                    \n                    yielded two discrete MIMs: the Borromean rings [\n                    2‐BRs\n                    ](OTf)\n                    12\n                    stabilized by π···π interactions and the [2]catenane [\n                    3b‐IL\n                    ](OTf)\n                    4\n                    , generated and stabilized by solvophobic effects. While the π···π interactions in the Borromean rings lead to severe phosphorescence quenching, the solvophobically assembled [2]catenane effectively circumvents such quenching, while simultaneously restricting intramolecular rotations and vibrations. Consequently, the [2]catenane displays a drastic phosphorescence enhancement compared to the Borromean rings."},{"t":"以双(二氟硼)-8-咪唑二吡咯甲烷为核心的电子受体用于短波红外光电响应","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3239137?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"近红外光电材料","kp":["[吸收波段]: 短波红外1000-3000 nm","[电子受体核]: 双硼二氟化-8-咪唑二吡咯甲烷(BIP)","[结构特征]: 共振N—B←N单元"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究设计了一种以双(二氟硼)-8-咪唑二吡咯甲烷为核心的新型电子受体，用于短波红外光电探测。具有给体-受体（D-A）结构的小分子电子受体在有机光电器件中表现出优异性能。该材料在短波红外区域具有良好的光响应特性，在夜视、生物成像和通信领域具有应用前景。","dp":1,"ot":"An Electron Acceptor With bis(Borondifluoride)‐8‐imidazodipyrromethene as the Core for Short‐Wavelength Infrared Photoresponse","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Small‐molecule electron acceptors with donor–acceptor (D–A) structures have emerged as attractive materials for organic optoelectronics, yet achieving strong absorption in the short‐wavelength infrared (SWIR, 1000–3000 nm) region remains a fundamental challenge. Here, a resonant N—B←N unit, bis(borondifluoride)‐8‐imidazodipyrromethene (BIP), is introduced as a new electron‐deficient core for constructing D–A type SWIR acceptors. Incorporation of the BIP unit induces a pronounced bathochromic shift of 255 nm and affords an ultranarrow optical bandgap of 0.86 eV, with thin‐film absorption extending to 1450 nm. The resulting acceptor, BIP‐M1, exhibits a high molar extinction coefficient of 3.8 × 10\n                    5\n                    M\n                    −\n                    1\n                    cm\n                    −\n                    1\n                    and an exceptionally small Stokes shift of 0.054 eV, indicative of its strong SWIR absorption capability and suppressed nonradiative losses. Photodiode‐type organic photodetectors based on BIP‐M1 enable sensitive photoresponse over a broad spectral range from 300 to 1400 nm, delivering a responsivity of 0.18 A W\n                    −\n                    1\n                    and a specific detectivity of 3.93 × 10\n                    11\n                    Jones at 1200 nm, together with an ultralow Urbach energy of 19.19 meV. This study identifies resonant N—B←N units as powerful structural motifs for small bandgap molecular design and establishes BIP‐based small molecular acceptors as a promising platform for next‐generation SWIR optoelectronics."},{"t":"MXene限域水的形貌与扩散性改变：机器学习加速计算结合实验研究","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz1780?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MXene限域水","kp":["[方法]: ML加速从头算分子动力学+XRD+非弹性中子散射","[研究对象]: MXene限域水的形貌与扩散率"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究结合机器学习加速计算与实验手段，揭示了MXene纳米受限空间中水的异常形貌和扩散行为。纳米受限水因空间限制和受阻氢键网络展现出与体相水截然不同的性质。研究利用机器学习势函数进行大规模分子动力学模拟，预测了MXene层间水的结构演化与传输特性，对纳米流体器件和储能材料设计具有指导意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Altered morphology and diffusivity of water confined in MXenes: Machine learning–accelerated computations combined with experiments","b":"Nanoconfined water exhibits unique properties compared to bulk water due to limited quantities, frustrated hydrogen bonding, and surface interactions, which are fundamental for energy storage and transport applications. We integrate machine learning–accelerated ab initio molecular dynamics with x-ray diffraction (XRD) and inelastic neutron scattering (INS) to systematically analyze the thermodynamic and dynamic behavior of water confined between functionalized (-F, -O, and -OH) two-dimensional (2D) Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    MXene layers. As water intercalates between layers, the interlayer spacing exhibits layer-dependent staging characteristics. The water polarization can be flipped by the count and morphology of intercalated molecules interacting with MXene surface groups, resulting in varying electrostatic potential profiles. On the basis of interfacial electrostatic potential, hydrogen bond lifetime, and molecular orientation, we establish a linear combination of exponential model describing water diffusivity. These computational insights align well with experimental x-ray and neutron measurements, suggesting strategies for tuning water morphology and transport by tailoring MXene surface chemistry and water content for electrochemical energy storage and nanofluidic applications."},{"t":"缩醛[6]芳烃：刚性环上手性大环促进电荷转移共组装及优异（手性）光学性能","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4969685?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性大环组装体","kp":["[分子特征]: 三氧杂双环[3.3.1]壬烷嵌入刚性手性大环","[组装特性]: 与缺电子芳环客体形成电荷转移复合物","[光学性能]: 优异手性光学性质"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究引入了缩醛[6]芳烃（Ac[6]）作为一类新型刚性手性大环分子，其碳中心手性赋予大环'环上手性'特征。该分子可与电子受体形成电荷转移共组装体，展现出优异的光学及手性光学性质。刚性大环框架有效固定了手性构象，为开发手性光功能材料和分子识别传感器提供了新平台。","dp":1,"ot":"Acetal[6]Arenes: Rigid Chirality‐on‐Annulus Macrocycles Promoting Charge‐Transfer Co‐Assembly With Exceptional (Chiro)Optical Properties","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Acetal[6]arenes (\n                    Ac[6]\n                    ) are introduced as a new class of rigid chiral macrocyclic arenes in which carbon‐centered chirality is embedded in a trioxabicyclo[3.3.1]nonane motif at macrocyclic waist.\n                    Ac[6]\n                    efficiently forms charge‐transfer (CT) complexes with electron‐deficient aromatic guests in both solution and the solid state. Single‐crystal x‐ray diffraction reveals that guest molecules bind to the outer surface of\n                    Ac[6]\n                    through well‐defined stacking interactions. In contrast, the corresponding acyclic bis‐acetal precursors show no complexation behavior, indicating that the rigid macrocyclic topology suppresses ring‐unit flipping and significantly enhances interfacial π–π interactions. The resulting solid‐state complexes exhibit dual emission at CT band (prompt fluorescence and TADF). Notably, complexes derived from enantiopure\n                    Ac[6]\n                    display intense circular dichroism (CD) and circularly polarized luminescence (CPL). The associated dissymmetry factors (\n                    \n                      g\n                      abs\n                    \n                    and\n                    \n                      g\n                      lum\n                    \n                    ) even exceed intrinsic\n                    Ac[6]\n                    values, indicating highly efficient chiral transfer.\n                    Ac[6]\n                    shows robust guest‐capture capability, forming CT complexes not only via solution co‐crystallization but also through simple physical mixing and even gas‐phase guest uptake. By exploiting time‐dependent capture kinetics and multicolor optoelectronic properties, we developed applications for optical sensing and time‐encoded encryption. These results establish macrocyclization of rigid chirality‐on‐annulus units as a powerful strategy for creating functional supramolecular CT materials with emergent chiroptical and optoelectronic properties."},{"t":"基于分层滚动优化的电力-交通耦合系统三级协调策略：整合个体电动汽车调度与网络管理","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600382X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电力交通协同","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A tri-level coordination strategy for coupled power and transportation systems based on hierarchical rolling optimization: integrating individual EV dispatch with network management"},{"t":"工业电池集群管理的数字孪生框架：带不确定性量化的统一多信号集成方法","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003934?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电池数字孪生","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A digital twin framework for industrial battery fleet management: A unified multi-signal ensemble approach with uncertainty quantification"},{"t":"水溶性PVA大分子硫醇实现400 mm/s速度下细胞交互水凝胶结构双光子微加工（Adv. Mater. 18/2026）","d":"2026-03-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72680?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双光子微制造水凝胶","kp":["加工速度[双光子微加工]: 400 mm s⁻¹","[材料]: 水溶性PVA大分子硫醇水凝胶"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A Water‐Soluble PVA Macrothiol Enables Two‐Photon Microfabrication of Cell‐Interactive Hydrogel Structures at 400 mm s−1 (Adv. Mater. 18/2026)"},{"t":"基因组移植后“僵尸细胞”起死回生","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00938-6","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"基因组移植","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.5,"r":7.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"as":""},{"t":"[ASAP]氮基多环芳烃宇宙尘埃合成模拟物：制备及初步影响","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18079","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"We report the preparation of the first synthetic mimic for submicron-sized nitrogen-based polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbon (PANH) cosmic dust. Melting point phase diagrams were constructed for two binary mixtures comprising N-phenylcarbazole (mp 96 °C) with either N-ethylcarbazole (mp 71 °C) or N-propylcarbazole (mp 50 °C) to identify their respective eutectic compositions. Each eutectic composition was then processed above its eutectic temperature via hot emulsification using a commercial water-soluble polymeric emulsifier: high-shear homogenization produced polydisperse molten PANH droplets of approximately 60-70 μm diameter. Each precursor emulsion was then subjected to high-pressure microfluidization to produce much finer submicron-sized PANH droplets. On cooling to 20 °C, these hybrid PANH microparticles were coated with an ultrathin overlayer of polypyrrole (PPy). This electrically conductive coating enabled the efficient accumulation of surface charge, which in turn allowed the electrostatic acceleration of such PPy-coated PANH microparticles up to the hypervelocity regime using a high-voltage dust accelerator. Firing such PPy-coated PANH microparticles into a gold target at 1.9-5.0 km s-1 led to their impact ionization and the in situ generation of an ionic plasma. Subsequent impact ionization mass spectrometry analysis confirmed the formation of the characteristic parent cations for N-phenylcarbazole and either N-propylcarbazole or N-ethylcarbazole, respectively. Such laboratory-based experiments augur well for the unambiguous identification of PANH-based cosmic dust by next-generation impact ionization mass spectrometers to be deployed in current and future space missions.","tp":"宇宙尘埃模拟","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究首次合成了亚微米级氮基多环芳烃（PANH）宇宙尘埃的模拟物。通过构建N-苯基咔唑与N-乙基咔唑或N-丙基咔唑二元混合物的熔点相图确定共晶组成，再通过热乳化法制备微粒。该模拟物可用于研究含氮多环芳烃宇宙尘埃的物理化学性质及其对天体化学和行星形成过程的影响，为宇宙尘埃的实验室研究提供了可用材料。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过单线态氧/自由基拦截抑制富锂锰基正极的级联降解","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c03092","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂锰基正极","kp":["[正极类型]: 富锂锰基层状氧化物","[失效机制]: 高压循环产单线态氧和自由基引发级联降解","[策略]: 单线态氧/自由基拦截粘结剂"],"as":"富锂锰基层状氧化物因高比容量被视为高能量密度锂电池极具潜力的正极材料，但其充放电过程中存在级联降解问题，导致容量和电压快速衰减。本研究提出抑制级联降解的新策略，通过结构调控或表面修饰等手段稳定材料晶格，有效提升循环寿命。该成果对推动低成本、高能量密度锂电正极的工程化应用具有重要意义。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Suppressing Cascade Degradation of Lithium-Rich Manganese-Based Cathodes via Singlet Oxygen/Free Radical-Intercep","b":"Lithium-rich manganese-based layered oxides with high capacity are regarded as highly attractive cathodes for high-energy-density lithium-ion batteries. However, the redox reactions in this cathode usually generate highly reactive singlet oxygen and electrolyte-derived free radicals during high-voltage cycling, which accelerate electrolyte oxidative decomposition and trigger cascading side reactions, leading to a rapid capacity fade. Herein, we report a targeted scavenging strategy employing a hindered amine-functionalized triblock binder to trap singlet oxygen and free radicals, improving the long-cycle stability of the cathodes. The amino groups (N-H) in the hindered amine structure can continuously scavenge singlet oxygen and generate nitroxide radicals (N-O·). Both the parent N-H groups and the resulting N-O· radicals further act as effective traps for free radicals derived from electrolyte decomposition, stabilizing the interfacial stability and transport kinetics of the cathode under 4.8 V. Consequently, the full cell with this binder exhibits a significantly reduced capacity decay rate of 0.175% per cycle over 200 cycles. Our work provides a viable solution for enhancing the cycling stability of lithium-rich manganese-based cathodes, promoting the development of high-energy-density lithium-ion batteries."},{"t":"[ASAP] 氢致钝化机制中金属-绝缘体界面缺陷密度的空间定量分析","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01240","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MIS光电极缺陷钝化","kp":["[MIS光电极]: ALD绝缘层缺陷钝化","[光电催化]: Si基MIS用于PEC水分解"],"as":"硅基金属-绝缘体-半导体（MIS）光电极利用内置电场驱动光电催化水分解制氢，但氢致缺陷会严重影响器件性能与稳定性。本研究开发了一种空间定量表征缺陷密度的方法，能够精确映射光电极中氢诱导缺陷的分布与演变规律。该方法为优化硅基光电极的界面工程设计提供了关键分析工具，有助于提升太阳能制氢效率。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Spatially Quantitative Profiling of Defect Density for Hydrogen-Induced Passivation Mechanism of Metal–Insulator–","b":"Silicon-based metal-insulator-semiconductor (MIS) photoelectrodes provide a built-in field for photoelectrochemical water splitting but suffer from inefficient charge transport due to carrier recombination at defect sites within the space-charge region. The insulating layer fabricated by atomic layer deposition (ALD) is critical for defect passivation and requires carefully engineered deposition and annealing processes for optimal performance. This necessitates the quantitative analysis of defect density distribution. However, such analysis remains impeded by intrinsic limitations of conventional single-capacitance techniques and the influence of tunneling leakage currents. This paper describes an integrated multicapacitance methodology that combines drive-level capacitance profiling (DLCP) and capacitance-voltage (C-V) techniques to quantify both interface (Nit) and bulk defect charge density (NDLCP) within the space-charge region, using the space-charge capacitance refined by MIS-adapted multicomponent equivalent circuit modeling. This approach reveals that Al2O3 reduces the Nit at n-Si/ITO interface from approximately 2.9 × 1016 to 1.4 × 1016 cm-3, while simultaneously profiling the variation of NDLCP and depletion width. Furthermore, systematic DLCP/C-V analysis enables the design of a tailored passivation protocol by tuning ALD deposition (Tdep) and annealing temperatures to leverage the hydrogen-induced mechanism. Optimal passivation is achieved at a moderate Tdep (∼160 °C) followed by 350 °C annealing, which balances sufficient hydrogen content and suitable structural properties of the Al2O3 film without introducing additional bulk defects during annealing. Eventually, the optimized n-Si/SiOx/Al2O3/ITO/Ni photoanode exhibits an onset potential of 0.88 V vs RHE and an applied bias photon-to-current efficiency (ABPE) of 2.91%, with a long-term stability of 120 h."},{"t":"[ASAP] 调控非共价相互作用构建高温多轴无铅金属卤化物杂化铁电体","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21648","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无铅铁电体","kp":["[无铅铁电体]: 非共价作用调控高温多轴性","材料体系[铁电体]: (PMA)3MBr6 (M=Bi3+/Sb3+)"],"as":"无铅分子铁电体因环境友好性被视为绿色电子技术的关键材料，但高温稳定性不足限制了其应用。本研究通过调控非共价相互作用（如氢键、卤键等），成功构建了耐高温多轴铁电材料。该策略使铁电相变温度显著提升，同时保持多轴极化特性，为柔性电子、存储器和传感器等高温环境应用开辟了新路径。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Regulating Noncovalent Interactions to Construct High-Temperature Multiaxial Lead-Free Metal Halide Hybrid Ferroe","b":"Lead-free molecular ferroelectrics are expected to promote the development of green electronics technology due to their environmental friendliness and functional diversity. Nevertheless, the limited variety, low Curie temperature (Tc), and uniaxial characteristics pose significant obstacles in their application. Herein, on the basis of (PMA)3MBr6 (PMA+ is benzylammonium, and M is Bi3+ or Sb3+), we constructed a series of lead-free metal halide hybrids (PMA)2(A)MBr6 (A is dimethylammonium (DMA+), formamidinium (FA+), or guanidinium (GA+)) using a cation mixing strategy. The cation mixing strategy introduces cation-π interactions and effectively regulates the hydrogen bonding network in the structure. The different strengths of noncovalent interactions in the structures lead to differences in the phase transition temperature and ferroelectricity of (PMA)2(A)MBr6. In (PMA)2(GA)MBr6 and (PMA)2(FA)MBr6, the excessively strong hydrogen bond network and cation-π interactions result in the system lacking the necessary kinetic degrees of freedom to achieve ferroelectric inversion. It is worth noting that moderate noncovalent interactions can ensure spontaneous polarization below the Curie temperature (Tc) and provide necessary dynamic channels for the flipping of polar units, thus successfully achieving ferroelectricity in (PMA)2(DMA)MBr6 (3̅mFm). The results revealed that in the design of molecular ferroelectrics, a delicate balance needs to be struck between the different strengths of noncovalent interactions. This finding provides a significant and effective pathway to design high-Tc and multiaxial environmentally friendly ferroelectrics."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过AI辅助性能分析实现钙钛矿太阳能电池快速参数预测","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00075","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿AI表征","kp":["[方法]: 随机森林中位叶值模型","训练规模[AI辅助]: >50000次漂移-扩散模拟","[输入]: 单次EIS阻抗谱实现全参数高精度预测"],"as":"金属卤化物钙钛矿因其优异的光电性能被视为下一代光伏材料的明星候选者，但材料体系复杂的物理过程使器件参数的全面优化极具挑战性。该研究提出一种AI辅助的性能快速参数预测方法，利用机器学习模型对钙钛矿太阳能电池的关键器件指标（如效率、稳定性等）进行高效预测与筛选，大幅缩减传统试错式实验的时间与成本。这一方法有望加速钙钛矿光伏组件的工程化迭代，推动其从实验室效率纪录走向规模化量产。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Rapid Parameter Prediction in Perovskite Solar Cells via AI-Assisted Performance Analysis","b":"Metal halide perovskites are highly promising for photovoltaics, yet their complex physics makes comprehensive device characterization challenging. Here, we introduce a machine learning approach that enables holistic, high-precision characterization of perovskite solar cells from an impedance (EIS) measurement. By training a Random Forests Median Leaf Value model on over 50,000 drift-diffusion simulations, our model simultaneously predicts 12 critical device parameters, including ion dynamics and densities, carrier mobilities, and recombination properties, with high accuracy (R2 > 0.99). This approach advances prior work by extracting a more complete parameter set while alleviating the nonuniqueness problem through information-rich EIS input features. We rigorously validate the model against experimental values and closed-loop verification. Applying this technique to triple-cation perovskites with varying compositions reveals intriguing underlying trends, demonstrating its power to uncover complex structure–property relationships. This work establishes ML-driven frameworks for rapid, reliable device analysis to accelerate photovoltaic optimization."},{"t":"[ASAP] 取向可控MOF膜实现可切换H2/CO2分离","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22587","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF膜气体分离","kp":["[分离对象]: H2/CO2可逆切换分离","[调控维度]: MOF膜晶体取向控制","[加工方法]: 溶剂诱导液-汽相处理"],"as":"金属有机框架（MOF）膜在气体分离领域潜力巨大，但精确调控晶体取向一直是难点。该研究通过控制MOF膜的晶体取向，实现了一种可切换的H2/CO2分离机制——即同一膜材料在不同条件下可选择性地透氢或透二氧化碳。这种取向控制的策略为化学分离引入了全新维度，有望在氢气纯化、碳捕集与工业尾气处理中实现按需切换的高效分离，显著降低能耗与运营成本。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Orientation-Controlled MOF Membranes Enabling Switchable H2/CO2 Separation","b":"Controlling the crystal orientation of metal-organic framework (MOF) membranes introduces a new dimension to chemical separations, as the alignment of anisotropic pore channels dictates the membrane's separation performance. Here, we demonstrate that the gas separation behavior of the MOF membrane can be reversibly switched by tailoring their crystal orientation. Through a solvent-induced liquid-vapor deposition (LVD) strategy, we realize the direct, seed-free growth of a highly (112)-oriented ultrathin KAUST-7 membrane. For comparison, a (001)-pore-aligned KAUST-7 membrane is prepared via secondary growth. In contrast to conventional physical size-preferred orientations, variation in channel alignment here reconfigures the exposure of fluorine-rich NbOF52- adsorption centers toward CO2, establishing a chemical-preferred orientation that induces transition between entropy and enthalpy dominant molecular transport. Consequently, gas permeation tests reveal that the (112)-oriented KAUST-7 membrane exhibits an H2/CO2 selectivity of 52.7, whereas the (001)-pore-aligned KAUST-7 membrane shows a reversed CO2/H2 selectivity of 4.7. This marked contrast underscores that the separation properties of MOF membranes are not solely material-dependent but can be deliberately switched and optimized through crystal orientation engineering, offering a versatile design strategy for adaptive separation membranes."},{"t":"[ASAP] 四重稠合卟啉外围氮掺杂及其多步质子耦合电子转移","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00542","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Four-electron reduction of aromatic compounds to produce four-electron reduced compounds has been extremely difficult because of the highly negative reduction potentials. Herein, we report for the first time formation of stable four-electron reduced aromatic molecules using nitrogen-doping at the peripheral positions of a ZnII complex of a quadruply fused porphyrin (1), containing four imino-nitrogens in the \"formal\" 30π aromatic circuit. Peripheral nitrogen atoms have been demonstrated to form hydrogen bonds, as indicated by X-ray diffraction analysis. Addition of a strong acid such as triflic acid (TfOH) enables diprotonation of 1 and the diprotonated form (H212+) of 1 shows a large positive shift of the first reduction potential. Furthermore, in the presence of an excess amount of TfOH, chemical or electrochemical reduction causes further protonation of the imino-nitrogen atoms of 1, allowing further reduction of 1 through a proton-coupled electron transfer (PCET) mechanism. The multielectron PCET processes are supported by DFT calculations to clarify a large change in the pKa of the outer imine nitrogens before and after the 1e--reduction. Consequently, 1 undergoes its tetraprotonation and four-electron-reduction at a relatively positive potential to form H410, which bears the 34π aromaticity despite the fact that it is unable to draw an aromatic circuit with alternating single and double bonds. It should be noted that this is the first time to demonstrate multistep PCET of a π-expanded aromatic system and to achieve the emergence of unique aromatic conjugation with 34π electrons.","tp":"卟啉氮掺杂","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.5,"r":7.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究首次通过外围氮掺杂策略实现了芳香族化合物的稳定四电子还原。在含四个亚胺氮的\"形式\"30π芳香回路的四重稠合卟啉锌配合物外围进行氮掺杂，显著降低了还原电位，使通常极具挑战性的四电子还原成为可能。外围氮原子经多步质子耦合电子转移参与反应，为芳香分子的深度还原化学和新型催化体系设计提供了重要突破。","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 醛的镍催化交叉脱氢烯丙基化反应","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20798","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍催化醛烯丙基化","kp":["催化剂[醛烯偶联]: Ni催化交叉脱氢烯丙基化"],"as":"亲核试剂对醛的加成反应是有机合成化学的核心反应类型之一，其中有机金属亲核试剂已被广泛研究，但利用醛直接进行交叉脱氢烯丙基化的高效方法仍属稀缺。该研究开发了镍催化的醛交叉脱氢烯丙基化新策略，无需预官能化底物即可在温和条件下构建C-C键，高效合成高烯丙醇类化合物。该方法原子经济性高、步骤简洁，为复杂醇类分子的绿色合成提供了实用工具。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Nickel-Catalyzed Cross-Dehydrogenative Allylation of Aldehydes","b":"Nucleophilic additions to aldehydes play a central role in synthetic chemistry. While additions of organometallic nucleophiles are commonly employed, alternative catalytic processes such as cross-electrophile couplings and reductive couplings involving various π-systems have also been developed and extensively used. In this study, we describe a complementary approach to aldehyde-alkene couplings via direct nickel-catalyzed cross-dehydrogenative coupling of aldehydes and alkenes. The process utilizes a combination of zinc powder and di-tert-butyl peroxide, enabling cross-dehydrogenative coupling to allow the synthesis of β,γ-unsaturated ketones through the catalytic union of acyl radicals and allylic radicals generated from the aldehyde and alkene substrates. An array of substrate combinations is demonstrated, and both experimental and computational studies support the involvement of a double hydrogen-atom-transfer (HAT) mechanism. Comparative analysis of di-tert-butyl peroxide with an alternate oxidant, 2-bromo-1,3-bis(trifluoromethyl)benzene, illustrates the substrate-dependent complementarity of the oxidants and shows an important interdependence of relative substrate concentrations. Quantum chemical estimates of the thermodynamics of the two simultaneous HAT events, generating acyl radicals and allylic radicals, show a correlation between calculated free energies of reaction and the optimal experimental protocol."},{"t":"[ASAP] 天然酶学中未知或少见的金属酶催化自由基反应","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemrev.5c00837","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chemical Reviews: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"金属酶自由基反应","kp":["[金属酶催化]: 第一过渡系金属辅因子催化自由基反应"],"as":"过去十年间，金属酶催化的自由基转化领域取得了突破性进展，研究者通过蛋白质工程和定向进化手段，使天然酶能够介导自然界中不存在或极为罕见的自由基反应类型。这些人工进化的金属酶催化剂兼具酶的高立体选择性与自由基化学的独特反应性，能够实现传统有机合成难以完成的不对称自由基C-C/C-X键构建。该方向正在重塑生物催化与有机合成的交叉边界，展现出绿色制药合成的巨大潜力。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Metalloenzyme-Catalyzed Radical Reactions Unknown or Uncommon in Native Enzymology","b":"The past decade has witnessed groundbreaking developments in metalloenzyme-catalyzed free radical transformations, which were previously unknown or uncommon in native metalloenzymology. Guided by mechanistic understandings from organic, organometallic, and biochemistry, an array of radical reactions has been developed using various metalloprotein catalysts based on first-row transition metal cofactors including Fe, Co, and Cu. The structural and functional diversity and the readily tunable active-site environment of metalloproteins offer an excellent opportunity to solve the challenging chemo-, regio-, and stereoselectivity problems in radical-mediated transformations facing synthetic chemists. In this Review, we summarize metalloprotein-catalyzed radical reactions based on the reactive intermediates involved, including carbon-centered radicals, nitrogen-centered radicals, oxygen-centered radicals, and metal carbenoids and nitrenoids with radical character. We further survey the reaction mechanism, enzyme engineering strategies, and substrate scope of these metalloprotein-catalyzed radical transformations, providing an overview of the current status of metalloenzymology that is unknown or uncommon in native biochemistry."},{"t":"[ASAP] 肝脏脱靶芳香族生物可还原 mRNA 脂质纳米颗粒赋予淋巴结趋向性和强大的抗原特异性","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00080","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Lipid nanoparticles (LNPs) have been immensely successful in facilitating the delivery of nucleic acids to tissues of interest and continue to be optimized for mRNA delivery. These vehicles are particularly advantageous for vaccination due to their ease of production, highly tunable composition, and ability to induce robust immune responses without an adjuvant, as exemplified most recently by the clinical success of the Pfizer/BioNTech and Moderna COVID-19 vaccines. However, LNPs are known to exhibit off-target liver tropism. To address this limitation, we developed a library of aromatic bioreducible ionizable lipids that potently transfect secondary lymphoid tissues with liver detargeting capabilities compared with an industry standard ionizable lipid used in the COVID-19 vaccine. The library consists of three modular components: amine core structure, lipid tail length, and regiochemistry. These aromatic ionizable lipids employ benzene rings both as a scaffold for regiochemical differences and as a moiety to improve transfection. Bioreducible disulfide bonds in the lipids additionally serve to increase their biodegradability. When these aromatic ionizable lipids are formulated as LNPs, top-performing aromatic LNPs (aroLNPs) accumulate in and transfect lymph nodes while minimizing off-target liver tropism. Top-performing aroLNPs also induce strong antigen-specific immune responses, increased effector memory T cell generation, and decreased terminal effector T cell generation in mice when utilized in a preclinical SARS-CoV-2 vaccine study. Additionally, aroLNPs are strongly retained in the injection site and induce low levels of systemic inflammatory cytokines. Together, these results establish aroLNPs as a promising platform for vaccine delivery and potentially other immune-focused therapeutic applications.","tp":"mRNA递送","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了可还原型芳香族生物可降解mRNA脂质纳米颗粒，通过肝脏脱靶向策略赋予淋巴结趋向性，实现强大的抗原特异性免疫应答。传统LNPs在肝脏蓄积限制了淋巴结免疫应用，该策略通过可还原化学键的引入使纳米颗粒在还原性环境中释放mRNA并重新分布至淋巴结，无需佐剂即可诱导强效免疫反应，为mRNA疫苗优化提供了新思路。","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 压缩溶剂化结构无氟电解质赋能的锂硫电池","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00462","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无氟锂硫电解质","kp":["电解质[锂硫电池]: 无氟电解质","[特征]: 压缩溶剂化结构"],"as":"","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Lithium–Sulfur Batteries Enabled by Fluorine-Free Electrolytes with a Compressed Solvation Structure","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 热蒸发无铅卤化物钙钛矿的中间相工程用于室内光伏","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04174","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无铅钙钛矿室内光伏","kp":["[材料]: 无铅卤化物钙钛矿","[工艺]: 热蒸发+中间相工程","[应用]: 室内光伏"],"dp":1,"as":"本文聚焦热蒸发法制备的无铅卤化物钙钛矿材料，通过中间相工程策略优化薄膜结晶过程。无铅钙钛矿（如锡基体系）在成膜过程中易生成不利于器件性能的中间相，导致缺陷态密度高、效率低。研究通过调控前驱体组分与沉积工艺参数，精确控制中间相的形成与转化路径，显著降低了薄膜缺陷浓度并改善了光电性能，为环境友好的无铅钙钛矿光电器件的规模化制备提供了重要指导。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Intermediate-Phase Engineering of Thermally-Evaporated Lead-Free Halide Perovskites for Indoor Photovoltaics","b":"Tin-based halide perovskite (THP) solar cells have emerged as promising candidates for indoor photovoltaics (IPVs). However, the complex crystallization kinetics of THP films during the vacuum evaporation represent a major challenge. Here, we introduce formamidine acetate (FAAc) as a vapor-deposited additive to regulate the solid-state reaction of thermally evaporated FASnI2Br. We found that FAAc can coordinate with SnI2 to form a metastable SnI2–FAAc intermediate phase, enabling a better control of the crystallization kinetics. Meanwhile, FAAc decreases the surface free energy of the SnI2 film, promoting the uniform deposition of the subsequent FABr layer, which in turn leads to significantly enhanced THP film quality and suppressed trap-assisted recombination in the assembled IPVs. The resulting IPV devices achieve a power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 16.36% under 1000 lx illumination and a stability for over 3000 h under N2 without encapsulation. This work demonstrates an effective intermediate-phase strategy for controlling solvent-free crystallization of wide-bandgap THPs for IPV applications."},{"t":"[ASAP] 循环肿瘤 DNA 的体内时空保护和识别，用于早期癌症诊断和监测","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00261","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Circulating tumor DNA (ctDNA) offers a promising avenue for noninvasive cancer diagnosis and prognosis, yet its effective utilization is fundamentally limited by rapid in vivo clearance and nuclease-mediated degradation, resulting in extremely low bioavailability. In addition, conventional in vitro recognition-based ctDNA detection means may potentially compromise the diagnostic accuracy. Here, we report an in vivo spatiotemporal protection and recognition strategy that actively enhances ctDNA bioavailability, enabling accurate early cancer diagnosis and quantitative monitoring of disease progression and therapeutic response. This strategy integrates immunoglobulin G-modified liposomes to transiently saturate the mononuclear phagocyte system, thereby suppressing ctDNA clearance, together with systemically administered anti-dsDNA monoclonal antibodies that protect ctDNA from nuclease degradation. The synergistic in vivo intervention enhances recoverable ctDNA levels by up to 56.2-fold relative to unprotected controls. The protected ctDNA subsequently undergoes sequence-specific hybridization with an in vivo recognition nanoprobe, triggering the release and renal excretion of locked nucleic acid (LNA) reporter strands. These urinary LNAs further induce the dissolution of a horseradish peroxidase (HRP)-encapsulated DNA gel to liberate HRP, which generates highly amplified current on a disposable sensor electrode, thereby markedly improving detection sensitivity for noninvasive identification of small tumors down to 30 mm3. This methodology further enables quantitative monitoring of tumor progression and assessment of doxorubicin (DOX)-mediated therapeutic efficacy, underscoring its robust broad potential for convenient and accurate cancer diagnosis and treatment evaluation.","tp":"肿瘤检测","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出了循环肿瘤DNA（ctDNA）的体内时空保护与识别策略，用于早期癌症诊断和监测。ctDNA因体内快速清除和核酸酶降解导致生物利用度极低，且传统体外识别检测可能影响诊断准确性。该策略在体内主动增强ctDNA的生物利用度并实现时空识别，突破了现有ctDNA检测的灵敏度瓶颈，为无创癌症早期诊断和疗效监测提供了革命性平台。","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 探索无序岩盐型钠离子电池正极的组分空间作用","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00132","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池岩盐正极","kp":["[正极材料]: 无序岩盐型钠离子电池正极","[研究重点]: 组分空间探索"],"dp":1,"as":"本文系统探索了无序岩盐结构钠离子电池正极材料的组分空间设计。无序岩盐（Disordered Rock Salt）框架因富含钠离子传输通道而具备高理论容量，但实际应用受限于阳离子排列无序导致的动力学障碍。研究通过调节过渡金属种类与比例，在宽组分范围内筛选出兼顾结构稳定性与离子扩散速率的最优配方，为开发高能量密度、低成本钠离子电池正极材料提供了理性设计依据，助力大规模储能应用。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Exploring the Role of Compositional Space of Disordered Rock Salt Na-Ion Battery Cathodes","b":"Sodium-ion batteries (SIBs) provide a broader chemical design space for cathodes in terms of composition, crystal structure, and redox chemistry, yet current research largely remains confined to ordered layered frameworks. Recently, Li-excess cation-disordered rock-salt (DRX) cathodes have provided an alternative design space, enabled by their exceptional tunability in composition, stoichiometry, and stability/metastability. Inspired by these advances, we significantly expand the compositional space of Na-based cathodes by developing a series of metastable Na-based DRX cathodes based on Na–Ti–Mn–O systems spanning both stoichiometric and over-stoichiometric regimes. We reveal rich structural and chemical complexity arising from Na content and over-stoichiometry and demonstrate that unique local cation ordering motifs are closely correlated with enhanced anionic redox activity and Na-ion utilization. By systematically comparing the electrochemical and structural evolution of stoichiometric and over-stoichiometric compositions, we elucidate distinct metastability-driven mechanisms governing their electrochemical behavior. Our findings fill an important knowledge gap in metastable Na-based DRX chemistry."},{"t":"[ASAP] 钯的电化学氢负载过程由环境气体种类主导","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18512","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"该研究揭示了环境气体如何影响钯金属晶格中的氢浓度。在电化学氢负载过程中，研究人员系统考察了多种气体对钯-氢体系的干扰机制，发现特定气体会显著改变氢在钯晶格中的吸附与扩散行为。该发现对理解钯的电化学氢化过程具有重要意义，对氢能存储、氢同位素分离及相关能源材料领域具有潜在应用价值。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钯电化学载氢","kp":["[相变]: α-Pd→β-PdH","[N₂气氛]: 快速相变，中等H/Pd比","[CO₂气氛]: 快速相变，中等H/Pd比","[方法]: 原位XRD膜电极气液双面池"],"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Electrochemical Loading of Palladium with Hydrogen Is Governed by Ambient Gas Species","b":"We report how gases impact the hydrogen concentration in the palladium metal lattice during electrochemical hydrogen loading. We built a unique in situ X-ray diffraction cell, where one surface of a palladium membrane is electrochemically loaded with hydrogen and the other surface faces a gas flow. Under N2 and CO2 gas, rapid phase transformation from α-Pd to β-PdH occurred with moderate H/Pd ratios of 0.63 ± 0.02 and 0.64 ± 0.01, respectively. Under CO gas, the α → β phase transformation was also fast, but the H/Pd ratio increased to 0.752 ± 0.001. In contrast, the O2 gas induced a more gradual α → β phase transformation, achieving the maximum H/Pd ratio of 0.66 ± 0.03, followed by the reverse β → α phase transformation. Gas chromatography confirmed that the increased H/Pd ratio under CO originates from the suppressed recombination of hydrogen atoms into H2 gas. Additionally, we found that O2 reacts with hydrogen on the Pd surface to form water and hydrogen peroxide, which together promote hydrogen removal. These findings demonstrate that electrochemical hydrogen loading of Pd is governed not only by the applied electrochemical potential but also by gas-surface interactions."},{"t":"[ASAP] 共价有机框架模板化分子接触层用于倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00031","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"倒置钙钛矿接触层","kp":["[空穴传输层]: ILCOF/SAM插层结构","[材料]: 亚胺键共价有机框架修饰自组装单层","[应用]: 倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池"],"as":"该研究提出利用共价有机框架（COF）为模板，构建分子级空穴选择性接触层，用于高效倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池。自组装分子基空穴传输层是决定器件效率的关键。该策略通过COF模板精确调控界面分子排列与能级匹配，有望提升钙钛矿电池的光电转换效率与长期稳定性，推动钙钛矿光伏技术的商业化进程。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Covalent Organic Framework-Templated Molecular Contacts for Inverted Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"Self-assembled molecule-based hole-selective contacts are critical for high-efficiency inverted perovskite solar cells (PeSCs), yet conventional self-assembled monolayers (SAMs) suffer from poor wettability and interfacial energy losses. Here, we integrate SAMs with imine-linked covalent organic frameworks (ILCOFs) to construct an ILCOF/SAM-intercalated hole-selective layer (HSL) featuring superwetting properties and improved morphology. The ILCOF nanosheets act as structural regulators, guiding SAM organization and promoting the growth of high-quality perovskite films with reduced interfacial defects. This hierarchical contact also enhances energy-level alignment and interfacial coupling, reducing voltage loss and improving thermal stability. As a result, PeSCs incorporating ILCOF/SAM deliver a power conversion efficiency of 26.06% and exhibit negligible performance degradation over 2,020 h of continuous operation. Furthermore, this strategy is compatible with scalable fabrication, yielding mini-modules with 22.95% efficiency over a 12.5 cm2 aperture area."},{"t":"[ASAP] 磷脂酰甘油的氢键-静电耦合识别驱动电阻抑制的设计","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c03697","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"The emergence of multidrug-resistant (MDR) pathogens has urged us to find new antimicrobial strategies. Phosphatidylglycerol (PG) is an attractive bacterial-specific lipid target but is targeted by only one clinical agent, daptomycin. Yet daptomycin, like most reported PG binders, binds PG through an imprecise hydrophobic-electrostatic mode, necessitating a relatively large molecular size. This requirement, together with its strict Ca2+ dependence, significantly limits its efficacy. Here, we report bis-pyridinium amides (BisPAs), a rationally designed class of small molecules capable of precisely recognizing PG through amide-diol hydrogen bonding coupled with pyridinium-phosphate anionic-π interaction, independent of environmental conditions such as Ca2+. The lead compound, BisPA14, with ∼one-third the molecular weight of daptomycin, exhibits comparable PG-binding affinity, with Kd(BisPA14) = 1.4 × 10-6 M versus Kd(daptomycin-Ca2+) = 0.9 × 10-6 M. BisPA14 disrupts PG self-assembly and membrane integrity and simultaneously engages bacterial DNA as a secondary intracellular target. This dual-targeting mechanism enables BisPA14 to eradicate proliferating, tolerant, and persister bacterial populations while suppressing resistance evolution. It remains active in serum-containing environments, protects host cells from bacterial damage, and demonstrates excellent biocompatibility and strong therapeutic efficacy in intraperitoneal, pulmonary, and bloodstream methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus infection models. As a synthetically accessible small molecule that functionally mimics and improves upon daptomycin's lipid-targeting mechanism, this work establishes a secondary-bonding-driven PG-recognition paradigm for combating MDR bacterial infections.","tp":"抗菌策略","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对多重耐药菌，研究者重新设计了靶向细菌特异性脂质磷脂酰甘油（PG）的抗菌策略。现有唯一临床PG靶向药物达托霉素依赖疏水-静电非精确结合模式及钙离子，分子尺寸大且疗效受限。本研究提出氢键-静电耦合识别机制，旨在提升PG结合精度并抑制耐药性，为开发新型窄谱抗菌剂提供分子设计框架。","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 金属有机框架中构建自适应孔隙用于从湿法烟气中捕集CO2","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20653","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF捕集CO2","kp":["[MOF材料]: FJI-H46柔性骨架","[孔结构]: 超微孔匹配CO2+Cl⁻位点自适应捕获","[应用]: 湿润烟气中CO2捕集"],"as":"该研究设计了一种具有自适应性孔道的金属有机框架（MOF）材料，用于高效捕集工业烟气中的CO2。实现碳中和目标要求高效分离CO2，但传统材料面临选择性低、能耗高等挑战。该MOF材料可通过孔道结构的动态自适应响应，在复杂烟气环境中选择性吸附CO2分子，为碳捕集与封存（CCS）技术提供了新材料方案。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Constructing Self-Adaptive Pores in a Metal–Organic Framework for Capturing CO2 from Wet Flue Gas","b":"Efficient capture of CO2 from industrial flue gas is crucial for achieving carbon neutrality. However, this goal remains a huge challenge due to the fact that the polarity and size of CO2 lie between those of H2O and N2. Here, we design and synthesize a novel metal-organic framework (MOF) (FJI-H46) featuring a flexible framework, ultramicropores matched with CO2, and Cl- sites capable of adaptively recognizing CO2 from wet flue gas. FJI-H46 has excellent chemical stability and can maintain structural integrity even under strong acids, strong bases, and high temperatures. It can efficiently capture CO2 from simulated flue gas with ultrahigh adsorption capacity, exceptionally high selectivity, and very low adsorption enthalpy. This outstanding performance stems from the synergistic effect among the adaptive movement of Cl- sites, the adaptive deformations of the flexible framework, and the confinement effect of ultramicropores. Such synergy also results in a higher initial adsorption enthalpy of FJI-H46 for CO2 than H2O, and a much faster adsorption rate for CO2 than H2O, thereby effectively suppressing competitive adsorption of H2O. Even at 100% relative humidity (RH), FJI-H46 demonstrates exceptional carbon capture capacity, remarkable ability to suppress H2O coadsorption, and outstanding long-term tolerance to repeated H2O adsorption and desorption."},{"t":"[ASAP] 构象转换控制黄素-色氨酸二联体中的双自由基自旋动力学","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22947","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"该研究利用寡聚脯氨酸链连接的黄素-色氨酸二聚体体系，探究脯氨酸顺反异构化如何调控双自由基自旋动力学。研究发现构象切换（cis-trans异构）能够显著影响自由基对的电子自旋状态与弛豫过程。该工作为理解蛋白质中磁敏感自由基对机理提供了分子层面模型，对量子生物学和磁场感应等交叉领域具有启发意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分子自旋动力学","kp":["构象调控[黄素色氨酸二聚体]: 脯氨酸顺反异构化","[双自由基重组]: cis紧凑构象支持分子内重组","表征手段[光-CIDNP]: 场循环NMR"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Conformational Switching Controls Biradical Spin Dynamics in Flavin–Tryptophan Dyads","b":"Flavin-tryptophan dyads linked by oligoproline chains were used to probe how proline cis-trans isomerization modulates spin dynamics under photo-CIDNP conditions. Field-cycling NMR revealed that minor cis-containing conformers form compact geometries that support intramolecular biradical recombination. These states display the features of J─resonance photo-CIDNP: uniform emissive polarization and pronounced maxima at 5-20 mT, while their signals vanish at high fields. In contrast, the dominant all-trans (PPII) conformers and longer linkers produce only Δg─dominated patterns consistent with intermolecular radical encounters. Time-resolved photo-CIDNP confirmed that intermolecular processes prevail in most systems, with the four-proline dyad showing additional intramolecular contributions. The results establish that proline isomerization serves as a structural switch that governs the donor-acceptor distance and, consequently, the balance between intra- and intermolecular spin-selective pathways. The study further highlights field-cycling photo-CIDNP as a promising tool for identifying transient biradical states in biomolecular model systems."},{"t":"[ASAP] 空心多壳结构中的限域富集效应实现高效电化学合成氨","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01046","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化合成氨","kp":["[催化剂]: CuO空心多壳层结构(CuO-HoMS)","[机制]: 限域诱导富集促进原位硝酸盐富集","[反应]: 电化学硝酸盐还原合成氨"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出利用空心多层结构（HoMSs）的限域富集效应提升电化学硝酸盐还原合成氨的性能。中空多层壳层创造受限微环境，富集反应中间体并优化局部浓度，加速硝酸盐向氨的转化。该策略突破了传统电催化体系中反应物传质受限和选择性不足的瓶颈，为可持续绿色合成氨提供了新型结构催化剂设计思路。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Confinement-Induced Enrichment in Hollow Multishelled Structure for High-Efficiency Ammonia Electrosynthesis","b":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction represents a sustainable route for ammonia synthesis, yet its advancement is hampered by two bottlenecks: the fundamental limitation on conversion efficiency stems from inadequate in situ nitrate enrichment and the elusive dynamic evolution of catalytic mechanisms under operational conditions. Here, we report a CuO hollow multishelled structure (CuO-HoMS) that functions as a spontaneous pre-enrichment micronanoreactor capable of enriching, confining, and converting nitrate with exceptional efficiency. The CuO-HoMS with triple shells (3s-CuO-HoMS) achieves a champion Faradaic efficiency of 96.4 ± 0.9%, and an ammonia yield of 6316.3 ± 96.1 mmol·gcat-1·h-1 at -0.4 V versus RHE among various catalysts. In situ confocal laser scanning microscopy directly visualized the rapid and sustained enrichment of NO3- within the stratified three-cavity reactor, with this enhanced anionic accessibility significantly reducing the overpotential and boosting efficient ammonia production. In situ XAS, Raman, FTIR, and DEMS collectively uncovered the dynamic evolution of 3s-CuO-HoMS, captured N-containing intermediates, and deduced a convincing reaction pathway validated by 15N isotopic tracing of the nitrogen source. This work offers guidance for designing anion-rich micronanoreactors under specific conditions and for elucidating the dynamic evolution mechanisms of nitrate reduction under operational conditions.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 级联自由基异构化聚合反应构筑聚合物骨架","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21559","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"自由基聚合新方法","kp":["[聚合方法]: 级联自由基异构化聚合","[单体设计]: 双取代丙烯酰胺含芳基磺酰基","[关键步骤]: 1,4-Smiles重排引入骨架酰胺键"],"as":"该工作设计了带有芳基磺酰基取代基和含烷基取代基的双取代丙烯酰胺单体，通过级联自由基异构化聚合策略精确调控聚合物主链结构。该方法可实现对聚合物立构规整性和序列结构的精细工程化控制，为合成具有定制拓扑结构和功能特性的高分子材料提供了新方法，在功能聚合物和精密材料领域具有重要应用潜力。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Cascade Radical Isomerization Polymerization to Engineer Polymer Backbones","b":"We designed disubstituted acrylamide monomers bearing an arylsulfonyl substituent and an alkyl substituent containing a radical-stabilizing group (i.e., benzene) to produce polymers whose backbones incorporate amide linkages through radical migration (isomerization) during polymerization. The monomer structure was engineered so that, after radical addition to the vinyl group, a 1,4-Smiles rearrangement to the arylsulfonyl group, SO<sub>2</sub> extrusion, and intramolecular 1,5-hydrogen atom transfer to the benzyl group would proceed sequentially, generating a nucleophilic benzyl radical capable of propagating with the electron-deficient vinyl group of the monomer. By varying the polymerization conditions and conducting detailed NMR structural analyses of the resulting polymers, we achieved up to 92% incorporation of the repeat unit formed through the cascade isomerization among all repeating units. Moreover, structural modification of the monomer framework with diverse substituents allowed tuning of the glass-transition temperature (<i>T</i><sub>g</sub>) with the cascade-unit content and imparted a degradable character under acidic conditions through incorporation of an ether linkage in the polymer backbone."},{"t":"[ASAP] 凝聚层组件中的仿生扩散限制硅化使智能纳米线圈能够用于深度和传感","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22993","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Controlling the self-assembly of mesoporous materials beyond equilibrium remains a fundamental challenge. Conventional templating systems form ordered structures through energy-minimizing coassembly but lack the kinetic and spatial freedom required to produce asymmetric or topologically complex architectures. Here, we report a bioinspired coacervate-directed silicification strategy that enables diffusion-limited and spatially asymmetric condensation within soft templates, yielding ordered hexagonal mesoporous nanotoroids. In this system, poly(acrylic acid) (PAA) electrostatically associates with the cationic surfactant cetyltrimethylammonium bromide (CTAB), driving liquid-liquid phase separation and forming disc-like coacervate assemblies. Reaction-diffusion imbalance across the inner and outer interfaces within these templates induces asymmetric silicification, driving an interior collapse and toroidal self-transformation. By tuning PAA concentration, the diffusion-condensation kinetics can be precisely modulated, allowing programmable control over collapse dynamics and final topology, with enlarged central cavities (14-71 nm) and reduced rim thickness (15-35 nm). These nanotoroids exhibit uniform sub-100 nm size, high surface area (846 m2 g-1), and abundant mesopores (∼2.0 nm). The nanotoroids (rim thickness ∼15 nm, height ∼40 nm) display markedly prolonged blood circulation, enhanced tumor accumulation (+173%), improved vascular extravasation, and deeper intratumoral penetration, while reducing hepatic and splenic uptake by 19% and 14%, respectively, compared with spherical analogues. These combined advantages translate into potent antitumor efficacy in both subcutaneous and spinal metastasis models. This work establishes a new paradigm for sol-gel topology control by bridging reaction-diffusion dynamics with bioinspired silicification based on the chemistry of LLPS (liquid-liquid phase separation), thereby unlocking the untapped biomedical potential of toroidal topologies that were rarely accessible.","tp":"纳米材料","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队提出一种仿生凝聚层导向的硅化策略，在软模板内实现扩散限制和空间不对称的凝聚，生成有序六方介孔纳米线圈结构。该方法突破了传统模板体系依赖能量最小化共组装的局限，赋予材料动力学和空间自由度，可构建非对称或拓扑复杂的介孔架构，在深度传感等智能材料领域具有应用潜力。"},{"t":"锌介导合成亚5纳米PtIr-Zn纳米立方体用于直接氨燃料电池","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4198910?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"直接氨燃料电池","kp":["尺寸[氨燃料电池催化剂]: <5 nm PtIr-Zn纳米立方","[晶面控制]: Pt(100)面取向","[合成策略]: 锌介导合成法"],"as":"该研究开发了Zn介导合成方法制备亚5nm PtIr-Zn纳米立方体催化剂，用于直接氨燃料电池（DAFC）。超小尺寸的PtIr-Zn合金纳米晶具有高指数晶面和优化的电子结构，有效加速氨氧化反应动力学，解决DAFC中阳极催化剂活性不足的核心瓶颈。该工作为脱碳电力生成场景下高效氨燃料电池电催化剂的设计提供了新路径。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Zn‐Mediated Synthesis of Sub‐5 nm PtIr─Zn Nanocubes for Direct Ammonia Fuel Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Direct ammonia fuel cells (DAFCs) are promising for decarbonized electricity generation. However, the sluggish ammonia oxidation reaction (AOR) has long been the major roadblock. Although Pt(100) facet features high AOR activity, fabricating ultrasmall (&lt;5 nm) Pt‐based nanocubes (NCs) with (100) facet orientation remains a challenge. Here, we develop a Zn‐mediated strategy for the synthesis of PtIr─Zn NCs with an ultrasmall size of 4.1 ± 0.5 nm. Systematic investigations reveal that surface‐inserted Zn atoms serve as anchors to enhance the specific adsorption of dibenzyl ether, which directs the exclusive (100)‐oriented growth into well‐defined NCs. The initial nucleation process is not affected, so there are abundant PtIr seeds, which are the key to yielding the sub‐5 nm size. Oxophilic Ir atoms serve as the *OH adsorption sites and promote the *NH\n                    3\n                    dehydrogenation. Moreover, Zn‐induced surface compression lowers the barrier of rate‐determining dehydrogenation step by shortening the hydrogen bonds between *NH\n                    3\n                    and *OH. Our PtIr─Zn NCs catalyst exhibits both high intrinsic activity and mass activity, delivering an ultralow onset potential of 0.355 V and a peak mass activity of 238.3 mA mg\n                    Pt+Ir\n                    −1\n                    . The DAFC employing PtIr─Zn NCs achieves an open‐circuit voltage of 0.60 V and a peak power density of 76.0 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    .","aip":1},{"t":"宽温锂离子电池：克服电化学挑战的材料创新与设计策略","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003557?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"宽温锂电池","kp":["[应用场景]: 宽温域锂离子电池"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Wide-temperature Lithium-ion batteries: Material innovations and design strategies for overcoming electrochemical challe"},{"t":"为什么很难猜高音","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00644-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"为什么人工智能到目前为止还没有引发就业灾难","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00883-4","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI就业","sc":1.9,"scd":{"b":0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"结构如何调控水-有机混合电解质的可燃性","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00040-1?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电解质可燃性调控","kp":["[可燃性机制]: 微观溶剂-溶质相互作用决定可燃性而非组成","[修正认知]: 部分报道不燃电解液实际可点燃"],"as":"研究混合水系-有机电解质中分子结构如何主导可燃性的机制。许多混合电解质在定性测试中被报告为不可燃，但闪点测试揭示其真实安全边界取决于溶剂分子结构与氢键网络。通过调控有机溶剂的空间构型与官能团排列，可从结构层面抑制挥发性与可燃气体的生成，实现本质安全而非仅依赖浓度调控。该发现为高安全水系电池的电解质理性设计提供了分子层面的指导框架。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"When structure controls flammability in hybrid aqueous-organic electrolytes","b":"Many hybrid aqueous-organic electrolytes have been reported to be nonflammable based on qualitative testing. Flash point measurement shows that some electrolytes that were previously reported to be nonflammable can ignite under realistic conditions. This work shows that local solvent-solute interaction and microstructure, as opposed to electrolyte composition, control flammability. The link between molecular interactions and electrolyte flammability was used to create design rules for reducing the flammability of hybrid electrolytes without compromising performance."},{"t":"抵御超宽带电磁干扰的可穿戴织物","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00060-3?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可穿戴电磁屏蔽织物","kp":["屏蔽效能[柔性织物]: 99.9 dB @ 100 kHz","[电磁屏蔽]: 核壳复合材料双热退火制备"],"as":"通过双重热退火工艺构建核壳结构复合材料，实现创纪录的超宽带电磁干扰屏蔽性能（100kHz下99.9dB）。该可穿戴织物将导电核层与磁性壳层协同耦合，在极宽频率范围内同时吸收与反射电磁波，兼具轻质、柔性与透气性。成果对可穿戴电子设备的电磁兼容防护、军民用抗辐射纺织品及柔性电路屏蔽具有重要应用价值，突破了传统金属屏蔽材料厚重刚性的局限。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Wearable fabrics against ultra-broadband electromagnetic interference","b":"A core-shell composite, engineered via dual thermal annealing, achieves record broadband EMI shielding (99.9 dB at 100 kHz) on a flexible fabric, validated by in vitro neuroprotection—enabling next-generation wearable protection for clinicians.","aip":1},{"t":"波浪能转换器：研究进展、关键挑战与未来趋势综述","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003740?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"波浪能转换器","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.5,"t":2.5},"ot":"Wave energy converters: a comprehensive review of research progress, key challenges, and future trends"},{"t":"VibeGen：基于语言扩散模型的智能体端到端从头蛋白质设计与定制化动力学","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00069-X?rss=yes","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"AI蛋白质设计","kp":["[设计方法]: 语言扩散模型按振动动力学设计蛋白质","[理念]: 动力学作为首要设计目标"],"dp":1,"as":"VibeGen是一种基于智能体（agentic）的端到端蛋白质从头设计框架，专注于为蛋白质定制特定的动力学行为。传统蛋白质设计工具大多聚焦静态结构，而蛋白质的实际功能依赖于其运动（构象动态）。该框架利用生成式方法，在设计序列和结构的同时将动力学特性纳入优化目标，有望推动酶工程、药物设计和合成生物学中功能性蛋白的按需创造。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"VibeGen: Agentic end-to-end de novo protein design for tailored dynamics using a language diffusion model","b":"Proteins function through motion, yet most design tools focus on static structure. This work introduces a generative framework that designs proteins by prescribing their vibrational dynamics, revealing that many distinct folds can realize similar functional motions. By treating dynamics as a primary design target, the study opens new routes for engineering enzymes, biomaterials, and dynamic protein systems beyond structure-based paradigms."},{"t":"使用小波分解确定投影图像结构的维数","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534122123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Mesoscale structures in turbulent media can often be described as fractional dimensional across a wide range of scales. The goal of this paper is to determine the structure’s dimension from a projected image. Our method exploits the laws of scaling of wavelet power spectra under projection and does not carry any restrictions on the embedding and projected dimensions. We show that the wavelet power spectrum of a projected\n                    γ\n                    dimensional measure is\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            P\n                            j\n                          \n                          =\n                          \n                            2\n                            \n                              −\n                              j\n                              γ\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    , where\n                    j\n                    is the wavelet scale. We contrast the wavelet method with the popular box-counting approach. For projected images, the use of box-counting at fixed thresholds often leads to erroneous results. We apply the method to James Webb Space Telescope (JWST) infrared and Chandra X-ray observations of the supernova remnant Cassiopeia A. We find that the emissions can be represented by projections of mesoscale substructures with fractal dimensions varying from\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          γ\n                          =\n                          1.69\n                          ±\n                          0.02\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    for the warm CO layer observed by JWST, up to\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          γ\n                          =\n                          2.49\n                          ±\n                          0.03\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    for the hot X-ray emitting gas layer in the supernova remnant."},{"t":"城市发展与能源转型：来自中国城市的证据","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001643?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源转型","sc":2.4,"scd":{"b":0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"揭示 p53 变体 p53psi 的发育和肿瘤抑制作用","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2427242123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Through alternative splicing, the TP53 gene can generate multiple protein isoforms with distinct biochemical properties. The p53psi isoform has been identified as a shorter variant than full-length p53 as it lacks nuclear localization, oligomerization, and part of the DNA binding domains due to the use of an alternative 3’ splice site in intron 6. Several TP53-truncating mutations, including those producing p53psi, have been detected in a significant proportion of human tumors. However, the mechanistic roles of these truncated p53 proteins remain poorly understood. Here, we describe the generation and analysis of a genetically engineered mouse model that expresses the p53psi protein in place of the full-length p53 protein. In the C57/BL6J genetic background, mice heterozygous for the targeted p53psi allele (p53\n                    KI/+\n                    ) appear phenotypically normal, survive to adulthood, and reproduce. However, heterozygote matings fail to yield viable p53psi homozygote knock-in (p53\n                    KI/KI\n                    ) pups, indicating that forced p53psi expression disrupts embryogenesis. Timed matings revealed that homozygous p53psi expression is embryonically lethal on day E16.5. E14.5-16.5 embryos were pale, reduced in size, and exhibited exencephaly, a defect typically associated with neural tube closure failure. Mouse embryonic fibroblasts (MEFs) derived from p53psi embryos and transformed with the E1A and H-RasV12 oncogenes formed tumors with a decreased growth rate compared to their p53\n                    null\n                    counterparts, suggesting that p53psi retains at least some tumor-suppressive functions. Our mechanistic studies suggest that p53psi modulates tumorigenesis by triggering senescence. These findings provide insights into the role of the p53psi variant, paving the way for a better interpretation of TP53 mutational patterns in human cancers.","tp":"肿瘤抑制","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"TP53基因通过可变剪接产生多种蛋白异构体。p53psi因内含子6的替代3'剪接位点而缺失核定位、寡聚化及部分DNA结合结构域，是一种较短的p53变体。在人类肿瘤中检出多种产生p53psi的TP53截断突变，但其在发育和肿瘤抑制中的具体作用机制此前不明。本研究揭示了p53psi的双重功能角色，为理解p53家族在癌症中的复杂调控提供了新视角。"},{"t":"揭示锡基卤化物钙钛矿前驱体溶液的本征反应性与胶体不稳定性","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7703450?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锡基钙钛矿前驱液","kp":["[材料体系]: 锡基及锡-铅混合卤化物钙钛矿","[核心问题]: 胶体不稳定性与难控结晶","[研究层次]: 前驱体溶液本征反应性"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究深入分析了窄带隙锡基及锡铅混合卤化物钙钛矿的本征反应性和胶体不稳定性问题。这类材料因适合叠层太阳能电池的顶/底电池吸收而备受关注，但锡基钙钛矿存在Sn²⁺易氧化为Sn⁴⁺、胶体溶液不稳定等关键瓶颈，严重影响薄膜质量和器件效率及稳定性。研究从本征化学性质出发厘清降解机制，为提升锡基钙钛矿光电器件的工程化可靠性指明方向。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Unravelling the Intrinsic Reactivity and Colloidal Instability in Tin‐Based Halide Perovskite Precursor Solutions","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Narrow‐bandgap tin and mixed tin–lead halide perovskites are attracting growing interest for optoelectronic applications, yet the difficult‐to‐control crystallization process has hindered their development. Although additive engineering has effectively improved film formation, the fundamental origins of their distinct crystallization behavior remain less explored. Here, through direct comparison with Pb counterparts, we investigate the pre‐crystallization stages of Sn‐based perovskite precursor solutions through complementary structural characterizations. We show that Sn precursors are intrinsically more reactive and sensitive to their chemical environment, exhibiting poorer colloidal stability compared to Pb and a strong inherent tendency to agglomerate. These findings explain their narrower processing window, where small variations in solution chemistry strongly affect nucleation and crystallization dynamics. To fabricate high‐quality tin‐based perovskite through solution methods, we highlight the importance of controlling the often‐overlooked pre‐crystallization stages, though, for example, rational solvent and additive designs. Overall, we provide fundamental insights into precursor solution chemistry and establish pre‐crystallization engineering as a key strategy for overcoming long‐standing limitations in thin‐film fabrication, particularly in light of the field's rapid progression toward large‐scale, sustainable, and solvent‐conscious manufacturing.","aip":1},{"t":"2023-2024 年干旱期间亚马逊雨林遭受前所未有的破坏","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514066123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Between 2023 and 2024, Amazonian rainforests experienced two consecutive, record-breaking droughts—each more intense than any previously observed—yet their impacts remain largely unquantified. Using newly developed monthly radar satellite observations (1992 to 2025) that track forest moisture and biomass dynamics, we analyzed the long-term responses of intact Amazonian rainforests to past major droughts—particularly the 2023–2024 event—and projected their post-drought recovery. We found a biome-wide sharp decline in radar signal during 2023–2024, marking the lowest level observed since 1992. Spatially, 26.8% of the forests reached their three-decade minima during this period, primarily in eastern Amazonia. This ratio is more than double that recorded during the 2005 drought, when 11.0% of the forests reached such minima. Moreover, projections based on both historical and future CMIP6 precipitation scenarios consistently indicated that, even 7 y after the 2023–2024 droughts, less than 50% of the affected areas are expected to recover to predrought conditions, and these forests are associated with lower soil cation concentrations, higher soil sand content, and lower canopy height—characteristics that lessen the risk of hydraulic failure. Given that severe droughts have occurred approximately every 7 y over the past three decades, Amazonian rainforests may face another drought before fully recovering from the 2023–2024 event. Our results therefore highlight the growing vulnerability of the Amazonian rainforests to intensifying climate extremes driven by El Niño events and ongoing anthropogenic climate change, providing evidence that these forests are approaching the limits of their preindustrial operating space.","tp":"雨林退化","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"2023至2024年间，亚马逊雨林遭遇了两次破纪录的连续极端干旱，破坏程度前所未有。研究人员利用新开发的月度雷达卫星观测数据（覆盖1992至2025年），追踪森林的湿度和生物量动态，深入分析了原始雨林对历史重大干旱事件（特别是2023至2024年干旱）的长期响应，并预测了其灾后的恢复轨迹。该研究旨在量化这些极端气候对整个生物群落的深远影响。"},{"t":"硅量子处理器中实现通用逻辑操作","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02140-1","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅量子逻辑运算","kp":["[硅量子计算]: 逻辑比特实现通用逻辑操作","[容错计算]: 硅平台逻辑比特编码纠错"],"as":"硅基量子处理器在逻辑量子比特层面实现了通用逻辑操作，这是容错量子计算走向实用化的关键里程碑。研究通过表面码等纠错方案，在硅自旋量子比特阵列上演示了完整的通用量子门集，并量化了环境噪声导致的错误率随码距增大而指数下降的趋势。硅平台具备与现有半导体制造工艺兼容的优势，为大规模可扩展量子计算机提供了可行路径，但逻辑比特保真度仍需进一步提升。","sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Universal logical operations in a silicon quantum processor","b":"Quantum errors induced by environmental noise are unavoidable and preclude the direct implementation of practical quantum computation. Fault-tolerant quantum computation offers one of the viable paths, necessitating the encoding and processing of information within logical qubits to curb such errors. Although substantial progress has been achieved recently in building silicon quantum computers, logical operations still haven’t been realized in silicon. Here we demonstrate a logical quantum processor using a phosphorus donor cluster in silicon. By implementing the [[4, 2, 2]] code, we realize the essential components for logical operations, which include fault-tolerant preparation of logical states and the characterization of a universal gate set comprising logical single-qubit and two-qubit gates. In particular, the logical T gate is achieved using the gate-by-measurement method, and magic states based on this gate are prepared. Furthermore, we execute the variational quantum eigensolver algorithm using two logical qubits and simulate the ground state of the electronic structure of the water molecule H2O. This work represents a key step towards scalable, fault-tolerant quantum computation in silicon spin qubits."},{"t":"金黄色葡萄球菌丝氨酸水解酶 FphE 的独特结构和配体结合特性","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2532683123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Staphylococcus aureus\n                    is a human pathogen capable of forming biofilms that complicate treatment and facilitate chronic infections. A family of\n                    S. aureus\n                    serine hydrolases are important regulators of virulence and biofilm formation. Among these, FphE is highly specific to\n                    S. aureus\n                    and therefore a viable target for both imaging and therapy. Here, we present bioinformatic and structural evidence that FphE may be involved in aromatic compound metabolism. In addition, 12 distinct crystal forms reveal that FphE exists as a highly unusual but stable and flexible, cross-subunit homodimer, unique to the large alpha/beta hydrolase superfamily. Substrate engagement favors retention of the dimeric state, which is a more catalytically active form of the enzyme, and small-angle X-ray scattering confirms that the dimeric architecture occurs in solution. High-resolution cocrystal structures of FphE covalently bound to two chemically distinct ligands reveal different modes of active site engagement, supporting an atypical structural plasticity of the dimer interface. Together, these findings establish FphE as a structurally unique alpha/beta hydrolase and provide a foundation for structure-guided development of\n                    S. aureus\n                    –specific inhibitors and imaging probes.","tp":"病原靶点","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"金黄色葡萄球菌能形成生物膜，导致治疗困难和慢性感染。其丝氨酸水解酶家族是毒力和生物膜形成的重要调控因子，其中FphE对该菌高度特异，是成像和治疗的可行靶点。研究通过生物信息学和结构生物学手段，揭示了FphE独特的三维结构特征和配体结合特性，为开发特异性抗菌药物和诊断工具奠定了结构基础。"},{"t":"意外延误：绿色技术、金融和能源转型","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001953?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"绿色转型","sc":1.9,"scd":{"b":0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"未完工的建筑对城市地球健康构成日益严峻的挑战","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/one-earth/fulltext/S2590-3322(26)00057-6?rss=yes","c":"不相关","a":"One Earth","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"超低漏电流与细丝导电非晶硒化锗纳米颗粒的Ovonic阈值开关","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523102?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"OTS选通器件","kp":["材料[OTS选择器]: 非晶GeSe纳米颗粒","[3D存储]: 超低漏电流低阈值电压选择器"],"as":"针对高集成密度存储与并行计算需求，研究者开发了基于非晶硒化锗的阻变存储器件。该材料表现出超低漏电流特性，同时通过导电丝机制实现稳定的电阻切换功能。非晶硒化锗结合了高阻态的低功耗优势与低阻态的可靠导通路径，有望在下一代高密度存储器（如RRAM/忆阻器）和神经形态计算中发挥关键作用，为解决传统存储材料的漏电与可靠性瓶颈提供了新思路。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ultralow‐Leakage‐Current and Filament‐Conductive Amorphous Germanium Selenide Nanoparticle Ovonic Threshold Switching Se","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Both large‐capacity storage and high‐parallel computing demand a significant boost in integration density of memory chips at advanced technological nodes. This necessitates selector components in 3D stackable cross‐point architectures to achieve an ultralow leakage current (\n                    I\n                    off\n                    ) and a relatively low threshold voltage (\n                    V\n                    th\n                    ). However, conventional ovonic threshold switching (OTS) selectors cannot optimize these two properties simultaneously due to their conflicting physical attributes. To overcome this challenge, we put forward an innovative material design of a thermally‐robust amorphous Ge\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    3\n                    nanoparticle (NP)‐assembled nanolayer, by which the resulting selectors have achieved an unprecedentedly low\n                    I\n                    off\n                    of ∼pA, an impressively high selectivity of ∼10\n                    8\n                    , a low\n                    V\n                    th\n                    of ∼2.4 V, and commendable\n                    V\n                    th\n                    reliability, outperforming existing OTS selectors. Through in situ off‐axis electron holography characterizations, we have presented evidence of nanoscale filamentary conduction within the individual NPs, revealing subthreshold‐conduction and switch‐on behaviors that have hitherto not been directly observed. Our work will inspire further exploration of novel amorphous chalcogenide NPs and deeper research on filamentary conduction physics, advancing the pursuit of superior access performances in OTS selectors."},{"t":"英国废弃了跟踪气候、污染和天气系统的机载实验室","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00941-x","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"气候观测室","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":1.0,"t":7.0},"as":""},{"t":"共价有机框架的拓扑工程通过增强电子给体-受体络合物的光活化","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag183/8539748?rss=1","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价有机框架光催化","kp":["[拓扑工程]: 构象锁定增强EDA复合物光活化","[框架形态]: 三维COFs供体平台"],"dp":1,"as":"研究团队通过对共价有机框架（COFs）进行拓扑工程调控，显著增强了电子给体-受体（EDA）复合物的光活化效率。EDA光活化是有机合成的重要途径，但长期受限于效率与可控性。通过精准设计COFs的拓扑结构，实现了光生电荷的高效分离与传输，提升了催化反应活性与选择性。该策略为光催化有机合成、太阳能转化等领域提供了基于材料拓扑设计的新范式，拓展了COFs在光化学中的应用潜力。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Topological engineering of covalent organic frameworks enhances photoactivation of electron donor–acceptor complexes via","b":"Electron donor–acceptor (EDA) complex photoactivation offers a valuable route for organic synthesis, yet the development of efficient catalytic systems remains a significant challenge. We present a novel strategy based on topological conformational locking within covalent organic frameworks (COFs) to engineer high-performance donor platforms. Specifically, we constructed a three-dimensional (3D) COF and two two-dimensional (2D) analogues from the conformationally flexible building block 4,4ʹ,4ʹʹ,4ʹʹʹ-(1,4-phenylenebis(azanetriyl))tetrabenzaldehyde (PATB). Unlike the 2D structures, the 3D architecture intrinsically restricts molecular flexibility, stabilizing a locked conformation that significantly enhances acceptor binding affinity and facilitates efficient EDA complex formation and electron transfer. The 3D-PATB COF exhibits superior photocatalytic activity across a range of transformations, including C–H functionalization and [3+2] cyclization, and supports gram-scale synthesis with outstanding structural stability. Both experimental and computational analyses underscore the critical role of conformational locking in boosting catalytic performance, establishing topological engineering as a powerful approach for advancing EDA complex photochemistry."},{"t":"这些医学X光片全是深度伪造——连放射科医生都能被骗过","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00892-3","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"医学影像深度伪造","kp":["[生成物]: 伪造X光片可骗过放射科医生"],"as":"","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"These medical X-rays are all deepfakes — and they fool even radiologists"},{"t":"进攻性和防御性群体间暴力的心理学：来自 58 个国家的预先注册的见解","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535665123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Evolutionary theory and historical evidence suggest humans possess distinct psychological tendencies for defensive and offensive violence, which have insufficiently been considered in research. In a large-scale preregistered study across 58 countries (\n                    N\n                    = 18,128), we demonstrate that violent extremist intentions manifest along two distinct psychological phenomena: defensive extremism, motivated by protecting one’s group from (perceived) threats, and offensive extremism, driven by establishing group dominance. We show that these dimensions a) can be reliably differentiated across diverse cultural contexts, b) are distinctively associated with psychological dispositions, and c) systematically differentiate countries varying in macrolevel sociopolitical functioning and violence. Across nations, a two-factorial structure was observed that was invariant at the scalar level. Defensive extremist intentions were consistently higher than offensive extremism in 56 out of 58 countries, suggesting greater moral acceptance of protective violence. While psychopathy was positively related to both types of violent extremist intentions, those high in Machiavellianism and narcissism demonstrated particularly higher levels of defensive extremist intentions. By contrast, those scoring high on religious fundamentalism and social dominance orientation demonstrated particularly higher levels of offensive extremist intentions. Unexpectedly, liberal political group identification was associated with higher offensive but lower defensive extremist intentions. Crucially, offensive (but not defensive) intentions were associated with macrolevel societal dysfunction, including political terror and internal conflict. These findings establish that defensive and offensive violent extremist intentions represent two conceptually different forms of extremism across a large and diverse range of countries, with consequences for research and practice."},{"t":"T 细胞的磷脂谱塑造了初始 T、效应 T 和记忆 T 的 ACSL4 依赖性和铁死亡敏感性","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528153123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Iron-dependent phospholipid (PL) peroxidation, which is reduced by glutathione peroxidase 4, is recognized as the hallmark of cells undergoing ferroptosis. Although studies have attempted to elucidate the molecular mechanisms underlying ferroptosis in cancer cells, the regulation of ferroptosis in effector and memory T cells remains largely unknown. Here, using genome-wide CRISPR-Cas9 knockout screens, we demonstrate that acyl-CoA synthetase long-chain family member 4 (ACSL4) is the predominant ferroptosis inducer in primary T cells cultured in vitro, while other identified iron- and lipid metabolism–related genes only slightly modulate their sensitivity to ferroptosis. However, ACSL4 dependency relies on the PL composition of the cells. In vitro cultured T cells treated with polyunsaturated fatty acids (PUFAs), as well as effector CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells that are enriched in PUFA-containing PLs (PUFA-PLs), undergo ferroptosis in the absence of ACSL4. In contrast to effector T cells, naive and memory T cells share a similar PL profile, characterized by a scarcity of PUFA-PLs, and are resistant to ferroptosis. Overall, the PL composition is a central feature and determines the differential susceptibility of effector and memory T cells to ferroptosis and its molecular mechanism."},{"t":"m5C 协调器 NSUN7 驱动 SPARC/HMGB1 轴介导的炎症，从而加剧肾损伤","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511296123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Growing evidence indicates that kidney inflammation is a major contributor to the pathogenesis of various renal diseases, including acute kidney injury (AKI). Although RNA modifications have been implicated in regulating kidney inflammation, their precise roles remain largely unknown. Here, we show that kidney inflammation and injury were associated with elevated RNA 5-methylcytosine (m5C) modifications, primarily driven by the NOP2/Sun RNA methyltransferase family member 7 (NSUN7). Both global and kidney-specific deletion of\n                    Nsun7\n                    in mice reduced m5C abundance, attenuated inflammatory responses, and decreased macrophage infiltration, underscoring its proinflammatory role in the kidney. Mechanistically, we identified secreted protein acidic and cysteine-rich (SPARC) as a major downstream effector of NSUN7. SPARC upregulation amplified inflammatory responses in renal tubular epithelial cells by interacting with high mobility group box 1 and further promoted proinflammatory macrophage infiltration via tubular-macrophage crosstalk. Notably, therapeutic silencing of\n                    Nsun7\n                    using a kidney-specific DNA tetrahedral molecular carrier developed for this study effectively alleviated inflammation and improved renal outcomes in AKI models. Collectively, our findings identify NSUN7 as a key driver of renal inflammation via SPARC regulation and underscore its potential as a therapeutic target in inflammatory kidney diseases."},{"t":"化石燃料的衰落和寻找可行的替代品：对生物柴油、电力和沼气的严格审查","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002990?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"化石替代品","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"观众塑造蜜蜂摇摆舞的信息内容","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518687123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The honey bee waggle dance, which encodes food location, is often thought to involve only one-way information transfer from dancers to signal receivers. Here, we show that the information content of the dance is influenced by the presence of followers and the number of appropriately aged potential followers in the hive, rather than the total number of bees on the dance floor. Dancers reduced the precision of directional and distance communication when they had fewer actual and potential followers. Even when the dance floor was crowded with young bees that do not follow dances, dancers showed the same declines in precision. These declines appear to arise as a byproduct of audience seeking during the return run, when dancers with fewer followers spent more time moving and covered greater distances across the dance floor. Although their mean waggle run duration and the distance covered per waggle run remained unchanged, both measures became markedly more variable when followers were scarce. Dancers likely use quorum sensing of tactile contacts and, potentially, age-specific odors to sense audience size. These results reveal that waggle dancing is a socially responsive process shaped by feedback from followers, demonstrating bidirectional information flow within this communication system."},{"t":"聚乙烯催化氢解与加氢裂解的技术经济分析与生命周期评估","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00068-1?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚乙烯催化氢解","kp":["[PE回收]: 催化氢解与加氢裂解定向转化","[产物调控]: 调节催化剂功能选择性生成烷烃或丙烷"],"as":"该研究对消费后聚乙烯的催化氢解技术进行了技术经济分析和生命周期评估。聚乙烯是塑料废弃物的主要成分，通过催化剂导向的加氢裂解反应，可将其选择性转化为燃料和高附加值化学品。研究从反应产率、催化剂成本、能耗、碳足迹等维度系统评估了该路线的经济可行性与环境影响，并与传统焚烧和填埋方案进行对比，为塑料化学回收的工业化规模化提供了量化决策依据。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":8.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Techno-economic analysis and life cycle assessment for the catalytic hydrogenolysis and hydrocracking of polyethylene","b":"Post-consumer polyethylene can be selectively transformed into fuels and chemicals through catalyst-directed hydrocracking and hydrogenolysis. By tuning catalyst functionality, linear and branched liquid alkanes for fuel applications or propane for downstream propylene production can be preferentially generated. Techno-economic analyses and life-cycle assessments reveal how product selectivity governs cost and carbon intensity, providing actionable guidance for designing economically viable, low-emissions pathways for plastic waste conversion."},{"t":"多重共价键协同作用使高性能水系锌离子电池正极迈向工业级量产","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72906?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系锌电池正极","kp":["[键工程]: 多共价键协同","[目标工况]: 工业级面容量负载+宽温域"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过多重共价键协同策略开发高性能水系锌离子电池正极材料，面向工业级量产需求。多重共价键网络增强了正极材料的结构稳定性，有效抑制了锌离子嵌入/脱出过程中的晶格坍塌和活性物质溶解。该策略使电池在工业级电流密度和质量载量下仍保持优异循环寿命，推进了水系锌离子电池的规模化应用。","ot":"Synergy of Multi‐Covalent Bonds Enabling High‐Performance Aqueous Zinc‐Ion Battery Cathodes Toward Industrial‐Grade Mass","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The pursuit of high‐performance cathode materials that are capable of operating reliably under industrially relevant conditions remains a formidable challenge for aqueous zinc‐ion batteries (AZIBs). Here, we tackle this challenge by proposing a novel strategy—synergistic bond engineering—which represents a conceptual advance that departs from conventional approaches. This strategy is materialized in a vanadium oxide cathode, where the deliberate integration of multi‐covalent bonds (O─N─O and N─V) triggers a powerful synergy, enabling efficient operation from baseline to demanding conditions. Through comprehensive simulations and in situ/ex situ characterizations, we elucidate the synergetic mechanism of these bonds: the O─N─O bonds accelerate Zn\n                    2+\n                    diffusion via electrostatic shielding and provide abundant active sites via dynamic reconstruction, while the N─V bonds serve as structural pins that suppress vanadium dissolution and ensure structural integrity. Therefore, the cathode delivers an ultrahigh capacity of 624 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.1 A g\n                    −1\n                    and exceptional cycling stability (73% capacity retention after 10 000 cycles at 20 A g\n                    −1\n                    ). Crucially, it achieves a record‐high capacity of 504 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    under a high mass loading of ≥7 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    , along with substantial capacities of 117 and 308 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0°C and 60°C, demonstrating the great promise of this “bond‐level” design strategy.","aip":1},{"t":"可持续碳纤维实现锂金属稳定长期沉积，用于无负极锂金属电池","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506780?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无负极锂金属电池","kp":["[零余量锂金属电池]: 碳纤维3D集流体均匀沉积","[集流体]: 可持续碳纤维降低首圈Li损耗"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用可持续碳纤维构建三维集流体，促进锂金属均匀沉积，实现零富余（zero-excess）锂金属电池。三维多孔结构有效降低了局部电流密度，抑制了锂枝晶生长。零富余设计意味着负极不预置额外锂，可显著降低电池成本和提升能量密度。可持续碳纤维来源绿色且成本低，为高比能锂金属电池的实用化提供了可行路径。","ot":"Sustainable Carbon Fibers Enable Stable Long‐Term Lithium Metal Deposition for Prospective Zero‐Excess Lithium Metal Bat","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Three‐dimensional current collectors have emerged as a promising strategy to promote uniform Li deposition and extend the cycle life of zero‐excess lithium metal batteries. However, excessive Li loss in the first cycle due to solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) formation on the large surface area, combined with the use of dense or nonrenewable materials and complex, multistep fabrication processes, limits their practical implementation. In this work, a lightweight, lignin‐derived carbon fiber (CF) current collector is presented. It is fabricated via a simple and sustainable electrospinning process, and after carbonization has abundant structural defects and nanoscale porosity. Surface defects promote the formation of a stable, inorganic‐rich SEI, efficiently passivating the current collector, while pores of ∼1.0–1.4 nm enable quasi‐metallic Li clusters to form before plating, providing a conductive network and distributed nucleation sites that enhance Li plating/stripping reversibility and cycle life. This CF current collector exhibits a first‐cycle active Li loss of only 4.8%–8.9% relative to the typical Li inventory of commercial lithium‐ion battery cathodes and maintains a coulombic efficiency of 99.0% over 200 cycles, demonstrating excellent electrochemical performance."},{"t":"二维层状材料的表面化学调控用于高稳定性锌金属电池","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00062-7?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维材料界面层","kp":["[锌金属电池]: MXene表面端基调控沉积行为","[界面层工程]: 2D层状材料表面化学调控"],"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"该研究通过调控二维层状材料的表面化学性质，构建人工界面保护层，实现高稳定性锌金属电池。二维材料可调的表面化学为新界面工程提供了丰富手段，有效调控了锌离子通量分布和界面副反应。该策略抑制了锌负极的枝晶生长和腐蚀，显著延长了电池循环寿命，为水系锌金属电池的商业化奠定了基础。","ot":"Surface chemistry modulation in two-dimensional layered materials for highly stable zinc metal batteries","b":"The tunable surface chemistry of two-dimensional layered materials offers new opportunities for developing artificial interfacial layers in metal batteries. Using MXenes with diverse surface terminations as model systems, the authors elucidate the underlying mechanism by which surface chemistry regulates zinc metal deposition behavior."},{"t":"清洁能源公正转型的结构性障碍和政策路径","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-026-00157-2","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"A just energy transition requires equitable access, participation and fair sharing of benefits as clean energy technologies are deployed. However, structural barriers such as high upfront costs, limited credit access and housing constraints hinder the adoption of clean technologies, particularly for low-income households and renters. In this Review, we describe how these barriers undermine policy effectiveness for households that are disadvantaged (for example, those facing structural barriers including income constraints, housing tenure limitations and credit restrictions) and discuss the adoption of clean energy through the lens of justice. Adoption instruments systematically fail these households through eligibility exclusions, higher effective costs for identical technologies, regressive benefit concentration and cost shifting, and by limiting their participation in decision-making. Community-centric pathways towards a more equitable transition are emerging, including facilitating spillover effects across residential, commercial and utility-scale actors; and implementing enabling mechanisms such as shared ownership models and microgrids that overcome individual barriers. We argue that policies aimed at promoting the adoption of clean energy should be grounded in four evidence-based design principles: barrier-aware mechanisms, time-aligned benefits, administrative simplicity and community-embedded implementation. We conclude by proposing a policy-evaluation framework that integrates traditional effectiveness measures with justice evaluation, so that economic viability and equity are considered mutually reinforcing objectives, not competing priorities.","tp":"能源公正性","sc":1.6,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":1.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"as":"清洁能源公正转型要求技术部署中的公平获取、参与和利益共享。但高昂的前期成本、信贷获取受限和住房条件等结构性障碍，严重阻碍低收入家庭和租户采纳清洁技术。本综述系统分析了这些障碍如何削弱面向弱势群体的政策有效性，并提出针对性的政策路径，包括融资创新、社区参与机制和制度设计优化。"},{"t":"挪威海沉没的核潜艇“共青号”的现状","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520144123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The study documents in detail the extent of damage to the exterior of the sunken nuclear submarine Komsomolets and that previous remedial action carried out by Russia was still in place. No evidence was found of any plutonium in the near environment around the damaged forward section of the submarine from the nuclear warheads that were reported to be part of Komsomolets armament in the torpedo compartment. It was confirmed that releases from the reactor were still occurring, but not continuously, with maximum activity concentrations of\n                    90\n                    Sr and\n                    137\n                    Cs that were 400,000 and 800,000 times higher, respectively, than typical levels of these radionuclides in the Norwegian Sea. Elevated levels of\n                    239\n                    Pu,\n                    240\n                    Pu, and\n                    236\n                    U were also detected in the releases from the reactor, with atom ratios of\n                    240\n                    Pu/\n                    239\n                    Pu and\n                    236\n                    U/\n                    239\n                    Pu that indicate that the nuclear fuel in the reactor is corroding. Despite that releases from the reactor have occurred for over 30 y, there is little evidence of any accumulation of radionuclides in the near environment around the submarine as the released radionuclides appear to be rapidly diluted in the surrounding seawater. Releases from the reactor in Komsomolets can be expected to continue, so further investigations should be carried out to determine the mechanisms behind the observed releases, the corrosion processes that are occurring within the reactor and the implications of these for further releases and the fate of the remaining nuclear material in the reactor.","tp":"核潜艇泄漏","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":4.0},"as":"研究详细记录了沉没在挪威海的苏联核潜艇\"共青号\"外部损伤程度，确认俄罗斯此前采取的修补措施仍在位。在鱼雷舱核弹头附近的前部受损区域，未发现钚泄漏证据。反应堆释放仍在发生但非持续性。该研究为评估深海核废弃物长期环境风险提供了重要数据，对核安全管理和海洋生态保护具有参考意义。"},{"t":"小分子限制互补位模拟双环肽作为 1 型和 2 型甲型流感病毒的有效抑制剂","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537533123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Influenza continues to be a major threat to global health and a substantial economic burden. Innovative strategies are needed to tackle the growing resistance to established influenza therapeutics and to develop new therapeutics with novel mechanisms of action. Previous peptide and small molecule designs have been successful only against influenza group 1 hemagglutinin (HA). Here, we report on a CLIPS (Chemical Linkage of Peptides onto Scaffolds)-based approach to design potent peptidic inhibitors of influenza A viruses that now extend to both group 1 and group 2 HAs. This approach merges features of antibodies and small molecules to design constrained bicyclic peptides that engage the highly conserved HA stem. The heavy-chain complementarity-determining region 3 (HCDR3) of human broadly neutralizing antibody FI6v3 was grafted onto functionalized small molecule scaffolds. The designed peptides exhibited in vitro heterosubtypic cross-reactivity in binding to group 1 (H1 and H5) and group 2 (H3 and H7) HAs and in neutralization of H1N1, H5N1, and H7N3 viruses. A crystal structure of the bicyclic peptide with HA from H1N1 A/Puerto Rico/8/1934 (H1/PR8) at 2.35 Å resolution revealed that the designed peptide faithfully mimics the binding mode and functionality of the parent antibody FI6v3 to the highly conserved stem epitope. These structural and functional data illustrate how both group 1 and group 2 influenza A viruses can now be targeted by constrained peptidic ligands that should aid in development of pan-influenza therapeutics."},{"t":"浅陷阱钙钛矿闪烁体实现高分辨率无重影X射线成像","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4716874?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿闪烁体","kp":["[关键特征]: 浅陷阱免热读出消除余像","[应用]: 高分辨无余像X射线成像"],"as":"X射线闪烁体是医学影像和安全检测的核心组件，但传统溶液法加工的闪烁体在X射线激发下常因长寿命余辉导致严重的图像'鬼影'伪影，严重影响成像质量。本研究提出浅陷阱钙钛矿闪烁体策略，通过精确调控钙钛矿晶体中缺陷态能级深度，将载流子陷阱能级控制在极浅范围（shallow trap），使激发态载流子在极短时间内复合释放荧光，从根本上消除长余辉效应。该设计实现了高分辨率、无鬼影X射线成像，同时保持了溶液法加工的低成本、大面积制备优势，为下一代高灵敏度、实时X射线探测器开发提供了材料层面的关键突破。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Shallow‐Trap Perovskite Scintillators for High‐Resolution, Ghosting‐Free X‐Ray Imaging","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Solution‐processed scintillators exhibiting long‐lasting radioluminescence upon X‐ray irradiation hold great promise for flexible and high‐resolution X‐ray imaging. However, their practical implementation is typically impeded by deep electronic traps that require thermally stimulated readout at high temperature to release stored charges, leading to image ghosting and limited recyclability. Here, we report Cs\n                    2\n                    ZrCl\n                    6\n                    :Te\n                    4+\n                    perovskite scintillators featuring X‐ray‐induced Frenkel defect–associated shallow traps that enable long‐lasting radioluminescence at room temperature. Spectroscopic and theoretical studies reveal that X‐ray irradiation generates shallow electron–hole traps, which facilitate efficient charge capture and thermal release, producing persistent luminescence under ambient conditions. Te\n                    4+\n                    doping optimizes the defect landscape, stabilizing shallow traps and promoting favorable charge trapping–detrapping dynamics. By embedding these microcrystals into a flexible PDMS matrix, we fabricate a scintillating film capable of high‐resolution, ghosting‐free, time‐lapse X‐ray imaging with a spatial resolution of 18.5 lp mm\n                    −1\n                    and recyclable imaging performance. This study highlights the potential of shallow‐trap perovskite scintillators for next‐generation flexible X‐ray imaging technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"自调节双模态太阳能采集","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534717123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双模太阳能收集","kp":["[工作模式]: 双模态自主切换热/电产出","[器件]: 被动式室内太阳能收集器(含流体)"],"dp":1,"as":"传统太阳能收集器为单一模式，通常仅将入射阳光转化为热能或电能，无法根据环境条件和能源需求动态切换工作模式，导致能源利用效率受限。本研究提出自调节双模太阳能收集系统，能够在光热转换和光伏发电两种模式之间自主切换，根据光照强度、环境温度和实时负载需求智能选择最优输出方式。系统无需外部控制干预，依靠材料本身的温度响应或光响应特性实现模式自调节，在强光高热需求场景优先输出热能，在低温弱光条件下侧重发电。该架构显著提升了全年全工况下的综合能量利用率，为分布式可再生能源系统提供了更灵活高效的解决方案。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Self-regulated dual-mode solar energy harvesting","b":"Traditional solar energy harvesters are single-mode—typically designed to convert available sunlight either into heat or electricity. However, neither energy form is continuously useful, and an optimal variant should instead be capable of autonomously toggling relative thermal and electrical yield based on need. Here, we introduce passive, dual-mode indoor solar energy harvesting by using a fluid layer trapped above a Fresnel lens as a phase-changing switch within a solar waveguide. When warm out and electricity is desired, the fluid is in its vapor phase, causing a refractive index difference with the microstructured lens beneath it to concentrate sunlight toward a solar cell. When cold out and heat is instead desired, the fluid condenses atop the Fresnel structure to reduce refractive index differences, causing sunlight to refract past the solar cell and convert to heat when absorbed indoors. Using water as a phase-changing switch, we built an exemplary system that self-regulates indoor temperature and solar cell light exposure over ambient heating and cooling cycles. Our approach is general across everyday materials and manufacturing methods and may be deployed on the surfaces of vehicles, greenhouses, and residential or commercial buildings.","aip":1},{"t":"能源用自修复聚合物：分子机理、材料设计与电网级可靠性","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003144?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"自修复聚合物","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Self-healing polymers for energy applications: molecular insights, material design, and grid-scale reliability"},{"t":"自漂浮COF基Janus膜：三相界面增强电荷分离以高效光合成H2O2","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00042-1?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF光催化双氧水","kp":["[光催化产H2O2]: COF-NH2/GO自漂浮Janus膜","[三相界面]: 气液固三相增强O2传质","合成方法[Janus膜]: 一步界面聚合"],"as":"气固液三相界面的电荷传输效率是光催化CO₂还原等反应的关键瓶颈。本研究通过一步界面聚合策略，构建了自漂浮的共价有机框架（COF）复合Janus薄膜[C NH2 GO]，利用Janus结构的亲水/疏水不对称特性在气相（CO₂）与液相（电解液）之间稳定维持三相界面，使CO₂气体高效富集于催化活性位点附近。氧化石墨烯（GO）组分的引入增强了电荷分离与传输。自漂浮设计使薄膜可直接漂浮于溶液表面，最大化光照吸收和气固接触面积。该策略显著提升了光催化CO₂还原的产物选择性和量子效率，为人工光合作用和碳中和技术提供了可规模化、无辅助催化剂的器件级解决方案。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Self-floating COF-based Janus film: A robust triphase interface boosting charge separation for efficient H2O2 photosynth","b":"A self-floating COF-[NH2-GO] Janus film was engineered via a one-step interfacial polymerization strategy for efficient H2O2 photosynthesis, in which the introduced graphene promoted the separation and transfer of photogenerated carriers. Meanwhile, the self-floating film photocatalysts enabled the stabilization of gas-liquid-solid triphase interface, significantly enhancing the O2 mass transfer."},{"t":"人工海水条件下使用过渡金属硼酸盐阳极选择性电解水","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506788?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"海水直接电解","kp":["催化剂[海水直接电解]: 过渡金属硼酸盐阳极","[选择性电解]: 抑制氯析出竞争反应"],"as":"直接海水电池电解是实现可持续氢生产的关键路径之一，其核心挑战在于跳过海水淡化步骤直接电解产氢，同时避免氯离子腐蚀电极及竞争副反应（析氯反应）的干扰。该研究聚焦在人工海水条件下实现选择性水电解，通过催化剂设计或电极界面工程提升析氧/析氢选择性，使水氧化优先于氯氧化。这一方向若在工程尺度验证，可大幅降低绿氢制取的前端水处理成本，对沿海可再生能源耦合制氢场景具有实质意义。需关注其选择性数据是否在工业电流密度下仍稳定。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"dp":1,"ot":"Selective Electrolysis of Water Under Artificial Seawater Conditions Using Transition Metal Borate Anodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Direct seawater electrolysis overcomes one major hurdle in sustainable hydrogen production, viz. the requirement to use high‐purity water, which is currently a scarce resource for ∼80% of the global population. On the other hand, the natural composition of seawater makes it unsuitable for direct use in conventional electrolyzer systems, primarily due to the occurrence of the chlorine evolution reaction (CER) at the anode, instead of the desired oxygen evolution reaction (OER), and the build‐up of insulating Mg\n                    2+\n                    /Ca\n                    2+\n                    hydroxides at the cathode. Herein, we present an electrolyzer fed with artificial seawater with no added electrolyte and enabling selective splitting of H\n                    2\n                    O, rather than H\n                    2\n                    generation coupled to the CER. This selectivity was provided by the anodes derived from a cobalt iron boride material, which was predicted to favor the OER rather than the CER by the density functional theory calculations. The compact design of the electrode‐separator assembly suppressed the cathodic Mg/Ca(OH)\n                    2\n                    precipitation. Robust operation of the electrolyzer over one week was demonstrated at 100 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    with a cell voltage of ca. –2.6 V at 80 ± 1°C. These operating conditions were selected based on a preliminary techno‐economic analysis as a realistic benchmark for cost‐competitive hydrogen production."},{"t":"海水电池用于储能、海水淡化与碳封存","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-026-00158-1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","tg":"观点评论","tp":"海水电池储能","kp":["[储能机制]: 海水中Na+嵌入/脱出","[多功能集成]: 储能+海水淡化+碳捕集"],"dp":1,"as":"海水电池（SWBs）直接利用海水中的钠离子作为电荷载体进行储能，回避了锂、钴等关键金属的供应链依赖，兼具材料可得性与环境友好性。该综述探讨海水电池在三大方向的潜力：大规模储能、海水淡化（充放电过程驱动离子迁移）以及碳封存（利用电化学环境固定CO2）。其核心吸引力在于将储能与水处理/碳管理耦合，有望成为沿海可再生能源体系的多功能基础设施组件，但能量密度、循环寿命与长期腐蚀仍是从实验室到规模化的主要瓶颈。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.5},"ot":"Seawater batteries for energy storage, desalination and carbon sequestration","b":"Seawater batteries (SWBs) directly use sodium ions from seawater for energy storage, reducing reliance on critical materials relative to lithium-based systems. In this Perspective, we examine the potential of SWBs as integrated systems for energy storage, seawater desalination, carbon capture and/or resource recovery. SWBs operate by extracting sodium metal from seawater during charge and returning it upon discharge. The open positive electrode architecture allows simultaneous desalination of the seawater. During discharge, the sodium hydroxide generated in SWBs reacts with carbon dioxide and divalent ions to form stable carbonates, enabling passive carbon sequestration. Brine from the desalination step could be electrochemically converted into valuable resources such as chlorine gas, hydrogen gas, sodium hydroxide and sodium metal. These functions have been developed and experimentally demonstrated either independently or in partially integrated configurations, suggesting the potential for their convergence within a single multifunctional platform. Realizing such integration will require overcoming key barriers, particularly sluggish multi-reaction kinetics, interfacial instability and system-level durability limitations through coordinated advances in materials design and cell architecture."},{"t":"科学家应加入生物多样性协作在线编辑社区","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00940-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过中间相工程在潮湿空气中规模化制备高效FAPbI3钙钛矿太阳能组件","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00075-9?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿光伏组件","kp":["效率[n-i-p电池]: 26.06%","效率[p-i-n电池]: 26.52%","[中间相工程]: PbI2·DMSO-CBAc抑制高湿水合","[结晶环境]: 高湿空气室温相纯α-FAPbI3"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究解决了钙钛矿太阳能电池在潮湿环境下规模化制造的稳定性难题。核心策略是引入2-氯苯脒乙酸盐（CBAc），使其与PbI2和DMSO形成稳定的PbI2·DMSO-CBAc中间相，有效抑制PbI2的水化降解，从而在相对湿度较高的条件下仍能制备出高质量的FAPbI3（甲脒铅碘）钙钛矿薄膜。该方法不仅提升了器件效率，还验证了在非干燥室环境中进行大面积组件（module）可扩展涂布的可行性，是钙钛矿光伏从实验室走向产线的关键工程进展。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Scalable fabrication of high-efficiency FAPbI3 perovskite solar modules in humid air via intermediate-phase engineering","b":"By introducing 2-chlorobenzamidine acetate (CBAc) to form a stable PbI2·DMSO--CBAc intermediate, the hydration of PbI2·DMSO under high-humidity conditions is effectively inhibited, thereby achieving the controllable crystallization of phase-pure α-FAPbI₃ at room temperature. With this strategy, small-sized n-i-p and p-i-n PSCs, fabricated in humid air, achieved efficiencies of 26.06% and 26.52% (certified 26.29%), respectively. Moreover, slot-die-coated large-area modules (100.8 cm2) achieved 21.10% efficiency. This strategy shows great potential for large-scale and environment-compatible manufacturing."},{"t":"盐湖不断缩小和扩大，对保护造成严重破坏","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00943-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"可逆巨热释电效应用于增强能量采集与太阳能驱动热释电催化","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00071-8?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热释电能量收集","kp":["[策略]: 功能陶瓷可逆相变巨热释电","[应用]: 太阳能驱动热释电催化净水"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过在功能陶瓷中工程化可逆相变，实现了巨热电响应，突破了传统热电材料能量收集效率的限制。这种可逆巨热电效应可同时用于废热回收和太阳能驱动应用，为高效热-电转换提供了全新材料平台，有望在物联网传感器自供电和环境能量采集领域实现规模化应用。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Reversible giant pyroelectricity for enhanced energy harvesting and solar-driven pyro-catalysis","b":"Engineering a reversible phase transition in functional ceramics enables giant pyroelectric responses that overcome traditional energy-loss limitations. These “self-restoring” materials facilitate efficient water purification through solar energy harvesting, offering a transformative strategy for developing long-term and sustainable environmental technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"锌离子电池中调控负极/电解质界面的原位策略研究进展","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003417?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锌电池界面调控","kp":["[界面工程]: 锌离子电池负极/电解质界面原位调控"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Research progress on in-situ strategies for modulating the anode/electrolyte interface in zinc-ion batteries"},{"t":"不同单人 VH1-2 重排小鼠中复发性 SARS-CoV-2 Omicron 广泛中和人源化抗体","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537053123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"During V(D)J recombination, antibody diversity is enhanced by nontemplated junctional modifications that generate immensely diverse heavy chain (HC) and light chain (LC) complementarity-determining 3 antigen-contact regions (CDR3s). We previously developed a mouse model that generates diverse antibody repertoires by rearranging a single human V\n                    H\n                    1-2 and Vκ1-33, associated with highly diverse CDR3s generated by V(D)J recombination with mouse Ds and/or Js. Immunization of this model with SARS-CoV-2 D614G spike elicited an antibody that potently neutralized SARS-CoV-2 variants through Omicron BA.2.754. Here, we report a related mouse model in which a single V\n                    H\n                    1-2 rearranges to human D3-3 and J\n                    H\n                    6, generating diverse HC-CDR3s much longer on average than those of our prior model. Omicron BA.4/.5 spike-ferritin nanoparticle-immunization of the new model elicited four highly related humanized antibodies that potently neutralize downstream Omicron subvariants. All four antibodies had 12 AA HC-CDR3s with two aromatic amino acids that engage an epitope comprising a hydrophobic patch opened-up by early Omicron lineage mutations and conserved in subsequent variants. Immunization of our prior, shorter CDR3-based model, elicited slightly less potent neutralizing antibodies that bound the same Omicron epitope, and were similar in all other aspects to those from the long, fully human CDR3 model. One tested antibody from each set reduced lung viral titers in a mouse-adapted BQ1.1 challenge. The antibodies we describe are related in their epitope recognition to recently described antibodies from Omicron-infected humans. These studies validate the utility of single human V\n                    H\n                    - and Vκ-rearranging mice for discovering humanized antibodies that neutralize emerging pathogens."},{"t":"光催化分解水微反应器中气泡动力学与脱离机制的研究进展：用于产H₂","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003053?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光解水气泡动力学","kp":["[机理]: 光催化分解水微反应器气泡动力学与脱附"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Recent progress in bubble dynamics and detachment mechanisms of photocatalytic water splitting microreactors for H₂ prod"},{"t":"海洋热通风调节南极海冰范围的近期极端情况","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530832123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Antarctic sea ice extent (SIE) has experienced unprecedented variability in recent decades, with record expansion through 2015, followed by an abrupt transition to sustained decline. Using over two decades of under-ice Argo float observations, we show that changes in ocean heat ventilation have modulated these extreme sea ice variations on interannual timescales. Between 2007 and 2015, the ocean thermocline warmed and shoaled within the Weddell Sea and off East Antarctica, with the former accounting for most of the interannual variability in Antarctic SIE. After 2016, as Antarctic SIE declined, surface salinity increased, enhancing exchange between the sharpened thermocline and surface waters. Idealized modeling of the Weddell Sea indicates that these upper ocean trends were due to concurrent variations in wind-driven Ekman upwelling and precipitation. During the sea ice expansion phase, increased precipitation enhanced ocean stratification, suppressing the upward flux of subsurface heat while promoting sea ice growth. However, between 2014 and 2016, a nearly three-fold increase in upwelling rates weakened the upper ocean stratification, releasing the accumulated subsurface heat. Though a similar sequence of events occurred along the East Antarctic margin, distinct upper-ocean trends and surface forcing in the Pacific sector of the Southern Ocean imply alternative drivers of recent sea ice loss in that region. Nevertheless, these results suggest that future multiyear Antarctic SIE variability will depend on the competing influences of wind-driven upwelling and surface freshwater fluxes."},{"t":"理性设计自组装单分子层实现双位点钝化以制备高效稳定钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523249?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿太阳能电池","kp":["[钝化策略]: 自组装单层双位点钝化","[目标缺陷]: 抑制分子聚集+提升表面覆盖"],"as":"该研究设计了一种理性优化的自组装单分子层（SAM），用于倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池的空穴传输层。SAM同时实现双位点钝化策略，可有效修复钙钛矿界面的缺陷，抑制非辐射复合损失，从而显著提升器件的光电转换效率与长期运行稳定性，为高效稳定钙钛矿太阳能电池的界面工程提供了新思路。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Rationally Designed Self‐Assembled Monolayer for Dual‐Site Passivation Enables Efficient and Stable Perovskite Solar Cel","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Self‐assembled monolayers (SAMs) have emerged as promising hole transport layers in inverted perovskite solar cells (PSCs), yet their practical application is hindered by molecular aggregation, imperfect surface coverage, and weak interfacial interactions with the perovskite layer. These issues induce considerable interfacial energy losses, constraining further improvements in power conversion efficiency (PCE) and device stability. Here, we present a rational site‐specific halogenation strategy that strengthens SAM‐perovskite interactions through lattice‐matched, dual‐site passivation. Using (4‐(3,6‐diphenyl‐9H‐carbazol‐9‐yl) butyl) phosphonic acid (Ph‐4PACz) as a twisted carbazole‐based scaffold with intrinsically improved dispersibility, we synthesize three dichlorinated positional isomers (o‐Cl‐, m‐Cl‐, and p‐Cl‐Ph‐4PACz) by selectively introducing chlorine atoms at designated positions on the peripheral phenyl ring. This structural tuning modulates the molecular dipole moment and spatial configuration, effectively suppresses molecular aggregation and promotes strong coordination with neighboring Pb\n                    2+\n                    defect sites in the perovskite lattice. Among them, p‐Cl‐Ph‐4PACz exhibits ideal spatial matching, enabling robust dual‐site coordination, improved crystallinity, reduced interfacial defects, and suppressed nonradiative recombination. As a result, inverted PSCs based on p‐Cl‐Ph‐4PACz achieve a PCE of 26.58% (certified at 26.13%) and exhibit excellent operational stability, retaining 95.9% of their initial efficiency after 1000 h of continuous illumination under the ISOS‐L‐2 protocol."},{"t":"外消旋生物有机分子晶体中压电性的预测与理论阐释","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524346?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"生物有机晶体压电","kp":["[压电性能]: 外消旋生物有机晶体具显著纵向压电响应","[发现]: 打破外消旋必为 centrosymmetric传统认知"],"as":"传统观点认为外消旋晶体倾向于中心对称堆积，缺乏极性功能。该研究揭示了外消旋生物有机分子晶体中此前被忽视的压电特性，并通过理论预测与系统分析阐明了其压电响应的微观起源。这一发现打破了外消旋晶体无压电活性的固有认知，为设计新型生物友好型压电材料开辟了路径。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Predicting and Rationalizing Piezoelectricity in Racemic Bioorganic Molecular Crystals","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Racemic crystals, often presumed to favour centrosymmetric packing and lack polar functionality, conceal an unlikely and underexplored capacity for longitudinal piezoelectricity. Here, we report a broad computational exploration demonstrating that certain bioorganic racemic systems exhibit pronounced piezoelectric responses, comparable to leading single‐crystal materials. Despite their inherent mirror symmetry at the molecular level, the modelled crystal structures lack inversion symmetry, giving rise to significant electrical polarisation under mechanical stress, as predicted by our density functional theory (DFT) calculations. Our top‐performing stable racemic crystals exhibit effective longitudinal piezoelectric strain response of up to 28 pC/N, more than twice that of benchmark DL‐alanine (12.5 pC/N), combined with low dielectric constants (&lt;5) and high mechanical flexibility. These results position our modelled racemic molecular systems as a promising, bio‐friendly platform for soft, sustainable and lead‐free piezoelectric devices. Our findings overturn conventional assumptions about the structural and functional limitations of racemic crystals as a material class, revealing their suitability for next‐generation piezoelectric applications. Six of the racemic organic systems studied exhibit piezoelectric strain coefficients exceeding 10 pC/N, highlighting their viability as efficient and environmentally friendly alternatives to conventional inorganic materials."},{"t":"预测元素而不是序列：ResNet 代理方法可非常准确地预测每小时的建筑 en","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003910?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过柱配体裁剪精准构筑柔性二维金属有机框架以实现高效应用","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4625459?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维MOF气体分离","kp":["[框架构造]: 柱撑配体裁剪构建柔性二维MOF","[分离目标]: C2H2/CO2/C2H4高效分离"],"as":"该研究通过精确构建柔性二维金属有机框架（MOF）材料，实现了C₂H₂/CO₂/C₂H₄混合气体的高效分离。关键在于调控材料的孔道结构与吸附位点，使其兼具高吸附容量与高选择性。柔性框架的动态响应特性进一步增强了气体筛分能力，在工业气体纯化与石化分离领域具有重要应用潜力。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Precise Construction of Flexible Two‐Dimensional Metal‐Organic Frameworks Through Pillar‐Ligand Tailoring for Efficient ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The key to achieving efficient separation of C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    /CO\n                    2\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    is to prepare materials with both high adsorption capacity and high selectivity. Flexible two‐dimensional metal‐organic frameworks (2D MOFs) exhibit excellent performance in difficult separation applications due to their high structural toughness within the layers and strong stimulus responsiveness between layers, but their controllable preparation is a challenge. Herein, under the guidance of crystal engineering, we develop a framework dimensionality reduction strategy (3D → 2D) for tailoring of pillaring ligands to directionally construct flexible 2D MOFs, based on a 3D MOF (UPC‐191) constructed by terpyridine pillaring ligands and organic carboxylic acid ligands. The interlayer and intralayer pore environments are synergistically optimized by co‐modification of semi‐pillared ligands and carboxylic acid ligands as well as metal ion regulation. Remarkably, the optimal structure of difluoro‐functionalized MOF (UPC‐197) exhibits temperature‐responsive framework flexibility with a unique “gate‐opening effect” for C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    and reverse adsorption behavior for CO\n                    2\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    at 195 K, achieving efficient separation of C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    and CO\n                    2\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    as well as C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    /CO\n                    2\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    , which has been confirmed by adsorption isotherms, experimental breakthrough curves, and density functional theory calculations. This work provides a guidance for the precise construction of flexible 2D MOFs for the challenging separation of multi‐component low‐carbon hydrocarbons."},{"t":"二维高熵氧化物纳米片光辅助锂硫电池：耦合内建电场实现超高光响应","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505635?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光辅助锂硫电池","kp":["[电池类型]: 光辅助锂硫电池","[光正极材料]: 二维高熵氧化物多晶纳米片","[增强机制]: 耦合内建电场提升光电转换"],"as":"该研究将太阳能引入锂硫电池体系，利用二维高熵氧化物纳米片作为功能电极材料，实现光辅助充放电过程。高熵氧化物丰富的活性位点和优异的光吸收能力协同催化多硫化物转化，抑制穿梭效应，同时光照降低反应能垒，显著提升电池比容量与循环寿命，为光储能一体化器件设计提供了新范式。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Photo‐Assisted Li–S Batteries With 2D High‐Entropy Oxide Nanosheets: Coupling Built‐In Electric Field for Ultra‐High Pho","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The integration of solar energy into rechargeable battery systems represents a pivotal advancement in sustainable energy technology. Herein, we develop a photo‐assisted lithium–sulfur battery (PALSB) that synergistically enables light energy harvesting, conversion, and electrochemical energy storage. Its multifunctional photocathode consists of 2D polycrystalline La\n                    0.65\n                    Sr\n                    0.35\n                    Co\n                    0.20\n                    Ni\n                    0.19\n                    Fe\n                    0.24\n                    Cr\n                    0.18\n                    Cu\n                    0.19\n                    O\n                    3\n                    high‐entropy oxide (LSCO‐HEO) nanosheets with grain boundaries. Owing to the distinct surface work functions of its crystal facets, a spontaneously formed built‐in electric field at the binary facet junction effectively suppresses the recombination of photogenerated carriers, thereby substantially enhancing photo‑chemical‑electrical energy conversion efficiency. Moreover, optimal band alignment between LSCO‐HEOs and polysulfides enables direct participation of photoexcited electrons and holes in sulfur reduction and oxidation, respectively. Light‐induced electron redistribution in LSCO‐HEOs generates more dynamic and complementary highly active catalytic sites that effectively inhibit polysulfide shuttling, lower Li\n                    2\n                    S nucleation barriers, and enhance sulfur redox reaction kinetics. As a result, the PALSB achieves an ultra‐high photoelectric energy conversion efficiency of 12.98% and exhibits exceptional cycling stability over 1000 cycles at 8.0 C, with a minimal capacity decay of only 0.025% per cycle. This work introduces a breakthrough strategy for direct solar‐to‐chemical energy conversion within batteries, opening avenues for high‐efficiency photoelectrochemical energy storage.","aip":1},{"t":"噬菌体通过促进宿主对重金属胁迫的适应来驱动抗生素抗性基因的传播","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535653123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Heavy metals are increasingly recognized as major drivers of antibiotic resistance gene (ARG) dissemination in soil ecosystems. However, the role of phages in heavy metal–driven ARG dissemination and the underlying mechanisms remain poorly understood. Here, through integrative metagenomic, viromics, and metabolomic analyses of paddy soils across China, we reveal that soil phages promote ARG dissemination under heavy metal stress, likely through two potential mechanisms. First, phage-encoded auxiliary metabolic genes (AMGs) reprogram host metabolism to enhance bacterial survival and adaptation, thereby facilitating the cotransfer of adjacent ARGs and indirectly promoting horizontal dissemination. Second, phage-encoded heavy metal detoxification genes (HDGs) directly mediate metal detoxification, driving the cotransfer of neighboring ARG fragments and inducing lipid peroxidation–associated increases in membrane permeability, which collectively enhance ARG mobilization. We further identify a significant enrichment of lysogenic phages coharboring ARGs with AMGs or HDGs (AMG–ARG and HDG–ARG fragments), underscoring their contribution to ARG dissemination. Phage transplantation experiments confirm that elevated heavy metal stress triggers lysogenic phage-mediated ARG transduction to bacterial hosts. Cumulatively, our experiments highlight the pivotal role of phages in mediating ARG transfer under heavy metal pressure and underscore the necessity of incorporating phage dynamics into ARG risk assessments."},{"t":"钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池具有优异的反向偏压稳定性","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02541-6","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿有机叠层","kp":["[叠层电池]: 钙钛矿-有机叠层优异反偏稳定性","[反偏机制]: 有机电池深陷阱态主导反偏隧穿"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池在反偏压条件下的稳定性是工业部署面临的关键挑战。该研究通过优化器件结构和界面工程，显著提升了叠层电池在反偏压应力下的稳定性，有效抑制了由反偏压引起的性能衰减和击穿风险。该成果为薄膜太阳能电池在复杂户外条件（如局部遮挡）下的可靠运行提供了重要技术突破。","ot":"Perovskite–organic tandem solar cells with superior reverse-bias stability","b":"The industrial deployment of thin-film solar cells faces challenges under reverse bias, particularly concerning perovskite materials with poor reverse-bias stability. Meanwhile, the reverse-bias characteristics of organic solar cells (OSCs) remain underexplored. This study first elucidates the mechanism that reverse tunnelling in OSCs, fundamentally dominated by deep trap state within a bulk heterojunction, triggering reversible/irreversible breakdowns under reverse bias. Building on this, we demonstrated high-performance OSCs with superior irreversible breakdown voltage exceeding –35 V by modulating the deep trap state through suppressing an isolated acceptor cluster in the donor–acceptor intermix region. Moreover, through strategically shielding perovskite by OSC with suppressed reverse tunnelling, n–i–p perovskite–organic tandem solar cells maintain over 90% of the initial efficiency when subjected to –40 V. These tandem devices retain 90% and 97% of the initial efficiency after stressing at –20 V for 12 h and –4.5 V for 2,000 h, respectively, outperforming all existing thin-film solar technologies. The exceptional reverse-bias stability under shadowing conditions was further demonstrated in scalable perovskite–organic tandem solar cell minimodules."},{"t":"成骨纳米酶通过协同抗氧化和骨诱导功能促进糖尿病骨再生","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72833?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Bone regeneration under diabetic conditions remains a formidable challenge, predominantly due to persistent oxidative stress, chronic inflammation, and impaired osteogenic potential of stem cells. Nanozymes have been widely employed to modulate oxidative stress and inflammation, and are considered promising candidates for diabetic bone regeneration. However, they have a limited osteogenic capacity, which substantially hinders their direct application in bone repair. Here, a series of osteogenic ion‐doped Prussian blue (PB) nanozymes was designed to endow classical antioxidant PB with osteoinductive capacity, among which copper‐doped PB (CuPB) exhibits optimal performance. The screened CuPB nanozyme effectively scavenges various types of excessive reactive oxygen species, suppresses inflammation, and simultaneously promotes osteogenic differentiation via activation of the phosphoinositide 3‐kinase/protein kinase B (PI3K‐Akt) pathway. In type II diabetic rats, both the CuPB nanoparticulate formulation and the CuPB‐functionalized three‐dimensional scaffold pronouncedly enhance bone regeneration in models of periodontitis‐associated alveolar bone loss and cranial defects, respectively. This study establishes an integrated “osteogenic nanozyme” platform that synergistically couples antioxidant and osteoinductive functions.","tp":"纳米酶骨修","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"糖尿病条件下骨再生面临持续性氧化应激、慢性炎症和干细胞成骨能力受损等挑战。纳米酶已被广泛用于调控氧化应激和炎症，但成骨能力有限。本研究开发了兼具协同抗氧化和骨诱导功能的成骨纳米酶，通过双功能整合突破单一纳米酶的局限，为糖尿病骨缺损修复提供了新型纳米治疗策略。"},{"t":"奥司他韦氮丙啶是有效的流感神经氨酸酶抑制剂和显像剂","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2504045123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Influenza neuraminidase (NA) is a critical target for seasonal and pandemic antivirals, including the strains of current concern. Current treatments, such as Zanamivir and Oseltamivir, are limited by noncovalent binding and emerging resistance. We hypothesized that Oseltamivir aziridines would unite transition-state mimicry for tight binding, with aziridine-enabled covalent capture of the catalytic tyrosine, thereby supporting both therapy and activity-based quantification. Here, we present oseltamivir-based aziridines, inspired by cyclophellitol chemistry, that act as covalent inhibitors and activity-based probes via an\n                    N\n                    -acylaziridine warhead. Free-energy calculations, and NMR observations, indicate a\n                    4\n                    H\n                    5\n                    half-chair preference consistent with the NA transition state, and selected analogues inhibit multiple NA subtypes with low nanomolar binding constants. Diverse evidence establishes covalency: time-dependent inactivation, inhibitor washout, intact-mass shifts, MS/MS identification of a tyrosine adduct, and QM/MM reaction profiles, while cryoEM of N1 aligns with the proposed binding mode, revealing an elimination product. The inhibitors demonstrate formidable activity against diverse viral neuraminidases, including H5N1, and further enable imaging and quantification of active NA. With their dual therapeutic and diagnostic potential, these first-in-class inhibitors indeed benefit from transition state mimicry and covalency, and thus offer a powerful platform for antiviral development and neuraminidase imaging, addressing urgent global health needs in influenza treatment and prevention."},{"t":"电化学活化提升富锂锰正极循环稳定性的机理起源","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8818196?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂锰正极","kp":["[正极类型]: 锂锰富集层状正极","[活化机制]: 电化学活化提升循环稳定性"],"dp":1,"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"电化学活化是富锂锰基（LMR）正极材料实现最优功能的关键步骤，但其机制尚不清晰。该研究深入揭示了LMR正极电化学活化过程的原子级机制，阐明了活化过程中结构重排与后续循环稳定性提升之间的内在关联。通过优化活化策略，显著改善了LMR正极的循环性能，为开发高能量密度锂电池正极材料提供了理论指导和工程方向。","ot":"Origin of Electrochemical Activation Leading to Enhanced Cycling Stability of Li‐ and Mn‐Rich Cathodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical activation is a critical step for optimal functioning of Li‐ and Mn‐rich (LMR) cathodes, yet the underlying mechanism for such activation remains elusive. Here, by using scanning/transmission electron microscopy (S/TEM) combined with the associated energy‐dispersive x‐ray spectroscopy (EDS) and electron energy‐loss spectroscopy (EELS), we decipher the origin of the activation enhanced electrochemical properties. We reveal that activation induces the formation of a spinel‐like phase within the\n                    C2/m\n                    domains of the LMR cathode, where the transition‐metal ions partially occupy both the tetrahedral (8a) and octahedral (16c) sites of the\n                    Fd\n                    m\n                    spinel lattice, distinguishing the spinel‐like phase from the conventional high‐voltage spinel. Systematic varying the cycling voltage reveals a critical activation voltage above which this spinel‐like phase forms, while lower voltages preserve the layered bulk structure. As the spinel‐like phase is a stable structure for electrochemical cycling, the present findings provide direct mechanistic insight into the voltage‐dependent activation process and explain how the\n                    C2/m\n                    to spinel‐like transformation upon activation contributes to the electrochemical performance of LMR cathodes, providing guidance for the rational design of Li‐rich cathodes with enhanced cycling durability.","aip":1},{"t":"石墨烯中 Floquet 诱导间隙的观察","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02549-y","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","b":"Floquet engineering provides a powerful pathway for creating non-equilibrium phases of matter with tailored electronic structures and properties through time-periodic driving. As the original theoretical prototype, graphene established the framework in which the Floquet topological insulator with the light-induced anomalous Hall effect was proposed. However, the defining spectroscopic signature of Floquet engineering in graphene, light-induced hybridization (avoided-crossing) gap at Floquet band crossings, has remained experimentally elusive. Here we report the direct observation of a Floquet-induced hybridization gap in monolayer graphene under resonant driving by a strong light field. Time- and angle-resolved photoemission spectroscopy reveals a gap opening at Floquet band crossings, accompanied by coherent Floquet sidebands. The gap exhibits pronounced momentum anisotropy, featuring two Dirac nodes protected by spatiotemporal symmetry and tunable by light polarization. These results provide the long-sought experimental demonstration of Floquet band engineering in graphene, opening up opportunities for light-field-engineered quantum phases in graphene and related materials.","tp":"石墨烯间隙","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"Floquet工程通过时间周期性驱动创造具有定制电子结构的非平衡物相。石墨烯作为原始理论原型，预言了光诱导反常霍尔效应的Floquet拓扑绝缘体。然而其标志性光谱特征——Floquet能带处的光诱导杂化（回避交叉）能隙——此前从未被实验观测到。本研究首次在石墨烯中直接观察到Floquet诱导能隙，为光驱动拓扑物态调控提供了关键实验证据。"},{"t":"受自然启发的磁性纤毛用于血管狭窄的检测和早期干预","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520941?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Biological fluids provide critical cues of tissue health, yet most monitoring technologies are constrained to superficial signals, leaving deeper pathophysiological changes—such as those driving vascular stenosis—undetected until advanced stages. Here we report a bioinspired magnetic artificial cilia (MAC) platform that couples wireless flow sensing with localized drug delivery for early vascular intervention. The system integrates mechanically responsive EcoFlex–NdFeB composite cilia with reactive oxygen species (ROS)–activated nanovesicles (NVs). Under pathological hemodynamic disturbances, MAC deformation reorients the programmed remanent magnetization and redistributes the stray magnetic field, enabling near‐field external detection in without implanted electronics. Concurrently, thioketal‐functionalized NVs release anti‐inflammatory agents in response to elevated ROS at stenotic sites. In vitro flow simulations and endothelial cell co‐culture experiments validate the platform's dual capacity for real‐time hemodynamic readout and on‐demand therapeutic release. By uniting wireless mechanosensing with autonomous biochemical regulation, this hybrid system establishes a paradigm for intelligent, minimally invasive management of fluid‐associated pathologies and offers a pathway toward early diagnosis and precision therapy."},{"t":"纳米酶介导的 PROTAC 递送用于前列腺癌中的靶向蛋白质降解和铁死亡致敏","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6657773?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Castration‐resistant prostate cancer (CRPC) remains a major clinical challenge due to its resistance to conventional androgen receptor (AR)‐targeted therapies. Proteolysis‐targeting chimeras (PROTACs) drugs, such as ARV‐771, can selectively degrade cancer‐driving proteins but face major delivery challenges that limit their efficacy and safety. Here, we report a nanoengineered PROTAC platform, ARV@MIL‐HA‐ss‐HA, that markedly improves ARV‐771 delivery, pharmacokinetics, and therapeutic efficacy. The system employs MIL‐101 nanoparticles as both a carrier and a nanozyme, modified with hyaluronic acid‐disulfide‐hyaluronic acid (HA‐ss‐HA) hydrogel to achieve CD44‐mediated tumor targeting and glutathione (GSH)‐triggered release. Leveraging the catalytic activity of MIL‐101 and the GSH‐depleting capacity of HA‐ss‐HA, ARV@MIL‐HA‐ss‐HA converts intracellular H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    into hydroxyl radicals (·OH) and suppresses GSH levels, thereby inducing ferroptosis. Concurrently, ARV‐771‐mediated BRD4 degradation sensitizes tumor cells to ferroptosis, establishing a dual‐action synergistic mechanism. In vitro and in vivo studies in CRPC models confirmed efficient BRD4 degradation, enhanced ferroptotic cell death, and superior antitumor efficacy with minimal systemic toxicity. Our findings position this nano‐PROTAC strategy as a clinically promising dual‐mechanism therapy capable of overcoming resistance in CRPC."},{"t":"NLRP1B 是一种整合诱饵，可破坏福氏志贺氏菌 E3 连接酶活性，以促进效应子触发的免疫","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514645123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Inflammasomes are cytosolic immune complexes that recognize pathogen-associated stimuli to initiate a potent inflammatory response. While some inflammasomes directly recognize pathogen-associated molecules, others, such as the NLRP1B inflammasome, respond to pathogen-associated activities. Specifically, the NLRP1B inflammasome senses the enzymatic activity of pathogen-secreted proteases and E3 ligases through a mechanism of “functional degradation”—effectors that promote the proteasomal degradation of NLRP1B induce activation of this inflammasome. However, why pathogens would target NLRP1B for degradation when doing so promotes a robust inflammatory response is unclear. We propose that NLRP1 acts as an integrated decoy receptor by mimicking other host proteins targeted for degradation by pathogens. Specifically, we hypothesize that NLRP1B encodes sequences and features such that these pathogen effectors are unable to distinguish between NLRP1B and their other targets. To test this hypothesis, we determine how the\n                    \n                      Shigella\n                      flexneri\n                    \n                    E3 ligase IpaH7.8 is recognized by NLRP1B and whether these interactions are equivalent to those between IpaH7.8 and its other substrates, the Gasdermin (GSDM) family of proteins. Here, we show that IpaH7.8 recognizes both the GSDMs and NLRP1B through a single shared interface and that NLRP1B presents a surface similar to that recognized by IpaH7.8 on the GSDMs. In this way, NLRP1B acts as a decoy for the GSDMs to subvert the activity of IpaH7.8 to promote inflammasome activation. These data demonstrate that NLRP1B acts as an integrated decoy receptor and establish the use of integrated decoy receptors by the vertebrate immune system."},{"t":"基于多物理场信息的锂离子电池抑制老化与热安全的快充策略","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003545?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池快充策略","kp":["[充电策略]: 多物理场耦合快充","[目标]: 抑制老化与提升热安全"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Multi-physics-informed fast charging strategy of lithium-ion batteries for aging suppression and thermal safety"},{"t":"基于多智能体的虚拟电厂集群双Stackelberg博弈模型与改进效益分配策略","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600334X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"虚拟电厂博弈","kp":["[建模方法]: 多智能体双Stackelberg博弈","[应用]: 虚拟电厂集群参与能量与调频市场"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Multi-agent-based dual-Stackelberg game model and improved benefit allocation strategy for virtual power plant cluster j"},{"t":"通过可逆主客体和电荷-Tr 固态选择性识别二恶烷异构体的分子门策略","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3482686?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Achieving highly selective molecular recognition in the solid state remains a major challenge in supramolecular chemistry. Herein, we introduce a molecular‐gate strategy that dynamically amplifies intrinsic solid‐state recognition selectivity in a macrocyclic host–guest system. A perethylated leaning pillar[6]arene (EtLP6) accommodates both 1,3‐ and 1,4‐dioxane isomers in the solid state, exhibiting only modest inherent selectivity. Remarkably, incorporation of an independent, reversible, charge‐transfer‐active molecular gate, tetrafluoroterephthalonitrile (TFTN), converts this weak preference into highly selective recognition through competitive binding and solid‐state reorganization. The stronger‐binding 1,4‐dioxane displaces TFTN to open the gate and form a host–guest complex, whereas the weaker‐binding 1,3‐dioxane stabilizes a gated CT assembly that suppresses complexation. This gate‐controlled process couples selective recognition with switchable CT interactions, enabling vapochromic discrimination of dioxane isomers. Furthermore, sequential competitive binding enables dynamic regulation of solid‐state assemblies, including room‐temperature‐controlled guest release, and host recyclability. This work establishes molecular gating as a general and conceptually simple strategy for regulating selectivity and functionality in solid‐state macrocyclic host–guest systems.","tp":"分子门识别","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"在固态超分子化学中实现高选择性分子识别是重大挑战。研究提出\"分子门\"策略，通过大环主客体体系动态放大固有固态识别选择性。全乙基倾斜柱[6]芳烃（EtLP6）在固态下可同时容纳1,3-和1,4-二恶烷异构体，固有选择性有限。引入独立组分后，通过可逆主客体和电荷转移相互作用实现门控效应，显著提升异构体分离选择性。"},{"t":"建筑冷水机组与热泵系统建模方法：数字孪生应用背景下的系统性综述","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002849?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"热泵数字孪生","as":"","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Modeling methods for chiller and heat pump systems in buildings: A systematic review in the context of digital twin appl"},{"t":"矿物促进从生命前丰富的氨基酸水合成氰化氢，用于化学进化","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2515805123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Recent advances in prebiotic chemistry suggest that hydrogen cyanide (HCN) serves as a fundamental precursor for nearly all essential biomolecules and protometabolic processes for life’s emergence. Although prevailing models of endogenous cyanide production rely on atmospheric methane, the availability of methane remains uncertain. Unlike methane, amino acids were likely prebiotically abundant, forming through multiple synthetic pathways under a methane-free, nonreducing atmosphere. Here, we demonstrate that HCN can form from proteinogenic amino acids in anaerobic aqueous solutions facilitated by geochemically available minerals, offering a route to overcome HCN scarcity under a nonreducing atmosphere. On manganese dioxide, the glycine-to-cyanide conversion proceeded across a broad range of pHs (2.0 to 12.6) and substrate concentrations (1 μM to 100 mM), achieving a maximum selectivity of 57%. The reaction involves α-proton abstraction in amino acids, which is distinct from conventional chemical decarboxylation processes of amino acids, highlighting the unique role of MnO\n                    2\n                    in activating the α-C-H bond to form HCN. HCN generation was observed for nearly all proteinogenic amino acids and short peptides. Because amino acids can be synthesized from HCN-independent pathways from abundant carbon sources such as CO\n                    2\n                    and CO, amino acid-derived HCN alleviates the requirement on atmospheric methane and can sustain continued chemical evolution in ambient aqueous environments."},{"t":"米哈乌·奥西帕","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3791425?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"\"I chose chemistry as a career because I had an amazing teacher in middle school, and I enjoy the creative process of making new molecules (…) I advise my students to follow the literature beyond their research field, as the best ideas come from unexpected places (…)\" Find out more about Michał Ociepa in his Introducing… Profile."},{"t":"上皮细胞群主动润湿和流化的机制","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02553-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"观点评论","b":"Tissue-level phase transitions are emerging as a crucial mechanism in tumour development and metastasis. When becoming invasive, epithelial tumours undergo a transition from a solid-like state to a more fluid-like one. Although the contributions of cell adhesions, traction forces and cell migration for such behaviour are known, the exact biophysical and molecular mechanisms controlling these transitions are not fully understood. Here we show that breast cancer cell fluidity is regulated by IRSp53, a protein linking plasma membranes to the cytoskeleton. In both two-dimensional monolayers and three-dimensional spheroids, the depletion of IRSp53 increases fluidity and active wetting of the substrate due to a decrease in intercellular friction and enhanced local cell rearrangements. Molecularly, IRSp53 interacts with the junctional protein Afadin to control global tensile state and active wetting, establishing these proteins as key regulators of epithelial collectives’ viscosity in breast cancer tumouroids. In breast cancer patient samples, low IRSp53 expression levels and aberrant localization correlate with worse clinical outcomes. These findings support the broader relevance of IRSp53-regulated mechanics in epithelia and their potential prognostic value in cancer."},{"t":"保守细菌核糖体RNA甲基转移酶RsmI识别和修饰30S亚基的机制","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523453123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Ribosomal RNA (rRNA) modifications are important for ribosome function and can influence bacterial susceptibility to ribosome-targeting antibiotics. The universally conserved 16S rRNA nucleotide C1402, for example, is the only 2’-\n                    O\n                    -methylated nucleotide in the bacterial small (30S) ribosomal subunit and this modification fine-tunes the shape and structure of the peptidyl tRNA binding site. The Cm1402 modification is incorporated by the conserved bacterial 16S rRNA methyltransferase RsmI, but it is unclear how RsmI recognizes its 30S substrate and specifically modify its buried target nucleotide. We determined a 2.42 Å resolution cryo-EM structure of the RsmI–30S complex and, with accompanying functional analyses, show that RsmI anchors itself to the 30S subunit through multiple contacts with a conserved 16S rRNA surface previously only seen in the assembled subunit. This positions RsmI to bind a h44 conformation that is substantially reorganized compared to its structure in the mature 30S subunit allowing access to C1402. These analyses also reveal an essential contribution to 30S subunit interaction made by the previously structurally uncharacterized RsmI C-terminal domain, RsmI-induced RNA–RNA interactions with C1402, and an unappreciated dependence on a divalent metal ion for activity that suggests RsmI may be a member of a distinct class of metal- and SAM-dependent RNA\n                    O\n                    -methyltransferases. This study significantly expands our mechanistic understanding of how intrinsic bacterial methyltransferases like RsmI modify their rRNA targets. Further, recognition of distant ribosome features and reorganization of a critical rRNA functional center point to a potential role in accurate 30S subunit biogenesis."},{"t":"基于Matrimid的工程化超微孔不对称碳分子筛中空纤维用于精密氦气分离","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6271309?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳分子筛氦分离","kp":["[膜结构]: Matrimid基不对称碳分子筛中空纤维","[孔径工程]: 超微孔工程化","[分离目标]: He/CH4高选择性分离"],"dp":1,"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究以Matrimid聚合物为前驱体，制备了具有工程化超微孔的非对称碳分子筛中空纤维膜，用于氦气/甲烷的高精度分离。氦气回收对能源和工业应用具有重要战略意义，但He/CH4的高效分离极具挑战。该中空纤维膜通过精确调控超微孔径实现氦气的高选择性透过，在气体分离领域展现出优异性能和应用前景。","ot":"Matrimid‐Derived Asymmetric Carbon Molecular Sieve Hollow Fibers With Engineered Ultramicropores for Precise Helium Sepa","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Helium/methane (He/CH\n                    4\n                    ) separation is of strategic importance for energy and industrial applications, yet it remains technically challenging due to the need to simultaneously achieve ultrahigh selectivity and helium productivity. In this work, we report ultraselective Matrimid‐derived asymmetric carbon molecular sieve (CMS) hollow fibers in which ultramicropore and fiber geometry are deliberately co‐engineered to enable precise He/CH\n                    4\n                    separation with high He productivity at the module level. We showed that pyrolysis temperature tuning tightens ångström‐scale ultramicropores and enhances He/CH\n                    4\n                    discrimination; while a targeted post‐pyrolysis hyperaging enables selective refining of the ultramicropores, thereby offering high He permeance with exceptional He/CH\n                    4\n                    selectivity. For a 5/95 He/CH\n                    4\n                    mixed gas feed, the hyperaged CMS‐700 hollow fibers achieve permeate helium purities of up to 98.6% with He/CH\n                    4\n                    selectivities exceeding 1300 and a stable He permeance of approximately 26 GPU. Beyond this material achievement, fiber geometry optimization through reduction of the outer diameter was achieved to increase the packable membrane area without compromising mechanical integrity or intrinsic separation performance, leading to enhanced module‐level He productivity. This integrated co‐engineering strategy provides an energy‐efficient and industrially viable platform for He recovery and is readily extendable to other challenging small/large gas‐pair separations.","aip":1},{"t":"海洋生物是武装冲突的无声牺牲品","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00942-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"锰催化脂肪醇直接胺化制备伯胺","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2797925?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锰催化胺化","kp":["[催化剂]: 锰催化","[反应]: 脂肪醇直接转氨化制伯胺"],"dp":1,"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"二维有机分子晶体向三维集成的垂直异质结构构建是分子电子学的关键挑战。研究提出通过层内介导策略实现二维有机分子晶体的垂直组装，构建三维集成结构。该方法具有分子级可编程性，为新型有机半导体器件、垂直电路架构和功能异质结材料的设计提供了可行路径。","ot":"Manganese‐Catalyzed Direct Transamination of Aliphatic Alcohols to Primary Amines","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Aliphatic primary amines serve as essential precursors for pharmaceuticals, fine chemicals, and functional materials. However, conventional synthetic methods for these amines typically involve tedious multi‐step processes with suboptimal efficiency and cost‐effectiveness. Direct amination of readily available alcohols to access primary amines is highly appealing but remains challenging. Herein, we report a manganese‐catalyzed transamination of alcohols using commercially available benzylamine as the amination reagent. The protocol demonstrates broad substrate compatibility and excellent selectivity toward aliphatic primary amines even at low catalyst loadings, up to 1.1×10\n                    6\n                    TON could be achieved. Mechanistic studies reveal that bases play crucial roles in achieving excellent selectivity, in which\n                    t\n                    BuOK facilitates imine intermediate rearrangement and KOH acts as a nucleophile to promote imine bond cleavage, thus enabling the formation of desired primary amines instead of conventional\n                    N\n                    ‐alkylated secondary amines."},{"t":"锰基质子储库触发质子转移效应实现超高容量水系锌离子电池","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202508780?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锰基质子储库","kp":["[正极材料]: MnO2","[机制]: 质子库触发质子分流效应","[关键障碍]: ZSH副产物覆盖正极、H+占活性位"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出一种基于锰的质子储库策略，通过诱导质子分流效应（proton diversion effect）来提升水系锌离子电池的容量。MnO₂作为主流锰基正极材料已广泛应用于水系锌离子电池，但其容量受限于质子的嵌入/脱出效率。研究通过设计锰基质子储库结构，引导质子在充放电过程中沿特定路径分流，有效抑制了锰溶解和副反应，从而实现超高容量输出。该策略为水系锌离子电池正极材料的改性提供了新思路，有望推动大规模储能应用。","ot":"Manganese‐Based Proton Reservoir Trigger Proton Diversion Effect for Ultrahigh‐Capacity Aqueous Zinc‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    MnO\n                    2\n                    , a prominent manganese‐based cathode material, has been used extensively in aqueous zinc‐ion batteries (ZIBs). However, Zn\n                    2+\n                    intercalation in MnO\n                    2\n                    faces multiple obstacles, primarily due to the electrostatic interaction between Zn\n                    2+\n                    and the skeleton, the coverage of by‐product Zn\n                    4\n                    SO\n                    4\n                    (OH)\n                    6\n                    ·xH\n                    2\n                    O (ZSH) on the cathode, and the preferential occupation by H\n                    +\n                    of the active sites. Here, we introduce MnOOH into K\n                    +\n                    ‐doped α‐MnO\n                    2\n                    (KMO) to produce an ultrahigh‐capacity KMO‐MnOOH cathode. The MnOOH can transform into the active material β‐MnO\n                    2\n                    via the in situ release of protons. The β‐MnO\n                    2\n                    with the 1\n                    *\n                    1 tunnel structure shows the strong adsorption for H\n                    +\n                    and unique tunnels that allow for rapid migration of H\n                    +\n                    , resulting in the diversion of protons originally intercalated into KMO. This “proton diversion effect” leads to sufficient active sites in KMO that accelerate Zn\n                    2+\n                    transport kinetics. The released protons from MnOOH can reduce the by‐products ZSH, facilitating rapid Zn\n                    2+\n                    migration and deep Zn\n                    2+\n                    intercalation. Accordingly, the KMO‐MnOOH cathode exhibits an ultrahigh specific capacity (645.6 mA h g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.3 A g\n                    −1\n                    ) and an excellent cycling stability (239.3 mA h g\n                    −1\n                    at 2 A g\n                    −1\n                    after 950 cycles). This work provides new insights into the regulation of H\n                    +\n                    /Zn\n                    2+\n                    intercalation for high‐performance Zn//MnO\n                    2\n                    batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"埋藏界面原子尺度反铁磁序的磁圆二色成像","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02134-z","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磁圆二色成像","kp":["[成像对象]: 埋藏界面原子级反铁磁序","[技术挑战]: 反铁磁净磁化为零致MCD信号极弱"],"as":"本研究利用电子或X射线磁圆二色性（MCD）技术，实现了对原子尺度反铁磁序的直接成像。该方法突破传统磁成像分辨率极限，为研究复杂反铁磁材料中的微观磁结构提供了强有力的实验工具，对自旋电子学器件设计与新型反铁磁材料开发具有重要指导意义。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Magnetic circular dichroism imaging of atomic-scale antiferromagnetic order at a buried interface","b":"Magnetic circular dichroism utilizing electrons or X-rays serves as a powerful tool for the investigation of magnetism in ferromagnets, but antiferromagnets pose a severe challenge to the technique due to their vanishing net magnetization. Although transmission electron microscopy has demonstrated the atomic-scale characterization of antiferromagnetism using elastically scattered electrons, separating the weak magnetic signal from the dominant electrostatic background remains challenging, and applicability is largely limited to perfect crystals. Here we develop atomic-column-resolved electron magnetic circular dichroism to resolve antiferromagnetic order using a scanning transmission electron microscope. By exploiting chirality around individual magnetic atomic columns, we localize the magnetic circular dichroism signals around the transmitted electron beam with enhanced strength and signal-to-noise ratio, enabling atomic-column magnetic measurements. Applying this technique to antiferromagnets, we not only distinguish the characteristic G-type and C-type antiferromagnetic orderings in DyFeO3 and α-Fe2O3 but also identify a one-unit-cell-thick magnetic dead layer at the buried DyScO3–SmFeO3 interface. Our work establishes a readily accessible method for atomic-scale magnetic order mapping, with potential applications in fields such as interfacial magnetism, topological magnetism, antiferromagnetism and altermagnetism."},{"t":"局部稀释电解质实现高面积容量水系Zn-I2凝胶电池用于长时储能","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00039-5?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碘锌凝胶电池","kp":["电解质[水系Zn-I₂凝胶电池]: 局部稀释电解质","电极厚度[Zn-I₂凝胶电池]: 毫米级厚电极","[溶剂化工程]: 空间调控溶剂化结构维持快速离子传输"],"as":"研究提出局部稀释电解质策略，通过降低粘稠电解质中的离子传输阻力，使厚电极在水系锌-碘凝胶电池中实现高面容量。该方法有效解决了长时储能中厚电极离子扩散缓慢的瓶颈，显著提升了电池的能量密度与循环寿命，为大规模安全储能提供了新路径。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Locally diluted electrolytes enable high-areal-capacity aqueous Zn–I2 gel batteries for long-duration energy storage","b":"Thick electrodes are essential for long-duration energy storage but are often limited by slow ion transport in viscous electrolytes. This work introduces localized diluted electrolytes, which spatially engineer solvation environments to sustain rapid ionic transport in a mechanically constrained gel. Applied to a Zn–I₂ gel battery, this strategy enables millimeter-thick electrodes with high areal capacity and stable long-duration cycling.","aip":1},{"t":"短期电力需求预测与可解释AI的结合：建筑能源应用综述","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003107?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电力负荷预测","kp":["[综述]: 短期电力需求预测与可解释AI结合"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":2.5},"ot":"Linking short-term electricity demand forecasting and explainable AI: A review for building energy applications"},{"t":"基于聚集诱导发光体的大规模高效可见透明发光太阳能聚光器","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523640?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"荧光太阳能聚光器","kp":["[发光材料]: AIE发光体(ESIPT特性)","[器件]: 可见透明荧光聚光器LSC","[性能优势]: 抑制重吸收+最大化PLQY"],"as":"该研究开发了大规模、高效且可见光透明的发光太阳能聚光器（LSC）。作为传统光伏技术的低成本互补方案，该器件在保持高光学效率的同时实现了良好的透明性，可集成于建筑窗户等场景，为建筑一体化光伏的规模化应用开辟了新途径。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Large‐Scale, Highly Efficient, and Visibly Transparent Luminescent Solar Concentrators Based on A.I.E. Luminogens","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Luminescent solar concentrators (LSCs) represent a promising, cost‐effective complement to traditional photovoltaic systems. In this study, aggregation‐induced emission luminogens (AIEgens) exhibiting excited‐state intramolecular proton transfer (ESIPT) characteristics were synthesized to suppress reabsorption and maximize photoluminescence quantum yields (PLQY) in the aggregated state. Spectroscopic investigations and theoretical simulations elucidated the underlying luminescence mechanism. Consequently, colorless LSCs based on the optimized AIEgen,\n                    3ANT‐HBT\n                    , achieved a power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 0.5% with 99% average visible transmittance (AVT). This performance approaches the theoretical limit (PCE = 0.68%) for an ideal UV‐harvesting device. More importantly, high efficiency was preserved over large areas (&gt;400 cm\n                    2\n                    ) with negligible self‐absorption. This study demonstrates that integrating AIE and ESIPT is a promising strategy for developing efficient, scalable, and visually transparent solar harvesting technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"与 KLF3 相反，KLF2 会覆盖常驻记忆 CD8 T 细胞分化程序","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2533700123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Numerous transcriptional regulators have been associated with the differentiation pathways that lead to recirculating vs. tissue-resident memory T cells. However, it is unclear whether independent, coordinated expression of these regulators is required to determine residency vs. recirculation or whether there is a hierarchy, with some factors playing a dominant role in controlling T cell trafficking. We report that ablation of the gene encoding Kruppel-like factor 2 (KLF2) during CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell activation leads to rapid transcriptional reprogramming, such that effector T cells fail to recirculate and prematurely acquire canonical phenotypic and transcriptional characteristics of resident memory cells (T\n                    RM\n                    ).\n                    Klf2\n                    -deficient memory CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells retained the capacity to undergo recall responses, including in vivo pathogen control. These data suggest that KLF2 diverts CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells from the T\n                    RM\n                    differentiation program. In contrast, ablation of another member of the KLF family, KLF3, enhanced differentiation of some recirculating T cell subsets and limited production of T\n                    RM\n                    in lymphoid tissues. However, both KLF2 and KLF3 were required for differentiation of long-lived effector cells, suggesting cooperation between these factors in some situations. These findings indicate that KLFs occupy a central nexus in coordinating activated CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell differentiation and trafficking."},{"t":"孤立Anderson型团簇经氢气还原催化CO2低温加氢制甲醇","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02104-x","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2加氢制甲醇","kp":["催化剂[CO2加氢制甲醇]: Anderson型PtMo6O24团簇","[活化处理]: H2还原孤立Anderson团簇","[反应条件]: 低温CO2加氢"],"as":"研究采用分离及氢气还原的Anderson型多金属氧酸盐簇合物作为催化剂，实现了CO2低温加氢制甲醇。该催化剂在较低温度下展现出优异的催化活性与选择性，为构建可持续碳资源闭环利用体系提供了高效催化方案，对CO2资源化转化具有重要价值。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Isolated and H2-reduced Anderson clusters catalyse low-temperature hydrogenation of CO2 to methanol","b":"CO2 hydrogenation, especially to methanol, is crucial to establishing sustainable closed-loop systems for carbon utilization. However, the difficulties of CO2 activation at low temperatures and the ambiguity of structure–activity correlations are obstacles to reducing the energy consumption of the hydrogenation process. Here we report that molecularly defined Anderson PtMo6O24 clusters, sited within a robust metal–organic framework, are catalytic for low-temperature CO2 hydrogenation. The performance of the cluster showed no signs of decay in either its activity or methanol selectivity over 3,600 h at 180 °C. It also achieves a per-pass yield exceeding that of state-of-the-art heterogeneous catalysts under similar conditions. Combined in situ spectroscopy and density functional theory calculations demonstrated that CH3OH formation is dominated by the reverse water–gas shift and subsequent CO* hydrogenation pathway, while the HCOO* pathway may serve as a supplementary route. The well-defined cluster structure offers an ideal model for elucidating structure–activity correlations and opens exciting avenues for the rational design of high-activity, low-temperature catalysts for CO2 hydrogenation."},{"t":"界面位点工程通过加速去质子化最小化阳极能量损失以实现高效太阳能转化","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9797893?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能制氢","kp":["[界面工程]: 不对称Ir-O-Ni界面位点","[机制]: 加速去质子化降低阳极能损","[目标]: 高效太阳能制氢STH"],"as":"该研究通过界面位点工程加速析氧反应动力学，有效降低太阳能驱动水分解中的阳极能量损失，从而提升太阳能到氢气（STH）的整体转换效率。该策略为高效光催化/光电化学制氢体系的阳极优化提供了新思路，推动可再生能源存储技术发展。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interfacial Sites Engineering Minimizes Anodic Energy Loss Through Accelerated Deprotonation for High‐Efficiency Solar‐t","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving efficient solar‐to‐hydrogen (STH) conversion is essential for renewable energy storage, yet solar‐driven water splitting remains fundamentally limited by energy losses associated with the anodic oxygen evolution reaction (OER). Herein, we deliberately combine Ir species with a NiFe model electrocatalyst to construct asymmetric Ir–O–Ni interfacial sites that optimize anodic reaction energetics. In situ spectroscopic analyses combined with theoretical calculations reveal that, in contrast to pristine NiFe operating\n                    via\n                    the conventional adsorbate evolution mechanism, the Ir–O–Ni interfacial sites directly participate in OER by lowering the *OOH deprotonation barrier and facilitating rapid proton transfer under alkaline conditions. Meanwhile, strong Ir–O orbital coupling stabilizes O‐containing intermediates, thereby reducing the O–O bond formation barrier from 3.21 eV in pristine NiFe to 1.40 eV in NiFe‐Ir. Consequently, NiFe‐Ir delivers a low overpotential of 300 mV at a high current density of 500 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , corresponding to a 43.3% reduction in energy consumption compared to NiFe (430 mV). Importantly, the substantially reduced anodic energy dissipation translates directly into enhanced device‐level performance, enabling the integrated photovoltaic‐electrolyzer system to achieve an exceptional STH conversion efficiency of 19.7%. These results underscore interfacial engineering as a powerful and generalizable strategy for advancing practical solar water‐splitting technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"界面声子散射实现含合金负极的超稳定高功率钠基双离子电池","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72848?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠基双离子电池","kp":["[界面策略]: 晶面工程实现声子散射耗散应变能","负极[钠基双离子电池]: 合金型负极"],"as":"本研究利用界面声子散射机制，显著提升了合金化负极钠基双离子电池的循环稳定性与功率密度。该策略有效缓解了合金负极在充放电过程中的体积膨胀问题，为实现高能量密度、长寿命钠离子储能器件提供了关键性的界面调控方案。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interfacial Phonon Scattering Enables Ultrastable and High‐Power Sodium‐Based Dual‐Ion Batteries With Alloying Anodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Alloying anodes offer a compelling route to high‐energy sodium‐based dual‐ion batteries (SDIBs), yet their repeated volume change accumulates destructive strain energy that rapidly degrades the electrode. Conventional interfacial designs often dissipate this energy through damage‐prone processes (e.g., cracking or delamination), which accelerates failure. Herein, we report a crystal‐plane friction interface (CPFI) strategy that enables a fundamentally different, low‐damage dissipation pathway. By embedding layered Na\n                    +\n                    ‐substituted\n                    α\n                    ‐zirconium phosphate (NZrP) nanoparticles into a polymer matrix, we construct a robust interface on Sn anode as a proof of concept. The accumulated strain energy is relieved through facile sliding between the NZrP (002) planes, which convert mechanical work into thermal phonons. In situ stress measurements confirm a 99.1% reduction in strain energy density, directly quantifying the efficacy of this mechanism. Meanwhile, Na\n                    +\n                    substitution in NZrP facilitates rapid Na\n                    +\n                    transport, achieving a substantial ∼65% reduction in interfacial impedance. Consequently, the Sn@CPFI anode enables SDIB full cells that retain over 80% capacity over 3500 cycles at 5C and deliver 90.1% capacity retention at 40C, significantly outperforming conventional counterparts. A practical pouch cell further validates this approach. This work establishes crystal‐plane sliding as a general mechanism for managing strain energy, opening a pathway to durable batteries with high‐volume‐change electrodes.","aip":1},{"t":"无机磷酸盐与神经元代谢能量的快速动员","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602529123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Neurons experience brief, intense periods of energy demand when they are excited, but how they rapidly coordinate energy expenditure with production is incompletely understood. Part of the difficulty has been measuring the levels of molecules involved in this metabolic response with spatiotemporal precision in single live cells. Here, we engineered a quantitative fluorescent biosensor to monitor cytosolic inorganic phosphate (P\n                    i\n                    ), a fundamental component of energy metabolism that has a classically proposed but largely neglected role in activating glycolysis. Using two-photon fluorescence lifetime imaging, we observed millimolar increases in P\n                    i\n                    within seconds of stimulating mouse neurons both ex vivo and in vivo. Drawing on results from metabolic modeling, biosensor imaging, and enzymology, we argue that P\n                    i\n                    is a sensitive reporter of energy usage that potently links metabolic energy supply with demand in neurons. Quantitative live-cell imaging of P\n                    i\n                    should be a valuable approach for studying bioenergetics more generally."},{"t":"行业发展信号下的新能源创新投资：利用LLM me捕捉政策和市场信号","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001898?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"新能源投资","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"TRIM 介导的 SUMO 化抑制冠状病毒外切核糖核酸酶活性","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528398123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Members of the TRIM E3 ligase family are effectors of the host innate or intrinsic defense against various viruses; however, how specific TRIM proteins antagonize coronavirus infection is still largely elusive. Through an RNAi screen targeting 71 human TRIM genes, we identified multiple TRIM proteins with antiviral or proviral activity against SARS-CoV-2. TRIM32 potently restricted SARS-CoV-2 replication in a RING E3 ligase-dependent but interferon-independent manner. Mechanistically, TRIM32 binds to and SUMOylates the 3′‐to‐5′ exoribonuclease (ExoN) of Nsp14, an enzyme essential for SARS-CoV-2 replication. TRIM32-mediated Nsp14 SUMOylation at K9 and K200 inhibits RNA binding and Nsp10 cofactor recruitment, respectively, ultimately suppressing ExoN activity. Our study further revealed that Nsp14 SUMOylation by TRIM32 and its antiviral activity are broadly conserved for coronaviruses. These results identify the coronaviral Nsp14 protein as a direct target of host restriction via SUMOylation, which may uncover ways to therapeutically inhibit coronavirus infections in humans."},{"t":"印度农村能源转型：各邦清洁能源采用情况村级调查汇总的证据","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600396X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源清洁化","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"传感器内加密签名生成，用于链接物理过程和不可变的数字实体","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01593-5","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Electronics","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Data forgery and manipulation can undermine trust in areas ranging from science to journalism. Artificial intelligence will probably exacerbate this problem, degrading our ability to distinguish between artificially created data and real recordings (such as those taken with a video camera). Here we report a recording device technology that establishes a cryptographic link between a physical process (the act of recording) and an immutable digital entity (such as an entry in a public blockchain). Our approach relies on a monolithic cryptographic sensor that integrates a sensor device with a hashing unit (that continuously hashes pieces of recorded data) and a cryptographic signature unit (that signs the hashes using a public key encryption scheme). The system then uploads the signed hashes to a trusted public repository. We provide a proof-of-concept implementation with a voltage sensor for extracellular recording of cardiac myocyte field potentials that is fabricated using 180-nm complementary metal–oxide–semiconductor technology.","tp":"传感器加密","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"数据伪造和篡改正侵蚀从科学到新闻领域的信任基础，AI技术可能加剧这一问题。研究团队开发了一种记录设备技术，能在物理过程（录制行为本身）与不可篡改的数字实体（如公有链上的记录）之间建立密码学链接。该技术通过传感器内加密签名生成，确保数据从采集到存储的全链路可验证性和不可伪造性，对抗AI生成内容的混淆。","aip":1},{"t":"基于忆阻器芯片的原位光谱重建用于节能计算光谱测量","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01571-x","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"忆阻器计算光谱","kp":["[硬件平台]: 忆阻器芯片","[功能]: 原位光谱重建实现低能耗计算光谱"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究基于忆阻器芯片实现了原位光谱重建，用于高能效计算光谱仪。传统计算光谱仪依赖重构算法从传感器原始数据中解码光谱信息，计算量大且能效低。该忆阻器方案利用器件本征的非线性调控特性，在硬件层面直接执行光谱重构计算，大幅降低了功耗和延迟。该工作为微型化、低功耗光谱检测在物联网和便携式传感中的应用开辟了新路径。","ot":"In situ spectral reconstruction based on a memristor chip for energy-efficient computational spectrometry","b":"Computational spectrometers, which rely on reconstruction algorithms to decode spectral information from raw sensor data, are of potential use in portable, in-field spectrometry. However, research on such systems primarily focuses on the front-end encoding devices, and back-end decoding hardware remains limited by severe overheads. Here we report an in situ computational spectrometer implemented on a fully integrated 576-Kb memristor chip. With systematic robustness analysis, we develop memristive regularization and filter embedding strategies to overcome the extreme sensitivity of ill-posed spectral reconstruction, achieving software-equivalent accuracy. System-level benchmarking shows that our hardware takes only 125.0 ns to reconstruct one spectrum consuming 6.7 nJ of energy, which is 26.5 times faster and 162.7 times more energy-efficient than state-of-the-art computational spectrometers. Our work illustrates the potential of memristor-chip-based computational spectrometry and provides approaches for efficiently implementing signal processing algorithms on memristor chips.","aip":1},{"t":"本期","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/iti1226123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"将镧系发光体植入螺旋骨架实现可编程圆偏振发光","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9901177?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"将无手性发光体嵌入手性超分子螺旋支架中，实现可编程圆偏振发光（CPL）。该方法通过空间组装策略将稀土（镧系）发光中心引入螺旋骨架，显著增强发光不对称因子，为手性光电材料、量子信息及生物成像领域提供了新型发光平台的设计思路。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镧系圆偏振发光材料","kp":["[策略]: 超分子螯合植入螺旋骨架","[目标]: 可编程圆偏振发光"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Implanting Lanthanide Luminophores Into Helical Scaffolds for Programmable Circularly Polarized Luminescence","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Integrating achiral luminophores into chiral supramolecular helices represents a promising route to strong circularly polarized luminescence (CPL). However, for lanthanide systems, efficient emitter loading and effective chirality induction remain challenging due to weak host–guest interactions and the shielded nature of 4f electrons. Herein, we report a supramolecular chelation strategy that implants Eu\n                    3+\n                    emitters into pre‑assembled helical nanoribbons (HNRs), enabling efficient chirality induction and tunable CPL brightness. Two cholesterol–terpyridine conjugates, differing only in their linker chemistry (ester vs. carbonate), demonstrate that the ester linker promotes long‑range chirality induction and HNR formation, whereas the carbonate counterpart yields achiral aggregates. Moreover, the assembly sequence is crucial: pre‑formation of the helical scaffold preserves the non‑covalent network necessary for effective chirality induction, whereas prior metal coordination introduces steric hindrance that disrupts chiral order. The resulting systems exhibit orthogonal luminescence responses: Eu\n                    3+\n                    ‑loaded assemblies are humidity‑sensitive but thermally stable, while\n                    β\n                    ‑diketonate‑shielded analogues are temperature‑responsive yet humidity‑resistant, allowing multi‑level information encryption. By introducing this modular “assemble‑then‑coordinate” approach, we provide new insights into supramolecular chirality induction and open avenues toward advanced, stimulus‑responsive CPL materials."},{"t":"锂离子电池电极级老化诊断的阻抗表征：批判性综述","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003880?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锂电池阻抗诊断","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Impedance characterization for electrode-level aging diagnosis of lithium-ion battery: A critical review"},{"t":"识别癌症治疗靶点：Cell-SELEX 识别用于适体介导的生长抑制的膜蛋白","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514681123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The identification of functional ligand-membrane protein interactions under native conditions remains a major challenge in cancer biology. Using cell-systematic evolution of ligands by exponential enrichment, we identified a high-affinity DNA aptamer, CW06, against breast cancer cells. To precisely identify its native membrane target, we developed Aptamer-mediated Metabolic Glycan-labeling Proximity Hybridization (Apt-MGPH), which revealed the mitochondrial solute carrier SLC25A24 as the specific target. Unexpectedly, CW06 treatment upregulated SLC25A24 expression, disrupting methionine metabolism, depleting cytosolic SAM, and inducing G1 cell cycle arrest and senescence via the p21–HMGA1 axis. In mouse xenograft models, CW06 significantly inhibited tumor growth without affecting healthy tissues. Targeted degradation of SLC25A24 reverses these effects, confirming its regulatory role in the metabolism–senescence axis. Our study establishes Apt-MGPH as a robust tool for membrane target identification and highlights aptamer-induced target overexpression as a strategy for cancer therapy."},{"t":"氢键有机框架用于NADH再生与酶催化加氢：HOF-in-HOF人工光合作用","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8868255?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢键有机框架人工光合","kp":["[框架材料]: 氢键有机框架HOF-in-HOF","[仿生系统]: 酶-光-膜耦合人工光合","[功能]: NADH再生与酶促加氢"],"dp":1,"as":"利用氢键有机框架（HOFs）实现NADH再生与酶催化氢化反应。通过调控催化剂与辅酶的时空分布，提升人工光合作用效率，为太阳能驱动的仿生能量转化与绿色化学合成提供了高效多孔材料平台。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Hydrogen‐Bonded Organic Frameworks (HOFs) for NADH Regeneration and Enzymatic Hydrogenation: HOF‐in‐HOF Artificial Photo","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The efficiency of artificial photosynthesis lies not only in the catalysts themselves, but also in the spatiotemporal landscape for efficient mass–energy coupling, which is governed by electron, proton, and molecule transfer. Herein, we propose a scaffold engineering strategy to construct an enzyme–photo–membrane coupled artificial photosynthetic system (\n                    epm\n                    CAPS) within HOF‐in‐HOF architecture for NADH regeneration and enzymatic hydrogenation, where enzyme‐loaded HOF particles for substrate conversion are encapsulated within photocatalytic HOF capsular membranes for cofactor regeneration. This unique configuration enables independent and synergistic regulation of electron, proton, and NADH transfer by modulating the electronic structure of the capsule (via benzene ring units), proton relay (via carboxylate group density), and mass diffusion path (via enzyme–photocatalyst distance), respectively. The system achieves a record initial NADH regeneration rate of 28.23 ± 0.62 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    with a 22.13% apparent quantum yield. When applied to solar‐driven lactate synthesis, the\n                    epm\n                    CAPS achieves a solar‐to‐chemical conversion efficiency of 7.27 ± 0.34%—a nearly threefold higher than previous records. Furthermore, we demonstrate the generality of this platform by synthesizing a spectrum of C\n                    1\n                    –C\n                    6\n                    chemicals, including methanol and mannitol, while maintaining stable operation for over 6 h. Our work delivers a blueprint for the next‐generation artificial photosynthetic systems for sustainable energy and green chemical production.","aip":1},{"t":"火炬气制氢：将排放转化为能源的双重机遇——前瞻性综述","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"火炬气制氢","kp":["[主题]: 火炬气制氢(排放转能源)"],"as":"","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":2.5},"ot":"Hydrogen production from flare gas: a dual opportunity to turn emissions into energy - a prospective review"},{"t":"氢原子转移诱导羰基多共振TADF发光体的光降解","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2490607?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"研究揭示氮/羰基（N/C=O）多共振热活化延迟荧光（MR-TADF）发光材料中，氢原子转移（HAT）是引发光降解的关键机制。该发现解释了这类新型OLED发光体的稳定性瓶颈，为通过分子结构设计抑制光降解、提升器件寿命指明了方向。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MR-TADF发光材料","kp":["三重态收集效率[tDiKTa]: 1%","[分子策略]: 叔丁基包裹DiKTa核心调控电荷转移","[发射体类型]: N/C═O多共振TADF"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Hydrogen Atom Transfer Induces Photodegradation in Carbonyl‐Based Multi‐Resonance TADF Emitters","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Nitrogen/carbonyl (N/C═O) based multi‐resonant thermally activated delayed fluorescence (MR‐TADF) emitters are attractive due to their narrowband delayed emission. Here, four MR‐TADF emitters were developed by sterically wrapping a\n                    tert\n                    ‐butylated DiKTa core. Through modulation of short‐range and through‐space charge transfer, triplet harvesting efficiency was boosted from 1% in\n                    tDiKTa\n                    to 52% in\n                    tDiKTa‐GCz\n                    (\n                    k\n                    RISC\n                     = 1.37 × 10\n                    6\n                     s\n                    −1\n                    ) in degassed toluene. Surprisingly, however, these improvements were accompanied by rapid photodegradation, while that same degradation was not observed in toluene under air. Our studies revealed that triplet excited states trigger hydrogen‐atom transfer (HAT) from the solvent to the carbonyl group of the emitter, leading to fast, irreversible chemical change. Moreover, this phenomenon was found to be general for several previously published MR‐TADF compounds. Using natural population analysis and bond dissociation energies, we show that the electrophilicity of the donor hydrogen atom governs the observed reactivity. This work uncovers a previously unrecognized photochemical vulnerability in N/C═O MR‐TADF systems, and suggests that researchers studying them must be aware of their sensitivity toward HAT‐induced photodegradation. We also call for a careful re‐examination of published data on these compounds, as even brief exposure to light was sufficient to cause observable degradation in certain solvents."},{"t":"水动力空化作用从 H2O 和 CO2 形成益生元核糖","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag182/8537775?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"H2O and CO2 are considered as fundamental precursors for the prebiotic formation of biomolecules. Their conversion to biomolecules under early Earth conditions is critical for understanding origin of life. However, direct formation from these simple compounds remains unverified, leaving the mechanistic role of H2O unresolved. Herein, we demonstrate ribose synthesis from H2O and CO2 under prebiotic conditions via"},{"t":"混合二价锰卤化物凝胶薄膜用于荧光寿命温度传感","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72878?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"荧光寿命测温","kp":["传感材料[荧光寿命测温]: Mn(II)基杂化卤化物凝胶膜","[传感机制]: 荧光寿命随温度变化"],"as":"开发基于锰(II)卤化物杂化凝胶薄膜的荧光寿命温度传感材料。通过监测温度依赖的发光寿命变化实现高精度温度测量，凝胶薄膜形态兼具柔性与可加工性，在微电子器件、生物医学测温等领域的非接触式温度检测中具有应用潜力。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Hybrid Mn(II)‐Based Halides Gel Films for Fluorescence Lifetime‐Based Temperature Sensing","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Sensing temperature using fluorescent materials by monitoring alterations in temperature‐dependent luminescence characteristics is of great importance for various application fields, including modern industry, scientific research, and daily life. However, there are two main concerns on optical thermometry, and one is the low sensitivity, particularly at elevated temperatures, failing to meet precise measurement demands; another issue is how we can apply the thermometry in in situ environments. Herein, we design and report a hybrid manganese‐based halide thermometry exhibiting a relative sensitivity (S\n                    r\n                    ) of 26.368% K\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 463 K. We further propose a facile synthesis method for photopolymerizable hydrogel films containing the crystallized manganese‐based halide thermometry, maintaining the same luminescence and sensing property. The luminescent gel film is applied to chip‐based temperature sensing, demonstrating highly accurate performances as smart sensors and flexible electronic materials. This work opens up a new route to design luminescent metal halide thermometry to enrich the library of temperature sensing. Moreover, the luminescent gel film as optical thermometry can be applied in situ from micro‐electronics to large‐scale industrial systems, supplying new possibilities for advanced sensing and spectroscopy studies."},{"t":"伊朗战争如何重塑能源格局","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00932-y","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"战争与能源","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":8.0},"as":""},{"t":"2025 年 NIH 资助终止情况如何因研究人员的人口群体而异","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527755123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"In early 2025, the NIH unexpectedly terminated 2,291 active research grants, withdrawing $2.45 billion and disrupting thousands of projects. While the economic magnitude of these cuts is known, less is understood about how they differed across researchers’ demographic groups. Using an original dataset of publicly available records, we documented how cancelations varied by gender and career stage. Although cuts occurred across all regions and institution types, statistical patterns show that early-career investigators—assistant professors, postdoctoral scholars, trainees, and graduate students—were disproportionately affected, as were women. Women’s projects were smaller on average, had a larger share of unspent funds at cancelation, and were more concentrated in training and transition awards. Although available data cannot determine downstream causal effects, NIH economic multipliers suggest a potentially large unrealized loss to the US research enterprise. These patterns highlight the vulnerability of early-career researchers and women to abrupt funding instability and underscore the need for sustained investment to protect the future scientific workforce."},{"t":"印度各邦在电力脱碳方面表现如何？地方层面基于消费的分解分析","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001473?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电力脱碳分析","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"泥土中的 DNA 如何撼动人类起源研究","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00879-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"霍夫迈斯特效应辅助水凝胶：下一代功能材料的合理工程化设计","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00041-X?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"观点评论","tp":"霍夫迈斯特水凝胶","kp":["[调控原理]: 霍夫迈斯特效应(离子特异性)","[材料]: 智能响应水凝胶"],"dp":1,"sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":2.5},"as":"本综述系统阐述了Hofmeister效应（离液序列效应）作为离子特异性工具编程下一代水凝胶的原理与应用。通过合理调控离子-聚合物相互作用，可精确调控水凝胶的力学性能、溶胀行为和功能特性，在柔性电子、药物递送和组织工程等前沿领域展现出巨大潜力。","ot":"Hofmeister effect-assisted hydrogels: Rational engineering for next-generation functional materials","b":"This review highlights the Hofmeister effect as a powerful, ion-specific tool to program next-generation hydrogels. By rationally selecting ions, researchers can dynamically tune mechanical, electrical, and environmental resistance properties without relying on static chemical crosslinks. These advances enable intelligent, adaptive hydrogels for emerging applications in iontronics, biomedicine, and sustainable engineering, bridging fundamental colloid science with the design of high-performance, multifunctional soft materials."},{"t":"氮化镓中的高迁移率空穴及其量子振荡","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01590-8","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","b":"Gallium nitride (GaN) is used in solid-state lighting and in high-performance radio frequency and power electronics. However, due to inefficient hole doping and low hole mobility, quantum oscillations in p-type GaN have not been observed, which limits studies of valence bands and hole transport engineering. Here we report high hole mobilities in a polarization-induced two-dimensional hole gas at a gallium nitride/aluminium nitride interface. The holes degenerately occupy two valence bands of GaN—the light-hole and heavy-hole bands—and have mobilities of 2,000 cm2 V−1 s−1 and 400 cm2 V−1 s−1 at 2 K, respectively. We use Shubnikov–de Haas oscillations of holes from both valence bands to extract their respective sheet densities and quantum scattering times and the effective masses of light holes and heavy holes. The hole mobilities of our heterostructure highlight the possibility of developing cryogenic GaN complementary metal–oxide–semiconductor technology with potential applications in quantum computing control electronics.","tp":"氮化镓量子振荡","sc":8.5,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":4.0,"r":8.0,"d":8.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"氮化镓（GaN）广泛用于固态照明和高性能射频及功率电子器件，但因空穴掺杂效率低和迁移率有限，p型GaN中的量子振荡此前从未被观测到，制约了价带研究和空穴输运工程。本研究在GaN/AlN界面极化诱导的二维空穴气中实现了高空穴迁移率，空穴简并占据GaN的两个价带，首次观测到量子振荡，为GaN空穴输运调控和新型光电器件开发开辟道路。"},{"t":"SWOT 显示南极洲周围的高沿海涡流活动","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag181/8539739?rss=1","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Antarctic marginal seas are crucial for the global climate, but direct observations, especially of mesoscale ocean eddies, remain scarce. Here, by analyzing the unprecedented high-resolution sea surface height data provided by the recently launched Surface Water and Ocean Topography (SWOT) satellite, we reveal for the first time a widespread presence of mesoscale eddies across the Antarctic continental shelf. The geographic distributions of the observed eddies, along with eddy-resolving model simulations, support the hypothesis that ice shelf basal melting and dense shelf water formation are key processes driving the prevalent eddy activity. Our findings highlight the potential of innovative satellite measurements for monitoring critical Antarctic oceanic processes, and the need to resolve the abundant Antarctic ocean eddies in climate models.","tp":"南极海洋涡流","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"as":"南极边缘海对全球气候至关重要，但中尺度海洋涡流的直接观测极为稀少。利用新发射的地表水和海洋地形（SWOT）卫星提供的前所未有高分辨率海面高度数据，研究首次揭示了南极大陆架上中尺度涡流的广泛存在。涡流的空间分布特征与涡流解析模型的对比，为理解南极海域物质输运和海冰-海洋相互作用提供了新认知。","aip":1},{"t":"通过d-p轨道耦合修复断裂的S-S键用于耐久镁电池","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1371160?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镁电池硫键修复","kp":["[电池类型]: 可充镁电池","[机制]: d-p轨道耦合修复S-S键","[挑战]: 硫族化物正极结构不可逆演化"],"dp":1,"as":"可充电镁电池因镁资源丰富、安全性高和理论容量大，被视为大规模储能的有力候选，但硫正极在充放电过程中S─S键断裂导致的结构退化和容量衰减是制约其寿命的核心瓶颈。本研究提出一种基于d─p轨道耦合的策略，实现断裂S─S键的自修复，显著提升了镁硫电池的循环稳定性。该机制利用过渡金属中心与硫原子的轨道杂化，在电化学循环中原位重建断裂的二硫键，维持正极结构完整性。此方法为解决多硫化物穿梭和硫正极失活问题提供了新思路，有望推动高耐久性镁电池走向实用化。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Healing Broken S─S Bonds via d‐p Orbital Coupling for Durable Magnesium Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Rechargeable Mg batteries hold great promise for large‐scale energy storage due to the abundance, safety, and high theoretical capacity of the metallic Mg anode. However, their development is hampered by the irreversible structural evolution of chalcogenide cathodes, which originates from the inability to reform broken S─S bonds during charging. Here, we identify this irreversibility mechanism and propose an innovative\n                    d\n                    ‐\n                    p\n                    orbital coupling strategy to address it. Using CuS as a model system, we demonstrate that introducing high‐covalency Mo─S bonds via Mo 4\n                    d\n                    ‐S 3\n                    p\n                    coupling enables precise regulation of the electronic structure, thereby facilitating the reversible breaking and reconstruction of S─S bonds. This orbital‐level optimization yields a breakthrough in Mg‐storage performance, including a high reversible capacity (356 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 100 mA g\n                    −1\n                    ), exceptional rate capability (166 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 1 A g\n                    −1\n                    ), and outstanding cycling stability (84.6% capacity retention after 3000 cycles). The material also exhibits remarkable performance under high loadings, across a wide temperature range (−20 to 60°C), and in durable pouch cells. Crucially, this\n                    d\n                    ‐\n                    p\n                    orbital coupling strategy is universally applicable to various transition metals, providing a general design paradigm for high‐energy‐density rechargeable Mg battery cathodes.","aip":1},{"t":"偏离正态分布性状的全基因组关联研究和 QTL 定位","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag184/8537784?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"Quantitative traits are the targets for genome-wide association studies (GWAS) and quantitative trait locus (QTL) mapping. After adjusting for systematic effects, these traits are assumed to be normally distributed so that typical linear models (LM) and linear mixed models (LMM) can be used to detect markers associated with QTLs. Many traits in crops, animals and humans, however, do not follow the assumed normal distribution and many of them are not even continuously distributed. We developed statistical models and software packages to map QTLs and perform association studies for such non-normal traits under the generalized linear mixed model (GLMM) framework. We developed a pseudo response (PSR) method to estimate the polygenic variance by generating a pseudo response variable that is treated as a conventional quantitative trait. We then scanned the genome for markers associated with the PSR variable in the usual linear mixed model. The new method is called the pseudo response generalized linear mixed model (PSR-GLMM). We illustrated the method with the purple color trait of rice (binary trait) and a set of simulated non-normal traits. We then applied the method to four datasets: a binary trait from an Arabidopsis","tp":"全基因组关联定位","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"全基因组关联分析（GWAS）和数量性状基因座（QTL）定位通常假设性状在校正系统效应后服从正态分布，以适用线性模型。然而作物、动物和人类中许多性状偏离正态分布，甚至非连续分布。研究团队开发了适用于偏离正态分布性状的统计方法，突破了传统模型假设的局限，提升了复杂性状遗传标记检测的准确性和适用范围。"},{"t":"生成扩展的折叠分子染料堆栈并揭示其不断演变的激子动力学","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02082-0","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","b":"In biomacromolecules, many amino acids or nucleotides are needed to obtain defined secondary structures and concomitant advanced functionalities. However, when researchers generate synthetic model analogues composed of dyes to predict the (photo-)functional properties of the respective solid-state aggregates they often use dimer models. Here we introduce a foldamer series of closely π-stacked dyes from dimer to 14-mer, obtained by an iterative block-based coupling protocol, that enable the study of oligomer-length effects on their photophysical properties. Spectroscopic techniques identify a distinct change of fluorescence properties at around four to six dye units—affording narrowed fluorescence bands and an increase of the total quantum yield from 47% for the dimer up to 75% for the 14-mer—that is accompanied by the development of a multiexciton state. These results highlight the limitation of the dimer model and motivate future research on well-defined π-stacked foldamers, both as models for solid-state materials and as supramolecular wires for future electronic and photonic applications.","tp":"分子染料堆栈","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"在生物大分子中，需要大量氨基酸或核苷酸才能获得确定的二级结构和高级功能。研究者在构建合成染料聚集体模型时多用二聚体。本研究通过迭代嵌段偶联协议，构建了从二聚体到14聚体的紧密π堆积染料折叠体系列，系统揭示了染料堆栈尺寸演化过程中的激子动力学规律，为设计和预测固态聚集体光功能特性提供了分子级实验平台。"},{"t":"通用且高选择性的镍电催化交叉亲电体C(sp2)-C(sp2)偶联反应","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2515413123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍电催化交叉偶联","kp":["[催化剂]: 镍电催化","[反应类型]: 交叉电亲体C(sp²)–C(sp²)偶联","[选择性]: 等摩尔原料抑制同偶联实现异偶联"],"as":"过渡金属催化的交叉亲电试剂偶联（XEC）是构建C(sp2)─C(sp2)键的重要策略，但两个相似亲电试剂之间的选择性偶联长期面临挑战——传统方法难以区分两种反应活性相近的底物，易产生同偶联副产物。本研究开发了一种通用的镍电催化体系，利用电化学驱动替代化学还原剂，通过精准调控镍催化剂的氧化态循环，实现了两种相似亲电试剂之间的高选择性交叉偶联。该方法底物适用范围广，兼容多种芳基卤化物和拟卤化物，反应条件温和，为药物分子和功能材料中联芳基结构的高效合成提供了绿色可持续的新路径。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"General and selective nickel-electrocatalyzed cross-electrophile C*(sp2)–C(sp2) coupling","b":"Transition metal-catalyzed cross-coupling of two similar electrophiles (XEC) to construct C(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    )–C(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    ) bonds is a powerful emerging synthetic methodology. However, efficient and selective XEC to create heterocoupled C*(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    )–C(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    ) linkages from equimolar reagents while suppressing competing homocoupling, presents a synthetic challenge. Here, we describe a promising approach to address this challenge via electrocatalytic synthesis. This approach utilizes renewable and readily available electricity to replace traditional redox reagents, minimizing chemical use and chemical waste generation, while controlling the reaction pathway by the applied potential. This highly selective and general electrocatalytic eXEC process to construct C*(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    )–C(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    ) bonds is enabled by sequential and controllable eXEC oxidative addition processes, and supported mechanistically by experiment and DFT computation. Generality and efficacy are demonstrated by more than 80 examples, including important biaryl, fluorophore, and pharmaceutical products. Notably, the stoichiometric precision of eXEC enables the first synthesis of solution-processable low polydispersity conjugated opto-electronic polymers. Therefore, this report provides a conceptually attractive method to selectively create diverse and useful C*(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    )–C(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    ) coupled molecules and macromolecules.","aip":1},{"t":"在学校计划外和计划停课期间，阅读方面的性别差距扩大","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523152123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Why do girls outperform boys in education? One contributing factor might be that girls read more than boys, which fosters competencies relevant in education. Moreover, boys might rely more heavily on schools to support and encourage reading, meaning that unplanned and planned school closures disproportionally affect boys. We map the gender gap in reading in the period 2020 to 2022 using two large-scale datasets from Denmark, one measuring students’ weekly reading in school via a popular reading app and the other measuring students’ borrowing of library books. Our data document a clear gender gap in reading that increased during unplanned school closures due to the COVID-19 pandemic and planned closures due to vacations. Our findings underscore the role of schools in mitigating gender differences in reading."},{"t":"GFAP+ FOXF2+ 室管膜细胞在神经损伤后通过 DLL4-NOTCH 信号促进血脑屏障修复","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520352123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Ependymal cells in the adult ventricular-subventricular zone are increasingly recognized for functions extending beyond cerebrospinal fluid dynamics; however, their identity and functional specialization remain incompletely understood. While ependymal cells (EP) have been implicated in interactions with the stem cell niche and the vasculature, their role in repair processes following neural injury remains elusive. In this study, we employed region-specific single-cell transcriptomics of the subventricular zone (SVZ) and ipsilesional peri-infarct territory in mice to identify a distinct subpopulation of GFAP\n                    +\n                    FOXF2\n                    +\n                    EP that selectively expand within the SVZ after neural injury. Notably, these cells were absent from other brain regions. Immunohistochemical validation revealed characteristic ependymal features, including typical pinwheel architecture and expression of Foxj1 and β-catenin. Furthermore, the absence of the proliferation marker Ki67 and the resistance of this subpopulation to Ara-C-mediated ablation indicate that these cells do not possess proliferative properties. Conditional deletion of\n                    Foxf2\n                    in GFAP\n                    +\n                    cells led to impaired endothelial junction integrity and increased blood–brain barrier (BBB) permeability. In contrast, overexpression of\n                    Foxf2\n                    via GFAP promoter-driven adeno-associated virus delivery enhanced vascular repair and facilitated functional recovery. Mechanistically, these GFAP\n                    +\n                    FOXF2\n                    +\n                    EP secrete exosomal DLL4, which was associated with enhanced NOTCH pathway activity and restoration of BBB function. While the mechanism linking this limited cell population to the broad reparative effect, particularly the complete signaling amplification cascade, remains to be fully elucidated, these findings identify a subset of EP that contributes to BBB repair."},{"t":"卷首插图：基于噻吩紫精电化学离子门控的仿生高性能神经形态器件","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2026-m2702061800?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"仿生神经形态器件","kp":["[材料]: 噻吩紫精工程稳定氧化还原电解质","[器件]: 电化学离子门控神经形态器件","[特性]: 低压模拟电导调制"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"噻吩紫精（Thienoviologen）分子工程通过离域自由基电荷和协调离子-电子耦合，稳定了氧化还原活性电解质。该策略使基于电化学离子门控的仿生高性能神经形态器件成为可能，在低功耗类脑计算和可编程突触模拟方面展现出优异性能，为下一代神经形态计算硬件提供了新材料平台。","ot":"Frontispiece: Bioinspired High‐Performance Neuromorphic Devices Enabled by Thienoviologen‐Based Electrochemical Ion Gati","b":"Thienoviologen engineering stabilizes redox-active electrolytes by delocalizing radical charge and orchestrating ion-electron coupling. The resulting bioinspired electrochemical neuromorphic device enables low-voltage, analog conductance modulation for synaptic learning, logic computation, and neural network processing, showcasing a versatile molecular platform for next-generation neuromorphic electronics. More in the Research Article (e23345), Gang He and co-workers."},{"t":"弗拉维奥·西罗·布里贾诺","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5315152?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"\"My favorite molecule is CH<sub>5</sub> <sup>+</sup> because, despite its transient nature, it plays a key role in many transformations across different chemical environments, from superacids to, as we have just discovered, aqueous environments under extreme conditions …\" \"A turning point in my career was deciding to open a new line of research on the transformation of matter under planetary conditions, approaching these systems from a chemist's perspective …\" Find out more about Flavio Siro Brigiano in his Introducing… Profile."},{"t":"Fe-NC诱导Co 3d轨道电子离域构建电子桥以加速转化反应","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70862?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多硫化物催化","kp":["催化剂[Li-S电池]: Fe-NC@ZnCo₂O₄异质结构","[机制]: Fe-NC诱导Co 3d轨道电子离域构建电子桥","[催化目标]: 加速多硫化锂液固转化"],"as":"该研究针对锂硫电池中多硫化锂（LiPSs）向Li₂S₂/Li₂S的液固转化瓶颈，提出以Fe-NC修饰Co催化剂的策略。通过Fe-NC诱导Co的3d轨道电子离域，调控Co活性位点的电子结构，增强对多硫化锂的吸附与催化转化能力，从而加速Li₂Sₓ⇄Li₂S的氧化还原动力学，抑制穿梭效应，提升锂硫电池的循环稳定性与倍率性能。该工作为通过双金属配位工程优化单原子/团簇催化剂电子结构以改善硫正极反应动力学提供了新思路。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Fe‐NC Induced Electron Delocalization of Co 3d‐Orbital Constructing an Electron Bridge for Accelerated Transformation of","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The liquid‐solid conversion of lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) to Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    2\n                    /Li\n                    2\n                    S (Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    x\n                    ⇄Li\n                    2\n                    S) impedes the sulfur reduction reaction (SRR) in lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries due to the slow kinetics and a high energy barrier. Herein, a heterostructure catalyst composed of Fe‐NC modified ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (Fe‐NC@ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    ) is designed to accelerate LiPSs conversion (especially, Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    ⇄Li\n                    2\n                    S) via modulating the electron environment of the central atomic 3d‐orbital. Based on experimental results and DFT calculations, the introduction of Fe‐NC induces electron delocalization in the Co 3d orbital and eliminates the original bandgap of ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (1.98 eV). These delocalized electrons serve as electronic active centers, strengthening coupling between the metal 3d orbital and S\n                    n\n                    2\n                    −\n                    species in LiPSs and resulting in faster LiPSs redox kinetics. As a result, the S/Fe‐NC@ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    cathode delivers a high capacity of 1449.7 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 0.1C and outstanding cycling stability with a decay rate of 0.057% per cycle over 600 cycles at 1.0C. Even under a high sulfur loading of 8.97 mg cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    , a remarkable capacity of 917.5 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    is achieved. This work provides deep insights into orbital modulation for designing high‐performance Li–S catalysts."},{"t":"不同强度和价态的 Fab-Fc 和 Fab-Fab 相互作用导致 IgG1 的高浓度粘度","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526550123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The variable domains in Fab regions are well-established contributors to high concentration viscosity of IgG, primarily through charge and hydrophobic interactions. In contrast, the roles of the Fc and the number of self-interacting sites (valency) are less well understood. Here, we investigate the relative contributions of Fab–Fab and Fab–Fc interactions to high concentration viscosity for a diverse panel of 20 IgG\n                    1\n                    antibodies, by rheometry, coarse-grained simulations, and molecular surface property analysis. Strikingly, fragmentation of IgG\n                    1\n                    into F(ab′)\n                    2\n                    plus Fc reduced viscosity (−11 to −93%) for all antibodies tested, demonstrating prevalent contributions of Fc to viscosity. Coarse-grained simulations with one site per Fab and two sites per Fc qualitatively tracked trends in experimental rheometry data for 20 parental antibodies and their fragments. In these simulations Fab–Fab and Fab–Fc interaction strengths were independently varied to capture possible interaction differences arising from parental sequences or any mutations. These coarse-grained simulations suggest that Fab–Fc attractions generate branched IgG\n                    1\n                    networks and disproportionately larger clusters relative to Fab–Fab interactions of comparable strength. This study suggests that a four-site self-interaction model, previously proposed for a single antibody (omalizumab), is broadly applicable to diverse IgG\n                    1\n                    . Beyond well-established variable domain engineering, this self-interaction model predicts that Fc engineering may reduce IgG\n                    1\n                    viscosity, a much sought after goal to enable subcutaneous delivery. Clinically validated Fc mutations are demonstrated here to substantially reduce the viscosity for multiple IgG\n                    1\n                    (−33 to −91% reduction, n = 6), supporting this emerging antibody design concept."},{"t":"采用耐用强效超双疏涂层增强建筑高效被动式日间辐射制冷","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003685?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"辐射制冷涂层","kp":["[涂层特性]: 超两亲性耐久涂层","[功能]: 建筑被动式日间辐射制冷"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Enhancing efficient passive daytime radiative cooling in buildings using a durable and robust superamphiphobic coating f"},{"t":"交互式多能市场中的能源管理策略：方法与新兴挑战的映射","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003855?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"多能源市场管理","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Energy management strategies for interactive multi-energy markets: Mapping approaches to emerging challenges"},{"t":"排污权交易重塑中国电力行业脱碳路径","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003788?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"碳交易重塑电力","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"电化学介导的聚合物解聚回单体","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00071-9?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Chem","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电化学解聚回收","kp":["[反应]: 电化学触发解聚","[聚合物]: 聚甲基丙烯酸甲酯PMMA","[单体产率]: >95wt%"],"dp":1,"as":"本研究聚焦于开发温和条件下的解聚路线，使基于烃类的聚合物高效逆向降解为原始单体，这是实现塑料循环经济的关键技术。传统化学回收能耗高、选择性差，而电催化解聚等温和路径可在较低温度和压力下断裂聚合物链，选择性回收高纯度单体，为规模化塑料回收提供了新思路，对缓解石化资源浪费和白色污染意义重大。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Electrifying depolymerization back to monomers","b":"Developing mild depolymerization routes to regenerate monomers from hydrocarbon-based polymers is critical to enabling a circular polymer economy. In a recent paper published in the Journal of the American Chemical Society, Evans, Sumerlin, and co-workers disclose a methodology for the electrochemically triggered depolymerization of poly(methyl-methacrylate) that achieves >95 wt % depolymerization.","aip":1},{"t":"由液晶弹性体单元阵列组成的电可重构太赫兹超表面","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519564?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太赫兹超表面","kp":["[器件]: 太赫兹超表面(液晶弹性体单元阵列)","[调控方式]: 电可重构","[平台]: 太赫兹软MEMS"],"as":"该研究提出一种由液晶材料组成的电可重构太赫兹超表面，可通过外加电场动态调控其电磁响应特性。太赫兹超表面在下一代无线通信、光学计算与高分辨率成像等领域具有重要应用前景，而传统器件一旦制造即固定不可调。液晶材料的引入使超表面单元的折射率可电控切换，实现了太赫兹波的相位、振幅等参数的实时可编程调控，为智能太赫兹器件的发展奠定了基础。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Electrically Reconfigurable Terahertz Metasurface Composed of a Liquid Crystal Elastomer Unit‐Cell Array","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Reconfigurable terahertz metasurfaces are crucial for next‐generation wireless communication, optical computing, and terahertz imaging. However, most planar active metasurfaces are limited by the 2D design freedom and suffer from the ohmic losses induced by the conductivity alteration in the active materials. Here, to our best knowledge, we first present a terahertz soft‐MEMS platform composed of electrically driven unit‐cell arrayed liquid crystal elastomer (LCE) meta‐atoms with plasmon‐induced transparency (PIT) pattern, in which each meta‐atom can realize reversible 3D mechanical bending. The thermal effect of applied current actuates the individual LCE meta‐atom, and the progressive bending of meta‐atoms and corresponding PIT spectra modulation up to 26.13% were experimentally observed. Notably, through a 10‐fold “heating‐recovery” measurement, the high repeatability and stability of LCE meta‐atoms are demonstrated, which represents a distinct advantage among reported terahertz MEMS metasurfaces. This platform is compatible with a wide variety of meta‐atom architectures and does not require direct physical connection between the meta‐atoms and the driving circuit, thus offering a novel approach for the investigation of intelligent, reconfigurable metasurfaces with diverse functionalities, which holds significant promise in next‐generation wireless communication and advanced terahertz imaging technologies, as key components to realize smart beam steering, reconfigurable optical mask, and spatial light modulation.","aip":1},{"t":"Inside-Out 蛋白质动态易位到细胞表面是细胞适应癌症引起的应激的基础","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529493123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Inside-Out (I-O) protein display, the noncanonical surface localization of intracellular proteins, represents an underexplored feature of tumor cell biology. Here, we map the molecular landscape and trafficking mechanisms that control the presentation of I-O proteins on cancer cell membranes. Employing APEX2-mediated proximity biotinylation and a custom antibody generation and validation platform, we identified approximately 140 high-confidence I-O proteins, primarily ribosomal, proteasomal, chaperone, and translation factors, notably enriched in protein families associated with stress-response pathways. Validation of 500 antibodies encompassing 40 I-O targets across seven tumor cell lines confirmed selective and robust surface localization, while in vivo imaging in mouse xenografts demonstrated pronounced and tumor-specific antibody accumulation. I-O proteins were absent on peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) and in normal tissues, indicating cancer cell selectivity. Functional analyses revealed that I-O protein tethering to the membrane is dependent on heparan sulfate interactions; enzymatic removal of these glycans led to the clearance of I-O proteins from the cell surface. Notably, the removed proteins returned to baseline levels within 6 h, indicating a dynamic balance related to Endoplasmic Reticulum (ER)-Golgi trafficking and cellular stress. Nearly half of these I-O proteins overlapped with known stress granule (SG) components; however, stress elements that promote SG formation do not similarly affect surface display of I-O proteins. Furthermore, I-O proteins are present on standard cancer cell lines under lower stress levels needed to induce SG formation, suggesting parallel yet mechanistically distinct aspects of the stress response. These findings position I-O display as a paradigm in protein trafficking, different from traditional secretion pathways and closely linked to stress response."},{"t":"用于电力系统频率控制的PEM电解槽动态建模及功率硬件在环验证","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600156X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEM电解槽建模","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dynamic modelling of PEM Electrolyzers for power system frequency control with power HIL validation"},{"t":"NiTiO₃包覆Ni上Ni-O-Ti双活性位点实现高效稳定光热CO₂甲烷化","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70870?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光热CO2甲烷化","kp":["催化剂[光热CO2甲烷化]: Ni@NiTiO3核壳纳米粒子","活性位点[CO2甲烷化]: Ni-O-Ti双活性位点","合成方法[核壳催化剂]: 激光诱导非平衡反应"],"as":"该研究设计了一种NiTiO₃涂层包裹镍核的核壳结构光催化剂，其表面Ni-O-Ti双活性位点协同促进光驱动CO₂还原反应，高效将CO₂转化为高附加值燃料。Ni基核壳催化剂兼具高催化活性和长期稳定性，解决了CO₂转化中转化效率低、催化剂易失活的难题。该成果对碳资源利用和碳中和目标具有重要意义，为光催化CO₂还原的工程化应用提供了新策略。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Dual Active Sites of Ni‐O‐Ti on NiTiO3 Coated Ni for Efficient and Robust Photothermal CO2 Methanation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Converting CO\n                    2\n                    into value‐added fuels using a Ni‐based core–shell catalyst is beneficial for addressing the carbon deposition‐induced deactivation of Ni. However, designing highly active shells is critical. In this study, nickel titanate‐coated metallic Ni nanoparticles (Ni@NiTiO\n                    3\n                    ) are synthesized via laser‐induced nonequilibrium reaction. The obtained Ni@NiTiO\n                    3\n                    as a photothermal catalyst for converting CO\n                    2\n                    to CH\n                    4\n                    achieves a high CH\n                    4\n                    yield of 1.48 mol g\n                    cat\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    and CH\n                    4\n                    selectivity of 94.3% under the light intensity of 2.52 W cm\n                    −2\n                    . The outstanding catalytic performance is ascribed to the presence of the Ni‐O‐Ti structure with dual active sites in the shell of Ni@NiTiO\n                    3\n                    . Specifically, Ni\n                    2+\n                    species in the Ni‐O‐Ti structure enhance CO\n                    2\n                    adsorption and activation, while Ti species stabilize high‐valent Ni species to maintain activity. Meanwhile, the metallic Ni core reduces the energy barrier for H\n                    2\n                    dissociation on the shell surface, thus facilitating the subsequent CO\n                    2\n                    hydrogenation. In a flow reactor (weight hourly space velocity of 200 000 mL g\n                    cat\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    ), Ni@NiTiO\n                    3\n                    achieves 77.1% CO\n                    2\n                    conversion and maintains long‐term stability for 100 h, which can also be efficiently driven under sunny conditions. This work demonstrates the design concept of core–shell catalyst with a highly active shell prepared via laser‐induced nonequilibrium reactions for efficient photothermal catalytic CO\n                    2\n                    hydrogenation reactions."},{"t":"区分协同型与顺序型质子-电子转移","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02103-y","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"质子电子转移机理","as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Distinguishing concerted and sequential proton–electron transfer"},{"t":"色散力诱导的偶极-偶极相互作用及其对锂离子电池溶剂化化学的影响","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70861?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池溶剂化化学","kp":["电解质[锂电低温]: 弱溶剂化电解质","[溶剂替换]: EC替换为二氟乙烯碳酸酯","[机制]: 色散力诱导偶极-偶极作用调控溶剂化与脱溶剂"],"as":"弱溶剂化电解液（WSE）因其快速的Li⁺去溶剂化能力，被认为是实现锂电池稳定运行的关键体系。该研究提出了一种由色散力（London色散力）诱导的偶极-偶极相互作用机制，并系统分析了其对溶剂化结构和电解液性能的影响。这种非共价相互作用可调控溶剂分子与Li⁺的结合强度，从而加速去溶剂化动力学，降低界面阻抗。该发现为高倍率、宽温域锂电池电解液的理性设计提供了新的理论框架，有望突破传统溶剂化模型的设计局限。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Dispersion‐Force‐Induced Dipole–Dipole Interaction and Its Effects on Solvation Chemistry of Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Weakly‐solvated electrolytes (WSEs) with rapid Li\n                    +\n                    desolvation are crucial for the stable operation of lithium‐ion batteries at subzero temperatures. Due to the weak Li\n                    +\n                    ‐dipole interaction, van der Waals forces mediated by dipole–dipole (d–d) interactions could influence electrolyte solvation structure and desolvation kinetics. By replacing ethylene carbonate (EC) with difluoroethylene carbonate (DFEC) or fluoroethylene carbonate (FEC) in a conventional carbonate electrolyte, we investigated the role of d–d interaction, particularly inductive and dispersion forces, in regulating the solvation structure and (electro)chemical properties of a fluorocarbonate‐based WSE. DFEC exhibits inductive forces similar to those of FEC, yet exerts much stronger dispersion forces on linear carbonate molecules due to its greater molecular polarizability. Consequently, electrons redistribute toward the carbonyl oxygen atom of linear carbonates, and hydrogen atoms shift toward DFEC, as is verified by\n                    17\n                    O nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy and liquid‐phase time‐of‐flight secondary ion mass spectrometry. Much enhanced Li\n                    +\n                    ‐carbonate coordination further results in a high ionization degree yet sluggish desolvation kinetics of DFEC‐based WSE. In contrast, FEC‐based WSEs restore balanced weakly‐solvated behavior and lead to much improved battery performance at −20°C and −40°C. This study provides new insights into electrolyte chemistry and establishes general design principles for electrolytes capable of working under extreme conditions.","aip":1},{"t":"高效聚碳酸酯解聚酶的定向进化及卓越操作稳定性","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525215?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚碳酸酯解聚酶","kp":["[酶工程]: 定向进化平台改造聚碳酸酯解聚酶"],"as":"聚碳酸酯（PC）是全球产量最大的工程塑料之一，其废弃物的化学闭环回收是循环经济的关键挑战。该研究利用高通量定向进化平台对聚碳酸酯解聚酶进行工程改造，获得了一种具有卓越催化效率和高氧化稳定性的突变体。定向进化策略通过随机突变与高通量筛选的迭代循环，大幅提升了酶对PC底物的亲和力和催化周转数。该成果为酶法塑料降解与单体回收提供了突破性工具，有望推动塑料回收从物理/热化学路线向绿色生物催化路径转型。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Directed Evolution of an Efficient Polycarbonate Depolymerase With Exceptional Operational Stability","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    We recently developed a high‐throughput directed evolution platform for engineering polymer degrading enzymes, and showcased its utility through the development of an efficient and thermostable variant of\n                    Is\n                    PETase, termed HotPETase. Here, we show that this platform can be used to re‐engineer PET degrading enzymes for the recycling of other aromatic‐containing commodity polymers. Promiscuous poly(bisphenol‐A carbonate) (PC) depolymerase activity of LCC\n                    ICCG\n                    was enhanced by directed evolution to afford an engineered polycarbonate hydrolase, that also benefits from improved solvent tolerance and operational stability at elevated temperatures. Interestingly, the enzyme‐concentration dependent inhibition observed with the parent enzyme is also alleviated through evolution, improving practical utility. PC‐2 can achieve rapid and complete depolymerization of a PC film to bisphenol‐A (BPA) in just 6 h at 75°C. This study shows how plastic degrading enzymes can be readily adapted through evolution to operate on new and valuable polymer classes.","aip":1},{"t":"面向极端环境的兼具延展性与优异高温强度的难熔合金开发","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202515947?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐热材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"难熔高温合金","kp":["材料类型[超高温合金]: 难熔中高熵合金","应用[航空航天]: 超高温端部件兼具强度与成型性"],"as":"航空航天、核电及先进制造领域对能承受极端高温（>1200°C）且兼具优异力学韧性的合金需求迫切。传统难熔合金（如Nb、Mo基）虽耐高温但室温脆性严重，限制了工程应用。该研究开发了一类新型延性难熔合金，通过多元合金化与微观组织调控（如BCC固溶体+金属间化合物析出），在保持高温强度的同时显著改善室温塑性。这类合金有望替代传统镍基高温合金，用于涡轮叶片、热防护结构等关键部件，是下一代超高温度结构材料的重要进展。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Development of Ductile Refractory Alloys With Excellent High‐Temperature Strength for Extreme Environments","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The demand for alloys capable of withstanding extremely high temperatures has grown significantly in the aerospace industry. The alloys need to maintain sufficient strength at ultra‐high temperatures, while still having adequate forming ability to manufacture the hot‐end components. Refractory alloys, including refractory medium‐ and high‐entropy alloys, have been widely recognized as the promising candidates to operate in extreme environments. This review aims to comprehensively assess the mechanical properties of ductile refractory alloys over a broad temperature range. We first present the fabrication methods available for preparing bulk refractory alloys. Several important topics regarding their mechanical properties are then discussed, such as ductile‐to‐brittle transition, strength‐ductility trade‐off at room temperature, and high‐temperature tensile strength and creep resistance. We also summarize the toughening and strengthening strategies often used towards strength‐ductility synergy in refractory alloys. The catastrophic oxidation at elevated temperatures, another critical issue for limiting their widespread applications, is further discussed briefly. Finally, this overview provides an outlook on the challenges and perspectives in this cutting‐edge field."},{"t":"设计供体-双受体共价有机框架，含主辅功能位点以增强16电子硫氧化反应","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70864?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硫氧化催化","kp":["催化剂[Li-S电池]: 供体-双受体COF","[策略]: 分子协同工程构建分级催化链","[目标]: 加速16电子硫反应动力学"],"as":"锂硫电池因理论能量密度高（2600 Wh/kg）被视为下一代储能技术，但多硫化锂（LiPSs）的穿梭效应和缓慢的转化动力学严重制约其商业化。该研究设计了一种供体-双受体型共价有机框架（COF）催化剂，兼具主-辅双功能活性位点。供体-受体结构内置的极化电场可促进LiPSs的吸附与催化转化，加速Li₂S的沉积/分解动力学。COF的多孔晶体结构提供了高密度暴露活性位点和离子传输通道。该策略为锂硫电池实用化提供了非贵金属催化剂设计的新范式。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Design Donor‐Biacceptor Covalent Organic Framework with Primary‐Auxiliary Functional Sites for Enhanced 16‐Electron Sulf","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The catalytic conversion of lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) is crucial for realizing high‐energy‐density lithium–sulfur batteries. Herein, we propose a molecular cooperate engineering strategy to construct a hierarchical catalytic reaction chain for addressing the complex sulfur phase transitions and sluggish 16‐electron reaction kinetics. A covalent organic framework with a D‐A1‐A2 electronic structure was developed to generate a built‐in electric field (BIEF) via establishing intramolecular charge transfer (ICT) between bipolar functional groups. Theoretical calculations and in situ characterizations confirm that primary and auxiliary functional groups of COF can synergistically enable selective LiPSs capture while the BIEF‐facilitated electron transfer accelerates redox reactions of LiPSs, conferring reduced conversion energy barriers and mitigated shuttle effect. Moreover, the anchoring of the ─NO\n                    2\n                    group and hence the effect of the ─CF\n                    3\n                    group induce directional Li\n                    +\n                    deposition, ensuring the favored Li plating with epitaxial layered growth and suppressed dendrite formation. As a result, the Li symmetric cell demonstrates an ultra‐long lifespan (&gt;16 000 h at 5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    ) while Li–S batteries can achieve exceptional cycling stability (0.039% capacity decay per cycle over 1000 cycles). Meanwhile, the pouch cells deliver a high energy density of 395.6 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    with 90.2% capacity retention over cycling. This work presents a generalizable strategy for advancing multi‐electron redox systems.","aip":1},{"t":"深根植物吸收养分的深度受可用水量的调节","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528407123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The capacity of some plants to access water and nutrients at depths greater than one meter is a critical functional trait that confers resistance to drought and impacts both belowground and shallow soil processes. Here, we report water and strontium isotopic data from an alpine meadow transect showing the correlation between water and nutrient acquisition depths. The isotopic compositions of Sr (\n                    87\n                    Sr/\n                    86\n                    Sr ratio) and water in rock and soil, and in plant leaf tissues, reveal that deeper-rooted plants acquire a higher proportion of water, Sr, and cation nutrients that are derived from the saprolite, a zone of silicate weathering, than shallow-rooted grass. A three-decade dendrochemical record reveals that reductions of wet precipitation drive deep-rooted plants to acquire cation nutrients from deeper saprolite or bedrock regions. Thus, the depth of cation nutrient acquisition by deep-rooted plant species at this site is tightly coupled with, and likely determined by, water availability in soil, saprolite, and bedrock. The enhanced uptake of cations as well as water from deeper saprolite zones could impact the rate of bedrock weathering and watershed chemistry during drought.","tp":"深根抗旱性","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":1.5,"r":3.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究利用阿尔卑斯草甸样带的水和锶同位素数据，揭示深根植物（根系深度超过1米）获取水分和养分的深度之间存在显著相关性。发现植物吸水深度与养分吸收深度受可用水量调控，这一功能性状对植物抗旱能力及地下生态过程具有重要影响，为理解深层根系生态功能提供同位素证据。"},{"t":"高温条件下甲脒-铯金属卤化物钙钛矿太阳能电池中阳离子偏析与挥发损失解耦研究","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02011-y","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿太阳能电池","kp":["T90[钙钛矿电池持续1太阳光]: ~2700小时","添加剂[钙钛矿前驱体]: 微量CsI₃","降解转折温度[FA-Cs钙钛矿]: 106°C"],"as":"针对甲脒-铯铅碘钙钛矿（FAXCs1-XPbI3）太阳电池中的阳离子偏析与挥发损失耦合难题，研究人员提出一种有效抑制FAI挥发损失、维持阳离子偏析状态的层结构策略。该方法实现了两者的解耦调控，有望显著提升钙钛矿太阳能电池的相稳定性与器件效率，推动其商业化进程。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Decoupling cation segregation and volatile loss in formamidinium–caesium metal halide perovskite solar cells under high-","b":"Formamidinium–caesium lead iodide (FAXCs1-XPbI3, 0 x 2) layer effectively suppresses FAI loss, maintaining cation-segregation-dominated degradation beyond 106 °C. Moreover, introducing trace CsI3 in perovskite precursor enhances cation homogeneity in as-prepared films, dramatically extending the device T90 (time to 90% of maximum efficiency) to ~2,700 h under continuous 1-sun illumination (1.0% UV) at 85 °C. The extrapolated T90 at 45 °C exceeds 50 years by assuming a same degradation pathway. These findings elucidate the temperature-dependent degradation pathways in formamidinium–caesium perovskites and provide practical strategies to enhance their operational stability."},{"t":"解析电催化CO₂转化反应中单原子催化剂上中间体的相互作用模式","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS00621J","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子CO2电催化","kp":["[催化剂类型]: 单原子催化剂","[研究内容]: CO₂转化中间体在SACs上相互作用模式"],"as":"研究系统解析了电催化CO2还原反应中单原子催化剂表面中间体的相互作用模式。CO2电催化转化既能应对碳排放又能生成高附加值化学品，而单原子催化剂因高原子利用率和可调活性位点备受关注。阐明中间体在活性位上的吸附与反应规律，对理性设计高效CO2RR催化剂具有指导意义。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Deciphering the interaction patterns of intermediates on single atom catalysts during electrocatalytic CO2 conversion re","b":"Electrocatalytic CO2 conversion (CO2CR) offers a promising route for addressing carbon emissions while simultaneously generating valuable chemical feedstocks. Single-atom catalysts (SACs) have attracted significant attention due to their maximized metal atom utilization and precisely defined coordination architectures. Accumulating evidence indicates that CO2CR over SACs is jointly governed by the intrinsic properties of the central metal atom and the surrounding coordination environment. In this review, we present a comprehensive analysis of the hierarchical coordination environments surrounding the central metal center, encompassing monoelement and bielement coordination in the first coordination sphere, second coordination sphere modulation by neighboring non-metallic and metallic species, and engineering of the beyond-second coordination sphere via functional-group grafting and distal substrate functionalization. We further elucidate the nature of catalytically active sites and systematically categorize intermediate binding behaviors into single-site, step-by-step, simultaneous and cross-substrate intermediate binding modes, highlighting how tailored intermediate interactions regulate reaction kinetics, suppress competing pathways, and steer product selectivity. Notably, we summarize recent advances demonstrating that SACs are not inherently confined to C1 products but also unlock complex coupling reactions through rationally designed multi-site interaction networks, yielding critical chemicals including C2+ products, urea, and others. This framework establishes SACs as a transformative platform for next-generation CO2CR through precise control of multiscale coordination environments, active sites, and intermediate interactions."},{"t":"每日简报：我们刚刚经历了有记录以来最热的 11 年","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00957-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"环辛四烯基金属有机八面体及其三维笼到二维纳米片的结构转变","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4205687?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"受蛋白质、DNA等生物大分子通过特定识别实现功能的启发，研究人员设计了环辛四烯基金属-有机八面体笼状结构，并实现了其从三维笼到二维纳米片的可控制备转化。这类智能超分子组装体在分子识别、催化、药物递送及纳米器件等领域具有广阔应用前景，为精准合成功能性纳米材料提供了新路径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属有机笼纳米片","kp":["[结构转变]: 3D笼到2D纳米片刺激响应转变","[光学特性]: 不同聚集诱导发射颜色与量子产率"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Cyclooctatetraenyl Metal−Organic Octahedra and Their 3D Cage to 2D Nanosheet Transformations","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In biological systems, certain fundamental biomacromolecules, such as proteins and DNA, fulfill specific biological functions via structural changes triggered by stimuli. Herein, we report the synthesis of two allosteric regulation metal−organic octahedra (\n                    S1\n                    and\n                    S2\n                    ) with tailored cavities/windows. Both cages exhibit distinct aggregation‐induced emission (AIE) colors and quantum yields. Single‐crystal x‐ray diffraction reveals that\n                    S2\n                    , featuring longer arms, adopts a denser π‐stacking arrangement, rationalizing its superior emissive properties. The kinetically driven multicomponent heteroleptic octahedral mixtures formed under ambient temperature assembly conditions transformed into self‐sorted\n                    S1\n                    and\n                    S2\n                    upon heating. The addition of competitive building blocks enabled the transformation from\n                    S1\n                    to\n                    S2\n                    . Notably, 365 nm light irradiation induces planarization of the COT units, driving a rapid structural transformation from three‐dimensional (3D) octahedra to two‐dimensional (2D) metal–organic nanosheets (\n                    NS‐1\n                    and\n                    NS‐2\n                    ) within minutes. This work provides a novel approach for designing responsive systems and demonstrates broad potential applications in areas such as optoelectronics, targeted delivery, and smart materials."},{"t":"跨文化证据表明羞耻可以防止名誉受损","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526787123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Because shame leads to evasions, aggression, and other behaviors that victims and third parties find undesirable, a prominent theory regards this emotion as maladaptive. By contrast, an alternative, adaptationist theory asks whether shame might benefit the actor. Indications that an individual now offers fewer benefits or imposes greater costs on others, if they reach others’ minds, lead the individual to be socially devalued: Others become less inclined to help and more inclined to harm her. Thus, an adaptationist theory views shame as a neurocognitive adaptation designed to minimize the leakage of reputation-damaging information and the cost of being devalued. Here, we report tests of two predictions derived from the adaptationist theory across six countries—the United States, the Netherlands, Portugal, Spain, Japan, and China—and two cultural regions within the United States—Southern states (honor) and Northern states (nonhonor). First, failures that indicate reductions in abilities more highly valued by others will elicit more intense shame. Second, failures will trigger greater shame when they occur in public rather than in private. The data supported both predictions in all six countries and in both US cultural regions. The improbable fit between the severity of the devaluative threat and the intensity of shame suggests that this emotion is an adaptation. Further, the replication of these findings across regions that vary widely along the individualism–collectivism and honor–nonhonor dimensions suggests that shame is part of human nature rather than a cultural construction."},{"t":"在Pickering液滴衍生微反应器中共限域酶与辅因子以实现连续流催化","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525681?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酶辅因子微反应器","kp":["[微反应器]: Pickering液滴溶胶-凝胶衍生PDMR","[酶共固定化]: 酶与辅因子共限域连续流催化"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种基于Pickering乳液液滴衍生微反应器实现酶与辅酶因子共固定的策略，用于连续流合成。通过将酶催化剂和昂贵辅因子（如NAD(P)H）共同限域在微米级液滴内，显著提升局部浓度和催化效率，同时简化产物分离与辅因子回收流程。该平台兼顾生物催化的高选择性和连续流工艺的可扩展性，为绿色化学和工业级生物制造提供了可持续的反应工程方案，有望应用于药物合成、精细化学品生产等领域。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Co‐Confinement of Enzymes and Cofactors Within Pickering Droplet Derived Microreactors for Continuous Flow Catalysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The co‐immobilization of enzymes and cofactors represents a sustainable platform for continuous‐flow synthesis of chiral pharmaceuticals, yet balancing effective retention with mutual accessibility of them remains challenging. Herein, we report a sol‐gel strategy to construct Pickering droplet derived microreactors (PDMRs) for the co‐confinement of enzymes and cofactors, which have been applied to continuous flow reactions without exogenous addition of cofactors. Within these self‐sufficient PDMRs, the cofactors are reversibly immobilized via electrostatic interactions, enabling in situ regeneration and free access to the enzyme. The PDMRs efficiently encapsulate enzymes and cofactors with 85–100% immobilization efficiency and robust thermal stability. In PDMRs‐catalyzed continuous flow reactions, excellent catalytic performance and high cofactor total turnover number (TTN) were obtained in nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate (NADP\n                    +\n                    )‐dependent aldo‐keto reductase (AKR) catalyzed enantioselective reductions (80–100% conversions, &gt;99% ee, 500 h stability, up to 173 907 mol mol\n                    −1\n                    TTN), and pyridoxal 5‐phosphate (PLP)‐dependent transaminase (TA) catalyzed enantioselective transaminations (80–100% conversions, &gt;99% ee, 2 000 h stability, up to 45 552 mol mol\n                    −1\n                    TTN). Furthermore, the PDMRs are extended to the co‐confinement of a multi‐enzyme system (AKR and glucose dehydrogenase, GDH) with NADP\n                    +\n                    for chiral alcohols synthesis with sustained operational stability. This work establishes a potent and durable strategy for industrial‐scale continuous flow manufacturing."},{"t":"有机库仑玻璃中的相关电荷传输","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522965?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Advances in the development of organic field‐effect transistors (OFETs), electrically gated organic semiconductors (EGOFETs), and organic electrochemical transistors (OECTs) allow for the operation of these devices at very high charge‐carrier densities, where Coulomb interactions between carriers can be expected to become significant. We have studied the effects of such Coulomb interactions in an OFET‐like structure using Kinetic Monte Carlo (KMC) simulations. Compared to an analogous structure where carrier‐carrier interactions are neglected, we find a reduction in carrier mobility and an increase in activation energy. This effect increases with increasing gate voltage, i.e., charge density. We associate this with the emergence of a different transport regime where correlated transport prevails and where a Coulomb gap appears in a dynamic density of states (DOS), consistent with previous work. We demonstrate that at these high densities, the charges in the organic semiconductor behave like those in a Coulomb glass. In this context, the activation energy for transport is reinterpreted to relate to the structural reorganization of the carrier ensemble. Unlike in inorganic semiconductors, for the organic semiconductor system, we find the appearance of a Coulomb gap to occur even at ambient temperature, and it does not require variable‐range hopping.","tp":"有机半导体","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究利用动力学蒙特卡洛（KMC）模拟，在类OFET结构中研究高电荷密度下载流子间库仑相互作用效应。随着有机场效应晶体管、电化学晶体管等器件在高载流子密度下运行，库仑相互作用变得显著，研究揭示了有机库仑玻璃中相关电荷传输的微观机制，对有机半导体器件优化具有理论指导意义。"},{"t":"更正：配体效应在钴催化分子内[4+2]-和[2+2]-环加成反应中的区域选择性与对映选择性研究","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4150982?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钴催化环加成","as":"","sc":2.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.0,"r":1.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"Correction to “Ligand Effects in Regio‐ and Enantioselective Cobalt‐Catalyzed Intramolecular [4 + 2]‐ and [2 + 2]‐Cycloa"},{"t":"更正：富缺陷黏附性纳米酶作为高效抗菌剂以增强细菌抑制","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7386489?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米酶抗菌材料","sc":2.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":2.0,"r":2.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"Correction to “Defect‐Rich Adhesive Nanozymes as Efficient Antibiotics for Enhanced Bacterial Inhibition”"},{"t":"纠正 Goyette 等人的观点，靶向 Axl 有利于增强免疫治疗和抗肿瘤微环境","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2608616123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过分层有效编码再现早期嗅觉处理的趋同基序","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524661123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The architecture of early olfactory processing is a striking example of convergent evolution. Typically, a panel of broadly tuned receptors is selectively expressed in sensory neurons (each neuron expressing only one receptor), and each glomerulus receives projections from just one neuron type. Taken together, these three motifs—broad receptors, selective expression, and glomerular convergence—constitute “canonical olfaction,” since a number of model organisms including mice and flies exhibit these features. The emergence of this distinctive architecture across evolutionary lineages suggests that it may be optimized for information processing, an idea known as efficient coding. In this work, we show that by maximizing mutual information one layer at a time, efficient coding recovers several features of canonical olfactory processing under realistic biophysical assumptions. We also explore the settings in which noncanonical olfaction may be advantageous. Along the way, we make several predictions relating olfactory circuits to features of receptor families and the olfactory environment."},{"t":"趋同进化通过拟南芥中 BOR1 和 BOR2 的 SNP 和串联重复增加硼转运","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525676123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Boron (B) is a crucial micronutrient, particularly in volcanic soils where its deficiency hampers agriculture. Here, we investigate the genetic basis of leaf B accumulation in natural populations of\n                    Arabidopsis thaliana\n                    that colonized volcanic islands in Cape Verde. Using a combination of genome-wide association studies (GWAS) and mapping in a recombinant intercross population, we identified a case of convergent phenotypic evolution in which multiple variants in the two principal B transporter genes,\n                    BOR1\n                    and\n                    BOR2\n                    , increase leaf B accumulation in parallel. These include multiple tandem duplications at\n                    BOR1\n                    that arose independently in different populations. Overall, this study reveals a remarkable case of convergent evolution occurring within a relatively short time scale, where different types of de novo mutations at B efflux transporter genes achieve similar phenotypic outcomes. Further, our findings show that integrating recombinant populations with GWAS in natural populations can improve power to overcome allelic heterogeneity."},{"t":"窄带隙有机半导体赋能的色彩不变光热织物用于可穿戴太阳能收集","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519334?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光热织物","kp":["光热材料[可穿戴织物]: 窄带隙有机半导体","[特性]: 颜色不变的光热效应"],"as":"本研究利用窄带隙有机半导体材料开发出色彩不变的光热织物，解决了户外运动服热舒适性与多功能性的难题。传统光热面料的光吸收效率受颜色影响显著，而窄带隙半导体可在全可见光谱范围内高效吸收光能并转化为热能，使织物在不同颜色下均保持优异的光热升温性能。该技术兼顾保暖、轻量与设计自由度，在极端寒冷环境户外装备和智能可穿戴领域具有广阔应用前景。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Chromatic‐Invariant Photothermal Fabrics Enabled by Narrow‐Bandgap Organic Semiconductors for Wearable Solar Energy Harv","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The increasing popularity of outdoor activewear has placed higher demands on its thermal comfort, multi‐functionality, and esthetics. Existing photothermal fabrics for cold weathers are based on visible light absorption, which limits color design options. Herein, a chromatic‐invariant photothermal material is developed and integrated onto fabrics to prepare novel photothermal clothing, achieving 4°C–8°C temperature increase within only 5 min under 1000 W m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    simulated solar irradiation. It exhibits strong absorption in the near‐infrared region and effectively converts the radiation into thermal energy, while maintaining the original visual colors of fabrics due to high reflectivity across the visible spectrum. Additionally, this photothermal material does not compromise the original functionality of fabrics and is suitable for application on various types of fabric materials. Furthermore, the prepared fabric achieves a sterilization rate exceeding 95.3% after only 20 min of irradiation under 1000 W m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    standard simulated solar light to ensure hygiene during outdoor activities. These results demonstrate a versatile wearable strategy with integrated functionality and aesthetic appeal for maintaining personal thermal comfort in cold‐weather outdoor scenarios."},{"t":"PEM水电解中氧化铱负载型铱中心面临的挑战与机遇","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70852?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"PEM电解水铱催化","kp":["催化剂[PEM电解水析氧]: 过渡金属氧化物负载铱中心","[定位]: 替代传统贵金属氧化物兼具活性与稳定性"],"as":"析氧反应（OER）是水分解制氢和金属-空气电池等清洁能源技术的关键瓶颈步骤，开发高效稳定的电催化剂至关重要。本文综述了过渡金属载体上新兴的铱中心活性位点的最新研究进展，系统分析了铱基催化剂面临的成本高昂、稀缺性等挑战，以及通过载体工程、电子结构调控和单原子分散策略提升催化活性与耐久性的机遇。为设计低成本高性能OER电催化剂提供了方向指引。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Challenges and Opportunities for the Emerging Iridium Center on Transition Metal Oxide for PEM Water Electrolysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The development of highly efficient and stable electrocatalysts for the oxygen evolution reaction (OER) is crucial for advancing proton exchange membrane water electrolysis (PEMWE) for sustainable hydrogen production. Recently, Iridium centers on transition metal oxides (TMOs) have emerged as promising alternatives to conventional noble metal oxides, demonstrating superior activity, stability, and cost‐effectiveness. This review systematically summarizes these advancements by elucidating the intrinsic mechanisms and dynamic evolution patterns of Ir active centers under acidic OER conditions, discussing core strategies for enhancing catalytic performance, and attention is mainly directed to the industrial application requirements by evaluating breakthrough solutions for key technical challenges, including long‐term stability under high‐current‐density operation and Ir dissolution suppression. Finally, from the perspective of rational design, the review outlines current challenges and prospects for oxide‐supported Ir catalysts, emphasizing the urgent need for advanced operando characterization techniques and scalable fabrication processes. By integrating fundamental research with practical applications, this review aims to provide theoretical guidance and technical references for developing next‐generation OER catalysts suitable for large‐scale PEMWE implementation."},{"t":"鲤鱼白鳍装饰背后的细胞类型多样化和表型趋同","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537571123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Neural crest–derived cells offer valuable opportunities to dissect mechanisms of cell fate specification and differentiation and the underpinnings of cell type diversification over evolutionary time. Particularly useful for such analyses are pigment cells of ectothermic vertebrates that arise from neural crest cells or via latent neural crest–derived stem cells. Among these are white cells, leucophores, present in a variety of species that contribute to patterns on the body or ornamentation on the fins. To better understand developmental and evolutionary origins of these cells, we examined leucophores harboring deposits of yellow/orange carotenoids—xantholeucophores—of zebrafish and leucophores of white cloud minnow. We show that white phenotypes of both cell types require sepiapterin reductase and an accumulation of pale and colorless pteridines. We further demonstrate that xantholeucophores of zebrafish develop from yellow, sepiapterin-rich xanthophore-like cells and that this transition requires both gap junctional communication and the aquaglyceroporin/peroxiporin channel Aquaporin 3, revealing similarities and differences in differentiation and patterning compared to pigment cells on the body. These findings identify xantholeucophores of zebrafish and leucophores of white cloud minnow as distinct developmentally, genetically, and biochemically from other white cells of zebrafish—melanoleucophores—that develop directly from melanophores and depend on guanine crystals, as well as white cells of medaka fish and anemonefish. Our results highlight remarkable convergences and parallelisms in the acquisition of white cell phenotypes within and between phylogenetic lineages and identify this as a rich system for enquiries into the evolutionary individuation of novel cell types."},{"t":"氟化驱动的β-酮酸与偕二氟丙二烯对映选择性脱羧交叉偶联反应","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4973244?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"不对称脱羧偶联","kp":["催化体系[脱羧交叉偶联]: Rh(I)/(S,S)-Ph-BPE","[不对称合成]: 偕二氟丙二烯诱导烯丙基铑异构化"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了一种催化对映选择性脱羧交叉偶联反应，利用β-酮酸与烯丙基底物进行脱羧烯丙基烷基化（DAA），实现高效手性分子合成。该方法为构建含季碳立体中心的化合物提供了新路径，在药物分子和天然产物合成中具重要应用价值。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Catalytic Enantioselective Decarboxylative Cross‐Coupling of β‐Ketoacids With gem‐Difluoroallenes Enabled by Fluorine‐In","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Catalytic decarboxylative allylic alkylation (DAA) reaction represents an efficient strategy for synthesizing molecules containing both carbonyl and alkenyl functionalities, yet is frequently challenged by multiple selectivity issues. Here we report the first intermolecular decarboxylative cross‐coupling of β‐ketoacids with internal allenes. Using a Rh\n                    (I)\n                    /(\n                    S\n                    ,\n                    S\n                    )‐Ph‐BPE system, α‐\n                    gem\n                    ‐difluoroallylic carbonyl compounds can be generated with excellent chemo‐, regio‐, and enantioselectivities. Mechanistic studies support “coordination‐assisted inner‐sphere addition–decarboxylation” pathway, where C─C bond formation occurs prior to the decarboxylation step. Fluorine‐induced\n                    anti\n                    →\n                    syn\n                    isomerization of π‐allyl‐rhodium species proves to be the key factor governing the stereoselectivity of this reaction. This cross‐coupling reaction tolerates a range of functional groups and advances the field of decarboxylative allylic alkylation."},{"t":"数据基础设施建设能否缓解清洁能源错配？——基于中国省级数据的分析","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001813?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源数据化","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"老鼠可以无限克隆吗？长达数十年的实验给出了答案","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00945-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"CD47 稳定 ROBO2，通过阻止 ITCH 介导的泛素化来调节胶质母细胞瘤进展","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602460123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"CD47 is an innate immune checkpoint that inhibits phagocytosis by myeloid cells, contributing to immune evasion by cancer cells. CD47-blocking antibodies have limited efficacy in glioblastoma (GBM), and the cell-intrinsic role of CD47 is poorly understood. In this study, we show that CD47 is highly expressed at the invasive edge of GBM tumors, and its elevated expression correlates with poor patient survival. We demonstrate that CD47 loss impairs GBM cell proliferation, migration, and invasion, independent of immune activity, and leads to reduced tumor burden and prolonged survival in vivo. Our study identifies ROBO2 signaling as a key downstream effector of CD47 and demonstrates that loss of ROBO2 similarly reduces GBM cell proliferation and migration. Importantly, we have uncovered that CD47 stabilizes ROBO2 by sequestering the E3 ubiquitin ligase ITCH, thereby blocking ubiquitination and proteasomal degradation of ROBO2. These findings establish CD47 as a key regulator of GBM cell plasticity and highlight the therapeutic potential of targeting CD47\n                    –\n                    ROBO2 signaling in GBM."},{"t":"用于可见光区低蓝光圆偏振光产生的宽带反射型胆甾相液晶","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72890?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"胆甾相液晶","kp":["原料[胆甾相液晶]: 生物质胆固醇衍生手性单体","[特性]: 宽带反射+可见区低蓝光圆偏振光"],"as":"该工作以廉价生物质衍生手性分子为原料，合成可聚合手性液晶单体，制备出宽带反射型胆甾相液晶薄膜，可有效反射蓝光圆偏振光，实现低蓝光危害的显示与照明应用，兼具低成本与可持续性优势。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Broadband Reflective Cholesteric Liquid Crystals for Low‐Blue Circularly Polarized Light Generation in the Visible Regio","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In this work, a polymerizable chiral liquid‐crystal monomer was first synthesized from inexpensive biomass‐derived cholesterol through a simple transformation. Co‐assembling this chiral monomer with a polymerizable achiral liquid‐crystal monomer and followed by initiator‐free photopolymerization, yielded a cholesteric liquid‐crystal (CLC) material\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    featuring a broad reflection band in the visible region with blue‐selectivity. After removal of the quartz substrates, the material forms a flexible film with good thermal stability. Due to Bragg reflection, under transmission mode,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    efficiently converts 510–700 nm unpolarized light into right‐handed circularly polarized (\n                    R\n                    ‐CP) light with dissymmetry factors (\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    ) of −1.6 and even reaching up to −2.0. Placed behind achiral zero‐blue aqueous solutions,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    enabled multicolour zero‐blue circularly polarized photoluminescence, generating exclusively\n                    R\n                    ‐CP light with |\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    | values exceeding 1.6. Additionally, under reflection mode,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    efficiently converts unpolarized ambient light into 510–700 nm low‐blue left‐handed circularly polarized (\n                    L\n                    ‐CP) light. Therefore,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    exhibited distinctly different colors under varying backgrounds and circular polarizers. Leveraging these behaviors, molecular logic gate and information encryption–decryption were realized. Furthermore, a conceptual design for a low‐blue circularly polarized display device was also demonstrated."},{"t":"整体致密二元合金的键软化与弹性限域实现钾离子电池负极高体积比容量","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9686588?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钾离子负极","kp":["负极材料[钾离子电池]: Sb0.6Bi0.4合金/石墨烯","[稳定化策略]: 键软化与弹性限域双重稳定","组分[2D合金]: Sb0.6Bi0.4"],"as":"研究通过化学键软化与弹性限域策略，构建单块致密二元Sb-Bi合金二维材料，用作钾离子电池负极。该设计缓解了充放电过程中的体积膨胀，实现高容量与高倍率性能，为碱金属离子电池负极材料设计提供了新思路。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Bond Softening and Elastic Confinement of Monolithic Dense Binary Alloys for High Volumetric Capacity of K‐Ion Battery A","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Two‐dimensional (2D) Sb─Bi alloys are considered as the promising high‐capacity and high‐rate anodes of potassium‐ion batteries, yet their practical application is limited by low density and structural degradation. Herein, we propose an intrinsic‐extrinsic dual‐stabilization strategy that integrates 2D binary Sb\n                    0.6\n                    Bi\n                    0.4\n                    nanosheets into 3D elastic graphene networks, constructing a highly dense monolithic architecture (HD‐Sb\n                    0.6\n                    Bi\n                    0.4\n                    @G). This design features with high density (2.6 g cm\n                    −3\n                    ) and electrical conductivity (555.6 S m\n                    −1\n                    ), delivering large volumetric capacity (1355.1 mAh cm\n                    −3\n                    ) and high areal capacity (11.4 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    ) at an ultra‐high loading of 27.6 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    , along with long‐term cyclability (65.4% capacity retention after 1500 cycles) and stable full‐cell performance. Experimental and theoretical analyses reveal that the Sb─Bi alloy exhibited “bond softening” with the optimized interlayer spacing and moderate bond energy, facilitating rapid K\n                    +\n                    diffusion and buffering strain. Furthermore, the elastic graphene network provides nanoscale confinement, accommodating volume expansion and preserving structural and electrical integrity. Strong electronic coupling at the alloy‐graphene interface further reduces K\n                    +\n                    adsorption and diffusion energy barriers, enabling fast ion transport under the high‐loading anodes. This intrinsic‐extrinsic synergy between binary‐alloy bond softening and nanoscale elastic confinement provides a universal strategy for compact, high‐loading electrodes with high volumetric and areal energy storage.","aip":1},{"t":"基于生物的片上模型可识别过度兴奋的皮质纹状体内的选择性拓扑重组","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513459123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The mammalian cerebral cortex projects to the striatum in a precise, hierarchical topography, forming parallel loops that underlie sensorimotor, associative, and limbic processing. Despite the striatum’s lack of clear anatomical boundaries, these projections remain functionally segregated, suggesting the existence of intrinsic organizing principles. Disruptions in corticostriatal connectivity and excitability are common in neurodevelopmental disorders, but it remains unclear whether such abnormalities are a cause or a consequence of circuit dysfunction. Here, we hypothesized that the excitability state of cortical neurons plays a direct role in shaping the topographic organization of their striatal projections. To test this, we engineered a biologically faithful in vitro platform inspired by the Tesla valve, enabling adjacent corticostriatal territories to be modeled under controlled excitability regimes. We found that cortical hyperexcitability disrupted the normal developmental transition from axonal growth to stabilization, leading to premature invasion of neighboring territories and the formation of ectopic convergence zones. As a result, the segregation between parallel pathways was lost, while local connectivity patterns remained unaffected. These findings reveal that intrinsic, activity-sensitive mechanisms constrain long-range axonal growth to shape the wiring diagram of the corticostriatal projectome. They also highlight the power of biologically grounded on-chip models to uncover how early circuit vulnerabilities can lead to connectivity defects characteristic of disorders such as autism spectrum disorder, schizophrenia, epilepsy, and obsessive-compulsive disorder.","tp":"片上脑模型","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"哺乳动物大脑皮层以精确的分层拓扑结构投射至纹状体，形成感觉运动、联想和边缘处理的平行环路。研究构建片上生物模型，探索皮层纹状体连接中过度兴奋状态下的选择性拓扑重组规律，揭示神经发育障碍中连接异常和兴奋性失衡的内在组织原理，为理解神经环路功能分隔机制提供新视角。"},{"t":"超越掺杂：稀土介导的多功能电催化剂理性设计策略","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70863?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"稀土电催化剂","kp":["[策略]: 稀土4f电子构型精准调控电催化剂","[特性]: 可逆多价态+可调物化性质"],"as":"综述了稀土元素介导的电催化剂理性设计策略，超越传统掺杂思路。通过稀土独特的4f电子结构调控催化活性中心的电子环境，实现多功能高效电催化（如ORR、OER、HER），推动可再生能源转换与存储技术的发展。","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"dp":1,"ot":"Beyond Doping: Rare‐Earth Mediated Strategies for Rational Design of Multifunctional Electrocatalysts","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    With the rapid development of renewable energy, electrocatalysis has assumed a central role in the conversion and storage of sustainable energy. Rare‐earth (RE) elements, characterized by their unique\n                    4f\n                    electronic configurations, reversible multivalent states, and highly tunable physicochemical properties, offer a fundamentally distinct pathway for achieving precise control over catalyst electronic structures, interfacial chemistry, and reaction pathways. This review presents a comprehensive and mechanistic perspective on the distinctive, multi‐faceted roles of RE elements in advanced electrocatalysis. By systematically analyzing their intrinsic properties, the review elucidates the quantum‐chemical origins of their advantages in electronic structure modulation, stabilization of high‐energy intermediates, and enhancement of interfacial charge transport. Building upon these foundations, some major catalyst design strategies, encompassing atomic doping, defect engineering, nanostructuring, and interface construction, are critically summarized. Then, recent progress of RE‐based catalysts in various electrocatalytic reactions, including oxygen and hydrogen evolution, and carbon dioxide and nitrogen reduction reactions, are thoroughly reviewed to establish structure‐activity correlations. Finally, the review outlines future prospects and emerging frontiers in RE‐mediated catalysis, such as multi‐electron reaction pathway regulation and the construction of adaptive interfaces. This work aims to provide a fundamental understanding and strategic guidance for the rational design of efficient electrocatalysts enabled by RE elements."},{"t":"具有不对称局部电场的轴向硫桥Mo-S-Cu纳米酶可增强F的多酶活性","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523888?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The axial coordination‐based nanozymes with asymmetric local electric field (LEF) are promising for efficient reactive oxygen species (ROS)‐mediated antitumor treatments, while normally hindered by a limited LEF upon individual coordination to adjacent atoms. Herein, an axial sulfur‐bridged Mo─S─Cu nanozymes with asymmetric LEF (A‐CuN\n                    3\n                    S\n                    1\n                    @MoS\n                    2‐x\n                    ) was constructed based on nanoislands (NIs)‐based axial ligand‐bridging to enhance ferroptosis‐pyroptosis therapy. The S bridge between Cu atoms in CuN\n                    3\n                    /C nanosheets and Mo site in NIs creates a broad and enhanced LEF, which facilitates rapid electron transfer between the nanozyme and substrates, thereby regulating its enzymatic activities. Theoretical calculations reveal that the S‐bridge induces asymmetric electron‐rich redistribution along the longitudinal axis of Cu─N\n                    3\n                    , promoting H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    heterolysis and O\n                    2\n                    desorption to enhance catalase‐like and peroxidase‐like activities. Simultaneously, Mo sites extract electrons from Cu via the S bridge, augmenting oxidase‐like activities and degrade overexpressed glutathione to avoid nontherapeutic ROS consumption. Consequently, A‐CuN\n                    3\n                    S\n                    1\n                    @MoS\n                    2‐x\n                    induces robust ferroptosis by cytotoxic ROS accumulation and causing severe mitochondria damages, while simultaneously activating pyroptosis within the tumor region without harming normal tissues. This work demonstrates high‐efficiency ferroptosis‐pyroptosis therapy driven by multi‐enzyme catalysis via axial Mo─S─Cu coordination with an expanded asymmetric LEF, offering a novel strategy for non‐apoptotic tumor treatment.","tp":"纳米酶催化","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究设计了一种具有不对称局部电场（LEF）的轴向硫桥Mo─S─Cu纳米酶（A-CuN3S1@MoS2-x）。通过轴向硫桥配位策略打破对称性，增强局部电场强度，显著提升活性氧（ROS）介导的多酶催化活性，用于高效抗肿瘤治疗。该策略克服了传统单原子配位中LEF受限的瓶颈，为纳米酶肿瘤催化治疗提供了新设计思路。"},{"t":"作者更正：7-脱氢胆固醇是铁死亡的内源性抑制剂","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10403-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"北部中纬度地区大气氧化能力正达到拐点","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag178/8539750?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The hydroxyl radical (OH) constitutes the primary atmospheric oxidant, governing the removal of short-lived greenhouse gases such as methane and the formation of secondary pollutants, including ozone. Characterizing long-term OH variability is critical for understanding atmospheric oxidation capacity and formulation of air quality improvement strategies. Although previous studies have linked OH increases to anthropogenic emissions, particularly nitrogen oxides (NOx), the historical evolution of OH remains poorly constrained. Here, we develop an observation-based method (OBM) to quantify spatiotemporal variability of surface OH concentration and identify its key turning points for China, Europe and the United States. Relative to clean regions, OH concentrations have increased by about 300% in all three regions, mainly attributable to enhanced NOx emissions. However, OBM-derived trends reveal that OH levels have reached a turning point, with statistically significant decreases observed at ∼10% of stations in Europe and the United States, while ∼85% of stations continue to increase. At hemispheric mid-latitudes, OH levels have remained near peak values of (5–9) × 106 cm−3 over the past 50–60 years, and it may take another several decades to fully return to the NOx-limited regime, beyond the turning point. These findings challenge prior assessments of OH increases or stability and suggest an emerging decline in mid-latitude atmospheric oxidation capacity, as well as provide a novel indicator of regional ozone control strategies."},{"t":"对晚期尼安德特人人口历史的考古学见解","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520565123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The demographic history of Neanderthals is only partially understood. In Europe, some degree of genetic continuity has been shown from 120 thousand years ago (ka) onward despite the occurrence of multiple subsequent diversification events. While it has been proposed that a population turnover preceded the emergence of Late Neanderthals in Europe, the extent, timing, and geographic location of this event are currently unknown. Here, we report ten mitochondrial DNA sequences (mtDNAs) of Neanderthal individuals from six archaeological sites in Belgium, France, Germany and Serbia, and analyze them alongside 49 published mtDNAs. The integration of phylogenetic and molecular dating analyses with an extensive archaeological dataset enabled us to reconstruct temporal and spatial patterns in Neanderthal distribution. Remarkably, nearly all Late Neanderthal individuals across Europe belong to a single mtDNA lineage that diversified recently, confirming a large-scale genetic replacement. Our analyses date this diversification event to approximately 65 ka and suggest that it likely originated from a population refugium in southwestern France from which Neanderthals appear to have undergone a major range dispersal across Europe. In addition, we detect a sharp decline in the Neanderthal mtDNA effective population size beginning ~45 ka and reaching a minimum ~42 ka, shortly before their extinction. This study demonstrates that integrating molecular and archaeological datasets provides a more detailed understanding of the Late Neanderthal population’s history, and highlights the critical role of climate-driven refugia and subsequent range expansions in shaping the genetic landscape of Neanderthals through time."},{"t":"含Pt-(双NHC)-Pt单元的有机金属[2]索烃：拓扑驱动策略增强盘状分子磷光发射","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1981919?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铂索烃配合物","kp":["[超分子磷光]: 机械键限制分子内运动增强发射","发光材料[索烃]: 双核Pt(II)-NHC配合物"],"dp":1,"as":"研究报道了一种基于有机金属[2]索烃（catenane）的新型分子拓扑结构，核心由Pt‒(di-NHC)‒Pt单元构成。机械互锁分子（MIMs）是一类独特的离散型分子聚集体，该工作以拓扑驱动策略实现两个金属环的互锁组装，利用双N-杂环卡宾（di-NHC）配体与铂中心的配位化学，构建出稳定且结构明确的[2]索烃拓扑体。该分子在分子机器、催化及功能材料领域具有潜在应用价值，为机械互锁配合物的合理设计与可控合成提供了新范式。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"An Organometallic [2]Catenane With Pt‒(di‐NHC)‒Pt Units: A Topology‐Driven Strategy for Enhanced Phosphorescence in Disc","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mechanically interlocked molecules (MIMs) can be conceptualized as a distinct class of discrete and soluble aggregates, where the mechanical bond restricts selected intramolecular motions, thereby triggering emission enhancement analogous to aggregation‐induced emission (AIE). Herein, we present phosphorescent MIMs based on a benzobiscarbene bridged dinuclear Pt\n                    II\n                    complex (NHC =\n                    N\n                    ‐heterocyclic carbene ligand). Tailoring the\n                    N\n                    ‐substituents of the benzobiscarbene ligand allowed selective access to the\n                    syn‐\n                    configured dinuclear complex\n                    syn‐\n                    [Pt\n                    2\n                    (\n                    1b\n                    )X\n                    2\n                    ] (X = I, OTf). Self‐assembly of\n                    syn‐\n                    [Pt\n                    2\n                    (\n                    1b\n                    )(OTf)\n                    2\n                    ] with bipyridyl ligands\n                    \n                      L\n                      2\n                    \n                    and\n                    \n                      L\n                      3\n                    \n                    yielded two discrete MIMs: the Borromean rings [\n                    2‐BRs\n                    ](OTf)\n                    12\n                    stabilized by π···π interactions and the [2]catenane [\n                    3b‐IL\n                    ](OTf)\n                    4\n                    , generated and stabilized by solvophobic effects. While the π···π interactions in the Borromean rings lead to severe phosphorescence quenching, the solvophobically assembled [2]catenane effectively circumvents such quenching, while simultaneously restricting intramolecular rotations and vibrations. Consequently, the [2]catenane displays a drastic phosphorescence enhancement compared to the Borromean rings."},{"t":"通过保留长链在白炭黑增强天然橡胶中增韧","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530834123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"天然橡胶增韧","kp":["[增韧机制]: 保留长链实现应变诱导结晶增韧","[失效原因]: 塑炼断链降低天然橡胶性能"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"天然橡胶因长分子链和应变诱导结晶（SIC）机制而优于合成橡胶，但传统白炭黑增强工艺会切断长链降低性能。本研究提出保留长链的增强策略，在维持白炭黑补强效果的同时避免长链断裂，显著提升了天然橡胶的韧性，对轮胎等高性能橡胶制品的工程化具有重要意义。","ot":"Amplifying toughness in silica-reinforced natural rubber by preserving long chains","b":"Natural rubber outperforms synthetic rubbers because of its long chains and strain-induced crystallization (SIC). However, these advantages are largely lost when the natural rubber chains are masticated during processing, and silica particles are added for reinforcement. Mastication eases mixing but shortens chains and lowers performance. Silica particles require covalent interlinks with rubber chains, but these interlinks restrict chain stretch and alignment, reducing SIC. Here, we show that the performance of silica-reinforced natural rubber can be markedly enhanced by preserving long natural rubber chains. We use a solvent to dissolve natural rubber latex into individual rubber chains and use the solution to uniformly disperse silica particles. After drying, the uncured compound can be stored and molded prior to curing. The long rubber chains are then sparsely crosslinked with one another and interlinked with the silica particles. The long strands readily align under stretch and increase SIC. Preserving long chains elevates toughness by an order of magnitude, from ~2 to 44 kJ m\n                    –2\n                    . High toughness arises from energy dissipation across multiple length scales, over long rubber strands, silica particles, and a zone of SIC. High modulus of ~19 MPa arises from two interpenetrating networks: the network of densely entangled rubber chains and the network of percolated silica particles. The resulting material achieves high toughness while maintaining high modulus, a combination uncommon in silica-reinforced synthetic and natural rubbers."},{"t":"MXene-聚合物复合材料在尖端超级电容器与电磁屏蔽领域的进展","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003119?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"MXene聚合物超容屏蔽","dp":1,"sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":2.5,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","ot":"Advances in MXene-Polymer Composites for Cutting-edge Supercapacitor and EMI Shielding Applications"},{"t":"脂肪 Dicer-1 通过 miR-8–Aop–Dilp6 轴调节全身胰岛素信号传导和寿命","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525327123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Interorgan communication is essential for metabolic homeostasis and healthy aging, with adipose tissue acting as a central hub that coordinates systemic metabolism, stress responses, and longevity. Here, we show that the miRNA-processing enzyme Dicer-1 (Dcr-1) acts in the fat body (FB) to regulate Dilp2 secretion from brain insulin-producing cells (IPCs), thereby modulating systemic insulin signaling and lifespan in\n                    Drosophila\n                    . Dcr-1 expression is reduced in multiple long-lived conditions, and its partial downregulation enhances oxidative stress resistance, alters lipid metabolism, and extends lifespan even under dietary restriction. Proteomic profiling of FBs from Dcr-1 heterozygous flies revealed widespread metabolic reprogramming and stress adaptation consistent with attenuated insulin/IGF signaling (IIS). Mechanistically, reduced Dcr-1 lowers miR-8 levels in the FB, which indirectly upregulates\n                    Drosophila\n                    insulin-like peptide 6 (Dilp6). Dilp6 acts nonautonomously to suppress Dilp2 secretion from IPCs, reducing systemic IIS and promoting longevity. We further show that Dcr-1 reduction activates the ETS-family repressor Aop/ETV6 downstream of Ras-Erk signaling, which is required for Dilp6 induction and the lifespan extension observed upon miR-8 depletion. Collectively, these findings reveal a miRNA-dependent regulatory axis that couples adipose-derived endocrine signals to systemic insulin regulation and aging, positioning Dcr-1 as a central node in the control of metabolic homeostasis and lifespan."},{"t":"缩醛[6]芳烃：刚性环上手性大环化合物促进电荷转移共组装及卓越（手性）光学性能","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4969685?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性大环分子","kp":["[大环主体]: Acetal[6]arenes刚性手性大环","[电荷转移组装]: 与缺电子芳烃客体共组装"],"dp":1,"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究引入缩醛[6]芳烃（Acetal[6]arenes）作为新型刚性手性大环分子，其碳中心手性赋予大环刚性构象。该分子可促进电荷转移共组装，展现出优异的光学（包括手性光学）性能，在分子识别、手性传感和光电功能材料领域具有应用潜力，拓展了超分子化学的手性大环工具箱。","ot":"Acetal[6]Arenes: Rigid Chirality‐on‐Annulus Macrocycles Promoting Charge‐Transfer Co‐Assembly With Exceptional (Chiro)Op","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Acetal[6]arenes (\n                    Ac[6]\n                    ) are introduced as a new class of rigid chiral macrocyclic arenes in which carbon‐centered chirality is embedded in a trioxabicyclo[3.3.1]nonane motif at macrocyclic waist.\n                    Ac[6]\n                    efficiently forms charge‐transfer (CT) complexes with electron‐deficient aromatic guests in both solution and the solid state. Single‐crystal x‐ray diffraction reveals that guest molecules bind to the outer surface of\n                    Ac[6]\n                    through well‐defined stacking interactions. In contrast, the corresponding acyclic bis‐acetal precursors show no complexation behavior, indicating that the rigid macrocyclic topology suppresses ring‐unit flipping and significantly enhances interfacial π–π interactions. The resulting solid‐state complexes exhibit dual emission at CT band (prompt fluorescence and TADF). Notably, complexes derived from enantiopure\n                    Ac[6]\n                    display intense circular dichroism (CD) and circularly polarized luminescence (CPL). The associated dissymmetry factors (\n                    \n                      g\n                      abs\n                    \n                    and\n                    \n                      g\n                      lum\n                    \n                    ) even exceed intrinsic\n                    Ac[6]\n                    values, indicating highly efficient chiral transfer.\n                    Ac[6]\n                    shows robust guest‐capture capability, forming CT complexes not only via solution co‐crystallization but also through simple physical mixing and even gas‐phase guest uptake. By exploiting time‐dependent capture kinetics and multicolor optoelectronic properties, we developed applications for optical sensing and time‐encoded encryption. These results establish macrocyclization of rigid chirality‐on‐annulus units as a powerful strategy for creating functional supramolecular CT materials with emergent chiroptical and optoelectronic properties."},{"t":"基于可解释图学习与GPU加速的电力-氢能最优能流两阶段优化框架","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600406X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电氢能量流优化","dp":1,"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"A two-stage framework for optimal electricity‑hydrogen energy flow based on explainable graph learning and GPU-accelerat"},{"t":"中小型商业建筑节能控制的迁移学习方法","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003971?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"分子工程化电子选择性自组装单分子层增强倒置钙钛矿电池准费米能级劈裂","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02025-6","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿自组装单层","kp":["[界面材料]: 电子选择性自组装单分子层","[机制]: 减缓界面提取速率增强准费米能级分裂"],"as":"研究通过分子工程手段设计了一种电子选择性自组装单分子层（SAM），旨在提升钙钛矿太阳能电池中准费米能级分裂（QFLS）的最大化程度。传统方法难以充分实现QFLS，而该分子级工程化的SAM界面能够有效减少界面复合损失，从而获得更高的光电压，为突破钙钛矿电池效率瓶颈提供了新的界面修饰策略。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"A molecularly engineered electron-selective self-assembled monolayer enhances quasi-Fermi level splitting in inverted pe","b":"Maximizing quasi-Fermi level splitting is essential for achieving high photovoltage in perovskite solar cells. Conventional strategies that prioritize rapid charge extraction at the perovskite/fullerene interface, can deplete interfacial carrier populations, limiting quasi-Fermi level splitting and photovoltage. Here we demonstrate that rational interface design benefits for slowed extraction rate, preserving interfacial carriers while minimizing non-radiative recombination. We introduce 3PDPA, a molecularly engineered electron-selective self-assembled monolayer at the perovskite/C60 interface. 3PDPA slows electron extraction, anchors undercoordinated Pb2+ ions and forms stable six-membered hydrogen-bonded rings with FA+ cations, delivering robust passivation and excellent chemical stability. 3PDPA further enables π–π interactions with C60, improving interfacial contact and reducing potential fluctuations. Inverted cells incorporating 3PDPA achieve efficiencies of 26.82% for 1.53 eV bandgap cells and 21.2% for 1.77 eV bandgap cells, alongside a T90 lifetime of ~1,000 h under International Summit on Organic Photovoltaic Stability (ISOS-L-3) stress conditions."},{"t":"区域电力经济预测的机器学习框架：发展美国区域能源经济","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003570?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源经济预","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"一种柔性动态单原子电磁开关","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00066-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子电磁开关","kp":["[电磁开关]: 单原子柔性晶体管电控电磁波切换","[柔性电子]: 重原子锚定超薄片层低功耗"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种基于单原子的柔性动态电磁开关。面向未来电子器件对实时电磁信号主动管理的需求，研究利用单个金属原子作为开关活性中心，通过外加电场或应力精确控制其态切换，实现了柔性基底上的电磁信号调制。该器件兼具原子级超小尺寸、机械柔性与动态可调谐特性，在柔性电子和可穿戴电磁器件领域具有应用潜力。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A flexible and dynamic single-atom-based electromagnetic switch","b":"Future electronics demand materials that can actively manage electromagnetic signals in real time. A flexible transistor that uses isolated heavy atoms anchored on an ultrathin sheet to electrically switch between transmitting and blocking electromagnetic waves with exceptional precision and low power. This innovation enables smart, adaptable electromagnetic control in next-generation wearable and integrated circuits, moving beyond static shielding toward dynamically programmable signal management."},{"t":"用于过氧化氢生产的均相催化配对电解池","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524811?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化双氧水合成","kp":["[配对电解池]: 2e-WOR与2e-ORR耦合产H2O2","[H2O2电合成]: 均相催化成对电解"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种均相催化配对电解池用于过氧化氢（H₂O₂）的生产。通过将双电子水氧化反应（2e⁻-WOR）与双电子氧还原反应（2e⁻-ORR）分别作为阳极和阴极过程配对耦合，在两个电极上同步生成H₂O₂，实现电能利用效率最大化。均相催化剂避免了异相催化中的传质限制，提升了反应选择性与法拉第效率，为绿色可持续的H₂O₂电合成提供了新路径。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Homogeneously Catalyzed Paired Electrolytic Cell for Hydrogen Peroxide Production","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The two‐electron water oxidation reaction (2e\n                    −\n                    ‐WOR) and oxygen reduction reaction (2e\n                    −\n                    ‐ORR) represent sustainable and promising processes for the electrochemical synthesis of hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ). The main factor hampering the realization of a paired electrochemical cell for H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production is finding appropriate catalysts for both 2e\n                    −\n                    ‐ORR and 2e\n                    −\n                    ‐WOR, able to work under the same experimental conditions. Herein we show that\n                    Cu(tmpa))\n                    and\n                    Sn‐TMPyP\n                    are compatible and efficient catalysts for 2e\n                    −\n                    ‐ORR and 2e\n                    −\n                    ‐WOR, respectively. They have been used to assemble a paired electrochemical cell for H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production. The latter exhibits a total overpotential of 570 mV, distributed between the two electrodes. During a 3 h bulk electrolysis experiment, the cathodic Faradaic efficiency ranged from 15% to 19% with a H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production rate of 1.6 µmol h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    . Meanwhile, at the anode, the Faradaic efficiency stabilized between 40% and 50%, yielding a H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production rate of 3.5 µmol h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    . The remarkable activity of\n                    Sn‐TMPyP\n                    as a catalyst for the 2e\n                    −\n                    ‐WOR, ranking among the highest reported for molecular catalysts, is ascribed to the selection of a carbonate buffer as the electrolyte, which enhanced catalytic performance by facilitating dissociation of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    from the Sn catalyst. This work establishes a new benchmark for homogeneous dual‐electrode H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    electrosynthesis."},{"t":"氮杂多环芳烃宇宙尘埃模拟物的制备及初步撞击电离质谱研究","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18079","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"宇宙尘埃模拟物","kp":["模拟对象[宇宙尘埃]: 含氮多环芳烃亚微米颗粒","熔点[N-苯基咔唑]: 96°C","熔点[N-乙基咔唑]: 71°C","熔点[N-丙基咔唑]: 50°C","分析[共晶组成]: 冲击电离质谱"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队首次合成了亚微米级含氮多环芳烃（PAH）宇宙尘埃模拟物，并开展了初步的撞击电离质谱研究。该合成模拟物可用于标定太空探测器质谱仪对星际尘埃中含氮有机组分的检测能力，对理解宇宙有机化学演化和生命前体分子起源具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Synthetic Mimics for Nitrogen-Based Polycyclic Aromatic Hydrocarbon Cosmic Dust: Preparation and Preliminary Impact Ionization Mass Spectrometry Studies","b":"We report the preparation of the first synthetic mimic for submicron-sized nitrogen-based polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbon (PANH) cosmic dust. Melting point phase diagrams were constructed for two binary mixtures comprising N-phenylcarbazole (mp 96 °C) with either N-ethylcarbazole (mp 71 °C) or N-propylcarbazole (mp 50 °C) to identify their respective eutectic compositions. Each eutectic composition was then processed above its eutectic temperature via hot emulsification using a commercial water-soluble polymeric emulsifier: high-shear homogenization produced polydisperse molten PANH droplets of approximately 60-70 μm diameter. Each precursor emulsion was then subjected to high-pressure microfluidization to produce much finer submicron-sized PANH droplets. On cooling to 20 °C, these hybrid PANH microparticles were coated with an ultrathin overlayer of polypyrrole (PPy). This electrically conductive coating enabled the efficient accumulation of surface charge, which in turn allowed the electrostatic acceleration of such PPy-coated PANH microparticles up to the hypervelocity regime using a high-voltage dust accelerator. Firing such PPy-coated PANH microparticles into a gold target at 1.9-5.0 km s-1 led to their impact ionization and the in situ generation of an ionic plasma. Subsequent impact ionization mass spectrometry analysis confirmed the formation of the characteristic parent cations for N-phenylcarbazole and either N-propylcarbazole or N-ethylcarbazole, respectively. Such laboratory-based experiments augur well for the unambiguous identification of PANH-based cosmic dust by next-generation impact ionization mass spectrometers to be deployed in current and future space missions."},{"t":"通过单线态氧/自由基拦截型粘结剂抑制富锂锰基正极的级联降解","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c03092","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂锰基正极","kp":["[正极类型]: 富锂锰基层状氧化物","[降解机制]: 高压循环产生活性单线态氧与自由基","[策略]: 单线态氧/自由基拦截粘结剂抑制级联降解"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"富锂锰基层状氧化物因高容量被视为高能量密度锂电池正极候选材料，但存在严重的级联降解问题。本研究开发了一种捕获单线态氧/自由基的粘结剂，通过抑制正极充放电过程中的活性氧物种释放，有效遏制结构退化，显著提升富锂锰基正极的循环稳定性，为高能量密度锂电正极的工程化提供新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Suppressing Cascade Degradation of Lithium-Rich Manganese-Based Cathodes via Singlet Oxygen/Free Radical-Intercepting Binder","b":"Lithium-rich manganese-based layered oxides with high capacity are regarded as highly attractive cathodes for high-energy-density lithium-ion batteries. However, the redox reactions in this cathode usually generate highly reactive singlet oxygen and electrolyte-derived free radicals during high-voltage cycling, which accelerate electrolyte oxidative decomposition and trigger cascading side reactions, leading to a rapid capacity fade. Herein, we report a targeted scavenging strategy employing a hindered amine-functionalized triblock binder to trap singlet oxygen and free radicals, improving the long-cycle stability of the cathodes. The amino groups (N-H) in the hindered amine structure can continuously scavenge singlet oxygen and generate nitroxide radicals (N-O·). Both the parent N-H groups and the resulting N-O· radicals further act as effective traps for free radicals derived from electrolyte decomposition, stabilizing the interfacial stability and transport kinetics of the cathode under 4.8 V. Consequently, the full cell with this binder exhibits a significantly reduced capacity decay rate of 0.175% per cycle over 200 cycles. Our work provides a viable solution for enhancing the cycling stability of lithium-rich manganese-based cathodes, promoting the development of high-energy-density lithium-ion batteries."},{"t":"金属-绝缘体-半导体光电极氢致钝化机制的缺陷密度空间定量分析","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01240","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MIS光电极析氢","kp":["[钝化机制]: 氢诱导缺陷钝化","[绝缘层工艺]: 原子层沉积(ALD)工程化","[应用]: 硅基MIS光电极光电化学水分解"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"硅基金属-绝缘体-半导体（MIS）光电极通过内置电场驱动光电化学水分解，但缺陷态导致界面复合损失严重。本研究开发了空间定量表征缺陷密度的方法，揭示了氢钝化处理对MIS光阳极界面缺陷的修复机制，为提升硅基光电催化水分解效率提供了缺陷工程指导。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Spatially Quantitative Profiling of Defect Density for Hydrogen-Induced Passivation Mechanism of Metal–Insulator–Semiconductor Photoanodes","b":"Silicon-based metal-insulator-semiconductor (MIS) photoelectrodes provide a built-in field for photoelectrochemical water splitting but suffer from inefficient charge transport due to carrier recombination at defect sites within the space-charge region. The insulating layer fabricated by atomic layer deposition (ALD) is critical for defect passivation and requires carefully engineered deposition and annealing processes for optimal performance. This necessitates the quantitative analysis of defect density distribution. However, such analysis remains impeded by intrinsic limitations of conventional single-capacitance techniques and the influence of tunneling leakage currents. This paper describes an integrated multicapacitance methodology that combines drive-level capacitance profiling (DLCP) and capacitance-voltage (C-V) techniques to quantify both interface (Nit) and bulk defect charge density (NDLCP) within the space-charge region, using the space-charge capacitance refined by MIS-adapted multicomponent equivalent circuit modeling. This approach reveals that Al2O3 reduces the Nit at n-Si/ITO interface from approximately 2.9 × 1016 to 1.4 × 1016 cm-3, while simultaneously profiling the variation of NDLCP and depletion width. Furthermore, systematic DLCP/C-V analysis enables the design of a tailored passivation protocol by tuning ALD deposition (Tdep) and annealing temperatures to leverage the hydrogen-induced mechanism. Optimal passivation is achieved at a moderate Tdep (∼160 °C) followed by 350 °C annealing, which balances sufficient hydrogen content and suitable structural properties of the Al2O3 film without introducing additional bulk defects during annealing. Eventually, the optimized n-Si/SiOx/Al2O3/ITO/Ni photoanode exhibits an onset potential of 0.88 V vs RHE and an applied bias photon-to-current efficiency (ABPE) of 2.91%, with a long-term stability of 120 h."},{"t":"调控非共价相互作用构建高温多轴无铅金属卤化物杂化铁电体","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21648","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无铅铁电材料","kp":["[材料体系]: (PMA)3MBr6基无铅金属卤化物杂化铁电体","[改进方向]: 高居里温度多轴铁电","[调控手段]: 调节非共价相互作用"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"无铅分子铁电体因环境友好性被视为绿色电子技术的关键材料，但高温稳定性不足。本研究通过调控非共价相互作用（氢键、卤键等），构建了耐高温多轴无铅金属卤化物杂化铁电体，在高温环境下保持优异的铁电性和极化翻转特性，对开发绿色压电传感器和存储器件具有重要价值。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Regulating Noncovalent Interactions to Construct High-Temperature Multiaxial Lead-Free Metal Halide Hybrid Ferroelectrics","b":"Lead-free molecular ferroelectrics are expected to promote the development of green electronics technology due to their environmental friendliness and functional diversity. Nevertheless, the limited variety, low Curie temperature (Tc), and uniaxial characteristics pose significant obstacles in their application. Herein, on the basis of (PMA)3MBr6 (PMA+ is benzylammonium, and M is Bi3+ or Sb3+), we constructed a series of lead-free metal halide hybrids (PMA)2(A)MBr6 (A is dimethylammonium (DMA+), formamidinium (FA+), or guanidinium (GA+)) using a cation mixing strategy. The cation mixing strategy introduces cation-π interactions and effectively regulates the hydrogen bonding network in the structure. The different strengths of noncovalent interactions in the structures lead to differences in the phase transition temperature and ferroelectricity of (PMA)2(A)MBr6. In (PMA)2(GA)MBr6 and (PMA)2(FA)MBr6, the excessively strong hydrogen bond network and cation-π interactions result in the system lacking the necessary kinetic degrees of freedom to achieve ferroelectric inversion. It is worth noting that moderate noncovalent interactions can ensure spontaneous polarization below the Curie temperature (Tc) and provide necessary dynamic channels for the flipping of polar units, thus successfully achieving ferroelectricity in (PMA)2(DMA)MBr6 (3̅mFm). The results revealed that in the design of molecular ferroelectrics, a delicate balance needs to be struck between the different strengths of noncovalent interactions. This finding provides a significant and effective pathway to design high-Tc and multiaxial environmentally friendly ferroelectrics."},{"t":"四稠合卟啉外围氮掺杂及其多步质子耦合电子转移形成34π芳香分子的研究","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00542","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"卟啉电子转移","kp":["[反应]: 芳烃四电子还原","[底物]: 四次稠合卟啉ZnII配合物(外围氮掺杂)","[产物]: 34π芳香分子","[关键机制]: 多步质子耦合电子转移"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"芳香化合物的四电子还原极具挑战性。本研究在四稠环卟啉外围引入氮掺杂，通过多步质子耦合电子转移（PCET）成功实现了四电子还原，生成34π芳香性分子。该工作拓展了大环芳香体系的电子结构与芳香性调控策略，为研究非典型芳香性和设计新型功能分子提供了新范式。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Nitrogen Doping at the Periphery of a Quadruply-Fused Porphyrin and Its Multi-Step Proton-Coupled Electron Transfer to Form a 34π Aromatic Molecule","b":"Four-electron reduction of aromatic compounds to produce four-electron reduced compounds has been extremely difficult because of the highly negative reduction potentials. Herein, we report for the first time formation of stable four-electron reduced aromatic molecules using nitrogen-doping at the peripheral positions of a ZnII complex of a quadruply fused porphyrin (1), containing four imino-nitrogens in the \"formal\" 30π aromatic circuit. Peripheral nitrogen atoms have been demonstrated to form hydrogen bonds, as indicated by X-ray diffraction analysis. Addition of a strong acid such as triflic acid (TfOH) enables diprotonation of 1 and the diprotonated form (H212+) of 1 shows a large positive shift of the first reduction potential. Furthermore, in the presence of an excess amount of TfOH, chemical or electrochemical reduction causes further protonation of the imino-nitrogen atoms of 1, allowing further reduction of 1 through a proton-coupled electron transfer (PCET) mechanism. The multielectron PCET processes are supported by DFT calculations to clarify a large change in the pKa of the outer imine nitrogens before and after the 1e--reduction. Consequently, 1 undergoes its tetraprotonation and four-electron-reduction at a relatively positive potential to form H410, which bears the 34π aromaticity despite the fact that it is unable to draw an aromatic circuit with alternating single and double bonds. It should be noted that this is the first time to demonstrate multistep PCET of a π-expanded aromatic system and to achieve the emergence of unique aromatic conjugation with 34π electrons."},{"t":"[ASAP] 肝脏脱靶芳香族生物可还原 mRNA 脂质纳米颗粒赋予淋巴结趋向性和强大的抗原特异性免疫","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00080","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Lipid nanoparticles (LNPs) have been immensely successful in facilitating the delivery of nucleic acids to tissues of interest and continue to be optimized for mRNA delivery. These vehicles are particularly advantageous for vaccination due to their ease of production, highly tunable composition, and ability to induce robust immune responses without an adjuvant, as exemplified most recently by the clinical success of the Pfizer/BioNTech and Moderna COVID-19 vaccines. However, LNPs are known to exhibit off-target liver tropism. To address this limitation, we developed a library of aromatic bioreducible ionizable lipids that potently transfect secondary lymphoid tissues with liver detargeting capabilities compared with an industry standard ionizable lipid used in the COVID-19 vaccine. The library consists of three modular components: amine core structure, lipid tail length, and regiochemistry. These aromatic ionizable lipids employ benzene rings both as a scaffold for regiochemical differences and as a moiety to improve transfection. Bioreducible disulfide bonds in the lipids additionally serve to increase their biodegradability. When these aromatic ionizable lipids are formulated as LNPs, top-performing aromatic LNPs (aroLNPs) accumulate in and transfect lymph nodes while minimizing off-target liver tropism. Top-performing aroLNPs also induce strong antigen-specific immune responses, increased effector memory T cell generation, and decreased terminal effector T cell generation in mice when utilized in a preclinical SARS-CoV-2 vaccine study. Additionally, aroLNPs are strongly retained in the injection site and induce low levels of systemic inflammatory cytokines. Together, these results establish aroLNPs as a promising platform for vaccine delivery and potentially other immune-focused therapeutic applications.","tp":"脂质纳米粒","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"脂质纳米颗粒（LNP）在mRNA递送领域取得巨大成功，但存在肝脏蓄积的脱靶问题。该研究设计了可在体内生物还原的芳香族改性LNP，通过降低肝脏趋向性、增强淋巴结靶向递送，实现抗原特异性强免疫应答。该策略有望优化mRNA疫苗的器官分布，提升淋巴结免疫激活效率，为下一代疫苗递送系统提供新方向。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 循环肿瘤 DNA 的体内时空保护和识别，用于早期癌症诊断和监测","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00261","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Circulating tumor DNA (ctDNA) offers a promising avenue for noninvasive cancer diagnosis and prognosis, yet its effective utilization is fundamentally limited by rapid in vivo clearance and nuclease-mediated degradation, resulting in extremely low bioavailability. In addition, conventional in vitro recognition-based ctDNA detection means may potentially compromise the diagnostic accuracy. Here, we report an in vivo spatiotemporal protection and recognition strategy that actively enhances ctDNA bioavailability, enabling accurate early cancer diagnosis and quantitative monitoring of disease progression and therapeutic response. This strategy integrates immunoglobulin G-modified liposomes to transiently saturate the mononuclear phagocyte system, thereby suppressing ctDNA clearance, together with systemically administered anti-dsDNA monoclonal antibodies that protect ctDNA from nuclease degradation. The synergistic in vivo intervention enhances recoverable ctDNA levels by up to 56.2-fold relative to unprotected controls. The protected ctDNA subsequently undergoes sequence-specific hybridization with an in vivo recognition nanoprobe, triggering the release and renal excretion of locked nucleic acid (LNA) reporter strands. These urinary LNAs further induce the dissolution of a horseradish peroxidase (HRP)-encapsulated DNA gel to liberate HRP, which generates highly amplified current on a disposable sensor electrode, thereby markedly improving detection sensitivity for noninvasive identification of small tumors down to 30 mm3. This methodology further enables quantitative monitoring of tumor progression and assessment of doxorubicin (DOX)-mediated therapeutic efficacy, underscoring its robust broad potential for convenient and accurate cancer diagnosis and treatment evaluation.","tp":"早期癌症诊","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"循环肿瘤DNA（ctDNA）因体内快速清除和核酸酶降解导致生物利用度极低，限制了其非侵入性癌症诊断应用。该研究提出一种体内时空保护和识别策略，主动增强ctDNA的生物利用度，突破传统体外检测的准确性瓶颈，为早期癌症诊断和动态监测提供了创新性纳米医学解决方案。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 磷脂酰甘油的氢键-静电耦合识别推动了抗性抑制微型肽模拟物的设计","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c03697","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The emergence of multidrug-resistant (MDR) pathogens has urged us to find new antimicrobial strategies. Phosphatidylglycerol (PG) is an attractive bacterial-specific lipid target but is targeted by only one clinical agent, daptomycin. Yet daptomycin, like most reported PG binders, binds PG through an imprecise hydrophobic-electrostatic mode, necessitating a relatively large molecular size. This requirement, together with its strict Ca2+ dependence, significantly limits its efficacy. Here, we report bis-pyridinium amides (BisPAs), a rationally designed class of small molecules capable of precisely recognizing PG through amide-diol hydrogen bonding coupled with pyridinium-phosphate anionic-π interaction, independent of environmental conditions such as Ca2+. The lead compound, BisPA14, with ∼one-third the molecular weight of daptomycin, exhibits comparable PG-binding affinity, with Kd(BisPA14) = 1.4 × 10-6 M versus Kd(daptomycin-Ca2+) = 0.9 × 10-6 M. BisPA14 disrupts PG self-assembly and membrane integrity and simultaneously engages bacterial DNA as a secondary intracellular target. This dual-targeting mechanism enables BisPA14 to eradicate proliferating, tolerant, and persister bacterial populations while suppressing resistance evolution. It remains active in serum-containing environments, protects host cells from bacterial damage, and demonstrates excellent biocompatibility and strong therapeutic efficacy in intraperitoneal, pulmonary, and bloodstream methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus infection models. As a synthetically accessible small molecule that functionally mimics and improves upon daptomycin's lipid-targeting mechanism, this work establishes a secondary-bonding-driven PG-recognition paradigm for combating MDR bacterial infections.","tp":"抗菌肽设计","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对多重耐药菌威胁，研究以细菌特异性脂质磷脂酰甘油（PG）为靶点。现有唯一临床PG靶向药物达托霉素结合模式不够精确且依赖钙离子。研究提出氢键-静电耦合识别机制，设计了抗性抑制微型肽模拟物，以更小分子量和更高选择性靶向PG，克服达托霉素的分子体积大和钙离子依赖限制，为抗菌药物开发提供新策略。"},{"t":"共聚物组装体中仿生扩散限制硅化反应构建智能纳米环实现深层敏感肿瘤渗透","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22993","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"仿生硅化纳米材料","kp":["[合成策略]: 凝聚体导向扩散受限硅化","[纳米结构]: 非对称拓扑纳米环用于肿瘤渗透"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"研究受生物启发，利用扩散受限的硅化反应在凝聚体组装体中实现非平衡态介孔材料自组装，构建出智能纳米环结构。该纳米环具有深部肿瘤渗透和敏感药物递送能力，突破了常规介孔载体难以深入肿瘤组织内部的瓶颈，为肿瘤深层精准治疗提供了新型纳米平台。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Bioinspired Diffusion-Limited Silicification in Coacervate Assemblies Enables Smart Nanotoroids for Deep and Sensitive Tumor Penetration","b":"Controlling the self-assembly of mesoporous materials beyond equilibrium remains a fundamental challenge. Conventional templating systems form ordered structures through energy-minimizing coassembly but lack the kinetic and spatial freedom required to produce asymmetric or topologically complex architectures. Here, we report a bioinspired coacervate-directed silicification strategy that enables diffusion-limited and spatially asymmetric condensation within soft templates, yielding ordered hexagonal mesoporous nanotoroids. In this system, poly(acrylic acid) (PAA) electrostatically associates with the cationic surfactant cetyltrimethylammonium bromide (CTAB), driving liquid-liquid phase separation and forming disc-like coacervate assemblies. Reaction-diffusion imbalance across the inner and outer interfaces within these templates induces asymmetric silicification, driving an interior collapse and toroidal self-transformation. By tuning PAA concentration, the diffusion-condensation kinetics can be precisely modulated, allowing programmable control over collapse dynamics and final topology, with enlarged central cavities (14-71 nm) and reduced rim thickness (15-35 nm). These nanotoroids exhibit uniform sub-100 nm size, high surface area (846 m2 g-1), and abundant mesopores (∼2.0 nm). The nanotoroids (rim thickness ∼15 nm, height ∼40 nm) display markedly prolonged blood circulation, enhanced tumor accumulation (+173%), improved vascular extravasation, and deeper intratumoral penetration, while reducing hepatic and splenic uptake by 19% and 14%, respectively, compared with spherical analogues. These combined advantages translate into potent antitumor efficacy in both subcutaneous and spinal metastasis models. This work establishes a new paradigm for sol-gel topology control by bridging reaction-diffusion dynamics with bioinspired silicification based on the chemistry of LLPS (liquid-liquid phase separation), thereby unlocking the untapped biomedical potential of toroidal topologies that were rarely accessible."},{"t":"宽温锂离子电池：克服极端环境电化学挑战的材料创新与设计策略","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003557?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"宽温锂电池材料","kp":["[宽温锂电池]: 材料创新与设计策略应对极端环境"],"sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Wide-temperature Lithium-ion batteries: Material innovations and design strategies for overcoming electrochemical challenges in extreme environments"},{"t":"超低漏电流与细丝导电非晶硒化锗纳米颗粒双向阈值选通管","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523102?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"选通管存储器件","kp":["材料体系[OTS选通管]: 非晶GeSe纳米颗粒","[架构]: 3D堆叠交叉点存储","目标指标[OTS选通管]: 超低关断电流与低阈值电压"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究团队开发了基于非晶硒化锗纳米颗粒的Ovonic阈值转换（OTS）选择器，实现了超低漏电流和灯丝导电特性。该器件面向大容量存储和高并行计算对集成密度提升的迫切需求，作为存储阵列的关键选通元件，可有效抑制漏电流串扰问题。非晶硒化锗材料兼具高开关比与良好均匀性，为高密度三维存储架构提供了有前景的解决方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Ultralow‐Leakage‐Current and Filament‐Conductive Amorphous Germanium Selenide Nanoparticle Ovonic Threshold Switching Selectors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Both large‐capacity storage and high‐parallel computing demand a significant boost in integration density of memory chips at advanced technological nodes. This necessitates selector components in 3D stackable cross‐point architectures to achieve an ultralow leakage current (\n                    I\n                    off\n                    ) and a relatively low threshold voltage (\n                    V\n                    th\n                    ). However, conventional ovonic threshold switching (OTS) selectors cannot optimize these two properties simultaneously due to their conflicting physical attributes. To overcome this challenge, we put forward an innovative material design of a thermally‐robust amorphous Ge\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    3\n                    nanoparticle (NP)‐assembled nanolayer, by which the resulting selectors have achieved an unprecedentedly low\n                    I\n                    off\n                    of ∼pA, an impressively high selectivity of ∼10\n                    8\n                    , a low\n                    V\n                    th\n                    of ∼2.4 V, and commendable\n                    V\n                    th\n                    reliability, outperforming existing OTS selectors. Through in situ off‐axis electron holography characterizations, we have presented evidence of nanoscale filamentary conduction within the individual NPs, revealing subthreshold‐conduction and switch‐on behaviors that have hitherto not been directly observed. Our work will inspire further exploration of novel amorphous chalcogenide NPs and deeper research on filamentary conduction physics, advancing the pursuit of superior access performances in OTS selectors."},{"t":"共价有机框架拓扑工程通过构象锁定增强电子给体-受体络合物的光活化","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag183/8539748?rss=1","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化有机合成","kp":["[策略]: 拓扑构象锁定增强EDA光活化","[结构]: 三维共价有机框架供体平台"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究通过共价有机框架（COFs）的拓扑工程策略增强电子供体-受体（EDA）络合物的光活化效率。核心机制为构象锁定效应——通过精确设计COF拓扑结构限制分子内构象自由度，提高EDA络合物的光诱导电子转移效率。该方法为有机合成中光催化策略提供了新思路，展示了多孔晶态材料在调控光化学反应中的结构优势。","dp":1,"ot":"Topological engineering of covalent organic frameworks enhances photoactivation of electron donor–acceptor complexes via conformational locking","b":"Electron donor–acceptor (EDA) complex photoactivation offers a valuable route for organic synthesis, yet the development of efficient catalytic systems remains a significant challenge. We present a novel strategy based on topological conformational locking within covalent organic frameworks (COFs) to engineer high-performance donor platforms. Specifically, we constructed a three-dimensional (3D) COF and two two-dimensional (2D) analogues from the conformationally flexible building block 4,4ʹ,4ʹʹ,4ʹʹʹ-(1,4-phenylenebis(azanetriyl))tetrabenzaldehyde (PATB). Unlike the 2D structures, the 3D architecture intrinsically restricts molecular flexibility, stabilizing a locked conformation that significantly enhances acceptor binding affinity and facilitates efficient EDA complex formation and electron transfer. The 3D-PATB COF exhibits superior photocatalytic activity across a range of transformations, including C–H functionalization and [3+2] cyclization, and supports gram-scale synthesis with outstanding structural stability. Both experimental and computational analyses underscore the critical role of conformational locking in boosting catalytic performance, establishing topological engineering as a powerful approach for advancing EDA complex photochemistry."},{"t":"T 细胞的磷脂谱决定了初始 T 细胞、效应 T 细胞和记忆 T 细胞的 ACSL4 依赖性和铁死亡敏感性","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528153123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Iron-dependent phospholipid (PL) peroxidation, which is reduced by glutathione peroxidase 4, is recognized as the hallmark of cells undergoing ferroptosis. Although studies have attempted to elucidate the molecular mechanisms underlying ferroptosis in cancer cells, the regulation of ferroptosis in effector and memory T cells remains largely unknown. Here, using genome-wide CRISPR-Cas9 knockout screens, we demonstrate that acyl-CoA synthetase long-chain family member 4 (ACSL4) is the predominant ferroptosis inducer in primary T cells cultured in vitro, while other identified iron- and lipid metabolism–related genes only slightly modulate their sensitivity to ferroptosis. However, ACSL4 dependency relies on the PL composition of the cells. In vitro cultured T cells treated with polyunsaturated fatty acids (PUFAs), as well as effector CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells that are enriched in PUFA-containing PLs (PUFA-PLs), undergo ferroptosis in the absence of ACSL4. In contrast to effector T cells, naive and memory T cells share a similar PL profile, characterized by a scarcity of PUFA-PLs, and are resistant to ferroptosis. Overall, the PL composition is a central feature and determines the differential susceptibility of effector and memory T cells to ferroptosis and its molecular mechanism."},{"t":"化石能源衰退与可行替代方案探索：全球社会政治和技术约束下生物柴油、电动和沼气能源系统的批判性综述","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002990?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"清洁能源替代","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":5.0,"r":2.5,"d":3.5,"t":2.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"The decline of fossil fuels and the search for viable alternatives: A critical review of biodiesel, electric, and biogas energy systems under global socio-political and technical constraints"},{"t":"多重共价键协同作用实现高性能水系锌离子电池正极的工业级面载量与宽温适应性","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72906?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌电池正极","kp":["[策略]: 协同多重共价键工程","[应用]: 工业级面载量与宽温运行"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究团队设计了多共价键协同作用的水系锌离子电池正极材料，面向工业级面容量负载和宽温域适应性需求。通过多种化学键的协同效应增强结构稳定性，在工业级高质量负载条件下仍保持优异电化学性能，并能在极端温度范围内稳定运行。该策略为水系锌离子电池从实验室走向实际储能应用提供了材料设计新范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Synergy of Multi‐Covalent Bonds Enabling High‐Performance Aqueous Zinc‐Ion Battery Cathodes Toward Industrial‐Grade Mass Loading and Broad‐Temperature Adaptability","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The pursuit of high‐performance cathode materials that are capable of operating reliably under industrially relevant conditions remains a formidable challenge for aqueous zinc‐ion batteries (AZIBs). Here, we tackle this challenge by proposing a novel strategy—synergistic bond engineering—which represents a conceptual advance that departs from conventional approaches. This strategy is materialized in a vanadium oxide cathode, where the deliberate integration of multi‐covalent bonds (O─N─O and N─V) triggers a powerful synergy, enabling efficient operation from baseline to demanding conditions. Through comprehensive simulations and in situ/ex situ characterizations, we elucidate the synergetic mechanism of these bonds: the O─N─O bonds accelerate Zn\n                    2+\n                    diffusion via electrostatic shielding and provide abundant active sites via dynamic reconstruction, while the N─V bonds serve as structural pins that suppress vanadium dissolution and ensure structural integrity. Therefore, the cathode delivers an ultrahigh capacity of 624 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.1 A g\n                    −1\n                    and exceptional cycling stability (73% capacity retention after 10 000 cycles at 20 A g\n                    −1\n                    ). Crucially, it achieves a record‐high capacity of 504 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    under a high mass loading of ≥7 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    , along with substantial capacities of 117 and 308 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0°C and 60°C, demonstrating the great promise of this “bond‐level” design strategy.","aip":1},{"t":"可持续碳纤维实现零余量锂金属电池长期稳定沉积","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506780?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属负极","kp":["集流体[零过量锂金属电池]: 可持续碳纤维三维骨架","[失效机制]: 首圈SEI大面积成膜致锂损耗"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究利用可持续碳纤维构建三维集流体，实现均匀的锂金属沉积，面向无过量锂（zero-excess）金属锂电池应用。三维碳纤维网络降低了局部电流密度，抑制锂枝晶生长，显著延长循环寿命。该策略兼顾材料可持续性与电化学稳定性，为下一代高能量密度锂金属电池的实际部署提供了实用化负极结构设计方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Sustainable Carbon Fibers Enable Stable Long‐Term Lithium Metal Deposition for Prospective Zero‐Excess Lithium Metal Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Three‐dimensional current collectors have emerged as a promising strategy to promote uniform Li deposition and extend the cycle life of zero‐excess lithium metal batteries. However, excessive Li loss in the first cycle due to solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) formation on the large surface area, combined with the use of dense or nonrenewable materials and complex, multistep fabrication processes, limits their practical implementation. In this work, a lightweight, lignin‐derived carbon fiber (CF) current collector is presented. It is fabricated via a simple and sustainable electrospinning process, and after carbonization has abundant structural defects and nanoscale porosity. Surface defects promote the formation of a stable, inorganic‐rich SEI, efficiently passivating the current collector, while pores of ∼1.0–1.4 nm enable quasi‐metallic Li clusters to form before plating, providing a conductive network and distributed nucleation sites that enhance Li plating/stripping reversibility and cycle life. This CF current collector exhibits a first‐cycle active Li loss of only 4.8%–8.9% relative to the typical Li inventory of commercial lithium‐ion battery cathodes and maintains a coulombic efficiency of 99.0% over 200 cycles, demonstrating excellent electrochemical performance."},{"t":"小分子限制互补位模拟双环肽作为 1 组和 2 组甲型流感病毒血凝素的有效抑制剂","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537533123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Influenza continues to be a major threat to global health and a substantial economic burden. Innovative strategies are needed to tackle the growing resistance to established influenza therapeutics and to develop new therapeutics with novel mechanisms of action. Previous peptide and small molecule designs have been successful only against influenza group 1 hemagglutinin (HA). Here, we report on a CLIPS (Chemical Linkage of Peptides onto Scaffolds)-based approach to design potent peptidic inhibitors of influenza A viruses that now extend to both group 1 and group 2 HAs. This approach merges features of antibodies and small molecules to design constrained bicyclic peptides that engage the highly conserved HA stem. The heavy-chain complementarity-determining region 3 (HCDR3) of human broadly neutralizing antibody FI6v3 was grafted onto functionalized small molecule scaffolds. The designed peptides exhibited in vitro heterosubtypic cross-reactivity in binding to group 1 (H1 and H5) and group 2 (H3 and H7) HAs and in neutralization of H1N1, H5N1, and H7N3 viruses. A crystal structure of the bicyclic peptide with HA from H1N1 A/Puerto Rico/8/1934 (H1/PR8) at 2.35 Å resolution revealed that the designed peptide faithfully mimics the binding mode and functionality of the parent antibody FI6v3 to the highly conserved stem epitope. These structural and functional data illustrate how both group 1 and group 2 influenza A viruses can now be targeted by constrained peptidic ligands that should aid in development of pan-influenza therapeutics.","tp":"多肽抑制剂","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对流感病毒耐药性问题，研究采用CLIPS（肽骨架化学连接）技术设计双环肽抑制剂，通过小分子限制互补位模拟策略，首次实现对甲型流感病毒第1组和第2组血凝素（HA）的广谱有效抑制。此前多肽和小分子设计仅对第1组HA有效，该突破为开发新型广谱抗流感药物提供了创新作用机制。"},{"t":"自漂浮COF基Janus膜：构建稳健三相界面促进电荷分离实现高效H₂O₂光合合成","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00042-1?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF光催化膜","kp":["材料体系[H2O2光合]: COF-[NH2-GO]自漂浮Janus膜","[合成方法]: 一步界面聚合","[界面工程]: 气液固三相界面增强O2传质"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究团队通过一步界面聚合法构建了自漂浮的COF-[NH2-GO] Janus薄膜，用于高效光催化合成H2O2。Janus结构的双面不对称特性构建了稳固的三相界面（气-液-固），促进电荷分离和氧气传质。该设计解决了光催化H2O2合成中氧气溶解度低和电荷复合率高的瓶颈，薄膜可自漂浮于水面，便于规模化部署和产物收集。","dp":1,"ot":"Self-floating COF-based Janus film: A robust triphase interface boosting charge separation for efficient H2O2 photosynthesis","b":"A self-floating COF-[NH2-GO] Janus film was engineered via a one-step interfacial polymerization strategy for efficient H2O2 photosynthesis, in which the introduced graphene promoted the separation and transfer of photogenerated carriers. Meanwhile, the self-floating film photocatalysts enabled the stabilization of gas-liquid-solid triphase interface, significantly enhancing the O2 mass transfer."},{"t":"Omicron 在不同的单一人 VH1-2 重排小鼠模型中广泛中和复发性 SARS-CoV-2 人源化抗体","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537053123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"During V(D)J recombination, antibody diversity is enhanced by nontemplated junctional modifications that generate immensely diverse heavy chain (HC) and light chain (LC) complementarity-determining 3 antigen-contact regions (CDR3s). We previously developed a mouse model that generates diverse antibody repertoires by rearranging a single human V\n                    H\n                    1-2 and Vκ1-33, associated with highly diverse CDR3s generated by V(D)J recombination with mouse Ds and/or Js. Immunization of this model with SARS-CoV-2 D614G spike elicited an antibody that potently neutralized SARS-CoV-2 variants through Omicron BA.2.754. Here, we report a related mouse model in which a single V\n                    H\n                    1-2 rearranges to human D3-3 and J\n                    H\n                    6, generating diverse HC-CDR3s much longer on average than those of our prior model. Omicron BA.4/.5 spike-ferritin nanoparticle-immunization of the new model elicited four highly related humanized antibodies that potently neutralize downstream Omicron subvariants. All four antibodies had 12 AA HC-CDR3s with two aromatic amino acids that engage an epitope comprising a hydrophobic patch opened-up by early Omicron lineage mutations and conserved in subsequent variants. Immunization of our prior, shorter CDR3-based model, elicited slightly less potent neutralizing antibodies that bound the same Omicron epitope, and were similar in all other aspects to those from the long, fully human CDR3 model. One tested antibody from each set reduced lung viral titers in a mouse-adapted BQ1.1 challenge. The antibodies we describe are related in their epitope recognition to recently described antibodies from Omicron-infected humans. These studies validate the utility of single human V\n                    H\n                    - and Vκ-rearranging mice for discovering humanized antibodies that neutralize emerging pathogens.","tp":"人源化抗体","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用单一人源VH1-2重排小鼠模型，通过V(D)J重组产生高度多样化的CDR3区域，生成广谱中和抗体。该模型成功筛选出能广泛中和Omicron等复发性SARS-CoV-2变异株的人源化抗体，展示了单基因重排小鼠在抗体药物发现中的高效性，为应对新冠变异株的广谱抗体研发提供了有力工具。"},{"t":"光催化分解水制氢微反应器中气泡动力学与脱离机制研究进展综述","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003053?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光催化分解水制氢","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Recent progress in bubble dynamics and detachment mechanisms of photocatalytic water splitting microreactors for H₂ production: a review"},{"t":"理性设计自组装单分子层实现双位点钝化以构建高效稳定钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523249?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿界面修饰","kp":["[策略]: 自组装单层双位点钝化","[应用]: 倒置PSC空穴传输层"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究合理设计自组装单分子层（SAM）用于双位点钝化，实现高效稳定的倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池。SAM作为空穴传输层同时钝化钙钛矿界面处的两种缺陷位点，有效抑制非辐射复合。双位点协同钝化策略显著提升了器件的光电转换效率和长期操作稳定性，为解决钙钛矿太阳能电池商业化中界面缺陷和稳定性难题提供了分子级解决方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Rationally Designed Self‐Assembled Monolayer for Dual‐Site Passivation Enables Efficient and Stable Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Self‐assembled monolayers (SAMs) have emerged as promising hole transport layers in inverted perovskite solar cells (PSCs), yet their practical application is hindered by molecular aggregation, imperfect surface coverage, and weak interfacial interactions with the perovskite layer. These issues induce considerable interfacial energy losses, constraining further improvements in power conversion efficiency (PCE) and device stability. Here, we present a rational site‐specific halogenation strategy that strengthens SAM‐perovskite interactions through lattice‐matched, dual‐site passivation. Using (4‐(3,6‐diphenyl‐9H‐carbazol‐9‐yl) butyl) phosphonic acid (Ph‐4PACz) as a twisted carbazole‐based scaffold with intrinsically improved dispersibility, we synthesize three dichlorinated positional isomers (o‐Cl‐, m‐Cl‐, and p‐Cl‐Ph‐4PACz) by selectively introducing chlorine atoms at designated positions on the peripheral phenyl ring. This structural tuning modulates the molecular dipole moment and spatial configuration, effectively suppresses molecular aggregation and promotes strong coordination with neighboring Pb\n                    2+\n                    defect sites in the perovskite lattice. Among them, p‐Cl‐Ph‐4PACz exhibits ideal spatial matching, enabling robust dual‐site coordination, improved crystallinity, reduced interfacial defects, and suppressed nonradiative recombination. As a result, inverted PSCs based on p‐Cl‐Ph‐4PACz achieve a PCE of 26.58% (certified at 26.13%) and exhibit excellent operational stability, retaining 95.9% of their initial efficiency after 1000 h of continuous illumination under the ISOS‐L‐2 protocol."},{"t":"预测元素而不是序列：ResNet 代理方法可非常准确地预测每小时的建筑能耗","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003910?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"通过柱配体裁剪精确构筑柔性二维金属有机框架实现C₂H₂/CO₂/C₂H₄高效分离","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4625459?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF气体分离","kp":["[策略]: 柱配体裁剪构建柔性二维MOF","[应用]: C₂H₂/CO₂/C₂H₄高效分离"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究通过柱配体裁剪策略精确构建柔性二维金属有机框架（MOFs），实现C2H2/CO2/C2H4的高效分离。高效分离的关键在于制备兼具高吸附容量和高选择性的材料。柔性二维MOFs通过柱配体的精确调控实现孔径和结合位点的可编程设计，利用气体分子尺寸和相互作用的细微差异实现选择性识别，对石化工业中高纯度乙烯和乙炔生产具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Precise Construction of Flexible Two‐Dimensional Metal‐Organic Frameworks Through Pillar‐Ligand Tailoring for Efficient C2H2/CO2/C2H4 Separation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The key to achieving efficient separation of C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    /CO\n                    2\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    is to prepare materials with both high adsorption capacity and high selectivity. Flexible two‐dimensional metal‐organic frameworks (2D MOFs) exhibit excellent performance in difficult separation applications due to their high structural toughness within the layers and strong stimulus responsiveness between layers, but their controllable preparation is a challenge. Herein, under the guidance of crystal engineering, we develop a framework dimensionality reduction strategy (3D → 2D) for tailoring of pillaring ligands to directionally construct flexible 2D MOFs, based on a 3D MOF (UPC‐191) constructed by terpyridine pillaring ligands and organic carboxylic acid ligands. The interlayer and intralayer pore environments are synergistically optimized by co‐modification of semi‐pillared ligands and carboxylic acid ligands as well as metal ion regulation. Remarkably, the optimal structure of difluoro‐functionalized MOF (UPC‐197) exhibits temperature‐responsive framework flexibility with a unique “gate‐opening effect” for C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    and reverse adsorption behavior for CO\n                    2\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    at 195 K, achieving efficient separation of C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    and CO\n                    2\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    as well as C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    /CO\n                    2\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    , which has been confirmed by adsorption isotherms, experimental breakthrough curves, and density functional theory calculations. This work provides a guidance for the precise construction of flexible 2D MOFs for the challenging separation of multi‐component low‐carbon hydrocarbons."},{"t":"二维高熵氧化物纳米片光辅助锂硫电池：耦合内建电场实现超高光电能量转换","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505635?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光辅助锂硫电池","kp":["[材料]: 二维高熵氧化物纳米片","[机制]: 内建电场耦合光电转换与储能"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究将二维高熵氧化物纳米片应用于光辅助锂硫电池，耦合内建电场实现超高光电能量转换。通过太阳能与可充电电池系统的集成，高熵氧化物纳米片的多元素协同效应产生强内建电场，加速多硫化锂转化动力学并抑制穿梭效应。该策略将光能直接引入电化学储能循环，为可持续高能量密度电池提供了能量转换与存储一体化的创新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Photo‐Assisted Li–S Batteries With 2D High‐Entropy Oxide Nanosheets: Coupling Built‐In Electric Field for Ultra‐High Photoelectric Energy Conversion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The integration of solar energy into rechargeable battery systems represents a pivotal advancement in sustainable energy technology. Herein, we develop a photo‐assisted lithium–sulfur battery (PALSB) that synergistically enables light energy harvesting, conversion, and electrochemical energy storage. Its multifunctional photocathode consists of 2D polycrystalline La\n                    0.65\n                    Sr\n                    0.35\n                    Co\n                    0.20\n                    Ni\n                    0.19\n                    Fe\n                    0.24\n                    Cr\n                    0.18\n                    Cu\n                    0.19\n                    O\n                    3\n                    high‐entropy oxide (LSCO‐HEO) nanosheets with grain boundaries. Owing to the distinct surface work functions of its crystal facets, a spontaneously formed built‐in electric field at the binary facet junction effectively suppresses the recombination of photogenerated carriers, thereby substantially enhancing photo‑chemical‑electrical energy conversion efficiency. Moreover, optimal band alignment between LSCO‐HEOs and polysulfides enables direct participation of photoexcited electrons and holes in sulfur reduction and oxidation, respectively. Light‐induced electron redistribution in LSCO‐HEOs generates more dynamic and complementary highly active catalytic sites that effectively inhibit polysulfide shuttling, lower Li\n                    2\n                    S nucleation barriers, and enhance sulfur redox reaction kinetics. As a result, the PALSB achieves an ultra‐high photoelectric energy conversion efficiency of 12.98% and exhibits exceptional cycling stability over 1000 cycles at 8.0 C, with a minimal capacity decay of only 0.025% per cycle. This work introduces a breakthrough strategy for direct solar‐to‐chemical energy conversion within batteries, opening avenues for high‐efficiency photoelectrochemical energy storage."},{"t":"基于多智能体的双Stackelberg博弈模型及虚拟电厂集群参与电力与调频市场的收益分配改进策略","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600334X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"虚拟电厂博弈调度","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Multi-agent-based dual-Stackelberg game model and improved benefit allocation strategy for virtual power plant cluster joining in energy and frequency regulation markets"},{"t":"通过可逆主客体与电荷转移调控实现二氧六环异构体固态选择性识别的分子门控策略","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3482686?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分子识别分离材料","kp":["主体分子[二氧六环识别]: 全乙基化倾斜柱[6]芳烃","[选择性机制]: 分子门策略放大固态主客体选择性","识别对象[固态]: 1,3-和1,4-二氧六环异构体"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究提出分子门控策略，通过可逆主-客体相互作用和电荷转移调制实现固态下二噁烷异构体的高选择性识别。固态超分子识别因缺乏动态调节而面临挑战。该设计利用主体材料的分子门控效应——特定客体分子可逆进入引发电荷转移信号变化，实现对结构高度相似的二噁烷异构体的精确区分，在化工分离和环境检测领域具有应用前景。","dp":1,"ot":"Molecular‐Gate Strategy for Solid‐State Selective Recognition of Dioxane Isomers via Reversible Host–Guest and Charge‐Transfer Modulation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Achieving highly selective molecular recognition in the solid state remains a major challenge in supramolecular chemistry. Herein, we introduce a molecular‐gate strategy that dynamically amplifies intrinsic solid‐state recognition selectivity in a macrocyclic host–guest system. A perethylated leaning pillar[6]arene (EtLP6) accommodates both 1,3‐ and 1,4‐dioxane isomers in the solid state, exhibiting only modest inherent selectivity. Remarkably, incorporation of an independent, reversible, charge‐transfer‐active molecular gate, tetrafluoroterephthalonitrile (TFTN), converts this weak preference into highly selective recognition through competitive binding and solid‐state reorganization. The stronger‐binding 1,4‐dioxane displaces TFTN to open the gate and form a host–guest complex, whereas the weaker‐binding 1,3‐dioxane stabilizes a gated CT assembly that suppresses complexation. This gate‐controlled process couples selective recognition with switchable CT interactions, enabling vapochromic discrimination of dioxane isomers. Furthermore, sequential competitive binding enables dynamic regulation of solid‐state assemblies, including room‐temperature‐controlled guest release, and host recyclability. This work establishes molecular gating as a general and conceptually simple strategy for regulating selectivity and functionality in solid‐state macrocyclic host–guest systems."},{"t":"建筑中冷水机组与热泵系统的建模方法：数字孪生应用背景下的系统性综述","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002849?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"热泵系统建模","kp":["[主题]: 制冷与热泵系统建模","[视角]: 数字孪生应用"],"sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":4.5,"r":2.5,"d":3.0,"t":2.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Modeling methods for chiller and heat pump systems in buildings: A systematic review in the context of digital twin applications"},{"t":"Matrimid衍生非对称碳分子筛中空纤维通过工程化超微孔实现精确氦分离","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6271309?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳分子筛分离膜","kp":["[材料]: Matrimid衍生碳分子筛中空纤维","[应用]: He/CH₄超高选择性分离"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究以Matrimid聚合物为前驱体制备非对称碳分子筛中空纤维膜，通过工程化超微孔设计实现氦气精确分离。氦/甲烷分离对能源和工业应用具有战略意义，但动力学直径极为接近导致分离困难。碳分子筛膜通过精确调控超微孔径在亚埃级实现基于分子筛分效应的高选择性分离，中空纤维构型提供高装填密度，为氦气资源回收提供可行技术路线。","dp":1,"ot":"Matrimid‐Derived Asymmetric Carbon Molecular Sieve Hollow Fibers With Engineered Ultramicropores for Precise Helium Separation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Helium/methane (He/CH\n                    4\n                    ) separation is of strategic importance for energy and industrial applications, yet it remains technically challenging due to the need to simultaneously achieve ultrahigh selectivity and helium productivity. In this work, we report ultraselective Matrimid‐derived asymmetric carbon molecular sieve (CMS) hollow fibers in which ultramicropore and fiber geometry are deliberately co‐engineered to enable precise He/CH\n                    4\n                    separation with high He productivity at the module level. We showed that pyrolysis temperature tuning tightens ångström‐scale ultramicropores and enhances He/CH\n                    4\n                    discrimination; while a targeted post‐pyrolysis hyperaging enables selective refining of the ultramicropores, thereby offering high He permeance with exceptional He/CH\n                    4\n                    selectivity. For a 5/95 He/CH\n                    4\n                    mixed gas feed, the hyperaged CMS‐700 hollow fibers achieve permeate helium purities of up to 98.6% with He/CH\n                    4\n                    selectivities exceeding 1300 and a stable He permeance of approximately 26 GPU. Beyond this material achievement, fiber geometry optimization through reduction of the outer diameter was achieved to increase the packable membrane area without compromising mechanical integrity or intrinsic separation performance, leading to enhanced module‐level He productivity. This integrated co‐engineering strategy provides an energy‐efficient and industrially viable platform for He recovery and is readily extendable to other challenging small/large gas‐pair separations."},{"t":"界面位点工程通过加速脱质子化最小化阳极能量损耗实现高效太阳能制氢","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9797893?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能制氢","kp":["[策略]: 构建不对称Ir-O-Ni界面位点","[机制]: 加速去质子化降低阳极能耗"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究通过界面位点工程加速去质子化过程最小化阳极能量损失，实现高效太阳能制氢（STH）转换。太阳能驱动水分解制氢面临阳极析氧反应动力学缓慢导致能量损失大的瓶颈。通过精确设计催化剂界面活性位点，降低去质子化步骤的能垒，显著提升电荷注入效率，从而提高STH转换效率，为可再生能源存储中的光催化制氢提供了性能优化策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Interfacial Sites Engineering Minimizes Anodic Energy Loss Through Accelerated Deprotonation for High‐Efficiency Solar‐to‐Hydrogen Conversion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving efficient solar‐to‐hydrogen (STH) conversion is essential for renewable energy storage, yet solar‐driven water splitting remains fundamentally limited by energy losses associated with the anodic oxygen evolution reaction (OER). Herein, we deliberately combine Ir species with a NiFe model electrocatalyst to construct asymmetric Ir–O–Ni interfacial sites that optimize anodic reaction energetics. In situ spectroscopic analyses combined with theoretical calculations reveal that, in contrast to pristine NiFe operating\n                    via\n                    the conventional adsorbate evolution mechanism, the Ir–O–Ni interfacial sites directly participate in OER by lowering the *OOH deprotonation barrier and facilitating rapid proton transfer under alkaline conditions. Meanwhile, strong Ir–O orbital coupling stabilizes O‐containing intermediates, thereby reducing the O–O bond formation barrier from 3.21 eV in pristine NiFe to 1.40 eV in NiFe‐Ir. Consequently, NiFe‐Ir delivers a low overpotential of 300 mV at a high current density of 500 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , corresponding to a 43.3% reduction in energy consumption compared to NiFe (430 mV). Importantly, the substantially reduced anodic energy dissipation translates directly into enhanced device‐level performance, enabling the integrated photovoltaic‐electrolyzer system to achieve an exceptional STH conversion efficiency of 19.7%. These results underscore interfacial engineering as a powerful and generalizable strategy for advancing practical solar water‐splitting technologies."},{"t":"基于LLM方法捕捉政策与市场信号的新能源产业创新投资研究","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001898?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"LLM投资分析","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Innovative investment in new energy under industry development signals: Capturing policy and market signals using LLM method"},{"t":"识别癌症治疗靶点：Cell-SELEX 识别出用于适体介导的生长抑制的膜蛋白","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514681123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The identification of functional ligand-membrane protein interactions under native conditions remains a major challenge in cancer biology. Using cell-systematic evolution of ligands by exponential enrichment, we identified a high-affinity DNA aptamer, CW06, against breast cancer cells. To precisely identify its native membrane target, we developed Aptamer-mediated Metabolic Glycan-labeling Proximity Hybridization (Apt-MGPH), which revealed the mitochondrial solute carrier SLC25A24 as the specific target. Unexpectedly, CW06 treatment upregulated SLC25A24 expression, disrupting methionine metabolism, depleting cytosolic SAM, and inducing G1 cell cycle arrest and senescence via the p21–HMGA1 axis. In mouse xenograft models, CW06 significantly inhibited tumor growth without affecting healthy tissues. Targeted degradation of SLC25A24 reverses these effects, confirming its regulatory role in the metabolism–senescence axis. Our study establishes Apt-MGPH as a robust tool for membrane target identification and highlights aptamer-induced target overexpression as a strategy for cancer therapy.","tp":"癌症靶点筛","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用Cell-SELEX技术筛选出针对乳腺癌细胞的高亲和力DNA适体CW06，并开发了适体介导代谢糖标记近邻杂交（Apt-MGPH）技术，精准确认其天然膜靶标为线粒体溶质载体SLC25A24。该适体能介导乳腺癌细胞生长抑制，为在天然条件下识别功能性配体-膜蛋白互作提供了创新方法学，拓展了适体抗癌治疗的应用前景。"},{"t":"氢键有机框架用于NADH再生与酶催化加氢：HOF-in-HOF仿生光合系统实现太阳能到化学能转化","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8868255?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"HOF人工光合作用","kp":["[系统架构]: 酶-光-膜耦合HOF-in-HOF人工光合体系","[应用]: NADH再生与酶催化加氢","[调控维度]: 电子/质子/分子传递时空耦合"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究构建了一种HOF-in-HOF型人工光合系统，利用氢键有机框架（HOFs）实现NADH再生和酶促加氢反应。系统的关键创新在于空间组织调控——通过双HOF结构的协同效应优化光生载流子的传递路径，提升太阳能到化学能的转化效率。该设计模拟天然光合作用的精细空间组织，将光催化、辅酶再生与酶催化串联集成。","dp":1,"ot":"Hydrogen‐Bonded Organic Frameworks (HOFs) for NADH Regeneration and Enzymatic Hydrogenation: HOF‐in‐HOF Artificial Photosynthetic System for Solar‐to‐Chemical Conversion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The efficiency of artificial photosynthesis lies not only in the catalysts themselves, but also in the spatiotemporal landscape for efficient mass–energy coupling, which is governed by electron, proton, and molecule transfer. Herein, we propose a scaffold engineering strategy to construct an enzyme–photo–membrane coupled artificial photosynthetic system (\n                    epm\n                    CAPS) within HOF‐in‐HOF architecture for NADH regeneration and enzymatic hydrogenation, where enzyme‐loaded HOF particles for substrate conversion are encapsulated within photocatalytic HOF capsular membranes for cofactor regeneration. This unique configuration enables independent and synergistic regulation of electron, proton, and NADH transfer by modulating the electronic structure of the capsule (via benzene ring units), proton relay (via carboxylate group density), and mass diffusion path (via enzyme–photocatalyst distance), respectively. The system achieves a record initial NADH regeneration rate of 28.23 ± 0.62 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    with a 22.13% apparent quantum yield. When applied to solar‐driven lactate synthesis, the\n                    epm\n                    CAPS achieves a solar‐to‐chemical conversion efficiency of 7.27 ± 0.34%—a nearly threefold higher than previous records. Furthermore, we demonstrate the generality of this platform by synthesizing a spectrum of C\n                    1\n                    –C\n                    6\n                    chemicals, including methanol and mannitol, while maintaining stable operation for over 6 h. Our work delivers a blueprint for the next‐generation artificial photosynthetic systems for sustainable energy and green chemical production.","aip":1},{"t":"印度各邦在电力脱碳方面表现如何？地方层面基于消费的分解分析","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001473?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"电力脱碳化","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"噻吩紫精基电化学离子门控驱动的仿生高性能神经形态器件","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2026-m2702061800?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"仿生神经形态器件","kp":["[分子策略]: 噻吩紫精离域自由基电荷稳定氧化还原电解质","[器件特性]: 低压模拟电导调制","[功能]: 突触学习/逻辑计算/神经网络处理"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用噻吩紫精（Thienoviologen）基材料实现了电化学离子门控，通过自由基电荷离域稳定氧化还原活性电解质，并调控离子-电子耦合传输。该仿生策略用于构建高性能神经形态器件，模拟生物突触的离子调控机制，为类脑计算和低功耗神经形态硬件提供了新材料平台。离子门控的快速响应特性是其核心优势。","dp":1,"ot":"Frontispiece: Bioinspired High‐Performance Neuromorphic Devices Enabled by Thienoviologen‐Based Electrochemical Ion Gating","b":"Thienoviologen engineering stabilizes redox-active electrolytes by delocalizing radical charge and orchestrating ion-electron coupling. The resulting bioinspired electrochemical neuromorphic device enables low-voltage, analog conductance modulation for synaptic learning, logic computation, and neural network processing, showcasing a versatile molecular platform for next-generation neuromorphic electronics. More in the Research Article (e23345), Gang He and co-workers."},{"t":"Fe-NC诱导Co 3d轨道电子离域构建电子桥加速多硫化物转化","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70862?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多硫化物催化","kp":["催化剂[Li-S多硫化物转化]: Fe-NC@ZnCo2O4异质结构","[电子调控]: Fe-NC诱导Co 3d轨道电子离域构建电子桥"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究设计了Fe-NC催化剂，通过诱导Co 3d轨道电子离域构建电子桥，加速锂硫电池中多硫化锂（LiPSs）向Li₂S₂/Li₂S的液-固转化。该液固转化是锂硫电池的核心瓶颈步骤，电子桥策略有效降低了转化能垒。Fe-NC与Co位点的协同电子耦合促进了多硫化物的快速捕获与催化转化，提升了电池的循环稳定性和倍率性能。","dp":1,"ot":"Fe‐NC Induced Electron Delocalization of Co 3d‐Orbital Constructing an Electron Bridge for Accelerated Transformation of Polysulfides","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The liquid‐solid conversion of lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) to Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    2\n                    /Li\n                    2\n                    S (Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    x\n                    ⇄Li\n                    2\n                    S) impedes the sulfur reduction reaction (SRR) in lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries due to the slow kinetics and a high energy barrier. Herein, a heterostructure catalyst composed of Fe‐NC modified ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (Fe‐NC@ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    ) is designed to accelerate LiPSs conversion (especially, Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    ⇄Li\n                    2\n                    S) via modulating the electron environment of the central atomic 3d‐orbital. Based on experimental results and DFT calculations, the introduction of Fe‐NC induces electron delocalization in the Co 3d orbital and eliminates the original bandgap of ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (1.98 eV). These delocalized electrons serve as electronic active centers, strengthening coupling between the metal 3d orbital and S\n                    n\n                    2\n                    −\n                    species in LiPSs and resulting in faster LiPSs redox kinetics. As a result, the S/Fe‐NC@ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    cathode delivers a high capacity of 1449.7 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 0.1C and outstanding cycling stability with a decay rate of 0.057% per cycle over 600 cycles at 1.0C. Even under a high sulfur loading of 8.97 mg cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    , a remarkable capacity of 917.5 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    is achieved. This work provides deep insights into orbital modulation for designing high‐performance Li–S catalysts."},{"t":"不同强度和价态的 Fab-Fc 和 Fab-Fab 相互作用导致 IgG1 抗体的高浓度粘度","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526550123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The variable domains in Fab regions are well-established contributors to high concentration viscosity of IgG, primarily through charge and hydrophobic interactions. In contrast, the roles of the Fc and the number of self-interacting sites (valency) are less well understood. Here, we investigate the relative contributions of Fab–Fab and Fab–Fc interactions to high concentration viscosity for a diverse panel of 20 IgG\n                    1\n                    antibodies, by rheometry, coarse-grained simulations, and molecular surface property analysis. Strikingly, fragmentation of IgG\n                    1\n                    into F(ab′)\n                    2\n                    plus Fc reduced viscosity (−11 to −93%) for all antibodies tested, demonstrating prevalent contributions of Fc to viscosity. Coarse-grained simulations with one site per Fab and two sites per Fc qualitatively tracked trends in experimental rheometry data for 20 parental antibodies and their fragments. In these simulations Fab–Fab and Fab–Fc interaction strengths were independently varied to capture possible interaction differences arising from parental sequences or any mutations. These coarse-grained simulations suggest that Fab–Fc attractions generate branched IgG\n                    1\n                    networks and disproportionately larger clusters relative to Fab–Fab interactions of comparable strength. This study suggests that a four-site self-interaction model, previously proposed for a single antibody (omalizumab), is broadly applicable to diverse IgG\n                    1\n                    . Beyond well-established variable domain engineering, this self-interaction model predicts that Fc engineering may reduce IgG\n                    1\n                    viscosity, a much sought after goal to enable subcutaneous delivery. Clinically validated Fc mutations are demonstrated here to substantially reduce the viscosity for multiple IgG\n                    1\n                    (−33 to −91% reduction, n = 6), supporting this emerging antibody design concept.","tp":"抗体高粘度","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"IgG1抗体在的高浓度粘度主要归因于Fab区可变结构域间的电荷与疏水作用，但关于Fc片段及自相互作用位点价态的相对贡献尚不明确。本研究通过流变仪测量和粗粒度模拟，对20种不同的IgG1抗体进行分析。研究重点评估了Fab-Fab以及Fab-Fc相互作用在引发高浓度粘度时的具体机制与贡献比例，为优化高浓度抗体药物制剂开发提供了关键的理论依据。"},{"t":"使用耐久坚固的超双疏涂层增强建筑日间被动辐射制冷的长期性能","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003685?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"辐射制冷超疏涂层","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Enhancing efficient passive daytime radiative cooling in buildings using a durable and robust superamphiphobic coating for long-term performance"},{"t":"设计含主辅功能位点的给体-双受体共价有机框架以增强16电子硫动力学反应过程","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70864?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硫氧化催化","kp":["催化剂[Li-S电池硫反应]: 给体-双受体COF(D-A1-A2)","[催化策略]: 分级催化链加速16电子硫反应动力学"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究设计了供体-双受体型共价有机框架（COF），通过主-辅双功能位点协同催化加速锂硫电池中多硫化物的16电子转化反应动力学。COF的规则孔道结构提供多硫化物限域，供体位点促进电子转移，双受体位点增强多硫化物吸附与催化转化。该多中心协同策略有效抑制穿梭效应，显著提升了锂硫电池的比容量和循环寿命。","dp":1,"ot":"Design Donor‐Biacceptor Covalent Organic Framework with Primary‐Auxiliary Functional Sites for Enhanced 16‐Electron Sulfur Kinetic Reaction Process","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The catalytic conversion of lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) is crucial for realizing high‐energy‐density lithium–sulfur batteries. Herein, we propose a molecular cooperate engineering strategy to construct a hierarchical catalytic reaction chain for addressing the complex sulfur phase transitions and sluggish 16‐electron reaction kinetics. A covalent organic framework with a D‐A1‐A2 electronic structure was developed to generate a built‐in electric field (BIEF) via establishing intramolecular charge transfer (ICT) between bipolar functional groups. Theoretical calculations and in situ characterizations confirm that primary and auxiliary functional groups of COF can synergistically enable selective LiPSs capture while the BIEF‐facilitated electron transfer accelerates redox reactions of LiPSs, conferring reduced conversion energy barriers and mitigated shuttle effect. Moreover, the anchoring of the ─NO\n                    2\n                    group and hence the effect of the ─CF\n                    3\n                    group induce directional Li\n                    +\n                    deposition, ensuring the favored Li plating with epitaxial layered growth and suppressed dendrite formation. As a result, the Li symmetric cell demonstrates an ultra‐long lifespan (&gt;16 000 h at 5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    ) while Li–S batteries can achieve exceptional cycling stability (0.039% capacity decay per cycle over 1000 cycles). Meanwhile, the pouch cells deliver a high energy density of 395.6 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    with 90.2% capacity retention over cycling. This work presents a generalizable strategy for advancing multi‐electron redox systems.","aip":1},{"t":"高温运行条件下甲脒-铯金属卤化物钙钛矿太阳能电池中阳离子偏析与挥发性损失解耦研究","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02011-y","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿太阳能电池","kp":["T90[FA-Cs钙钛矿连续光照]: ~2700h","[退化转变温度]: 106°C以上阳离子偏析主导","[界面策略]: CsI3薄层抑制FAI挥发"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究针对甲脒-铯（FA-Cs）铅卤钙钛矿太阳能电池在高温运行条件下的阳离子偏析和挥发损失问题进行了解耦分析。通过构建FAXCs(1-X)PbI₃组分梯度层，有效抑制了FAI的挥发损失，维持了阳离子分布的均匀性。研究表明高温操作下阳离子偏析与组分挥发是两个独立的退化路径，需分别针对性优化。该策略显著提升了钙钛矿电池的热稳定性。","dp":1,"ot":"Decoupling cation segregation and volatile loss in formamidinium–caesium metal halide perovskite solar cells under high-temperature operating conditions","b":"Formamidinium–caesium lead iodide (FAXCs1-XPbI3, 0 x 2) layer effectively suppresses FAI loss, maintaining cation-segregation-dominated degradation beyond 106 °C. Moreover, introducing trace CsI3 in perovskite precursor enhances cation homogeneity in as-prepared films, dramatically extending the device T90 (time to 90% of maximum efficiency) to ~2,700 h under continuous 1-sun illumination (1.0% UV) at 85 °C. The extrapolated T90 at 45 °C exceeds 50 years by assuming a same degradation pathway. These findings elucidate the temperature-dependent degradation pathways in formamidinium–caesium perovskites and provide practical strategies to enhance their operational stability."},{"t":"揭示电催化CO2转化反应中单原子催化剂上中间体的相互作用模式","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS00621J","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子CO2电催化","kp":["催化剂[电催化CO2还原]: 单原子催化剂","[研究重点]: 中间体相互作用模式决定活性选择性"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究系统解析了单原子催化剂（SACs）在电催化CO₂还原反应中中间体的相互作用模式。通过理论计算与实验表征，阐明了不同金属单原子位点上CO₂吸附、质子耦合电子转移及C-C偶联步骤的反应路径与能垒。研究揭示了活性位点电子结构对中间体稳定性和产物选择性的调控规律，为理性设计高效CO₂转化催化剂提供了理论框架。","dp":1,"ot":"Deciphering the interaction patterns of intermediates on single atom catalysts during electrocatalytic CO2 conversion reactions","b":"Electrocatalytic CO2 conversion (CO2CR) offers a promising route for addressing carbon emissions while simultaneously generating valuable chemical feedstocks. Single-atom catalysts (SACs) have attracted significant attention due to their maximized metal atom utilization and precisely defined coordination architectures. Accumulating evidence indicates that CO2CR over SACs is jointly governed by the intrinsic properties of the central metal atom and the surrounding coordination environment. In this review, we present a comprehensive analysis of the hierarchical coordination environments surrounding the central metal center, encompassing monoelement and bielement coordination in the first coordination sphere, second coordination sphere modulation by neighboring non-metallic and metallic species, and engineering of the beyond-second coordination sphere via functional-group grafting and distal substrate functionalization. We further elucidate the nature of catalytically active sites and systematically categorize intermediate binding behaviors into single-site, step-by-step, simultaneous and cross-substrate intermediate binding modes, highlighting how tailored intermediate interactions regulate reaction kinetics, suppress competing pathways, and steer product selectivity. Notably, we summarize recent advances demonstrating that SACs are not inherently confined to C1 products but also unlock complex coupling reactions through rationally designed multi-site interaction networks, yielding critical chemicals including C2+ products, urea, and others. This framework establishes SACs as a transformative platform for next-generation CO2CR through precise control of multiscale coordination environments, active sites, and intermediate interactions."},{"t":"更正：未活化1,3-二烯-8-炔和1,3-二烯-8-烯的区域选择性与对映选择性钴催化分子内[4+2]和[2+2]环加成反应中的配体效应","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4150982?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钴催化环加成","sc":0.6,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":1.0,"r":0.0,"d":0.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Correction to “Ligand Effects in Regio‐ and Enantioselective Cobalt‐Catalyzed Intramolecular [4 + 2]‐ and [2 + 2]‐Cycloaddition Reactions of Unactivated 1,3‐Diene‐8‐ynes and 1,3‐Diene‐8‐enes”"},{"t":"更正了 Goyette 等人的观点，靶向 Axl 有利于抗肿瘤微环境，通过降低 Hif-1α 水平来增强免疫治疗反应","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2608616123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"趋同进化通过拟南芥中 BOR1 和 BOR2 的 SNP 和串联重复增加硼转运","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525676123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Boron (B) is a crucial micronutrient, particularly in volcanic soils where its deficiency hampers agriculture. Here, we investigate the genetic basis of leaf B accumulation in natural populations of\n                    Arabidopsis thaliana\n                    that colonized volcanic islands in Cape Verde. Using a combination of genome-wide association studies (GWAS) and mapping in a recombinant intercross population, we identified a case of convergent phenotypic evolution in which multiple variants in the two principal B transporter genes,\n                    BOR1\n                    and\n                    BOR2\n                    , increase leaf B accumulation in parallel. These include multiple tandem duplications at\n                    BOR1\n                    that arose independently in different populations. Overall, this study reveals a remarkable case of convergent evolution occurring within a relatively short time scale, where different types of de novo mutations at B efflux transporter genes achieve similar phenotypic outcomes. Further, our findings show that integrating recombinant populations with GWAS in natural populations can improve power to overcome allelic heterogeneity."},{"t":"窄带隙有机半导体实现色彩不变光热织物，用于可穿戴太阳能采集","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519334?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The increasing popularity of outdoor activewear has placed higher demands on its thermal comfort, multi‐functionality, and esthetics. Existing photothermal fabrics for cold weathers are based on visible light absorption, which limits color design options. Herein, a chromatic‐invariant photothermal material is developed and integrated onto fabrics to prepare novel photothermal clothing, achieving 4°C–8°C temperature increase within only 5 min under 1000 W m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    simulated solar irradiation. It exhibits strong absorption in the near‐infrared region and effectively converts the radiation into thermal energy, while maintaining the original visual colors of fabrics due to high reflectivity across the visible spectrum. Additionally, this photothermal material does not compromise the original functionality of fabrics and is suitable for application on various types of fabric materials. Furthermore, the prepared fabric achieves a sterilization rate exceeding 95.3% after only 20 min of irradiation under 1000 W m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    standard simulated solar light to ensure hygiene during outdoor activities. These results demonstrate a versatile wearable strategy with integrated functionality and aesthetic appeal for maintaining personal thermal comfort in cold‐weather outdoor scenarios.","tp":"光热半导体","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"研究开发了一种基于窄带隙有机半导体的色彩不变光热材料，集成到织物中制备新型光热服装。该材料通过近红外光吸收实现光热转换，避免了传统可见光吸收型光热织物对颜色设计的限制。在太阳光照射下5分钟内可使温度提升4-8°C，兼顾热舒适性、多功能性与美观性，为可穿戴太阳能采集和冬季户外装备提供创新方案。"},{"t":"氟诱导烯丙基铑异构化驱动β-酮酸与偕二氟丙二烯催化对映选择性脱羧交叉偶联","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4973244?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"不对称催化偶联","kp":["[催化体系]: Rh(I)/(S,S)-Ph-BPE","[反应类型]: β-酮酸与gem-二氟丙二烯脱羧交叉偶联","[关键机制]: 氟诱导烯丙基铑异构化"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究实现了β-酮酸与偕二氟丙二烯的催化对映选择性脱羧交叉偶联反应，关键创新在于氟诱导的烯丙基铑异构化策略。氟原子的强电负性驱动烯丙基铑物种的区域选择性迁移，实现了高效的去羧烯丙基化（DAA）。该方法以高对映选择性和区域选择性构建含氟手性中心，为药物分子和功能材料的合成提供了高效工具。","dp":1,"ot":"Catalytic Enantioselective Decarboxylative Cross‐Coupling of β‐Ketoacids With gem‐Difluoroallenes Enabled by Fluorine‐Induced Allylrhodium Isomerization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Catalytic decarboxylative allylic alkylation (DAA) reaction represents an efficient strategy for synthesizing molecules containing both carbonyl and alkenyl functionalities, yet is frequently challenged by multiple selectivity issues. Here we report the first intermolecular decarboxylative cross‐coupling of β‐ketoacids with internal allenes. Using a Rh\n                    (I)\n                    /(\n                    S\n                    ,\n                    S\n                    )‐Ph‐BPE system, α‐\n                    gem\n                    ‐difluoroallylic carbonyl compounds can be generated with excellent chemo‐, regio‐, and enantioselectivities. Mechanistic studies support “coordination‐assisted inner‐sphere addition–decarboxylation” pathway, where C─C bond formation occurs prior to the decarboxylation step. Fluorine‐induced\n                    anti\n                    →\n                    syn\n                    isomerization of π‐allyl‐rhodium species proves to be the key factor governing the stereoselectivity of this reaction. This cross‐coupling reaction tolerates a range of functional groups and advances the field of decarboxylative allylic alkylation."},{"t":"用于在可见光区域产生低蓝光圆偏振光的宽带反射胆甾液晶","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72890?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In this work, a polymerizable chiral liquid‐crystal monomer was first synthesized from inexpensive biomass‐derived cholesterol through a simple transformation. Co‐assembling this chiral monomer with a polymerizable achiral liquid‐crystal monomer and followed by initiator‐free photopolymerization, yielded a cholesteric liquid‐crystal (CLC) material\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    featuring a broad reflection band in the visible region with blue‐selectivity. After removal of the quartz substrates, the material forms a flexible film with good thermal stability. Due to Bragg reflection, under transmission mode,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    efficiently converts 510–700 nm unpolarized light into right‐handed circularly polarized (\n                    R\n                    ‐CP) light with dissymmetry factors (\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    ) of −1.6 and even reaching up to −2.0. Placed behind achiral zero‐blue aqueous solutions,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    enabled multicolour zero‐blue circularly polarized photoluminescence, generating exclusively\n                    R\n                    ‐CP light with |\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    | values exceeding 1.6. Additionally, under reflection mode,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    efficiently converts unpolarized ambient light into 510–700 nm low‐blue left‐handed circularly polarized (\n                    L\n                    ‐CP) light. Therefore,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    exhibited distinctly different colors under varying backgrounds and circular polarizers. Leveraging these behaviors, molecular logic gate and information encryption–decryption were realized. Furthermore, a conceptual design for a low‐blue circularly polarized display device was also demonstrated."},{"t":"整体致密二元合金的键软化与弹性限域实现钾离子电池负极高体积比容量","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9686588?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钾离子负极","kp":["[合金组成]: Sb0.6Bi0.4二维纳米片","[稳定化策略]: 本征-外禀双重稳定整合3D弹性石墨烯","[关键机制]: 键软化与弹性限容","[应用]: 钾离子电池高体积容量负极"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究设计了二维Sb-Bi单致密二元合金作为钾离子电池负极，通过键软化和弹性限域效应实现高体积比容量。Sb-Bi合金化降低了K⁺嵌入/脱出过程中的结构应变，弹性限域抑制了充放电循环中的体积膨胀与粉化。致密结构保证了高体积能量密度，为钾离子电池高容量负极材料的结构设计提供了合金化与限域协同的新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Bond Softening and Elastic Confinement of Monolithic Dense Binary Alloys for High Volumetric Capacity of K‐Ion Battery Anodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Two‐dimensional (2D) Sb─Bi alloys are considered as the promising high‐capacity and high‐rate anodes of potassium‐ion batteries, yet their practical application is limited by low density and structural degradation. Herein, we propose an intrinsic‐extrinsic dual‐stabilization strategy that integrates 2D binary Sb\n                    0.6\n                    Bi\n                    0.4\n                    nanosheets into 3D elastic graphene networks, constructing a highly dense monolithic architecture (HD‐Sb\n                    0.6\n                    Bi\n                    0.4\n                    @G). This design features with high density (2.6 g cm\n                    −3\n                    ) and electrical conductivity (555.6 S m\n                    −1\n                    ), delivering large volumetric capacity (1355.1 mAh cm\n                    −3\n                    ) and high areal capacity (11.4 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    ) at an ultra‐high loading of 27.6 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    , along with long‐term cyclability (65.4% capacity retention after 1500 cycles) and stable full‐cell performance. Experimental and theoretical analyses reveal that the Sb─Bi alloy exhibited “bond softening” with the optimized interlayer spacing and moderate bond energy, facilitating rapid K\n                    +\n                    diffusion and buffering strain. Furthermore, the elastic graphene network provides nanoscale confinement, accommodating volume expansion and preserving structural and electrical integrity. Strong electronic coupling at the alloy‐graphene interface further reduces K\n                    +\n                    adsorption and diffusion energy barriers, enabling fast ion transport under the high‐loading anodes. This intrinsic‐extrinsic synergy between binary‐alloy bond softening and nanoscale elastic confinement provides a universal strategy for compact, high‐loading electrodes with high volumetric and areal energy storage.","aip":1},{"t":"基于生物的片上模型可识别过度兴奋的皮质纹状体网络内的选择性拓扑重组","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513459123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The mammalian cerebral cortex projects to the striatum in a precise, hierarchical topography, forming parallel loops that underlie sensorimotor, associative, and limbic processing. Despite the striatum’s lack of clear anatomical boundaries, these projections remain functionally segregated, suggesting the existence of intrinsic organizing principles. Disruptions in corticostriatal connectivity and excitability are common in neurodevelopmental disorders, but it remains unclear whether such abnormalities are a cause or a consequence of circuit dysfunction. Here, we hypothesized that the excitability state of cortical neurons plays a direct role in shaping the topographic organization of their striatal projections. To test this, we engineered a biologically faithful in vitro platform inspired by the Tesla valve, enabling adjacent corticostriatal territories to be modeled under controlled excitability regimes. We found that cortical hyperexcitability disrupted the normal developmental transition from axonal growth to stabilization, leading to premature invasion of neighboring territories and the formation of ectopic convergence zones. As a result, the segregation between parallel pathways was lost, while local connectivity patterns remained unaffected. These findings reveal that intrinsic, activity-sensitive mechanisms constrain long-range axonal growth to shape the wiring diagram of the corticostriatal projectome. They also highlight the power of biologically grounded on-chip models to uncover how early circuit vulnerabilities can lead to connectivity defects characteristic of disorders such as autism spectrum disorder, schizophrenia, epilepsy, and obsessive-compulsive disorder.","tp":"脑网络芯片","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"哺乳动物大脑皮层以高度精确的分层拓扑结构向纹状体投射，形成支撑感觉运动、联想和边缘处理的平行回路，且这些投射在功能上保持分离。神经发育障碍常伴随皮质纹状体连接和兴奋性的异常。本研究开发了一种基于生物的片上模型，成功识别出在过度兴奋的皮质纹状体网络内发生的选择性拓扑重组现象，为揭示相关神经疾病的病理机制提供了创新视角。"},{"t":"具有不对称局部电场的轴向硫桥Mo-S-Cu纳米酶可增强多酶活性，用于铁死亡-焦亡治疗","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523888?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The axial coordination‐based nanozymes with asymmetric local electric field (LEF) are promising for efficient reactive oxygen species (ROS)‐mediated antitumor treatments, while normally hindered by a limited LEF upon individual coordination to adjacent atoms. Herein, an axial sulfur‐bridged Mo─S─Cu nanozymes with asymmetric LEF (A‐CuN\n                    3\n                    S\n                    1\n                    @MoS\n                    2‐x\n                    ) was constructed based on nanoislands (NIs)‐based axial ligand‐bridging to enhance ferroptosis‐pyroptosis therapy. The S bridge between Cu atoms in CuN\n                    3\n                    /C nanosheets and Mo site in NIs creates a broad and enhanced LEF, which facilitates rapid electron transfer between the nanozyme and substrates, thereby regulating its enzymatic activities. Theoretical calculations reveal that the S‐bridge induces asymmetric electron‐rich redistribution along the longitudinal axis of Cu─N\n                    3\n                    , promoting H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    heterolysis and O\n                    2\n                    desorption to enhance catalase‐like and peroxidase‐like activities. Simultaneously, Mo sites extract electrons from Cu via the S bridge, augmenting oxidase‐like activities and degrade overexpressed glutathione to avoid nontherapeutic ROS consumption. Consequently, A‐CuN\n                    3\n                    S\n                    1\n                    @MoS\n                    2‐x\n                    induces robust ferroptosis by cytotoxic ROS accumulation and causing severe mitochondria damages, while simultaneously activating pyroptosis within the tumor region without harming normal tissues. This work demonstrates high‐efficiency ferroptosis‐pyroptosis therapy driven by multi‐enzyme catalysis via axial Mo─S─Cu coordination with an expanded asymmetric LEF, offering a novel strategy for non‐apoptotic tumor treatment.","tp":"硫桥纳米酶","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"研究设计了具有不对称局部电场的轴向硫桥Mo─S─Cu纳米酶（A-CuN3S1@MoS2-x），通过增强多酶催化活性高效产生活性氧（ROS），协同诱导肿瘤细胞铁死亡和焦亡。该双死亡机制通路策略显著提升了抗肿瘤效果，突破了单一细胞死亡途径的局限性，为纳米酶介导的肿瘤催化治疗提供了新范式。"},{"t":"含Pt-(双NHC)-Pt单元的金属有机[2]索烃：拓扑驱动策略增强离散聚集体磷光发射","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1981919?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"拓扑磷光分子","kp":["[分子设计]: 苯并双碳烯桥连双核Pt(II)配合物","[拓扑策略]: 机械键限制分子内运动增强磷光","[聚集体类型]: 离散型可溶性机械互锁分子"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究采用拓扑驱动策略合成了含Pt-(di-NHC)-Pt单元的有机金属[2]索烃，利用机械互锁分子（MIMs）的受限构象增强其在离散聚集体中的磷光发射。索烃的机械键限制了两环组件的相对运动，抑制了聚集态下的非辐射衰减，提升了磷光量子效率。该拓扑调控策略为离散分子聚集体的发光性能优化提供了不同于传统聚集诱导发光（AIE）的新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"An Organometallic [2]Catenane With Pt‒(di‐NHC)‒Pt Units: A Topology‐Driven Strategy for Enhanced Phosphorescence in Discrete Aggregates","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mechanically interlocked molecules (MIMs) can be conceptualized as a distinct class of discrete and soluble aggregates, where the mechanical bond restricts selected intramolecular motions, thereby triggering emission enhancement analogous to aggregation‐induced emission (AIE). Herein, we present phosphorescent MIMs based on a benzobiscarbene bridged dinuclear Pt\n                    II\n                    complex (NHC =\n                    N\n                    ‐heterocyclic carbene ligand). Tailoring the\n                    N\n                    ‐substituents of the benzobiscarbene ligand allowed selective access to the\n                    syn‐\n                    configured dinuclear complex\n                    syn‐\n                    [Pt\n                    2\n                    (\n                    1b\n                    )X\n                    2\n                    ] (X = I, OTf). Self‐assembly of\n                    syn‐\n                    [Pt\n                    2\n                    (\n                    1b\n                    )(OTf)\n                    2\n                    ] with bipyridyl ligands\n                    \n                      L\n                      2\n                    \n                    and\n                    \n                      L\n                      3\n                    \n                    yielded two discrete MIMs: the Borromean rings [\n                    2‐BRs\n                    ](OTf)\n                    12\n                    stabilized by π···π interactions and the [2]catenane [\n                    3b‐IL\n                    ](OTf)\n                    4\n                    , generated and stabilized by solvophobic effects. While the π···π interactions in the Borromean rings lead to severe phosphorescence quenching, the solvophobically assembled [2]catenane effectively circumvents such quenching, while simultaneously restricting intramolecular rotations and vibrations. Consequently, the [2]catenane displays a drastic phosphorescence enhancement compared to the Borromean rings."},{"t":"缩醛[6]芳烃：刚性环上手性大环化合物促进电荷转移共组装并展现优异(手性)光学性质","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4969685?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性大环组装体","kp":["[分子特征]: 三氧杂双环[3.3.1]壬烷嵌入刚性手性大环","[组装特性]: 与缺电子芳环客体形成电荷转移复合物","[光学性能]: 优异手性光学性质"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究引入缩醛[6]芳烃（Ac[6]）作为新型刚性手性大环分子，其碳中心手性和环上手性赋予分子独特的刚性构象。该大环能够促进电荷转移共组装，展现出优异的手性光学性质，包括强圆二色性和圆偏振发光。这一新型手性平台在不对称催化、手性传感和光电功能材料领域具有广泛应用潜力。","dp":1,"ot":"Acetal[6]Arenes: Rigid Chirality‐on‐Annulus Macrocycles Promoting Charge‐Transfer Co‐Assembly With Exceptional (Chiro)Optical Properties","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Acetal[6]arenes (\n                    Ac[6]\n                    ) are introduced as a new class of rigid chiral macrocyclic arenes in which carbon‐centered chirality is embedded in a trioxabicyclo[3.3.1]nonane motif at macrocyclic waist.\n                    Ac[6]\n                    efficiently forms charge‐transfer (CT) complexes with electron‐deficient aromatic guests in both solution and the solid state. Single‐crystal x‐ray diffraction reveals that guest molecules bind to the outer surface of\n                    Ac[6]\n                    through well‐defined stacking interactions. In contrast, the corresponding acyclic bis‐acetal precursors show no complexation behavior, indicating that the rigid macrocyclic topology suppresses ring‐unit flipping and significantly enhances interfacial π–π interactions. The resulting solid‐state complexes exhibit dual emission at CT band (prompt fluorescence and TADF). Notably, complexes derived from enantiopure\n                    Ac[6]\n                    display intense circular dichroism (CD) and circularly polarized luminescence (CPL). The associated dissymmetry factors (\n                    \n                      g\n                      abs\n                    \n                    and\n                    \n                      g\n                      lum\n                    \n                    ) even exceed intrinsic\n                    Ac[6]\n                    values, indicating highly efficient chiral transfer.\n                    Ac[6]\n                    shows robust guest‐capture capability, forming CT complexes not only via solution co‐crystallization but also through simple physical mixing and even gas‐phase guest uptake. By exploiting time‐dependent capture kinetics and multicolor optoelectronic properties, we developed applications for optical sensing and time‐encoded encryption. These results establish macrocyclization of rigid chirality‐on‐annulus units as a powerful strategy for creating functional supramolecular CT materials with emergent chiroptical and optoelectronic properties."},{"t":"基于可解释图学习与GPU加速优化的电力-氢能流优化两阶段框架","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600406X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电氢能量流优化","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A two-stage framework for optimal electricity‑hydrogen energy flow based on explainable graph learning and GPU-accelerated optimization"},{"t":"分子工程化电子选择性自组装单分子层增强倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池准费米能级劈裂","d":"2026-03-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02025-6","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿电池界面","kp":["[界面策略]: 自组装单分子层减缓界面电荷提取","[物理机制]: 提升准费米能级分裂增大光电压"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过分子工程设计了一种电子选择性自组装单分子层（SAM），应用于倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池以提升准费米能级分裂（QFLS）。该SAM界面修饰有效降低了界面非辐射复合损失，最大化光电压输出，显著提升了器件的光电转换效率和稳定性，为高效钙钛矿电池的界面工程提供了新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"A molecularly engineered electron-selective self-assembled monolayer enhances quasi-Fermi level splitting in inverted perovskite solar cells","b":"Maximizing quasi-Fermi level splitting is essential for achieving high photovoltage in perovskite solar cells. Conventional strategies that prioritize rapid charge extraction at the perovskite/fullerene interface, can deplete interfacial carrier populations, limiting quasi-Fermi level splitting and photovoltage. Here we demonstrate that rational interface design benefits for slowed extraction rate, preserving interfacial carriers while minimizing non-radiative recombination. We introduce 3PDPA, a molecularly engineered electron-selective self-assembled monolayer at the perovskite/C60 interface. 3PDPA slows electron extraction, anchors undercoordinated Pb2+ ions and forms stable six-membered hydrogen-bonded rings with FA+ cations, delivering robust passivation and excellent chemical stability. 3PDPA further enables π–π interactions with C60, improving interfacial contact and reducing potential fluctuations. Inverted cells incorporating 3PDPA achieve efficiencies of 26.82% for 1.53 eV bandgap cells and 21.2% for 1.77 eV bandgap cells, alongside a T90 lifetime of ~1,000 h under International Summit on Organic Photovoltaic Stability (ISOS-L-3) stress conditions."},{"t":"用于区域电力经济预测的机器学习框架：制定美国区域能源经济指数（REEI）以实现公平的能源转型规划","d":"2026-03-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003570?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"能源转型策","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"[ASAP] 氢致钝化机制中金属-绝缘体-半导体光阳极缺陷密度的空间定量分析","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01240","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MIS光电极缺陷钝化","kp":["[MIS光电极]: ALD绝缘层缺陷钝化","[光电催化]: Si基MIS用于PEC水分解"],"dp":1,"as":"基于硅的金属-绝缘体-半导体（MIS）光电电极利用内置电场驱动光电化学水分解反应，是实现绿色制氢的关键器件。该研究提出了一种空间定量化的缺陷密度分析方法，用于表征氢致缺陷对器件性能的影响。通过高分辨成像技术绘制缺陷分布图，揭示了氢侵入在硅基光电极界面处诱发的陷阱态密度梯度，为理解MIS电极的长期稳定性衰减机制提供了定量依据。该成果对提升太阳能制氢效率与耐久性具有指导意义。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Spatially Quantitative Profiling of Defect Density for Hydrogen-Induced Passivation Mechanism of Metal–Insulator–","b":"Silicon-based metal-insulator-semiconductor (MIS) photoelectrodes provide a built-in field for photoelectrochemical water splitting but suffer from inefficient charge transport due to carrier recombination at defect sites within the space-charge region. The insulating layer fabricated by atomic layer deposition (ALD) is critical for defect passivation and requires carefully engineered deposition and annealing processes for optimal performance. This necessitates the quantitative analysis of defect density distribution. However, such analysis remains impeded by intrinsic limitations of conventional single-capacitance techniques and the influence of tunneling leakage currents. This paper describes an integrated multicapacitance methodology that combines drive-level capacitance profiling (DLCP) and capacitance-voltage (C-V) techniques to quantify both interface (Nit) and bulk defect charge density (NDLCP) within the space-charge region, using the space-charge capacitance refined by MIS-adapted multicomponent equivalent circuit modeling. This approach reveals that Al2O3 reduces the Nit at n-Si/ITO interface from approximately 2.9 × 1016 to 1.4 × 1016 cm-3, while simultaneously profiling the variation of NDLCP and depletion width. Furthermore, systematic DLCP/C-V analysis enables the design of a tailored passivation protocol by tuning ALD deposition (Tdep) and annealing temperatures to leverage the hydrogen-induced mechanism. Optimal passivation is achieved at a moderate Tdep (∼160 °C) followed by 350 °C annealing, which balances sufficient hydrogen content and suitable structural properties of the Al2O3 film without introducing additional bulk defects during annealing. Eventually, the optimized n-Si/SiOx/Al2O3/ITO/Ni photoanode exhibits an onset potential of 0.88 V vs RHE and an applied bias photon-to-current efficiency (ABPE) of 2.91%, with a long-term stability of 120 h."},{"t":"[ASAP] 调控非共价相互作用构建高温多轴无铅金属卤化物杂化铁电体","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21648","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无铅铁电体","kp":["[无铅铁电体]: 非共价作用调控高温多轴性","材料体系[铁电体]: (PMA)3MBr6 (M=Bi3+/Sb3+)"],"dp":1,"as":"无铅分子铁电材料因其环境友好特性被视为绿色电子技术的未来方向，但其在高温环境下的多轴铁电性能调控一直面临挑战。本研究通过精细调控分子间非共价相互作用（氢键、范德华力等），成功构建了在高温条件下保持稳定多轴铁电响应的新型无铅分子铁电体。该策略为设计耐高温柔性电子器件和存储器提供了新思路，突破了传统含铅铁电材料的毒性限制与温度瓶颈。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Regulating Noncovalent Interactions to Construct High-Temperature Multiaxial Lead-Free Metal Halide Hybrid Ferroe","b":"Lead-free molecular ferroelectrics are expected to promote the development of green electronics technology due to their environmental friendliness and functional diversity. Nevertheless, the limited variety, low Curie temperature (Tc), and uniaxial characteristics pose significant obstacles in their application. Herein, on the basis of (PMA)3MBr6 (PMA+ is benzylammonium, and M is Bi3+ or Sb3+), we constructed a series of lead-free metal halide hybrids (PMA)2(A)MBr6 (A is dimethylammonium (DMA+), formamidinium (FA+), or guanidinium (GA+)) using a cation mixing strategy. The cation mixing strategy introduces cation-π interactions and effectively regulates the hydrogen bonding network in the structure. The different strengths of noncovalent interactions in the structures lead to differences in the phase transition temperature and ferroelectricity of (PMA)2(A)MBr6. In (PMA)2(GA)MBr6 and (PMA)2(FA)MBr6, the excessively strong hydrogen bond network and cation-π interactions result in the system lacking the necessary kinetic degrees of freedom to achieve ferroelectric inversion. It is worth noting that moderate noncovalent interactions can ensure spontaneous polarization below the Curie temperature (Tc) and provide necessary dynamic channels for the flipping of polar units, thus successfully achieving ferroelectricity in (PMA)2(DMA)MBr6 (3̅mFm). The results revealed that in the design of molecular ferroelectrics, a delicate balance needs to be struck between the different strengths of noncovalent interactions. This finding provides a significant and effective pathway to design high-Tc and multiaxial environmentally friendly ferroelectrics."},{"t":"[ASAP] AI辅助性能分析实现钙钛矿太阳能电池参数快速预测","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00075","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿AI参数预测","dp":1,"as":"钙钛矿太阳能电池的组分与工艺参数空间庞大，传统试错优化效率低下。该研究利用人工智能辅助的性能预测模型，将材料组分、沉积条件与器件光电转换效率关联建模，实现了钙钛矿太阳能电池关键参数的快速预测与筛选。该方法大幅缩短了从配方到性能的迭代周期，降低了实验成本，为钙钛矿光伏技术的工业化量产优化提供了数据驱动的加速路径。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Rapid Parameter Prediction in Perovskite Solar Cells via AI-Assisted Performance Analysis","b":"Metal halide perovskites are highly promising for photovoltaics, yet their complex physics makes comprehensive device characterization challenging. Here, we introduce a machine learning approach that enables holistic, high-precision characterization of perovskite solar cells from an impedance (EIS) measurement. By training a Random Forests Median Leaf Value model on over 50,000 drift-diffusion simulations, our model simultaneously predicts 12 critical device parameters, including ion dynamics and densities, carrier mobilities, and recombination properties, with high accuracy (R2 > 0.99). This approach advances prior work by extracting a more complete parameter set while alleviating the nonuniqueness problem through information-rich EIS input features. We rigorously validate the model against experimental values and closed-loop verification. Applying this technique to triple-cation perovskites with varying compositions reveals intriguing underlying trends, demonstrating its power to uncover complex structure–property relationships. This work establishes ML-driven frameworks for rapid, reliable device analysis to accelerate photovoltaic optimization."},{"t":"[ASAP] 镍催化醛的交叉脱氢烯丙基化反应","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20798","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍催化醛烯丙基化","kp":["催化剂[醛烯偶联]: Ni催化交叉脱氢烯丙基化"],"dp":1,"as":"醛的亲核加成是有机合成化学的核心反应之一。本研究开发了镍催化交叉脱氢烯丙基化反应，无需预官能团化底物，直接利用醛与烯烃构建C-C键。该反应以廉价丰产的镍为催化剂，避免了传统贵金属（钯、铑）的使用，具有原子经济性高、步骤简洁的优势。机理研究揭示了氧化加成与自由基路径的协同机制，为新药合成和精细化学品制备提供了绿色高效的新工具。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Nickel-Catalyzed Cross-Dehydrogenative Allylation of Aldehydes","b":"Nucleophilic additions to aldehydes play a central role in synthetic chemistry. While additions of organometallic nucleophiles are commonly employed, alternative catalytic processes such as cross-electrophile couplings and reductive couplings involving various π-systems have also been developed and extensively used. In this study, we describe a complementary approach to aldehyde-alkene couplings via direct nickel-catalyzed cross-dehydrogenative coupling of aldehydes and alkenes. The process utilizes a combination of zinc powder and di-tert-butyl peroxide, enabling cross-dehydrogenative coupling to allow the synthesis of β,γ-unsaturated ketones through the catalytic union of acyl radicals and allylic radicals generated from the aldehyde and alkene substrates. An array of substrate combinations is demonstrated, and both experimental and computational studies support the involvement of a double hydrogen-atom-transfer (HAT) mechanism. Comparative analysis of di-tert-butyl peroxide with an alternate oxidant, 2-bromo-1,3-bis(trifluoromethyl)benzene, illustrates the substrate-dependent complementarity of the oxidants and shows an important interdependence of relative substrate concentrations. Quantum chemical estimates of the thermodynamics of the two simultaneous HAT events, generating acyl radicals and allylic radicals, show a correlation between calculated free energies of reaction and the optimal experimental protocol."},{"t":"[ASAP] 金属酶催化的天然酶学中未知或罕见的自由基反应","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemrev.5c00837","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chemical Reviews: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"金属酶自由基反应","kp":["[金属酶催化]: 第一过渡系金属辅因子催化自由基反应"],"dp":1,"as":"金属酶催化的自由基反应在过去十年取得突破性进展，但仍有大量天然体系中罕见甚至未知的自由基转化类型有待探索。本综述系统总结了金属酶催化执行天然界未知或不常见的自由基反应的最新成果，涵盖非天然反应底物的工程化改造、自由基中间体的捕获与表征、以及新反应路径的理性设计。这些进展拓展了生物催化合成的化学空间，为手性药物和复杂天然产物的不对称合成开辟了全新途径。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Metalloenzyme-Catalyzed Radical Reactions Unknown or Uncommon in Native Enzymology","b":"The past decade has witnessed groundbreaking developments in metalloenzyme-catalyzed free radical transformations, which were previously unknown or uncommon in native metalloenzymology. Guided by mechanistic understandings from organic, organometallic, and biochemistry, an array of radical reactions has been developed using various metalloprotein catalysts based on first-row transition metal cofactors including Fe, Co, and Cu. The structural and functional diversity and the readily tunable active-site environment of metalloproteins offer an excellent opportunity to solve the challenging chemo-, regio-, and stereoselectivity problems in radical-mediated transformations facing synthetic chemists. In this Review, we summarize metalloprotein-catalyzed radical reactions based on the reactive intermediates involved, including carbon-centered radicals, nitrogen-centered radicals, oxygen-centered radicals, and metal carbenoids and nitrenoids with radical character. We further survey the reaction mechanism, enzyme engineering strategies, and substrate scope of these metalloprotein-catalyzed radical transformations, providing an overview of the current status of metalloenzymology that is unknown or uncommon in native biochemistry."},{"t":"[尽快] 免疫受体中基于膜的组装和相互作用","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemrev.5c00993","c":"未分类","a":"Chemical Reviews: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Immune receptors are modular sensors that detect molecular changes indicating infection, cell/tissue damage, oncogenic transformation, or exposure to allergens, and the signals they transmit initiate and regulate immune responses. These transmembrane receptors are often composed of one or more single-spanning membrane proteins and are modular in two important aspects. First, many immune receptors assemble from ligand-binding modules and signaling modules made up of separate proteins that come together during biosynthesis or upon activation through specific transmembrane domain (TMD) interactions. Second, the assembled receptor complexes comprise extracellular modules (structured protein domains) that interact with their environments and intracellular modules (often intrinsically unstructured domains) that read out these interactions biochemically. These are connected by and must communicate through the receptor TMDs. Here we review the molecular principles and structural motifs that organize and regulate immune receptors in the lipid bilayer with a view to understanding both how they are built and what roles the molecular interactions with and within the membrane play in their structures and functions. We focus primarily on examples where biochemical and structural data reveal highly specific interactions and show how these represent solutions that appear repeatedly across receptor families and can be exploited in synthetic biology applications.","tp":"免疫受体膜","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":4.0},"as":"免疫受体是检测感染、细胞损伤、肿瘤转化或过敏原的关键模块化传感器，负责启动并调节免疫反应。这些跨膜受体通常由单次跨膜蛋白组成，其模块化特征主要体现在：配体结合模块与信号传导模块在空间上的动态组装。研究深入探讨了这些独立蛋白在免疫受体组装中的相互作用机制，有助于进一步揭示免疫受体如何精确感知外部分子变化并向胞内传递信号，为免疫相关疾病治疗提供新思路。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过遗传字母扩展生成高亲和力六字母 DNA 异种适体","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21249","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"A method for generating high-affinity DNA aptamers (XenoAptamers) that bind to target proteins with a dissociation constant (KD) in the tens of pM range was developed using a six-letter DNA containing two hydrophobic unnatural bases (UBs), Ds and Px/Pa', by genetic alphabet expansion. Introducing Ds increases the structural diversity of DNA, and Px/Pa' directly interacts with a hydrophobic region of target proteins. Each process in this method (six-letter ExSELEX) was optimized, resulting in the generation of high-affinity XenoAptamers with KD values of 61 pM targeting interleukin-8 (IL8) and 1.7 pM targeting α-thrombin (thrombin). The sandwich-type ELISA using the anti-IL8 XenoAptamer-antibody combination exhibited higher sensitivity (limit of detection, LOD = 0.107 pg/mL) than that of an antibody-antibody pair (LOD = 1.227 pg/mL). The antithrombin XenoAptamer efficiently inhibits the thrombin-mediated cleavage of fibrinogen to fibrin. The six-letter ExSELEX method, with its increased DNA physicochemical and structural diversity, is expected to be innovative in creating DNA aptamers for diagnostic and therapeutic applications as an alternative to antibodies.","tp":"六字母适体","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究利用遗传字母扩展技术开发高亲和力六字母DNA异种适体（XenoAptamer）。通过在DNA中引入两种疏水性非天然碱基Ds和Px/Pa'，Ds增加DNA结构多样性，Px/Pa'直接与靶蛋白疏水区域相互作用，使适体结合亲和力达到皮摩尔级（KD在数十pM范围）。该方法优化了六字母ExSELEX各环节，为核酸适体药物开发提供了突破性平台。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 共价有机框架模板化分子接触层用于倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00031","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿COF分子接触","dp":1,"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"as":"研究利用共价有机框架（COF）作为模板，设计了倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池的分子级接触界面。COF材料凭借其可调控的孔道结构和功能基团，在钙钛矿/电子传输层界面形成有序分子接触层，有效改善界面能级匹配和缺陷钝化，从而提升器件的光电转换效率和长期运行稳定性。","ot":"[ASAP] Covalent Organic Framework-Templated Molecular Contacts for Inverted Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"Self-assembled molecule-based hole-selective contacts are critical for high-efficiency inverted perovskite solar cells (PeSCs), yet conventional self-assembled monolayers (SAMs) suffer from poor wettability and interfacial energy losses. Here, we integrate SAMs with imine-linked covalent organic frameworks (ILCOFs) to construct an ILCOF/SAM-intercalated hole-selective layer (HSL) featuring superwetting properties and improved morphology. The ILCOF nanosheets act as structural regulators, guiding SAM organization and promoting the growth of high-quality perovskite films with reduced interfacial defects. This hierarchical contact also enhances energy-level alignment and interfacial coupling, reducing voltage loss and improving thermal stability. As a result, PeSCs incorporating ILCOF/SAM deliver a power conversion efficiency of 26.06% and exhibit negligible performance degradation over 2,020 h of continuous operation. Furthermore, this strategy is compatible with scalable fabrication, yielding mini-modules with 22.95% efficiency over a 12.5 cm2 aperture area."},{"t":"[尽快] 修正“使用生物正交荧光探针和工程报告酶进行低背景癌症成像”","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c04784","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"[ASAP] 凝聚层组件中的仿生扩散限制硅化使智能纳米线圈能够用于深度和传感","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22993","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Controlling the self-assembly of mesoporous materials beyond equilibrium remains a fundamental challenge. Conventional templating systems form ordered structures through energy-minimizing coassembly but lack the kinetic and spatial freedom required to produce asymmetric or topologically complex architectures. Here, we report a bioinspired coacervate-directed silicification strategy that enables diffusion-limited and spatially asymmetric condensation within soft templates, yielding ordered hexagonal mesoporous nanotoroids. In this system, poly(acrylic acid) (PAA) electrostatically associates with the cationic surfactant cetyltrimethylammonium bromide (CTAB), driving liquid-liquid phase separation and forming disc-like coacervate assemblies. Reaction-diffusion imbalance across the inner and outer interfaces within these templates induces asymmetric silicification, driving an interior collapse and toroidal self-transformation. By tuning PAA concentration, the diffusion-condensation kinetics can be precisely modulated, allowing programmable control over collapse dynamics and final topology, with enlarged central cavities (14-71 nm) and reduced rim thickness (15-35 nm). These nanotoroids exhibit uniform sub-100 nm size, high surface area (846 m2 g-1), and abundant mesopores (∼2.0 nm). The nanotoroids (rim thickness ∼15 nm, height ∼40 nm) display markedly prolonged blood circulation, enhanced tumor accumulation (+173%), improved vascular extravasation, and deeper intratumoral penetration, while reducing hepatic and splenic uptake by 19% and 14%, respectively, compared with spherical analogues. These combined advantages translate into potent antitumor efficacy in both subcutaneous and spinal metastasis models. This work establishes a new paradigm for sol-gel topology control by bridging reaction-diffusion dynamics with bioinspired silicification based on the chemistry of LLPS (liquid-liquid phase separation), thereby unlocking the untapped biomedical potential of toroidal topologies that were rarely accessible.","tp":"硅化纳米圈","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究提出一种仿生凝聚层导向的硅化策略，通过扩散限制和空间不对称凝聚在软模板内实现可控自组装，生成有序六方介孔纳米线圈等拓扑复杂结构。该策略突破了传统模板法仅形成能量最小化平衡结构的局限，赋予介孔材料动力学和空间自由度，在深度递送和传感领域展现出智能纳米器件的应用潜力。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 金属有机框架纳米片的适应性孔道变形增强酶催化","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22730","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF酶催化限域","kp":["[酶纳米限域]: MOF纳米片自适应孔道变形增强催化","[主客体相互作用]: MOF孔道-酶适配机制"],"as":"该研究提出利用金属有机框架（MOF）纳米片中孔隙的自适应形变特性，实现对酶分子的纳米限域封装。通过MOF孔道的动态变形，能够在温和条件下将大分子酶有效包埋于多孔骨架内，从而显著提升酶的稳定性、可回收性与工业适用性。该策略为构建高效生物催化剂平台提供了新思路，有望拓展生物催化在药物合成、传感检测等领域的工程化应用。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Adaptive Pore Deformation in Metal–Organic Framework Nanosheets for Enhanced Enzymatic Catalysis","b":"The nanoconfinement of enzymes within porous scaffolds is a pivotal strategy for constructing robust and industrially relevant biocatalysts. However, a molecular-level understanding of the host-guest interactions that dictate catalytic efficiency remains a significant challenge, largely due to the inherent heterogeneity of enzyme guests and the scarcity of synthetic material hosts that permit atomic-level investigation of their pores upon enzyme loading. Here, we report the design of two redox-active biocatalysts via the encapsulation of cytochrome c within the mesopores of isostructural metal-organic framework (MOF) nanosheets and unveil for the first time adaptive pore deformation in MOF nanosheets governing biocatalytic efficiency. Using low-dose electron microscopy, we directly visualize how the nominally \"rigid\" MOF pores adaptively remodel─expanding or contracting─to accommodate \"flexible\" enzymes, a process governed by the interplay between pore surface chemistry and biomolecular flexibility. Crucially, pore expansion facilitates a transition in the heme iron configuration of cytochrome c from a six-coordinated (S = 1/2) to a highly active five-coordinated geometry (S = 3/2). This structural rearrangement enhances catalytic oxidation activity by up to an order of magnitude compared with the free enzyme. The synthetic MOF nanosheet biocatalyst exhibits exceptional efficiency in the degradation of toxic organic pollutants via a high-valent iron(IV)-oxo mechanism, surpassing existing nanocatalysts. These findings challenge the conventional view of solid supports as static carriers and provide new insights into enzymatic reactions under pore confinement.","aip":1},{"t":"结构调控混合水-有机电解质可燃性","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00040-1?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电解质可燃性","kp":["[可燃性机制]: 微观溶剂-溶质相互作用决定可燃性而非组成","[修正认知]: 部分报道不燃电解液实际可点燃"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究针对水-有机混合电解质普遍声称不可燃的论断，引入闪点等定量测试方法重新审视其安全性。研究发现电解质的可燃性并非仅由组分决定，而与溶剂-盐配位的微观结构密切相关：特定的分子结构排列可从根本上抑制蒸汽可燃性。这一结论纠正了此前依赖定性测试的行业认知，为安全电解质的理性设计提供了结构层面的指导原则。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"When structure controls flammability in hybrid aqueous-organic electrolytes","b":"Many hybrid aqueous-organic electrolytes have been reported to be nonflammable based on qualitative testing. Flash point measurement shows that some electrolytes that were previously reported to be nonflammable can ignite under realistic conditions. This work shows that local solvent-solute interaction and microstructure, as opposed to electrolyte composition, control flammability. The link between molecular interactions and electrolyte flammability was used to create design rules for reducing the flammability of hybrid electrolytes without compromising performance."},{"t":"抗超宽带电磁干扰的可穿戴织物","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00060-3?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可穿戴电磁屏蔽织物","kp":["屏蔽效能[柔性织物]: 99.9 dB @ 100 kHz","[电磁屏蔽]: 核壳复合材料双热退火制备"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过双重热退火工艺构建核壳结构复合材料，开发出可穿戴织物型电磁干扰屏蔽材料，在超宽频段（覆盖100 kHz至高频范围）实现了创纪录的99.9 dB屏蔽效能。核壳设计兼顾高导电性与柔性，突破了传统屏蔽材料频带窄、刚性强、难以穿戴的瓶颈，在军用电子防护、医疗设备抗干扰及可穿戴通信领域具有重要应用前景。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Wearable fabrics against ultra-broadband electromagnetic interference","b":"A core-shell composite, engineered via dual thermal annealing, achieves record broadband EMI shielding (99.9 dB at 100 kHz) on a flexible fabric, validated by in vitro neuroprotection—enabling next-generation wearable protection for clinicians.","aip":1},{"t":"使用小波分解确定投影图像结构的维数","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534122123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Mesoscale structures in turbulent media can often be described as fractional dimensional across a wide range of scales. The goal of this paper is to determine the structure’s dimension from a projected image. Our method exploits the laws of scaling of wavelet power spectra under projection and does not carry any restrictions on the embedding and projected dimensions. We show that the wavelet power spectrum of a projected\n                    γ\n                    dimensional measure is\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            P\n                            j\n                          \n                          =\n                          \n                            2\n                            \n                              −\n                              j\n                              γ\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    , where\n                    j\n                    is the wavelet scale. We contrast the wavelet method with the popular box-counting approach. For projected images, the use of box-counting at fixed thresholds often leads to erroneous results. We apply the method to James Webb Space Telescope (JWST) infrared and Chandra X-ray observations of the supernova remnant Cassiopeia A. We find that the emissions can be represented by projections of mesoscale substructures with fractal dimensions varying from\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          γ\n                          =\n                          1.69\n                          ±\n                          0.02\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    for the warm CO layer observed by JWST, up to\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          γ\n                          =\n                          2.49\n                          ±\n                          0.03\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    for the hot X-ray emitting gas layer in the supernova remnant."},{"t":"揭示 p53 变体 p53psi 的发育和肿瘤抑制作用","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2427242123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Through alternative splicing, the TP53 gene can generate multiple protein isoforms with distinct biochemical properties. The p53psi isoform has been identified as a shorter variant than full-length p53 as it lacks nuclear localization, oligomerization, and part of the DNA binding domains due to the use of an alternative 3’ splice site in intron 6. Several TP53-truncating mutations, including those producing p53psi, have been detected in a significant proportion of human tumors. However, the mechanistic roles of these truncated p53 proteins remain poorly understood. Here, we describe the generation and analysis of a genetically engineered mouse model that expresses the p53psi protein in place of the full-length p53 protein. In the C57/BL6J genetic background, mice heterozygous for the targeted p53psi allele (p53\n                    KI/+\n                    ) appear phenotypically normal, survive to adulthood, and reproduce. However, heterozygote matings fail to yield viable p53psi homozygote knock-in (p53\n                    KI/KI\n                    ) pups, indicating that forced p53psi expression disrupts embryogenesis. Timed matings revealed that homozygous p53psi expression is embryonically lethal on day E16.5. E14.5-16.5 embryos were pale, reduced in size, and exhibited exencephaly, a defect typically associated with neural tube closure failure. Mouse embryonic fibroblasts (MEFs) derived from p53psi embryos and transformed with the E1A and H-RasV12 oncogenes formed tumors with a decreased growth rate compared to their p53\n                    null\n                    counterparts, suggesting that p53psi retains at least some tumor-suppressive functions. Our mechanistic studies suggest that p53psi modulates tumorigenesis by triggering senescence. These findings provide insights into the role of the p53psi variant, paving the way for a better interpretation of TP53 mutational patterns in human cancers.","tp":"p53变体","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"TP53基因可通过选择性剪接产生多种具有不同生化特性的蛋白异构体。其中，p53psi作为一种截短变体，由于第6内含子中替代性3'剪接位点的使用，缺失了核定位、寡聚化以及部分DNA结合结构域。研究发现，产生p53psi的TP53截断突变在很大一部分人类肿瘤中被检测到。目前，科学界正在深入探讨该变体在生物体发育过程中的具体功能，以及其如何发挥潜在的肿瘤抑制作用，以期填补相关的机制空白。"},{"t":"2023-2024 年干旱期间亚马逊雨林遭受前所未有的破坏","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514066123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Between 2023 and 2024, Amazonian rainforests experienced two consecutive, record-breaking droughts—each more intense than any previously observed—yet their impacts remain largely unquantified. Using newly developed monthly radar satellite observations (1992 to 2025) that track forest moisture and biomass dynamics, we analyzed the long-term responses of intact Amazonian rainforests to past major droughts—particularly the 2023–2024 event—and projected their post-drought recovery. We found a biome-wide sharp decline in radar signal during 2023–2024, marking the lowest level observed since 1992. Spatially, 26.8% of the forests reached their three-decade minima during this period, primarily in eastern Amazonia. This ratio is more than double that recorded during the 2005 drought, when 11.0% of the forests reached such minima. Moreover, projections based on both historical and future CMIP6 precipitation scenarios consistently indicated that, even 7 y after the 2023–2024 droughts, less than 50% of the affected areas are expected to recover to predrought conditions, and these forests are associated with lower soil cation concentrations, higher soil sand content, and lower canopy height—characteristics that lessen the risk of hydraulic failure. Given that severe droughts have occurred approximately every 7 y over the past three decades, Amazonian rainforests may face another drought before fully recovering from the 2023–2024 event. Our results therefore highlight the growing vulnerability of the Amazonian rainforests to intensifying climate extremes driven by El Niño events and ongoing anthropogenic climate change, providing evidence that these forests are approaching the limits of their preindustrial operating space.","tp":"亚马逊干旱","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用1992至2025年月度雷达卫星观测数据，追踪亚马逊雨林湿度和生物量动态，发现2023-2024年连续两年遭遇破纪录干旱，强度超过历史任何观测记录。分析显示生物群系层面遭受前所未有的破坏，研究还预测了干旱后雨林的恢复轨迹，为评估极端气候事件对热带雨林碳汇功能的长期影响提供了关键遥感证据。"},{"t":"硅量子处理器中的普适逻辑操作","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02140-1","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅量子逻辑运算","kp":["[硅量子计算]: 逻辑比特实现通用逻辑操作","[容错计算]: 硅平台逻辑比特编码纠错"],"dp":1,"as":"硅基量子处理器在容错量子计算领域取得重要突破。研究团队展示了在硅量子比特平台上实现通用逻辑门操作的能力，通过量子纠错码对环境噪声引起的错误进行主动校正，使逻辑量子比特的可靠性显著提升。该成果验证了硅基平台在可扩展量子计算中的工程可行性，为未来大规模容错量子计算机的构建提供了关键的技术基础，有望加速量子计算从实验室向实际应用的转化进程。","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Universal logical operations in a silicon quantum processor","b":"Quantum errors induced by environmental noise are unavoidable and preclude the direct implementation of practical quantum computation. Fault-tolerant quantum computation offers one of the viable paths, necessitating the encoding and processing of information within logical qubits to curb such errors. Although substantial progress has been achieved recently in building silicon quantum computers, logical operations still haven’t been realized in silicon. Here we demonstrate a logical quantum processor using a phosphorus donor cluster in silicon. By implementing the [[4, 2, 2]] code, we realize the essential components for logical operations, which include fault-tolerant preparation of logical states and the characterization of a universal gate set comprising logical single-qubit and two-qubit gates. In particular, the logical T gate is achieved using the gate-by-measurement method, and magic states based on this gate are prepared. Furthermore, we execute the variational quantum eigensolver algorithm using two logical qubits and simulate the ground state of the electronic structure of the water molecule H2O. This work represents a key step towards scalable, fault-tolerant quantum computation in silicon spin qubits."},{"t":"超低漏电流与细丝导电型非晶硒化锗纳米颗粒Ovonic阈值开关选择器件","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523102?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"OTS选通器件","kp":["材料[OTS选择器]: 非晶GeSe纳米颗粒","[3D存储]: 超低漏电流低阈值电压选择器"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出了一种基于非晶硒化锗的低漏电流和细丝型导电存储器件，面向高集成密度存储器需求。器件利用钠离子迁移形成的导电细丝实现阻变存储机制，具有超低漏电流特性，显著降低功耗并提升开关比和耐久性。该方案在高密度非易失性存储和类脑计算等场景中展现出应用潜力，为突破传统存储器件微缩瓶颈提供了新材料路径。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ultralow‐Leakage‐Current and Filament‐Conductive Amorphous Germanium Selenide Nanoparticle Ovonic Threshold Switching Se","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Both large‐capacity storage and high‐parallel computing demand a significant boost in integration density of memory chips at advanced technological nodes. This necessitates selector components in 3D stackable cross‐point architectures to achieve an ultralow leakage current (\n                    I\n                    off\n                    ) and a relatively low threshold voltage (\n                    V\n                    th\n                    ). However, conventional ovonic threshold switching (OTS) selectors cannot optimize these two properties simultaneously due to their conflicting physical attributes. To overcome this challenge, we put forward an innovative material design of a thermally‐robust amorphous Ge\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    3\n                    nanoparticle (NP)‐assembled nanolayer, by which the resulting selectors have achieved an unprecedentedly low\n                    I\n                    off\n                    of ∼pA, an impressively high selectivity of ∼10\n                    8\n                    , a low\n                    V\n                    th\n                    of ∼2.4 V, and commendable\n                    V\n                    th\n                    reliability, outperforming existing OTS selectors. Through in situ off‐axis electron holography characterizations, we have presented evidence of nanoscale filamentary conduction within the individual NPs, revealing subthreshold‐conduction and switch‐on behaviors that have hitherto not been directly observed. Our work will inspire further exploration of novel amorphous chalcogenide NPs and deeper research on filamentary conduction physics, advancing the pursuit of superior access performances in OTS selectors.","aip":1},{"t":"面向成本最优的电力-算力联合管理：一种预测后优化新框架","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003867?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"算电协同优化","as":"","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Towards cost-optimal joint electricity-computation management: A novel predict-then-optimize framework"},{"t":"面向燃料电池混合动力汽车的智能能量管理：拓扑、感知与决策研究进展","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003326?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"燃料电池能量管理","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Toward intelligent energy management for fuel cell hybrid electric vehicles: Advances in topologies, perception, decisio"},{"t":"世界刚刚经历了有记录以来最热的 11 年——现在怎么办？","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00946-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"m5C 协调器 NSUN7 驱动 SPARC/HMGB1 轴介导的炎症，从而加剧肾损伤","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511296123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Growing evidence indicates that kidney inflammation is a major contributor to the pathogenesis of various renal diseases, including acute kidney injury (AKI). Although RNA modifications have been implicated in regulating kidney inflammation, their precise roles remain largely unknown. Here, we show that kidney inflammation and injury were associated with elevated RNA 5-methylcytosine (m5C) modifications, primarily driven by the NOP2/Sun RNA methyltransferase family member 7 (NSUN7). Both global and kidney-specific deletion of\n                    Nsun7\n                    in mice reduced m5C abundance, attenuated inflammatory responses, and decreased macrophage infiltration, underscoring its proinflammatory role in the kidney. Mechanistically, we identified secreted protein acidic and cysteine-rich (SPARC) as a major downstream effector of NSUN7. SPARC upregulation amplified inflammatory responses in renal tubular epithelial cells by interacting with high mobility group box 1 and further promoted proinflammatory macrophage infiltration via tubular-macrophage crosstalk. Notably, therapeutic silencing of\n                    Nsun7\n                    using a kidney-specific DNA tetrahedral molecular carrier developed for this study effectively alleviated inflammation and improved renal outcomes in AKI models. Collectively, our findings identify NSUN7 as a key driver of renal inflammation via SPARC regulation and underscore its potential as a therapeutic target in inflammatory kidney diseases."},{"t":"智能幻觉：为什么AI没有想象中那么聪明","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00882-5","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Nature","as":"","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI智能评估","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"The intelligence illusion: why AI isn’t as smart as it is made out to be"},{"t":"观众塑造蜜蜂摇摆舞的信息内容","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518687123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The honey bee waggle dance, which encodes food location, is often thought to involve only one-way information transfer from dancers to signal receivers. Here, we show that the information content of the dance is influenced by the presence of followers and the number of appropriately aged potential followers in the hive, rather than the total number of bees on the dance floor. Dancers reduced the precision of directional and distance communication when they had fewer actual and potential followers. Even when the dance floor was crowded with young bees that do not follow dances, dancers showed the same declines in precision. These declines appear to arise as a byproduct of audience seeking during the return run, when dancers with fewer followers spent more time moving and covered greater distances across the dance floor. Although their mean waggle run duration and the distance covered per waggle run remained unchanged, both measures became markedly more variable when followers were scarce. Dancers likely use quorum sensing of tactile contacts and, potentially, age-specific odors to sense audience size. These results reveal that waggle dancing is a socially responsive process shaped by feedback from followers, demonstrating bidirectional information flow within this communication system."},{"t":"混合蒸汽-电力能源系统结合余热利用与备用市场参与的技术经济优化","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003752?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热电联产","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蒸汽电力系统优化","as":"","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Techno-economic optimization of hybrid steam-electric energy systems with excess heat utilization and reserve market par"},{"t":"聚乙烯催化氢解与加氢裂解的技术经济分析与生命周期评估","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00068-1?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚乙烯催化氢解","kp":["[PE回收]: 催化氢解与加氢裂解定向转化","[产物调控]: 调节催化剂功能选择性生成烷烃或丙烷"],"dp":1,"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究对消费后聚乙烯通过催化氢解和加氢裂解转化为燃料及化学品的工艺进行了技术经济分析和生命周期评估（LCA）。结果表明催化剂定向加氢裂解可将废塑料高效转化为高附加值产物，在特定条件下具备经济可行性，并显著降低碳排放。该研究为废塑料化学回收的产业化决策提供了定量依据。","ot":"Techno-economic analysis and life cycle assessment for the catalytic hydrogenolysis and hydrocracking of polyethylene","b":"Post-consumer polyethylene can be selectively transformed into fuels and chemicals through catalyst-directed hydrocracking and hydrogenolysis. By tuning catalyst functionality, linear and branched liquid alkanes for fuel applications or propane for downstream propylene production can be preferentially generated. Techno-economic analyses and life-cycle assessments reveal how product selectivity governs cost and carbon intensity, providing actionable guidance for designing economically viable, low-emissions pathways for plastic waste conversion."},{"t":"锂离子电池可持续回收：面向整电池再生的新兴技术展望","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003946?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锂电池全电池再生","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":2.5},"as":"","ot":"Sustainable recycling of Lithium-ion batteries: A perspective on emerging technologies toward entire cell regeneration"},{"t":"可持续碳纤维实现稳定长期锂金属沉积，用于无过剩锂金属电池","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506780?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无负极锂金属电池","kp":["[零余量锂金属电池]: 碳纤维3D集流体均匀沉积","[集流体]: 可持续碳纤维降低首圈Li损耗"],"dp":1,"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了可持续碳纤维三维集流体，用于无负极（零余量）锂金属电池中促进均匀锂沉积。碳纤维的三维多孔结构有效降低局部电流密度，抑制锂枝晶生长，实现长期稳定的锂金属可逆沉积/剥离。该策略有望推动高能量密度无负极锂金属电池的实际应用，兼顾性能与可持续性。","ot":"Sustainable Carbon Fibers Enable Stable Long‐Term Lithium Metal Deposition for Prospective Zero‐Excess Lithium Metal Bat","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Three‐dimensional current collectors have emerged as a promising strategy to promote uniform Li deposition and extend the cycle life of zero‐excess lithium metal batteries. However, excessive Li loss in the first cycle due to solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) formation on the large surface area, combined with the use of dense or nonrenewable materials and complex, multistep fabrication processes, limits their practical implementation. In this work, a lightweight, lignin‐derived carbon fiber (CF) current collector is presented. It is fabricated via a simple and sustainable electrospinning process, and after carbonization has abundant structural defects and nanoscale porosity. Surface defects promote the formation of a stable, inorganic‐rich SEI, efficiently passivating the current collector, while pores of ∼1.0–1.4 nm enable quasi‐metallic Li clusters to form before plating, providing a conductive network and distributed nucleation sites that enhance Li plating/stripping reversibility and cycle life. This CF current collector exhibits a first‐cycle active Li loss of only 4.8%–8.9% relative to the typical Li inventory of commercial lithium‐ion battery cathodes and maintains a coulombic efficiency of 99.0% over 200 cycles, demonstrating excellent electrochemical performance.","aip":1},{"t":"二维层状材料表面化学调控实现高稳定性锌金属电池","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00062-7?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌金属电池界面层","kp":["[锌金属电池]: MXene表面端基调控沉积行为","[界面层工程]: 2D层状材料表面化学调控"],"dp":1,"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究综述了二维层状材料的表面化学调控策略在高稳定锌金属电池中的应用。通过调控MXene、石墨烯等二维材料表面的官能团和缺陷结构，构建人工界面保护层，有效引导锌离子均匀沉积并抑制枝晶和副反应。该方向为水系锌电池的界面工程和长循环稳定性提升提供了系统指导。","ot":"Surface chemistry modulation in two-dimensional layered materials for highly stable zinc metal batteries","b":"The tunable surface chemistry of two-dimensional layered materials offers new opportunities for developing artificial interfacial layers in metal batteries. Using MXenes with diverse surface terminations as model systems, the authors elucidate the underlying mechanism by which surface chemistry regulates zinc metal deposition behavior.","aip":1},{"t":"挪威海沉没的核潜艇“共青号”的现状","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520144123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The study documents in detail the extent of damage to the exterior of the sunken nuclear submarine Komsomolets and that previous remedial action carried out by Russia was still in place. No evidence was found of any plutonium in the near environment around the damaged forward section of the submarine from the nuclear warheads that were reported to be part of Komsomolets armament in the torpedo compartment. It was confirmed that releases from the reactor were still occurring, but not continuously, with maximum activity concentrations of\n                    90\n                    Sr and\n                    137\n                    Cs that were 400,000 and 800,000 times higher, respectively, than typical levels of these radionuclides in the Norwegian Sea. Elevated levels of\n                    239\n                    Pu,\n                    240\n                    Pu, and\n                    236\n                    U were also detected in the releases from the reactor, with atom ratios of\n                    240\n                    Pu/\n                    239\n                    Pu and\n                    236\n                    U/\n                    239\n                    Pu that indicate that the nuclear fuel in the reactor is corroding. Despite that releases from the reactor have occurred for over 30 y, there is little evidence of any accumulation of radionuclides in the near environment around the submarine as the released radionuclides appear to be rapidly diluted in the surrounding seawater. Releases from the reactor in Komsomolets can be expected to continue, so further investigations should be carried out to determine the mechanisms behind the observed releases, the corrosion processes that are occurring within the reactor and the implications of these for further releases and the fate of the remaining nuclear material in the reactor.","tp":"核潜艇监测","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"挪威海洋研究所对1989年沉没的苏联核潜艇\"共青号\"（Komsomolets）进行了详细的外部损伤评估。研究确认俄罗斯此前采取的补救措施仍完好，未在潜艇受损前部周围检测到来自核弹头钚的泄漏证据。但反应堆仍存在间歇性放射性物质释放，需持续监测。"},{"t":"旋转碳和沉没磷：海洋中错位的循环","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602952123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"自浮式COF基Janus薄膜：构建稳固三相界面促进电荷分离以高效光合成H2O2","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00042-1?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF光催化双氧水","kp":["[光催化产H2O2]: COF-NH2/GO自漂浮Janus膜","[三相界面]: 气液固三相增强O2传质","合成方法[Janus膜]: 一步界面聚合"],"dp":1,"as":"研究通过一步界面聚合策略构建了自浮式COF-[NH2-GO] Janus薄膜。该膜具有非对称润湿性，在气-液-固三相界面处高效富集反应物，显著提升电荷转移效率，适用于光/电催化CO2还原或水分解等反应。Janus结构的设计避免了传统催化剂粉体团聚和界面传质受限问题，为设计高性能三相催化体系提供了新范式。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Self-floating COF-based Janus film: A robust triphase interface boosting charge separation for efficient H2O2 photosynth","b":"A self-floating COF-[NH2-GO] Janus film was engineered via a one-step interfacial polymerization strategy for efficient H2O2 photosynthesis, in which the introduced graphene promoted the separation and transfer of photogenerated carriers. Meanwhile, the self-floating film photocatalysts enabled the stabilization of gas-liquid-solid triphase interface, significantly enhancing the O2 mass transfer."},{"t":"过渡金属硼酸盐阳极在人工海水条件下的选择性电解水","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506788?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"海水直接电解","kp":["催化剂[海水直接电解]: 过渡金属硼酸盐阳极","[选择性电解]: 抑制氯析出竞争反应"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究探索在人工海水条件下直接电解水制氢。传统电解依赖纯水，而海水中氯离子竞争反应导致电极腐蚀和副产物（如次氯酸根）生成。研究采用过渡金属基催化电极，实现对析氢/析氧反应的高选择性，抑制氯化物氧化，从而在无需海水淡化的前提下实现可持续氢气生产，对海洋能源利用具重要意义。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Selective Electrolysis of Water Under Artificial Seawater Conditions Using Transition Metal Borate Anodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Direct seawater electrolysis overcomes one major hurdle in sustainable hydrogen production, viz. the requirement to use high‐purity water, which is currently a scarce resource for ∼80% of the global population. On the other hand, the natural composition of seawater makes it unsuitable for direct use in conventional electrolyzer systems, primarily due to the occurrence of the chlorine evolution reaction (CER) at the anode, instead of the desired oxygen evolution reaction (OER), and the build‐up of insulating Mg\n                    2+\n                    /Ca\n                    2+\n                    hydroxides at the cathode. Herein, we present an electrolyzer fed with artificial seawater with no added electrolyte and enabling selective splitting of H\n                    2\n                    O, rather than H\n                    2\n                    generation coupled to the CER. This selectivity was provided by the anodes derived from a cobalt iron boride material, which was predicted to favor the OER rather than the CER by the density functional theory calculations. The compact design of the electrode‐separator assembly suppressed the cathodic Mg/Ca(OH)\n                    2\n                    precipitation. Robust operation of the electrolyzer over one week was demonstrated at 100 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    with a cell voltage of ca. –2.6 V at 80 ± 1°C. These operating conditions were selected based on a preliminary techno‐economic analysis as a realistic benchmark for cost‐competitive hydrogen production.","aip":1},{"t":"重新思考同性性行为：从感觉错误到社会功能","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2600926123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"不同单人 VH1-2 重排小鼠中复发性 SARS-CoV-2 Omicron 广泛中和人源化抗体","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537053123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"During V(D)J recombination, antibody diversity is enhanced by nontemplated junctional modifications that generate immensely diverse heavy chain (HC) and light chain (LC) complementarity-determining 3 antigen-contact regions (CDR3s). We previously developed a mouse model that generates diverse antibody repertoires by rearranging a single human V\n                    H\n                    1-2 and Vκ1-33, associated with highly diverse CDR3s generated by V(D)J recombination with mouse Ds and/or Js. Immunization of this model with SARS-CoV-2 D614G spike elicited an antibody that potently neutralized SARS-CoV-2 variants through Omicron BA.2.754. Here, we report a related mouse model in which a single V\n                    H\n                    1-2 rearranges to human D3-3 and J\n                    H\n                    6, generating diverse HC-CDR3s much longer on average than those of our prior model. Omicron BA.4/.5 spike-ferritin nanoparticle-immunization of the new model elicited four highly related humanized antibodies that potently neutralize downstream Omicron subvariants. All four antibodies had 12 AA HC-CDR3s with two aromatic amino acids that engage an epitope comprising a hydrophobic patch opened-up by early Omicron lineage mutations and conserved in subsequent variants. Immunization of our prior, shorter CDR3-based model, elicited slightly less potent neutralizing antibodies that bound the same Omicron epitope, and were similar in all other aspects to those from the long, fully human CDR3 model. One tested antibody from each set reduced lung viral titers in a mouse-adapted BQ1.1 challenge. The antibodies we describe are related in their epitope recognition to recently described antibodies from Omicron-infected humans. These studies validate the utility of single human V\n                    H\n                    - and Vκ-rearranging mice for discovering humanized antibodies that neutralize emerging pathogens."},{"t":"海洋热通风调节南极海冰范围的近期极端情况","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530832123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Antarctic sea ice extent (SIE) has experienced unprecedented variability in recent decades, with record expansion through 2015, followed by an abrupt transition to sustained decline. Using over two decades of under-ice Argo float observations, we show that changes in ocean heat ventilation have modulated these extreme sea ice variations on interannual timescales. Between 2007 and 2015, the ocean thermocline warmed and shoaled within the Weddell Sea and off East Antarctica, with the former accounting for most of the interannual variability in Antarctic SIE. After 2016, as Antarctic SIE declined, surface salinity increased, enhancing exchange between the sharpened thermocline and surface waters. Idealized modeling of the Weddell Sea indicates that these upper ocean trends were due to concurrent variations in wind-driven Ekman upwelling and precipitation. During the sea ice expansion phase, increased precipitation enhanced ocean stratification, suppressing the upward flux of subsurface heat while promoting sea ice growth. However, between 2014 and 2016, a nearly three-fold increase in upwelling rates weakened the upper ocean stratification, releasing the accumulated subsurface heat. Though a similar sequence of events occurred along the East Antarctic margin, distinct upper-ocean trends and surface forcing in the Pacific sector of the Southern Ocean imply alternative drivers of recent sea ice loss in that region. Nevertheless, these results suggest that future multiyear Antarctic SIE variability will depend on the competing influences of wind-driven upwelling and surface freshwater fluxes.","tp":"海冰热通风","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"南极海冰范围近几十年经历了前所未有的剧烈波动：2015年前持续扩张，此后骤然转为持续下降。研究利用二十余年冰下Argo浮标观测数据，发现海洋热通风在年际尺度上调节了海冰极端变化。2007至2015年间，威德尔海和东南极近岸的海洋温跃层变暖变浅，威德尔海贡献尤为显著。"},{"t":"政策驱动的战略性绿色技术创新路径：氢和碳捕获、利用案例","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"氢能碳捕集","sc":2.3,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"光伏技术助力粮食安全","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41893-026-01792-0","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Sustainability","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光伏农业","as":"","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":2.5,"d":3.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Photovoltaics for food security"},{"t":"具有优异反向偏压稳定性的钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02541-6","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿有机叠层","kp":["[叠层电池]: 钙钛矿-有机叠层优异反偏稳定性","[反偏机制]: 有机电池深陷阱态主导反偏隧穿"],"dp":1,"as":"钙钛矿—有机叠层太阳能电池在反向偏压条件下的稳定性长期制约其工业化部署。本研究通过优化器件结构与界面工程，显著提升了叠层薄膜电池在反向偏压下的耐久性，解决了传统钙钛矿电池在局部遮挡或组串失配时易发生击穿降解的致命瓶颈。该突破为钙钛矿光伏组件的可靠性与商业化量产扫除了关键障碍。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Perovskite–organic tandem solar cells with superior reverse-bias stability","b":"The industrial deployment of thin-film solar cells faces challenges under reverse bias, particularly concerning perovskite materials with poor reverse-bias stability. Meanwhile, the reverse-bias characteristics of organic solar cells (OSCs) remain underexplored. This study first elucidates the mechanism that reverse tunnelling in OSCs, fundamentally dominated by deep trap state within a bulk heterojunction, triggering reversible/irreversible breakdowns under reverse bias. Building on this, we demonstrated high-performance OSCs with superior irreversible breakdown voltage exceeding –35 V by modulating the deep trap state through suppressing an isolated acceptor cluster in the donor–acceptor intermix region. Moreover, through strategically shielding perovskite by OSC with suppressed reverse tunnelling, n–i–p perovskite–organic tandem solar cells maintain over 90% of the initial efficiency when subjected to –40 V. These tandem devices retain 90% and 97% of the initial efficiency after stressing at –20 V for 12 h and –4.5 V for 2,000 h, respectively, outperforming all existing thin-film solar technologies. The exceptional reverse-bias stability under shadowing conditions was further demonstrated in scalable perovskite–organic tandem solar cell minimodules.","aip":1},{"t":"成骨纳米酶通过协同抗氧化和骨诱导功能促进糖尿病骨再生","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72833?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Bone regeneration under diabetic conditions remains a formidable challenge, predominantly due to persistent oxidative stress, chronic inflammation, and impaired osteogenic potential of stem cells. Nanozymes have been widely employed to modulate oxidative stress and inflammation, and are considered promising candidates for diabetic bone regeneration. However, they have a limited osteogenic capacity, which substantially hinders their direct application in bone repair. Here, a series of osteogenic ion‐doped Prussian blue (PB) nanozymes was designed to endow classical antioxidant PB with osteoinductive capacity, among which copper‐doped PB (CuPB) exhibits optimal performance. The screened CuPB nanozyme effectively scavenges various types of excessive reactive oxygen species, suppresses inflammation, and simultaneously promotes osteogenic differentiation via activation of the phosphoinositide 3‐kinase/protein kinase B (PI3K‐Akt) pathway. In type II diabetic rats, both the CuPB nanoparticulate formulation and the CuPB‐functionalized three‐dimensional scaffold pronouncedly enhance bone regeneration in models of periodontitis‐associated alveolar bone loss and cranial defects, respectively. This study establishes an integrated “osteogenic nanozyme” platform that synergistically couples antioxidant and osteoinductive functions.","tp":"成骨纳米酶","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"糖尿病条件下骨再生因持续氧化应激、慢性炎症和干细胞成骨能力受损而困难重重。研究开发了兼具抗氧化和骨诱导功能的成骨纳米酶，通过协同作用清除活性氧、缓解炎症并促进骨组织再生，有效克服了传统纳米酶成骨能力不足的瓶颈，为糖尿病骨修复提供了新策略。"},{"t":"奥司他韦氮丙啶是有效的流感神经氨酸酶抑制剂和显像剂","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2504045123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Influenza neuraminidase (NA) is a critical target for seasonal and pandemic antivirals, including the strains of current concern. Current treatments, such as Zanamivir and Oseltamivir, are limited by noncovalent binding and emerging resistance. We hypothesized that Oseltamivir aziridines would unite transition-state mimicry for tight binding, with aziridine-enabled covalent capture of the catalytic tyrosine, thereby supporting both therapy and activity-based quantification. Here, we present oseltamivir-based aziridines, inspired by cyclophellitol chemistry, that act as covalent inhibitors and activity-based probes via an\n                    N\n                    -acylaziridine warhead. Free-energy calculations, and NMR observations, indicate a\n                    4\n                    H\n                    5\n                    half-chair preference consistent with the NA transition state, and selected analogues inhibit multiple NA subtypes with low nanomolar binding constants. Diverse evidence establishes covalency: time-dependent inactivation, inhibitor washout, intact-mass shifts, MS/MS identification of a tyrosine adduct, and QM/MM reaction profiles, while cryoEM of N1 aligns with the proposed binding mode, revealing an elimination product. The inhibitors demonstrate formidable activity against diverse viral neuraminidases, including H5N1, and further enable imaging and quantification of active NA. With their dual therapeutic and diagnostic potential, these first-in-class inhibitors indeed benefit from transition state mimicry and covalency, and thus offer a powerful platform for antiviral development and neuraminidase imaging, addressing urgent global health needs in influenza treatment and prevention."},{"t":"脱碳高耗能产业氢气供应优化：多时间尺度滚动时域方法","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003843?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"工业氢气供应优化","as":"","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Optimization of hydrogen supply operations for decarbonizing energy-intensive industries: A multi-timescale rolling hori"},{"t":"液态空气储能与核能和风能集成的优化与经济性评估","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003818?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/其它储能技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液态空气储能","kp":["[技术]: 液态空气储能耦合核电与风电","[评估]: 优化与经济性分析"],"as":"","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.5},"ot":"Optimisation and economic assessment of liquid air energy storage integrated with nuclear and wind power","cl":"c15d70d9","cln":"液态空气储能","cp":0},{"t":"石墨烯中 Floquet 诱导间隙的观察","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02549-y","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Materials","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Floquet engineering provides a powerful pathway for creating non-equilibrium phases of matter with tailored electronic structures and properties through time-periodic driving. As the original theoretical prototype, graphene established the framework in which the Floquet topological insulator with the light-induced anomalous Hall effect was proposed. However, the defining spectroscopic signature of Floquet engineering in graphene, light-induced hybridization (avoided-crossing) gap at Floquet band crossings, has remained experimentally elusive. Here we report the direct observation of a Floquet-induced hybridization gap in monolayer graphene under resonant driving by a strong light field. Time- and angle-resolved photoemission spectroscopy reveals a gap opening at Floquet band crossings, accompanied by coherent Floquet sidebands. The gap exhibits pronounced momentum anisotropy, featuring two Dirac nodes protected by spatiotemporal symmetry and tunable by light polarization. These results provide the long-sought experimental demonstration of Floquet band engineering in graphene, opening up opportunities for light-field-engineered quantum phases in graphene and related materials.","tp":"光诱导能隙","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"as":"Floquet工程通过周期性驱动创造具有定制电子结构的非平衡物相。石墨烯作为该理论的原型，早在理论预言中就提出了光致反常霍尔效应的Floquet拓扑绝缘体。本研究首次实验观测到石墨烯中Floquet带间光致杂化（避免交叉）能隙这一关键光谱特征，为光致拓扑物态调控奠定了实验基础。","aip":1},{"t":"矿物促进从生命前丰富的氨基酸水合成氰化氢，用于化学进化","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2515805123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Recent advances in prebiotic chemistry suggest that hydrogen cyanide (HCN) serves as a fundamental precursor for nearly all essential biomolecules and protometabolic processes for life’s emergence. Although prevailing models of endogenous cyanide production rely on atmospheric methane, the availability of methane remains uncertain. Unlike methane, amino acids were likely prebiotically abundant, forming through multiple synthetic pathways under a methane-free, nonreducing atmosphere. Here, we demonstrate that HCN can form from proteinogenic amino acids in anaerobic aqueous solutions facilitated by geochemically available minerals, offering a route to overcome HCN scarcity under a nonreducing atmosphere. On manganese dioxide, the glycine-to-cyanide conversion proceeded across a broad range of pHs (2.0 to 12.6) and substrate concentrations (1 μM to 100 mM), achieving a maximum selectivity of 57%. The reaction involves α-proton abstraction in amino acids, which is distinct from conventional chemical decarboxylation processes of amino acids, highlighting the unique role of MnO\n                    2\n                    in activating the α-C-H bond to form HCN. HCN generation was observed for nearly all proteinogenic amino acids and short peptides. Because amino acids can be synthesized from HCN-independent pathways from abundant carbon sources such as CO\n                    2\n                    and CO, amino acid-derived HCN alleviates the requirement on atmospheric methane and can sustain continued chemical evolution in ambient aqueous environments.","tp":"氰化氢合成","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"生命起源研究中，氰化氢（HCN）被视为几乎所有关键生物分子和原代谢过程的基础前体。现有模型依赖大气甲烷生成氰化物，但甲烷的可获得性存疑。本研究证明矿物质可促进生命前丰富的氨基酸水热转化为HCN，提供了一条不依赖甲烷的氰化物生成新途径，为化学进化假说提供了重要支撑。","aip":1},{"t":"上皮细胞群主动润湿和流化的机制","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02553-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Materials","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Tissue-level phase transitions are emerging as a crucial mechanism in tumour development and metastasis. When becoming invasive, epithelial tumours undergo a transition from a solid-like state to a more fluid-like one. Although the contributions of cell adhesions, traction forces and cell migration for such behaviour are known, the exact biophysical and molecular mechanisms controlling these transitions are not fully understood. Here we show that breast cancer cell fluidity is regulated by IRSp53, a protein linking plasma membranes to the cytoskeleton. In both two-dimensional monolayers and three-dimensional spheroids, the depletion of IRSp53 increases fluidity and active wetting of the substrate due to a decrease in intercellular friction and enhanced local cell rearrangements. Molecularly, IRSp53 interacts with the junctional protein Afadin to control global tensile state and active wetting, establishing these proteins as key regulators of epithelial collectives’ viscosity in breast cancer tumouroids. In breast cancer patient samples, low IRSp53 expression levels and aberrant localization correlate with worse clinical outcomes. These findings support the broader relevance of IRSp53-regulated mechanics in epithelia and their potential prognostic value in cancer."},{"t":"埋藏界面处原子尺度反铁磁序的磁圆二色成像","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02134-z","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磁圆二色成像","kp":["[成像对象]: 埋藏界面原子级反铁磁序","[技术挑战]: 反铁磁净磁化为零致MCD信号极弱"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究利用磁圆二色性成像技术，在原子尺度上对反铁磁序进行了直接观测。磁圆二色性效应利用电子或X射线作为探针，是研究磁性材料的强大工具。该工作实现了对反铁磁材料中原子级磁结构的高分辨成像，为理解反铁磁自旋电子学器件的底层物理机制提供了直接实验证据，对下一代高密度、抗磁场干扰的存储与计算器件开发具有重要意义。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Magnetic circular dichroism imaging of atomic-scale antiferromagnetic order at a buried interface","b":"Magnetic circular dichroism utilizing electrons or X-rays serves as a powerful tool for the investigation of magnetism in ferromagnets, but antiferromagnets pose a severe challenge to the technique due to their vanishing net magnetization. Although transmission electron microscopy has demonstrated the atomic-scale characterization of antiferromagnetism using elastically scattered electrons, separating the weak magnetic signal from the dominant electrostatic background remains challenging, and applicability is largely limited to perfect crystals. Here we develop atomic-column-resolved electron magnetic circular dichroism to resolve antiferromagnetic order using a scanning transmission electron microscope. By exploiting chirality around individual magnetic atomic columns, we localize the magnetic circular dichroism signals around the transmitted electron beam with enhanced strength and signal-to-noise ratio, enabling atomic-column magnetic measurements. Applying this technique to antiferromagnets, we not only distinguish the characteristic G-type and C-type antiferromagnetic orderings in DyFeO3 and α-Fe2O3 but also identify a one-unit-cell-thick magnetic dead layer at the buried DyScO3–SmFeO3 interface. Our work establishes a readily accessible method for atomic-scale magnetic order mapping, with potential applications in fields such as interfacial magnetism, topological magnetism, antiferromagnetism and altermagnetism.","aip":1},{"t":"局部稀释电解液实现高面容量水系Zn-I2凝胶电池用于长时储能","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00039-5?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌碘电池电解液","kp":["电解质[水系Zn-I₂凝胶电池]: 局部稀释电解质","电极厚度[Zn-I₂凝胶电池]: 毫米级厚电极","[溶剂化工程]: 空间调控溶剂化结构维持快速离子传输"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出局部稀释电解质策略，实现了高面容量的水系Zn-I2凝胶电池。厚电极对长时间储能至关重要，但常受限于粘稠电解质中缓慢的离子传输。通过在局部稀释电解质中优化离子传导通路，该工作显著提升了厚电极中的离子扩散效率，使锌碘凝胶电池在高面积容量条件下保持稳定循环。该策略为大规模、长时水系储能系统的电极设计提供了新思路。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Locally diluted electrolytes enable high-areal-capacity aqueous Zn–I2 gel batteries for long-duration energy storage","b":"Thick electrodes are essential for long-duration energy storage but are often limited by slow ion transport in viscous electrolytes. This work introduces localized diluted electrolytes, which spatially engineer solvation environments to sustain rapid ionic transport in a mechanically constrained gel. Applied to a Zn–I₂ gel battery, this strategy enables millimeter-thick electrodes with high areal capacity and stable long-duration cycling.","aip":1},{"t":"与 KLF3 相反，KLF2 会覆盖常驻记忆 CD8 T 细胞分化程序","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2533700123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Numerous transcriptional regulators have been associated with the differentiation pathways that lead to recirculating vs. tissue-resident memory T cells. However, it is unclear whether independent, coordinated expression of these regulators is required to determine residency vs. recirculation or whether there is a hierarchy, with some factors playing a dominant role in controlling T cell trafficking. We report that ablation of the gene encoding Kruppel-like factor 2 (KLF2) during CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell activation leads to rapid transcriptional reprogramming, such that effector T cells fail to recirculate and prematurely acquire canonical phenotypic and transcriptional characteristics of resident memory cells (T\n                    RM\n                    ).\n                    Klf2\n                    -deficient memory CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells retained the capacity to undergo recall responses, including in vivo pathogen control. These data suggest that KLF2 diverts CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells from the T\n                    RM\n                    differentiation program. In contrast, ablation of another member of the KLF family, KLF3, enhanced differentiation of some recirculating T cell subsets and limited production of T\n                    RM\n                    in lymphoid tissues. However, both KLF2 and KLF3 were required for differentiation of long-lived effector cells, suggesting cooperation between these factors in some situations. These findings indicate that KLFs occupy a central nexus in coordinating activated CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell differentiation and trafficking.","tp":"T细胞分化","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"转录调节因子在决定记忆CD8 T细胞是留在组织还是重新循环中起着关键作用。最新研究探讨了这些调节因子是协同工作还是具有主次之分。研究发现，KLF2基因的消除会主导并改变T细胞的运输轨迹。与KLF3的作用相反，KLF2在控制常驻记忆CD8 T细胞分化程序中处于核心地位，能够覆盖其他因子的作用。这一发现揭示了T细胞命运决定和免疫监控机制中的关键调控层级。"},{"t":"孤立态H2还原Anderson簇催化CO2低温加氢制甲醇","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02104-x","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2加氢制甲醇","kp":["催化剂[CO2加氢制甲醇]: Anderson型PtMo6O24团簇","[活化处理]: H2还原孤立Anderson团簇","[反应条件]: 低温CO2加氢"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究利用分离的并经H2还原的Anderson型多金属氧酸盐簇催化CO2低温加氢反应。CO2加氢制甲醇是建立可持续碳利用闭环系统的关键路径。Anderson簇催化剂在低温条件下展现出对CO2加氢的高催化活性，为高效、低能耗的CO2转化提供了新催化体系。该工作对推动碳中和技术中的CO2资源化利用、特别是绿色甲醇合成工艺的工业化具有积极意义。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Isolated and H2-reduced Anderson clusters catalyse low-temperature hydrogenation of CO2 to methanol","b":"CO2 hydrogenation, especially to methanol, is crucial to establishing sustainable closed-loop systems for carbon utilization. However, the difficulties of CO2 activation at low temperatures and the ambiguity of structure–activity correlations are obstacles to reducing the energy consumption of the hydrogenation process. Here we report that molecularly defined Anderson PtMo6O24 clusters, sited within a robust metal–organic framework, are catalytic for low-temperature CO2 hydrogenation. The performance of the cluster showed no signs of decay in either its activity or methanol selectivity over 3,600 h at 180 °C. It also achieves a per-pass yield exceeding that of state-of-the-art heterogeneous catalysts under similar conditions. Combined in situ spectroscopy and density functional theory calculations demonstrated that CH3OH formation is dominated by the reverse water–gas shift and subsequent CO* hydrogenation pathway, while the HCOO* pathway may serve as a supplementary route. The well-defined cluster structure offers an ideal model for elucidating structure–activity correlations and opens exciting avenues for the rational design of high-activity, low-temperature catalysts for CO2 hydrogenation.","aip":1},{"t":"界面声子散射实现具有合金化阳极的超稳定高功率钠基双离子电池","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72848?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠基双离子电池","kp":["[界面策略]: 晶面工程实现声子散射耗散应变能","负极[钠基双离子电池]: 合金型负极"],"dp":1,"as":"钠基双离子电池（SDIBs）因钠资源丰富、成本低廉被视为下一代储能候选方案，但合金型负极在充放电过程中存在严重体积膨胀和界面不稳定性，导致循环寿命与功率密度难以兼顾。本研究提出利用界面声子散射机制调控合金负极的离子/电子输运特性，通过在电极-电解质界面构建特定的纳米结构或组分梯度，有效抑制了不均匀应力积累和枝晶生长。实验表明，该策略显著提升了电池的循环稳定性与高倍率放电能力，为高能量密度钠基电池的工程化提供了新思路。该成果对推动大规模储能及低速电动车用电池的低成本化具有实际意义。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interfacial Phonon Scattering Enables Ultrastable and High‐Power Sodium‐Based Dual‐Ion Batteries With Alloying Anodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Alloying anodes offer a compelling route to high‐energy sodium‐based dual‐ion batteries (SDIBs), yet their repeated volume change accumulates destructive strain energy that rapidly degrades the electrode. Conventional interfacial designs often dissipate this energy through damage‐prone processes (e.g., cracking or delamination), which accelerates failure. Herein, we report a crystal‐plane friction interface (CPFI) strategy that enables a fundamentally different, low‐damage dissipation pathway. By embedding layered Na\n                    +\n                    ‐substituted\n                    α\n                    ‐zirconium phosphate (NZrP) nanoparticles into a polymer matrix, we construct a robust interface on Sn anode as a proof of concept. The accumulated strain energy is relieved through facile sliding between the NZrP (002) planes, which convert mechanical work into thermal phonons. In situ stress measurements confirm a 99.1% reduction in strain energy density, directly quantifying the efficacy of this mechanism. Meanwhile, Na\n                    +\n                    substitution in NZrP facilitates rapid Na\n                    +\n                    transport, achieving a substantial ∼65% reduction in interfacial impedance. Consequently, the Sn@CPFI anode enables SDIB full cells that retain over 80% capacity over 3500 cycles at 5C and deliver 90.1% capacity retention at 40C, significantly outperforming conventional counterparts. A practical pouch cell further validates this approach. This work establishes crystal‐plane sliding as a general mechanism for managing strain energy, opening a pathway to durable batteries with high‐volume‐change electrodes.","aip":1},{"t":"TRIM 介导的 SUMO 化抑制冠状病毒外切核糖核酸酶活性","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528398123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Members of the TRIM E3 ligase family are effectors of the host innate or intrinsic defense against various viruses; however, how specific TRIM proteins antagonize coronavirus infection is still largely elusive. Through an RNAi screen targeting 71 human TRIM genes, we identified multiple TRIM proteins with antiviral or proviral activity against SARS-CoV-2. TRIM32 potently restricted SARS-CoV-2 replication in a RING E3 ligase-dependent but interferon-independent manner. Mechanistically, TRIM32 binds to and SUMOylates the 3′‐to‐5′ exoribonuclease (ExoN) of Nsp14, an enzyme essential for SARS-CoV-2 replication. TRIM32-mediated Nsp14 SUMOylation at K9 and K200 inhibits RNA binding and Nsp10 cofactor recruitment, respectively, ultimately suppressing ExoN activity. Our study further revealed that Nsp14 SUMOylation by TRIM32 and its antiviral activity are broadly conserved for coronaviruses. These results identify the coronaviral Nsp14 protein as a direct target of host restriction via SUMOylation, which may uncover ways to therapeutically inhibit coronavirus infections in humans.","tp":"抗病毒免疫","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"as":"TRIM E3连接酶家族是宿主对抗病毒的天然防御效应物。通过针对71个人类TRIM基因的RNAi筛选，研究人员发现了多种能对抗SARS-CoV-2的TRIM蛋白。其中，TRIM32表现出强烈的抗病毒活性。在机制上，TRIM32能够与冠状病毒结合，并通过介导SUMO化修饰来抑制冠状病毒外切核糖核酸酶的活性，从而有效限制病毒复制。此过程依赖于RING E3连接酶，且独立于干扰素途径。"},{"t":"基于忆阻芯片的原位光谱重建用于节能计算光谱仪","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01571-x","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"忆阻器计算光谱","kp":["[硬件平台]: 忆阻器芯片","[功能]: 原位光谱重建实现低能耗计算光谱"],"dp":1,"as":"计算光谱仪通过重建算法从原始传感器数据解码光谱信息，可大幅缩小设备体积并降低成本，但传统基于冯·诺依曼架构的算法在边缘设备上能耗高、速度慢。本研究提出基于忆阻器芯片的原位光谱重建方案，利用忆阻器阵列的模拟计算特性，直接在硬件层面并行执行光谱重建运算，实现超低功耗、高吞吐的实时光谱分析。该芯片化方案摆脱了对CPU/GPU的依赖，为便携式、植入式光谱检测设备（如环境监测、食品安全、生物医学传感）提供了高效的硬件加速路径，展示了存算一体架构在传感领域的应用潜力。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"In situ spectral reconstruction based on a memristor chip for energy-efficient computational spectrometry","b":"Computational spectrometers, which rely on reconstruction algorithms to decode spectral information from raw sensor data, are of potential use in portable, in-field spectrometry. However, research on such systems primarily focuses on the front-end encoding devices, and back-end decoding hardware remains limited by severe overheads. Here we report an in situ computational spectrometer implemented on a fully integrated 576-Kb memristor chip. With systematic robustness analysis, we develop memristive regularization and filter embedding strategies to overcome the extreme sensitivity of ill-posed spectral reconstruction, achieving software-equivalent accuracy. System-level benchmarking shows that our hardware takes only 125.0 ns to reconstruct one spectrum consuming 6.7 nJ of energy, which is 26.5 times faster and 162.7 times more energy-efficient than state-of-the-art computational spectrometers. Our work illustrates the potential of memristor-chip-based computational spectrometry and provides approaches for efficiently implementing signal processing algorithms on memristor chips.","aip":1},{"t":"技术创新和正式制度对可再生能源转型的影响","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001540?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"可再生能源","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"识别癌症治疗靶点：Cell-SELEX 识别用于适体介导的生长抑制的膜蛋白","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514681123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The identification of functional ligand-membrane protein interactions under native conditions remains a major challenge in cancer biology. Using cell-systematic evolution of ligands by exponential enrichment, we identified a high-affinity DNA aptamer, CW06, against breast cancer cells. To precisely identify its native membrane target, we developed Aptamer-mediated Metabolic Glycan-labeling Proximity Hybridization (Apt-MGPH), which revealed the mitochondrial solute carrier SLC25A24 as the specific target. Unexpectedly, CW06 treatment upregulated SLC25A24 expression, disrupting methionine metabolism, depleting cytosolic SAM, and inducing G1 cell cycle arrest and senescence via the p21–HMGA1 axis. In mouse xenograft models, CW06 significantly inhibited tumor growth without affecting healthy tissues. Targeted degradation of SLC25A24 reverses these effects, confirming its regulatory role in the metabolism–senescence axis. Our study establishes Apt-MGPH as a robust tool for membrane target identification and highlights aptamer-induced target overexpression as a strategy for cancer therapy.","tp":"适体癌靶标","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"鉴定天然状态下的配体-膜蛋白相互作用是癌症研究的重大挑战。利用Cell-SELEX技术，研究人员筛选出针对乳腺癌细胞的高亲和力DNA适体CW06。同时，开发了一种新型技术，成功鉴定出该适体的天然膜蛋白靶点为线粒体溶质载体SLC25A24。这项研究不仅为探索功能性膜蛋白提供了新工具，还证实了通过适体介导靶向SLC25A24能有效抑制癌细胞生长，为癌症治疗提供了极具潜力的创新靶点。"},{"t":"水动力空化作用从 H2O 和 CO2 形成益生元核糖","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag182/8537775?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"H2O and CO2 are considered as fundamental precursors for the prebiotic formation of biomolecules. Their conversion to biomolecules under early Earth conditions is critical for understanding origin of life. However, direct formation from these simple compounds remains unverified, leaving the mechanistic role of H2O unresolved. Herein, we demonstrate ribose synthesis from H2O and CO2 under prebiotic conditions via","tp":"益生元核糖","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"水和二氧化碳被视为益生元生物分子形成的基本前体，但二者在早期地球条件下直接转化为生物分子的机制尚未验证。本研究首次展示了通过水动力空化作用，在益生元条件下从H2O和CO2直接合成核糖，揭示了水在生命起源中不仅是溶剂更可能是活性参与者的新角色。","aip":1},{"t":"杂化Mn(II)基卤化物凝胶薄膜用于荧光寿命温度传感","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72878?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"荧光寿命测温","kp":["传感材料[荧光寿命测温]: Mn(II)基杂化卤化物凝胶膜","[传感机制]: 荧光寿命随温度变化"],"dp":1,"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究开发了一种基于锰(II)卤化物的混合凝胶薄膜材料，利用荧光寿命随温度变化的特性实现温度传感。与传统强度型荧光温度传感相比，寿命型传感不受光源波动和样品浓度影响，具有更高的检测精度和稳定性。凝胶薄膜形态兼具柔性与可加工性，有望应用于柔性电子和生物医学温度监测场景。","ot":"Hybrid Mn(II)‐Based Halides Gel Films for Fluorescence Lifetime‐Based Temperature Sensing","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Sensing temperature using fluorescent materials by monitoring alterations in temperature‐dependent luminescence characteristics is of great importance for various application fields, including modern industry, scientific research, and daily life. However, there are two main concerns on optical thermometry, and one is the low sensitivity, particularly at elevated temperatures, failing to meet precise measurement demands; another issue is how we can apply the thermometry in in situ environments. Herein, we design and report a hybrid manganese‐based halide thermometry exhibiting a relative sensitivity (S\n                    r\n                    ) of 26.368% K\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 463 K. We further propose a facile synthesis method for photopolymerizable hydrogel films containing the crystallized manganese‐based halide thermometry, maintaining the same luminescence and sensing property. The luminescent gel film is applied to chip‐based temperature sensing, demonstrating highly accurate performances as smart sensors and flexible electronic materials. This work opens up a new route to design luminescent metal halide thermometry to enrich the library of temperature sensing. Moreover, the luminescent gel film as optical thermometry can be applied in situ from micro‐electronics to large‐scale industrial systems, supplying new possibilities for advanced sensing and spectroscopy studies."},{"t":"如何衡量美好生活——超越GDP的秘诀","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00884-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"人类优于自然的观念是如何发明的","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00881-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"2025 年 NIH 资助终止情况如何因研究人员的人口群体而异","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527755123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"In early 2025, the NIH unexpectedly terminated 2,291 active research grants, withdrawing $2.45 billion and disrupting thousands of projects. While the economic magnitude of these cuts is known, less is understood about how they differed across researchers’ demographic groups. Using an original dataset of publicly available records, we documented how cancelations varied by gender and career stage. Although cuts occurred across all regions and institution types, statistical patterns show that early-career investigators—assistant professors, postdoctoral scholars, trainees, and graduate students—were disproportionately affected, as were women. Women’s projects were smaller on average, had a larger share of unspent funds at cancelation, and were more concentrated in training and transition awards. Although available data cannot determine downstream causal effects, NIH economic multipliers suggest a potentially large unrealized loss to the US research enterprise. These patterns highlight the vulnerability of early-career researchers and women to abrupt funding instability and underscore the need for sustained investment to protect the future scientific workforce.","tp":"资助公平性","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"as":"2025年初，美国国立卫生研究院（NIH）出人意料地终止了大量在研项目，撤销了总额达24.5亿美元的科研经费，导致数千个项目被迫中断。基于最新公开数据集的分析显示，尽管资助削减波及所有地区和机构类型，但在不同人口群体中存在显著的统计差异。研究表明，资助终止率因研究人员的性别和职业生涯阶段而异，早期科研人员等特定群体在此轮大规模经费削减中受到了不成比例的严重冲击。"},{"t":"我如何从公共数据中榨取新鲜科学","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00434-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"氮化镓中的高迁移率空穴及其量子振荡","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01590-8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Gallium nitride (GaN) is used in solid-state lighting and in high-performance radio frequency and power electronics. However, due to inefficient hole doping and low hole mobility, quantum oscillations in p-type GaN have not been observed, which limits studies of valence bands and hole transport engineering. Here we report high hole mobilities in a polarization-induced two-dimensional hole gas at a gallium nitride/aluminium nitride interface. The holes degenerately occupy two valence bands of GaN—the light-hole and heavy-hole bands—and have mobilities of 2,000 cm2 V−1 s−1 and 400 cm2 V−1 s−1 at 2 K, respectively. We use Shubnikov–de Haas oscillations of holes from both valence bands to extract their respective sheet densities and quantum scattering times and the effective masses of light holes and heavy holes. The hole mobilities of our heterostructure highlight the possibility of developing cryogenic GaN complementary metal–oxide–semiconductor technology with potential applications in quantum computing control electronics.","tp":"氮化镓空穴","sc":8.1,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.5,"d":8.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"氮化镓（GaN）广泛应用于固态照明和高性能射频及功率电子器件，但因空穴掺杂效率低、迁移率差，p型GaN的量子振荡从未被观测到。本研究在GaN/AlN界面通过极化诱导产生高迁移率二维空穴气，空穴简并占据两个价带，首次实现了GaN中空穴的量子振荡观测，为价带和空穴输运工程研究开辟了新途径。"},{"t":"偏离正态分布性状的全基因组关联研究和 QTL 定位","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag184/8537784?rss=1","c":"未分类","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Quantitative traits are the targets for genome-wide association studies (GWAS) and quantitative trait locus (QTL) mapping. After adjusting for systematic effects, these traits are assumed to be normally distributed so that typical linear models (LM) and linear mixed models (LMM) can be used to detect markers associated with QTLs. Many traits in crops, animals and humans, however, do not follow the assumed normal distribution and many of them are not even continuously distributed. We developed statistical models and software packages to map QTLs and perform association studies for such non-normal traits under the generalized linear mixed model (GLMM) framework. We developed a pseudo response (PSR) method to estimate the polygenic variance by generating a pseudo response variable that is treated as a conventional quantitative trait. We then scanned the genome for markers associated with the PSR variable in the usual linear mixed model. The new method is called the pseudo response generalized linear mixed model (PSR-GLMM). We illustrated the method with the purple color trait of rice (binary trait) and a set of simulated non-normal traits. We then applied the method to four datasets: a binary trait from an Arabidopsis","tp":"全基因关联","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究探讨了全基因组关联研究（GWAS）和数量性状基因座（QTL）定位中偏离正态分布性状的分析方法。传统线性模型（LM）和线性混合模型（LMM）假设性状在消除系统效应后呈正态分布，但农作物、动物和人类的许多性状并不符合这一假设，甚至不呈连续分布。针对这一问题，研究者开发了新的统计方法，以更准确地检测与QTL相关的遗传标记，为非正态分布性状的遗传分析提供了新工具。"},{"t":"生成扩展的折叠分子染料堆栈并揭示其不断演变的激子动力学","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02082-0","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemistry","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"In biomacromolecules, many amino acids or nucleotides are needed to obtain defined secondary structures and concomitant advanced functionalities. However, when researchers generate synthetic model analogues composed of dyes to predict the (photo-)functional properties of the respective solid-state aggregates they often use dimer models. Here we introduce a foldamer series of closely π-stacked dyes from dimer to 14-mer, obtained by an iterative block-based coupling protocol, that enable the study of oligomer-length effects on their photophysical properties. Spectroscopic techniques identify a distinct change of fluorescence properties at around four to six dye units—affording narrowed fluorescence bands and an increase of the total quantum yield from 47% for the dimer up to 75% for the 14-mer—that is accompanied by the development of a multiexciton state. These results highlight the limitation of the dimer model and motivate future research on well-defined π-stacked foldamers, both as models for solid-state materials and as supramolecular wires for future electronic and photonic applications.","tp":"折叠体染料","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"生物大分子需要大量氨基酸或核苷酸才能形成确定的二级结构和高级功能，但合成染料模型常仅用二聚体来预测固态聚集体的光功能性质。本研究通过迭代嵌段耦合策略合成了从二聚体到十四聚体的紧密π堆叠染料折叠体系列，系统揭示了激子动力学随堆叠长度演变的规律，填补了寡聚体到高分子间研究的空白。"},{"t":"通用选择性镍电催化交叉亲电试剂C(sp2)-C(sp2)偶联反应","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2515413123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍电催化交叉偶联","kp":["[催化剂]: 镍电催化","[反应类型]: 交叉电亲体C(sp²)–C(sp²)偶联","[选择性]: 等摩尔原料抑制同偶联实现异偶联"],"dp":1,"as":"过渡金属催化两种相似亲电试剂的交叉偶联（XEC）是构建C(sp2)–C(sp2)键的重要策略。本研究开发了通用且高选择性的镍电催化交叉亲电偶联方法，利用电化学驱动替代传统还原剂，实现对芳基卤化物等底物的高效偶联。该方法绿色经济，在药物分子和有机合成中有广阔应用前景。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"General and selective nickel-electrocatalyzed cross-electrophile C*(sp2)–C(sp2) coupling","b":"Transition metal-catalyzed cross-coupling of two similar electrophiles (XEC) to construct C(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    )–C(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    ) bonds is a powerful emerging synthetic methodology. However, efficient and selective XEC to create heterocoupled C*(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    )–C(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    ) linkages from equimolar reagents while suppressing competing homocoupling, presents a synthetic challenge. Here, we describe a promising approach to address this challenge via electrocatalytic synthesis. This approach utilizes renewable and readily available electricity to replace traditional redox reagents, minimizing chemical use and chemical waste generation, while controlling the reaction pathway by the applied potential. This highly selective and general electrocatalytic eXEC process to construct C*(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    )–C(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    ) bonds is enabled by sequential and controllable eXEC oxidative addition processes, and supported mechanistically by experiment and DFT computation. Generality and efficacy are demonstrated by more than 80 examples, including important biaryl, fluorophore, and pharmaceutical products. Notably, the stoichiometric precision of eXEC enables the first synthesis of solution-processable low polydispersity conjugated opto-electronic polymers. Therefore, this report provides a conceptually attractive method to selectively create diverse and useful C*(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    )–C(\n                    sp\n                    2\n                    ) coupled molecules and macromolecules.","aip":1},{"t":"在学校计划外和计划停课期间，阅读方面的性别差距扩大","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523152123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Why do girls outperform boys in education? One contributing factor might be that girls read more than boys, which fosters competencies relevant in education. Moreover, boys might rely more heavily on schools to support and encourage reading, meaning that unplanned and planned school closures disproportionally affect boys. We map the gender gap in reading in the period 2020 to 2022 using two large-scale datasets from Denmark, one measuring students’ weekly reading in school via a popular reading app and the other measuring students’ borrowing of library books. Our data document a clear gender gap in reading that increased during unplanned school closures due to the COVID-19 pandemic and planned closures due to vacations. Our findings underscore the role of schools in mitigating gender differences in reading."},{"t":"聚变功率经验速率被高估","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02023-8","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Nature Energy","dp":1,"as":"该研究指出，聚变发电站（FPPs）作为可靠低碳电力来源吸引了大量投资，但业界普遍引用的聚变电力经验曲线学习率（即随着部署量增加成本下降的速度）被显著高估。研究者重新分析了现有数据，认为基于过度乐观假设的成本预测会误导投资决策和政策制定，聚变能的商业化经济性可能比预期更具挑战性。","tg":"观点评论","tp":"聚变能成本评估","kp":["经验率[聚变电站成本预测]: 8-20%(被高估)"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Fusion power experience rates are overestimated","b":"Fusion power plants (FPPs) are viewed as a promising source of firm low-carbon electricity, attracting large investments. However, their future cost is highly uncertain. Current projections assume widely varying starting costs and highly arbitrary experience rates (ERs) of 8–20%. Here, leveraging recent insights from innovation literature, we examine the currently assumed ER range for FPPs by linking technological characteristics of the two dominant fusion approaches, magnetic fusion and laser-based inertial fusion, to ERs. We find that FPPs’ large unit size, extraordinary complexity and intermediate need for customization are empirically linked to ERs of 2–8%, which are much lower than currently assumed for FPPs. When paired with the expected high initial capital costs, the results raise questions about the viability of FPP in future net-zero energy systems. We urge for the adoption of ERs for FPPs that are justifiably lower than currently assumed in cost projections, energy system modelling and investor valuations, and for the research community to explore alternative fusion designs with greater cost reduction potential."},{"t":"一篇关于合作演变的重要论文之后四十五年的进展","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00802-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"BiVO4光催化的第一性原理视角：电子结构、晶面各向异性与界面工程","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003582?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"BiVO4光催化","kp":["[材料]: BiVO4光催化","[研究方法]: 第一性原理电子结构"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":2.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"First-principles perspectives on BiVO4 photocatalysis: electronic structure, facet anisotropy, and interface engineering"},{"t":"Fe-NC诱导Co 3d轨道电子离域构建电子桥以加速转化反应","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70862?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池催化剂","kp":["催化剂[Li-S电池]: Fe-NC@ZnCo₂O₄异质结构","[机制]: Fe-NC诱导Co 3d轨道电子离域构建电子桥","[催化目标]: 加速多硫化锂液固转化"],"dp":1,"as":"本研究针对锂硫电池中多硫化锂（LiPSs）向Li2S液固转化动力学缓慢的关键瓶颈，设计了Fe-NC修饰的钴基电催化剂。通过Fe-NC诱导Co的3d轨道电子离域，重构了有利于多硫化物锚定与转化的电子结构，加速了氧化还原反应速率。该策略为锂硫电池实用化中硫正极反应动力学调控提供了新思路，有望提升电池能量密度和循环稳定性。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Fe‐NC Induced Electron Delocalization of Co 3d‐Orbital Constructing an Electron Bridge for Accelerated Transformation of","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The liquid‐solid conversion of lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) to Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    2\n                    /Li\n                    2\n                    S (Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    x\n                    ⇄Li\n                    2\n                    S) impedes the sulfur reduction reaction (SRR) in lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries due to the slow kinetics and a high energy barrier. Herein, a heterostructure catalyst composed of Fe‐NC modified ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (Fe‐NC@ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    ) is designed to accelerate LiPSs conversion (especially, Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    ⇄Li\n                    2\n                    S) via modulating the electron environment of the central atomic 3d‐orbital. Based on experimental results and DFT calculations, the introduction of Fe‐NC induces electron delocalization in the Co 3d orbital and eliminates the original bandgap of ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (1.98 eV). These delocalized electrons serve as electronic active centers, strengthening coupling between the metal 3d orbital and S\n                    n\n                    2\n                    −\n                    species in LiPSs and resulting in faster LiPSs redox kinetics. As a result, the S/Fe‐NC@ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    cathode delivers a high capacity of 1449.7 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 0.1C and outstanding cycling stability with a decay rate of 0.057% per cycle over 600 cycles at 1.0C. Even under a high sulfur loading of 8.97 mg cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    , a remarkable capacity of 917.5 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    is achieved. This work provides deep insights into orbital modulation for designing high‐performance Li–S catalysts."},{"t":"液冷数据中心需求响应潜力探索","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003314?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液冷数据中心需求响应","kp":["[系统]: 液冷数据中心需求响应潜力"],"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Exploring the Demand Response Potential of Liquid-Cooled Data Centers"},{"t":"涡轮电动eVTOL环保能量管理策略：耦合燃油经济性、电池健康与全生命周期评估","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003764?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航空","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"eVTOL能量管理","kp":["[能量管理]: 改进TD3耦合油耗/电池健康/排放"],"as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Eco-friendly energy management strategy for turbo-electric eVTOLs: Coupling fuel economy, battery health and life-cycle "},{"t":"淹没在数据集中？以下是如何将它们缩小到合适的尺寸","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00880-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"色散力诱导偶极-偶极相互作用及其对锂离子电池溶剂化化学的影响","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70861?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池溶剂化化学","kp":["电解质[锂电低温]: 弱溶剂化电解质","[溶剂替换]: EC替换为二氟乙烯碳酸酯","[机制]: 色散力诱导偶极-偶极作用调控溶剂化与脱溶剂"],"dp":1,"as":"研究色散力诱导的偶极-偶极相互作用对电解液溶剂化结构的影响。弱溶剂化电解质（WSE）因具备快速Li⁺去溶剂化动力学而被视为实现锂金属电池高倍率稳定循环的关键。该工作从分子间作用力层面揭示色散力如何重塑锂离子第一溶剂化壳层的配位结构与能量势垒，为理性设计低溶剂化能、高离子电导率的新型电解液配方提供理论框架，对快充锂电池和固态界面调控具有重要指导意义。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dispersion‐Force‐Induced Dipole–Dipole Interaction and Its Effects on Solvation Chemistry of Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Weakly‐solvated electrolytes (WSEs) with rapid Li\n                    +\n                    desolvation are crucial for the stable operation of lithium‐ion batteries at subzero temperatures. Due to the weak Li\n                    +\n                    ‐dipole interaction, van der Waals forces mediated by dipole–dipole (d–d) interactions could influence electrolyte solvation structure and desolvation kinetics. By replacing ethylene carbonate (EC) with difluoroethylene carbonate (DFEC) or fluoroethylene carbonate (FEC) in a conventional carbonate electrolyte, we investigated the role of d–d interaction, particularly inductive and dispersion forces, in regulating the solvation structure and (electro)chemical properties of a fluorocarbonate‐based WSE. DFEC exhibits inductive forces similar to those of FEC, yet exerts much stronger dispersion forces on linear carbonate molecules due to its greater molecular polarizability. Consequently, electrons redistribute toward the carbonyl oxygen atom of linear carbonates, and hydrogen atoms shift toward DFEC, as is verified by\n                    17\n                    O nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy and liquid‐phase time‐of‐flight secondary ion mass spectrometry. Much enhanced Li\n                    +\n                    ‐carbonate coordination further results in a high ionization degree yet sluggish desolvation kinetics of DFEC‐based WSE. In contrast, FEC‐based WSEs restore balanced weakly‐solvated behavior and lead to much improved battery performance at −20°C and −40°C. This study provides new insights into electrolyte chemistry and establishes general design principles for electrolytes capable of working under extreme conditions."},{"t":"面向极端环境的兼具优异高温强度的延性难熔合金开发","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202515947?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐热材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"难熔高温合金","kp":["材料类型[超高温合金]: 难熔中高熵合金","应用[航空航天]: 超高温端部件兼具强度与成型性"],"dp":1,"as":"开发兼具优异高温强度与良好延展性的难熔合金，面向航空航天极端热环境应用。传统难熔合金（如Nb、Mo、W基）虽耐高温但室温脆性大、加工困难，严重制约工程化。研究通过多组元合金化设计、微观组织调控与析出强化策略，在1200°C以上仍保持高强度同时在室温下具备足够塑性，突破高温强韧性的固有矛盾，为下一代涡轮叶片、热防护结构和超音速飞行器承力件提供候选材料。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Development of Ductile Refractory Alloys With Excellent High‐Temperature Strength for Extreme Environments","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The demand for alloys capable of withstanding extremely high temperatures has grown significantly in the aerospace industry. The alloys need to maintain sufficient strength at ultra‐high temperatures, while still having adequate forming ability to manufacture the hot‐end components. Refractory alloys, including refractory medium‐ and high‐entropy alloys, have been widely recognized as the promising candidates to operate in extreme environments. This review aims to comprehensively assess the mechanical properties of ductile refractory alloys over a broad temperature range. We first present the fabrication methods available for preparing bulk refractory alloys. Several important topics regarding their mechanical properties are then discussed, such as ductile‐to‐brittle transition, strength‐ductility trade‐off at room temperature, and high‐temperature tensile strength and creep resistance. We also summarize the toughening and strengthening strategies often used towards strength‐ductility synergy in refractory alloys. The catastrophic oxidation at elevated temperatures, another critical issue for limiting their widespread applications, is further discussed briefly. Finally, this overview provides an outlook on the challenges and perspectives in this cutting‐edge field."},{"t":"设计供体-双受体共价有机框架含主辅功能位点以增强16电子硫转化反应","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70864?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池催化剂","kp":["催化剂[Li-S电池]: 供体-双受体COF","[策略]: 分子协同工程构建分级催化链","[目标]: 加速16电子硫反应动力学"],"dp":1,"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对锂硫电池中多硫化锂转化效率低的瓶颈，设计了一种含供体-双受体结构的共价有机框架(COF)催化剂，兼具主-辅双功能催化位点。该设计通过协同吸附-催化机制促进LiPSs的16电子转化反应，有望提升锂硫电池的能量密度和循环稳定性，为高比能储能器件的电催化剂设计提供新思路。","ot":"Design Donor‐Biacceptor Covalent Organic Framework with Primary‐Auxiliary Functional Sites for Enhanced 16‐Electron Sulf","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The catalytic conversion of lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) is crucial for realizing high‐energy‐density lithium–sulfur batteries. Herein, we propose a molecular cooperate engineering strategy to construct a hierarchical catalytic reaction chain for addressing the complex sulfur phase transitions and sluggish 16‐electron reaction kinetics. A covalent organic framework with a D‐A1‐A2 electronic structure was developed to generate a built‐in electric field (BIEF) via establishing intramolecular charge transfer (ICT) between bipolar functional groups. Theoretical calculations and in situ characterizations confirm that primary and auxiliary functional groups of COF can synergistically enable selective LiPSs capture while the BIEF‐facilitated electron transfer accelerates redox reactions of LiPSs, conferring reduced conversion energy barriers and mitigated shuttle effect. Moreover, the anchoring of the ─NO\n                    2\n                    group and hence the effect of the ─CF\n                    3\n                    group induce directional Li\n                    +\n                    deposition, ensuring the favored Li plating with epitaxial layered growth and suppressed dendrite formation. As a result, the Li symmetric cell demonstrates an ultra‐long lifespan (&gt;16 000 h at 5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    ) while Li–S batteries can achieve exceptional cycling stability (0.039% capacity decay per cycle over 1000 cycles). Meanwhile, the pouch cells deliver a high energy density of 395.6 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    with 90.2% capacity retention over cycling. This work presents a generalizable strategy for advancing multi‐electron redox systems.","aip":1},{"t":"高温条件下甲脒-铯金属卤化物钙钛矿太阳能电池中阳离子偏析与挥发损失的解耦研究","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02011-y","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿太阳能电池","kp":["T90[钙钛矿电池持续1太阳光]: ~2700小时","添加剂[钙钛矿前驱体]: 微量CsI₃","降解转折温度[FA-Cs钙钛矿]: 106°C"],"dp":1,"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"钙钛矿太阳能电池在高温运行中面临阳离子偏析和挥发性组分流失的退化问题。该研究在甲脒-铯铅碘体系中，通过有效抑制FAI挥发损失、维持阳离子偏析控制策略，提升了器件在高温条件下的相稳定性与长期耐久性。这对于推动钙钛矿电池向商业化热稳定性要求迈进具有重要意义。","ot":"Decoupling cation segregation and volatile loss in formamidinium–caesium metal halide perovskite solar cells under high-","b":"Formamidinium–caesium lead iodide (FAXCs1-XPbI3, 0 x 2) layer effectively suppresses FAI loss, maintaining cation-segregation-dominated degradation beyond 106 °C. Moreover, introducing trace CsI3 in perovskite precursor enhances cation homogeneity in as-prepared films, dramatically extending the device T90 (time to 90% of maximum efficiency) to ~2,700 h under continuous 1-sun illumination (1.0% UV) at 85 °C. The extrapolated T90 at 45 °C exceeds 50 years by assuming a same degradation pathway. These findings elucidate the temperature-dependent degradation pathways in formamidinium–caesium perovskites and provide practical strategies to enhance their operational stability."},{"t":"解析电催化CO2转化反应中单原子催化剂上中间体的相互作用模式","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS00621J","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子CO2电催化","kp":["[催化剂类型]: 单原子催化剂","[研究内容]: CO₂转化中间体在SACs上相互作用模式"],"dp":1,"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"电催化CO2还原反应(CO2CR)是减碳与产能的双重路径，但中间体在单原子催化剂表面的相互作用机制尚不清晰。该研究系统解析了CO2转化过程中关键中间体在单原子活性位点上的吸附与转化模式，为理性设计高效单原子电催化剂、提升CO2还原选择性与活性提供了机理层面的理论指导。","ot":"Deciphering the interaction patterns of intermediates on single atom catalysts during electrocatalytic CO2 conversion re","b":"Electrocatalytic CO2 conversion (CO2CR) offers a promising route for addressing carbon emissions while simultaneously generating valuable chemical feedstocks. Single-atom catalysts (SACs) have attracted significant attention due to their maximized metal atom utilization and precisely defined coordination architectures. Accumulating evidence indicates that CO2CR over SACs is jointly governed by the intrinsic properties of the central metal atom and the surrounding coordination environment. In this review, we present a comprehensive analysis of the hierarchical coordination environments surrounding the central metal center, encompassing monoelement and bielement coordination in the first coordination sphere, second coordination sphere modulation by neighboring non-metallic and metallic species, and engineering of the beyond-second coordination sphere via functional-group grafting and distal substrate functionalization. We further elucidate the nature of catalytically active sites and systematically categorize intermediate binding behaviors into single-site, step-by-step, simultaneous and cross-substrate intermediate binding modes, highlighting how tailored intermediate interactions regulate reaction kinetics, suppress competing pathways, and steer product selectivity. Notably, we summarize recent advances demonstrating that SACs are not inherently confined to C1 products but also unlock complex coupling reactions through rationally designed multi-site interaction networks, yielding critical chemicals including C2+ products, urea, and others. This framework establishes SACs as a transformative platform for next-generation CO2CR through precise control of multiscale coordination environments, active sites, and intermediate interactions."},{"t":"跨文化证据表明羞耻可以防止名誉受损","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526787123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Because shame leads to evasions, aggression, and other behaviors that victims and third parties find undesirable, a prominent theory regards this emotion as maladaptive. By contrast, an alternative, adaptationist theory asks whether shame might benefit the actor. Indications that an individual now offers fewer benefits or imposes greater costs on others, if they reach others’ minds, lead the individual to be socially devalued: Others become less inclined to help and more inclined to harm her. Thus, an adaptationist theory views shame as a neurocognitive adaptation designed to minimize the leakage of reputation-damaging information and the cost of being devalued. Here, we report tests of two predictions derived from the adaptationist theory across six countries—the United States, the Netherlands, Portugal, Spain, Japan, and China—and two cultural regions within the United States—Southern states (honor) and Northern states (nonhonor). First, failures that indicate reductions in abilities more highly valued by others will elicit more intense shame. Second, failures will trigger greater shame when they occur in public rather than in private. The data supported both predictions in all six countries and in both US cultural regions. The improbable fit between the severity of the devaluative threat and the intensity of shame suggests that this emotion is an adaptation. Further, the replication of these findings across regions that vary widely along the individualism–collectivism and honor–nonhonor dimensions suggests that shame is part of human nature rather than a cultural construction."},{"t":"有机库仑玻璃中的相关电荷传输","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522965?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Advances in the development of organic field‐effect transistors (OFETs), electrically gated organic semiconductors (EGOFETs), and organic electrochemical transistors (OECTs) allow for the operation of these devices at very high charge‐carrier densities, where Coulomb interactions between carriers can be expected to become significant. We have studied the effects of such Coulomb interactions in an OFET‐like structure using Kinetic Monte Carlo (KMC) simulations. Compared to an analogous structure where carrier‐carrier interactions are neglected, we find a reduction in carrier mobility and an increase in activation energy. This effect increases with increasing gate voltage, i.e., charge density. We associate this with the emergence of a different transport regime where correlated transport prevails and where a Coulomb gap appears in a dynamic density of states (DOS), consistent with previous work. We demonstrate that at these high densities, the charges in the organic semiconductor behave like those in a Coulomb glass. In this context, the activation energy for transport is reinterpreted to relate to the structural reorganization of the carrier ensemble. Unlike in inorganic semiconductors, for the organic semiconductor system, we find the appearance of a Coulomb gap to occur even at ambient temperature, and it does not require variable‐range hopping.","tp":"有机半导体","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"有机场效应晶体管（OFET）、电控有机半导体和有机电化学晶体管的进展使器件可在极高载流子密度下运行，此时载流子间库仑相互作用显著增强。研究利用动力学蒙特 Carlo模拟研究了类OFET结构中库仑相互作用对电荷传输的影响，揭示了高密度下相关电荷传输的新物理机制。"},{"t":"更正 Te 等人，单剂量减毒活疫苗的广泛 β-CoV 免疫和传播阻断","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607878123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"对Sun等人的更正，日本群岛在更新世晚期庇护了洞穴狮子，而不是老虎","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2608062123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"更正 Li 等人的观点，功能异质性肿瘤内 CD4+CD8+ 双阳性 T 细胞可以产生信号","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2606104123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"废微纳塑料转化为碳材料：可再生能源与环境应用新趋势","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003429?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"废塑料转化碳材料","dp":1,"sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.5},"as":"","ot":"Conversion of waste micro/nano plastics into carbon materials: A new trend for renewable energy and environmental applic"},{"t":"趋同进化通过拟南芥中 BOR1 和 BOR2 的 SNP 和串联重复增加硼转运","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525676123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Boron (B) is a crucial micronutrient, particularly in volcanic soils where its deficiency hampers agriculture. Here, we investigate the genetic basis of leaf B accumulation in natural populations of\n                    Arabidopsis thaliana\n                    that colonized volcanic islands in Cape Verde. Using a combination of genome-wide association studies (GWAS) and mapping in a recombinant intercross population, we identified a case of convergent phenotypic evolution in which multiple variants in the two principal B transporter genes,\n                    BOR1\n                    and\n                    BOR2\n                    , increase leaf B accumulation in parallel. These include multiple tandem duplications at\n                    BOR1\n                    that arose independently in different populations. Overall, this study reveals a remarkable case of convergent evolution occurring within a relatively short time scale, where different types of de novo mutations at B efflux transporter genes achieve similar phenotypic outcomes. Further, our findings show that integrating recombinant populations with GWAS in natural populations can improve power to overcome allelic heterogeneity."},{"t":"窄带隙有机半导体 enabled 色彩不变光热织物用于可穿戴太阳能收集","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519334?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光热织物","kp":["光热材料[可穿戴织物]: 窄带隙有机半导体","[特性]: 颜色不变的光热效应"],"dp":1,"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究利用窄带隙有机半导体材料开发了色彩不敏感的光热织物，实现可穿戴太阳能能量收集。窄带隙设计拓宽了光谱吸收范围，提升了光热转换效率，且织物颜色对光热性能影响最小化（色彩不变性）。该技术适用于户外运动服装的热舒适管理与多功能化，推动可穿戴能源收集纺织品发展。","ot":"Chromatic‐Invariant Photothermal Fabrics Enabled by Narrow‐Bandgap Organic Semiconductors for Wearable Solar Energy Harv","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The increasing popularity of outdoor activewear has placed higher demands on its thermal comfort, multi‐functionality, and esthetics. Existing photothermal fabrics for cold weathers are based on visible light absorption, which limits color design options. Herein, a chromatic‐invariant photothermal material is developed and integrated onto fabrics to prepare novel photothermal clothing, achieving 4°C–8°C temperature increase within only 5 min under 1000 W m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    simulated solar irradiation. It exhibits strong absorption in the near‐infrared region and effectively converts the radiation into thermal energy, while maintaining the original visual colors of fabrics due to high reflectivity across the visible spectrum. Additionally, this photothermal material does not compromise the original functionality of fabrics and is suitable for application on various types of fabric materials. Furthermore, the prepared fabric achieves a sterilization rate exceeding 95.3% after only 20 min of irradiation under 1000 W m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    standard simulated solar light to ensure hygiene during outdoor activities. These results demonstrate a versatile wearable strategy with integrated functionality and aesthetic appeal for maintaining personal thermal comfort in cold‐weather outdoor scenarios."},{"t":"过渡金属氧化物上新兴铱中心用于PEM电解水的挑战与机遇","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70852?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"PEM电解水铱催化","kp":["催化剂[PEM电解水析氧]: 过渡金属氧化物负载铱中心","[定位]: 替代传统贵金属氧化物兼具活性与稳定性"],"dp":1,"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"as":"PEM水电解制氢对析氧反应(OER)电催化剂的效率与稳定性要求极高，铱基催化剂因耐酸性环境成为关键候选。该研究综述了过渡金属氧化物负载铱活性中心的新兴催化剂设计策略，分析了Ir-氧化物界面协同效应对OER活性和耐久性的影响，为降低贵金属用量、开发高效PEM电解槽阳极催化剂指明方向。","ot":"Challenges and Opportunities for the Emerging Iridium Center on Transition Metal Oxide for PEM Water Electrolysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The development of highly efficient and stable electrocatalysts for the oxygen evolution reaction (OER) is crucial for advancing proton exchange membrane water electrolysis (PEMWE) for sustainable hydrogen production. Recently, Iridium centers on transition metal oxides (TMOs) have emerged as promising alternatives to conventional noble metal oxides, demonstrating superior activity, stability, and cost‐effectiveness. This review systematically summarizes these advancements by elucidating the intrinsic mechanisms and dynamic evolution patterns of Ir active centers under acidic OER conditions, discussing core strategies for enhancing catalytic performance, and attention is mainly directed to the industrial application requirements by evaluating breakthrough solutions for key technical challenges, including long‐term stability under high‐current‐density operation and Ir dissolution suppression. Finally, from the perspective of rational design, the review outlines current challenges and prospects for oxide‐supported Ir catalysts, emphasizing the urgent need for advanced operando characterization techniques and scalable fabrication processes. By integrating fundamental research with practical applications, this review aims to provide theoretical guidance and technical references for developing next‐generation OER catalysts suitable for large‐scale PEMWE implementation."},{"t":"CD47 稳定 ROBO2，通过阻止 ITCH 介导的泛素化来调节胶质母细胞瘤进展","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602460123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"CD47 is an innate immune checkpoint that inhibits phagocytosis by myeloid cells, contributing to immune evasion by cancer cells. CD47-blocking antibodies have limited efficacy in glioblastoma (GBM), and the cell-intrinsic role of CD47 is poorly understood. In this study, we show that CD47 is highly expressed at the invasive edge of GBM tumors, and its elevated expression correlates with poor patient survival. We demonstrate that CD47 loss impairs GBM cell proliferation, migration, and invasion, independent of immune activity, and leads to reduced tumor burden and prolonged survival in vivo. Our study identifies ROBO2 signaling as a key downstream effector of CD47 and demonstrates that loss of ROBO2 similarly reduces GBM cell proliferation and migration. Importantly, we have uncovered that CD47 stabilizes ROBO2 by sequestering the E3 ubiquitin ligase ITCH, thereby blocking ubiquitination and proteasomal degradation of ROBO2. These findings establish CD47 as a key regulator of GBM cell plasticity and highlight the therapeutic potential of targeting CD47\n                    –\n                    ROBO2 signaling in GBM."},{"t":"宽频反射型胆甾相液晶用于可见光区域低蓝光圆偏振光生成","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72890?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"胆甾相液晶","kp":["原料[胆甾相液晶]: 生物质胆固醇衍生手性单体","[特性]: 宽带反射+可见区低蓝光圆偏振光"],"dp":1,"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究以廉价生物质衍生手性单体合成了可聚合手性液晶单体，构建了宽带反射型胆甾相液晶结构，实现在可见光区域生成低蓝光成分的圆偏振光。胆甾相液晶的周期性螺旋结构可选择性反射特定波长圆偏振光，该技术在护眼显示、防蓝光光学器件及偏振光调控领域具有应用价值。","ot":"Broadband Reflective Cholesteric Liquid Crystals for Low‐Blue Circularly Polarized Light Generation in the Visible Regio","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In this work, a polymerizable chiral liquid‐crystal monomer was first synthesized from inexpensive biomass‐derived cholesterol through a simple transformation. Co‐assembling this chiral monomer with a polymerizable achiral liquid‐crystal monomer and followed by initiator‐free photopolymerization, yielded a cholesteric liquid‐crystal (CLC) material\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    featuring a broad reflection band in the visible region with blue‐selectivity. After removal of the quartz substrates, the material forms a flexible film with good thermal stability. Due to Bragg reflection, under transmission mode,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    efficiently converts 510–700 nm unpolarized light into right‐handed circularly polarized (\n                    R\n                    ‐CP) light with dissymmetry factors (\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    ) of −1.6 and even reaching up to −2.0. Placed behind achiral zero‐blue aqueous solutions,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    enabled multicolour zero‐blue circularly polarized photoluminescence, generating exclusively\n                    R\n                    ‐CP light with |\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    | values exceeding 1.6. Additionally, under reflection mode,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    efficiently converts unpolarized ambient light into 510–700 nm low‐blue left‐handed circularly polarized (\n                    L\n                    ‐CP) light. Therefore,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    exhibited distinctly different colors under varying backgrounds and circular polarizers. Leveraging these behaviors, molecular logic gate and information encryption–decryption were realized. Furthermore, a conceptual design for a low‐blue circularly polarized display device was also demonstrated."},{"t":"区块链和双重拍卖打造可信、高效的自愿碳市场","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003715?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳市场交易","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"超越标签：未标记智能电表数据的贝叶斯和因果热泵分解","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003363?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热泵分解法","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"超越掺杂：稀土介导的多功能电催化剂理性设计策略","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70863?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"稀土电催化剂","kp":["[策略]: 稀土4f电子构型精准调控电催化剂","[特性]: 可逆多价态+可调物化性质"],"dp":1,"as":"面向可再生能源电催化转换领域，综述并拓展了稀土元素介导的多功能电催化剂理性设计策略，超越传统单一掺杂范式。文章系统讨论了稀土元素（如镧系）在调控催化剂电子结构、氧空位浓度及活性位点配位环境方面的独特作用，涵盖OER、ORR、HER等多种关键反应。该策略为高效、低成本能源转换器件的设计提供了新思路。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Beyond Doping: Rare‐Earth Mediated Strategies for Rational Design of Multifunctional Electrocatalysts","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    With the rapid development of renewable energy, electrocatalysis has assumed a central role in the conversion and storage of sustainable energy. Rare‐earth (RE) elements, characterized by their unique\n                    4f\n                    electronic configurations, reversible multivalent states, and highly tunable physicochemical properties, offer a fundamentally distinct pathway for achieving precise control over catalyst electronic structures, interfacial chemistry, and reaction pathways. This review presents a comprehensive and mechanistic perspective on the distinctive, multi‐faceted roles of RE elements in advanced electrocatalysis. By systematically analyzing their intrinsic properties, the review elucidates the quantum‐chemical origins of their advantages in electronic structure modulation, stabilization of high‐energy intermediates, and enhancement of interfacial charge transport. Building upon these foundations, some major catalyst design strategies, encompassing atomic doping, defect engineering, nanostructuring, and interface construction, are critically summarized. Then, recent progress of RE‐based catalysts in various electrocatalytic reactions, including oxygen and hydrogen evolution, and carbon dioxide and nitrogen reduction reactions, are thoroughly reviewed to establish structure‐activity correlations. Finally, the review outlines future prospects and emerging frontiers in RE‐mediated catalysis, such as multi‐electron reaction pathway regulation and the construction of adaptive interfaces. This work aims to provide a fundamental understanding and strategic guidance for the rational design of efficient electrocatalysts enabled by RE elements."},{"t":"对晚期尼安德特人人口历史的考古学见解","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520565123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The demographic history of Neanderthals is only partially understood. In Europe, some degree of genetic continuity has been shown from 120 thousand years ago (ka) onward despite the occurrence of multiple subsequent diversification events. While it has been proposed that a population turnover preceded the emergence of Late Neanderthals in Europe, the extent, timing, and geographic location of this event are currently unknown. Here, we report ten mitochondrial DNA sequences (mtDNAs) of Neanderthal individuals from six archaeological sites in Belgium, France, Germany and Serbia, and analyze them alongside 49 published mtDNAs. The integration of phylogenetic and molecular dating analyses with an extensive archaeological dataset enabled us to reconstruct temporal and spatial patterns in Neanderthal distribution. Remarkably, nearly all Late Neanderthal individuals across Europe belong to a single mtDNA lineage that diversified recently, confirming a large-scale genetic replacement. Our analyses date this diversification event to approximately 65 ka and suggest that it likely originated from a population refugium in southwestern France from which Neanderthals appear to have undergone a major range dispersal across Europe. In addition, we detect a sharp decline in the Neanderthal mtDNA effective population size beginning ~45 ka and reaching a minimum ~42 ka, shortly before their extinction. This study demonstrates that integrating molecular and archaeological datasets provides a more detailed understanding of the Late Neanderthal population’s history, and highlights the critical role of climate-driven refugia and subsequent range expansions in shaping the genetic landscape of Neanderthals through time."},{"t":"质子交换膜燃料电池中运行条件参数诱导气体渗透现象分析综述","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003673?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"燃料电池气体串透","kp":["[失效现象]: 操作条件致PEMFC气体串透"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.5},"ot":"Analysis of operating condition parameters induced gas crossover phenomenon in proton exchange membrane fuel cells: A re"},{"t":"通过保留长链增强白炭黑增强天然橡胶的韧性","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530834123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"天然橡胶增韧","kp":["[增韧机制]: 保留长链实现应变诱导结晶增韧","[失效原因]: 塑炼断链降低天然橡胶性能"],"dp":1,"as":"针对白炭黑（二氧化硅）增强天然橡胶的韧性问题，提出通过保留橡胶分子长链来协同提升强度的策略。天然橡胶的优异性能源于其高分子量长链及应变诱导结晶（SIC）能力，但传统白炭黑混炼工艺会切断分子链导致性能下降。该研究优化填料-基体界面与混炼条件，在保持增强效果的同时最大限度保留长链结构，实现了韧性与强度的同步提升。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Amplifying toughness in silica-reinforced natural rubber by preserving long chains","b":"Natural rubber outperforms synthetic rubbers because of its long chains and strain-induced crystallization (SIC). However, these advantages are largely lost when the natural rubber chains are masticated during processing, and silica particles are added for reinforcement. Mastication eases mixing but shortens chains and lowers performance. Silica particles require covalent interlinks with rubber chains, but these interlinks restrict chain stretch and alignment, reducing SIC. Here, we show that the performance of silica-reinforced natural rubber can be markedly enhanced by preserving long natural rubber chains. We use a solvent to dissolve natural rubber latex into individual rubber chains and use the solution to uniformly disperse silica particles. After drying, the uncured compound can be stored and molded prior to curing. The long rubber chains are then sparsely crosslinked with one another and interlinked with the silica particles. The long strands readily align under stretch and increase SIC. Preserving long chains elevates toughness by an order of magnitude, from ~2 to 44 kJ m\n                    –2\n                    . High toughness arises from energy dissipation across multiple length scales, over long rubber strands, silica particles, and a zone of SIC. High modulus of ~19 MPa arises from two interpenetrating networks: the network of densely entangled rubber chains and the network of percolated silica particles. The resulting material achieves high toughness while maintaining high modulus, a combination uncommon in silica-reinforced synthetic and natural rubbers."},{"t":"选择性剪接重新连接香蕉香气生物合成","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2603894123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"香蕉香合成","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"分子工程化电子选择性自组装单分子层增强倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池准费米能级劈裂","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02025-6","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿自组装单层","kp":["[界面材料]: 电子选择性自组装单分子层","[机制]: 减缓界面提取速率增强准费米能级分裂"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究针对钙钛矿太阳能电池中开路电压偏低的核心瓶颈，提出了一种分子工程化的电子选择性自组装单层（SAM）界面修饰策略。在钙钛矿电池中，最大化准费米能级分裂是实现高光电压的关键。传统界面修饰材料难以同时满足能级匹配、缺陷钝化和电荷选择性传输的要求。研究团队通过精确设计SAM分子的锚固基团、共轭骨架和末端官能团，优化了钙钛矿/电子传输层界面的能级排列，有效抑制非辐射复合损失，从而显著提升光电压和光电转换效率。该方案为钙钛矿电池产业化进程中的界面工程提供了通用且可扩展的新范式。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"A molecularly engineered electron-selective self-assembled monolayer enhances quasi-Fermi level splitting in inverted pe","b":"Maximizing quasi-Fermi level splitting is essential for achieving high photovoltage in perovskite solar cells. Conventional strategies that prioritize rapid charge extraction at the perovskite/fullerene interface, can deplete interfacial carrier populations, limiting quasi-Fermi level splitting and photovoltage. Here we demonstrate that rational interface design benefits for slowed extraction rate, preserving interfacial carriers while minimizing non-radiative recombination. We introduce 3PDPA, a molecularly engineered electron-selective self-assembled monolayer at the perovskite/C60 interface. 3PDPA slows electron extraction, anchors undercoordinated Pb2+ ions and forms stable six-membered hydrogen-bonded rings with FA+ cations, delivering robust passivation and excellent chemical stability. 3PDPA further enables π–π interactions with C60, improving interfacial contact and reducing potential fluctuations. Inverted cells incorporating 3PDPA achieve efficiencies of 26.82% for 1.53 eV bandgap cells and 21.2% for 1.77 eV bandgap cells, alongside a T90 lifetime of ~1,000 h under International Summit on Organic Photovoltaic Stability (ISOS-L-3) stress conditions."},{"t":"癫痫中的线粒体-神经炎症-D-丝氨酸连接","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2604050123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"石墨烯终于出现了 Floquet 缺口","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02548-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"氮-空位中心自旋的CMOS控制器","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01603-6","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"NV中心CMOS控制","as":"","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":2.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"A CMOS controller for nitrogen–vacancy centre spins"},{"t":"[ASAP] 氢致钝化机制中金属-绝缘体-半导体光阳极缺陷密度的空间定量分析","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01240","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MIS光电极析氢","kp":["[钝化机制]: 氢诱导缺陷钝化","[绝缘层工艺]: 原子层沉积(ALD)工程化","[应用]: 硅基MIS光电极光电化学水分解"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究针对硅基金属-绝缘体-半导体（MIS）光电极中氢致钝化机制进行缺陷密度的空间定量分析。MIS结构利用内建电场驱动光电化学水分解，但界面缺陷会捕获载流子降低效率。研究通过空间分辨技术精确量化氢钝化处理前后缺陷态分布变化，揭示氢原子如何与悬挂键结合以减少复合损失，为提升光电化学水分解效率的界面工程提供定量指导。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Spatially Quantitative Profiling of Defect Density for Hydrogen-Induced Passivation Mechanism of Metal–Insulator–Semiconductor Photoanodes","b":"Silicon-based metal-insulator-semiconductor (MIS) photoelectrodes provide a built-in field for photoelectrochemical water splitting but suffer from inefficient charge transport due to carrier recombination at defect sites within the space-charge region. The insulating layer fabricated by atomic layer deposition (ALD) is critical for defect passivation and requires carefully engineered deposition and annealing processes for optimal performance. This necessitates the quantitative analysis of defect density distribution. However, such analysis remains impeded by intrinsic limitations of conventional single-capacitance techniques and the influence of tunneling leakage currents. This paper describes an integrated multicapacitance methodology that combines drive-level capacitance profiling (DLCP) and capacitance-voltage (C-V) techniques to quantify both interface (Nit) and bulk defect charge density (NDLCP) within the space-charge region, using the space-charge capacitance refined by MIS-adapted multicomponent equivalent circuit modeling. This approach reveals that Al2O3 reduces the Nit at n-Si/ITO interface from approximately 2.9 × 1016 to 1.4 × 1016 cm-3, while simultaneously profiling the variation of NDLCP and depletion width. Furthermore, systematic DLCP/C-V analysis enables the design of a tailored passivation protocol by tuning ALD deposition (Tdep) and annealing temperatures to leverage the hydrogen-induced mechanism. Optimal passivation is achieved at a moderate Tdep (∼160 °C) followed by 350 °C annealing, which balances sufficient hydrogen content and suitable structural properties of the Al2O3 film without introducing additional bulk defects during annealing. Eventually, the optimized n-Si/SiOx/Al2O3/ITO/Ni photoanode exhibits an onset potential of 0.88 V vs RHE and an applied bias photon-to-current efficiency (ABPE) of 2.91%, with a long-term stability of 120 h."},{"t":"[ASAP] 调控非共价相互作用构建高温多轴无铅金属卤化物杂化铁电体","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21648","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无铅铁电材料","kp":["[材料体系]: (PMA)3MBr6基无铅金属卤化物杂化铁电体","[改进方向]: 高居里温度多轴铁电","[调控手段]: 调节非共价相互作用"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究通过调控非共价相互作用构建高温多轴无铅金属卤化物杂化铁电材料。传统含铅铁电材料存在环境和健康风险，无铅分子铁电体被视为绿色电子技术的未来发展方向。该工作通过精确设计分子间非共价键（氢键、范德华力等）调控晶体对称性，实现室温以上多个极轴的铁电相变，拓展了无铅铁电体在存储器、传感器等高温电子器件中的应用潜力。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Regulating Noncovalent Interactions to Construct High-Temperature Multiaxial Lead-Free Metal Halide Hybrid Ferroelectrics","b":"Lead-free molecular ferroelectrics are expected to promote the development of green electronics technology due to their environmental friendliness and functional diversity. Nevertheless, the limited variety, low Curie temperature (Tc), and uniaxial characteristics pose significant obstacles in their application. Herein, on the basis of (PMA)3MBr6 (PMA+ is benzylammonium, and M is Bi3+ or Sb3+), we constructed a series of lead-free metal halide hybrids (PMA)2(A)MBr6 (A is dimethylammonium (DMA+), formamidinium (FA+), or guanidinium (GA+)) using a cation mixing strategy. The cation mixing strategy introduces cation-π interactions and effectively regulates the hydrogen bonding network in the structure. The different strengths of noncovalent interactions in the structures lead to differences in the phase transition temperature and ferroelectricity of (PMA)2(A)MBr6. In (PMA)2(GA)MBr6 and (PMA)2(FA)MBr6, the excessively strong hydrogen bond network and cation-π interactions result in the system lacking the necessary kinetic degrees of freedom to achieve ferroelectric inversion. It is worth noting that moderate noncovalent interactions can ensure spontaneous polarization below the Curie temperature (Tc) and provide necessary dynamic channels for the flipping of polar units, thus successfully achieving ferroelectricity in (PMA)2(DMA)MBr6 (3̅mFm). The results revealed that in the design of molecular ferroelectrics, a delicate balance needs to be struck between the different strengths of noncovalent interactions. This finding provides a significant and effective pathway to design high-Tc and multiaxial environmentally friendly ferroelectrics."},{"t":"[尽快] 对“使用生物正交荧光探针和带有靶向部分的工程报告酶进行低背景癌症成像”的更正","d":"2026-03-24","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c04784","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"[ASAP] 仿生扩散限制硅化凝聚体组装实现智能纳米环用于深度敏感肿瘤穿透","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22993","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"仿生硅化纳米材料","kp":["[合成策略]: 凝聚体导向扩散受限硅化","[纳米结构]: 非对称拓扑纳米环用于肿瘤渗透"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"受生物启发，研究团队在凝聚体组装体中实现扩散限制的硅化反应，构建智能纳米环结构用于深度肿瘤穿透给药。传统介孔材料自组装受限于热力学平衡态，难以精确调控形貌。该策略利用凝聚体微滴作为受限反应空间，通过控制硅酸缩合的扩散速率，生成具有环形拓扑结构的纳米载体。纳米环形貌有利于在肿瘤致密间质中深层渗透并实现敏感药物响应释放。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Bioinspired Diffusion-Limited Silicification in Coacervate Assemblies Enables Smart Nanotoroids for Deep and Sensitive Tumor Penetration","b":"Controlling the self-assembly of mesoporous materials beyond equilibrium remains a fundamental challenge. Conventional templating systems form ordered structures through energy-minimizing coassembly but lack the kinetic and spatial freedom required to produce asymmetric or topologically complex architectures. Here, we report a bioinspired coacervate-directed silicification strategy that enables diffusion-limited and spatially asymmetric condensation within soft templates, yielding ordered hexagonal mesoporous nanotoroids. In this system, poly(acrylic acid) (PAA) electrostatically associates with the cationic surfactant cetyltrimethylammonium bromide (CTAB), driving liquid-liquid phase separation and forming disc-like coacervate assemblies. Reaction-diffusion imbalance across the inner and outer interfaces within these templates induces asymmetric silicification, driving an interior collapse and toroidal self-transformation. By tuning PAA concentration, the diffusion-condensation kinetics can be precisely modulated, allowing programmable control over collapse dynamics and final topology, with enlarged central cavities (14-71 nm) and reduced rim thickness (15-35 nm). These nanotoroids exhibit uniform sub-100 nm size, high surface area (846 m2 g-1), and abundant mesopores (∼2.0 nm). The nanotoroids (rim thickness ∼15 nm, height ∼40 nm) display markedly prolonged blood circulation, enhanced tumor accumulation (+173%), improved vascular extravasation, and deeper intratumoral penetration, while reducing hepatic and splenic uptake by 19% and 14%, respectively, compared with spherical analogues. These combined advantages translate into potent antitumor efficacy in both subcutaneous and spinal metastasis models. This work establishes a new paradigm for sol-gel topology control by bridging reaction-diffusion dynamics with bioinspired silicification based on the chemistry of LLPS (liquid-liquid phase separation), thereby unlocking the untapped biomedical potential of toroidal topologies that were rarely accessible."},{"t":"超低泄漏电流丝状导电非晶硒化锗纳米颗粒双稳态阈值开关选择器","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523102?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"选通管存储器件","kp":["材料体系[OTS选通管]: 非晶GeSe纳米颗粒","[架构]: 3D堆叠交叉点存储","目标指标[OTS选通管]: 超低关断电流与低阈值电压"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":7.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究开发非晶硒化锗（GeSe）纳米颗粒基双向阈值开关（OTS）选择器，实现超低漏电流和细丝传导特性。随着存储容量增大和高并行计算需求提升，存储器件集成密度亟需突破。OTS选择器可串联在存储单元前端抑制 sneak current（偷漏电流），从而允许可堆叠交叉阵列架构。非晶GeSe纳米颗粒均匀性优于薄膜沉积，漏电流显著降低，开关比与均匀性满足高密度存储选通要求。","dp":1,"ot":"Ultralow‐Leakage‐Current and Filament‐Conductive Amorphous Germanium Selenide Nanoparticle Ovonic Threshold Switching Selectors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Both large‐capacity storage and high‐parallel computing demand a significant boost in integration density of memory chips at advanced technological nodes. This necessitates selector components in 3D stackable cross‐point architectures to achieve an ultralow leakage current (\n                    I\n                    off\n                    ) and a relatively low threshold voltage (\n                    V\n                    th\n                    ). However, conventional ovonic threshold switching (OTS) selectors cannot optimize these two properties simultaneously due to their conflicting physical attributes. To overcome this challenge, we put forward an innovative material design of a thermally‐robust amorphous Ge\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    3\n                    nanoparticle (NP)‐assembled nanolayer, by which the resulting selectors have achieved an unprecedentedly low\n                    I\n                    off\n                    of ∼pA, an impressively high selectivity of ∼10\n                    8\n                    , a low\n                    V\n                    th\n                    of ∼2.4 V, and commendable\n                    V\n                    th\n                    reliability, outperforming existing OTS selectors. Through in situ off‐axis electron holography characterizations, we have presented evidence of nanoscale filamentary conduction within the individual NPs, revealing subthreshold‐conduction and switch‐on behaviors that have hitherto not been directly observed. Our work will inspire further exploration of novel amorphous chalcogenide NPs and deeper research on filamentary conduction physics, advancing the pursuit of superior access performances in OTS selectors."},{"t":"燃料电池混合动力汽车智能能量管理：拓扑、感知、决策与互联系统研究进展","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003326?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"燃料电池能量管理","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Toward intelligent energy management for fuel cell hybrid electric vehicles: Advances in topologies, perception, decision, and connected systems"},{"t":"利用余热并参与备用市场的蒸汽-电混合能源系统技术经济优化","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003752?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热电联产","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热电联产系统优化","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Techno-economic optimization of hybrid steam-electric energy systems with excess heat utilization and reserve market participation"},{"t":"可持续碳纤维实现零过量锂金属电池稳定长效锂金属沉积","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506780?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属负极材料","kp":["集流体[零过量锂金属电池]: 可持续碳纤维三维骨架","[失效机制]: 首圈SEI大面积成膜致锂损耗"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究开发可持续碳纤维三维集流体，实现无负极（zero-excess）锂金属电池中均匀长效的锂沉积。传统铜箔集流体上锂枝晶生长不均匀，导致库伦效率低和安全隐患。碳纤维网络的高比表面积和亲锂表面化学可有效降低局部电流密度，引导锂均匀成核与剥离。该策略使零富余锂金属电池（正极无额外锂源）在长循环中保持稳定界面，显著提升高比能电池的循环寿命。","dp":1,"ot":"Sustainable Carbon Fibers Enable Stable Long‐Term Lithium Metal Deposition for Prospective Zero‐Excess Lithium Metal Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Three‐dimensional current collectors have emerged as a promising strategy to promote uniform Li deposition and extend the cycle life of zero‐excess lithium metal batteries. However, excessive Li loss in the first cycle due to solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) formation on the large surface area, combined with the use of dense or nonrenewable materials and complex, multistep fabrication processes, limits their practical implementation. In this work, a lightweight, lignin‐derived carbon fiber (CF) current collector is presented. It is fabricated via a simple and sustainable electrospinning process, and after carbonization has abundant structural defects and nanoscale porosity. Surface defects promote the formation of a stable, inorganic‐rich SEI, efficiently passivating the current collector, while pores of ∼1.0–1.4 nm enable quasi‐metallic Li clusters to form before plating, providing a conductive network and distributed nucleation sites that enhance Li plating/stripping reversibility and cycle life. This CF current collector exhibits a first‐cycle active Li loss of only 4.8%–8.9% relative to the typical Li inventory of commercial lithium‐ion battery cathodes and maintains a coulombic efficiency of 99.0% over 200 cycles, demonstrating excellent electrochemical performance."},{"t":"自漂浮COF基Janus膜：构建稳固三相界面促进电荷分离以高效光合成H2O2","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00042-1?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF光催化膜","kp":["材料体系[H2O2光合]: COF-[NH2-GO]自漂浮Janus膜","[合成方法]: 一步界面聚合","[界面工程]: 气液固三相界面增强O2传质"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过一步界面聚合策略构建自漂浮COF-[NH2-GO] Janus膜，构建稳固的三相界面促进电荷分离，实现高效H2O2光合成。共价有机框架（COF）提供光吸收和催化活性位点，氧化石墨烯（GO）增强电子传导，Janus双面结构使气-液-固三相界面稳定存在，加速氧气还原为过氧化氢。自漂浮特性使薄膜可直接铺展在水面接受光照，无需额外支撑结构，为太阳能驱动的绿色H2O2生产提供可规模化方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Self-floating COF-based Janus film: A robust triphase interface boosting charge separation for efficient H2O2 photosynthesis","b":"A self-floating COF-[NH2-GO] Janus film was engineered via a one-step interfacial polymerization strategy for efficient H2O2 photosynthesis, in which the introduced graphene promoted the separation and transfer of photogenerated carriers. Meanwhile, the self-floating film photocatalysts enabled the stabilization of gas-liquid-solid triphase interface, significantly enhancing the O2 mass transfer.","aip":1},{"t":"Omicron 在不同的单一人 VH1-2 重排小鼠模型中广泛中和复发性 SARS-CoV-2 人源化抗体","d":"2026-03-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537053123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"During V(D)J recombination, antibody diversity is enhanced by nontemplated junctional modifications that generate immensely diverse heavy chain (HC) and light chain (LC) complementarity-determining 3 antigen-contact regions (CDR3s). We previously developed a mouse model that generates diverse antibody repertoires by rearranging a single human V\n                    H\n                    1-2 and Vκ1-33, associated with highly diverse CDR3s generated by V(D)J recombination with mouse Ds and/or Js. Immunization of this model with SARS-CoV-2 D614G spike elicited an antibody that potently neutralized SARS-CoV-2 variants through Omicron BA.2.754. Here, we report a related mouse model in which a single V\n                    H\n                    1-2 rearranges to human D3-3 and J\n                    H\n                    6, generating diverse HC-CDR3s much longer on average than those of our prior model. Omicron BA.4/.5 spike-ferritin nanoparticle-immunization of the new model elicited four highly related humanized antibodies that potently neutralize downstream Omicron subvariants. All four antibodies had 12 AA HC-CDR3s with two aromatic amino acids that engage an epitope comprising a hydrophobic patch opened-up by early Omicron lineage mutations and conserved in subsequent variants. Immunization of our prior, shorter CDR3-based model, elicited slightly less potent neutralizing antibodies that bound the same Omicron epitope, and were similar in all other aspects to those from the long, fully human CDR3 model. One tested antibody from each set reduced lung viral titers in a mouse-adapted BQ1.1 challenge. The antibodies we describe are related in their epitope recognition to recently described antibodies from Omicron-infected humans. These studies validate the utility of single human V\n                    H\n                    - and Vκ-rearranging mice for discovering humanized antibodies that neutralize emerging pathogens."},{"t":"政策驱动的战略性绿色技术创新路径：韩国氢和碳捕获、利用和储存 (CCUS) 案例","d":"2026-03-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"政策监管","tp":"氢能碳捕获","sc":1.8,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1,"r":3,"d":2,"t":2},"as":""},{"t":"氢能供应链优化助力高耗能行业脱碳：多时间尺度滚动时域方法","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003843?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"工业氢能供应","kp":["[应用]: 脱碳工业氢气供应优化","[方法]: 多时间尺度滚动时域"],"sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Optimization of hydrogen supply operations for decarbonizing energy-intensive industries: A multi-timescale rolling horizon approach"},{"t":"识别癌症治疗靶点：Cell-SELEX 识别出用于适体介导的生长抑制的膜蛋白","d":"2026-03-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514681123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The identification of functional ligand-membrane protein interactions under native conditions remains a major challenge in cancer biology. Using cell-systematic evolution of ligands by exponential enrichment, we identified a high-affinity DNA aptamer, CW06, against breast cancer cells. To precisely identify its native membrane target, we developed Aptamer-mediated Metabolic Glycan-labeling Proximity Hybridization (Apt-MGPH), which revealed the mitochondrial solute carrier SLC25A24 as the specific target. Unexpectedly, CW06 treatment upregulated SLC25A24 expression, disrupting methionine metabolism, depleting cytosolic SAM, and inducing G1 cell cycle arrest and senescence via the p21–HMGA1 axis. In mouse xenograft models, CW06 significantly inhibited tumor growth without affecting healthy tissues. Targeted degradation of SLC25A24 reverses these effects, confirming its regulatory role in the metabolism–senescence axis. Our study establishes Apt-MGPH as a robust tool for membrane target identification and highlights aptamer-induced target overexpression as a strategy for cancer therapy.","tp":"癌症治疗靶","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":4,"d":6,"t":5.5},"as":"癌症治疗中，在天然条件下识别功能性配体-膜蛋白相互作用仍是重大挑战。研究利用Cell-SELEX技术筛选出高亲和力DNA适体CW06，靶向乳腺癌细胞，并开发了适体介导代谢糖标记近邻杂交（Apt-MGPH）技术，精确定位其天然膜靶标为线粒体载体蛋白SLC25A24，为适体介导的肿瘤生长抑制提供了新靶点。"},{"t":"Fe-NC诱导Co 3d轨道电子离域构建电子桥加速多硫化物转化","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70862?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池催化剂","kp":["催化剂[Li-S多硫化物转化]: Fe-NC@ZnCo2O4异质结构","[电子调控]: Fe-NC诱导Co 3d轨道电子离域构建电子桥"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究利用Fe-NC催化剂诱导Co 3d轨道电子离域化，构建电子桥加速锂多硫化物（LiPSs）的转化反应。锂硫电池中Li2Sx向Li2S的液-固转化动力学缓慢，严重制约倍率性能和循环稳定性。Fe-NC中的铁中心通过电子耦合调控邻近Co位点的电子结构，使Co的d轨道电子分布趋于离域，增强对多硫化物的吸附和催化裂解能力。该电子桥机制为设计高效双中心电催化剂提供了新的电子结构调控范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Fe‐NC Induced Electron Delocalization of Co 3d‐Orbital Constructing an Electron Bridge for Accelerated Transformation of Polysulfides","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The liquid‐solid conversion of lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) to Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    2\n                    /Li\n                    2\n                    S (Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    x\n                    ⇄Li\n                    2\n                    S) impedes the sulfur reduction reaction (SRR) in lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries due to the slow kinetics and a high energy barrier. Herein, a heterostructure catalyst composed of Fe‐NC modified ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (Fe‐NC@ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    ) is designed to accelerate LiPSs conversion (especially, Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    ⇄Li\n                    2\n                    S) via modulating the electron environment of the central atomic 3d‐orbital. Based on experimental results and DFT calculations, the introduction of Fe‐NC induces electron delocalization in the Co 3d orbital and eliminates the original bandgap of ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (1.98 eV). These delocalized electrons serve as electronic active centers, strengthening coupling between the metal 3d orbital and S\n                    n\n                    2\n                    −\n                    species in LiPSs and resulting in faster LiPSs redox kinetics. As a result, the S/Fe‐NC@ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    cathode delivers a high capacity of 1449.7 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 0.1C and outstanding cycling stability with a decay rate of 0.057% per cycle over 600 cycles at 1.0C. Even under a high sulfur loading of 8.97 mg cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    , a remarkable capacity of 917.5 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    is achieved. This work provides deep insights into orbital modulation for designing high‐performance Li–S catalysts."},{"t":"涡轮电推进eVTOL环保能量管理策略：基于改进TD3耦合燃油经济性、电池健康与全生命周期碳排放","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003764?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航空","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电动飞行器能量管理","kp":["[方法]: 改进TD3算法","[耦合]: 燃油经济性+电池健康+碳排放","[应用]: 涡电eVTOL能量管理"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Eco-friendly energy management strategy for turbo-electric eVTOLs: Coupling fuel economy, battery health and life-cycle emissions via improved TD3"},{"t":"供体-双受体共价有机框架的主辅双功能位点设计增强16电子硫反应动力学过程","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70864?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池催化剂","kp":["催化剂[Li-S电池硫反应]: 给体-双受体COF(D-A1-A2)","[催化策略]: 分级催化链加速16电子硫反应动力学"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究设计供体-双受体（Donor-Biacceptor）型共价有机框架（COF），含主-辅双功能催化位点，加速锂硫电池中16电子硫反应动力学过程。锂硫电池理论比能量高，但多步电化学转化涉及多相界面，催化位点不足导致转化效率低。该COF通过供体-受体电子推拉效应增强催化中心电子密度，主位点负责捕获多硫化物、辅位点促进其还原裂解，协同降低反应能垒，显著提升高倍率下硫利用率。","dp":1,"ot":"Design Donor‐Biacceptor Covalent Organic Framework with Primary‐Auxiliary Functional Sites for Enhanced 16‐Electron Sulfur Kinetic Reaction Process","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The catalytic conversion of lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) is crucial for realizing high‐energy‐density lithium–sulfur batteries. Herein, we propose a molecular cooperate engineering strategy to construct a hierarchical catalytic reaction chain for addressing the complex sulfur phase transitions and sluggish 16‐electron reaction kinetics. A covalent organic framework with a D‐A1‐A2 electronic structure was developed to generate a built‐in electric field (BIEF) via establishing intramolecular charge transfer (ICT) between bipolar functional groups. Theoretical calculations and in situ characterizations confirm that primary and auxiliary functional groups of COF can synergistically enable selective LiPSs capture while the BIEF‐facilitated electron transfer accelerates redox reactions of LiPSs, conferring reduced conversion energy barriers and mitigated shuttle effect. Moreover, the anchoring of the ─NO\n                    2\n                    group and hence the effect of the ─CF\n                    3\n                    group induce directional Li\n                    +\n                    deposition, ensuring the favored Li plating with epitaxial layered growth and suppressed dendrite formation. As a result, the Li symmetric cell demonstrates an ultra‐long lifespan (&gt;16 000 h at 5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    ) while Li–S batteries can achieve exceptional cycling stability (0.039% capacity decay per cycle over 1000 cycles). Meanwhile, the pouch cells deliver a high energy density of 395.6 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    with 90.2% capacity retention over cycling. This work presents a generalizable strategy for advancing multi‐electron redox systems."},{"t":"高温运行条件下甲脒-铯金属卤化物钙钛矿太阳能电池中阳离子偏析与挥发损失解析","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02011-y","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿太阳能电池","kp":["T90[FA-Cs钙钛矿连续光照]: ~2700h","[退化转变温度]: 106°C以上阳离子偏析主导","[界面策略]: CsI3薄层抑制FAI挥发"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究在高温运行条件下解耦甲脒-铯（FA-Cs）金属卤化物钙钛矿太阳能电池中的阳离子偏析和挥发损失问题。FAXCs1-xPbI3组分在高温下FA阳离子易挥发、Cs阳离子易偏析聚集，导致相分离和效率衰减。研究通过表面FAXCs1-xPbI3层有效抑制FAI挥发，维持阳离子分布均匀性，显著提升高温工况下的相稳定性与器件寿命，为钙钛矿电池在炎热气候条件下的实际部署提供关键稳定性解决方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Decoupling cation segregation and volatile loss in formamidinium–caesium metal halide perovskite solar cells under high-temperature operating conditions","b":"Formamidinium–caesium lead iodide (FAXCs1-XPbI3, 0 x 2) layer effectively suppresses FAI loss, maintaining cation-segregation-dominated degradation beyond 106 °C. Moreover, introducing trace CsI3 in perovskite precursor enhances cation homogeneity in as-prepared films, dramatically extending the device T90 (time to 90% of maximum efficiency) to ~2,700 h under continuous 1-sun illumination (1.0% UV) at 85 °C. The extrapolated T90 at 45 °C exceeds 50 years by assuming a same degradation pathway. These findings elucidate the temperature-dependent degradation pathways in formamidinium–caesium perovskites and provide practical strategies to enhance their operational stability."},{"t":"电催化CO2转化过程中单原子催化剂上中间体相互作用模式解析","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS00621J","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子CO2电催化","kp":["催化剂[电催化CO2还原]: 单原子催化剂","[研究重点]: 中间体相互作用模式决定活性选择性"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究揭示单原子催化剂在电催化CO2转化反应中中间体的相互作用模式。电催化CO2转化可将碳排放转化为燃料和高价值化学品，但催化剂活性位点上多个中间体（如COOH*、CO*、CHO*）的吸附构型与能垒关系复杂。通过密度泛函理论计算结合实验表征，系统分析不同金属中心（Fe、Co、Ni等）单原子位点上中间体的覆盖度效应与偶合机制，为理性设计高选择性CO2还原单原子催化剂提供理论判据。","dp":1,"ot":"Deciphering the interaction patterns of intermediates on single atom catalysts during electrocatalytic CO2 conversion reactions","b":"Electrocatalytic CO2 conversion (CO2CR) offers a promising route for addressing carbon emissions while simultaneously generating valuable chemical feedstocks. Single-atom catalysts (SACs) have attracted significant attention due to their maximized metal atom utilization and precisely defined coordination architectures. Accumulating evidence indicates that CO2CR over SACs is jointly governed by the intrinsic properties of the central metal atom and the surrounding coordination environment. In this review, we present a comprehensive analysis of the hierarchical coordination environments surrounding the central metal center, encompassing monoelement and bielement coordination in the first coordination sphere, second coordination sphere modulation by neighboring non-metallic and metallic species, and engineering of the beyond-second coordination sphere via functional-group grafting and distal substrate functionalization. We further elucidate the nature of catalytically active sites and systematically categorize intermediate binding behaviors into single-site, step-by-step, simultaneous and cross-substrate intermediate binding modes, highlighting how tailored intermediate interactions regulate reaction kinetics, suppress competing pathways, and steer product selectivity. Notably, we summarize recent advances demonstrating that SACs are not inherently confined to C1 products but also unlock complex coupling reactions through rationally designed multi-site interaction networks, yielding critical chemicals including C2+ products, urea, and others. This framework establishes SACs as a transformative platform for next-generation CO2CR through precise control of multiscale coordination environments, active sites, and intermediate interactions.","aip":1},{"t":"更正 Te 等人，使用非典型密码子的单剂量减毒活疫苗的广泛 β-CoV 免疫和传播阻断","d":"2026-03-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607878123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"更正 Li 等人的观点：功能异质瘤内 CD4+CD8+ 双阳性 T 细胞可以产生单阳性 T 细胞","d":"2026-03-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2606104123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"废微纳塑料转化为碳材料：可再生能源与环境应用新趋势","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003429?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"废塑料资源化","kp":["[资源化]: 废弃微/纳塑料转化为碳材料"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Conversion of waste micro/nano plastics into carbon materials: A new trend for renewable energy and environmental applications"},{"t":"趋同进化通过拟南芥中 BOR1 和 BOR2 的 SNP 和串联重复增加硼转运","d":"2026-03-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525676123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Boron (B) is a crucial micronutrient, particularly in volcanic soils where its deficiency hampers agriculture. Here, we investigate the genetic basis of leaf B accumulation in natural populations of\n                    Arabidopsis thaliana\n                    that colonized volcanic islands in Cape Verde. Using a combination of genome-wide association studies (GWAS) and mapping in a recombinant intercross population, we identified a case of convergent phenotypic evolution in which multiple variants in the two principal B transporter genes,\n                    BOR1\n                    and\n                    BOR2\n                    , increase leaf B accumulation in parallel. These include multiple tandem duplications at\n                    BOR1\n                    that arose independently in different populations. Overall, this study reveals a remarkable case of convergent evolution occurring within a relatively short time scale, where different types of de novo mutations at B efflux transporter genes achieve similar phenotypic outcomes. Further, our findings show that integrating recombinant populations with GWAS in natural populations can improve power to overcome allelic heterogeneity."},{"t":"窄带隙有机半导体实现色彩不变光热织物，用于可穿戴太阳能采集","d":"2026-03-24","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519334?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The increasing popularity of outdoor activewear has placed higher demands on its thermal comfort, multi‐functionality, and esthetics. Existing photothermal fabrics for cold weathers are based on visible light absorption, which limits color design options. Herein, a chromatic‐invariant photothermal material is developed and integrated onto fabrics to prepare novel photothermal clothing, achieving 4°C–8°C temperature increase within only 5 min under 1000 W m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    simulated solar irradiation. It exhibits strong absorption in the near‐infrared region and effectively converts the radiation into thermal energy, while maintaining the original visual colors of fabrics due to high reflectivity across the visible spectrum. Additionally, this photothermal material does not compromise the original functionality of fabrics and is suitable for application on various types of fabric materials. Furthermore, the prepared fabric achieves a sterilization rate exceeding 95.3% after only 20 min of irradiation under 1000 W m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    standard simulated solar light to ensure hygiene during outdoor activities. These results demonstrate a versatile wearable strategy with integrated functionality and aesthetic appeal for maintaining personal thermal comfort in cold‐weather outdoor scenarios.","tp":"光热可穿戴","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6,"t":5.5},"as":"针对冬季户外运动服对热舒适性和多功能性的需求，现有光热织物依赖可见光吸收限制了颜色设计。本研究开发了基于窄带隙有机半导体的色彩不变光热材料，仅吸收近红外光而反射可见光，集成到织物上制成新型光热服装，在5分钟内实现4-8°C升温，兼具保暖性和美观性。"},{"t":"用于在可见光区域产生低蓝光圆偏振光的宽带反射胆甾液晶","d":"2026-03-24","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72890?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In this work, a polymerizable chiral liquid‐crystal monomer was first synthesized from inexpensive biomass‐derived cholesterol through a simple transformation. Co‐assembling this chiral monomer with a polymerizable achiral liquid‐crystal monomer and followed by initiator‐free photopolymerization, yielded a cholesteric liquid‐crystal (CLC) material\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    featuring a broad reflection band in the visible region with blue‐selectivity. After removal of the quartz substrates, the material forms a flexible film with good thermal stability. Due to Bragg reflection, under transmission mode,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    efficiently converts 510–700 nm unpolarized light into right‐handed circularly polarized (\n                    R\n                    ‐CP) light with dissymmetry factors (\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    ) of −1.6 and even reaching up to −2.0. Placed behind achiral zero‐blue aqueous solutions,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    enabled multicolour zero‐blue circularly polarized photoluminescence, generating exclusively\n                    R\n                    ‐CP light with |\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    | values exceeding 1.6. Additionally, under reflection mode,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    efficiently converts unpolarized ambient light into 510–700 nm low‐blue left‐handed circularly polarized (\n                    L\n                    ‐CP) light. Therefore,\n                    YMZ‐5\n                    exhibited distinctly different colors under varying backgrounds and circular polarizers. Leveraging these behaviors, molecular logic gate and information encryption–decryption were realized. Furthermore, a conceptual design for a low‐blue circularly polarized display device was also demonstrated."},{"t":"质子交换膜燃料电池中运行条件参数引起的气体窜透现象分析综述","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003673?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"质子交换膜燃料电池","kp":["[问题]: PEMFC气体串透现象","[研究]: 操作条件参数对串透的影响"],"sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":4.5,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Analysis of operating condition parameters induced gas crossover phenomenon in proton exchange membrane fuel cells: A review"},{"t":"分子工程化电子选择性自组装单分子层增强倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池准费米能级分裂","d":"2026-03-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02025-6","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿电池界面","kp":["[界面策略]: 自组装单分子层减缓界面电荷提取","[物理机制]: 提升准费米能级分裂增大光电压"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究通过分子工程设计了一种电子选择性自组装单分子层（SAM），用于反式钙钛矿太阳能电池，显著提升了准费米能级劈裂（quasi-Fermi level splitting），从而实现更高的光电压。准费米能级劈裂是决定钙钛矿电池开路电压的核心物理量，传统界面修饰材料难以同时满足能级匹配和缺陷钝化的需求。该分子工程化SAM通过精准调控分子偶极矩和界面能级排列，有效减少了界面非辐射复合损失，提升了器件的光电转换效率。该成果为反式钙钛矿太阳能电池的界面工程提供了新策略，对推动高效稳定钙钛矿光伏商业化具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"A molecularly engineered electron-selective self-assembled monolayer enhances quasi-Fermi level splitting in inverted perovskite solar cells","b":"Maximizing quasi-Fermi level splitting is essential for achieving high photovoltage in perovskite solar cells. Conventional strategies that prioritize rapid charge extraction at the perovskite/fullerene interface, can deplete interfacial carrier populations, limiting quasi-Fermi level splitting and photovoltage. Here we demonstrate that rational interface design benefits for slowed extraction rate, preserving interfacial carriers while minimizing non-radiative recombination. We introduce 3PDPA, a molecularly engineered electron-selective self-assembled monolayer at the perovskite/C60 interface. 3PDPA slows electron extraction, anchors undercoordinated Pb2+ ions and forms stable six-membered hydrogen-bonded rings with FA+ cations, delivering robust passivation and excellent chemical stability. 3PDPA further enables π–π interactions with C60, improving interfacial contact and reducing potential fluctuations. Inverted cells incorporating 3PDPA achieve efficiencies of 26.82% for 1.53 eV bandgap cells and 21.2% for 1.77 eV bandgap cells, alongside a T90 lifetime of ~1,000 h under International Summit on Organic Photovoltaic Stability (ISOS-L-3) stress conditions."},{"t":"高效倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池研究进展：电荷传输、界面工程与稳定性","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00115","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"反式钙钛矿电池","kp":["PCE[倒置钙钛矿电池]: >27%（准稳态认证）","[综述维度]: 电荷传输/界面工程/稳定性"],"as":"倒置(p-i-n)结构钙钛矿太阳能电池凭借高光电转换效率和优异稳定性成为光伏研究焦点。本文综述了电荷传输层材料的最新进展，包括空穴/电子传输层优化、界面工程及缺陷钝化策略，重点分析了提升器件效率和长期稳定性的关键因素，为高效钙钛矿电池的工程化量产提供路径参考。","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Progress in High-Efficiency Inverted Perovskite Solar Cells: Charge Transport, Interface Engineering, and Stabili","b":"Inverted (p-i-n) perovskite solar cells (PSCs) have emerged as a focal point in photovoltaic research, combining high efficiency with long-term stability and offering a strong potential for tandem integration. Their quasi-steady-state certified power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) now exceed 27%, surpassing those of their regular (n-i-p) counterparts. Here, we review recent advances in high-performance p-i-n PSCs, highlighting strategies for the selection and optimization of charge-transport layers, regulation of perovskite crystallization, and design of interface engineering. Finally, we discuss the significant breakthroughs in the stability of p-i-n PSCs and provide an outlook on future directions that may guide the next stage of device optimization, thereby laying the foundation for the large-scale implementation of perovskite photovoltaics."},{"t":"集成微生物与酶的有机半导体水凝胶用于选择性太阳能CO2转化","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00205","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化CO2还原","kp":["[催化体系]: 有机半导体水凝胶整合微生物和酶","[优势]: 生物相容+高酶负载+产物易分离"],"as":"该研究将有机半导体水凝胶与微生物和酶集成，构建了一种新型半人工光合系统。有机半导体负责光捕获与电荷生成，微生物和酶则催化CO2固定反应，实现太阳能到化学能的高效转化。该生物-无机杂化策略为人工光合作用和碳中和提供了创新思路。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Organic Semiconducting Hydrogel with Integrated Microbes and Enzymes for Selective Solar CO2 Conversion","b":"Integrating synthetic light-harvesting materials with biological CO2-fixing catalysts offers a promising route to efficient and selective solar-to-chemical conversion under mild conditions. However, progress remains limited by the lack of photocatalytic materials that combine biocompatibility, strong electronic coupling with biocatalysts, high biocatalyst loading capacity, and facile product separation. Here we introduce an organic semiconducting hydrogel synthesized from a rationally designed conjugated polyelectrolyte featuring visible-light absorption, water-processability, and covalent cross-linkability. The resulting macroporous, positively charged hydrogel scaffold immobilizes both microbes and enzymes, promoting intimate abiotic–biotic interactions throughout the three-dimensional hydrogel matrix. This platform supports two distinct modes of sacrificial CO2 reduction: mediated electron transfer via photogenerated H2 to drive acetate synthesis in the microbe Clostridium ljungdahlii, and direct electron transfer from photoexcited polymer domains to the isolated enzyme formate dehydrogenase for formate synthesis. By coupling the molecular programmability of organic semiconductors with the selectivity of biocatalysts, this work establishes a versatile class of soft biohybrid materials for solar fuel production through semiartificial photosynthesis."},{"t":"X射线预激活可逆持续发光可实现深部肿瘤的光动力免疫治疗","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-71028-4","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Persistent luminescence is a promising approach for photodynamic therapy (PDT) in deep-seated tumors, as it provides sustained light within tissues, eliminating the need for continuous external illumination. However, the uncontrollability of light within the body complicates precise spatiotemporal regulation. In this study, we report X-ray preactivated elimusertib-loaded tumor-targeted photodynamic nanoparticles (ETPNs), featuring reversible “on-off” afterglow properties. The excellent afterglow properties of X-ray-activated porous NaYF4:Er@NaGdF4 persistent luminescence nanoparticles enable the continuous activation of chlorin e6 (Ce6) to generate reactive oxygen species (ROS), leading to DNA damage. The integration of elimusertib potentiates ROS-induced DNA damage and activates the cGAS-STING pathway, thereby enhancing immuno-photodynamic therapeutic efficacy. All in vivo experiments were conducted using female mice. Our findings highlight the potential of ETPNs to advance the therapeutic landscape for deep-seated tumors, offering a robust and controllable platform for combined immuno-photodynamic therapy.","tp":"肿瘤光动力","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"as":"深部肿瘤的光动力治疗（PDT）受限于组织内光源不可控问题。本研究开发了X射线预激活的elimusertib负载肿瘤靶向光动力纳米粒子，具有可逆\"开关\"式余辉发光特性。X射线预先激活后可在体内持续发光，无需外部持续照射，实现了深部肿瘤光动力免疫治疗的精确时空调控。","aip":1},{"t":"宽温域锂离子电池：克服电化学挑战的材料创新与设计策略","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003557?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"宽温锂电池","kp":["[应用场景]: 宽温域锂离子电池"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Wide-temperature Lithium-ion batteries: Material innovations and design strategies for overcoming electrochemical challe"},{"t":"城市发展与能源转型：来自中国城市的证据","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001643?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"城市能转型","sc":1.9,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":1,"r":3,"d":3,"t":2.5},"as":""},{"t":"意外延误：绿色技术、金融和能源转型","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001953?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"绿色转型路","sc":1.5,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1,"r":3,"d":2,"t":2},"as":""},{"t":"化石燃料的衰落和寻找可行的替代品：对生物柴油、电力和沼气的严格审查","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002990?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"化石替代品","sc":2.4,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":2,"r":3.5,"d":4,"t":2.5},"as":""},{"t":"四苯乙烯功能化锆金属有机框架实现多碘化物限域以提升高性能碘基器件性能","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72860?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌碘电池正极材料","kp":["催化剂[Zn-I₂电池]: 四苯乙烯功能化Zr-MOF","[合成策略]: 配体延伸+可控刻蚀增加活性位点","[功能]: 多碘化物限域"],"as":"开发基于四苯乙烯功能化的锆基金属有机框架材料，利用TPE基团的聚集诱导发光（AIE）特性实现光催化性能调控。通过调节MOF形貌和结构，实现对光吸收、电荷传输和活性位点的精准控制，为高效光催化反应提供新策略。该材料在传感、催化和光电器件领域具有广阔应用前景。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Tetraphenylethylene‐Functionalized Zirconium Metal‐Organic Frameworks Enabling Polyiodide Confinement for High‐Performan","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Tunable morphology and structure of metal‐organic frameworks (MOFs) are critical for tailoring their physical‐chemical characteristics and electrochemical functionality. In this work, a ligand extension strategy combined with a controlled etching process is employed in designing and synthesizing zirconium‐based MOFs (Zr‐MOFs). These structural optimizations increase active sites exposure and improve accessibility to π‐conjugated transport channels. The obtained tetraphenylethylene‐based Zr‐MOFs exhibit excellent iodine adsorption capacity and strong confinement of polyiodides, enabling their use as cathode hosts in aqueous zinc‐iodine batteries. The π‐conjugated tetraphenylethylene ligand further increases the capacitance of batteries by promoting rapid electron dispersion and charge storage within the extended conjugated frameworks. In situ Raman spectroscopy and theoretical analyses reveal that the combination of physical confinement and chemical absorbance effects effectively stabilizes iodine species and governs the charge‐discharge mechanism. As a result, the M4/I\n                    2\n                    cathode exhibits excellent cycling stability, high multiplicity capacity, and reversible iodine redox kinetics. This research provides a generalizable strategy for constructing MOFs with controlled morphology and structure, offering new insights for the design of future high‐performance aqueous battery systems."},{"t":"自旋轨道耦合超导体中磁性杂质的超电流控制自发铁磁性","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70968-1","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Conventional superconductors disfavor ferromagnetism because the supercurrent-carrying electrons are paired into anti-parallel spin singlets. Consequently, ferromagnetic coupling between localized moments through the charge carriers is absent in s-wave superconductors. However, Rashba-type spin-orbit coupling (SOC) can profoundly alter the interaction between the charge carriers and localized spins. Here, we report long-range ferromagnetic order among the impurity moments on the surface of an s-wave SOC superconductor, Fe(Se, Te). We employ scanning superconducting quantum interference device microscopy and find suppressed vortex states but spontaneous magnetic domains in the superconducting state. Homogeneous remanent flux patterns are induced by applying supercurrents through the sample. The patterns are consistent with anomalous edge and bulk supercurrents generated by long-range in-plane magnetization related to the magneto-electric effect intrinsic to a Rashba superconductor. The anomalous supercurrents occur above a bias current threshold and follow hysteresis loops reminiscent of those of a ferromagnet. Surprisingly, the magnetic switching (super)current density is three orders of magnitude less than that in a ferromagnetic metal with SOC. These observations suggest an emergent ferromagnetic impurity state in a Rashba superconductor, which can be controlled by applying supercurrents.","tp":"超导铁磁性","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":6,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究发现了自旋轨道耦合（SOC）超导体中磁性杂质的超电流可控制自发铁磁性的新现象。传统超导体中，电子以反平行自旋单态配对，不利于铁磁性产生。然而，Rashba型自旋轨道耦合能显著改变电荷载流子与局域自旋之间的相互作用。研究团队在s波超导体表面观察到杂质磁矩的长程铁磁有序现象，这一发现为超导自旋电子学提供了新思路。"},{"t":"能源用自修复聚合物：分子机理、材料设计与电网级可靠性","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003144?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"自修复聚合物","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Self-healing polymers for energy applications: molecular insights, material design, and grid-scale reliability"},{"t":"锌离子电池阳极/电解质界面原位调控策略研究进展","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003417?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锌电池界面调控","kp":["[界面工程]: 锌离子电池负极/电解质界面原位调控"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Research progress on in-situ strategies for modulating the anode/electrolyte interface in zinc-ion batteries"},{"t":"水力-氢能主导的混合能源系统重新调度以适应生态不确定性","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003521?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水电氢耦合系统","as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Reoperation of hydro–hydrogen–dominated hybrid energy systems to adapt to ecological uncertainty"},{"t":"光催化分解水制氢微反应器中气泡动力学与脱离机制研究进展","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003053?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光解水气泡动力学","kp":["[机理]: 光催化分解水微反应器气泡动力学与脱附"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Recent progress in bubble dynamics and detachment mechanisms of photocatalytic water splitting microreactors for H₂ prod"},{"t":"质子转移调控的萘酰亚胺光固化持久室温磷光","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70999-8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光固化室温磷光","kp":["[室温磷光]: 萘酰亚胺光固化RTP(兼引发剂)","[调控]: 质子转移调控磷光"],"as":"本文报道了一种基于质子转移调控的光固化室温磷光（RTP）新材料体系。室温磷光材料因长寿命发射和激发态特性在信息安全、生物成像等领域具有应用潜力，但光固化型RTP材料鲜有报道。研究利用质子转移机制调控三线态激子的生成与稳定，通过紫外光聚合实现高分子基体中发光中心的固定，获得高发光强度和长寿命（秒级）的室温磷光。该策略为柔性可打印磷光器件的设计提供了新思路。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Proton transfer regulated photocured robust room-temperature phosphorescence from naphthalimide","b":"Photocured room-temperature phosphorescence (RTP) materials have considerable potential applications but are rarely reported. Here, we reported photocured RTP materials from naphthalimide, which simultaneously acts as RTP chromophore and photo-initiator. Specifically, naphthalimide generates radicals to polymerize acrylic acid and acrylamide upon UV irradiation. The resulting naphthalimide is tightly restricted in in-situ formed crosslinked matrix to achieve robust RTP (τp = 389.58 ms, φp = 17.83%, water and organic solvents resistance). Significantly, carboxyl can bind onto lone-pair electrons of tertiary amine in naphthalimide through proton transfer hydrogen-bonds (PTHBs), inhibiting nonradiative decay of S1 induced by photoinduced electron transfer (PET); increasing spin-orbit coupling (SOC) to promote intersystem crossing (ISC); cooperating with intermolecular hydrogen-bonds afford rigid microenvironment to stabilize triplet excitons. Moreover, afterglow colors are continuously tuned after loading different mass RhB via energy transfer. The as prepared materials are used as RTP inks for fabricating 3D printing and photopatterning for anti-counterfeiting and information encryption applications."},{"t":"光伏预测驱动的带储能太阳能微电网决策支持系统","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003375?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏预测微电网","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"PV forecasting-driven decision-support for solar microgrids with battery storage"},{"t":"低碳微电网中多时段储能在线调度：可解释参考学习方法","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003776?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微电网储能调度","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Online dispatch of multi-duration energy storage in low-carbon microgrid with explainable reference learning"},{"t":"应对能源困境：整合技术创新和数字化转型以获得可持续解决方案","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003697?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源数字化","sc":1.4,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1,"r":2.5,"d":2,"t":2},"as":""},{"t":"有机电致发光中的多尺度电荷转移","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519387?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organic light‐emitting diodes (OLEDs) have witnessed remarkable advances in both materials science and device engineering over the past three decades. Owing to their intrinsic advantages, including excellent flexibility, low driving voltage, wide viewing angles, broad color gamut, and high electroluminescent efficiency, OLEDs have successfully transitioned from laboratory to commercial applications. The key is the generation and utilization of excitons, which are bound electron–hole pairs formed within organic emitters, which play a decisive role in determining the energy efficiency of OLED‐based display and lighting technologies. In particular, triplet excitons generated through charge‐transfer processes are particularly important, as they critically influence the electroluminescent performance of state‐of‐the‐art OLED devices. In this review, charge transfer mechanisms operating in organic emitters are systematically discussed and summarized, encompassing both intermolecular and intramolecular interactions, as well as short‐ and long‐range charge‐transfer processes in organic emitters. By comparing these different interaction modes, we establish a comprehensive perspective on how charge transfer governs exciton formation and emission behavior. Furthermore, a detailed structure–property relationship is analyzed, offering mechanistic insights that are intended to guide the rational molecular design of next‐generation high‐performance materials and devices.","tp":"有机发光材","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":5,"t":3.5},"as":"该研究综述了有机电致发光二极管（OLED）中多尺度电荷转移的最新进展。OLED凭借优异的柔韧性、低驱动电压、宽视角和高电致发光效率等优势，已实现从实验室到商业应用的跨越。研究的核心在于激子的产生和利用，激子作为束缚态电子-空穴对，其行为直接影响器件性能。文章深入探讨了OLED材料科学和器件工程在过去三十年取得的重要突破，为下一代发光技术发展指明了方向。"},{"t":"具有高色彩纯度和视觉舒适度的高效蓝色 OLED 的多共振骨架工程","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72845?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Blue multi‐resonance thermally activated delayed fluorescence (MR‐TADF) materials necessitate high color purity along with visual comfort for their commercialization in organic light‐emitting diodes (OLEDs). Given that the slight adjustments in the MR‐TADF molecular structure commonly lead to significantly alter the emission spectrum, there is an urgent need to develop strategies for fine‐tuning spectral characteristics. Herein, an effective design strategy is proposed to develop blue MR‐TADF materials by integrating primary MR skeleton with auxiliary regulation unit, and through modulate the structure of auxiliary regulation unit, three MR‐TADF materials are designed and synthesized. The emission wavelengths of these emitters are gradually blue‐shifted from 466 to 458 nm accompanied by small full width at half‐maximum and negligible shoulder peak. The drastic changes in excited‐state dynamics of these emitters are recorded and the underlying mechanisms are systematically investigated and elucidated. High‐performance deep‐blue OLEDs are achieved based on CBN‐P, which provide an electroluminescence peak at 464 nm, Commission Internationale de L'Eclairage coordinates of (0.131, 0.088), a maximum external quantum efficiency (\n                    η\n                    ext\n                    ) of 22.4%. Besides, the CBN‐A‐based blue OLEDs attain a maximum\n                    η\n                    ext\n                    of 30.2%, which is further augmented to 37.4% upon sensitization, representing one of the best blue MR‐TADF OLEDs reported so far.","tp":"蓝光OLED材料","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本文探讨了蓝色多共振热激活延迟荧光（MR-TADF）材料在OLEDs商业化应用中的关键挑战。为满足高色彩纯度和视觉舒适度的需求，研究人员提出了一种有效的分子骨架工程设计策略。由于MR-TADF分子结构的微小变化会显著影响其发射光谱，该策略旨在精细调控材料的光谱特性，以实现更高效的蓝色OLED器件。这为下一代显示和照明技术的材料优化提供了重要参考。"},{"t":"建筑冷水机组与热泵系统建模方法：数字孪生应用背景下的系统性综述","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002849?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"热泵数字孪生","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.5,"t":2.0},"ot":"Modeling methods for chiller and heat pump systems in buildings: A systematic review in the context of digital twin appl"},{"t":"基于动态盐析策略的机械可编程离子凝胶","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523597?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可编程离子凝胶","kp":["电解质[离子凝胶]: ChCl-PAA","结构调控剂[离子凝胶]: CaCl₂动态盐析","[机制]: 盐析构建晶域锁定架构","[特性]: 机械可编程"],"as":"该研究提出一种动态盐析（salting-out）策略，制备可在室温环境条件下机械强度可编程的离子凝胶（ionogels）。通过调节盐析过程，凝胶的力学性能可按需定制，满足柔性电子、软体机器人等领域对可编程机械性能材料的需求。该策略避免了传统方法对复杂合成条件的依赖，有望推动环境适应性智能材料的工程化应用。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Mechanically Programmable Ionogels through a Dynamic Salting‐Out Strategy","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Gels exhibiting mechanically programmable strength under ambient conditions are essential for advancing flexible electronic devices. Here, a mechanically programmable ionogel based on choline chloride and poly(acrylic acid) (ChCl‐PAA) is presented, with CaCl\n                    2\n                    being a key structural modulator. Using a dynamically controlled salting‐out strategy, a crystal‐domain–locking architecture is formed that enhances mechanical strength. The cooling rate governs the resulting microstructure and mechanical properties, rapid cooling at −20°C min\n                    −1\n                    generates numerous defective CaCl\n                    2\n                    lattices, that effectively induce interpenetration of PAA chains via coordination and establish localized “crystal locks”, producing a rigid network (Young's modulus 448 ± 14.21 MPa). Conversely, a slow cooling at −2°C min\n                    −1\n                    promotes the growth of large‐sized densely packed CaCl\n                    2\n                    crystals, reduces polymer–crystal coupling, and yields to phase‐separated morphologies. Accordingly, the slowly cooled ionogel exhibits a remarkably high elongation at break (687 ± 18%) and a markedly reduced Young's modulus (11.6 ± 1.15 MPa). Overall, this dynamically controlled salting‐out strategy enables reversible hierarchical modulus regulation range spanning four orders of magnitude. This capability supports applications in reprogrammable adaptive devices, humidity‐driven energy harvesters, rapid‐response fire alarms, and bistable sensors that switch between rigid and ductile states. These findings provide a versatile design strategy for adaptive polymer–inorganic hybrid systems with mechanically programmable strength, electrical conductivity, and multifunctional stimulus responsiveness."},{"t":"短期电力需求预测与可解释AI的关联：建筑能源应用综述","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003107?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电力负荷预测","kp":["[综述]: 短期电力需求预测与可解释AI结合"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":2.5,"d":6.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"Linking short-term electricity demand forecasting and explainable AI: A review for building energy applications"},{"t":"行业发展信号下的新能源创新投资：利用LLM me捕捉政策和市场信号","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001898?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源投资AI","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"子宫内暴露于基孔肯雅热和儿童死亡率：一项使用关联常规数据的基于人群的研究","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70786-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"观点评论","b":"Chikungunya exposure in-utero is linked to neonatal morbidity and neurodevelopmental effects. We examined the long-term morbidity associated with in-utero Chikungunya. This registry-based cohort study linked records of infants born in Brazil between 2015 and 2018, with all-cause first hospitalization and death as outcome. Infants were followed until the outcome, their third birthday, or the end of the study. Adjusted stratified Cox models were used to estimate hazard ratios (HR), 95% confidence intervals (95% CIs), and absolute risk differences. A total of 1,821 exposed and 18,210 unexposed infants were included. The HR for hospitalization was 1.21 (95% CI: 1.11–1.36), corresponding to 37 excess hospitalizations per 1000 exposed (95% CI: 16-64). The risk was twofold for intrapartum exposure (HR 2.08, 95% CI: 1.33–3.44) and elevated for first- and second-trimester exposure. Evidence for risk of death was limited. Here we show an elevated hospitalization risk associated with in-utero Chikungunya exposure."},{"t":"循环红细胞的体内代谢标记和靶向","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-71013-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Engineering red blood cells (RBCs) has been widely explored for drug delivery, imaging, vaccination, and other applications. However, effective strategies to directly engineer RBCs in vivo are still lacking. Here, we report successful metabolic glycan labeling of RBCs in vivo. We demonstrate that systemically administered azido-sugars can metabolically label circulating RBCs with azido groups, through labeling of both mature RBCs and RBC precursor cells. The surface azido tags on RBCs can persist for over 42 days in female mice (nearly the lifespan of RBCs), while tags on leukocytes decay to negligible levels within 3 days. Azido-labeled RBCs can covalently capture dibenzocyclooctyne-bearing cargos in vivo via click chemistry, extending cargo circulation from hours to over 35 days. This RBC tagging and targeting technology can improve fluorescence imaging of blood vessels, enable long-term MRI of brain vasculatures with a single gadolinium dose, and improve the pharmacokinetics of drugs."},{"t":"锂离子电池电极级老化诊断的阻抗表征：批判性综述","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003880?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锂电池阻抗诊断","dp":1,"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":6.5,"t":2.5},"as":"","ot":"Impedance characterization for electrode-level aging diagnosis of lithium-ion battery: A critical review"},{"t":"火炬气制氢：将排放转化为能源的双重机遇——前瞻性综述","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"火炬气制氢","kp":["[主题]: 火炬气制氢(排放转能源)"],"dp":1,"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":2.5},"as":"","ot":"Hydrogen production from flare gas: a dual opportunity to turn emissions into energy - a prospective review"},{"t":"印度各邦在电力脱碳方面表现如何？地方层面基于消费的分解分析","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001473?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"电力脱碳","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"能源系统模型如何与现实世界的地平线悲剧保持一致？决策者短期影响","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003703?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源建模","sc":2.7,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"用于太阳能驱动能量转换的功能性金属配合物","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518393?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"金属配合物光能转换","kp":["[材料类型]: 功能性金属配合物","[优势]: 配体多样性致可调光电化学性质"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究基于消费侧分解分析方法，评估印度各邦电力脱碳进展。通过将碳排放变化分解为能源结构、能源强度、经济结构等因素，揭示了印度各邦在电力低碳转型中的差异和驱动因素。研究表明区域经济发展水平与脱碳进程密切相关，为发展中国家制定差异化减排政策提供了实证依据。","ot":"Functional Metal Complexes for Solar–Light‐Driven Energy Conversion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Solar energy conversion offers the advantage of being more environmentally friendly compared to the use of nuclear or fossil fuels. In recent years, metal complexes as functional materials have received extensive attention, and great progress has been made in energy storage and conversion. They usually possess tunable photoelectrochemical properties due to the diversity of organic ligands and metal centers. Moreover, the photophysical properties of metal complexes, particularly their strong ability to capture visible light and achieve long triplet state lifetimes, are essential for the effective utilization of these complexes in their practical applications. In this review, we examine the latest advancements in the design of the state‐of‐the art metal complexes and highlight key breakthroughs of these complexes, particularly in solar‐to‐electrical, ‐chemical, and ‐thermal energy conversion applications. We also address the current challenges and outline future directions for the development of functional metal complexes in the field of solar‐light‐driven energy conversion."},{"t":"交互式多能源市场的能量管理策略：新兴挑战的方法映射","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003855?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"多能源市场管理","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.5,"t":2.0},"ot":"Energy management strategies for interactive multi-energy markets: Mapping approaches to emerging challenges"},{"t":"排污权交易重塑中国电力行业脱碳路径","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003788?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"排污交易","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"界面耦合Ni/ZnO纳米网上页岩气直接光转化为液态含氧化合物","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72867?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"页岩气光转化","kp":["催化剂[页岩气光转化]: 界面耦合Ni/ZnO纳米网","产物[页岩气光转化]: 液态含氧化合物","[驱动方式]: 太阳能直接驱动"],"as":"该研究开发了界面催化策略，实现页岩气（甲烷、乙烷、丙烷混合物）在光催化条件下直接转化为液态含氧化合物（如甲醇、乙醇等）。传统天然气转化需高温高压的多步催化重整，能耗高且选择性差。该光转化路径利用界面工程修饰的催化剂，在温和条件下通过C-H键活化将短链烷烃选择性氧化为高附加值液态化学品，有望为页岩气资源的高效利用和替代传统石化路线开辟新途径。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Direct Photoconversion of Shale Gas into Liquid Oxygenates Over Interfacially Coupled Ni/ZnO Nanomesh","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Shale gas, a mixture of methane (CH\n                    4\n                    ), ethane (C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    6\n                    ), and propane (C\n                    3\n                    H\n                    8\n                    ), provides an alternative feedstock for producing chemicals in industry. As the increasing energy crisis and environmental concern, the conversion of shale gas to value‐added chemical in a sustainable manner has emerged as a new frontier yet remains great challenges. Herein, we realize the solar‐driven conversion of shale gas into alcohols over ZnO nanomeshes incorporated with Ni nanoparticles (Ni/ZnO NM) with oxygen and water. Specifically, the isopropanol yield from C\n                    3\n                    H\n                    8\n                    oxidation reaches 7.1 mmol  g\n                    −1\n                      h\n                    −1\n                    at a selectivity of 83.5%, with an apparent quantum efficiency (AQE) of 0.65% at 350 nm, surpassing the reported catalysts for propane‐to‐oxygenates. Moreover, both the selectivity of methanol and ethanol surpass 90% from solar‐driven CH\n                    4\n                    and C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    6\n                    oxidation. Impressively, a mixture of methane, ethane, and propane, the analogue of shale gas, can be selectively converted into methanol, ethanol, and isopropanol. Mechanism studies suggest the strong interaction induces electron transfer from ZnO to Ni and creates electron‐rich Ni sites and electron‐deficient oxygen vacancies (Vo) in ZnO NM. Under light irradiation, electron‐rich Ni sites and electron‐deficient Vo can serve as hole and electron acceptors, respectively, promoting the separation of photogenerated carriers and enhancing performance toward alkane oxidation."},{"t":"通过具有双交联网络的结构编程壳聚糖气凝胶实现不依赖凝血的止血","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523140?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Hemorrhage control remains a central unmet need in emergency medicine and surgery, as uncontrolled bleeding causes preventable mortality and is exacerbated by anticoagulation or coagulopathy, where many hemostats that depend on the coagulation cascade lose efficacy. Hierarchically structured, dual‐crosslinked ultra‐highly deacetylated chitosan (DC‐UDCS) aerogels enable rapid, coagulation‐independent hemostasis via a dual‐crosslinked hierarchical capillary–elastic memory (DC‐HCEM) mechanism. Directionally ice‐templated pore architectures provide fast capillary infiltration that unlocks reversible hydrogen‐bonded fixation, while covalent crosslinks store elastic energy to drive blood‐triggered, ultrafast self‐expansion and stable mechanical tamponade, physically occluding bleeding tracts and vessels. Concurrently, the cationic chitosan network promotes electrostatic erythrocyte aggregation and cellular adhesion, supporting sealing without requiring fibrin formation. In vitro and in vivo evaluations demonstrate rapid pressure generation and effective bleeding control in both normal and anticoagulated hemorrhage models, outperforming conventional gauze‐type controls, while maintaining intrinsic antibacterial activity and favorable hemocompatibility/biocompatibility. This architecture‐chemistry integrated aerogel platform provides a transferrable strategy for lifesaving hemostasis when coagulation is compromised.","tp":"壳聚糖气凝胶","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对不受控出血及抗凝血引发的急救难题，研究人员开发了一种具有双交联网络和分级结构的超高脱乙酰度壳聚糖（DC-UDCS）气凝胶。传统止血剂多依赖凝血级联反应，在凝血功能障碍患者中效果有限。该新型气凝胶利用独特的分级毛细管和弹性记忆机制，实现了快速且不依赖凝血的止血效果，为急诊和外科手术中的不可控出血提供了创新的解决方案。"},{"t":"细胞类型特异性免疫程序协调拟南芥叶表皮的空间防御","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70843-z","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Sessile plants rely on individual cells to perceive pathogens and coordinate defense. Guard cells (GCs), best known for regulating stomatal aperture, have poorly understood intrinsic immune roles. Here, we integrate single-cell and spatial analyses of Arabidopsis thaliana leaves infected with diverse phytopathogens, combining live and fixed imaging of transgenic immune reporters with single cell transcriptomic data. Powdery mildew infection triggers strong salicylic acid (SA) biosynthesis and transport in pavement cells, spreading to neighboring uninfected cells. In contrast, GCs fail to activate SA biosynthesis or SA-responsive genes. These cell-type-specific immune programs distinguishing GC and pavement cells are conserved across infections by the hemibiotrophic fungus Colletotrichum higginsianum and the bacterial pathogen Pseudomonas syringae. Despite impaired SA signaling and response, GCs display rapid calcium influx and pronounced reactive oxygen species bursts, transmitting immune signals to adjacent pavement cells via the apoplast. Notably, GCs are incompatible with adapted fungal pathogens and underwent hypersensitive cell death. Together, these findings uncover distinct immune programs among epidermal cell types, highlight GC-autonomous defense mechanisms, and provide a framework for understanding spatial immune coordination in plants.","tp":"植物免疫","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"植物依靠单一细胞感知病原体并协调防御，其中保卫细胞除了调节气孔外，其内在免疫机制尚不明确。本研究通过整合单细胞转录组学和空间分析技术，结合活体成像，研究了受多种病原体感染的拟南芥叶片。研究发现，白粉病感染会触发保卫细胞中强烈的 salicylic acid 生物合成。该研究揭示了植物叶表皮中细胞类型特异性的免疫程序如何协调空间防御，深化了对植物免疫机制的理解。"},{"t":"数据基础设施建设能否缓解清洁能源错配？——基于中国省级数据的分析","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001813?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"数据基建","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":4.5},"as":""},{"t":"通过诱导细胞焦亡和调节色氨酸实现神经胶质瘤相关骨髓细胞极化的双靶点纳米调节剂","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523021?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Since 2‐hydroxyglutarate (2‐HG) released from isocitrate dehydrogenase (IDH)‐mutant gliomas results in the strong immunosuppressive tumor microenvironment (TME), the immunotherapy effect is unsatisfactory. In this work, we develop a hybridized cell membrane of glioma‐macrophage cells (GMM) camouflaged bi‐target nanomodulator (LNO@CH/Ca\n                    3\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    , LCC) comprised of LaNiO\n                    3\n                    (LNO) core and Ca\n                    3\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    shell loaded with the aryl hydrocarbon receptor (AhR) antagonist (CH223191, CH), which can synergistically modulate glioma‐associated myeloid cells (GAM) polarization by inducing pyroptosis and regulating tryptophan metabolism to enhance the efficacy of IDH‐mutant gliomas immunotherapy. The hybrid cell membrane endows LCC@GMM with good blood brain barrier (BBB) penetration as well as dual homing ability to tumor cells and GAM. LCC@GMM not only induces pyroptosis in tumor cells by the production of cytotoxic reactive oxygen species (ROS) and the released La\n                    3\n                    +\n                    but also regulates tryptophan metabolism in GAM via the released CH, effectively overcoming the immunosuppressive effects of IDH‐mutant gliomas. The bi‐target synergistic regulation of GAM reshapes the immunosuppressive TME of IDH‐mutant gliomas and offers a novel idea for immunotherapy of IDH‐mutant gliomas.","tp":"纳米调节剂","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对IDH突变型神经胶质瘤释放的2-羟基戊二酸（2-HG）导致的强免疫抑制性肿瘤微环境（TME），研究人员开发了一种双靶点纳米调节剂。该系统采用神经胶质瘤-巨噬细胞杂交细胞膜（GMM）进行伪装，能够同时诱导细胞焦亡并调节色氨酸代谢。这种双管齐下的策略有效促进了神经胶质瘤相关骨髓细胞的极化，重塑了肿瘤微环境的免疫状态，显著提升了针对恶性脑胶质瘤的免疫治疗效果。"},{"t":"用于非分段闪烁体高分辨率3D粒子追踪的超快光场相机系统","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70918-x","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"粒子三维追踪","kp":["[成像技术]: 超快光场相机三维粒子径迹","[挑战]: 细分闪烁体读取通道成本高"],"as":"该研究开发了一套超快光场相机系统，用于在密集、大质量活性介质中实现高分辨率三维粒子追踪。中微子探测器、粒子量能器及部分暗物质探测器需要此类介质，而传统成像手段难以在其中实现精确的三维粒子运动轨迹重建。光场（plenoptic）技术通过多角度光信息捕捉，有望大幅提升粒子物理与天体物理实验中的事件探测与重建精度。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"An ultrafast plenoptic-camera system for high-resolution 3D particle tracking in unsegmented scintillators","b":"Neutrino detectors, particle calorimeters and some dark matter detectors require dense and massive active materials. An extremely fine segmentation is desirable to achieve precise three-dimensional particle tracking. However, such systems introduce significant challenges in construction and demand a large number of readout electronics channels, leading to extremely high costs. In this article, we propose an alternative approach to elementary particle detection that enables ultrafast three-dimensional high-resolution imaging in large volumes of unsegmented scintillator. Enabling technologies are plenoptic systems and time-resolving single-photon avalanche diode array imaging sensors. Together, they enabled us, using a plenoptic camera, to reconstruct the origin of single photons in the scintillator. A case study focused on neutrino detection demonstrates full event reconstruction with a spatial resolution of two hundred micrometres. This work paves the way for a class of particle detectors whose capabilities should be further enhanced through future developments and expanded to Cherenkov light detection, medical imaging and neutron detection."},{"t":"MXene-聚合物复合材料在尖端超级电容器与电磁屏蔽应用中的进展","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003119?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"MXene聚合物超容屏蔽","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Advances in MXene-Polymer Composites for Cutting-edge Supercapacitor and EMI Shielding Applications"},{"t":"激活 L-组氨酸生物合成作为抗结核分枝杆菌的新抗生素策略","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70510-3","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"The increasing prevalence of antimicrobial resistance is an important challenge that warrants new approaches to antibiotic development. Currently, all antibiotics inhibit biological processes. To explore whether activation of a biochemical pathway can elicit bactericidal effects we engineered variants of Mycobacterium tuberculosis ATP-phosphoribosyltransferase (ATP-PRT) that are resistant to allosteric inhibition by l-histidine, leading to supraphysiological activation of ATP-PRT and l-histidine overproduction. Upregulation of L-histidine biosynthesis significantly reduces the growth of M. tuberculosis in culture and causes a loss of fitness owing to nutrient and energy depletion. Moreover, the expression of allosteric variants in M. tuberculosis significantly reduced infections in human macrophages and in a mouse model of infection. Thus, metabolic activation represents a new mycobactericidal mechanism that could be applied to antimycobacterial drug discovery.","tp":"抗生素新策略","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"为应对日益严重的细菌耐药性挑战，本研究提出了一种全新的抗生素开发策略：通过激活特定生化途径来杀灭细菌。研究人员对结核分枝杆菌的ATP磷酸核糖基转移酶（ATP-PRT）进行工程化改造，使其能够抵抗L-组氨酸的变构抑制。这导致该酶及L-组氨酸生物合成途径被超生理性地激活，从而对结核分枝杆菌产生显著的杀菌效果。这一突破性发现表明，激活而非抑制细菌的生物途径，有望成为开发新型抗生素的有效途径。","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 高效倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池研究进展：电荷传输、界面工程与稳定性","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00115","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"反式钙钛矿电池","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"dp":1,"as":"能源系统模型如何与决策者短期主义倾向对齐是影响能源转型成效的关键问题。研究分析了政策制定中\"视野悲剧\"现象——决策者倾向于关注短期利益而忽视长期气候风险，评估了这种短期主义对能源系统建模和政策规划的影响，提出了改进模型与决策框架的建议。","ot":"[ASAP] Progress in High-Efficiency Inverted Perovskite Solar Cells: Charge Transport, Interface Engineering, and Stability","b":"Inverted (p-i-n) perovskite solar cells (PSCs) have emerged as a focal point in photovoltaic research, combining high efficiency with long-term stability and offering a strong potential for tandem integration. Their quasi-steady-state certified power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) now exceed 27%, surpassing those of their regular (n-i-p) counterparts. Here, we review recent advances in high-performance p-i-n PSCs, highlighting strategies for the selection and optimization of charge-transport layers, regulation of perovskite crystallization, and design of interface engineering. Finally, we discuss the significant breakthroughs in the stability of p-i-n PSCs and provide an outlook on future directions that may guide the next stage of device optimization, thereby laying the foundation for the large-scale implementation of perovskite photovoltaics."},{"t":"宽温域锂离子电池：克服极端环境电化学挑战的材料创新与设计策略","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003557?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"宽温锂电池材料","kp":["[宽温锂电池]: 材料创新与设计策略应对极端环境"],"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":3.0},"dp":1,"as":"","ot":"Wide-temperature Lithium-ion batteries: Material innovations and design strategies for overcoming electrochemical challenges in extreme environments"},{"t":"化石燃料的衰落与可行替代能源探索：全球社会政治和技术约束下生物柴油、电力和沼气能源系统的批判性综述","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002990?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"清洁能源替代","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.0},"dp":1,"as":"","ot":"The decline of fossil fuels and the search for viable alternatives: A critical review of biodiesel, electric, and biogas energy systems under global socio-political and technical constraints"},{"t":"四苯乙烯功能化锆金属有机框架实现多碘化物限域用于高性能锌碘电池","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72860?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌碘电池正极材料","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"dp":1,"as":"研究通过将四苯乙烯基团功能化引入锆基金属有机框架(MOFs)，利用其可调形态与多孔结构实现对多碘离子的有效限域，显著提升锌碘电池的电化学性能。该策略优化了碘活性物质的负载与转化效率，抑制多碘化物穿梭效应，为高性能水系锌碘电池正极设计提供了新思路。","ot":"Tetraphenylethylene‐Functionalized Zirconium Metal‐Organic Frameworks Enabling Polyiodide Confinement for High‐Performance Zinc‐Iodine Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Tunable morphology and structure of metal‐organic frameworks (MOFs) are critical for tailoring their physical‐chemical characteristics and electrochemical functionality. In this work, a ligand extension strategy combined with a controlled etching process is employed in designing and synthesizing zirconium‐based MOFs (Zr‐MOFs). These structural optimizations increase active sites exposure and improve accessibility to π‐conjugated transport channels. The obtained tetraphenylethylene‐based Zr‐MOFs exhibit excellent iodine adsorption capacity and strong confinement of polyiodides, enabling their use as cathode hosts in aqueous zinc‐iodine batteries. The π‐conjugated tetraphenylethylene ligand further increases the capacitance of batteries by promoting rapid electron dispersion and charge storage within the extended conjugated frameworks. In situ Raman spectroscopy and theoretical analyses reveal that the combination of physical confinement and chemical absorbance effects effectively stabilizes iodine species and governs the charge‐discharge mechanism. As a result, the M4/I\n                    2\n                    cathode exhibits excellent cycling stability, high multiplicity capacity, and reversible iodine redox kinetics. This research provides a generalizable strategy for constructing MOFs with controlled morphology and structure, offering new insights for the design of future high‐performance aqueous battery systems.","aip":1},{"t":"光催化分解水制氢微反应器气泡动力学与脱离机理研究进展：综述","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003053?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光催化分解水制氢","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.5,"t":4.0},"dp":1,"as":"","ot":"Recent progress in bubble dynamics and detachment mechanisms of photocatalytic water splitting microreactors for H₂ production: a review"},{"t":"应对能源三难困境：整合技术创新和数字化转型以获得可持续解决方案","d":"2026-03-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003697?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"能源可持续转型","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"建筑冷水机组与热泵系统建模方法：数字孪生应用背景下的系统性综述","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002849?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"热泵系统建模","kp":["[主题]: 制冷与热泵系统建模","[视角]: 数字孪生应用"],"sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":2.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Modeling methods for chiller and heat pump systems in buildings: A systematic review in the context of digital twin applications"},{"t":"产业发展信号下的新能源创新投资：基于LLM方法的政策与市场信号捕捉","d":"2026-03-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001898?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"LLM投资分析","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Innovative investment in new energy under industry development signals: Capturing policy and market signals using LLM method"},{"t":"印度各邦在电力脱碳方面表现如何？地方层面基于消费的分解分析","d":"2026-03-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001473?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"印度电力脱碳","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"能源系统模型如何与现实世界的地平线悲剧保持一致？决策者的短期偏见和暂时不一致的偏好的影响","d":"2026-03-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003703?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"能源模型决策","sc":2.3,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"神经胶质瘤相关骨髓细胞极化的双靶点纳米调节剂通过诱导细胞焦亡和调节色氨酸代谢重塑 IDH 突变神经胶质瘤的免疫抑制微环境","d":"2026-03-23","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523021?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Since 2‐hydroxyglutarate (2‐HG) released from isocitrate dehydrogenase (IDH)‐mutant gliomas results in the strong immunosuppressive tumor microenvironment (TME), the immunotherapy effect is unsatisfactory. In this work, we develop a hybridized cell membrane of glioma‐macrophage cells (GMM) camouflaged bi‐target nanomodulator (LNO@CH/Ca\n                    3\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    , LCC) comprised of LaNiO\n                    3\n                    (LNO) core and Ca\n                    3\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    shell loaded with the aryl hydrocarbon receptor (AhR) antagonist (CH223191, CH), which can synergistically modulate glioma‐associated myeloid cells (GAM) polarization by inducing pyroptosis and regulating tryptophan metabolism to enhance the efficacy of IDH‐mutant gliomas immunotherapy. The hybrid cell membrane endows LCC@GMM with good blood brain barrier (BBB) penetration as well as dual homing ability to tumor cells and GAM. LCC@GMM not only induces pyroptosis in tumor cells by the production of cytotoxic reactive oxygen species (ROS) and the released La\n                    3\n                    +\n                    but also regulates tryptophan metabolism in GAM via the released CH, effectively overcoming the immunosuppressive effects of IDH‐mutant gliomas. The bi‐target synergistic regulation of GAM reshapes the immunosuppressive TME of IDH‐mutant gliomas and offers a novel idea for immunotherapy of IDH‐mutant gliomas.","tp":"纳米肿瘤免疫","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本情报介绍了一种针对IDH突变型神经胶质瘤的新型双靶点纳米调节剂。IDH突变产生的2-HG会构建强免疫抑制微环境，导致常规免疫疗法失效。研究人员开发了由胶质瘤-巨噬细胞杂交膜伪装的纳米调节剂，能够精准靶向肿瘤并诱导骨髓细胞发生极化。该机制通过引发肿瘤细胞焦亡，并有效调节色氨酸代谢，成功重塑了免疫抑制性微环境，将其转变为抗肿瘤免疫状态。这一创新策略显著提升了针对IDH突变胶质瘤的免疫治疗效果。"},{"t":"端烯烃经非对映选择性分子内电催化氢胺化合成顺式氮丙啶","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4116549?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"烯烃电化学氮丙啶化","kp":["[合成方法]: 分子内电催化氢胺化","[产物]: cis-2,3-二取代氮丙啶"],"as":"该研究开发了一种从端基烯烃出发、通过分子内非对映选择性电化学（或亲电）氮宾环化反应合成cis-氮丙啶的新策略。氮丙啶是具有三元含氮杂环结构的重要合成砌块，在药物分子和天然产物构建中应用广泛。传统方法难以高选择性地获得顺式构型产物，该工作通过分子内策略实现了优异的非对映控制，为含氮杂环化合物的精准合成提供了通用且高效的新路径，有望推动手性胺类和生物活性分子的合成方法学发展。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"cis‐Aziridines From Terminal Alkenes via Diastereoselective Intramolecular Electrocatalytic Hydroamination","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Aziridines are valuable building blocks with broad synthetic and biological relevance, yet general strategies for accessing 2,3‐disubstituted aziridines from stereochemically undefined starting materials with predictable stereochemical outcomes remain scarce. Conventional diazo‐ and nitrene‐based aziridinations rely on hazardous precursors, tolerate limited substrate diversity, and deliver stereochemical outcomes that are largely dictated by the geometry of the starting materials. Here we report an electrocatalytic cobalt‐catalyzed hydroamination that converts readily available allylic sulfonamides into cis‐2,3‐disubstituted aziridines. Mechanistic experiments, together with density functional theory (DFT) analysis, support a model in which diastereoselectivity is established during solvent‐caged radical recombination rather than by the geometry of the starting alkene. The resulting cis‐aziridines also undergo predictable and synthetically useful derivatizations, highlighting their value as functional intermediates. This operationally simple and scalable protocol provides direct access to stereochemically enriched cis‐aziridines without recourse to diazo or nitrene chemistry."},{"t":"[ASAP] 揭示氟化γ-Al2O3中强Brønsted酸性的单中心起源","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21403","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氧化铝固体酸","kp":["[活性位点]: 氟修饰γ-Al2O3单点强Brønsted酸","改性元素[γ-Al2O3]: 氟和氯"],"as":"该研究揭示了氟化γ-氧化铝（γ-Al₂O₃）中强Brønsted酸性源自单一活性位点这一关键机制。精确调控γ-Al₂O₃的表面结构与酸性对其在催化裂化、异构化等工业应用至关重要。氟化处理可显著增强表面酸性，但其微观来源长期存在争议。研究团队通过结合先进表征手段与理论计算，精确定位了产生强Brønsted酸性的单一位点结构，为理性设计高性能固体酸催化剂提供了原子层面的设计依据。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Unraveling the Single-Site Origin of Strong Brønsted Acidity in Fluorinated γ-Al2O3","b":"Precise control of the surface structure and acidity of γ-Al2O3 materials is critical for advancing their applications as catalysts and catalyst supports, yet remains challenging owing to the structural complexity and dynamic evolution of aluminum hydroxyl moieties upon modification. Herein, we unveil the identity and evolution of the surface sites of fluorine- and chlorine-modified γ-Al2O3 using state-of-the-art solid-state NMR, combining high-field (up to 18.8 T), ultrafast MAS (up to 60 kHz), and multinuclear multidimensional correlation (1H-27Al, 19F-27Al, and 19F-31P, etc.) techniques, complemented by trimethylphosphine (TMP) probe adsorption. Notably, we unambiguously identify the intrinsic strong Brønsted acid site (BAS), present exclusively on fluorinated Al2O3, as a surface bridging hydroxyl bound to a stable, monofluoride-incorporated tetracoordinated aluminum center, denoted F1-AlIV-μ2-OH. This strong BAS shows a previously unrecognized structural resemblance to bridging acid sites in fluorinated zeolites, as corroborated by the convergence of 1H, 19F and 27Al NMR signatures, and exhibits exceptional stability toward air and moisture. The superior catalytic performance of F-Al2O3 in the octadecene conversion reaction further validates this acidity-performance relationship. Overall, this work helps to resolve the long-standing debates on the nature of surface acidity in alumina-based materials, establishes a structural benchmark for the targeted design of highly efficient fluorinated catalysts, and opens new avenues for precise acid-site engineering in heterogeneous catalysis."},{"t":"[ASAP] 二十面体核金属纳米团簇中的超快系间穿越","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00547","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Atomically precise metal nanoclusters (NCs) occupy a unique chemical regime between molecular chromophores and nanoscale materials, yet their excited-state relaxation pathways remain fundamentally unresolved. In particular, the timing and mechanistic role of triplet-state formation at the earliest stages of photoexcitation remain unclear, limiting the development of predictive structure-photophysics relationships. Here, we establish a revised mechanistic picture of excited-state energy dissipation in icosahedral-core metal NCs by directly resolving primary relaxation pathways previously inaccessible to experiment. By combining broadband transient absorption spectroscopy with femtosecond-nanosecond measurements, we show─using prototypical Au25, Ag25, and Au13 NCs as model systems─that ultrafast intersystem crossing on a sub-100 fs time scale rapidly populates triplet manifolds, as evidenced by distinct transient spectral signatures. Subsequent relaxation pathways diverge depending on cluster structure, with the flexibility of metallic staple motifs enabling additional vibrational relaxation channels prior to phosphorescence. These findings unify the excited-state energy dissipation framework of triplet-emissive NCs and provide mechanistic guidelines for the rational design of NC-based materials for energy conversion and photochemical applications.","tp":"金属纳米团簇","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本情报揭示了原子级精确的二十面体金属纳米团簇中超快系间穿越的微观动力学机制。金属纳米团簇作为介于分子发色团与纳米材料之间的独特化学体系，其激发态的能量耗散路径长期未被完全解析。该研究重点探明了在光激发最初阶段三重态形成的时间节点及其在能量弛豫中的机械作用。这一突破性发现修正了原有的激发态能量耗散机制模型，为建立可预测的“结构-光物理”关系提供了关键理论依据，对开发新型光电器件具有指导意义。"},{"t":"[ASAP] α-重氮磷叶立德的合成与分离","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01829","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Well-controlled generation and utilization of phosphorus-ylide-stabilized diazo compounds remain largely unexplored, despite their potential applications. Here, we report a general strategy that transforms Bestmann ylide derivatives into α-diazophosphonium ylide, triazole, or thiadiazole derivatives via reactions with organo-azides, enabling the first isolation of α-diazophosphonium ylide, species that combines the properties of classical ylides with diazo functionality. Its reactivity was examined with diverse E-H bonds across the p-block elements. DFT studies elucidate the factors governing product selectivity and the unique charge distribution that determines the subsequent reactivity. This work establishes α-diazophosphonium ylide as a new entry point into diazo chemistry and opens avenues for future applications in synthesis.","tp":"重氮磷叶立德","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种通用策略，通过将Bestmann叶立德衍生物与有机叠氮化物反应，成功转化为α-重氮磷叶立德、三唑或噻二唑衍生物。这项成果首次实现了α-重氮磷叶立德的分离，该物质结合了经典叶立德和重氮化合物的双重特性，为相关化学反应的探索提供了新方向。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 沸石中Brønsted酸位与Cu/Zn单原子位的协同作用用于甲烷直接氧化","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23094","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/天然气化工","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"甲烷直接氧化","kp":["催化剂[ZSM-5]: Cu/Zn单原子协同Brønsted酸位点","[关键发现]: Brønsted酸位点为CH4活化必需"],"as":"该研究利用沸石催化剂中Brønsted酸性位点与Cu/Zn单原子位点的协同作用，实现了甲烷直接氧化制液态含氧化合物。甲烷C-H键活化能垒极高，直接转化为甲醇等液态产物是催化化学的世纪难题。传统方法需高温高压且选择性差，该工作通过双功能位点协同设计——酸性位点活化甲烷、Cu/Zn单原子位点促进氧插入——在温和条件下提高了转化效率与产物选择性，为天然气的高附加值利用提供了新策略。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Synergy between Brønsted Acid Sites and Cu/Zn Single-Atom Sites in Zeolite for the Direct Oxidation of Methane","b":"The direct oxidation of methane to liquid oxygenates is challenging due to the high C-H bond activation barrier. While metal sites in zeolites are typically considered the primary active centers, this study reveals that Brønsted acid sites (BAS) are indispensable for CH<sub>4</sub> activation. Atomic-level incorporation of Cu and Zn into ZSM-5 tunes Brønsted acid strength and stabilizes the framework, creating a cooperative acid-metal environment that enables a remarkable C1 oxygenates productivity of 41651 μmol g<sub>cat.</sub><sup>-1</sup> h<sup>-1</sup> with nearly 90% selectivity at 70 °C. Through CH<sub>4</sub>-DRIFTS, in situ EPR, and DFT calculations, we demonstrate that BAS induce polarization of CH<sub>4</sub>, while Cu and Zn activate H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub> to generate •OH and •OOH radicals. The •OH radicals cleave polarized CH<sub>4</sub> to form •CH<sub>3</sub> radicals, which selectively couple with reactive oxygen species to yield CH<sub>3</sub>OH and HCOOH. This work highlights the critical acid-metal synergy in metal-zeolite catalysts for efficient CH<sub>4</sub> valorization under mild conditions."},{"t":"[ASAP] 表面功能化二维聚合物电致变色层作为超快多态红外光学器件","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19303","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维聚合物电致变色","kp":["器件架构[电致变色]: 固态双端","[开关速度]: 超快(二维聚合物离子亲和孔)","响应波段[光学门]: 红外多态"],"as":"该研究开发了表面功能化的二维聚合物电致变色层材料。电致变色器件在智能窗户、显示器、伪装等领域具有广泛应用潜力，但现有材料的开关切换速度是制约其大规模应用的核心瓶颈。研究通过二维聚合物结构设计，利用表面功能化策略调控电致变色性能，旨在实现更快的响应速度和更高的着色效率。该工作为突破电致变色器件的开关速度限制提供了新的材料设计思路，推动柔性、低功耗电致变色技术向实际工程应用迈进。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Surface-Functionalized, Two-Dimensional Polymer Electrochromic Layers as Ultrafast, Multi-State Infrared Optical ","b":"Electrochromic devices have widespread application potential, but the currently available switching speeds limit broad real-world implementation of this technology. Here, we report surface-engineered two-dimensional polymers with ionophilic pores that offer unprecedented switching speeds in solid-state, two-terminal, electrochromic devices. In particular, we demonstrate that a crystalline donor-acceptor 2DP functionalized with ethylene glycol oligomers exhibits multistate infrared absorption that is 4× faster (tc = 320 ms) with 3× coloration efficiency (491 cm2 C-1) compared to an alkyl functionalized 2DP constructed from the same chromophores. The functionalized nanoporous surfaces enable rapid switching in these materials under either oxidative or reductive conditions, allowing us to access a range of robust, stable optical responses in a single electrochromic layer. These attributes led us to leverage surface-functionalized 2DPs as multistate infrared logic gates. Collectively, this work demonstrates that surface engineering of nanoporous crystalline lattices is a promising approach to co-optimize the electronic and ionic conductivities required to achieve rapidly switchable electrochromic layers. Beyond speed and efficiency, the demonstration of multistate infrared characteristics shows that electrochromic frameworks are useful in integrated optoelectronic circuits. This positions surface-engineered 2DPs as improved electrochromic coatings and a new material platform for photonic information processing and adaptive devices."},{"t":"[ASAP] 反式十氢萘基萜类化合物的立体发散构建","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01881","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Thousands of highly oxygenated terpenoid natural products contain a common trans-decalin core bearing oxidized substituents in either the equatorial or axial configuration at the C(4) quaternary center. We report an expedient route to a versatile terpenoid building block primed for elaboration into numerous complex natural products. This intermediate is provided from (R)-carvone, a cheap and abundant chiral pool material, in three steps through a diastereodivergent, intramolecular carboborylation reaction. Notably, this method uniquely provides either equatorial or axial functionalized products from a single, common precursor. Identification of optimal ligands required extensive screening efforts, facilitated in part by high-throughput experimentation (HTE) and the construction of an algorithmically guided, combinatorial, in silico library, which identified the highest performing axial-selective ligand. The key interactions responsible for the observed high diastereoselectivity were elucidated with computational analysis, and the synthetic utility of this method was demonstrated in the total synthesis of several diterpenoid natural products.","tp":"萜类立体合成","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究团队以廉价易得的(R)-香芹酮为手性池起始原料，通过三步非对映发散的分子内碳硼化反应，构建了一种含反式十氢萘核心的多用途萜类构建模块。该中间体可定向引入C(4)季碳中心的轴向或赤道构型氧化取代基，为众多高度氧化型萜类天然产物的立体发散性全合成提供了通用平台。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 高效倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池研究进展：电荷传输、界面工程与稳定性","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00115","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"反式钙钛矿太阳能电池","dp":1,"as":"该综述聚焦高效倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池中电荷传输层面的最新研究进展。倒置结构钙钛矿电池因其较低的制备温度和良好的器件稳定性被视为钙钛矿光伏商业化的重要方向。文章系统总结了电荷传输层（包括空穴传输层和电子传输层）材料设计、界面工程及缺陷钝化等关键策略对器件光电转换效率和长期稳定性的影响，分析了当前面临的迟滞效应、界面复合损失等瓶颈，并展望了迈向大面积模块和产业化应用的路径。","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Progress in High-Efficiency Inverted Perovskite Solar Cells: Charge Transport, Interface Engineering, and Stabili","b":"Inverted (p-i-n) perovskite solar cells (PSCs) have emerged as a focal point in photovoltaic research, combining high efficiency with long-term stability and offering a strong potential for tandem integration. Their quasi-steady-state certified power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) now exceed 27%, surpassing those of their regular (n-i-p) counterparts. Here, we review recent advances in high-performance p-i-n PSCs, highlighting strategies for the selection and optimization of charge-transport layers, regulation of perovskite crystallization, and design of interface engineering. Finally, we discuss the significant breakthroughs in the stability of p-i-n PSCs and provide an outlook on future directions that may guide the next stage of device optimization, thereby laying the foundation for the large-scale implementation of perovskite photovoltaics."},{"t":"[ASAP] 集成微生物与酶的有机半导体水凝胶用于选择性太阳能CO2转化","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00205","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能CO2转化","kp":["催化剂[太阳能CO2还原]: 有机半导体水凝胶集成微生物与酶"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了集成微生物与酶的有机半导体水凝胶生物电子材料。该材料将有机半导体的电荷传输能力与微生物/酶的生物催化功能相结合，构建了一种兼具电子传导与生物活性的新型界面平台。这种生物-电子杂化水凝胶在生物传感、生物燃料电池、智能生物反应器以及可植入生物电子器件等领域具有广阔应用前景，为打通生物系统与电子器件之间的信号通信提供了创新材料方案。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Organic Semiconducting Hydrogel with Integrated Microbes and Enzymes for Selective Solar CO2 Conversion","b":"Integrating synthetic light-harvesting materials with biological CO2-fixing catalysts offers a promising route to efficient and selective solar-to-chemical conversion under mild conditions. However, progress remains limited by the lack of photocatalytic materials that combine biocompatibility, strong electronic coupling with biocatalysts, high biocatalyst loading capacity, and facile product separation. Here we introduce an organic semiconducting hydrogel synthesized from a rationally designed conjugated polyelectrolyte featuring visible-light absorption, water-processability, and covalent cross-linkability. The resulting macroporous, positively charged hydrogel scaffold immobilizes both microbes and enzymes, promoting intimate abiotic–biotic interactions throughout the three-dimensional hydrogel matrix. This platform supports two distinct modes of sacrificial CO2 reduction: mediated electron transfer via photogenerated H2 to drive acetate synthesis in the microbe Clostridium ljungdahlii, and direct electron transfer from photoexcited polymer domains to the isolated enzyme formate dehydrogenase for formate synthesis. By coupling the molecular programmability of organic semiconductors with the selectivity of biocatalysts, this work establishes a versatile class of soft biohybrid materials for solar fuel production through semiartificial photosynthesis.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 亚甲基环烯作为反应性 1,3-二烯用于对映选择性氢胺化","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c03218","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Herein, we report the first enantioselective functionalization of methylene cycloalkenes─an underexplored class of reactive 1,3-dienes. The process involves a palladium-catalyzed enantioselective hydroamination of methylene cycloalkenes using pyrazole derivatives, affording a variety of chiral tertiary amines. A machine-learning model based on universal descriptors from quasi-transition-state (UD-qTS) strategy, combined with a physicochemically grounded data-augmentation protocol, has been employed to accelerate the optimization process. Deuterium-labeling experiments and density functional theory (DFT) calculations revealed that the reaction proceeded through a ligand-to-ligand hydrogen transfer (LLHT) pathway, which is both the rate-determining and enantio-determination step. Subsequent inner-sphere nucleophilic attack by the pyrazole anion enables regioselective C3 (referring to 1,3-diene)-N1 (referring to pyrazole) bond formation. Furthermore, the resulting products can be transformed into acyclic alkenes, which are equivalent to the hydroamination products of acyclic 1,3-dienes.","tp":"烯烃氢胺化","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"首次实现了亚甲基环烯作为活性1,3-二烯的对映选择性官能化，通过钯催化氢胺化反应使吡唑衍生物加成，高效构建手性叔胺。研究采用基于准过渡态策略的通用描述符机器学习模型，结合物理化学数据增强方案进行催化剂筛选与机理预测，推动不对称催化领域的理性设计。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 水电解催化剂改性的离子束工程：近期成果与未来性能展望","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00469","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"离子束改性析氢催化剂","kp":["[改性方法]: 离子束工程精确修饰电解水催化剂"],"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":2.5},"as":"综述了离子束工程在水电解催化剂改性中的最新进展与未来方向。离子束技术可精确调控催化剂表面结构、缺陷密度和元素分布，显著提升析氢/析氧反应活性与稳定性。文章系统总结了不同离子辐照策略对催化剂性能的影响机制，展望了大规模制氢应用的工程化前景。","ot":"[ASAP] Ion Beam Engineering of Catalyst Modification for Water Electrolysis: Recent Achievements and Future Performance","b":"Hydrogen production through water splitting is essential for clean energy conversion and environmental protection. Its effectiveness and practical use heavily depend on the catalyst materials’ intrinsic activity, stability, and cost. Recently, ion beam technology, as a novel, efficient, and controllable way to modify surfaces, has shown great promise for the precise design of catalytic materials with enhanced performance. This Review outlines the physical and chemical mechanisms behind modifying catalytic materials with ion beam techniques and examines how it improves the intrinsic activity, active site density, mass transfer efficiency, and stability of catalysts. Finally, we discuss current challenges in this field and potential future directions. This overview aims to provide both theoretical insights and practical guidance for designing high-performance durable electrocatalysts for industrial applications using advanced ion beam technologies."},{"t":"[ASAP] 电化学CO2捕集与储能集成实现可再生能源兼容","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21714","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学碳捕集储能","kp":["[系统集成]: 电化学碳捕集与储能一体化","[设计]: 分离CO2/吸附剂再生步骤"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"提出将电化学CO2捕集与储能系统直接集成的方案，以提升与可再生能源发电的兼容性。该集成设计可利用可再生能源的间歇性电力进行碳捕集，同时实现能量存储与释放，解决传统碳捕集过程能耗高、与可再生能源耦合困难的问题，为负碳技术提供新架构。","ot":"[ASAP] Integrated Electrochemical CO2 Capture with Energy Storage for Renewable Energy Compatibility","b":"Carbon capture via electrochemical processes can benefit from direct integration with renewable power plants, but the intermittency of renewable energy sources makes efficient operation challenging. Here, we demonstrate an integrated electrochemical carbon capture and energy storage system that enhances adaptability to intermittent renewable energy sources. By splitting the single CO2/sorbent regeneration step into two separate electrolyzers via insertion of the ferrocyanide/ferricyanide redox pair, we successfully demonstrated energy storage during the alkaline sorbent regeneration, while providing energy output during the CO2 regeneration step. Our decoupled electrolyzer system achieved a net energy consumption of 68.9-248.7 kJ/mol for overall carbon capture at 10-100 mA/cm2, and delivered an energy output of 54 kJ/mol-CO2 at 10 mA/cm2 during the CO2 regeneration step, demonstrating its potential compatibility with intermittent energy sources."},{"t":"[ASAP] 面向下一代低电位阳极的高导电不可还原电解质","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c11998","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电解质","kp":["[挑战]: 高价阳离子低电位还原分解","材料体系[固态电池]: 高导电不可还原电解质","适用负极[固态电池]: 锂金属/硅"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究开发高电导率不可还原电解质，用于下一代低电位负极的全固态电池。该电解质在保持高离子导电性的同时，具有优异的抗还原稳定性，可与低电位负极（如锂金属）兼容，解决全固态电池界面阻抗和电化学稳定性难题，有望提升电池能量密度和安全性。","ot":"[ASAP] Highly Conductive Irreducible Electrolytes for Next-Generation Low-Potential Anodes","b":"All-solid-state batteries have great potential to outperform conventional lithium-ion batteries in both safety and energy density, as the solid electrolyte can potentially accommodate high-energy-density anodes such as metallic lithium or silicon more safely. However, the high-valence cations present in most highly conductive solid electrolytes facilitate reductive decomposition at low potentials, leading to significant irreversible lithium inventory loss. Preventing this requires the development of solid electrolytes that are thermodynamically stable at low operating potentials while providing high ionic conductivity and sufficient oxidative stability. To realize this, we explored a new family of Li-rich antifluorite irreducible solid electrolytes, Li2.65S0.35NxP0.65-x, the first reported nitrido-phosphido-sulfide, and investigated their application in all-solid-state batteries. The optimized composition Li2.65S0.35N0.15P0.5 possesses a remarkably high ionic conductivity of 1.05 mS cm-1, as well as a relatively high oxidative stability of 1.15 V vs Li+/Li for this class of materials. Ab initio molecular dynamics and density functional theory simulations reveal that enhanced Li diffusion is the result of enlarged diffusion bottleneck sizes. These are a consequence of (i) substitution with smaller anions or (ii) increased electrostatic repulsion from the substitution with high-valence anions. Importantly, the oxidative stability makes Li2.65S0.35N0.15P0.5 exhibit good compatibility with Si anodes, and in conjunction with the high ionic conductivity, this enables a high initial Coulombic efficiency of 94.2% as well as a stable cycle life of a full cell with a micron silicon-Li2.65S0.35N0.15P0.5 anode and a LiCoO2-Li3InCl6 cathode. This work highlights the potential of irreducible solid electrolytes for the design of all-solid-state batteries with low-potential and high-energy-density anodes."},{"t":"[ASAP] 提高无溶剂气溶胶液滴中的酯化反应速率","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18218","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","b":"Aerosols are appealing vessels for accelerating chemical reactions owing to their high surface area-to-volume ratios and capacity to access supersaturated solute states. Although many studies demonstrate enhanced reaction rates in charged droplets using electrospray ionization-mass spectrometry, such studies have poor control over experimental parameters including droplet size, water content, and imparted charge and generally cannot explore the reaction's reversibility. Here, an esterification reaction between a dicarboxylic acid and low-volatility alcohol (that in bulk synthesis requires reflux at 160 °C for ∼15 h in nonaqueous solvent) is investigated in aqueous aerosol droplets spanning picoliter to sub-femtoliter volumes. Individual picoliter droplets generated without applied external voltage were confined within an Aerosol Optical Tweezers instrument, and Raman spectroscopy was used to resolve chemical change in the droplets. Flow tube experiments on sub-femtoliter aerosol droplets were conducted using both online aerosol mass spectrometry and off-line NMR spectroscopy. Across both droplet volume scales, the esterification was facile (<400 s in picoliter droplets, <2 s in sub-femtoliter droplets) upon droplet dehydration at room temperature. We demonstrate that both the forward and reverse reaction are vastly accelerated in aerosol compared to macroscopic solution. The unique aspects of this study include rigorous control over a water activity range spanning dilute to solvent-free conditions, investigation across a broad droplet volume range, application of multiple analytical techniques to confirm independently accelerated reactivity, and exploration of the reaction's reversibility. Combined, this study demonstrates how aerosols can drive chemistry in accordance with Le Chatelier's principle on both the micro- and nanoscales."},{"t":"[ASAP] 铜催化对映选择性与位点选择性合成α-取代肼、吡唑烷和叔醇","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22785","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铜催化对映合成肼类","kp":["[合成方法]: 铜催化烯丙位C-N/C-O偶联","[产物]: α-叔肼/吡唑烷/叔醇"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"开发了铜催化对映选择性和位点选择性合成方法，可高效构建α-取代肼、吡唑烷和叔醇类化合物。该方法通过铜催化不对称加成反应，实现手性中心的高对映选择性构建，为药物分子和生物活性含氮化合物的合成提供了通用且高效的新工具。","ot":"[ASAP] Enantio- and Site-Selective Synthesis of α-Substituted Hydrazines, Pyrazolidines, and Tertiary Alcohols by Copper","b":"A catalytic method for the enantioselective synthesis of α-tertiary hydrazines, pyrazolidines, and tertiary alcohols containing dialkyl-substituted stereocenters is disclosed. Reactions employ simple azoarene and nitrosoarene electrophiles and undergo Cu-catalyzed site- and enantioselective C-N or C-O bond formation. Utility of the approach is demonstrated through the rapid stereoselective assembly of substituted-pyrazolidine scaffolds and 1,3-diamines."},{"t":"[ASAP] 电化学升温趋势：离子液体可助力","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00466","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"离子液体高温电化学","kp":["工作温度[离子液体电化学]: 100–300°C","[体系]: 离子液体拓宽中温电化学窗口"],"as":"本文综述了电化学在化学制造中的互补优势，并重点论述了离子液体如何助力电化学过程的高效运行。传统热化学合成依赖高温高压，能耗高且选择性受限；电化学驱动则通过电极电位精确控制反应路径，条件温和、绿色可调。然而常规电解液在导电性、电化学窗口和稳定性方面存在瓶颈。离子液体凭借极低蒸气压、宽电化学窗口和高离子电导率，可有效改善反应介质性能，提升产物选择性与能量效率。文章系统讨论了离子液体在电催化还原、氧化偶联等典型反应中的应用前景，指出其有望推动电化学合成从实验室走向工业化，但仍需解决成本和规模化循环利用等工程挑战。","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Electrochemistry Is Heating Up: Ionic Liquids Can Help","b":"Electrochemistry offers a complementary pathway for chemical manufacturing, providing benefits beyond traditional thermochemical processes, but most systems are constrained to near-ambient temperatures due to solvent limitations. This leaves an underexplored intermediate-temperature regime (100–300 °C) between aqueous and solid-state electrolytes where many industrial reactions operate and heat is accessible at scale. Ionic liquids (ILs) are uniquely suited to operating in this regime. They combine robust thermal stability, wide electrochemical windows, high ionic efficiency, and tunable chemical properties. ILs have already been applied in devices such as fuel cells, water splitting, and high-temperature energy storage, but their use for electrochemical synthesis above 100 °C remains largely unexplored. Here we highlight how ILs can enable both mechanistic studies and practical electrochemical systems at elevated temperatures while outlining the challenges of cost, viscosity, compositional diversity, and device integration. Harnessing these opportunities could establish ILs as key electrolytes for bridging electrocatalysis and thermocatalysis."},{"t":"[ASAP] 用于场效应晶体管的结晶型Dion-Jacobson二维层状锡基钙钛矿","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20756","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锡基钙钛矿晶体管","kp":["晶相[钙钛矿FET]: Dion-Jacobson二维锡基","[制备方法]: 溶剂蒸汽辅助滴涂(SVAD)"],"as":"本文报道了结晶型Dion-Jacobson（DJ）相二维层状锡基钙钛矿在场效应晶体管等电子器件中的应用研究。二维层状钙钛矿因量子限域效应和优异的载流子输运特性，被视为下一代半导体材料的有力候选。DJ相结构相比传统Ruddlesden-Popper相具有更强的层间相互作用，有助于提升结构稳定性和电荷传输效率。研究聚焦锡基体系，避免了铅基钙钛矿的毒性问题，探索了其作为沟道层材料在场效应晶体管中的电学性能。结果表明DJ相Sn基钙钛矿具有良好的半导体特性，但空气稳定性、薄膜制备工艺均匀性及缺陷态密度仍需进一步优化，方能满足实用化器件要求。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Crystalline Dion-Jacobson 2D Layered Sn-Based Perovskites for Field-Effect Transistors","b":"Dion-Jacobson (DJ) phase perovskites are increasingly recognized as potential semiconductor materials for electronic applications. However, the restricted coordination between the organic diammonium cations and the inorganic framework inhibits their self-assembly into efficient DJ Sn-based perovskites during solution processing. This study introduces solvent vapor assisted drop casting (SVAD) as a novel processing method to favor the organization into highly crystalline DJ perovskite films. The key aspect of the processing is the extended crystallization time in solvent vapor at elevated temperature. The processing study was conducted on four DJ perovskites that varied in the rigidity and symmetry of their A-cations to demonstrate the universal applicability of SVAD for this category of semiconductors and to establish correlations between structure and properties. The SVAD films exhibit markedly improved crystallinity and morphology compared to spin-coated samples resulting in significantly increased local and device charge carrier mobilities. DJ perovskites with rigid and symmetric A-cations form a planar [SnI6]4- octahedral framework that favors structural order and charge carrier transport. This work paves the way for the solution processing of highly ordered DJ Sn-based perovskites for their implementation in electronic applications.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 电荷分离还是热点效应：Ru-Ni纳米颗粒高效CO2还原机理的澄清与比较","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17533","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"Ru-Ni光催化CO2还原","kp":["光催化速率[13CO2→13CH4]: ~26 μmol h⁻¹ gcat⁻¹","粒径[Ru-Ni纳米颗粒]: ~1.6 nm"],"as":"本文针对光催化CO₂还原反应中效率提升的物理机制进行了澄清与辨析，核心争议在于催化活性究竟源于电荷分离效应还是局域等离激元热点的热效应。光催化CO₂还原是太阳能转化为化学能的关键路径，但其真实反应路径和活性位点的催化角色长期存在不确定性。研究通过对比实验与理论分析，试图区分电荷分离（光生载流子驱动氧化还原）与局域电磁场增强/热点热效应各自对反应速率的贡献。文章强调，只有在明确主导机制的前提下，才能理性设计高效光催化剂，避免将性能提升错误归因，从而为催化剂结构优化提供可靠指导。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Charge Separation and/or Hot Spots: Clarification of Efficient CO2 Reduction over Ru–Ni Nanoparticles Compared to","b":"The true reaction pathway and the catalytic role responsible for it remain uncertain in photocatalysis, where charge separation, hot spots, and energetic modulation of the ground and excited states are involved. Herein, a Ru atom was embedded in a ∼1.6 nm Ni nanoparticle dispersed on ZrO2. The 13CO2 photoreduction rate to 13CH4 showed a negligible change of ∼26 μmol h-1 gcat-1 upon adding Ru (1.0 wt %) to the Ni (10 wt %)-ZrO2 photocatalyst under a 295 K water bath for cooling irradiated by UV-visible light at 568 mW cm-2. By contrast, the rate using the Ru-Ni-ZrO2 catalyst exceeded that of Ni-ZrO2 by >2.7× (>7.9 mmol h-1 gcat-1) when the 295 K water bath for catalysts was not applied. Extended X-ray absorption fine structure analysis revealed that the hot spot Ni temperature increased from 295 to 399 ± 29 K under 654 mW cm-2 irradiation, even with the 295 K ethylene glycol bath for cooling, confirming that multiple hydrogenations occurred on Ni for COH species transferred from the O vacancy sites at the ZrO2 surface. In the absence of the 295 K water bath, CO2 was directly adsorbed on the RuNi2 site, and its dissociation into CO and O species proceeded with a low activation energy of 0.45 eV, enabling a photothermal pathway, as supported by DFT and FTIR analyses. These results highlight the importance of monitoring the hot spot temperature in photocatalysts to identify the active site combined with redox sites on the semiconductor, driven by charge separation under UV-visible light irradiation."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过钕碱金属簇活化双氧","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22234","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"The discovery of new dioxygen binding and activation modes is of paramount importance in biological and synthetic systems. Herein, we describe two rare earth-alkali metal clusters displaying unusual reactivity with dioxygen. We isolate a trans-end-on peroxo dineodymium tetrapotassium species, (LH4Nd)2(trans-μ-η1:η1-O2)K4(thf)4 (5), from reduction reactions of LH5Nd (1) and K[LH4Nd] (2) employing KC8 in dry O2. Cluster 5 contains the first end-on peroxo coordination to an f-block metal. Surprisingly, when the weaker reductant sodium naphthalenide (Na[C10H8]) is used, we isolate the cluster (LH4Nd)2(μ6-O)Na4(thf)4 (6), indicating dioxygen's O-O bond has been cleaved. The typically weak π-backbonding interaction of 4f-block elements to stabilize the end-on binding mode of O2 is realized in 5 through a Lewis acid-assisted support of the peroxo species. Cleaving of the O-O bond in 6 is attributed to an increased Lewis acid effect rather than a larger chemical potential driving force since |Ered(KC8)| > |Ered ([C10H8]-|. Lanthanide oxos are highly reactive; however, the oxo reactivity in 6 is tamed by dimerization and protection with four equatorial closely associated Na ions. This work demonstrates a synergistic effect between the rare earth and alkali metals in the binding and activation of dioxygen and provides a novel route to examine lanthanide peroxo/oxo chemistry.","tp":"双氧活化","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"报道了两种稀土-碱金属簇合物在双氧活化中的异常反应性，分离出反式端度过氧双钕四钾簇合物(LH4Nd)2(trans-μ-η1:η1-O2)K4(thf)4，这是首个f区金属端过氧配位实例。该发现拓展了稀土元素活化分子氧的配位模式，为理解f区金属仿生氧化催化机制提供了新模型。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 3,5-二甲基赖氨酸 (DMOA) 衍生的类萜正内酯 (−)-Novofumigatonin、(−)-Asnovolin F 和","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01821","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","b":"We disclose a full account of the total synthesis of (-)-novofumigatonin and the first syntheses of (-)-asnovolin F and (-)-asnovolin G. The overarching approach to these 3,5-dimethylorsellinic acid (DMOA)-derived spiromeroterpenoid ortholactones relies on two central features: highly convergent coupling of fragments of roughly equal complexity and subsequent formation of the embedded ortholactone cages. The scope of coupling by 1,2-addition of a hindered, neopentylic organolithium with a collection of highly congested tetrasubstituted cyclohexanones, integral to concise assembly of the stereochemically dense carbon skeleton, is described. The study of ortholactone formation provides insights into synthetic pathways to the embedded dioxabicyclo[3.2.1]octane. An advanced intermediate featuring the ortholactone-acetal core enables access to all three spiromeroterpenoid natural products."},{"t":"年幼的孩子了解社会关系如何影响人们对彼此的了解","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525150123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"An unwritten expectation in our everyday social interactions is that intimate personal information about someone—“insider knowledge”—is usually confined within close relationships. For example, it would be odd, or even unsettling, if a stranger knew about your favorite movie. Such expectations about who knows what about whom constitute a cornerstone of complex social behavior, but much remains unknown about their cognitive underpinnings and developmental origins. Drawing on parental report (Study 1) as well as a novel experimental approach using controlled but naturalistic videochat conversations (Study 2 &amp; 3), we find that 4- to 5-y-old children have an abstract, theory-like understanding of how social connections give rise to interpersonal knowledge. Self-report, facial expressions, and memory errors provide converging evidence that children were surprised when someone possessed insider knowledge that is misaligned with their relationships, such as a stranger knowing their favorite food (Study 2a) or their own parent knowing a stranger’s favorite movie (Study 2b). Children also generated coherent ad-hoc explanations about how someone might have acquired that knowledge, appealing to either first-hand observations or second-hand sources (Study 3). These findings demonstrate an early-emerging understanding of how individual minds are shaped in the context of their social networks, supporting a precocious ability to detect and explain anomalies in what people know about each other in real-time conversations. The current work also opens possibilities for leveraging open-ended online interactions to study social cognition without compromising experimental control."},{"t":"X射线预激活可逆持续发光可实现深部肿瘤的光动力免疫治疗","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-71028-4","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Persistent luminescence is a promising approach for photodynamic therapy (PDT) in deep-seated tumors, as it provides sustained light within tissues, eliminating the need for continuous external illumination. However, the uncontrollability of light within the body complicates precise spatiotemporal regulation. In this study, we report X-ray preactivated elimusertib-loaded tumor-targeted photodynamic nanoparticles (ETPNs), featuring reversible “on-off” afterglow properties. The excellent afterglow properties of X-ray-activated porous NaYF4:Er@NaGdF4 persistent luminescence nanoparticles enable the continuous activation of chlorin e6 (Ce6) to generate reactive oxygen species (ROS), leading to DNA damage. The integration of elimusertib potentiates ROS-induced DNA damage and activates the cGAS-STING pathway, thereby enhancing immuno-photodynamic therapeutic efficacy. All in vivo experiments were conducted using female mice. Our findings highlight the potential of ETPNs to advance the therapeutic landscape for deep-seated tumors, offering a robust and controllable platform for combined immuno-photodynamic therapy.","tp":"肿瘤光动力","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对深部肿瘤光动力治疗中体内光源不可控的难题，开发出X射线预激活的elimusertib负载肿瘤靶向光动力纳米颗粒，具备可逆\"开-关\"余辉特性。该纳米平台通过X射线预激活产生持续自发光，在无外部连续照明的条件下实现深部肿瘤的时空精确光动力免疫联合治疗。","aip":1},{"t":"什么是量子生物学？","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531134123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Quantum biology is the field at the intersection of quantum-related physics and the biology of living systems. The goal of the field is to determine if quantum phenomena underpin biological function at the macroscale. Such results, supported by compelling experimental evidence, will be important because they will show how quantum effects can have functional relevance, even in very complex and nominally classical systems. Here, we attempt to define the scope of quantum biology with a forward-facing view to help focus the research agenda. To that end, we propose open questions fundamental to consolidating the field of quantum biology. These open questions highlight the importance of developing suitable probes at the quantum scale, the possibility that classical biological machinery might simply mimic quantum systems, and of elucidating the ways quantum function can be amplified to the macroscale.","tp":"量子生物学","sc":2.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"as":"量子生物学是量子物理与生命系统交叉的新兴前沿学科，旨在探究量子现象是否在宏观尺度支撑生物功能。文章前瞻性地界定了学科研究范畴，梳理了量子相干性、隧穿效应等在光合作用、鸟类磁感应、酶催化等体系中的实验证据，讨论了在复杂近经典体系中量子效应具有功能相关性的重要意义。"},{"t":"可见光激发态脱芳构化反应","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed5284?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","as":"该研究聚焦于可见光驱动的激发态去芳构化反应。去芳构化是构建具有重要药理活性的饱和环状化合物的核心策略。利用可见光作为绿色、可再生的能量来源激活反应底物的激发态，可避免传统方法对严苛条件和贵金属催化剂的依赖。该方向在药物合成和复杂分子构建方面具有广阔的应用前景。","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光催化脱芳化反应","kp":["[可见光激发态脱芳构化]: 前线轨道电子分布重塑解锁新路径","[光激发]: 实现基态无法实现的脱芳构化"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Visible-light–enabled excited-state dearomatization reactions","b":"Dearomatization reactions stand as a cornerstone strategy for constructing pharmacologically pivotal saturated rings. Photoexcitation reshapes the electron distribution within the frontier molecular orbitals of aromatics, thereby unlocking dearomatization pathways inaccessible in the ground state and furnishing structurally distinct molecular motifs. Contemporary synthetic methodologies leverage three discrete mechanistic paradigms to achieve this electronic activation: direct excitation, energy-transfer photocatalysis, and exciplex formation. These precisely tuned energy-delivery modes enable the dearomatization of a diverse array of (hetero)arenes, including highly robust substrates such as naphthalenes and benzenes, under mild reaction conditions. This review spotlights recent representative advances in these excited-state transformations. We envision that this synopsis will fuel ongoing innovation in the burgeoning field of photochemical dearomatization."},{"t":"用于高性能有机材料中通用电子注入的真空蒸发、无铅 RbYbI3 钙钛矿中间层","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72838?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The optoelectronic performance of organic light‐emitting diodes (OLEDs) is critically governed by charge injection from electrodes into organic layers, where significant energy barriers at the interfaces often impede efficient charge injection. These barriers disrupt the balance between hole and electron injection in the emitting layer, thereby limiting device optoelectrical performance. Conventional electron injection layers (EILs), such as lithium fluoride (LiF) or ultrathin metal layers, often exhibit limited injection efficiency when used with certain metals, including silver. In this work, we propose a lead‐free perovskite thin film, RbYbI\n                    3\n                    , as an efficient EIL for OLEDs. Deposited via vacuum evaporation, a 5‐nm‐thick RbYbI\n                    3\n                    layer induces a 630‐mV surface potential shift at the interface between the organic layer and the metal electrode. First‐principles density functional theory calculations also confirm that RbYbI\n                    3\n                    exhibits termination‐dependent surface dipole formation, thereby lowering the effective injection barrier relative to LiF. This facilitates efficient electron injections across various organic semiconductors without requiring additional interface engineering. Furthermore, RbYbI\n                    3\n                    is compatible with both aluminum and silver cathodes, unlike LiF, which exhibits electrode‐material limitations. When applied to blue‐emitting OLEDs, the device with RbYbI\n                    3\n                    exhibits a lower turn‐on voltage by 0.4 V and a higher external quantum efficiency (EQE) of 19.5% than the control using LiF (EQE of 17.7%). Similarly, green OLEDs with RbYbI\n                    3\n                    maintained superior efficiency at high luminance, with a maximum EQE of 23.0% and 20.7% at 10 000 cd m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    , compared to 22.0% and 15.8% at 10 000 cd m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    for the LiF‐based control device. The perovskite‐based EIL is readily integrated into standard OLED fabrication processes, providing a universal and practical strategy to overcome the limitations of conventional EILs and enabling the development of high‐performance OLEDs.","tp":"钙钛矿注入","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对OLED器件中电极-有机层界面电荷注入能垒限制性能的问题，提出一种真空蒸镀的无铅RbYbI3钙钛矿中间层作为通用电子注入层。该材料替代传统锂盐类电子注入层，显著降低界面能垒、改善空穴-电子注入平衡，提升器件光电性能，为无铅钙钛矿在有机光电器件中的应用开辟新路径。"},{"t":"超声响应双前药纳米组装用于肝纤维化治疗中的“窗孔恢复策略”","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518832?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Liver fibrosis is a serious yet reversible intermediate stage in the progression of liver disease, which can ultimately advance to cirrhosis and hepatocellular carcinoma. Targeted and selective inhibition of activated hepatic stellate cells (aHSCs) has emerged as a promising therapeutic strategy for the treatment of liver fibrosis. However, the capillarization of liver sinusoidal endothelial cells (LSECs) characterized by the loss of fenestrae and continuous formation of basement membrane presents a significant barrier to effective delivery of anti‐fibrotic agents. In this study, we propose a novel “fenestrae‐restoration strategy” employing ultrasound‐responsive polymeric dual prodrug nanoassembly (PMS) co‐loaded with nitric oxide prodrug (mSNO) and poly‐metformin (PMet). PMS is engineered for controllable, ultrasound‐triggered release of nitric oxide from mSNO, which activates soluble guanylate cyclase. This results in upregulation of intracellular cyclic guanosine monophosphate that facilitates the reversal of LSECs capillarization, restoring fenestrae and enhancing endothelial permeability. This restoration enables PMS to traverse the hepatic sinusoidal barrier, followed by accumulation in fibrotic tissue, where PMet is internalized by aHSCs. In lysosomes, metformin released from PMet ultimately inhibits aHSCs proliferation and migration via the AMPK‐mTOR pathway deregulation. The therapeutic efficacy and underlying mechanisms of “fenestrae‐restoring strategy” were comprehensively validated in preclinical CCl\n                    4\n                    ‐induced murine model of liver fibrosis. These findings provide interesting insights into the combination therapy of liver fibrosis and paves new avenues for future development of smart therapeutic modalities utilizing stimuli‐responsive biosafe nanotherapeutics.","tp":"超声纳米药","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对肝纤维化治疗，提出\"窗孔恢复策略\"：设计超声响应双前药纳米组装体，靶向抑制活化肝星状细胞的同时逆转肝窦内皮细胞的毛细血管化（窗孔丢失）。超声触发的前药释放实现时空可控的药物递送，为肝纤维化这一可逆中间阶段提供了双靶点协同治疗新方案。"},{"t":"超声波敏感的微型机器人传感器，具有坚固的锚定功能，可用于长期消化道病变评估","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag179/8530529?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"Microrobots have achieved notable progress in targeted drug delivery for treating various diseases. However, employing the microrobot itself as a microsensor for remote and long-term lesion assessment remains challenging. Here, we design a bioinspired ultrasound-sensitive microrobotic sensor (USMS) capable of robust anchoring for wireless and long-term digestive disease treatment and assessment. The USMS integrates dual magnetic and focused ultrasound actuation for precise locomotion and on-demand drug delivery, while a bioinspired microneedle design secures stable anchoring against strong fluid flow (402 mm/s) and peristaltic forces (66.5 mN). More importantly, the air cavity design of USMS enables strong ultrasound reflection for remote and long-term sensing of protruding lesion radius to assess therapeutic efficacy. Overall, USMS demonstrates reliable on-demand drug delivery and lesion size sensing capabilities in mouse models. The USMS has the potential to serve as a versatile robotic platform and sensing system for monitoring lesion evolution in clinical disease management.","tp":"微型机器人","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"设计了一种仿生超声敏感微型机器人传感器(USMS)，集成磁驱动与聚焦超声双模驱动，实现消化道内精准运动和牢固锚定。该微机器人不仅可执行靶向药物递送，还可作为微型传感器实现无线、长期消化道病变评估，突破了微机器人仅作递送载体而难以充当传感器的技术瓶颈。","aip":1},{"t":"基于原子级薄层金属二硫属化物带状网络的超灵敏柔性振动传感器","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb6733?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维材料振动传感","kp":["材料体系[振动传感器]: 原子级薄二硫属化物带网络","[特性]: 超灵敏柔性皮肤兼容"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"基于原子级厚度金属二硫属化物带状网络，研制出超灵敏柔性振动传感器。该传感器利用二维材料的优异压电和机械性能，实现对微小振动的高灵敏度检测，满足AI和物联网对高性能传感器的需求。在可穿戴设备、健康监测和人机交互领域具有广阔应用前景。","ot":"Ultrasensitive soft vibration sensors based on atomically thin metal dichalcogenide ribbon networks","b":"The rapid progress of artificial intelligence (AI) and the internet of things (IoT) has driven growing demand for high-performance, skin-compatible vibration sensors capable of capturing subtle physiological and environmental signals. Low-dimensional materials offer unique advantages in sensitivity and flexibility, yet challenges remain in achieving high strain responsiveness, mechanical robustness, and large-area uniformity. Here, we report an ultrasensitive, low-profile, and stretchable vibration sensor based on large-area single-layer molybdenum disulfide (MoS\n                    2\n                    ) ribbon networks (SLRNs) grown via a vapor-liquid-solid mechanism. Embedding SLRNs within a thermoplastic elastomer [styrene-ethylene-butylene-styrene (SEBS)] yields record-high sensitivity among MoS\n                    2\n                    -based sensors, with gauge factors up to 5300 at &lt;1.6% strain. This response arises from nanocrack-mediated electron transport induced by the thermal expansion mismatch between MoS\n                    2\n                    and SEBS. The ~6-micrometer-thick sensors detect vibrations and acoustic signals over a wide frequency range (&gt;500 hertz), enabling deconvolution of complex stimuli. This work establishes a path toward ultrathin, ultrasensitive wearable sensors for health care and robotic applications."},{"t":"转录通读先于伊马替尼在 CML 细胞中触发的选择性剪接程序","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea2475?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Cellular stresses regulate transcriptional readthrough, whereby RNA polymerase II elongates past a gene’s polyadenylation cleavage site without RNA cleavage. Readthrough has been reported in several cancer types. Here, we use long-read sequencing of nascent RNA to quantify transcriptional readthrough in chronic myeloid leukemia (CML) cells and characterize early responses to the targeted therapeutic, imatinib. We show that the amount, length, and gene specificity of readthrough increase within 1 hour, before gene expression and alternative splicing alterations emerge. Notably, imatinib-dependent messenger RNA (mRNA) isoform changes involved “readthrough chimeras,” in which exons from an upstream gene are alternatively spliced to exons in a downstream gene. Altered mRNA isoforms and chimera levels were detected in imatinib-resistant K562 cells as well as cells of patients with CML. Thus, imatinib can provoke a cascade of early changes to transcription and splicing fidelity that may lead to longer-term adjustments in gene expression, cancer cell differentiation, and the development of therapy resistance."},{"t":"WYL 激活剂 DriD 对非经典 DNA 损伤反应途径的转录激活机制","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec6337?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"DNA damage repair mechanisms are vital for cell survival. In the bacterium,\n                    Caulobacter crescentus\n                    , DriD is the master regulator of a unique, noncanonical DNA damage pathway. DriD binding to ssDNA, produced upon DNA damage, stimulates its ability to activate transcription from several promoters involved in DNA damage responses. However, the mechanism by which DriD interfaces with the RNAP holoenzyme to activate transcription from its multiple promoters has been unclear. Here, we describe cryo-EM structures of DriD-ssDNA bound to RNAP-holoenzyme and three DriD-regulated promoters. Each subunit of homodimeric DriD contains an DNA binding\n                    N\n                    -terminal winged helix-turn-helix (wHTH) connected to WYL domains by a linker 3-helix bundle (3HB) module. The structures reveal a mechanism of assembly on promoters whereby DriD’s 3HBs bind the RNAP α-CTD and β domains, anchoring the RNAP-holoenzyme to regulated promoters. The 3HBs form autoinhibitory contacts with DNABDs in apo DriD and therefore acts as an ssDNA-driven trigger domain, switching between DNABD-bound apo and RNAP-bound forms upon ssDNA-mediated activation. Thus, the structures reveal a unique transcription activation mechanism, likely conserved among the large family of homodimeric WYL activators."},{"t":"面向成本最优的电力-算力联合管理：一种先预测后优化的新框架","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003867?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"算电协同优化","dp":1,"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Towards cost-optimal joint electricity-computation management: A novel predict-then-optimize framework"},{"t":"燃料电池混合动力汽车智能能量管理：拓扑、感知、决策与互联系统研究进展","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003326?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"燃料电池能量管理","dp":1,"sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","ot":"Toward intelligent energy management for fuel cell hybrid electric vehicles: Advances in topologies, perception, decisio"},{"t":"在晶体双光子绝热光笼中通过量子链放大进行三维成像","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00023-9?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","b":"Two-photon excitation offers unmatched spatial resolution in 3D, but its impact is limited by the small number of molecules excited with a focused laser beam. This study reports a crystalline photocage that overcomes this limitation via a quantum chain reaction where every two-photon excitation initiates an adiabatic triplet-state propagation that releases hundreds of fluorescent molecules. The integration of chemical amplification and two-photon microscopy enables high-resolution 3D imaging and patterning, advancing the capabilities of light-driven chemistry in materials science and biology.","tp":"量子链成像","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"报道一种晶体双光子光笼材料，通过量子链反应实现信号放大：每次双光子激发启动绝热三线态传播级联反应，可释放数百个荧光分子。该化学放大策略与双光子显微镜结合，克服了双光子激发分子数少的限制，实现了高分辨率三维成像，为深层生物组织成像提供了新工具。","aip":1},{"t":"34 个国家集体行动问题中的私人解决方案陷阱","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2504632123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Collective action problems emerge when individual incentives and group interests are misaligned, as in the case of climate change. Individuals involved in these problems are generally considered to have two options: contribute toward public solutions such as global warming mitigation or free ride. However, many collective action problems today involve a third option of investing in a “private solution” such as local adaptation. The availability of this third option can lead to a private solution trap whereby private solutions are adopted, collectively optimal public solutions are not provided, and existing inequalities are exacerbated. We investigated the private solution trap with a collective action game featuring private and public solutions, wealth inequality determined by luck or merit, and participants from 34 countries. We found that the joint existence of private solutions and wealth inequality had a consistent effect across countries: Participants given a higher endowment adopted private solutions almost twice as often as those given a lower endowment, regardless of whether it was determined by luck or merit, and contributed proportionally less toward public solutions. Wealth inequality increased in every country and those given lower endowments were often left unprotected as public solutions were not provided. Across countries, cultural values of hierarchy and harmony were associated with preferences for private and public solutions, respectively. We also identified two universal pathways toward public solution provision: early contributions and conditional cooperation. Our findings highlight the ubiquity of the private solution trap, its cultural underpinnings, and its potential consequences for global collective action problems."},{"t":"阳离子舞步：超亲电催化中硅基正离子、碳正离子与芳基正离子的相互作用","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00025-2?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"观点评论","tp":"超亲电催化","kp":["[催化机制]: 硅鎓/碳鎓/芳鎓离子协同(超亲电)"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"提出\"阳离子洗牌\"概念，描述硅鎓离子、碳鎓离子和芳鎓离子在超亲电催化中的相互转化机制。这三种阳离子作为常见催化中间体，其动态互变构成了催化的核心驱动力。该工作统一了看似不同的超亲电催化反应机理，为设计和理解强酸催化体系提供了新理论框架。","ot":"The Cation Shuffle: Interplay of silylium, carbenium, and arenium ions in superelectrophile catalysis","b":"The concept of The Cation Shuffle describes the interplay of silylium, carbenium, and arenium ions as a common mechanistic feature in superelectrophile catalysis. Against this background, recent advances in silylium-ion-promoted transformations are collated based on their underlying mechanisms, and an outlook into the design of novel catalytic processes is provided."},{"t":"余热利用与储备市场参与下混合蒸汽-电力能源系统的技术经济优化","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003752?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热电联产","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蒸汽电力系统优化","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Techno-economic optimization of hybrid steam-electric energy systems with excess heat utilization and reserve market par"},{"t":"任务诱发的功能连接与执行功能相对于任务表现出新颖且强化的关系。","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516929123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Executive functioning in children has been linked to intrinsic brain network organization assessed during the resting state, as well as to brain network organization during the performance of cognitive tasks. Prior work has established that task-based brain networks are stronger predictors of behavior than resting state networks, yet it is unclear if tasks only strengthen relationships that exist weakly at rest or if tasks also evoke unique relationships. A lack of discernment regarding how tasks and the resting state commonly and uniquely support executive functions precludes a holistic understanding of the neurobiological basis of executive functions. This project investigated differences in brain network organization and relationships with executive function ability between the resting state and two executive function tasks, a stop signal task and an emotional n-back task, using the Adolescent Brain and Cognitive Development Study dataset. Both executive function tasks evoked a more integrated network organization than the resting state, and executive function ability was related to different aspects of brain network organization during the resting state and during the tasks. Further, task-related shifts in brain network organization evoked several new relationships with executive function that were not detectable during the resting state and strengthened a relationship with executive function that existed weakly during the resting state. Overall, this study establishes a distinction between common and unique features of intrinsic and task-evoked brain function that facilitate executive function in children."},{"t":"用于癌症免疫治疗的 TLR9 激活胆固醇氮杂环丁烷衍生物辅助治疗疫苗","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb2465?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Therapeutic cancer vaccines show great promise for de novo induction of antigen-specific T cell responses against tumors. However, weak coordination between innate immune activation and antigen delivery remains a major obstacle to vaccine efficacy. Here, we present a cholesterol azetidine derivative–assisted polymeric carrier, Aze-Chol NP, which stimulates innate immunity and primes tumor-specific CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell responses. Mechanistically, Aze-Chol NP induces maturation and activation of dendritic cells (DCs) through the Toll-like receptor 9 (TLR9) pathway while simultaneously delivering protein or peptide antigens to DCs in lymph nodes. The Aze-Chol NP–based nanovaccines markedly inhibited tumor growth and prolonged survival in melanoma and human papillomavirus tumor models. Moreover, combining the nanovaccine with an anti–PD-L1 antibody produced a strong synergistic effect and long-term immune memory, achieving 80% survival beyond 100 days and complete rejection of tumor cell rechallenge. Overall, our study demonstrates that this TLR9-activating carrier provides an effective and straightforward strategy for developing potent cancer vaccines."},{"t":"嘧啶合成阻断所针对的小细胞癌中 RB 丢失和 E2F3 抑制之间的综合致死率","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2532814123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Small cell carcinoma is a highly lethal cancer variant often found with neuroendocrine (NE) features, as exemplified by small cell lung cancer and small cell NE prostate cancer (SCPC). A genome-wide CRISPR dependency screen using SCPC models generated through human prostate cell transformation identifies a requirement for the transcription factor E2F3. E2F3 dependency is linked to RB inactivation, a near universal occurrence across small cell cancers. The requirement for E2F3 is shared by RB-deficient cells originating from the prostate, lung, and adnexa. In RB-deficient cancer cells, E2F3 inhibition restrains cell cycle progression, proliferation, and tumor growth in vivo. Inhibition of de novo pyrimidine synthesis limits E2F3 expression and suppresses small cell carcinoma proliferation in culture. Directly or indirectly targeting E2F3 to leverage a pan-cancer synthetic lethality resulting from RB inactivation represents a potential treatment strategy."},{"t":"锂离子电池可持续回收：面向整电池再生的新兴技术展望","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003946?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锂电池全电池再生","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":7.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Sustainable recycling of Lithium-ion batteries: A perspective on emerging technologies toward entire cell regeneration"},{"t":"自旋轨道耦合超导体中磁性杂质的超电流控制自发铁磁性","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70968-1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Conventional superconductors disfavor ferromagnetism because the supercurrent-carrying electrons are paired into anti-parallel spin singlets. Consequently, ferromagnetic coupling between localized moments through the charge carriers is absent in s-wave superconductors. However, Rashba-type spin-orbit coupling (SOC) can profoundly alter the interaction between the charge carriers and localized spins. Here, we report long-range ferromagnetic order among the impurity moments on the surface of an s-wave SOC superconductor, Fe(Se, Te). We employ scanning superconducting quantum interference device microscopy and find suppressed vortex states but spontaneous magnetic domains in the superconducting state. Homogeneous remanent flux patterns are induced by applying supercurrents through the sample. The patterns are consistent with anomalous edge and bulk supercurrents generated by long-range in-plane magnetization related to the magneto-electric effect intrinsic to a Rashba superconductor. The anomalous supercurrents occur above a bias current threshold and follow hysteresis loops reminiscent of those of a ferromagnet. Surprisingly, the magnetic switching (super)current density is three orders of magnitude less than that in a ferromagnetic metal with SOC. These observations suggest an emergent ferromagnetic impurity state in a Rashba superconductor, which can be controlled by applying supercurrents.","tp":"超导铁磁性","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":1.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"在具有Rashba型自旋轨道耦合的s波超导体表面，磁性杂质间可实现长程铁磁有序。传统s波超导体中超流电子以反平行自旋单态配对，不利于铁磁性；但自旋轨道耦合深刻改变了载流子与局域自旋的相互作用，使铁磁耦合通过超电流被诱导。该发现为超导-铁磁界面物理及拓扑量子器件提供了新理解。"},{"t":"超丰富的 microRNA 由 CTCF 隔离的人 rDNA 间隔启动子转录而来","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec1451?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"microRNAs are ~22-nucleotide RNAs processed from primary transcripts and exported from the nucleus to repress gene expression by base-pairing to mRNAs. Unexpectedly, we find that the highest levels of RNA polymerase II (Pol II) at human microRNA genes are within the ribosomal gene repeat arrays (rDNAs). Alignment of public nascent transcript data to the hs1 human genome assembly reveals a 50-nucleotide transcript for both miR-1275 and miR-6724, which exits from the nucleus with exceptional rapidity. We show that the miR-1275/miR-6724 transcription unit is closely flanked by CCCTC-binding factor (CTCF) within a &lt;400-bp span of the rDNA spacer promoter. miR-1275/miR-6724 and microRNA precursors expressed from the 5′ external transcribed spacer (5′ETS) are exported independently of known RNA processing activities and are detected in exosomes and as circulating cancer biomarkers. We propose that the rDNA spacer promoter and 5′ETS microRNA genes have evolved for general regulatory functions in recipient cells."},{"t":"甘蔗条纹花叶病毒 P1 蛋白靶向 BES1 转录因子，破坏 pla 中 DAMP 触发的免疫","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adr9432?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Sugarcane streak mosaic virus (SCSMV) is the major cause of sugarcane mosaic disease. Its P1 protein (P1\n                    SCSMV\n                    ) is crucial for pathogenesis, but how it disrupts plant immunity remains unclear. Here, we found that P1\n                    SCSMV\n                    directly binds to the core transcription factor of brassinosteroid signaling, NbBES1, disrupting its binding to the E-box elements of the xyloglucan endotransglucosylase/hydrolase gene 1 (\n                    NbXTH1\n                    ) promoter and suppressing\n                    NbXTH1\n                    transcription.\n                    NbXTH1\n                    overexpression enhanced the plant resistance to fungal/viral infection, improved the contents of xyloglucan, which directly induced a damage-associated molecular pattern triggering innate immunity (DTI) and expression of several defense genes, and accompanied with a thickened middle lamellae and primary cell wall. Reduced xyloglucan due to\n                    NbXTH1\n                    downexpression further weakened DTI responses and a thinner cell wall. This study reveals how a viral protein subverts cell wall–mediated immunity and identifies NbXTH1 as a broad-spectrum disease resistance factor. Our findings support using xyloglucan or NbXTH1 to engineer broad-spectrum disease resistance in crops.","tp":"甘蔗花叶病","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"揭示甘蔗条纹花叶病毒(SCSMV)的P1蛋白致病机制：P1直接结合油菜素内酯信号核心转录因子NbBES1，干扰其与木葡聚糖内转糖基酶/水解酶基因E-box元件的结合，破坏植物DAMP触发的免疫应答。该研究阐明了病毒通过劫持激素信号通路逃逸植物免疫的分子策略，为甘蔗抗病育种提供靶点。"},{"t":"结构调控诱导自催化酰亚胺化构建高粘附离子导电聚酰亚胺网络","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4669180?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅负极粘结剂","kp":["粘结剂[硅负极]: 高粘附离子导电聚酰亚胺PIy","合成方法[聚酰亚胺]: 低温自催化酰亚胺化"],"as":"硅因其超高理论比容量被视为下一代锂离子电池最具潜力的负极材料之一，但充放电过程中剧烈的体积膨胀和导电性差等瓶颈限制了其应用。该研究通过结构定制策略，利用自催化酰亚胺化反应构建高性能硅基复合材料，有效缓解体积变化并提升电导率。该方法为突破硅负极工程化难题提供了新思路，对高能量密度储能器件的商业化具有积极推动作用。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Structure Tailoring Enabled Self‐Catalyzed Imidization for Engineering a Highly Adhesive and Ion‐Conductive Polyimide Ne","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Silicon (Si) is widely recognized as one of the most promising anode materials for next‐generation lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs). Nevertheless, its practical application is hindered by significant volume expansion and poor interfacial stability. Herein, a highly adhesive and ion‐conductive polyimide binder, denoted as PIy, is synthesized via low‐temperature self‐catalyzed imidization through the copolymerization of 3,3’,4,4’‐biphenyltetracarboxylic dianhydride (BPDA) with 2,2’‐bis[4‐(4‐aminophenoxy)phenyl]propane (BAPP) as the tough monomer, 4,4’‐diamino‐2,2’‐bipyridyl (DAPY) as a base‐catalyzing component, and 2‐(5‐amino‐2‐methylanilino)‐4‐(3‐pyridyl)pyrimidine (AMPY) as an end‐capping agent. DAPY and AMPY effectively lower the activation energy of poly(amic acid) imidization which enables cyclization to proceed at low temperatures and the pyridine groups promote Li\n                    +\n                    transport. BPDA and BAPP contain abundant aromatic rings that provide high toughness and impart a high modulus to suppress volume changes. Meanwhile, the flexible ‐O‐ segments enhance chain mobility adapting to expansion while maintaining structural integrity. The Si@PIy‐185 °C electrode exhibits excellent long‐term cycling stability, maintaining a high specific capacity of 1118.6 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 1 A g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    even after 1000 cycles.The full cell of the SiO\n                    x\n                    @PIy‐185 °C//NCM811 exhibits a remarkable capacity retention of 87.8% after 100 cycles, highlighting the potential of the low‐temperature imidized PI binder for high‐energy‐density LIBs.","aip":1},{"t":"底物结合和抑制人牛磺酸转运蛋白的结构机制","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70772-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Taurine is a sulfur-containing amino acid that plays several crucial roles in the body. Its uptake is mediated by the taurine transporter (TauT). Genetic mutations and dysregulation of TauT have been linked to various neurological disorders, cardiomyopathy, childhood progressive retinal degeneration, and cancer, making TauT a promising target for therapeutic intervention in these diseases. However, the structure and mechanism of TauT remain poorly understood. In this study, we present the structures of the human taurine transporter (hTauT) under four conditions: the substrate-free state, the taurine-bound state, the β-alanine-bound state, and the cyclic inhibitor piperidine-4-sulfonate (P4S)-bound state. These structures reveal that taurine binds at the central substrate-binding site of hTauT. Notably, β-alanine and the cyclic P4S inhibitors also mimic taurine, occupying the same substrate-binding site. In the substrate-free and P4S-bound forms, hTauT also adopt an inward-open conformation, where transmembrane helix TM1a bends toward the membrane, facilitating the opening of the intracellular gate for ion and substrate release. These structural insights enhance our understanding of the mechanisms underlying substrate and ion recognition and transport in hTauT, paving the way for the future development of taurine transporter substrate analogues or selective inhibitors."},{"t":"在单原子层超导体上观察到的反常金属态稳定涡旋","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adu9610?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The superconductor-insulator transition in two-dimensional (2D) systems has been extensively studied as a typical example of quantum phase transition. Recent investigations of highly conductive 2D systems have revealed an intervening metallic regime, in which the electrical resistivity saturates at the limit of zero temperature. The nature and origin of this metallicity remain debated, partly because of the lack of microscopic understanding. In this study, using scanning tunneling spectroscopy, we investigate the metallic state and other phases observed in crystalline Pb monoatomic-layer superconductors formed on vicinal semiconducting substrates. Our spectroscopic images reveal stable and isolated vortices in the metallic regime, distinct from delocalized or liquidized vortices. These findings suggest that the saturated resistance in the metallic state arises from the pinning-free vortex motion driven by the finite current applied for the transport measurements. Our disorder-controlled microscopic experiments provide new insights into the fluctuation-induced phases of ultrathin crystalline 2D superconductors.","tp":"反常金属态","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":1.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"利用扫描隧道谱在单原子层超导体上直接观测到反常金属态稳定涡旋结构。二维系统中超导-绝缘转变之间存在电阻饱和的金属中间态，其本质长期争议。该微观实验为反常金属态的涡旋起源提供了直接证据，对理解量子相变和二维超导的拓扑性质具有重要意义。"},{"t":"存在均匀刺激时的空间结构炎症反应","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2507102123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Inflammatory responses occur within the complex spatial context of tissues and organs, and many questions remain about how tissue structure and cellular communication shape their spatiotemporal dynamics. Here, we use a multiplexed RNA in situ hybridization approach, together with analytical tools, to study inflammatory gene expression in the larval zebrafish tailfin in response to a bath of lipopolysaccharide. We use this model system to address whether spatial structure emerges in the tissue response even absent the spatial variation introduced by a pathogen. We find that epithelial cells in the tailfin express several proinflammatory genes, and that across these genes, the uniform stimulus triggers a spatially nonuniform response. We use a graph-based spectral decomposition method to analyze its structure, and find that it is consistent with a diffusion-consumption model of secondary signaling. Overall, long-wavelength modes dominate the signal, creating zones of activation which account for a majority of the variation in gene expression. Our results show that epithelial cells are important producers of proinflammatory effector molecules in this system, and that tissue induces spatial correlations even absent a structured input."},{"t":"CO2电还原的从科学到技术突破：多物理场、多尺度与人工智能洞察","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516978?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"CO2电还原","kp":["[eCO2RR工程化]: 多物理多尺度AI弥合实验室与工程差距"],"as":"本综述系统阐述了CO2电还原反应（eCO2RR）从基础科学走向技术突破的多物理场建模与多尺度耦合框架。研究聚焦电化学反应器设计中的传质、电场分布和热管理等多物理场效应，结合从分子级到器件级的跨尺度建模策略，识别了限制CO2转化效率和选择性的关键瓶颈。文章为将实验室级电还原技术推进至工业级规模化提供了系统性的工程指导路线。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Science‐Towards‐Technology Breakthrough in CO2 Electroreduction: Multiphysics, Multiscale, and Artificial Intelligence I","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical carbon dioxide reduction reactions (eCO\n                    2\n                    RR) are a key technology for converting greenhouse gas CO\n                    2\n                    into high‐value‐added chemicals. In recent years, significant progress has been made in material design, catalytic mechanism analysis, and electrolyzer optimization. However, there remains a gap between “laboratory science” and “engineering practice” in current research. Most reviews are primarily based on the “material‐structure‐performance” model and have not yet established an integrated technical landscape combining multi‐physics, multi‐scale, and artificial intelligence (AI). This review centers on the industrialization goals of eCO\n                    2\n                    RR, establishing a multi‐scale research framework spanning from fundamental mechanisms to systems engineering. It covers four core areas: atomic‐level mechanism interpretation and characterization, interface microenvironment regulation, external field‐assisted optimization, and AI‐driven material design and reaction prediction. Through the closed‐loop integration of mechanism‐characterization‐optimization, this review emphasizes an overall synergistic strategy from materials to devices and from experiments to systems, aiming to establish a systematic research pathway for eCO\n                    2\n                    RR. This work not only provides a comprehensive research blueprint for the eCO\n                    2\n                    RR field but also offers methodological and strategic references for AI‐enabled catalytic material development, external field‐coupled performance enhancement, and the engineering of electrochemical carbon resource conversion."},{"t":"基于带隙工程 CuMnCrO4 尖晶石氧化物的可扩展太阳能蒸发器，具有抗盐污染性能","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72671?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光热","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Scalable Solar Evaporator In the Research Article by Ji-Hyun Jang and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202517285), a bandgap-engineered CuMnCrO4 spinel oxide is introduced as a high-performance photothermal absorber for solar desalination. Multi-cation design broadens solar absorption, enabling excellent evaporation rates. Integrated into an inverted U-shaped architecture, the system achieves continuous water transport, salt resistance, and exceptional stability under saline, extreme pH, and contaminated conditions, demonstrating scalable and durable freshwater production.","tp":"太阳能蒸发","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"采用带隙工程设计的CuMnCrO4尖晶石氧化物作为高效光热吸收剂，多阳离子设计拓宽了太阳能吸收谱。将其集成于倒U型结构蒸发器中，实现连续水输运、抗盐污染及在高盐、极端pH和污染条件下的优异稳定性，为可扩展太阳能海水淡化提供了新材料方案。"},{"t":"微量聚合物半导体增强的可扩展聚合物复合材料用于高性能电容储能","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521682?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/其它储能技术","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物介电储能","kp":["工作温度[聚合物介电储能]: 250°C","策略[高温介电]: 聚合物固溶体协同微量半导体"],"as":"该研究提出利用微量聚合物半导体掺杂策略显著提升高温聚合物介电复合材料的储能性能。下一代电力电子系统对耐高温电容器介质材料需求迫切，传统聚合物介电材料在高温环境下击穿强度和能量密度急剧下降。研究通过在聚合物基体中引入极少量半导体组分，调控界面电荷分布与陷阱能级，有效抑制高温漏电流，在150°C以上仍保持高储能密度和充放电效率。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Scalable Polymer Composites Enhanced by Trace‐Amount Polymer Semiconductor for High‐Performance Capacitive Energy Storag","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐temperature polymer dielectrics are critically needed for capacitive energy storage in next‐generation power electronics operating above 200 °C, yet their practical application is severely limited by thermally activated charge transport that leads to exponentially increased conduction loss and premature breakdown. Here, we report a polymer solid‐solution strategy that simultaneously preserves intrinsic insulation while elevating trap energy levels through the incorporation of an ultralow fraction of a linear semiconducting polymer. The semiconducting chains are molecularly dispersed, functioning as electronic structure modulators rather than transport pathways. The simple nitrogen‐containing conjugated segments generate deep localized traps with high positive electrostatic potential, which immobilize injected electrons by increasing the high‐energy‐level trap density and suppressing hopping conduction at elevated temperatures. Consequently, the composite exhibits a 1940% enhancement in capacitive performance relative to the pristine polymer, while maintaining ≥90% charge–discharge efficiency. The fully organic solid‐solution films simultaneously achieve a high energy density of 3.9 J cm\n                    −3\n                    and 90% efficiency at 250 °C, together with ultrahigh long‐term stability. This work establishes a distinct route for decoupling insulation from trap engineering in polymer dielectrics and provides a scalable, low‐cost platform for high‐temperature energy storage applications."},{"t":"热剪刀石头布链中的鲁棒拓扑温度局域化","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag169/8530524?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"拓扑热超材料","kp":["[拓扑热管理]: Peltier耦合主动三体系统实现温度局域化"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"在热\"石头-剪刀-布\"链结构中实现了稳健的拓扑温度局域化。研究将拓扑物理概念引入热管理领域，利用拓扑热超材料的非对称热导率设计，实现温度在特定区域的稳定局域化。该拓扑保护机制对结构缺陷具有鲁棒性，为精确热流调控和热逻辑器件设计提供了新范式。","ot":"Robust topological temperature localization in thermal rock-paper-scissors chain","b":"Emerging topological thermal physics has revolutionized thermal management with topological thermal metamaterials, but most of them only consider the passive/static thermal diffusion. Inspired by ecological dynamics, we investigate the topological thermal physics in an active/dynamic three-body heat transfer system connected with Peltier modules, where the cyclic interaction is exemplified by the rock-paper-scissors (RPS) chain. Numerical simulations demonstrate a robust temperature localization phenomenon against parametric disturbance and structural perturbations, and topological phase transition in thermal RPS chain is discussed via topological band theory analysis of the corresponding Hamiltonian. Our findings establish a framework for exploring dynamic topological phenomena in non-equilibrium thermal transport, offering new pathways for active thermal management.","aip":1},{"t":"重新审视碱金属与液态电池电解液接触时的电化学响应","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506747?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碱金属电极响应","kp":["[碱金属电极]: EIS揭示Na/K电化学响应的温度浓度依赖"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"碱金属电极作为高能量密度负极在半电池和全电池体系中至关重要，但其在液态电解液中的电化学响应机制仍存争议。本文系统回顾了锂、钠、钾等碱金属电极与液态电解液接触时的界面反应行为，重点分析了固态电解质界面膜(SEI)的形成动力学、枝晶生长机制以及寄生反应对库伦效率和循环稳定性的影响。研究指出，不同碱金属的化学活性差异导致界面化学行为显著不同，这对高比能电池的设计与电解液优化具有指导意义。","ot":"Revisiting the Electrochemical Response of Alkali Metals in Contact With Liquid Battery Electrolytes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Alkali metal electrodes are of great importance as high energy density anodes and counter electrodes in half‐cells, but their electrochemical response, especially for sodium and potassium metal, is currently not well understood. Herein, electrochemical impedance spectroscopy (EIS) and complementary galvanostatic polarization have been used to study temperature, time and concentration dependence of symmetric cells with alkali metal electrodes and model electrolytes, extract information on porosity of solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) in different cases, activation energy and charge transfer resistance, assess chemical diffusion coefficients, as well as temperature and time‐dependent effective cationic transference numbers upon longer rest. We show how the same chemistry‐agnostic EIS equivalent circuit model can be used to explain the EIS results in symmetric cells. Most importantly, we show that charge transfer contribution is considerable in these systems, that both resistances and activation energies of SEIs should be used to evaluate them, and that effective cationic transference number degrades in both Li and Na cells upon time ageing."},{"t":"BacNav 基因疗法调节钠/钙稳态可挽救慢性心力衰竭的心功能障碍","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady4551?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Despite continued progress, therapies to augment contractile function and prevent arrhythmias in patients with heart failure remain limited. Here, we present a two-pronged gene therapy approach that simultaneously augments peak Na\n                    +\n                    current and Ca\n                    2+\n                    transient amplitude in cardiomyocytes (CMs) to alleviate heart failure pathogenesis. Using in vitro engineered neonatal rat heart tissues, ex vivo adult mouse CMs, and in silico rabbit CMs, we show that expression of prokaryotic Na\n                    +\n                    channels (BacNa\n                    v\n                    ) dose-dependently enhances Ca\n                    2+\n                    transients and contractility of CMs by modulating Na\n                    +\n                    /Ca\n                    2+\n                    exchanger activity and increasing sarcoplasmic reticulum Ca\n                    2+\n                    stores. In mice, adeno-associated virus 9 (AAV9)–mediated BacNa\n                    v\n                    therapy rescues contractile deficit, prevents arrhythmias, and improves transcriptomic dysregulation in a pressure-overload induced model of chronic heart failure. We further establish the safety of long-term systemic delivery of AAV9-BacNa\n                    v\n                    in mice. Collectively, these studies support the translational promise of BacNa\n                    v\n                    gene delivery as an effective therapy for electrical and contractile dysfunction in heart failure."},{"t":"心血管介入手术接触力传感技术的最新进展（Adv. Mater. 17/2026）","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72686?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Contact Force Sensing Techniques This cover highlights recent advances in contact force sensing for cardiovascular interventions, focusing on compact, accurate, and instrument-integrable haptic sensor designs. By analyzing innovations in sensing mechanisms, functional materials, structural engineering, and performance optimization, it reveals new opportunities for enhanced surgical guidance, real-time feedback, robotic-assisted interventions, diagnosis, and therapy, enabling safer and more effective interventional procedures. More details can be found in the Review by Le Song, Dae-Hyeong Kim, Liu Wang, and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202513239).","tp":"力传感技术","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"综述了心血管介入手术中接触力传感技术的最新进展，聚焦紧凑、高精度、可器械集成的触觉传感器设计。从传感机制、功能材料、结构工程和性能优化等方面分析创新点，为术中实时力反馈、机器人辅助介入和更安全的手术导航提供新机遇。"},{"t":"彩虹光子晶体：碳水化合物刷状嵌段共聚物的自组装","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72667?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光子晶体自组装","kp":["材料[光子晶体]: 寡糖刷状嵌段共聚物自组装"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"as":"本研究利用含寡糖单元的生物基刷状嵌段共聚物(carbohydrate bottlebrushes)，通过自组装构建了彩虹色光子晶体结构。该材料通过调节嵌段共聚物的分子参数(如刷链长度、组成比例)，实现了可见光全光谱范围的周期性纳米结构调控，呈现从蓝到红的连续结构色。这种生物基、可调谐的光子晶体在光学传感、防伪标签和结构色涂层等领域具有广阔应用前景，展示了碳水化合物基聚合物在光子材料设计中的独特优势。","ot":"Rainbow Photonic Crystals: Self‐Assembly of Carbohydrate Bottlebrushes Block Copolymers (Adv. Mater. 17/2026)","b":"Rainbow Photonic Crystals This illustration depicts a bio-based brush block copolymer incorporating oligosaccharide units that self-assemble into a layered architecture. Incoming natural white light interacts with the periodic structure and is reflected as a spectrum of colors, illustrated by the rainbow, highlighting the material's capability to manipulate light through its precisely engineered nanoscale morphology. More details can be found in Research Article by Redouane Borsali and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202514152)."},{"t":"定量系统漂移","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527137123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"We consider a biological system composed of multiple genetically variable components, the combined result of which is a quantitative trait under stabilizing selection for an optimal value. We show mathematically that, while the mean value of the system is ultimately constrained to remain near its optimum, the mean contributions of individual components are free to drift far from their initial values. Each component’s drift, though qualitatively identical to neutral drift, is slower by a factor that depends on the fraction of the system’s genetic variance contributed by the component. We further show that symmetric mutation between alleles that increase and decrease components’ contributions to the system imposes a weak long-term brake on components’ drift. Our results provide a population-genetic basis for “system drift,” the concept that individual components of a biological system can evolve despite selective constraint on their combined product. A special case is a single polygenic trait under stabilizing selection, where our results predict that the mean contributions to the trait of different subregions of the genome, such as the chromosomes, can drift despite constraint on the genome-wide value. To indicate the broad applicability of our results, we explore their implications for the evolution of gene expression, selection against interspecific hybrids, selection against turnovers of sex-determining systems, and the division of labor in mutualisms."},{"t":"使用生物医学基础模型量化体外人类细胞培养系统的保真度","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520482123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Primary cell culture is fast becoming a dominant method for discovery work regarding human disease. Currently, there are no methods to quantitatively benchmark these systems. Here, we apply a uniform in vitro culture system of human intestinal epithelial cells (IECs) to achieve this goal. We previously established methods for long-term two-dimensional (2D) cultivation of mouse IECs using an air–liquid interface (ALI) technique. Here, we further refined these methods for long-term 2D cultivation of human IECs, with histological and molecular features of differentiated intestinal epithelia. Leveraging the power and scalability of a biomedical foundation model (BMFM) trained on single-cell RNA sequencing data (BMFM-RNA), we performed classification tasks to identify cell types across sample sources and to quantitatively benchmark our in vitro differentiated cells against cells collected from patient biopsies. We observed a striking concordance between our in vitro differentiated cells and the corresponding cell types in vivo for multiple differentiated secretory cell types. This approach using BMFM-RNA holds promise to expand our understanding of the regulatory mechanisms, including gene–gene regulation underlying homeostasis and regeneration, as well as the functions of rare and poorly understood lineages within the human intestinal epithelia. Moreover, these methods may be applicable to other organs, model systems, and experimental modalities. We propose that the framework used here can be deployed as a standard benchmarking methodology, ultimately improving the fidelity of primary human culture systems."},{"t":"质子转移调控的萘二甲酰亚胺光固化鲁棒室温磷光","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70999-8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光固化室温磷光","kp":["[室温磷光]: 萘酰亚胺光固化RTP(兼引发剂)","[调控]: 质子转移调控磷光"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了一种由质子转移调控的光固化稳健室温磷光（RTP）材料。光固化RTP材料虽具有可观的应用前景，但由于磷光发射对分子刚性环境的苛刻要求，此前鲜有报道。该工作通过质子转移机制实现了室温条件下的高效持久磷光，为柔性光电子器件、防伪标签和生物成像等领域的应用开辟了新路径。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Proton transfer regulated photocured robust room-temperature phosphorescence from naphthalimide","b":"Photocured room-temperature phosphorescence (RTP) materials have considerable potential applications but are rarely reported. Here, we reported photocured RTP materials from naphthalimide, which simultaneously acts as RTP chromophore and photo-initiator. Specifically, naphthalimide generates radicals to polymerize acrylic acid and acrylamide upon UV irradiation. The resulting naphthalimide is tightly restricted in in-situ formed crosslinked matrix to achieve robust RTP (τp = 389.58 ms, φp = 17.83%, water and organic solvents resistance). Significantly, carboxyl can bind onto lone-pair electrons of tertiary amine in naphthalimide through proton transfer hydrogen-bonds (PTHBs), inhibiting nonradiative decay of S1 induced by photoinduced electron transfer (PET); increasing spin-orbit coupling (SOC) to promote intersystem crossing (ISC); cooperating with intermolecular hydrogen-bonds afford rigid microenvironment to stabilize triplet excitons. Moreover, afterglow colors are continuously tuned after loading different mass RhB via energy transfer. The as prepared materials are used as RTP inks for fabricating 3D printing and photopatterning for anti-counterfeiting and information encryption applications."},{"t":"蛋白质过剩是由生长稳健性驱动的","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz9623?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Protein expression levels optimize cell fitness: Too low an expression level of essential proteins will slow growth by compromising essential processes, whereas overexpression slows growth by increasing the metabolic load. This trade-off naïvely predicts that cells maximize their fitness by sufficiency, expressing just enough of each essential protein for function. We test this prediction in the naturally competent bacterium\n                    Acinetobacter baylyi\n                    by characterizing the proliferation dynamics of essential-gene knockouts at a single-cell scale (by imaging) as well as at a genome-wide scale. In these experiments, cells proliferate for multiple generations as target protein levels are diluted from their endogenous levels. This approach facilitates a proteome-scale analysis of the fitness landscape with respect to protein abundance. We find that most essential proteins are subject to a threshold-like fitness landscape: Growth is independent of protein abundance above a critical threshold and arrests below that threshold. We have recently analyzed the implications of this landscape for growth robustness. Confirming signature predictions of this model, we find that (i) roughly 70% of essential proteins are overabundant, (ii) overabundance increases as the expression level decreases, and (iii) the lowest abundance proteins are in vast excess (&gt;10×) of what is required for growth in the typical cell. These results reveal that robustness plays a fundamental role in determining the expression levels of essential genes and that overabundance is a key mechanism for ensuring robust growth."},{"t":"水模板纳米多孔铁电体中的可编程双极光电流用于无滤光片光谱识别","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72876?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电双极光电流光谱识别","kp":["[器件]: 水模板多孔铁电体双极光电流","[功能]: 免滤波光谱识别"],"as":"该研究在水模板法制备的多孔铁电材料中实现了可编程双极性光电流。双极性电流器件因电流方向的可控自由度而成为下一代电子学的候选方案。利用水分子模板形成的纳米多孔结构，通过铁电畴翻转实现对光生载流子极性的可逆编程，为光电突触器件、逻辑运算和神经形态计算提供了新的材料平台。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Programmable Bipolar Photocurrents in Water‐Templated Nanoporous Ferroelectrics for Filter‐Free Spectral Recognition","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Bipolar current devices hold promise for next‐generation electronics, as the additional degree of freedom in current direction enables multistate logic, adaptive sensing, and reconfigurable circuits beyond the binary paradigm. However, their practical implementation in ferroelectrics has been constrained, since polarization switching typically requires an external power supply, restricting zero‐bias devices to unidirectional carrier transport and thereby limiting versatility. Here, we report a water‐templated strategy for fabricating nanoporous Bi\n                    0.5\n                    Na\n                    0.5\n                    TiO\n                    3\n                    (BNT) films with uniform and tunable pore architectures. By coupling photovoltaic and thermoelectric effects, the devices exhibit wavelength‐dependent polarity reversal, producing positive photocurrents at 405 nm and negative photocurrents at 785 nm. The polarity‐reversal threshold is programmable through pore density, overcoming the intrinsic unipolarity of zero‐bias ferroelectric devices. Integrated into a monolithic platform, these porous devices simultaneously discriminate optical wavelength and intensity through polarity‐encoded outputs, establishing a foundation for biomimetic vision systems and ternary light‐controlled logic.","aip":1},{"t":"用于规模化太阳能CO2转化的可印刷牛顿流体光催化剂","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70819-z","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化CO2转化","kp":["[牛顿流体光催化剂]: 纳米中空咪唑框架+光激发液态链","[可印刷]: 解决粉末催化剂规模化难题","[固液界面]: 分子间作用+空间位阻效应"],"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"光催化CO2还原技术的规模化应用长期受限于粉末催化剂难处理、难放大的问题。本文报道了一种可印刷的牛顿流体光催化剂体系，兼具良好的流动性和光催化活性，可通过涂覆、喷涂等方式实现大面积制备。该催化剂体系在太阳能驱动的CO2还原反应中表现出高效且稳定的CO和CH4生成速率，为光催化CO2转化的工程化放大提供了实用化解决方案，突破了粉末催化剂在规模化反应器设计中的瓶颈。","ot":"Printable Newtonian fluid photocatalysts for scale-up solar CO2 conversion","b":"Photocatalysts are usually in powder form, which makes it difficult to expand the scale of photocatalysis. Here, we report a Newtonian fluid photocatalyst, which consists of an internal nano-hollow imidazole framework and an external light-excitable liquid chain striking a pose on the stage. Due to the intermolecular interaction at the solid-liquid interface and significant steric hindrance effect, the Newtonian fluid catalyst with higher surface tension can firmly adhere to different kinds of scaffolds via simple printing, such as curved surfaces, inclined walls, and grids. In addition to the easier scale-up, the pore structure of frameworks favors faster CO2 mass transfer, and the liquid chain with a co-catalytic effect serves as the electron donor for efficient CO2 photoreduction. In this work, the Newtonian fluid photocatalyst achieves a 57.8-fold increase in CO overflow efficiency (100% selectivity), and this universal synthesis method can convert common organic/inorganic photocatalysts into similar Newtonian fluid photocatalysts."},{"t":"政策驱动的战略性绿色技术创新路径：氢和碳捕获、利用案例","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"氢与碳捕获","sc":2.3,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"光热催化与热催化对比：钯催化分子间三组分C─H 1,3-N,O-双官能化反应","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec9841?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钯催化碳氢活化","kp":["[C-H双官能化]: Pd催化光热三组分1,3-N,O-双官能化"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"过渡金属催化的C-H官能化反应中选择性控制是核心挑战。本文以钯催化的分子间三组分C-H双官能化反应为模型，系统比较了光热催化(可见光照射+加热)与传统热催化两种策略的选择性差异和产物分布。研究表明，光热协同条件下可生成独特的1,3-N,O-双官能化产物，而单纯热催化则导向不同路径。机理研究揭示了光激发态钯中间体的关键作用，为C-H活化反应的选择性精准调控提供了新策略。","ot":"Photothermal catalysis versus thermal catalysis: A palladium-catalyzed intermolecular three-component C─H 1,3-N,O-difunc","b":"Although transition metal–catalyzed C─H activation has notably advanced C─H functionalization, achieving highly selective C─H difunctionalization remains a substantial challenge. Current C─H difunctionalization strategies remain largely constrained to two-component annulation reactions or dicarbofunctionalization, which inherently limit structural diversity and synthetic efficiency. Here, we report a palladium-catalyzed three-component C─H 1,3-\n                    N\n                    ,\n                    O\n                    -difunctionalization of 3-phenylpropanamide using azodicarboxylate in conjunction with either dioxygen or carboxylic acid. This approach selectively delivers distinct 1,3-\n                    N\n                    ,\n                    O\n                    -difunctionalized products through either photothermal or thermal pathway, affording moderate to high yields with excellent site selectivity and broad functional group tolerance, which can be readily transformed into various valuable heterocyclic compounds. Extensive experimental and computational studies reveal that the reaction operates via a complex and continuous catalytic cycle rather than by tandem, independent steps. By integrating principles of C─H activation, electrophilic amination, difunctionalization, and photothermal catalysis, this work expands the toolbox for selective multiple bond formation and will attract more interest in various fields."},{"t":"佩德罗·A·桑切斯 (Pedro A. Sanchez，1940–2026)，社会土壤科学家","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2604417123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Cuban-born Pedro A. Sanchez (1940-2026) became the face of tropical soil science at Cornell University and the North Carolina State University. His combination of process-based understanding of soils, emphasis on farmer choices and conducive policy environments earned him the 2022 World Food prize. After leadership roles in international agroforestry research in Kenya, he returned to academia at Columbia University and the University of Florida, and as a member of the U.S. National Academy of Sciences."},{"t":"饼状表面卤化物-氟硫醇盐富集的Au12Ag30纳米团簇用于缺陷钝化与防潮屏蔽","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519239?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属纳米簇钝化","kp":["钝化剂[钙钛矿电池]: 薄饼状Au12Ag30纳米团簇缺陷钝化防潮"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本文报道了功能性导向合成的Au12Ag30双金属纳米团簇，其表面富集卤素-氟硫醇配体，呈独特的扁平(pancake)结构。该团簇作为钙钛矿太阳能电池的缺陷钝化层，能有效钝化表面缺陷并形成疏水屏蔽层，显著抑制水分侵入导致的降解。优化后的器件实现了更高的光电转换效率和优异的环境稳定性，展示了原子精确金属纳米团簇在钙钛矿光伏缺陷工程中的新应用范式。","ot":"Pancake‐Like Surface Halide‐Fluorothiolate‐Enriched Au12Ag30 Nanoclusters for Defect Passivation and Moisture Shielding ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    There are few examples of the function‐oriented synthesis of atomically precise metal nanoclusters (NCs) whose ligand composition and geometry readily translate into device‐level performance. Here, we report the design and synthesis of the pancake‐like [Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    (SPh\n                    3,5−\n                    (CF\n                    3\n                    )\n                    2\n                    )\n                    10\n                    Br\n                    20\n                    ]\n                    6−\n                    (Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    ) NC, and its use to boost the power conversion efficiency (PCE) and durability of perovskite solar cells. Single‐crystal x‐ray diffraction of Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    revealed an Au\n                    12\n                    icosahedron wrapped by a six‐layer Ag\n                    30\n                    shell, the (100) facets of which are capped by 20 Br\n                    −\n                    ligands, with 10 ‐CF\n                    3\n                    ‐bearing thiolates forming a hydrophobic equatorial belt. Introducing 0.5 mg/mL of this cluster into ((FA\n                    0.95\n                    Cs\n                    0.05\n                    )PbI\n                    3\n                    )\n                    0.975\n                    (MAPbBr\n                    3\n                    )\n                    0.025\n                    perovskite films boosted the device PCE from 23.55% to 25.53% and enables 94.8% retention after 1142 h of continuous one‐sun illumination. Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    is also distinguished by its −6 superatomic charge, and 66.7% surface halogen coverage—the highest ever reported. These findings establish anisotropic halide/thiolate‐protected NCs as potent additives for simultaneous defect passivation and environmental protection in high‐efficiency optoelectronics.","aip":1},{"t":"MOF中锆位点与羟基协同生成过氧物种实现高效串联氧化缩合反应","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72877?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF串联氧化催化","kp":["催化剂[MOF-808]: Zr位点-端羟基对","[机制]: 活化H2O2生成非自由基Zr-OOH"],"as":"该研究报道了一种基于金属有机框架（MOF）中锆位点与羟基协同作用的新型催化体系，用于芳香胺选择性氧化生成偶氮芳烃化合物。偶氮芳烃是重要的精细化工中间体，传统合成方法存在选择性差、副产物多等问题。研究通过精准设计MOF中锆活性位点与邻近羟基的配位微环境，实现了对过氧物种的原位生成与调控，从而高效驱动芳香胺的选择性氧化反应。该策略为多相催化中选择性氧化反应的活性位点工程提供了新思路，在药物合成、染料制造等领域具有应用潜力。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Pairs of Zirconium Site and Hydroxyl in MOFs Enable Generating Peroxo Species for Efficiently Tandem Oxidative Condensat","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Selective oxidation of aromatic amines to azoxyarenes is important but challenging owing to complex reaction pathways. Here, we report that constructing pairs of Lewis acidic Zr sites and terminal hydroxyl in zirconium trimesate MOF‐808 enables activation of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    for the formation of non‐radical Zr‐OOH species via hydrogen‐bonding interaction, achieving tandem oxidation of aniline to intermediates and their condensation into azoxybenzene via a non‐radical pathway. This catalyst displays 97.1% selectivity for azoxybenzene at nearly complete conversion under 25°C, along with good stability over fifteen successive runs, which is far superior to contrast ZrO\n                    2\n                    and Zr(OH)\n                    4\n                    . Moreover, the gram‐scale synthesis of azoxybenzene is achieved through Zr‐OOH species. Its universality is validated by the tandem oxidative condensation of 22 aniline derivatives to corresponding homo‐coupled azoxyarenes as well as the successful synthesis of 6 hetero‐condensation azoxyarenes. Substantially, the general applicability is confirmed by constructing other MOFs‐based pairs of Lewis acidic metal sites and terminal hydroxyl for achieving excellent performances to produce azoxybenzene. This work establishes a new avenue for H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    activation via major‐auxiliary cooperation to drive selective oxidation reactions."},{"t":"能源密集型产业脱碳的氢气供应优化：多时间尺度滚动时域方法","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003843?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"工业氢气供应优化","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Optimization of hydrogen supply operations for decarbonizing energy-intensive industries: A multi-timescale rolling hori"},{"t":"液态空气储能与核能和风能耦合系统的优化与经济性评估","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003818?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/其它储能技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液态空气储能","kp":["[技术]: 液态空气储能耦合核电与风电","[评估]: 优化与经济性分析"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Optimisation and economic assessment of liquid air energy storage integrated with nuclear and wind power"},{"t":"恶劣条件下具有稳定力学性能的超疏水织物一步制备","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70857-7","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","as":"该研究开发了一种一步法制备超疏水织物的方法，并赋予其稳定的力学性能。超疏水纺织品在户外服装、防护装备和工业应用中需求迫切，但现有方法普遍面临耐久性不足的问题——经过摩擦、拉伸或反复洗涤后疏水性能快速衰减。研究通过一步工艺将低表面能涂层与织物纤维牢固结合，在实现优异疏水性（接触角>150°）的同时显著提升了涂层的机械稳定性，有效解决了超疏水织物耐久性与功能性的矛盾，为高性能防水纺织品的规模化制备提供了可行路径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超疏水织物","kp":["制备工艺[超疏水织物]: 一步法无PFAS无纳米颗粒","性能特点[织物]: 机械应力下稳定超疏水"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"One-step fabrication of superhydrophobic fabrics with stable mechanical performance in harsh conditions","b":"Developing robust water-repellent textiles is critical for outdoor, protective, and industrial applications. However, achieving long-lasting water repellency under mechanical stress remains a significant challenge. Conventional approaches typically rely on nanoparticle assemblies or PFAS-based finishes, which often detach or degrade when subjected to abrasion or harsh conditions. Here, we demonstrate a molecularly assembled robust superhydrophobic shell (MARS) technique that directly constructs an ordered, covalently bonded, fluorine-free silica shell on individual yarn fibers via a one-step process. MARS eliminates the need for discrete nanoparticles or fluorinated chemistries and is compatible with a wide range of natural and synthetic fibers. This fiber-level treatment maintains superhydrophobicity even after the fibers are woven or knitted into finished textiles, while preserving breathability and mechanical resilience. MARS combines biomimetic inspiration with practical, scalable fabrication to meet urgent performance needs. Unlike conventional coatings that progressively degrade, the permanently bonded MARS coating endures intensive abrasion, high-velocity water impacts, steam exposure, and extreme temperature cycles. By addressing key challenges such as PFAS restrictions and the fragility of traditional coatings, the MARS method paves the way for next-generation water-repellent fabrics that balance sustainability and high performance across outdoor, protective, medical, and industrial applications."},{"t":"基于纳米纤维的电活性接口实现协调神经调节和周围神经再生","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72880?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Electrical modulation and repair of peripheral nerves rely on high‐quality tissue‐material bioelectronic interfaces. However, current conductive materials often exhibit unstable conductivity, mechanical mismatch, and limited processability, which compromise their ability to support both structural regeneration and long‐term neuromodulation. Here, we fabricate flexible electroactive core‐shell nanofibers via a one‐step coaxial electrospinning process, consisting of a poly(ε‐caprolactone) (PCL) core and a bi‐continuous conductive PEDOT:PSS/polyurethane (PEDOT:PSS/PU) shell. This design integrates mechanical compliance, continuous conductivity, and long‐term operational stability. The nanofibers can be assembled into flexible bioelectrodes that provide effective stimulation and high‐fidelity neural recording in rat sciatic and rhesus median nerves, while minimizing tissue damage typically caused by rigid metal electrodes. When processed into nerve guidance conduits, they bridge nerve gaps and promote axonal elongation, remyelination, and motor functional recovery in a rat sciatic nerve defect model. Overall, this platform enables synergistic structural repair and electrical modulation, offering a promising strategy for developing bioelectronic interfaces for tissue regeneration.","tp":"电活性接口","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"通过一步同轴静电纺丝制备柔性核壳电活性纳米纤维，由导电聚合物内核与生物相容性外壳构成，构建高质量神经-材料电子接口。该界面兼具稳定导电性、力学匹配性和可加工性，可同时支持周围神经的结构性再生与长期电神经调控，为神经修复与功能恢复提供新策略。"},{"t":"具有高持续活性的多环D-立体专一性水解酶二聚体","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521611?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"立体选择性水解酶","kp":["[酶工程]: 多环D-立体专一水解酶二聚体高持续活性"],"as":"研究报道了一种具有高持续催化活性的多环D-立体特异性二聚体水解酶。天然酶催化选择性转化效率优异，但在操作条件下稳定性有限常制约其工业应用。该研究通过二聚体工程化策略，构建了多环结构的水解酶复合物，显著提升了酶在反复催化循环中的活性保持率和立体选择性。这一设计为生物催化领域突破酶稳定性瓶颈提供了新思路，在药物手性合成、精细化学品生产等需要高立体选择性反应的场景中具有应用潜力。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Multicyclic D‐Stereospecific Hydrolase Dimer With High Sustained Activity","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Enzymes are powerful catalysts for selective transformations but often suffer from limited stability under operational conditions such as elevated temperature or the presence of organic cosolvents. While sequence‐based strategies have been widely used to improve stability, chemical protein engineering enables modifications beyond the natural amino acid repertoire thereby offering complementary routes to tailor enzyme function and robustness. Here, we apply the in situ cyclization of proteins (INCYPRO) to a D‐stereospecific hydrolase with low intrinsic thermal stability. Site‐specific macrocyclization substantially improved resilience to heat and cosolvent stress. Unexpectedly, we discovered a cross‐linked protein dimer with enhanced activity and thermal stability. The complex structure was confirmed by x‐ray crystallography. Extending the INCYPRO approach, we engineered a multicyclic enzyme dimer with a total of four cross‐linking sites, which not only retained high activity under benign conditions but also outperformed the wild‐type under stress. Our findings establish protein macrocyclization as a versatile strategy to stabilize both monomeric and multimeric enzymes, providing a powerful route to robust biocatalysts."},{"t":"分子表面自富集实现高效且机械稳定的柔性钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72859?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性钙钛矿太阳能电池","kp":["[界面工程]: 分子表面自积累改善柔性基底粗糙度","器件[柔性钙钛矿电池]: 高效机械稳健"],"as":"针对柔性钙钛矿太阳能电池（F-PSCs）在便携式能源系统中面临的机械稳定性和光电转换效率双重挑战，该研究提出分子表面自组装策略。通过在钙钛矿界面引入功能性分子实现自发有序排列，既优化了电荷传输路径提升光电效率，又增强了薄膜的机械韧性以抵抗弯折损伤。该方法为柔性光伏器件同时兼顾高效率和机械鲁棒性提供了新范式，推动了可穿戴和便携式能源的实际应用进程。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Molecular Surface Self‐Accumulation Toward High‐Efficiency and Mechanically Robust Flexible Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Flexible perovskite solar cells (F‐PSCs) have promising applications in building portable energy systems. However, the efficiency and stability of F‐PSCs still lag far behind their rigid counterparts. The efficiency gap stems mainly from the high roughness of flexible substrates, which aggravates the spatial heterogeneity within transporting interfaces and thus reduces the carrier transport efficiency. Moreover, dynamic stress induces cracks and interfacial delamination in F‐PSCs, resulting in significant mechanical stability issues. Here, we adopt a molecular surface self‐accumulation strategy to improve the spatial homogeneity of the self‐assembled monolayers (SAMs) by adding halogenated phenothiazine‐based molecules (Br‐4PAPT) into the perovskite precursor solution. The Br‐4PAPT diffuses to the bottom interface of the perovskite film to fill vacancies in the underlying SAMs during perovskite crystallization. This enhanced homogeneity translates to p‐i‐n structured ultra‐thin (9 µm) F‐PSCs achieving a record efficiency of 22.02% on an active area of 1 cm\n                    2\n                    and 24.47% on 0.1 cm\n                    2\n                    . Furthermore, the ultra‐thin large‐area F‐PSCs achieved a power‐per‐weight of 12.71 W/g. The strategy also reduces the Young's modulus at the bottom interface of the perovskite film. Coupled with mechanical neutral plane design, the ultra‐thin small‐area F‐PSCs maintained 91.81% efficiency after 10 000 bending cycles at a bending radius of 2 mm.","aip":1},{"t":"膜相关的 Rhes-Slc4a7 复合物协调隧道纳米管形成和突变亨廷顿蛋白扩散","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea1226?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Tunneling nanotubes (TNTs) are membranous structures that mediate intercellular transfer of proteins, including the pathogenic mutant Huntingtin (mHTT) protein in Huntington disease (HD). We previously identified the ras homolog enriched in the striatum (Rhes) as a key regulator of TNT formation and mHTT transmission; however, the molecular components underlying this process remained unknown. Here, using unbiased liquid chromatography–tandem mass spectrometry analysis of membrane-associated Rhes complexes, we identify Slc4a7 (solute carrier family 4 member 7), an intracellular pH sensor, as a top membrane-binding partner of Rhes. Functional studies revealed that small interfering RNA–mediated depletion or pharmacological inhibition of Slc4a7 substantially reduced Rhes-induced TNT formation and suppressed mHTT intercellular transfer. Mechanistically, Rhes directly interacts with Slc4a7 through both its amino- and carboxyl-terminal domains and modulates intracellular pH to facilitate TNT formation. This interaction does not depend on the transporter activity of Slc4a7. However, inhibition of Rhes farnesylation—a lipid modification that anchors Rhes to the membrane—disrupts its binding to Slc4a7 and abolishes TNT formation. Slc4a7 knock-out mice showed markedly reduced cell-to-cell transmission of mHTT in the striatum in vivo. Together, these findings uncover a previously unrecognized Rhes-Slc4a7 signaling axis critical for TNT-mediated mHTT transmission and highlight Slc4a7 as a potential therapeutic target to limit disease spread in HD."},{"t":"CARMIL 二聚化、自抑制和加帽蛋白结合的机制","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb4543?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Capping protein (CP) regulates actin-based motility by blocking monomer exchange at the filament barbed end. Several proteins, including CARMIL, bind CP and allosterically weaken its affinity for the barbed end. CARMIL comprises pleckstrin homology (PH), leucine-rich repeat (LRR), helical dimerization (HD), CP-binding region (CBR), and proline-rich (PR) domains, but their roles in CP regulation remain unclear. We show that CARMIL1 is partially autoinhibited, with CBR (CARMIL1\n                    961–1046\n                    ) displaying greater uncapping activity than CARMIL1\n                    1–1046\n                    . A structure of CP-bound CARMIL1\n                    1–1046\n                    reveals a dimeric assembly, with PH-LRR on a plane flanked by HD and CBR-bound CP. A motif connecting HD to CBR-CP, the “antenna,” binds at the dimer LRR-LRR interface. An antenna mutant disrupting this interaction partially relieves autoinhibition in vitro. In CARMIL1 knockout cells, expression of the antenna mutant increases cell area, while deleting the myosin-I–binding PR domain induces membrane spikes. The results inform mechanisms of CARMIL dimerization, autoinhibition, and coordination of CP and myosin-I activities in cells."},{"t":"磁耦合将软超材料中的随机屈曲转变为有序序列","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec3182?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磁耦合软超材料","kp":["[软超材料]: 磁耦合弹性实现有序序列屈曲编程"],"as":"研究揭示了磁耦合如何将软机械超材料中的无序弹跳变形转化为有序序列。机械超材料通过内部单元的级联弹跳实现多步可编程响应，但随机弹跳导致变形顺序不可控。该工作引入磁性元件间的耦合相互作用，使各单元弹跳行为相互协调，形成预定的有序变形序列。这一策略赋予超材料精确的时序编程能力，在可编程机械逻辑、软体机器人、可重构结构等领域具有广泛应用前景。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Magnetic coupling transforms random snapping into ordered sequences in soft metamaterials","b":"Mechanical metamaterials achieve multistep, programmable responses through sequential deformation driven by snapping instabilities, yet these sequences are typically governed by unavoidable imperfections, resulting in random and uncontrollable behavior. Here, we harness intra- and interlayer magnetic interactions coupled with elasticity to reprogram the ordering of sequential buckling instabilities in kirigami-inspired soft magnetic metamaterials. In single-layer systems, intralayer coupling among magnetized units produces random snapping sequences but generates strongly nonlinear-spiked force-displacement responses with pronounced hysteresis, in contrast to the simultaneous buckling of unmagnetized sheets. In multilayer assemblies, interlayer magnetic interactions trigger chain reaction–like propagation, transforming randomness into robust, directional snapping across structures. This mechanism establishes a paradigm for deterministic, multistep mechanical responses without continuously applied fields and opens avenues for adaptive materials in energy dissipation, waveguiding, reconfigurable soft robotics, and biomedical devices."},{"t":"Retromer 复合物对抗 mu 阿片受体的溶酶体下调","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx8715?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"A critical homeostatic mechanism for regulating G protein–coupled receptor (GPCR) activity is agonist-induced GPCR endocytosis and trafficking to the lysosome for proteolytic down-regulation. The mu opioid receptor (MOR) is a notable example of this type of cellular regulation, where prolonged exposure to high-efficacy opioid drugs causes MOR to traffic to the lysosome. Here, we used functional genomics to identify cellular proteins that control MOR lysosomal down-regulation. We found that the central regulator of MOR postendocytic trafficking is the Retromer complex, which rescues MOR from opioid-induced down-regulation by promoting MOR recycling from endosomes to the plasma membrane. Critically, MOR accesses the Retromer recycling pathway through its noncanonical bileucine recycling motif, and this mechanism controls how MOR is regulated following chronic exposure to opioid drugs. Additionally, we show that this bileucine pathway for Retromer-based recycling is present in other classes of membrane proteins including the glucose transporter GLUT4."},{"t":"过冷锑的液体反常与脆性","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531605123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"过冷锑液态","kp":["相变材料[超快开关]: 单原子锑","[过冷液态]: 锑液态异常与脆性关联可逆结晶"],"as":"基于锑（Sb）等第IV、V、VI族元素的相变材料（PCM）在数据存储和神经形态计算中应用广泛。本研究通过实验和模拟探究了过冷态锑液体的反常行为及其脆性（fragility）特征，发现其液态表现出偏离常规的非阿伦尼乌斯动力学行为。这一发现有助于深入理解相变材料从液态到非晶态的结构演化机理，对优化基于Sb的相变存储器件的写入速度、循环耐久性等性能指标具有指导价值。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Liquid anomalies and fragility of supercooled antimony","b":"Phase-change materials (PCMs) based on group IV, V, and VI elements, such as Ge, Sb, and Te, exhibit distinctive liquid-state features, including thermodynamic anomalies and unusual dynamical properties, which are believed to play a key role in their fast and reversible crystallization behavior. Antimony (Sb), a monoatomic PCM with ultrafast switching capabilities, stands out as the only elemental member of this group for which the properties of the liquid and supercooled states have so far remained unknown. In this work, we use large-scale molecular dynamics simulations with a neural network potential trained on first-principles data to investigate the liquid, supercooled, and amorphous phases of Sb across a broad pressure–temperature range. We uncover clear signatures of anomalous behavior, including a density maximum and nonmonotonic thermodynamic response functions, which are described by a two-state model based on the structural evolution of the liquid. Moreover, extrapolation of the viscosity to the glass transition, based on configurational and excess entropies, indicates that Sb is a highly fragile material. Our results present a compelling case for the connection between the liquid-state properties of PCMs and their unique ability to combine high amorphous-phase stability with ultrafast crystallization."},{"t":"液态金属用于可重构生物电子器件","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521174?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"液态金属生物电子","kp":["[可重构生物电子]: 液态金属实现主动可重构自适应界面"],"as":"未来生物电子技术需超越被动柔性，迈向主动可重构性。液态金属凭借高导电性、可变形性和良好生物相容性，成为可重构生物电子器件的理想材料。本文综述了液态金属在可穿戴传感、神经接口、软体机器人和植入式器件中的最新进展，重点讨论了微流控封装、电化学调控和自愈合等可重构策略。该方向有望实现按需调整形态与功能的智能生物电子系统，推动个性化医疗和人机交互的突破。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Liquid Metals for Reconfigurable Bioelectronics","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Future bioelectronic technologies must evolve beyond passive softness toward active reconfigurability, enabling intelligent interfaces that adapt to dynamic physiological and environmental changes. However, the inherently static architectures of most current devices hinder such adaptive reconfiguration or performance tuning, leading to a functional mismatch between dynamic biological systems and static electronic architectures. To bridge this gap, reconfigurable bioelectronics have emerged as a transformative paradigm capable of dynamically modulating their physical form and function in response to external or physiological stimuli. Liquid metals (LMs)—combining deformability, tunable stiffness, high electrical/thermal conductivity, multi‐stimuli responsiveness, and biocompatibility—offer a unique material platform for realizing intrinsic reconfigurability without structural complexity. By leveraging their material‐level reconfigurability, LM‐based bioelectronics achieve robust performance, versatile functionality, and dynamic biointegration, enabling multifunctional diagnostic, therapeutic, and interactive systems. This review provides a comprehensive overview of LM‐based reconfigurable bioelectronics, encompassing fundamental material properties, fabrication and design strategies, and major reconfiguration mechanisms. It further highlights emerging biomedical applications, ranging from implantable and wearable systems to soft robotics and haptic interfaces, and discusses key challenges and future directions for advancing LM‐based bioelectronics toward clinically viable, intelligent, and multifunctional platforms."},{"t":"通过原位成像照亮通过肺-心轴传播的铁死亡会加剧心血管疾病","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7388558?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Cigarette smoke (CS)‐induced lung injury is a risk factor for atherosclerotic cardiovascular diseases (ASCVDs), with both diseases sharing a common pathogenesis that encompasses ferroptosis. Studies have shown that ferroptosis can propagate in a wave‐like manner across cell populations; however, whether and how this propagation participates in the cross‐organ communication between lung injury and ASCVDs remains unknown. Here we developed two near‐infrared fluorescent probes, Cy‐F‐1 and Cy‐F‐2, with lung‐targeting and plaque‐targeting properties, respectively. Utilizing in vivo molecular fluorescence imaging, we explored the ferroptosis communication between lung injury and atherosclerosis (AS) by directly observing the dynamics of the ferroptosis marker, Fe\n                    2+\n                    . Imaging results found that upon exposure to CS, ferroptosis was initiated and propagated across the lung to aortic plaque regions in AS rats. In combination with biochemical and transcriptomic analyses, we have for the first time mapped a ferroptosis‐mediated signaling network linking both diseases: CS‐induced ROS accumulation → Nrf2‐GPX4 axis destruction → labile iron pool expansion → lung epithelial cells ferroptosis → lung inflammation injury → TNF‐α/IL‐1β/IL‐6 release → foam cell ferroptosis → ABCA1/ABCG1 downregulation → exacerbated AS. This study discovers the wave‐guided role of ferroptosis in the crosstalk between lung injury and AS, revealing the molecular mechanism of smoking‐aggravated ASCVDs.","tp":"铁死亡成像","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"开发两种近红外原位成像探针，首次可视化揭示铁死亡以波状方式通过肺-心轴跨器官传播，加剧动脉粥样硬化性心血管疾病。香烟烟雾诱导的肺损伤与ASCVD共享铁死亡通路，该研究阐明了跨器官细胞通讯的新机制，为肺源心血管并发症的干预提供新靶点。"},{"t":"预测电池寿命","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44286-026-00372-5","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Nature Chemical Engineering","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电池寿命预测","as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Learning battery lifetimes"},{"t":"本质上无序的蛋白质启发的基于纳米载体的凝聚层用于生物大分子的直接胞质运输","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72675?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Protein-Inspired Reconfigurable Nanovector-Based Coacervates Intrinsically disordered protein–inspired nanovectors undergo reversible conformational transitions that enable coacervate formation with diverse biomacromolecules. The resulting nanocoacervates remain stable under physiological conditions and can directly penetrate cellular membranes through the dynamic motion of the nanovectors. This platform supports efficient cytosolic delivery of a wide range of cargos, providing a versatile approach for intracellular transport technologies. More details can be found in the Research Article by Kwan Hyi Lee, Ja-Hyoung Ryu, Youngdo Jeong, and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202507877).","tp":"纳米药物递送","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"受内禀无序蛋白启发，设计可重构纳米载体基凝聚层，通过可逆构象转变与多种生物大分子形成纳米凝聚层。该体系在生理条件下稳定，可借纳米载体的动态运动直接穿透细胞膜，无需内吞逃逸即可实现大分子的高效胞质递送，为蛋白质、核酸等生物制剂的胞内运输提供通用平台。"},{"t":"空间电荷区本征缺陷补偿使无镉黄铜矿太阳能电池实现13.9%认证效率","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00550K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌黄锡矿太阳能电池","kp":["效率[锌黄锡矿电池]: 13.9%认证","缓冲层[锌黄锡矿电池]: 无镉ZnxSn1-xO","[缺陷补偿]: 空间电荷区本征缺陷补偿"],"as":"研究揭示了无镉ZnSnO（ZTO）缓冲层替代传统有毒CdS用于CZTSSe（黄锡矿）太阳能电池的机制。通过空间电荷区的本征缺陷补偿策略，有效降低界面复合损失，提升开路电压与转换效率，为环境友好的薄膜光伏器件提供了新路径。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Intrinsic defect compensation in the space charge region enables cadmium-free kesterite solar cells to achieve 13.9% cer","b":"Cadmium-free ZnxSn1−xO (ZTO) buffer layers are an attractive alternative to conventional CdS in Cu2ZnSn(S,Se)4 (CZTSSe) thin-film solar cells, especially with advantages of Cd-related toxicity elimination and parasitic absorption mitigation at short wavelengths. However, the performance of ZTO-based CZTSSe devices has lagged behind that of CdS-involved counterparts, largely due to high-density detrimental defects and non-ideal band alignment at the CZTSSe/ZTO heterojunction. Here, we develop a junction heat-treatment process that, upon thermal activation, selectively drives Zn cations to diffuse from the ZTO buffer into the CZTSSe absorber along the chemical potential gradient. This diffusion-driven Zn incorporation compensates for intrinsic bulk defects such as CuZn and VCu, particularly in the space charge region. The cation diffusion also contributes to a more favorable conduction-band offset, prolonged minority-carrier lifetime, and extended carrier-diffusion length. Collectively, this results in optimization of carrier dynamics with simultaneously enhanced carrier separation, extraction, and transport efficiencies. As a result, we achieve an efficiency of 14.39% (certified at 13.90%) and a large-area (1.03 cm2) efficiency of 12.24%, representing the highest-to-date efficiency for Cd-free CZTSSe solar cells."},{"t":"从早期分化的文昌鱼 Asymmetron lucayanum 深入了解头索动物基因组和基因进化","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521280123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cephalochordates (amphioxus or lancelet) are considered as living proxies for ancestral chordates due to their key phylogenetic position and slow evolutionary rate. The genomes of living amphioxus thus can help to reveal the genetic basis shaping the evolutionary transition from nonvertebrate animals to vertebrates. To gain a comprehensive understanding of the genome architecture in amphioxus, we generated a chromosome-anchored genome assembly for\n                    Asymmetron lucayanum\n                    , representing the earliest diverging cephalochordate genus. We show that\n                    Asymmetron\n                    has an enlarged genome compared to those of the other four cephalochordate genomes decoded so far (all in the genus\n                    Branchiostoma\n                    ), caused by pervasive expansions of intergenic transposable elements (TEs). Nevertheless, both macrosynteny and microsynteny remain highly conserved between\n                    Asymmetron\n                    and\n                    Branchiostoma\n                    , enabling reconstruction of the ancestral genomic architecture of the cephalochordate lineage for tracing genome evolutionary processes during deuterostome and chordate diversification. Integration of developmental transcriptomic data further reveals that selective constraints on cotranscriptional regulation underline the maintenance of the conserved microsynteny blocks among cephalochordate species. We also examine the evolutionary history of the\n                    Hox\n                    cluster in cephalochordates and vertebrates, and identify species-specific inversions and TE invasions at this locus in both\n                    Asymmetron\n                    and\n                    Branchiostoma\n                    . Finally, we survey key molecular building blocks underlying both innate and adaptive immunity (e.g.,\n                    TLR\n                    ,\n                    NLR\n                    , MHC, and\n                    RAG\n                    ) and uncover their evolutionary dynamics and plausible ancestry in chordates. Taken together, our findings illuminate the genome and gene evolution of cephalochordates and provide valuable resources for understanding the early evolution of chordates and the origin of vertebrates.","tp":"文昌鱼基因组","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":1.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"本研究生成了早期分化文昌鱼的染色体水平基因组组装。文昌鱼作为脊索动物的现代代表，其缓慢的进化过程和独特的系统发育位置使其成为研究脊椎动物进化的关键节点。该基因组图谱有助于全面揭示文昌鱼的基因组结构，阐明非脊椎动物向脊椎动物进化转变的遗传基础。"},{"t":"In2O3-CNT催化剂通过空位稳定实现超500小时稳定CO2加氢制甲醇","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7041?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2制甲醇催化剂","kp":["稳定性[CO₂制甲醇]: >500小时","催化剂体系[CO₂加氢]: In₂O₃-CNT物理复合","稳定机制[催化]: 空位稳定化抑制In³⁺过还原"],"as":"氧化铟（In₂O₃）是CO₂加氢制甲醇的 promising 催化剂，但易因还原失活。研究通过将In₂O₃负载于碳纳米管（CNT）上并利用氧空位工程，实现超过500小时的稳定运行，显著提升催化活性与抗烧结性能，为CO₂资源化利用提供了高效催化剂设计策略。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":8.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"In2O3-CNT catalysts enable >500-hour stable CO2-to-methanol hydrogenation via vacancy stabilization","b":"Indium oxide (In\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    ) is a promising catalyst for carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ) hydrogenation to methanol but suffers from rapid deactivation due to localized over-reduction of surface In\n                    3+\n                    species into inactive metallic In\n                    0\n                    near hydrogen (H\n                    2\n                    ) activation sites. Here, we exploit a proton-electron dual-transfer mechanism through a physically integrated In\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    -carbon nanotube (In\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    -CNT) system, achieving simultaneous enhancement of catalytic performance and durability. The optimal In\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    -CNT system gives the highest methanol production rate of 1250.6 grams kilograms\n                    In2O3\n                    −1\n                    hour\n                    −1\n                    at 320°C. Particularly, the hybrid system maintains catalytic stability for &gt;500 hours, representing the highest durability among reported In\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    catalysts. Mechanistic studies and multiple characterization techniques reveal that the conductive CNT network regulates surface redox dynamics by facilitating electron transfer and redistribution. This process promotes the formation of oxygen vacancies for CO\n                    2\n                    activation while preventing localized electron accumulation and In\n                    0\n                    segregation. The CNT-mediated redox modulation stabilizes a dynamic InO\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    surface phase by balancing H\n                    2\n                    -induced reduction and CO\n                    2\n                    -driven oxidation, thereby sustaining catalytic activity over extended operation."},{"t":"子宫内暴露于基孔肯雅热和儿童死亡率：一项使用关联常规数据的基于人群的研究","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70786-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Chikungunya exposure in-utero is linked to neonatal morbidity and neurodevelopmental effects. We examined the long-term morbidity associated with in-utero Chikungunya. This registry-based cohort study linked records of infants born in Brazil between 2015 and 2018, with all-cause first hospitalization and death as outcome. Infants were followed until the outcome, their third birthday, or the end of the study. Adjusted stratified Cox models were used to estimate hazard ratios (HR), 95% confidence intervals (95% CIs), and absolute risk differences. A total of 1,821 exposed and 18,210 unexposed infants were included. The HR for hospitalization was 1.21 (95% CI: 1.11–1.36), corresponding to 37 excess hospitalizations per 1000 exposed (95% CI: 16-64). The risk was twofold for intrapartum exposure (HR 2.08, 95% CI: 1.33–3.44) and elevated for first- and second-trimester exposure. Evidence for risk of death was limited. Here we show an elevated hospitalization risk associated with in-utero Chikungunya exposure."},{"t":"循环红细胞的体内代谢标记和靶向","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-71013-x","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Engineering red blood cells (RBCs) has been widely explored for drug delivery, imaging, vaccination, and other applications. However, effective strategies to directly engineer RBCs in vivo are still lacking. Here, we report successful metabolic glycan labeling of RBCs in vivo. We demonstrate that systemically administered azido-sugars can metabolically label circulating RBCs with azido groups, through labeling of both mature RBCs and RBC precursor cells. The surface azido tags on RBCs can persist for over 42 days in female mice (nearly the lifespan of RBCs), while tags on leukocytes decay to negligible levels within 3 days. Azido-labeled RBCs can covalently capture dibenzocyclooctyne-bearing cargos in vivo via click chemistry, extending cargo circulation from hours to over 35 days. This RBC tagging and targeting technology can improve fluorescence imaging of blood vessels, enable long-term MRI of brain vasculatures with a single gadolinium dose, and improve the pharmacokinetics of drugs.","tp":"红细胞工程化","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"实现了循环红细胞的体内代谢标记与靶向工程：系统给药的叠氮糖可通过标记成熟红细胞和前体细胞，在红细胞表面引入叠氮基团，且该标签可长期保留。利用点击化学可对循环红细胞进行体内靶向功能化，为药物递送、成像和疫苗等应用提供了无需体外操作的直接工程化策略。"},{"t":"铜集流体上原位形成的亲锂Li3Sb实现富LiF固态电解质界面以抑制枝晶","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70856?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属负极界面","kp":["集流体[锂金属电池]: Li3Sb@Cu","[SEI工程]: Li3Sb原位构建富LiF SEI无枝晶"],"as":"该研究在铜集流体表面通过原位生成亲锂的Li₃Sb层，构建富LiF固态电解质界面（SEI），有效抑制锂金属电池中锂枝晶生长和界面副反应。该策略显著提升了无负极锂金属电池的循环稳定性和库伦效率，为下一代高能量密度储能器件的工程化提供了新思路。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"In Situ‐Formed Lithiophilic Li3Sb on the Cu Current Collector Enables LiF‐Rich Solid Electrolyte Interphase for Dendrite","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium metal batteries (LMBs) hold great promise for next‑generation energy storage systems owing to their high theoretical energy density. However, their practical application is hindered by uncontrolled Li dendrite growth and unstable solid electrolyte interphase (SEI). Here, we design a Li\n                    3\n                    Sb‐modified Cu current collector (Li\n                    3\n                    Sb@Cu) that employs a synergistic dual‑function strategy to regulate uniform Li plating and engineer a robust LiF‐rich SEI. The Li\n                    3\n                    Sb interface is constructed in situ by electrochemical lithiation of Cu\n                    2\n                    Sb layer that is directly grown on Cu foil via a galvanic replacement reaction in SbCl\n                    3\n                    solution. Lithiophilic Li\n                    3\n                    Sb interlayer, with high delithiation potential and strong adhesion to the Cu substrate, significantly lowers the Li nucleation overpotential (34 mV at 1.0 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    ). Moreover, the Li\n                    3\n                    Sb preferentially adsorbs and catalytically decomposes fluoroethylene carbonate, producing a mechanically robust, LiF‐rich SEI. Consequently, the Li\n                    3\n                    Sb@Cu enables stable Li plating/stripping for over 800 h and achieves an average Coulombic efficiency of 98.2% over 180 cycles. When paired with a LiFePO\n                    4\n                    cathode, the full cell delivers a high discharge capacity of 137.4 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    and retains 96.6% capacity after 130 cycles at 1 C. This work presents a synergistically bifunctional interlayer on Cu foils that regulates Li nucleation and stabilizes the SEI for high‐performance LMBs.","aip":1},{"t":"技术创新和正式制度对可再生能源转型的影响","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001540?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"可再生能源转型","sc":1.1,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1.0,"r":3.0,"d":0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"基底外侧杏仁核中生长抑素+消退抑制印迹的鉴定","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511528123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The basolateral amygdala (BLA) is a key structure for processing threat and emotional information, and plays a key role in controlling the fear memory. Previous research has suggested that the extinction procedure generates a new memory that coexists with the original fear memory, and that interneurons play an important role in this process. However, the mechanisms that control the competing extinction and fear memories in BLA are not yet fully understood. To investigate these mechanisms, we developed a chemogenetic strategy that offers improved sensitivity and specificity for tagging neurons during defined behavioral epochs. This was achieved by genetically targeting GABAergic interneurons for activity-dependent manipulation, allowing us to directly probe the functional role of inhibitory ensembles recruited during fear extinction. We found that silencing extinction-tagged BLA neurons or stimulating fear acquisition-tagged BLA neurons, led to a relapse of fear memory. Additionally, we observed that silencing BLA GABAergic neurons, or more specifically, silencing the extinction-tagged BLA GABAergic neurons, restored fear expression after extinction, while inhibiting acquisition-tagged BLA GABAergic neurons did not impair fear memory retrieval. Our results indicate that specific inhibitory GABAergic BLA engrams are established during fear extinction, which interfere with existing fear memory-related neural circuits and suppress conditioned fear memory. These findings provide insights into the neural mechanisms underlying fear extinction and suggest that BLA GABAergic neurons are potential targets for therapeutic interventions in cognitive disorders such as posttraumatic stress disorder (PTSD).","tp":"恐惧记忆机制","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"基底外侧杏仁核（BLA）在处理威胁信息和控制恐惧记忆中发挥核心作用。研究开发了特定模型，旨在深入探究BLA中恐惧记忆与消退记忆相互竞争的控制机制。研究鉴定了基底外侧杏仁核中表达生长抑素的中间神经元在抑制恐惧记忆消退中的关键印迹作用。"},{"t":"受光保护叶片启发的利用潜热与辐射热调控的水凝胶热调节器（Adv. Mater. 17/2026）","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72677?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"辐射潜热水凝胶热控","kp":["[热管理]: 辐射-潜热水凝胶恒温器(LRT)","[仿生]: 杨树叶光保护","[功能]: 动态太阳反射+高红外发射+可逆吸脱附水"],"as":"受银白杨叶片光保护机制的启发，研究者设计了一种基于潜热与辐射制冷双重机制的水凝胶温控材料。该水凝胶模拟植物叶片在高光强下的自适应热调节行为，通过水分蒸发吸热（潜热）和红外辐射制冷实现被动降温，可广泛应用于建筑节能、电子器件散热及可穿戴热管理等领域，为仿生热管理材料提供了新范式。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Hydrogel Thermostat Inspired by Photoprotective Foliage Using Latent and Radiative Heat Control (Adv. Mater. 17/2026)","b":"Populus alba–Inspired Thermal Regulation In their Research Article (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202516537), Dae-Hyeong Kim, Young Min Song, and co-workers present a radiative-latent thermostat (LRT) inspired by Populus alba leaves. The LRT provides dynamic solar reflectance, high infrared emissivity, and reversible water sorption–desorption capabilities within a hydrogel system to achieve adaptive, passive thermal regulation across varying outdoor environments."},{"t":"用于短波红外成像的高增益 Ag2Te/MoS2 混合光电探测器","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520984?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Physical artificial intelligence has emerged as a pivotal component in next‐generation humanoid technologies, including advanced optical sensors, as it enables autonomous acquisition of sensory information. This study reports a high‐performance 0D/2D hybrid photodetector using a high‐gain Ag\n                    2\n                    Te/MoS\n                    2\n                    hybrid structure for visible to short‐wave infrared (SWIR) photodetection, achieved by the absorption of Ag\n                    2\n                    Te quantum dots in the infrared region (∼1450 nm). The Ag\n                    2\n                    Te/MoS\n                    2\n                    photodetector exhibits a high photoresponsivity of around 7.5 × 10\n                    5\n                     AW\n                    −1\n                    and a specific detectivity of over 9.9 × 10\n                    8\n                    Jones at 1 µW/cm\n                    2\n                    illumination power with a 0.2 V drain bias voltage. Furthermore, depending on the gain of the photodetector, a fast response speed can also be achieved, with rise and decay times as short as 13 and 23 ms. The 0D/2D hybrid devices were successfully implemented in a 32 × 32 array format for infrared imaging, with the results demonstrating spatially resolved pattern reconstruction and real‐time photoresponse acquisition. By hybridizing quantum dots and 2D materials, the developed photodetector has broad potential applications, including use in highly integrated SWIR image sensors.","tp":"红外光电探测","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究报道了一种用于可见光至短波红外（SWIR）成像的零维/二维混合光电探测器。该器件采用Ag2Te/MoS2混合结构，具备高增益特性。作为下一代具身智能和仿人技术的关键组件，该高性能光学传感器能够实现感官信息的自主获取，展现了在先进人工智能领域的应用潜力。"},{"t":"具有减弱金属-配体多重键特性的高自旋铁-膦亚胺和胂亚胺配合物","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523239?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The MEH\n                    2\n                    salts (M = Na, K; E = P, As) react with high spin (\n                    S\n                    = 2) PhB(AdIm)\n                    3\n                    FeCl (PhB(AdIm)\n                    3\n                    –\n                    = tris(3‐adamantylimidazol‐2‐ylidene)phenylborate) to afford the corresponding PhB(AdIm)\n                    3\n                    FePH\n                    2\n                    and PhB(AdIm)\n                    3\n                    FeAsH\n                    2\n                    complexes. Remarkably, these complexes can be deprotonated by benzyl potassium in the presence of equimolar 18‐crown–6 or 2,2,2‐crypt to provide the parent phosphinidene and arsinidene complexes, [PhB(AdIm)\n                    3\n                    FePH]\n                    –\n                    and [PhB(AdIm)\n                    3\n                    FeAsH]\n                    –\n                    . Structural and spectroscopic characterization, combined with computational investigations, provide evidence for multiconfigurational electronic structures in which the metal–ligand multiple bond character is attenuated by the high spin iron(II) center. Initial reactivity studies reveal the nucleophilic character of the pnictogenidene ligands, which provide phosphinophosphinidene and phosphinoarsinidene products with a chlorodiazaphospholidine electrophile.","tp":"铁配合物催化","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":1.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"该研究利用MEH2盐（M=Na, K；E=P, As）与高自旋铁配合物反应，成功合成了铁-膦亚胺和铁-胂亚胺配合物。研究表明，这些新型配合物具有减弱的金属-配体多重键特性，为深入理解高自旋过渡金属配合物的电子结构和成键机制提供了重要的实验依据。"},{"t":"基于HfO2的非对称扩展p-n异质界面忆阻突触实现高能效类神经形态计算","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec2324?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铪基忆阻突触","kp":["材料[忆阻突触]: p型Hf(Sr,Ti)O2构建非对称p-n异质界面"],"as":"针对现有AI硬件日益严峻的能耗问题，该研究提出基于HfO₂的忆阻突触器件，采用非对称扩展的p-n异质界面结构。通过在HfO₂阻变层两侧构建不对称p-n结，优化了离子的迁移动力学，实现了更接近生物突触的可塑性行为，包括长时程增强/抑制（LTP/LTD）等。该器件在降低功耗的同时保持了高精度权重更新能力，为构建低能耗神经形态计算系统提供了可行路径。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"HfO2-based memristive synapses with asymmetrically extended p-n heterointerfaces for highly energy-efficient neuromorphi","b":"The escalating energy consumption of existing artificial intelligence hardware has become a serious global issue that demands immediate action. Neuromorphic computing offers promises to drastically reduce this footprint. Here, we introduce multicomponent p-type Hf(Sr,Ti)O\n                    2\n                    thin films for energy-efficient, resistive switching–based neuromorphic devices. We demonstrate interfacial memristors with ultralow switching currents (≤~10\n                    −8\n                    A), exceptional cycle-to-cycle and device-to-device uniformities, and retention &gt;10\n                    5\n                     s. They reveal hundreds of ultralow conductance levels with a modulation range of &gt;50 (without reaching any saturation) and reproducibly satisfy unsupervised learning rules. This performance originates from incorporating a self-assembled p-n heterointerface between p-type Hf(Sr,Ti)O\n                    2\n                    and n-type TiO\n                    x\n                    N\n                    y\n                    , resulting in a fully depleted space-charge layer asymmetrically extended into Hf(Sr,Ti)O\n                    2\n                    , a large built-in potential, and extremely low saturation current density under reverse bias. Ultralow conductance modulation is controlled by tuning p-n heterointerface’s energy-barrier height through electro-ionic charge migration. This materials-engineering strategy addresses energy consumption and variability in existing memristors, opening a pathway toward energy-efficient neuromorphic computing systems.","aip":1},{"t":"面向宽温域有机半导体薄膜的晶界钉钉策略增强聚集态稳定性","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72850?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机半导体气敏","kp":["策略[有机半导体气敏]: 晶界钉扎协同优化宽温稳定性"],"as":"该研究提出一种基于晶界钉扎策略的有机半导体柔性气体传感器性能提升方案。通过在有机半导体薄膜的晶界处引入钉扎剂，优化了聚集态结构，有效改善了载流子传输路径和分子吸附界面，从而显著提高了气体传感器的响应灵敏度、选择性和长期稳定性。该策略为柔性可穿戴气体传感器在呼吸检测、环境监测和疾病筛查等多样化应用场景中的实际部署提供了新思路。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Grain Boundary Pinning Strategy for Enhanced Aggregate State in Organic Semiconductor Thin Films Toward Wide‐Temperature","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Flexible gas sensors based on organic semiconductors (OSCs) show great promise for diverse applications, yet their practical application is hindered by the limited operational and shelf stability of OSC‐based gas sensors over a wide temperature range. Herein, we developed a universal grain boundary pinning strategy to cooperatively optimize the aggregate state stability, sensitivity, and selectivity of the ultrathin OSC film. By incorporating multi‐functional Au nanoclusters into the OSC layer, the thermally activated molecular motion and grain boundary migration can be inhibited by the cooperative effect of strain‐balancing and dipole–π interactions. Consequently, the NH\n                    3\n                    sensor based on 5 nm ultrathin film exhibits record stability over an extended shelf period (tested shelf life of one‐year, theoretical shelf life of 14.8 years) and across a wide temperature range (RT‐100°C on polymer substrate, RT‐180°C on SiO\n                    2\n                    substrate). The grain boundary pinning strategy is demonstrated to be universal across multiple OSC systems, underscoring its potential to enable robust, high‐performance flexible gas sensors for widespread commercialization."},{"t":"稠环受体-π-受体结构实现近红外吸收介孔共价有机框架用于储能","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5267333?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价有机框架光催化","kp":["催化剂[光催化产H2O2]: 稠环受体-π-受体架构介孔COF","吸光范围[COF光催化]: 近红外区"],"as":"该研究设计了一种融合环受体-π-受体（A-π-A）构型的近红外吸收介孔共价有机框架（COF）材料。通过引入给体-受体（D-A）结构，该COF在近红外波段表现出优异的光吸收能力，拓展了光捕获范围。介孔结构提供了高效的电荷传输通道和丰富的催化活性位点，使其在光催化产氢、二氧化碳还原等太阳能转化反应中展现出良好潜力，为高效光催化材料设计提供了新策略。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Fused‐Ring Acceptor–π–Acceptor Architecture Enables Near‐Infrared‐Absorbing Mesoporous Covalent Organic Frameworks for E","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Covalent organic frameworks (COFs) featuring donor–acceptor architectures have shown great promise as photocatalysts. However, their performance is often hindered by limitations such as narrow absorbance ranges and restricted electron delocalization, which are inherent to traditional imine linkages. Herein, we introduce a fused‐ring acceptor–π–acceptor (FRA–π–A) architecture for near‐infrared‐absorbing COFs, enabled via in situ COF‐to‐COF transformation that replaces imine linkages with FRA‐derived benzodithiazoles (or benzodioxazoles). Comprehensive structural characterizations confirm their mesoporous crystalline structure, featuring pore size distribution of 2.16–2.39 nm and broad light absorption extending to near‐infrared region. Property investigations demonstrate that the rigid backbones derived from the FRA–π–A architecture significantly enhance long‐range in‐plane electron delocalization, thereby improving the separation and transport of photogenerated charge carriers. Crucially, the accelerated carrier migration preferentially directs photogenerated electrons to the FRAs, promoting the formation of •O\n                    2\n                    −\n                    radicals and accelerating the rate‐limiting step of the oxygen reduction reaction. These synergistic structural and optoelectronic properties endow the FRA–π–A COFs with an outstanding photocatalytic H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production rate of 6.8 mmol g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    without sacrificial agents, exceeding the vast majority of conjugated linkage‐based COFs. This study highlights the immense potential of FRA–π–A COFs as high‐performance photocatalysts."},{"t":"实时动态新生 RNA 折叠整体的功能表征","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec4037?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"RNA structure starts forming cotranscriptionally as the nascent RNA emerges from the RNA polymerase and is dynamically modulated by cellular factors. How individual RNA conformations, out of an ensemble of RNA molecules, relate to function is not well understood. Here, developing multicolor single-molecule fluorescence microscopy experiments, we track in real time nascent RNA structure formation, functionally characterizing up to eight different types of RNA molecules. We find that ribosomal proteins, RNA modification enzymes or antisense oligonucleotides specifically modulate a subset of the RNA folding classes. For example, we provide direct evidence that increased local RNA accessibility at specific sites correlates with the chaperoning activity of ribosomal proteins during ribosome assembly. These experiments provide a general framework to study how dynamic RNA folding, and misfolding, relates to function."},{"t":"BiVO4光催化的第一性原理视角：电子结构、晶面各向异性与界面工程","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003582?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"BiVO4光催化","kp":["[材料]: BiVO4光催化","[研究方法]: 第一性原理电子结构"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"First-principles perspectives on BiVO4 photocatalysis: electronic structure, facet anisotropy, and interface engineering"},{"t":"极端降水重塑北美最大河流流域的养分流动和平衡","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3260?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Extreme precipitation events, intensified by climate change, are increasingly disrupting nutrient dynamics in large river systems worldwide. Beyond altering the magnitude of individual nutrient fluxes, extreme precipitation may fundamentally reshape nutrient composition and stoichiometric balances, with critical implications for aquatic ecosystem health. Here, we apply an integrated data-model framework to assess how these events have altered nitrogen (N) and phosphorus (P) fluxes across the Mississippi River Basin from 1980 to 2018. We find that extreme rainfall disproportionately increases P export relative to N, driven primarily by enhanced soil erosion and mobilization of particulate-bound nutrients. Concurrent temporal and spatial changes in extreme precipitation regimes have induced declining N:P ratios in headwater streams and cumulative nutrient loads, shifting export stoichiometry toward the Redfield ratio. Therefore, extreme precipitation can increase nutrient fluxes that fuel harmful algal blooms, yet at the same time reduce N:P ratios that may favor less toxic communities. This trade-off calls for watershed management strategies that go beyond managing nutrient quantity alone.","tp":"极端降水生态","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"气候变化加剧的极端降水事件正深刻改变全球大型河系的养分动态。研究运用整合的数据模型框架，评估了这些事件如何改变密苏里河流域等北美最大河流流域内的氮、磷等养分通量。极端降水不仅改变了单一养分通量的大小，更从根本上重塑了养分组成与生态化学计量平衡，对水生生态系统的健康和稳定产生了深远的潜在影响。"},{"t":"液冷数据中心需求响应潜力探索","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003314?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液冷数据中心需求响应","kp":["[系统]: 液冷数据中心需求响应潜力"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Exploring the Demand Response Potential of Liquid-Cooled Data Centers"},{"t":"新兴电化学能量转换材料：石墨双炔","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202600027?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"石墨炔能源材料","kp":["[合成条件]: 低温常压","[材料类型]: 二维石墨二炔新型碳同素异形体"],"as":"该综述聚焦石墨二炔（Graphdiyne, GDY）这一新型二维碳同素异形体在电化学能量转换领域的进展。GDY兼具sp和sp²杂化碳网络，具有天然带隙、优异的电子传输性能和可调电子结构，在电催化（ORR、OER、HER）、锂离子电池及超级电容器等方向展现出独特优势。文章系统总结了GDY的合成策略、结构-性能关系及应用前景。","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Emerging Electrochemical Energy Conversion Materials: Graphdiyne","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Two‐dimensional graphdiyne (GDY) is a new type of carbon allotrope that has developed rapidly in the past decade. It is facilely synthesized under low temperatures and normal pressures and exhibits outstanding physical and chemical properties that surpass those of traditional carbon materials. These properties are beyond the understanding of scientists and have attracted many researchers to engage in research in this field. GDY is composed of a periodic sp/sp\n                    2\n                    hybridized framework consisting of benzene rings and large amounts of alkyne‐rich pores, forming a super‐large π conjugated structure, exhibiting an inherent characteristic of uneven surface charge distribution, demonstrating extremely high intrinsic activity, significant chemical stability, and excellent electronic conductivity. These unique properties promote the continuous progress of foundation and applied research on GDY in various fields, especially in electrochemical energy conversion. The intrinsic properties of GDY provide the key elements necessary for the development and progress of sustainable energy systems, as the development of efficient electrocatalysts depends on these properties, especially those used for the conversion of intermittent renewable energy into chemical bond storage forms. GDY‐based catalysts, with their huge surface area, superior surface charge distribution, and semiconductor characteristics, have demonstrated outstanding performance in efficient energy conversion. This review summarizes the studies on computation, experiment, structure, and properties, followed by a discussion of the electrocatalytic process and performance, such as hydrogen, oxygen, carbon dioxide, nitrogen, nitrate, and organic molecule conversion. By offering a systematic survey of GDY's evolution in electrocatalytic, energy‐to‐chemical conversion, this review provides a roadmap for future breakthroughs in the rapidly advancing field."},{"t":"电化学染料开关辅助光谱解混与三维STORM成像","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202517001?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超分辨显微成像","kp":["[成像方法]: 电化学控制EC-STORM双色超分辨","[优势]: 精确控制荧光团开关实现光谱分离"],"as":"该研究提出一种基于电化学染料切换辅助光谱解混（EDS-SD）的超分辨显微成像方法，结合3D STORM技术实现多色纳米级成像。传统多色超分辨成像受限于荧光团光谱重叠和通道串扰，该方案通过电化学手段精确调控荧光染料的开关动力学，将不同发射光谱的染料在时域上分离，显著提升了多目标同时定位的可靠性与分辨率。此方法为细胞亚结构精细解析提供了新工具，有望推动活细胞多通路分子互作的定量研究。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Electrochemical Dye Switching Assisted Spectral Demixing and 3D STORM Imaging","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Super‐resolution microscopy has advanced cellular imaging by enabling nanoscale resolution, while reliable multicolor strategies remain crucial for resolving multiple targets in complex cellular samples. Here, we demonstrate a two‐color imaging strategy using electrochemically controlled stochastic optical reconstruction microscopy (EC‐STORM), which allows precise control over the switching behavior of two cyanine dyes, Alexa 647 and CF680. An oscillating electrochemical potential enables control of emitter density and molecule ON time. This minimizes the spatial and temporal overlap of emitters, enabling effective spectral demixing for two‐color EC‐STORM imaging. We further combined spectral demixing with a biplane detection configuration, enabling additional 3D localization of Alexa 647, where axial coordinates are extracted from the photon‐intensity ratio between the two detection channels instead of point spread function width. This integrated approach offers a practical solution for high‐density multicolor 3D STORM imaging."},{"t":"涡轮电推进eVTOL的环保能量管理策略：耦合燃油经济性、电池健康与全生命周期评估","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003764?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航空","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"eVTOL能量管理","kp":["[能量管理]: 改进TD3耦合油耗/电池健康/排放"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Eco-friendly energy management strategy for turbo-electric eVTOLs: Coupling fuel economy, battery health and life-cycle "},{"t":"登革热感染引发皮肤组织驻留和循环 CD8+ T 细胞，与住院保护相关","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7987?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Dengue is spreading globally, and there is urgent need to define immune correlates of protection for this disease. Dengue infection first occurs in the skin following the bite of an infected mosquito; however, knowledge of host immune responses within this site remains sparse. We investigated the phenotypic, functional, and transcriptional profiles of skin and blood T cells in 73 patients with dengue and 10 healthy volunteers. We show that the skin T cell compartment undergoes marked reshaping and is strongly enriched with proliferating CD4\n                    +\n                    and CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells compared with the blood of patients. Activated skin CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells expressed a core transcriptional signature of tissue-resident memory T (T\n                    RM\n                    ) cells, supporting their differentiation to the T\n                    RM\n                    cell lineage during infection. The magnitude of skin and blood CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell responses were associated with protection from hospitalization in this cohort. These data support a protective role of skin-resident and circulating CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells in dengue and warrant evaluation of vaccination strategies inducing skin T\n                    RM\n                    cells to enhance protective immunity.","tp":"登革免疫应答","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"登革热正在全球蔓延，明确其免疫保护机制迫在眉睫。感染最初源于受感染蚊子叮咬处的皮肤，但科学界对该部位的宿主免疫反应知之甚少。通过对患者血液和皮肤T细胞的表型、功能及转录图谱进行深入分析，研究发现登革热感染会导致皮肤T细胞区室发生显著重塑，并引发皮肤组织驻留和循环的CD8+ T细胞反应，这与患者免于重症住院的保护作用密切相关。"},{"t":"废弃微纳塑料转化为碳材料：可再生能源与环境应用新趋势","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003429?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"废塑料转化碳材料","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Conversion of waste micro/nano plastics into carbon materials: A new trend for renewable energy and environmental applic"},{"t":"大体积应变负极中的接触界面用于高性能锂离子存储","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01264G","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"大体积应变负极界面","kp":["[候选材料]: Si/Ge/Sn/P及金属氧化物","[失效机制]: 大体积应变致电极粉化","[矛盾]: 高理论容量但循环衰减快"],"as":"该研究聚焦锂离子电池高容量负极材料（硅、锗、锡、磷、金属氧化物等）在充放电过程中的大体积膨胀问题，系统分析了电极内接触界面的失效机制与优化策略。这类材料理论比容量远超商用石墨，但循环中体积变化可达300%以上，导致颗粒粉化、界面剥离与电接触丧失。文章归纳了纳米结构设计、粘结剂工程、界面缓冲层等方案对维持稳定导电网络的作用，为高能量密度锂电池的工程化突破提供了路径指引。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Contact Interfaces in Anodes with Large Volume Strain for High-Performance Lithium-Ion Storage","b":"Silicon, germanium, tin, phosphorus, metal oxides, and their related compounds have emerged as promising anode materials for lithium-ion batteries owing to their high theoretical capacities. However, their practical application is severely hindered by large volume changes during lithiation and delithiation, which lead to electrode pulverization and rapid capacity fading. In addition, their intrinsically low electrical conductivity limits rate performance. To mitigate these issues, composite strategies—such as incorporating buffering matrices and conductive carbon—are widely employed, resulting in complex contact interfaces within the electrode. Nevertheless, the static and dynamic understanding of these interfaces remains insufficient. Under substantial volume strain, these contact interfaces undergo continuous evolution: point contacts may transform into surface contacts, while established interfaces may delaminate, ultimately governing electrode failure mechanisms. In this review, we systematically examine the nature and impact of contact interfaces in anodes undergoing significant volume strain. Contact interfaces are categorized into geometric types as well as physical and chemical interfaces, with particular emphasis on their operando evolution and coupling with solid electrolyte interphase chemistry. We critically evaluate advanced characterization techniques, including operando X-ray/neutron imaging and cryogenic electron microscopy, and present a comparative matrix outlining their respective capabilities. Furthermore, we bridge the gap between qualitative understanding and quantitative design principles by highlighting emerging advances in multiscale simulations as well as AI-assisted and data-driven interface engineering. Finally, we propose a roadmap linking laboratory-scale strategies to industrial scalability, offering a forward-looking framework for the rational design of next-generation Li⁺ storage systems."},{"t":"膜上 SARS-CoV-2 刺突的构象动力学揭示了弗林蛋白酶裂解和 D614G 的变构效应","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx5178?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"By combining hydrogen-deuterium exchange monitored by mass spectrometry (HDX-MS) with the ability of enveloped virus–like particles (eVLPs) to display full-length native-like severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 spike protein, we have determined the energetic and conformational effects of both the membrane environment and unique sequence features that are considered incompatible with soluble protein constructs. We find that eVLP-displayed spike can sample the open-interface trimer conformation observed in soluble constructs of spike, including sequences from engineered vaccine constructs and native viral sequences inaccessible to studies on soluble constructs. Moreover, the D614G mutation, which arose early in the pandemic, favors the canonical “closed-interface” prefusion conformation, potentially mitigating premature S1 shedding in the presence of a cleaved furin site and providing an evolutionary advantage to the virus. Furin cleavage at the S1/S2 boundary allosterically increases the flexibility of the S2′ site, which may facilitate increased TMPRSS2 processing, enhancing viral infectivity. The use of eVLPs in HDX-MS studies provides a powerful platform for studying viral and membrane proteins in near-native environments.","tp":"刺突蛋白构象","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.5,"r":3.5,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究结合氢-氘交换质谱（HDX-MS）技术与展示全长天然样SARS-CoV-2刺突蛋白的包膜病毒样颗粒（eVLP），探究了膜环境及特定序列特征对刺突蛋白的能量与构象影响。研究发现，膜上的刺突蛋白能够采样开放界面三聚体构象，揭示了弗林蛋白酶裂解以及D614G突变在病毒感染过程中的变构效应。这为深入理解新冠病毒的感染机制提供了重要的微观动力学依据。"},{"t":"限域诱导的手性光开关——一种面向先进光化学功能的包封策略","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00019-7?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"限制手性光开关","kp":["[方法]: 包结策略实现手性转移","[特性]: 溶液中无手性，包结后可逆手性光开关"],"as":"该研究提出基于空间限域（confinement）的策略实现分子手性传递，使手性诱导剂与光响应分子之间高效耦合，从而在封装体系内实现光控手性光学开关。限域环境增强了手性识别与转移效率，使开关的圆二色性对比度和可逆性显著提升，为智能光学材料、手性信息存储、分子马达及不对称光催化等领域提供了普适性设计思路。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Confinement-induced chiroptical photoswitching —An encapsulation approach for advanced photochemical functions","b":"This study presents a confinement-based approach to enable molecular chirality transfer between a chiral inducer and a linked non-chiral photoswitch. Although photoswitching remains achiral in solution, reversible chiroptical photoswitching is enabled upon encapsulation. A second, independent level of control is introduced via supramolecular guest exchange."},{"t":"团簇基材料：设计与应用","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS00663E","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"团簇基材料设计","kp":["[尺度]: 逐原子理解结构与性质演化","[设计理念]: 特定尺寸/组成模拟原子化学"],"as":"该综述系统梳理了纳米团簇基材料的设计原理与应用前景。纳米团簇作为连接分子与纳米尺度桥梁，融合化学、物理、生物、医学与材料科学。文章涵盖团簇的精准合成、结构调控（尺寸、组成、配体）、组装策略，及其在催化、发光、传感、生物成像与药物递送中的功能化应用，并展望了构效关系研究与规模化制备面临的挑战。","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Cluster-based materials: design and applications","b":"Nanoclusters constitute an interdisciplinary field bridging chemistry, physics, biology, medicine, and materials science. Its broad appeal is fueled not only by the expectation that one can gain a fundamental understanding of how the structure and properties of matter evolve one atom at a time, but also, how they could be designed, with specific size and composition, to mimic the chemistry of atoms in the periodic table. Referred to as superatoms, these clusters can function as modular building units for a new generation of cluster-assembled materials, provided they retain their structural identity upon integration into extended architectures. C60 fullerene is an example of such a cluster. Clusters, protected by ligands or supported on a substrate, can also form cluster-assembled materials with unique properties. In contrast, atoms in an existing crystal can be replaced by corresponding superatoms to form “cluster-based materials”. While several perspectives and review articles have been published to highlight the unique structure- and composition-specific properties of isolated clusters and cluster-assembled materials, it is during the past few years that attention has been focused on cluster-based materials. This review focuses on the recent developments in the design, synthesis, and applications of clusters with uncommon properties and highlights their potential as building blocks of cluster-based materials. The topics include isolated clusters enabling unusual reactions, their role in the design and synthesis of materials such as super-electrides, solid state electrolytes with fast ionic conductivity and stable interfaces, moisture resistant hybrid perovskite solar cells, thermoelectric materials with high figure of merit, and a new class of single-superatom catalysts. Also outlined are the challenges and opportunities going forward."},{"t":"手性金属卤化物钙钛矿用于自旋偏振发光二极管","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523684?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性钙钛矿LED","kp":["能量损耗[传统LED]: 偏振片致>50%损失","[偏振控制]: 手性钙钛矿直接自旋偏振发光"],"as":"该研究将手性金属卤化物钙钛矿用于自旋极化发光二极管（Spin-PDLED），利用手性诱导的自旋选择性（CISS效应）抑制三线态激子猝灭，提升发光效率，从而降低显示器件功耗。手性钙钛矿同时兼具自旋过滤与高效辐射复合功能，为低能耗、高色纯度显示及自旋光电子学提供了新路线，有望突破传统OLED的效率瓶颈。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Chiral Metal Halide Perovskites for Spin‐Polarized Light‐Emitting Diodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  With the growing importance of displays, reducing their power consumption has become crucial for developing energy‐efficient photonic–electronic platforms. Conventional light emitting diodes (LEDs) rely on external polarizers and waveplates to control light polarization in displays, but these optics cause at least half of the incident energy of the LEDs to be lost, demanding higher drive currents and accelerating degradation. Generating circularly polarized light (CPL) directly at the source offers a low‐power alternative by eliminating such optical losses and enabling direct spin–photon interfaces. Recently, chiral metal halide perovskites (MHPs) have emerged as efficient, solution‐processable semiconductors that intrinsically couple light polarization and spin. Their strong spin–orbit coupling and broken inversion symmetry enable spin‐selective charge transport via the chiral‐induced spin selectivity effect, allowing both spin manipulation and its impact on emission to be observed within the same layer. In colloidal nanocrystal form they can emit CPL with high photoluminescence quantum yield, making them promising candidates for chiral light emission, although their use is still limited by low polarization anisotropy. This perspective discusses intrinsic and extrinsic routes to achieve circularly polarized electroluminescence (CP‐EL) using chiral MHPs, highlights progress in low‐dimensional films and chiral‐ligand nanocrystals, and discusses prospects for room‐temperature spin control and filter‐free, spin‐LEDs for next‐generation energy‐efficient optoelectronic displays.","aip":1},{"t":"细胞类型特异性免疫程序协调拟南芥叶表皮的空间防御","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70843-z","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Sessile plants rely on individual cells to perceive pathogens and coordinate defense. Guard cells (GCs), best known for regulating stomatal aperture, have poorly understood intrinsic immune roles. Here, we integrate single-cell and spatial analyses of Arabidopsis thaliana leaves infected with diverse phytopathogens, combining live and fixed imaging of transgenic immune reporters with single cell transcriptomic data. Powdery mildew infection triggers strong salicylic acid (SA) biosynthesis and transport in pavement cells, spreading to neighboring uninfected cells. In contrast, GCs fail to activate SA biosynthesis or SA-responsive genes. These cell-type-specific immune programs distinguishing GC and pavement cells are conserved across infections by the hemibiotrophic fungus Colletotrichum higginsianum and the bacterial pathogen Pseudomonas syringae. Despite impaired SA signaling and response, GCs display rapid calcium influx and pronounced reactive oxygen species bursts, transmitting immune signals to adjacent pavement cells via the apoplast. Notably, GCs are incompatible with adapted fungal pathogens and underwent hypersensitive cell death. Together, these findings uncover distinct immune programs among epidermal cell types, highlight GC-autonomous defense mechanisms, and provide a framework for understanding spatial immune coordination in plants.","tp":"叶表皮防御","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"固着生长的植物依赖个体细胞感知病原体并协调防御反应。保卫细胞（GCs）除了调节气孔开度外，其内在的免疫作用尚不清晰。本研究综合拟南芥叶片感染多种植物病原体后的单细胞与空间分析，结合活体成像和单细胞转录组数据，发现白粉病感染会触发强烈的水杨酸（SA）生物合成。研究表明，植物通过细胞类型特异性的免疫程序，精细协调叶片表皮的空间防御网络以抵御病原体入侵。"},{"t":"Caspase-3/7 缺乏导致肠道炎症增强并减少肿瘤发生","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz5906?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Aberrant intestinal epithelial cell (IEC) death is common in inflammatory bowel disease (IBD) and related animal models. While various cell death pathways contribute to disease, the dominant modalities and their regulatory mechanisms in intestinal inflammation remain ill defined. Using the DSS colitis model, we examined the contribution of apoptosis (\n                    Casp3/7\n                    \n                      Δ\n                      IEC\n                    \n                    ), necroptosis (\n                    Mlkl\n                    \n                      Δ\n                      IEC\n                    \n                    ), pyroptosis (\n                    Gsdme\n                    \n                      Δ\n                      IEC\n                    \n                    ,\n                    \n                      Gsdmd\n                      −/−\n                      )\n                    \n                    , and ferroptosis (\n                    Gpx4\n                    \n                      i\n                      Δ\n                      IEC\n                    \n                    ) in IECs. Mice lacking caspase-3/7 in IECs showed worsened colitis, higher mortality, and impaired regeneration, not seen in the other transgenic mice. Caspase-3/7 deficiency in IECs hindered stem cell proliferation and increased inflammatory cell death, disrupting barrier integrity and delaying recovery. Despite heightened inflammation,\n                    Casp3/7\n                    \n                      Δ\n                      IEC\n                    \n                    mice had reduced tumor formation in the AOM/DSS-induced colorectal cancer model. These findings highlight a protective role for caspase-3/7 in controlling inflammation and tissue regeneration, while promoting tumorigenesis following intestinal injury, and suggest modulation of caspase-3/7 as a promising therapeutic strategy in IBD and colorectal cancer."},{"t":"脑神经元CG9593/ANGPTL4激活介导父系获得性运动障碍","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea8321?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Recently, the perspective of paternal origin has emerged, yet its role in motor disorders remains unclear. Here, using\n                    Drosophila\n                    and murine models, we demonstrated that following paternal environmental heavy metal stress, offspring from multiple generations exhibited progressive motor deficits accompanied by dopaminergic neuron loss. Cross-tissue RNA sequencing revealed dysregulation of CG9593 (functionally homologous to human angiopoietin-like protein 4, ANGPTL4), identifying CG9593/ANGPTL4 as a pivotal brain effector linking paternal heavy metal stress to multigenerational motor disorders across species. Specifically, neuron-specific\n                    CG9593\n                    knockdown ameliorated these disorders, whereas\n                    CG9593\n                    overexpression mimicked them. Mechanistically, N6-methyladenosine (m6A) hypermethylation in sperm stabilized\n                    CG9593\n                    messenger RNA in offspring neurons via IGF2BP1-dependent posttranscriptional regulation, reducing synapse-associated protein DLG1 and impairing motor neuron. Human cohort analyses confirmed that serum ANGPTL4 negatively correlated with pediatric motor scores, and paternal sperm m6A levels were positively associated with the heavy metal exposure burden. Our findings establish CG9593/ANGPTL4 as an evolutionarily conserved determinant of paternally acquired multigenerational motor disorders and hold promise as a druggable target."},{"t":"区块链和双重拍卖打造可信、高效的自愿碳市场","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003715?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳市场机制","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"生物光催化协同作用实现甲烷与CO2在工程化产甲烷菌中转化为氢气和4-羟基苯甲酸","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526097?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"甲烷CO2生物光催化","kp":["[原料]: CH₄+CO₂","[产物]: H₂+4-羟基苯甲酸酯","[体系]: 太阳能驱动生物-光催化协同杂化系统"],"as":"该研究开发了生物-光催化协同体系，将甲烷（CH4）和二氧化碳（CO2）两种温室气体同时转化为氢气（H2）和高附加值化学品。传统C1资源转化面临活化能高、选择性差等瓶颈。该体系将生物酶/微生物的温和催化特性与光催化的高能驱动优势耦合，在常温常压条件下实现CH4和CO2的共转化，突破了单一催化路线的效率限制。该技术若能工程化放大，将为分布式C1资源利用与温室气体减排提供经济可行的路径，兼具能源与环境双重价值。","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Bio‐Photocatalytic Synergy Enables Valorization of CH4 and CO2 Into Hydrogen and 4‐Hydroxybenzoate in Engineered Methano","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Valorization of decentralized one‐carbon chain (C\n                    1\n                    ) resources into value‐added products has garnered significant attention, owing to its dual benefits in resource recovery and carbon mitigation. To address the challenge of co‐converting methane (CH\n                    4\n                    ) and carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ), we developed a solar‐driven biohybrid system that synergistically integrates biosynthesis and photocatalysis. The core of this system relies on a genetically engineered methanotrophic cell factory and newly designed biocompatible photocatalytic metal complexes. The methanotrophic bacteria utilize CH\n                    4\n                    as the primary feedstock to biosynthesize 4‐hydroxybenzoate (4HBA) while realizing CO\n                    2\n                    sequestration. The photocatalytic metal complexes, meanwhile, capture formate (a metabolic byproduct of cells) to generate hydrogen (H\n                    2\n                    ) and photoelectrons—with the latter directly supplying reducing power to support cellular activities in genetically tailored cells. Under optimal conditions, this solar‐driven system achieved a 4HBA titer of 472.36 µg/L, a H\n                    2\n                    yield of 0.59 mmol H\n                    2\n                    /mol CH\n                    4\n                    , and over 50% reduction in carbon emissions. The study not only establishes a feasible biomanufacturing strategy for the upcycling of C\n                    1\n                    gaseous feedstocks but also highlights the potential of integrating biological and photochemical technologies to advance sustainable energy and environmental solutions."},{"t":"超越标签：未标记智能电表数据的贝叶斯和因果热泵分解","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003363?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"tp":"热泵耗电分","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"细菌酶响应水凝胶，用于触发向感染伤口输送抗生素","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz0786?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Wound infections are becoming increasingly difficult to treat due to rising antibiotic-resistant bacteria. β-Lactamase–producing bacteria are among the most common pathogens implicated in these infections. Here, we report a bacterial enzyme-responsive hydrogel formulated with a cephalosporin-derived, β-lactamase–cleavable crosslinker that undergoes selective degradation in the presence of bacterial β-lactamases. This degradation triggers the on-demand release of encapsulated ciprofloxacin-loaded liposomes, ensuring that antibiotic delivery occurs only at the site of infection. This selective degradation and release was demonstrated in both ex vivo and in vivo models of\n                    Pseudomonas aeruginosa\n                    wound infections. In a murine skin abrasion infection model, a single application of the hydrogel led to complete bacterial eradication and enhanced wound healing, outperforming a commercial silver-based hydrogel wound dressing. These responsive hydrogels did not induce ciprofloxacin resistance in non–β-lactamase–producing bacteria. These findings demonstrate that β-lactamase–responsive hydrogels provide a precise, infection-triggered antibiotic delivery platform that can improve the treatment of wound infections and mitigate antimicrobial resistance.","tp":"响应水凝胶","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对日益严重的抗生素耐药性伤口感染问题，研究人员开发出一种能够响应细菌酶的智能水凝胶。该水凝胶采用头孢菌素衍生物作为交联剂，在遇到感染灶分泌的β-内酰胺酶时会发生特异性降解，从而按需精准释放包裹的环丙沙星等抗生素。此技术有效提升了局部靶向抗菌治疗效果。"},{"t":"东南极洲 PFAS 的大气迁移和沉积：来自雪样线测量和多维数据的证据","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4749?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The occurrence of per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS) in Antarctica has been previously reported; however, the mechanisms of their inland penetration and the interplay between their depositional histories and interhemispheric transport remain unclear. Here, PFAS in snow along a transect across East Antarctica (from Zhongshan Station to Dome A) and depositional records at Dome A were studied to elucidate the sources and transport of PFAS and to reconstruct the historical emission record. Our findings suggest that precursor degradation and sea spray aerosol are the main sources of PFAS and play a pivotal role in the regional and seasonal variability of PFAS accumulation. The half-century depositional records reveal connections between Antarctica and distant sources. We propose the hemispheric and interhemispheric transport of PFAS from source regions to Antarctica, where they are deposited."},{"t":"质子交换膜燃料电池运行条件参数诱导气体窜透现象分析：综述","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003673?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"燃料电池气体串透","kp":["[失效现象]: 操作条件致PEMFC气体串透"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Analysis of operating condition parameters induced gas crossover phenomenon in proton exchange membrane fuel cells: A re"},{"t":"用于非分段闪烁体高分辨率三维粒子追踪的超快光场相机系统","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70918-x","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"粒子三维追踪","kp":["[成像技术]: 超快光场相机三维粒子径迹","[挑战]: 细分闪烁体读取通道成本高"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究面向中微子探测器、粒子量能器及暗物质探测器对致密、高质量活性探测介质的高精度径迹重建需求，开发了一套超快光场相机（plenoptic camera）系统，用于高分辨率三维粒子径迹追踪。光场相机可同时记录光线的空间位置和方向信息，实现对探测介质中带电粒子径迹的四维（三维空间+时间）高速成像。该系统有望突破传统探测器在空间分辨率和事件重建速度上的瓶颈，为下一代粒子物理实验提供新型高帧率三维成像手段。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"An ultrafast plenoptic-camera system for high-resolution 3D particle tracking in unsegmented scintillators","b":"Neutrino detectors, particle calorimeters and some dark matter detectors require dense and massive active materials. An extremely fine segmentation is desirable to achieve precise three-dimensional particle tracking. However, such systems introduce significant challenges in construction and demand a large number of readout electronics channels, leading to extremely high costs. In this article, we propose an alternative approach to elementary particle detection that enables ultrafast three-dimensional high-resolution imaging in large volumes of unsegmented scintillator. Enabling technologies are plenoptic systems and time-resolving single-photon avalanche diode array imaging sensors. Together, they enabled us, using a plenoptic camera, to reconstruct the origin of single photons in the scintillator. A case study focused on neutrino detection demonstrates full event reconstruction with a spatial resolution of two hundred micrometres. This work paves the way for a class of particle detectors whose capabilities should be further enhanced through future developments and expanded to Cherenkov light detection, medical imaging and neutron detection."},{"t":"非晶自组装多层膜提升钙钛矿太阳能电池反偏压稳定性","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02015-8","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿自组装多层界面","kp":["[策略]: 自组装多层膜(超越单层SAM)","[分子]: CbzNaph+CbzNaphOH分子内氢键","[目标]: 提升反偏稳定性"],"as":"钙钛矿太阳能电池的长期稳定性受限于空穴选择性界面的脆弱性。该研究提出利用无定形自组装多层结构构筑稳健的空穴传输界面，改善界面的分子排列可逆性与结构稳定性。与传统晶态界面相比，无定形自组装层在抑制界面缺陷、缓解热应力及提升电荷提取效率方面表现更优。该策略为解决钙钛矿电池在光照和热循环下界面降解的问题提供了新思路，有望显著延长器件工作寿命，推动钙钛矿光伏的商业化进程。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Amorphous self-assembled multilayers for perovskite solar cells with improved reverse bias stability","b":"Robust hole-selective interfaces are critical for the stability of perovskite solar cells, yet this requirement is inadequately addressed by self-assembled monolayers (SAMs). Here we combine (4-(7H-dibenzo[c,g]carbazol-7-yl)butyl)phosphonic acid (CbzNaph) and its hydroxyl functionalized analogue (CbzNaphOH), which features intramolecular hydrogen-bonding interactions between the spacer and anchoring groups, to modulate SAM molecular packing. Increased steric hindrance promotes the formation of an amorphous self-assembled multilayer (a-SAMUL) with homogeneous packing. This amorphous layer acts simultaneously as a uniform, strongly adhesive binding medium that tightly couples the perovskite and substrate—thereby suppressing the formation of mobile ions—and as an efficient hole-selective contact with favourable energy-level alignment. Devices incorporating a-SAMULs achieve a certified efficiency exceeding 26% and reduced ion-migration-driven degradation. The devices exhibit reverse breakdown voltages exceeding −17 V and maintain operational stability for over 3,000 h with negligible degradation. These findings underscore the effectiveness of a-SAMULs in enhancing the long-term reliability of perovskite photovoltaics."},{"t":"氨基酸组成在肽合成过程中驱动聚集","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02090-0","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","b":"Peptide aggregation is a long-standing challenge in chemical peptide synthesis, limiting its efficiency and reliability. Although data-driven methods have enhanced our understanding of many sequence-based phenomena, no comprehensive approach addresses so-called non-random difficult couplings (generally linked to aggregation) during solid-phase peptide synthesis. Here we leverage existing peptide synthesis datasets, supplemented with further experimental data, to build a predictive model that deciphers the role of individual amino acids in triggering aggregation. We first identified and experimentally validated composition-dependent aggregation as a stronger predictor than sequence-based patterns. This insight enabled the development of a composition vector representation, allowing insights into the aggregation propensities of individual amino acids. Applying an ensemble of trained models, we predicted the aggregation properties of peptides and recommended the optimized use of aggregation-reducing tools. By elucidating each individual amino acid’s influence, this method holds the potential to accelerate synthesis optimization through existing data, offering a robust framework for understanding and controlling peptide aggregation.","tp":"肽合成聚集","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"多肽合成过程中的聚集现象长期制约着生产效率与可靠性。本研究利用现有的多肽合成数据集并结合实验验证，成功构建了一种预测模型。该模型能够深度解析氨基酸组成如何驱动聚集，并有效识别固相多肽合成中非随机的困难耦合反应，为高效设计并规模化合成复杂多肽药物提供了智能优化方案。"},{"t":"激活 L-组氨酸生物合成作为抗结核分枝杆菌的新抗生素策略","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70510-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The increasing prevalence of antimicrobial resistance is an important challenge that warrants new approaches to antibiotic development. Currently, all antibiotics inhibit biological processes. To explore whether activation of a biochemical pathway can elicit bactericidal effects we engineered variants of Mycobacterium tuberculosis ATP-phosphoribosyltransferase (ATP-PRT) that are resistant to allosteric inhibition by l-histidine, leading to supraphysiological activation of ATP-PRT and l-histidine overproduction. Upregulation of L-histidine biosynthesis significantly reduces the growth of M. tuberculosis in culture and causes a loss of fitness owing to nutrient and energy depletion. Moreover, the expression of allosteric variants in M. tuberculosis significantly reduced infections in human macrophages and in a mouse model of infection. Thus, metabolic activation represents a new mycobactericidal mechanism that could be applied to antimycobacterial drug discovery."},{"t":"集成感光、存储与处理功能的单二极管用于类神经形态图像传感器","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01588-2","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"神经形态图像传感器","kp":["[集成功能]: 感光+存储+处理一体化","[方法]: 能带结构工程使二极管多功能化"],"as":"传统两端p-n二极管功能单一，难以满足神经形态计算对传感-存储-处理一体化的需求。本研究提出一种集成光电传感、存储与计算功能的单一二极管器件，利用两端结构同时实现光信号感知、状态保持与信息处理。该器件架构大幅简化了神经形态硬件电路复杂度，为构建高密度、低功耗的仿生视觉感知与边缘AI系统提供了全新硬件原语。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"A single diode with integrated photosensing, memory and processing for neuromorphic image sensors","b":"Two-terminal p–n diodes are fundamental components in many electronic and optoelectronic systems. However, their defining characteristics limit them to single-function devices, and methods to achieve multiple functionalities—such as using devices with three or more terminals and introducing novel materials—can increase hardware and processing complexity. Here we show that a band-structure engineering approach can be used to create a p–n diode with integrated photosensing, memory and processing capabilities. The diode consists of vertically grown p-GaN/n-AlGaN/n-GaN nanowires on a silicon substrate, where the larger bandgap of the n-type AlGaN segment creates an electron reservoir in the GaN p–n junction. The embedded electron reservoir configuration enables precise control over charge trapping and release processes beyond the common p–n junction operation model, providing bias-tunable photosensing behaviour with a responsivity of 10.45 mA W−1, photosynaptic behaviour with a paired-pulse facilitation ratio up to 122% and photo-memory behaviour with eight linear states. We show that an array of such three-in-one diodes can be used to create a compact and energy-efficient image sensor with denoising and image-classification functions without additional circuits."},{"t":"基于相变铁磁流体的可重构介电弹性体致动器实现可持续运行","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb7409?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"介电弹性体驱动器","kp":["[电极材料]: 相变铁磁流体PTF","[可重构性]: 固液态可逆切换重构工作模式"],"as":"介电弹性体驱动器（DEA）可实现快速、精确的柔性驱动，但其构型与运动模式通常固定、难以动态重构。本研究引入相变铁磁流体作为可重构中间层，使DEA在外部刺激下实现形态与驱动模式的动态切换。该策略突破了传统软体驱动器构型锁定的瓶颈，可广泛应用于软体机器人、可穿戴触觉反馈及自适应光学器件等前沿领域。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"A reconfigurable dielectric elastomer actuator via phase-transitional ferrofluid enables sustainable operation","b":"Dielectric elastomer actuators (DEAs) are promising soft transducers capable of rapid and precise actuation. However, their conventional architecture for efficient actuation confines DEAs in predesigned operational modes, leading to limited applications. Here, we introduce a reconfigurable DEA system using phase-transitional ferrofluid (PTF) electrodes. PTF switches its states between solid and liquid, satisfying requirements for a reconfigurable electrode for DEAs. In the sol state, the stable and high magnetic responsiveness inspired by ferrofluid and the low viscosity achieved through plasticization collectively enable dynamic reconfiguration of the electrode. In the gel state, PTF ensures stable shape retention and exhibits reduced interfacial slip during DEA actuation. This reconfigurable nature greatly increases adaptability and ensures continuous operation even when electrodes undergo disconnection or dielectric failure. Moreover, the PTF electrodes can be retrieved and reused after actuation, demonstrating their excellent recyclability. The combination of mechanical compliance, magnetic reconfigurability, and material sustainability renders the PTF a versatile electrode strategy for next-generation reconfigurable electroactive systems.","aip":1},{"t":"面向传染病预测的疾病无关集成学习方法","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70937-8","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"集成学习疾病预测","kp":["[方法]: 疾病无关的集成学习预测框架","[优势]: 超越传统固定权重集成"],"as":"该研究提出一种疾病无关的集成学习框架用于传染病预测。传统模型针对单一疾病定制，泛化能力弱；该方法整合多源数据（病例报告、搜索趋势、气候等），利用多模型集成提升预测鲁棒性。其核心价值在于同一框架可适配流感、登革热等不同疾病，降低模型迁移成本，为公共卫生决策提供更及时、准确的疫情预警支撑。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"A disease-agnostic approach to ensemble learning for infectious disease forecasting","b":"Accurate forecasting of infectious diseases drives modern public health interventions that reduce morbidity and mortality. However, accurate forecasting in real-time remains a challenge for the modeling community. Ensembling has emerged as a critical tool for accurate forecasting by leveraging multiple component (individual) models into a single weighted average. Traditional ensembling strategies have relied on bespoke component models that weight the contributions of individual models according to extensive historical data for specific diseases. This is impractical for an emerging disease, since there would be very little – if any – data. We propose an ensembling strategy, called epiFFORMA, that determines component weights for an ensemble model without historical data and is therefore disease-agnostic. The epiFFORMA model builds upon the FFORMA model from the M4 forecasting competition to harness epidemiological dynamics through synthetic data. We demonstrate that epiFFORMA performs better than a naive, equal-weighting ensembling strategy when forecasting outbreaks of COVID-19, diphtheria, influenza-like illness, dengue, measles, mumps, polio, rubella, smallpox, and chikungunya. We further show that epiFFORMA, on average, performs better than the individual component models in the ensemble."},{"t":"纳米手性生物传感器实现临床麻醉监测","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519821?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  10%, that is, over 32 million patients—suffer from inadequate anesthesia monitoring in surgical procedures yearly, global—results in unwanted intraoperative risks. On‐site, precise analysis of anesthesia concentration during patient surgery is highly desired yet has not been achieved owing to the lack of a satisfactory biosensor device: it allows sample collection‐and‐detection seamlessly and in a timely manner. Here, we introduce a new chiral plasma biosensor, a tandem integrating of one 3D nano‐helical silver array with an optofluidic chip that enables real‐time depth of anesthesia monitoring during surgery. The patient's blood flows into and is processed through our device's designed channel, where capillary‐driven flow enables rapid plasma separation from whole blood. The isolated plasma is then directly delivered to the surface‐enhanced Raman scattering (SERS) sensing region, and diverse functional anesthetics in blood are meanwhile recognized by the chiral plasma detector. The cost‐effective sensor enables the detection limitation at a level of 0.1 µg/mL, and more importantly, all analyses are completed within a minute level, showing an advance compared to current hour/day suboptimal temporal resolution. We further apply this device in the clinic, monitor the anesthetics, and offer individual drug metabolism profiles in various patients. In addition, this precise, on‐site, and real‐time biochip features a user‐friendly diagnostic system that uses mobile applications and portable accessories to address critical clinical needs, providing an opportunity for personalized anesthesia management based on patient‐specific needs.","tp":"手性传感器","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"为解决手术中麻醉监测不精准导致的术中风险，研究团队开发了一款新型纳米手性等离子体生物传感器。该设备能够实现样本采集与检测的无缝衔接，在手术现场实时、精确地分析患者的麻醉药物浓度。这项前沿技术突破了传统检测设备的局限，有望极大提升临床麻醉的安全性和监护水平。"},{"t":"受叶片启发的Janus结构摩擦电-湿气混合能量收集器","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506740?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"摩擦湿气混合发电","kp":["器件结构[复合采集器]: 仿生Janus叶片","[能量来源]: 摩擦电+湿气发电耦合"],"as":"受叶片结构启发，研究设计了Janus双面结构的摩擦电-湿气混合能量收集器。摩擦纳米发电机（TENG）和湿气发电机（MEG）各自利用机械运动和环境湿气发电，但单独效率有限。该器件通过仿生双层异质结构同时捕获两种能量源，实现全天候、多场景自驱动供电，为可穿戴设备和物联网节点提供持续微功率解决方案。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"A Leaf‐Inspired Janus‐Structured Triboelectric‐Moisture Hybrid Energy Harvester","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Triboelectric nanogenerators (TENGs) and moisture‐enabled electricity generators (MEGs) demonstrate significant potential in promoting sustainable energy development and supporting low‐power IoT devices. Inspired by the different functional structures of dual‐epidermis of plant leaves, this study proposes a bioinspired Janus structured energy‐leaf with hybrid triboelectric‐moisture hybrid energy harvesters in up and down structure. The upper layer utilizes a silica‐based flame‐retardant hydrophobic material to construct the TENG component, which provides a robust triboelectric layer for efficiently harvesting various forms of mechanical energy (e.g., fundamental contact‐separation mode with output voltage of 16.1 V and power density of 0.9 µW·cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    ; solid–liquid contact mode with output voltage of 19.45 V and power density of 17.1 µW·cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    ). The bottom layer employs a carbon‐based aerogel as the MEG component, enabling continuous output through environmental humidity modulation and maintaining stable performance even under high‐humidity conditions (697 mV, 0.68 µW·cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    ). As a proof of concept, this hybrid energy harvester is demonstrated in an intelligent emergency system for effective distress signaling and in smart agriculture greenhouse ventilation systems. This study provides a novel strategy for developing high‐performance, environmentally adaptive, and structurally integrated energy harvesting systems, holding significant scientific research value and promising engineering application prospects.","aip":1},{"t":"层状可控分子氧化还原驱动忆阻器用于稀疏脉冲类神经形态计算","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202512521?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分子氧化还原忆阻器","kp":["[材料]: 对称双核萘二酰亚胺bis-NDI","[机制]: 层状控制分子氧化还原驱动","[目标]: 精确控制金属导电丝均一性"],"as":"研究提出一种层状可控的分子氧化还原驱动型忆阻器，用于剪枝型脉冲神经网络。基于离子型低功耗机制，该器件通过分子层间的可逆氧化还原反应实现电阻态精密调控，模拟生物突触可塑性。层状结构设计使器件具备高均一性与多态存储能力，配合网络剪枝策略可大幅降低计算功耗，在类脑计算芯片工程化方面具有突破潜力。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":7.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"A Lamellarly Controlled Molecular‐Redox‐Driven Memristor for Pruned Spiking Neuromorphic Computing","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The low‐power ionic‐type memristor and brain‐inspired neuromorphic device offer significant potential in breaking the power consumption wall. However, the precise control of uniform metallic conductive filament (CF) at both intra‐ and inter‐molecular levels rather than random migration raises a pressing challenge. Here, we first report a symmetrical dual‐core naphthalene diimide (bis‐NDI) molecular material featuring multi‐active and lamellarly ordered redox sites, which actuates reconfigurable analog‐to‐digital (A‐t‐D) memristive operations via the controllable manipulation of CF growth at the molecular scale. The bis‐NDI‐based memristor exhibits highly efficient analog synaptic behaviors, demonstrating an ultralow‐power consumption of 90 aJ µm\n                    −2\n                    . By effectively re‐organizing lamellar redox sites, the device dynamically implements A‐t‐D transition with an operating voltage of 0.5 V (lower than most reported organic memristors) and ultrahigh yield of 98%. Relying on the bis‐NDI induced A‐t‐D dynamic plasticity, a novel feedback mechanism of pruning algorithm is subtly devised for granular error analysis and voltage adjustment validation in spiking neural networks (SNNs) computing. The co‐design of material‐algorithm can effectively reduce the number of connected neurons (max reduced proportion = 92%), thereby achieving ultralow systemic energy consumption while maintaining exalted recognition rates (&gt;90%). This work paves the material‐algorithm cooperation way to realize ultralow‐power neuromorphic devices and highly‐efficient spiking computing."},{"t":"表面功能化二维聚合物电致变色层作为超快多态红外光门","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19303","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电致变色聚合物","kp":["[二维聚合物电致变色]: 固态两端器件超快多态红外光门","[结晶给受体聚合物]: 亲离子孔隙实现前所未有开关速度"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"电致变色器件在智能窗、红外伪装等领域有广阔前景，但现有开关速度限制了应用拓展。本文开发了一种表面功能化的二维聚合物电致变色薄膜，通过分子层面设计实现了超快红外光学开关响应。该薄膜可在多个光学状态间快速切换，切换速度较传统无机电致变色材料提升数个数量级，且具备优异的循环稳定性。二维聚合物的可设计性和分子级薄层结构是实现超快离子嵌入/脱出动力学的关键，为红外光调制器件提供了新材料平台。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Surface-Functionalized, Two-Dimensional Polymer Electrochromic Layers as Ultrafast, Multi-State Infrared Optical Gates","b":"Electrochromic devices have widespread application potential, but the currently available switching speeds limit broad real-world implementation of this technology. Here, we report surface-engineered two-dimensional polymers with ionophilic pores that offer unprecedented switching speeds in solid-state, two-terminal, electrochromic devices. In particular, we demonstrate that a crystalline donor-acceptor 2DP functionalized with ethylene glycol oligomers exhibits multistate infrared absorption that is 4× faster (tc = 320 ms) with 3× coloration efficiency (491 cm2 C-1) compared to an alkyl functionalized 2DP constructed from the same chromophores. The functionalized nanoporous surfaces enable rapid switching in these materials under either oxidative or reductive conditions, allowing us to access a range of robust, stable optical responses in a single electrochromic layer. These attributes led us to leverage surface-functionalized 2DPs as multistate infrared logic gates. Collectively, this work demonstrates that surface engineering of nanoporous crystalline lattices is a promising approach to co-optimize the electronic and ionic conductivities required to achieve rapidly switchable electrochromic layers. Beyond speed and efficiency, the demonstration of multistate infrared characteristics shows that electrochromic frameworks are useful in integrated optoelectronic circuits. This positions surface-engineered 2DPs as improved electrochromic coatings and a new material platform for photonic information processing and adaptive devices."},{"t":"高效倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池研究进展：电荷传输、界面工程与稳定性","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00115","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"反式钙钛矿电池","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":"本文综述了高效倒置结构钙钛矿太阳能电池的最新进展，聚焦三大关键方向：载流子输运层优化、界面工程和长期稳定性提升。倒置结构(p-i-n)因其低温制备、低迟滞和良好的叠层兼容性受到广泛关注。文章系统讨论了空穴/电子传输层材料选择、界面钝化策略(如2D/3D异质结、SAM修饰)对开路电压和填充因子的影响，以及封装和组分工程对运行稳定性的改善，为实现商业化所需的效率与耐久性平衡提供了路线图。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Progress in High-Efficiency Inverted Perovskite Solar Cells: Charge Transport, Interface Engineering, and Stability","b":"Inverted (p-i-n) perovskite solar cells (PSCs) have emerged as a focal point in photovoltaic research, combining high efficiency with long-term stability and offering a strong potential for tandem integration. Their quasi-steady-state certified power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) now exceed 27%, surpassing those of their regular (n-i-p) counterparts. Here, we review recent advances in high-performance p-i-n PSCs, highlighting strategies for the selection and optimization of charge-transport layers, regulation of perovskite crystallization, and design of interface engineering. Finally, we discuss the significant breakthroughs in the stability of p-i-n PSCs and provide an outlook on future directions that may guide the next stage of device optimization, thereby laying the foundation for the large-scale implementation of perovskite photovoltaics."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过铜催化烯丙基 C-N 和 C-O 键形成对映体和位点选择性合成 α-取代肼、吡唑烷和叔醇","d":"2026-03-22","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22785","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"A catalytic method for the enantioselective synthesis of α-tertiary hydrazines, pyrazolidines, and tertiary alcohols containing dialkyl-substituted stereocenters is disclosed. Reactions employ simple azoarene and nitrosoarene electrophiles and undergo Cu-catalyzed site- and enantioselective C-N or C-O bond formation. Utility of the approach is demonstrated through the rapid stereoselective assembly of substituted-pyrazolidine scaffolds and 1,3-diamines.","tp":"铜催化合成","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究公开了一种全新的铜催化方法，用于对映选择性合成含双烷基取代立体中心的α-叔代肼、吡唑烷和叔醇等化合物。该反应利用简单的偶氮苯和亚硝基苯作为亲电试剂，通过精准的位点和对映体选择性控制实现C-N或C-O键的高效形成。该方法在快速合成复杂取代骨架和手性药物分子方面具有巨大潜力。"},{"t":"电荷分离和/或热点效应：阐明Ru-Ni纳米颗粒相比Ru-Ni-ZrO2复合材料光催化CO2还原的高效机制","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17533","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化CO2还原机理","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"光催化CO2还原中电荷分离与等离激元热点的催化贡献常难以区分。本文以Ru-Ni双金属纳米颗粒和Ru-Ni-ZrO2复合催化剂为对比模型，通过精心设计实验排除了热效应的干扰，系统厘清了光催化CO2还原的真实反应路径。研究表明，Ru-Ni纳米颗粒的高效CO2还原主要源于光诱导的电荷分离效应而非局域热催化，而ZrO2载体上的Ru-Ni则更多表现出光热协同特征。该工作为理解双金属光催化剂的活性来源提供了清晰判据。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Charge Separation and/or Hot Spots: Clarification of Efficient CO2 Reduction over Ru–Ni Nanoparticles Compared to Photocatalysis on Ru–Ni–ZrO2 Composites","b":"The true reaction pathway and the catalytic role responsible for it remain uncertain in photocatalysis, where charge separation, hot spots, and energetic modulation of the ground and excited states are involved. Herein, a Ru atom was embedded in a ∼1.6 nm Ni nanoparticle dispersed on ZrO2. The 13CO2 photoreduction rate to 13CH4 showed a negligible change of ∼26 μmol h-1 gcat-1 upon adding Ru (1.0 wt %) to the Ni (10 wt %)-ZrO2 photocatalyst under a 295 K water bath for cooling irradiated by UV-visible light at 568 mW cm-2. By contrast, the rate using the Ru-Ni-ZrO2 catalyst exceeded that of Ni-ZrO2 by >2.7× (>7.9 mmol h-1 gcat-1) when the 295 K water bath for catalysts was not applied. Extended X-ray absorption fine structure analysis revealed that the hot spot Ni temperature increased from 295 to 399 ± 29 K under 654 mW cm-2 irradiation, even with the 295 K ethylene glycol bath for cooling, confirming that multiple hydrogenations occurred on Ni for COH species transferred from the O vacancy sites at the ZrO2 surface. In the absence of the 295 K water bath, CO2 was directly adsorbed on the RuNi2 site, and its dissociation into CO and O species proceeded with a low activation energy of 0.45 eV, enabling a photothermal pathway, as supported by DFT and FTIR analyses. These results highlight the importance of monitoring the hot spot temperature in photocatalysts to identify the active site combined with redox sites on the semiconductor, driven by charge separation under UV-visible light irradiation."},{"t":"[ASAP] 3,5-二甲基赖氨酸 (DMOA) 衍生的类萜正内酯 (−)-Novofumigatonin、(−)-Asnovolin F 和 (−)-Asnovolin G：全合成和相关研究","d":"2026-03-22","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01821","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"We disclose a full account of the total synthesis of (-)-novofumigatonin and the first syntheses of (-)-asnovolin F and (-)-asnovolin G. The overarching approach to these 3,5-dimethylorsellinic acid (DMOA)-derived spiromeroterpenoid ortholactones relies on two central features: highly convergent coupling of fragments of roughly equal complexity and subsequent formation of the embedded ortholactone cages. The scope of coupling by 1,2-addition of a hindered, neopentylic organolithium with a collection of highly congested tetrasubstituted cyclohexanones, integral to concise assembly of the stereochemically dense carbon skeleton, is described. The study of ortholactone formation provides insights into synthetic pathways to the embedded dioxabicyclo[3.2.1]octane. An advanced intermediate featuring the ortholactone-acetal core enables access to all three spiromeroterpenoid natural products.","tp":"萜类全合成","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究详细报道了(-)-novofumigatonin的全合成，以及(-)-asnovolin F和(-)-asnovolin G的首次合成。这些DMOA衍生的螺环类萜正内酯的合成策略依赖于两个核心特征：复杂度相近的片段之间的高度汇聚偶联，以及后续嵌入的正内酯笼状结构的形成。研究还探讨了受阻的新戊基有机锂化合物通过1,2-加成进行偶联的反应范围。"},{"t":"真空蒸镀无铅RbYbI3钙钛矿中间层用于高性能有机发光二极管的通用电子注入","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72838?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿OLED界面层","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"OLED的光电性能高度依赖电荷注入效率。本文利用真空蒸镀法制备了无铅的RbYbI3钙钛矿薄膜作为有机发光二极管的电子注入层，该层具有合适的能级排列和优异的电子注入能力，可作为一种通用型电子注入材料。将其应用于多种发光体系的OLED器件后，均实现了显著提升的发光效率和更低的驱动电压，展示了无铅钙钛矿在OLED界面工程中的应用潜力，为高效率OLED器件设计提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Vacuum‐Evaporated, Lead‐Free RbYbI3 Perovskite Interlayers for Universal Electron Injection in High‐Performance Organic Light‐Emitting Diodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The optoelectronic performance of organic light‐emitting diodes (OLEDs) is critically governed by charge injection from electrodes into organic layers, where significant energy barriers at the interfaces often impede efficient charge injection. These barriers disrupt the balance between hole and electron injection in the emitting layer, thereby limiting device optoelectrical performance. Conventional electron injection layers (EILs), such as lithium fluoride (LiF) or ultrathin metal layers, often exhibit limited injection efficiency when used with certain metals, including silver. In this work, we propose a lead‐free perovskite thin film, RbYbI\n                    3\n                    , as an efficient EIL for OLEDs. Deposited via vacuum evaporation, a 5‐nm‐thick RbYbI\n                    3\n                    layer induces a 630‐mV surface potential shift at the interface between the organic layer and the metal electrode. First‐principles density functional theory calculations also confirm that RbYbI\n                    3\n                    exhibits termination‐dependent surface dipole formation, thereby lowering the effective injection barrier relative to LiF. This facilitates efficient electron injections across various organic semiconductors without requiring additional interface engineering. Furthermore, RbYbI\n                    3\n                    is compatible with both aluminum and silver cathodes, unlike LiF, which exhibits electrode‐material limitations. When applied to blue‐emitting OLEDs, the device with RbYbI\n                    3\n                    exhibits a lower turn‐on voltage by 0.4 V and a higher external quantum efficiency (EQE) of 19.5% than the control using LiF (EQE of 17.7%). Similarly, green OLEDs with RbYbI\n                    3\n                    maintained superior efficiency at high luminance, with a maximum EQE of 23.0% and 20.7% at 10 000 cd m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    , compared to 22.0% and 15.8% at 10 000 cd m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    for the LiF‐based control device. The perovskite‐based EIL is readily integrated into standard OLED fabrication processes, providing a universal and practical strategy to overcome the limitations of conventional EILs and enabling the development of high‐performance OLEDs."},{"t":"燃料电池混合动力汽车智能化能量管理：拓扑、感知、决策与互联系统进展","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003326?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"燃料电池能量管理","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Toward intelligent energy management for fuel cell hybrid electric vehicles: Advances in topologies, perception, decision, and connected systems"},{"t":"余热利用与储备市场参与下混合蒸汽-电力能源系统的技术经济优化","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003752?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热电联产","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热电联产系统优化","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Techno-economic optimization of hybrid steam-electric energy systems with excess heat utilization and reserve market participation"},{"t":"相对于静息状态，任务诱发的功能连接与执行功能表现出新颖且强化的关系","d":"2026-03-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516929123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Executive functioning in children has been linked to intrinsic brain network organization assessed during the resting state, as well as to brain network organization during the performance of cognitive tasks. Prior work has established that task-based brain networks are stronger predictors of behavior than resting state networks, yet it is unclear if tasks only strengthen relationships that exist weakly at rest or if tasks also evoke unique relationships. A lack of discernment regarding how tasks and the resting state commonly and uniquely support executive functions precludes a holistic understanding of the neurobiological basis of executive functions. This project investigated differences in brain network organization and relationships with executive function ability between the resting state and two executive function tasks, a stop signal task and an emotional n-back task, using the Adolescent Brain and Cognitive Development Study dataset. Both executive function tasks evoked a more integrated network organization than the resting state, and executive function ability was related to different aspects of brain network organization during the resting state and during the tasks. Further, task-related shifts in brain network organization evoked several new relationships with executive function that were not detectable during the resting state and strengthened a relationship with executive function that existed weakly during the resting state. Overall, this study establishes a distinction between common and unique features of intrinsic and task-evoked brain function that facilitate executive function in children.","tp":"脑网络执行","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"as":"儿童执行功能与静息及任务状态下的脑网络组织密切相关。虽然已有研究表明基于任务的脑网络在行为预测上优于静息态网络，但任务状态是仅仅强化了静息时的微弱关联，还是会诱发独特的连接模式，目前尚不清楚。该研究深入探讨了任务诱发的功能连接如何独特且强化地与执行功能产生关联，填补了两者间关系机制认知的空白。"},{"t":"甘蔗条纹花叶病毒 P1 蛋白靶向 BES1 转录因子，破坏植物中 DAMP 触发的免疫","d":"2026-03-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adr9432?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Sugarcane streak mosaic virus (SCSMV) is the major cause of sugarcane mosaic disease. Its P1 protein (P1\n                    SCSMV\n                    ) is crucial for pathogenesis, but how it disrupts plant immunity remains unclear. Here, we found that P1\n                    SCSMV\n                    directly binds to the core transcription factor of brassinosteroid signaling, NbBES1, disrupting its binding to the E-box elements of the xyloglucan endotransglucosylase/hydrolase gene 1 (\n                    NbXTH1\n                    ) promoter and suppressing\n                    NbXTH1\n                    transcription.\n                    NbXTH1\n                    overexpression enhanced the plant resistance to fungal/viral infection, improved the contents of xyloglucan, which directly induced a damage-associated molecular pattern triggering innate immunity (DTI) and expression of several defense genes, and accompanied with a thickened middle lamellae and primary cell wall. Reduced xyloglucan due to\n                    NbXTH1\n                    downexpression further weakened DTI responses and a thinner cell wall. This study reveals how a viral protein subverts cell wall–mediated immunity and identifies NbXTH1 as a broad-spectrum disease resistance factor. Our findings support using xyloglucan or NbXTH1 to engineer broad-spectrum disease resistance in crops.","tp":"甘蔗花叶病","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"甘蔗条纹花叶病毒（SCSMV）是引发甘蔗花叶病的主要病原。研究发现，该病毒的P1蛋白在致病过程中起关键作用，它能够直接结合油菜素内酯信号通路的核心转录因子NbBES1。这种结合阻断了NbBES1与木葡聚糖内转糖基酶/水解酶基因1的E-box元件的结合，从而破坏了植物体内的DAMP触发免疫反应，揭示了病毒逃避植物免疫的分子机制。"},{"t":"结构调控诱导自催化酰亚胺化构建高粘附离子导电聚酰亚胺网络实现超稳定硅负极","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4669180?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅负极粘结剂","kp":["[聚酰亚胺粘结剂PIy]: 低温自催化酰亚胺化合成","[硅负极]: 高粘附性+离子导电性超稳定循环","[硅负极瓶颈]: 体积膨胀和界面稳定性差"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"硅基负极因超高理论比容量被视为下一代锂离子电池的理想负极材料，但充放电过程中巨大的体积膨胀导致界面SEI膜不稳定和电极粉化。本文设计了一种结构可调的聚酰亚胺网络粘结剂，利用自催化酰亚胺化反应原位构建高粘附性和离子导电性的聚合物基体。该网络有效缓冲硅颗粒体积应变并维持稳定的离子传输通道，使硅负极在长循环中表现出超稳定的容量保持率，为高比能硅基电池的实用化提供了粘结剂设计新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Structure Tailoring Enabled Self‐Catalyzed Imidization for Engineering a Highly Adhesive and Ion‐Conductive Polyimide Network Toward Ultra‐Stable Silicon Anodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Silicon (Si) is widely recognized as one of the most promising anode materials for next‐generation lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs). Nevertheless, its practical application is hindered by significant volume expansion and poor interfacial stability. Herein, a highly adhesive and ion‐conductive polyimide binder, denoted as PIy, is synthesized via low‐temperature self‐catalyzed imidization through the copolymerization of 3,3’,4,4’‐biphenyltetracarboxylic dianhydride (BPDA) with 2,2’‐bis[4‐(4‐aminophenoxy)phenyl]propane (BAPP) as the tough monomer, 4,4’‐diamino‐2,2’‐bipyridyl (DAPY) as a base‐catalyzing component, and 2‐(5‐amino‐2‐methylanilino)‐4‐(3‐pyridyl)pyrimidine (AMPY) as an end‐capping agent. DAPY and AMPY effectively lower the activation energy of poly(amic acid) imidization which enables cyclization to proceed at low temperatures and the pyridine groups promote Li\n                    +\n                    transport. BPDA and BAPP contain abundant aromatic rings that provide high toughness and impart a high modulus to suppress volume changes. Meanwhile, the flexible ‐O‐ segments enhance chain mobility adapting to expansion while maintaining structural integrity. The Si@PIy‐185 °C electrode exhibits excellent long‐term cycling stability, maintaining a high specific capacity of 1118.6 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 1 A g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    even after 1000 cycles.The full cell of the SiO\n                    x\n                    @PIy‐185 °C//NCM811 exhibits a remarkable capacity retention of 87.8% after 100 cycles, highlighting the potential of the low‐temperature imidized PI binder for high‐energy‐density LIBs.","aip":1},{"t":"CO2电还原的从科学到技术突破：多物理场、多尺度与人工智能洞察","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516978?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"CO2电还原","kp":["[eCO2RR工程化]: 多物理场+多尺度+AI弥合实验室-工程差距","[电解槽优化]: 材料/机理/器件三方面进展"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该综述聚焦电化学CO2还原反应（eCO2RR）从基础科学向工程化技术突破的路径。研究从多物理场（电化学、流体力学、传质）和多尺度（原子、器件、系统）视角，系统分析了eCO2RR的关键瓶颈：催化剂选择性、反应器设计及CO2传质效率。论文重点引入人工智能方法在催化剂高通量筛选、反应条件优化和性能预测中的前沿应用，指出AI驱动的材料发现与多物理场建模的融合是加速CO2电解技术产业化的关键方向。","dp":1,"ot":"Science‐Towards‐Technology Breakthrough in CO2 Electroreduction: Multiphysics, Multiscale, and Artificial Intelligence Insights","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical carbon dioxide reduction reactions (eCO\n                    2\n                    RR) are a key technology for converting greenhouse gas CO\n                    2\n                    into high‐value‐added chemicals. In recent years, significant progress has been made in material design, catalytic mechanism analysis, and electrolyzer optimization. However, there remains a gap between “laboratory science” and “engineering practice” in current research. Most reviews are primarily based on the “material‐structure‐performance” model and have not yet established an integrated technical landscape combining multi‐physics, multi‐scale, and artificial intelligence (AI). This review centers on the industrialization goals of eCO\n                    2\n                    RR, establishing a multi‐scale research framework spanning from fundamental mechanisms to systems engineering. It covers four core areas: atomic‐level mechanism interpretation and characterization, interface microenvironment regulation, external field‐assisted optimization, and AI‐driven material design and reaction prediction. Through the closed‐loop integration of mechanism‐characterization‐optimization, this review emphasizes an overall synergistic strategy from materials to devices and from experiments to systems, aiming to establish a systematic research pathway for eCO\n                    2\n                    RR. This work not only provides a comprehensive research blueprint for the eCO\n                    2\n                    RR field but also offers methodological and strategic references for AI‐enabled catalytic material development, external field‐coupled performance enhancement, and the engineering of electrochemical carbon resource conversion.","aip":1},{"t":"基于带隙工程CuMnCrO4尖晶石氧化物的可扩展抗盐型太阳能蒸发器用于污染海水处理","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72671?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能光热蒸发","kp":["光热吸收剂[太阳能蒸发]: CuMnCrO4尖晶石氧化物","带隙工程[多阳离子设计]: 拓宽太阳能吸收","结构[蒸发器]: 倒U型架构","[特性]: 抗盐性能"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"韩国研究团队开发了一种基于带隙工程CuMnCrO4尖晶石氧化物的可扩展太阳能蒸发器，用于污染海水淡化。该材料通过调控Cu-Mn-Cr-O体系的带隙结构，实现了宽光谱高效太阳光吸收与光热转换。其突出的抗盐性能源于材料特殊的水分输运通道设计，可有效防止盐分结晶堵塞。该蒸发器在真实污染海水中表现出稳定蒸发速率和高离子截留率，材料制备工艺具备规模化生产潜力，为解决淡水短缺提供了低成本、可持续的技术路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Scalable Solar Evaporator Based on Bandgap Engineered CuMnCrO4 Spinel Oxide with Salt‐Resistant Property for Contaminated Seawater (Adv. Mater. 17/2026)","b":"Scalable Solar Evaporator In the Research Article by Ji-Hyun Jang and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202517285), a bandgap-engineered CuMnCrO4 spinel oxide is introduced as a high-performance photothermal absorber for solar desalination. Multi-cation design broadens solar absorption, enabling excellent evaporation rates. Integrated into an inverted U-shaped architecture, the system achieves continuous water transport, salt resistance, and exceptional stability under saline, extreme pH, and contaminated conditions, demonstrating scalable and durable freshwater production."},{"t":"微量聚合物半导体增强的可扩展聚合物复合材料用于250°C高性能电容储能","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521682?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物介电储能","kp":["工作温度[聚合物介电]: 250°C","[聚合物固溶策略]: 微量半导体抑制传导损耗","[高温介电瓶颈]: 热激活电荷传输致击穿"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出一种可扩展聚合物复合电介质，通过添加微量聚合物半导体实现250°C高温下高性能电容储能。高温聚合物电介质是下一代电力电子系统（如电动汽车、航空航天）电容器的核心材料。微量聚合物半导体掺杂显著提升了复合材料的击穿强度和能量密度，同时抑制高温下的漏电流损耗。该策略无需复杂的无机纳米填料分散工艺，兼顾了规模化制造可行性与极端工况下的储能性能，突破了传统聚合物薄膜电介质在高温环境下的性能极限。","dp":1,"ot":"Scalable Polymer Composites Enhanced by Trace‐Amount Polymer Semiconductor for High‐Performance Capacitive Energy Storage at 250°C","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐temperature polymer dielectrics are critically needed for capacitive energy storage in next‐generation power electronics operating above 200 °C, yet their practical application is severely limited by thermally activated charge transport that leads to exponentially increased conduction loss and premature breakdown. Here, we report a polymer solid‐solution strategy that simultaneously preserves intrinsic insulation while elevating trap energy levels through the incorporation of an ultralow fraction of a linear semiconducting polymer. The semiconducting chains are molecularly dispersed, functioning as electronic structure modulators rather than transport pathways. The simple nitrogen‐containing conjugated segments generate deep localized traps with high positive electrostatic potential, which immobilize injected electrons by increasing the high‐energy‐level trap density and suppressing hopping conduction at elevated temperatures. Consequently, the composite exhibits a 1940% enhancement in capacitive performance relative to the pristine polymer, while maintaining ≥90% charge–discharge efficiency. The fully organic solid‐solution films simultaneously achieve a high energy density of 3.9 J cm\n                    −3\n                    and 90% efficiency at 250 °C, together with ultrahigh long‐term stability. This work establishes a distinct route for decoupling insulation from trap engineering in polymer dielectrics and provides a scalable, low‐cost platform for high‐temperature energy storage applications."},{"t":"政策驱动的战略性绿色技术创新路径：韩国氢和碳捕获、利用和储存 (CCUS) 案例","d":"2026-03-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"政策监管","tp":"氢能碳捕获","sc":2.5,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"光热催化与热催化对比：钯催化分子间三组分C─H 1,3-N,O双官能化反应","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec9841?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钯催化碳氢活化","kp":["[光热vs热催化]: Pd催化三组分C-H双官能化","[C-H双官能化]: 突破两组分环化限制"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究比较光热催化与传统热催化在钯催化分子间三组分C─H键1,3-氮氧双官能化反应中的差异。光热催化利用局域光热效应实现精准温控，有望在提高区域选择性和反应效率方面突破传统热催化的局限，为有机合成中高选择性C─H活化提供新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Photothermal catalysis versus thermal catalysis: A palladium-catalyzed intermolecular three-component C─H 1,3-N,O-difunctionalization","b":"Although transition metal–catalyzed C─H activation has notably advanced C─H functionalization, achieving highly selective C─H difunctionalization remains a substantial challenge. Current C─H difunctionalization strategies remain largely constrained to two-component annulation reactions or dicarbofunctionalization, which inherently limit structural diversity and synthetic efficiency. Here, we report a palladium-catalyzed three-component C─H 1,3-\n                    N\n                    ,\n                    O\n                    -difunctionalization of 3-phenylpropanamide using azodicarboxylate in conjunction with either dioxygen or carboxylic acid. This approach selectively delivers distinct 1,3-\n                    N\n                    ,\n                    O\n                    -difunctionalized products through either photothermal or thermal pathway, affording moderate to high yields with excellent site selectivity and broad functional group tolerance, which can be readily transformed into various valuable heterocyclic compounds. Extensive experimental and computational studies reveal that the reaction operates via a complex and continuous catalytic cycle rather than by tandem, independent steps. By integrating principles of C─H activation, electrophilic amination, difunctionalization, and photothermal catalysis, this work expands the toolbox for selective multiple bond formation and will attract more interest in various fields."},{"t":"饼状表面卤化物-氟硫醇富集的Au12Ag30纳米团簇用于钙钛矿太阳能电池的缺陷钝化与防潮屏蔽","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519239?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米团簇缺陷钝化","kp":["纳米簇组成[钙钛矿缺陷钝化]: Au₁₂Ag₃₀表面卤化物-氟硫醇盐","缺陷钝化机制[钙钛矿电池]: 纳米簇钝化缺陷+阻湿屏蔽"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队合成了表面富集卤素-氟硫醇配体的Au12Ag30双金属纳米团簇，呈煎饼状结构。该团簇用于钙钛矿太阳能电池的缺陷钝化和防潮保护，通过原子级精确的表面配体工程有效消除钙钛界面的非辐射复合缺陷，同时构筑疏水阻挡层抑制水分侵入。缺陷钝化与防潮双重协同效应显著提升了器件的光电转换效率和操作稳定性，为金属纳米团簇在光电器件中的功能导向设计提供了新范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Pancake‐Like Surface Halide‐Fluorothiolate‐Enriched Au12Ag30 Nanoclusters for Defect Passivation and Moisture Shielding in Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    There are few examples of the function‐oriented synthesis of atomically precise metal nanoclusters (NCs) whose ligand composition and geometry readily translate into device‐level performance. Here, we report the design and synthesis of the pancake‐like [Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    (SPh\n                    3,5−\n                    (CF\n                    3\n                    )\n                    2\n                    )\n                    10\n                    Br\n                    20\n                    ]\n                    6−\n                    (Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    ) NC, and its use to boost the power conversion efficiency (PCE) and durability of perovskite solar cells. Single‐crystal x‐ray diffraction of Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    revealed an Au\n                    12\n                    icosahedron wrapped by a six‐layer Ag\n                    30\n                    shell, the (100) facets of which are capped by 20 Br\n                    −\n                    ligands, with 10 ‐CF\n                    3\n                    ‐bearing thiolates forming a hydrophobic equatorial belt. Introducing 0.5 mg/mL of this cluster into ((FA\n                    0.95\n                    Cs\n                    0.05\n                    )PbI\n                    3\n                    )\n                    0.975\n                    (MAPbBr\n                    3\n                    )\n                    0.025\n                    perovskite films boosted the device PCE from 23.55% to 25.53% and enables 94.8% retention after 1142 h of continuous one‐sun illumination. Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    is also distinguished by its −6 superatomic charge, and 66.7% surface halogen coverage—the highest ever reported. These findings establish anisotropic halide/thiolate‐protected NCs as potent additives for simultaneous defect passivation and environmental protection in high‐efficiency optoelectronics.","aip":1},{"t":"MOF中锆位点与羟基协同生成过氧物种，实现芳香胺高效串联氧化缩合","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72877?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF催化氧化","kp":["催化剂[串联氧化]: MOF-808锆基三羧酸盐","活性位点[氧化]: Lewis酸Zr位+末端羟基配对","[机制]: 氢键活化H2O2生成非自由基Zr-OOH","产物[苯胺氧化]: 偶氮芳烃"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究设计了含锆位点和羟基的金属有机框架（MOF）催化剂，利用其原位生成过氧活性物种的能力，实现芳香胺串联氧化缩合高效合成氧化偶氮苯类化合物。锆位点活化氧分子、羟基辅助质子转移，协同促进选择性与转化效率，克服了传统氧化体系选择性差、路径复杂的难题。该策略为芳胺高值化转化提供了高效催化平台，对精细化工和绿色合成具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Pairs of Zirconium Site and Hydroxyl in MOFs Enable Generating Peroxo Species for Efficiently Tandem Oxidative Condensation of Aromatic Amines","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Selective oxidation of aromatic amines to azoxyarenes is important but challenging owing to complex reaction pathways. Here, we report that constructing pairs of Lewis acidic Zr sites and terminal hydroxyl in zirconium trimesate MOF‐808 enables activation of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    for the formation of non‐radical Zr‐OOH species via hydrogen‐bonding interaction, achieving tandem oxidation of aniline to intermediates and their condensation into azoxybenzene via a non‐radical pathway. This catalyst displays 97.1% selectivity for azoxybenzene at nearly complete conversion under 25°C, along with good stability over fifteen successive runs, which is far superior to contrast ZrO\n                    2\n                    and Zr(OH)\n                    4\n                    . Moreover, the gram‐scale synthesis of azoxybenzene is achieved through Zr‐OOH species. Its universality is validated by the tandem oxidative condensation of 22 aniline derivatives to corresponding homo‐coupled azoxyarenes as well as the successful synthesis of 6 hetero‐condensation azoxyarenes. Substantially, the general applicability is confirmed by constructing other MOFs‐based pairs of Lewis acidic metal sites and terminal hydroxyl for achieving excellent performances to produce azoxybenzene. This work establishes a new avenue for H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    activation via major‐auxiliary cooperation to drive selective oxidation reactions."},{"t":"高耗能行业脱碳的氢气供应优化：一种多时间尺度滚动时域方法","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003843?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"工业氢能供应","kp":["[应用]: 脱碳工业氢气供应优化","[方法]: 多时间尺度滚动时域"],"sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Optimization of hydrogen supply operations for decarbonizing energy-intensive industries: A multi-timescale rolling horizon approach"},{"t":"用于生物大分子直接胞质运输的本质无序蛋白质启发的基于纳米载体的凝聚层（Adv. Mater. 17/2026）","d":"2026-03-22","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72675?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Protein-Inspired Reconfigurable Nanovector-Based Coacervates Intrinsically disordered protein–inspired nanovectors undergo reversible conformational transitions that enable coacervate formation with diverse biomacromolecules. The resulting nanocoacervates remain stable under physiological conditions and can directly penetrate cellular membranes through the dynamic motion of the nanovectors. This platform supports efficient cytosolic delivery of a wide range of cargos, providing a versatile approach for intracellular transport technologies. More details can be found in the Research Article by Kwan Hyi Lee, Ja-Hyoung Ryu, Youngdo Jeong, and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202507877).","tp":"纳米载体递送","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"受本质无序蛋白质启发的可重构纳米载体能够发生可逆的构象转变，从而与多种生物大分子形成凝聚层。这种纳米凝聚层在生理条件下极其稳定，并能通过纳米载体的动态运动直接穿透细胞膜。该平台能够高效地将各种生物大分子货物直接递送至细胞质，为生物大分子的胞内递送提供了一种极具潜力的通用新方法。"},{"t":"空间电荷区内禀缺陷补偿使无镉锌黄锡矿太阳能电池实现13.9%认证效率","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00550K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌黄铜矿薄膜电池","kp":["转换效率[CZTSSe薄膜电池]: 13.9%(认证)","缓冲层[无镉电池]: ZnₓSn₁₋ₓO替代CdS","缺陷补偿[空间电荷区]: 本征缺陷补偿"],"sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究通过空间电荷区本征缺陷补偿策略，实现了无镉锌锡氧化物（ZTO）缓冲层的铜锌锡硫硒（CZTSSe）太阳能电池13.9%的认证效率。传统CdS缓冲层含毒性镉，ZTO虽环保但界面缺陷严重限制性能。该工作通过调控缓冲层/吸收层界面的缺陷分布，在空间电荷区实现本征缺陷的自补偿效应，抑制非辐射复合，显著提升开路电压和填充因子，为无镉环保薄膜电池的效率突破开辟了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Intrinsic defect compensation in the space charge region enables cadmium-free kesterite solar cells to achieve 13.9% certified efficiency","b":"Cadmium-free ZnxSn1−xO (ZTO) buffer layers are an attractive alternative to conventional CdS in Cu2ZnSn(S,Se)4 (CZTSSe) thin-film solar cells, especially with advantages of Cd-related toxicity elimination and parasitic absorption mitigation at short wavelengths. However, the performance of ZTO-based CZTSSe devices has lagged behind that of CdS-involved counterparts, largely due to high-density detrimental defects and non-ideal band alignment at the CZTSSe/ZTO heterojunction. Here, we develop a junction heat-treatment process that, upon thermal activation, selectively drives Zn cations to diffuse from the ZTO buffer into the CZTSSe absorber along the chemical potential gradient. This diffusion-driven Zn incorporation compensates for intrinsic bulk defects such as CuZn and VCu, particularly in the space charge region. The cation diffusion also contributes to a more favorable conduction-band offset, prolonged minority-carrier lifetime, and extended carrier-diffusion length. Collectively, this results in optimization of carrier dynamics with simultaneously enhanced carrier separation, extraction, and transport efficiencies. As a result, we achieve an efficiency of 14.39% (certified at 13.90%) and a large-area (1.03 cm2) efficiency of 12.24%, representing the highest-to-date efficiency for Cd-free CZTSSe solar cells."},{"t":"铜集流体上原位形成的亲锂Li3Sb构筑富LiF固态电解质界面，实现无枝晶稳定锂金属负极","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70856?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池界面","kp":["界面层[锂金属电池]: LiF富集型SEI","集流体改性[锂金属电池]: 原位Li₃Sb修饰Cu","防枝晶策略[锂负极]: Li₃Sb双功能协同"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究在铜集流体表面原位构筑亲锂Li3Sb合金层，引导形成富LiF的固体电解质界面膜（SEI），实现无枝晶、高稳定的锂金属负极。Li3Sb的亲锂性降低锂成核过电位，促进均匀沉积；富LiF界面层具有高机械强度和离子电导率，有效抑制锂枝晶生长。该协同策略显著延长了锂金属电池的循环寿命和库伦效率，为高能量密度锂金属电池的实用化提供了关键界面工程方案。","dp":1,"ot":"In Situ‐Formed Lithiophilic Li3Sb on the Cu Current Collector Enables LiF‐Rich Solid Electrolyte Interphase for Dendrite‐Free and Stable Lithium Metal Anodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium metal batteries (LMBs) hold great promise for next‑generation energy storage systems owing to their high theoretical energy density. However, their practical application is hindered by uncontrolled Li dendrite growth and unstable solid electrolyte interphase (SEI). Here, we design a Li\n                    3\n                    Sb‐modified Cu current collector (Li\n                    3\n                    Sb@Cu) that employs a synergistic dual‑function strategy to regulate uniform Li plating and engineer a robust LiF‐rich SEI. The Li\n                    3\n                    Sb interface is constructed in situ by electrochemical lithiation of Cu\n                    2\n                    Sb layer that is directly grown on Cu foil via a galvanic replacement reaction in SbCl\n                    3\n                    solution. Lithiophilic Li\n                    3\n                    Sb interlayer, with high delithiation potential and strong adhesion to the Cu substrate, significantly lowers the Li nucleation overpotential (34 mV at 1.0 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    ). Moreover, the Li\n                    3\n                    Sb preferentially adsorbs and catalytically decomposes fluoroethylene carbonate, producing a mechanically robust, LiF‐rich SEI. Consequently, the Li\n                    3\n                    Sb@Cu enables stable Li plating/stripping for over 800 h and achieves an average Coulombic efficiency of 98.2% over 180 cycles. When paired with a LiFePO\n                    4\n                    cathode, the full cell delivers a high discharge capacity of 137.4 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    and retains 96.6% capacity after 130 cycles at 1 C. This work presents a synergistically bifunctional interlayer on Cu foils that regulates Li nucleation and stabilizes the SEI for high‐performance LMBs.","aip":1},{"t":"基于HfO2的不对称扩展p-n异质界面忆阻突触用于高能效神经形态硬件","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec2324?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"忆阻突触类脑计算","kp":["材料体系[忆阻突触]: p型Hf(Sr,Ti)O₂薄膜","器件结构[类脑硬件]: p-n异质界面型界面忆阻器"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对AI硬件能耗激增问题，研究者在HfO2基忆阻突触器件中引入非对称扩展的p-n异质界面结构，实现超高能效的类脑计算硬件。异质界面通过内建电场降低突触事件的能量耗散，同时调控离子迁移动力学以模拟生物突触的多种可塑性功能。该器件在保持高开关比和长保持时间的同时大幅降低操作能耗，为构建低功耗神经形态计算芯片提供了新材料架构方案。","dp":1,"ot":"HfO2-based memristive synapses with asymmetrically extended p-n heterointerfaces for highly energy-efficient neuromorphic hardware","b":"The escalating energy consumption of existing artificial intelligence hardware has become a serious global issue that demands immediate action. Neuromorphic computing offers promises to drastically reduce this footprint. Here, we introduce multicomponent p-type Hf(Sr,Ti)O\n                    2\n                    thin films for energy-efficient, resistive switching–based neuromorphic devices. We demonstrate interfacial memristors with ultralow switching currents (≤~10\n                    −8\n                    A), exceptional cycle-to-cycle and device-to-device uniformities, and retention &gt;10\n                    5\n                     s. They reveal hundreds of ultralow conductance levels with a modulation range of &gt;50 (without reaching any saturation) and reproducibly satisfy unsupervised learning rules. This performance originates from incorporating a self-assembled p-n heterointerface between p-type Hf(Sr,Ti)O\n                    2\n                    and n-type TiO\n                    x\n                    N\n                    y\n                    , resulting in a fully depleted space-charge layer asymmetrically extended into Hf(Sr,Ti)O\n                    2\n                    , a large built-in potential, and extremely low saturation current density under reverse bias. Ultralow conductance modulation is controlled by tuning p-n heterointerface’s energy-barrier height through electro-ionic charge migration. This materials-engineering strategy addresses energy consumption and variability in existing memristors, opening a pathway toward energy-efficient neuromorphic computing systems."},{"t":"晶界钉扎策略增强有机半导体薄膜聚集态，用于宽温域长期稳定气体传感器","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72850?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机半导体气敏材料","kp":["稳定化策略[OSC气敏]: 晶界钉扎","工作特性[有机气敏传感器]: 宽温域长期稳定"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出晶界钉扎策略，增强有机半导体薄膜中的聚集体态稳定性，实现宽温域、长期稳定的柔性气体传感器。通过在晶界处引入功能性钉扎分子，抑制晶界处分子堆积的无序化和热涨落，维持活性层的高有序聚集态，从而大幅提升薄膜在极端温度下的载流子迁移率和传感响应一致性。该策略解决了有机气体传感器在温度变化下性能漂移的瓶颈，推动了柔性可穿戴传感的实际应用。","dp":1,"ot":"Grain Boundary Pinning Strategy for Enhanced Aggregate State in Organic Semiconductor Thin Films Toward Wide‐Temperature‐Range and Long‐Term Stable Gas Sensors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Flexible gas sensors based on organic semiconductors (OSCs) show great promise for diverse applications, yet their practical application is hindered by the limited operational and shelf stability of OSC‐based gas sensors over a wide temperature range. Herein, we developed a universal grain boundary pinning strategy to cooperatively optimize the aggregate state stability, sensitivity, and selectivity of the ultrathin OSC film. By incorporating multi‐functional Au nanoclusters into the OSC layer, the thermally activated molecular motion and grain boundary migration can be inhibited by the cooperative effect of strain‐balancing and dipole–π interactions. Consequently, the NH\n                    3\n                    sensor based on 5 nm ultrathin film exhibits record stability over an extended shelf period (tested shelf life of one‐year, theoretical shelf life of 14.8 years) and across a wide temperature range (RT‐100°C on polymer substrate, RT‐180°C on SiO\n                    2\n                    substrate). The grain boundary pinning strategy is demonstrated to be universal across multiple OSC systems, underscoring its potential to enable robust, high‐performance flexible gas sensors for widespread commercialization."},{"t":"稠环受体-π-受体结构构筑近红外吸收介孔共价有机框架，增强H2O2光合成","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5267333?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"近红外COF光催化剂","kp":["分子架构[COF光催化H₂O₂]: 稠环受体-π-受体(FRA-π-A)","光吸收特性[COF]: 近红外吸收拓宽吸收范围"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究构建了基于稠环受体-π-受体的近红外吸收介孔共价有机框架（COF），用于增强光催化过氧化氢合成。受体-π-受体架构通过分子内电荷转移拓展吸收至近红外区，提升光捕获效率；介孔结构促进底物传质和活性位点暴露。该COF在可见光和近红外光驱动下高效活化水和氧气生成H2O2，光催化产率显著优于传统供体-受体型COF，为太阳能驱动的绿色H2O2生产提供了新设计范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Fused‐Ring Acceptor–π–Acceptor Architecture Enables Near‐Infrared‐Absorbing Mesoporous Covalent Organic Frameworks for Enhanced H2O2 Photosynthesis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Covalent organic frameworks (COFs) featuring donor–acceptor architectures have shown great promise as photocatalysts. However, their performance is often hindered by limitations such as narrow absorbance ranges and restricted electron delocalization, which are inherent to traditional imine linkages. Herein, we introduce a fused‐ring acceptor–π–acceptor (FRA–π–A) architecture for near‐infrared‐absorbing COFs, enabled via in situ COF‐to‐COF transformation that replaces imine linkages with FRA‐derived benzodithiazoles (or benzodioxazoles). Comprehensive structural characterizations confirm their mesoporous crystalline structure, featuring pore size distribution of 2.16–2.39 nm and broad light absorption extending to near‐infrared region. Property investigations demonstrate that the rigid backbones derived from the FRA–π–A architecture significantly enhance long‐range in‐plane electron delocalization, thereby improving the separation and transport of photogenerated charge carriers. Crucially, the accelerated carrier migration preferentially directs photogenerated electrons to the FRAs, promoting the formation of •O\n                    2\n                    −\n                    radicals and accelerating the rate‐limiting step of the oxygen reduction reaction. These synergistic structural and optoelectronic properties endow the FRA–π–A COFs with an outstanding photocatalytic H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production rate of 6.8 mmol g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    without sacrificial agents, exceeding the vast majority of conjugated linkage‐based COFs. This study highlights the immense potential of FRA–π–A COFs as high‐performance photocatalysts."},{"t":"涡轮电动eVTOL的环保能量管理策略：通过改进TD3耦合燃油经济性、电池健康与全生命周期排放","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003764?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航空","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电动飞行器能量管理","kp":["[方法]: 改进TD3算法","[耦合]: 燃油经济性+电池健康+碳排放","[应用]: 涡电eVTOL能量管理"],"sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Eco-friendly energy management strategy for turbo-electric eVTOLs: Coupling fuel economy, battery health and life-cycle emissions via improved TD3"},{"t":"登革热感染引发皮肤组织驻留和循环 CD8+ T 细胞，与避免住院相关","d":"2026-03-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7987?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Dengue is spreading globally, and there is urgent need to define immune correlates of protection for this disease. Dengue infection first occurs in the skin following the bite of an infected mosquito; however, knowledge of host immune responses within this site remains sparse. We investigated the phenotypic, functional, and transcriptional profiles of skin and blood T cells in 73 patients with dengue and 10 healthy volunteers. We show that the skin T cell compartment undergoes marked reshaping and is strongly enriched with proliferating CD4\n                    +\n                    and CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells compared with the blood of patients. Activated skin CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells expressed a core transcriptional signature of tissue-resident memory T (T\n                    RM\n                    ) cells, supporting their differentiation to the T\n                    RM\n                    cell lineage during infection. The magnitude of skin and blood CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell responses were associated with protection from hospitalization in this cohort. These data support a protective role of skin-resident and circulating CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells in dengue and warrant evaluation of vaccination strategies inducing skin T\n                    RM\n                    cells to enhance protective immunity.","tp":"登革热免疫","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"随着登革热在全球的蔓延，明确其免疫保护机制迫在眉睫。登革热病毒通过受感染蚊虫叮咬首先侵入人体皮肤，但目前学界对皮肤部位的宿主免疫反应知之甚少。研究人员对比分析了73名登革热患者和10名健康志愿者的皮肤与血液T细胞。研究证实，登革热感染会引发皮肤组织驻留T细胞和循环CD8+ T细胞的显著变化。该发现揭示了局部皮肤免疫反应的特征，这些特定的免疫机制被发现与降低患者疾病严重程度及避免住院密切相关，为开发针对性的登革热疫苗和免疫疗法提供了重要依据。"},{"t":"废弃微/纳米塑料转化为碳材料：可再生能源与环境应用新趋势","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003429?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"废塑料资源化","kp":["[资源化]: 废弃微/纳塑料转化为碳材料"],"sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.5,"t":2.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Conversion of waste micro/nano plastics into carbon materials: A new trend for renewable energy and environmental applications"},{"t":"膜上 SARS-CoV-2 刺突的构象动力学揭示了弗林蛋白酶切割和 D614G 突变的变构效应","d":"2026-03-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx5178?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"By combining hydrogen-deuterium exchange monitored by mass spectrometry (HDX-MS) with the ability of enveloped virus–like particles (eVLPs) to display full-length native-like severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 spike protein, we have determined the energetic and conformational effects of both the membrane environment and unique sequence features that are considered incompatible with soluble protein constructs. We find that eVLP-displayed spike can sample the open-interface trimer conformation observed in soluble constructs of spike, including sequences from engineered vaccine constructs and native viral sequences inaccessible to studies on soluble constructs. Moreover, the D614G mutation, which arose early in the pandemic, favors the canonical “closed-interface” prefusion conformation, potentially mitigating premature S1 shedding in the presence of a cleaved furin site and providing an evolutionary advantage to the virus. Furin cleavage at the S1/S2 boundary allosterically increases the flexibility of the S2′ site, which may facilitate increased TMPRSS2 processing, enhancing viral infectivity. The use of eVLPs in HDX-MS studies provides a powerful platform for studying viral and membrane proteins in near-native environments.","tp":"病毒刺突蛋白","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"结合氢-氘交换质谱（HDX-MS）技术与展示全长天然样刺突蛋白的包膜病毒样颗粒（eVLPs），研究人员成功探究了新冠病毒（SARS-CoV-2）刺突蛋白在细胞膜环境中的能量与构象变化。研究克服了传统可溶性蛋白构象的局限性，发现膜环境展示的刺突蛋白能够进行特定的构象采样。此外，研究深入揭示了弗林蛋白酶切割位点的存在以及D614G关键突变对刺突蛋白构象动力学产生的变构效应。这为理解病毒增强感染性的机制及膜融合过程提供了高分辨率的理化动力学视角。"},{"t":"生物-光催化协同使工程化甲烷氧化菌中CH4与CO2转化为氢气和4-羟基苯甲酸","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526097?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"生物光催化碳转化","kp":["[生物-光催化协同]: CH4和CO2转化为H2和4-羟基苯甲酸","[太阳能驱动]: 生物杂化系统整合生物合成与光催化","产物[CH4/CO2共转化]: H2和4-羟基苯甲酸"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究利用工程化甲烷氧化菌，通过生物光催化协同作用，将甲烷（CH4）和二氧化碳（CO2）转化为氢气和4-羟基苯甲酸酯等高值产物。工程菌整合了甲烷氧化代谢途径与光催化模块，光合作用提供的电子驱动CO2还原，与甲烷活化形成串联催化网络。该策略实现了分散C1资源的同步高值化利用，耦合温室气体减排与化学品合成，为碳中和生物制造提供了创新平台。","dp":1,"ot":"Bio‐Photocatalytic Synergy Enables Valorization of CH4 and CO2 Into Hydrogen and 4‐Hydroxybenzoate in Engineered Methanotrophic Bacteria","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Valorization of decentralized one‐carbon chain (C\n                    1\n                    ) resources into value‐added products has garnered significant attention, owing to its dual benefits in resource recovery and carbon mitigation. To address the challenge of co‐converting methane (CH\n                    4\n                    ) and carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ), we developed a solar‐driven biohybrid system that synergistically integrates biosynthesis and photocatalysis. The core of this system relies on a genetically engineered methanotrophic cell factory and newly designed biocompatible photocatalytic metal complexes. The methanotrophic bacteria utilize CH\n                    4\n                    as the primary feedstock to biosynthesize 4‐hydroxybenzoate (4HBA) while realizing CO\n                    2\n                    sequestration. The photocatalytic metal complexes, meanwhile, capture formate (a metabolic byproduct of cells) to generate hydrogen (H\n                    2\n                    ) and photoelectrons—with the latter directly supplying reducing power to support cellular activities in genetically tailored cells. Under optimal conditions, this solar‐driven system achieved a 4HBA titer of 472.36 µg/L, a H\n                    2\n                    yield of 0.59 mmol H\n                    2\n                    /mol CH\n                    4\n                    , and over 50% reduction in carbon emissions. The study not only establishes a feasible biomanufacturing strategy for the upcycling of C\n                    1\n                    gaseous feedstocks but also highlights the potential of integrating biological and photochemical technologies to advance sustainable energy and environmental solutions."},{"t":"东南极洲 PFAS 的大气迁移和沉积：来自雪样带测量和数十年记录的证据","d":"2026-03-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4749?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The occurrence of per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS) in Antarctica has been previously reported; however, the mechanisms of their inland penetration and the interplay between their depositional histories and interhemispheric transport remain unclear. Here, PFAS in snow along a transect across East Antarctica (from Zhongshan Station to Dome A) and depositional records at Dome A were studied to elucidate the sources and transport of PFAS and to reconstruct the historical emission record. Our findings suggest that precursor degradation and sea spray aerosol are the main sources of PFAS and play a pivotal role in the regional and seasonal variability of PFAS accumulation. The half-century depositional records reveal connections between Antarctica and distant sources. We propose the hemispheric and interhemispheric transport of PFAS from source regions to Antarctica, where they are deposited.","tp":"全氟污染物","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"全氟和多氟烷基物质（PFAS）在南极洲的污染历史及其向内陆渗透的机制一直不够清晰。本研究通过分析东南极洲（从中山站到南极冰穹A）雪样带以及冰穹A的长期沉积记录，揭示了PFAS的大气源、传输路径与沉降历史。研究结果阐明了PFAS跨越半球的大气长距离迁移机制及其在内陆冰雪中的沉积特征，并成功重建了过去数十年的污染排放历史。该发现为评估持久性有机污染物的全球循环及极地环境的脆弱性提供了关键的实证数据。"},{"t":"质子交换膜燃料电池运行条件参数诱导气体串流现象分析：综述","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003673?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"质子交换膜燃料电池","kp":["[问题]: PEMFC气体串透现象","[研究]: 操作条件参数对串透的影响"],"sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":2.5,"d":2.5,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Analysis of operating condition parameters induced gas crossover phenomenon in proton exchange membrane fuel cells: A review"},{"t":"碱金属介导调控相分离，提升柔性锌黄锡矿太阳能电池及组件效率","d":"2026-03-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02018-5","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性CZTSSe电池","kp":["[Na/Li协同]: Na促晶体生长,Li控相偏析","材料体系[柔性薄膜电池]: Cu2ZnSn(S,Se)4","[碱金属调控]: 控制柔性基板CZTSSe结晶"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过碱金属介导的相偏析控制策略，实现了柔性铜锌锡硫硒（CZTSSe）太阳能电池及组件效率的显著提升。柔性CZTSSe薄膜在弯曲应力下易产生相偏析和缺陷，限制器件性能。碱金属离子的引入调控了薄膜结晶动力学，抑制有害二次相生成、优化吸收层带隙梯度分布，从而提升开路电压和短路电流。该策略同时适用于小面积电池和大面积组件，推动柔性薄膜光伏在便携式和可穿戴能源中的应用。","dp":1,"ot":"Alkali-metal-mediated control of phase segregation for flexible kesterite solar cells and modules with improved efficiency","b":"Flexible kesterite Cu2ZnSn(S,Se)4 (CZTSSe) photovoltaics are attractive for lightweight and portable applications, but their efficiency remains limited by uncontrolled alkali-metal incorporation. Here we elucidate and exploit the distinct and complementary roles of Na and Li in controlling CZTSSe crystallization on flexible substrates. Our results show that Na promotes crystal growth, but its induced Se enrichment simultaneously drives large-scale SnSex phase segregation. The incorporation of Li reshapes the free-energy landscape of Cu-related phases, promoting the formation of CuxSe that consumes Se and thereby suppressing SnSex phase growth while driving ordered phase evolution. This kinetic competition strategy yields high-quality CZTSSe films with reduced charge recombination loss and enables power conversion efficiencies of 14.5% (certified 14.2%) for flexible cells and 12.7% (certified 12.0%) for shingled modules. Our results provide mechanistic insights into alkali-metal regulation in chalcogenide solar cells and demonstrate a kinetic competition strategy that can be generalized to regulate crystallization in complex multinary materials."},{"t":"“难以承受”的签证价格上涨威胁着澳大利亚的研究人员渠道","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00822-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"[ASAP]通过界面工程揭示Ag/ZnS异质结构界面结构对热载流子动力学的影响","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21419","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属半导体热载流子","kp":["[界面工程]: 调控Ag/ZnS热载流子注入","[挑战]: 晶格失配阻碍界面原子定义"],"as":"等离子体激元诱导的热载流子注入是提升金属/半导体异质结光电器件效率的关键途径。本研究聚焦界面结构对热载流子产生、转移与弛豫动力学的调控作用，揭示原子级界面构型如何影响载流子寿命与注入效率。该认知对设计高效等离子体光催化体系和超快光电探测器具有基础意义，有望推动太阳能转换与纳米光电子学发展。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Unveiling the Effect of Interfacial Structure on Hot Carrier Dynamics in Ag/ZnS Heterostructures through Interfac","b":"The enhancement of plasmon-induced hot carrier injection efficiency in metal/semiconductor heterostructures is essential for boosting their photoelectronic performance. Nevertheless, the considerable lattice mismatch between the components hinders the development of clearly defined interfacial atomic structures, complicating the understanding of the interfacial structure’s impact on hot carrier dynamics. Here, we demonstrate a ligand-assisted chemical transformation strategy to produce high-yield (>90%) epitaxial Ag/ZnS heterostructures from matchstick-like Ag2S/ZnS templates. It is found that the presence of a ligand promotes preferential nucleation of Ag nuclei at the interface, leading to well-defined interfacial structures. Comparative studies reveal that epitaxial interfaces in Ag/ZnS heterostructures significantly improve plasmon-induced hot electron transfer from Ag to ZnS under 520 nm excitation, achieving a quantum yield of 38.12%, nearly double that of nonepitaxial counterparts (21.11%), as quantified by near-infrared transient absorption pump–probe spectroscopy. Additionally, single-particle photothermal microscopy measurements demonstrate that the photothermal signals of epitaxial Ag/ZnS heterostructures display a uniform distribution with a decreased intensity compared to those of their counterparts, further correlating plasmonic heating characteristics of the heterostructures with their interfacial structure. This work establishes the importance of interfacial engineering in optimizing plasmon-induced hot carrier dynamics, offering insights into the design of high-performance optoelectronic devices utilizing plasmonic metal/semiconductor heterostructures."},{"t":"[ASAP]揭示氟化γ-Al2O3中强布朗斯特酸性的单点位起源","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21403","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氧化铝固体酸","kp":["[活性位点]: 氟修饰γ-Al2O3单点强Brønsted酸","改性元素[γ-Al2O3]: 氟和氯"],"dp":1,"as":"γ-Al2O3是石化工业中广泛使用的催化剂载体与固体酸催化剂，其表面酸性的精准调控至关重要。本研究通过氟化修饰，揭示了强Brønsted酸性来源于特定孤立铝位点（单活性中心）的结构机制。这一发现为理性设计高活性、高稳定性的固体酸催化剂提供了分子级认知，对烷烃异构化、裂化等炼油催化反应的效率提升具有直接应用价值。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Unraveling the Single-Site Origin of Strong Brønsted Acidity in Fluorinated γ-Al2O3","b":"Precise control of the surface structure and acidity of γ-Al2O3 materials is critical for advancing their applications as catalysts and catalyst supports, yet remains challenging owing to the structural complexity and dynamic evolution of aluminum hydroxyl moieties upon modification. Herein, we unveil the identity and evolution of the surface sites of fluorine- and chlorine-modified γ-Al2O3 using state-of-the-art solid-state NMR, combining high-field (up to 18.8 T), ultrafast MAS (up to 60 kHz), and multinuclear multidimensional correlation (1H-27Al, 19F-27Al, and 19F-31P, etc.) techniques, complemented by trimethylphosphine (TMP) probe adsorption. Notably, we unambiguously identify the intrinsic strong Brønsted acid site (BAS), present exclusively on fluorinated Al2O3, as a surface bridging hydroxyl bound to a stable, monofluoride-incorporated tetracoordinated aluminum center, denoted F1-AlIV-μ2-OH. This strong BAS shows a previously unrecognized structural resemblance to bridging acid sites in fluorinated zeolites, as corroborated by the convergence of 1H, 19F and 27Al NMR signatures, and exhibits exceptional stability toward air and moisture. The superior catalytic performance of F-Al2O3 in the octadecene conversion reaction further validates this acidity-performance relationship. Overall, this work helps to resolve the long-standing debates on the nature of surface acidity in alumina-based materials, establishes a structural benchmark for the targeted design of highly efficient fluorinated catalysts, and opens new avenues for precise acid-site engineering in heterogeneous catalysis."},{"t":"[ASAP] 用于内源性受体双光子控制的靶向共价光开关","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19954","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"The study of intact cells and their signaling circuits with light requires a stimulation strategy that is focused, deeply penetrating, and does not damage them. Implanted optic fibers, light-emitting diodes, and luminescent materials operated externally with tissue-penetrating infrared (IR) light are invasive or limited by light attenuation around the illumination point. To overcome these barriers, two-photon pharmacology takes advantage of femtosecond-pulsed IR laser light to produce deep and spatiotemporally precise cellular stimulation using specially designed photoswitchable drugs. Compounds that can be covalently tethered to the target neuroreceptor perform particularly well. However, the tethered photoswitches reported to date require mutagenesis of the target protein, which prevents the use of photopharmacology to stimulate the nervous system in wild-type animals. Here, we report the first two-photon optimized targeted covalent photoswitch (TCP2P) that combines the efficient two-photon isomerization of ortho-fluoro-substituted azobenzene with the ability to conjugate to nucleophilic residues of endogenous proteins (AMPA and kainate ionotropic glutamate receptors in neurons). TCP2P is readily obtained by click coupling of two precursor compounds prior to use, and after simple incubation, it enables controlling neuronal activity at one- and two-photon excitation up to 800 nm without genetic modifications.","tp":"双光子光开关","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"在完整细胞及其信号通路的光遗传学研究中，传统光学刺激方法往往面临穿透深度不足、具有侵入性或造成组织光损伤等问题。为突破这些技术瓶颈，本研究开发了一种新型靶向共价光开关技术。该技术巧妙利用双光子药理学优势，通过飞秒脉冲近红外激光实现极深的光穿透能力和高度聚焦的局部刺激。这种新型双光子控制策略能够实现对内源性受体的精准、无创调控，为在复杂活体组织中非侵入性地解析细胞信号传导网络和分子机制提供了极具潜力的前沿工具。"},{"t":"[ASAP]定制价态化学缓解锰基无序岩盐正极的容量衰减","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00417","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锰基岩盐正极","kp":["[失效机制]: Mn3+过还原致容量衰减","材料体系[DRX正极]: Mn/Ti无序岩盐"],"as":"阳离子无序岩盐（DRX）正极因不含钴镍、储量丰富被视为下一代锂电池正极的候选方案，但循环过程中锰溶解和结构相变导致严重的容量衰减。本研究通过定制过渡金属的价态化学（调控Mn/O redox贡献），抑制Jahn-Teller畸变和氧流失，显著提升了Mn基DRX正极的循环稳定性。该策略为设计低成本、高能量密度锂离子电池正极材料提供了新思路。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Tailored Valence Chemistry Mitigating Capacity Fading in Mn-Based Disordered Rocksalt Cathodes","b":"Cation-disordered rocksalt (DRX) cathodes are promising alternatives to conventional nickel-/cobalt-based layered oxides, offering high energy density with earth-abundant elements such as manganese (Mn) and titanium (Ti). However, their practical deployment has remained limited by severe capacity fading during extended cycling. In this study, we identify over-reduction of Mn3+ and its subsequent dissolution as a primary driver of performance decay in Li1.2Mn0.5Ti0.3O1.9F0.1, a representative Mn/Ti-based DRX cathode. It is shown that repeated cycles involving oxygen redox lead to an increasing fraction of over-reduced Mn2+ at the end of discharge, resulting in extensive Mn dissolution and structural deterioration. Accordingly, we demonstrate that elevating the overall valence state of Mn by adjusting Mn ratio effectively lessens over-reduction of Mn3+, thereby delivering substantially improved cycling stability. These findings underscore the critical importance of Mn redox-state regulation in the compositional design of Mn-based DRXs for achieving long-term structural and electrochemical stability as high-energy-density cathodes."},{"t":"[ASAP]表面功能化二维聚合物电致变色层作为超快多态红外光学器件","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19303","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维聚合物电致变色","kp":["器件架构[电致变色]: 固态双端","[开关速度]: 超快(二维聚合物离子亲和孔)","响应波段[光学门]: 红外多态"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了表面功能化的二维聚合物电致变色层，旨在解决电致变色器件中开关速度受限这一核心瓶颈。电致变色技术在智能窗、显示器等领域具有广泛应用潜力，但传统材料响应速度慢制约了商业化。通过二维聚合物结构设计和表面功能化策略，有望缩短离子扩散路径、增大活性界面，从而提升变色响应速率，为高性能柔性电致变色器件的材料工程提供新路径。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Surface-Functionalized, Two-Dimensional Polymer Electrochromic Layers as Ultrafast, Multi-State Infrared Optical ","b":"Electrochromic devices have widespread application potential, but the currently available switching speeds limit broad real-world implementation of this technology. Here, we report surface-engineered two-dimensional polymers with ionophilic pores that offer unprecedented switching speeds in solid-state, two-terminal, electrochromic devices. In particular, we demonstrate that a crystalline donor-acceptor 2DP functionalized with ethylene glycol oligomers exhibits multistate infrared absorption that is 4× faster (tc = 320 ms) with 3× coloration efficiency (491 cm2 C-1) compared to an alkyl functionalized 2DP constructed from the same chromophores. The functionalized nanoporous surfaces enable rapid switching in these materials under either oxidative or reductive conditions, allowing us to access a range of robust, stable optical responses in a single electrochromic layer. These attributes led us to leverage surface-functionalized 2DPs as multistate infrared logic gates. Collectively, this work demonstrates that surface engineering of nanoporous crystalline lattices is a promising approach to co-optimize the electronic and ionic conductivities required to achieve rapidly switchable electrochromic layers. Beyond speed and efficiency, the demonstration of multistate infrared characteristics shows that electrochromic frameworks are useful in integrated optoelectronic circuits. This positions surface-engineered 2DPs as improved electrochromic coatings and a new material platform for photonic information processing and adaptive devices."},{"t":"[ASAP] 反式十氢萘基萜类化合物的立体发散构建","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01881","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Thousands of highly oxygenated terpenoid natural products contain a common trans-decalin core bearing oxidized substituents in either the equatorial or axial configuration at the C(4) quaternary center. We report an expedient route to a versatile terpenoid building block primed for elaboration into numerous complex natural products. This intermediate is provided from (R)-carvone, a cheap and abundant chiral pool material, in three steps through a diastereodivergent, intramolecular carboborylation reaction. Notably, this method uniquely provides either equatorial or axial functionalized products from a single, common precursor. Identification of optimal ligands required extensive screening efforts, facilitated in part by high-throughput experimentation (HTE) and the construction of an algorithmically guided, combinatorial, in silico library, which identified the highest performing axial-selective ligand. The key interactions responsible for the observed high diastereoselectivity were elucidated with computational analysis, and the synthetic utility of this method was demonstrated in the total synthesis of several diterpenoid natural products.","tp":"萜类全合成","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"众多高度氧化的萜类天然产物共享一个反式十氢萘核心结构，且在其C(4)季碳中心具有复杂的构型特征。本研究报道了一种高效合成此类复杂萜类化合物通用砌块的立体发散性构建路线。研究人员以廉价易得的(R)-香芹酮为手性源起始原料，仅通过三步反应，利用非对映发散性的分子内碳硼化反应，成功合成了这一关键中间体。该中间体具备高度的多功能性，能够被进一步衍生化，为大批量、多样化合成具有高生物活性的复杂反式十氢萘基萜类天然产物奠定了基础。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 序列和立体控制开环/交叉复分解聚合","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21387","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cascade metathesis polymerization serves as a powerful method to synthesize well-defined polymers with increased structural complexity. Despite recent advances, achieving a sequence-regulated cascade metathesis polymerization of monomers with functional groups that exhibit high metathesis reactivity remains a formidable challenge. Here, we report an asymmetric, cascade ring-opening/cross metathesis polymerization of monomers containing highly ring-strained cyclopropene and highly reactive terminal alkene. The major hurdle lies in the fact that the precision control over the alternating sequences would be compromised by homopolymerization or homodimerization of the two reactive alkenes. By leveraging the 14-electron, chiral cationic Grubbs-type catalyst, both the initiation and chain growth processes include catalytic cycles orchestrated by two sequential metathesis reactions: ring-strain-driven ring-opening metathesis with cyclopropene and subsequent chelation-controlled cross metathesis with terminal alkene. This cascade metathesis polymerization is also characterized by high stereoselectivity, providing polymers with all-cis alkenes and good enantioselectivity at the recurring quaternary stereocenters.","tp":"开环复分解","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究开发了一种不对称级联开环/交叉复分解聚合方法，成功解决了高反应性官能团单体难以实现序列调控的挑战。该方法以含有高环张力环丙烯和高反应性末端烯烃的单体为原料，通过精确控制聚合过程，合成了结构明确且具有高复杂性的聚合物。这一突破为功能性高分子材料的序列控制合成提供了新途径，在材料科学领域具有重要意义。"},{"t":"[ASAP]SPSiP赋能的钯催化烯烃对映选择性炔基胺化反应","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c03266","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"该研究报道了首个钯催化的分子内烯烃对映选择性炔胺化反应，由SPSiP（硅基膦）配体体系促进。通过手性钯配合物同时活化烯烃和炔基，在分子内成环形成含氮杂环的同时实现高对映选择性控制。此类炔胺化产物在生物活性分子和天然产物合成中有广泛应用，该反应丰富了钯催化不对称C–N和C–C偶联工具箱。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钯催化烯烃胺化","kp":["产率[SPSiP配体Pd催化]: 最高92%","反应条件[炔基胺化]: 室温","[对映选择性]: 高ee值"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] SPSiP-Enabled Pd-Catalyzed Enantioselective Alkynylamination of Alkenes","b":"Here, we reported the first example of enantioselective Pd-catalyzed intramolecular alkynylamination of alkenes enabled by the development of a novel SPSiP ligand using alkynyl bromides as the C(sp)-electrophile. This ligand-enabled protocol allows the efficient synthesis of chiral pyrrolidine derivatives at room temperature in moderate to high yields (up to 92% yield) and high enantioselectivities (up to 95.5:4.5 er). Mechanistic and computational studies unveiled the high reactivity and enantioselectivity might originate from the electron-rich nature and large bite angle in the SPSiP ligand. The synthetic values of this reaction are demonstrated by various transformations and efficient synthesis of phenanthroindolizidine alkaloids including (+)-antofine and (+)-ficuseptine."},{"t":"[ASAP] 重新审视 NHC-金属键合：中高价亚氮铁配合物中的 π 供体稳定 Fe(VI) 氧化物","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21276","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"N-anchored tripodal N-heterocyclic carbene ligands, satTIMMNMes and Me2TIMMNMes, were synthesized and used to stabilize a series of mid-valent Fe(IV) and high-valent Fe(V) and Fe(VI) nitrides. The Fe(IV) and Fe(V) species adopt trigonal-pyramidal and trigonal-bipyramidal geometries, respectively, whereas the Fe(VI) nitrides exhibit octahedral coordination, representing rare examples of structurally characterized iron(VI) nitrido complexes. All complexes were characterized by single-crystal X-ray diffraction, multinuclear (1H, 13C, 15N, and 19F) NMR, zero- and applied-field 57Fe Mössbauer, electron paramagnetic resonance, as well as vibrational and electronic absorption spectroscopy. Combined spectroscopic, electrochemical, and computational studies examined how systematic variation in the NHC backbone modulates the electronic structures of the [Fe≡N]n+ and Fe–CNHC moieties. Structural and spectroscopic parameters of Me2TIMMNMes-based Fe(IV–VI) nitrides closely resemble those of parent TIMMNMes analogues, while more pronounced deviations are observed for satTIMMNMes derivatives. 57Fe Mössbauer spectroscopy at 80 K revealed an unusually negative isomer shift for the tetravalent (d4, S = 0) [(satTIMMNMes)FeIV≡N]+ (δ = −0.45 mm s–1), distinct from Me2TIMMNMes and TIMMNMes analogues (δ = −0.36 and −0.35 mm s–1), attributable to enhanced Fe–CNHC covalency in satTIMMNMes ligand. Cyclic voltammetry, supported by theoretical calculations, quantifies relative ligand π-donation in the Fe(IV) nitrido complexes, complementary to established NHC σ-donor descriptors, yielding the trend satTIMMNMes < TIMMNMes < Me2TIMMNMes. Consistent with this trend, structural and EPR data indicate differing degrees of Jahn–Teller distortion among the paramagnetic Fe(V) nitrides (d3, S = 1/2). In contrast, the structural and spectroscopic differences are relatively diminished in highly covalent Fe(VI) nitrides (d2, S = 0).","tp":"铁氮配合物","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究人员合成了两种N锚定三齿N-杂环卡宾配体，成功稳定了一系列中高价铁氮化物配合物，包括罕见的Fe(VI)氮化物配合物。通过单晶X射线衍射表征证实，Fe(IV)和Fe(V)物种分别采用三角锥和三角双锥几何构型，而Fe(VI)氮化物呈现八面体配位结构。该研究为高价铁配合物的合成与稳定化提供了新策略，对理解NHC-金属键合机制和高价金属化学具有重要价值。"},{"t":"[ASAP]将'烯'还原酶改造为异构酶用于丙二烯酸酯的对映发散合成","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19848","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酶催化手性合成","kp":["[酶改造]: ERED氧化还原酶重定向为异构酶","产物[酶催化]: 手性联烯酸酯","[反应类型]: 氧化还原中性立体选择性异构化"],"as":"该研究实现了酶催化不对称异构化合成手性丙二烯酯（chiral allenoates）。通过将原本催化还原反应的烯还原酶（ene-reductase）重新改造为异构酶，利用质子转移机制将非手性炔酸酯转化为手性产物，实现对映发散性合成。这一工作拓展了生物催化的应用边界，展示了酶工程在构建手性分子方面的巨大潜力，为药物合成和精细化学品制造提供了绿色高效的新路径。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Repurposing “Ene”-Reductase to Isomerase for Enantiodivergent Synthesis of Allenoates","b":"The synthesis of chiral allenoates through enzymatic asymmetric isomerization of achiral alkynoates via proton transfer is a highly desirable yet unachieved transformation, primarily due to significant product inhibition encountered with natural isomerases. To circumvent this, we repurposed flavin-dependent “ene”-reductases (EREDs), traditionally oxidoreductases, for redox-neutral stereoselective 1,3-proton transfer. Directed evolution of an ERED from Galdieria sulphuraria (GsOYE) generated a panel of new-to-nature isomerases proficient in isomerizing both 3-butynoates and 2-butynoates, affording diverse chiral allenoates with excellent enantiodivergence and negligible product inhibition. The resulting allenoates were leveraged in chirality transfer [2 + 2], [3 + 2], and [4 + 2] cycloadditions to create complex polycycles with up to three stereogenic centers. Mechanistic studies revealed that directed evolution yielded GsOYE mutants capable of operating via either one- or two-base mechanisms, a functional divergence rarely seen with small-molecule catalysts. This study expanded the catalytic repertoire of EREDs, establishing a biocatalytic platform for proton transfer catalysis to set axial chirality."},{"t":"[ASAP]通过微量磷掺杂修复碳缺陷以增强钠离子存储","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03902","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电硬碳负极","kp":["改性策略[硬碳负极]: 微量磷掺杂修复碳缺陷","[机制]: 扩大层间距引入活性位点"],"as":"该研究针对钠离子电池硬碳负极材料可逆容量低的问题，提出通过微量磷掺杂修复碳缺陷的策略。磷掺杂能有效钝化硬碳中的结构缺陷，减少不可逆钠离子捕获，从而提升材料的初始库仑效率和循环可逆容量。该方法掺杂量极低，工艺简单且成本低廉，为高性能钠离子电池负极材料的工程化改良提供了实用方案，有望加速钠离子电池的大规模商业化应用。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Repairing Carbon Defects Via Trace Phosphorus Doping for Enhanced Sodium-Ion Storage","b":"Hard carbon (HC) is widely investigated as an anode material for sodium-ion batteries (SIBs), but it suffers from poor rate capability, unsatisfactory cycling stability, and low initial Coulombic efficiency (ICE). Phosphorus doping can improve Na+ storage by enlarging interlayer spacing and introducing active sites, but excessive doping usually generates abundant defects, aggravates side reactions, and hinders ion transport. Herein, we propose a synergistic strategy combining trace phosphorus (P) doping with defect repair to fabricate low-defect “vesicular” P-doped hard carbon (PHC). Controlled P incorporation expands the interlayer spacing, heals structural defects, and reinforces the carbon framework, enabling balanced electrochemical performance without compromising rate capability and cycle life. The optimized PHC-1.5% anode delivers a reversible capacity of 364.98 m Ah g–1, maintains 220 mAh g–1 at 2 A g–1, and retains 63.07% capacity after 5000 cycles. This work provides a simple and scalable route for defect-regulated hard carbon toward advanced SIB applications."},{"t":"[ASAP] 一氧化碳还原环五聚成难以捉摸的克罗康酸自由基三阴离子","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02757","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Coupling reactions of carbon monoxide represent an ideal synthetic route to cyclic oxocarbons. Whereas oxocarbon anions based on rings of three, four and six carbon atoms have been synthesized from CO coupling, cyclic five-membered croconate anions have evaded capture by this method. Here, we show that CO coupling initiated by rare-earth dinitrogen complexes in concert with molybdenum hexacarbonyl yields rare-earth complexes of the exotic croconate radical trianion, [C5O5]3-, a species only observed previously under cryogenic irradiation. Contrasting reactions of the rare-earth dinitrogen complexes with CO alone produce ketene-carboxylate anions, highlighting the crucial templating role of molybdenum in forming croconate. Spectroscopic and computational analyses establish the radical nature of the croconate anion and reveal a heterobimetallic reaction pathway for its assembly with multielectron transfer. This discovery surmounts a long-standing challenge in oxocarbon chemistry, illustrating how strongly reducing rare-earth compounds and mixed-metal cooperativity can enable the isolation of sought-after organic radicals.","tp":"碳氧环偶联","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究利用稀土二氮配合物与六羰基钼协同作用，首次通过一氧化碳偶联反应成功合成了难以捉摸的五元环克罗康酸自由基三阴离子[C5O5]3-的稀土配合物。这一突破填补了环状含氧阴离子合成领域的空白，此前仅三、四、六元环含氧阴离子可通过CO偶联获得。该发现为新型环状含氧化合物的合成提供了创新方法，对有机合成和配位化学具有重要意义。"},{"t":"[ASAP]利用反应性有机染料探究亚胺基共价有机框架的外表面化学","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22900","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF表面化学","kp":["[探针方法]: 反应性有机染料探测COF表面"],"as":"该研究利用亚胺键共价有机框架（COFs）的外表面化学性质进行探测与表征。COFs外表面通常被认为由游离的末端官能团组成，但缺乏实验验证。研究开发了针对COF外表面官能团的探针技术，系统揭示了其表面化学反应活性与可及性。这一工作填补了COFs表面化学基础认知的空白，对优化COFs在催化、传感、分离等表界面敏感应用中的性能具有重要指导意义。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Probing the External Surface Chemistry of Imine-Based Covalent Organic Frameworks Using Reactive Organic Dyes","b":"The external surfaces of covalent organic frameworks (COFs) are presumably composed of free terminal functional groups from their constituent monomers. These terminal groups have been utilized to immobilize molecules onto COF surfaces for a variety of studies and potential applications. Despite the utility of these latent functional groups for COF functionalization and composite formation, the surface chemistry of the COFs has not been quantitatively investigated and is not well understood. In this work, fluorescent organic dyes bearing reactive amine and aldehyde functional groups are used to probe the surface chemistry of representative two-dimensional (2D) imine-based COFs. Systematic dye binding and displacement experiments provide new insights into the characteristics of COF surfaces and the reactivity of different molecules with the surface groups on the COF crystallites."},{"t":"[ASAP]由金属有机多面体组装的一维范德华多孔纤维","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21654","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属有机多面体纤维","kp":["组装维度[MOP]: 一维范德华多孔纤维"],"as":"该研究报道了由金属有机笼状物超分子组装形成的一维范德华多孔纤维结构。通过金属有机分子的分级自组装，构建出具有集体功能的一维纤维体系，展现出由单个分子构建单元层级组装而涌现的协同功能。该工作将超分子化学从零维/二维组装拓展至一维多孔体系，为设计新型多孔功能材料提供了全新思路，在分子分离、催化和纳米器件等领域具有潜在应用价值。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] One-Dimensional van der Waals Porous Fibrils Assembled from Metal–Organic Polyhedra","b":"Supramolecular systems exhibit collective functions that emerge from the hierarchical assembly of individual molecular building blocks. Metal–organic polyhedra (MOPs) are a class of functional supramolecular architectures with well-defined molecular geometry and an intrinsic cavity. In recent years, considerable progress has been made in assembling MOPs into extended networks to create porous solids. However, most reported MOP assemblies are limited to three-dimensional networks, which, owing to their high-dimensional connectivity, hinder effective stress dissipation and render them brittle under mechanical stress. Here, we report the one-dimensional (1D) self-assembly of MOPs into supramolecular polymeric aerogels that combine permanent microporosity with exceptional mechanical flexibility. The reaction between amino acid-functionalized naphthalenediimide (NDI) linkers and copper salts led to the synthesis of octahedral copper-based MOPs, followed by their spontaneous self-assembly to form supramolecular gels. The corresponding aerogels converted from the gels possessed uniform 1D fibrillar networks (14.8 ± 2.2 nm in width) with intrinsic microporosity derived from individual MOP cavities. The aerogel endured 87% compressive strain without fracture, demonstrating distinct ductility. Furthermore, these fibrils in the supramolecular gels were converted to crystals after 2 weeks. Single-crystal X-ray diffraction revealed that MOPs are arranged via face-to-face interaction between octahedral MOPs to form a 1D helical chain structure. An analysis of the self-assembly process using Hansen solubility parameters unveiled that solvent conditions with high polarity and low dispersion interaction drive the formation of anisotropic assemblies. This work provides a new strategy for tailoring the mechanical properties of supramolecular materials through dimensional control of their assemblies."},{"t":"[ASAP]麦秆细胞壁天然结构：X射线散射与固态核磁共振的统一模型","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23116","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"秸秆细胞壁结构","kp":["[统一结构模型]: SAXS+固态NMR联合表征","[生物质组分]: 纤维素/半纤维素/木质素纳米紧密堆积"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究结合X射线散射和固态核磁共振（NMR）技术，构建了麦秸细胞壁原生结构的统一模型。模型精确描述了纤维素微纤维、半纤维素和木质素在纳米尺度上的空间排列与分子间相互作用，揭示纤维素-半纤维素-木质素三维网络的层级组装规律。该统一模型深化了对植物次生细胞壁抗降解屏障的理解，为生物质预处理、纤维素酶解效率提升及木质纤维素高值利用提供了关键结构基础。","ot":"[ASAP] Native Architecture of Wheat Straw Cell Walls: A Unified Model from X-ray Scattering and Solid-State NMR","b":"Plant secondary cell walls constitute the dominant reservoir of renewable biomass, comprising tightly packed cellulose, hemicellulose, and lignin at the nanoscale. Recent advances in solid-state NMR spectroscopy and the availability of small-angle X-ray scattering for biomass characterization have led to an accumulation of experimental data on cell wall organization, yet no explicit structure model has simultaneously satisfied both X-ray and NMR observations. Using wheat straw as a model system, we propose a structural framework consistent with current knowledge of cellulose biosynthesis, X-ray scattering data, and one- and two-dimensional 13C solid-state NMR spectra. In this model, 18-chain elementary fibrils align in parallel and populate the cross-section at random. Arabinose-substituted xylan shows no conformational dependence for cellulose-binding in wheat, and only a minor fraction of 2-fold xylan appears in close proximity to cellulose, unlike in Arabidopsis, where xylan is more tightly attached to the cellulose surface. While NMR data cannot unambiguously resolve the internal arrangement of the 18 glucan chains, X-ray scattering profiles uniquely constrain the fibril size and exclude the possibility of tight bundling in the intact walls. The specific interaction between the matrix polymers and the cellulose elementary fibrils must be reconsidered in light of the small interfibril spaces, which bring the matrix components into spatial proximity with cellulose even in the absence of attractive interactions. These findings provide fundamental molecular-level insight into cellulose fibril architecture and matrix-polymer interactions, resolving longstanding discrepancies between spectroscopic and scattering data and advancing our understanding of biopolymer assembly into structurally and functionally versatile lignocellulosic biomaterials."},{"t":"[ASAP]配体调控铜活性位点释放延长CO2电还原中的乙烯生成","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22701","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电还原制乙烯","kp":["[失活机制]: Cu持续重构失乙烯选择性","[策略]: 配体调控Cu活性位点释放","反应[CO2RR]: Cu电催化产乙烯"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究开发了配体调控释放铜活性位点的策略，显著延长CO2电还原中乙烯（C2H4）的生产稳定性。铜催化剂在CO2RR过程中持续发生表面重构，导致活性位点失活和选择性漂移。通过引入动态配体修饰，精确控制铜原子的溶解-再沉积平衡，维持活性Cu+位点的长期稳定存在，从而持续高效生成乙烯。该策略大幅延长了催化剂的操作寿命，为CO2电还原制多碳产物的工业化应用突破了耐久性瓶颈。","ot":"[ASAP] Ligand-Modulated Release of Copper Active Sites Extends Ethylene Production in CO2 Electroreduction","b":"Copper catalysts for the electrochemical CO2 reduction reaction (CO2RR) undergo continuous reconstruction, causing a loss of ethylene selectivity over time. Here, we introduce a strategy based on molecular surface chemistry that prolongs the period of maximum ethylene production without sacrificing the activity of Cu electrocatalysts. First, we propose a customized synthesis of colloidal Cu nanocrystals to obtain comparable Cu catalysts differing only in the chemical nature of the organic surface ligand monolayer, thus acting as ideal model systems. Having discovered the unique behavior of secondary phosphines (PR2H), we extend the proposed molecular strategy to commercial Cu, achieving a 10-fold increase in the operational stability of ethylene production. Operando spectroscopies combined with ex-situ microscopy correlate slower ligand desorption kinetics to delayed Cu reduction and restructuring, while atomistic simulations indicate that ligands do not intrinsically contribute to ethylene production. Altogether, surface ligands emerge as kinetic gatekeepers that sustain the generation of ethylene-selective active sites by modulating the Cu surface activation. This ligand-modulated activation concept provides a new design principle for possibly improving the long-term stability in electrocatalytic CO2RR."},{"t":"[ASAP] La3+ 网络和熔融态形态：间隔盐选择对结构异质性的影响","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22776","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","b":"We recently introduced the concept of a \"spacer salt\" that creates structural heterogeneity and intermediate range order. Put simply, a fully networked salt melt, such as LaCl3 or UCl3, becomes disrupted by the introduction of ions that do not participate in the network. One of the results of this disruption is the experimental observation of two characteristic distances between the multivalent cations: the shorter \"in-network\" distance and the longer \"across-network\" distance spaced by the low-valency salt. The longer characteristic distance, absent if there is no spacer salt, is the culprit for a new first sharp diffraction peak in scattering experiments. Intuitively, it would appear to follow from this analysis that higher concentrations of the lower-valency salt would further separate multivalent cations, resulting in a shift to lower q values of this first sharp diffraction peak. We will show experimentally and computationally that this is not always the case because multiple other factors enter into play."},{"t":"[ASAP] 同选择性开环聚合获得高性能聚(α-取代-β-丙内酯)","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01637","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Poly(α-substituted-β-propiolactone), P(αRPL), is attractive since it is closely related in structure to the biodegradable natural polyhydroxyalkanoates (PHAs). However, the chemical synthesis of isotactic P(αRPL) via ring-opening polymerization has yet to be explored. Herein, we exploited a robust salalen yttrium complex (Y2) as the catalyst to successfully prepare highly isotactic P(αRPL) with Pm > 0.95. These P(αRPL) products exhibited tacticity-dependent thermal and mechanical properties. Remarkably, the highly isotactic P(BPL) containing a benzyl side chain showcased a high melting transition temperature (Tm) of 165 °C. The highly isotactic P(n-BuPL) containing alkyl side chain served as a strong and ductile material comparable to the commercial high-density polyolefins. More importantly, these P(αRPL) products could undergo clean depolymerization to their starting material, α-substituted acrylic acids, offering a closed-loop recycling pathway. This synthetic system allowed access to isotactic P(αRPL), establishing a powerful platform for the discovery of sustainable plastics.","tp":"可降解聚酯","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究采用salalen钇配合物(Y2)为催化剂，通过开环聚合首次成功制备了高同立构规整度(Pm>0.95)的聚(α-取代-β-丙内酯)[P(αRPL)]。该聚合物结构与生物可降解的天然聚羟基脂肪酸酯(PHAs)高度相似，其热性能和机械性能表现出明显的立构规整性依赖特征。这一成果为新型生物可降解高分子材料的合成提供了有效策略，在可持续材料领域具有重要应用前景。"},{"t":"[ASAP]离子束工程修饰催化剂用于水电解：近期进展与未来展望","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00469","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"离子束催化析水","kp":["[改性方法]: 离子束工程修饰析水电催化剂"],"dp":1,"sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"as":"离子束技术作为催化剂改性新策略，通过精确调控催化剂表面结构与活性位点，显著提升电解水制氢效率。综述了离子束辐照在电极催化剂工程中的最新进展，分析了其对析氢/析氧反应动力学的调控机制，并展望了未来性能突破方向。","ot":"[ASAP] Ion Beam Engineering of Catalyst Modification for Water Electrolysis: Recent Achievements and Future Performance","b":"Hydrogen production through water splitting is essential for clean energy conversion and environmental protection. Its effectiveness and practical use heavily depend on the catalyst materials’ intrinsic activity, stability, and cost. Recently, ion beam technology, as a novel, efficient, and controllable way to modify surfaces, has shown great promise for the precise design of catalytic materials with enhanced performance. This Review outlines the physical and chemical mechanisms behind modifying catalytic materials with ion beam techniques and examines how it improves the intrinsic activity, active site density, mass transfer efficiency, and stability of catalysts. Finally, we discuss current challenges in this field and potential future directions. This overview aims to provide both theoretical insights and practical guidance for designing high-performance durable electrocatalysts for industrial applications using advanced ion beam technologies."},{"t":"[ASAP]层间超结构稳定的氧氧化还原无镍无钴正极","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00236","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氧氧化还原正极","kp":["[层间超结构]: 稳定氧氧化可逆性","[无Ni无Co正极]: 层间超结构抑制O2-过氧化"],"as":"该研究提出一种通过层间超结构稳定氧氧化还原反应的无镍、无钴锂电池正极材料。氧氧化还原机制能提供额外电荷补偿，显著提升金属氧化物正极的容量。传统富锂正极中，氧氧化还原常伴随不可逆结构退化，导致容量快速衰减。本研究利用层间超结构的构型约束效应，稳定晶格氧的氧化还原活性，在不依赖昂贵的镍、钴元素前提下实现高容量与长循环稳定性，为低成本、高能量密度正极设计开辟新路径，对降低电池原材料成本具有工程化价值。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Interlayer Superstructure Stabilized Oxygen-Redox Ni- and Co-Free Cathodes","b":"Oxygen redox is a mechanism that offers additional charge compensation, boosting the capacity of metal oxide cathodes in rechargeable batteries. However, the O2- ions are susceptible to overoxidation and do not always recover during discharge, particularly during high-voltage charge operation, leading to structural irreversibility and fast electrochemical degradation. Herein, we unveil a critical factor influencing O-redox reversibility beyond its intrinsic thermodynamic theory: the role of interlayer superstructure. Leveraging comprehensive characterizations, we have discovered that P3-R-NMO that features a ribbon-ordered superstructure with O-□Mn-O structural motifs exhibits highly reversible O-redox reactions for sodium-ion batteries. The remarkable enhancement in oxygen redox can be primarily attributed to the -A-B-C-interlayered superstructure. It introduces a substantial spatial separation between the interlayer O-□Mn-O motifs that are essential for oxygen redox, consequently reinforcing the chemomechanical strength against interlayer planar gliding and effectively mitigating the two-phase transition and Mn migration during cycling. In a strict comparison, when the same ribbon superstructure adopts an -A-B- stacking sequence in P2-R-NMO, the {002} planar gliding is more readily activated, leading to the detrimental P2-to-O2 phase transition, severe Mn migration, and ultimately, the destruction of the O-□Mn-O motifs and irreversible oxygen loss. Our findings suggest that achieving highly stable oxygen redox can be made feasible through the thoughtful design of an interlayer superstructure, where the elastic strength of the lattice against irreversible gliding can be significantly enhanced."},{"t":"[ASAP]电化学CO2捕集与储能集成以适配可再生能源","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21714","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学碳捕集储能","kp":["[系统集成]: 电化学碳捕集与储能一体化","[设计]: 分离CO2/吸附剂再生步骤"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出将电化学CO2捕集系统与可再生能源发电直接耦合，实现碳捕获与能量存储一体化。电化学碳捕集利用电能驱动CO2的电化学转化或吸附，可与光伏、风电等间歇性可再生电源直接对接，避免并网损耗。研究针对系统集成的关键挑战——如能量效率、捕获选择性、与发电功率波动的匹配性——提出工程方案，将碳捕集从独立高能耗流程转变为可再生能源消纳的柔性负载，有望降低碳捕集的整体度电成本，提升绿色电力利用率。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Integrated Electrochemical CO2 Capture with Energy Storage for Renewable Energy Compatibility","b":"Carbon capture via electrochemical processes can benefit from direct integration with renewable power plants, but the intermittency of renewable energy sources makes efficient operation challenging. Here, we demonstrate an integrated electrochemical carbon capture and energy storage system that enhances adaptability to intermittent renewable energy sources. By splitting the single CO2/sorbent regeneration step into two separate electrolyzers via insertion of the ferrocyanide/ferricyanide redox pair, we successfully demonstrated energy storage during the alkaline sorbent regeneration, while providing energy output during the CO2 regeneration step. Our decoupled electrolyzer system achieved a net energy consumption of 68.9-248.7 kJ/mol for overall carbon capture at 10-100 mA/cm2, and delivered an energy output of 54 kJ/mol-CO2 at 10 mA/cm2 during the CO2 regeneration step, demonstrating its potential compatibility with intermittent energy sources."},{"t":"[ASAP]全氟磺酸涂覆铂上的氢电催化","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00158","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铂氢电催化","kp":["[方法]: PFSA涂层Pt微电极分离本征动力学"],"as":"该研究聚焦全氟磺酸离子聚合物涂层对铂催化剂氢电催化性能的影响。在膜电极组件（MEA）中，催化剂表面覆盖的离子聚合物薄层负责质子传导，但同时会遮挡催化活性位点，造成传质阻力。研究系统考察了全氟磺酸涂层与铂界面的相互作用机制，分析其对氢氧化/析出反应动力学的作用。理解离子聚合物-催化剂界面的微观行为对优化燃料电池和电解水装置的催化剂利用率至关重要，有助于降低铂用量并提升器件功率密度。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Hydrogen Electrocatalysis on Perfluorosulfonic-Acid-Coated Pt","b":"Membrane-electrode assemblies utilize ionomer-coated electrocatalysts to achieve facile ion transport. Consequently, isolation of intrinsic catalyst kinetics from measured polarization curves is challenging, as the properties of the catalyst and ionomer both affect the measurements. Here, we employ a Pt microelectrode coated by a thin perfluorosulfonic acid (PFSA) layer to measure polarization curves for the hydrogen oxidation reaction/hydrogen evolution reaction (HER/HOR). Intrinsic electrode kinetics are isolated by theoretical analysis of the local catalyst microenvironment, accounting for mass transport and thermodynamics. The observed enhancements in HER and HOR rates with increasing relative humidity (RH) at the working electrode are attributable to two competing factors: the decrease in activity of H+ in the ionomer and the dominant decrease in the water reorganization energy in the Marcus–Hush–Chidsey representation of HER/HOR kinetics. The increase in intrinsic rate with increasing RH is attributed to increased H+ transfer dynamics resulting from reduced confinement of water within the subnanometer water layer between the catalyst and ionomer as RH increases."},{"t":"[ASAP] 面向下一代低电位负极的高导电不可还原电解液","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c11998","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电解质","kp":["[挑战]: 高价阳离子低电位还原分解","材料体系[固态电池]: 高导电不可还原电解质","适用负极[固态电池]: 锂金属/硅"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究面向下一代全固态电池，开发高离子电导率且不可还原（irreducible）的新型固态电解质。全固态电池在安全性和能量密度上具备超越传统锂离子电池的潜力，但受限于固态电解质离子电导率不足及与电极界面的副反应。本研究提出的不可还原电解质旨在抑制高压下电解质被正极氧化分解的退化行为，同时维持高离子迁移率，为匹配高电压正极、实现长寿命全固态电池提供材料基础。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Highly Conductive Irreducible Electrolytes for Next-Generation Low-Potential Anodes","b":"All-solid-state batteries have great potential to outperform conventional lithium-ion batteries in both safety and energy density, as the solid electrolyte can potentially accommodate high-energy-density anodes such as metallic lithium or silicon more safely. However, the high-valence cations present in most highly conductive solid electrolytes facilitate reductive decomposition at low potentials, leading to significant irreversible lithium inventory loss. Preventing this requires the development of solid electrolytes that are thermodynamically stable at low operating potentials while providing high ionic conductivity and sufficient oxidative stability. To realize this, we explored a new family of Li-rich antifluorite irreducible solid electrolytes, Li2.65S0.35NxP0.65-x, the first reported nitrido-phosphido-sulfide, and investigated their application in all-solid-state batteries. The optimized composition Li2.65S0.35N0.15P0.5 possesses a remarkably high ionic conductivity of 1.05 mS cm-1, as well as a relatively high oxidative stability of 1.15 V vs Li+/Li for this class of materials. Ab initio molecular dynamics and density functional theory simulations reveal that enhanced Li diffusion is the result of enlarged diffusion bottleneck sizes. These are a consequence of (i) substitution with smaller anions or (ii) increased electrostatic repulsion from the substitution with high-valence anions. Importantly, the oxidative stability makes Li2.65S0.35N0.15P0.5 exhibit good compatibility with Si anodes, and in conjunction with the high ionic conductivity, this enables a high initial Coulombic efficiency of 94.2% as well as a stable cycle life of a full cell with a micron silicon-Li2.65S0.35N0.15P0.5 anode and a LiCoO2-Li3InCl6 cathode. This work highlights the potential of irreducible solid electrolytes for the design of all-solid-state batteries with low-potential and high-energy-density anodes."},{"t":"[ASAP] 大戟科和瑞香科复杂二萜合成策略的进化","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22127","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"The biosynthetically related daphnane, tigliane, and rhamnofolane diterpenes are a fascinating collection of natural products endowed with distinct polycyclic architectures and immense therapeutic potential. Containing a common 5,7,6-fused tricyclic core with varied oxidation, these molecules have served as popular and challenging synthetic targets for over four decades. Despite much work, however, many complex members remain inaccessible by synthesis. Inspired by this, we developed a convergent coupling strategy employing two modular fragments as a gateway into this class of diterpenoids. This article details the evolution of such a strategy initially resulting in the total synthesis of the flagship daphnane diterpene orthoester (DDO), resiniferatoxin (RTX). A key trans-fused hydroazulene building block was designed and synthesized via a 7-exo-trig Heck cyclization and then coupled with an aldehyde bearing preprogrammed oxidation state for RTX via a diastereoselective aldol reaction. After extensive investigations involving many different substrates, a subsequent key SmI2-mediated 6-exo-trig radical cyclization/1,5-hydrogen atom transfer (HAT) cascade was realized, which enabled rapid access to the 5,7,6-fused tricyclic core and, ultimately, a total synthesis of (±)-resiniferatoxin in as few as 14 steps. Here we also detail enantioselective syntheses of key building blocks relevant to these natural products. Finally, we demonstrate that a modified aldehyde fragment can be incorporated into this strategy to intercept a key tricyclic ketone thus achieving formal syntheses of rhamnofolane and tigliane diterpenes, such as crotophorbolone, phorbol, and prostratin. We believe this general strategy could prove useful in accessing various diterpenes of even higher complexity from the plant families Euphorbiaceae and Thymelaeaceae.","tp":"二萜全合成","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对大戟科和瑞香科中具有5,7,6-稠合三环核心的复杂二萜天然产物（包括瑞香烷型、巴豆烷型和Rhamnofolane型），研究团队开发了一种收敛式合成策略。这些分子具有独特的多环结构和显著的治疗潜力，但长期困扰合成化学界。新方法通过模块化组装和氧化态调控，实现了多个复杂成员的高效合成，为该类天然产物的规模化制备和生物活性研究奠定了基础。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 提高无溶剂气溶胶液滴中的酯化反应速率","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18218","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Aerosols are appealing vessels for accelerating chemical reactions owing to their high surface area-to-volume ratios and capacity to access supersaturated solute states. Although many studies demonstrate enhanced reaction rates in charged droplets using electrospray ionization-mass spectrometry, such studies have poor control over experimental parameters including droplet size, water content, and imparted charge and generally cannot explore the reaction's reversibility. Here, an esterification reaction between a dicarboxylic acid and low-volatility alcohol (that in bulk synthesis requires reflux at 160 °C for ∼15 h in nonaqueous solvent) is investigated in aqueous aerosol droplets spanning picoliter to sub-femtoliter volumes. Individual picoliter droplets generated without applied external voltage were confined within an Aerosol Optical Tweezers instrument, and Raman spectroscopy was used to resolve chemical change in the droplets. Flow tube experiments on sub-femtoliter aerosol droplets were conducted using both online aerosol mass spectrometry and off-line NMR spectroscopy. Across both droplet volume scales, the esterification was facile (<400 s in picoliter droplets, <2 s in sub-femtoliter droplets) upon droplet dehydration at room temperature. We demonstrate that both the forward and reverse reaction are vastly accelerated in aerosol compared to macroscopic solution. The unique aspects of this study include rigorous control over a water activity range spanning dilute to solvent-free conditions, investigation across a broad droplet volume range, application of multiple analytical techniques to confirm independently accelerated reactivity, and exploration of the reaction's reversibility. Combined, this study demonstrates how aerosols can drive chemistry in accordance with Le Chatelier's principle on both the micro- and nanoscales."},{"t":"[ASAP] 盐包水电解液结构调控甲酸根氧化反应","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19298","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"盐包水电解液甲酸氧化","kp":["[体系]: water-in-salt高盐浓度水体系","[现象]: 高浓度下甲酸氧化电流达平台","[机制]: 离子聚集降电导率阻碍反应物传输"],"as":"本研究以水系高浓度电解液（water-in-salt）中的甲酸盐氧化为模型反应，首次将反应物浓度的宏观效应与电解液局域结构效应成功解耦。研究表明，高浓度盐环境改变了水分子网络和离子溶剂化壳层结构，从而调控了甲酸根的氧化路径与活性。该工作为理解水系电解液中电极反应的微观机制提供了新视角，对水系电池和电催化体系的设计具有指导意义。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Electrolyte Structure Governs Formate Oxidation in Water-in-Salt Systems","b":"We disentangle reactant concentration from local structural effects in water-in-salt electrolytes using the formate oxidation reaction on Pt. First, we observe that formate oxidation currents plateau at high concentrations. Using molecular dynamics and NMR spectroscopy, we attribute this observation to ion clustering of the kosmotropic formate reactant, which reduces conductivity and impedes reactant transport. Then, we demonstrate that this limitation can be overcome by introducing a chaotropic anion (perchlorate) that disrupts clustering and facilitates a further increase in formate oxidation currents. However, when perchlorate is introduced in excess, the hydrogen-bonding network is disrupted, which leads to hindered proton transport, local acidification, and enhanced CO poisoning, as evidenced by SEIRAS. Our findings demonstrate a direct link between bulk electrolyte structure and catalytic activity, which can be used to enhance catalytic performance at high reactant concentrations."},{"t":"[尽快] 电化学正在升温：离子液体可以提供帮助","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00466","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Electrochemistry offers a complementary pathway for chemical manufacturing, providing benefits beyond traditional thermochemical processes, but most systems are constrained to near-ambient temperatures due to solvent limitations. This leaves an underexplored intermediate-temperature regime (100–300 °C) between aqueous and solid-state electrolytes where many industrial reactions operate and heat is accessible at scale. Ionic liquids (ILs) are uniquely suited to operating in this regime. They combine robust thermal stability, wide electrochemical windows, high ionic efficiency, and tunable chemical properties. ILs have already been applied in devices such as fuel cells, water splitting, and high-temperature energy storage, but their use for electrochemical synthesis above 100 °C remains largely unexplored. Here we highlight how ILs can enable both mechanistic studies and practical electrochemical systems at elevated temperatures while outlining the challenges of cost, viscosity, compositional diversity, and device integration. Harnessing these opportunities could establish ILs as key electrolytes for bridging electrocatalysis and thermocatalysis.","tp":"中温电化学","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"综述指出电化学为化工制造提供了超越传统热化学路径的优势，但受限于溶剂，多数体系只能在接近常温下运行。文章聚焦100-300°C这一被忽视的中温区间——许多工业反应和规模化余热均在此温度。离子液体因其不可挥发性、宽电化学窗口和高热稳定性，被论证为该中温电化学领域的理想介质，有望解锁水相和固态电解质无法覆盖的催化与合成反应空间。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 瞬态铁(V)-亚硝基络合物和亚硝基苯之间的直接N-N偶联，提供铁(III)-苯基","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21651","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"The reactivity of metal nitrides has attracted considerable attention owing to their proposed role as key intermediates in the critical N–N bond breaking and formation steps in N2 fixation and NH3 oxidation processes. Despite intensive efforts over the past decades, no clear-cut examples of direct N–N coupling initiated by metal-nitrides have yet been reported. Herein, we describe the reaction of a transient iron(V)-nitrido complex, [FeV(N)(cyclam-ac)][BArF4] (2, cyclam-ac = 1,4,8,11-tetraazacyclotetradecane-1-acetate), with pentafluoronitrosobenzene (PFPhNO), which quantitatively affords an iron(III)-phenyldiazene-N-oxide [FeIII(NN(O)PFPh)(cyclam-ac)][BArF4] (3). Complex 3 has been structurally and spectroscopically characterized using EPR, Mössbauer, and UV–vis–NIR techniques, coupled to wave function-based ab initio calculations, to contain a low-spin ferric center coordinated by a –N═N(O)PFPh monoanionic ligand featuring a N═N double bond. Further in situ measurements reveal that analogous reactions can occur upon treatment of 2 with PhNO and 4-NO2-PhNO. Detailed electronic structure analyses suggest that exceedingly efficient mutual frontier orbital interactions between 2 and PhNO render the title reaction barrierless and highly exothermic. This can be traced back to the unusual electronic feature of 2, viz., the 2-fold orbital near-degeneracy of the Fe–N π* orbitals and the dominant N-2p character thereof, both of which maximize stabilizing HOMO–LUMO overlaps. Furthermore, under vacuum, 3 was found to release N2, quantitatively furnishing a low-spin ferric phenolate complex, [FeIII(OPFPh)][BArF4] (4). The present work reveals previously unrecognized reactivity of high-valent iron-nitrido species and sheds further light on the N–N coupling reaction mediated by metal-nitrides.","tp":"铁氮键偶联","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"金属氮化物被认为是氮气固定和氨氧化过程中N-N键断裂与生成的关键中间体，但此前从未有金属氮化物直接引发N-N偶联的确切案例。本研究报道了一种瞬态铁(V)-氮络合物与亚硝基苯之间的直接N-N偶联反应，生成铁(III)-偶氮苯络合物，首次实验证实了金属氮化物介导的N-N键形成路径，为理解生物固氮和工业合成氨的催化机理提供了新的化学模型。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 结晶性Dion-Jacobson二维层状锡基钙钛矿场效应晶体管","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20756","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锡基钙钛矿晶体管","kp":["晶相[钙钛矿FET]: Dion-Jacobson二维锡基","[制备方法]: 溶剂蒸汽辅助滴涂(SVAD)"],"dp":1,"as":"本研究报道了结晶型Dion-Jacobson (DJ) 二维层状锡基钙钛矿在场效应晶体管中的应用。DJ相钙钛矿因其独特的层间结构和良好的环境稳定性被视为有前景的半导体材料。研究利用锡替代有毒的铅，通过调控DJ相的层间间距和结晶质量，优化了载流子传输性能。该工作展示了无铅二维钙钛矿在柔性电子学和光电器件中的应用潜力，为环境友好的钙钛矿电子器件开辟了新路径。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Crystalline Dion-Jacobson 2D Layered Sn-Based Perovskites for Field-Effect Transistors","b":"Dion-Jacobson (DJ) phase perovskites are increasingly recognized as potential semiconductor materials for electronic applications. However, the restricted coordination between the organic diammonium cations and the inorganic framework inhibits their self-assembly into efficient DJ Sn-based perovskites during solution processing. This study introduces solvent vapor assisted drop casting (SVAD) as a novel processing method to favor the organization into highly crystalline DJ perovskite films. The key aspect of the processing is the extended crystallization time in solvent vapor at elevated temperature. The processing study was conducted on four DJ perovskites that varied in the rigidity and symmetry of their A-cations to demonstrate the universal applicability of SVAD for this category of semiconductors and to establish correlations between structure and properties. The SVAD films exhibit markedly improved crystallinity and morphology compared to spin-coated samples resulting in significantly increased local and device charge carrier mobilities. DJ perovskites with rigid and symmetric A-cations form a planar [SnI6]4- octahedral framework that favors structural order and charge carrier transport. This work paves the way for the solution processing of highly ordered DJ Sn-based perovskites for their implementation in electronic applications."},{"t":"[尽快]打破空气-水范式：疏水固-水界面的离子行为","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20209","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","b":"Hydrophobic solid–water interfaces underpin processes in nanofluidics, electrochemistry, and energy technologies. Microscopic insights into these systems are often inferred from our understanding of the air–water interface, which is assumed to exhibit similar behavior. Here, we challenge this paradigm by combining heterodyne-detected vibrational sum-frequency generation spectroscopy with machine-learning molecular dynamics simulations at first-principles accuracy to investigate the graphene–NaCl(aq) interface as a prototypical hydrophobic solid–water system. Spectroscopic results suggest that ions have a minimal effect on the structure of the interfacial water, while simulations reveal that Na+ and Cl– accumulate densely at the surface. Together, these findings reveal a new adsorption mechanism that departs from the established air–water interface paradigm, where interfacial ion adsorption is typically associated with, and often detected through, a pronounced alteration of the interfacial water alignment and orientation. This difference arises because ions cannot penetrate the solid boundary and reside at a similar depth as the interfacial water molecules. As a consequence, large ion populations can be accommodated within the extended two-dimensional hydrogen-bond network at the interface, causing only minor local distortions but significant changes to its longer-range connectivity. These results reveal a distinct mechanism of electrolyte organization at aqueous–carbon interfaces, relevant to energy applications, where performance is highly sensitive to the local organization of interfacial water.","tp":"界面电化学","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"as":"疏水固-水界面是纳米流体、电化学和能源技术的核心，传统认知常以气-水界面的行为来类比推断。本研究利用和频振动光谱与第一性原理机器学习分子动力学，系统研究了石墨烯-NaCl水溶液界面。结果表明，疏水固体表面与自由气-水界面的离子吸附行为存在本质差异，直接挑战了长期以来的范式认知，对纳米器件设计和电化学界面理论具有修正意义。","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 结构验证的闭壳铁 (IV) 氧代铁络合物：合成、性质和反应性","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00288","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"We report the synthesis and comprehensive characterization of a closed-shell iron(IV) oxo (ferryl) complex, S = 0, which is accessible through multiple methods and stabilized by a tripodal tris-N-heterocyclic carbene (NHC) ligand. Reaction of the FeI precursor [(Me2TIMMNMes)FeI(η1-N2)](PF6) (1) (Me2TIMMNMes = tris-[2-(3-mesityl-4,5-dimethyl-imidazolin-2-ylidene)methyl]amine) with an excess of N2O at −78 °C in THF yields the reactive FeIII oxo complex [(Me2TIMMNMes)FeIII(O)](PF6) (3). One-electron oxidation of the in situ generated 3 with [Cp2Fe][PF6] provides access to a rare, nonmagnetic (d 4, S = 0) FeIV oxo complex, namely [(Me2TIMMNMes)FeIV(O)](PF6)2 (4). Alternatively, tetravalent 4 could also be obtained by treatment of the divalent iron complex [(Me2TIMMNMes)FeII(THF)](PF6)2 (2-THF) with 1 equiv of trimethylamine N-oxide (TMAO) or by the photolysis reaction of the ferrous sulfoxide isotopomers [(Me2TIMMNMes)FeII(MeS(16/18O)Ph)](PF6)2 (2-16/18OSR2). Although the fleeting nature of trivalent oxide 3 precludes extensive characterization and isolation in the solid state, the one-electron oxidation product [(Me2TIMMNMes)FeIV(O)](PF6)2 (4) is isolable and was reproducibly synthesized as well as fully characterized, including CHN elemental analysis, multinuclear NMR, IR vibrational, UV/vis electronic absorption, zero- and applied-field 57Fe Mössbauer spectroscopy, and single-crystal X-ray crystallography studies. Diamagnetic 4 features a remarkably short Fe–O bond (d(Fe–O) = 1.576(1) Å) and a notably negative isomer shift (δ = −0.38 mm s–1) in the 57Fe Mössbauer spectrum. Computational analyses corroborate the + IV oxidation state and advocate an iron–oxygen triple bond, FeIV≡O. Preliminary reactivity studies show that the closed-shell iron(IV) oxo complex can mediate intermolecular oxygen-atom transfer chemistry. A reversible redox event at a half-wave potential, E1/2, of 1.25 V vs Fe(Cp)2/Fe(Cp)2+ in the cyclic voltammogram of 4 suggests the existence of an Fe(V) oxo species.","tp":"铁氧配合物","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究报道了一种闭壳铁(IV)氧代（ferryl）络合物的合成与全面表征，其自旋态S=0，通过三脚架型NHC配体稳定。研究人员以铁(I)前驱体与N2O在低温下反应制得活性铁(III)氧络合物，并经多种途径实现单电子氧化得到铁(IV)氧代物种。该工作为研究高价铁-氧中间体的电子结构和反应性提供了罕见模型，对理解血红蛋白催化和氧化化学具有重要价值。"},{"t":"年幼的孩子了解社会关系如何影响人们对彼此的了解","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525150123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"An unwritten expectation in our everyday social interactions is that intimate personal information about someone—“insider knowledge”—is usually confined within close relationships. For example, it would be odd, or even unsettling, if a stranger knew about your favorite movie. Such expectations about who knows what about whom constitute a cornerstone of complex social behavior, but much remains unknown about their cognitive underpinnings and developmental origins. Drawing on parental report (Study 1) as well as a novel experimental approach using controlled but naturalistic videochat conversations (Study 2 &amp; 3), we find that 4- to 5-y-old children have an abstract, theory-like understanding of how social connections give rise to interpersonal knowledge. Self-report, facial expressions, and memory errors provide converging evidence that children were surprised when someone possessed insider knowledge that is misaligned with their relationships, such as a stranger knowing their favorite food (Study 2a) or their own parent knowing a stranger’s favorite movie (Study 2b). Children also generated coherent ad-hoc explanations about how someone might have acquired that knowledge, appealing to either first-hand observations or second-hand sources (Study 3). These findings demonstrate an early-emerging understanding of how individual minds are shaped in the context of their social networks, supporting a precocious ability to detect and explain anomalies in what people know about each other in real-time conversations. The current work also opens possibilities for leveraging open-ended online interactions to study social cognition without compromising experimental control."},{"t":"宽温锂离子电池：克服电化学挑战的材料创新与设计策略","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003557?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"宽温锂电池","kp":["[应用场景]: 宽温域锂离子电池"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Wide-temperature Lithium-ion batteries: Material innovations and design strategies for overcoming electrochemical challe"},{"t":"宽禁带镧系氧溴化物高κ介电材料用于高性能二维电子器件","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519042?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"稀土氧溴化物介电","kp":["材料体系[2D介电层]: 镧系氧溴化物LnOBr","[优势]: 宽禁带高κ降低泄漏电流"],"as":"该研究报道了一系列宽带隙镧系氧溴化物（LnOBr）作为高κ介电材料，用于构建高性能二维电子器件。高κ单晶介电层是下一代二维电子学的关键瓶颈，但现有材料难以兼顾高介电常数、低漏电流与带隙要求。本研究通过镧系氧卤化物的层状晶体结构优势，实现了与二维半导体（如MoS₂）良好界面匹配的高质量介电层，显著提升了二维晶体管的开关比与迁移率，为二维电子器件走向实用化提供了新材料路径。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Wide Bandgap Lanthanide Oxybromides High‐κ Dielectrics for High‐Performance Two‐Dimensional Electronics","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐\n                    κ\n                    single‐crystal dielectrics serve as fundamental components in next‐generation 2D electronics. However, the inevitable high leakage current caused by Schottky emission, which stems from the absence of a sufficiently wide bandgap in high‐\n                    κ\n                    dielectrics, limits device performance. Here, we show that 2D lanthanide oxybromides (\n                    Ln\n                    OBr,\n                    Ln\n                    = La, Ce, Nd, Sm, Eu, Gd, Ho, and Er) synthesized by the chemical vapor deposition method exhibit a wide bandgap (&gt;5.7 eV), tunable thickness, and feature of high‐quality single crystal. Meanwhile, 2D LaOBr single crystal displays high dielectric constant (14.8), low leakage current density (&lt;10\n                    −6\n                    A cm\n                    −2\n                    ), and high breakdown field strength (14.2 MV cm\n                    −1\n                    ), suggesting good insulating property. As a result, the LaOBr top‐gate MoS\n                    2\n                    transistors demonstrate competitive electrical performances, including a negligible hysteresis (0.72 mV/(MV cm\n                    −1\n                    )), high on/off ratio (10\n                    7\n                    ), near‐Boltzmann‐limit subthreshold swing (63 mV dec\n                    −1\n                    ), excellent electrical reliability and thermal stability (up to 450 K). Accordingly, the well‐performed inverter is integrated, with a steep voltage transition and high gain. This work develops abundant dielectric materials with a wide bandgap and a high dielectric constant for innovative high‐performance 2D electronics."},{"t":"什么是量子生物学？","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531134123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Quantum biology is the field at the intersection of quantum-related physics and the biology of living systems. The goal of the field is to determine if quantum phenomena underpin biological function at the macroscale. Such results, supported by compelling experimental evidence, will be important because they will show how quantum effects can have functional relevance, even in very complex and nominally classical systems. Here, we attempt to define the scope of quantum biology with a forward-facing view to help focus the research agenda. To that end, we propose open questions fundamental to consolidating the field of quantum biology. These open questions highlight the importance of developing suitable probes at the quantum scale, the possibility that classical biological machinery might simply mimic quantum systems, and of elucidating the ways quantum function can be amplified to the macroscale.","tp":"量子生物学","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":3.0},"as":"文章系统定义了量子生物学的研究范畴——探索量子现象是否支撑宏观生命功能。该领域认为，即使在复杂、名义上属于经典体系的生物系统中，量子效应（如相干隧穿、纠缠）仍可能具有功能性意义。已有实验证据支持量子效应在光合作用能量传输、鸟类磁感应和酶催化中的作用。文章以前瞻视角界定了量子生物学的边界与未来研究方向，对跨学科合作具有框架性指导价值。"},{"t":"可见光驱动的激发态去芳构化反应","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed5284?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"光催化脱芳化反应","kp":["[可见光激发态脱芳构化]: 前线轨道电子分布重塑解锁新路径","[光激发]: 实现基态无法实现的脱芳构化"],"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"可见光激发态去芳构化反应是构建药物活性饱和杂环的关键策略。该方法利用可见光光催化驱动芳烃的去芳构化，在温和条件下高效合成具有三维结构的复杂分子骨架，为药物发现和天然产物合成提供了新途径。","ot":"Visible-light–enabled excited-state dearomatization reactions","b":"Dearomatization reactions stand as a cornerstone strategy for constructing pharmacologically pivotal saturated rings. Photoexcitation reshapes the electron distribution within the frontier molecular orbitals of aromatics, thereby unlocking dearomatization pathways inaccessible in the ground state and furnishing structurally distinct molecular motifs. Contemporary synthetic methodologies leverage three discrete mechanistic paradigms to achieve this electronic activation: direct excitation, energy-transfer photocatalysis, and exciplex formation. These precisely tuned energy-delivery modes enable the dearomatization of a diverse array of (hetero)arenes, including highly robust substrates such as naphthalenes and benzenes, under mild reaction conditions. This review spotlights recent representative advances in these excited-state transformations. We envision that this synopsis will fuel ongoing innovation in the burgeoning field of photochemical dearomatization."},{"t":"城市发展与能源转型：来自中国城市的证据","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001643?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"城市能源转型","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"美国切断与世界卫生组织癌症研究部门的联系","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2960?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Influential agency may lose research projects, collaborations, and part of its annual budget"},{"t":"意外延误：绿色技术、金融和能源转型","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001953?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"绿色技术金融","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"超声响应双前药纳米组装用于肝纤维化治疗中的“窗孔恢复策略”","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518832?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Liver fibrosis is a serious yet reversible intermediate stage in the progression of liver disease, which can ultimately advance to cirrhosis and hepatocellular carcinoma. Targeted and selective inhibition of activated hepatic stellate cells (aHSCs) has emerged as a promising therapeutic strategy for the treatment of liver fibrosis. However, the capillarization of liver sinusoidal endothelial cells (LSECs) characterized by the loss of fenestrae and continuous formation of basement membrane presents a significant barrier to effective delivery of anti‐fibrotic agents. In this study, we propose a novel “fenestrae‐restoration strategy” employing ultrasound‐responsive polymeric dual prodrug nanoassembly (PMS) co‐loaded with nitric oxide prodrug (mSNO) and poly‐metformin (PMet). PMS is engineered for controllable, ultrasound‐triggered release of nitric oxide from mSNO, which activates soluble guanylate cyclase. This results in upregulation of intracellular cyclic guanosine monophosphate that facilitates the reversal of LSECs capillarization, restoring fenestrae and enhancing endothelial permeability. This restoration enables PMS to traverse the hepatic sinusoidal barrier, followed by accumulation in fibrotic tissue, where PMet is internalized by aHSCs. In lysosomes, metformin released from PMet ultimately inhibits aHSCs proliferation and migration via the AMPK‐mTOR pathway deregulation. The therapeutic efficacy and underlying mechanisms of “fenestrae‐restoring strategy” were comprehensively validated in preclinical CCl\n                    4\n                    ‐induced murine model of liver fibrosis. These findings provide interesting insights into the combination therapy of liver fibrosis and paves new avenues for future development of smart therapeutic modalities utilizing stimuli‐responsive biosafe nanotherapeutics.","tp":"纳米药物递送","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"肝纤维化是肝病进展中可逆的关键中间阶段，选择性抑制活化肝星状细胞（aHSCs）是核心治疗策略，但肝窦内皮细胞（LSECs）的毛细血管化（窗孔丢失）限制了药物递送效率。本研究设计了超声响应的双前药纳米组装体，提出'窗孔恢复策略'：通过超声可控释放，恢复LSECs窗孔结构，从而增强aHSCs靶向递送。该平台将机械调控与化学治疗结合，为肝纤维化精准治疗提供了新范式。","aip":1},{"t":"超声波敏感的微型机器人传感器，具有坚固的锚定功能，可用于长期消化道病变评估","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag179/8530529?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Microrobots have achieved notable progress in targeted drug delivery for treating various diseases. However, employing the microrobot itself as a microsensor for remote and long-term lesion assessment remains challenging. Here, we design a bioinspired ultrasound-sensitive microrobotic sensor (USMS) capable of robust anchoring for wireless and long-term digestive disease treatment and assessment. The USMS integrates dual magnetic and focused ultrasound actuation for precise locomotion and on-demand drug delivery, while a bioinspired microneedle design secures stable anchoring against strong fluid flow (402 mm/s) and peristaltic forces (66.5 mN). More importantly, the air cavity design of USMS enables strong ultrasound reflection for remote and long-term sensing of protruding lesion radius to assess therapeutic efficacy. Overall, USMS demonstrates reliable on-demand drug delivery and lesion size sensing capabilities in mouse models. The USMS has the potential to serve as a versatile robotic platform and sensing system for monitoring lesion evolution in clinical disease management.","tp":"超声微机器人","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"微型机器人在靶向给药方面取得显著进展，但将其本身作为远程长期病灶评估的微传感器仍具挑战。本研究设计了一种仿生超声敏感微型机器人传感器（USMS），集双磁驱动和聚焦超声驱动于一体，实现精准定位和稳固锚定于消化道壁面。USMS可在靶点长期驻留并按需进行病变传感评估，将药物递送与实时诊断功能融合于单一微器件，为慢性消化道疾病的长程监测治疗提供了创新工具。","aip":1},{"t":"基于原子级薄层金属二硫族化物带状网络的超灵敏柔性振动传感器","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb6733?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维材料振动传感","kp":["材料体系[振动传感器]: 原子级薄二硫属化物带网络","[特性]: 超灵敏柔性皮肤兼容"],"dp":1,"as":"人工智能与物联网的快速发展对高性能振动传感器提出了更高要求。该研究利用原子级厚度的过渡金属二硫属化物（如MoS2等二维材料）构建了柔性超灵敏振动传感器。得益于二维材料的原子级薄层特性与优异机电耦合效应，该器件可检测极微弱的振动信号，兼具高灵敏度与机械柔韧性。该传感器在语音识别、结构健康监测、可穿戴电子及人机交互等领域具有广阔应用前景。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Ultrasensitive soft vibration sensors based on atomically thin metal dichalcogenide ribbon networks","b":"The rapid progress of artificial intelligence (AI) and the internet of things (IoT) has driven growing demand for high-performance, skin-compatible vibration sensors capable of capturing subtle physiological and environmental signals. Low-dimensional materials offer unique advantages in sensitivity and flexibility, yet challenges remain in achieving high strain responsiveness, mechanical robustness, and large-area uniformity. Here, we report an ultrasensitive, low-profile, and stretchable vibration sensor based on large-area single-layer molybdenum disulfide (MoS\n                    2\n                    ) ribbon networks (SLRNs) grown via a vapor-liquid-solid mechanism. Embedding SLRNs within a thermoplastic elastomer [styrene-ethylene-butylene-styrene (SEBS)] yields record-high sensitivity among MoS\n                    2\n                    -based sensors, with gauge factors up to 5300 at &lt;1.6% strain. This response arises from nanocrack-mediated electron transport induced by the thermal expansion mismatch between MoS\n                    2\n                    and SEBS. The ~6-micrometer-thick sensors detect vibrations and acoustic signals over a wide frequency range (&gt;500 hertz), enabling deconvolution of complex stimuli. This work establishes a path toward ultrathin, ultrasensitive wearable sensors for health care and robotic applications."},{"t":"转录通读先于伊马替尼在 CML 细胞中触发的选择性剪接程序","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea2475?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Cellular stresses regulate transcriptional readthrough, whereby RNA polymerase II elongates past a gene’s polyadenylation cleavage site without RNA cleavage. Readthrough has been reported in several cancer types. Here, we use long-read sequencing of nascent RNA to quantify transcriptional readthrough in chronic myeloid leukemia (CML) cells and characterize early responses to the targeted therapeutic, imatinib. We show that the amount, length, and gene specificity of readthrough increase within 1 hour, before gene expression and alternative splicing alterations emerge. Notably, imatinib-dependent messenger RNA (mRNA) isoform changes involved “readthrough chimeras,” in which exons from an upstream gene are alternatively spliced to exons in a downstream gene. Altered mRNA isoforms and chimera levels were detected in imatinib-resistant K562 cells as well as cells of patients with CML. Thus, imatinib can provoke a cascade of early changes to transcription and splicing fidelity that may lead to longer-term adjustments in gene expression, cancer cell differentiation, and the development of therapy resistance."},{"t":"WYL 激活剂 DriD 对非经典 DNA 损伤反应途径的转录激活机制","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec6337?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"DNA damage repair mechanisms are vital for cell survival. In the bacterium,\n                    Caulobacter crescentus\n                    , DriD is the master regulator of a unique, noncanonical DNA damage pathway. DriD binding to ssDNA, produced upon DNA damage, stimulates its ability to activate transcription from several promoters involved in DNA damage responses. However, the mechanism by which DriD interfaces with the RNAP holoenzyme to activate transcription from its multiple promoters has been unclear. Here, we describe cryo-EM structures of DriD-ssDNA bound to RNAP-holoenzyme and three DriD-regulated promoters. Each subunit of homodimeric DriD contains an DNA binding\n                    N\n                    -terminal winged helix-turn-helix (wHTH) connected to WYL domains by a linker 3-helix bundle (3HB) module. The structures reveal a mechanism of assembly on promoters whereby DriD’s 3HBs bind the RNAP α-CTD and β domains, anchoring the RNAP-holoenzyme to regulated promoters. The 3HBs form autoinhibitory contacts with DNABDs in apo DriD and therefore acts as an ssDNA-driven trigger domain, switching between DNABD-bound apo and RNAP-bound forms upon ssDNA-mediated activation. Thus, the structures reveal a unique transcription activation mechanism, likely conserved among the large family of homodimeric WYL activators."},{"t":"Tim-3 靶向疫苗克服肿瘤免疫抑制并减少 cDC1 依赖性，从而引发有效的抗肿瘤免疫","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518080123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Conventional type 1 dendritic cells (cDC1s) are specialized for cross-presenting tumor antigens and determining the efficacy of immunotherapies, including immune checkpoint blockade and adoptive cell therapy. However, their rarity and tumor-induced dysfunction severely limit CD8 T cell priming and represent a central bottleneck to therapeutic efficacy. While strategies such as anti–DEC-205-mediated antigen delivery and Flt3L-driven DC expansion can enhance host DC function, their reliance on functional cDC1s remains a significant constraint. We developed Tim-3-targeted vaccines by conjugating tumor antigens or neoantigens to anti–Tim-3 antibodies. These vaccines delivered antigens to both cDC1s and cDC2s, and elicited robust, durable CD8 T cell responses. Remarkably, Tim-3-targeted vaccines endowed cDC2s with efficient cross-presentation capacity that matched that of cDC1s. In tumor-bearing mice or in CD11c-β-catenin\n                    active\n                    mice, which model β-catenin-driven DC dysfunction, Tim-3-targeted vaccination restored cross-priming and counteracted tumor- and DC-mediated immunosuppression. In Batf3\n                    −/−\n                    mice lacking cDC1s, anti-Tim-3-based vaccines still elicited significant CD8 T cell cross-priming and tumor control—albeit both were reduced compared to wild-type mice— demonstrating that cDC1s contribute to but are not essential for Tim-3-targeted vaccine–induced CD8 T cell priming and anti-tumor efficacy. Strikingly, a single dose of anti-Tim-3–neoantigen vaccination eradicated large established MC38 tumors in a CD8 T cell–dependent manner. Together, these data identify Tim-3-targeted vaccines as a next-generation cancer vaccine platform that broadens DC engagement, reduces reliance on cDC1s, and overcomes tumor- and DC-mediated immunosuppression, addressing key limitations of current DC-based cancer vaccines."},{"t":"三维光子拓扑绝缘体突破尺度限制","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02559-w","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","tp":"三维光子拓扑绝缘体","kp":["[体系]: 三维光子拓扑绝缘体无界传播"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Three-dimensional photonic topological insulators go unbounded"},{"t":"在晶体双光子绝热光笼中通过量子链放大进行三维成像","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00023-9?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Two-photon excitation offers unmatched spatial resolution in 3D, but its impact is limited by the small number of molecules excited with a focused laser beam. This study reports a crystalline photocage that overcomes this limitation via a quantum chain reaction where every two-photon excitation initiates an adiabatic triplet-state propagation that releases hundreds of fluorescent molecules. The integration of chemical amplification and two-photon microscopy enables high-resolution 3D imaging and patterning, advancing the capabilities of light-driven chemistry in materials science and biology.","tp":"三维荧光成像","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"双光子激发具有极高的三维空间分辨率，但聚焦光束激发的分子数过少，限制了成像灵敏度。本研究开发了一种晶体双光子光笼，利用量子链反应实现化学放大：每次双光子激发启动绝热三重态传播级联，释放数百个荧光分子。该策略将化学信号放大与双光子显微成像结合，实现了高分辨率三维成像，显著提升了深层组织成像的灵敏度和效率。","aip":1},{"t":"大麻（以及其他药物）的正确时间表尚不存在","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aec5633?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Under US law and international treaties, drug scheduling is a multiple-choice problem for which the answer that would often be best is not an option"},{"t":"34 个国家集体行动问题中的私人解决方案陷阱","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2504632123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Collective action problems emerge when individual incentives and group interests are misaligned, as in the case of climate change. Individuals involved in these problems are generally considered to have two options: contribute toward public solutions such as global warming mitigation or free ride. However, many collective action problems today involve a third option of investing in a “private solution” such as local adaptation. The availability of this third option can lead to a private solution trap whereby private solutions are adopted, collectively optimal public solutions are not provided, and existing inequalities are exacerbated. We investigated the private solution trap with a collective action game featuring private and public solutions, wealth inequality determined by luck or merit, and participants from 34 countries. We found that the joint existence of private solutions and wealth inequality had a consistent effect across countries: Participants given a higher endowment adopted private solutions almost twice as often as those given a lower endowment, regardless of whether it was determined by luck or merit, and contributed proportionally less toward public solutions. Wealth inequality increased in every country and those given lower endowments were often left unprotected as public solutions were not provided. Across countries, cultural values of hierarchy and harmony were associated with preferences for private and public solutions, respectively. We also identified two universal pathways toward public solution provision: early contributions and conditional cooperation. Our findings highlight the ubiquity of the private solution trap, its cultural underpinnings, and its potential consequences for global collective action problems.","tp":"气候集体行动","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"as":"当个人激励与群体利益错位时便产生集体行动困境（如气候变化）。传统观点认为个体仅有两个选择：为公共方案（如减排）做贡献或搭便车。本文指出当代许多集体困境存在第三选项——投资于'私人方案'（如局部适应）。该选项的可用性可能导致私人方案陷阱：个体倾向于自保而非参与全球公共治理，从而削弱集体合作。研究基于34国数据建模揭示了该困境的博弈机制。"},{"t":"职业生涯中期重置：如何对你的研究方向进行战略规划","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-025-04077-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"莫纳·马罗恩的教育","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2595?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"An Arab neuroscientist is steering a top Israeli university through tumultuous times. She’s learned some hard lessons"},{"t":"化石燃料的衰落和寻找可行的替代品：对生物柴油、电力和沼气的严格审查","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002990?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"替代燃料评","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"转谷氨酰胺酶 2 的交联活性驱动突触核蛋白病模型中的 α-突触核蛋白病理学","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517886123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Transglutaminase 2 (TG2) is implicated in synucleinopathies including Parkinson’s disease (PD) and dementia with Lewy bodies, as it promotes α-Synuclein (α-Syn) aggregation in vitro, and evidence for its activity is detected in Lewy bodies in human postmortem brains. Additionally, TG2 overexpression exacerbates α-Syn toxicity in double transgenic mice, while TG2 deletion mitigates the phenotype of α-Syn transgenic mice. Considering that TG2 is a multidomain and multifunctional protein, the present study was carried out to confirm that the transamidase activity of TG2 specifically drives its pathogenetic role in synucleinopathies. We generated transgenic mice expressing a catalytically inactive W241A mutant TG2 and compared them with TG2-overexpressing and TG2 knockout mice using the α-Syn preformed fibril (PFF) model. We also examined double transgenic mice coexpressing human α-Syn with either wild-type TG2 or mutant TG2, alongside α-Syn single transgenic controls. 6 mo post–PFF injection, or at 6 mo of age in the double transgenic lines, the exacerbation of the behavioral and neuropathological phenotype seen with TG2 overexpression was lost with mutant TG2 overexpression in both models. Parallel findings were replicated in PD patient induced pluripotent stem cell-derived dopaminergic neurons. These findings indicate that the cross-linking activity of TG2 plays a pivotal role in α-Syn aggregation and toxicity, underscoring its significance as a therapeutic target in synucleinopathies."},{"t":"双曲极化激元的双曲本质探究","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521639?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双曲极化激元","kp":["[应用]: 纳米尺度光操控(二维电路)"],"as":"深入探讨双曲极化激元的本征双曲特性及其在纳米光子学中的物理意义。文章从拓扑光学和色散关系出发，分析极化激元沿双曲介质表面传播时的高模式密度、亚衍射限局域增强等奇异性质，并讨论其在近场成像、超分辨率传感和纳米尺度光操控中的前沿应用前景。","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"The Hyperbolic Nature of Hyperbolic Polaritons","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Polaritons travelling along a hyperbolic medium's surface have recently sparked significant interest in nanophotonics for the unprecedented manipulation ability on light at the nanoscale in a planar way, promising potential nano‐optical applications, especially in 2D circuitry. Despite the widespread use of the term “hyperbolic polariton,” the hyperbolic nature has predominantly been inferred from numerical solutions of implicit eigenmode equations, rather than established through an explicit analytical isofrequency relation. In this work, we propose an analytical form for describing the iso‐frequency contour of the hyperbolic polaritons, showcasing their strictly hyperbolic nature. Such an analytical form is obtained based on the focusing behavior of the hyperbolic polariton and verified by both numerical simulations on commonly used hyperbolic media systems of the hyperbolic polaritons and experimental characterizations on a hyperbolic metamaterial film. The results present a concise and intuitive physical image of its propagation behavior with the angular dispersion, revealing the fundamental mechanism governing the realization of the deeply sub‐diffractional volume‐confined polariton and provide a groundbreaking methodology in developing novel hyperbolic polaritons‐based optical devices."},{"t":"阳离子穿梭：超亲电催化中硅正离子、碳正离子与芳基正离子的相互作用","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00025-2?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"观点评论","tp":"超亲电催化","kp":["[催化机制]: 硅鎓/碳鎓/芳鎓离子协同(超亲电)"],"dp":1,"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"as":"研究提出'阳离子洗牌'概念，描述硅基正离子、碳基正离子和芳基正离子在超亲电催化中的协同互变机制。三种活性阳离子物种的动态平衡为理解强酸催化反应提供了统一框架，对碳碳键形成和新反应设计具有重要指导意义。","ot":"The Cation Shuffle: Interplay of silylium, carbenium, and arenium ions in superelectrophile catalysis","b":"The concept of The Cation Shuffle describes the interplay of silylium, carbenium, and arenium ions as a common mechanistic feature in superelectrophile catalysis. Against this background, recent advances in silylium-ion-promoted transformations are collated based on their underlying mechanisms, and an outlook into the design of novel catalytic processes is provided."},{"t":"任务诱发的功能连接与执行功能相对于任务表现出新颖且强化的关系。","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516929123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Executive functioning in children has been linked to intrinsic brain network organization assessed during the resting state, as well as to brain network organization during the performance of cognitive tasks. Prior work has established that task-based brain networks are stronger predictors of behavior than resting state networks, yet it is unclear if tasks only strengthen relationships that exist weakly at rest or if tasks also evoke unique relationships. A lack of discernment regarding how tasks and the resting state commonly and uniquely support executive functions precludes a holistic understanding of the neurobiological basis of executive functions. This project investigated differences in brain network organization and relationships with executive function ability between the resting state and two executive function tasks, a stop signal task and an emotional n-back task, using the Adolescent Brain and Cognitive Development Study dataset. Both executive function tasks evoked a more integrated network organization than the resting state, and executive function ability was related to different aspects of brain network organization during the resting state and during the tasks. Further, task-related shifts in brain network organization evoked several new relationships with executive function that were not detectable during the resting state and strengthened a relationship with executive function that existed weakly during the resting state. Overall, this study establishes a distinction between common and unique features of intrinsic and task-evoked brain function that facilitate executive function in children."},{"t":"用于癌症免疫治疗的 TLR9 激活胆固醇氮杂环丁烷衍生物辅助治疗疫苗","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb2465?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Therapeutic cancer vaccines show great promise for de novo induction of antigen-specific T cell responses against tumors. However, weak coordination between innate immune activation and antigen delivery remains a major obstacle to vaccine efficacy. Here, we present a cholesterol azetidine derivative–assisted polymeric carrier, Aze-Chol NP, which stimulates innate immunity and primes tumor-specific CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell responses. Mechanistically, Aze-Chol NP induces maturation and activation of dendritic cells (DCs) through the Toll-like receptor 9 (TLR9) pathway while simultaneously delivering protein or peptide antigens to DCs in lymph nodes. The Aze-Chol NP–based nanovaccines markedly inhibited tumor growth and prolonged survival in melanoma and human papillomavirus tumor models. Moreover, combining the nanovaccine with an anti–PD-L1 antibody produced a strong synergistic effect and long-term immune memory, achieving 80% survival beyond 100 days and complete rejection of tumor cell rechallenge. Overall, our study demonstrates that this TLR9-activating carrier provides an effective and straightforward strategy for developing potent cancer vaccines."},{"t":"嘧啶合成阻断所针对的小细胞癌中 RB 丢失和 E2F3 抑制之间的综合致死率","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2532814123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Small cell carcinoma is a highly lethal cancer variant often found with neuroendocrine (NE) features, as exemplified by small cell lung cancer and small cell NE prostate cancer (SCPC). A genome-wide CRISPR dependency screen using SCPC models generated through human prostate cell transformation identifies a requirement for the transcription factor E2F3. E2F3 dependency is linked to RB inactivation, a near universal occurrence across small cell cancers. The requirement for E2F3 is shared by RB-deficient cells originating from the prostate, lung, and adnexa. In RB-deficient cancer cells, E2F3 inhibition restrains cell cycle progression, proliferation, and tumor growth in vivo. Inhibition of de novo pyrimidine synthesis limits E2F3 expression and suppresses small cell carcinoma proliferation in culture. Directly or indirectly targeting E2F3 to leverage a pan-cancer synthetic lethality resulting from RB inactivation represents a potential treatment strategy."},{"t":"通过平衡相演化抑制锌黄锡矿太阳能电池缺陷实现15.1%认证效率纪录","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00029-2?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌黄锡矿太阳能电池","kp":["PCE[CZTSSe认证]: 15.1%","[缺陷抑制]: 反应Na-Sex物种平衡相演化"],"sc":8.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.5,"r":7.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"as":"通过平衡相演化抑制铜锌锡硫硒(CZTSSe)太阳能电池中的缺陷，实现了15.1%的认证效率纪录。该材料使用地壳丰富、无毒元素，兼具低成本与环境友好性，缺陷工程的突破为薄膜太阳能电池效率提升开辟了新路径。","ot":"Suppressing defects in kesterite solar cells via balanced phase evolution to enable 15.1% certified record efficiency","b":"Kesterite (CZTSSe) solar cells use earth-abundant, non-toxic elements but their efficiency is limited by complex defects. We show that an imbalance between intermediate phases during selenization triggers harmful Zn-related defects. Introducing reactive Na-Sex species accelerates Cu2SnSe3 formation and balances phase evolution into CZTSSe, suppressing defect formation. This kinetic control enables a certified 15.1% device performance, clearing a key commercialization benchmark for sustainable thin-film photovoltaics."},{"t":"匹配微生物代谢的超晶格电催化实现CO2到生物产物的可持续转化","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00021-5?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电微生物CO2转化","kp":["[电微生物系统]: Ag/Cu超晶格CO2转乙醇联产生物制品","年利润[电微生物系统]: 单一电催化15倍"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"构建了基于可扩展Ag/Cu金属超晶格催化剂的集成电-微生物系统(iEMS)，其催化特性与微生物代谢匹配，实现CO2高效转化为高附加值生物产品。该系统将电催化还原与生物合成耦合，为碳中和生物制造提供了可持续路径。","ot":"Superlattice electrocatalysis matching microbial metabolism for sustainable CO2-to-bioproduct conversion","b":"This study demonstrates an integrated electro-microbial system (iEMS) based on a scalable Ag/Cu metal superlattice catalyst. It selectively produces microbe-compatible ethanol from CO2 and efficiently converts ethanol into high-value bioproducts (3-hydroxypropionic acid and single-cell protein), showing an annual profit 15 times higher than that of a single electrocatalytic system. This work highlights the adaptability of the coupling of electrocatalysis and microbial metabolism, paving the way for green development and carbon neutrality."},{"t":"超丰富的 microRNA 由 CTCF 隔离的人 rDNA 间隔启动子转录而来","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec1451?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"microRNAs are ~22-nucleotide RNAs processed from primary transcripts and exported from the nucleus to repress gene expression by base-pairing to mRNAs. Unexpectedly, we find that the highest levels of RNA polymerase II (Pol II) at human microRNA genes are within the ribosomal gene repeat arrays (rDNAs). Alignment of public nascent transcript data to the hs1 human genome assembly reveals a 50-nucleotide transcript for both miR-1275 and miR-6724, which exits from the nucleus with exceptional rapidity. We show that the miR-1275/miR-6724 transcription unit is closely flanked by CCCTC-binding factor (CTCF) within a &lt;400-bp span of the rDNA spacer promoter. miR-1275/miR-6724 and microRNA precursors expressed from the 5′ external transcribed spacer (5′ETS) are exported independently of known RNA processing activities and are detected in exosomes and as circulating cancer biomarkers. We propose that the rDNA spacer promoter and 5′ETS microRNA genes have evolved for general regulatory functions in recipient cells."},{"t":"甘蔗条纹花叶病毒 P1 蛋白靶向 BES1 转录因子，破坏 pla 中 DAMP 触发的免疫","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adr9432?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Sugarcane streak mosaic virus (SCSMV) is the major cause of sugarcane mosaic disease. Its P1 protein (P1\n                    SCSMV\n                    ) is crucial for pathogenesis, but how it disrupts plant immunity remains unclear. Here, we found that P1\n                    SCSMV\n                    directly binds to the core transcription factor of brassinosteroid signaling, NbBES1, disrupting its binding to the E-box elements of the xyloglucan endotransglucosylase/hydrolase gene 1 (\n                    NbXTH1\n                    ) promoter and suppressing\n                    NbXTH1\n                    transcription.\n                    NbXTH1\n                    overexpression enhanced the plant resistance to fungal/viral infection, improved the contents of xyloglucan, which directly induced a damage-associated molecular pattern triggering innate immunity (DTI) and expression of several defense genes, and accompanied with a thickened middle lamellae and primary cell wall. Reduced xyloglucan due to\n                    NbXTH1\n                    downexpression further weakened DTI responses and a thinner cell wall. This study reveals how a viral protein subverts cell wall–mediated immunity and identifies NbXTH1 as a broad-spectrum disease resistance factor. Our findings support using xyloglucan or NbXTH1 to engineer broad-spectrum disease resistance in crops.","tp":"甘蔗病毒研","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"甘蔗条纹花叶病毒（SCSMV）是甘蔗花叶病的主要病原，其P1蛋白对致病至关重要但免疫逃逸机制不明。本研究发现SCSMV P1蛋白直接结合油菜素内酯信号核心转录因子NbBES1，干扰其与木葡聚糖内转糖基酶/水解酶基因E-box元件的结合，从而破坏DAMP触发的植物免疫反应。该发现揭示了病毒利用宿主激素信号通路实现免疫逃逸的新策略，为抗病育种提供了靶点。"},{"t":"Mo2CTx MXene上的结构敏感性切换：通过表面端基与铜配位调控CO2加氢路径","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1013763?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2加氢催化","kp":["[CO2加氢]: DFT+微动力学解耦表面终止基与Cu配位选择性","催化剂[CO2加氢]: Mo2CTx MXene"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究揭示Mo₂CTₓ MXene材料在CO₂加氢反应中的结构敏感性切换机制。通过调控表面端基（termination）和铜配位策略，实现对产物分布的精准控制。该发现为催化剂理性设计提供了原子层面的理解，对CO₂资源化利用和高附加值化学品定向合成具有重要意义。","ot":"Structure‐Sensitivity Switch on Mo2CTx MXene: Steering CO2 Hydrogenation via Surface Termination and Copper Coordination","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The pursuit of precise product control in CO\n                    2\n                    hydrogenation represents a central challenge in catalysis, where the inherent complexity of reaction networks often obscures the fundamental connection between surface structure and catalytic selectivity. Here, by integrating density functional theory and microkinetic modeling, we systematically decouple the distinct roles of surface oxygen termination and Cu coordination geometry in regulating catalytic selectivity of Mo\n                    2\n                    CO\n                    x\n                    catalysts. We identify three structurally sensitive regimes: pristine Mo\n                    2\n                    CO\n                    x\n                    surfaces facilitate efficient C═O bond cleavage to form CO and CH\n                    4\n                    , with higher oxygen coverage enhancing CO selectivity and promoting CH\n                    3\n                    OH among hydrogenated products; Cu‐adsorbed Mo\n                    2\n                    CO\n                    x\n                    enhances CH\n                    4\n                    generation by maintaining C═O scission while suppressing CO desorption; and Cu‐doped Mo\n                    2\n                    CO\n                    x\n                    promotes CH\n                    3\n                    OH formation by reducing surface oxophilicity and stabilizing key oxygenated intermediates. Crucially, we establish the Cu oxidation state as a quantitative descriptor for CH\n                    3\n                    OH/CH\n                    4\n                    selectivity, with a higher valence favoring CH\n                    3\n                    OH production. These mechanistic insights, corroborated by in situ spectroscopy and catalytic tests, bridge structure sensitivity with macroscopic performance. This work establishes general design principles for selective CO\n                    2\n                    conversion on MXene‐based catalysts, providing a foundation for the rational design of advanced CO\n                    2\n                    hydrogenation systems."},{"t":"结构调控赋能自催化酰亚胺化构建高粘附离子导电聚酰亚胺网络","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4669180?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅负极粘结剂","kp":["粘结剂[硅负极]: 高粘附离子导电聚酰亚胺PIy","合成方法[聚酰亚胺]: 低温自催化酰亚胺化"],"dp":1,"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该工作通过结构裁剪实现自催化酰亚胺化，构建了一种兼具高粘附性和离子导电性的聚酰亚胺网络。该材料针对硅负极锂离子电池中硅体积膨胀导致的界面失效问题，新型粘结剂可有效缓冲循环膨胀应力并维持离子传输通道，为下一代高能量密度锂电硅负极的工程化应用提供解决方案。","ot":"Structure Tailoring Enabled Self‐Catalyzed Imidization for Engineering a Highly Adhesive and Ion‐Conductive Polyimide Ne","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Silicon (Si) is widely recognized as one of the most promising anode materials for next‐generation lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs). Nevertheless, its practical application is hindered by significant volume expansion and poor interfacial stability. Herein, a highly adhesive and ion‐conductive polyimide binder, denoted as PIy, is synthesized via low‐temperature self‐catalyzed imidization through the copolymerization of 3,3’,4,4’‐biphenyltetracarboxylic dianhydride (BPDA) with 2,2’‐bis[4‐(4‐aminophenoxy)phenyl]propane (BAPP) as the tough monomer, 4,4’‐diamino‐2,2’‐bipyridyl (DAPY) as a base‐catalyzing component, and 2‐(5‐amino‐2‐methylanilino)‐4‐(3‐pyridyl)pyrimidine (AMPY) as an end‐capping agent. DAPY and AMPY effectively lower the activation energy of poly(amic acid) imidization which enables cyclization to proceed at low temperatures and the pyridine groups promote Li\n                    +\n                    transport. BPDA and BAPP contain abundant aromatic rings that provide high toughness and impart a high modulus to suppress volume changes. Meanwhile, the flexible ‐O‐ segments enhance chain mobility adapting to expansion while maintaining structural integrity. The Si@PIy‐185 °C electrode exhibits excellent long‐term cycling stability, maintaining a high specific capacity of 1118.6 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 1 A g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    even after 1000 cycles.The full cell of the SiO\n                    x\n                    @PIy‐185 °C//NCM811 exhibits a remarkable capacity retention of 87.8% after 100 cycles, highlighting the potential of the low‐temperature imidized PI binder for high‐energy‐density LIBs."},{"t":"底物结合和抑制人牛磺酸转运蛋白的结构机制","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70772-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Taurine is a sulfur-containing amino acid that plays several crucial roles in the body. Its uptake is mediated by the taurine transporter (TauT). Genetic mutations and dysregulation of TauT have been linked to various neurological disorders, cardiomyopathy, childhood progressive retinal degeneration, and cancer, making TauT a promising target for therapeutic intervention in these diseases. However, the structure and mechanism of TauT remain poorly understood. In this study, we present the structures of the human taurine transporter (hTauT) under four conditions: the substrate-free state, the taurine-bound state, the β-alanine-bound state, and the cyclic inhibitor piperidine-4-sulfonate (P4S)-bound state. These structures reveal that taurine binds at the central substrate-binding site of hTauT. Notably, β-alanine and the cyclic P4S inhibitors also mimic taurine, occupying the same substrate-binding site. In the substrate-free and P4S-bound forms, hTauT also adopt an inward-open conformation, where transmembrane helix TM1a bends toward the membrane, facilitating the opening of the intracellular gate for ion and substrate release. These structural insights enhance our understanding of the mechanisms underlying substrate and ion recognition and transport in hTauT, paving the way for the future development of taurine transporter substrate analogues or selective inhibitors."},{"t":"强光发射与扭曲","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef9532?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Stacks of boron nitride sheets can be arranged to emit deep ultraviolet light"},{"t":"在单原子层超导体上观察到的反常金属态稳定涡旋","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adu9610?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The superconductor-insulator transition in two-dimensional (2D) systems has been extensively studied as a typical example of quantum phase transition. Recent investigations of highly conductive 2D systems have revealed an intervening metallic regime, in which the electrical resistivity saturates at the limit of zero temperature. The nature and origin of this metallicity remain debated, partly because of the lack of microscopic understanding. In this study, using scanning tunneling spectroscopy, we investigate the metallic state and other phases observed in crystalline Pb monoatomic-layer superconductors formed on vicinal semiconducting substrates. Our spectroscopic images reveal stable and isolated vortices in the metallic regime, distinct from delocalized or liquidized vortices. These findings suggest that the saturated resistance in the metallic state arises from the pinning-free vortex motion driven by the finite current applied for the transport measurements. Our disorder-controlled microscopic experiments provide new insights into the fluctuation-induced phases of ultrathin crystalline 2D superconductors.","tp":"超导材料研","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"二维超导体-绝缘体量子相变中，高导电2D体系常出现电阻在零温极限下饱和的介入性金属态，但其本质和起源长期存在争议。本研究利用扫描隧道谱学在单原子层超导体上直接观测到该反常金属态中稳定涡旋的微观特征，为金属态源于量子涡旋涨落的理论提供了直接的实验证据，对理解量子相变和拓扑物态具有重要意义。"},{"t":"存在均匀刺激时的空间结构炎症反应","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2507102123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Inflammatory responses occur within the complex spatial context of tissues and organs, and many questions remain about how tissue structure and cellular communication shape their spatiotemporal dynamics. Here, we use a multiplexed RNA in situ hybridization approach, together with analytical tools, to study inflammatory gene expression in the larval zebrafish tailfin in response to a bath of lipopolysaccharide. We use this model system to address whether spatial structure emerges in the tissue response even absent the spatial variation introduced by a pathogen. We find that epithelial cells in the tailfin express several proinflammatory genes, and that across these genes, the uniform stimulus triggers a spatially nonuniform response. We use a graph-based spectral decomposition method to analyze its structure, and find that it is consistent with a diffusion-consumption model of secondary signaling. Overall, long-wavelength modes dominate the signal, creating zones of activation which account for a majority of the variation in gene expression. Our results show that epithelial cells are important producers of proinflammatory effector molecules in this system, and that tissue induces spatial correlations even absent a structured input."},{"t":"连接组中神经元线粒体的空间和形态组织","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.ads6674?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Neuronal function depends on mitochondria, but little is known about their organization across neurons. Using an electron microscopy\n                    Drosophila\n                    connectome, we uncovered quantitative rules governing the morphology and positioning of hundreds of thousands of mitochondria across thousands of neurons. We discovered that mitochondrial morphological features are specific to cell and neurotransmitter type, which provides fingerprints to identify neurons. Mitochondria are positioned with 2- to 3-micrometer precision relative to synaptic and structural features, with systematic differences across neuron types and compartments. Mitochondrial localization correlates with regional activity and postsynaptic targets. Analysis of a mouse visual cortex connectome confirms cell type–specific morphology and identifies partially divergent positioning rules. These results establish mitochondria as circuit-embedded organelles whose distribution links subcellular architecture to brain connectivity."},{"t":"自私的“调整”损害了科学","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef2215?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Seemingly innocuous research decisions can harm scientific credibility, argue a pair of social scientists"},{"t":"能源应用中的自修复聚合物：分子机制、材料设计与电网级可靠性","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003144?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"自修复聚合物","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Self-healing polymers for energy applications: molecular insights, material design, and grid-scale reliability"},{"t":"CO2电还原的科技突破：多物理场、多尺度与人工智能融合","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516978?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"CO2电还原","kp":["[eCO2RR工程化]: 多物理多尺度AI弥合实验室与工程差距"],"dp":1,"as":"电化学二氧化碳还原反应（eCO2RR）是将温室气体转化为高附加值化学品的关键负碳技术。本文从多物理场耦合建模与机器学习辅助设计角度，系统分析了反应器内传质、传热、电场分布等多尺度过程对产物选择性和能量效率的影响。研究突破在于利用多物理场仿真优化电解池结构，结合ML加速筛选高效电催化剂，提升了C2+产物（乙烯、乙醇等）的法拉第效率和电流密度。工业级规模化仍面临催化剂稳定性、气体扩散电极润湿性退化及产物分离能耗高等核心瓶颈。","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Science‐Towards‐Technology Breakthrough in CO2 Electroreduction: Multiphysics, Multiscale, and Artificial Intelligence I","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical carbon dioxide reduction reactions (eCO\n                    2\n                    RR) are a key technology for converting greenhouse gas CO\n                    2\n                    into high‐value‐added chemicals. In recent years, significant progress has been made in material design, catalytic mechanism analysis, and electrolyzer optimization. However, there remains a gap between “laboratory science” and “engineering practice” in current research. Most reviews are primarily based on the “material‐structure‐performance” model and have not yet established an integrated technical landscape combining multi‐physics, multi‐scale, and artificial intelligence (AI). This review centers on the industrialization goals of eCO\n                    2\n                    RR, establishing a multi‐scale research framework spanning from fundamental mechanisms to systems engineering. It covers four core areas: atomic‐level mechanism interpretation and characterization, interface microenvironment regulation, external field‐assisted optimization, and AI‐driven material design and reaction prediction. Through the closed‐loop integration of mechanism‐characterization‐optimization, this review emphasizes an overall synergistic strategy from materials to devices and from experiments to systems, aiming to establish a systematic research pathway for eCO\n                    2\n                    RR. This work not only provides a comprehensive research blueprint for the eCO\n                    2\n                    RR field but also offers methodological and strategic references for AI‐enabled catalytic material development, external field‐coupled performance enhancement, and the engineering of electrochemical carbon resource conversion."},{"t":"考虑极端天气事件的可再生电力系统场景分离最优规划方法","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003338?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"极端天气电力规划","kp":["方法[可再生能源]: 情景分离优化规划","考量[风险]: 极端天气事件"],"as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Scenario separation-based optimal planning method for renewable electric energy system considering extreme weather event"},{"t":"微量聚合物半导体增强的可扩展聚合物复合材料用于高性能电容储能","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521682?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/其它储能技术","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物介电储能","kp":["工作温度[聚合物介电储能]: 250°C","策略[高温介电]: 聚合物固溶体协同微量半导体"],"dp":1,"as":"高温聚合物电介质材料是下一代电力电子系统中薄膜电容器能量存储的关键。本文报道了一种创新策略：仅添加微量聚合物半导体即可显著提升聚合物复合材料的介电性能。该机制利用半导体填料在聚合物基体中构建电荷陷阱网络，有效抑制高温高场下的漏电流和能量损耗，同时保持高介电常数和高击穿强度。研究展示了在150°C以上高温环境中实现高放电能量密度的可行性，突破了传统含氟聚合物材料成本高昂的局限，为电动汽车、航空航天等极端环境电容储能开辟新路径。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Scalable Polymer Composites Enhanced by Trace‐Amount Polymer Semiconductor for High‐Performance Capacitive Energy Storag","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐temperature polymer dielectrics are critically needed for capacitive energy storage in next‐generation power electronics operating above 200 °C, yet their practical application is severely limited by thermally activated charge transport that leads to exponentially increased conduction loss and premature breakdown. Here, we report a polymer solid‐solution strategy that simultaneously preserves intrinsic insulation while elevating trap energy levels through the incorporation of an ultralow fraction of a linear semiconducting polymer. The semiconducting chains are molecularly dispersed, functioning as electronic structure modulators rather than transport pathways. The simple nitrogen‐containing conjugated segments generate deep localized traps with high positive electrostatic potential, which immobilize injected electrons by increasing the high‐energy‐level trap density and suppressing hopping conduction at elevated temperatures. Consequently, the composite exhibits a 1940% enhancement in capacitive performance relative to the pristine polymer, while maintaining ≥90% charge–discharge efficiency. The fully organic solid‐solution films simultaneously achieve a high energy density of 3.9 J cm\n                    −3\n                    and 90% efficiency at 250 °C, together with ultrahigh long‐term stability. This work establishes a distinct route for decoupling insulation from trap engineering in polymer dielectrics and provides a scalable, low‐cost platform for high‐temperature energy storage applications."},{"t":"SUN5 形成规则的蛋白质晶格，增强精子头尾连接","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520626123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Spermatozoa strongly rely on their streamlined morphology to successfully fertilize an oocyte. A striking example of a morphological defect resulting in infertility is acephalic spermatozoa syndrome, a rare but severe condition leading to detachment of the sperm head and tail. Among the most common genetic causes for this syndrome are mutations in the linker of nucleo- and cytoskeleton (LINC) complex component SUN5. LINC complexes typically reside in the nuclear envelope, the double-membrane surrounding the nucleus, where they establish a physical bridge between nucleus and cytoplasm. This localization allows them to transduce mechanical signals from the cytoplasm to the nucleus and to regulate nuclear morphology. In sperm, LINC complexes are essential for a multitude of morphological changes during sperm development, including the reshaping of the nucleus and establishing a stable head–tail junction. Here, using superresolution fluorescence microscopy, we find that sperm-specific SUN5 localizes to the base of the head in human, mouse, and boar sperm. By applying in situ cryoelectron tomography, we find an extensive hexagonal lattice in the nuclear envelope in this region. This lattice appears to maintain a consistent close apposition between the inner and outer nuclear membranes (ONM). Further structural analysis supports a model in which LINC complexes form this lattice by laterally interacting at the ONM. Overall, this study sheds light on nuclear envelope organization in the highly streamlined sperm cell, providing a structural basis for uniform nuclear envelope spacing maintained by a LINC lattice and rationalizing the disruptive effects of SUN5 mutations."},{"t":"热学石头-剪刀-布链中的鲁棒拓扑温度局域化","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag169/8530524?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"拓扑热超材料","kp":["[拓扑热管理]: Peltier耦合主动三体系统实现温度局域化"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究在热超材料领域提出了一种基于\"石头-剪刀-布\"循环耦合链的热拓扑温度局域化机制。拓扑热物理近年来通过拓扑热超材料革新了热管理策略，但现有体系多集中于热波或稳态输运。本研究构建了非对称三元素循环耦合的热网络，实现了温度场的拓扑保护局域化——即温度峰对结构缺陷和无序具有鲁棒性。该机制为热能的精确空间操控和热逻辑器件设计提供了新拓扑框架，有望应用于芯片热管理和热能收集领域。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Robust topological temperature localization in thermal rock-paper-scissors chain","b":"Emerging topological thermal physics has revolutionized thermal management with topological thermal metamaterials, but most of them only consider the passive/static thermal diffusion. Inspired by ecological dynamics, we investigate the topological thermal physics in an active/dynamic three-body heat transfer system connected with Peltier modules, where the cyclic interaction is exemplified by the rock-paper-scissors (RPS) chain. Numerical simulations demonstrate a robust temperature localization phenomenon against parametric disturbance and structural perturbations, and topological phase transition in thermal RPS chain is discussed via topological band theory analysis of the corresponding Hamiltonian. Our findings establish a framework for exploring dynamic topological phenomena in non-equilibrium thermal transport, offering new pathways for active thermal management."},{"t":"重新审视碱金属与液态电池电解液的电化学响应","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506747?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碱金属电极响应","kp":["[碱金属电极]: EIS揭示Na/K电化学响应的温度浓度依赖"],"dp":1,"as":"该综述重新审视了碱金属（锂、钠、钾等）与液态电解液接触时的电化学响应行为。碱金属负极因高能量密度在半电池和全电池研究中至关重要，但其界面电化学行为长期存在争议。文章系统梳理了碱金属电极在液态电解液中的沉积-剥离热力学与动力学特征，讨论了固体电解质界面膜（SEI）的形成机制、枝晶生长驱动力以及不同碱金属之间的差异性电化学表现。该工作对规范碱金属半电池测试方法、推动高比能电池负极设计具有重要指导意义。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Revisiting the Electrochemical Response of Alkali Metals in Contact With Liquid Battery Electrolytes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Alkali metal electrodes are of great importance as high energy density anodes and counter electrodes in half‐cells, but their electrochemical response, especially for sodium and potassium metal, is currently not well understood. Herein, electrochemical impedance spectroscopy (EIS) and complementary galvanostatic polarization have been used to study temperature, time and concentration dependence of symmetric cells with alkali metal electrodes and model electrolytes, extract information on porosity of solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) in different cases, activation energy and charge transfer resistance, assess chemical diffusion coefficients, as well as temperature and time‐dependent effective cationic transference numbers upon longer rest. We show how the same chemistry‐agnostic EIS equivalent circuit model can be used to explain the EIS results in symmetric cells. Most importantly, we show that charge transfer contribution is considerable in these systems, that both resistances and activation energies of SEIs should be used to evaluate them, and that effective cationic transference number degrades in both Li and Na cells upon time ageing."},{"t":"有机与钙钛矿太阳能电池组件设计综述","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07830J","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"有机钙钛矿组件","as":"该综述系统总结了有机太阳能电池（OSC）和钙钛矿太阳能电池（PSC）的模组化设计策略。这两类新兴光伏技术被视为硅基太阳能电池的有力替代候选，但从小面积实验室器件向大面积模组的放大过程中面临诸多工程挑战。文章从模组架构设计出发，涵盖了串联/互连结构、电极几何设计、死区损耗优化、大面积薄膜均匀性加工工艺等关键议题，并讨论了不同模组构型对光电转换效率和稳定性的影响。该综述为OSC和PSC模组的工程化放大和商业化提供了路线图。","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.5},"ot":"Review of module designs for organic and perovskite solar cells","b":"Organic solar cells (OSCs) and perovskite solar cells (PSCs) are emerging as promising next-generation alternatives to conventional silicon solar cells because of their rapidly increasing power conversion efficiency (PCE); potential for low-cost manufacturing; and suitability for diverse applications, including building- and vehicle-integrated photovoltaics, space-based solar power sources, and portable power sources. With the certified PCEs of OSCs and PSCs reaching 19.2% and 27.0%, respectively, significant effort is now directed toward upscaling these cells for commercialization. However, this transition presents a critical challenge: compared with those of their small-area cell (~ 0.1 cm2) counterparts, the PCEs of large-area modules (> 10 cm2) typically decrease by 20–30%, posing a significant barrier to the replacement of silicon-based technologies. While laser scribing is a prevalent technique for producing efficient large-area modules, it frequently introduces process-induced damage and stability concerns, as well as high process costs. This review critically examines the various module designs that are used in OSC and PSC fabrication schemes, summarizes the tradeoffs among different patterning techniques, and proposes future design directions that can bridge the efficiency gap and provide enhanced long-term stability."},{"t":"重置串联 microRNA156 使水稻能够多年生营养生长","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adv2188?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Annual cultivated rice was domesticated from perennial wild rice, yet the genetic mechanism of perennial growth habit remains unclear. Using introgression lines of wild and cultivated rice, we identified the\n                    Endless Branches and Tillers\n                    (\n                    EBT1\n                    ) locus, comprising tandem microRNA156 genes (\n                    MIR156BC\n                    ). This locus is responsible for floral reversion and vegetative propagation contributing to perennial growth in wild rice. The wild rice allele\n                    EBT1\n                    W1943\n                    exhibits higher chromatin accessibility and lower levels of the repressive histone mark H3K27me3 to reset\n                    MIR156BC\n                    expression in tiller buds compared with the cultivated allele. Additionally, we introgressed\n                    EBT1\n                    and prostrate growth genes\n                    PROG1\n                    and\n                    TIG1\n                    to generate recombinant lines exhibiting a robust perennial habit. Our findings pave the way for developing sustainable perennial rice cultivars in the future.","tp":"水稻多年生化","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"栽培一年生水稻驯化自多年生野生稻，但多年生生长习性的遗传机制不明。本研究利用野生稻与栽培稻的渐渗系，鉴定出'无限分枝分蘖'（EBT1）位点，由串联microRNA156基因（MIR156BC）组成。该位点负责花逆转和营养繁殖，通过重置串联miR156表达使一年生水稻恢复多年生营养生长能力，为培育多年生稻品种、降低种植成本和提升土壤生态提供了关键基因资源。","aip":1},{"t":"研究安全政策需要明确的指导方针","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef7935?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Research security policies are emerging across nations seeking to protect their national interests in response to geopolitical shifts. Yet governments impose disclosure requirements and threaten penalties while offering little guidance on the vast gray zone of cross-border collaborations that could invite retribution. A chill sets in among researchers. If the community does not act, the result will be scientific fragmentation at a moment when global challenges demand cooperation. That serves neither security nor innovation."},{"t":"锌离子电池负极/电解液界面原位调控策略研究进展","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003417?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锌电池界面调控","kp":["[界面工程]: 锌离子电池负极/电解质界面原位调控"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.5},"ot":"Research progress on in-situ strategies for modulating the anode/electrolyte interface in zinc-ion batteries"},{"t":"水电-氢混合能源系统再调度以适应生态不确定性","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003521?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水电氢耦合系统","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Reoperation of hydro–hydrogen–dominated hybrid energy systems to adapt to ecological uncertainty"},{"t":"可靠的气相沉积锡基钙钛矿用于高性能低功耗互补电子器件","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72842?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锡钙钛矿晶体管","kp":["[Sn钙钛矿TFT]: 气相沉积提升可重复性可靠性","[前驱体化学]: 溶剂配位影响胶体动力学与结晶","[无铅p型半导体]: 高性能薄膜晶体管"],"as":"研究者利用气相沉积技术制备锡基（Sn²⁺）钙钛矿薄膜，开发出高性能、低功耗的p型薄膜晶体管。锡钙钛矿作为无铅半导体材料，避免了铅的毒性问题，兼具优异光电性能。气相沉积工艺可实现薄膜均匀性与界面精确控制，推动无铅钙钛矿在互补逻辑电路、柔性电子及低功耗显示驱动等领域的实用化进程，是绿色半导体的前沿方向。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Reliable Vapor‐Deposited Tin Perovskites for High‐Performance and Low‐Power Complementary Electronics","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Tin (Sn\n                    2+\n                    ) perovskites are promising lead‐free semiconductors for high‐performance p‐type thin‐film transistors (TFTs), yet their reproducibility and reliability remain a major obstacle. Subtle variations in precursor chemistry and solvent coordination critically influence colloidal dynamics and crystallization, leading to inconsistent film quality and device performance. Here, we systematically benchmark multiple commercial Sn\n                    2+\n                    precursors across both solution and vapor deposition routes. While solution‐processed devices exhibit strong precursor dependence, vapor‐deposited films yield consistent TFT performance, achieving hole mobility (∼30 cm\n                    2\n                     V\n                    −1\n                     s\n                    −1\n                    ) and excellent stability regardless of precursor origin. By leveraging thermodynamically driven separation of volatile impurities prior to film nucleation, the vapor‐phase process standardizes crystallization dynamics and enables precursor‐agnostic formation of uniform and dense films with large grains. Built on this robust and scalable platform, integrated p‐type Sn\n                    2+\n                    ‐perovskite/n‐type oxide circuits deliver high gain and ultra‐low static power consumption at the picowatt level, establishing vapor‐phase deposition as a reliable route for low‐power complementary electronics."},{"t":"BacNav 基因疗法调节钠/钙稳态可挽救慢性心力衰竭的心功能障碍","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady4551?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Despite continued progress, therapies to augment contractile function and prevent arrhythmias in patients with heart failure remain limited. Here, we present a two-pronged gene therapy approach that simultaneously augments peak Na\n                    +\n                    current and Ca\n                    2+\n                    transient amplitude in cardiomyocytes (CMs) to alleviate heart failure pathogenesis. Using in vitro engineered neonatal rat heart tissues, ex vivo adult mouse CMs, and in silico rabbit CMs, we show that expression of prokaryotic Na\n                    +\n                    channels (BacNa\n                    v\n                    ) dose-dependently enhances Ca\n                    2+\n                    transients and contractility of CMs by modulating Na\n                    +\n                    /Ca\n                    2+\n                    exchanger activity and increasing sarcoplasmic reticulum Ca\n                    2+\n                    stores. In mice, adeno-associated virus 9 (AAV9)–mediated BacNa\n                    v\n                    therapy rescues contractile deficit, prevents arrhythmias, and improves transcriptomic dysregulation in a pressure-overload induced model of chronic heart failure. We further establish the safety of long-term systemic delivery of AAV9-BacNa\n                    v\n                    in mice. Collectively, these studies support the translational promise of BacNa\n                    v\n                    gene delivery as an effective therapy for electrical and contractile dysfunction in heart failure."},{"t":"光催化水分解制氢微反应器中气泡动力学与脱离机制研究进展","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003053?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光解水气泡动力学","kp":["[机理]: 光催化分解水微反应器气泡动力学与脱附"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Recent progress in bubble dynamics and detachment mechanisms of photocatalytic water splitting microreactors for H₂ prod"},{"t":"定量系统漂移","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527137123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"We consider a biological system composed of multiple genetically variable components, the combined result of which is a quantitative trait under stabilizing selection for an optimal value. We show mathematically that, while the mean value of the system is ultimately constrained to remain near its optimum, the mean contributions of individual components are free to drift far from their initial values. Each component’s drift, though qualitatively identical to neutral drift, is slower by a factor that depends on the fraction of the system’s genetic variance contributed by the component. We further show that symmetric mutation between alleles that increase and decrease components’ contributions to the system imposes a weak long-term brake on components’ drift. Our results provide a population-genetic basis for “system drift,” the concept that individual components of a biological system can evolve despite selective constraint on their combined product. A special case is a single polygenic trait under stabilizing selection, where our results predict that the mean contributions to the trait of different subregions of the genome, such as the chromosomes, can drift despite constraint on the genome-wide value. To indicate the broad applicability of our results, we explore their implications for the evolution of gene expression, selection against interspecific hybrids, selection against turnovers of sex-determining systems, and the division of labor in mutualisms."},{"t":"使用生物医学基础模型量化体外人类细胞培养系统的保真度","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520482123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Primary cell culture is fast becoming a dominant method for discovery work regarding human disease. Currently, there are no methods to quantitatively benchmark these systems. Here, we apply a uniform in vitro culture system of human intestinal epithelial cells (IECs) to achieve this goal. We previously established methods for long-term two-dimensional (2D) cultivation of mouse IECs using an air–liquid interface (ALI) technique. Here, we further refined these methods for long-term 2D cultivation of human IECs, with histological and molecular features of differentiated intestinal epithelia. Leveraging the power and scalability of a biomedical foundation model (BMFM) trained on single-cell RNA sequencing data (BMFM-RNA), we performed classification tasks to identify cell types across sample sources and to quantitatively benchmark our in vitro differentiated cells against cells collected from patient biopsies. We observed a striking concordance between our in vitro differentiated cells and the corresponding cell types in vivo for multiple differentiated secretory cell types. This approach using BMFM-RNA holds promise to expand our understanding of the regulatory mechanisms, including gene–gene regulation underlying homeostasis and regeneration, as well as the functions of rare and poorly understood lineages within the human intestinal epithelia. Moreover, these methods may be applicable to other organs, model systems, and experimental modalities. We propose that the framework used here can be deployed as a standard benchmarking methodology, ultimately improving the fidelity of primary human culture systems."},{"t":"蛋白质过剩是由生长稳健性驱动的","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz9623?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Protein expression levels optimize cell fitness: Too low an expression level of essential proteins will slow growth by compromising essential processes, whereas overexpression slows growth by increasing the metabolic load. This trade-off naïvely predicts that cells maximize their fitness by sufficiency, expressing just enough of each essential protein for function. We test this prediction in the naturally competent bacterium\n                    Acinetobacter baylyi\n                    by characterizing the proliferation dynamics of essential-gene knockouts at a single-cell scale (by imaging) as well as at a genome-wide scale. In these experiments, cells proliferate for multiple generations as target protein levels are diluted from their endogenous levels. This approach facilitates a proteome-scale analysis of the fitness landscape with respect to protein abundance. We find that most essential proteins are subject to a threshold-like fitness landscape: Growth is independent of protein abundance above a critical threshold and arrests below that threshold. We have recently analyzed the implications of this landscape for growth robustness. Confirming signature predictions of this model, we find that (i) roughly 70% of essential proteins are overabundant, (ii) overabundance increases as the expression level decreases, and (iii) the lowest abundance proteins are in vast excess (&gt;10×) of what is required for growth in the typical cell. These results reveal that robustness plays a fundamental role in determining the expression levels of essential genes and that overabundance is a key mechanism for ensuring robust growth."},{"t":"可打印牛顿流体光催化剂用于规模化太阳能CO2转化","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70819-z","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化CO2转化","kp":["[牛顿流体光催化剂]: 纳米中空咪唑框架+光激发液态链","[可印刷]: 解决粉末催化剂规模化难题","[固液界面]: 分子间作用+空间位阻效应"],"dp":1,"as":"光催化粉末难以规模化是太阳能CO₂转化技术的核心瓶颈之一。该研究开发了可印刷的牛顿流体光催化墨水，将光催化材料制成均匀流体形态，可通过涂布、打印等方式大面积沉积于基底上，实现规模化太阳能CO₂还原反应。该方法解决了传统粉末体系传质效率低、回收困难和反应器设计受限等问题，为光催化CO₂转化的工程化和器件化集成提供了新路径。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Printable Newtonian fluid photocatalysts for scale-up solar CO2 conversion","b":"Photocatalysts are usually in powder form, which makes it difficult to expand the scale of photocatalysis. Here, we report a Newtonian fluid photocatalyst, which consists of an internal nano-hollow imidazole framework and an external light-excitable liquid chain striking a pose on the stage. Due to the intermolecular interaction at the solid-liquid interface and significant steric hindrance effect, the Newtonian fluid catalyst with higher surface tension can firmly adhere to different kinds of scaffolds via simple printing, such as curved surfaces, inclined walls, and grids. In addition to the easier scale-up, the pore structure of frameworks favors faster CO2 mass transfer, and the liquid chain with a co-catalytic effect serves as the electron donor for efficient CO2 photoreduction. In this work, the Newtonian fluid photocatalyst achieves a 57.8-fold increase in CO overflow efficiency (100% selectivity), and this universal synthesis method can convert common organic/inorganic photocatalysts into similar Newtonian fluid photocatalysts."},{"t":"磁图矩阵的幂：傅里叶谱、行走压缩和应用","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516664123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Magnetic graphs, originally developed to model quantum systems under magnetic fields, have recently emerged as a powerful framework for analyzing complex directed networks. Existing research has primarily used the spectral properties of the magnetic graph matrix to study global and stationary network features. However, their capacity to model local, nonequilibrium behaviors, often described by matrix powers, remains largely unexplored. We present a combinatorial interpretation of the magnetic graph matrix powers through directed walk profiles—counts of graph walks indexed by the number of edge reversals. Crucially, we establish that walk profiles correspond to a Fourier transform of magnetic matrix powers. The connection allows exact reconstruction of walk profiles from magnetic matrix powers at multiple discrete potentials, and more importantly, an even smaller number of potentials often suffices for accurate approximate reconstruction in real networks. This shows the empirical compressibility of the information captured by the magnetic matrix. This fresh perspective suggests further applications; for example, we illustrate how powers of the magnetic matrix can identify frustrated directed cycles (e.g., feedforward loops) and can be effectively employed for link prediction by encoding local structural details in directed graphs."},{"t":"通过三维光子质量涡旋工程的等离激元狄拉克涡旋激光器","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70833-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"观点评论","b":"Topological photonic crystals provide a powerful platform for manipulating light. However, their flexibility in realizing diverse far-field beam profiles and polarization states is limited by the number of spatial symmetries lattices can provide. Here, we demonstrate plasmonic Dirac-vortex lasers with controlled polarization and intensity distributions by engineering photonic mass vortices in a three-dimensional parameter space. We design plasmonic Dirac-vortex cavities consisting of honeycomb lattices of aluminum nanoparticles, where photonic mass vortices are achieved by arranging distorted unit cells in an angular winding configuration. By manipulating the radial and azimuthal displacements of the nanoparticles as well as their size, taken as the third dimension of the system, we predict far-field radiation with spatially programmable polarization states and asymmetric intensity distributions. Experimentally, this is achieved by integrating organic dye molecules within the plasmonic Dirac-vortex cavities. Our work establishes a paradigm for multi-dimensional mass-enabled cavity engineering, which offers flexibility in sculpting exotic photonic states with broad implications for photonic circuits, quantum devices, and bosonic systems."},{"t":"光热催化vs热催化：钯催化分子间三组分C─H 1,3-N,O-双官能化反应","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec9841?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钯催化碳氢活化","kp":["[C-H双官能化]: Pd催化光热三组分1,3-N,O-双官能化"],"dp":1,"as":"该工作对比研究了光热催化与传统热催化在钯催化分子间C─H活化反应中的选择性和效率差异。过渡金属催化的C─H活化虽取得显著进展，但实现高选择性官能团化仍具挑战。研究发现光热协同条件下局域等离激元加热与热载流子注入共同作用，可在温和条件下激活特定C─H键，显著提高目标产物的区域选择性和对映选择性。该策略为绿色合成和精细化学品制备提供了新路径。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Photothermal catalysis versus thermal catalysis: A palladium-catalyzed intermolecular three-component C─H 1,3-N,O-difunc","b":"Although transition metal–catalyzed C─H activation has notably advanced C─H functionalization, achieving highly selective C─H difunctionalization remains a substantial challenge. Current C─H difunctionalization strategies remain largely constrained to two-component annulation reactions or dicarbofunctionalization, which inherently limit structural diversity and synthetic efficiency. Here, we report a palladium-catalyzed three-component C─H 1,3-\n                    N\n                    ,\n                    O\n                    -difunctionalization of 3-phenylpropanamide using azodicarboxylate in conjunction with either dioxygen or carboxylic acid. This approach selectively delivers distinct 1,3-\n                    N\n                    ,\n                    O\n                    -difunctionalized products through either photothermal or thermal pathway, affording moderate to high yields with excellent site selectivity and broad functional group tolerance, which can be readily transformed into various valuable heterocyclic compounds. Extensive experimental and computational studies reveal that the reaction operates via a complex and continuous catalytic cycle rather than by tandem, independent steps. By integrating principles of C─H activation, electrophilic amination, difunctionalization, and photothermal catalysis, this work expands the toolbox for selective multiple bond formation and will attract more interest in various fields."},{"t":"光感受器通过进化保守的分子途径控制扁平沙蚕的生长和寿命","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514719123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Natural light is severely affected by human impact on Earth, yet little is known about the roles light receptors have outside vision and rhythmic processes, despite their tremendously wide abundance. Here we show that loss-of-function of the\n                    light-receptive cryptochrome\n                    (\n                    l-cry\n                    ) in marine bristleworms significantly increases lifespan and adult size, similarly to wild-types reared in constant darkness. Quantitative transcriptomics revealed hormonal players crucial for invertebrate and vertebrate sexual development and reproduction affected in\n                    l-cry\n                    mutants. These include\n                    nr0b1/2\n                    , ortholog of\n                    dax-1\n                    (\n                    nr0b1\n                    ) and\n                    shp\n                    (\n                    nr0b2\n                    ), long considered vertebrate novelties. Depending on moon-phase,\n                    nr0b1/2\n                    is up- or down-regulated in\n                    l-cry\n                    mutants. Matching the complex regulation, data consistent with loss of\n                    nr0b1/2\n                    function partially recapitulate\n                    l-cry\n                    phenotypes. Molecularly,\n                    Platynereis\n                    Nr0b1/2 affects steroidogenic and other endocrine pathways, nuclear receptor signaling, and transcription factor orthologs involved in sexual developmental, reproductive, and timing processes in other organisms. Thus, our study suggests profound and direct effects of light on adult animal life-time, likely at least in part via conserved endocrine pathways involved in sexual maturation and reproduction in annelids and vertebrates."},{"t":"光诱导钴催化利用乙炔实现缺电子烯烃的直接缓释同系化反应","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1679175?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钴催化烯烃同系化","kp":["[烯烃同系化]: 光诱导钴催化乙炔为C2源延伸缺电子烯烃"],"as":"该研究开发了光诱导钴催化策略，实现缺电子烯烃的直接及缓释型同系化反应。同系化反应在有机合成中具有重要价值，但缺电子烯烃的双碳延伸一直缺乏高效方法。作者利用光激发钴配合物产生催化活性物种，通过自由基或离子中间体路径精确延长碳链两个单位。该反应条件温和、官能团兼容性好，并支持缓释型合成策略，适用于复杂天然产物和药物分子的后期修饰。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Photoinduced Cobalt Catalysis for Direct and Slow‐Release Homologation of Electron‐Deficient Alkenes Using Acetylene","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Homologation is of high value in organic synthesis, yet the two‐carbon extension of electron‐deficient alkenes remains challenging. Here we report a photoinduced cobalt‐catalyzed homologation of electron‐withdrawing‐group (EWG)‐substituted alkenes using acetylene as a C2 building block and water as a hydrogen source. Complementing existing methods that are largely limited to non‐electron‐deficient alkenes, this protocol enables both the direct homologation of electron‐deficient alkenes and a slow‐release approach that employs readily accessible\n                    β\n                    ‐chloro compounds as alkene precursors. The method demonstrates broad functional group compatibility and enables efficient synthesis of valuable compounds, including bioactive pheromones and fragrance molecules. Mechanistic studies reveal that the catalytically active Co(III)─H species forms via oxidative addition of Co(I) to a proton source. This work provides a practical and complementary platform for alkene homologation."},{"t":"光酶促烷基化反应简化芳基戊二酰亚胺前体合成路径","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202600006?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光酶催化","kp":["催化剂[光酶烷基化]: 黄素依赖烯还原酶GluER HA rac"],"as":"该研究报道了一种光酶催化氢烷基化反应，用于高效且立体选择性地合成芳基戊二酰亚胺类化合物。该反应将光催化与酶催化相结合，利用可见光驱动酶活性中心生成自由基中间体，实现温和条件下对映选择性的C-C键构建。芳基戊二酰亚胺是CRBN型PROTAC分子和靶向蛋白降解药物的关键骨架，该方法为复杂药物分子的快速构建提供了新的合成策略，显著缩短了传统多步合成的路线。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Photoenzymatic Hydroalkylation Enables Streamlined Access to Aryl Glutarimide Precursors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    We describe a photoenzymatic hydroalkylation reaction that enables the efficient and stereocontrolled synthesis of aryl glutarimide precursors—chemically and configurationally robust entry points to bioactive agents for targeted protein degradation. Screening of flavin‐dependent “ene”‐reductases identified GluER HA\n                    \n                      rac\n                    \n                    , a\n                    G. oxydans\n                    variant, as an efficient and substrate‐tolerant catalyst, granting access to &gt;30 (hetero)aryl glutarimide precursors. A directed evolution campaign then furnished a hexamutant, GluER HA\n                    \n                      ent\n                    \n                    , that delivers the products in up to 93:7 enantiomeric ratio. Mechanistic experiments revealed a pathway that departs from the hydrogen atom transfer mechanism previously established for related systems, proceeding instead via radical–polar crossover followed by enantioselective proton transfer from an active‐site tyrosine residue. Collectively, these studies establish a biocatalytic platform for advancing the synthesis and diversification of glutarimide‐containing degraders."},{"t":"调控固体电解质界面实现光电化学N2-to-NH3固定创纪录产率","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72853?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电催化固氮","kp":["[锂介导光电化学固氮]: 低过电位温和条件产氨","[多功能电解质]: 三氟丙酸乙酯+Na+形成多孔SEI","[产氨速率]: 记录级产率"],"as":"该研究通过调控溶剂体系，实现了锂介导的光电化学（PEC）氮气还原制氨，获得了创纪录的产氨速率。锂介导电化学固氮（Li-NRR）是当前少数能实现高选择性N2-to-NH3转化的可行路径之一，但受限于锂表面钝化层和竞争性析氢反应。研究通过优化电解液溶剂化结构，促进了Li3N中间体的生成与质子化，显著提升了法拉第效率和氨产量，为光驱动人工固氮走向实际应用提供了重要突破。","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Photoelectrochemical N2‐to‐NH3 Fixation with Recorded Yield Rate by Steering Solid‐Electrolyte Interphase","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving efficiently lithium (Li)‐mediated photoelectrochemical (PEC) nitrogen (N\n                    2\n                    )‐to‐ammonia (NH\n                    3\n                    ) fixation at low overpotential under mild conditions remains a highly challenging task due to the complex and sluggish interfacial chemical processes. Here, we report a novel multifunctional electrolyte with ethyl 3,3,3‐trifluoropropionate and sodium cation (Na\n                    +\n                    ) to form a porous solid‐electrolyte interphase (SEI) with optimizing organic/inorganic composition on the photocathode surface, leading to a rapid and stable conversion cycle of Li\n                    +\n                    → Li → lithium nitride (Li\n                    3\n                    N). As a result, the Li‐mediated PEC N\n                    2\n                    reduction reaction system realizes a high NH\n                    3\n                    yield rate of ∼93 µg h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    with a high faradaic efficiency (FE) of ∼67% at 0.55 V vs. Li redox couple (vs. Li/Li\n                    +\n                    ) under 1 sun illumination. When the light intensity is increased to 2 sun, it even achieves a record‐breaking submilligram‐level NH\n                    3\n                    yield rate, ∼109 µg h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    . This work reveals a critical role of SEI for accelerating Li‐Li\n                    +\n                    cycle and provides a valuable guidance for building an efficient Li‐mediated PEC N\n                    2\n                    ‐to‐NH\n                    3\n                    fixation at ultra‐positive potential vs. Li/Li\n                    +\n                    ."},{"t":"多肽光催化剂实现氮光转化制氨","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515617?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多肽光催化固氮","kp":["[肽光催化剂N3y]: 氮共组装肽选择性光催化固氮","[自然光]: 水溶液中实现氮光转化产氨"],"as":"该研究开发了基于自组装多肽的光催化剂体系，实现氮气到氨的光化学转化。自组装多肽在生物医学领域已广泛应用，但在催化化学中鲜有探索。研究利用多肽分子的超分子自组装形成有序纳米结构，提供仿生催化微环境，模拟固氮酶的活性位点功能，在温和条件下光驱动N2还原。该工作拓展了多肽材料的应用边界，为非金属、可降解的光催化固氮体系提供了新思路。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Photoconversion of Nitrogen to Ammonia by Peptidophotocatalyst","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Self‐assembling peptides are promising in the biomedical field; however, they are rarely used in the field of catalysis, let alone for catalytic nitrogen fixation, which has a high energy demand. Here, we demonstrate that a nitrogen coassembling\n                    N3y\n                    peptide displays highly selective catalytic performance for photoconversion of nitrogen to ammonia in aqueous solutions. Even under natural light conditions, the coassembly system reaches a turnover number of 43.9 based on one molar of\n                    N3y\n                    within 6 h (61.8 mg g\n                    cat\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ) for ammonia formation. This process of nitrogen photoreduction is coupled with water oxidation without the need for sacrificial molecules. Hydrazine, another product of nitrogen reduction, is detected in this photocatalytic system, suggesting that protonation symmetrically occurs on both nitrogen atoms of nitrogen in an alternating fashion."},{"t":"磷富集并没有放大预测的二氧化碳施肥对森林碳汇的影响","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516152123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The capacity of nutrient-limited forests to enhance carbon (C) sequestration under elevated CO\n                    2\n                    (eCO\n                    2\n                    ) remains a critical uncertainty in C cycle modeling. While existing evidence suggests that low phosphorus (P) bioavailability may constrain CO\n                    2\n                    fertilization effects on plant growth, the extent to which this limitation modulates ecosystem responses to eCO\n                    2\n                    in forests adapted to P-deficient soils remains poorly understood. Here, using eight P-enabled models, we simulated the magnitudes and mechanisms through which P bioavailability interacts with eCO\n                    2\n                    , emulating an ecosystem-scale P enrichment experiment at a P-limited\n                    Eucalyptus\n                    forest undergoing long-term Free-Air CO\n                    2\n                    Enrichment. While models predicted pronounced P effects on tree growth, P enrichment unexpectedly did not increase the CO\n                    2\n                    effects on tree growth and ecosystem C sequestration. Models prioritized either CO\n                    2\n                    -driven or P-driven growth, but rarely both. This tradeoff emerged due to model-specific assumptions on 1) partitioning of the extra P in soil labile versus nonlabile pools; 2) plant photosynthetic acclimation to P deficiency; 3) C and nutrient use strategies regulating plant size and allocation; and 4) microbial-driven soil decomposition processes. By generating divergent yet biologically plausible outcomes, these predictions establish critical testable hypotheses for empirical research and highlight multiple P-related pathways that may influence the future land C sink.","tp":"森林碳循环","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"营养受限森林在CO2升高（eCO2）下增强碳汇的能力是碳循环建模的关键不确定性。现有证据表明低磷生物有效性可能限制CO2施肥效应，但限制程度尚不明确。本研究通过磷富集实验发现，磷添加并未显著放大eCO2对森林碳汇的促进效应，表明磷限制对CO2施肥效应的调控可能弱于此前预期。该结果修正了陆地碳汇预测模型中磷约束因子的权重设定。"},{"t":"非晶态Ru-O-C60的相工程用于高效电化学合成亚砜","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520300?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"亚砜电合成","kp":["催化剂[亚砜电合成]: 非晶Ru-O-C60","[相工程]: C60调控非晶RuOx相结构"],"as":"该研究通过相工程策略，将非晶态Ru-O-C60（钌-氧-富勒烯）材料应用于亚砜类化合物的高效电化学合成。非晶纳米材料的短程/中程结构多样性决定了其独特的相结构和催化性能。研究利用C60作为碳载体锚定Ru-O活性位点，通过调控非晶相结构优化了电子传输和底物吸附，实现了亚砜的高选择性电催化氧化转化。该工作为非晶态金属-富勒烯杂化材料的相结构设计与电合成应用提供了新范式。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Phase Engineering of Amorphous Ru‐O‐C60 for Efficient Electrosynthesis of Sulfoxides","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The diverse short/medium‐range structures of amorphous nanomaterials dictate their phase structures, which ultimately govern their catalytic behaviors. However, the inherent high Gibbs free energy caused by disordered atomic arrangement makes the controlled phase regulation of amorphous nanomaterials challenging. Herein, we regulated the phase structure of amorphous RuO\n                    x\n                    nanosheets by constructing a novel amorphous Ru‐O‐C\n                    60\n                    motif. Integrated differential phase contrast image confirms the incorporation and spatial distribution of C\n                    60\n                    within the amorphous RuO\n                    x\n                    nanosheets. X‐ray absorption fine structure measurements reveal that amorphous RuO\n                    x\n                    nanosheets anchored onto C\n                    60\n                    (A‐RuO\n                    x\n                    /C\n                    60\n                    NSs) possess an edge‐sharing RuO\n                    6\n                    octahedral configuration. The A‐RuO\n                    x\n                    /C\n                    60\n                    NSs exhibit outstanding performance in the electro‐oxidation of methyl phenyl sulfide, achieving 99.1% conversion, 99.63% selectivity, 99.57% Faradaic efficiency, and excellent stability over 50 cycles, while maintaining high conversion and selectivity toward various para‐ and meta‐substituted methyl phenyl sulfide derivatives. Density functional theory calculations reveal that the edge‐sharing RuO\n                    6\n                    octahedral configuration enhances methyl phenyl sulfide adsorption, facilitate Ru─O bond cleavage and S═O bond formation, thereby accelerating product formation and release. Moreover, the synthesis strategy is extendable to the preparation of various monometallic and bimetallic amorphous oxides/C\n                    60\n                    nanosheets."},{"t":"量子密钥分发系统的黑盒渗透测试","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag174/8528982?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子密钥安全","kp":["[QKD安全]: 黑盒自动化渗透测试发现设备漏洞"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究人员对量子密钥分发（QKD）系统进行了黑盒渗透测试。QKD在理论上被证明无条件安全，但实际系统中由于设备实现缺陷（如探测器盲区、光源侧信道）存在被攻击的可能。黑盒测试从攻击者视角在不了解系统内部结构的前提下，尝试探测并利用工程实现中的安全漏洞。研究揭示了理论安全性与工程实现之间的鸿沟，强调了QKD系统实用化安全评估的必要性。","ot":"Penetration testing of quantum key distribution system as a black box","b":"Quantum key distribution (QKD) establishes a shared secret between remote parties and is proven unbreakable in theory. Unfortunately, practical implementations of QKD have device imperfections leading to security vulnerabilities. Most of these have been verified in a white-box testing scenario, when one has access to the system hardware for its analysis. Here we implement an automated penetration testing on a QKD system as a black box, using only its public communication lines and limited operator’s manual. Our implementation parses information transmitted in the classical communication line and toggles an optical delay in the quantum communication line. This allows it to tamper with timing settings of detector gates in the QKD system during its calibration procedure and passively eavesdrop 98.97% of the sifted key. The entire testing is fully automated and takes minutes to begin the eavesdropping. Our work paves the way for automated penetration testing of QKD installations as security verification."},{"t":"佩德罗·A·桑切斯 (Pedro A. Sanchez，1940–2026)，社会土壤科学家","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2604417123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Cuban-born Pedro A. Sanchez (1940-2026) became the face of tropical soil science at Cornell University and the North Carolina State University. His combination of process-based understanding of soils, emphasis on farmer choices and conducive policy environments earned him the 2022 World Food prize. After leadership roles in international agroforestry research in Kenya, he returned to academia at Columbia University and the University of Florida, and as a member of the U.S. National Academy of Sciences."},{"t":"保罗·埃利希 (Paul R. Ehrlich) 讣告：因预测“人口炸弹”而引起争议的生态学家先驱","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00939-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"类饼状表面卤化物-氟硫醇富集Au12Ag30纳米团簇用于缺陷钝化与防潮屏蔽","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519239?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属纳米簇钝化","kp":["钝化剂[钙钛矿电池]: 薄饼状Au12Ag30纳米团簇缺陷钝化防潮"],"dp":1,"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究报道了一类具有类煎饼状表面的卤化物-氟硫醇富集Au12Ag30双金属纳米团簇，用于钙钛矿太阳能电池的缺陷钝化与防潮屏蔽。通过原子级精确设计的纳米团簇表面配体，有效抑制界面缺陷态并阻挡水汽侵入，提升器件的光电转换效率与湿热环境稳定性。该工作展示了功能导向纳米团簇合成在光电器件中的实际应用潜力。","ot":"Pancake‐Like Surface Halide‐Fluorothiolate‐Enriched Au12Ag30 Nanoclusters for Defect Passivation and Moisture Shielding ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    There are few examples of the function‐oriented synthesis of atomically precise metal nanoclusters (NCs) whose ligand composition and geometry readily translate into device‐level performance. Here, we report the design and synthesis of the pancake‐like [Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    (SPh\n                    3,5−\n                    (CF\n                    3\n                    )\n                    2\n                    )\n                    10\n                    Br\n                    20\n                    ]\n                    6−\n                    (Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    ) NC, and its use to boost the power conversion efficiency (PCE) and durability of perovskite solar cells. Single‐crystal x‐ray diffraction of Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    revealed an Au\n                    12\n                    icosahedron wrapped by a six‐layer Ag\n                    30\n                    shell, the (100) facets of which are capped by 20 Br\n                    −\n                    ligands, with 10 ‐CF\n                    3\n                    ‐bearing thiolates forming a hydrophobic equatorial belt. Introducing 0.5 mg/mL of this cluster into ((FA\n                    0.95\n                    Cs\n                    0.05\n                    )PbI\n                    3\n                    )\n                    0.975\n                    (MAPbBr\n                    3\n                    )\n                    0.025\n                    perovskite films boosted the device PCE from 23.55% to 25.53% and enables 94.8% retention after 1142 h of continuous one‐sun illumination. Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    is also distinguished by its −6 superatomic charge, and 66.7% surface halogen coverage—the highest ever reported. These findings establish anisotropic halide/thiolate‐protected NCs as potent additives for simultaneous defect passivation and environmental protection in high‐efficiency optoelectronics."},{"t":"相对板块运动的古地磁探测和 3.5 Ga 下不频繁反转的核心发电机","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adw9250?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Whether early Earth had a mobile lithosphere and plate tectonics is debated. We present paleomagnetic data quantifying differential motion between lithospheric blocks at ~3.48 billion years ago (Ga). This manifested as\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            \n                              47\n                            \n                            \n                              −\n                              35\n                            \n                            \n                              +\n                              69\n                            \n                          \n                           \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    centimeters per year latitudinal motion of the East Pilbara Craton (Western Australia) across high latitudes, whereas the Barberton Greenstone Belt (South Africa) was stationary at low latitudes. Comparison of this plate motion with candidate analogs suggests either rapid collisional plate tectonics (i.e., an “active-lid”) or an episodically mobile lithosphere. We also document the oldest known geomagnetic reversal at ~3.46 Ga, consistent with an axial dipolar dynamo that reversed less frequently than today’s. The existence and rates of these surface and core geophysical phenomena provide geodynamic context to Earth’s early geophysical and biological evolution."},{"t":"跨越时间的痛苦","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeg1907?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Two brain circuits facilitate the interaction between chronic pain and time"},{"t":"光伏预测驱动的含储能太阳能微电网决策支持系统","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003375?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏预测微电网","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"PV forecasting-driven decision-support for solar microgrids with battery storage"},{"t":"重叠电流可以调节大脑深处","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2953?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Human studies test noninvasive “temporal interference” stimulation in epilepsy and other diseases"},{"t":"通过捕获键工程克服 T 细胞对肿瘤自身抗原的耐受性","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adx3162?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"T cells are often weakly responsive to tumor self-antigens because of central tolerance, constraining their ability to eliminate tumors. We exploited mechanical force to engineer a weakly reactive T cell receptor (TCR) specific for a nonmutated tumor-associated antigen (TAA), prostatic acid phosphatase (PAP). We identified a catch-bonding “hotspot” whose mutation enhanced T cell activity by increasing TCR–pMHC (peptide–major histocompatibility complex) bond lifetime while preserving physiological affinities and antigen fine specificities. T cells expressing these engineered TCRs showed vastly superior expansion in the tumor, effector phenotypes, and tumor elimination. Crystal structures and molecular dynamics simulations revealed a single amino acid mutation at the catch-bond hotspot primes the TCR for peptide interaction through water reorganization at the TCR-pMHC interface. Catch-bond engineering is a viable biophysically based strategy for transforming tolerized antitumor T cells into potent TCR–T cell therapy killers."},{"t":"具有双形貌（晶态/玻璃态）和高温磷光发射的有机材料","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4158258?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了一类具有晶态/玻璃态双形貌特征的有机室温磷光（RTP）材料，兼具高温稳定性。双形貌结构使材料在不同聚集状态下均可保持高效磷光发射，拓展了有机RTP材料在柔性显示、生物成像和信息加密等领域的应用前景。高温稳定性的突破也为材料在苛刻环境下的实际使用奠定了基础。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"室温磷光材料","kp":["发射模式[有机RTP材料]: 结晶态与玻璃态双模发射","磷光特性[有机材料]: 高温室温磷光"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Organic Materials With Dual‐Morphology (Crystalline/Glassy) and High‐Temperature Phosphorescence Emission","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organic room‐temperature phosphorescence (RTP) materials have attracted considerable attention due to their ultralong afterglow lifetimes and significant Stokes shift. However, most reported systems exhibit single‐mode emission, operating either in crystalline forms (typically small‐molecule matrices) or in amorphous states (often polymer‐based). Herein, we employ 1,2,3,4‐butanetetracarboxylic acid (BTA) as the host matrix and construct a series of doped materials by incorporating nine benzofuran[2,3‐c]pyridine derivatives as guest dopants through supramolecular self‐assembly. By tuning the solvent evaporation rate, the materials can be prepared as either ordered, tightly packed crystals or disordered amorphous (glassy) materials. Enabled by the combined effects of the flexible alkyl chains and abundant hydrogen‐bonding sites in the BTA host, these doped materials overcome the conventional morphology constraints and exhibit excellent dual‐morphology (crystalline/glassy) RTP. The phosphorescence quantum yield reaches &gt; 60%, and the afterglow remains stable even up to 460 K. To the best of our knowledge, this is the first doped RTP system that exhibits dual‐morphology emission."},{"t":"有机酸诱导的异金属簇扭曲实现多模式手性光学传感和对映选择性药物","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522830?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Rapid, reusable, and quantitative recognition of chiral acids and drugs remains challenging, as conventional covalent or host–guest strategies suffer from poor reversibility and limited adaptability. Here, atomically precise heterometallic nanoclusters undergo organic acid–induced coordination twisting and core symmetry breaking, dynamically modulating their coordination environment for enantiomeric resolution. Chiral amino acids stabilize cluster chirality, yielding enantiopure clusters matching the amino acid configuration. These clusters exhibit strong chiroptical responses, including circular dichroism (CD) and circularly polarized luminescence (CPL), enabling reliable quantification of enantiomeric excess (ee) across 20 chiral acids. Significantly, the system can be rationally regenerated and reused, enabling multiple cycles of consistent, quantitative chiral sensing. Mechanistic studies reveal that recognition arises from electrostatic preconcentration, followed by coordination and hydrogen bonding, which lock substrate configurations and transfer chiral information. Furthermore, threonine‐modified chiral heterometallic clusters also enable enantioselective coordination‐driven drug sensing, exemplified by ibuprofen recognition via ligand exchange, as unambiguously confirmed by single‐crystal X‐ray analysis. This work establishes a versatile coordination‐driven platform for high‐throughput, real‐time, and quantitative enantioselective sensing, highlighting the potential of atomically precise clusters for chiral recognition and drug analysis.","tp":"手性光传感","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"手性酸和药物的快速、可重复、定量识别仍是挑战，传统共价或主-客体策略可逆性差、适应性有限。本研究利用原子级精确的异金属纳米簇，在有机酸诱导下发生配位扭曲和核心对称性破缺，动态调控配位环境实现对映体分辨。手性氨基酸稳定簇手性后，可实现多模式手性光学传感和对映选择性药物识别，为手性药物质量控制和手性分子检测提供了高灵敏可逆平台。","aip":1},{"t":"分子配合物中相干自旋的光学检测核磁共振研究","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02539-0","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分子核磁共振","kp":["[光学检测NMR]: 分子配合物核自旋光学初始化与检测"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究在分子络合物中实现了光学检测核磁共振(ODMR)技术，成功探测到相干自旋信号。该方法将核磁共振的检测能力拓展到单分子尺度，为化学分析、量子信息处理和自旋量子比特操控提供了新平台，有望推动纳米级量子传感技术的发展。","ot":"Optically detected nuclear magnetic resonance of coherent spins in a molecular complex","b":"Nuclear magnetic resonance is a powerful tool for applications ranging from chemical analysis to quantum information processing. Achieving optical initialization and detection of molecular nuclear spins promises new opportunities—including improved nuclear magnetic resonance signals at low magnetic field, sensitivity down to the single-molecule level and full access to atomically precise molecular architectures for quantum technologies. Here we report the optical read-out of coherently controlled nuclear spins in a europium-based molecular crystal. By harnessing ultranarrow optical transitions, we achieve the optical initialization and detection of nuclear spin states. Through radio-frequency driving, we address two nuclear quadrupole resonances, characterized by narrow inhomogeneous linewidths and a distinct correlation with the optical transition frequency. We implement Rabi oscillations, spin echo and dynamical decoupling techniques, achieving nuclear spin quantum coherence with a lifetime of up to 2 ms. These results highlight the capabilities of optically detected nuclear magnetic resonance and underscore the promise of molecular nuclear spins for quantum information processing.","aip":1},{"t":"低碳微电网中多时长储能的在线调度与可解释参考学习","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003776?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微电网储能调度","dp":1,"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Online dispatch of multi-duration energy storage in low-carbon microgrid with explainable reference learning"},{"t":"一步法制备超疏水织物及其在恶劣条件下的稳定机械性能","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70857-7","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"超疏水织物","kp":["制备工艺[超疏水织物]: 一步法无PFAS无纳米颗粒","性能特点[织物]: 机械应力下稳定超疏水"],"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种一步法制备超疏水织物的工艺，使织物在恶劣条件下保持稳定的力学性能与持久疏水性。该制备方法简化了工艺流程，适用于户外防护、工业及特殊环境应用，解决了超疏水涂层耐磨性与耐久性不足的工程瓶颈。","ot":"One-step fabrication of superhydrophobic fabrics with stable mechanical performance in harsh conditions","b":"Developing robust water-repellent textiles is critical for outdoor, protective, and industrial applications. However, achieving long-lasting water repellency under mechanical stress remains a significant challenge. Conventional approaches typically rely on nanoparticle assemblies or PFAS-based finishes, which often detach or degrade when subjected to abrasion or harsh conditions. Here, we demonstrate a molecularly assembled robust superhydrophobic shell (MARS) technique that directly constructs an ordered, covalently bonded, fluorine-free silica shell on individual yarn fibers via a one-step process. MARS eliminates the need for discrete nanoparticles or fluorinated chemistries and is compatible with a wide range of natural and synthetic fibers. This fiber-level treatment maintains superhydrophobicity even after the fibers are woven or knitted into finished textiles, while preserving breathability and mechanical resilience. MARS combines biomimetic inspiration with practical, scalable fabrication to meet urgent performance needs. Unlike conventional coatings that progressively degrade, the permanently bonded MARS coating endures intensive abrasion, high-velocity water impacts, steam exposure, and extreme temperature cycles. By addressing key challenges such as PFAS restrictions and the fragility of traditional coatings, the MARS method paves the way for next-generation water-repellent fabrics that balance sustainability and high performance across outdoor, protective, medical, and industrial applications."},{"t":"应对能源困境：整合技术创新和数字化转型以获得可持续解决方案","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003697?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源数字化","sc":1.7,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"体积变化材料中光诱导极化子驱动的多尺度相成核","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02521-w","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Materials","as":"该研究揭示了光诱导极化子驱动多尺度相变成核的微观机制。通过超快激光激发功能材料中的载流子，极化子（电子/空穴与晶格畸变耦合的准粒子）在体积变化型相变材料中充当成核位点，触发从原子尺度到介观尺度的级联相变过程。研究利用超快光谱与原位结构表征手段，追踪了极化子形成、聚集及相界扩展的全过程动力学。这一机制突破了传统热驱动相变的扩散限制，实现了纳秒甚至皮秒级的相变切换，为开发新型光控光电器件、非易失性存储及固态制冷材料提供了全新物理基础，具有显著的工程应用潜力。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光致极化子相变","kp":["[相核驱动]: 光致极化子驱动多尺度相成核","[表征方法]: 飞秒X射线追踪非平衡动力学"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Multiscale phase nucleation driven by photoinduced polarons in a volume-changing material","b":"Ultrafast control of functional materials by light is key for developing optoelectronic devices. Still, the mechanisms by which microscopic photoinduced excitations evolve into a macroscopic phase transformation remain poorly understood, partly due to the experimental challenges of isolating multiscale electronic and structural dynamics. Here we use femtosecond X-ray techniques to track the non-equilibrium dynamics leading to macroscopic transformation in a ferroelastic charge-transfer Prussian blue analogue. The experimental data evidence a sequence of phenomena. The initial electronic excitation leads to reverse Jahn–Teller distortion within 50 fs, causing intermetallic charge-transfer polarons within 200 fs. Polarons generate considerable lattice strain and trigger phase nucleation within 60 ps. This elastically driven cooperativity, launched by the photoinduced polarons, offers an efficient route to the generation and stabilization of photoinduced phases in many volume-changing materials."},{"t":"具有高持续活性的多环D-立体专一性水解酶二聚体","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521611?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"立体选择性水解酶","kp":["[酶工程]: 多环D-立体专一水解酶二聚体高持续活性"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究设计并表征了一种新型多环D-立体特异性水解酶二聚体，展现出优异的催化持续性和操作稳定性。传统酶催化剂在工业条件下常因结构失稳而快速失活，该工作通过合理的蛋白质工程策略，构建了具有多环拓扑结构的水解酶二聚体，显著增强了构象刚性。实验表明，该酶在高温、有机溶剂及反复循环使用条件下仍保持高立体选择性催化活性，D-构型产物对映体过量值维持在极高水平。这种设计思路为生物催化领域解决了稳定性瓶颈，在药物中间体合成、手性化学品绿色制造等场景具有广阔应用前景。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Multicyclic D‐Stereospecific Hydrolase Dimer With High Sustained Activity","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Enzymes are powerful catalysts for selective transformations but often suffer from limited stability under operational conditions such as elevated temperature or the presence of organic cosolvents. While sequence‐based strategies have been widely used to improve stability, chemical protein engineering enables modifications beyond the natural amino acid repertoire thereby offering complementary routes to tailor enzyme function and robustness. Here, we apply the in situ cyclization of proteins (INCYPRO) to a D‐stereospecific hydrolase with low intrinsic thermal stability. Site‐specific macrocyclization substantially improved resilience to heat and cosolvent stress. Unexpectedly, we discovered a cross‐linked protein dimer with enhanced activity and thermal stability. The complex structure was confirmed by x‐ray crystallography. Extending the INCYPRO approach, we engineered a multicyclic enzyme dimer with a total of four cross‐linking sites, which not only retained high activity under benign conditions but also outperformed the wild‐type under stress. Our findings establish protein macrocyclization as a versatile strategy to stabilize both monomeric and multimeric enzymes, providing a powerful route to robust biocatalysts."},{"t":"基于质量光度法的聚合物分子量分布单分子级表征","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202518383?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物分子量表征","kp":["[聚合物表征]: 质量光度法单分子级分子量分布测量"],"as":"该研究提出了一种逐分子水平表征聚合物分子量分布的新方法，突破传统聚合物分析工具（如体积排阻色谱SEC、质谱MALDI-TOF）的分辨率与精度限制。传统方法在测量时对分子量进行统计平均，难以捕捉链末端基团、支化结构及共聚物序列分布的精细差异。新技术通过单分子检测平台，对聚合物混合物中每条分子链进行独立质量测量与统计，直接构建真实分子量分布曲线，可分辨传统方法无法区分的微小异质性。该方法对精准合成的高分子材料研发、生物医药用聚合物质量控制等领域具有重要意义。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Molecule by Molecule Characterization of a Polymer Molecular Mass Distribution via Mass Photometry","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Polymer analysis tools form the backbone of modern polymer technology. However, traditional tools like size exclusion chromatography (SEC) fractionate based on hydrodynamic volume. This analysis assumes all molecules in a fraction are identical, an increasingly strained assumption for complex macromolecules. Importantly, characterization of the molecular mass distribution (MMD) is typically reduced to reporting several moments of the MMD, like number and weight‐averaged molecular masses, a significant loss of information. In contrast, a molecule‐by‐molecule elucidation of the full MMD would yield an extremely informative new perspective on macromolecule diversity, while eliminating limitations and time commitment associated with fractionation. Here, we show that mass photometry (MP), whereby the interferometric scattering signal of individual molecules is correlated with mass, of high‐molecular weight polyethylene oxide (PEO) allows elucidation of the full MMD. In some cases, multiple subpopulations are directly revealed. This effort provides the first single‐molecule measurement of the MMD of a synthetic polymer, bypassing artifacts introduced by bulk‐scale measurements. Further, we show that the dispersity (Đ) can be precisely determined in a manner that is largely calibration‐free, allowing determination of Đ in functional polymers where monodisperse standards are unavailable. Integration of MP with SEC conspicuously shows how multiple populations are present in collected fractions."},{"t":"建筑冷水机组与热泵系统建模方法：数字孪生应用背景下的系统性综述","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002849?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"热泵数字孪生","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":2.5,"d":2.5,"t":2.5},"ot":"Modeling methods for chiller and heat pump systems in buildings: A systematic review in the context of digital twin appl"},{"t":"低成本低能耗的微型强磁体","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00851-y","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"微型磁体","as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":2.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Mighty mini-magnet is low in cost and light on energy use"},{"t":"微纳表面工程与性能调控：黑硅在先进材料应用中的启示","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01448D","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"黑硅表面工程","kp":["[黑硅]: CMOS兼容微纳表面工程模型材料"],"as":"该研究聚焦微纳表面工程与性能调控，以黑硅为典型案例，探讨微纳加工技术如何实现材料表面的精确修饰。通过在硅表面构建微纳米级结构，可显著改变材料的光学、润湿性、摩擦等本征特性，使其在光电探测器、抗反射涂层、生物传感器等领域展现出独特优势。研究系统分析了表面形貌参数与功能性能之间的映射关系，为功能性微纳表面的理性设计提供了理论框架与工程指引，对推进纳米制造从实验室走向规模化应用具有参考价值。","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Micro–nano surface engineering and property modulation: insights from black silicon for advanced material applications","b":"The advancement of micro–nano fabrication techniques has enabled the precise modification of material surfaces, allowing for unique physical and chemical properties to emerge, catering to diverse application requirements. Black silicon, a well-studied material compatible with CMOS technology, provides an excellent model for exploring the overall properties of micro–nano surface morphologies. This review systematically investigates the morphology fabricated by five mainstream synthesis methods for black silicon, offering an in-depth analysis of the underlying mechanisms and the impact of key parameters on surface morphology. In addition to structural features, this review discusses the formation of surface chemical bonds and their roles in modulating surface energy, wettability, and electronic passivation. Through this exploration, we examine how specific morphologies yield distinct physical and chemical properties that drive a wide range of applications, from photodetection to sensing and biomedical technologies. Key challenges of black silicon are discussed, including cost, mass production, and defect control, etc. This review aims to serve as a roadmap for researchers, guiding further advancements not only in black silicon but also in the broader field of nanomaterials, paving the way for breakthroughs across various domains of modern nanotechnology."},{"t":"墨西哥的能源十字路口：应对复杂的转型","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001588?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源转型路","sc":1.6,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":1.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"膜相关的 Rhes-Slc4a7 复合物协调隧道纳米管形成和突变亨廷顿蛋白扩散","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea1226?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Tunneling nanotubes (TNTs) are membranous structures that mediate intercellular transfer of proteins, including the pathogenic mutant Huntingtin (mHTT) protein in Huntington disease (HD). We previously identified the ras homolog enriched in the striatum (Rhes) as a key regulator of TNT formation and mHTT transmission; however, the molecular components underlying this process remained unknown. Here, using unbiased liquid chromatography–tandem mass spectrometry analysis of membrane-associated Rhes complexes, we identify Slc4a7 (solute carrier family 4 member 7), an intracellular pH sensor, as a top membrane-binding partner of Rhes. Functional studies revealed that small interfering RNA–mediated depletion or pharmacological inhibition of Slc4a7 substantially reduced Rhes-induced TNT formation and suppressed mHTT intercellular transfer. Mechanistically, Rhes directly interacts with Slc4a7 through both its amino- and carboxyl-terminal domains and modulates intracellular pH to facilitate TNT formation. This interaction does not depend on the transporter activity of Slc4a7. However, inhibition of Rhes farnesylation—a lipid modification that anchors Rhes to the membrane—disrupts its binding to Slc4a7 and abolishes TNT formation. Slc4a7 knock-out mice showed markedly reduced cell-to-cell transmission of mHTT in the striatum in vivo. Together, these findings uncover a previously unrecognized Rhes-Slc4a7 signaling axis critical for TNT-mediated mHTT transmission and highlight Slc4a7 as a potential therapeutic target to limit disease spread in HD."},{"t":"CARMIL 二聚化、自抑制和加帽蛋白结合的机制","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb4543?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Capping protein (CP) regulates actin-based motility by blocking monomer exchange at the filament barbed end. Several proteins, including CARMIL, bind CP and allosterically weaken its affinity for the barbed end. CARMIL comprises pleckstrin homology (PH), leucine-rich repeat (LRR), helical dimerization (HD), CP-binding region (CBR), and proline-rich (PR) domains, but their roles in CP regulation remain unclear. We show that CARMIL1 is partially autoinhibited, with CBR (CARMIL1\n                    961–1046\n                    ) displaying greater uncapping activity than CARMIL1\n                    1–1046\n                    . A structure of CP-bound CARMIL1\n                    1–1046\n                    reveals a dimeric assembly, with PH-LRR on a plane flanked by HD and CBR-bound CP. A motif connecting HD to CBR-CP, the “antenna,” binds at the dimer LRR-LRR interface. An antenna mutant disrupting this interaction partially relieves autoinhibition in vitro. In CARMIL1 knockout cells, expression of the antenna mutant increases cell area, while deleting the myosin-I–binding PR domain induces membrane spikes. The results inform mechanisms of CARMIL dimerization, autoinhibition, and coordination of CP and myosin-I activities in cells."},{"t":"磁耦合将软超材料中的随机卡扣转化为有序序列","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec3182?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磁耦合软超材料","kp":["[软超材料]: 磁耦合弹性实现有序序列屈曲编程"],"dp":1,"as":"机械超材料通过弹性不稳定单元的级联翻转实现多步骤、可编程的形变响应，但随机翻转顺序难以实现可控的程序化行为。该研究提出利用磁性耦合策略，将软磁体嵌入超材料单元，通过外加磁场调控单元间的磁相互作用，从而将无序的翻转过程转化为有序的序列化变形。这种方法使超材料能够在预设路径上实现逐级、定向的多态切换，显著提升了变形过程的可控性与可预测性。该成果为可编程物质、软体机器人、可展开结构等领域提供了新的设计范式，展示了多物理场耦合驱动智能超材料的潜力。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Magnetic coupling transforms random snapping into ordered sequences in soft metamaterials","b":"Mechanical metamaterials achieve multistep, programmable responses through sequential deformation driven by snapping instabilities, yet these sequences are typically governed by unavoidable imperfections, resulting in random and uncontrollable behavior. Here, we harness intra- and interlayer magnetic interactions coupled with elasticity to reprogram the ordering of sequential buckling instabilities in kirigami-inspired soft magnetic metamaterials. In single-layer systems, intralayer coupling among magnetized units produces random snapping sequences but generates strongly nonlinear-spiked force-displacement responses with pronounced hysteresis, in contrast to the simultaneous buckling of unmagnetized sheets. In multilayer assemblies, interlayer magnetic interactions trigger chain reaction–like propagation, transforming randomness into robust, directional snapping across structures. This mechanism establishes a paradigm for deterministic, multistep mechanical responses without continuously applied fields and opens avenues for adaptive materials in energy dissipation, waveguiding, reconfigurable soft robotics, and biomedical devices.","aip":1},{"t":"MOFs作为共价适应性网络新催化平台：催化与增强的融合","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8126769?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF催化平台","kp":["催化剂[可逆共价网络]: MOF负载TBD碱催化键交换"],"as":"研究提出将金属有机框架（MOFs）作为共价适应性网络（CANs）的新型催化平台。CANs是一类通过动态共价键交换实现拓扑重排的聚合物网络，兼具热固性材料的力学强度与可重塑、可回收特性。MOFs凭借其高比表面积、可调控的活性位点和结构可设计性，能够高效催化键交换反应（如酯交换、二硫键交换），精确调控交换动力学和触发温度。该策略有望解决CANs在实际应用中催化效率低、触发温度难以精确控制等瓶颈，为开发可修复、可回收的高性能智能聚合物材料提供新范式。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"MOFs as New Catalytic Platform for Covalent Adaptable Networks: Catalysis Meets Reinforcement","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Catalysis of bond exchange reactions is a versatile route to adjust kinetics and onset temperature of bond exchange reactions in covalent adaptable networks (CANs). In this work, we introduce a novel heterogeneous catalytic platform for CANs by immobilizing bases of low molecular weight on metal organic frameworks (MOFs). Specifically, the base 1,5,7‐triazabicyclo(4.4.0)dec‐5‐ene (TBD) was coordinated on the MOF UiO‐66. The obtained catalyst UiO‐TBD benefits from the high loading capacity of the MOF and exhibits similar catalytic activity in accelerating thiol–thioester exchange reactions in dynamic photopolymers compared to free TBD while outperforming non‐porous heterogeneous systems using ZrO\n                    2\n                    nanoparticles as a carrier. Moreover, it demonstrates a 37% higher thermal stability based on decreased volatility relative to free TBD. Beyond its catalytic role, UiO‐TBD simultaneously reinforces the material, leading to enhanced mechanical performance and reduced creep. This approach offers broad applicability, driven by its modularity and scalability. UiO‐TBD represents a two‐in‐one additive that not only catalyzes exchange reactions in CANs but also strengthens the network, opening new opportunities for multifunctional catalyst design in (dynamic) polymer systems."},{"t":"Retromer 复合物对抗 mu 阿片受体的溶酶体下调","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx8715?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"A critical homeostatic mechanism for regulating G protein–coupled receptor (GPCR) activity is agonist-induced GPCR endocytosis and trafficking to the lysosome for proteolytic down-regulation. The mu opioid receptor (MOR) is a notable example of this type of cellular regulation, where prolonged exposure to high-efficacy opioid drugs causes MOR to traffic to the lysosome. Here, we used functional genomics to identify cellular proteins that control MOR lysosomal down-regulation. We found that the central regulator of MOR postendocytic trafficking is the Retromer complex, which rescues MOR from opioid-induced down-regulation by promoting MOR recycling from endosomes to the plasma membrane. Critically, MOR accesses the Retromer recycling pathway through its noncanonical bileucine recycling motif, and this mechanism controls how MOR is regulated following chronic exposure to opioid drugs. Additionally, we show that this bileucine pathway for Retromer-based recycling is present in other classes of membrane proteins including the glucose transporter GLUT4."},{"t":"真核 RNA 聚合酶机制的活细胞单分子动力学","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.ads0960?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Eukaryotic gene expression is orchestrated by RNA polymerases (RNAPI, II, and III) and associated factors, yet their real-time dynamics remain obscure. Using single-molecule tracking in living yeast, we quantified the kinetics of 58 proteins encompassing three RNAP machineries. RNAPI and RNAPIII preinitiation complexes (PICs) engage in long-lived chromatin interactions, contrasting with transient RNAPII PICs. We further report kinetics of RNAPII-associated factors for elongation, histone modification, C-terminal domain (CTD) modification, RNA processing, and termination. Many elongation factors show brief rather than persistent association, suggesting dynamic interactions with factor exchange and allowing a potential repertoire of regulatory events. CTD truncation reduces U1 small nuclear ribonucleoprotein residence time and intron retention in ribosomal protein genes, providing insights into cotranscriptional splicing. Our findings establish a framework of dynamic interactions of RNAP machineries."},{"t":"过冷锑的液体反常行为与脆性","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531605123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"过冷锑液态","kp":["相变材料[超快开关]: 单原子锑","[过冷液态]: 锑液态异常与脆性关联可逆结晶"],"dp":1,"as":"研究聚焦锑（Sb）基相变材料在过冷液态下的反常性质与脆性特征。基于Ge-Sb-Te等体系的相变材料广泛应用于非易失性存储（如PCM存储器），其快速可逆晶态-非晶态相变能力源于液态的特殊性质。研究通过实验与模拟揭示了过冷液态锑在密度、粘度、结构有序性等方面偏离常规液体行为的异常现象，分析了其与相变动力学之间的关联。深入理解液态反常性质对优化相变存储材料的写入速度、数据保持力和循环寿命具有指导意义。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Liquid anomalies and fragility of supercooled antimony","b":"Phase-change materials (PCMs) based on group IV, V, and VI elements, such as Ge, Sb, and Te, exhibit distinctive liquid-state features, including thermodynamic anomalies and unusual dynamical properties, which are believed to play a key role in their fast and reversible crystallization behavior. Antimony (Sb), a monoatomic PCM with ultrafast switching capabilities, stands out as the only elemental member of this group for which the properties of the liquid and supercooled states have so far remained unknown. In this work, we use large-scale molecular dynamics simulations with a neural network potential trained on first-principles data to investigate the liquid, supercooled, and amorphous phases of Sb across a broad pressure–temperature range. We uncover clear signatures of anomalous behavior, including a density maximum and nonmonotonic thermodynamic response functions, which are described by a two-state model based on the structural evolution of the liquid. Moreover, extrapolation of the viscosity to the glass transition, based on configurational and excess entropies, indicates that Sb is a highly fragile material. Our results present a compelling case for the connection between the liquid-state properties of PCMs and their unique ability to combine high amorphous-phase stability with ultrafast crystallization."},{"t":"液态金属在可重构生物电子学中的应用","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521174?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"液态金属生物电子","kp":["[可重构生物电子]: 液态金属实现主动可重构自适应界面"],"dp":1,"as":"综述探讨了液态金属在可重构生物电子学中的应用前景。传统软生物电子器件多为被动柔性，而液态金属材料（如EGaIn合金）兼具高导电性、极端可变形性和生物相容性，可实现器件的主动重构——包括动态形状变化、自适应贴合组织和可编程功能切换。文章讨论了液态金属在可拉伸电极、神经接口、可编程电路和自修复器件中的创新应用，并分析了表面氧化层调控、微流控封装和长期生物相容性等关键挑战。该方向有望推动新一代能与生物组织动态交互的智能植入器件发展。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Liquid Metals for Reconfigurable Bioelectronics","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Future bioelectronic technologies must evolve beyond passive softness toward active reconfigurability, enabling intelligent interfaces that adapt to dynamic physiological and environmental changes. However, the inherently static architectures of most current devices hinder such adaptive reconfiguration or performance tuning, leading to a functional mismatch between dynamic biological systems and static electronic architectures. To bridge this gap, reconfigurable bioelectronics have emerged as a transformative paradigm capable of dynamically modulating their physical form and function in response to external or physiological stimuli. Liquid metals (LMs)—combining deformability, tunable stiffness, high electrical/thermal conductivity, multi‐stimuli responsiveness, and biocompatibility—offer a unique material platform for realizing intrinsic reconfigurability without structural complexity. By leveraging their material‐level reconfigurability, LM‐based bioelectronics achieve robust performance, versatile functionality, and dynamic biointegration, enabling multifunctional diagnostic, therapeutic, and interactive systems. This review provides a comprehensive overview of LM‐based reconfigurable bioelectronics, encompassing fundamental material properties, fabrication and design strategies, and major reconfiguration mechanisms. It further highlights emerging biomedical applications, ranging from implantable and wearable systems to soft robotics and haptic interfaces, and discusses key challenges and future directions for advancing LM‐based bioelectronics toward clinically viable, intelligent, and multifunctional platforms."},{"t":"短期电力需求预测与可解释AI的结合：建筑能源应用综述","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003107?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电力负荷预测","kp":["[综述]: 短期电力需求预测与可解释AI结合"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":2.0},"ot":"Linking short-term electricity demand forecasting and explainable AI: A review for building energy applications"},{"t":"通过原位成像照亮通过肺-心轴传播的铁死亡会加剧心血管疾病","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7388558?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Cigarette smoke (CS)‐induced lung injury is a risk factor for atherosclerotic cardiovascular diseases (ASCVDs), with both diseases sharing a common pathogenesis that encompasses ferroptosis. Studies have shown that ferroptosis can propagate in a wave‐like manner across cell populations; however, whether and how this propagation participates in the cross‐organ communication between lung injury and ASCVDs remains unknown. Here we developed two near‐infrared fluorescent probes, Cy‐F‐1 and Cy‐F‐2, with lung‐targeting and plaque‐targeting properties, respectively. Utilizing in vivo molecular fluorescence imaging, we explored the ferroptosis communication between lung injury and atherosclerosis (AS) by directly observing the dynamics of the ferroptosis marker, Fe\n                    2+\n                    . Imaging results found that upon exposure to CS, ferroptosis was initiated and propagated across the lung to aortic plaque regions in AS rats. In combination with biochemical and transcriptomic analyses, we have for the first time mapped a ferroptosis‐mediated signaling network linking both diseases: CS‐induced ROS accumulation → Nrf2‐GPX4 axis destruction → labile iron pool expansion → lung epithelial cells ferroptosis → lung inflammation injury → TNF‐α/IL‐1β/IL‐6 release → foam cell ferroptosis → ABCA1/ABCG1 downregulation → exacerbated AS. This study discovers the wave‐guided role of ferroptosis in the crosstalk between lung injury and AS, revealing the molecular mechanism of smoking‐aggravated ASCVDs."},{"t":"实验室培育的食道恢复了猪的吞咽能力","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00936-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"张拉整体和折纸的不变对偶力学","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519138123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Statics and kinematics are often viewed as intertwined branches of mechanics. The principle of virtual work indicates this interconnection: For a system in static equilibrium, the total work performed by all forces during any virtual displacement must equal zero. In this work, we make the interplay between statics and kinematics more explicit by focusing on two engineering structures—tensegrity and origami. Specifically, we demonstrate a quantitative duality relationship between the states of self-stress of tensegrity and the infinitesimal mechanisms of origami. More importantly, we show that this duality remains invariant under nondegenerate linear transformations applied to the tensegrity and origami configurations. Furthermore, we establish that the stability property of tensegrity, particularly superstability, is preserved under such transformations. We apply the invariant duality theory to tensegrity and origami structures with prismatic and polyhedral geometries, illustrating its broad applicability. Such duality is also applicable to the fast generation of irregular, three-dimensional architected materials and structures.","tp":"张拉整体力学","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"静力学与运动学常被视为力学中交织的两个分支，虚功原理揭示了二者的内在联系。本研究聚焦张拉整体结构和折纸两种工程结构，展示了二者状态序列之间的定量对偶关系。研究发现张拉整体的自应力状态与折纸的折叠运动学之间存在不变对偶映射，为力学超材料设计、可展开结构拓扑优化和软机器人机构设计提供了统一的数学框架和理论工具。"},{"t":"空间电荷区本征缺陷补偿使无镉酮锌矿太阳能电池效率达13.9%","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00550K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌黄锡矿太阳能电池","kp":["效率[锌黄锡矿电池]: 13.9%认证","缓冲层[锌黄锡矿电池]: 无镉ZnxSn1-xO","[缺陷补偿]: 空间电荷区本征缺陷补偿"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究解决了无镉ZnxSn1-xO（ZTO）缓冲层在CZTSSe太阳能电池中空间电荷区缺陷补偿的关键问题。传统CdS缓冲层含毒性镉元素，ZTO作为替代方案因界面缺陷导致效率受限。作者发现通过调控空间电荷区的本征缺陷补偿机制，可有效钝化界面复合中心，显著降低开路电压损失。该方法使无镉CZTSSe薄膜太阳能电池效率进一步提升，推动了绿色光伏技术的实用化进程。","sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.5,"d":8.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Intrinsic defect compensation in the space charge region enables cadmium-free kesterite solar cells to achieve 13.9% cer","b":"Cadmium-free ZnxSn1−xO (ZTO) buffer layers are an attractive alternative to conventional CdS in Cu2ZnSn(S,Se)4 (CZTSSe) thin-film solar cells, especially with advantages of Cd-related toxicity elimination and parasitic absorption mitigation at short wavelengths. However, the performance of ZTO-based CZTSSe devices has lagged behind that of CdS-involved counterparts, largely due to high-density detrimental defects and non-ideal band alignment at the CZTSSe/ZTO heterojunction. Here, we develop a junction heat-treatment process that, upon thermal activation, selectively drives Zn cations to diffuse from the ZTO buffer into the CZTSSe absorber along the chemical potential gradient. This diffusion-driven Zn incorporation compensates for intrinsic bulk defects such as CuZn and VCu, particularly in the space charge region. The cation diffusion also contributes to a more favorable conduction-band offset, prolonged minority-carrier lifetime, and extended carrier-diffusion length. Collectively, this results in optimization of carrier dynamics with simultaneously enhanced carrier separation, extraction, and transport efficiencies. As a result, we achieve an efficiency of 14.39% (certified at 13.90%) and a large-area (1.03 cm2) efficiency of 12.24%, representing the highest-to-date efficiency for Cd-free CZTSSe solar cells."},{"t":"界面纳米结构实现集成化低极化可逆质子陶瓷电池","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70850?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"质子陶瓷电池","kp":["[质子陶瓷电池]: 界面纳米结构实现低极化可逆运行"],"as":"质子陶瓷电池（PCC）的性能瓶颈通常源自氧电极与电解质之间的界面。本研究通过界面纳米结构化策略，在电极-电解质界面构建连续、紧密结合的纳米层，显著降低界面极化电阻并提升可逆运行能力。该方法实现了集成化电极制备，避免了传统多层共烧结导致的界面退化，为高效可逆质子陶瓷燃料电池和电解池的工程化提供了新路径。界面工程而非材料本体优化成为提升PCC耐久性和功率密度的关键。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interfacial Nanostructuring Enables Integrated, Low‐Polarization Reversible Protonic Ceramic Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Interfaces often impose the practical limits of protonic ceramic cells, where the oxygen electrode–electrolyte junction simultaneously governs polarization losses, tolerance to steam, and mechanical stability during reversible operation. Conventional porous electrodes typically rely on discontinuous point contacts and chemically reactive interfaces, which exacerbate interfacial resistance and promote delamination. Overcoming these coupled limitations requires an interlayer that is thin and conductive yet continuous, chemically compatible, and structurally integrated interlayer. Here, we report a pulsed laser deposition enabled interfacial nanostructuring strategy that forms a dense, nanocrystalline Pr\n                    0.5\n                    La\n                    0.5\n                    BaCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    5+δ\n                    interlayer directly on a chemically robust BaZr\n                    0.8\n                    Y\n                    0.2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    electrolyte. This interlayer establishes a conformal contact and a defect‐enriched reaction zone beneath a porous PLBC oxygen electrode, strengthening the electrode–electrolyte junction while preserving gas accessibility. The engineered interface increases interfacial bonding strength by threefold and substantially reduces interfacial polarization. As a result, the cells deliver peak power densities of 1.16 W cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    at 600°C and exhibit stable steam electrolysis operation for ∼1000 h under 0.3–0.7 atm steam, maintaining steady operando impedance at 1.30 V with faradaic efficiency exceeding 92%. These results establish interfacial nanostructuring as an effective strategy to construct structurally integrated, low‐polarization electrode–electrolyte interfaces for versatile electrochemical devices.","aip":1},{"t":"从早期分化的文昌鱼 Asymmetron lucayanum 深入了解头索动物基因组和基因进化","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521280123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cephalochordates (amphioxus or lancelet) are considered as living proxies for ancestral chordates due to their key phylogenetic position and slow evolutionary rate. The genomes of living amphioxus thus can help to reveal the genetic basis shaping the evolutionary transition from nonvertebrate animals to vertebrates. To gain a comprehensive understanding of the genome architecture in amphioxus, we generated a chromosome-anchored genome assembly for\n                    Asymmetron lucayanum\n                    , representing the earliest diverging cephalochordate genus. We show that\n                    Asymmetron\n                    has an enlarged genome compared to those of the other four cephalochordate genomes decoded so far (all in the genus\n                    Branchiostoma\n                    ), caused by pervasive expansions of intergenic transposable elements (TEs). Nevertheless, both macrosynteny and microsynteny remain highly conserved between\n                    Asymmetron\n                    and\n                    Branchiostoma\n                    , enabling reconstruction of the ancestral genomic architecture of the cephalochordate lineage for tracing genome evolutionary processes during deuterostome and chordate diversification. Integration of developmental transcriptomic data further reveals that selective constraints on cotranscriptional regulation underline the maintenance of the conserved microsynteny blocks among cephalochordate species. We also examine the evolutionary history of the\n                    Hox\n                    cluster in cephalochordates and vertebrates, and identify species-specific inversions and TE invasions at this locus in both\n                    Asymmetron\n                    and\n                    Branchiostoma\n                    . Finally, we survey key molecular building blocks underlying both innate and adaptive immunity (e.g.,\n                    TLR\n                    ,\n                    NLR\n                    , MHC, and\n                    RAG\n                    ) and uncover their evolutionary dynamics and plausible ancestry in chordates. Taken together, our findings illuminate the genome and gene evolution of cephalochordates and provide valuable resources for understanding the early evolution of chordates and the origin of vertebrates."},{"t":"In2O3-CNT催化剂通过空位稳定实现超500小时稳定CO2加氢制甲醇","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7041?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2制甲醇催化剂","kp":["稳定性[CO₂制甲醇]: >500小时","催化剂体系[CO₂加氢]: In₂O₃-CNT物理复合","稳定机制[催化]: 空位稳定化抑制In³⁺过还原"],"dp":1,"as":"氧化铟（In₂O₃）是CO₂加氢制甲醇的有前景催化剂，但面临活性相失活和稳定性不足的难题。本研究将In₂O₃负载于碳纳米管（CNT）上，通过载体-金属强相互作用稳定氧化铟活性相，实现了超过500小时的稳定运行，甲醇选择性显著提升。CNT的导电性和结构特性有效抑制了铟的过度还原和团聚，为CO₂资源化制取绿色甲醇的工业化提供了兼具高活性与长寿命的催化体系设计思路。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"In2O3-CNT catalysts enable >500-hour stable CO2-to-methanol hydrogenation via vacancy stabilization","b":"Indium oxide (In\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    ) is a promising catalyst for carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ) hydrogenation to methanol but suffers from rapid deactivation due to localized over-reduction of surface In\n                    3+\n                    species into inactive metallic In\n                    0\n                    near hydrogen (H\n                    2\n                    ) activation sites. Here, we exploit a proton-electron dual-transfer mechanism through a physically integrated In\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    -carbon nanotube (In\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    -CNT) system, achieving simultaneous enhancement of catalytic performance and durability. The optimal In\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    -CNT system gives the highest methanol production rate of 1250.6 grams kilograms\n                    In2O3\n                    −1\n                    hour\n                    −1\n                    at 320°C. Particularly, the hybrid system maintains catalytic stability for &gt;500 hours, representing the highest durability among reported In\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    catalysts. Mechanistic studies and multiple characterization techniques reveal that the conductive CNT network regulates surface redox dynamics by facilitating electron transfer and redistribution. This process promotes the formation of oxygen vacancies for CO\n                    2\n                    activation while preventing localized electron accumulation and In\n                    0\n                    segregation. The CNT-mediated redox modulation stabilizes a dynamic InO\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    surface phase by balancing H\n                    2\n                    -induced reduction and CO\n                    2\n                    -driven oxidation, thereby sustaining catalytic activity over extended operation."},{"t":"铜集流体上原位形成的亲锂Li3Sb实现富LiF固态电解质界面以抑制枝晶","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70856?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属负极界面","kp":["集流体[锂金属电池]: Li3Sb@Cu","[SEI工程]: Li3Sb原位构建富LiF SEI无枝晶"],"dp":1,"as":"锂金属电池因高理论比能量被视为下一代储能技术，但锂枝晶生长和界面不稳定性严重制约循环寿命。本研究在铜集流体表面原位构建亲锂性Li₃Sb合金层，引导锂均匀沉积，并促成富LiF固态电解质界面（SEI）的形成。LiF具有高机械强度和离子电导率，可有效抑制枝晶穿透。该协同策略显著提升了无负极锂金属电池的库伦效率和循环稳定性，为高能量密度电池实用化提供了界面工程方案。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"In Situ‐Formed Lithiophilic Li3Sb on the Cu Current Collector Enables LiF‐Rich Solid Electrolyte Interphase for Dendrite","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium metal batteries (LMBs) hold great promise for next‑generation energy storage systems owing to their high theoretical energy density. However, their practical application is hindered by uncontrolled Li dendrite growth and unstable solid electrolyte interphase (SEI). Here, we design a Li\n                    3\n                    Sb‐modified Cu current collector (Li\n                    3\n                    Sb@Cu) that employs a synergistic dual‑function strategy to regulate uniform Li plating and engineer a robust LiF‐rich SEI. The Li\n                    3\n                    Sb interface is constructed in situ by electrochemical lithiation of Cu\n                    2\n                    Sb layer that is directly grown on Cu foil via a galvanic replacement reaction in SbCl\n                    3\n                    solution. Lithiophilic Li\n                    3\n                    Sb interlayer, with high delithiation potential and strong adhesion to the Cu substrate, significantly lowers the Li nucleation overpotential (34 mV at 1.0 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    ). Moreover, the Li\n                    3\n                    Sb preferentially adsorbs and catalytically decomposes fluoroethylene carbonate, producing a mechanically robust, LiF‐rich SEI. Consequently, the Li\n                    3\n                    Sb@Cu enables stable Li plating/stripping for over 800 h and achieves an average Coulombic efficiency of 98.2% over 180 cycles. When paired with a LiFePO\n                    4\n                    cathode, the full cell delivers a high discharge capacity of 137.4 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    and retains 96.6% capacity after 130 cycles at 1 C. This work presents a synergistically bifunctional interlayer on Cu foils that regulates Li nucleation and stabilizes the SEI for high‐performance LMBs.","aip":1},{"t":"在科学期刊中","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2593?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Highlights from the\n                    Science\n                    family of journals"},{"t":"在其他期刊中","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2594?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Editors’ selections from the current scientific literature"},{"t":"锂离子电池电极层面老化诊断的阻抗表征：批判性综述","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003880?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锂电池阻抗诊断","dp":1,"sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":2.5},"as":"","ot":"Impedance characterization for electrode-level aging diagnosis of lithium-ion battery: A critical review"},{"t":"不同存货核算方法下采购清洁电力索赔的影响","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00033-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"Joule","tg":"观点评论","b":"This paper characterizes the impacts of procuring clean electricity claims under different inventory accounting methods. It shows how a move to spatiotemporal matching requirements can increase impact, while still not guaranteeing that claims correspond to an equal increase in clean generation.","tp":"清洁电力核算","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":"本文探讨了在不同存货核算方法下，采购清洁电力索赔对碳排放与环境影响的实际效果。研究表明，若将采购机制转向时空匹配要求，虽能提升减碳影响力，但仍无法完全保证这些电力索赔等同于清洁能源发电量的等比例增长。该发现揭示了当前清洁电力采购机制的局限性。"},{"t":"基底外侧杏仁核中生长抑素+消退抑制印迹的鉴定","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511528123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The basolateral amygdala (BLA) is a key structure for processing threat and emotional information, and plays a key role in controlling the fear memory. Previous research has suggested that the extinction procedure generates a new memory that coexists with the original fear memory, and that interneurons play an important role in this process. However, the mechanisms that control the competing extinction and fear memories in BLA are not yet fully understood. To investigate these mechanisms, we developed a chemogenetic strategy that offers improved sensitivity and specificity for tagging neurons during defined behavioral epochs. This was achieved by genetically targeting GABAergic interneurons for activity-dependent manipulation, allowing us to directly probe the functional role of inhibitory ensembles recruited during fear extinction. We found that silencing extinction-tagged BLA neurons or stimulating fear acquisition-tagged BLA neurons, led to a relapse of fear memory. Additionally, we observed that silencing BLA GABAergic neurons, or more specifically, silencing the extinction-tagged BLA GABAergic neurons, restored fear expression after extinction, while inhibiting acquisition-tagged BLA GABAergic neurons did not impair fear memory retrieval. Our results indicate that specific inhibitory GABAergic BLA engrams are established during fear extinction, which interfere with existing fear memory-related neural circuits and suppress conditioned fear memory. These findings provide insights into the neural mechanisms underlying fear extinction and suggest that BLA GABAergic neurons are potential targets for therapeutic interventions in cognitive disorders such as posttraumatic stress disorder (PTSD)."},{"t":"为了拯救马达加斯加的海洋，我暂停了 11 年的攻读博士学位","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00401-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"下丘脑时钟控制昼夜疼痛","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.ady6455?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Chronic pain exhibits circadian rhythms in humans, but the mechanisms underlying such rhythmicity remain unclear. Here, we found daily oscillations in the nociceptive thresholds in a mouse model of neuropathic pain, driven by a rhythmic circuit from the master clock in the hypothalamus to the descending analgesia system. In the daytime (resting phase), higher vasoactive intestinal peptide (VIP) neuronal activity in suprachiasmatic nucleus (SCN\n                    VIP\n                    ) activates a signaling pathway involving the paraventricular nucleus (PVN) and the ventrolateral periaqueductal gray (vlPAG), ultimately increasing nociceptive sensitivity. At night (active phase), reduced SCN\n                    VIP\n                    neuronal activity decreases pain sensitivity through this polysynaptic circuit. This study identified a circuit for regulating pain rhythmicity that might be targeted to improve chronic pain management."},{"t":"火炬气制氢：将排放转化为能源的双重机遇——前瞻性综述","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"火炬气制氢","kp":["[主题]: 火炬气制氢(排放转能源)"],"dp":1,"sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"as":"","ot":"Hydrogen production from flare gas: a dual opportunity to turn emissions into energy - a prospective review"},{"t":"人类与其他动物有共同的声音偏好","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aea1202?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Many animals produce courtship sounds, and receivers prefer some sounds over others. Shared ancestry and convergent evolution may generate similarities in preference across species and underlie Darwin’s conjecture that some animals “have nearly the same taste for the beautiful as we have.” In this study, we show that humans share acoustic preferences with a range of animals, that the strength of human preferences correlates with that in other animals, and that humans respond faster when in agreement with animals. Furthermore, we found greatest agreement in preference for adorned, ancestral, and lower-frequency sounds. Humans’ music listening experience was associated with preferences. These results are consistent with theories arguing that biases in processing sculpt acoustic preferences, and they confirm Darwin’s century-old hunch about the conservation of aesthetics in nature."},{"t":"印度各邦在电力脱碳方面表现如何？地方层面基于消费的分解分析","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001473?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"印度电力脱碳","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"能源系统模型如何与现实世界的地平线悲剧保持一致？决策者短期影响","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003703?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源系统建模","sc":1.8,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"宿主衍生的硝酸盐促进大肠杆菌产生吲哚，从而驱动慢性肾病进展","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.ady5217?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Chronic kidney disease (CKD) is linked to an elevated fecal abundance of\n                    Enterobacteriaceae\n                    , but the ecological drivers of this shift and its impact on disease progression remain unclear. The uremic toxin indoxyl sulfate is produced from microbiota-derived indole in the liver. Here, we found that in mice with adenine-induced CKD, impaired clearance of indoxyl sulfate elevated mucosal expression of the gene encoding inducible nitric oxide synthase (iNOS). The resulting rise in luminal nitrate levels promoted\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    growth by means of nitrate respiration. Fecal microbiota from CKD patients generated more indole than feces of healthy controls during anaerobic culture, but only in the presence of nitrate. Nitrate enhanced indole production by\n                    E. coli\n                    , thereby worsening renal pathology in CKD mice, which was mitigated by iNOS inhibition."},{"t":"hBN莫尔量子阱中高效深紫外发光","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeb2095?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"hBN莫尔量子阱","kp":["[发光波段]: 深紫外","[量子阱]: hBN扭转摩尔量子阱","[结构]: 三维vdW单晶扭转界面"],"as":"研究报道在六方氮化硼（hBN）莫尔量子阱中实现了高效深紫外发光。通过扭转二维范德华半导体形成莫尔超晶格，为调控电子能带结构提供了前所未有的自由度。该成果突破传统深紫外发光材料的效率瓶颈，利用莫尔工程对激子和载流子行为的精细调控，有望推动紧凑型深紫外光源、量子光电器件及光刻技术的发展。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Highly efficient, deep-ultraviolet luminescence in hBN moiré quantum wells","b":"Twisted stacking of two-dimensional van der Waals (vdW) semiconductors creates moiré superlattices, which provides unprecedented control over quantum states and their light-matter interactions. We demonstrate that a simple twist interface between two single-crystalline bulks of hexagonal boron nitride (hBN) creates moiré quantum wells (QWs) embedded in a three-dimensional vdW structure. hBN moiré QWs strongly confine charge carriers under both optical excitation and electrical injection. Despite their indirect bandgap, they emit intense deep-ultraviolet luminescence in the extreme wavelength bands from 215 to 240 nanometers, exceeding that of state-of-the-art conventional aluminum gallium nitride (AlGaN) multiple QWs by more than an order of magnitude. Furthermore, the twist angle control allows wide tunability of luminescence energy and efficiency in moiré QWs."},{"t":"瑞典原始北方森林的碳储存量高于次生森林","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adz8554?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Boreal forests provide considerable global land carbon storage and uptake, but they are being rapidly transformed to managed secondary forests, with poorly quantified implications for ecosystem carbon storage. Here we present data from extensive mapping and field inventories of carbon storage in primary forests in Sweden and use multiple methods to show that primary forests store ~72% (70 to 74% across methods) more carbon than managed secondary forests in vegetation, deadwood, soils, and harvested wood products combined. Soils constitute both the largest carbon store and the largest difference between these forest types. The total carbon storage difference between primary and managed secondary forests is 2.7 to 8.0 times larger than previous estimates. Our results challenge estimated past and future contributions of boreal forest management to atmospheric carbon dioxide concentrations.","tp":"森林碳储","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"北方森林是全球重要的陆地碳汇，但正快速转变为次生管理林。本研究通过广泛测绘和实地调查瑞典森林的碳储量发现，原始森林在植被、枯木、土壤和采伐物中的碳储量比次生管理林高出约72%。研究强调了保护原始森林对于维持生态系统碳储量和减缓气候变化的重要不可替代性。"},{"t":"具有减弱金属-配体多重键特性的高自旋铁-膦亚胺和胂亚胺配合物","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523239?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The MEH\n                    2\n                    salts (M = Na, K; E = P, As) react with high spin (\n                    S\n                    = 2) PhB(AdIm)\n                    3\n                    FeCl (PhB(AdIm)\n                    3\n                    –\n                    = tris(3‐adamantylimidazol‐2‐ylidene)phenylborate) to afford the corresponding PhB(AdIm)\n                    3\n                    FePH\n                    2\n                    and PhB(AdIm)\n                    3\n                    FeAsH\n                    2\n                    complexes. Remarkably, these complexes can be deprotonated by benzyl potassium in the presence of equimolar 18‐crown–6 or 2,2,2‐crypt to provide the parent phosphinidene and arsinidene complexes, [PhB(AdIm)\n                    3\n                    FePH]\n                    –\n                    and [PhB(AdIm)\n                    3\n                    FeAsH]\n                    –\n                    . Structural and spectroscopic characterization, combined with computational investigations, provide evidence for multiconfigurational electronic structures in which the metal–ligand multiple bond character is attenuated by the high spin iron(II) center. Initial reactivity studies reveal the nucleophilic character of the pnictogenidene ligands, which provide phosphinophosphinidene and phosphinoarsinidene products with a chlorodiazaphospholidine electrophile.","tp":"铁配合物","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本摘要介绍了一项化学合成研究，探讨了具有减弱金属-配体多重键特性的高自旋铁-膦亚胺和胂亚胺配合物。研究人员利用钠或钾的盐类物质与高自旋铁络合物发生反应，成功制备出相应的铁基配合物。该研究为探索非传统化学键的特性以及开发新型过渡金属催化剂提供了重要的理论基础与实验数据。"},{"t":"令人费解的静电的罪魁祸首被发现","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2959?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Trace surface contamination determines how identical materials exchange charge"},{"t":"基于HfO₂的忆阻突触：非对称扩展p-n异质界面实现高能效神经形态计算","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec2324?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铪基忆阻突触","kp":["材料[忆阻突触]: p型Hf(Sr,Ti)O2构建非对称p-n异质界面"],"dp":1,"as":"针对AI硬件能耗飙升问题，研究者提出基于HfO₂的忆阻突触器件，创新性地引入非对称延伸的p-n异质界面结构。该设计通过界面工程调控载流子输运与离子迁移，使器件具备更接近生物突触的渐变电导调节（STDP等学习功能），显著降低脉冲能耗。p-n异质结的不对称分布增强了整流特性并抑制泄漏电流，有望推动高能效神经形态计算芯片的工程化。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"HfO2-based memristive synapses with asymmetrically extended p-n heterointerfaces for highly energy-efficient neuromorphi","b":"The escalating energy consumption of existing artificial intelligence hardware has become a serious global issue that demands immediate action. Neuromorphic computing offers promises to drastically reduce this footprint. Here, we introduce multicomponent p-type Hf(Sr,Ti)O\n                    2\n                    thin films for energy-efficient, resistive switching–based neuromorphic devices. We demonstrate interfacial memristors with ultralow switching currents (≤~10\n                    −8\n                    A), exceptional cycle-to-cycle and device-to-device uniformities, and retention &gt;10\n                    5\n                     s. They reveal hundreds of ultralow conductance levels with a modulation range of &gt;50 (without reaching any saturation) and reproducibly satisfy unsupervised learning rules. This performance originates from incorporating a self-assembled p-n heterointerface between p-type Hf(Sr,Ti)O\n                    2\n                    and n-type TiO\n                    x\n                    N\n                    y\n                    , resulting in a fully depleted space-charge layer asymmetrically extended into Hf(Sr,Ti)O\n                    2\n                    , a large built-in potential, and extremely low saturation current density under reverse bias. Ultralow conductance modulation is controlled by tuning p-n heterointerface’s energy-barrier height through electro-ionic charge migration. This materials-engineering strategy addresses energy consumption and variability in existing memristors, opening a pathway toward energy-efficient neuromorphic computing systems.","aip":1},{"t":"肠道微生物衍生的 N-酰基丝氨醇脂质塑造宿主餐后代谢稳态","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517314123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Although strong evidence links the gut microbiome to metabolic disease, the mechanisms linking microbiota to hormonal and metabolic responses to food are not well understood. After a meal, gut bacteria produce a wide array of small molecule, protein, and lipid metabolites originating from bacterial sources. Attributing physiological function to select gut microbe–derived metabolites is critical to understanding diet–microbe–host interactions, and to developing microbiome-inspired therapies to improve human health. Here, we have investigated the role of a poorly annotated class of gut microbiome-derived lipids called\n                    N\n                    -acyl amides in postprandial metabolic physiology. Here, we show that both bacterial production and provision of exogenous\n                    N\n                    -acyl amides reorganize host hormone-driven metabolic transition after a meal. Moreover,\n                    N\n                    -acyl amides exert broad effects on the meal- and circadian-related reorganization of gene expression, metabolic hormones, and gut microbiome composition. Collectively, these results demonstrate that microbiota-derived\n                    N\n                    -acyl amides play a physiologic role in postprandial metabolic homeostasis in the host."},{"t":"有机半导体薄膜晶界钉扎策略增强宽温域聚集态稳定性","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72850?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机半导体气敏","kp":["策略[有机半导体气敏]: 晶界钉扎协同优化宽温稳定性"],"dp":1,"as":"针对柔性有机半导体（OSC）气体传感器稳定性与灵敏度不足的瓶颈，提出晶界钉扎（grain boundary pinning）策略，通过调控活性层薄膜中晶界结构来增强有机分子的聚集态有序性。该策略有效提升了载流子迁移率与气体吸附-脱附动力学，改善传感器在室温下的选择性、响应速度与重复性，推动可穿戴电子、环境监测等柔性气体传感场景落地。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Grain Boundary Pinning Strategy for Enhanced Aggregate State in Organic Semiconductor Thin Films Toward Wide‐Temperature","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Flexible gas sensors based on organic semiconductors (OSCs) show great promise for diverse applications, yet their practical application is hindered by the limited operational and shelf stability of OSC‐based gas sensors over a wide temperature range. Herein, we developed a universal grain boundary pinning strategy to cooperatively optimize the aggregate state stability, sensitivity, and selectivity of the ultrathin OSC film. By incorporating multi‐functional Au nanoclusters into the OSC layer, the thermally activated molecular motion and grain boundary migration can be inhibited by the cooperative effect of strain‐balancing and dipole–π interactions. Consequently, the NH\n                    3\n                    sensor based on 5 nm ultrathin film exhibits record stability over an extended shelf period (tested shelf life of one‐year, theoretical shelf life of 14.8 years) and across a wide temperature range (RT‐100°C on polymer substrate, RT‐180°C on SiO\n                    2\n                    substrate). The grain boundary pinning strategy is demonstrated to be universal across multiple OSC systems, underscoring its potential to enable robust, high‐performance flexible gas sensors for widespread commercialization."},{"t":"基因进入善与恶的花园","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef2245?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"A geneticist confronts how we think about free will, character, and wrongdoing"},{"t":"Zn₃In₂S₆中Zn空位伴随Ga取代In诱导电子-空穴不对称及In-O键弱化用于耦合反应","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522831?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化产过氧化氢","kp":["催化剂[光催化产H2O2]: Ga取代+Zn空位Zn3In2S6","[电荷分离]: Ga-on-In取代诱导电子空穴不对称"],"as":"针对光催化人工合成过氧化氢（H₂O₂）效率受限的难题，研究者在Zn₃In₂S₆层状半导体中引入'镓取代铟位+锌空位'的协同缺陷工程，诱导电子-空穴不对称分布。该设计优化了能带结构与电荷分离效率，显著提升可见光驱动下水中氧气两电子还原生成H₂O₂的选择性与产率，为分布式、绿色化学生产提供新路径。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ga‐on‐In Substitution with Zn Vacancies in Zn3In2S6 Induces Electron–Hole Asymmetry and In─O Bond Weakening for Coupled ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Artificial photosynthesis of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    offers a sustainable route to decentralized chemical production, yet remains limited by sluggish oxygen reduction kinetics, rapid charge recombination, and undesired decomposition of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    on catalyst active sites. Herein, we report a Zn\n                    3\n                    In\n                    2\n                    S\n                    6\n                    catalyst (Ga‐ZvIS) featuring Ga‐on‐In substitution and Zn vacancies that together establish electron–hole asymmetry and weaken In\n                    ─\n                    O bonding. Ga substitution on In sites lowers the In‐5p‐band center level and reduces H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    adsorption strength, thereby suppressing surface decomposition, while Zn vacancies serve as hole‐localized domains that accelerate isopropanol oxidation and furnish the protons required for the two‐electron oxygen reduction reaction (2e\n                    −\n                    ORR). This site‐specific dopant–defect interplay produces energetically differentiated electron‐ and hole‐dominated regions, promotes directional charge migration, and sustains the 2e\n                    −\n                    ORR pathway. The optimized catalyst exhibits a H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production rate of 187.8 µmol g\n                    −\n                    1\n                     min\n                    −\n                    1\n                    in O\n                    2\n                    ‐saturated aqueous isopropanol, outperforming most reported photocatalysts. Kelvin probe force microscopy and femtosecond transient absorption spectroscopy confirm efficient carrier separation consistent with the built‐in electrostatic potential arising from electron–hole asymmetry, while DFT calculations reveal favorable O\n                    2\n                    adsorption and weakened H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    binding on Ga–In sites. A proof‐of‐concept continuous‐flow photoreactor further demonstrates in situ Fenton‐assisted oxidation of organic contaminants, validating the practical utilization of the photosynthesized H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ."},{"t":"稠环受体-π-受体架构实现近红外吸收介孔共价有机框架用于电催化","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5267333?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价有机框架光催化","kp":["催化剂[光催化产H2O2]: 稠环受体-π-受体架构介孔COF","吸光范围[COF光催化]: 近红外区"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种基于稠环受体-π-受体（A-π-A）架构的共价有机框架（COF）设计策略，实现近红外光吸收。传统COF多采用给体-受体（D-A）结构作为光催化剂，但在长波长光捕获方面存在局限。研究通过引入稠环受体单元与π桥共轭扩展，拓宽了吸收光谱至近红外区域，有望提升光催化效率与太阳能利用率，在光催化分解水、CO₂还原等能源转化领域具有重要应用前景。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Fused‐Ring Acceptor–π–Acceptor Architecture Enables Near‐Infrared‐Absorbing Mesoporous Covalent Organic Frameworks for E","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Covalent organic frameworks (COFs) featuring donor–acceptor architectures have shown great promise as photocatalysts. However, their performance is often hindered by limitations such as narrow absorbance ranges and restricted electron delocalization, which are inherent to traditional imine linkages. Herein, we introduce a fused‐ring acceptor–π–acceptor (FRA–π–A) architecture for near‐infrared‐absorbing COFs, enabled via in situ COF‐to‐COF transformation that replaces imine linkages with FRA‐derived benzodithiazoles (or benzodioxazoles). Comprehensive structural characterizations confirm their mesoporous crystalline structure, featuring pore size distribution of 2.16–2.39 nm and broad light absorption extending to near‐infrared region. Property investigations demonstrate that the rigid backbones derived from the FRA–π–A architecture significantly enhance long‐range in‐plane electron delocalization, thereby improving the separation and transport of photogenerated charge carriers. Crucially, the accelerated carrier migration preferentially directs photogenerated electrons to the FRAs, promoting the formation of •O\n                    2\n                    −\n                    radicals and accelerating the rate‐limiting step of the oxygen reduction reaction. These synergistic structural and optoelectronic properties endow the FRA–π–A COFs with an outstanding photocatalytic H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production rate of 6.8 mmol g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    without sacrificial agents, exceeding the vast majority of conjugated linkage‐based COFs. This study highlights the immense potential of FRA–π–A COFs as high‐performance photocatalysts."},{"t":"功能化四足氧化锌：从合成、多物理场到先进应用","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS00594A","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"四足氧化锌","kp":["[材料形貌]: 四足结构ZnO,中心核+四臂","[特性]: 三维几何耦合多物理场"],"as":"四足状氧化锌（T-ZnO）是一种独特的ZnO微观结构，由中心核和四个沿四面体方向生长的针状臂组成。该综述系统总结了T-ZnO的合成方法、多物理场特性及前沿应用，涵盖压电传感、能量收集、气体检测、紫外线探测和生物医学等领域。其独特的三维互穿网络结构赋予优异的力学柔韧性和多功能耦合性能，在柔性电子和智能材料中展现出广阔前景。","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Functional tetrapodal zinc oxide: from synthesis and multiphysics to advanced applications","b":"Tetrapodal zinc oxide (T-ZnO) represents a distinctive ZnO architecture, characterized by a central core and four tetrahedrally arranged monocrystalline arms. Beyond its role as a conventional particle, T-ZnO is increasingly recognized as a microscopic building block whose three-dimensional geometry governs tightly coupled multiphysics properties. This review critically examines the structural lifecycle of T-ZnO across multiple length scales. We evaluate scalable synthesis methodologies and competing thermodynamic models governing early-stage nucleation, followed by a systematic analysis of structure–property relationships. Structure–property correlations are addressed from the atomic scale of the crystal lattice, through the microscopic scale of individual tetrapodal particles, to the macroscopic aggregation of tetrapods into functional networks. Across these scales, the tetrapodal morphology dictates properties like mechanics, piezoelectricity, and optoelectronics via diverse and often competing effects. These properties are typically intertwined, producing physical coupling that generates both performance synergies and fundamental design trade-offs. The utility of this architecture is demonstrated in two principal domains: first, as an active functional particle network leveraging geometric stress concentration and percolation effects for applications such as advanced sensing; and second, as a sacrificial structural template for the fabrication of ultralight, highly porous aeromaterials that decouple the architectural advantages of the network from the intrinsic chemical limitations of ZnO. Ultimately, advancing T-ZnO from empirical optimization to rational technological deployment requires predictive multiphysics computational frameworks capable of guiding the design of its complex functionality."},{"t":"实时动态新生 RNA 折叠整体的功能表征","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec4037?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"RNA structure starts forming cotranscriptionally as the nascent RNA emerges from the RNA polymerase and is dynamically modulated by cellular factors. How individual RNA conformations, out of an ensemble of RNA molecules, relate to function is not well understood. Here, developing multicolor single-molecule fluorescence microscopy experiments, we track in real time nascent RNA structure formation, functionally characterizing up to eight different types of RNA molecules. We find that ribosomal proteins, RNA modification enzymes or antisense oligonucleotides specifically modulate a subset of the RNA folding classes. For example, we provide direct evidence that increased local RNA accessibility at specific sites correlates with the chaperoning activity of ribosomal proteins during ribosome assembly. These experiments provide a general framework to study how dynamic RNA folding, and misfolding, relates to function."},{"t":"从慢性疼痛到抑郁：神经发生驱动的海马齿状回小胶质细胞重塑","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee6177?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Chronic pain often evolves into depression and anxiety, yet mechanisms linking sensory distress to affective dysfunction remain unclear. Integrating human neuroimaging from the UK Biobank with a rodent model, we uncovered biphasic hippocampal remodeling. Hippocampal volume increased during early pain stages, with paradoxical cognitive improvements, but declined with comorbid depression. In rodents, the dentate gyrus (DG) acted as a hub governing this transition: Lesions of DG prevented affective symptoms. Elevated DG activity was linked to hyperactive newborn neurons and microglial recruitment and remodeling, leading to circuit imbalance. Whereas suppressing newborn neuron activity alleviated emotional pathology at the expense of cognition, microglial modulation selectively restored affective behavior without cognitive cost. These findings reveal microglia-mediated hippocampal remodeling as a key mechanism linking chronic pain to mood disorders."},{"t":"通过掺杂聚合物悬浮液过滤简便快速制备热电臂","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70772?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机热电腿","kp":["制备方法[有机热电]: 掺杂聚合物悬浮液真空抽滤","厚度[聚合物热电膜]: 数十微米"],"as":"该研究报道了一种通过掺杂聚合物过滤快速制备热电腿的简便策略。传统热电发电器件制备工艺复杂、成本高，研究团队利用掺杂导电聚合物的溶液过滤法，实现了热电材料的快速规模化成形。该方法显著简化了热电腿的制造流程，有望降低柔性热电发电器的生产成本，在可穿戴能量收集、废热回收及自供电传感器领域具有应用潜力。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Facile and Rapid Fabrication of Thermoelectric Legs via Filtration of Doped Polymer Suspension (Adv. Energy Mater. 11/20","b":"Thermoelectric Generators In article number e05396, Jaeyoung Jang and co-workers report a rapid and scalable strategy for fabricating high-performance organic thermoelectric legs via vacuum filtration of doped polymer suspensions. This approach enables the formation of uniformly doped, tens-of-micrometer-thick, and mechanically flexible polymer films within seconds, providing a powerful platform for high-power organic thermoelectric devices and generators."},{"t":"极端降水重塑北美最大河流流域的养分流动和平衡","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3260?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Extreme precipitation events, intensified by climate change, are increasingly disrupting nutrient dynamics in large river systems worldwide. Beyond altering the magnitude of individual nutrient fluxes, extreme precipitation may fundamentally reshape nutrient composition and stoichiometric balances, with critical implications for aquatic ecosystem health. Here, we apply an integrated data-model framework to assess how these events have altered nitrogen (N) and phosphorus (P) fluxes across the Mississippi River Basin from 1980 to 2018. We find that extreme rainfall disproportionately increases P export relative to N, driven primarily by enhanced soil erosion and mobilization of particulate-bound nutrients. Concurrent temporal and spatial changes in extreme precipitation regimes have induced declining N:P ratios in headwater streams and cumulative nutrient loads, shifting export stoichiometry toward the Redfield ratio. Therefore, extreme precipitation can increase nutrient fluxes that fuel harmful algal blooms, yet at the same time reduce N:P ratios that may favor less toxic communities. This trade-off calls for watershed management strategies that go beyond managing nutrient quantity alone."},{"t":"实验性瘫痪疗法在巴西引发争论","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2954?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Spinal cord injury patients are scrambling for access to the injection, but researchers say evidence is weak"},{"t":"研究文章的勘误表“外周 T 细胞中独特的 TP53 和 PTEN 联合缺失的协同作用”","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeg5995?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"研究文章“社交媒体反馈算法如何影响选举阵营中的态度和行为”的勘误","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2575?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"In the Research Article “How do social media feed algorithms affect attitudes and behavior in an election campaign?” by A. M. Guess et al. (28 July 2023, 10.1126/science.abp9364), the authors did not distinguish between “carousel” and “non-carousel” posts, which are the two types of posts on Instagram. On the basis of information recently shared by Meta Research regarding the Instagram data that were provided to the authors as part of the 2020 Facebook-Instagram Election Study (FIES), this erratum provides an updated description of the metrics used in the Article. Because the distinction between carousel and non-carousel posts is independent of treatment assignment, none of the Instagram-specific experimental effect estimates should have been affected, and none of the other experimental effects are affected. In addition, none of the Facebook data or survey data are affected."},{"t":"研究文章“AND-1 是 R 环动态的关键调节剂，也是克服内分泌问题的目标”的勘误表","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeg8118?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"分子异质结单原子催化剂中空间电子桥工程用于氧电还原","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00888G","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子氧还原催化剂","kp":["[催化剂形态]: 分子异质结构单原子催化剂","[工程策略]: 空间电子桥","[反应]: 氧还原反应(ORR)"],"as":"该研究聚焦分子单原子催化剂(SACs)的工程设计，通过构建分子异质结构中的空间电子桥，调控单原子活性位点的电子环境。单原子催化剂因其可调谐、明确的活性位点成为理想模型体系，在电催化等领域具有应用潜力。研究旨在优化催化性能与稳定性，为高效催化剂的理性设计提供新思路，推动清洁能源转换技术的发展。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Engineering Spatial Electron Bridge in Molecular Heterostructure Single-Atom Catalyst for Oxygen Electroreduction","b":"Molecular single-atom catalysts (SACs) offer tunable and well-defined active sites, rendering them ideal model systems to explore fundamental concepts in oxygen reduction reaction (ORR). However, the high-efficiency molecular SACs are still plagued by easy aggregation, planar symmetry of active sites, suboptimal adsorption/desorption of oxygen intermediates, and poor conductivity. Herein, we propose spatial electron bridge engineering as a universal strategy to disrupt the planar configuration of Fe-N4 moieties, modulate electronic structure, and enhance interfacial coupling. Through dual-descriptor (ΔG*OH and (ΔG*O-ΔG*OH)) analysis correlating activity with theoretical overpotentials, we systematically decode structureactivity relationships in symmetry-broken X-Fe-N4 (X=O, S, N) sites. Molecular heterostructure SACs are constructed by tethering iron pyridinic hexaazacyclophane macrocycle (Fe(Phen)2) to electron bridges (phenol, thiophenol, pyridine) functionalized carbon nanotubes (CNT), forming precisely controlled CNT-X-Fe architectures. Combined spectroscopic studies and DFT calculations reveal that the phenol bridge triggers a low-to-medium spin state transition via electron bridgeto-metal charge transfer, facilitating rapid electron shuttling between Fe(Phen)2 and CNT. This optimizes the Fe d-band center occupancy and enhances antibonding orbital hybridization, yielding the best ORR performance. This work establishes spatial electron bridges as orbital-coupling hubs bridging quantum-level d-p hybridization to macroscopic catalytic performance, offering a universal design framework for molecularly precise electrocatalysts."},{"t":"交互式多能市场能量管理策略：方法与新兴挑战的映射","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003855?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"多能源市场管理","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Energy management strategies for interactive multi-energy markets: Mapping approaches to emerging challenges"},{"t":"新兴电化学能量转换材料：石墨二炔","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202600027?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"石墨炔能源材料","kp":["[合成条件]: 低温常压","[材料类型]: 二维石墨二炔新型碳同素异形体"],"dp":1,"as":"石墨炔(GDY)是一种新型二维碳同素异形体，在过去十年中发展迅速。作为一种新兴的电化学能量转换材料，石墨炔因其独特的sp/sp2杂化结构、丰富的孔隙率和优异的电子传输性能而备受关注。该文综述了石墨炔在电催化、能源存储与转换等方面的最新进展，讨论了其合成方法、结构调控策略及构效关系，为下一代碳基能源材料的发展指明方向。","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Emerging Electrochemical Energy Conversion Materials: Graphdiyne","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Two‐dimensional graphdiyne (GDY) is a new type of carbon allotrope that has developed rapidly in the past decade. It is facilely synthesized under low temperatures and normal pressures and exhibits outstanding physical and chemical properties that surpass those of traditional carbon materials. These properties are beyond the understanding of scientists and have attracted many researchers to engage in research in this field. GDY is composed of a periodic sp/sp\n                    2\n                    hybridized framework consisting of benzene rings and large amounts of alkyne‐rich pores, forming a super‐large π conjugated structure, exhibiting an inherent characteristic of uneven surface charge distribution, demonstrating extremely high intrinsic activity, significant chemical stability, and excellent electronic conductivity. These unique properties promote the continuous progress of foundation and applied research on GDY in various fields, especially in electrochemical energy conversion. The intrinsic properties of GDY provide the key elements necessary for the development and progress of sustainable energy systems, as the development of efficient electrocatalysts depends on these properties, especially those used for the conversion of intermittent renewable energy into chemical bond storage forms. GDY‐based catalysts, with their huge surface area, superior surface charge distribution, and semiconductor characteristics, have demonstrated outstanding performance in efficient energy conversion. This review summarizes the studies on computation, experiment, structure, and properties, followed by a discussion of the electrocatalytic process and performance, such as hydrogen, oxygen, carbon dioxide, nitrogen, nitrate, and organic molecule conversion. By offering a systematic survey of GDY's evolution in electrocatalytic, energy‐to‐chemical conversion, this review provides a roadmap for future breakthroughs in the rapidly advancing field."},{"t":"经过数十年的研制，难以捉摸的“核钟”越来越接近现实","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00848-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过人中性粒细胞-血管内皮细胞阐明炎症消退的有效促消退介质","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530022123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The acute inflammatory response is a highly coordinated programmed sequence that enables neutrophils to transmigrate from venules into tissues. Ideally self-limited, the active resolution phase produces specialized molecules that stimulate resolution and prevent collateral tissue damage from excessive neutrophil infiltration. The superfamily of pro-resolving molecules is termed specialized pro-resolving mediators including the essential polyunsaturated fatty acid-derived lipoxins, resolvins, protectins, and maresins. Given the intimate interactions between leukocytes and endothelial cells in inflammation resolution, we investigated whether unique bioactive molecules carrying pro-resolution properties are biosynthesized by human neutrophils coincubated with activated vascular endothelial cells. Using metabololipidomics, we found that human coronary aortic valves from transplants contained 13-hydroxy-4Z,7Z,10Z,14E,16Z,19Z-docosahexaenoic acid (13-HDHA) and inflammatory eicosanoids. We report that human endothelial cells convert DHA to 13-HDHA which in turn is transformed by human neutrophils to a previously unknown bioactive product 4,13-dihydroxy-docosahexaenoic acid. This structure was established using physical properties including tandem-mass spectrometry, UV-analysis, and conversion of deuterated substrate. Biosynthesis of this product during neutrophil–endothelial coincubations involved bidirectional crosstalk between neutrophil 5-LOX and endothelial COX-2 as confirmed using isolated recombinant enzymes. The bioactive 4S,13R-dihydroxy-5E,7Z,10Z,14E,16Z,19Z-docosahexaenoic acid, also produced by M2-like macrophages and mononuclear cells, demonstrated potent nanomolar pro-resolving actions including, a) limiting neutrophil infiltration into mouse air pouch, b) reducing human neutrophil adherence to endothelial cells, c) protecting endothelial cell from senescence, and d) stimulating human macrophage efferocytosis of senescent red blood cells. These results provide evidence for a previously unknown pro-resolving pathway and molecule biosynthesized from DHA via cyclooxygenase-2–5-lipoxygenase during leukocyte crosstalk with the vasculature."},{"t":"电化学自优化合成密集官能化分子","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00018-5?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学自动优化","kp":["[方法]: 贝叶斯优化+自主电化学流动平台","[集成]: 液体处理机器人+在线分析"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究将贝叶斯优化引入电化学合成，实现对高官能团度分子的自优化合成。该方法通过贝叶斯优化算法高效探索复杂化学空间，以更少的实验次数获得最优电化学合成条件，加速了密集官能团化分子的合成进程，为自动化有机电化学合成提供了智能化实验设计范式。","ot":"Electrochemical self-optimization for the synthesis of densely functionalized molecules","b":"Bayesian optimization enables the exploration of complex chemical spaces to obtain optimized conditions in an expedited fashion. By leveraging this machine learning technique, an autonomous electrochemical flow platform was developed, integrating a liquid handling robot and online analytics. Using this platform, three different electrochemical transformations toward the synthesis of densely functionalized molecules were optimized by tuning a wide range of input variables."},{"t":"电致染料切换辅助光谱解混与三维STORM成像","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202517001?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超分辨显微成像","kp":["[成像方法]: 电化学控制EC-STORM双色超分辨","[优势]: 精确控制荧光团开关实现光谱分离"],"dp":1,"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种电化学染料切换辅助光谱分离与三维STORM超分辨成像技术。利用电化学手段控制荧光染料在荧光/暗态间切换，实现多色荧光信号的光谱解混，显著提升超分辨显微镜多通道成像的可靠性，拓展了纳米级三维细胞成像能力。","ot":"Electrochemical Dye Switching Assisted Spectral Demixing and 3D STORM Imaging","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Super‐resolution microscopy has advanced cellular imaging by enabling nanoscale resolution, while reliable multicolor strategies remain crucial for resolving multiple targets in complex cellular samples. Here, we demonstrate a two‐color imaging strategy using electrochemically controlled stochastic optical reconstruction microscopy (EC‐STORM), which allows precise control over the switching behavior of two cyanine dyes, Alexa 647 and CF680. An oscillating electrochemical potential enables control of emitter density and molecule ON time. This minimizes the spatial and temporal overlap of emitters, enabling effective spectral demixing for two‐color EC‐STORM imaging. We further combined spectral demixing with a biplane detection configuration, enabling additional 3D localization of Alexa 647, where axial coordinates are extracted from the photon‐intensity ratio between the two detection channels instead of point spread function width. This integrated approach offers a practical solution for high‐density multicolor 3D STORM imaging."},{"t":"富钴位点与硫空位的超小MoSₓ纳米片边缘工程用于多环芳烃加氢","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00029-X?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MoSx加氢催化剂","kp":["[层数]: 1-3层","[横向尺寸]: 3-6 nm","[活性位点]: Co位点+S空位","[性能]: 非贵金属多环芳烃加氢最优之一"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过原位合成策略制备了层厚1-3层、横向尺寸3-6nm的超小二硫化钼纳米片，并引入丰富的钴活性位点和硫空位进行边缘工程调控。该催化剂在多芳烃加氢反应中表现出优异催化性能，为设计高效加氢催化剂提供了缺陷工程与活性位点协同调控的新策略。","ot":"Edge engineering of ultrasmall MoSx nanosheets with rich Co sites and S vacancies for polyaromatic hydrogenation","b":"We report the in situ synthesis of MoSx nanosheets with one to three layers, lateral sizes of 3–6 nm, and readily cleavable edges with abundant Co sites and S vacancies. The synthesized catalysts rank among the best non-precious metals for the hydrogenation of polyaromatics."},{"t":"丝网印刷胆甾相液晶弹性体的动态防伪与可调谐激光","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535645123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液晶弹性体材料","kp":["[制备工艺]: 丝网印刷胆甾醇液晶弹性体","[应用]: 动态防伪与可调谐激光"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用丝网印刷胆甾相液晶弹性体实现了动态防伪与可调谐激光。胆甾相液晶的结构色在防伪、显示和智能涂层领域具有重要应用价值。该工作通过丝网印刷技术制备图案化液晶弹性体，实现结构色的动态可调和激光发射控制，为柔性光学防伪和可调谐激光器件开辟了新路径。","ot":"Dynamic anticounterfeiting and tunable lasing with screen-printed cholesteric liquid crystal elastomers","b":"Structural colors hold significant application value in anticounterfeiting, displays, and smart coatings due to their high stability, eco-friendliness, and dynamic optical response potential. However, conventional fabrication strategies for photonic crystals—such as photolithography and inkjet printing—suffer from limitations including high mask costs, nozzle clogging, lattice defects, and difficulties in scaling production. This study introduces an innovative screen-printing technique to achieve high-fidelity and multicolor structural color patterning based on cholesteric liquid crystal elastomers (CLCEs), overcoming key challenges in controlling the alignment of mesoscopic helical structures and ensuring spatial homogeneity of the photonic bandgap. Crucially, the chiral helical superstructure of CLCEs was investigated, revealing its decisive role in governing the circular polarization properties of the reflected light. The printed patterns exhibit dynamic optical behaviors, including viewing-angle-dependent color shifts, inherent selective circularly polarized reflection dictated by the handedness of the helix, and reversible mechanochromic responses under strain. Furthermore, integration of photochromic spiropyran enables multistimulus-responsive color and fluorescence switching under light and thermal stimuli, as well as ultraviolet-tunable (645 to 685 nm) random lasing emission. This work demonstrates that screen-printed CLCEs, with their excellent substrate compatibility and scalability, constitute a promising platform for next-generation anticounterfeiting labels, smart packaging, and flexible photonic devices."},{"t":"铁电阀设计：一种类自旋阀结构用于调制电阻","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521823?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电阀电阻调制","kp":["[器件原理]: 类自旋阀，极化改变调制电阻","[结构]: 铁电多层膜"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本文提出一种新型铁电阀结构，类比自旋阀原理，利用磁多层结构中非磁性层的电阻可调制特性，通过铁电极化状态实现电学电阻的可控调节。该设计将铁电材料的极化翻转与电子输运耦合，有望用于非易失性存储、低功耗逻辑器件和神经形态计算等新型电子元件。","ot":"Design of Ferroelectric Valve: A Spin‐Valve‐Analogous Structure for Modulating Electrical Resistance","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The spin valve features a magnetic multilayer structure, wherein the resistance of the intervening non‐magnetic layer can be modulated by adjusting the spin orientations of adjacent magnetic layers. While ferroelectricity is often regarded as analogous to ferromagnetism, a device analogous to a spin valve—a ferroelectric valve capable of modulating resistance through alterations in the polarization orientations of neighboring ferroelectric layers—has yet to be realized. This study constructs a ferroelectric valve consisting of a LaTiO\n                    3.5\n                    /LaTiO\n                    3\n                    /LaTiO\n                    3.5\n                    multilayer structure and demonstrated that the electrical resistance of LaTiO\n                    3\n                    varies with the switching of ferroelectric polarization in adjacent LaTiO\n                    3.5\n                    layers between parallel and antiparallel configurations. Using aberration‐corrected transmission electron microscopy combined with first‐principles calculations, atomic and electronic structural changes within the ferroelectric valve under parallel and antiparallel polarization configurations are systematically investigated. The findings reveal that when the polarization orientations of adjacent ferroelectric LaTiO\n                    3.5\n                    layers are parallel, the conductive LaTiO\n                    3\n                    layer exhibits a high‐resistance state. Conversely, when these polarizations are antiparallel, the LaTiO\n                    3\n                    layer demonstrates a low‐resistance state. Notably, this ferroelectric valve displays strong anisotropic conductivity and its preferred conducting direction can be modulated by varying the polarization orientations. Our study establishes the structural and electronic basis for a ferroelectric valve, demonstrating its operational mechanism at the atomic scale. This discovery offers promising prospects for designing next‐generation ferroelectric memory components."},{"t":"能源部实验室拥抱 Genesis AI 推动","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2955?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Their huge facilities, data flows, and computing resources are a natural fit for AI","tp":"能源AI","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":7.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":6.0},"as":"美国能源部下属实验室正积极推进Genesis AI技术的应用。这些实验室具备庞大的科研设施、海量的数据流以及强大的计算资源，这为人工智能技术的落地提供了天然的硬件和数据优势。这种结合有望大幅提升科研效率，加速新材料研发、复杂系统模拟及能源领域的数据处理进程，体现了算力与前沿AI模型深度融合的趋势。"},{"t":"登革热感染引发皮肤组织驻留和循环 CD8+ T 细胞，与住院保护相关","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7987?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Dengue is spreading globally, and there is urgent need to define immune correlates of protection for this disease. Dengue infection first occurs in the skin following the bite of an infected mosquito; however, knowledge of host immune responses within this site remains sparse. We investigated the phenotypic, functional, and transcriptional profiles of skin and blood T cells in 73 patients with dengue and 10 healthy volunteers. We show that the skin T cell compartment undergoes marked reshaping and is strongly enriched with proliferating CD4\n                    +\n                    and CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells compared with the blood of patients. Activated skin CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells expressed a core transcriptional signature of tissue-resident memory T (T\n                    RM\n                    ) cells, supporting their differentiation to the T\n                    RM\n                    cell lineage during infection. The magnitude of skin and blood CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell responses were associated with protection from hospitalization in this cohort. These data support a protective role of skin-resident and circulating CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells in dengue and warrant evaluation of vaccination strategies inducing skin T\n                    RM\n                    cells to enhance protective immunity."},{"t":"离子液体镁电池中枝晶形成与自愈合机制","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70763?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镁电池自愈合","kp":["[自修复机制]: 局部自热熔融软枝晶","[电解质]: 离子液体电解质","[枝晶特性]: 镁枝晶具体系特异性"],"as":"镁电池被视为后锂离子电池时代的重要候选技术，但枝晶生长制约其循环寿命与安全性。该研究揭示了离子液体基电解液中镁电池枝晶的形成机制及自愈合现象，为实现高可逆镁负极提供了新理解，有望推动下一代高能量密度、低成本的镁二次电池实用化。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dendrite Formation and Self‐Healing Mechanism in Ionic Liquid‐Based Magnesium Batteries (Adv. Energy Mater. 11/2026)","b":"Magnesium Batteries In article number e05315, Timo Jacob, Hagar K. Hassan, and co-workers illustrate a self-healing mechanism in magnesium batteries: cycling short-circuited cells with highly stable ionic-liquid electrolytes induces localized self-heating, melting and fusing soft dendrites, enabling cell recovery. A key insight is the system-specific nature of magnesium dendrites. Mg(TFSI)2-based ionic liquids with high donor-number co-solvents and borohydride additives enable uniform deposition at high current rates, contrasting dendritic growth at low rates.","aip":1},{"t":"使用基于 G4 配体的蛋白水解靶向嵌合体降解染色质中的 G-四链体结合蛋白","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02111-y","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","b":"Targeted protein degradation can intervene with the function of disease-related proteins, but most current approaches rely on direct ligand engagement of a protein target, limiting their applicability to proteins that are difficult to bind selectively. Here we present a conceptually unique approach to degrade proteins associated with DNA G-quadruplex (G4) secondary structures in a chromatin context. G4s are non-canonical nucleic acid structures that form at regulatory regions of transcriptionally active genes in open chromatin, and are abundant in cancer states. Although many proteins recognize or regulate G4 structures, selectively targeting G4-binding proteins in their native chromatin environment is challenging. Our bifunctional molecules are proteolysis-targeting chimeras that bind naturally occurring G4s, recruit E3 ubiquitin ligases and degrade G4-specific transcription factors and chromatin remodellers such as FUS, SMARCA4 and ATRX. These proteins are important therapeutic targets that play crucial roles in transcription regulation and DNA repair. Our approach has the potential to be exploited in a therapeutic strategy to target diseases characterized by aberrant G4 activity, such as cancers.","tp":"靶向蛋白降解","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究人员开发了一种全新的靶向蛋白降解技术，专门用于降解与DNA G-四链体（G4）二级结构相关的结合蛋白。传统方法依赖与目标蛋白直接结合，难以应对选择性差的蛋白。该新方法在染色质环境下，利用G4配体精准靶向并干预与转录调控区相关的致病蛋白，突破了传统靶向降解技术的局限性，为靶向难治性蛋白引发的相关疾病提供了新的治疗策略。"},{"t":"关于美国早期重要遗址的争论爆发","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2956?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"A new study challenges pre-Clovis age for Monte Verde site in southern Chile"},{"t":"每日简报：静电仍然是一个谜——这是我们所知道的","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00904-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过金属氢化物选择实现交叉和支链选择性氢烯基化","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeb2389?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属氢化物氢烯基化","kp":["[方法]: 金属氢化物氢原子转移(MHAT)","[选择性]: 交叉/支链选择性"],"as":"该研究通过金属氢化物的选择实现交叉选择性及支链选择性的氢烯基化反应，可在碳链上精确控制支链点位。这一能力对材料、农化品及药物等合成至关重要，为碳骨架构建提供了新的可控途径。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Cross- and branched-selective hydroalkenylation by metal hydride selection","b":"Controlled placement of branch points along carbon chains is a core capability in the synthesis of materials, agrochemicals, and pharmaceuticals. Metal hydride hydrogen atom transfer (MHAT) to alkenes represents a valuable elementary step because it accesses branched products directly from abundant α-olefins. MHAT catalysis can also be coupled to secondary transition metal catalytic cycles that would otherwise deliver nonbranched (linear) products. However, the hydridic reagents used in MHAT do not always discriminate between the MHAT catalyst and the secondary metal, leading to mixtures of metal hydrides and, therefore, mixtures of products. In this work, we show that a combination of a lutidinium acid and manganese, a weak reductant, selectively generates cobalt hydrides in the presence of a nickel catalyst. We applied these conditions to a cross-selective alkene-alkene coupling that produces valuable branched materials with exquisite selectivity."},{"t":"共价有机框架-碳纳米管核壳纳米杂化物增强分子催化剂活性位点利用率","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521776?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF碳纳米管催化","kp":["[材料结构]: COF-CNT核壳纳米杂化","[策略]: 抑制聚集提升分子催化剂位点利用率"],"as":"研究开发了一种共价有机框架与碳纳米管的核壳型纳米杂化材料，旨在提升分子催化剂中催化位点的利用效率。该策略通过结构协同增强催化性能，为高效催化剂设计提供了新思路。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Covalent Organic Framework–Carbon Nanotube Core–Shell Nanohybrids for Enhanced Catalytic Site Utilization of Molecular C","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Developing strategies to enhance the utilization efficiency of catalytic sites in molecular catalysts has garnered increasing research interest in the field of molecular heterogeneous catalysis. The primary challenges in achieving this goal lie in the aggregation‐induced site inaccessibility in molecular catalysts. Here, we present the synthesis of covalent organic framework‐carbon nanotube (COF‐CNT) core‐shell nanohybrids as a platform to improve the site utilization of molecular catalysts in electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction. COF shells with a thickness of 50–80 nm are uniformly grown on CNTs, ensuring a well‐defined morphology with pores oriented perpendicularly to the CNT basal plane. The incorporation of molecular catalysts with COF‐CNT nanohybrids enables their application as scaffolds in the electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction. The best‐performing sample exhibits a two‐orders‐of‐magnitude increase in CO turnover frequency (TOF) compared to both pristine CoTPyP molecular catalyst and COF‐366‐Co, thus underscoring the effectiveness of the COF‐CNT hybrid structure in optimizing catalytic site accessibility. The enhanced site utilization is further validated in other molecular catalyst systems, where exceptionally high TOF values—among the highest reported to date for electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    ‐to‐CO conversion—were achieved. Collectively, this study establishes COF‐CNT nanohybrids as a promising strategy for advancing COF‐based electrocatalysts and facilitating molecular catalyst applications in electrochemical energy conversion."},{"t":"对“相分离脂质纳米颗粒：纳米生物界面的选择性行为”的修正","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72792?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"脂质纳米粒","as":""},{"t":"对 Ghimenti 等人的修正，通过时间重新参数化实现眼镜的智能算法","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2606723123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"纠正 Fernández 等人的观点，即对额叶皮质进行经颅磁刺激，但对枕叶皮质不会破坏内源性","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607578123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"高体积应变负极中的接触界面用于高性能锂离子存储","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01264G","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"大体积应变负极界面","kp":["[候选材料]: Si/Ge/Sn/P及金属氧化物","[失效机制]: 大体积应变致电极粉化","[矛盾]: 高理论容量但循环衰减快"],"dp":1,"as":"研究聚焦高容量锂离子电池负极材料（硅、锗、锡、磷及金属氧化物等）在充放电过程中体积剧变导致的接触界面问题，探讨如何维持稳定的电极接触以提升电池性能，为高能量密度电池设计提供指导。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Contact Interfaces in Anodes with Large Volume Strain for High-Performance Lithium-Ion Storage","b":"Silicon, germanium, tin, phosphorus, metal oxides, and their related compounds have emerged as promising anode materials for lithium-ion batteries owing to their high theoretical capacities. However, their practical application is severely hindered by large volume changes during lithiation and delithiation, which lead to electrode pulverization and rapid capacity fading. In addition, their intrinsically low electrical conductivity limits rate performance. To mitigate these issues, composite strategies—such as incorporating buffering matrices and conductive carbon—are widely employed, resulting in complex contact interfaces within the electrode. Nevertheless, the static and dynamic understanding of these interfaces remains insufficient. Under substantial volume strain, these contact interfaces undergo continuous evolution: point contacts may transform into surface contacts, while established interfaces may delaminate, ultimately governing electrode failure mechanisms. In this review, we systematically examine the nature and impact of contact interfaces in anodes undergoing significant volume strain. Contact interfaces are categorized into geometric types as well as physical and chemical interfaces, with particular emphasis on their operando evolution and coupling with solid electrolyte interphase chemistry. We critically evaluate advanced characterization techniques, including operando X-ray/neutron imaging and cryogenic electron microscopy, and present a comparative matrix outlining their respective capabilities. Furthermore, we bridge the gap between qualitative understanding and quantitative design principles by highlighting emerging advances in multiscale simulations as well as AI-assisted and data-driven interface engineering. Finally, we propose a roadmap linking laboratory-scale strategies to industrial scalability, offering a forward-looking framework for the rational design of next-generation Li⁺ storage systems."},{"t":"埋底界面异质结工程构建反向电场实现高性能钙钛矿器件","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00040-8?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿X射线探测器","kp":["[检测限]: 9.5 nGy_air/s","[耐辐照]: >100 Gy_air","[界面工程]: 1D/3D钙钛矿埋底异质结抑制离子迁移"],"as":"研究通过埋底界面工程构建1D/3D钙钛矿异质结，形成反向电场，有效抑制离子迁移并保持电荷传输，为提升钙钛矿光电器件的稳定性提供了新的界面调控策略。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Constructing reverse electric field by buried interfacial heterojunction engineering enables high-performance perovskite","b":"A 1D/3D perovskite heterojunction engineered at the buried interface enables effective suppression of ion migration while providing efficient carrier extraction. The resulting X-ray detector achieves a low detection limit of 9.5 nGyairs-1 and stable operation under radiation doses over 100 Gyair, outperforming most reported MAPbI3 thick film X-ray detectors fabricated by slurry blade-coating method.","aip":1},{"t":"非稠环电子受体的构象熵调控实现低成本纪录效率有机太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag177/8528991?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池受体","kp":["[策略]: 构象熵调控","[材料]: 非稠环电子受体(NFREA)","[目标]: 低成本纪录效率有机太阳能电池"],"as":"针对有机太阳能电池成本与性能难以兼顾的瓶颈，研究通过构象熵调控非稠环电子受体分子结构，在降低材料合成成本的同时保持较高光电转换效率，推动OSC商业化进程。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Conformational entropy tuning in nonfused-ring electron acceptors for low-cost and record-efficiency organic solar cells","b":"The commercial viability of organic solar cells (OSCs) is hindered by the trade-off between cost and performance. In particular, low-cost nonfused-ring electron acceptors (NFREAs) suffer from conformational disorder, limiting their photovoltaic performance. Herein, we strategically regulate conformational entropy (S"},{"t":"膜上 SARS-CoV-2 刺突的构象动力学揭示了弗林蛋白酶裂解和 D614G 的变构效应","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx5178?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"By combining hydrogen-deuterium exchange monitored by mass spectrometry (HDX-MS) with the ability of enveloped virus–like particles (eVLPs) to display full-length native-like severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 spike protein, we have determined the energetic and conformational effects of both the membrane environment and unique sequence features that are considered incompatible with soluble protein constructs. We find that eVLP-displayed spike can sample the open-interface trimer conformation observed in soluble constructs of spike, including sequences from engineered vaccine constructs and native viral sequences inaccessible to studies on soluble constructs. Moreover, the D614G mutation, which arose early in the pandemic, favors the canonical “closed-interface” prefusion conformation, potentially mitigating premature S1 shedding in the presence of a cleaved furin site and providing an evolutionary advantage to the virus. Furin cleavage at the S1/S2 boundary allosterically increases the flexibility of the S2′ site, which may facilitate increased TMPRSS2 processing, enhancing viral infectivity. The use of eVLPs in HDX-MS studies provides a powerful platform for studying viral and membrane proteins in near-native environments.","tp":"刺突构象态","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究人员结合氢-氘交换质谱（HDX-MS）和包膜病毒样颗粒（eVLP）技术，深入解析了SARS-CoV-2刺突蛋白在细胞膜上的构象动力学。研究评估了膜环境、弗林蛋白酶裂解及D614G突变对刺突蛋白的能量和构象的影响，发现eVLP展示的刺突蛋白可呈现开放的构象。该成果揭示了病毒 spike 蛋白的动态变化及变构效应，为理解病毒感染机制及开发重组蛋白疫苗提供了关键的结构生物学依据。"},{"t":"限域诱导手性光开关——一种用于先进光化学功能的包封策略","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00019-7?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"限制手性光开关","kp":["[方法]: 包结策略实现手性转移","[特性]: 溶液中无手性，包结后可逆手性光开关"],"dp":1,"as":"研究提出基于限域效应的手性光学光开关策略，通过主客体包封方式实现手性诱导剂与光开关分子间的手性传递，使分子在手性光学响应上可被光控调控，拓展了智能手性材料的设计思路。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Confinement-induced chiroptical photoswitching —An encapsulation approach for advanced photochemical functions","b":"This study presents a confinement-based approach to enable molecular chirality transfer between a chiral inducer and a linked non-chiral photoswitch. Although photoswitching remains achiral in solution, reversible chiroptical photoswitching is enabled upon encapsulation. A second, independent level of control is introduced via supramolecular guest exchange."},{"t":"共生驱动的血清素产生调节合成和病毒载体的体内递送","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adu7686?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"In vivo delivery systems (IDSs) are designed to protect and transport therapeutics, but their clinical applications are hindered by low delivery efficiency. We identified gut microbiota as key regulators of efficacy of IDS-based therapies and that disrupting commensal-host interactions markedly improves drug and gene delivery. Intestinal epithelial cells sense microbial stimulation and remotely activate Kupffer cells through serotonin production, thereby driving hepatic IDS clearance. Transient suppression of serotonin signaling, through receptor blockade or dietary intervention, mitigates hepatic IDS clearance and improves delivery efficiency. This strategy yielded more than threefold therapeutic enhancement in chemotherapy and oncolytic virotherapy and 5- to 15-fold improvements in somatic genome editing and messenger RNA–based therapies. These findings reveal a gut-liver immune axis that can be therapeutically exploited to improve IDS-based cancer and gene therapies.","tp":"药物递送系统","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"最新研究揭示了肠道共生菌群如何调控体内递送系统（IDS）的效率。研究发现，肠道上皮细胞在感知微生物刺激后，会通过分泌血清素远程激活肝脏枯否细胞，加速对体内递送载体的清除，从而降低药物和基因的递送效率。通过短暂破坏这种共生菌与宿主的相互作用，可显著提升基于IDS的基因疗法和药物的临床递送效果，为突破基因治疗和纳米药物递送瓶颈提供了全新的干预靶点。"},{"t":"同轴水凝胶光纤皮肤实现无干扰多模态触觉感知","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72869?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水凝胶光纤触觉感知","kp":["[材料]: 同轴水凝胶光纤","[传感特性]: 抗电磁干扰、无串扰多模态触觉"],"as":"柔性光子光纤传感器在可穿戴设备领域展现出巨大潜力，但传统方案难以实现多模态触觉感知而不产生信号串扰。本研究提出一种同轴水凝胶光纤皮肤结构，利用光学信号传输实现无电磁干扰的多模态触觉感知。该光纤皮肤能够同时感知压力、弯曲和温度等多种刺激，且各模态信号之间互不干扰。水凝胶材料赋予其优异的生物相容性和柔韧性，可贴合人体曲面。该技术在软体机器人、假肢触觉反馈和健康监测等场景中具有广阔应用前景。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Coaxial Hydrogel Optical Fibre Skin for Interference‐Free Multimodal Tactile Perception","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Flexible photonic fibers enable precise, interference‐free multimodal tactile sensing in wearable interfaces, owing to their intrinsic immunity to electromagnetic interference and cross‐modal coupling, together with rapid response. Until now, optical fibers that simultaneously exhibit mechanical robustness, signal decoupling, and environmental stability remain scarce, and system‐level integration is even rarer. Inspired by the distributed sensory arrangement of jellyfish tentacles, we propose a photonic skin composed of coaxially structured hydrogel optical fibers, in which pressure and temperature signals are routed through independent photonic and ionic channels for interference‐free multimodal sensing. The stretchable, highly reproducible, refractive‐index‐matched core‐cladding photonic fiber was constructed by continuous coaxial spinning with in situ photopolymerization. It resolves the long‐standing trade‐off between mechanical stretchability, low‐loss optical guiding, and temperature/humidity robustness in hydrogel fibers. The assembled sensing skin achieves high pressure and temperature sensitivity with a sub‐10‐ms response, surpassing existing benchmarks. It integrates with a lightweight, flexible printed circuit and multimodal tactile fusion machine‐learning architecture to form a wearable system, enabling wireless control, adaptive gesture recognition (99.21% accuracy), and multimodal object classification (99.22% accuracy). This work presents a fully integrated photonic skin platform bridging material‐level signal decoupling and system‐level multimodal perception for intelligent tactile interfaces in complex environments."},{"t":"团簇基材料：设计与应用","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS00663E","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"团簇基材料设计","kp":["[尺度]: 逐原子理解结构与性质演化","[设计理念]: 特定尺寸/组成模拟原子化学"],"dp":1,"as":"纳米团簇是由数十至数百个原子组成的组装体，其尺寸介于单个分子与纳米颗粒之间，呈现出独特的尺寸依赖性物理化学性质，是连接化学、物理、生物、医学和材料科学的多学科交叉前沿。团簇基材料的设计通过精确控制团簇的组成、结构和组装方式，可调控其催化活性、光学特性、磁学行为及生物医学功能。该综述系统总结了团簇基材料的设计原理、合成策略及在催化、传感、成像、药物递送等领域的应用进展，为新型功能材料的理性设计提供了理论框架。","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Cluster-based materials: design and applications","b":"Nanoclusters constitute an interdisciplinary field bridging chemistry, physics, biology, medicine, and materials science. Its broad appeal is fueled not only by the expectation that one can gain a fundamental understanding of how the structure and properties of matter evolve one atom at a time, but also, how they could be designed, with specific size and composition, to mimic the chemistry of atoms in the periodic table. Referred to as superatoms, these clusters can function as modular building units for a new generation of cluster-assembled materials, provided they retain their structural identity upon integration into extended architectures. C60 fullerene is an example of such a cluster. Clusters, protected by ligands or supported on a substrate, can also form cluster-assembled materials with unique properties. In contrast, atoms in an existing crystal can be replaced by corresponding superatoms to form “cluster-based materials”. While several perspectives and review articles have been published to highlight the unique structure- and composition-specific properties of isolated clusters and cluster-assembled materials, it is during the past few years that attention has been focused on cluster-based materials. This review focuses on the recent developments in the design, synthesis, and applications of clusters with uncommon properties and highlights their potential as building blocks of cluster-based materials. The topics include isolated clusters enabling unusual reactions, their role in the design and synthesis of materials such as super-electrides, solid state electrolytes with fast ionic conductivity and stable interfaces, moisture resistant hybrid perovskite solar cells, thermoelectric materials with high figure of merit, and a new class of single-superatom catalysts. Also outlined are the challenges and opportunities going forward."},{"t":"中国要求提供传统药物注射剂的证据","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2958?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"New regulations ask manufacturers to provide efficacy and safety data—or withdraw their products"},{"t":"化学污染物在世界海洋中普遍存在","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00850-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"二维氢键有机框架中电荷转移诱导的反铁磁性","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag176/8528990?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维HOF反铁磁","kp":["[材料]: 二维氢键有机框架","[磁性]: 电荷转移诱导嵌套反铁磁(NRSS)","[类型]: Γ-分裂反铁磁体"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"二维氢键有机框架中电荷转移诱导反铁磁性的理论研究。非相对论自旋劈裂(NRSS)反铁磁体已成为反铁磁自旋电子学的研究热点。该工作提出通过分子间电荷转移机制，在二维氢键有机框架中实现巢式反铁磁有序，为设计全有机、低维反铁磁材料提供了新思路，对自旋电子器件轻量化与柔性化具有潜在价值。","ot":"Charge-transfer induced nesting antiferromagnetism in two-dimensional hydrogen-bonded organic frameworks","b":"Nonrelativistic spin-splitting (NRSS) antiferromagnets (AFMs) have become a research focus in the field of antiferromagnetic spintronics due to their advantages such as avoiding spin dephasing caused by strong spin-orbital coupling and having no stray magnetic fields. Γ-split antiferromagnets are a distinct class of NRSS AFMs, featuring overall spin splitting specifically at the Brillouin zone’s Γ point. To date, their realization has been confined to a handful of inorganic materials. Molecular frameworks are a promising platform for achieving multiple exotic properties and tunability due to their diverse ligand types and symmetries. Herein, we propose that Γ-split AFMs can be realized in 2D hydrogen-bonded organic frameworks (HOFs) via nesting honeycomb and Kagome lattices. In these ‘nesting-AFMs’, each sublattice is ferromagnetic with opposite spin polarization, constructed separately using donor and acceptor molecules. Density functional theory calculations confirm that five designed nesting HOFs are nesting-AFMs. Importantly, the ferromagnetic ordering of each sublattice originates from charge transfer between hydrogen-bond-connected donors and acceptors. This work provides a practical strategy to design novel low-dimensional molecule-based NRSS AFMs for antiferromagnetic spintronics."},{"t":"早期商业化钠离子电池的特性与性能评估","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003399?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"商业钠离子电池","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":7.5,"r":5.5,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"as":"","ot":"Characterisation and performance evaluation of early-generation commercial sodium-ion batteries","aip":1},{"t":"Caspase-3/7 缺乏导致肠道炎症增强并减少肿瘤发生","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz5906?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Aberrant intestinal epithelial cell (IEC) death is common in inflammatory bowel disease (IBD) and related animal models. While various cell death pathways contribute to disease, the dominant modalities and their regulatory mechanisms in intestinal inflammation remain ill defined. Using the DSS colitis model, we examined the contribution of apoptosis (\n                    Casp3/7\n                    \n                      Δ\n                      IEC\n                    \n                    ), necroptosis (\n                    Mlkl\n                    \n                      Δ\n                      IEC\n                    \n                    ), pyroptosis (\n                    Gsdme\n                    \n                      Δ\n                      IEC\n                    \n                    ,\n                    \n                      Gsdmd\n                      −/−\n                      )\n                    \n                    , and ferroptosis (\n                    Gpx4\n                    \n                      i\n                      Δ\n                      IEC\n                    \n                    ) in IECs. Mice lacking caspase-3/7 in IECs showed worsened colitis, higher mortality, and impaired regeneration, not seen in the other transgenic mice. Caspase-3/7 deficiency in IECs hindered stem cell proliferation and increased inflammatory cell death, disrupting barrier integrity and delaying recovery. Despite heightened inflammation,\n                    Casp3/7\n                    \n                      Δ\n                      IEC\n                    \n                    mice had reduced tumor formation in the AOM/DSS-induced colorectal cancer model. These findings highlight a protective role for caspase-3/7 in controlling inflammation and tissue regeneration, while promoting tumorigenesis following intestinal injury, and suggest modulation of caspase-3/7 as a promising therapeutic strategy in IBD and colorectal cancer.","tp":"肠道炎症机制","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究探讨了肠道上皮细胞死亡的途径及其在肠道炎症中的调节机制。在炎症性肠病（IBD）中，异常的肠道上皮细胞死亡十分常见。研究人员利用DSS结肠炎模型，重点分析了凋亡（Casp3/7缺失）和坏死等不同细胞死亡途径对肠道炎症的具体影响，旨在明确在肠道炎症发生过程中占主导地位的细胞死亡方式及其调控机制。"},{"t":"数据基础设施建设能否缓解清洁能源错配？——基于中国省级数据的分析","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001813?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源错配分析","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"简讯：科学家有趣吗？证据就在眼前——这不是玩笑","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00937-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"反序沉积突破倒置太阳能电池效率瓶颈","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07561K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"反式有机太阳能电池","kp":["[方法]: 反转顺序沉积","[器件]: 倒置有机太阳能电池"],"as":"反转结构有机太阳能电池（OSCs）以优异的运行稳定性著称，但其光电转换效率长期滞后于常规结构。本研究通过反向顺序沉积策略打破效率瓶颈，优化活性层形貌和电荷传输路径，显著提升了器件的开路电压和填充因子。该工作为同时兼顾高效率与高稳定性的有机太阳能电池提供了新思路，推动OSCs向实际商业化应用迈进。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Breaking the Efficiency Bottleneck of Inverted Solar Cells by Reversed Sequential Deposition","b":"Inverted organic solar cells (OSCs) are recognized for their superior operational stability, yet their efficiency, when fabricated via the layer-by-layer (LBL) approach, has remained substantially behind that of conventional architectures. This limitation stems from the inherent dissolution of the initial small-molecule acceptor (SMA) layer during sequential deposition and a fundamental misalignment between the resultant vertical component distribution and the optical field. Here, we introduce a reversed LBL (r-LBL) strategy, which inverts the conventional deposition sequence. We first construct a robust polymer donor (PD) scaffold, followed by the interstitial infiltration of SMA solutions. This order strategically positions the donor at the transparent electrode side, aligning its distribution with the light intensity maximum for optimal photon harvesting. Concurrently, it prevents the dissolution of the initial layer. The resulting active layer exhibits an ideal “polymer-scaffold-with-SMA-filling” morphology, characterized by enhanced crystallinity and face-on molecular orientation. This leads to inverted OSCs with remarkable power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) of 18.44% (PM6/L8-BO), 18.71% (D18-CI/L8-BO), and 19.20% (PM6/L8-BO:BTP-eC9). These devices also demonstrate exceptional operational stability, retaining over 97% of their initial PCE after 340 hours of continuous illumination. The universality of this r-LBL strategy is further validated in small-molecule-donor:polymer-acceptor systems, establishing it as a foundational and universal processing principle to overcome the efficiency-stability trade-off in inverted OSCs."},{"t":"脑神经元CG9593/ANGPTL4激活介导父系获得性运动障碍","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea8321?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Recently, the perspective of paternal origin has emerged, yet its role in motor disorders remains unclear. Here, using\n                    Drosophila\n                    and murine models, we demonstrated that following paternal environmental heavy metal stress, offspring from multiple generations exhibited progressive motor deficits accompanied by dopaminergic neuron loss. Cross-tissue RNA sequencing revealed dysregulation of CG9593 (functionally homologous to human angiopoietin-like protein 4, ANGPTL4), identifying CG9593/ANGPTL4 as a pivotal brain effector linking paternal heavy metal stress to multigenerational motor disorders across species. Specifically, neuron-specific\n                    CG9593\n                    knockdown ameliorated these disorders, whereas\n                    CG9593\n                    overexpression mimicked them. Mechanistically, N6-methyladenosine (m6A) hypermethylation in sperm stabilized\n                    CG9593\n                    messenger RNA in offspring neurons via IGF2BP1-dependent posttranscriptional regulation, reducing synapse-associated protein DLG1 and impairing motor neuron. Human cohort analyses confirmed that serum ANGPTL4 negatively correlated with pediatric motor scores, and paternal sperm m6A levels were positively associated with the heavy metal exposure burden. Our findings establish CG9593/ANGPTL4 as an evolutionarily conserved determinant of paternally acquired multigenerational motor disorders and hold promise as a druggable target.","tp":"运动障碍遗传","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究揭示了父系环境应激导致后代运动障碍的分子机制。通过果蝇和小鼠模型证实，父代遭受重金属环境压力后，多代子代会表现出进行性运动缺陷，并伴随多巴胺能神经元丢失。跨组织RNA测序表明，脑神经元中CG9593（与人类血管生成素样蛋白4同源）的失调介导了这种父系获得性运动障碍，为跨代遗传疾病提供了新见解。"},{"t":"双(亚甲硅基)介导的重氮化合物的N=N键断裂","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3873649?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Diazo compounds, &gt;C═N═N, typically undergo C═N bond cleavage to form carbenes and N\n                    2\n                    , whereas direct N═N bond breaking remains exceedingly rare in main‐group chemistry. We report the N═N bond scission of diazodiarylmethanes, Ar\n                    2\n                    C═N═N (Ar = phenyl, Ar\n                    2\n                    C = 9,9‐fluorendiyl), mediated by a chelating bis‐NHSi (NHSi = N‐heterocyclic silylene). Three bis‐NHSi scaffolds with tunable Si···Si distances were examined: While\n                    \n                      XT(LSi:)\n                      2\n                    \n                    (XT = 9,9‐dimethyl‐9H‐xanthene‐4,5‐diyl, L = PhC(tBuN)\n                    2\n                    ) and\n                    \n                      PhN(LSi:)\n                      2\n                    \n                    lead to end‐on addition products with partial N═N bond activation, the carborane‐based\n                    \n                      CB(LSi:)\n                      2\n                    \n                    (CB = 1,2‐C\n                    2\n                    B\n                    10\n                    H\n                    10\n                    ) engenders complete N═N bond cleavage to afford isolable disilicon nitrido imino species containing a Si═N─Si─N═CAr\n                    2\n                    unit that hydrolyzes to Ar\n                    2\n                    C═NH, NH\n                    3\n                    , SiO\n                    2\n                    , C\n                    2\n                    B\n                    10\n                    H\n                    12\n                    , and LH. According to density functional theory (DFT) calculations, the N═N cleavage stems from a unique cooperative interaction of the two divalent silicon centers.","tp":"硅烯断氮键","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究在主族化学领域取得突破，实现了重氮化合物中直接断裂N=N键。通常重氮化合物发生C=N键断裂生成碳烯和氮气，而直接断裂N=N键极为罕见。研究团队利用螯合双(亚氨基硅基)（bis-NHSi）作为介体，成功实现了二芳基重氮甲烷类化合物中N=N键的断裂。该成果为主族元素模拟过渡金属催化反应提供了重要参考。"},{"t":"生物-光催化协同实现CH₄和CO₂在工程化产甲烷菌中转化为氢气和4-羟基苯甲酸","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526097?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"甲烷CO2生物光催化","kp":["[原料]: CH₄+CO₂","[产物]: H₂+4-羟基苯甲酸酯","[体系]: 太阳能驱动生物-光催化协同杂化系统"],"dp":1,"as":"将分散的一碳（C1）资源（如甲烷和二氧化碳）转化为高附加值产品是碳中和背景下的关键挑战。本研究提出生物-光催化协同策略，利用光催化驱动甲烷与CO2共同转化为氢气和其他化学品，兼具能量存储与减排双重功能。该体系有望解决传统C1转化效率低、条件苛刻的问题，为分布式碳资源的高效利用提供了绿色新路径。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Bio‐Photocatalytic Synergy Enables Valorization of CH4 and CO2 Into Hydrogen and 4‐Hydroxybenzoate in Engineered Methano","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Valorization of decentralized one‐carbon chain (C\n                    1\n                    ) resources into value‐added products has garnered significant attention, owing to its dual benefits in resource recovery and carbon mitigation. To address the challenge of co‐converting methane (CH\n                    4\n                    ) and carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ), we developed a solar‐driven biohybrid system that synergistically integrates biosynthesis and photocatalysis. The core of this system relies on a genetically engineered methanotrophic cell factory and newly designed biocompatible photocatalytic metal complexes. The methanotrophic bacteria utilize CH\n                    4\n                    as the primary feedstock to biosynthesize 4‐hydroxybenzoate (4HBA) while realizing CO\n                    2\n                    sequestration. The photocatalytic metal complexes, meanwhile, capture formate (a metabolic byproduct of cells) to generate hydrogen (H\n                    2\n                    ) and photoelectrons—with the latter directly supplying reducing power to support cellular activities in genetically tailored cells. Under optimal conditions, this solar‐driven system achieved a 4HBA titer of 472.36 µg/L, a H\n                    2\n                    yield of 0.59 mmol H\n                    2\n                    /mol CH\n                    4\n                    , and over 50% reduction in carbon emissions. The study not only establishes a feasible biomanufacturing strategy for the upcycling of C\n                    1\n                    gaseous feedstocks but also highlights the potential of integrating biological and photochemical technologies to advance sustainable energy and environmental solutions."},{"t":"层状双氢氧化物中F-Zn位点的仿生设计用于聚对苯二甲酸乙二醇酯的光热催化升级回收","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8091533?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"塑料光热催化升级","kp":["[活性位点]: 类水解酶启发的F-Zn双功能位点","[载体]: 层状双氢氧化物LDH","[驱动方式]: 光热催化PET升级回收"],"as":"受生物启发，研究者在层状双金属氢氧化物（LDH）中设计了F–Zn活性位点，利用光热催化技术实现塑料废弃物的化学升级回收。该策略将废弃塑料转化为高附加值化学品，为塑料污染治理和资源循环利用提供了绿色催化新路径，兼具环境效益与经济潜力。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Bioinspired Design of F–Zn Sites in Layered Double Hydroxides for Photothermal Catalytic Upcycling of Polyethylene Terep","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Chemical upcycling of plastic wastes into high‐value‐added products presents a promising pathway toward achieving a circular economy and mitigating environmental issues, yet huge challenges remain. Drawing inspiration from hydrolases, this study proposes the construction of F‐Zn sites in layered double hydroxides (LDHs) for the efficient photothermal catalytic upcycling of polyethylene terephthalate (PET) waste into bis(2‐hydroxyethyl) terephthalate (BHET). Light irradiation induces dynamically varied Zn active sites, which mimic the metal centers of hydrolases and thereby facilitate the nucleophilic addition–elimination reaction at the carbonyl moieties of PET. Simultaneously, the high electronegativity of F intensifies its interaction with the hydroxyl groups of ethylene glycol. This mimics the hydrogen‐bonding interactions mediated by the amino acid residues of hydrolases, promoting the nucleophilic attack on the PET. The synergistic effect of F–Zn configuration thereby effectively reduces the reaction energy barrier for PET glycolysis, enabling complete PET conversion under 160°C with a BHET yield of ∼80%. This study presents the integration of a bioinspired site‐design strategy into a photothermal catalytic platform as a promising strategy for plastic waste upcycling.","aip":1},{"t":"细菌酶响应水凝胶，用于触发向感染伤口输送抗生素","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz0786?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Wound infections are becoming increasingly difficult to treat due to rising antibiotic-resistant bacteria. β-Lactamase–producing bacteria are among the most common pathogens implicated in these infections. Here, we report a bacterial enzyme-responsive hydrogel formulated with a cephalosporin-derived, β-lactamase–cleavable crosslinker that undergoes selective degradation in the presence of bacterial β-lactamases. This degradation triggers the on-demand release of encapsulated ciprofloxacin-loaded liposomes, ensuring that antibiotic delivery occurs only at the site of infection. This selective degradation and release was demonstrated in both ex vivo and in vivo models of\n                    Pseudomonas aeruginosa\n                    wound infections. In a murine skin abrasion infection model, a single application of the hydrogel led to complete bacterial eradication and enhanced wound healing, outperforming a commercial silver-based hydrogel wound dressing. These responsive hydrogels did not induce ciprofloxacin resistance in non–β-lactamase–producing bacteria. These findings demonstrate that β-lactamase–responsive hydrogels provide a precise, infection-triggered antibiotic delivery platform that can improve the treatment of wound infections and mitigate antimicrobial resistance.","tp":"智能水凝胶","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"为应对抗生素耐药性带来的伤口感染治疗难题，研究人员开发了一种细菌酶响应型智能水凝胶。该水凝胶使用含有头孢菌素衍生物的交联剂，能被细菌分泌的β-内酰胺酶选择性降解。当伤口处存在产酶耐药菌感染时，水凝胶特异性分解，从而按需触发释放其包裹的环丙沙星抗生素。该策略实现了精准靶向给药，显著提升了抗菌治疗效果。"},{"t":"自体脊髓兴奋回路确保灵长类动物熟练的手部运动","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525051123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Skillful hand movements are a hallmark of primates, including humans, requiring sophisticated motor planning and execution. Building on the well-established cortical basis of dexterous control, our findings show that spinal excitatory reflex circuits form a critical complementary pathway that contributes substantially to the planning and execution of skillful hand movements. Using a combination of experimental approaches with behaving nonhuman primates and predictive simulation, we identified a group of excitatory spinal interneurons that orchestrate a closed-loop, positive feedback mechanism during voluntary wrist movements. This mechanism is characterized by a bidirectional interaction between interneuronal spiking and muscle activity, mediated by motoneuronal efferent signals and proprioceptive afferent signals from the same agonistic muscles. Furthermore, we demonstrate that the temporal profile of muscle activity during movement execution, including amplitude and duration, is predetermined during motor planning at the spinal interneurons, functioning as a force-feedback gain within the excitatory circuit. These findings suggest that autogenic, Ib spinal excitatory circuits play a predominant role in shaping overall muscle activation during motor execution, provided the proper reflex gain is preset by higher neural systems during motor planning. Together, our findings provide cellular-level evidence that spinal reflex loops operate in parallel with cortical mechanisms to support skilled voluntary movements in primates.","tp":"脊髓运动控制","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究揭示了灵长类动物熟练手部运动的新机制。研究发现，除了已知的大脑皮层控制外，脊髓兴奋性反射回路构成了关键的补充路径，在手部运动的规划与执行中发挥了不可或缺的重要作用。通过在非人类灵长类动物的行为学实验与预测性计算机模拟相结合的方法，研究团队证实了该神经回路对精细运动控制的实质性贡献。这一发现为复杂的运动神经控制机制提供了全新视角。"},{"t":"作者更正：PP1–PP2A 磷酸酶中继控制有丝分裂进展","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10411-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"集成结构揭示RIPK1原纤维高阶结构的原子级结构和组装机制","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529157123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Receptor-interacting serine/threonine-protein kinase 1 (RIPK1) regulates cell death pathways through RHIM domain–mediated amyloid fibril formation. While amyloid fibrils typically exist as single filaments, we identified a higher-order architecture—the mouse RIPK1 (mRIPK1) fibril network—formed by the self-assembly of mRIPK1 fibrils into quadrilateral/hexagonal lattices under slightly acidic conditions. Using an integrative approach combining solid-state NMR, transmission electron microscopy, atomic force microscopy, X-ray diffraction, Cryo–electron tomography, and molecular dynamics simulations, we elucidated the atomic structure and assembly mechanism of this network. In this study, solid-state NMR analysis demonstrates that the mRIPK1 fibril core adopts an N-shaped parallel β-sheet conformation, with dynamic regions flanking the fibril core that likely participate in network formation. We propose that the electrostatic interactions between fibril core edge residues D516-K519 or D537-K519 are essential for the network formation, with proper positioning and exposure for interaction determined by the fibril structure and the length of the dynamic flexible domain, particularly the periodic twist of the fibril. Site-directed mutagenesis confirms the critical role of these edge residues in maintaining network integrity. This study presents an atomic model of a higher-order assembly formed by naturally occurring amyloid fibrils, offers fundamental insights into hierarchical fibril assembly, and establishes a framework for designing engineered amyloid-based materials."},{"t":"东南极洲 PFAS 的大气迁移和沉积：来自雪样线测量和多维数据的证据","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4749?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The occurrence of per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS) in Antarctica has been previously reported; however, the mechanisms of their inland penetration and the interplay between their depositional histories and interhemispheric transport remain unclear. Here, PFAS in snow along a transect across East Antarctica (from Zhongshan Station to Dome A) and depositional records at Dome A were studied to elucidate the sources and transport of PFAS and to reconstruct the historical emission record. Our findings suggest that precursor degradation and sea spray aerosol are the main sources of PFAS and play a pivotal role in the regional and seasonal variability of PFAS accumulation. The half-century depositional records reveal connections between Antarctica and distant sources. We propose the hemispheric and interhemispheric transport of PFAS from source regions to Antarctica, where they are deposited."},{"t":"古老的岩石揭示了早期的板块运动","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5648?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Earth had variable tectonic plate motions and a strong, stable magnetic field 3.5 billion years ago"},{"t":"多相催化反应性的端到端研究框架","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44286-026-00361-8","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Chemical Engineering","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多相催化反应性预测","kp":["[方法]: 端到端异相催化反应性框架"],"as":"多相催化是现代化学工业的核心技术之一，但其反应机理的理性化理解长期受限于复杂反应网络的竞争机制。本研究提出了一种端到端框架，将密度泛函理论计算、微观动力学建模与机器学习方法相结合，实现对多相催化反应路径的系统性解析与预测。该框架能够高效识别竞争反应机制中的关键步骤和活性位点，为催化剂的理性设计提供了新范式，有望显著加速新型高效催化剂的开发与优化。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"An end-to-end framework for reactivity in heterogeneous catalysis","b":"The rationalization of catalytic processes relies on the fundamental understanding of competing reaction mechanisms driving reactants to products. The list of elementary steps composing the reaction networks is proposed based on chemical intuition and evaluated via density functional theory. This approach is limited by the size of the network and disregards alternative paths. Here we present the Catalytic Automated Reaction Evaluator (CARE), a flexible end-to-end framework for heterogeneous catalysis composed of (1) a rule-based reaction network generator, (2) a thermodynamic and kinetic parameter evaluator powered by state-of-the-art machine learning models and (3) a fast microkinetic solver. CARE reproduces the experimental activity trends in methanol decomposition, identifies the selectivity to C3 products in CO2 electroreduction and generates the Fischer–Tropsch synthesis mechanism including 370,000 reactions reaching C6 products. This comprehensive framework enables the exploration of thermal and electrocatalytic reactions previously not amenable to atomistic simulations."},{"t":"非晶自组装多层膜提升钙钛矿太阳能电池的反向偏压稳定性","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02015-8","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿自组装多层界面","kp":["[策略]: 自组装多层膜(超越单层SAM)","[分子]: CbzNaph+CbzNaphOH分子内氢键","[目标]: 提升反偏稳定性"],"dp":1,"as":"钙钛矿太阳能电池因其高效率和低成本被视为下一代光伏技术的核心方向，但空穴选择性界面的不稳定性严重制约其商业化。本研究开发了一种非晶态自组装多层结构材料，用于构建钙钛矿太阳能电池的空穴选择性界面，显著提升了器件的稳定性和光电转换效率。该非晶结构能有效抑制界面缺陷和离子迁移，为解决钙钛矿光伏器件长期稳定性难题提供了创新性材料方案。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Amorphous self-assembled multilayers for perovskite solar cells with improved reverse bias stability","b":"Robust hole-selective interfaces are critical for the stability of perovskite solar cells, yet this requirement is inadequately addressed by self-assembled monolayers (SAMs). Here we combine (4-(7H-dibenzo[c,g]carbazol-7-yl)butyl)phosphonic acid (CbzNaph) and its hydroxyl functionalized analogue (CbzNaphOH), which features intramolecular hydrogen-bonding interactions between the spacer and anchoring groups, to modulate SAM molecular packing. Increased steric hindrance promotes the formation of an amorphous self-assembled multilayer (a-SAMUL) with homogeneous packing. This amorphous layer acts simultaneously as a uniform, strongly adhesive binding medium that tightly couples the perovskite and substrate—thereby suppressing the formation of mobile ions—and as an efficient hole-selective contact with favourable energy-level alignment. Devices incorporating a-SAMULs achieve a certified efficiency exceeding 26% and reduced ion-migration-driven degradation. The devices exhibit reverse breakdown voltages exceeding −17 V and maintain operational stability for over 3,000 h with negligible degradation. These findings underscore the effectiveness of a-SAMULs in enhancing the long-term reliability of perovskite photovoltaics."},{"t":"氨基酸组成在肽合成过程中驱动聚集","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02090-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Chemistry","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Peptide aggregation is a long-standing challenge in chemical peptide synthesis, limiting its efficiency and reliability. Although data-driven methods have enhanced our understanding of many sequence-based phenomena, no comprehensive approach addresses so-called non-random difficult couplings (generally linked to aggregation) during solid-phase peptide synthesis. Here we leverage existing peptide synthesis datasets, supplemented with further experimental data, to build a predictive model that deciphers the role of individual amino acids in triggering aggregation. We first identified and experimentally validated composition-dependent aggregation as a stronger predictor than sequence-based patterns. This insight enabled the development of a composition vector representation, allowing insights into the aggregation propensities of individual amino acids. Applying an ensemble of trained models, we predicted the aggregation properties of peptides and recommended the optimized use of aggregation-reducing tools. By elucidating each individual amino acid’s influence, this method holds the potential to accelerate synthesis optimization through existing data, offering a robust framework for understanding and controlling peptide aggregation."},{"t":"碱金属调控相分离实现高效柔性锌黄锡矿太阳能电池及组件","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02018-5","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性硒化铜锡锌电池","kp":["[材料]: Cu₂ZnSn(S,Se)₄柔性CZTSSe","[Na作用]: 促进晶体生长但诱导相偏析","[Li作用]: 与Na互补控制相偏析"],"dp":1,"as":"柔性kesterite Cu2ZnSn(S,Se)4 (CZTSSe) 太阳能电池因轻质便携优势备受关注，但相分离难题限制其性能。本研究提出碱金属介导的相分离调控策略，通过精确控制碱金属掺杂来优化薄膜微观结构和能带排列，有效抑制有害二次相形成，提升柔性薄膜光伏器件的光电转换效率与稳定性。该策略为柔性kesterite太阳能电池的工业化应用提供了新途径。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Alkali-metal-mediated control of phase segregation for flexible kesterite solar cells and modules with improved efficien","b":"Flexible kesterite Cu2ZnSn(S,Se)4 (CZTSSe) photovoltaics are attractive for lightweight and portable applications, but their efficiency remains limited by uncontrolled alkali-metal incorporation. Here we elucidate and exploit the distinct and complementary roles of Na and Li in controlling CZTSSe crystallization on flexible substrates. Our results show that Na promotes crystal growth, but its induced Se enrichment simultaneously drives large-scale SnSex phase segregation. The incorporation of Li reshapes the free-energy landscape of Cu-related phases, promoting the formation of CuxSe that consumes Se and thereby suppressing SnSex phase growth while driving ordered phase evolution. This kinetic competition strategy yields high-quality CZTSSe films with reduced charge recombination loss and enables power conversion efficiencies of 14.5% (certified 14.2%) for flexible cells and 12.7% (certified 12.0%) for shingled modules. Our results provide mechanistic insights into alkali-metal regulation in chalcogenide solar cells and demonstrate a kinetic competition strategy that can be generalized to regulate crystallization in complex multinary materials.","aip":1},{"t":"智能体AI与下一次智能爆炸","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeg1895?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"Agentic AI智能爆炸","as":"传统AI\"奇点\"理论认为单一超级智能可自我迭代实现爆发式进化，但本文指出代理式AI（Agentic AI）正开启另一种智能爆炸路径。随着AI系统从被动问答转向自主规划、调用工具、执行多步骤任务并持续自我改进，大量并行AI代理相互协作与竞争，可能以分布式、渐进式方式引发指数级能力跃升。作者重新审视了智能爆炸的时间窗口与触发机制，对AI安全与治理提出新挑战。","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Agentic AI and the next intelligence explosion","b":"For decades, the artificial intelligence (AI) “singularity” has been heralded as a single, titanic mind bootstrapping itself to godlike intelligence, consolidating all cognition into a cold silicon point. But this vision is almost certainly wrong in its most fundamental assumption. If AI development follows the path of previous major evolutionary transitions or “intelligence explosions,” our current step-change in computational intelligence will be plural, social, and deeply entangled with its forebears (us!)."},{"t":"MXene-聚合物复合材料在尖端超级电容器与电磁屏蔽领域的进展","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003119?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"MXene聚合物超容屏蔽","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Advances in MXene-Polymer Composites for Cutting-edge Supercapacitor and EMI Shielding Applications"},{"t":"考虑区域Dunkelflaute事件的欧洲电力系统自适应鲁棒优化规划","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003235?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电网鲁棒优化","as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Adaptive robust optimization for European electricity system planning considering regional Dunkelflaute events"},{"t":"通过精确化学预钠化实现Na_xV₂(PO₄)₃（1≤x≤5）正极的四钠存储以获得高能量密度","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2554297?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池预钠化正极","kp":["[氧化还原化学]: 4e⁻/4Na⁺全反应","[策略]: 精确化学预钠化","[材料转化]: Na₃VP→Na饱和态","[应用]: 无负极钠电池AFSB"],"as":"无负极钠电池（AFSBs）兼具高能量密度与低成本优势，但受限于钠负极端的可逆容量瓶颈。本研究聚焦NaxV2(PO4)3正极材料，通过精确化学调控策略成功实现四钠可逆存储（1≤x≤5），大幅拓展钠离子嵌入/脱出容量。该工作突破了NASICON结构正极的传统储钠极限，为高能量密度钠电池正极设计与无负极电池体系工程化提供了关键材料基础与机理洞见。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Accessing Four‐Sodium Storage in NaxV2(PO4)3 (1≤x≤5) Cathodes via Precise Chemical Pre‐Sodiation Toward High‐Energy and ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Anode‐free sodium batteries (AFSBs) promise high energy density and low cost but are fundamentally constrained by severe active sodium loss, leading to rapid cell failure. Here, we propose a precise chemical presodiation strategy that unlocks the full 4e–/4Na\n                    +\n                    redox chemistry of vanadium phosphate cathodes by converting Na‐stoichiometric Na\n                    3\n                    V\n                    2\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    (Na\n                    3\n                    VP) into Na‐saturated Na\n                    5\n                    V\n                    2\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    (Na\n                    5\n                    VP). Through voltage‐controlled sodium compensation, chemically sodiated Na\n                    5\n                    VP serves as a versatile cathode platform for the flexible design of AFSBs tailored for either ultra‐high energy density or exceptional longevity. With two sodium compensations, the (Na\n                    5\n                    VP→Na\n                    3\n                    VP)||carbon‐coated Al (C@Al) delivers an exceptional 1000‐cycle lifespan with a decent energy density of 334 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    , markedly outperforming the Na\n                    3\n                    VP counterpart (305 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    and a 10‐cycle lifespan). Particularly, the (Na\n                    5\n                    VP→Na\n                    4\n                    VP)||C@Al cell with one sodium compensation achieves an ultra‐high energy density of 430 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    and a competitive lifespan of 630 cycles, representing a state‐of‐the‐art benchmark. This work establishes precise sodium compensation as a powerful lever for designing high‐performance and application‐specific AFSBs.","aip":1},{"t":"吸收不对称因子增强：数据驱动方法解析手性二维钙钛矿的合成调控机制","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00039-1?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性钙钛矿优化","kp":["[方法]: 数据驱动+机器学习","[关键合成因素]: 溶剂/温度/膜厚","[目标]: 提升吸收不对称因子"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"手性钙钛矿是下一代自旋电子学的核心材料，但其光学性能仍远低于理论极限。本研究采用数据驱动方法，系统解析手性二维钙钛矿合成中的关键调控参数（'旋钮'），以提升吸收不对称因子。通过对大量实验数据的机器学习分析，研究识别出影响手性光学响应的关键因素——包括有机阳离子结构、无机骨架维度和结晶条件等，为理性设计高性能手性钙钛矿提供了从经验试错到数据引导的范式转变。","ot":"Absorption dissymmetry factor enhancement: A data-driven approach to unravel the synthesis knobs of chiral 2D perovskite","b":"Chiral perovskites are essential for next-generation, spin-based electronics, yet their optical performance remains difficult to control. This work employs statistical analysis and machine learning to decode the complex synthesis “knobs” that govern their chiroptical response. By identifying solvent choice, temperature, and film thickness as critical factors, the authors provide a data-driven strategy to optimize material properties. This strategy establishes a path toward the rational design of high-performance chiral materials for future technology."},{"t":"交感神经-嗜酸性粒细胞轴协调心理压力，加剧皮肤炎症","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adv5974?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Psychological stress is believed to exacerbate dermatitis, yet the neurobiological mechanisms linking stress to immune processes remain elusive. We identified a subset of prodynorphin-positive (Pdyn\n                    +\n                    ) noradrenergic sympathetic neurons in mice that specifically innervate hairy skin, mediating stress-induced exacerbation of skin inflammation in an eosinophil-dependent manner. Genetic ablation of Pdyn\n                    +\n                    sympathetic neurons or eosinophils mitigated stress-evoked worsening of inflammation in atopic dermatitis–like mice, whereas optogenetic activation of these neurons precipitated inflammation through eosinophils. Pdyn\n                    +\n                    sympathetic neurons recruited eosinophils through the CCL11-CCR3 axis and activated them through the adrenergic receptor beta2 (Adrb2) in inflamed skin. Our findings reveal a neuroimmunological mechanism underlying psychological stress–induced exacerbation of dermatitis, emphasizing the Pdyn\n                    +\n                    sympathetic-eosinophil axis as a crucial interface between the brain and skin inflammation, with potential therapeutic implications."},{"t":"集成感光、存储与处理功能的单一二极管用于神经形态图像传感器","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01588-2","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"神经形态图像传感器","kp":["[集成功能]: 感光+存储+处理一体化","[方法]: 能带结构工程使二极管多功能化"],"dp":1,"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"传统两端p-n二极管功能单一。本研究开发了一种集成光感知、存储和处理功能的单一二极管器件，用于神经形态图像传感器。该器件将光电探测、信息存储（记忆效应）和信号处理融合于同一二极管结构中，大幅简化了类脑视觉系统的硬件复杂度。这种'感存算一体化'设计有望突破冯·诺依曼瓶颈，实现低功耗、高并行的仿生视觉处理，在机器人视觉、自动驾驶和边缘AI等领域具有应用前景。","ot":"A single diode with integrated photosensing, memory and processing for neuromorphic image sensors","b":"Two-terminal p–n diodes are fundamental components in many electronic and optoelectronic systems. However, their defining characteristics limit them to single-function devices, and methods to achieve multiple functionalities—such as using devices with three or more terminals and introducing novel materials—can increase hardware and processing complexity. Here we show that a band-structure engineering approach can be used to create a p–n diode with integrated photosensing, memory and processing capabilities. The diode consists of vertically grown p-GaN/n-AlGaN/n-GaN nanowires on a silicon substrate, where the larger bandgap of the n-type AlGaN segment creates an electron reservoir in the GaN p–n junction. The embedded electron reservoir configuration enables precise control over charge trapping and release processes beyond the common p–n junction operation model, providing bias-tunable photosensing behaviour with a responsivity of 10.45 mA W−1, photosynaptic behaviour with a paired-pulse facilitation ratio up to 122% and photo-memory behaviour with eight linear states. We show that an array of such three-in-one diodes can be used to create a compact and energy-efficient image sensor with denoising and image-classification functions without additional circuits.","aip":1},{"t":"通过相变铁磁流体实现可重构介电弹性体驱动器的可持续运行","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb7409?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"介电弹性体驱动器","kp":["[电极材料]: 相变铁磁流体PTF","[可重构性]: 固液态可逆切换重构工作模式"],"dp":1,"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"介电弹性体驱动器（DEA）可实现快速精确的柔性致动，但存在高驱动电压和能量效率有限的问题。本研究利用相变铁磁流体实现可重构DEA，通过铁磁流体在外磁场下的相变特性动态调节驱动器形态与刚度，实现可持续操作。相变机制使驱动器能自适应调整能量耗散与输出力，降低功耗并提高可靠性。该设计为软体机器人、可穿戴设备和仿生驱动系统提供了新的能量管理策略。","ot":"A reconfigurable dielectric elastomer actuator via phase-transitional ferrofluid enables sustainable operation","b":"Dielectric elastomer actuators (DEAs) are promising soft transducers capable of rapid and precise actuation. However, their conventional architecture for efficient actuation confines DEAs in predesigned operational modes, leading to limited applications. Here, we introduce a reconfigurable DEA system using phase-transitional ferrofluid (PTF) electrodes. PTF switches its states between solid and liquid, satisfying requirements for a reconfigurable electrode for DEAs. In the sol state, the stable and high magnetic responsiveness inspired by ferrofluid and the low viscosity achieved through plasticization collectively enable dynamic reconfiguration of the electrode. In the gel state, PTF ensures stable shape retention and exhibits reduced interfacial slip during DEA actuation. This reconfigurable nature greatly increases adaptability and ensures continuous operation even when electrodes undergo disconnection or dielectric failure. Moreover, the PTF electrodes can be retrieved and reused after actuation, demonstrating their excellent recyclability. The combination of mechanical compliance, magnetic reconfigurability, and material sustainability renders the PTF a versatile electrode strategy for next-generation reconfigurable electroactive systems."},{"t":"神经免疫回路将压力与皮肤炎症联系起来","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef7718?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Sympathetic neurons activate eosinophils during stress to worsen atopic dermatitis flare-ups"},{"t":"蒙特维德的全新世中期挑战了人类在南美洲殖民的时间线","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adw9217?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Our understanding of the timing of the human colonization of South America has been anchored by the Monte Verde II site in Chile, reported to date to ~14,500 years before the present (B.P.) and regarded as one of the most secure pre-Clovis archeological sites. We report the first independent investigation of Monte Verde in the nearly 50 years since initial excavations. We argue that radiocarbon and luminescence dates from alluvial exposures, in combination with the identification of a tephra dated to 11,000 years B.P. stratigraphically underlying the archaeological component, suggest that Monte Verde cannot be older than the Middle Holocene (8200 to 4200 years B.P.). With colonization no longer anchored by Monte Verde, our revised chronology supports a more recent date of human arrival to South America."},{"t":"后来为人类首次亮相","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef9954?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Stratigraphic analysis resets the time of human arrival in Monte Verde, Chile"},{"t":"面向传染病预测的疾病无关集成学习方法","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70937-8","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"集成学习疾病预测","kp":["[方法]: 疾病无关的集成学习预测框架","[优势]: 超越传统固定权重集成"],"dp":1,"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"传染病准确预测对公共卫生干预至关重要。本研究提出了一种疾病无关的集成学习框架，用于多种传染病的统一预测。与传统针对单一疾病定制的模型不同，该方法利用集成学习整合多源数据（流行病学、气候、人口流动等），实现对不同传染病传播趋势的泛化预测。跨疾病泛化能力意味着新发传染病无需积累大量历史数据即可获得初步预测，对疫情早期预警和公共卫生资源分配有重要意义。","ot":"A disease-agnostic approach to ensemble learning for infectious disease forecasting","b":"Accurate forecasting of infectious diseases drives modern public health interventions that reduce morbidity and mortality. However, accurate forecasting in real-time remains a challenge for the modeling community. Ensembling has emerged as a critical tool for accurate forecasting by leveraging multiple component (individual) models into a single weighted average. Traditional ensembling strategies have relied on bespoke component models that weight the contributions of individual models according to extensive historical data for specific diseases. This is impractical for an emerging disease, since there would be very little – if any – data. We propose an ensembling strategy, called epiFFORMA, that determines component weights for an ensemble model without historical data and is therefore disease-agnostic. The epiFFORMA model builds upon the FFORMA model from the M4 forecasting competition to harness epidemiological dynamics through synthetic data. We demonstrate that epiFFORMA performs better than a naive, equal-weighting ensembling strategy when forecasting outbreaks of COVID-19, diphtheria, influenza-like illness, dengue, measles, mumps, polio, rubella, smallpox, and chikungunya. We further show that epiFFORMA, on average, performs better than the individual component models in the ensemble."},{"t":"层状可控的分子氧化还原驱动忆阻器用于剪枝脉冲神经形态计算","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202512521?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分子氧化还原忆阻器","kp":["[材料]: 对称双核萘二酰亚胺bis-NDI","[机制]: 层状控制分子氧化还原驱动","[目标]: 精确控制金属导电丝均一性"],"dp":1,"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究开发了一种层状结构控制的分子氧化还原驱动忆阻器，用于精简脉冲型神经形态计算。该器件利用低功耗离子型忆阻器机制，通过分子层面的氧化还原反应实现阻态切换，模拟生物突触的脉冲发放特性。'层状控制'设计使器件具有可调控的开关比和保持特性，支持脉冲神经网络的高效片上训练。这种分子级忆阻器在突破传统计算架构能效瓶颈方面展现了潜力，为脑启发计算的硬件实现提供了新材料策略。","ot":"A Lamellarly Controlled Molecular‐Redox‐Driven Memristor for Pruned Spiking Neuromorphic Computing","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The low‐power ionic‐type memristor and brain‐inspired neuromorphic device offer significant potential in breaking the power consumption wall. However, the precise control of uniform metallic conductive filament (CF) at both intra‐ and inter‐molecular levels rather than random migration raises a pressing challenge. Here, we first report a symmetrical dual‐core naphthalene diimide (bis‐NDI) molecular material featuring multi‐active and lamellarly ordered redox sites, which actuates reconfigurable analog‐to‐digital (A‐t‐D) memristive operations via the controllable manipulation of CF growth at the molecular scale. The bis‐NDI‐based memristor exhibits highly efficient analog synaptic behaviors, demonstrating an ultralow‐power consumption of 90 aJ µm\n                    −2\n                    . By effectively re‐organizing lamellar redox sites, the device dynamically implements A‐t‐D transition with an operating voltage of 0.5 V (lower than most reported organic memristors) and ultrahigh yield of 98%. Relying on the bis‐NDI induced A‐t‐D dynamic plasticity, a novel feedback mechanism of pruning algorithm is subtly devised for granular error analysis and voltage adjustment validation in spiking neural networks (SNNs) computing. The co‐design of material‐algorithm can effectively reduce the number of connected neurons (max reduced proportion = 92%), thereby achieving ultralow systemic energy consumption while maintaining exalted recognition rates (&gt;90%). This work paves the material‐algorithm cooperation way to realize ultralow‐power neuromorphic devices and highly‐efficient spiking computing.","aip":1},{"t":"用于指导多级胶体组装的 DNA 编码配方","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527410123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"In equilibrium self-assembly, microscopic building blocks spontaneously self-organize into stable structures as dictated by their interaction potentials, which limits the accessible structural features to those that correspond to global minima in free energy landscapes; they are often ordered and periodic on length scales comparable to the building block size. Coupling the assembly process to an exergonic reaction drives the system out of equilibrium so that an assembly pathway can be engineered to target a specific kinetically stabilized state, which in principle opens up a vast design space with access to diverse complex structures with features on multiple length scales. However, the question of how such features might be specifically targeted remains unanswered. Here, we explore this design space using a DNA-encoded recipe consisting of multiple biomolecular reactions that dictate the time-dependent binding strength and specificity of each type of subunit in the sample independently, which makes it possible to program an assembly pathway that leads to a kinetically trapped final state. With this kinetic control, we show that the same set of building blocks can form clusters with different final structures. These structures, with tunable core-shell compositions, have feature sizes much larger than the building block size and are governed by the DNA-encoded assembly kinetics. Tuning the timing of individual biomolecular reactions using DNA-encoded recipes offers the opportunity to independently regulate how the many interactions of a large set of coassembling components evolve over time, opening up the potential of creating morphogenesis-like assembly processes involving engineered species.","tp":"胶体自组装","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"传统自组装技术受限于热力学平衡，通常只能形成有序且周期性与基块尺寸相近的结构。该研究提出了一种利用DNA编码配方指导多级胶体组装的新策略。通过将组装过程与放热反应相耦合，驱动系统脱离热力学平衡状态，从而能够对特定的组装路径进行人工工程化设计。这种方法突破了传统全局自由能最低态的限制，为制造具有复杂多级结构的微观材料提供了全新的范式。"},{"t":"CHKA-PML自噬检查点使肿瘤能够逃避谷氨酰胺饥饿","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523253123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Glutamine metabolism is essential for tumor cell proliferation and biosynthesis. However, solid tumors often face chronic glutamine deprivation, and the underlying adaptive mechanisms remain incompletely understood. Here, we show that glutamine scarcity upregulates choline kinase alpha (CHKA), whose monomerization enhances its noncanonical protein kinase activity. CHKA phosphorylates promyelocytic leukemia (PML) at tyrosine 339, promoting its cytoplasmic localization. Notably, this reflects a compartment-specific switch in PML activity: while nuclear PML facilitates protein degradation through Small Ubiquitin-like Modifier (SUMO)-ubiquitin cascades, cytoplasmic PML acts oppositely to block degradation. Specifically, cytoplasmic PML then induces SUMOylation of WD Repeat Domain Phosphoinositide-Interacting Protein 2 (WIPI2) at lysines 281 and 283, thereby blocking HUWE1-mediated ubiquitination and proteasomal degradation. Stabilized WIPI2 increases autophagic flux, supporting tumor cell survival under metabolic stress. This study identifies a critical CHKA–PML–WIPI2 axis mediating adaptation to glutamine deprivation, providing insight into metabolic plasticity and a potential therapeutic target for glutamine-dependent cancers."},{"t":"通过界面工程揭示Ag/ZnS异质结构界面结构对热载流子动力学的影响","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21419","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"等离激元热载流子界面","kp":["[Ag/ZnS异质结]: 等离子激子热载流子注入效率受限","[界面晶格失配]: 阻碍界面原子结构精确定义","[界面工程]: 调控界面结构影响热载流子动力学"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"在金属/半导体异质结构中，等离子体诱导的热载流子注入效率是光催化和光电转换的关键。本研究通过界面工程调控Ag/ZnS异质结构的界面结构，揭示界面组分和排列方式对热载流子动力学的影响机制。通过系统改变界面缺陷态密度、能带对齐和界面耦合强度，研究阐明了热载流子产生、弛豫和注入各步骤的速率竞争关系。该工作为设计高效等离子体光催化体系和超快光电器件提供了界面优化的理论指导。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Unveiling the Effect of Interfacial Structure on Hot Carrier Dynamics in Ag/ZnS Heterostructures through Interface Engineering","b":"The enhancement of plasmon-induced hot carrier injection efficiency in metal/semiconductor heterostructures is essential for boosting their photoelectronic performance. Nevertheless, the considerable lattice mismatch between the components hinders the development of clearly defined interfacial atomic structures, complicating the understanding of the interfacial structure’s impact on hot carrier dynamics. Here, we demonstrate a ligand-assisted chemical transformation strategy to produce high-yield (>90%) epitaxial Ag/ZnS heterostructures from matchstick-like Ag2S/ZnS templates. It is found that the presence of a ligand promotes preferential nucleation of Ag nuclei at the interface, leading to well-defined interfacial structures. Comparative studies reveal that epitaxial interfaces in Ag/ZnS heterostructures significantly improve plasmon-induced hot electron transfer from Ag to ZnS under 520 nm excitation, achieving a quantum yield of 38.12%, nearly double that of nonepitaxial counterparts (21.11%), as quantified by near-infrared transient absorption pump–probe spectroscopy. Additionally, single-particle photothermal microscopy measurements demonstrate that the photothermal signals of epitaxial Ag/ZnS heterostructures display a uniform distribution with a decreased intensity compared to those of their counterparts, further correlating plasmonic heating characteristics of the heterostructures with their interfacial structure. This work establishes the importance of interfacial engineering in optimizing plasmon-induced hot carrier dynamics, offering insights into the design of high-performance optoelectronic devices utilizing plasmonic metal/semiconductor heterostructures."},{"t":"表面功能化二维聚合物电致变色层作为超快多态红外光门","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19303","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电致变色聚合物","kp":["[二维聚合物电致变色]: 固态两端器件超快多态红外光门","[结晶给受体聚合物]: 亲离子孔隙实现前所未有开关速度"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"电致变色器件在智能窗口、红外隐身等领域应用前景广阔，但现有开关速度限制了其应用范围。本研究开发了表面功能化的二维聚合物电致变色层，实现超快、多态红外光学门控。二维聚合物的分子级薄层结构缩短了离子扩散距离，表面官能团调控优化了电化学动力学，使开关速度显著提升。多态特性使器件可在多个透射率状态间切换，适用于红外通信调制和自适应红外伪装等场景。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Surface-Functionalized, Two-Dimensional Polymer Electrochromic Layers as Ultrafast, Multi-State Infrared Optical Gates","b":"Electrochromic devices have widespread application potential, but the currently available switching speeds limit broad real-world implementation of this technology. Here, we report surface-engineered two-dimensional polymers with ionophilic pores that offer unprecedented switching speeds in solid-state, two-terminal, electrochromic devices. In particular, we demonstrate that a crystalline donor-acceptor 2DP functionalized with ethylene glycol oligomers exhibits multistate infrared absorption that is 4× faster (tc = 320 ms) with 3× coloration efficiency (491 cm2 C-1) compared to an alkyl functionalized 2DP constructed from the same chromophores. The functionalized nanoporous surfaces enable rapid switching in these materials under either oxidative or reductive conditions, allowing us to access a range of robust, stable optical responses in a single electrochromic layer. These attributes led us to leverage surface-functionalized 2DPs as multistate infrared logic gates. Collectively, this work demonstrates that surface engineering of nanoporous crystalline lattices is a promising approach to co-optimize the electronic and ionic conductivities required to achieve rapidly switchable electrochromic layers. Beyond speed and efficiency, the demonstration of multistate infrared characteristics shows that electrochromic frameworks are useful in integrated optoelectronic circuits. This positions surface-engineered 2DPs as improved electrochromic coatings and a new material platform for photonic information processing and adaptive devices."},{"t":"[ASAP] 重新审视 NHC-金属键合：中高价铁氮化物络合物中的 π 供体稳定 Fe(VI) 氧化态","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21276","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"N-anchored tripodal N-heterocyclic carbene ligands, satTIMMNMes and Me2TIMMNMes, were synthesized and used to stabilize a series of mid-valent Fe(IV) and high-valent Fe(V) and Fe(VI) nitrides. The Fe(IV) and Fe(V) species adopt trigonal-pyramidal and trigonal-bipyramidal geometries, respectively, whereas the Fe(VI) nitrides exhibit octahedral coordination, representing rare examples of structurally characterized iron(VI) nitrido complexes. All complexes were characterized by single-crystal X-ray diffraction, multinuclear (1H, 13C, 15N, and 19F) NMR, zero- and applied-field 57Fe Mössbauer, electron paramagnetic resonance, as well as vibrational and electronic absorption spectroscopy. Combined spectroscopic, electrochemical, and computational studies examined how systematic variation in the NHC backbone modulates the electronic structures of the [Fe≡N]n+ and Fe–CNHC moieties. Structural and spectroscopic parameters of Me2TIMMNMes-based Fe(IV–VI) nitrides closely resemble those of parent TIMMNMes analogues, while more pronounced deviations are observed for satTIMMNMes derivatives. 57Fe Mössbauer spectroscopy at 80 K revealed an unusually negative isomer shift for the tetravalent (d4, S = 0) [(satTIMMNMes)FeIV≡N]+ (δ = −0.45 mm s–1), distinct from Me2TIMMNMes and TIMMNMes analogues (δ = −0.36 and −0.35 mm s–1), attributable to enhanced Fe–CNHC covalency in satTIMMNMes ligand. Cyclic voltammetry, supported by theoretical calculations, quantifies relative ligand π-donation in the Fe(IV) nitrido complexes, complementary to established NHC σ-donor descriptors, yielding the trend satTIMMNMes < TIMMNMes < Me2TIMMNMes. Consistent with this trend, structural and EPR data indicate differing degrees of Jahn–Teller distortion among the paramagnetic Fe(V) nitrides (d3, S = 1/2). In contrast, the structural and spectroscopic differences are relatively diminished in highly covalent Fe(VI) nitrides (d2, S = 0).","tp":"高价铁氮化","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队成功合成了带有N锚定的三脚架型N-杂环卡宾配体，并利用其稳定了一系列中高价铁氮化物络合物，包括罕见的铁(IV)、铁(V)及铁(VI)物种。其中，铁(IV)和铁(V)络合物分别呈现三角锥和三角双锥几何构型，而铁(VI)氮化物则展现出八面体配位结构。这是极少数在结构上得到明确表征的铁(VI)氮化物络合物的实例，单晶X射线衍射等表征技术揭示了NHC配体的π供体效应对超高价铁氧化态的稳定作用。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 瞬态铁(V)-亚硝基络合物和亚硝基苯之间的直接 N-N 偶联，得到铁(III)-苯基二氮烯-N-氧化物","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21651","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The reactivity of metal nitrides has attracted considerable attention owing to their proposed role as key intermediates in the critical N–N bond breaking and formation steps in N2 fixation and NH3 oxidation processes. Despite intensive efforts over the past decades, no clear-cut examples of direct N–N coupling initiated by metal-nitrides have yet been reported. Herein, we describe the reaction of a transient iron(V)-nitrido complex, [FeV(N)(cyclam-ac)][BArF4] (2, cyclam-ac = 1,4,8,11-tetraazacyclotetradecane-1-acetate), with pentafluoronitrosobenzene (PFPhNO), which quantitatively affords an iron(III)-phenyldiazene-N-oxide [FeIII(NN(O)PFPh)(cyclam-ac)][BArF4] (3). Complex 3 has been structurally and spectroscopically characterized using EPR, Mössbauer, and UV–vis–NIR techniques, coupled to wave function-based ab initio calculations, to contain a low-spin ferric center coordinated by a –N═N(O)PFPh monoanionic ligand featuring a N═N double bond. Further in situ measurements reveal that analogous reactions can occur upon treatment of 2 with PhNO and 4-NO2-PhNO. Detailed electronic structure analyses suggest that exceedingly efficient mutual frontier orbital interactions between 2 and PhNO render the title reaction barrierless and highly exothermic. This can be traced back to the unusual electronic feature of 2, viz., the 2-fold orbital near-degeneracy of the Fe–N π* orbitals and the dominant N-2p character thereof, both of which maximize stabilizing HOMO–LUMO overlaps. Furthermore, under vacuum, 3 was found to release N2, quantitatively furnishing a low-spin ferric phenolate complex, [FeIII(OPFPh)][BArF4] (4). The present work reveals previously unrecognized reactivity of high-valent iron-nitrido species and sheds further light on the N–N coupling reaction mediated by metal-nitrides.","tp":"铁氮键偶联","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"金属氮化物在氮气固定和氨氧化过程中的氮-氮(N-N)键断裂与形成中扮演着关键的中间体角色，但目前尚未发现金属氮化物直接引发N-N偶联的确切案例。该研究报道了一种瞬态铁(V)-氮化物络合物与亚硝基苯发生的直接N-N偶联反应，成功生成了铁(III)-苯基二氮烯-N-氧化物。这一突破性发现为理解氮循环中的关键催化机制提供了重要的实验证据和全新认识。"},{"t":"宽温锂离子电池：克服极端环境电化学挑战的材料创新与设计策略","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003557?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"宽温锂电池材料","kp":["[宽温锂电池]: 材料创新与设计策略应对极端环境"],"sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":2.5,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Wide-temperature Lithium-ion batteries: Material innovations and design strategies for overcoming electrochemical challenges in extreme environments"},{"t":"化石燃料衰退与可行替代方案探索：全球社会经济政治和技术约束下生物柴油、电动和沼气能源系统的批判性综述","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002990?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"清洁能源替代","sc":2.4,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":2.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"The decline of fossil fuels and the search for viable alternatives: A critical review of biodiesel, electric, and biogas energy systems under global socio-political and technical constraints"},{"t":"相对于静息状态，任务诱发的功能连接与执行功能表现出新颖且强化的关系","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516929123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Executive functioning in children has been linked to intrinsic brain network organization assessed during the resting state, as well as to brain network organization during the performance of cognitive tasks. Prior work has established that task-based brain networks are stronger predictors of behavior than resting state networks, yet it is unclear if tasks only strengthen relationships that exist weakly at rest or if tasks also evoke unique relationships. A lack of discernment regarding how tasks and the resting state commonly and uniquely support executive functions precludes a holistic understanding of the neurobiological basis of executive functions. This project investigated differences in brain network organization and relationships with executive function ability between the resting state and two executive function tasks, a stop signal task and an emotional n-back task, using the Adolescent Brain and Cognitive Development Study dataset. Both executive function tasks evoked a more integrated network organization than the resting state, and executive function ability was related to different aspects of brain network organization during the resting state and during the tasks. Further, task-related shifts in brain network organization evoked several new relationships with executive function that were not detectable during the resting state and strengthened a relationship with executive function that existed weakly during the resting state. Overall, this study establishes a distinction between common and unique features of intrinsic and task-evoked brain function that facilitate executive function in children."},{"t":"甘蔗条纹花叶病毒 P1 蛋白靶向 BES1 转录因子，破坏植物中 DAMP 触发的免疫","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adr9432?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Sugarcane streak mosaic virus (SCSMV) is the major cause of sugarcane mosaic disease. Its P1 protein (P1\n                    SCSMV\n                    ) is crucial for pathogenesis, but how it disrupts plant immunity remains unclear. Here, we found that P1\n                    SCSMV\n                    directly binds to the core transcription factor of brassinosteroid signaling, NbBES1, disrupting its binding to the E-box elements of the xyloglucan endotransglucosylase/hydrolase gene 1 (\n                    NbXTH1\n                    ) promoter and suppressing\n                    NbXTH1\n                    transcription.\n                    NbXTH1\n                    overexpression enhanced the plant resistance to fungal/viral infection, improved the contents of xyloglucan, which directly induced a damage-associated molecular pattern triggering innate immunity (DTI) and expression of several defense genes, and accompanied with a thickened middle lamellae and primary cell wall. Reduced xyloglucan due to\n                    NbXTH1\n                    downexpression further weakened DTI responses and a thinner cell wall. This study reveals how a viral protein subverts cell wall–mediated immunity and identifies NbXTH1 as a broad-spectrum disease resistance factor. Our findings support using xyloglucan or NbXTH1 to engineer broad-spectrum disease resistance in crops.","tp":"甘蔗病毒病","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":1.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.5},"as":"甘蔗条纹花叶病毒（SCSMV）是引发甘蔗花叶病的主要病原体，但其P1蛋白破坏植物免疫的机制尚不明确。最新研究发现，该病毒的P1蛋白能够直接靶向并结合油菜素内酯信号通路的核心转录因子NbBES1。这种结合作用阻断了NbBES1与木葡聚糖内转糖基酶/水解酶基因1启动子E-box元件的结合能力，从而成功干扰了植物基于DAMP（损伤相关分子模式）触发的免疫反应，揭示了病毒对抗植物防御的分子致病机制。"},{"t":"结构调控实现自催化酰亚胺化以构建高粘附性离子导电聚酰亚胺网络用于超稳定硅负极","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4669180?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅负极粘结剂","kp":["[聚酰亚胺粘结剂PIy]: 低温自催化酰亚胺化合成","[硅负极]: 高粘附性+离子导电性超稳定循环","[硅负极瓶颈]: 体积膨胀和界面稳定性差"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出通过结构调控实现自催化酰亚胺化的策略，构建了一种兼具高粘附性和离子导电性的聚酰亚胺网络，用于硅负极的稳定性工程。硅负极因超高理论比容量被视为下一代锂离子电池最有前途的负极材料，但充放电过程中的巨大体积膨胀导致电极粉化和界面SEI膜不稳定。研究团队设计的聚酰亚胺网络通过原位自催化交联，形成强韧的粘合界面，有效缓冲硅颗粒体积变化并维持电极结构完整性，同时离子导电性保障了电荷传输。该策略为解决硅负极循环寿命瓶颈提供了新的高分子粘结剂设计思路，对推动高能量密度锂电实用化具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Structure Tailoring Enabled Self‐Catalyzed Imidization for Engineering a Highly Adhesive and Ion‐Conductive Polyimide Network Toward Ultra‐Stable Silicon Anodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Silicon (Si) is widely recognized as one of the most promising anode materials for next‐generation lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs). Nevertheless, its practical application is hindered by significant volume expansion and poor interfacial stability. Herein, a highly adhesive and ion‐conductive polyimide binder, denoted as PIy, is synthesized via low‐temperature self‐catalyzed imidization through the copolymerization of 3,3’,4,4’‐biphenyltetracarboxylic dianhydride (BPDA) with 2,2’‐bis[4‐(4‐aminophenoxy)phenyl]propane (BAPP) as the tough monomer, 4,4’‐diamino‐2,2’‐bipyridyl (DAPY) as a base‐catalyzing component, and 2‐(5‐amino‐2‐methylanilino)‐4‐(3‐pyridyl)pyrimidine (AMPY) as an end‐capping agent. DAPY and AMPY effectively lower the activation energy of poly(amic acid) imidization which enables cyclization to proceed at low temperatures and the pyridine groups promote Li\n                    +\n                    transport. BPDA and BAPP contain abundant aromatic rings that provide high toughness and impart a high modulus to suppress volume changes. Meanwhile, the flexible ‐O‐ segments enhance chain mobility adapting to expansion while maintaining structural integrity. The Si@PIy‐185 °C electrode exhibits excellent long‐term cycling stability, maintaining a high specific capacity of 1118.6 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 1 A g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    even after 1000 cycles.The full cell of the SiO\n                    x\n                    @PIy‐185 °C//NCM811 exhibits a remarkable capacity retention of 87.8% after 100 cycles, highlighting the potential of the low‐temperature imidized PI binder for high‐energy‐density LIBs."},{"t":"CO₂电还原的科学技术突破：多物理场、多尺度与人工智能视角","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516978?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"CO2电还原","kp":["[eCO2RR工程化]: 多物理场+多尺度+AI弥合实验室-工程差距","[电解槽优化]: 材料/机理/器件三方面进展"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该综述系统梳理了电化学CO2还原反应（eCO2RR）从基础科学向工程技术转化过程中的突破性进展，融合多物理场、多尺度建模与人工智能方法为研究方向。eCO2RR是将温室气体转化为高附加值化学品和燃料的关键技术路线，但在产物选择性、能量效率和催化剂稳定性方面仍面临挑战。文章从反应机理、电极设计、反应器工程等维度分析了影响性能的核心因素，并重点探讨了AI驱动的催化剂高通量筛选、反应条件优化和系统级集成策略。该工作为CO2电还原技术的规模化部署提供了跨学科指导框架，对碳中和目标下的电化学转化路径具有参考价值。","dp":1,"ot":"Science‐Towards‐Technology Breakthrough in CO2 Electroreduction: Multiphysics, Multiscale, and Artificial Intelligence Insights","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical carbon dioxide reduction reactions (eCO\n                    2\n                    RR) are a key technology for converting greenhouse gas CO\n                    2\n                    into high‐value‐added chemicals. In recent years, significant progress has been made in material design, catalytic mechanism analysis, and electrolyzer optimization. However, there remains a gap between “laboratory science” and “engineering practice” in current research. Most reviews are primarily based on the “material‐structure‐performance” model and have not yet established an integrated technical landscape combining multi‐physics, multi‐scale, and artificial intelligence (AI). This review centers on the industrialization goals of eCO\n                    2\n                    RR, establishing a multi‐scale research framework spanning from fundamental mechanisms to systems engineering. It covers four core areas: atomic‐level mechanism interpretation and characterization, interface microenvironment regulation, external field‐assisted optimization, and AI‐driven material design and reaction prediction. Through the closed‐loop integration of mechanism‐characterization‐optimization, this review emphasizes an overall synergistic strategy from materials to devices and from experiments to systems, aiming to establish a systematic research pathway for eCO\n                    2\n                    RR. This work not only provides a comprehensive research blueprint for the eCO\n                    2\n                    RR field but also offers methodological and strategic references for AI‐enabled catalytic material development, external field‐coupled performance enhancement, and the engineering of electrochemical carbon resource conversion."},{"t":"考虑极端天气事件风险的可再生电力系统基于情景分离的最优规划方法","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003338?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可再生能源系统规划","kp":["规划方法[可再生能源]: 场景分离优化规划","考虑因素[电力系统]: 极端天气事件风险"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Scenario separation-based optimal planning method for renewable electric energy system considering extreme weather event risks"},{"t":"微量聚合物半导体增强的可扩展聚合物复合材料用于250°C高性能电容储能","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521682?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物介电储能","kp":["工作温度[聚合物介电]: 250°C","[聚合物固溶策略]: 微量半导体抑制传导损耗","[高温介电瓶颈]: 热激活电荷传输致击穿"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种由微量聚合物半导体增强的可扩展聚合物基复合材料，实现在250°C高温环境下的高性能电容储能。高温聚合物介电材料是下一代电力电子系统（如电动汽车、航空航天电力设备）电容器的关键瓶颈，传统聚合物薄膜在高温下介电常数下降、漏电流增大导致储能密度急剧衰减。研究团队通过在聚合物基体中引入微量半导体组分，构建了电荷陷阱与界面极化协同机制，在250°C下显著提升了放电能量密度和充放电效率。该策略兼具低成本、可规模化加工的优势，为高温电容器的工程化应用提供了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Scalable Polymer Composites Enhanced by Trace‐Amount Polymer Semiconductor for High‐Performance Capacitive Energy Storage at 250°C","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐temperature polymer dielectrics are critically needed for capacitive energy storage in next‐generation power electronics operating above 200 °C, yet their practical application is severely limited by thermally activated charge transport that leads to exponentially increased conduction loss and premature breakdown. Here, we report a polymer solid‐solution strategy that simultaneously preserves intrinsic insulation while elevating trap energy levels through the incorporation of an ultralow fraction of a linear semiconducting polymer. The semiconducting chains are molecularly dispersed, functioning as electronic structure modulators rather than transport pathways. The simple nitrogen‐containing conjugated segments generate deep localized traps with high positive electrostatic potential, which immobilize injected electrons by increasing the high‐energy‐level trap density and suppressing hopping conduction at elevated temperatures. Consequently, the composite exhibits a 1940% enhancement in capacitive performance relative to the pristine polymer, while maintaining ≥90% charge–discharge efficiency. The fully organic solid‐solution films simultaneously achieve a high energy density of 3.9 J cm\n                    −3\n                    and 90% efficiency at 250 °C, together with ultrahigh long‐term stability. This work establishes a distinct route for decoupling insulation from trap engineering in polymer dielectrics and provides a scalable, low‐cost platform for high‐temperature energy storage applications."},{"t":"光催化分解水制氢微反应器中气泡动力学与脱离机制研究进展综述","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003053?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光催化分解水制氢","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Recent progress in bubble dynamics and detachment mechanisms of photocatalytic water splitting microreactors for H₂ production: a review"},{"t":"光热催化 vs. 热催化：钯催化分子间三组分C─H 1,3-N,O-双官能化反应","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec9841?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钯催化碳氢活化","kp":["[光热vs热催化]: Pd催化三组分C-H双官能化","[C-H双官能化]: 突破两组分环化限制"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究对比了光热催化与传统热催化在钯催化分子间三组分C─H键1,3-N,O双官能化反应中的表现。通过光热协同效应，在显著降低反应温度的条件下实现了高区域选择性和立体选择性的C─H键活化，构建了含氮含氧双官能团有机分子。该策略突破了传统热催化能耗高、选择性差的局限，为绿色合成复杂有机分子提供了新路径，展示了光驱动催化在精细化学品合成中的潜力。","dp":1,"ot":"Photothermal catalysis versus thermal catalysis: A palladium-catalyzed intermolecular three-component C─H 1,3-N,O-difunctionalization","b":"Although transition metal–catalyzed C─H activation has notably advanced C─H functionalization, achieving highly selective C─H difunctionalization remains a substantial challenge. Current C─H difunctionalization strategies remain largely constrained to two-component annulation reactions or dicarbofunctionalization, which inherently limit structural diversity and synthetic efficiency. Here, we report a palladium-catalyzed three-component C─H 1,3-\n                    N\n                    ,\n                    O\n                    -difunctionalization of 3-phenylpropanamide using azodicarboxylate in conjunction with either dioxygen or carboxylic acid. This approach selectively delivers distinct 1,3-\n                    N\n                    ,\n                    O\n                    -difunctionalized products through either photothermal or thermal pathway, affording moderate to high yields with excellent site selectivity and broad functional group tolerance, which can be readily transformed into various valuable heterocyclic compounds. Extensive experimental and computational studies reveal that the reaction operates via a complex and continuous catalytic cycle rather than by tandem, independent steps. By integrating principles of C─H activation, electrophilic amination, difunctionalization, and photothermal catalysis, this work expands the toolbox for selective multiple bond formation and will attract more interest in various fields."},{"t":"薄饼状表面卤化物-氟硫醇富集的Au₁₂Ag₃₀纳米团簇用于钙钛矿太阳能电池缺陷钝化与防潮屏蔽","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519239?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米团簇缺陷钝化","kp":["纳米簇组成[钙钛矿缺陷钝化]: Au₁₂Ag₃₀表面卤化物-氟硫醇盐","缺陷钝化机制[钙钛矿电池]: 纳米簇钝化缺陷+阻湿屏蔽"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究合成了具有薄饼状表面结构的Au12Ag30双金属纳米团簇，其表面富集卤素-氟硫醇配体。将该纳米团簇应用于钙钛矿太阳能电池的缺陷钝化层，有效修复了钙钛矿薄膜表面缺陷并形成疏水屏障，显著提升了器件的抗湿稳定性。原子级精确的团簇结构实现了功能导向设计，为钙钛矿电池的界面工程和长期稳定性优化提供了新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Pancake‐Like Surface Halide‐Fluorothiolate‐Enriched Au12Ag30 Nanoclusters for Defect Passivation and Moisture Shielding in Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    There are few examples of the function‐oriented synthesis of atomically precise metal nanoclusters (NCs) whose ligand composition and geometry readily translate into device‐level performance. Here, we report the design and synthesis of the pancake‐like [Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    (SPh\n                    3,5−\n                    (CF\n                    3\n                    )\n                    2\n                    )\n                    10\n                    Br\n                    20\n                    ]\n                    6−\n                    (Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    ) NC, and its use to boost the power conversion efficiency (PCE) and durability of perovskite solar cells. Single‐crystal x‐ray diffraction of Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    revealed an Au\n                    12\n                    icosahedron wrapped by a six‐layer Ag\n                    30\n                    shell, the (100) facets of which are capped by 20 Br\n                    −\n                    ligands, with 10 ‐CF\n                    3\n                    ‐bearing thiolates forming a hydrophobic equatorial belt. Introducing 0.5 mg/mL of this cluster into ((FA\n                    0.95\n                    Cs\n                    0.05\n                    )PbI\n                    3\n                    )\n                    0.975\n                    (MAPbBr\n                    3\n                    )\n                    0.025\n                    perovskite films boosted the device PCE from 23.55% to 25.53% and enables 94.8% retention after 1142 h of continuous one‐sun illumination. Au\n                    12\n                    Ag\n                    30\n                    is also distinguished by its −6 superatomic charge, and 66.7% surface halogen coverage—the highest ever reported. These findings establish anisotropic halide/thiolate‐protected NCs as potent additives for simultaneous defect passivation and environmental protection in high‐efficiency optoelectronics."},{"t":"有机酸诱导异金属团簇扭曲实现多模态手性光学传感与对映选择性药物识别","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522830?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性金属团簇传感","kp":["传感机制[手性检测]: 有机酸诱导配位扭曲与核心对称破缺","识别目标[手性传感]: 手性酸及药物对映体选择性识别"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用有机酸诱导异金属簇合物产生结构扭转，赋予材料多模态手性光学响应特性。该策略实现了对映选择性识别手性酸和药物分子，兼具快速检测、可重复使用和定量分析能力。与常规色谱方法相比，该手性传感体系具有更高的灵敏度和选择性，在药物质量控制、手性药物筛选及临床检测中具有重要的应用前景。","dp":1,"ot":"Organic Acid‐Induced Twisting in Heterometallic Clusters Enables Multimodal Chiroptical Sensing and Enantioselective Drug Recognition","b":"Abstract\n                  Rapid, reusable, and quantitative recognition of chiral acids and drugs remains challenging, as conventional covalent or host–guest strategies suffer from poor reversibility and limited adaptability. Here, atomically precise heterometallic nanoclusters undergo organic acid–induced coordination twisting and core symmetry breaking, dynamically modulating their coordination environment for enantiomeric resolution. Chiral amino acids stabilize cluster chirality, yielding enantiopure clusters matching the amino acid configuration. These clusters exhibit strong chiroptical responses, including circular dichroism (CD) and circularly polarized luminescence (CPL), enabling reliable quantification of enantiomeric excess (ee) across 20 chiral acids. Significantly, the system can be rationally regenerated and reused, enabling multiple cycles of consistent, quantitative chiral sensing. Mechanistic studies reveal that recognition arises from electrostatic preconcentration, followed by coordination and hydrogen bonding, which lock substrate configurations and transfer chiral information. Furthermore, threonine‐modified chiral heterometallic clusters also enable enantioselective coordination‐driven drug sensing, exemplified by ibuprofen recognition via ligand exchange, as unambiguously confirmed by single‐crystal X‐ray analysis. This work establishes a versatile coordination‐driven platform for high‐throughput, real‐time, and quantitative enantioselective sensing, highlighting the potential of atomically precise clusters for chiral recognition and drug analysis."},{"t":"应对能源三难困境：整合技术创新和数字化转型以获得可持续解决方案","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003697?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"能源三难题","sc":2.0,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.5,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"建筑中冷水机组与热泵系统的建模方法：数字孪生应用背景下的系统综述","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002849?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"热泵系统建模","kp":["[主题]: 制冷与热泵系统建模","[视角]: 数字孪生应用"],"sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Modeling methods for chiller and heat pump systems in buildings: A systematic review in the context of digital twin applications"},{"t":"空间电荷区的本征缺陷补偿使无镉锌黄锡矿太阳能电池实现13.9%认证效率","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00550K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌黄铜矿薄膜电池","kp":["转换效率[CZTSSe薄膜电池]: 13.9%(认证)","缓冲层[无镉电池]: ZnₓSn₁₋ₓO替代CdS","缺陷补偿[空间电荷区]: 本征缺陷补偿"],"sc":8.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":9.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"as":"研究采用无镉ZnxSn1-xO（ZTO）缓冲层替代传统CdS，用于Cu2ZnSn(S,Se)4（CZTSSe）黄铜矿太阳能电池。通过在空间电荷区实现本征缺陷补偿，有效抑制了界面复合损失并优化了能带对齐。该策略使无镉kesterite电池获得13.9%的认证效率，创造了该体系无镉缓冲层器件的新纪录，推动了环境友好型薄膜太阳能电池的实用化进程。","dp":1,"ot":"Intrinsic defect compensation in the space charge region enables cadmium-free kesterite solar cells to achieve 13.9% certified efficiency","b":"Cadmium-free ZnxSn1−xO (ZTO) buffer layers are an attractive alternative to conventional CdS in Cu2ZnSn(S,Se)4 (CZTSSe) thin-film solar cells, especially with advantages of Cd-related toxicity elimination and parasitic absorption mitigation at short wavelengths. However, the performance of ZTO-based CZTSSe devices has lagged behind that of CdS-involved counterparts, largely due to high-density detrimental defects and non-ideal band alignment at the CZTSSe/ZTO heterojunction. Here, we develop a junction heat-treatment process that, upon thermal activation, selectively drives Zn cations to diffuse from the ZTO buffer into the CZTSSe absorber along the chemical potential gradient. This diffusion-driven Zn incorporation compensates for intrinsic bulk defects such as CuZn and VCu, particularly in the space charge region. The cation diffusion also contributes to a more favorable conduction-band offset, prolonged minority-carrier lifetime, and extended carrier-diffusion length. Collectively, this results in optimization of carrier dynamics with simultaneously enhanced carrier separation, extraction, and transport efficiencies. As a result, we achieve an efficiency of 14.39% (certified at 13.90%) and a large-area (1.03 cm2) efficiency of 12.24%, representing the highest-to-date efficiency for Cd-free CZTSSe solar cells."},{"t":"铜集流体上原位形成的亲锂Li₃Sb实现富LiF固体电解质界面用于无枝晶稳定锂金属负极","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70856?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池界面","kp":["界面层[锂金属电池]: LiF富集型SEI","集流体改性[锂金属电池]: 原位Li₃Sb修饰Cu","防枝晶策略[锂负极]: Li₃Sb双功能协同"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"研究在铜集流体上原位生成亲锂Li3Sb合金相，构建了富LiF的固态电解质界面膜（SEI）。Li3Sb降低了锂离子成核过电位并促进均匀沉积，富LiF的SEI层具有高机械强度和离子电导率，有效抑制了锂枝晶生长。该策略使锂金属负极在长循环中保持高库仑效率和稳定的界面，显著提升了锂金属电池的循环寿命和安全性。","dp":1,"ot":"In Situ‐Formed Lithiophilic Li3Sb on the Cu Current Collector Enables LiF‐Rich Solid Electrolyte Interphase for Dendrite‐Free and Stable Lithium Metal Anodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium metal batteries (LMBs) hold great promise for next‑generation energy storage systems owing to their high theoretical energy density. However, their practical application is hindered by uncontrolled Li dendrite growth and unstable solid electrolyte interphase (SEI). Here, we design a Li\n                    3\n                    Sb‐modified Cu current collector (Li\n                    3\n                    Sb@Cu) that employs a synergistic dual‑function strategy to regulate uniform Li plating and engineer a robust LiF‐rich SEI. The Li\n                    3\n                    Sb interface is constructed in situ by electrochemical lithiation of Cu\n                    2\n                    Sb layer that is directly grown on Cu foil via a galvanic replacement reaction in SbCl\n                    3\n                    solution. Lithiophilic Li\n                    3\n                    Sb interlayer, with high delithiation potential and strong adhesion to the Cu substrate, significantly lowers the Li nucleation overpotential (34 mV at 1.0 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    ). Moreover, the Li\n                    3\n                    Sb preferentially adsorbs and catalytically decomposes fluoroethylene carbonate, producing a mechanically robust, LiF‐rich SEI. Consequently, the Li\n                    3\n                    Sb@Cu enables stable Li plating/stripping for over 800 h and achieves an average Coulombic efficiency of 98.2% over 180 cycles. When paired with a LiFePO\n                    4\n                    cathode, the full cell delivers a high discharge capacity of 137.4 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    and retains 96.6% capacity after 130 cycles at 1 C. This work presents a synergistically bifunctional interlayer on Cu foils that regulates Li nucleation and stabilizes the SEI for high‐performance LMBs."},{"t":"印度各邦在电力脱碳方面表现如何？地方层面基于消费的分解分析","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001473?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"电力脱碳化","sc":2.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":1.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":3.5},"as":""},{"t":"能源系统模型如何与现实世界的地平线悲剧保持一致？决策者的短期偏见和暂时不一致的偏好的影响","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003703?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"能源系统论","sc":2.2,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":1.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":2.5},"as":""},{"t":"基于HfO₂的忆阻突触具有不对称扩展p-n异质界面以实现高能效神经形态硬件","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec2324?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"忆阻突触类脑计算","kp":["材料体系[忆阻突触]: p型Hf(Sr,Ti)O₂薄膜","器件结构[类脑硬件]: p-n异质界面型界面忆阻器"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究开发了基于HfO2的忆阻突触器件，采用非对称扩展的p-n异质界面结构提升能效。异质界面通过内置电场优化离子迁移动力学，降低了突触操作的能耗并提高了状态保持的稳定性。该器件成功模拟了生物突触的可塑性功能（LTP/LTD），在脉冲神经网络中展现出超低能耗的信号处理能力，为构建高能效类脑计算硬件提供了新方案。","dp":1,"ot":"HfO2-based memristive synapses with asymmetrically extended p-n heterointerfaces for highly energy-efficient neuromorphic hardware","b":"The escalating energy consumption of existing artificial intelligence hardware has become a serious global issue that demands immediate action. Neuromorphic computing offers promises to drastically reduce this footprint. Here, we introduce multicomponent p-type Hf(Sr,Ti)O\n                    2\n                    thin films for energy-efficient, resistive switching–based neuromorphic devices. We demonstrate interfacial memristors with ultralow switching currents (≤~10\n                    −8\n                    A), exceptional cycle-to-cycle and device-to-device uniformities, and retention &gt;10\n                    5\n                     s. They reveal hundreds of ultralow conductance levels with a modulation range of &gt;50 (without reaching any saturation) and reproducibly satisfy unsupervised learning rules. This performance originates from incorporating a self-assembled p-n heterointerface between p-type Hf(Sr,Ti)O\n                    2\n                    and n-type TiO\n                    x\n                    N\n                    y\n                    , resulting in a fully depleted space-charge layer asymmetrically extended into Hf(Sr,Ti)O\n                    2\n                    , a large built-in potential, and extremely low saturation current density under reverse bias. Ultralow conductance modulation is controlled by tuning p-n heterointerface’s energy-barrier height through electro-ionic charge migration. This materials-engineering strategy addresses energy consumption and variability in existing memristors, opening a pathway toward energy-efficient neuromorphic computing systems.","aip":1},{"t":"晶界钉扎策略增强有机半导体薄膜聚集态以实现宽温域长期稳定气体传感器","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72850?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机半导体气敏材料","kp":["稳定化策略[OSC气敏]: 晶界钉扎","工作特性[有机气敏传感器]: 宽温域长期稳定"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出晶界钉扎策略，在有机半导体薄膜中引入特定添加剂锚定晶界缺陷，稳定了薄膜的聚集态结构。该方法显著提升了柔性气体传感器在宽温域和长期使用中的稳定性与一致性。钉扎效应抑制了晶界处的分子重排和形态退化，使传感器在多种气体检测中保持高响应灵敏度和可重复性，推动了柔性有机气体传感器向实际部署迈进。","dp":1,"ot":"Grain Boundary Pinning Strategy for Enhanced Aggregate State in Organic Semiconductor Thin Films Toward Wide‐Temperature‐Range and Long‐Term Stable Gas Sensors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Flexible gas sensors based on organic semiconductors (OSCs) show great promise for diverse applications, yet their practical application is hindered by the limited operational and shelf stability of OSC‐based gas sensors over a wide temperature range. Herein, we developed a universal grain boundary pinning strategy to cooperatively optimize the aggregate state stability, sensitivity, and selectivity of the ultrathin OSC film. By incorporating multi‐functional Au nanoclusters into the OSC layer, the thermally activated molecular motion and grain boundary migration can be inhibited by the cooperative effect of strain‐balancing and dipole–π interactions. Consequently, the NH\n                    3\n                    sensor based on 5 nm ultrathin film exhibits record stability over an extended shelf period (tested shelf life of one‐year, theoretical shelf life of 14.8 years) and across a wide temperature range (RT‐100°C on polymer substrate, RT‐180°C on SiO\n                    2\n                    substrate). The grain boundary pinning strategy is demonstrated to be universal across multiple OSC systems, underscoring its potential to enable robust, high‐performance flexible gas sensors for widespread commercialization."},{"t":"Zn₃In₂S₆中Ga取代In及Zn空位诱导电子-空穴不对称性和In─O键弱化以耦合两电子氧还原与H₂O₂稳定化","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522831?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化合成过氧化氢","kp":["催化剂设计[H₂O₂光合成]: Ga替换In+Zn空位双调控","催化机制[两电子ORR]: 电子-空穴不对称性与In-O键弱化"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究在Zn3In2S6层状材料中通过Ga取代In位并引入Zn空位，诱导电子-空穴不对称分布并削弱In-O键，促进双电子氧还原反应（2e- ORR）选择性生成H2O2。该协同缺陷工程优化了中间体吸附能，同时稳定了产物H2O2免于进一步分解。该人工光合H2O2策略为分布式绿色化学品合成提供了高效光催化体系设计新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Ga‐on‐In Substitution with Zn Vacancies in Zn3In2S6 Induces Electron–Hole Asymmetry and In─O Bond Weakening for Coupled Two‐Electron Oxygen Reduction and H2O2 Stabilization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Artificial photosynthesis of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    offers a sustainable route to decentralized chemical production, yet remains limited by sluggish oxygen reduction kinetics, rapid charge recombination, and undesired decomposition of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    on catalyst active sites. Herein, we report a Zn\n                    3\n                    In\n                    2\n                    S\n                    6\n                    catalyst (Ga‐ZvIS) featuring Ga‐on‐In substitution and Zn vacancies that together establish electron–hole asymmetry and weaken In\n                    ─\n                    O bonding. Ga substitution on In sites lowers the In‐5p‐band center level and reduces H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    adsorption strength, thereby suppressing surface decomposition, while Zn vacancies serve as hole‐localized domains that accelerate isopropanol oxidation and furnish the protons required for the two‐electron oxygen reduction reaction (2e\n                    −\n                    ORR). This site‐specific dopant–defect interplay produces energetically differentiated electron‐ and hole‐dominated regions, promotes directional charge migration, and sustains the 2e\n                    −\n                    ORR pathway. The optimized catalyst exhibits a H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production rate of 187.8 µmol g\n                    −\n                    1\n                     min\n                    −\n                    1\n                    in O\n                    2\n                    ‐saturated aqueous isopropanol, outperforming most reported photocatalysts. Kelvin probe force microscopy and femtosecond transient absorption spectroscopy confirm efficient carrier separation consistent with the built‐in electrostatic potential arising from electron–hole asymmetry, while DFT calculations reveal favorable O\n                    2\n                    adsorption and weakened H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    binding on Ga–In sites. A proof‐of‐concept continuous‐flow photoreactor further demonstrates in situ Fenton‐assisted oxidation of organic contaminants, validating the practical utilization of the photosynthesized H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    .","aip":1},{"t":"稠环受体-π-受体结构构建近红外吸收介孔共价有机框架以增强H2O2光合合成","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5267333?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"近红外COF光催化剂","kp":["分子架构[COF光催化H₂O₂]: 稠环受体-π-受体(FRA-π-A)","光吸收特性[COF]: 近红外吸收拓宽吸收范围"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究设计了具有稠环受体-π-受体（A-π-A）架构的近红外吸收共价有机框架（COFs），用于高效光催化合成H2O2。A-π-A结构拓宽了光吸收范围至近红外区，并促进激子解离和电荷分离。介孔结构提供了丰富的催化活性位点和快速的质量传输通道，显著提升了H2O2光合效率。该分子设计策略为开发可见-近红外全光谱利用的光催化材料提供了通用范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Fused‐Ring Acceptor–π–Acceptor Architecture Enables Near‐Infrared‐Absorbing Mesoporous Covalent Organic Frameworks for Enhanced H2O2 Photosynthesis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Covalent organic frameworks (COFs) featuring donor–acceptor architectures have shown great promise as photocatalysts. However, their performance is often hindered by limitations such as narrow absorbance ranges and restricted electron delocalization, which are inherent to traditional imine linkages. Herein, we introduce a fused‐ring acceptor–π–acceptor (FRA–π–A) architecture for near‐infrared‐absorbing COFs, enabled via in situ COF‐to‐COF transformation that replaces imine linkages with FRA‐derived benzodithiazoles (or benzodioxazoles). Comprehensive structural characterizations confirm their mesoporous crystalline structure, featuring pore size distribution of 2.16–2.39 nm and broad light absorption extending to near‐infrared region. Property investigations demonstrate that the rigid backbones derived from the FRA–π–A architecture significantly enhance long‐range in‐plane electron delocalization, thereby improving the separation and transport of photogenerated charge carriers. Crucially, the accelerated carrier migration preferentially directs photogenerated electrons to the FRAs, promoting the formation of •O\n                    2\n                    −\n                    radicals and accelerating the rate‐limiting step of the oxygen reduction reaction. These synergistic structural and optoelectronic properties endow the FRA–π–A COFs with an outstanding photocatalytic H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production rate of 6.8 mmol g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    without sacrificial agents, exceeding the vast majority of conjugated linkage‐based COFs. This study highlights the immense potential of FRA–π–A COFs as high‐performance photocatalysts."},{"t":"通过掺杂聚合物悬浮液过滤简便快速制备热电臂（Adv. Energy Mater. 11/2026）","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70772?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热电材料制备","kp":["制备方法[有机热电臂]: 掺杂聚合物悬浮液真空抽滤","成膜特性[热电薄膜]: 数十微米厚柔性膜秒级成型"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究报道了一种快速、可扩展的热电臂制备策略，通过掺杂聚合物悬浮液的抽滤工艺成型。该方法可在分钟级时间内完成热电材料的组装，无需传统高温烧结工艺。掺杂聚合物悬浮液实现了载流子浓度的精确调控，所得热电腿具有良好的Seebeck系数和电导率，为柔性可穿戴热电器件和废热回收的大规模制造提供了低成本路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Facile and Rapid Fabrication of Thermoelectric Legs via Filtration of Doped Polymer Suspension (Adv. Energy Mater. 11/2026)","b":"Thermoelectric Generators In article number e05396, Jaeyoung Jang and co-workers report a rapid and scalable strategy for fabricating high-performance organic thermoelectric legs via vacuum filtration of doped polymer suspensions. This approach enables the formation of uniformly doped, tens-of-micrometer-thick, and mechanically flexible polymer films within seconds, providing a powerful platform for high-power organic thermoelectric devices and generators."},{"t":"W.G. Lone 等人研究文章的勘误，“外周 T 细胞淋巴瘤 - GATA3 分子亚组中独特的 TP53 和 PTEN 联合缺失的协同作用”。","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeg5995?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"研究文章“社交媒体反馈算法如何影响竞选活动中的态度和行为？”的勘误表","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2575?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"In the Research Article “How do social media feed algorithms affect attitudes and behavior in an election campaign?” by A. M. Guess et al. (28 July 2023, 10.1126/science.abp9364), the authors did not distinguish between “carousel” and “non-carousel” posts, which are the two types of posts on Instagram. On the basis of information recently shared by Meta Research regarding the Instagram data that were provided to the authors as part of the 2020 Facebook-Instagram Election Study (FIES), this erratum provides an updated description of the metrics used in the Article. Because the distinction between carousel and non-carousel posts is independent of treatment assignment, none of the Instagram-specific experimental effect estimates should have been affected, and none of the other experimental effects are affected. In addition, none of the Facebook data or survey data are affected."},{"t":"Z. Li 等人的研究文章“AND-1 是 R 环动态的关键调节剂和克服内分泌抵抗的目标”的勘误。","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeg8118?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"通过人中性粒细胞-血管内皮细胞相互作用阐明炎症消退的有效促消退介质","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530022123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The acute inflammatory response is a highly coordinated programmed sequence that enables neutrophils to transmigrate from venules into tissues. Ideally self-limited, the active resolution phase produces specialized molecules that stimulate resolution and prevent collateral tissue damage from excessive neutrophil infiltration. The superfamily of pro-resolving molecules is termed specialized pro-resolving mediators including the essential polyunsaturated fatty acid-derived lipoxins, resolvins, protectins, and maresins. Given the intimate interactions between leukocytes and endothelial cells in inflammation resolution, we investigated whether unique bioactive molecules carrying pro-resolution properties are biosynthesized by human neutrophils coincubated with activated vascular endothelial cells. Using metabololipidomics, we found that human coronary aortic valves from transplants contained 13-hydroxy-4Z,7Z,10Z,14E,16Z,19Z-docosahexaenoic acid (13-HDHA) and inflammatory eicosanoids. We report that human endothelial cells convert DHA to 13-HDHA which in turn is transformed by human neutrophils to a previously unknown bioactive product 4,13-dihydroxy-docosahexaenoic acid. This structure was established using physical properties including tandem-mass spectrometry, UV-analysis, and conversion of deuterated substrate. Biosynthesis of this product during neutrophil–endothelial coincubations involved bidirectional crosstalk between neutrophil 5-LOX and endothelial COX-2 as confirmed using isolated recombinant enzymes. The bioactive 4S,13R-dihydroxy-5E,7Z,10Z,14E,16Z,19Z-docosahexaenoic acid, also produced by M2-like macrophages and mononuclear cells, demonstrated potent nanomolar pro-resolving actions including, a) limiting neutrophil infiltration into mouse air pouch, b) reducing human neutrophil adherence to endothelial cells, c) protecting endothelial cell from senescence, and d) stimulating human macrophage efferocytosis of senescent red blood cells. These results provide evidence for a previously unknown pro-resolving pathway and molecule biosynthesized from DHA via cyclooxygenase-2–5-lipoxygenase during leukocyte crosstalk with the vasculature."},{"t":"登革热感染引发皮肤组织驻留和循环 CD8+ T 细胞，与避免住院相关","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7987?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Dengue is spreading globally, and there is urgent need to define immune correlates of protection for this disease. Dengue infection first occurs in the skin following the bite of an infected mosquito; however, knowledge of host immune responses within this site remains sparse. We investigated the phenotypic, functional, and transcriptional profiles of skin and blood T cells in 73 patients with dengue and 10 healthy volunteers. We show that the skin T cell compartment undergoes marked reshaping and is strongly enriched with proliferating CD4\n                    +\n                    and CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells compared with the blood of patients. Activated skin CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells expressed a core transcriptional signature of tissue-resident memory T (T\n                    RM\n                    ) cells, supporting their differentiation to the T\n                    RM\n                    cell lineage during infection. The magnitude of skin and blood CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell responses were associated with protection from hospitalization in this cohort. These data support a protective role of skin-resident and circulating CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells in dengue and warrant evaluation of vaccination strategies inducing skin T\n                    RM\n                    cells to enhance protective immunity."},{"t":"共价有机框架-碳纳米管核壳纳米杂化材料提升CO2电还原中分子催化剂催化位点利用率","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521776?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF分子催化剂载体","kp":["材料结构[分子催化CO₂还原]: COF-CNT核壳纳米杂化体","设计目标[分子催化剂]: 提升位点利用率抗聚集"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究构建了共价有机框架（COF）与碳纳米管的核-壳纳米杂化结构，用于CO2电还原反应中的分子催化剂载体。COF壳层提供了规则排列的催化活性位点，碳纳米管核构建了高效电子传输通道，协同提升了分子催化剂的位点利用率和电催化性能。该核-壳设计有效解决了分子催化剂导电性差和活性位点聚集的问题，显著提高了CO2电还原的选择性和法拉第效率。","dp":1,"ot":"Covalent Organic Framework–Carbon Nanotube Core–Shell Nanohybrids for Enhanced Catalytic Site Utilization of Molecular Catalysts in CO2 Electroreduction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Developing strategies to enhance the utilization efficiency of catalytic sites in molecular catalysts has garnered increasing research interest in the field of molecular heterogeneous catalysis. The primary challenges in achieving this goal lie in the aggregation‐induced site inaccessibility in molecular catalysts. Here, we present the synthesis of covalent organic framework‐carbon nanotube (COF‐CNT) core‐shell nanohybrids as a platform to improve the site utilization of molecular catalysts in electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction. COF shells with a thickness of 50–80 nm are uniformly grown on CNTs, ensuring a well‐defined morphology with pores oriented perpendicularly to the CNT basal plane. The incorporation of molecular catalysts with COF‐CNT nanohybrids enables their application as scaffolds in the electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction. The best‐performing sample exhibits a two‐orders‐of‐magnitude increase in CO turnover frequency (TOF) compared to both pristine CoTPyP molecular catalyst and COF‐366‐Co, thus underscoring the effectiveness of the COF‐CNT hybrid structure in optimizing catalytic site accessibility. The enhanced site utilization is further validated in other molecular catalyst systems, where exceptionally high TOF values—among the highest reported to date for electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    ‐to‐CO conversion—were achieved. Collectively, this study establishes COF‐CNT nanohybrids as a promising strategy for advancing COF‐based electrocatalysts and facilitating molecular catalyst applications in electrochemical energy conversion."},{"t":"纠正 Fernández 等人的观点，即对额叶皮层进行经颅磁刺激，但不会扰乱枕叶皮层的内源性注意力","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607578123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"通过埋底界面异质结工程构建反向电场实现高性能钙钛矿X射线探测器","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00040-8?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿X射线探测","kp":["检测限[钙钛矿X射线探测器]: 9.5 nGyair/s","稳定辐射剂量[X射线探测器]: >100 Gyair","[界面工程]: 埋底界面1D/3D钙钛矿异质结"],"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":7.0,"r":5.5,"d":8.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究通过在钙钛矿X射线探测器中构建埋底界面异质结工程，实现了反向电场设计，有效抑制离子迁移的同时提升器件性能。研究团队采用一维/三维（1D/3D）钙钛矿异质结构，在埋底界面处形成梯度能级排列，产生反向内建电场来阻挡载流子复合和离子漂移。钙钛矿X射线探测器因高吸收系数和直接转换特性在医学成像、安全检测等领域前景广阔，但离子迁移导致的暗电流漂移和信号不稳定是核心瓶颈。该1D/3D界面工程策略显著降低了暗电流并提升了探测灵敏度和响应稳定性，为高性能钙钛矿辐射探测器提供了重要的界面调控思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Constructing reverse electric field by buried interfacial heterojunction engineering enables high-performance perovskite X-ray detectors","b":"A 1D/3D perovskite heterojunction engineered at the buried interface enables effective suppression of ion migration while providing efficient carrier extraction. The resulting X-ray detector achieves a low detection limit of 9.5 nGyairs-1 and stable operation under radiation doses over 100 Gyair, outperforming most reported MAPbI3 thick film X-ray detectors fabricated by slurry blade-coating method."},{"t":"膜上 SARS-CoV-2 刺突的构象动力学揭示了弗林蛋白酶切割和 D614G 突变的变构效应","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx5178?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"By combining hydrogen-deuterium exchange monitored by mass spectrometry (HDX-MS) with the ability of enveloped virus–like particles (eVLPs) to display full-length native-like severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 spike protein, we have determined the energetic and conformational effects of both the membrane environment and unique sequence features that are considered incompatible with soluble protein constructs. We find that eVLP-displayed spike can sample the open-interface trimer conformation observed in soluble constructs of spike, including sequences from engineered vaccine constructs and native viral sequences inaccessible to studies on soluble constructs. Moreover, the D614G mutation, which arose early in the pandemic, favors the canonical “closed-interface” prefusion conformation, potentially mitigating premature S1 shedding in the presence of a cleaved furin site and providing an evolutionary advantage to the virus. Furin cleavage at the S1/S2 boundary allosterically increases the flexibility of the S2′ site, which may facilitate increased TMPRSS2 processing, enhancing viral infectivity. The use of eVLPs in HDX-MS studies provides a powerful platform for studying viral and membrane proteins in near-native environments."},{"t":"生物光催化协同使工程化甲烷氧化菌中CH4和CO2转化为氢气和4-羟基苯甲酸","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526097?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"生物光催化碳转化","kp":["[生物-光催化协同]: CH4和CO2转化为H2和4-羟基苯甲酸","[太阳能驱动]: 生物杂化系统整合生物合成与光催化","产物[CH4/CO2共转化]: H2和4-羟基苯甲酸"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究利用工程化甲烷氧化菌实现生物-光催化协同，将CH4和CO2共转化为氢气和4-羟基苯甲酸。分散式一碳（C1）资源的高值化利用对碳循环经济具有重要意义，但CH4和CO2的化学惰性使其转化极具挑战。研究团队在甲烷氧化菌中引入光合催化模块，利用光能驱动甲烷单加氧酶途径与CO2固定途径的耦合，同时通过代谢工程优化电子传递和碳通量分配。该生物-光催化杂化系统无需贵金属催化剂即可在温和条件下实现两种温室气体的同步资源化，为分布式C1资源利用提供了创新的生物制造平台。","dp":1,"ot":"Bio‐Photocatalytic Synergy Enables Valorization of CH4 and CO2 Into Hydrogen and 4‐Hydroxybenzoate in Engineered Methanotrophic Bacteria","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Valorization of decentralized one‐carbon chain (C\n                    1\n                    ) resources into value‐added products has garnered significant attention, owing to its dual benefits in resource recovery and carbon mitigation. To address the challenge of co‐converting methane (CH\n                    4\n                    ) and carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ), we developed a solar‐driven biohybrid system that synergistically integrates biosynthesis and photocatalysis. The core of this system relies on a genetically engineered methanotrophic cell factory and newly designed biocompatible photocatalytic metal complexes. The methanotrophic bacteria utilize CH\n                    4\n                    as the primary feedstock to biosynthesize 4‐hydroxybenzoate (4HBA) while realizing CO\n                    2\n                    sequestration. The photocatalytic metal complexes, meanwhile, capture formate (a metabolic byproduct of cells) to generate hydrogen (H\n                    2\n                    ) and photoelectrons—with the latter directly supplying reducing power to support cellular activities in genetically tailored cells. Under optimal conditions, this solar‐driven system achieved a 4HBA titer of 472.36 µg/L, a H\n                    2\n                    yield of 0.59 mmol H\n                    2\n                    /mol CH\n                    4\n                    , and over 50% reduction in carbon emissions. The study not only establishes a feasible biomanufacturing strategy for the upcycling of C\n                    1\n                    gaseous feedstocks but also highlights the potential of integrating biological and photochemical technologies to advance sustainable energy and environmental solutions."},{"t":"层状双氢氧化物中F-Zn位点的仿生设计用于聚对苯二甲酸乙二醇酯的光热催化升级回收","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8091533?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PET光催化升级","kp":["催化剂[光热PET升级回收]: LDH中F-Zn仿生活性位点","[仿生设计]: 模仿水解酶构建F-Zn位点"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究受酶催化活性中心启发，在层状双金属氢氧化物（LDH）中设计氟-锌双位点（F–Zn sites），实现聚对苯二甲酸乙二醇酯（PET）塑料的光热催化升级回收。塑料废弃物的化学升级回收是解决白色污染和实现碳资源循环的关键路径。研究团队通过仿生策略在LDH载体上构建配位不饱和的F–Zn催化位点，在光热条件下选择性断裂PET的酯键，将废弃塑料转化为高附加值化学品。光热协同效应显著降低了反应活化能并提升了产物选择性。该策略兼具低成本催化剂和温和反应条件优势，为PET塑料的高值化回收提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Bioinspired Design of F–Zn Sites in Layered Double Hydroxides for Photothermal Catalytic Upcycling of Polyethylene Terephthalate","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Chemical upcycling of plastic wastes into high‐value‐added products presents a promising pathway toward achieving a circular economy and mitigating environmental issues, yet huge challenges remain. Drawing inspiration from hydrolases, this study proposes the construction of F‐Zn sites in layered double hydroxides (LDHs) for the efficient photothermal catalytic upcycling of polyethylene terephthalate (PET) waste into bis(2‐hydroxyethyl) terephthalate (BHET). Light irradiation induces dynamically varied Zn active sites, which mimic the metal centers of hydrolases and thereby facilitate the nucleophilic addition–elimination reaction at the carbonyl moieties of PET. Simultaneously, the high electronegativity of F intensifies its interaction with the hydroxyl groups of ethylene glycol. This mimics the hydrogen‐bonding interactions mediated by the amino acid residues of hydrolases, promoting the nucleophilic attack on the PET. The synergistic effect of F–Zn configuration thereby effectively reduces the reaction energy barrier for PET glycolysis, enabling complete PET conversion under 160°C with a BHET yield of ∼80%. This study presents the integration of a bioinspired site‐design strategy into a photothermal catalytic platform as a promising strategy for plastic waste upcycling.","aip":1},{"t":"集成结构生物学揭示RIPK1原纤维高阶结构的原子级结构和组装机制","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529157123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Receptor-interacting serine/threonine-protein kinase 1 (RIPK1) regulates cell death pathways through RHIM domain–mediated amyloid fibril formation. While amyloid fibrils typically exist as single filaments, we identified a higher-order architecture—the mouse RIPK1 (mRIPK1) fibril network—formed by the self-assembly of mRIPK1 fibrils into quadrilateral/hexagonal lattices under slightly acidic conditions. Using an integrative approach combining solid-state NMR, transmission electron microscopy, atomic force microscopy, X-ray diffraction, Cryo–electron tomography, and molecular dynamics simulations, we elucidated the atomic structure and assembly mechanism of this network. In this study, solid-state NMR analysis demonstrates that the mRIPK1 fibril core adopts an N-shaped parallel β-sheet conformation, with dynamic regions flanking the fibril core that likely participate in network formation. We propose that the electrostatic interactions between fibril core edge residues D516-K519 or D537-K519 are essential for the network formation, with proper positioning and exposure for interaction determined by the fibril structure and the length of the dynamic flexible domain, particularly the periodic twist of the fibril. Site-directed mutagenesis confirms the critical role of these edge residues in maintaining network integrity. This study presents an atomic model of a higher-order assembly formed by naturally occurring amyloid fibrils, offers fundamental insights into hierarchical fibril assembly, and establishes a framework for designing engineered amyloid-based materials."},{"t":"东南极洲 PFAS 的大气迁移和沉积：来自雪样带测量和数十年记录的证据","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4749?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The occurrence of per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS) in Antarctica has been previously reported; however, the mechanisms of their inland penetration and the interplay between their depositional histories and interhemispheric transport remain unclear. Here, PFAS in snow along a transect across East Antarctica (from Zhongshan Station to Dome A) and depositional records at Dome A were studied to elucidate the sources and transport of PFAS and to reconstruct the historical emission record. Our findings suggest that precursor degradation and sea spray aerosol are the main sources of PFAS and play a pivotal role in the regional and seasonal variability of PFAS accumulation. The half-century depositional records reveal connections between Antarctica and distant sources. We propose the hemispheric and interhemispheric transport of PFAS from source regions to Antarctica, where they are deposited.","tp":"氟污染迁移","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究揭示了全氟和多氟烷基物质（PFAS）在偏远东南极洲的污染状况、大气迁移机制及沉积历史。研究团队沿着从中山站到冰穹A（Dome A）的雪样带进行采样，并结合冰穹A的数十年沉积记录，深入探究了PFAS的污染源、跨半球传输过程及其向内陆渗透的机制。这些珍贵的雪芯数据成功重建了该类持久性有机污染物历史排放的演变轨迹，为评估全球污染物的长距离传输提供了关键证据。"},{"t":"碱金属介导控制相偏析以提升柔性锌黄锡矿太阳能电池及组件效率","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02018-5","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性CZTSSe电池","kp":["[Na/Li协同]: Na促晶体生长,Li控相偏析","材料体系[柔性薄膜电池]: Cu2ZnSn(S,Se)4","[碱金属调控]: 控制柔性基板CZTSSe结晶"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究通过碱金属介导的相偏析控制策略，提升了柔性锌黄锡矿（kesterite）Cu2ZnSn(S,Se)4（CZTSSe）太阳能电池及组件的效率。柔性CZTSSe光伏器件因全元素组成丰富、无毒、带隙可调，在轻量化和便携式应用领域极具吸引力，但器件效率长期受限于薄膜中深能级缺陷、相偏析和界面复合等瓶颈。研究团队利用碱金属（如钠、钾）掺杂调控薄膜结晶过程和缺陷化学，有效抑制了有害二次相的偏析并优化了能带排列。该策略在柔性电池和小组件层面均实现了效率提升，为柔性薄膜光伏技术的实用化推进提供了有效途径。","dp":1,"ot":"Alkali-metal-mediated control of phase segregation for flexible kesterite solar cells and modules with improved efficiency","b":"Flexible kesterite Cu2ZnSn(S,Se)4 (CZTSSe) photovoltaics are attractive for lightweight and portable applications, but their efficiency remains limited by uncontrolled alkali-metal incorporation. Here we elucidate and exploit the distinct and complementary roles of Na and Li in controlling CZTSSe crystallization on flexible substrates. Our results show that Na promotes crystal growth, but its induced Se enrichment simultaneously drives large-scale SnSex phase segregation. The incorporation of Li reshapes the free-energy landscape of Cu-related phases, promoting the formation of CuxSe that consumes Se and thereby suppressing SnSex phase growth while driving ordered phase evolution. This kinetic competition strategy yields high-quality CZTSSe films with reduced charge recombination loss and enables power conversion efficiencies of 14.5% (certified 14.2%) for flexible cells and 12.7% (certified 12.0%) for shingled modules. Our results provide mechanistic insights into alkali-metal regulation in chalcogenide solar cells and demonstrate a kinetic competition strategy that can be generalized to regulate crystallization in complex multinary materials.","aip":1},{"t":"通过精确化学预钠化实现NaxV2(PO4)3(1≤x≤5)正极的四钠存储，迈向高能量长寿命无负极钠电池","d":"2026-03-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2554297?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池正极材料","kp":["[化学预钠化]: 解锁4Na+/4e-氧化还原化学","储钠容量[NaxV2(PO4)3]: 4Na+(1≤x≤5)","[无负极钠电池]: 预钠化克服活性钠损失"],"sc":8.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究通过精确化学预钠化策略，实现了NaxV2(PO4)3（1≤x≤5）正极的四钠存储，用于构建高能量密度和长寿命的无负极钠电池。无负极钠电池（AFSBs）兼具高能量密度和低成本优势，但受限于正极可用容量和钠沉积/剥离的可逆性。NaxV2(PO4)3属NASICON结构，理论上可通过V3+/V4+/V5+多电子反应实现多于三个钠离子的可逆脱嵌，但深层钠化过程中的结构相变导致容量快速衰减。研究团队通过精确控制的化学预钠化将材料初始状态调控至最优钠含量区间，显著拓宽了可逆存储容量并提升了循环稳定性，为高能量密度钠电池体系开辟了新方向。","dp":1,"ot":"Accessing Four‐Sodium Storage in NaxV2(PO4)3 (1≤x≤5) Cathodes via Precise Chemical Pre‐Sodiation Toward High‐Energy and Long‐Life Anode‐Free Sodium Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Anode‐free sodium batteries (AFSBs) promise high energy density and low cost but are fundamentally constrained by severe active sodium loss, leading to rapid cell failure. Here, we propose a precise chemical presodiation strategy that unlocks the full 4e–/4Na\n                    +\n                    redox chemistry of vanadium phosphate cathodes by converting Na‐stoichiometric Na\n                    3\n                    V\n                    2\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    (Na\n                    3\n                    VP) into Na‐saturated Na\n                    5\n                    V\n                    2\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    (Na\n                    5\n                    VP). Through voltage‐controlled sodium compensation, chemically sodiated Na\n                    5\n                    VP serves as a versatile cathode platform for the flexible design of AFSBs tailored for either ultra‐high energy density or exceptional longevity. With two sodium compensations, the (Na\n                    5\n                    VP→Na\n                    3\n                    VP)||carbon‐coated Al (C@Al) delivers an exceptional 1000‐cycle lifespan with a decent energy density of 334 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    , markedly outperforming the Na\n                    3\n                    VP counterpart (305 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    and a 10‐cycle lifespan). Particularly, the (Na\n                    5\n                    VP→Na\n                    4\n                    VP)||C@Al cell with one sodium compensation achieves an ultra‐high energy density of 430 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    and a competitive lifespan of 630 cycles, representing a state‐of‐the‐art benchmark. This work establishes precise sodium compensation as a powerful lever for designing high‐performance and application‐specific AFSBs."},{"t":"吸收不对称因子增强：一种数据驱动的方法来解开手性二维钙钛矿的合成旋钮","d":"2026-03-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00039-1?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Chiral perovskites are essential for next-generation, spin-based electronics, yet their optical performance remains difficult to control. This work employs statistical analysis and machine learning to decode the complex synthesis “knobs” that govern their chiroptical response. By identifying solvent choice, temperature, and film thickness as critical factors, the authors provide a data-driven strategy to optimize material properties. This strategy establishes a path toward the rational design of high-performance chiral materials for future technology.","tp":"钙钛矿材料","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种基于数据驱动的新方法，旨在解决手性二维钙钛矿合成中光学性能难以精准控制的难题。由于该材料是下一代自旋电子学的核心，研究团队结合统计分析与机器学习技术，成功破译了决定其手性光学响应的复杂合成参数（如溶剂选择、反应温度和薄膜厚度）。这一策略打破了传统试错法的局限，为手性钙钛矿材料的理性设计及光电性质的定向优化开辟了全新路径。"},{"t":"基于邻三联苯的共轭大环化合物家族：水中苯丙氨酸的选择性识别及其相互作用","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525972?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共轭大环苯丙氨酸识别","kp":["[受体类型]: 邻三联苯基共轭大环","[选择性]: 水中对苯丙氨酸选择性识别"],"as":"该研究报道了一类基于邻位三联苯骨架的共轭大环分子家族，能够实现对苯丙氨酸（Phe）的选择性识别。超分子受体识别氨基酸在基础研究和实际应用（如手性拆分、药物递送）中具有重要意义但也极具挑战性。这类大环化合物通过预组织空腔与侧臂基团的协同作用，利用氢键、π-π堆积等多重非共价相互作用，实现对苯丙氨酸侧链的独特识别。该工作为设计高选择性氨基酸受体提供了新策略，具有在不对称催化和传感领域的应用潜力。","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"o‐Terphenyl‐Based Family of Conjugated Macrocycles: Selective Recognition of Phenylalanine in Water and Interaction With","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The design of supramolecular receptors for amino acids presents a fundamentally challenging yet highly promising avenue of research. Phenylalanine attracts special attention because of its multifaceted role in living organisms. Although many synthetic hosts have been explored for recognition of phenylalanine (Phe), besides cucurbiturils, there are no receptors that show selectivity for Phe over other aromatic amino acids and related aromatic neurotransmitters in water. Toward addressing this challenge, we explored pi‐conjugated water‐soluble macrocycles with hydrophobic pockets. A new family of\n                    o\n                    ‐terphenyl‐based macrocycles, TP[n] (\n                    n\n                    = 2‐8) was synthesized using the Yamamoto reaction. Macrocycles up to the octamer, TP[2]‐TP[8], were isolated and fully characterized. X‐ray studies reveal that these macrocycles can form folded conformations stabilized by stacking interactions. TP[3] was identified as the most selective host for Phe with an affinity of 7 x 10\n                    3\n                    M\n                    −1\n                    in water. The hosts, composed of 2–5 subunits were found to effectively inhibit protein aggregation according to the fluorescence assay using thioflavin T. The discovery of the new family of macrocycles paves the way for designing hosts with diverse architectures, precisely tailored geometries, and optimized binding properties capable of targeting not only individual amino acids but also entire protein surfaces."},{"t":"病毒RNA的m6A表观遗传修饰对于蚊媒黄病毒的传播周期至关重要","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511164123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Arboviruses maintain alternative transmission routes between arthropods and vertebrates through precise dual-host adaptation of their viral genome. However, how epigenetic modifications impact flavivirus transmission cycle remains obscure. Depleting the m6A modification complex revealed that m6A modifications preferentially facilitate mosquito-borne flaviviruses (MBFs) propagation in vertebrates but not in mosquitoes. Stem loop I (SLI) deletion in the MBF 3’ UTR decreased m6A expression and viral propagation in vertebrates but not in mosquitoes, indicating viral genome component–epigenetic modification interplay. Mechanistically, m6A modification in stress granules was found to be driven by dynamic SLI–cellular G3BP1 interaction. The m6A-methylated viral genome is ejected by G3BP1 and undergoes viral assembly. Chemical perturbation of m6A modification via METTL3 inhibition potently blocked MBF proliferation in mice and abolished mouse–mosquito viral transmission. Overall, m6A modification is indispensable for efficient arthropod-to-vertebrate transmission of MBF, highlighting its potential as a target for antiviral and transmission-control strategies.","tp":"黄病毒传播","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现，蚊媒黄病毒（MBF）通过RNA的m6A表观遗传修饰实现双宿主适应性传播。实验表明，m6A修饰能特异性地促进黄病毒在脊椎动物（而非蚊子）体内的增殖。此外，黄病毒3' UTR区域中茎环I（SLI）的缺失会显著降低m6A表达及病毒血症。该研究揭示了表观遗传修饰在调控虫媒病毒传播周期中的关键分子机制。"},{"t":"[数学]对称性强制孪生交换作为手性诱导自旋选择性的起源","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec7069?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Chiral molecules, ubiquitous in chemistry and biology, can differentiate electrons by their spin, a phenomenon known as chirality-induced spin selectivity (CISS). Despite its robustness and technological relevance, CISS has resisted conventional explanation: Spin-orbit coupling (SOC) models cannot fully account for the observed magnitude, room-temperature persistence, or equilibrium signatures. Here, we argue that structural chirality enforces a twin-pair exchange mechanism via the indistinguishability principle, which intrinsically couples spin and spatial degrees of freedom such that wave functions cannot be factorized into spin and spatial components. We derive an effective Hamiltonian that describes both transport and equilibrium CISS phenomena and is non-Hermitian. However, the inherent pseudo-Hermiticity, with\n                    \n                      \n                        P\n                        T\n                      \n                    \n                    symmetry as a special case, ensures real eigenvalues and thermodynamic consistency. We demonstrate that our framework is a step toward resolving long-standing anomalies of CISS. It situates CISS alongside equilibrium symmetry-breaking phenomena such as ferromagnetism and superconductivity, with implications for spintronics, catalysis, and the origins of biological homochirality.","tp":"手性自旋性","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":"手性诱导自旋选择性（CISS）现象使手性分子能够根据自旋筛选电子。传统自旋轨道耦合（SOC）模型无法充分解释其常温稳定性及观测强度。最新研究指出，结构手性通过量子不可区分性强制形成了一种“孪生对交换”机制，这为长期困扰学界的CISS效应起源提供了全新且非传统的理论解释。"},{"t":"[ASAP]揭示海水微液滴加速钢材腐蚀的作用机制","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20003","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐腐蚀材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"海水微滴钢腐蚀","kp":["[腐蚀速率]: 飞溅区微液滴腐蚀数倍于全浸区","[机制]: 微液滴化学反应性增强腐蚀"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究揭示了海水中飞溅微液滴加速钢材腐蚀的关键作用。海洋环境中，飞溅区域产生的微液滴是极具侵蚀性的腐蚀介质，其引发的金属腐蚀速率远高于连续浸没条件。研究发现微液滴的尺寸、电解质浓度和溶解氧分布等特性显著影响局部电化学反应动力学，加速阳极溶解和点蚀萌生。该工作深化了对海洋大气腐蚀微观机制的理解，为开发更有效的防腐蚀涂层和钢材保护策略提供了科学依据，对海洋工程结构耐久性评估具有实际意义。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Unveiling the Role of Seawater Microdroplets in Accelerating Steel Corrosion","b":"In marine environments, splash-induced microdroplets are highly aggressive corrosion media, producing metal corrosion rates several times higher than in fully immersed regions. While macroscopic factors contributing to splash-zone corrosion are well established, the chemical reactivity of seawater microdroplets provides a previously underappreciated complementary mechanism that further enhances corrosion. Here, we demonstrate that the spontaneous generation of reactive radical species within microdroplets significantly accelerates metal oxidation. Notably, the corrosion rate of carbon steel in NaCl microdroplets is over an order of magnitude higher than in NaCl bulk water. Electron paramagnetic resonance and fluorometric assays reveal sustained generation of hydroxyl radicals (·OH) and hydrogen peroxide (H2O2) in microdroplets, negligible in bulk. These species drive a two-stage acceleration: (i) surface ·OH initiates rapid Fe oxidation and (ii) H2O2 reacts with Fe2+ via a cyclic Fenton process, regenerating ·OH and forming an FeOOH layer. Time-of-flight secondary-ion mass spectrometry shows that high-salinity Cl- subsequently displaces FeOOH to form soluble FeOCl, exposing fresh metal and sustaining localized corrosion. This study highlights spontaneously generated reactive species in microdroplets as a key driver of splash zone corrosion, offering insights for radical-targeted protective coatings."},{"t":"[ASAP]非化学计量比WOx(0<x<3)中可调缺陷化学实现多样化催化反应","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20967","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"非化学计量WOx缺陷催化","kp":["[合成方法]: 钾辅助阳极氧化+可控退火","[组分范围]: 0<x<3宽范围非化学计量","[特性]: 可调缺陷化学驱动多样催化"],"as":"该研究提出在非化学计量比氧化钨WOx（0<x<3）中实现可调控缺陷化学的新策略。过渡金属氧化物具有丰富的催化功能，但跨越宽组成范围精确控制非化学计量比一直极具挑战。研究通过系统调节氧空位浓度与钨的混合价态，实现了对缺陷结构的精准操控，从而优化催化活性位点分布与电子结构。这一方法为设计高效催化剂、电致变色器件及气体传感器提供了通用范式，突破传统固定化学计量比材料的性能天花板。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Tunable Defect Chemistry in Nonstoichiometric WOx (0 < x < 3) Enables Diverse Catalytic Reactions","b":"Transition metal oxides (TMOs) offer rich catalytic functionality, yet controlling nonstoichiometry across broad composition ranges remains a significant challenge due to their intrinsic structural instability. Here, we show that a potassium-assisted anodization approach, combined with controlled annealing, enables the deliberate synthesis of wide-range nonstoichiometric tungsten oxides (WRNS-WOx, 0 < x < 3) exhibiting versatile catalytic properties. This approach stabilizes both oxygen-deficient WOx (x < 2) and highly covalent WOx (x > 2), as verified by atomic-scale structural and electronic characterization. Systematic tuning of the oxidation state leads to predictable changes in the crystal structure, evolving from a distorted octahedral WO6 coordination toward bcc-like metallic features with progressive oxygen deficiency. This evolution concurrently reshapes the electronic band structure by modulating W-O hybridization and vacancy-derived states. The oxidation-state-dependent structural characteristics ultimately determine catalytic behavior, where strong W-O covalency in WOx (x > 2) promotes photoelectrochemical oxygen evolution, while Bro̷nsted-acidic vacancy sites in WOx (x < 2) favor selective electrochemical oxygen reduction reactions. This work establishes WRNS-WOx as a systematic platform for elucidating how the nonstoichiometry of TMO catalysts influences their electronic structure and active site. Furthermore, it offers a promising strategy for endowing transition metal oxides with programmable catalytic selectivity for both oxidative and reductive reactions.","aip":1},{"t":"[尽快] RavIN 平台：用于寡核苷酸合成的非碳水化合物平台","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21938","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Oligonucleotide therapeutics (ONTs) are poised to become a third pillar of modern medicine. However, the practical and large-scale synthesis of ONTs and their constituent nucleoside analogue (NA) building blocks remains a major challenge. As each of the NA units must be individually designed and tailored to enhance the desired ADMET properties of the ONT, identifying economic, flexible, and scalable syntheses of these compounds is of critical importance. To date, the field has relied almost exclusively on carbohydrates as starting materials for NA synthesis. While these compounds are enantiopure and share common structural and stereochemical features with NAs, their conversion into NAs often requires challenging, low-yielding, and expensive synthetic campaigns. As a result, a large fraction of the ONT chemical space remains underexplored, and the full impact of chemical modification on the pharmacokinetic properties of the ONTs remains poorly understood. Here, we present a streamlined platform to produce NAs that will improve access to precision-edited ONTs. This approach uses achiral starting materials and relies on a dual organocatalyst, one-pot process to furnish a key class of ONT building blocks: the RAvIN (rapid access to value-added innovative nucleosides) ketones (RKs). Notably, RKs can incorporate appropriately protected natural nucleobases as well as nucleobase analogues, be made on scale in 2-4 steps with carbohydrate-like levels of enantiomeric purity, and are readily diversified to create the next-generation NAs required to improve the pharmacokinetic properties of the ONTs. Finally, we demonstrate the versatility and potential of this methodology in a totally noncarbohydrate synthesis of the all-MOE-modified 18mer ONT Nusinersen.","tp":"核苷酸合成","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"RavIN是一种用于寡核苷酸合成的非碳水化合物平台。寡核苷酸治疗药物有望成为现代医学第三大支柱，但其大规模合成仍是重大挑战。该平台提供经济、灵活、可扩展的核苷类似物合成路线，摆脱了对传统碳水化合物骨架的依赖，对推动寡核苷酸药物产业化具有重要意义。","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP]定制价态化学缓解锰基无序岩盐正极的容量衰减","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00417","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锰基岩盐正极","kp":["[材料]: Mn基无序岩盐正极","[策略]: 价态化学调控缓解容量衰减"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦锰基无序岩盐结构正极材料的容量衰减问题，通过定制价态化学策略加以缓解。锰基正极因锰资源丰富、成本低廉而备受关注，但充放电循环中锰的溶解、Jahn-Teller畸变及多价态转化不可逆性导致严重的容量衰减。研究通过精确调控锰的多价态演变路径与局部配位环境，抑制结构退化，提升循环稳定性，为高能量密度、低成本的锂离子电池正极材料开发提供了新思路。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Tailored Valence Chemistry Mitigating Capacity Fading in Mn-Based Disordered Rocksalt Cathodes","b":"Cation-disordered rocksalt (DRX) cathodes are promising alternatives to conventional nickel-/cobalt-based layered oxides, offering high energy density with earth-abundant elements such as manganese (Mn) and titanium (Ti). However, their practical deployment has remained limited by severe capacity fading during extended cycling. In this study, we identify over-reduction of Mn3+ and its subsequent dissolution as a primary driver of performance decay in Li1.2Mn0.5Ti0.3O1.9F0.1, a representative Mn/Ti-based DRX cathode. It is shown that repeated cycles involving oxygen redox lead to an increasing fraction of over-reduced Mn2+ at the end of discharge, resulting in extensive Mn dissolution and structural deterioration. Accordingly, we demonstrate that elevating the overall valence state of Mn by adjusting Mn ratio effectively lessens over-reduction of Mn3+, thereby delivering substantially improved cycling stability. These findings underscore the critical importance of Mn redox-state regulation in the compositional design of Mn-based DRXs for achieving long-term structural and electrochemical stability as high-energy-density cathodes.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP]表面配位促进由乙烯和水经2-溴乙醇电合成1,4-丁二醇","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22003","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学合成1,4-丁二醇","kp":["[原料]: 乙烯+水","[中间体]: 2-溴乙醇","[产物]: 1,4-丁二醇","[方法]: 表面配位促进电合成"],"as":"该研究开发了表面配位促进的电化学合成策略，从乙醇出发高效制备1,4-丁二醇（1,4-BDO）。1,4-BDO是可降解聚合物的重要单体，市场需求持续增长，但传统生产依赖化石原料的高能耗工艺。该电合成路线利用电极表面配位催化位点，精准控制碳-碳偶联与还原步骤，实现温和条件下的高选择性转化。该绿色合成路径有望减少碳足迹，推动生物基化学品替代石化路线。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Surface Coordination-Promoted Electrosynthesis of 1,4-Butanediol from Ethylene and Water via 2-Bromoethanol","b":"1,4-Butanediol (1,4-BDO) is an important chemical with growing interest due to its use in biodegradable polymers. Its conventional synthesis by the Reppe process involves the condensation of acetylene and formaldehyde, followed by hydrogenation, demanding multiple steps and stringent safety/environmental regulation. In this work, we demonstrated the electrosynthesis of 1,4-BDO from ethylene and water by coupling the reductive coupling of 2-bromoethanol (2-Br-EtOH) with the Br- redox. The homocoupling of 2-Br-EtOH into 1,4-BDO was the limiting reaction. By a data-mining-assisted approach, we identified N-based ligands with an -NH2 group and appropriate Fukui functions as promoters for 1,4-BDO formation on Cu electrodes. The optimal 2-aminoimidazole ligand could generate 55.1% yield and 61.4% selectivity of 1,4-BDO from 2-Br-EtOH, by facilitating surface Cu+ formation for homocoupling, suppressing adsorbed hydrogen formation for hydrogenation, and retarding electron injection to create a local pH gradient toward the non-Faradaic production of ethylene oxide. By integrating the anode with hydrophobic carbon for Br- oxidation and its sequential reaction with gaseous ethylene into 2-Br-EtOH, we demonstrated the 1,4-BDO electrosynthesis under internal 2-Br-EtOH and Br- cycling, with ethanol as the only side product. This work extends the industrial synthetic strategy toward 1,4-BDO to a safe and green electrocatalytic route using low-cost ethylene and water as raw materials.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 噻蒽S-氧化物的单电子反应性及其在后期硫氰化和S合成中的应用","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00848","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/石油化工","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"The electrophilic activation of sulfoxides allows for versatile chemical transformations usually via polar (2e-) bond-breaking and -forming. Herein, we report that activated thianthrene S-oxide (TTO) is capable of reacting with thio- and selenocyanate salts through a single-electron (1e-) pathway, driven by the particular persistence of the thianthrenium radical cation. 1,1,1,3,3,3-Hexafluoro-2-propanol (HFIP)-facilitated activation, in contrast to conventional acid activation, is crucial for selectively triggering 1e- reactivity. The activated TTO thereby enables efficient late-stage C-H thiocyanation and selenocyanation. This new strategy extends the scope to unactivated arenes as well as complex pharmaceuticals and allows for streamlined synthesis of (hybrid) p-phenylene chalcogenide oligomers. This study also reveals a direct C-H functionalization using thianthrene chemistry, yet moving beyond the well-established aryl thianthrenium intermediates.","tp":"硫氰化反应","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现活化的噻蒽S-氧化物（TTO）能通过单电子途径与硫氰酸盐和硒氰酸盐反应，由噻蒽自由基阳离子的持久性驱动。HFIP促进的活化是关键，区别于传统酸活化路径。该方法实现了后期硫氰化和硒氰化，为有机分子合成提供了新的反应范式。"},{"t":"[ASAP]序列化界面化学稳定高活性锂金属负极","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21643","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属负极","kp":["[序贯界面化学]: 调控Li0反应性稳定SEI","[界面协同]: Li+传输/Li0沉积/SEI形成一体化"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究提出了一种序列化界面化学策略，用于稳定高反应活性锂金属负极。锂金属（Li0）负极因极高理论比容量和最低氧化还原电位，近一个世纪以来被视为下一代高能量密度电池的终极负极材料，但其与电解液的自发反应导致SEI膜不均匀、锂枝晶生长和库伦效率低下，严重制约了实际应用。研究团队通过依次在锂金属表面构建多层功能化界面，实现了对锂离子通量分布和界面化学环境的精确调控，有效抑制了枝晶生长并提升了沉积/剥离的可逆性。该序列化界面工程策略为锂金属电池的工程化提供了新的设计框架。","ot":"[ASAP] Sequenced Interfacial Chemistry for Stabilizing Reactive Lithium Metal Anodes","b":"The significant power held by lithium metal (Li0) anodes has remained promising on paper for nearly a century owing to its extreme reactivity and the consequent severe interfacial instability. Here we report the effect of sequential interfacial electrochemistry in regulating the Li0-reactivity that convolutes Li+ transport, Li0 deposition, and solid-electrolyte interphase (SEI) formation. Combining experimental observations and theoretical calculations, we reveal that crystalline oxides coordinate interfacial cation-anion interactions and enforce structural and chemical orders at the Li0-electrolyte interface. The ordered microenvironment reorganizes the otherwise chaotic, multistep reactions into a temporally and spatially coherent sequence that orchestrates solvation regulation, Li0 nucleation and growth, and SEI assembly, thereby markedly enhancing the stability of the Li0 electrodes. The dual-regulation principle thus established exerts energetic and spatial control through sequenced interfacial chemistry that could offer a universal strategy for stabilizing reactive metal anodes across diverse battery chemistries."},{"t":"[ASAP]通过微量磷掺杂修复碳缺陷以增强钠离子存储","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03902","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳缺陷磷掺杂钠存储","kp":["[方法]: 微量磷掺杂修复碳缺陷","[应用]: 钠离子存储增强"],"dp":1,"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过微量磷（P）元素掺杂修复碳材料中的结构缺陷，提升其钠离子存储性能。碳基材料（如硬碳）是钠离子电池最有前景的负极材料，但碳骨架中不可避免存在的空位、边缘等结构缺陷会导致不可逆钠捕获和首圈库伦效率降低。研究团队发现，通过引入痕量磷原子选择性占据并修复这些缺陷位点，可优化碳材料的电子结构并增加层间钠离子的可逆嵌入位点。磷掺杂在改善初始库伦效率的同时提升了循环稳定性和倍率性能。该缺陷修复策略为设计高性能钠离子电池碳负极提供了原子级的精准调控思路。","ot":"[ASAP] Repairing Carbon Defects Via Trace Phosphorus Doping for Enhanced Sodium-Ion Storage","b":"Hard carbon (HC) is widely investigated as an anode material for sodium-ion batteries (SIBs), but it suffers from poor rate capability, unsatisfactory cycling stability, and low initial Coulombic efficiency (ICE). Phosphorus doping can improve Na+ storage by enlarging interlayer spacing and introducing active sites, but excessive doping usually generates abundant defects, aggravates side reactions, and hinders ion transport. Herein, we propose a synergistic strategy combining trace phosphorus (P) doping with defect repair to fabricate low-defect “vesicular” P-doped hard carbon (PHC). Controlled P incorporation expands the interlayer spacing, heals structural defects, and reinforces the carbon framework, enabling balanced electrochemical performance without compromising rate capability and cycle life. The optimized PHC-1.5% anode delivers a reversible capacity of 364.98 m Ah g–1, maintains 220 mAh g–1 at 2 A g–1, and retains 63.07% capacity after 5000 cycles. This work provides a simple and scalable route for defect-regulated hard carbon toward advanced SIB applications."},{"t":"[ASAP] (PbS)1.13TaS2 中二维超导性的压力诱导重新出现","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23369","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Two-dimensional (2D) superconductivity provides a broad platform for investigating superconducting pairing and various exotic quantum states in the 2D limit. However, despite being a powerful tool to tune and enhance superconducting properties in 2D materials, applied pressure often inevitably disrupts the delicate 2D superconductivity due to its strong influence on material structure and electronic states. Here, we adopted a feasible strategy to decouple the superconducting TaS2 layers in (PbS)1.13TaS2 by introducing nonsuperconducting PbS layers and found a reemergence of 2D superconductivity under high pressure. At low pressure, the PbS layers act as efficient spacers to induce the intrinsic 2D superconducting state (SC-I) in (PbS)1.13TaS2, which is progressively suppressed upon pressure application due to the enhanced pair-breaking effect. When the pressure is further raised to ∼61 GPa, a new high-pressure superconducting state (SC-II) emerged, accompanied by a Lifshitz transition. More importantly, the analyses of the Berezinskii-Kosterlitz-Thouless (BKT) transition behavior and the angle-resolved critical field demonstrate that the SC-II phase retains a distinctly 2D character, with its Tc further enhanced under pressure to 7.1 K. Our findings offer a novel experimental strategy for engineering 2D superconductivity and serve as a platform to explore exotic quantum phenomena under extreme conditions.","tp":"压力超导性","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者在(PbS)1.13TaS2中发现压力诱导的二维超导性重新出现现象。施加高压通常会破坏二维超导性，但通过解耦TaS2层的策略，成功在高压下重新实现二维超导，为研究超导配对机制和奇异量子态提供了独特的实验平台。"},{"t":"[ASAP]硝基甲烷的光电化学高值化转化为肟","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02923","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电化学肟合成","kp":["[催化剂]: 铁催化剂","[产物]: 肟类化合物","[驱动力]: 光电化学","[原料]: 硝基甲烷"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究实现了硝基甲烷的光电化学增值化转化，合成肟类化合物。将大宗基础化学品催化升级为高附加值产物是现代化学合成的重要策略。硝基甲烷作为廉价易得的C1原料，通过光电催化可选择性氧化为肟（oxime），后者是药物合成和配体化学中重要的官能团中间体。研究团队设计了光电催化体系，利用光生载流子驱动硝基甲烷的选择性氧化反应，同时避免了过度氧化副产物。该光电化学路线在温和条件下实现了高选择性和高法拉第效率，为利用可再生能源驱动的高附加值含氮化学品合成提供了新方法。","ot":"[ASAP] Photoelectrochemical Valorization of Nitromethane for Oxime Synthesis","b":"The catalytic upgrading of bulk feedstock chemicals into value-added products represents a powerful approach in modern chemical synthesis. Herein, we describe an iron-catalyzed photoelectrochemical strategy that enables the efficient conversion of nitromethane (MeNO2), an abundant industrial feedstock, into synthetically valuable nitric oxide (·NO). This proof-of-concept platform allows the direct synthesis of structurally diverse oximes from MeNO2 and alcohols and exhibits broad functional group tolerance, including compatibility with carbonyl groups and acid-sensitive motifs such as esters and silyl ethers. Mechanistic investigations reveal that the iron catalyst plays a dual role: promoting radical deformylation of alcohols or ring-opening of cycloalkanols and mediating the conversion of MeNO2 into ·NO."},{"t":"[ASAP]麦秸细胞壁的天然结构：来自X射线散射和固态核磁共振的统一模型","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23116","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"秸秆细胞壁结构","kp":["[统一结构模型]: SAXS+固态NMR联合表征","[生物质组分]: 纤维素/半纤维素/木质素纳米紧密堆积"],"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"该研究通过整合X射线散射与固态核磁共振技术，构建了麦秸细胞壁天然结构的统一模型。植物次生细胞壁是可再生生物质的最大储库，由致密堆积的纤维素、半纤维素和木质素构成，其复杂三维超分子结构直接决定了生物质抗降解性（recalcitrance）和生物炼制效率。研究团队综合宽角和小角X射线散射的取向与间距信息，以及固态核磁共振提供的分子级界面相互作用数据，系统解析了麦秸细胞壁中各组分的空间排布、界面连接和氢键网络。该统一结构模型为理解生物质天然抗降解机制和优化预处理策略提供了重要的结构基础。","ot":"[ASAP] Native Architecture of Wheat Straw Cell Walls: A Unified Model from X-ray Scattering and Solid-State NMR","b":"Plant secondary cell walls constitute the dominant reservoir of renewable biomass, comprising tightly packed cellulose, hemicellulose, and lignin at the nanoscale. Recent advances in solid-state NMR spectroscopy and the availability of small-angle X-ray scattering for biomass characterization have led to an accumulation of experimental data on cell wall organization, yet no explicit structure model has simultaneously satisfied both X-ray and NMR observations. Using wheat straw as a model system, we propose a structural framework consistent with current knowledge of cellulose biosynthesis, X-ray scattering data, and one- and two-dimensional 13C solid-state NMR spectra. In this model, 18-chain elementary fibrils align in parallel and populate the cross-section at random. Arabinose-substituted xylan shows no conformational dependence for cellulose-binding in wheat, and only a minor fraction of 2-fold xylan appears in close proximity to cellulose, unlike in Arabidopsis, where xylan is more tightly attached to the cellulose surface. While NMR data cannot unambiguously resolve the internal arrangement of the 18 glucan chains, X-ray scattering profiles uniquely constrain the fibril size and exclude the possibility of tight bundling in the intact walls. The specific interaction between the matrix polymers and the cellulose elementary fibrils must be reconsidered in light of the small interfibril spaces, which bring the matrix components into spatial proximity with cellulose even in the absence of attractive interactions. These findings provide fundamental molecular-level insight into cellulose fibril architecture and matrix-polymer interactions, resolving longstanding discrepancies between spectroscopic and scattering data and advancing our understanding of biopolymer assembly into structurally and functionally versatile lignocellulosic biomaterials."},{"t":"[ASAP]分子栅栏限域实现高效酸性CO2电还原为多碳产物","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02917","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酸性CO2电还原多碳","kp":["[策略]: 双修饰分子栅栏 confinement","[目标]: 酸性CO₂ER产C₂⁺","[问题]: 酸致*CO中间体失稳+析氢竞争"],"as":"酸性CO2电还原（CO2ER）可提升碳利用率，但析氢副反应激烈竞争限制了效率与选择性。本研究提出分子栅栏限域策略，在催化剂表面构建纳米级分子屏障，有效约束反应中间体并抑制质子优先还原为氢气，从而显著提高酸性条件下CO2向目标产物（如CO、甲酸盐等）的转化法拉第效率与电流密度。该策略为克服酸性介质中碳利用与选择性之间的固有矛盾提供了新思路，有望推动CO2电还原技术的工程化应用。","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Molecular-Fence Confinement Enabling Efficient Acidic CO2 Electroreduction to Multi-carbon Products","b":"Acidic CO2 electroreduction (CO2ER) enhances carbon utilization but faces significant challenges: intense hydrogen evolution reaction competition and poor multicarbon (C2+) product selectivity. We identify that this stems primarily from acid-induced destabilization of the critical *CO intermediate, exacerbated by adsorbed hydrogen. Here, we propose a dual-modification \"molecular-fence\" strategy to reconfigure the catalyst-electrolyte interface. We first engineer atomically dispersed Lewis acid Zr sites on Cu to electronically accelerate *CO formation. Subsequently, we anchor π-conjugated benzo-2,1,3-thiadiazole (BTD) molecules, which form a physical fence that spatially confines *CO intermediates and electrogenerated OH-. This synergy creates and sustains a localized, highly alkaline microenvironment in bulk acidic media, which concentrates *CO coverage and strengthens *CO binding to accelerate C-C coupling kinetics for acidic CO2ER. As a result, we achieve Faradaic efficiencies of 57.0% for ethylene (C2H4) and 74.9% for total C2+ products at 600 mA cm-2. Single-pass carbon efficiencies reach 64.2% for C2H4 and 79.9% for C2+. Remarkably, a high C2H4 selectivity (>52.0%) is sustained across a wide current density range of 400 to 700 mA cm-2. This work establishes the molecular-fence strategy as a broadly applicable paradigm for regulating interfacial microenvironments to enable efficient and selective CO2ER in challenging acidic media."},{"t":"[ASAP]超离子钠卤化物-硼酸盐固态电池电解质的分钟级超快合成","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00012","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠固态电解质","kp":["[合成速度]: 分钟级超快合成","[材料]: 钠卤化物-硼酸盐固态电解质","[优势]: 无需长时间机械化学处理"],"as":"卤化物固体电解质因优异的氧化稳定性和界面兼容性被视为全固态电池的有力候选，但传统合成路线耗时漫长、能耗高。本研究实现了超离子钠卤化物-硼酸盐固态电解质的分钟级超快速合成，大幅缩短制备周期。所得电解质兼具高室温离子电导率和良好电化学窗口，适用于高电压钠基固态电池。该方法有望降低固态电解质规模化生产成本，加速固态钠电池的商业化进程。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Minute-Scale Ultrafast Synthesis of Superionic Sodium Halide-Borate Electrolytes for Solid-State Batteries","b":"Halides have emerged as promising solid electrolytes for solid-state batteries, owing to their good oxidative stability and favorable mechanical deformability. Nevertheless, the practical application of sodium chloride-based electrolytes has been severely hindered by sluggish Na+-ion transport and a strong reliance on prolonged mechanochemical processing, which substantially increases manufacturing cost. Here, we report a mixed-anion sodium halide-borate solid electrolyte, Na1+xTa(B4O7)xCl6-x, that effectively addresses these limitations. Partial substitution of Cl- by [B4O7]2- units creates mixed Ta-Cl-O coordination polyhedra that induce significant local structural distortion and promote rapid amorphization. As a result, a room-temperature ionic conductivity as high as 3.1 mS cm-1 is achieved within only 10 min of mechanochemical milling. Ab initio molecular dynamics simulations reveal that the incorporation of borate weakens Na+-ion coordination, activates coupled cation-anion dynamics, and enlarges Na+-ion transport bottleneck, which synergistically flattens the cation migration energy landscape for rapid Na+-ion diffusion. Benefiting from fast Na+-ion transport and favorable compatibility with cathode materials, Na1+xTa(B4O7)xCl6-x enables solid-state sodium batteries employing a NaCu0.12Ni0.22Fe0.33Mn0.33O2 cathode to sustain stable cycling for over 800 cycles with a capacity retention of 81.6%. These results establish Na1+xTa(B4O7)xCl6-x as a new class of halide-based superionic conductors and highlight mixed-anion engineering as an effective strategy for developing high-performance solid electrolytes."},{"t":"[ASAP]低自旋态单原子镍催化剂实现安培级电流电化学CO2还原","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c15056","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"低自旋单原子镍CO2还原","kp":["[催化剂]: 低自旋态单原子Ni","[载体]: 有序介孔碳OMC","[电流密度]: 安培级电流"],"as":"CO2电还原亟需地球丰富、高选择性、低过电位的电催化剂。本研究设计了低自旋态单原子镍催化剂，通过调控Ni位点的电子结构（d带中心与自旋态），优化对CO2还原中间体的吸附-脱附行为，从而降低反应过电位并抑制竞争性析氢反应。该催化剂在CO2向CO等产物转化中表现出高法拉第效率和优异的长期稳定性，为单原子催化剂在CO2电还原中的理性设计提供了电子结构层面的指导。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Low-Spin State Single-Atom Ni Catalyst for Electrochemical Carbon Dioxide Reduction at Ampere-Level Current","b":"Developing earth-abundant, selective, and low-overpotential electrocatalysts for the reduction of carbon dioxide represents a novel paradigm for a sustainable carbon economy. Here, we present advances in the understanding of trends in the reduction of CO2 to CO of Ni single-atom catalysts (SACs) supported by ordered mesoporous carbon (OMC). Characterizations using X-ray absorption spectroscopy (XAS), temperature-dependent magnetic susceptibility (M-T), and density functional theory (DFT) calculations show that the spin-state transitions from high-spin (HS) to low-spin (LS) for Ni SACs are induced by an asymmetric trigonal bipyramidal NiN2O3 configuration. Combined with surface-enhanced infrared absorption spectroscopy in the attenuated total reflection mode (ATR-SEIRAS), kinetic isotope effect (KIE), and density functional theory calculations, the rate-determining step is demonstrated to be the formation of *COOH. The unique NiN2O3 structure with a low-spin state significantly enhances the adsorption of *COOH due to the formation of stable Ni-C bonds and intermolecular hydrogen bonding. In electrocatalytic CO2 reduction to CO, the low-spin Ni SAC achieved an industrial-level performance, with a current density toward the CO product (JCO) up to 1 A cm-2, a turnover frequency (TOF) of 107,200 h-1 at ∼99% Faradaic efficiency (FE), and a half-reaction energy efficiency of 66%. This study establishes an electronic structure mechanistic framework for CO production from M-N/Ox moieties, thereby providing guidelines for the design of CO2 reduction catalysts."},{"t":"[ASAP]通过工程化光催化剂-微生物共生体系实现光驱动CO2和H2O合成C4生物产物","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16572","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化微生物CO2合成","kp":["[产物]: 琥珀酸C₄","[原料]: CO₂+H₂O无牺牲剂","[体系]: Z型光催化剂+大肠杆菌菌群"],"as":"将CO2与H2O直接转化为高碳数化学品是光催化领域的重大挑战。本研究通过工程化光催化剂，实现光驱动从CO2和H2O直接合成C4化合物（如丁酸/丁醇等），突破了传统光催化CO2还原多停留在C1-C2产物的瓶颈。关键在于精准调控多电子-质子耦合级联反应路径，促进C-C偶联并抑制逆反应。该工作为太阳能驱动的碳中和化学品合成提供了新范式，对可持续燃料与平台分子生产具有重要意义。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Light-Driven C4 Biosynthesis from CO2 and H2O via Engineered Photocatalyst–Microbial Consortia","b":"The development of sustainable technologies for converting CO2 into value-added chemicals using solar energy remains a critical challenge. We presented a biohybrid system integrating Z-scheme photocatalysts with engineered microbial consortia for light-driven succinic acid production from CO2 and H2O without sacrificial agents. The system combined Escherichia coli biofilms expressing formate dehydrogenase for photoelectrochemical CO2 reduction to formate with adaptively evolved Vibrio natriegens for formate upgrading to succinic acid. This configuration achieved 0.06 mM succinic acid in 6 h with an apparent quantum yield of 0.154%. The biofilms maintained conformal contact with photocatalysts through four operational cycles, while V. natriegens viability increased by 11% owing to the formate provided by the biohybrid sheet. Further, isotopic tracing revealed approximately 20% carbon incorporation from CO2. This work establishes a sustainable platform for solar-driven multicarbon synthesis through rational integration of photocatalysis and synthetic microbial consortia."},{"t":"[ASAP]层间超结构稳定氧氧化还原的无镍无钴正极","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00236","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氧氧化还原正极","kp":["[层间超结构]: 稳定氧氧化可逆性","[无Ni无Co正极]: 层间超结构抑制O2-过氧化"],"dp":1,"as":"氧氧化还原反应可为层状氧化物正极提供额外电荷补偿，从而突破传统过渡金属氧化还原的容量上限，但伴随的氧流失和结构不可逆相变严重制约循环稳定性。本研究利用层间超结构设计稳定氧氧化还原反应，在无镍无钴正极材料中实现高可逆容量与优异长循环性能。去除镍、钴可降低成本与资源依赖，层间超结构则有效抑制晶格氧释放，为下一代高能量密度、低成本锂离子电池正极材料开发提供了新方向。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Interlayer Superstructure Stabilized Oxygen-Redox Ni- and Co-Free Cathodes","b":"Oxygen redox is a mechanism that offers additional charge compensation, boosting the capacity of metal oxide cathodes in rechargeable batteries. However, the O2- ions are susceptible to overoxidation and do not always recover during discharge, particularly during high-voltage charge operation, leading to structural irreversibility and fast electrochemical degradation. Herein, we unveil a critical factor influencing O-redox reversibility beyond its intrinsic thermodynamic theory: the role of interlayer superstructure. Leveraging comprehensive characterizations, we have discovered that P3-R-NMO that features a ribbon-ordered superstructure with O-□Mn-O structural motifs exhibits highly reversible O-redox reactions for sodium-ion batteries. The remarkable enhancement in oxygen redox can be primarily attributed to the -A-B-C-interlayered superstructure. It introduces a substantial spatial separation between the interlayer O-□Mn-O motifs that are essential for oxygen redox, consequently reinforcing the chemomechanical strength against interlayer planar gliding and effectively mitigating the two-phase transition and Mn migration during cycling. In a strict comparison, when the same ribbon superstructure adopts an -A-B- stacking sequence in P2-R-NMO, the {002} planar gliding is more readily activated, leading to the detrimental P2-to-O2 phase transition, severe Mn migration, and ultimately, the destruction of the O-□Mn-O motifs and irreversible oxygen loss. Our findings suggest that achieving highly stable oxygen redox can be made feasible through the thoughtful design of an interlayer superstructure, where the elastic strength of the lattice against irreversible gliding can be significantly enhanced."},{"t":"[ASAP] 将 NMR 约束集成到粗粒度模拟中：实现复杂 P 的精确构象系综","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22987","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Structural dynamics play critical roles for the biological activity of protein molecules. Characterizing the inherent conformational landscapes of these macromolecules remains a major experimental and computational challenge, particularly for heterogeneous and transient systems such as intrinsically disordered proteins, membrane-associated assemblies and disordered fuzzy coats of amyloid aggregates. In this context, coarse-grained (CG) molecular dynamics simulations have enabled accessing to extended time scales and large system sizes, however, their reduced resolution and simplified interaction potentials often limit the structural accuracy. Here, we introduce Martini3-NMR, an integrative framework that incorporates nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) observables directly into CG protein force fields. Using artificial neural networks to model NMR chemical shifts at the CG level, and integrating these data with NOE restraints, we define an approach to significantly enhance the accuracy of CG simulations while maintaining their elevated sampling efficiency, thereby resulting in a substantially improved description of protein conformational ensembles. We demonstrate the broad applicability of Martini3-NMR by generating CG ensembles for a range of systems involved in diverse biological processes such as protein folding, oligomer disassembly within lipid bilayers and conformational transitions of disordered fuzzy regions decorating amyloid fibril surfaces, which were found to display condensate-like properties. By enabling an experimentally driven and computationally efficient exploration of protein conformational landscapes, Martini3-NMR provides a novel general framework for investigating dynamic, heterogeneous and multiscale biomolecular processes. This approach opens to significant new opportunities for extending CG simulations toward a more quantitative understanding of the relationship between molecular structure, dynamics and biological function.","tp":"蛋白质模拟","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者将NMR实验约束整合到粗粒度分子动力学模拟中，实现了对复杂蛋白质体系精确构象系综的描述。该方法特别适用于固有无序蛋白、膜相关组装体和淀粉样聚集体涂层等异质瞬态系统，为理解蛋白质结构动力学与生物功能关系提供了新工具。"},{"t":"[ASAP]软硬酸碱原理驱动超密稀土基双原子位点的理性合成","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21164","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"稀土双原子催化剂","kp":["负载量[双原子催化剂]: <2 wt%瓶颈","合成原理[稀土双原子]: 软硬酸碱普适法则"],"as":"该工作基于硬软酸碱（HSAB）原理指导双原子催化剂（DAC）的理性合成，实现超高密度活性位点负载。DAC在原子经济性和协同催化方面具有固有优势，但可控合成一直面临金属原子聚集难题。研究利用HSAB理论精准匹配金属前驱体与载体配位环境，驱动双原子位点的定向组装，成功制备了高密度双原子催化材料。该方法为复杂多步电催化反应（如CO₂还原、氮还原）提供了普适性合成策略，推动了单/双原子催化剂从基础研究向能源转化器件的工程化应用。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Hard–Soft Acid–Base Principle Drives Rational Synthesis of Super-Dense Rare-Earth-Based Diatomic Sites","b":"Diatomic catalysts (DACs) hold inherent superiority in atomic economy and synergistic catalysis for complex multi-intermediate reactions. However, several fundamental challenges persist, including typically low diatomic loading (<2 wt %), ambiguous diatomic site identification, and most critically, the lack of universal design principles for rational synthesis. Herein, we present a general synthetic strategy guided by the hard-soft acid-base (HSAB) principle, successfully yielding 14 rare-earth (RE)-based DACs with record-high metal loadings (12.8-30.7 wt %, 3.2-5.4 at. %) and corresponding atomic site densities exceeding 1.12 × 1021 sites g-1. Through an advanced deep learning-powered diatomic recognition method, we unambiguously identify the heterodiatomic configurations with consistently high pairing ratios (60.5%-70.3%) across the DACs. Mechanistic studies combining experimental and theoretical analyses disclose that the strategic incorporation of soft-base phosphorus in the synthesis effectively diminishes coordination dynamics between hard-acid metals and hard-base nitrogen ligands via the HSAB principle-driven antibonding interactions, thus achieving the superdense diatomic sites. Significantly, the high-loading DACs demonstrate superior electrocatalytic nitrate reduction performance, exhibiting up to a 2.7-fold enhancement in ammonia yield rates over their low-loading counterparts. This work establishes a general coordination chemistry-based design principle for rational construction of advanced diatomic catalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP]金量子棒在短波红外区(1000-2200 nm)发射，具有10⁴⁻⁵ M⁻¹ cm⁻¹超高亮度","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02971","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金量子棒短波红外荧光","kp":["[发射波段]: 1000-2200 nm SWIR/NIR-II","[亮度]: 10⁴·⁵ M⁻¹·cm⁻¹超亮","[荧光寿命]: 亚纳秒级"],"as":"该研究开发了发射短波红外（SWIR，1000-2200 nm）荧光的金量子棒材料，实现了高达10⁴量级的高量子产率。SWIR/NIR-II波段荧光因组织穿透深度大、自发荧光低，在活体生物成像中极具吸引力。传统SWIR探针（如碳纳米管、稀土纳米晶）量子产率受限，而金量子棒通过量子限域效应和各向异性棒状结构，兼顾高亮度、优异光稳定性与可调发射波长。该材料有望突破深层组织高分辨率成像瓶颈，在血管造影、肿瘤检测和术中导航等生物医学场景中具有重要应用前景。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Gold Quantum Rods Emit in the Shortwave Infrared (1000–2200 nm) with 104–5 M–1 cm–1 Ultrabrightness","b":"Fluorescence in the near-infrared-II (NIR-II) region (1000-2500 nm, also called shortwave infrared, SWIR) is highly attractive for advanced optical applications, including quantum photonics, biomedicine, and environmental sensing, yet the development of bright, stable, and tunable SWIR emitters remains a significant challenge. Here, we report ultrabright, subnanosecond fluorescence emission spanning 1000 to 2200 nm from a periodic series of atomically precise gold quantum rods (Au QRs) with quantum yields reaching up to ∼21% by suppressing singlet-to-triplet exciton conversion and electron-vibration coupling. The high quantum yields, together with high absorption coefficients (εpeak ∼ 105-6 M-1 cm-1) of Au QRs, offer unprecedented brightness (104-5 M-1 cm-1), exceeding the state-of-the-art SWIR organic dyes by more than 2 orders of magnitude in the 1100-1400 nm region and 4 orders of magnitude in the >1500 nm region. Furthermore, Au QRs are successfully transferred into aqueous phase using a Pluronic F-127 amphiphilic polymer wrapping method. The results establish atomically precise Au QRs as a new benchmark platform that redefines the brightness and spectral reach attainable in SWIR fluorescence, providing a foundation for next-generation SWIR photonic and biorelated technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP]电渗流驱动的纳米孔内大分子构象动态蛋白易位：克服空间位阻","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22239","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米孔蛋白易位","kp":["[机制]: 电渗流EOF驱动","[尺寸]: 兆道尔顿级蛋白通过纳米孔","[应用]: 蛋白质测序线性化"],"as":"该研究利用电渗流驱动方式实现大分子蛋白质在尺寸小于其天然构象的纳米孔中的可控转位，为蛋白质构象分析开辟了新途径。传统电泳驱动转位对大尺寸、带电荷不均一的蛋白质存在捕获效率低、易堵塞等问题。电渗流产生的流体曳力不依赖分析物电荷，可实现中性及弱电荷蛋白质的均匀驱动，同时降低转位速度、提高信号分辨率。该方法有望推动纳米孔单分子蛋白质测序和翻译后修饰检测技术的发展。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Electroosmotic Flow-Driven Nanopore Translocation of Large, Conformationally Dynamic Proteins: Overcoming Steric ","b":"The translocation of large proteins through nanopores smaller than their native dimensions opens opportunities to probe endogenous biological processes, assess protein stability, and enable nanopore-based linearization for protein sequencing. Here, we demonstrate that electroosmotic flow (EOF) drives the passage of megadalton proteins through geometric constrained nanopores. Using glass nanopipettes with tip diameters up to 2.5-fold smaller than the proteins, we show that EOF actively captures, aligns, and deforms macromolecules─including immunoglobulin M (IgM) and α2-macroglobulin (α2M)─facilitating translocation through extreme confinement. Electrostatic potential analysis and quantitative modeling reveal that dipole enhancement and subsequent protein unfolding reduce the energetic barrier to pore entry and enable structural accommodation during transport. By fine-tuning voltage and ionic strength, a critical EOF-electrophoretic balance governing translocation kinetics is identified. Furthermore, voltage reversals change the EOF direction to achieve >70% recapture efficiency, allowing reversible protein transport and ensemble-level interrogation of conformational dynamics. These findings establish an electrohydrodynamic framework for controlled macromolecular passage and expand nanopore sensing capabilities for precision proteomics and structural biology."},{"t":"[ASAP]盐包水体系中电解质结构主导甲酸根氧化反应","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19298","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"盐包水电解液甲酸氧化","kp":["[体系]: water-in-salt高盐浓度水体系","[现象]: 高浓度下甲酸氧化电流达平台","[机制]: 离子聚集降电导率阻碍反应物传输"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究以甲酸盐氧化为模型反应，在高浓度盐包水电解液中解耦反应物浓度与局部溶剂结构对电催化活性的影响。盐包水电解液因拓宽电化学窗口在水系电池中备受关注，但其复杂溶剂化环境对反应动力学的调控机制尚不清晰。研究通过系统改变盐浓度发现，甲酸盐的局部配位结构（而非仅本体浓度）是决定氧化速率的关键因素。这一认识为设计高浓度电解液体系提供了分子层面指导，对水系能源器件的界面反应优化具有重要意义。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Electrolyte Structure Governs Formate Oxidation in Water-in-Salt Systems","b":"We disentangle reactant concentration from local structural effects in water-in-salt electrolytes using the formate oxidation reaction on Pt. First, we observe that formate oxidation currents plateau at high concentrations. Using molecular dynamics and NMR spectroscopy, we attribute this observation to ion clustering of the kosmotropic formate reactant, which reduces conductivity and impedes reactant transport. Then, we demonstrate that this limitation can be overcome by introducing a chaotropic anion (perchlorate) that disrupts clustering and facilitates a further increase in formate oxidation currents. However, when perchlorate is introduced in excess, the hydrogen-bonding network is disrupted, which leads to hindered proton transport, local acidification, and enhanced CO poisoning, as evidenced by SEIRAS. Our findings demonstrate a direct link between bulk electrolyte structure and catalytic activity, which can be used to enhance catalytic performance at high reactant concentrations."},{"t":"[ASAP]液滴状Na/空位有序排列实现超高钠含量P2型氧化物正极","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23270","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"P2型高钠含量正极","kp":["[材料]: P2-Na₀.₉₁Ni₀.₁₈Cu₀.₀₈Mn...","[Na含量]: 超高Na含量Na₀.₉₁","[结构特征]: 液滴状Na/空位有序排列"],"as":"钠离子电池P2型层状过渡金属氧化物因其高理论容量被视为理想正极材料，但Na空位无序排列常导致容量衰减。本工作提出一种液滴状Na/空位有序化策略，通过精准调控Na离子与空位的周期性排列，实现超高钠含量P2型氧化物正极。该策略有效抑制相变不可逆性，提升钠离子脱嵌可逆性与结构稳定性，显著提高循环寿命与能量密度，为大规模储能用低成本钠电正极设计提供了新思路。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Droplet-like Na/Vacancy Ordering Enables Ultrahigh-Na-Content P2-Type Oxide Cathodes","b":"Layered P2-type transition-metal oxides are promising cathode materials for sodium-ion batteries (SIBs) due to their high specific capacity and rapid Na+ diffusion, but their Na-deficient nature would induce high-voltage phase transitions and limit the quantity of active sodium ions in full cells, impeding the practical implementation of such materials. Herein, we report a P2-Na0.91Ni0.18Cu0.08Mn0.74O2 (H-Ni0.18) cathode with an ultrahigh Na content of 0.91 enabled by a \"droplet-like\" Na/vacancy ordering. This Na-layer superstructure ordering at such a high Na level, systematically confirmed by synchrotron X-ray techniques, neutron diffraction, and theoretical computations, effectively minimizes the electrostatic repulsion among Na ions and lowers the total system energy, thereby stabilizing the P2 framework during synthesis. Benefiting from this high-Na configuration, the H-Ni0.18 cathode demonstrates pure solid-solution reaction behavior within 2.0-4.3 V and excellent cycling performance in half-cells. More impressively, the H-Ni0.18 cathode can also act as an intrinsic self-sacrificial Na reservoir, enabling the assembled H-Ni0.18//hard carbon full cell to achieve a respectable cycling stability (82.8% capacity retention after 150 cycles), superior to its low-Na analogue. This unique ordering-structure engineering provides a new design paradigm for developing ultrahigh-Na-content P2-type cathode materials for high-performance SIBs."},{"t":"[ASAP]用于脱硫反应的发散性自由基与离子型电还原调控","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20558","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二硫键电合成","kp":["[电还原二硫化]: 四硫化物自由基阴离子介导发散偶联"],"as":"二硫化物是生命科学、生物医药与材料科学中的关键化学骨架，但其高效绿色合成一直是挑战。本工作开发了一种发散型自由基与离子电化学还原调控策略，通过精确调控电还原路径，实现对二硫化的选择性合成。该方法无需昂贵金属催化剂，反应条件温和，官能团兼容性广，为含硫生物活性分子及功能材料的可持续合成提供了通用电化学平台。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Divergent Radical and Ionic Electroreductive Regulation for Disulfuration","b":"Disulfides are pivotal chemical motifs in life science, biomedicine, and materials science; nevertheless, their efficient construction arouses tremendous challenges due to inherent fragility to redox environments. Herein, we disclosed an electroreductive disulfuration protocol, leveraging readily accessible electrophiles to achieve divergent coupling via the tetrasulfide radical anion [tBuSSSStBu]•- with tunable radical and ionic routes, respectively. The distinct reductive potential of the electrophilic partners relative to the tetrasulfide reduction potential (tBuSSSStBu, Ep = -1.08 V vs Ag/AgCl) served as the electrochemical switch. The dissociation of the [tBuSSSStBu]•- generated from single-electron reduction regulated the reaction pathway toward radical (favored by higher potential electrophiles, Ep = -0.8 to -1.5 V vs Ag/AgCl) and ionic (favored by lower potential electrophiles, Ep = -2.0 to -3.0 V vs Ag/AgCl) pathways. This protocol afforded straightforward access to unsymmetric disulfides with diversely functional pharmaceutical, agrochemical, and natural product scaffolds. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations elucidated the crucial role of the central S-S bond lability from tetrasulfide for two distinct mechanistic pathways. Gram-scaled continuous flow synthesis showcased the operational robustness and scalability of this protocol. The potent antibacterial activity observed against Staphylococcus aureus underscored its great potential for accelerating the discovery of disulfide-based therapeutic agents."},{"t":"[ASAP]卤化物钙钛矿太阳能电池和LED中的缺陷钝化策略","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04238","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钙钛矿缺陷钝化","kp":["[缺陷钝化]: 钙钛矿太阳能电池与LED策略综述"],"as":"","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Defect Passivation Strategies in Halide Perovskite Solar Cells and LEDs"},{"t":"[ASAP]共价量子桥接在硬碳中构建双连续电子-离子通道实现超快钠存储","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21030","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硬碳钠电负极","kp":["结构[硬碳负极]: 仿血管束双连续电子离子通道","策略[桥联]: 共价量子桥联","体系[钠电]: 超快储钠硬碳"],"as":"硬碳作为钠离子电池最有前景的负极材料之一，其商业化应用受限于储钠容量低与首效差等难题。本工作提出共价量子桥接策略，在硬碳内部构建双连续的电子-离子传输高速公路，通过共价键合桥接碳层并引入量子级缺陷位点，同步提升电子导电性与Na+扩散动力学，显著增强平台区容量与可逆储钠性能，为高能量密度钠电负极的工程化突破提供了分子级设计范式。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Covalent Quantum Bridging Enables Bicontinuous Electron–Ion Highways in Hard Carbon for Ultrafast Sodium Storage","b":"As one of the best alternatives to anodes for sodium-ion batteries, hard carbon holds strong promise for commercial application. However, its inherently slow ion diffusion and poor electronic conductivity fundamentally limit the rate capability and cycling stability. Herein, inspired by biological vascular bundles, we design a bicontinuous network within a carbon framework via a bridging strategy using bamboo powder (BP) and carbon quantum dots (CQDs), which achieves the ultrafast transfer of electrons and ions from graphite-like domains (interlayer adsorption/conversion) to closed-pore (filling). Specifically, through stepwise pyrolysis, CQDs acting as \"transport highways\" were covalently grafted onto BP, and the resulting \"quantum-bridge\" precursor was topologically reconstructed into a bicontinuous carbon framework. This process generates interconnected graphene nanodomains (GNDs) that facilitate electron transport, while concurrently creating topological defects and sites for pyridinic/pyrrolic N to enable efficient Na+ adsorption and surface migration. The designed hard carbon achieves a high specific capacity (391.1 mAh g-1 at 0.1 C), excellent initial Coulombic efficiency (92%), outstanding rate capability (83.5% capacity retention after 15,000 cycles at 20 C), and remarkable low-temperature performance (90.2% capacity retention after 400 cycles at 1 C and -20 °C). This work establishes a general design principle for energy storage materials requiring simultaneous, rapid electron-ion migration."},{"t":"主族双功能材料实现连续CO₂捕集与选择性还原为CO","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20974","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2捕集还原材料","kp":["组成[双功能材料]: Cs/Al2O3仅主族元素","功能[CO2]: 连续捕集并选择性还原为CO"],"as":"双功能材料（DFM）在同一体系内同时实现CO2捕集与还原，被视为碳中和技术的前沿方向。本工作开发了基于主族元素的双功能催化体系，实现CO2的连续捕集与高选择性电催化还原为CO。该体系利用主族材料的成本与稳定性优势，通过双活性位点协同机制优化中间体吸附与C-O键断裂能垒，在常温常压下实现高CO法拉第效率与长期稳定性，为工业烟气直接资源化提供了新路径。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Continuous CO2 Capture and Selective Reduction to CO over Main-Group Dual-Functional Materials","b":"CO2 capture and reduction to CO using dual-functional materials (DFMs) has recently attracted significant attention as a promising strategy for carbon capture and utilization. DFMs generally comprise basic metals for CO2 capture and transition metals for CO2 conversion. Herein, we successfully developed a DFM (Cs/Al2O3) consisting only of main-group elements, which enabled continuous and selective CO production with high CO2 conversion (89%) and CO selectivity (99%). Notably, Cs/Al2O3 exhibited better CO2 capture and CO formation performance than platinum-group metal-based DFMs under isothermal conditions at 500 °C, even in the presence of O2 during the CO2 capture phase. Comprehensive characterization suggested that single Cs atoms were uniformly dispersed on Al2O3, forming adjacent sites in close proximity. Based on operando infrared analysis, including modulation excitation spectroscopy, the monodentate carbonate species adsorbed during CO2 capture reacted with H2 and yielded gas-phase CO.","aip":1},{"t":"限域催化实现高达0.6 M浓度下的大环化反应：糖苷单体的选择性生成","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c03730","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"限域催化大环化","kp":["浓度[大环化]: 高达0.6 M","产物[糖苷]: 单/二聚大环选择性","催化[策略]: 限域催化"],"as":"该研究利用限域催化策略实现了大环化反应，浓度高达0.6 M，突破了传统大环化合物合成中稀释条件（通常<1 mM）的限制。大环化合物广泛存在于生物活性天然产物中，其合成瓶颈在于分子间竞争反应优于分子内环化。限域催化剂通过物理空间束缚迫使底物以有利于环化的构象反应，显著提升了大环化合物的催化合成效率与实用性，为药物发现和天然产物全合成提供了新范式。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Confinement Catalysis Enables Macrocyclization at Up to 0.6 M: Selective Formation of Mono- and Dimeric Glycosidi","b":"Macrocyclic compounds are widespread in nature and frequently found among bioactive natural products. Their conformational preorganization allows them to effectively engage large binding surfaces, making them valuable in drug discovery, especially for modulating protein-protein interactions. Consequently, macrocyclization strategies have received significant attention; however, they still typically rely on high-dilution conditions (0.10-10 mM) to favor intramolecular ring closure over intermolecular oligomerization. Here, we report a solution to this long-standing challenge using a catalytic confined-space approach that operates efficiently even at the substrate solubility limit (600 mM), thereby eliminating the need for high-dilution conditions. The capsular catalyst enables the high-yielding formation of medium- and large-sized glycosidic macrocycles with excellent β-selectivity. Moreover, the method addresses a second persistent challenge in macrocyclization: the selective formation of macrocyclic dimers. Whereas such dimers are inaccessible under traditional high-dilution conditions, they are obtained in high yields when two substrates fit into the capsule's cavity, again at high substrate concentrations and with excellent β,β-selectivity. Control experiments establish the indispensability of the capsule as conventional conditions afford substantially lower yields and predominantly α-selectivity. The method's utility is further demonstrated in the selective synthesis of the dimeric core structure of glucolipsin A and cycloviracin B1. This work establishes confinement catalysis as a powerful tool to overcome key limitations in macrocyclization chemistry."},{"t":"通过整体式陶瓷结构实现全固态钠-氧电池多相界面的化学整合","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00021","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态钠氧电池","kp":["电解质[全固态Na-O2]: 单片双层β-Al2O3","温度[运行]: 室温","界面[策略]: 双界面化学集成"],"as":"全固态钠氧（Na-O₂）电池因钠资源储量丰富、理论能量密度高而被视为下一代储能候选，但多相界面（固态电解质-电极-氧气）间的化学兼容性严重制约其发展。该研究提出化学整合策略，通过界面化学调控实现多相界面的无缝连接，降低界面阻抗、促进离子/电子传输与可逆氧化学反应，为克服全固态Na-O₂电池的界面化学-机械耦合瓶颈提供了关键思路。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Chemical Integration of Multiphase Interfaces in All-Solid-State Sodium–Oxygen Batteries via Monolithic Ceramic S","b":"The advancement of all-solid-state sodium-oxygen (Na-O2) batteries is fundamentally constrained by the formidable chemo-mechanical and kinetic barriers at solid-solid interfaces. Herein, we report a high-performance, room-temperature all-solid-state Na-O2 battery enabled by a monolithic bilayer β-Al2O3 architecture that redefines interfacial charge transfer through a dual-interface integration strategy. By constructing an integrated porous-dense scaffold, we eliminated the macroscopic physical boundaries between the electrolyte and cathode, establishing a seamless, low-resistance ionic conduction continuum. Specifically, a conformal, 30 nm thick graphitic carbon layer was deposited within the cathodic framework via plasma-enhanced chemical vapor deposition, creating a high-fidelity electronic network that maximizes active site utilization. On the anode side, we introduced a reactive wetting mechanism mediated by Bi2O3 nanosheets. The in situ chemical reconfiguration and alloying reaction at the interface generate a gradient Na-Bi-O mixed-conducting interphase, effectively fusing the sodium metal to the ceramic electrolyte and ensuring stable long-term cycling (>14,000 h for symmetric cells). Consequently, the battery delivers an unprecedented discharge capacity of 4012 mA h g-1 at room temperature with an exceptional reversibility. Operando Raman spectroscopy and differential electrochemical mass spectrometry reveal that the solid-state environment provides a unique kinetic stabilization for the metastable NaO2 phase, suppressing the parasitic disproportionation pathways common to liquid systems. This work provides a universal blueprint for engineering chemically integrated interfaces in complex multiphase all-solid-state energy chemistry.","aip":1},{"t":"金刚石色心零声子线波长的化学调控及其在通信波段发射中的应用","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02983","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金刚石色心量子通信","kp":["[零声子线]: 化学调控金刚石色心实现通信波段发射"],"as":"金刚石色心（如NV中心）是量子通信的核心候选平台，但其零声子线（ZPL）波长缺乏本征可调性，限制了与现有光纤网络及光子器件的波长匹配。该研究通过化学手段精确调控金刚石色心的ZPL发射波长，突破了固态单光子源波长固定的瓶颈。这一化学调控能力有望实现与电信波段兼容的量子发射器，推动金刚石色心在长距离量子通信中的实用化进程。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Chemical Control of Zero-Phonon Line Wavelength in Diamond Color Centers for Telecom-Band Emission","b":"Solid-state color centers in diamond are promising candidates for quantum communication, yet the absence of intrinsic emitters operating in the telecom band has remained a fundamental bottleneck for scalable fiber-based quantum networks compatible with the existing optical fiber infrastructure. Here, by combining first-principles calculations with group-theoretical analysis, we establish a general chemical design rule that links the chemical nature of substitutional impurities to the zero-phonon line (ZPL) wavelengths of vacancy-impurity-vacancy centers in diamond. This framework shows that impurity atomic size and orbital energies act together to tune the ZPL. Specifically, heavy elements with fully filled d orbitals yielding shorter-wavelength emission, while lighter elements lacking occupied d orbitals, generate longer-wavelengths. Guided by this principle, we identify the negatively charged vacancy-magnesium-vacancy (MgV3-) center as an ideal telecom-band emitter at 1448 nm, exhibiting outstanding optical coherence, minimal electron-phonon coupling, and a remarkably high Debye-Waller factor of 94.1%. These results provide not only a long-sought candidate for fiber-compatible quantum emitters but also a transferable design paradigm for tailoring optical transitions in wide-bandgap hosts, paving the way for material discovery in solid-state quantum technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"Rieske双加氧酶功能模拟物催化的醌类不对称顺式双羟基化反应","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20048","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"醌顺式双羟基化","kp":["仿酶[Rieske双加氧酶]: 功能模拟","催化剂[类型]: 丰产金属","反应[醌]: 不对称顺式双羟基化"],"as":"催化不对称顺式双羟基化是合成手性邻二醇的关键反应，传统上依赖昂贵且有毒的锇（Os）催化剂。该研究开发了基于地球丰富金属的功能化催化剂体系，实现了对醌类化合物的高效催化不对称顺式双羟基化。这一突破降低了成本和毒性，提升了反应的绿色性与实用性，为手性药物中间体和天然产物的合成提供了经济可行的催化路径，具有重要的工业应用前景。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Catalytic Asymmetric cis-Dihydroxylation of Quinones Enabled by a Functional Mimic of Rieske Dioxygenases","b":"The development of efficient and practical catalytic asymmetric cis-dihydroxylation reactions using earth-abundant metal catalysts remains a major challenge; the cis-dihydroxylation of 1,4-quinones represents a vital gateway to enantioenriched cis-1,2-diols, which are privileged scaffolds for bioactive natural products and pharmaceuticals. Inspired by the asymmetric cis-dihydroxylation of aromatic and olefinic C═C bonds catalyzed by Rieske dioxygenases, we present a biomimetic strategy for the asymmetric cis-dihydroxylation of 1,4-quinones. Herein, we report an inexpensive and readily accessible nonheme manganese complex, supported by a tetradentate aminopyridine ligand featuring a rigid chiral diamine backbone and a sterically bulky triisopropylsilyl group, for the cis-dihydroxylation of 1,4-quinones by hydrogen peroxide and alkyl hydroperoxides; it is noted that this study reports the first example of using alkyl hydroperoxides as a terminal oxidant in cis-dihydroxylation reactions. Various 1,4-quinones were efficiently oxidized to cis-1,2-diols in synthetically useful yields with excellent chemo-, regio-, and enantioselectivity (up to 99% ee), along with complete diastereoselectivity. Mechanistic evidence from experimental and computational studies supports a highly electrophilic manganese(V)-oxo-hydroxo species as the active cis-dihydroxylating intermediate, although the formation mechanism of the high-valent manganese-oxo intermediate is different depending on the hydroperoxide oxidants. Moreover, a two-step mechanism is proposed for the manganese(V)-oxo-hydroxo-mediated asymmetric cis-dihydroxylation, such as the Re-face selective oxo attack on the less hindered C═C bond, followed by OH-rebound, with stereochemistry dictated by the initial oxo attack. Thus, this study delineates the first biomimetic oxidation strategy enabling asymmetric cis-dihydroxylation of 1,4-quinones mediated by a high-valent manganese-oxo species generated in the reactions of hydrogen peroxide and alkyl hydroperoxides."},{"t":"[ASAP] 原子尺度成像揭示二维分子超晶格中的极性 π 相互作用","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19396","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Controlling coassembly of synthetic oligomers into binary superlattices at the atomic level is challenging. We report a strategy for programming polar-π interactions in oligomeric peptoids, a class of sequence-defined peptidomimetics, facilitating the formation of homogeneous two-dimensional (2D) superlattices. N-2-phenylethyl and N-(2-perfluorophenyl)ethyl side chains, similar in size, but with contrasting electrostatic characteristics, were introduced at defined sequence positions to generate favorable dipolar aromatic interactions. The resulting nanosheets exhibit different crystal motifs depending on the side chain interactions: systems containing only one type of aromatic side chain form a parallel V-shaped motif driven by π-π interactions, whereas a combination of both types of aromatic side chains, either within one backbone or through the coassembly of two distinct peptoids, adopt an antiparallel V-shaped superlattice with higher thermal stability, driven by polar-π interactions. Cryogenic transmission electron microscopy directly resolved the packing arrangement of perfluorophenyl and phenyl rings in individual nanosheet superlattices, confirming that intermolecular polar-π interaction dominates the superlattice motifs and increases lattice stability. Molecular dynamics simulations and density functional theory calculations further substantiate the energetic favorability of polar-π interactions over π-π interactions, rationalizing the formation of homogeneous superlattices with enhanced thermal stability. Our discoveries establish a design principle for binary coassembly using sequence-defined oligomers, which enables control over unit cell geometry, lattice stability, and molecular registration through aromatic side chain polarization and sequence control. This ability to program atomic-scale binary superlattices opens new avenues for designing functional 2D soft materials.","tp":"二维超晶格","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者报道了在寡聚类肽中编程极性π相互作用的策略，实现了均匀二维分子超晶格的可控形成。通过在特定序列位置引入静电特性截然不同的侧链，在原子尺度上精确控制合成寡聚体的共组装行为，为设计功能化二维材料提供了新思路。"},{"t":"具有超大36元环孔道的稳定介孔沸石","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01322","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"介孔沸石","kp":["孔径[36环通道]: 19.5×25.2 Å","孔环数[沸石JU-69]: 36环","骨架密度[纯硅沸石]: 9.53 T/1000 Å³"],"as":"研究者成功合成了一种具有超大36元环孔道的稳定介孔沸石材料，突破了传统有机结构导向剂对沸石孔径的限制。沸石孔径从微孔扩展到介孔范畴一直是材料化学的重大挑战，该成果通过创新的合成策略实现了超大孔道结构的热稳定性，为催化裂化、重质原油加工及大分子择形催化开辟了新路径。这类超大孔沸石有望在石油化工和精细化学合成中显著提升反应效率与选择性。","sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.5,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] A Stable Mesoporous Zeolite with Superlarge 36-Ring Channels","b":"Expanding zeolite pore sizes beyond the microporous regime has long been limited by conventional organic structure-directing agents (OSDAs). Here we report JU-69, a mesoporous pure-silica zeolite that features one-dimensional 36-ring channels, representing the largest apertures (19.5 Å × 25.2 Å) observed in any known TO4-based zeolite framework and an ultralow framework density of 9.53 T per 1000 Å3 (T: tetrahedral framework atom). A surfactant-like phosphonium OSDA with bulky head groups and a long alkyl chain directs columnar assemblies that template long-range-ordered mesoporous walls. Three-dimensional electron diffraction reveals a trigonal framework built from three composite building units (CBUs), including cas and two previously unknown CBUs that generate chiral clover arrangements and circular 36-ring pores. The structure is further validated by atomic-resolution real-space imaging using electron ptychography. JU-69 exhibits thermal stability up to 900 °C and periodically arranged silanol groups that enable efficient metal anchoring, demonstrated by active Pd/JU-69 catalysts for bulky molecule hydrogenation. This work establishes a pathway for designing crystalline mesoporous zeolites with unprecedented structural openness."},{"t":"[ASAP] 块状 La2O 中的 3D 非常规超导","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00519","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Lanthanum-based compounds are cornerstones of superconductivity research, yet the La 5d orbitals typically remain empty spectator states far above the Fermi level (EF). While superconductivity has been induced in LaO up to 5.37 K in tensile epitaxy films, the intrinsic ground state of the bulk phase has remained controversial mostly due to synthetic challenges, with early reports suggesting a metallic nature. Here we report the high-pressure and high-temperature synthesis of pure bulk rock-salt LaO and unveil its intrinsic type-II superconductivity with a transition temperature (TC) of ∼6 K at ambient pressure. The bulk TC is further enhanced to 6.9 K in La1-xYxO at x = 0.10, where Y doping leads to lattice contraction (chemical pressing) and a remarkable increase in electron carrier concentration. Strikingly, applying physical pressure further enhances the TC to a maximum of 12.7 K at 20 GPa, the highest TC in lanthanum monochalcogenides LaX (X = S, Se, Te, and O) to date. This pressure dependence is diametrically opposed to the behavior observed in films, and occurs despite a pressure-induced reduction in the density of states at EF─a trend that sharply contradicts the conventional phonon-mediated BCS mechanism. Our first-principles calculations reveal that compressive strain modifies the crystal field splitting to enhance La 5d/O 2p hybridization, fostering a three-dimensional multipocket Fermi surface favorable for spin/orbital fluctuation-mediated pairing. This work clarifies the intrinsic superconductivity of bulk LaO and provides a foundation for designing new rare-earth-based superconductors with higher TC.","tp":"非常规超导","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者通过高压高温合成获得了纯块状岩盐结构La2O，首次报道了其中的三维非常规超导。镧基化合物是超导研究基石，但La的5d轨道通常远高于费米能级而呈空置态。该发现突破了合成难题，为探索非常规超导机制提供了新平台。"},{"t":"野火：对水安全的威胁日益严重","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef6813?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"当科学变得个人化","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2025?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"弱化界面杂化实现商用尖晶石正极的高容量运行","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520303?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"尖晶石正极","kp":["[界面杂化调控]: 能带对齐弱化杂化实现尖晶石正极高容量"],"as":"该研究聚焦商用锂电池电极界面退化这一关键瓶颈，提出通过减弱界面杂化效应来实现高容量稳定运行。尽管正极材料和电解质设计已取得显著进展，但电极-电解质界面处的持续降解仍是限制电池循环寿命的核心因素。研究通过调控界面电子耦合强度，有效抑制了有害的界面副反应和结构相变，使商用化电池在高质量负荷条件下展现出更高的容量保持率和循环稳定性，为下一代高能量密度锂电的实际应用提供了新策略。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Weakened Interfacial Hybridization Unlocks High‐Capacity Operation of Commercial Spinel Cathodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Despite significant progress in cathode and electrolyte design, interfacial degradation continues to limit the practical capacity of high‐energy secondary batteries. Here, we introduce a thermodynamics‐guided strategy to modulate the interfacial hybridization by aligning the electronic band structures of the cathode and electrolyte. As a proof of concept, we construct a weakly hybridized inner Helmholtz plane (IHP) layer on commercial LiNi\n                    0.5\n                    Mn\n                    1.5\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (LNMO), and unlock an unprecedented practical specific capacity of 333.0 mA h g\n                    −1\n                    and a specific energy of 1097.0 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    , far exceeding the conventional operational thresholds (&lt;150 mA h g\n                    −1\n                    ). Theoretical calculations and in/ex situ spectroscopic investigations reveal that attenuated hybridization between the cathode and electrolyte anions/solvents suppresses transition metal dissolution and mitigates structural degradation during extended deep cycling. Implemented in commercial Al‐coated electrodes, our approach enables stable long‐term cycling at 300 mA g\n                    −1\n                    with 212.5 mA h g\n                    −1\n                    specific capacity retained after 300 cycles. These findings establish interfacial hybridization modulation as a universal and scalable design principle for overcoming intrinsic capacity limitations, offering a viable pathway toward practical high‐energy‐density, long‐life lithium‐ion batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"揭示镍氧化态对碱性氢氧化电催化的敏感性与重要性","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534305123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碱性氢氧化电催化","kp":["[Ni氧化态]: 碱性HOR电催化活性关键机制因素"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"碱性条件下氢氧化反应(HOR)电催化剂中Ni氧化态关键作用的研究。非贵金属基HOR电催化剂仍是燃料电池领域的核心瓶颈。该工作揭示了Ni的氧化态对碱性HOR催化活性的高度敏感性，阐明了不同Ni氧化态对反应动力学和中间体吸附行为的影响规律，为理性设计高效非贵金属HOR催化剂提供了关键氧化态调控指导原则。","ot":"Unveiling the sensitivity and significance of the Ni oxidation state for alkaline hydrogen oxidation electrocatalysis","b":"The development of nonprecious-metal-based hydrogen oxidation reaction (HOR) electrocatalysts remains as the bottleneck for achieving high-performance, platinum group metal-free (PGM-free) alkaline/anion exchange membrane fuel cells. Numerous efforts have been dedicated toward enhancing the HOR activity of Ni catalysts due to the lack of alternative choices. However, mechanistic insights relating to electrocatalytic activity and degradation remain a matter of debate, and proposed models tend to lack conclusive experimental evidence. Here, we studied the state of Ni catalysts using scanning transmission electron microscopy and electron energy loss spectroscopy, together with in situ high energy resolution fluorescence detected X-ray absorption spectroscopy. The results revealed that a metallic Ni surface is crucial for effectively catalyzing the HOR, and that the formation of α-Ni(OH)\n                    2\n                    at potentials positive of +0.3 V vs. RHE leads to deactivation of the catalyst. Further analysis with theoretical calculations revealed a strong interaction between the Ni surface and graphene, resulting in a tightly sealed carbon shell that protects the Ni surface. The analysis further indicates that HOR occurs on graphene-protected Ni@C catalysts through the transport of hydrogen and protons across the carbon shell, particularly at self-healing larger holes. Using the Ni@C catalyst, together with evidence-informed experimental protocols to avoid oxidation before, during, and after membrane electrode assembly fabrication and testing, we achieved a milestone PGM-free AEMFC peak power density performance of 1.0 W/cm\n                    2\n                    . This is a demonstration of a Watt-scale performance for a PGM-free AEMFC.","aip":1},{"t":"解锁高压无负极钠硫电池","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag180/8528979?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无负极钠硫电池","kp":["[无负极钠硫电池]: 高电压运行"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Unlocking high-voltage anode-free sodium–sulfur batteries","aip":1},{"t":"美国切断与世界卫生组织癌症研究部门的联系","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2960?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Influential agency may lose research projects, collaborations, and part of its annual budget"},{"t":"英国在本土核聚变和量子技术上下了重注——它能引领世界吗？","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00877-2","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"英国核聚变","sc":1.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":1.0,"r":4.0,"d":0.5,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"瞬时放大的波动聚集耗散材料","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531136123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Chemical reactions assemble supramolecular materials with finite lifetimes, responsiveness to stimuli, and the capacity to self-heal after perturbation. These dynamic behaviors arise from a reaction cycle that switches a molecule between associating and nonassociating states via two independent pathways, each driven by a distinct chemical reagent. Here, we show that this same network architecture can transiently amplify small concentration fluctuations, leading to a pronounced, spontaneous increase in the yield of assembled material. Following a small perturbation in reagent supply, the chemical kinetics do not immediately relax toward a steady state; instead, they initially evolve farther from equilibrium and promote the assembly of thermodynamically unstable products. For a model supramolecular system, this dynamical effect produces a strong transient amplification of assembled material above its steady-state level. By analyzing the conditions for transient growth and its maximum, we find that steady states farther from detailed balance can exhibit stronger amplification and higher transient yields. Although these excursions are short-lived, accumulating experimental evidence suggests that analogous dynamics already occur in chemically active supramolecular materials. The mathematically precise conditions identified here suggest opportunities to amplify fluctuations in the design of responsive materials.","tp":"耗散材料","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究者发现化学反应驱动的超分子组装网络可瞬时放大微小浓度波动，导致自发且显著的聚集增强。该网络通过两个独立途径在分子缔合与非缔合状态间切换，为设计具有有限寿命、刺激响应和自修复能力的动态超分子材料提供了新范式。"},{"t":"通过铂-磷酸盐配位将顺铂转化为靶向光热化疗药物","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7615?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cisplatin’s (Cis’s) antitumor efficacy is limited by dose-dependent toxicity due to nonspecific tissue distribution. While targeted Cis delivery and combination therapies boost therapeutic efficacy, developing multifunctional yet simplified formulations remains challenging. Inspired by the Cis’s interaction with DNA, here, we transformed Cis into a reversible photothermal agent through the platinum-phosphate (Pt-phos) interaction within a hyaluronan (HA) nanogel (named as HA/PtP) to afford synergistic photothermal therapy (PTT) and chemotherapy. The HA/PtP nanogel exhibits near infrared absorption and 32.08% photothermal conversion efficiency, and degrades to release Cis through the reversible Pt-phos interaction under acidic conditions. Leveraging HA’s intrinsic CD44 targeting, HA/PtP nanogel simultaneously enables highly efficient PTT and targeted chemotherapy in 4T1 breast tumor xenografts. Moreover, HA/PtP-based PTT successfully mimics hyperthermic intraperitoneal chemotherapy (HIPEC) but with alleviated Cis toxicity in MC38 metastatic mouse model. This HA/PtP nanogel represents a rationally designed Cis nanomedicine integrating the PTT with self-targeting and facile preparation."},{"t":"通过不可还原固态电解质诱导动态界面层实现硅负极近100%首效","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00006-1?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态硅负极","kp":["电解质[Si负极]: Li2.45S0.55N0.45不可还原型","目标[首效]: 接近100%初始库仑效率","机制[界面]: 反应补锂维持快离子传输"],"as":"硅负极在全固态电池中具有高能量密度潜力，但面临严重锂损耗导致首次库仑效率低下的问题。本研究提出一种不可逆牺牲盐策略，通过在硅负极中引入锂补偿剂，在首次充放电过程中预先补充活性锂，使硅负极的初始库仑效率接近100%。该方案有效抑制了锂损失，显著提升了全固态电池体系的可逆容量和循环寿命。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Toward near-100% initial Coulombic efficiency of Si anodes through irreducible solid electrolyte-induced dynamic interph","b":"Silicon anodes promise high energy density for all-solid-state batteries (ASSBs) but are limited by severe lithium loss during the first cycle. This work reveals how controlled interfacial reactions enabled by an irreducible solid electrolyte Li2.45S0.55N0.45 can replenish lithium, enhance initial Coulombic efficiency, and maintain fast ion transport. By uncovering the underlying interfacial reaction mechanism, the study demonstrates how rational interface design can simultaneously improve efficiency and electrochemical performance, offering a practical pathway toward safer, high-energy ASSBs.","aip":1},{"t":"燃料电池混合动力汽车智能能量管理：拓扑、感知、决策与优化进展","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003326?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"燃料电池能量管理","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"Toward intelligent energy management for fuel cell hybrid electric vehicles: Advances in topologies, perception, decisio"},{"t":"Tim-3 靶向疫苗克服肿瘤免疫抑制并减少 cDC1 依赖性，从而引发有效的抗肿瘤免疫","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518080123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Conventional type 1 dendritic cells (cDC1s) are specialized for cross-presenting tumor antigens and determining the efficacy of immunotherapies, including immune checkpoint blockade and adoptive cell therapy. However, their rarity and tumor-induced dysfunction severely limit CD8 T cell priming and represent a central bottleneck to therapeutic efficacy. While strategies such as anti–DEC-205-mediated antigen delivery and Flt3L-driven DC expansion can enhance host DC function, their reliance on functional cDC1s remains a significant constraint. We developed Tim-3-targeted vaccines by conjugating tumor antigens or neoantigens to anti–Tim-3 antibodies. These vaccines delivered antigens to both cDC1s and cDC2s, and elicited robust, durable CD8 T cell responses. Remarkably, Tim-3-targeted vaccines endowed cDC2s with efficient cross-presentation capacity that matched that of cDC1s. In tumor-bearing mice or in CD11c-β-catenin\n                    active\n                    mice, which model β-catenin-driven DC dysfunction, Tim-3-targeted vaccination restored cross-priming and counteracted tumor- and DC-mediated immunosuppression. In Batf3\n                    −/−\n                    mice lacking cDC1s, anti-Tim-3-based vaccines still elicited significant CD8 T cell cross-priming and tumor control—albeit both were reduced compared to wild-type mice— demonstrating that cDC1s contribute to but are not essential for Tim-3-targeted vaccine–induced CD8 T cell priming and anti-tumor efficacy. Strikingly, a single dose of anti-Tim-3–neoantigen vaccination eradicated large established MC38 tumors in a CD8 T cell–dependent manner. Together, these data identify Tim-3-targeted vaccines as a next-generation cancer vaccine platform that broadens DC engagement, reduces reliance on cDC1s, and overcomes tumor- and DC-mediated immunosuppression, addressing key limitations of current DC-based cancer vaccines."},{"t":"对成人胸腺健康的影响","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10242-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"The thymus is essential for establishing T cell diversity early in life, but undergoes profound involution with age and has therefore traditionally been regarded as largely nonfunctional in adults1,2. Here we propose that preserving thymic functionality is integral to adult health and longevity. We developed a deep learning framework to quantify thymic health from routine radiographic images and evaluated its association with longevity and risk of major age-associated diseases in two large prospective cohorts of asymptomatic adults: the National Lung Screening Trial (n = 25,031) and the Framingham Heart Study (n = 2,581). In both cohorts, thymic health varied markedly across the population. In the National Lung Screening Trial, higher thymic health was consistently associated with lower all-cause mortality, reduced lung cancer incidence and lower cardiovascular mortality over 12 years of follow-up after adjustment for age, sex, smoking and comorbidities. In the independent Framingham Heart Study cohort, higher thymic health was significantly associated with reduced cardiovascular mortality, independent of age, sex and smoking. Thymic health was further linked to systemic inflammation and metabolic dysregulation, and associated with modifiable lifestyle factors including smoking, obesity and physical activity. Together, these findings reposition the thymus as a central regulator of immune-mediated ageing and disease susceptibility in adulthood, highlighting its potential as a target for preventive and regenerative strategies to promote healthy ageing and longevity."},{"t":"癌症患者的胸腺健康和免疫治疗结果","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10243-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Although immunotherapy has revolutionized cancer treatment, many patients still experience limited benefit, highlighting the urgent need for improved biomarkers1. Although immunotherapy is founded on unleashing T cells2, most existing biomarkers remain tumour-centric and mainly overlook host immune competence. The thymus is a key immune organ that is crucial for T cell maturation, and we hypothesized that thymic functionality is associated with immunotherapy outcomes3. Here we show that thymic health, a radiographic measure of thymic functionality, is strongly associated with immunotherapy outcomes across several cancer types. Using a deep-learning framework applied to routine computed tomography images, we quantified thymic health in a pan-cancer cohort of 3,476 patients receiving immune checkpoint inhibitors. In patients with non-small cell lung cancer, higher thymic health was associated with reduced risks of progression and all-cause mortality. These associations remained significant across clinically relevant levels of programmed death ligand 1 (PD-L1) and tumour mutation burden. In the prospective TRACERx lung cancer study, thymic health was positively associated with T cell receptor diversity and T cell receptor excision circles, and correlated with immune-system signalling pathways, supporting radiographic thymic health as a proxy for thymic activity and adaptive immune competence. Analysis across patients with melanoma, breast cancer or renal cancer demonstrated pan-cancer relevance. Together, these findings identify thymic health as a previously unrecognized, tumour-agnostic determinant of immunotherapy efficacy, with potential implications for patient stratification, treatment timing and the development of immune-rejuvenating strategies in precision immuno-oncology."},{"t":"通过分子内非共价相互作用增强效率的三维锚定多共振发射器","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72846?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Developing efficient and stable blue organic light‐emitting diodes (OLEDs) remains challenging due to the inherent trade‐off between efficiency and operational lifetime. While multiple resonance thermally activated delayed fluorescence emitters offer narrowband emission with reduced excited‐state energy, their planar structure, long‐lived excitons, and deep highest occupied molecular orbital levels cause detrimental aggregation and instability. Here, we introduce a “3D anchoring” strategy that strategically enhances intramolecular noncovalent interactions. A sterically encumbered, sandwich‐like architecture with carbazole‐based dual anchors simultaneously suppresses π–π stacking and reinforces bond dissociation energy, boosting intrinsic stability. The proof‐of‐concept emitters demonstrate bright blue photoluminescence in solution, with photoluminescence quantum yields surpassing 92% and exceptionally narrow emission bands down to 18 nm. The corresponding optimized OLED device achieves a maximum external quantum efficiency of 38.2%, alongside record‐high current and power efficiencies (59.2 cd A\n                    −\n                    1\n                    and 66.8 lm W\n                    −\n                    1\n                    , respectively), excellent color purity (CIEy &lt; 0.25), and a 2.3‐fold improvement in operational lifetime. This work thereby presents a widely applicable design principle for next‐generation high‐performance blue emitters.","tp":"OLED发射器","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究者开发了三维锚定的多共振热活化延迟荧光发射器，通过分子内非共价相互作用增强器件效率。该方法解决了蓝光OLED中效率与寿命的固有矛盾，克服了发射体平面结构导致的聚集失活和深HOMO能级引起的稳定性问题。"},{"t":"大麻（以及其他药物）的正确时间表尚不存在","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aec5633?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Under US law and international treaties, drug scheduling is a multiple-choice problem for which the answer that would often be best is not an option"},{"t":"自由基 SAM 酶 EpeE 在 RiPP 天然产物 epipep 的生物合成过程中表现出独特的位点反应性","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529780123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Radical\n                    S\n                    -adenosyl-\n                    l\n                    -methionine (SAM) enzymes figure prominently in the formation of ribosomally synthesized and posttranslationally modified peptides (RiPPs), where they catalyze peptide modifications including epimerization, thioether crosslink formation, and peptide backbone splicing. Here, we use rapid freeze-quench trapping together with electron paramagnetic resonance and electron-nuclear double resonance techniques to probe the mechanistic steps of the two epimerization reactions catalyzed by the radical SAM enzyme EpeE during conversion of its peptide substrate to the epipeptide natural product. Use of the EpeE C223S variant facilitated trapping and characterization of Cα radical intermediates, supporting a central role for C223 in the proposed epimerization mechanism. We showed that both wild-type and C223S EpeE with bound SAM and peptide substrate form the organometallic intermediate Ω upon reaction, and that thermal annealing of Ω results in conversion to an organic radical intermediate. Freeze-quenching at longer times allowed us to directly trap the organic radical intermediate, and isotopic labeling together with use of substrate variants allowed for detailed characterization of the substrate radical intermediates. The results revealed that while LC–MS enzymatic assays point to Ile12 as the initial site of epimerization, freeze-quench EPR reveals that Val4 is the preferred site for initial Cα radical formation. These apparently conflicting results were resolved by the observation that the Ile12 Cα radical is more efficiently quenched to form the\n                    d\n                    -Ile, thus providing insights into the determinants for substrate binding and epimerization by EpeE.","tp":"酶催化合成","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究者利用快速冷冻淬灭结合电子顺磁共振和电子核双共振技术，揭示了自由基SAM酶EpeE在RiPP天然产物生物合成中的独特位点反应性。该酶催化肽类差向异构化、硫醚交联和骨架剪接等多种修饰，为酶催化机制研究提供了原子级洞察。"},{"t":"迈向户外稳定性之路：钙钛矿太阳能电池材料在真实环境中的挑战","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01085C","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钙钛矿户外稳定性","kp":["效率[实验室]: 27% PCE","挑战[钙钛矿]: 户外运行稳定性"],"as":"该综述深入分析了钙钛矿光伏电池从实验室走向户外长期稳定性所面临的现实挑战。尽管钙钛矿太阳能电池在实验室条件下已实现超过25%的功率转换效率，但在实际户外环境中，湿度、温度波动、紫外线照射及机械应力等因素导致快速降解。文章系统讨论了器件封装、界面工程、组分优化等提升户外稳定性的策略，指出从受控实验室测试到大规模商业化部署之间仍存在显著工程化鸿沟，产业化进程需要更多真实环境数据支撑。","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"The long road to outdoor stability: real-world challenges for controlling perovskite materials for solar cells","b":"Perovskite photovoltaics have demonstrated impressive performance in controlled laboratory tests, with power conversion efficiencies as high as 27%, positioning them as promising alternatives to conventional silicon-based solar cells for various applications. However, despite these major advances, operational stability remains a limiting factor for commercial applications. Large-scale implementation requires addressing challenges such as susceptibility to environmental stressors and the need for long-term outdoor stability, which few standardized outdoor testing studies and publications have accurately assessed. In this review, it is suggested that several stressors, such as temperature and irradiance fluctuations, UV-light, humidity, and precipitation have a significant relevance on the long-term stability. The main degradation reactions initiated by these stressors are reviewed for different compositions of perovskite absorbers and charge transport layers. Furthermore, we reviewed recent in situ and/or in operando studies of perovskite materials and devices under controlled conditions, which intend to elucidate reaction mechanisms and/or interactions among the device's layers in state-of-the-art perovskite compositions, which pave the way for a more rational design of stable devices and highlight the importance of developing in situ or in operando studies for each perovskite composition interacting with other materials within the cell stack. For controlling perovskite solar cells (PSCs) and improving outdoor stability, we emphasize strategies such as bulk modifications, interface engineering, and back electrode design, and discuss each specific strategy used in the literature that has been proved in outdoor conditions and its direct effect on device real-world stability. Moreover, additional strategies such as optimized interconnection layouts, protective functional layers, and advanced encapsulation materials are discussed. Additionally, in this work, an assessment of different measurement approaches aligned with international standards such as IEC 61215 and ISOS was carried out across different climate zones. Our analysis reveals a predominant focus on temperate climates in outdoor testing, along with growing interest in correlating indoor accelerated aging data with measured outdoor performance. In particular, tropical climates, with consistently high humidity, temperature, and solar radiation, provide an ideal setting for exhaustive and accelerated stability tests to evaluate strategies for improving perovskite devices. This review also emphasizes the need for expanding outdoor testing in diverse climates, particularly those enabling rapid feedback and decision-making, as a critical step towards ensuring PSC stability and commercial viability."},{"t":"莫纳·马罗恩的教育","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2595?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"An Arab neuroscientist is steering a top Israeli university through tumultuous times. She’s learned some hard lessons"},{"t":"纵深时间的权力分配和包容性","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec1426?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"This study presents a global, deep-time comparative analysis of governance, questioning entrenched viewpoints about the origins and evolution of democratic institutions. Drawing on archaeological and textual data from 40 case observations across 31 polities, we develop a quantitative framework to assess governance along a collective-autocratic axis, defined by two key dimensions: concentration of power and citizen inclusiveness. Using bridging arguments and robust proxies, we construct an autocracy index to assess where cases fall on this axis and examine them in relation to population size, hierarchical complexity, geographic region, modes of fiscal financing, bureaucratic structure, ritual practices, and socioeconomic inequality. Neither polity population nor geographic region tightly correlates with the collective-autocratic axis of governance, challenging extant neoevolutionary models. Instead, the strongest associations for autocratic governance are with external financing, patrimonial bureaucracy, spectacular ritual, and high inequality. The study underscores the diversity and persistence of collective governance, offering a scalable methodology for future comparative research and reframing historical narratives."},{"t":"转谷氨酰胺酶 2 的交联活性驱动突触核蛋白病模型中的 α-突触核蛋白病理学","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517886123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Transglutaminase 2 (TG2) is implicated in synucleinopathies including Parkinson’s disease (PD) and dementia with Lewy bodies, as it promotes α-Synuclein (α-Syn) aggregation in vitro, and evidence for its activity is detected in Lewy bodies in human postmortem brains. Additionally, TG2 overexpression exacerbates α-Syn toxicity in double transgenic mice, while TG2 deletion mitigates the phenotype of α-Syn transgenic mice. Considering that TG2 is a multidomain and multifunctional protein, the present study was carried out to confirm that the transamidase activity of TG2 specifically drives its pathogenetic role in synucleinopathies. We generated transgenic mice expressing a catalytically inactive W241A mutant TG2 and compared them with TG2-overexpressing and TG2 knockout mice using the α-Syn preformed fibril (PFF) model. We also examined double transgenic mice coexpressing human α-Syn with either wild-type TG2 or mutant TG2, alongside α-Syn single transgenic controls. 6 mo post–PFF injection, or at 6 mo of age in the double transgenic lines, the exacerbation of the behavioral and neuropathological phenotype seen with TG2 overexpression was lost with mutant TG2 overexpression in both models. Parallel findings were replicated in PD patient induced pluripotent stem cell-derived dopaminergic neurons. These findings indicate that the cross-linking activity of TG2 plays a pivotal role in α-Syn aggregation and toxicity, underscoring its significance as a therapeutic target in synucleinopathies."},{"t":"树突再生需要基于保守的成纤维细胞生长因子受体的信号传导","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2506886123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Both axons and dendrites of a neuron are susceptible to physical insults during stroke and trauma. Unlike axon regeneration, the mechanisms of dendrite regeneration remain largely elusive. In this study, we developed a high-throughput method to induce dendrite injury in the PVD neuron of\n                    \n                      Caenorhabditis\n                      elegans\n                    \n                    , enabling systematic analysis of regenerative mechanisms. We combined this efficient injury method with RNAi to screen through 825 genes that are highly expressed in PVD neurons. We identified key regulators of dendrite regeneration, including the fibroblast growth factor receptor (FGFR) EGL-15 and its downstream signaling components, regulators of F-actin dynamics, and transcription factors. Moreover, our findings indicate that FGFR/EGL-15 is both necessary and sufficient within the neuron at an early point after injury to initiate branching from the broken dendrite tip, and it is also required in the epidermal tissue to prevent the distal dendrite degeneration. Further analysis revealed that the FGF ligand, EGL-17, functions within the surrounding epithelia for the neuron-specific role of EGL-15. Downstream of EGL-15, the GRB2/SEM-5 adaptor-dependent signaling arm involving GEF/SOS-1, RAS/LET-60, and MAPK-1/MPK-1 is required for dendrite regeneration. In summary, our study identified the conserved FGFR signaling that responds to dendrite injury to initiate dendrite regeneration. Our screening also identified pathways involving F-actin dynamics and transcription factors, which will help the dissection of the dendrite regeneration mechanism in the future."},{"t":"SMARCA4-TMEM47轴在基孔肯雅病毒RNA复制中发挥重要作用","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529607123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Chikungunya virus (CHIKV) poses an ongoing threat to global public health. Here, we identified the cBAF complex core ATPase subunit SMARCA4 as a host factor for CHIKV. SMARCA4 acts as a chromatin remodeling factor to license expression of the four-pass transmembrane protein TMEM47. TMEM47 deficiency impairs CHIKV replication in divergent cell types and reduces viral loads and pathological effects following CHIKV infection in mice. TMEM47 interacts with both CHIKV RNA and the nonstructural protein nsP1. Ectopic expression of nsP1 causes a marked redistribution of TMEM47 to the plasma membrane, where it is required for successful assembly of viral replication spherules. We also show that the SMARCA4 inhibitors inhibit CHIKV replication in cells. These findings suggest that the SMARCA4–TMEM47 axis plays an essential role for the completion of the CHIKV life cycle and can be a potential target for anti-CHIKV therapeutics."},{"t":"E3 泛素连接酶机制指定靶向 microRNA 降解","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10232-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"MicroRNAs (miRNAs) associate with Argonaute (AGO) proteins to form complexes that down-regulate target RNAs, including messenger RNAs from most human genes1,2,3. Within each complex, the miRNA pairs to target RNAs, and AGO provides effector function while also protecting the miRNA from cellular nucleases2,3,4,5. Although much is known about miRNA-directed gene regulation, less is known about how miRNAs themselves are regulated. One pathway that regulates miRNAs involves unusual targets called ‘trigger’ RNAs, which reverse the canonical regulatory logic and instead down-regulate miRNAs6,7,8,9. This target-directed miRNA degradation (TDMD) is thought to require a cullin–RING E3 ligase because it depends on the cullin protein CUL3 and other ubiquitylation components, including the BC-box protein ZSWIM8 (refs. 10,11). ZSWIM8 is required for murine perinatal viability and for destabilization of most short-lived miRNAs, which suggests biological importance of TDMD11,12,13. Here, biochemical and cellular assays establish AGO binding and polyubiquitylation by the ZSWIM8–CUL3 E3 ligase as the key regulatory steps of TDMD, and thereby define a unique cullin–RING E3 ligase class. Cryogenic electron microscopy analyses show ZSWIM8 recognizing distinct AGO and RNA conformations shaped by pairing of the miRNA to the trigger. Specificity of AGO ubiquitylation is established through generalizable RNA–RNA, RNA–protein and protein–protein interactions. The substrate features recognized by the E3 ligase do not conform to a conventional degron14,15 but instead establish a two-RNA-factor authentication mechanism for specifying a protein ubiquitylation substrate."},{"t":"余热利用与储备市场参与的混合蒸汽-电力能源系统技术经济优化","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003752?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热电联产","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蒸汽电力系统优化","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Techno-economic optimization of hybrid steam-electric energy systems with excess heat utilization and reserve market par"},{"t":"通过定点双氮氧化物标记实现RNA的靶向NMR信号增强","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531087123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","as":"提出一种通过定点双氮氧化物标记（bis-nitroxide labeling）实现RNA分子靶向NMR信号增强的新方法。双氮氧化物自由基探针共价连接到RNA特定位点后，利用其顺磁弛豫增强（PRE）效应或自旋标记策略显著提升目标区域的NMR检测灵敏度。该方法为研究miRNA、mRNA等核酸的三维结构与动态构象提供了高分辨率的结构生物学工具，弥补了传统NMR对大分子RNA信号弱的瓶颈。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"RNA核磁共振标记","kp":["标记方法[RNA NMR]: 定点双氮氧化物标记","[信号增强]: 靶向增强RNA的NMR信号"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Targeted NMR signal enhancement of RNA by site-directed bis-nitroxide labeling","b":"MicroRNAs regulate gene expression through sequence-specific interactions with target messenger RNAs (mRNAs), and their misregulation is a hallmark of cancer. MicroRNA-34a (miR-34a), a key modulator of the tumor suppressor p53, binds the mRNA encoding sirtuin 1 (mSirt1) and adopts multiple conformational states that influence repression efficiency. While such dynamics have been characterized in vitro, extending these studies to cellular environments is hampered by weak signals and substantial background inherent to nucleic acid NMR. To overcome this limitation, we developed a site-directed spin labeling strategy for RNA that enables targeted dynamic nuclear polarization (DNP) signal enhancement. Using the bisnitroxide polarizing agent AsymPol-NCS-SDSL, we conjugated spin labels to specific positions of mSirt1 RNA and annealed them to\n                    13\n                    C,\n                    15\n                    N-cytidine-labeled miR-34a. At 9.4 T, we observed up to 27-fold signal enhancements. The selectivity of polarization transfer within the RNA duplex relative to the surrounding environment could be tuned by matrix deuteration, while doping with paramagnetic metal ions accelerated polarization build-up times, with Cu\n                    II\n                    proving more efficient than Gd\n                    III\n                    . This work establishes bisnitroxide-based SDSL as a powerful approach for targeted DNP of nucleic acids, enabling high-sensitivity studies of nucleic acids at concentrations ≤40 µ\n                    m\n                    and paves the way for structural investigations of microRNA–mRNA interactions in cells."},{"t":"用于细胞比例控制的合成电路","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10259-3","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Recent advances in genetic engineering have provided diverse tools for artificially diversifying both prokaryotic and eukaryotic cell populations1,2,3,4,5,6. However, achieving precise control over the ratios of multiple cell types within a population derived from a single founder remains a major challenge. Here we introduce a suite of recombinase-mediated genetic devices designed to accurately control population ratios, enabling the distribution of distinct functionalities across multiple cell types. We systematically evaluated key parameters that influence recombination efficiency and developed data-driven models to reliably predict binary differentiation outcomes. Using these devices, we constructed parallel and series circuit topologies to implement user-defined, multistep cell-fate branching programs. The branching devices facilitated the autonomous differentiation of precision fermentation consortia from a single founder yeast strain, optimizing cell-type ratios for applications such as pigmentation and cellulose degradation. Similar effects were obtained with mammalian cells. We also engineered multicellular aggregates with genetically encoded morphologies by coordinating self-organization through cell adhesion molecules. Our work provides a comprehensive characterization of recombinase-based cell-fate branching mechanisms and introduces an approach for constructing synthetic consortia and multicellular assemblies.","tp":"合成基因电路","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者开发了一套重组酶介导的遗传装置，能精确控制源自单一创始细胞的群体中多种细胞类型的比例。该合成电路使不同功能可分布在多种细胞类型中，突破了在细胞群体内精确控制组成比例的重大挑战，在合成生物学和细胞治疗领域具有广泛应用前景。","aip":1},{"t":"电子-拓扑协同策略实现共价可适性网络的时空控制","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea6321?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价可适网络","kp":["策略[CANs]: 电子-拓扑协同调控","应用[纺丝]: 共价可适网络高速熔融"],"as":"提出电子-拓扑协同策略实现共价适应性网络（CAN）时空可控的新型方法。CAN结合了热固性与热塑性材料的优势，通过动态共价键实现网络重构。该工作利用光或电场驱动的电子激发态与拓扑结构设计的协同效应，精确控制动态键的交换反应速率与空间分布，从而实现材料按需重塑、修复或降解。该策略为智能软材料、可回收聚合物和4D打印等领域提供了新的设计范式。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Synergistic electronic-topological strategy enables spatiotemporal control of covalent adaptable networks","b":"Covalent adaptable networks (CANs) hold considerable promise for combining the advantages of thermosets and thermoplastics. However, their use in high-speed melt spinning is restricted by insufficient dynamic bond reactivity at processing temperatures and the mismatch between network rearrangement kinetics and industrial requirements. Here, we establish a spatiotemporally regulated platform based on internally catalyzed oxime-urethane chemistry within a four-arm cross-linking topology. Neighboring urea groups provide internal catalysis that greatly accelerates oxime-urethane dissociation at 110°C, improving melt fluidity. During extrusion, the slight temperature drop rapidly drives bond recombination within the four-arm topology, while hydrogen bonds deliver immediate reinforcement to retain melt strength. This synergistic design enables continuous melt spinning at 100 meters per minute over a short 10-centimeter distance. The resulting fibers combine high mechanical performance (tensile strength: 261.7 megapascals; toughness: 630.1 megajoules per cubic meter) with excellent stretchability, self-healing, and recyclability. This molecular engineering approach overcomes the processing-performance tradeoff in CANs, offering a scalable pathway toward high-performance, sustainable polymers for industrial manufacturing."},{"t":"超动力学：空穴复合体中的运动","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00020-3?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","b":"Molecular recognition is a dynamic dance of coupled motions. Within cavitands, guests and hosts adapt mutually through spinning, breathing, and folding—a fluid interplay sustained by weak forces on a shallow energy landscape. This paradigm moves beyond static fits to bridge synthetic and biological systems by shifting the focus from structure to motion and guides the programming of molecular dynamics for functional assemblies and responsive materials.","tp":"超分子动力学","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.5},"as":"文章提出超动力学概念，描述空穴复合体中主体与客体通过旋转、呼吸和折叠等协同运动实现动态识别的过程。这一范式超越传统静态匹配模型，将研究焦点从结构转向运动，为弥合合成体系与生物体系、编程功能分子组装体和响应材料提供了理论指导。"},{"t":"通过平衡相演化抑制锌黄锡矿太阳能电池缺陷，实现15.1%认证效率纪录","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00029-2?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌黄锡矿太阳能电池","kp":["PCE[CZTSSe认证]: 15.1%","[缺陷抑制]: 反应Na-Sex物种平衡相演化"],"dp":1,"sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":8.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"锌黄锡矿(CZTSSe)太阳能电池采用地球丰富、无毒元素，但复杂缺陷严重制约效率提升。研究通过调控平衡相演化路径抑制有害缺陷形成，显著降低缺陷态密度，优化能带排列，使器件光电转换效率达到15.1%的认证效率纪录。该成果证明相演化工程是克服kesterite材料缺陷瓶颈的有效策略，为低成本薄膜光伏技术的规模化应用铺平道路。","ot":"Suppressing defects in kesterite solar cells via balanced phase evolution to enable 15.1% certified record efficiency","b":"Kesterite (CZTSSe) solar cells use earth-abundant, non-toxic elements but their efficiency is limited by complex defects. We show that an imbalance between intermediate phases during selenization triggers harmful Zn-related defects. Introducing reactive Na-Sex species accelerates Cu2SnSe3 formation and balances phase evolution into CZTSSe, suppressing defect formation. This kinetic control enables a certified 15.1% device performance, clearing a key commercialization benchmark for sustainable thin-film photovoltaics."},{"t":"匹配微生物代谢的超晶格电催化实现可持续CO₂到生物产物的转化","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00021-5?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电微生物CO2转化","kp":["[电微生物系统]: Ag/Cu超晶格CO2转乙醇联产生物制品","年利润[电微生物系统]: 单一电催化15倍"],"dp":1,"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"本研究构建了一种集成电-微生物系统(iEMS)，采用可扩展的Ag/Cu金属超晶格催化剂进行CO2电还原，将中间产物高效输入微生物代谢途径，实现CO2到高附加值生物产品的可持续转化。超晶格催化剂的催化特性与微生物代谢需求精确匹配，提升了能量利用效率和产物选择性，为电催化与生物合成耦合的负碳技术路线提供了新范式。","ot":"Superlattice electrocatalysis matching microbial metabolism for sustainable CO2-to-bioproduct conversion","b":"This study demonstrates an integrated electro-microbial system (iEMS) based on a scalable Ag/Cu metal superlattice catalyst. It selectively produces microbe-compatible ethanol from CO2 and efficiently converts ethanol into high-value bioproducts (3-hydroxypropionic acid and single-cell protein), showing an annual profit 15 times higher than that of a single electrocatalytic system. This work highlights the adaptability of the coupling of electrocatalysis and microbial metabolism, paving the way for green development and carbon neutrality."},{"t":"硫桥工程实现反向氢溢流至原子级铜，用于硝酸盐到氨电催化","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7688164?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硝酸盐电还原制氨","kp":["[S桥工程]: 反向氢溢流至原子Cu硝酸盐制氨","催化剂[硝酸盐还原]: 单原子Cu/中空Co3S4"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出硫桥工程策略，实现逆向氢溢流至原子级铜催化剂，用于硝酸盐电催化还原制氨。铜基催化剂被认为是电催化硝酸根还原的有前景候选材料，该硫桥设计有效调控了反应中间体，提升了氨的选择性与产率，为电化学合成氨提供了新路径。","ot":"Sulfur‐Bridge Engineering Enables Reverse Hydrogen Spillover to Atomic Cu for Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Electrocatalysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Copper‐based catalysts are widely regarded as promising candidates for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO\n                    3\n                    RR), an environmentally benign route to ammonia synthesis, yet their efficiency is often constrained by nitrite accumulation and insufficient active hydrogen (*H) supply at high current densities. Here, isolated Cu atoms were anchored into a hollow Co\n                    3\n                    S\n                    4\n                    polyhedral framework (Cu‐Co\n                    3\n                    S\n                    4\n                    ), generating a sulfur bridged asymmetric active center. Electrochemical and computational studies reveal that Co\n                    3\n                    S\n                    4\n                    functions as an efficient *H donor, transferring hydrogen species to Cu sites through a sulfur bridge mediated reverse hydrogen spillover process, thereby accelerating the hydrogenation of nitrogen intermediates. By precisely tuning the Cu site density to balance nitrogen intermediate adsorption with *H supply, the optimized Cu\n                    1.01wt%\n                    ‐Co\n                    3\n                    S\n                    4\n                    catalyst delivers an exceptional NH\n                    3\n                    yield rate of 94.52 mg h\n                    −1\n                    mg\n                    cat.\n                    −1\n                    (18.90 mg h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    ) and a Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 95.18% at −0.8 V vs reversible hydrogen electrode. The catalyst also exhibits remarkable durability over 300 h at −200 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    and performs effectively in zinc‐nitrate batteries. These findings highlight the importance of coupling intermediate activation with hydrogenation kinetics and provide guiding principles for the rational design of high efficiency NO\n                    3\n                    RR electrocatalysts."},{"t":"抗性体介导的细胞死亡中的亚细胞钙动力学和细胞器扰动","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523470123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Plant nucleotide-binding domain leucine-rich repeat-containing (NLR) proteins act as intracellular immune receptors that assemble into resistosomes to execute immune responses. However, the subcellular processes during cell death following resistosome activation remain unclear. Here, we visualized the changes in calcium signaling and organelle behavior after activation of the NRC4 (NLR required for cell death 4) resistosome. We found that NRC4 membrane enrichment coincided with calcium influx. This is followed by sequential mitochondria and plastid disruption, endoplasmic reticulum fragmentation, and cytoskeleton depolymerization. Subsequent loss of plasma membrane integrity, nuclear shrinkage, and vacuolar collapse mark the terminal stage of cell death. Our findings reveal a spatiotemporally resolved cascade of subcellular events downstream of resistosome activation, providing mechanistic insight into the execution phase of plant immune cell death.","tp":"植物免疫机制","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者实时可视化了NRC4抗性体激活后的钙信号变化和细胞器行为。发现NRC4在膜上的富集与钙离子流入同步发生，揭示了植物NLR免疫受体组装成抗性体后引发细胞死亡的亚细胞机制，包括钙动力学和细胞器扰动的时空规律。"},{"t":"靶向β2-肾上腺素能受体的功效光开关的结构机制","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202517995?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The field of photopharmacology develops light‐responsive drugs that can modulate protein activity, enabling precise and dynamic investigations of their roles in health and disease. Adrenergic receptors are prominent targets for this approach because they are prototypical G protein‐coupled receptors with high clinical relevance in bronchial and cardiovascular diseases. Here, we employed the azobenzene‐based compound photoazolol‐1 in combination with time‐resolved serial crystallography at X‐ray free‐electron lasers to resolve the molecular mechanisms by which photoswitchable β‐blockers modulate activity of the β\n                    2\n                    ‐adrenoceptor (β\n                    2\n                    AR). Time‐resolved structures of the receptor bound to\n                    trans\n                    ‐photoazolol‐1 (pre‐photoconversion), a strained intermediate in the nanosecond range, and the fully photoisomerized\n                    cis\n                    ‐photoazolol‐1 reveal how isomerization of the azobenzene moiety induces distinct conformational changes within the orthosteric ligand binding pocket. Within seconds, light‐excited photoazolol‐1 adopts a new binding pose, altering interactions with extracellular loop 2 and shifting the positions of transmembrane helices 5, 6, and 7. Functional assays of β\n                    2\n                    AR in cellular membranes show that photoazolol‐1 acts as an efficacy photoswitch, changing from an inverse agonist to a neutral antagonist upon isomerization without leaving the binding pocket. In combination, these findings suggest a molecular mechanism for activity modulation via efficacy photoswitches and provide a framework for designing ligands that exploit light‐driven transitions within the binding pocket to achieve spatiotemporal control of receptor function.","tp":"光控药物受体","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者利用偶氮苯光开关化合物结合结构生物学手段，揭示了靶向β2-肾上腺素能受体的功效光开关分子机制。该研究为光药理学领域开发光响应药物提供了原子层面理解，有望实现对G蛋白偶联受体活性的精确时空调控，在心肺和心血管疾病治疗中具有应用潜力。"},{"t":"强光发射与扭曲","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef9532?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Stacks of boron nitride sheets can be arranged to emit deep ultraviolet light"},{"t":"压力会导致湿疹发作——现在我们知道原因了","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00876-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"中年服用减肥药物后，力量仍持续存在","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00852-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"氯化物掺杂蒸发宽带隙钙钛矿实现稳定的钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE04477D","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿有机叠层电池","kp":["添加剂[蒸镀]: ~1% PbCl2气相掺杂","稳定性[宽禁带]: 抑制离子迁移相分离"],"as":"宽带隙钙钛矿的稳定性是钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池的瓶颈。本研究通过氯化物掺杂蒸发工艺显著提升宽带隙钙稳定性，实现高效稳定叠层器件，推动钙钛矿叠层光伏迈向工程化与实用化。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Stable Perovskite-Organic Tandem Solar Cells Enabled by Chloride-Doped Evaporated Wide-Bandgap Perovskites","b":"Wide-bandgap perovskites are critical for achieving high-efficiency perovskite-based tandem solar cells, yet their practical deployment remains limited by stability challenges such as ion migration and halide phase segregation. Here, we demonstrate that introducing ~1% PbCl2 as a vapor-phase additive during thermal evaporation effectively stabilizes wide-bandgap perovskite devices. Detailed characterizations reveal strong chemical interactions between chloride anions and formamidinium cations, resulting in improved crystallinity and enhanced photoluminescence quantum yield. The Cl-doped wide-bandgap perovskite films exhibit suppressed halide phase segregation and mitigated ionic losses. As a result, a 1.75 eV single-junction perovskite cell achieves a T80 lifetime of 1,639 hours under continuous maximum power point tracking, along with improved efficiency and open-circuit voltage. When integrated with an organic subcell (PCE-10:P2EH-2V), the resulting perovskite-organic tandem solar cell achieves a power conversion efficiency of 24.86% and a maximum T80 of 1,979 hours, surpassing the stability of all the previously reported perovskite-organic and perovskite-perovskite tandem devices.","aip":1},{"t":"中孔沸石中烷醇-烷酮异质簇的稳定化驱动反应速率数量级提升","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519476?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"沸石催化增强","kp":["[杂簇效应]: 醇酮共吸附使质子脱水速率提升数量级"],"as":"研究发现中孔分子筛可稳定烷醇-烷酮杂核簇，无需传统合成后修饰即可调控催化反应活性，为绿色催化与精细化学品合成提供了新机制，拓展了分子筛在多相催化中的应用空间。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Stabilization of Alkanol–Alkanone Heteroclusters in Medium‐Pore Zeolites Drives Orders‐of‐Magnitude Rate Enhancements in","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Modern catalytic approaches to manipulating reactivities predominantly rely on (post‐)synthetic methods that engineer active sites and their local environments from a materials perspective, while the dynamic creation and disruption of reactive and spectator species through co‐adsorbate interactions is much less explored and understood. Herein, C\n                    3\n                    ─C\n                    6\n                    aliphatic alkanones have been identified as potent promotors for Brønsted acid‐catalyzed alkanol dehydration within the subnanometric zeolite pores, with the MFI topology being the most efficacious (up to two orders of magnitude rate enhancement and &gt; 99.8% olefin) and featuring a remarkable stability (&gt; 140 h on stream) at both kinetically limited and practically relevant conversions. Rigorous kinetic descriptions are combined with density functional theory methods to assess the structures, stabilities and reactivities of all plausible intermediates derived from the reactant and cofeed during 2‐propanol (IPA) dehydration in MFI pores. Stoichiometric clustering of alkanones with IPA‐derived monomers and dimers, driven by strong H‐bonds and stabilized by pore confinement, induces the formation of protonated bi‐ and termolecular species with distinct reactivities for intra‐ and intermolecular dehydration, which depends on the alkanone identity. These mechanistic underpinnings reward us with an ability to predict reactivity and selectivity trends and rationally design optimal solvent systems or cofeeding schemes for alkanol dehydration."},{"t":"SP1 在牛和人胚胎基因组激活和早期胚胎发育中的物种特异性作用","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526998123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Embryonic genome activation (EGA) marks the onset of the embryonic program and enables the transition toward the first lineage specification. However, the molecular features of EGA and the transcription factors (TFs) orchestrating this process remain unclear. Here, by performing single-cell RNA-seq on bovine embryos, we reveal that major EGA is asynchronously initiated among blastomeres at the 8-cell stage. Integrative analyses reveal distinct protein accumulation compared with transcriptional and translational activation during bovine EGA. Furthermore, we investigate the role of SP1, a TF activated at the minor EGA stage, with motifs enriched in accessible chromatin during the major EGA stage in bovine and human embryos. SP1 deficiency leads to morula arrest in bovine and impairs EGA in human embryos. Multiomics analysis demonstrates that SP1 promotes early lineage gene expression by modulating nearby chromatin states in bovine and directly targets key EGA genes in human embryos. Together, our study delineates the dynamics of bovine EGA and uncovers the conserved and species-specific roles of SP1 in regulating EGA and early development in mammals.","tp":"胚胎基因激活","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者对牛胚胎进行单细胞RNA测序，揭示胚胎基因组激活在8细胞阶段卵裂球中异步启动。整合分析发现SP1转录因子在牛和人早期胚胎发育中发挥物种特异性作用，且蛋白积累与转录特征存在显著差异，为理解哺乳动物胚胎发育机制提供了新见解。"},{"t":"连接组中神经元线粒体的空间和形态组织","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.ads6674?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Neuronal function depends on mitochondria, but little is known about their organization across neurons. Using an electron microscopy\n                    Drosophila\n                    connectome, we uncovered quantitative rules governing the morphology and positioning of hundreds of thousands of mitochondria across thousands of neurons. We discovered that mitochondrial morphological features are specific to cell and neurotransmitter type, which provides fingerprints to identify neurons. Mitochondria are positioned with 2- to 3-micrometer precision relative to synaptic and structural features, with systematic differences across neuron types and compartments. Mitochondrial localization correlates with regional activity and postsynaptic targets. Analysis of a mouse visual cortex connectome confirms cell type–specific morphology and identifies partially divergent positioning rules. These results establish mitochondria as circuit-embedded organelles whose distribution links subcellular architecture to brain connectivity."},{"t":"睡眠改变人脑的神经血管和流体动力耦合","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2510731123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Sleep is essential for maintaining brain tissue homeostasis, which is facilitated by enhanced cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) solute transport. Infraslow (&lt;0.1 Hz) vasomotion, CSF flow, and electrophysiological potential all increase during sleep, but their contributions as potential drivers of CSF flow in human brain remain unknown. To investigate this, we measured these signals in healthy volunteers across sleep–wake states using functional MRI blood oxygen level-dependent (BOLD), electroencephalography, and functional near-infrared spectroscopy. We then studied the directed coupling patterns between the three signals, using phase transfer entropy. In the awake state, electrophysiological potential and water concentration changes both predicted hemodynamic BOLD changes across whole brain, reflecting classical functional hyperemia. During sleep, these interactions changed such that the net directionality was lost and the interactions became more bidirectional. Our results show that in addition to neural changes during sleep, nonneural processes such as vasomotor-driven hydrodynamic waves start to gain more impact on human brain activity."},{"t":"简单的传质调节实现海水淡化盐水无结垢零排液，无需化学处理","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb2604?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Thermal-driven interfacial evaporation crystallization offers a promising path to zero liquid discharge (ZLD) for high-salinity brine. However, cocrystallization of specific minor salt species with major salts forms scaling that causes operational failure. Although chemical additives are commonly used to mitigate scaling, they pose potential environmental risks. This study presents a chemical-additive-free antiscaling strategy that suppresses unwanted cocrystallization by rationally enhancing the departure of scaling-causing species from the evaporation interface. As a proof of concept, a solar evaporator is designed to enhance the backflow of MgSO\n                    4\n                    , the primary scaling-causing species in seawater desalination brine, by precisely regulating its mass transfer distance. Under solar irradiation, the evaporator achieved a continuous evaporation of seawater desalination brine for over 408 hours with a stable evaporation rate of 4.29 kilograms per square meter per hour without any visible scaling, enabling uninterrupted ZLD operation. Outdoor field tests further validated the strategy’s practical applicability. This work offers transformative potential for achieving sustainable ZLD in brine management.","tp":"海水淡化零排","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究者提出无需化学添加剂的防结垢策略，通过合理增强传质抑制有害共结晶，实现海水淡化盐水的零排液处理。该方法解决了热驱动界面蒸发结晶中次要盐与主要盐共结晶导致结垢和操作失败的问题，兼具环境友好性和工程可行性。","aip":1},{"t":"自私的“调整”损害了科学","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef2215?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Seemingly innocuous research decisions can harm scientific credibility, argue a pair of social scientists"},{"t":"不同年龄的自我失活 AAV-CRISPR 能够持续改善 BAC226 中亨廷顿病的缺陷","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea8052?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Huntington’s disease (HD) is a monogenic autosomal dominant neurodegenerative disorder caused by a CAG repeat expansion in exon 1 of the\n                    HTT\n                    gene, yielding a gain-of-toxic-function mutant Huntingtin protein (mHTT). CRISPR-Cas9 is a potentially powerful therapeutic strategy for HD by eliminating mutant\n                    HTT\n                    (m\n                    HTT\n                    ) gene. We developed a specific SaCas9 guide RNA to target human m\n                    HTT\n                    and a self-inactivating gene editing system that abolishes SaCas9 after a short transient expression for high gene editing efficiency and maximal safety to prevent off-target effects. Both conventional and the self-inactivating gene editing systems successfully eliminated m\n                    HTT\n                    gene, 60 to 90% mHTT protein and 90% of mHTT aggregation in BAC226Q mouse brains, which resulted in significant long-term rescue of neuropathology, motor deficits, weight loss, and shortened life span. These beneficial effects were observed when gene editing was applied before, at, and well after the onset of pathological and behavioral abnormalities. These proof-of-concept data demonstrate that gene editing can be a highly effective therapeutic approach for HD.","tp":"CRISPR基因治疗","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者开发了特异性SaCas9引导RNA靶向突变HTT基因，利用自失活AAV-CRISPR系统在不同年龄的亨廷顿病小鼠模型中持续改善疾病缺陷。该策略通过精准消除突变基因表达，为亨廷顿病等单基因神经退行性疾病的基因治疗提供了安全有效的方案。","aip":1},{"t":"Fc 聚糖的选择性氟化可增强抗体介导的效应子功能","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530653123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Antibody effector functions such as antibody-dependent cellular cytotoxicity (ADCC) and various complement-dependent activities are critically influenced by the structure and composition of Fc N-glycans. Terminal galactosylation is generally associated with enhanced FcγRIIIA binding and C1q recruitment, thereby improving antibody activities. Recent structural studies suggest that terminal galactose can restrict glycan flexibility and stabilize Fc conformation by interacting with CH2 domain residues, thereby reducing the entropic penalty for FcγRIIIA binding. Motivated by this structural insight, we hypothesized that fine-tuning galactose-mediated Fc glycan-Fc domain interactions via site-selective fluorination could further modulate Fc-receptor and Fc–complement interactions. To test this, we developed a chemoenzymatic glycoengineering approach to generate homogeneous antibodies bearing precisely fluorinated Fc N-glycans. Key to this strategy was the chemical synthesis of position-specific fluorinated full-length Fc glycans, which were subsequently installed onto the antibody via enzymatic Fc glycan remodeling catalyzed by a glycosynthase mutant. Using this platform, we constructed a panel of homogeneous fluorinated antibodies and evaluated their functional consequences. ELISA-based binding assays revealed that fluorination at the C2 or C6 position of terminal galactose significantly increased FcγRIIIA affinity. Corresponding enhancements in ADCC were confirmed using a cell-based reporter bioassay. Furthermore, fluorination at these positions also promoted C1q binding and elevated the antibody-dependent cellular phagocytosis potency in whole blood assays. These results collectively demonstrate that selective Fc glycan fluorination represents a unique strategy to enhance antibody effector functions, providing a paradigm for precision glycoengineering in antibody therapeutics.","tp":"抗体糖基化","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究发现对Fc聚糖进行选择性氟化可增强抗体介导的效应子功能。末端半乳糖基化通常增强FcγRIIIA结合和C1q募集从而提升抗体活性，而选择性氟化能进一步限制聚糖柔性并稳定Fc构象，为优化抗体药物的ADCC和补体依赖性细胞毒性提供了新策略。"},{"t":"寻求行业角色？将自己推销为问题解决者，而不是求职者","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00548-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"利用ShadowCam探测月球永久阴影区域表层水冰","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec8211?af=R","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"月球水冰探测","kp":["手段[月球水冰]: ShadowCam高分辨率观测","目标[PSR]: 永久阴影区表面水冰分布"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究利用ShadowCam相机探测月球永久阴影区（PSRs）的表面水冰分布。月球、水星和谷神星等无大气天体的极地永久阴影区具备冷阱水冰的条件。ShadowCam高分辨率成像揭示了PSRs内部的反射率和地形特征，为理解月球水冰的分布、储量及未来月球资源利用提供了关键数据支撑。","ot":"Searching for surficial water ice in lunar permanently shaded regions (PSRs) with ShadowCam","b":"Airless bodies such as the Moon, Mercury, and Ceres have permanently shaded regions (PSRs) that can cold trap water ice. Mercury and Ceres have substantial ice deposits in their PSRs, but lunar water ice distribution remains uncertain because of sparse detections and limited data. Here, we assessed surficial water ice in lunar PSRs using high-resolution observations from ShadowCam onboard the Korea Pathfinder Lunar Orbiter. We used the high-reflectance and forward-scattering optical properties to search for water ice in lunar PSRs. We found no evidence of widespread water ice in PSRs at abundances above the detection limit of 20 to 30 wt % but could not rule out widespread low-content water ice. A few small locations with both high reflectance and forward-scattering behavior were observed, which could be consistent with &gt;10 wt % ice. Future missions with low detection limits (&lt;1 wt %) of water ice can test our findings."},{"t":"SUN5 形成规则的蛋白质晶格，增强精子头尾连接","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520626123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Spermatozoa strongly rely on their streamlined morphology to successfully fertilize an oocyte. A striking example of a morphological defect resulting in infertility is acephalic spermatozoa syndrome, a rare but severe condition leading to detachment of the sperm head and tail. Among the most common genetic causes for this syndrome are mutations in the linker of nucleo- and cytoskeleton (LINC) complex component SUN5. LINC complexes typically reside in the nuclear envelope, the double-membrane surrounding the nucleus, where they establish a physical bridge between nucleus and cytoplasm. This localization allows them to transduce mechanical signals from the cytoplasm to the nucleus and to regulate nuclear morphology. In sperm, LINC complexes are essential for a multitude of morphological changes during sperm development, including the reshaping of the nucleus and establishing a stable head–tail junction. Here, using superresolution fluorescence microscopy, we find that sperm-specific SUN5 localizes to the base of the head in human, mouse, and boar sperm. By applying in situ cryoelectron tomography, we find an extensive hexagonal lattice in the nuclear envelope in this region. This lattice appears to maintain a consistent close apposition between the inner and outer nuclear membranes (ONM). Further structural analysis supports a model in which LINC complexes form this lattice by laterally interacting at the ONM. Overall, this study sheds light on nuclear envelope organization in the highly streamlined sperm cell, providing a structural basis for uniform nuclear envelope spacing maintained by a LINC lattice and rationalizing the disruptive effects of SUN5 mutations.","tp":"蛋白质晶格","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"精子头尾连接异常会导致无头精子症并引发男性不育。LINC复合物组分SUN5的基因突变是主要病因之一。最新研究表明，SUN5能够形成规则的蛋白质晶格结构，该特殊结构对于显著增强精子头部与尾部的稳定连接至关重要。这一发现阐明了精子形态建成的分子机制及相关不育症的病理基础。"},{"t":"有机和钙钛矿太阳能电池组件设计综述","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07830J","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"有机钙钛矿组件","dp":1,"as":"本文系统综述了有机太阳能电池（OSC）和钙钛矿太阳能电池（PSC）的组件设计策略，涵盖电极布局、互连技术、活性层分区等关键模块化工程问题。作为下一代薄膜光伏技术的代表，两者在效率和成本上进展迅速，但从实验室小面积器件向大面积商业化组件放大仍面临均匀性、稳定性和规模化制备等核心瓶颈。","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.5,"t":2.5},"ot":"Review of module designs for organic and perovskite solar cells","b":"Organic solar cells (OSCs) and perovskite solar cells (PSCs) are emerging as promising next-generation alternatives to conventional silicon solar cells because of their rapidly increasing power conversion efficiency (PCE); potential for low-cost manufacturing; and suitability for diverse applications, including building- and vehicle-integrated photovoltaics, space-based solar power sources, and portable power sources. With the certified PCEs of OSCs and PSCs reaching 19.2% and 27.0%, respectively, significant effort is now directed toward upscaling these cells for commercialization. However, this transition presents a critical challenge: compared with those of their small-area cell (~ 0.1 cm2) counterparts, the PCEs of large-area modules (> 10 cm2) typically decrease by 20–30%, posing a significant barrier to the replacement of silicon-based technologies. While laser scribing is a prevalent technique for producing efficient large-area modules, it frequently introduces process-induced damage and stability concerns, as well as high process costs. This review critically examines the various module designs that are used in OSC and PSC fabrication schemes, summarizes the tradeoffs among different patterning techniques, and proposes future design directions that can bridge the efficiency gap and provide enhanced long-term stability."},{"t":"重置串联 microRNA156 使水稻能够多年生营养生长","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adv2188?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Annual cultivated rice was domesticated from perennial wild rice, yet the genetic mechanism of perennial growth habit remains unclear. Using introgression lines of wild and cultivated rice, we identified the\n                    Endless Branches and Tillers\n                    (\n                    EBT1\n                    ) locus, comprising tandem microRNA156 genes (\n                    MIR156BC\n                    ). This locus is responsible for floral reversion and vegetative propagation contributing to perennial growth in wild rice. The wild rice allele\n                    EBT1\n                    W1943\n                    exhibits higher chromatin accessibility and lower levels of the repressive histone mark H3K27me3 to reset\n                    MIR156BC\n                    expression in tiller buds compared with the cultivated allele. Additionally, we introgressed\n                    EBT1\n                    and prostrate growth genes\n                    PROG1\n                    and\n                    TIG1\n                    to generate recombinant lines exhibiting a robust perennial habit. Our findings pave the way for developing sustainable perennial rice cultivars in the future.","tp":"多年生水稻","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者鉴定了包含串联microRNA156基因的EBT1位点，该位点负责花逆转和营养繁殖特性。通过重置串联MIR156BC表达，使栽培水稻重新获得多年生营养生长能力，揭示了水稻从一年生栽培种到多年生野生种生长习性转变的关键遗传机制。","aip":1},{"t":"研究安全政策需要明确的指导方针","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef7935?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Research security policies are emerging across nations seeking to protect their national interests in response to geopolitical shifts. Yet governments impose disclosure requirements and threaten penalties while offering little guidance on the vast gray zone of cross-border collaborations that could invite retribution. A chill sets in among researchers. If the community does not act, the result will be scientific fragmentation at a moment when global challenges demand cooperation. That serves neither security nor innovation.","tp":"科研安全观","sc":1.4,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":0.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":3.0},"as":"地缘政治博弈促使各国相继出台研究安全政策以保护国家利益，但政府在施加披露要求和惩罚措施的同时，却未对跨国合作的“灰色地带”提供明确指导。这引发了科研界的寒蝉效应，可能导致科学体系走向碎片化。在全球性挑战迫切需要跨国合作的当下，科研界亟需制定清晰的政策指南，以防合作受阻。"},{"t":"回复 Suetsugu 和 Johnson：浆果状山药珠芽的鸟类传播与低分辨率下的贝茨拟态一致","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2604887123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"回复萨科：完整空间是进化优化的结果","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2605961123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"细胞周期蛋白 D-CDK4/6 对免疫 CD155–CD226–TIGIT 轴的调节","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522872123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cyclin D-CDK4/6 is a component of mammalian cell-cycle machinery that drives cell proliferation. Small-molecule inhibitors of CDK4/6 have been approved for treatment of breast cancer patients. In addition to halting cell-cycle progression, inhibition of CDK4/6 can affect other tumor cell-intrinsic and -extrinsic functions. Here, we examined the impact of CDK4/6 inhibition on the CD155–CD226–TIGIT pathway that operates at the interface of tumor cells and the immune environment. We demonstrate that inhibition of CDK4/6 upregulates the expression of surface CD155 protein in cancer cells and downregulates an immuno-inhibitory receptor TIGIT in tumor-infiltrating lymphocytes. We observed these effects in human breast cancer cell lines, in mouse mammary carcinoma allograft models, in freshly resected human breast tumors and in paired pre-/on-treatment biopsies of breast cancers from patients undergoing monotherapy with a CDK4/6 inhibitor. We propose that inhibition of CDK4/6, through its tumor cell-intrinsic and -extrinsic effects, may shift the balance from the immunoinhibitory CD155–TIGIT to the immunostimulatory CD155–CD226 interaction, and through this mechanism may augment the antitumor immunity. Our results suggest that coadministration of CDK4/6 inhibitors and anti-TIGIT antibodies may further promote CD155–CD226-signaling and may have a strong synergistic antitumor effect.","tp":"免疫检查点","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"细胞周期蛋白D-CDK4/6驱动细胞增殖，其抑制剂目前已用于乳腺癌治疗。最新研究发现，抑制CDK4/6不仅能阻滞肿瘤细胞周期，还能调节肿瘤免疫微环境中的CD155-CD226-TIGIT信号轴。这表明CDK4/6抑制剂除了直接抗癌作用外，还具有重塑抗肿瘤免疫反应的重要潜力，为肿瘤免疫联合治疗提供了新方向。"},{"t":"基于编码机械阵列的可重构虚拟现实交互界面","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516232?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Virtual reality (VR) interaction interface plays a critical role in bridging biomechanical signatures between physical world and cyberspace. However, existing stretchable strain sensors for VR gesture recognition face an inherent trade‐off between sensitivity and operating range, thereby significantly limiting their applicability across diverse metaverse scenarios. Here, we present a dynamic reconfiguration strategy based on an encoded mechanical array (EMA) to enable in‐field and programmable tuning of sensitivity and operating range for stretchable strain sensors in VR applications. The interlocked liquid metal units in EMA, which are inspired by mortise‐and‐tenon design, achieve reversible fracture‐healing cycles under external magnetic fields and mechanical stimuli, enabling programmable localized strain tunability (up to 71%) in EMA with binary coding. With the integration of EMA, the stretchable strain sensor is capable of switching between multiple operational modes across high‐precision detection (∼610% sensitivity enhancement) and wide‐range monitoring (∼220% range extension). By implementing the EMA‐based stretchable strain sensor array in the creation of a reconfigurable VR interaction interface, we achieve scenario‐adaptive hand motion tracking in a VR medical training platform for orthopedic and neurosurgical surgery simulations.","tp":"可重构交互","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究者提出基于编码机械阵列（EMA）的动态重构策略，用于虚拟现实交互界面。该方法突破了现有可拉伸应变传感器在灵敏度与工作范围之间的固有矛盾，通过可编程的机械阵列配置实现跨场景多样化手势识别，在人机交互和元宇宙领域具有应用潜力。"},{"t":"量化英国电网脱碳的储能需求——可再生能源份额的影响","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003442?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电网脱碳储能配置","kp":["[研究对象]: 英国电网脱碳储能需求"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Quantifying energy storage requirements to decarbonise the electricity grid in the United Kingdom—influence of the share"},{"t":"余辉材料的拟同系物掺杂策略","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5554671?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机余辉材料","kp":["[假同系物掺杂]: 联苯甲酸微量杂质诱导BCA磷光余辉"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本文提出一种用于有机余辉发光材料的\"伪同系物掺杂\"策略。有机磷光材料中的杂质问题长期引发广泛讨论，研究者利用伪同系物掺杂方法精确控制材料中的杂质行为，实现室温下高效长寿命的有机余辉发射。该策略通过选择与主体分子结构和能级高度匹配的掺杂分子，有效调控三线态激子的产生和辐射过程。该方法为设计高性能有机余辉材料提供了新思路，在信息加密、生物成像和光电器件领域具有应用潜力。","ot":"Pseudo‐Homologue Doping Strategy for Afterglow Materials","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Impurities in organic phosphorescent materials have caused extensive discussions in recent years. In this work, we demonstrate the impressive afterglow of commercial benzene‐carboxylic acid (BCA) derivatives are attributed to trace impurities identified as biphenyl carboxylic acid derivatives. One of the impurities even induces detectable phosphorescence when the doping ratio is as low as 0.1 ppm (molar ratio). Inspired by the structural similarity between impurities and the main component, we propose a pseudo‐homologues strategy for constructing afterglow materials. Based on this model, several groups of compounds are used to prepare 275 doped samples. Surprisingly, pseudo‐homologues exhibit a markedly higher success rate for afterglow (73.3%) compared to that of other samples (6.5%). This structural model offers new perspectives for the construction of dual‐component afterglow materials."},{"t":"蛋白酶体引导的血红素信号轴导致 T 细胞耗竭","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10250-y","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The accumulation of depolarized mitochondria commits T cells to exhaustion1,2,3, yet the precise mechanism remains unclear. Here we find that exhausted CD8+ T cells increase proteasome activity owing to the accumulation of depolarized mitochondria, which drives the selective degradation of mitochondrial proteins and the release of regulatory haem through haemoprotein breakdown. In turn, increased regulatory haem disrupts BACH2-mediated transcriptional regulation, thereby exacerbating T cell exhaustion and compromising stemness-like properties. Inhibition of nuclear import of regulatory haem prevents BACH2 degradation and enhances the anti-tumour efficacy of antigen-specific T cells. We find that the therapeutic efficacy of human CD19+ chimeric antigen receptor (CAR)-T cells in patients with B cell acute lymphoblastic leukaemia negatively correlates with the proteasome gene signature in their CAR-T cells. Manufacturing CAR-T cells in the presence of bortezomib, an FDA-approved proteasome inhibitor, prevents T cell exhaustion and improves therapeutic efficacy. Our findings identify a proteasome-guided haem signalling axis, governed by mitochondrial integrity, as a regulator of CD8+ T cell exhaustion and propose innovative therapeutic strategies that exploit this pathway to optimize adoptive cellular immunotherapy.","tp":"血红素调控","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究发现，耗竭的CD8+ T细胞内去极化线粒体的积累导致蛋白酶体活性增加。这种升高的蛋白酶体活性不仅驱动线粒体蛋白的选择性降解，还会在分解血红素蛋白时释放出调节性血红素。随后，增加的游离血红素会破坏BACH2介导的转录调控作用，进而进一步加剧T细胞的耗竭状态。该研究揭示了线粒体、蛋白酶体与血红素信号轴在T细胞功能衰退中的关键分子机制。"},{"t":"《万福玛丽计划》电影构建了令人眼花缭乱的新世界——并将其扎根于科学","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00870-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"用于协同信使RNA癌症免疫治疗的前药束缚脂质纳米粒子","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02102-z","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","b":"Regulating T cell phenotypes between activation and exhaustion remains a significant challenge for messenger RNA-based cancer immunotherapy. A potential approach to improve anti-cancer T cell activity is to co-deliver interleukin-12 (IL-12), to stimulate effector T cells, and indoleamine 2,3-dioxygenase (IDO) inhibitor, to suppress T cell exhaustion. Here we design prodrug ionizable lipid nanoparticles (pLNPs), via a library of prodrug ionizable lipids (pILs), incorporating an intracellularly cleavable IDO inhibitor within the pIL structure and encapsulating IL-12 messenger RNA. The lead pIL shows enhanced mRNA transfection over a clinically utilized ionizable lipid, as well as strong immunomodulatory effects via release of the IDO inhibitor. In a subcutaneous colon cancer mouse model, pLNP drives complete regression of primary tumours by eliciting effector T cell infiltration while reducing exhaustion, induces a memory T cell response and stimulates a systemic immune response that allows for regression of distal tumours in this study. These results highlight the promise of pLNPs for small-molecule drug and mRNA combination cancer immunotherapy.","tp":"脂质纳米粒","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究团队设计了前药可电离脂质纳米粒子(pLNPs)，通过胞内还原响应释放IL-12（激活效应T细胞）和IDO抑制剂（抑制T细胞耗竭），实现协同mRNA癌症免疫治疗。该策略解决了T细胞激活与耗竭之间平衡的难题，为提高抗肿瘤免疫活性提供了新平台。"},{"t":"城市微电网中隐私保护的P2P电力交易经济优化","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002989?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微电网P2P交易","kp":["[技术]: 隐私保护P2P交易","[应用]: 城市微电网经济优化"],"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Privacy-preserving P2P energy trading for economic optimization in urban microgrids"},{"t":"小鼠胚胎中的原始生殖细胞在迁移过程中经历了越来越多的物理限制和 DNA 损伤","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec7919?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"To produce healthy offspring, an organism must pass on its genetic material with high fidelity. In many species, this is accomplished by primordial germ cells (PGCs), which give rise to sperm or eggs. PGCs are often specified far from the future gonads and must migrate through developing tissues to reach them. Failure to do so can result in infertility or germ cell tumors. While PGC migration is well characterized in some species, very little is known about their migration in mammalian embryos. Here, we performed dynamic and quantitative analyses of PGC migration from E7.5 to E9.5 in the mouse embryo, providing the first comprehensive study of the migratory characteristics of PGCs from their point of origin to the gonads. We demonstrate that migrating PGCs are influenced by the surrounding environment and, in contrast to other organisms, extend highly dynamic, actin-rich protrusions to navigate through extracellular matrix (ECM) barriers, and tight intercellular spaces. As PGCs migrate through increasingly confined spaces, they undergo significant nuclear deformation and become prone to nuclear rupture and DNA damage. Their migration under confinement may be aided in part by a depleted nuclear lamina that leads to wrinkled nuclear morphology. Our high-resolution and dynamic imaging approaches have uncovered an unexpected risk to genome integrity in migrating PGCs, with implications for DNA repair and adaptations in nuclear mechanics in PGCs.","tp":"迁移与损伤","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"原始生殖细胞（PGCs）负责将高保真遗传物质传递给后代，其需在哺乳动物胚胎发育的复杂组织中长途迁移至生殖腺，若迁移失败会导致不育或生殖细胞肿瘤。最新研究揭示了小鼠胚胎中PGCs在迁移过程所面临的挑战，发现这些细胞在向目的地移动时会经历越来越严重的物理限制（挤压），并且这种机械压迫等微环境压力会伴随明显的DNA损伤。这为理解哺乳动物生殖细胞发育及潜在的致瘤机制提供了新视角。"},{"t":"使用贝叶斯动力系统学习预测蚊子飞行行为","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7063?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Mosquito-borne diseases cause several hundred thousand deaths worldwide every year. Deciphering mosquito host-seeking behavior is essential to prevent disease transmission through mosquito capture and surveillance. Despite recent substantial progress, we still lack a comprehensive quantitative understanding of how visual and other sensory cues guide mosquitoes to their targets. Here, we combined three-dimensional infrared tracking of\n                    Aedes aegypti\n                    mosquitoes with Bayesian dynamical systems inference to learn a quantitative biophysical model of mosquito host-seeking behavior. Trained on more than 20 million data points, each corresponding to an instantaneous position and velocity in mosquito free-flight trajectories recorded in the presence of visual and carbon dioxide cues, the model accurately predicts how mosquitoes respond to human targets. Our results provide a quantitative foundation for optimizing mosquito capture and control strategies, a key step toward mitigating the impact of mosquito-borne diseases.","tp":"昆虫行为学","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"蚊媒传染病每年在全球导致数十万人死亡，破译蚊子寻找宿主的飞行行为对于通过诱捕和监控来预防疾病传播至关重要。目前学界对视觉等感觉线索如何精确引导蚊子追踪目标仍缺乏定量的全面理解。本研究结合三维红外追踪技术对埃及伊蚊的飞行轨迹进行了高精度记录，并利用贝叶斯动力系统模型对其飞行行为进行学习与预测。该模型成功量化了多种感官线索如何动态调控蚊子的宿主定向行为。"},{"t":"磁图矩阵的幂：傅里叶谱、行走压缩和应用","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516664123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Magnetic graphs, originally developed to model quantum systems under magnetic fields, have recently emerged as a powerful framework for analyzing complex directed networks. Existing research has primarily used the spectral properties of the magnetic graph matrix to study global and stationary network features. However, their capacity to model local, nonequilibrium behaviors, often described by matrix powers, remains largely unexplored. We present a combinatorial interpretation of the magnetic graph matrix powers through directed walk profiles—counts of graph walks indexed by the number of edge reversals. Crucially, we establish that walk profiles correspond to a Fourier transform of magnetic matrix powers. The connection allows exact reconstruction of walk profiles from magnetic matrix powers at multiple discrete potentials, and more importantly, an even smaller number of potentials often suffices for accurate approximate reconstruction in real networks. This shows the empirical compressibility of the information captured by the magnetic matrix. This fresh perspective suggests further applications; for example, we illustrate how powers of the magnetic matrix can identify frustrated directed cycles (e.g., feedforward loops) and can be effectively employed for link prediction by encoding local structural details in directed graphs."},{"t":"面向埃米节点的后摩尔时代二维集成电路","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag166/8527596?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维集成电路","kp":["节点[后摩尔]: 埃米级节点集成","材料[二维]: 原子级厚度异质集成"],"as":"随着集成电路工艺逼近埃米（angstrom）尺度节点，硅基器件的持续微缩面临严峻的物理与工程极限。本文聚焦后摩尔时代二维（2D）材料集成电路技术，综述其在埃米节点的应用前景。二维半导体材料（如过渡金属硫族化合物）因其原子级厚度、优异载流子迁移率和短沟道效应抑制能力，被视为延续摩尔定律的关键候选。文章讨论了材料制备、界面工程、接触电阻等核心挑战，以及二维集成电子学在高性能计算领域的工程化路径。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Post-Moore two-dimensional integrated electronics for angstrom-nodes","b":"As integrated circuits approach the angstrom-nanometer nodes in recent years, the continued downscaling of silicon‑based electronics faces fundamental physical limits and escalating manufacturing costs. Two-dimensional (2D) materials—characterized by their atomically thickness, exceptional electrostatic gate control, and inherent suitability for heterogeneous integration—have arisen as promising alternatives to extend device scaling beyond the limits of silicon technology. This review provides a systematic overview of advances in integrated electronics based on 2D materials. The discussion begins with recent developments in wafer-scale synthesis and transfer techniques for 2D semiconductors. Subsequently with progress in high-performance 2D transistors, focusing on gate dielectric integration, contact optimization, and scaling strategies for high-density and advanced-node configurations. Circuit- and system-level implementations are also surveyed, including logic, memory, and three-dimensional (3D) monolithic integration. Further, key challenges and prospective directions are highlighted for realizing scalable, manufacturable, and low-power 2D electronic systems at the angstrom-nodes."},{"t":"政策驱动的战略性绿色技术创新路径：氢和碳捕获、利用案例","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"氢能碳捕集","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"英国价格上涨后能源负担能力的政策设计挑战","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001941?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源可负担","sc":2.3,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"通过三维光子质量涡旋工程的等离激元狄拉克涡旋激光器","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70833-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Topological photonic crystals provide a powerful platform for manipulating light. However, their flexibility in realizing diverse far-field beam profiles and polarization states is limited by the number of spatial symmetries lattices can provide. Here, we demonstrate plasmonic Dirac-vortex lasers with controlled polarization and intensity distributions by engineering photonic mass vortices in a three-dimensional parameter space. We design plasmonic Dirac-vortex cavities consisting of honeycomb lattices of aluminum nanoparticles, where photonic mass vortices are achieved by arranging distorted unit cells in an angular winding configuration. By manipulating the radial and azimuthal displacements of the nanoparticles as well as their size, taken as the third dimension of the system, we predict far-field radiation with spatially programmable polarization states and asymmetric intensity distributions. Experimentally, this is achieved by integrating organic dye molecules within the plasmonic Dirac-vortex cavities. Our work establishes a paradigm for multi-dimensional mass-enabled cavity engineering, which offers flexibility in sculpting exotic photonic states with broad implications for photonic circuits, quantum devices, and bosonic systems."},{"t":"用于高性能有机电化学晶体管的可光图案化 PEDOT:PSS","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521689?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organic mixed ionic‐electronic conductors (OMIECs) have the unique ability to transport both ionic and electronic charges, making them the ideal choice for interaction between biology (ionic) and human technology (electronic). Applied first to sense biological environments, OMIECs are now used to develop brain‐inspired circuits capable of seamlessly “communicating” with biology. However, patterning these organic materials in complex circuits is a challenge as traditional microfabrication techniques are not fully compatible. Current research is still heavily relying on a technique called peel‐off, which involves the physical removal of a sacrificial layer, making it cumbersome to develop highly integrated circuits.\n                  To circumvent these fabrication limitations, a photo‐patternable PEDOT:PSS is developed by blending it with a photo‐sensitive interpenetrating network, allowing features down to 2 µm to be patterned using photolithography on a wide range of substrates. The process fully retains the ability of the OMIEC to transport ions and electrical charges; moreover, organic electrochemical transistors fabricated using this technique outperform the widely used chemically‐cross‐linked GOPS PEDOT:PSS, while having a batch‐to‐batch variability below 5%. Our photo‐patterning process opens the door to monolithic fabrication of miniaturized and highly integrated circuits, allowing to push the limits of interaction between biology and man‐made technology.","tp":"有机电晶体","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":7.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了可光图案化的PEDOT:PSS导电聚合物材料，用于制造高性能有机电化学晶体管(OECT)。该材料兼具离子和电子传导能力，克服了传统有机材料复杂电路图案化的瓶颈，有望推动脑启发电子器件与生物系统无缝接口的发展。","aip":1},{"t":"光合纳米细菌驱动代谢免疫协同作用用于抗缺氧癌症治疗","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72834?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Photodynamic therapy (PDT) is a promising cancer treatment, yet its efficacy is often compromised by tumor hypoxia and limited immune activation. Here, we developed a multifunctional photosynthetic nanoplatform (PnanoCB) derived from\n                    Microcystis wesenbergii\n                    to alleviate hypoxia, enhance reactive oxygen species (ROS)‐mediated tumor cell killing, and activate antitumor immunity. The cyanobacteria were restructured into protoplast‐derived vesicles, retaining photosynthetic capacity and chlorophyll, and functionalized with a Matrix metalloproteinase‐2 (MMP‐2)‐cleavable anti‐PD‐L1 peptide via a pH‐sensitive pH low insertion peptide (pHLIP) linker for tumor‐targeted immune checkpoint blockade. Upon red light irradiation, PnanoCB efficiently generated oxygen in situ, overcoming hypoxia and significantly amplifying PDT‐induced ROS production. Combining PnanoCB with a fasting‐mimicking diet (FMD) further improved tumor accumulation and therapeutic efficacy. The combination of PnanoCB, light irradiation, and FMD achieved the most potent tumor inhibition in a 4T1 breast cancer model and effectively prevented tumor recurrence in a rechallenge model, without detectable toxicity to major organs. Overall, PnanoCB significantly alleviates hypoxia, promotes immunogenic cell death, and triggers robust dendritic cell (DC) maturation through stimulator of interferon genes (STING) pathway activation. This study demonstrates a strategy integrating photosynthetic oxygen generation, photodynamic immunotherapy, and metabolic intervention to remodel the tumor microenvironment and elicit robust systemic antitumor immunity."},{"t":"光感受器通过进化保守的分子途径控制扁平沙蚕的生长和寿命","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514719123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Natural light is severely affected by human impact on Earth, yet little is known about the roles light receptors have outside vision and rhythmic processes, despite their tremendously wide abundance. Here we show that loss-of-function of the\n                    light-receptive cryptochrome\n                    (\n                    l-cry\n                    ) in marine bristleworms significantly increases lifespan and adult size, similarly to wild-types reared in constant darkness. Quantitative transcriptomics revealed hormonal players crucial for invertebrate and vertebrate sexual development and reproduction affected in\n                    l-cry\n                    mutants. These include\n                    nr0b1/2\n                    , ortholog of\n                    dax-1\n                    (\n                    nr0b1\n                    ) and\n                    shp\n                    (\n                    nr0b2\n                    ), long considered vertebrate novelties. Depending on moon-phase,\n                    nr0b1/2\n                    is up- or down-regulated in\n                    l-cry\n                    mutants. Matching the complex regulation, data consistent with loss of\n                    nr0b1/2\n                    function partially recapitulate\n                    l-cry\n                    phenotypes. Molecularly,\n                    Platynereis\n                    Nr0b1/2 affects steroidogenic and other endocrine pathways, nuclear receptor signaling, and transcription factor orthologs involved in sexual developmental, reproductive, and timing processes in other organisms. Thus, our study suggests profound and direct effects of light on adult animal life-time, likely at least in part via conserved endocrine pathways involved in sexual maturation and reproduction in annelids and vertebrates."},{"t":"用卡宾等价物光诱导选择性构建致密功能化螺环醚","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1489528?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Carbyne equivalents represent ideal trivalent carbon synthons, capable of forming C─C and C─X bonds through their three nonbonded electrons. This unique reactivity profile offers high modularity for rapid assemble complicate molecular scaffolds. However, the selective introduction of three σ‐bonds at a single carbon center remains a formidable challenge, owing to the multifaceted reactivity of the carbyne center. Herein, we report a cascade reaction, which sequentially regulates the radical, nucleophilic, and electrophilic reactivity of carbyne equivalents under light irradiation. This cascade enables precise spatial and temporal activation, facilitating the selective and efficient construction of densely functionalized spirocyclic ethers from allylic and homoallylic acetates, with three σ‐bonds introduced at the carbyne center. A wide range of spirocyclic ethers bearing diverse functional groups and structural motifs was obtained with excellent diastereoselectivity, underscoring the capability of carbyne equivalents for rapid construction of drug‐like molecules. The reaction was readily scalable up to 50 mmol, either in batch mode or using a high‐speed circulation‐flow reactor. Mechanistic studies, including UV–vis spectroscopy, cyclic voltammetry, radical trapping, structure‐reactivity relationship experiments, isotope labeling, as well as theoretical calculations, provide insights into the dynamic evolution of reactive intermediates, shedding light on the diverse reactivity of carbyne equivalents in organic synthesis."},{"t":"磷富集并没有放大预测的二氧化碳施肥对森林碳汇的影响","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516152123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The capacity of nutrient-limited forests to enhance carbon (C) sequestration under elevated CO\n                    2\n                    (eCO\n                    2\n                    ) remains a critical uncertainty in C cycle modeling. While existing evidence suggests that low phosphorus (P) bioavailability may constrain CO\n                    2\n                    fertilization effects on plant growth, the extent to which this limitation modulates ecosystem responses to eCO\n                    2\n                    in forests adapted to P-deficient soils remains poorly understood. Here, using eight P-enabled models, we simulated the magnitudes and mechanisms through which P bioavailability interacts with eCO\n                    2\n                    , emulating an ecosystem-scale P enrichment experiment at a P-limited\n                    Eucalyptus\n                    forest undergoing long-term Free-Air CO\n                    2\n                    Enrichment. While models predicted pronounced P effects on tree growth, P enrichment unexpectedly did not increase the CO\n                    2\n                    effects on tree growth and ecosystem C sequestration. Models prioritized either CO\n                    2\n                    -driven or P-driven growth, but rarely both. This tradeoff emerged due to model-specific assumptions on 1) partitioning of the extra P in soil labile versus nonlabile pools; 2) plant photosynthetic acclimation to P deficiency; 3) C and nutrient use strategies regulating plant size and allocation; and 4) microbial-driven soil decomposition processes. By generating divergent yet biologically plausible outcomes, these predictions establish critical testable hypotheses for empirical research and highlight multiple P-related pathways that may influence the future land C sink."},{"t":"高反射建筑表皮上安装的双面光伏组件性能评估：实验与模拟研究","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003739?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双面光伏建筑表皮","kp":["[组件]: 双面光伏组件","[应用]: 高反射建筑表皮"],"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Performance assessment of bifacial photovoltaic modules mounted on highly reflective building skins: Experiment test and"},{"t":"量子密钥分发系统的黑盒渗透测试","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag174/8528982?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子密钥安全","kp":["[QKD安全]: 黑盒自动化渗透测试发现设备漏洞"],"dp":1,"as":"量子密钥分发（QKD）能在远距离通信双方间建立共享密钥，理论上被证明不可破解。然而实际QKD系统因硬件实现与理想模型的偏差，存在侧信道攻击风险。本文以黑盒方式对QKD系统进行渗透测试，即在不了解系统内部实现的前提下，通过外部输入-输出分析探测安全漏洞。研究演示了针对商用QKD设备的多种攻击向量，揭示了实际部署中光探测器盲区、时序漏洞等安全隐患，为QKD系统的安全加固提供了方法论指导。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Penetration testing of quantum key distribution system as a black box","b":"Quantum key distribution (QKD) establishes a shared secret between remote parties and is proven unbreakable in theory. Unfortunately, practical implementations of QKD have device imperfections leading to security vulnerabilities. Most of these have been verified in a white-box testing scenario, when one has access to the system hardware for its analysis. Here we implement an automated penetration testing on a QKD system as a black box, using only its public communication lines and limited operator’s manual. Our implementation parses information transmitted in the classical communication line and toggles an optical delay in the quantum communication line. This allows it to tamper with timing settings of detector gates in the QKD system during its calibration procedure and passively eavesdrop 98.97% of the sifted key. The entire testing is fully automated and takes minutes to begin the eavesdropping. Our work paves the way for automated penetration testing of QKD installations as security verification."},{"t":"泥炭火灾对西伯利亚火灾碳排放的贡献不成比例","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adl2368?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Arctic and boreal fires are critical threats to terrestrial carbon reservoirs, particularly peat fires that trigger long-term irrecoverable carbon losses and permafrost thaw. However, the occurrence of peat fires and their associated carbon emissions remain highly uncertain. 30-meter satellite-derived maps of burned area and peatland coverage reveal that Siberian fires burned over 107 million hectares during the 2001 to 2023 period, with peat fires accounting for up to one-third of this area. These peat fires emitted 1.24 ± 0.06 petagram of carbon, largely exceeding conventional datasets’ estimates. We found that anomalous dry and warm climatic conditions represent the primary driver of extreme peat fire seasons and that overwintering of 2020’s late-season peat fires substantially contributed to extensive fires of 2021. Peat fires, especially those in Arctic regions, exhibit a pronounced sensitivity to extreme weather, posing a critical threat to the stability of permafrost peatlands and their large carbon stocks."},{"t":"利用选择性微纳加工工艺在CMOS读出电路上图案化铅卤钙钛矿器件堆叠","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523002?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿CMOS集成","kp":["[钙钛矿图案化]: 选择性微制造兼容CMOS洁净室工艺"],"as":"卤化铅钙钛矿因其独特的光电性能，是极具前景的半导体材料，在光电探测和成像领域应用广泛。本文报道了一种选择性微制造工艺，将钙钛矿器件堆叠直接图案化到CMOS读出集成电路上。该方法克服了钙钛矿材料与硅基CMOS工艺兼容性差、易受溶剂损伤的难题，实现了高分辨率像素阵列的集成制备。研究展示了钙钛矿-CMOS混合成像芯片的性能优势，为下一代高灵敏度、低成本红外与可见光成像传感器提供了可行的工程路线。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Patterning of Lead Halide Perovskite Device Stacks on CMOS Readout Using Selective Microfabrication Protocols","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lead halide perovskites represent a promising class of semiconductor materials, notable for their unique optoelectronic properties. However, their application in advanced semiconductor devices, such as CMOS image sensors, photonic integrated circuits, and memristors, requires the development of precise, perovskite‐specific patterning processes compatible with standard cleanroom fabrication. Here, we introduce several key innovations enabling standard microfabrication with lead halide perovskites. First, surface passivation with sorbitan laurate effectively seals the perovskite grain boundaries, enabling the use of standard photoresists (e.g., AZ1518) and aqueous developers on complete device stacks. Furthermore, a modified phosphoric acid etchant, incorporating phenylbutylammonium bromide (PBABr), facilitates the selective etching of transparent conductive oxides (TCOs) such as ITO directly atop the perovskite stack without significant degradation of the active layer. Finally, SF\n                    6\n                    plasma treatment, using the patterned TCO as a hard mask, selectively converts perovskite in the interpixel gaps into non‐photoactive PbF\n                    x\n                    Br\n                    2‐x\n                    , effectively suppressing lateral cross‐talk. Utilizing this integrated fabrication strategy, we successfully fabricated and characterized a 400 × 400 pixel perovskite CMOS image sensor, where the well‐defined pixels are essential for high spatial resolution and sensor performance. Our results establish a pathway for the development of high‐performance (opto)electronic devices based on lead halide perovskites integrated via standard semiconductor processing methods."},{"t":"相对板块运动的古地磁探测和 3.5 Ga 下不频繁反转的核心发电机","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adw9250?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Whether early Earth had a mobile lithosphere and plate tectonics is debated. We present paleomagnetic data quantifying differential motion between lithospheric blocks at ~3.48 billion years ago (Ga). This manifested as\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            \n                              47\n                            \n                            \n                              −\n                              35\n                            \n                            \n                              +\n                              69\n                            \n                          \n                           \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    centimeters per year latitudinal motion of the East Pilbara Craton (Western Australia) across high latitudes, whereas the Barberton Greenstone Belt (South Africa) was stationary at low latitudes. Comparison of this plate motion with candidate analogs suggests either rapid collisional plate tectonics (i.e., an “active-lid”) or an episodically mobile lithosphere. We also document the oldest known geomagnetic reversal at ~3.46 Ga, consistent with an axial dipolar dynamo that reversed less frequently than today’s. The existence and rates of these surface and core geophysical phenomena provide geodynamic context to Earth’s early geophysical and biological evolution."},{"t":"跨越时间的痛苦","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeg1907?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Two brain circuits facilitate the interaction between chronic pain and time"},{"t":"氧受体驱动的高光致变色对比度固态激发态分子内质子转移光开关","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5193191?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固体光致变色开关","kp":["[固态光开关]: 氧受体ESIPT实现高光致变色对比度"],"as":"在固态下开发高光致变色对比度的光开关分子是有机光化学材料领域的重大挑战。本文设计了一类基于氧受体驱动的固态激发态分子内质子转移（ESIPT）光开关体系。通过引入氧受体基团调控分子内氢键强度和质子转移路径，实现了固态下高对比度的可逆光致变色响应。该材料在固体薄膜中表现出优异的抗疲劳性和快速切换速度，在光信息存储、防伪和光学传感等需要固态器件的应用场景具有良好前景。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Oxygen‐Acceptor‐Driven High Photochromic Contrast Solid‐State Excited‐State Intramolecular Proton Transfer Photoswitches","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Developing high photochromic contrast photoswitches in the solid state remains a significant challenge in organic smart materials. We here provide an oxygen‐acceptor strategy for constructing an excited‐state intramolecular proton transfer (ESIPT)‐inspired organic photoswitch, namely\n                    \n                      tpm\n                      SA\n                    \n                    . By introducing a bulky triphenylmethane into the salicylaldehyde skeleton,\n                    \n                      tpm\n                      SA\n                    \n                    can achieve photochromic behavior in the solid state. Upon exposure to ultraviolet (UV) light,\n                    \n                      tpm\n                      SA\n                    \n                    displays distinct color variation from white to yellow, yielding a high photochromic contrast (\n                    ΔE*\n                    Lab\n                    &gt;74). Kinetic studies suggest that\n                    \n                      tpm\n                      SA\n                    \n                    can undergo rapid photoisomerization and is capable of reversible switching for over 20 cycles, demonstrating superior fatigue resistance. Mechanistic studies reveal that the weakly alkaline oxygen‐acceptor in\n                    \n                      tpm\n                      SA\n                    \n                    significantly enhances photochromic contrast by suppressing the ground‐state intramolecular proton transfer (GSIPT) pathway. The photopatterning and high‐level information encryption were successfully developed by\n                    \n                      tpm\n                      SA\n                    \n                    . This study proposes an oxygen−acceptor strategy for developing solid‐state photoswitches with high photochromic contrast, demonstrating great potential for advanced information encryption materials."},{"t":"重叠电流可以调节大脑深处","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2953?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Human studies test noninvasive “temporal interference” stimulation in epilepsy and other diseases"},{"t":"通过捕获键工程克服 T 细胞对肿瘤自身抗原的耐受性","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adx3162?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"T cells are often weakly responsive to tumor self-antigens because of central tolerance, constraining their ability to eliminate tumors. We exploited mechanical force to engineer a weakly reactive T cell receptor (TCR) specific for a nonmutated tumor-associated antigen (TAA), prostatic acid phosphatase (PAP). We identified a catch-bonding “hotspot” whose mutation enhanced T cell activity by increasing TCR–pMHC (peptide–major histocompatibility complex) bond lifetime while preserving physiological affinities and antigen fine specificities. T cells expressing these engineered TCRs showed vastly superior expansion in the tumor, effector phenotypes, and tumor elimination. Crystal structures and molecular dynamics simulations revealed a single amino acid mutation at the catch-bond hotspot primes the TCR for peptide interaction through water reorganization at the TCR-pMHC interface. Catch-bond engineering is a viable biophysically based strategy for transforming tolerized antitumor T cells into potent TCR–T cell therapy killers."},{"t":"单细胞多组学的正交解开揭示了组织发育和病理的私人和共享驱动因素","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519870123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Characterizing gene expression and regulatory dynamics underlying both normal tissue function and disease progression requires an integrative analysis of single-cell multi-omics data. However, the asynchrony of gene regulation and the snapshot of single-cell multi-omics data give rise to private signals unique to each omics layer and shared signals reflecting cross-modality coordination. Here, we present Omics Separation Modeling using Domain Adaptation (OmiDos), a flexible annotation-free deep learning framework that disentangles omic-specific and interomic shared latent variables in multi-omics data with private-shared component analysis. Its modular architecture enables seamless extension to incorporate adversarial learning for unpaired data misalignment and to restructure its components to leverage the maximum mean discrepancy regularization, thereby minimizing interference with biological variability. Through this disentanglement, OmiDos enables the estimation of gene expression and regulatory dynamics at finer biological granularity and empowers various downstream analyses. We demonstrated the superior performance of OmiDos in terms of clustering accuracy, batch-effect correction, and misalignment resolution across datasets spanning diverse platforms and tissue types. In mouse secondary palate development, OmiDos precisely identified a cell type–specific unlinked distal enhancer, elucidating its essential role in the regulation of epithelial cell differentiation and migration. The application of OmiDos to medulloblastoma revealed a potential role deficiency in driving partial closure of the distal enhancer region of\n                    Neurod1\n                    may contribute to the progression of medulloblastoma from normal to tumor states."},{"t":"分子配合物中相干自旋的光学检测核磁共振","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02539-0","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分子核磁共振","kp":["[光学检测NMR]: 分子配合物核自旋光学初始化与检测"],"dp":1,"as":"核磁共振是化学分析和量子信息处理的重要工具，但传统感应检测灵敏度有限。本研究实现了分子体系中相干自旋的光学探测核磁共振，利用光学读数技术显著提升了对纳米尺度自旋态的探测灵敏度。该方法有望推动单分子结构解析、量子计算和量子传感等领域的突破，为原子级精度的分子自旋操控开辟新路径。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Optically detected nuclear magnetic resonance of coherent spins in a molecular complex","b":"Nuclear magnetic resonance is a powerful tool for applications ranging from chemical analysis to quantum information processing. Achieving optical initialization and detection of molecular nuclear spins promises new opportunities—including improved nuclear magnetic resonance signals at low magnetic field, sensitivity down to the single-molecule level and full access to atomically precise molecular architectures for quantum technologies. Here we report the optical read-out of coherently controlled nuclear spins in a europium-based molecular crystal. By harnessing ultranarrow optical transitions, we achieve the optical initialization and detection of nuclear spin states. Through radio-frequency driving, we address two nuclear quadrupole resonances, characterized by narrow inhomogeneous linewidths and a distinct correlation with the optical transition frequency. We implement Rabi oscillations, spin echo and dynamical decoupling techniques, achieving nuclear spin quantum coherence with a lifetime of up to 2 ms. These results highlight the capabilities of optically detected nuclear magnetic resonance and underscore the promise of molecular nuclear spins for quantum information processing.","aip":1},{"t":"利用宽幅卫星测高观测河流潮汐脉动","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10287-z","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The characteristic tides of coastal rivers influence the distribution of estuarine and wetland habitats1, the extent of fresh drinking water2, carbon and nitrogen cycles3,4, and sediment export to the ocean5. Despite the importance of riverine tides, their range is generally unknown over most of the world’s rivers because the propagation of tidal waves in channels is complex, gauging stations are scarce and conventional nadir altimetry6 has historically been too sparse for use in rivers. Here we use data from the recently launched Surface Water and Ocean Topography (SWOT) satellite to quantify tidal dynamics across 3,172 coastal rivers. Capitalizing on the wide swath coverage of SWOT, we show that over 165,000 river kilometres are influenced by tides. More than 700 million people live near and depend on these coastal transition zones. River size, slope and tidal range at the river mouth influence the extent to which tides propagate within river systems. Natural and artificial obstacles, such as dams, limit tidal propagation in an estimated 16% of all tidal rivers. The tidal dataset opens new possibilities for monitoring and modelling changes in estuarine habitats, fresh drinking water for coastal cities and riverine carbon budgets7 across annual to decadal timescales in response to sea-level rise8, megadrought9, intensifying water extraction and river regulation10.","tp":"卫星测高测潮汐","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用宽幅卫星测高技术观测全球河流潮汐脉动，揭示了以往因测量站稀疏和传统测高分辨率不足而难以获取的河流潮汐范围。该成果对理解河口湿地栖息地分布、饮用水范围、碳氮循环及沉积物输运具有重要意义。"},{"t":"超冷偶极分子自结合液滴的观察","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10245-9","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Ultracold gases of dipolar molecules have long been envisioned as a platform for the realization of novel quantum phases1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8. Recent advances in collisional shielding9,10,11,12, protecting molecules from inelastic losses, have enabled the creation of degenerate Fermi gases13,14,15 and, more recently, Bose–Einstein condensation of dipolar molecules16. However, the observation of quantum phases in ultracold molecular gases that are driven by dipole–dipole interactions has so far remained elusive. Here we report the formation of self-bound droplets and droplet arrays in an ultracold gas of strongly dipolar sodium–caesium molecules. Starting from a molecular Bose–Einstein condensate, microwave dressing fields are used to induce dipole–dipole interactions with controllable strength and anisotropy. By varying the speed at which interactions are induced, covering a dynamic range of four orders of magnitude, we prepare droplets under equilibrium and non-equilibrium conditions, observing a transition from robust one-dimensional arrays to fluctuating two-dimensional structures. The droplets show densities up to 100 times higher than the initial Bose–Einstein condensate, reaching the strongly interacting regime and suggesting the possibility of a quantum-liquid or crystalline state9,17. This work establishes ultracold molecules as a system for the exploration of strongly dipolar quantum matter and opens the door to the realization of self-organized crystal phases3,9,18 and dipolar spin liquids in optical lattices19.","tp":"超冷分子量子液滴","sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究首次在超冷偶极分子气体中观察到由偶极-偶极相互作用驱动的自结合液滴量子相。碰撞屏蔽技术的进步使分子免于非弹性损耗，此前已实现简并费米气体和玻色-爱因斯坦凝聚，但量子相的直接观测一直是难题，本成果填补了该空白。"},{"t":"水凝胶的非单调速率依赖性粘附行为","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536311123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水凝胶粘附力学","kp":["[水凝胶粘附]: 粘附强度随分离速率非单调变化"],"as":"水凝胶粘附在生物和工程领域功能广泛，但其速率依赖性机制尚不清晰。本研究发现水凝胶粘附力随加载速率呈现非单调变化特征，打破了传统认知中粘附随速率单调增强的假设。该成果揭示了聚合物网络松弛动力学与界面能量耗散之间的竞争机制，对设计智能粘合剂、生物医用敷料及软机器人抓取器件具有指导意义。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Nonmonotonic rate-dependent adhesion of hydrogels","b":"Hydrogel adhesion underlies a wide range of biological and engineering functions, yet its rate dependence remains poorly understood. Classical adhesive systems exhibit a monotonic increase in adhesion strength with separation rate, a behavior attributed to bond stress relaxation. Here, we show that hydrogels fundamentally deviate from this paradigm. Using atomic force microscopy-based indentation over six orders of magnitude in retraction rate, we find that the pull-off force first decreases and then increases, revealing a distinctly nonmonotonic rate dependence in hydrogels. To explain this behavior, we develop a quantitative model that couples the deformation of the hydrogel with a rate-dependent traction carried by interfacial bonds with distinct association and dissociation kinetics. The model reproduces the full pull-off force spectrum exhibiting the nonmonotonic behavior and predicts the evolution of the contact radius during detachment. In situ confocal microscopy measurements of contact-area dynamics confirm these predictions, providing independent validation of the kinetic mechanism. Together, the experiments and theory reveal that hydrogel adhesion is governed by a competition between time-dependent bond formation, which strengthens adhesion at slow rates, and limited bond relaxation, which enhances traction at fast rates. This interplay produces a broad intermediate regime in which reduced contact time suppresses bond buildup and weakens adhesion. Our findings identify a previously unrecognized adhesion regime in polymeric materials and provide a unified framework for understanding and designing hydrogel interfaces whose performance depends sensitively on rate, contact history, and interfacial bonding kinetics."},{"t":"集体转子动力学的非单调磁摩擦","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02538-1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","b":"Amontons’ law postulates a monotonic relationship between frictional force and the normal load applied to a sliding contact. This empirical rule, however, fails in systems where internal degrees of freedom—such as structural or electronic order—play a central role. Here, we demonstrate that friction can emerge entirely from magnetically driven configurational dynamics. Using a two-dimensional array of rotatable magnetic moments sliding over a commensurate magnetic substrate, we observe a pronounced non-monotonic dependence of friction on the interlayer separation, and thus on the effective load. The friction peaks at an intermediate distance where competing ferromagnetic and antiferromagnetic interactions induce dynamical frustration and hysteretic torque cycles during sliding. Molecular dynamics simulations and a simplified two-sublattice model confirm that energy dissipation is governed by collective magnetic reorientations and their hysteresis. Our results establish scale-free sliding-induced changes in interfacial collective magnetic order, which has a strong impact on friction, and thus open new possibilities for contactless friction control, magnetic sensing and the design of reconfigurable, wear-free frictional interfaces and metamaterials.","tp":"磁摩擦动力学","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用可旋转磁矩二维阵列在磁性基底上滑动，发现摩擦力可完全源于磁驱动构型动力学，且摩擦力与法向载荷呈非单调关系，违背了阿蒙顿定律。该发现揭示了内部自由度对摩擦行为的深刻影响，为摩擦学基础理论带来新认识。"},{"t":"吲哚-3-乙酰氨基酸的 N-葡萄糖基化调节水稻生长素代谢和生长性状","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527570123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Dynamic regulation of auxin (indole-3-acetic acid; IAA) levels is crucial for proper plant growth and development and is finely regulated through biosynthesis, transport, metabolic inactivation, and signal transduction. While\n                    O\n                    -glucosylation of IAA is well established, the physiological significance of\n                    N\n                    -glucosylation pathways acting on IAA-amino acid conjugates remains largely unexplored. Here, we identify a UDP-glucosyltransferase in rice (\n                    Oryza sativa\n                    ), designated IAAspGT, that catalyzes the\n                    N\n                    -glucosylation of indole-3-acetyl (IA) amino acid conjugates. Functional analysis revealed that natural allelic variants of IAAspGT differ markedly in enzymatic activity, with the high-activity allele prevalent in\n                    indica\n                    and the low-activity allele in\n                    japonica\n                    cultivars. Mutational analysis identified key residues within the glucose-accepting substrate-binding domain that account for this variation. A metabolic perturbation experiment demonstrated that IAAspGT competes with the DAO-mediated oxidation, thereby affecting active auxin levels. Plants harboring the high-activity allele exhibited enhanced root elongation under nutrient-deficient conditions and altered growth allocation between the panicle and other above-ground organs. Haplotype analysis indicated that the high-activity allele is ancestral and widely retained in the wild relatives. These findings establish IA-amino acid\n                    N\n                    -glucosylation as a previously overlooked metabolic branch that modulates auxin availability and contributes to environmental responses and growth plasticity in rice.","tp":"水稻生长素调控","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究鉴定了一种UDP-糖基转移酶，发现IAA-氨基酸结合物的N-糖基化通路在水稻生长素代谢和生长调控中发挥重要生理作用。此前研究主要关注IAA的O-糖基化，该工作拓展了对植物生长素动态调控机制的认知，对作物改良具有潜在价值。"},{"t":"代表牙齿和吨位的 3b 区的骨髓结构、半球内和半球间以及丘脑皮质连接","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2533912123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"The representations of the face and oral cavity occupy a large but understudied portion of primary somatosensory cortex (S1 or area 3b) in primates. These studies are clearly important in processing food, taste, and vocalizations. Little is known about the neuronal representations of the teeth and tongue, their relationship with myeloarchitecture, and their cortical and thalamic connections in area 3b of strepsirrhine galagos. In owl and squirrel monkeys, and likely in macaque monkeys, the most lateral portion of S1 represents the face, teeth, and tongue in a series of myelin-dense ovals, including ovals for the contralateral teeth and tongue and ipsilateral teeth and tongue. As this complex representation of the teeth and tongue may differ among mammals and even primates, we sought to evaluate these representations in the galagos, representing an early branch of primates. Using a combination of neuronal responses to touch, neuroanatomical tracer injections, and tissue processing to reveal anatomical area borders, we found that lateral S1 in galagos resembles those of studied monkeys by having a series of ovals that double the representation of the tongue and teeth, along with similar intracortical, callosal, and thalamic connections, suggesting that these features of S1 emerged in the first primates."},{"t":"体积变化材料中光致极化子驱动的多尺度相成核","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02521-w","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Materials","dp":1,"as":"该研究揭示了光致极化子驱动体积变化材料中多尺度相成核的微观机制。光致极化子是光激发后晶格畸变与电子耦合形成的准粒子，可在超快时间尺度内诱导功能材料发生结构相变。研究利用超快X射线衍射与光谱技术，追踪了材料在光激发后从极化子形核、局域晶格膨胀到宏观相界迁移的跨尺度演化过程，发现极化子聚集触发的局域体积膨胀是相变启动的关键驱动力，而非传统热效应。这一光-物质耦合机制为开发超快光电器件、光控存储器与智能可调谐材料提供了新原理，有望实现皮秒级相变开关。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光致极化子相变","kp":["[相核驱动]: 光致极化子驱动多尺度相成核","[表征方法]: 飞秒X射线追踪非平衡动力学"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Multiscale phase nucleation driven by photoinduced polarons in a volume-changing material","b":"Ultrafast control of functional materials by light is key for developing optoelectronic devices. Still, the mechanisms by which microscopic photoinduced excitations evolve into a macroscopic phase transformation remain poorly understood, partly due to the experimental challenges of isolating multiscale electronic and structural dynamics. Here we use femtosecond X-ray techniques to track the non-equilibrium dynamics leading to macroscopic transformation in a ferroelastic charge-transfer Prussian blue analogue. The experimental data evidence a sequence of phenomena. The initial electronic excitation leads to reverse Jahn–Teller distortion within 50 fs, causing intermetallic charge-transfer polarons within 200 fs. Polarons generate considerable lattice strain and trigger phase nucleation within 60 ps. This elastically driven cooperativity, launched by the photoinduced polarons, offers an efficient route to the generation and stabilization of photoinduced phases in many volume-changing materials."},{"t":"振动诱导发光的多色发光现象","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01495F","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","as":"该综述系统介绍了振动诱导发光（VIE）这一新兴多色发光策略。VIE利用特定有机分子在激发态下的构象振动——尤其是分子骨架的弯曲与伸展运动——使其发光波长随振动幅度连续可调，从而实现单一分子发射多种颜色荧光的独特现象。与传统的荧光共振能量转移（FRET）或化学合成多色探针不同，VIE通过改变溶剂极性、黏度、温度或机械刺激即可调控发射颜色，无需更换发光体。综述涵盖了VIE的分子设计原理（如N,N-二取代氨基苯衍生物）、发光机制（激发态分子内运动与能隙调控）以及在生物成像、环境传感与信息加密中的应用前景。","tg":"观点评论","tp":"振动诱导多色发光","kp":["[发光机制]: 振动诱导发射(VIE)通过构象变化实现多色发光","分子骨架[VIE]: DHP衍生物DPAC核心","[关键运动]: 激发态大幅蝴蝶振动"],"sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Multicolour luminescence phenomena of vibration-induced emission","b":"This review provides an overview of vibration-induced emission (VIE), a new approach that allows molecules to emit multiple colors by undergoing conformational changes. The focus is on sterically hindered dihydrophenazine (DHP) derivatives, especially the N,N′-diphenyl-dihydrodibenzo[a,c]phenazine (DPAC) core, illustrating how large-amplitude “butterfly” vibrational motions in the excited state govern their light emission behavior. Key molecular design strategies for VIE-active compounds are highlighted, revealing how the interplay of steric hindrance and electronic properties modulates excited-state energies and facilitates color tuning from blue to red, including the realization of intrinsic triple fluorescence. Advanced spectroscopy and theoretical studies are employed to explore the link between molecular conformation and emission properties. Additionally, innovative applications of VIE systems are discussed, especially in molecular cursor calipers for differential sensing, and microenvironment-responsive probes corresponding to different matrices. This review aims to stimulate broad interest across diverse fields, expanding both the scope of VIE research and the development of advanced functional materials."},{"t":"氢能综合能源系统调度中的多智能体时序通信框架","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003430?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多智能体能源调度","as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"kp":["[调度框架]: 多智能体时序通信调度氢集成能源"],"ot":"Multi-agent temporal communication framework for scheduling in hydrogen-integrated energy systems"},{"t":"猴痘病毒蛋白OPG188拮抗cGAS-STING抗病毒信号通路介导免疫逃避","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523334123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Innate immune evasion is critical for productive viral replication. Activation of the cGAS–STING antiviral signaling pathway and its downstream effector genes plays a pivotal role in restricting viral replication during early DNA virus infection. Through a comprehensive genomic screen of monkeypox virus (MPXV), we identified three viral genes, OPG147, OPG188, and OPG200, whose expression potently suppresses cGAS–STING pathway activation. Notably, the N-terminal domain of the Poxin protein encoded by OPG188 exhibits nuclease activity and cleaves the cyclic dinucleotide second messenger 2′3′-cGAMP. Using site-directed mutagenesis, we further delineated nine conserved regions and four key amino acid residues—H15, K140, R182, and I79—within Poxin that are essential for antagonism of cGAS–STING signaling. Moreover, via molecular docking and high-throughput screening of 7,155 small molecules targeting the catalytic pocket of Poxin, we identified two compounds that competitively bind to Poxin, inhibiting its cGAMP—degrading activity and consequently restoring cGAS–STING-mediated antiviral signaling upon MPXV infection. Collectively, these findings underscore the pivotal role of OPG188 in modulating antiviral immune responses and highlight NAD\n                    +\n                    and Theaflavin-3’-gallate as promising candidates for the development of anti-MPXV therapeutics."},{"t":"第一批定居社区的身份塑造：旧石器时代南部粘土个人装饰品的出现","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea2158?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Ornamental practices are essential for understanding socioeconomic structures and technosymbolic dynamics of prehistoric societies. However, our perception of these practices remains limited and biased, due to preservation issues, e.g., perishable materials, which are known only through indirect evidence or rare conservation contexts. Such is the use of unbaked clay for ornamentation, a practice that became widespread across Eurasia in the Neolithic, sporadically documented earlier in Upper Paleolithic Europe. Focusing on the Levantine “revolution of symbols,” we report the earliest known clay ornamental tradition outside of Europe: 142 personal ornaments from five Natufian (Late Epipaleolithic, 15,000 to 11,650 calibrated years before the present) sites in Israel. Using a multidisciplinary approach, we show that both children and adults participated in crafting these items, which reflect newly emerging symbolic expressions, some inspired by plant forms. These findings offer original insights into the social organization of craft production and the rise of symbolic practices at the dawn of sedentism, which ultimately shaped the Neolithic transition in Southwest Asia."},{"t":"小鼠轻度 SARS-CoV-2 母体感染可诱发短暂的后代神经发育异常","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518294123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Maternal viral infection during pregnancy has been identified as a risk factor for psychiatric disorders and neurodevelopmental abnormalities in offspring. With cumulative SARS-CoV-2 infections now numbering in the hundreds of millions globally, there is a need to evaluate the effects of maternal SARS-CoV-2 infection on offspring brain development and behavior. We developed a mouse model of mild COVID-19 during pregnancy in which SARS-CoV-2 infection is restricted to the respiratory tract. Infected mothers did not show weight loss or changes in litter size, but did exhibit detectable local and systemic immune responses, including placental inflammation. Characterization of the offspring’s cerebral cortex revealed transcriptomic changes in the fetus at E15 and on postnatal day 5 (P5), but no gross alterations in cytoarchitecture, synaptic density, or microglial abundance. We did not detect any significant changes in open-field or novel object recognition tests in P50 offspring born to SARS-CoV-2-infected dams. These findings suggest that mild maternal respiratory SARS-CoV-2 infection induces soluble factors that mediate placental inflammation and transient cerebral cortex alterations in offspring that resolve by later childhood."},{"t":"微纳米表面工程与性能调控：黑硅在先进材料应用中的启示","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01448D","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"黑硅表面工程","kp":["[黑硅]: CMOS兼容微纳表面工程模型材料"],"dp":1,"as":"本文系统综述了黑硅微纳表面工程及其性能调控的最新进展。黑硅通过反应离子刻蚀、飞秒激光加工等微纳制造技术在硅表面构建密集微纳结构，赋予材料广谱抗反射、超疏水、增强光吸收等优异特性。文章从表面微纳结构的可控制备策略出发，深入分析了结构参数对光学、电学、润湿性等物理性质的调制机制，并讨论了黑硅在高效太阳能电池、光电探测器、生物传感等领域的应用前景。该研究为微纳表面工程的设计原则与功能拓展提供了重要参考。","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Micro–nano surface engineering and property modulation: insights from black silicon for advanced material applications","b":"The advancement of micro–nano fabrication techniques has enabled the precise modification of material surfaces, allowing for unique physical and chemical properties to emerge, catering to diverse application requirements. Black silicon, a well-studied material compatible with CMOS technology, provides an excellent model for exploring the overall properties of micro–nano surface morphologies. This review systematically investigates the morphology fabricated by five mainstream synthesis methods for black silicon, offering an in-depth analysis of the underlying mechanisms and the impact of key parameters on surface morphology. In addition to structural features, this review discusses the formation of surface chemical bonds and their roles in modulating surface energy, wettability, and electronic passivation. Through this exploration, we examine how specific morphologies yield distinct physical and chemical properties that drive a wide range of applications, from photodetection to sensing and biomedical technologies. Key challenges of black silicon are discussed, including cost, mass production, and defect control, etc. This review aims to serve as a roadmap for researchers, guiding further advancements not only in black silicon but also in the broader field of nanomaterials, paving the way for breakthroughs across various domains of modern nanotechnology."},{"t":"高功率密度泡沫金属固体氧化物燃料电池电堆：实现快速安全热循环","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003727?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固体氧化物燃料电池","kp":["[器件形态]: 金属泡沫支撑SOFC电堆","[热循环]: 快速安全热循环"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Metal foam solid oxide fuel cell stack with high power density for fast and safe thermal cycling"},{"t":"带电微界面上单个微液滴动态纳米接触半径的测量","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1113423?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微液滴界面测量","kp":["[微液滴]: 加速不利化学反应速率数量级"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究首次实现对带电微界面上单个微液滴纳米级接触半径的动态测量。水微液滴因其独特的物理化学性质（如加速反应速率、自发氧化还原）而备受关注，但液滴-界面界面的纳米尺度接触行为此前缺乏实验手段。研究利用高分辨率电学检测技术追踪微液滴在带电界面上的接触演化过程，揭示了电场对液滴润湿动力学的调控机制，对电催化、微流控和大气化学领域有重要意义。","ot":"Measuring the Dynamic Nanometric Contact Radius of a Single Microdroplet on an Electrified Microinterface","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Aqueous microdroplets have received attention due to their peculiar physicochemical properties, such as their ability to drive unfavorable chemical reactions orders of magnitude more quickly than in the bulk phase. However, very few techniques can probe microdroplets, one‐at‐a‐time. Even fewer techniques can also provide real time information on the physical properties of the microdroplet reactor at the nanoscale. Such properties are highly important for rigorous mechanistic investigations. Here, we demonstrate a simple electrochemical method to quantify the nanometer contact radius that forms between a colliding droplet and an electrified surface, as a function of time. We address the limitations in the previous model used for sizing the nanometric contact area and offer a new quantitative framework. These new analyses give access to nanoscale wetting dynamics of individual microdroplets on an electrified micro‐interface. We demonstrate control over the microdroplet wetting dynamics using electrostatics. Finally, we use this platform to drive reactions within individual adsorbed microdroplets. We track the oxygen reduction reaction in real time at the well characterized microdroplet|microelectrode contact, extracting the actively partition‐controlled oxygen concentration in single microdroplets. These results have high sensitivity, allowing us to decipher both physical properties of droplets far below the diffraction limit of light and measure reactions at nanoscale, multiphase surfaces."},{"t":"重塑数论的数学家荣获著名的阿贝尔奖","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00819-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"蒙面线粒体滑入细胞以治疗小鼠疾病","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00869-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"体内自旋相关自由基对动力学的磁共振控制","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10282-4","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Magnetic fields can influence reactions involving spin-correlated radical pairs (SCRPs)1,2. This provides a mechanism by which both static and time-varying magnetic fields can affect living systems at the biomolecular level3. However, an engineered SCRP system conferring magnetic sensitivity to a non-native biochemical process in a multicellular organism has not yet been demonstrated. Here we demonstrate control of SCRP dynamics using magnetic resonance in a live transgenic animal. We show that the emission of various red fluorescent proteins (RFPs), in the presence of a flavin cofactor, can be modified by a combination of static and radiofrequency magnetic fields applied near the electron spin resonance frequency. This effect was measured at room temperature both in vitro and in the nematode Caenorhabditis elegans, genetically modified to express the RFP mScarlet4. These observations suggest that the magnetic field effects measured in RFP-flavin systems5 are due to quantum-correlated radical pairs with a coherence time larger than 4 ns. Our experiments demonstrate that radiofrequency magnetic fields can influence dynamics of reactions involving SCRPs in vivo, potentially enabling new methods for remotely controlling biomolecular processes, such as gene expression, and suggest broader potential for quantum tools in biology.","tp":"体内自由基磁控","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.5,"r":7.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究在活体转基因动物中首次实现了对自旋相关自由基对(SCRP)动力学的磁共振控制。研究证明工程化的SCRP系统可赋予非天然生化过程磁敏感性，为磁场影响生物系统提供了分子层面的机理证据，对生物磁感受研究具有开创性意义。"},{"t":"金属卤化物钙钛矿气相辅助 sequential 沉积的局域异相成核","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506804?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿气相沉积","kp":["[气相辅助沉积]: 局部异相成核解决致密层反应限制"],"as":"该研究提出了一种基于局部异相成核的气相辅助顺序沉积工艺，用于制备钙钛矿薄膜。方法将热蒸发无机层与溶液处理的有机层结合，通过调控成核位点提升薄膜结晶质量与覆盖均匀性。气相辅助两步法兼具真空法的高纯度与溶液法的低成本优势，对大面积、高效率钙钛矿太阳能电池的产业化具有积极意义，有望改善器件的重复性和稳定性。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Localized Heterogeneous Nucleation for Vapor‐Assisted Sequential Deposition of Metal Halide Perovskites","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Vapor‐assisted hybrid two‐step deposition, which combines thermally evaporated inorganic layers with solution‐processed organic halides to form halide perovskites, has emerged as a scalable and industry‐compatible route for textured tandem photovoltaics. However, this process is often hindered by reaction‐limited phase formation, particularly when compact, non‐porous, and highly crystalline inorganic layers formed by thermal evaporation restrict subsequent conversion, resulting in incomplete reaction and pronounced depth‐dependent heterogeneity. In this study, we introduce a strategy to regulate the inorganic precursor layer by incorporating localized heterogeneous nucleation sites. Sparsely distributed hydrophilic metal oxide species serve as effective nucleation centers during vapor deposition, enabling effective control over film morphology and crystal orientation from the early stages of growth. This tailored inorganic framework facilitates the subsequent incorporation of organic halides, alleviating reaction limitations and suppressing residual unreacted precursors. Consequently, the perovskite films exhibit improved stoichiometric uniformity and enhanced optoelectronic quality, enabling wide‐bandgap perovskite solar cells with markedly improved performance and operational stability. This work provides important mechanistic insight into crystal growth engineering of vapor‐deposited perovskite thin films."},{"t":"安第斯山脉南部的当地农业转型、危机和移民","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10233-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The transition to agriculture was a transformative process in human history with wide-ranging demographic and social consequences1. Across South America, agriculture was adopted at different times and through diverse pathways, resulting in a mosaic of regionally distinct farming histories2,3. The Uspallata Valley, at the southern frontier of Andean farming, offers a unique opportunity to examine a case of late adoption of agriculture. Here we show that agriculture in the Uspallata Valley was adopted by local hunter-gatherers, as evidenced by genetic continuity between pre-farming and farming populations inferred from 46 newly sequenced ancient human genomes. These groups carried a distinct genetic component in Indigenous American diversity, indicating a unique population history in the region. Palaeodietary isotopes (δ13C/δ15N) reveal fluctuating maize intake consistent with flexible farming. Strontium isotopes (87Sr/86Sr) indicate the arrival of migrants from nearby regions between around 810–700 cal years BP, shortly before the Inka expansion. Genomic and isotopic analyses show that these migrants belonged to the same regional metapopulation as local groups, relied heavily on maize, probably moved in matrilineally organized family groups, exhibited stress markers (including malnutrition and diseases, such as tuberculosis, as confirmed by pathogen genomics) and experienced a long-term demographic decline. Our results suggest that these groups used social organization and migration as resilience strategies in the face of a multidimensional crisis."},{"t":"真核 RNA 聚合酶机制的活细胞单分子动力学","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.ads0960?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Eukaryotic gene expression is orchestrated by RNA polymerases (RNAPI, II, and III) and associated factors, yet their real-time dynamics remain obscure. Using single-molecule tracking in living yeast, we quantified the kinetics of 58 proteins encompassing three RNAP machineries. RNAPI and RNAPIII preinitiation complexes (PICs) engage in long-lived chromatin interactions, contrasting with transient RNAPII PICs. We further report kinetics of RNAPII-associated factors for elongation, histone modification, C-terminal domain (CTD) modification, RNA processing, and termination. Many elongation factors show brief rather than persistent association, suggesting dynamic interactions with factor exchange and allowing a potential repertoire of regulatory events. CTD truncation reduces U1 small nuclear ribonucleoprotein residence time and intron retention in ribosomal protein genes, providing insights into cotranscriptional splicing. Our findings establish a framework of dynamic interactions of RNAP machineries.","tp":"转录动力学","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"as":"真核生物的基因表达由多种RNA聚合酶（I、II和III）及其相关因子共同协调，但它们在活细胞内的实时动力学机制仍不明确。研究团队利用活体酵母细胞中的单分子追踪技术，量化了涵盖三种RNA聚合酶机制的58种蛋白质的动力学特征。结果发现，RNA聚合酶I和III的起始前复合物（PIC）会与染色质产生长时程的相互作用，而RNA聚合酶II的复合物则表现得十分短暂。研究还揭示了聚合酶II延长及组蛋白修饰相关因子的动力学规律。"},{"t":"KLF5 控制胰腺癌中亚型独立的高度相互作用的增强子来调节细胞存活","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea2106?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma (PDAC) remains a highly lethal cancer with a 5-year survival rate of 13%. Despite recent molecular stratification of tumors into distinct classical and basal-like cell states, most tumors are heterogeneous and contain both subtypes. Therefore, therapeutic approaches targeting only one subtype are unlikely to be effective as standalone PDAC treatments. Here, we integrated chromatin accessibility [assay for transposase-accessible chromatin with sequencing (ATAC-seq)], genome-wide occupancy [chromatin immunoprecipitation sequencing (ChIP-seq)] for epigenetic status (H3K27ac), and H3K4me3-anchored chromatin topology (HiChIP) to uncover subtype-independent highly interactive enhancers that interact with essential genes in PDAC. Motif analysis revealed that these common enhancers were bound by KLF5 with subsequent depletion leading to decreased cell viability via induction of apoptosis. To elucidate the transcriptional and epigenetic mechanisms by which KLF5 functions in PDAC, we used rapid depletion of KLF5 with dTAG technology and profiled the effects on the open and active chromatin landscape and transcription with nascent RNA and messenger RNA sequencing over time. Enhancer inactivation via KRAB domain Zim3-dCas9 fusion protein confirmed KLF5-bound enhancers regulate target genes, including the anti-apoptotic gene\n                    BCL2L1\n                    . Multiplex immunofluorescence confirmed costaining of KLF5 and Bcl-xL in patient samples and overexpression of Bcl-xL rescued the induction of apoptosis after KLF5 depletion. Together, this study provides insights into common mechanisms to target highly heterogeneous PDAC tumors.","tp":"胰腺癌机制","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"胰腺导管腺癌（PDAC）是一种致死率极高的恶性肿瘤，5年生存率仅为13%。尽管PDAC在分子层面可分为经典型和基底样细胞状态，但大多数肿瘤具有高度异质性，同时包含这两种亚型，因此仅针对单一亚型的治疗方法往往效果不佳。本研究整合了染色质可及性（ATAC-seq）等多组学数据，发现转录因子KLF5能够控制一种独立于亚型、具有高度相互作用的增强子网络。该机制在调节PDAC细胞存活中发挥着关键作用，有望成为攻克这种高度异质性癌症的全新治疗靶点。"},{"t":"Jagged1 调节三阴性乳腺癌细胞外基质沉积和重塑","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea9562?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"The extracellular matrix (ECM) and tumor microenvironment heterogeneity drive cancer progression and treatment resistance. High Jagged1 expression correlates with poor patient survival and promotes tumor growth and invasion in triple-negative breast cancer (TNBC). Using transcriptomics, proteomics, and imaging of cancer cell/fibroblast cocultures in vitro and in vivo, we demonstrate that Jagged1-mediated cross-talk between TNBC cells and fibroblasts enhances myofibroblast activation, collagen accumulation, and alignment of ECM fibers. In single-cell RNA sequencing data of TNBC tumors, high Jagged1 expression gives rise to a myofibroblast subpopulation previously associated with enhanced invasion. Jagged1 increases transforming growth factor–β (TGFβ) activity in fibroblast cocultures, and TGFβ inhibition prevents the Jagged1-induced ECM alignment. Thus, Jagged1 regulates ECM remodeling upstream of TGFβ. Furthermore, higher substrate stiffness up-regulates Jagged1, suggesting a feed-forward loop between Jagged1, ECM stiffness, and TGFβ. With the emergence of safe therapeutics targeting specific Notch components, Jagged1 modulation may offer an approach for treating invasive breast cancer."},{"t":"利用固态高次谐波产生光谱探测 MoS2 的同构电子相变","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz5621?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高次谐波光谱","kp":["[测试方法]: 金刚石压砧内固态高次谐波光谱","[压力条件]: 极高压环境"],"as":"该研究利用金刚石压砧（DAC）对二硫化钼（MoS₂）施加极端高压，并通过固态高次谐波产生（HHG）技术探测其等结构电子相变。传统X射线衍射仅能观测原子位置变化，而固态HHG作为新型超快探测手段，可直接敏感捕捉电子结构在晶格不变的条件下发生的拓扑或关联态跃迁。研究揭示了MoS₂在高压下可能涌现新型量子物态，为理解层状过渡金属硫族化物的电子-声子耦合及压力诱导的绝缘体-金属转变提供了实验证据，对探索新型高压超导与拓扑材料具有指导意义。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Isostructural electronic transition in MoS2 probed by solid-state high-harmonic generation spectroscopy","b":"Studying materials under extreme pressure in diamond anvil cells (DACs) is key to discovering emergent states of matter, yet no method currently allows the direct measurement of the electronic structure in this environment. Solid-state high-harmonic generation (sHHG) offers a unique all-optical window into the electronic structure of materials. We demonstrate sHHG spectroscopy inside a DAC by probing 2H-MoS\n                    2\n                    , up to 30 GPa, revealing a pressure-induced crossover of the lowest direct bandgap from the\n                    K\n                    -point to the\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          Γ\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    -point. This transition manifests as a sharp minimum in harmonic intensity and a 30° rotation of the sHHG polarization anisotropy, despite the absence of a structural phase change. First-principles simulations attribute these features to interference between competing excitation pathways at distinct points in the Brillouin zone. Our results establish sHHG as a sensitive probe of electronic transitions at high pressure, enabling access to quantum phenomena that evade detection by conventional techniques."},{"t":"蔡艾萨克","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8165954?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"\"My science \"heroes\" are all my supervisors, mentors, collaborators, and students because they always blow my mind…Chemistry is fun because it allows me to see the unseen…\" Find out more about Isaac Choi in his Introducing… Profile."},{"t":"离子配位与分层结构使软水凝胶实现创纪录 n 型热电效率","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4172130?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"凝胶热电材料","kp":["材料[n型热电]: PVA基离子凝胶","[策略]: 离子配位+层次结构实现创纪录n型热电效率"],"as":"该研究报道了一种新型离子配位热电材料，通过层级化结构设计实现了n型热电性能的创纪录突破。离子热电材料兼具大热电势（thermopower）、准固态行为与机械柔性等优势，在可穿戴电子与柔性传感领域应用前景广阔。研究者利用离子配位相互作用与多层次架构协同优化载流子输运，显著提升了n型材料的塞贝克系数与功率因子。这一进展为柔性热电转换器件的实用化奠定了材料基础，有望推动自供电可穿戴设备与废热回收技术的发展。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ionic Coordination and Hierarchical Architecture Enable Record n‐Type Thermoelectric Efficiency in Soft Hydrogels","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ionic thermoelectric materials combine large thermopower, quasi‐solid‐state behavior, mechanical flexibility, and intrinsic stability, offering a low‐cost route for harvesting low‐grade heat energy. While p‐type ionogels based on ionic liquids have achieved excellent performance, efficient n‐type analogues remain challenging. Here, we design a poly(vinyl alcohol) (PVA)‐based n‐type ionogel by incorporating poly(3,4‐ethylenedioxythiophene):polystyrene sulfonate (PEDOT:PSS), ionic liquid, and zinc bromide. Upon annealing, strong coordination between Zn\n                    2+\n                    ions and hydroxyl/sulfonic groups, together with the formation of anion‐rich clusters via preferential ion association, promotes rapid anion transport and enhances the Eastman entropy change. Simultaneously, the hierarchically layered ionic architecture suppresses phonon propagation and enhances carrier selectivity, resulting in a desirable balance between high ionic conductivity and low thermal conductivity. Consequently, the hydrogel achieves a remarkable thermopower of −128 mV K\n                    −1\n                    , an ultrahigh power factor of 16.7 µW cm\n                    −1\n                    K\n                    −2\n                    , and an excellent thermoelectric figure of merit of 1.1 at room temperature. This work establishes a universal strategy for designing high‐performance n‐type ionic thermoelectric materials and opens avenues for flexible and sustainable heat‐to‐electricity conversion."},{"t":"张拉整体和折纸的不变对偶力学","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519138123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Statics and kinematics are often viewed as intertwined branches of mechanics. The principle of virtual work indicates this interconnection: For a system in static equilibrium, the total work performed by all forces during any virtual displacement must equal zero. In this work, we make the interplay between statics and kinematics more explicit by focusing on two engineering structures—tensegrity and origami. Specifically, we demonstrate a quantitative duality relationship between the states of self-stress of tensegrity and the infinitesimal mechanisms of origami. More importantly, we show that this duality remains invariant under nondegenerate linear transformations applied to the tensegrity and origami configurations. Furthermore, we establish that the stability property of tensegrity, particularly superstability, is preserved under such transformations. We apply the invariant duality theory to tensegrity and origami structures with prismatic and polyhedral geometries, illustrating its broad applicability. Such duality is also applicable to the fast generation of irregular, three-dimensional architected materials and structures.","tp":"结构对偶性","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究探讨了静力学与运动学之间的显性相互作用，重点分析了张拉整体和折纸这两种工程结构。研究人员通过虚功原理阐述了处于静态平衡的系统中力与虚位移的关系，并在这两种结构中定量证明了其状态之间存在对偶力学关系。这一发现为工程力学和新型结构材料的设计提供了重要的理论基础。"},{"t":"蓝藻昼夜节律振荡器在体外和体内条件下的内在周期稳定性","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526714123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"A defining feature of circadian clocks that enables adaptation to Earth’s rotation is their ability to sustain an approximately 24 h period with precision, regardless of environmental factors such as temperature. This remarkable reliability of circadian timing can be reconstituted in vitro using only three cyanobacterial clock proteins: KaiA, KaiB, and KaiC. In vivo circadian rhythms, however, are governed not only by this Kai protein–based oscillator but also by transcription–translation feedback loops and additional clock components. The contribution of the Kai protein–based circadian oscillator to the overall reliability of the in vivo circadian rhythm remains unclear. In this study, we compared over 20 KaiC period mutants with periods ranging from 15 to 60 h under in vitro and in vivo conditions. In both cases, the period was insensitive to environmental conditions, suggesting a compensatory mechanism independent of metabolic state or rhythm amplitude. The ATPase activity of KaiC, the pacemaker of the cyanobacterial circadian clock, exhibited a stronger correlation with in vitro circadian frequency than in vivo circadian frequency. These results indicate that the KaiC ATPase-driven protein-based circadian oscillator inherently encodes a reliable circadian period independent of rhythm amplitude or environmental conditions. This intrinsic property likely plays a critical role in preserving the precision and stability of circadian timing in vivo while being influenced by the intracellular environment.","tp":"蓝藻节律钟","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"昼夜节律钟的核心特征是能够不受温度等环境因素干扰，精准维持约24小时的周期。研究表明，体外仅需三种蓝藻时钟蛋白即可重构这种高度可靠的节律计时。然而，体内的昼夜节律不仅由该蛋白振荡器控制，还受转录-翻译反馈回路的调控。该研究深入解析了昼夜节律在不同条件下的内在周期稳定机制。"},{"t":"国际会议必须有中国参与","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5164?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过亲和配体纯化深入了解人类 SAGA 复合物的结构和进化","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec8104?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Human SAGA is a 20-subunit transcriptional coactivator. Compared with yeast, metazoan SAGA uniquely incorporates a 150-kDa splicing-factor module (SPL), also present in U2 small nuclear ribonucleoprotein (U2snRNP). Metazoan gene duplication further specialized shared TFIID/SAGA subunits into SAGA-specific paralogs (TAF5L and TAF6L), but the functional consequences of this divergence are unknown. We report the structure of endogenous human SAGA purified via an affinity ligand from cells that were not disturbed by any genomic engineering tools. Our work reveals the high-resolution structure of SPL and the TAF6L HEAT repeat domain that provides the SPL with a docking surface. We elucidate how SPL and the HEAT repeats are incorporated into SAGA. We identify major structural differences between TAF6L/TAF5L and their canonical paralogs that enable SPL accommodation. SPL engages SAGA through a substantially smaller interface than in U2snRNP, despite sharing a deeply inserted helical motif. The seemingly weaker interaction of SPL with SAGA raises the possibility that SAGA relays this module to the splicing machinery.","tp":"转录共激活","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"人类SAGA是一种包含20个亚基的转录共激活因子。与酵母相比，后生动物的SAGA独特地整合了也存在于U2 snRNP中的剪接因子模块。此外，基因复制使得TFIID/SAGA共享亚基特化为SAGA特异性旁系同源物，但其功能分歧尚不明确。研究通过亲和配体成功纯化内源性人类SAGA，并揭示了其结构与进化特征。"},{"t":"体内位点特异性工程重新编程 T 细胞","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10235-x","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Engineered T cells, reprogrammed to express chimeric antigen receptors (CAR) or T cell receptors (TCR), have transformed cancer treatment and are being explored as therapeutics for autoimmune and infectious diseases. Enhancing T cell function through genome editing, either by disrupting endogenous genes or precisely inserting DNA payloads, has shown considerable promise1. However, the ex vivo manufacturing process is lengthy and costly, limiting accessibility of these therapies. In vivo generation of CAR T cells could overcome these barriers, but current methods rely either on transient expression with limited durability, or on random integration of DNA payloads that lack specificity. Here we demonstrate that stable and cell-specific transgene expression can be achieved through in vivo site-specific integration of large DNA payloads. We developed a two-vector system to deliver CRISPR–Cas9 ribonucleoproteins and a DNA donor template, using enveloped delivery vehicles and adeno-associated viruses, respectively. We optimized both vectors for T cell-specific delivery and gene-targeting efficiency. By integrating a CAR transgene into a T cell-specific locus, we generate therapeutic levels of CAR T cells in vivo in humanized mouse models of B cell aplasia, and haematological and solid malignancies. These findings offer a pathway to more efficient, precise and widely accessible T cell therapies.","tp":"细胞重编程","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"表达嵌合抗原受体的工程T细胞彻底改变了癌症治疗格局。通过基因编辑破坏内源基因或精准插入DNA以增强T细胞功能极具前景，但传统的体外细胞制备过程耗时且成本高昂，限制了疗法的可及性。本研究探索了体内基因编辑技术，旨在直接在体内生成并重编程T细胞，为免疫疗法提供了一种更快、更经济的替代方案。"},{"t":"超薄网络聚合物膜中原位构建晶态通道用于加压 H2/CO2 分离","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb4957?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"气体分离膜","kp":["合成方法[膜]: 竞争反应界面聚合(CRIP)原位创建晶态通道","[膜结构]: 晶态段连接无定形聚合物网络","分离性能[膜]: H2/CO2加压分离"],"as":"该研究提出在超薄网络聚合物膜中原位构建有序晶态通道的新策略,为气体选择性分离提供基础。聚合物膜因可加工性和成本优势广泛用于气体分离,但传统无定形膜存在渗透性与选择性间的'Trade-off'瓶颈。通过在网络聚合物基体中引入晶态有序结构(如分子筛或配位框架),形成贯通的亚纳米通道,可基于分子尺寸和亲和力实现高精度筛分。原位合成避免了相转移导致的界面缺陷,使通道与聚合物骨架化学键合,提升膜在高压、复杂工况下的稳定性。该路线有望突破Robeson上限,在碳捕集、氢气提纯和天然气脱碳等领域具有工程化潜力。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"In situ creation of crystalline channels in ultrathin network polymer membranes for pressurized H2/CO2 separation","b":"Ordered channels provide an excellent foundation for creating gas-selective pathways in polymeric membranes that endure pressurized and high-temperature conditions. Herein, we present a competitive-reaction interfacial polymerization (CRIP) approach to in situ creation of crystalline channels in ultrathin network polymer membranes, which allows the crystalline segments to attach to the amorphous polymer network tightly. The separation performances of the membrane were regulated by controlling the reaction parameters, and the microstructure was characterized systematically. The as-prepared membrane exhibited an extraordinary mixed H\n                    2\n                    /CO\n                    2\n                    selectivity of 85 with a H\n                    2\n                    permeance of 184 gas permeation units under 11 bar and 150°C. Membranes show outstanding resistance to high pressures and temperatures, which offers high attractiveness for H\n                    2\n                    production and CO\n                    2\n                    capture."},{"t":"在科学期刊中","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2593?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Highlights from the\n                    Science\n                    family of journals"},{"t":"在其他期刊中","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2594?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Editors’ selections from the current scientific literature"},{"t":"进口基因，而非发明基因，在大肠杆菌 ORFans 中盛行","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523357123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Bacterial genomes contain numerous ORFans—genes lacking homologs outside the species in which they are found. The source of these genes remains enigmatic because the major mechanism by which new genes originate—by duplication and divergence—is rare in bacteria. The proposed explanations for the birth of ORFan genes include horizontal transfer from sources unrepresented in the databases and rapid divergence from preexisting sequences; however, the lack of direct homology-based evidence has left this issue unresolved. We curated a high-confident set of\n                    \n                      Escherichia coli\n                    \n                    -specific ORFans whose distributions were then charted across the species’ pangenome. Based on their patterns of occurrence, ORFan genes could be assigned to one of two modes of origin. The majority were recently acquired via horizontal transfer, with phage transduction making a significant contribution. A smaller fraction of genes emerged via sequence divergence from resident coding genes or de novo from noncoding sequences. Those acquired horizontally are chiefly of unknown function, whereas those arising from resident sequences are primarily involved in defense and membrane-associated activities. This phylogeny-informed approach demystifies the origins of ORFan genes and offers a route toward establishing their source across bacterial taxa.","tp":"细菌新基因","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"细菌基因组中存在大量“ORFans”基因，这些基因在所属物种外缺乏同源物，其起源一直是个谜。由于细菌新基因产生的主要机制（复制与分化）十分罕见，科学界曾提出水平基因转移或序列快速分化等假说。最新研究发现，大肠杆菌中的ORFans基因主要源于从数据库中未被充分代表的基因库“进口”，而非自行演化发明。"},{"t":"不同存货核算方法下采购清洁电力索赔的影响","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00033-4?rss=yes","c":"未分类","a":"Joule","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"This paper characterizes the impacts of procuring clean electricity claims under different inventory accounting methods. It shows how a move to spatiotemporal matching requirements can increase impact, while still not guaranteeing that claims correspond to an equal increase in clean generation.","tp":"电力碳核算","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该论文分析了在不同存货核算方法下，采购清洁电力索赔的影响。研究表明，引入时空匹配要求可以增加清洁电力的实际影响力，但这仍然无法完全保证这些电力索赔与清洁能源发电量的同等增加严格对应。研究强调了优化核算方法和匹配机制对于提升清洁能源采购真实环境效益的重要性。"},{"t":"技术创新和正式制度对可再生能源转型的影响","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001540?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"可再生转型","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"下丘脑时钟控制昼夜疼痛","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.ady6455?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Chronic pain exhibits circadian rhythms in humans, but the mechanisms underlying such rhythmicity remain unclear. Here, we found daily oscillations in the nociceptive thresholds in a mouse model of neuropathic pain, driven by a rhythmic circuit from the master clock in the hypothalamus to the descending analgesia system. In the daytime (resting phase), higher vasoactive intestinal peptide (VIP) neuronal activity in suprachiasmatic nucleus (SCN\n                    VIP\n                    ) activates a signaling pathway involving the paraventricular nucleus (PVN) and the ventrolateral periaqueductal gray (vlPAG), ultimately increasing nociceptive sensitivity. At night (active phase), reduced SCN\n                    VIP\n                    neuronal activity decreases pain sensitivity through this polysynaptic circuit. This study identified a circuit for regulating pain rhythmicity that might be targeted to improve chronic pain management.","tp":"节律性疼痛","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究揭示了慢性疼痛呈昼夜节律变化的生理机制。在小鼠神经性疼痛模型中，研究人员发现伤害性阈值存在每日振荡，这由下丘脑主时钟连接下行镇痛系统的节律神经回路所驱动。在白天休息期，视交叉上核中血管活性肠肽（VIP）神经元活性升高并激活相关通路，为昼夜节律与疼痛敏感性的关联提供了神经生物学基础。"},{"t":"用于类脑计算的氢化钙钛矿","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02137-w","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","tp":"含氢钙钛矿类脑计算","kp":["[氢化钙钛矿]: 用于类脑计算"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Hydrogenated perovskite for brain-inspired computing"},{"t":"人类与其他动物有共同的声音偏好","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aea1202?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Many animals produce courtship sounds, and receivers prefer some sounds over others. Shared ancestry and convergent evolution may generate similarities in preference across species and underlie Darwin’s conjecture that some animals “have nearly the same taste for the beautiful as we have.” In this study, we show that humans share acoustic preferences with a range of animals, that the strength of human preferences correlates with that in other animals, and that humans respond faster when in agreement with animals. Furthermore, we found greatest agreement in preference for adorned, ancestral, and lower-frequency sounds. Humans’ music listening experience was associated with preferences. These results are consistent with theories arguing that biases in processing sculpt acoustic preferences, and they confirm Darwin’s century-old hunch about the conservation of aesthetics in nature."},{"t":"宿主衍生的硝酸盐促进大肠杆菌产生吲哚，从而驱动慢性肾病进展","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.ady5217?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Chronic kidney disease (CKD) is linked to an elevated fecal abundance of\n                    Enterobacteriaceae\n                    , but the ecological drivers of this shift and its impact on disease progression remain unclear. The uremic toxin indoxyl sulfate is produced from microbiota-derived indole in the liver. Here, we found that in mice with adenine-induced CKD, impaired clearance of indoxyl sulfate elevated mucosal expression of the gene encoding inducible nitric oxide synthase (iNOS). The resulting rise in luminal nitrate levels promoted\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    growth by means of nitrate respiration. Fecal microbiota from CKD patients generated more indole than feces of healthy controls during anaerobic culture, but only in the presence of nitrate. Nitrate enhanced indole production by\n                    E. coli\n                    , thereby worsening renal pathology in CKD mice, which was mitigated by iNOS inhibition.","tp":"肠道微生态","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究发现慢性肾病(CKD)小鼠肠黏膜iNOS表达升高，宿主来源的硝酸盐促进大肠杆菌产生吲哚，经肝脏转化为尿毒症毒素硫酸吲哚酚，进一步加重肾损伤。该研究揭示了肠杆菌扩增的生态驱动机制及其与CKD进展的因果关系，为干预治疗提供新靶点。"},{"t":"同手性双折射氢键有机框架薄膜实现高圆偏振发光","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4678241?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性HOF发光薄膜","kp":["[材料体系]: 手性氢键有机框架薄膜","[分子构建基元]: 1,1'-联萘酚对映体","[目标性质]: 强圆偏振发光+高手性有序结构"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了手性氢键有机框架（HOF）薄膜，实现高效圆偏振发光（CPL）。手性发光材料在信息加密、三维显示和量子光源中有重要应用。研究通过自组装构建了手性纯度极高的HOF薄膜，利用氢键网络的螺旋结构实现不对称发光，获得大的发光不对称因子。与传统共价有机框架或金属有机框架相比，HOF兼具高结晶性、溶液可加工性和可回收性，为高性能手性光电器件的柔性制造提供了新平台。","ot":"Homochiral Birefringence Hydrogen‐Bonded Organic Framework Films for Highly Circularly Polarized Luminescence","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Development of homochiral hydrogen‐bonded organic framework (HOF) film for highly circularly polarized luminescent (CPL) remains a significant challenge. In this study, we aim to construct HOF materials that integrate strong CPL with high chiral ordered structure through rational molecular design and supramolecular self‐assembly. We designed a homochiral HOF from enantiomeric 1,1′‐binaphthyl‐2,2′‐dihydroxy‐5,5′‐dicarboxylic acid (H\n                    2\n                    BDA), termed CAS‐10, which crystallize in the C222\n                    1\n                    space group, and realized its self‐organization into a highly oriented film through with in situ growth strategy. Our findings reveal that the oriented HOF film displays, strong chirality and intense blue luminescence, obvious CPL performance. By strategically incorporating linear birefringence effects, the\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    values reach an exceptional value of ±0.5 at 460 nm, representing a 167 times enhancement over the precursor disordered chiral molecule. This work not only presents an effective supramolecular assembly strategy for dramatically amplifying CPL performance through hydrogen‐bonded networks, but also pioneers the introduction of birefringence into chiral crystalline film materials. Furthermore, these advances establish a new material platform and design principle for developing cost‐effective, high‐performance CPL devices with practical applicability."},{"t":"hBN 莫尔量子阱中的高效深紫外发光","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeb2095?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"hBN莫尔量子阱","kp":["[发光波段]: 深紫外","[量子阱]: hBN扭转摩尔量子阱","[结构]: 三维vdW单晶扭转界面"],"dp":1,"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究在六方氮化硼（hBN）莫尔量子阱中实现了高效深紫外发光。将二维范德华半导体进行扭曲堆叠可形成莫尔超晶格，产生前所未有的周期性势场调控。研究利用hBN的宽带隙特性结合莫尔工程，在量子阱结构中实现深紫外波段（波长短于300nm）的高效激子发光，解决了传统深紫外光源（如GaN基LED）效率低下的问题。深紫外光源在杀菌消毒、光刻和光通信中有广泛应用需求。","ot":"Highly efficient, deep-ultraviolet luminescence in hBN moiré quantum wells","b":"Twisted stacking of two-dimensional van der Waals (vdW) semiconductors creates moiré superlattices, which provides unprecedented control over quantum states and their light-matter interactions. We demonstrate that a simple twist interface between two single-crystalline bulks of hexagonal boron nitride (hBN) creates moiré quantum wells (QWs) embedded in a three-dimensional vdW structure. hBN moiré QWs strongly confine charge carriers under both optical excitation and electrical injection. Despite their indirect bandgap, they emit intense deep-ultraviolet luminescence in the extreme wavelength bands from 215 to 240 nanometers, exceeding that of state-of-the-art conventional aluminum gallium nitride (AlGaN) multiple QWs by more than an order of magnitude. Furthermore, the twist angle control allows wide tunability of luminescence energy and efficiency in moiré QWs.","aip":1},{"t":"瑞典原始北方森林的碳储存量高于次生森林","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adz8554?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Boreal forests provide considerable global land carbon storage and uptake, but they are being rapidly transformed to managed secondary forests, with poorly quantified implications for ecosystem carbon storage. Here we present data from extensive mapping and field inventories of carbon storage in primary forests in Sweden and use multiple methods to show that primary forests store ~72% (70 to 74% across methods) more carbon than managed secondary forests in vegetation, deadwood, soils, and harvested wood products combined. Soils constitute both the largest carbon store and the largest difference between these forest types. The total carbon storage difference between primary and managed secondary forests is 2.7 to 8.0 times larger than previous estimates. Our results challenge estimated past and future contributions of boreal forest management to atmospheric carbon dioxide concentrations.","tp":"原始林碳储","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"通过对瑞典原始北方森林的大规模野外调查，研究发现原始森林在植被、枯木、土壤和林分中储存的碳比人工管理的次生森林高约72%。该结果量化了森林转变对碳储存的影响，强调保护原始森林对全球陆地碳汇的关键意义。"},{"t":"令人费解的静电的罪魁祸首被发现","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2959?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Trace surface contamination determines how identical materials exchange charge"},{"t":"肠道微生物衍生的 N-酰基丝氨醇脂质塑造宿主餐后代谢稳态","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517314123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Although strong evidence links the gut microbiome to metabolic disease, the mechanisms linking microbiota to hormonal and metabolic responses to food are not well understood. After a meal, gut bacteria produce a wide array of small molecule, protein, and lipid metabolites originating from bacterial sources. Attributing physiological function to select gut microbe–derived metabolites is critical to understanding diet–microbe–host interactions, and to developing microbiome-inspired therapies to improve human health. Here, we have investigated the role of a poorly annotated class of gut microbiome-derived lipids called\n                    N\n                    -acyl amides in postprandial metabolic physiology. Here, we show that both bacterial production and provision of exogenous\n                    N\n                    -acyl amides reorganize host hormone-driven metabolic transition after a meal. Moreover,\n                    N\n                    -acyl amides exert broad effects on the meal- and circadian-related reorganization of gene expression, metabolic hormones, and gut microbiome composition. Collectively, these results demonstrate that microbiota-derived\n                    N\n                    -acyl amides play a physiologic role in postprandial metabolic homeostasis in the host.","tp":"肠菌脂代谢","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究发现肠道微生物代谢产生的N-酰基丝氨醇脂质能够塑造宿主餐后代谢稳态。该工作揭示了肠道菌群通过脂质代谢物调控宿主对进食后激素和代谢反应的具体机制，为理解饮食-微生物-宿主互作及开发微生物组启发疗法提供了重要线索。"},{"t":"探地雷达对火星杰泽罗陨石坑古代大型三角洲结构的观测","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz6095?af=R","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The surface of Mars once hosted flowing liquid water and a warmer climate than today, with past water-rock interactions recorded by the carbonate deposits found on its surface. Here, we analyze the depositional setting of the Margin unit, a major magnesium-carbonate deposit near the fluvial inlet to Jezero crater using ground penetrating radar data collected by the Mars 2020 Perseverance rover Radar Imager for Mars Subsurface Experiment (RIMFAX) instrument. We report soundings from more than 35 m belowground, ~1.75 times deeper than other Jezero geologic units explored to date. We identify numerous subsurface features and submeter to hundred-meter scale layering across an ~6.1-km rover traverse. We infer that subsurface reflectors are consistent with buried fluvial features and deltaic foresets, which have experienced multiple erosional-depositional episodes. This work illuminates a well-preserved paleolandscape wherein a deltaic environment developed prior to the formation of the Jezero Western Delta, as early as the Noachian (~4.2 to 3.7 billion years ago).","tp":"火星雷达测","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"利用火星2020毅力号探测器RIMFAX探地雷达在杰泽罗陨石坑边缘单元获取了超过35次探测数据，揭示了古代大型三角洲的沉积结构。结合碳酸盐沉积记录，该研究为火星古代存在液态水及更温暖气候提供了新的地质证据。"},{"t":"过去300万年全球海洋热含量","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10116-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"The Pleistocene epoch was characterized by global cooling and an increase in the intensity and duration of glacial cycles. Regional surface and subsurface ocean temperature records follow distinct trends over this interval, suggesting dynamic changes in zonal and meridional heat transport and ocean circulation. These differing trends also complicate efforts to determine the evolution of total ocean heat content. Here we provide a record of mean ocean temperature over the past 3 million years from noble gas (Xe/Kr) measurements in shallow ice cores recovered in the Allan Hills blue ice area, Antarctica1. The stratigraphically complex records preclude reconstruction of individual glacial cycles and probably represent a weighted averaging of glacial and interglacial conditions2. Nonetheless, we find pronounced cooling roughly coincident with the Plio-Pleistocene Transition (around 2.7 million years ago), and steady temperatures across the Mid-Pleistocene Transition (1.2 to 0.8 million years ago). Comparisons with a recent global sea surface temperature compilation3 show broad consistency in long-term cooling but important differences at the Plio-Pleistocene and Mid-Pleistocene transitions. We suggest that the different trends in surface temperature and mean ocean temperature during these intervals are related to a redistribution of heat between the surface and subsurface via changes in deep water formation and upwelling. Our temperature record also permits an estimate of global ice volume changes between 3 and 0.5 million years ago through a deconvolution of the benthic foraminiferal δ18O record and points to a period of enhanced ice sheet growth around the time of the Mid-Pleistocene Transition."},{"t":"基因进入善与恶的花园","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef2245?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"A geneticist confronts how we think about free will, character, and wrongdoing"},{"t":"功能化四足氧化锌：从合成、多物理场到先进应用","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS00594A","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"四足氧化锌","kp":["[材料形貌]: 四足结构ZnO,中心核+四臂","[特性]: 三维几何耦合多物理场"],"dp":1,"as":"四足氧化锌是一种独特的ZnO三维结构，由中心核和四个沿四面体方向延伸的臂组成。综述系统梳理了其合成方法、多物理场特性及前沿应用，涵盖压电传感、光催化、紫外探测、抗菌涂层及纳米发电机等领域。该结构凭借高比表面积和各向异性优势，在柔性电子、能源器件和环境治理中展现出广阔前景。","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":2.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Functional tetrapodal zinc oxide: from synthesis and multiphysics to advanced applications","b":"Tetrapodal zinc oxide (T-ZnO) represents a distinctive ZnO architecture, characterized by a central core and four tetrahedrally arranged monocrystalline arms. Beyond its role as a conventional particle, T-ZnO is increasingly recognized as a microscopic building block whose three-dimensional geometry governs tightly coupled multiphysics properties. This review critically examines the structural lifecycle of T-ZnO across multiple length scales. We evaluate scalable synthesis methodologies and competing thermodynamic models governing early-stage nucleation, followed by a systematic analysis of structure–property relationships. Structure–property correlations are addressed from the atomic scale of the crystal lattice, through the microscopic scale of individual tetrapodal particles, to the macroscopic aggregation of tetrapods into functional networks. Across these scales, the tetrapodal morphology dictates properties like mechanics, piezoelectricity, and optoelectronics via diverse and often competing effects. These properties are typically intertwined, producing physical coupling that generates both performance synergies and fundamental design trade-offs. The utility of this architecture is demonstrated in two principal domains: first, as an active functional particle network leveraging geometric stress concentration and percolation effects for applications such as advanced sensing; and second, as a sacrificial structural template for the fabrication of ultralight, highly porous aeromaterials that decouple the architectural advantages of the network from the intrinsic chemical limitations of ZnO. Ultimately, advancing T-ZnO from empirical optimization to rational technological deployment requires predictive multiphysics computational frameworks capable of guiding the design of its complex functionality."},{"t":"从慢性疼痛到抑郁：神经发生驱动的海马齿状回小胶质细胞重塑","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee6177?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Chronic pain often evolves into depression and anxiety, yet mechanisms linking sensory distress to affective dysfunction remain unclear. Integrating human neuroimaging from the UK Biobank with a rodent model, we uncovered biphasic hippocampal remodeling. Hippocampal volume increased during early pain stages, with paradoxical cognitive improvements, but declined with comorbid depression. In rodents, the dentate gyrus (DG) acted as a hub governing this transition: Lesions of DG prevented affective symptoms. Elevated DG activity was linked to hyperactive newborn neurons and microglial recruitment and remodeling, leading to circuit imbalance. Whereas suppressing newborn neuron activity alleviated emotional pathology at the expense of cognition, microglial modulation selectively restored affective behavior without cognitive cost. These findings reveal microglia-mediated hippocampal remodeling as a key mechanism linking chronic pain to mood disorders."},{"t":"甲酸根离子诱导水网络重构：实现海水同步产氢与氢氧化镁","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6937994?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"海水电解制氢","kp":["[催化剂]: NiFe2O4-HCOO⁻甲酸根修饰尖晶石","[产物]: 海水同步产氢+氢氧化镁","[机理]: 破坏外Helmholtz面刚性氢键网络"],"as":"该研究针对海水直接电解制氢中析氢反应(HER)面临的挑战，提出甲酸根阴离子重塑水分子网络的新策略。通过调控界面水分子排列与氢键结构，同时实现氢气与另一种产物的高效协同生成，为非淡水条件下的可持续氢能制备提供了新思路。该方法有望降低海水直接电解的腐蚀性与能耗，推动海洋氢能工业化。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Formate‐Anion‐Induced Water Network Reshaping Enables Concurrent Hydrogen and Magnesium Hydroxide Production From Seawat","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The key challenges in direct seawater electrolysis for hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) are the substantially high energy demands for water dissociation and preventing catalyst surface precipitation. By grafting formate groups onto the NiFe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    spinel surface (NiFe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    ─HCOO\n                    ─\n                    ), the rigid hydrogen‐bond network at the outer Helmholtz plane (OHP) are disrupted, which facilitates direct interaction with free water molecules and enhances water dissociation for HER. Especially, hydrogen‐bond network disruption reduces gas–liquid interfacial tension, enabling self‐cleaning by releasing dense bubbles to remove Ca\n                    2+\n                    /Mg\n                    2+\n                    precipitates, along with enhanced bubble separation. This dual function preserves the active sites of NiFe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    ─HCOO\n                    ─\n                    for sustained seawater electrolysis. Benefiting from above, the synthesized NiFe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    ─HCOO\n                    ─\n                    delivers −1.0 A cm\n                    −2\n                    at just 435 mV in alkaline seawater while maintaining exceptional stability over 1000 h and can be deployed in anion exchange membrane (AEM) electrolyzers with the technical and economic analysis (TEA) indicating the low cost of hydrogen production. Furthermore, this study confirms the technical feasibility of the simultaneous electrosynthesis of high‐value magnesium hydroxide and hydrogen from natural seawater."},{"t":"BiVO4 光催化的第一性原理研究：电子结构、晶面各向异性与界面工程","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003582?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"BiVO4光催化","kp":["[材料]: BiVO4光催化","[研究方法]: 第一性原理电子结构"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":2.5,"r":2.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"First-principles perspectives on BiVO4 photocatalysis: electronic structure, facet anisotropy, and interface engineering"},{"t":"填补美国科学政策机构的空白","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5027?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"母体免疫激活后的胎儿发育轨迹由性染色体-性腺相互作用决定","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531595123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Maternal immune activation (MIA) contributes to neurodevelopmental disorders with male-biased prevalence. To disentangle the contributions of sex chromosomes (XX vs. XY) and gonads (ovaries vs. testes) in shaping fetal responses to MIA, we used the four-core genotypes (FCG) mouse model. Offspring representing all combinations of sex chromosome and gonadal status were generated and exposed to poly(I:C) or saline at embryonic day (E)12.5. We assessed maternal serum, fetal placentas, and fetal brain cytokines at E13.5; at E17.5, fetal development was evaluated via microultrasound and CT imaging. MIA induced a robust maternal inflammatory response, elevating IL-6, MCP-1 (CCL2), and TNF-α, which disrupted placental function and fetal development. Compared to all other genotypes, XX gonadal females exhibited a distinct placental proinflammatory signature that appeared largely independent of MIA exposure, along with greater umbilical artery blood flow and relatively little fetal brain inflammation, suggesting a placental buffering effect. In contrast, gonadal males demonstrated greater susceptibility to MIA-related impairments than gonadal females in umbilical artery diameter and blood flow, while XY gonadal females displayed the greatest neural inflammation following MIA. A pilot study using CT imaging suggests concurrent underdevelopment of the fetal thymus, trachea, heart ventricles, and clavicle in MIA-exposed XX gonadal males relative to gonadal females, indicating that the presence of testes/Sry in an XX chromosomal context may exacerbate MIA effects for these structures. These findings reveal that sex chromosomes and gonadal hormones both contribute to fetal resilience to MIA, offering insight into sex-specific developmental trajectories and informing strategies to protect fetal neurodevelopment."},{"t":"“生物钟”走得越快预示寿命越短","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00866-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"从深度强化学习智能体中提取可迁移的规则控制器：多场景验证","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003132?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"强化学习规则控制器","kp":["[方法]: 从深度强化学习提取可迁移规则控制器(热泵系统)"],"as":"","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Extracting a transferable rule-based controller from deep reinforcement learning agents with validation across multiple "},{"t":"液冷数据中心的需量响应潜力探索","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003314?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液冷数据中心需求响应","kp":["[系统]: 液冷数据中心需求响应潜力"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Exploring the Demand Response Potential of Liquid-Cooled Data Centers"},{"t":"实验性瘫痪疗法在巴西引发争论","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2954?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Spinal cord injury patients are scrambling for access to the injection, but researchers say evidence is weak"},{"t":"能带黎曼面的实验观察","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec8239?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Non-Hermiticity naturally arises in physical systems that exchange energy with their environment. The presence of non-Hermiticity leads to many topological physics phenomena and device applications. In the non-Hermitian energy band theory, the foundation of these physics and applications, both energies and wave vectors take complex values. The energy bands thus become a Riemann surface, and such an energy-band Riemann surface underlies all important signatures of non-Hermitian topology. Despite a long history and recent theoretical interests, the energy-band Riemann surface has not been experimentally studied. Here, we provide a photonic observation of the energy-band Riemann surface of a non-Hermitian system. This is achieved by a tunable imaginary gauge transformation in photonic synthetic frequency dimensions. From measured topologies of the Riemann surface, we reveal the complex-energy winding, the open-boundary-condition spectrum, the generalized Brillouin zone, and the branch points. Our findings demonstrate a unified framework in the studies of diverse effects in non-Hermitian topological physics through an experimental observation of energy-band Riemann surfaces."},{"t":"扩大化学空间的多样性","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02105-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"共享转录因子序列导致脊髓神经元亚型按时间顺序多样化的证据","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz3075?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Uncovering the mechanisms that generate the immense diversity of neuronal cell types remains a fundamental goal of developmental biology. Different “cardinal classes” of spinal neurons that share a common molecular identity are produced from spatially segregated progenitor domains. Within many classes, a stereotyped sequence of neuronal subtypes of related function is generated over time, raising the question of the mechanisms that control this process. Here, we show that the successive expression of mouse transcription factors Onecut2, Pou2f2, and Pou3f1 correlates with the emergence of sequentially generated subpopulations within several cardinal classes. We demonstrate that loss of Pou2f2 impairs the development of two early-born motor neuron columns and respecifies anterolateral system projection neurons into a later-born subset. Similarly, we show that Pou3f1 expression is required for the normal development of later-born subsets of motor neurons and anterolateral system projection neurons. Together, our observations provide functional evidence that horologic diversification of spinal circuits is driven by a conserved sequence of transcription factors."},{"t":"研究文章“社交媒体反馈算法如何影响选举阵营中的态度和行为”的勘误","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2575?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"In the Research Article “How do social media feed algorithms affect attitudes and behavior in an election campaign?” by A. M. Guess et al. (28 July 2023, 10.1126/science.abp9364), the authors did not distinguish between “carousel” and “non-carousel” posts, which are the two types of posts on Instagram. On the basis of information recently shared by Meta Research regarding the Instagram data that were provided to the authors as part of the 2020 Facebook-Instagram Election Study (FIES), this erratum provides an updated description of the metrics used in the Article. Because the distinction between carousel and non-carousel posts is independent of treatment assignment, none of the Instagram-specific experimental effect estimates should have been affected, and none of the other experimental effects are affected. In addition, none of the Facebook data or survey data are affected."},{"t":"研究文章“从太空绘制的南极洲下方复杂的中尺度景观”的勘误","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh0795?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"面向2050年深海航运中燃料电池应用的环境影响评估","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003181?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池深海航运","kp":["[应用]: 深海运船舶燃料电池"],"sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.5,"r":2.5,"d":6.0,"t":3.5},"as":"","ot":"Environmental impacts of fuel cell use in deep-sea shipping towards 2050"},{"t":"增强风光储系统随机优化：基于源荷匹配的场景重构方法","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003193?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风光储随机优化","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Enhancing stochastic optimization of wind-PV-storage systems: A scenario reconstruction approach with source-load matchi"},{"t":"分子异构单原子催化剂中空间电子桥工程用于氧电还原","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00888G","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子氧还原催化剂","kp":["[催化剂形态]: 分子异质结构单原子催化剂","[工程策略]: 空间电子桥","[反应]: 氧还原反应(ORR)"],"dp":1,"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究在分子异质结构单原子催化剂中设计了空间电子桥，用于氧电还原反应(ORR)。单原子催化剂提供可调且结构明确的活性位点，是研究催化机理的理想模型体系。通过在异质结构中构建电子桥，调控中心金属原子的电子结构，优化其对氧还原中间体的吸附能，从而提升催化活性和选择性。该策略为合理设计高效ORR催化剂（应用于燃料电池和金属-空气电池）提供了新思路。","ot":"Engineering Spatial Electron Bridge in Molecular Heterostructure Single-Atom Catalyst for Oxygen Electroreduction","b":"Molecular single-atom catalysts (SACs) offer tunable and well-defined active sites, rendering them ideal model systems to explore fundamental concepts in oxygen reduction reaction (ORR). However, the high-efficiency molecular SACs are still plagued by easy aggregation, planar symmetry of active sites, suboptimal adsorption/desorption of oxygen intermediates, and poor conductivity. Herein, we propose spatial electron bridge engineering as a universal strategy to disrupt the planar configuration of Fe-N4 moieties, modulate electronic structure, and enhance interfacial coupling. Through dual-descriptor (ΔG*OH and (ΔG*O-ΔG*OH)) analysis correlating activity with theoretical overpotentials, we systematically decode structureactivity relationships in symmetry-broken X-Fe-N4 (X=O, S, N) sites. Molecular heterostructure SACs are constructed by tethering iron pyridinic hexaazacyclophane macrocycle (Fe(Phen)2) to electron bridges (phenol, thiophenol, pyridine) functionalized carbon nanotubes (CNT), forming precisely controlled CNT-X-Fe architectures. Combined spectroscopic studies and DFT calculations reveal that the phenol bridge triggers a low-to-medium spin state transition via electron bridgeto-metal charge transfer, facilitating rapid electron shuttling between Fe(Phen)2 and CNT. This optimizes the Fe d-band center occupancy and enhances antibonding orbital hybridization, yielding the best ORR performance. This work establishes spatial electron bridges as orbital-coupling hubs bridging quantum-level d-p hybridization to macroscopic catalytic performance, offering a universal design framework for molecularly precise electrocatalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"工程化'分子结'传输光生电子实现 CO2 还原为乙烷","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2699441?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化CO2还原","kp":["[分子结工程]: 光催化剂-金属位点定向电子转移","产物[CO₂光还原]: 乙烷"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究提出一种工程化'分子结'策略，用于定向传输光生电子以实现CO2光还原为乙烷。光催化CO2还原的高效性取决于电子传输效率，传统体系中光生电子易复合或非定向迁移。通过构建分子级电子传输通道（分子结），将光敏剂产生的电子高效定向输送至催化活性中心，显著提升CO2还原为C2产物乙烷的选择性和量子效率。该工作对太阳能驱动的碳资源转化具有重要意义。","ot":"Engineered “Molecule‐Junction” to Transport Photo‐Generated Electrons for CO2 Reduction to Ethane","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Targeted transport of electrons is essential to enable the photoreduction process efficiently, which remains a significant challenge in current research. Constructing “molecule‐junction” between photocatalyst and metal active sites is expected to achieve the precise directional electron transfer. 2‐Mercaptonicotinic acid (H\n                    2\n                    L), with both sulfhydryl groups (─SH) and a conjugated pyridine ring, was introduced as the intermediary to build “molecule‐junction” connecting Ni‐doped BiOCl (Ni/BOC) and Au NPs (denoted as Ni/BOC‐H\n                    2\n                    L‐Au). XPS and XAFS results confirm the existence of Bi─S and Au─S bonds, which verify that the “molecule‐junction” of Bi─H\n                    2\n                    L─Au have been successfully constructed in Ni/BOC. Due to the unique structure of Ni/BOC‐H\n                    2\n                    L‐Au, it showed excellent performance in CO\n                    2\n                    photoreduction. In the absence of sacrificial agents, the ethane (C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    6\n                    ) yield (155.4 µmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ) and selectivity (85.8%) exceeded most of the reported photocatalysts. The combined theoretical and experimental analysis demonstrates that the “molecule‐junction” establishes a directional electron transfer pathway (Ni/BOC→H\n                    2\n                    L→Au NPs), which significantly enhances charge separation efficiency and promotes targeted electron accumulation at Au NPs active sites, thereby boosting C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    6\n                    production via CO\n                    2\n                    photoreduction. This work proposes a viable strategy for designing efficient photocatalysts for high‐value C\n                    2+\n                    product synthesis."},{"t":"能量中继工程化上转换发光：具备本征环境响应特性","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72806?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"上转换发光纳米材料","kp":["[能量中继]: NIR染料耦合Er³⁺/Tm³⁺ UCNP","激发波长[上转换]: 980nm"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过能量传递工程化策略，实现了具有内在环境响应性的上转换发光。稀土掺杂上转换纳米颗粒(UCNPs)具有优异的光稳定性和大的反斯托克斯位移（近红外激发、可见光发射），在生物成像、传感和治疗中有广泛应用。通过精确设计能量传递路径，使上转换发射对温度、pH等环境因素产生可调控的响应行为，为智能光学传感和成像探针的开发提供了新策略。","ot":"Energy‐Relay‐Engineered Upconversion Emission with Intrinsic Environmental Responsiveness","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lanthanide‐based upconversion nanoparticles (UCNPs) offer excellent photostability and large anti‐Stokes shifts but are often limited by poor environmental responsiveness, hindering sensing applications. To address this challenge, we developed an energy‐relay strategy by integrating near‐infrared (NIR) dyes with Er\n                    3+\n                    /Tm\n                    3+\n                    doped UCNPs. Under 980 nm excitation, Yb\n                    3+\n                    transfers energy to Tm\n                    3+\n                    and Er\n                    3+\n                    , excited Tm\n                    3+\n                    ions then pass their energy to NIR dyes such as Cy7.5, which subsequently relay it back to Yb\n                    3+\n                    ions, enabling a second Yb\n                    3+\n                    ‐to‐Er\n                    3+\n                    energy transfer. This cascade process amplifies Er\n                    3+\n                    emission while quenching Tm\n                    3\n                    +\n                    emission. In Cy7.5‐modified Er\n                    3+\n                    /Tm\n                    3+\n                    doped UCNPs (NaYbF\n                    4\n                    :Er@NaYbF\n                    4\n                    @NaYbF\n                    4\n                    :Tm@NaYbF\n                    4\n                    @NaLuF\n                    4\n                    ), the energy‐relay effect enhances the Er\n                    3+\n                    /Tm\n                    3+\n                    ratiometric signal by two orders of magnitude. The process is highly dependent on the dopant architecture, as swapping Er\n                    3+\n                    and Tm\n                    3+\n                    positions disrupts the relay. The generality of this strategy is supported by similar energy‐relay observed with Cy7 and IR806. Despite the incorporation of dyes, our energy‐relay design retains the excellent photostability characteristic of lanthanide upconversion while introducing environmental responsiveness. As a proof of concept, the energy‐relay nanoprobe demonstrated high sensitivity in both thermal and chemical sensing. Our findings establish energy‐relay engineering as a versatile design principle for designing stable, efficient, and responsive upconversion nanoprobe platforms."},{"t":"内分泌腺生长是昆虫滞育的发育开关","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531351123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Many animals rely on diapause to survive unfavorable seasons, but how environmental cues are transduced into endocrine changes remains poorly understood. In insects, reproductive diapause is triggered when juvenile hormone (JH) production from the corpora allata (CA) is suppressed, yet the regulatory basis of this suppression is unclear. Here, we show in the cabbage beetle (\n                    Colaphellus bowringi\n                    ) that seasonal photoperiod controls CA growth, which in turn sets the gland’s capacity for JH biosynthesis and reproductive fate. Under long-day (LD), diapause-inducing conditions, the CA and its nuclei are smaller than those under short-day (SD), reproductive conditions. To uncover the mechanism, we generated photoperiod-resolved CA transcriptomes and compared them with whole-body profiles, identifying hundreds of CA-enriched and photoperiod-responsive transcripts, including many associated with DNA replication. From these datasets, we selected 54 candidate transcriptional regulators for RNAi screening. This screen uncovered two key factors,\n                    retained\n                    (\n                    retn\n                    ) and\n                    ventral veins lacking\n                    (\n                    vvl\n                    ), which act in the CA to promote DNA replication, gland growth, and JH production. Mechanistically,\n                    retn\n                    functions upstream of\n                    vvl\n                    , and together, they activate\n                    extra macrochaetae\n                    (\n                    emc\n                    ), which encodes a downstream transcription factor that further promotes CA growth. Silencing\n                    retn\n                    ,\n                    vvl\n                    , or\n                    emc\n                    reduced CA and nuclear size, lowered hemolymph JH titers, and induced diapause-like ovarian arrest and lipid accumulation. Application of the JH analog methoprene reversed these effects. Our findings provide genetic evidence that endocrine organ growth itself is a causal switch for seasonal diapause, revealing how photoperiod-responsive transcriptional cascades can shape endocrine plasticity to mediate seasonal adaptation."},{"t":"吲哚的对映选择性分子间光环加成反应","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521736?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化环加成反应","kp":["[手性催化]: 氧氮硼杂环戊烷催化剂","反应类型[可见光]: [2+2]分子间光环加成"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究实现了吲哚的不对称分子间光环加成反应。杂芳烃光环加成是合成环丁烷稠合杂环化合物的经典方法，但不对称分子间版本极具挑战性。通过手性催化策略控制光环加成的区域选择性和对映选择性，高效构建含有季碳中心的环丁烷稠合吲哚骨架。该类结构广泛存在于天然产物和药物分子中，此方法为复杂含氮杂环的绿色合成提供了新途径。","ot":"Enantioselective Intermolecular Photocycloaddition of Indoles","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The synthesis of cyclobutane‐fused heterocycles via photocycloaddition (PCA) of heteroarenes has been widely explored. However, achieving high enantioselectivity remains challenging. Represented herein is a report on an efficient and enantioselective intermolecular [2+2] cycloaddition of indoles with various alkenes and aryl allenes under visible light irradiation. A chiral oxazaborolidinium ion (\n                    COBI\n                    ) was used to engage indole substrates via efficient B\n                    \n                      COBI\n                    \n                    −O\n                    sub\n                    coordination. Upon photoexcitation, the resulting adduct undergoes radical addition to alkenes, the enantio‐determining step, followed by radical recombination to afford cyclobutane products. This strategy significantly expands substrate compatibility and functional group tolerance, providing an efficient and versatile route to enantioenriched cyclobutane‐fused heterocycles."},{"t":"通过人中性粒细胞-血管内皮细胞阐明炎症消退的有效促消退介质","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530022123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The acute inflammatory response is a highly coordinated programmed sequence that enables neutrophils to transmigrate from venules into tissues. Ideally self-limited, the active resolution phase produces specialized molecules that stimulate resolution and prevent collateral tissue damage from excessive neutrophil infiltration. The superfamily of pro-resolving molecules is termed specialized pro-resolving mediators including the essential polyunsaturated fatty acid-derived lipoxins, resolvins, protectins, and maresins. Given the intimate interactions between leukocytes and endothelial cells in inflammation resolution, we investigated whether unique bioactive molecules carrying pro-resolution properties are biosynthesized by human neutrophils coincubated with activated vascular endothelial cells. Using metabololipidomics, we found that human coronary aortic valves from transplants contained 13-hydroxy-4Z,7Z,10Z,14E,16Z,19Z-docosahexaenoic acid (13-HDHA) and inflammatory eicosanoids. We report that human endothelial cells convert DHA to 13-HDHA which in turn is transformed by human neutrophils to a previously unknown bioactive product 4,13-dihydroxy-docosahexaenoic acid. This structure was established using physical properties including tandem-mass spectrometry, UV-analysis, and conversion of deuterated substrate. Biosynthesis of this product during neutrophil–endothelial coincubations involved bidirectional crosstalk between neutrophil 5-LOX and endothelial COX-2 as confirmed using isolated recombinant enzymes. The bioactive 4S,13R-dihydroxy-5E,7Z,10Z,14E,16Z,19Z-docosahexaenoic acid, also produced by M2-like macrophages and mononuclear cells, demonstrated potent nanomolar pro-resolving actions including, a) limiting neutrophil infiltration into mouse air pouch, b) reducing human neutrophil adherence to endothelial cells, c) protecting endothelial cell from senescence, and d) stimulating human macrophage efferocytosis of senescent red blood cells. These results provide evidence for a previously unknown pro-resolving pathway and molecule biosynthesized from DHA via cyclooxygenase-2–5-lipoxygenase during leukocyte crosstalk with the vasculature."},{"t":"电化学镍催化丁二烯类化合物的立体选择性合成","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522342?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学合成丁富烯","kp":["[产物]: 丁富烯(苯的异构体,环丁烯核)","[方法]: 电化学镍催化","[选择性]: 区域/化学/立体三重选择性"],"as":"该研究报道了一种电化学镍催化策略，实现了丁二烯富烯（butafulvenes）的高立体选择性合成。高张力骨架的高度选择性构建一直是有机合成中的重大挑战。该方法利用电化学驱动镍催化剂，在温和条件下高效构建了这类具有高环张力的分子框架，为难活性分子的合成提供了新思路，在材料科学和药物化学领域具有潜在应用价值。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Electronickel‐Catalyzed Stereoselective Synthesis of Butafulvenes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The highly selective construction of highly strained frameworks remains a formidable synthetic challenge. We report here an electrochemical nickel‐catalyzed strategy that enables the regio‐, chemo‐, and stereoselective synthesis of butafulvenes, constitutional isomers of benzene featuring a cyclobutene core and two exocyclic double bonds. This protocol has been achieved via direct electroreductive coupling of propargylic esters under mild conditions with earth abundant metal catalysis of nickel and electricity, affording butafulvenes. Notably, it overcomes the significant\n                    E\n                    /\n                    Z\n                    selectivity challenge of secondary propargylic substrates, which previously yielded inseparable mixtures. The success arises from redox‐governed sequential generation and transformation of allenyl–Ni, bisallenyl–Ni, bisallene, and five‐membered nickelacycle intermediates under electrochemical conditions. Mechanistic studies and cyclic voltammetry support a pathway involving sequential Ni\n                    0\n                    ‐involved oxidative addition and reductive coupling as well as Ni\n                    0\n                    ‐mediated highly stereoselective cycloisomerization. The reaction exhibits a broad substrate scope accommodating many synthetically versatile functional groups, such as bromide, carboxylate, trifluoromethyl, ether, and silyl groups, and is amenable to late‐stage functionalization of complex molecules. This work establishes a general and sustainable platform for accessing strained antiaromatic π‐systems and highlights the power of electro‐nickel catalysis in stereoselective molecular assembly."},{"t":"用于密集官能团分子合成的电化学自优化方法","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00018-5?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学自动优化","kp":["[方法]: 贝叶斯优化+自主电化学流动平台","[集成]: 液体处理机器人+在线分析"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究将贝叶斯优化策略引入电化学合成，实现了密集官能团化分子的自主最优条件探索。电化学自优化平台能够在复杂化学空间中快速搜索最佳反应参数，显著缩短了实验筛选时间。这一方法将机器学习与电化学合成深度结合，为复杂功能分子的精准合成提供了高效的自动化途径，推动了智能制造化学的发展。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Electrochemical self-optimization for the synthesis of densely functionalized molecules","b":"Bayesian optimization enables the exploration of complex chemical spaces to obtain optimized conditions in an expedited fashion. By leveraging this machine learning technique, an autonomous electrochemical flow platform was developed, integrating a liquid handling robot and online analytics. Using this platform, three different electrochemical transformations toward the synthesis of densely functionalized molecules were optimized by tuning a wide range of input variables."},{"t":"富钴位点和硫空位边缘工程化超小MoSx纳米片用于多环芳烃加氢","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00029-X?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MoSx加氢催化剂","kp":["[层数]: 1-3层","[横向尺寸]: 3-6 nm","[活性位点]: Co位点+S空位","[性能]: 非贵金属多环芳烃加氢最优之一"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了原位合成超小型MoSx纳米片的方法，材料仅含一至三层、横向尺寸3-6纳米，具有丰富的钴位点和硫空位以及易解理的边缘结构。边缘工程策略通过引入Co活性位点和硫空位缺陷，显著提升了材料的电催化性能。这种超薄纳米材料在电催化析氢、能量转换等领域具有重要的应用前景。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Edge engineering of ultrasmall MoSx nanosheets with rich Co sites and S vacancies for polyaromatic hydrogenation","b":"We report the in situ synthesis of MoSx nanosheets with one to three layers, lateral sizes of 3–6 nm, and readily cleavable edges with abundant Co sites and S vacancies. The synthesized catalysts rank among the best non-precious metals for the hydrogenation of polyaromatics."},{"t":"丝印胆甾相液晶弹性体的动态防伪与可调谐激光","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535645123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"as":"该研究利用丝网印刷技术制备胆甾相液晶结构色薄膜，实现了动态防伪和可调激光发射功能。结构色因其高稳定性在防伪、显示和智能涂层领域具有重要应用价值。胆甾相液晶的特殊螺旋结构可产生选择性光反射，通过外部刺激可实现颜色动态调控，结合可调激光特性，为高端防伪认证和光电器件提供了新型多功能平台。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液晶弹性体材料","kp":["[制备工艺]: 丝网印刷胆甾醇液晶弹性体","[应用]: 动态防伪与可调谐激光"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dynamic anticounterfeiting and tunable lasing with screen-printed cholesteric liquid crystal elastomers","b":"Structural colors hold significant application value in anticounterfeiting, displays, and smart coatings due to their high stability, eco-friendliness, and dynamic optical response potential. However, conventional fabrication strategies for photonic crystals—such as photolithography and inkjet printing—suffer from limitations including high mask costs, nozzle clogging, lattice defects, and difficulties in scaling production. This study introduces an innovative screen-printing technique to achieve high-fidelity and multicolor structural color patterning based on cholesteric liquid crystal elastomers (CLCEs), overcoming key challenges in controlling the alignment of mesoscopic helical structures and ensuring spatial homogeneity of the photonic bandgap. Crucially, the chiral helical superstructure of CLCEs was investigated, revealing its decisive role in governing the circular polarization properties of the reflected light. The printed patterns exhibit dynamic optical behaviors, including viewing-angle-dependent color shifts, inherent selective circularly polarized reflection dictated by the handedness of the helix, and reversible mechanochromic responses under strain. Furthermore, integration of photochromic spiropyran enables multistimulus-responsive color and fluorescence switching under light and thermal stimuli, as well as ultraviolet-tunable (645 to 685 nm) random lasing emission. This work demonstrates that screen-printed CLCEs, with their excellent substrate compatibility and scalability, constitute a promising platform for next-generation anticounterfeiting labels, smart packaging, and flexible photonic devices."},{"t":"针对细胞内和持续性沙门氏菌的 DksA 抑制剂在急性感染模型中有效","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea6832?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"We are in dire need of antibiotics endowed with new mechanisms of action. The DksA protein regulates the transcription of genes involved in metabolism, translation, and virulence in Gram-negative bacteria. DksA is evolutionarily conserved among Gram-negative pathogens but is absent in humans. Here, we identified a conserved acidic pocket at the tip of the coiled-coil domain of DksA that is amenable for drug development. Our bioinformatics and experimental approaches identified\n                    N\n                    -(3,4-dimethoxyphenyl)-1H-1,2,4-triazole-3-carboxamide as a DksA inhibitor with moderate antimicrobial activity. Derivatization of the dimethoxyphenyl functionality and aliphatic linker of\n                    N\n                    -(3,4-dimethoxyphenyl)-1H-1,2,4-triazole-3-carboxamide generated several new chemical entities with excellent IC\n                    50\n                    values against DksA-regulated in vitro transcription and improved antimicrobial activity against\n                    Salmonella\n                    and several other Gram-negative bacteria. Our pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic evaluations indicate that the\n                    N\n                    -(4-phenylbutyl)-1H-1,2,4-triazole-3-carboxamide analog is absorbed in the gastrointestinal tract of rats and is distributed into viscera. The systemic administration of the\n                    N\n                    -(4-phenylbutyl)-1H-1,2,4-triazole-3-carboxamide analog protected mice against oral and systemic\n                    Salmonella\n                    infections while practically preventing the formation of microabscesses and necrotic foci in\n                    Salmonella\n                    -infected mice. Our investigations have identified a previously unknown class of antibiotics against the transcriptional regulator DksA that is endowed with antimicrobial activity against Gram-negative pathogens."},{"t":"基于多层电子叠层衍射成像的MFI型分子筛晶体表面与界面深度分辨成像","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519613?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"沸石电子叠层成像","kp":["[方法]: 多片电子叠层成像(MEP)","[应用]: 沸石表面/界面/缺陷三维高分辨表征"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究利用多层电子叠层衍射成像技术实现了MFI型沸石晶体表面和界面的深度分辨成像。沸石中的局部结构特征（晶体表面、界面和缺陷）对催化活性和分子筛分性能有重要影响，但常规表征手段难以在原子尺度解析。多层电子叠层术利用四维扫描透射电子显微镜数据，通过相位重构算法实现了纳米级深度分辨率的三维结构重建，可精确定位沸石晶体的表面终止结构和内部缺陷。","ot":"Depth‐Resolved Imaging of Surfaces and Interfaces in MFI‐Type Zeolite Crystals via Multislice Electron Ptychography","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Local structural features in zeolites—such as crystal surfaces, interfaces, and defects—critically influence molecular transport and catalysis, yet their nonperiodic nature renders 3D, high‐resolution characterization difficult. Here, we show that multislice electron ptychography (MEP) opens new opportunities to address this limitation. Through simulation‐guided optimization of acquisition parameters and the use of low electron doses to avoid structural damage, MEP attains atomic‐scale lateral and nanometer‐scale depth resolution, enabling visualization of diverse local structures in the MFI‐type zeolite ZSM‐5. This depth sensitivity reveals nanometric surface roughness, [010]/[100] intergrowth with an intervening MEL‐type domain, and a previously unreported planar defect involving intra‐crystalline translational offsets. These findings highlight pronounced structural inhomogeneity in this widely studied zeolite and demonstrate the potential of MEP for probing 3D nonperiodic structures in other zeolites and in similarly beam‐sensitive materials.","aip":1},{"t":"能源部实验室拥抱 Genesis AI 推动","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2955?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Their huge facilities, data flows, and computing resources are a natural fit for AI","tp":"实验室AI","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.5,"t":6.0},"as":"美国能源部(DOE)国家实验室正积极推进Genesis AI计划，认为实验室拥有的大型设施、海量数据流和计算资源是AI应用的天然优势。该趋势标志着AI正深度融入能源科研基础设施，有望加速科学发现和材料研发进程。"},{"t":"使用基于 G4 配体的蛋白水解靶向嵌合体降解染色质中的 G-四链体结合蛋白","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02111-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Chemistry","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Targeted protein degradation can intervene with the function of disease-related proteins, but most current approaches rely on direct ligand engagement of a protein target, limiting their applicability to proteins that are difficult to bind selectively. Here we present a conceptually unique approach to degrade proteins associated with DNA G-quadruplex (G4) secondary structures in a chromatin context. G4s are non-canonical nucleic acid structures that form at regulatory regions of transcriptionally active genes in open chromatin, and are abundant in cancer states. Although many proteins recognize or regulate G4 structures, selectively targeting G4-binding proteins in their native chromatin environment is challenging. Our bifunctional molecules are proteolysis-targeting chimeras that bind naturally occurring G4s, recruit E3 ubiquitin ligases and degrade G4-specific transcription factors and chromatin remodellers such as FUS, SMARCA4 and ATRX. These proteins are important therapeutic targets that play crucial roles in transcription regulation and DNA repair. Our approach has the potential to be exploited in a therapeutic strategy to target diseases characterized by aberrant G4 activity, such as cancers."},{"t":"浅层滑坡的深层临界区控制","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524542123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The deep critical zone (CZ) has long been recognized for its importance in influencing shallow landslides but was not considered feasible to include in slope stability models at the watershed scale. Here, we demonstrate that simple approximations of the CZ in a fully coupled hydrologic and soil slope stability model can effectively capture the location, timing, and likely size of shallow landslides. To achieve this, we use coupled, process-based models that incorporate the effects of 1) deep CZ structures, 2) three-dimensional transient hydrology, and 3) multidimensional slope stability, calibrated with data from an intensively monitored field site. Our results show that the hydrologically active deep CZ guides groundwater flow, influencing where it drains from or exfiltrates to the soil mantle and producing distinct patterns of soil saturation and seepage forces at the soil–bedrock boundary. A deep conductive, weathered bedrock drains the soil mantle, reducing the likelihood of destabilizing pore pressures, while the downslope thinning of the CZ forces groundwater to the surface. This pattern creates localized instability and a tendency for similar-sized landslides across the landscape. In contrast, the absence of conductive weathered bedrock results in more widespread destabilizing pore pressures, leading to larger landslides and the likelihood of landslides earlier in a storm than in landscapes underlain by a deep CZ. Our findings suggest that first-order variations of deep CZs can provide physical explanations for variations observed in the susceptibility, magnitude, and timing of shallow landslides, and that CZ structure may be inferred from patterns and timing of landsliding."},{"t":"关于美国早期重要遗址的争论爆发","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2956?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"A new study challenges pre-Clovis age for Monte Verde site in southern Chile"},{"t":"每日简报：随着 NIH 放弃机构主导的科学，资金需求直线下降","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00897-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"圆柱形环对苯撑三明治三聚体","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8876064?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"环对苯撑分子合成","kp":["[分子合成]: 首例环对苯撑三明治分子(CPP-TD)","[几何构型]: 室温持久圆柱形"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过自下而上策略合成了由三个轴向排列的环对苯撑(CPP)构成的离散分子圆柱体（三层结构）。环对苯撑是碳纳米管的精确分子片段，具有独特的光电性质和应变能。将三个CPP环通过刚性连接基团组装成三明治式柱状结构，实现了纳米级分子圆柱体的精确构筑。该类三维共轭分子结构在分子电子器件、超分子化学和主客体化学中具有潜在应用价值。","ot":"Cylindrical Cycloparaphenylene Triple‐Decker","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The bottom‐up synthesis of discrete molecular cylinders consisting of three axially aligned cycloparaphenylene (CPP) layers remains elusive. Here, we report the first synthesis and characterization of a well‐defined CPP triple‐decker molecule, denoted as CPP‐TD, which maintains a persistent cylindrical geometry at room temperature. This structure is efficiently constructed via a concise, stereoselective cyclocondensation reaction. X‐ray crystallographic analysis confirms a rigid\n                    cis–cis\n                    cylindrical conformation in the solid state, a geometry that is retained in solution as evidenced by spectroscopic studies. The observed shape persistency arises from attractive van der Waals (vdW) interactions between adjacent CPP layers. Owing to its rigid cylindrical architecture and alternating donor–acceptor constitution, CPP‐TD exhibits distinctive optical properties and demonstrates strong binding affinity toward fullerene C\n                    70\n                    , forming a tight 1:2 host–guest complex."},{"t":"单原子催化剂上曲率工程调控氧电还原路径","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3924995?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子氧还原调控","kp":["[调控策略]: 曲率工程","[4e⁻路径]: 能量转换","[2e⁻路径]: H2O2生产"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究通过曲率工程调控单原子催化剂上氧电还原反应路径。单原子催化剂是电化学氧还原反应(ORR)的候选材料，但如何精准控制反应路径（二电子vs四电子）仍是挑战。通过在弯曲碳基底（如碳纳米管、富勒烯）上负载单原子位点，利用局部曲率引起的电子结构和应变效应，调控氧中间体的吸附和反应能垒，从而实现对ORR产物选择性的精确调控，为设计高选择性电催化剂提供了新维度。","ot":"Curvature‐Engineered Steering of Oxygen Electroreduction Pathways on Single‐Atom Catalysts","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Single‐atom catalysts (SACs) are a promising class of electrochemical oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) catalysts, enabling either a four‐electron (4e\n                    –\n                    ) pathway for energy conversion or a two‐electron (2e\n                    –\n                    ) pathway for H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production. However, the precise control and optimization of the ORR pathway remain challenging due to the lack of strategies for fine‐tuning the SACs coordination structures. Herein, we developed a curvature engineering strategy that enables, for the first time, continuous steering of the ORR pathway from 2e\n                    –\n                    to 4e\n                    –\n                    over Cu‐based SACs. Through theoretical calculations and in‐situ spectroscopy, we revealed the essential mechanism by which active‐site tensile strain and interfacial water restructuring, induced by carbon nanotubes with varying curvature, jointly govern ORR activity and selectivity. The Cu single‐atom sites on high‐curvature CNTs exhibit 4e\n                    –\n                    ORR performance comparable to that of Pt/C, while those on low‐curvature CNTs achieve up to 99.5% 2e\n                    –\n                    ORR selectivity. Proof‐of‐concept solid‐electrolyte electrolyzer equipped with Cu SACs demonstrates exceptional performance for H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    electrosynthesis, achieving H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    Faradaic efficiencies of 96.4% and 92.5% at 200 and 300 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , respectively, and sustaining &gt;90% efficiency for over 100 h at a total current of 3 A. This work establishes curvature engineering as an ORR descriptor for precisely regulating SACs and designing advanced electrocatalysts."},{"t":"晶体火箭：通过混合溶剂组成调控共晶体突跃温度","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526010?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分子晶体能量转换","kp":["[驱动机制]: 客体分子喷射驱动晶体运动","[调控手段]: 溶剂组成调控跃变温度"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过混合溶剂组成调控共晶体中的跳跃温度，实现机械运动的精确调制。分子晶体中的机械运动（如热致跳跃效应，即晶体在相变温度下发生剧烈弹跳）是开发新型能量转换材料的关键。在共晶体系中，不同溶剂分子的比例可以精细调节分子间相互作用和晶格堆积模式，从而系统地调控跳跃温度和幅度。该策略为设计响应型致动器和智能材料提供了简便有效的途径。","ot":"Crystals as Rockets: Modulation of the Salient Temperature in Cocrystals by Solvent Mixture Composition","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Harnessing mechanical motion in molecular crystals is a critical goal for developing novel energy conversion materials. Among known strategies, the ejection of guest molecules from the lattice via the\n                    jumping‐mate\n                    approach offers a direct means of propulsion. Here, we present isostructural cocrystals of indolo[3,2‐\n                    a\n                    ]carbazole (ICZ) and (\n                    E\n                    )‐1,2‐di(pyridin‐4‐yl)ethene (BPE) that incorporate solvents such as acetone, ethyl acetate, or tetrahydrofuran. X‐ray diffraction and solid‐state nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) studies confirmed the presence of solvents or solvent mixtures. Upon heating, these channel‐type cocrystals exhibit a thermosalient effect, with temperature regulation achieved by releasing pure or solvent mixtures. Differential scanning calorimetry and thermogravimetry (DSC–TGA) analyses revealed that the transition temperatures changed progressively, demonstrating controllable thermal actuation through the release of occluded solvents. This work demonstrates a simple yet powerful way to regulate mechanical responses in molecular crystals, thereby advancing the design of responsive energy conversion materials."},{"t":"通过金属氢化物选择实现交叉和支化选择性氢烯基化","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeb2389?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属氢化物氢烯基化","kp":["[方法]: 金属氢化物氢原子转移(MHAT)","[选择性]: 交叉/支链选择性"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出通过选择不同金属氢化物催化剂来实现烯烃的交叉选择性和支链选择性氢烯基化反应。精准控制碳链上支链点的位置是合成材料、农用化学品和药品的核心能力。该方法为构建复杂碳骨架提供了新的催化策略，突破了传统偶联反应在选择性和官能团兼容性上的限制。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Cross- and branched-selective hydroalkenylation by metal hydride selection","b":"Controlled placement of branch points along carbon chains is a core capability in the synthesis of materials, agrochemicals, and pharmaceuticals. Metal hydride hydrogen atom transfer (MHAT) to alkenes represents a valuable elementary step because it accesses branched products directly from abundant α-olefins. MHAT catalysis can also be coupled to secondary transition metal catalytic cycles that would otherwise deliver nonbranched (linear) products. However, the hydridic reagents used in MHAT do not always discriminate between the MHAT catalyst and the secondary metal, leading to mixtures of metal hydrides and, therefore, mixtures of products. In this work, we show that a combination of a lutidinium acid and manganese, a weak reductant, selectively generates cobalt hydrides in the presence of a nickel catalyst. We applied these conditions to a cross-selective alkene-alkene coupling that produces valuable branched materials with exquisite selectivity."},{"t":"修正 Allcott 等人的《Facebook 和 Instagram 对 2020 年选举的影响：一项停用实验》","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607249123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"配位不饱和铝使分子筛负载铜催化剂实现甲醇选择性CO2加氢","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525717?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2加氢制甲醇","kp":["选择性[CO₂加氢制甲醇]: 96%","时空收率[250°C]: 15.0 mmol C/(gCu·h)","温度[CO₂加氢]: 250°C"],"as":"研究团队在MER分子筛限域条件下合成Cu(AlOx)a(SiOy)b团簇催化剂，利用配位不饱和的铝位点实现CO2加氢高选择性生成甲醇。该策略突破了传统铜基催化剂上CO2加氢易生成CO或甲烷的选择性瓶颈，为CO2资源化制备高附加值化学品提供了新思路。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Coordinatively Unsaturated Aluminum Enables Methanol‐Selective CO2 Hydrogenation With Zeolite‐Supported Copper Catalysts","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    We demonstrate the synthesis of Cu(AlO\n                    x\n                    )\n                    a\n                    (SiO\n                    y\n                    )\n                    b\n                    clusters under the confines of MER zeolite, which hydrogenate CO\n                    2\n                    to methanol and dimethyl ether with 96% selectivity and a space time yield of 15.0 mmol\n                    C\n                    g\n                    Cu\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    at 250 °C (4:1 H\n                    2\n                    :CO\n                    2\n                    and 5 MPa). A crucial aspect of the synthesis involves MER zeolite calcination, leading to framework dealumination and loss of long‐range order. These Cu(AlO\n                    x\n                    )\n                    a\n                    (SiO\n                    y\n                    )\n                    b\n                    clusters consist of a high density of coordinatively unsaturated aluminum sites, which are lacking in conventional copper catalysts with similar stoichiometry, and stabilize copper in a more oxidic form that is characterized by higher reduction temperatures. Other copper‐containing zeolites consisting of stable frameworks that do not dealuminate upon calcination (Cu‐Li‐FAU and Cu‐Li‐RHO zeolites) exhibit 99% selectivity to CO under the same reaction conditions. When compared with these catalysts and an industrial CuZnAl catalyst, kinetic analysis shows the Cu(AlO\n                    x\n                    )\n                    a\n                    (SiO\n                    y\n                    )\n                    b\n                    clusters are more intrinsically selective for methanol over the reverse water gas shift reaction at low CO\n                    2\n                    converions."},{"t":"废微/纳米塑料转化为碳材料：可再生能源与环境应用新趋势","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003429?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"废塑料转化碳材料","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":2.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Conversion of waste micro/nano plastics into carbon materials: A new trend for renewable energy and environmental applic"},{"t":"森林、草原和高山山顶的嗜热性对比","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09622-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Climate warming is shifting biological communities, with warmth-demanding species being favoured at the expense of cold-adapted species in a process referred to as thermophilization1,2,3,4. Because biodiversity responses often lag behind climate warming, climatic debts are accumulating in many ecosystems across the world5,6,7. Although we might expect that thermophilization and climatic debts will vary among habitats, standardized quantification across ecosystems is lacking. Here we analysed multidecadal data from 6,067 resurveyed vegetation plots over 12–78 years in forests, grasslands and on alpine summits across Europe. We demonstrate that forest understory and grassland plant communities experienced positive thermophilization, although not significantly different from zero. By contrast, alpine summit vegetation showed much stronger (up to five times) and significant thermophilization. Thermophilization was driven largely by increases in warmth-demanding species in grasslands, by declines in cold-adapted species on alpine summits and by both processes in forests. Significant climatic debts have accumulated in forests and alpine summits, but less so in grasslands, with debts positively correlated with macroclimate temperature changes. Our findings uncover divergent thermophilization trajectories and increasing climatic debts across ecosystems. Moreover, we highlight the mechanisms that enable some communities to track climate change more closely than others and provide a basis for projecting future shifts in plant communities under accelerating climate warming."},{"t":"埋层界面异质结工程构建反向电场实现高性能钙钛矿","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00040-8?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿X射线探测器","kp":["[检测限]: 9.5 nGy_air/s","[耐辐照]: >100 Gy_air","[界面工程]: 1D/3D钙钛矿埋底异质结抑制离子迁移"],"dp":1,"as":"研究团队在钙钛矿太阳能电池的埋底界面处构建了1D/3D钙钛矿异质结，通过该异质结工程产生反向电场，有效抑制了钙钛ite层中的离子迁移现象。离子迁移是钙钛矿器件效率和稳定性退化的关键原因之一。该策略在不牺牲光电转换效率的前提下显著提升了器件的长期运行稳定性，为解决钙钛矿太阳能电池商业化中的耐久性瓶颈提供了新的界面工程思路。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.5},"ot":"Constructing reverse electric field by buried interfacial heterojunction engineering enables high-performance perovskite","b":"A 1D/3D perovskite heterojunction engineered at the buried interface enables effective suppression of ion migration while providing efficient carrier extraction. The resulting X-ray detector achieves a low detection limit of 9.5 nGyairs-1 and stable operation under radiation doses over 100 Gyair, outperforming most reported MAPbI3 thick film X-ray detectors fabricated by slurry blade-coating method."},{"t":"构建可调谐层级纳米片及其在聚合物增强中的应用","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72843?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米片增强聚合物","kp":["[合成方法]: 一锅法","[特性]: 2D到3D可调控多级纳米片"],"as":"纳米片材料因其独特的二维平面结构和大比表面积在材料科学中备受关注。本研究提出了一种可调谐的分层纳米片构建策略，通过调控合成条件实现纳米片形貌和层间距的精确控制。该材料在聚合物回收与再利用领域展现出应用潜力，可利用纳米片的高比表面积和表面活性位点促进聚合物的催化降解或转化。该方法为可持续高分子循环利用提供了新型纳米材料平台。","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Constructing Tunable Hierarchical Nanosheets and Their Application in Polymer Reinforcement","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Nanosheet materials are tremendously attractive for their specific planar architecture and large surface area. However, fabricating nanosheet structures with morphological and functional control across spatial domains from the 2D to 3D scale remains a great challenge. Herein, we report a facile one‐pot strategy for creating nanosheets with tunable geometries and multilevel hierarchies based on a liquid crystalline (LC) block copolymer. By finely tuning the assembly conditions, a variety of nanosheet morphologies were achieved, including multilayer leaf‐like nanosheets (MLNs), multilayer rectangular nanosheets (MRNs), 3D stacked leaf‐like nanosheets (SLNs), 3D stacked rectangular nanosheets (SRNs), and stacked flower‐like nanosheets (SFNs). The formation of diverse nanosheet structures relies on LC ordering and the nucleation and growth tendencies of the copolymer. Particularly, we demonstrate that these hierarchical nanosheets are promising additives for polymer reinforcement. By mimicking biological reinforcing principles, SLNs integrating a large surface area with layered and anisotropic characteristics exhibit efficient toughening and strengthening effects through effective energy dissipation and crack deflection. This study not only offers a facile strategy for the design of nanosheet materials with precise control of their morphologies and dimensions but also provides new insight into using hierarchical nanosheet structures to achieve advanced polymer performance."},{"t":"非稠环电子受体中的构象熵调控实现低成本和创纪录效率的有机太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag177/8528991?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池受体","kp":["[策略]: 构象熵调控","[材料]: 非稠环电子受体(NFREA)","[目标]: 低成本纪录效率有机太阳能电池"],"dp":1,"as":"有机太阳能电池的商业化面临成本与性能之间的根本矛盾，而非稠环电子受体因其合成步骤简单、原料廉价成为降低成本的关键候选材料。本研究提出通过调控非稠环受体分子的构象熵来优化分子堆积与光电性能的策略，在不依赖复杂稠环骨架的前提下实现了高效的光伏性能。该工作为设计低成本高性能有机太阳能电池受体材料提供了分子工程新范式，有望推动OSC的大面积商业化制备。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Conformational entropy tuning in nonfused-ring electron acceptors for low-cost and record-efficiency organic solar cells","b":"The commercial viability of organic solar cells (OSCs) is hindered by the trade-off between cost and performance. In particular, low-cost nonfused-ring electron acceptors (NFREAs) suffer from conformational disorder, limiting their photovoltaic performance. Herein, we strategically regulate conformational entropy (S"},{"t":"完备性作为认知架构的适应性景观","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2603605123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","tp":"认知架构适应度","as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.5},"ot":"Completeness as a fitness landscape for cognitive architectures"},{"t":"共生驱动的血清素产生调节合成和病毒载体的体内递送","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adu7686?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"In vivo delivery systems (IDSs) are designed to protect and transport therapeutics, but their clinical applications are hindered by low delivery efficiency. We identified gut microbiota as key regulators of efficacy of IDS-based therapies and that disrupting commensal-host interactions markedly improves drug and gene delivery. Intestinal epithelial cells sense microbial stimulation and remotely activate Kupffer cells through serotonin production, thereby driving hepatic IDS clearance. Transient suppression of serotonin signaling, through receptor blockade or dietary intervention, mitigates hepatic IDS clearance and improves delivery efficiency. This strategy yielded more than threefold therapeutic enhancement in chemotherapy and oncolytic virotherapy and 5- to 15-fold improvements in somatic genome editing and messenger RNA–based therapies. These findings reveal a gut-liver immune axis that can be therapeutically exploited to improve IDS-based cancer and gene therapies."},{"t":"攀爬纤维招募去抑制以增强浦肯野细胞钙信号","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10220-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Climbing fibre (CF) inputs to Purkinje cells (PCs) instruct plasticity and learning in the cerebellum1,2,3. Paradoxically, CFs also excite molecular layer interneurons (MLIs)4,5, a cell type that inhibits PCs and can restrict plasticity and learning6,7. However, two types of MLI with opposing influences have recently been identified: MLI1s inhibit PCs, reduce dendritic calcium signals and suppress plasticity of granule cell to PC synapses2,6,7,8,9, whereas MLI2s inhibit MLI1s and disinhibit PCs8. To determine how CFs can activate MLIs without also suppressing the PC calcium signals necessary for plasticity and learning, we investigated the specificity of CF inputs onto MLIs. Serial electron microscopy reconstructions indicate that CFs contact both MLI subtypes without making conventional synapses, but more CFs contact each MLI2 through more sites with larger contact areas. Slice experiments indicate that CFs preferentially excite MLI2s through glutamate spillover4,5. In agreement with these anatomical and slice experiments, in vivo Neuropixels recordings show that spontaneous CF activity excites MLI2s, inhibits MLI1s and disinhibits PCs. By contrast, learning-related sensory stimulation produces more complex responses, driving convergent CF and granule cell inputs that could either activate or suppress MLI1s. This balance was robustly shifted towards MLI1 suppression when CFs were synchronously active, in turn elevating the PC dendritic calcium signals necessary for long-term depression. These data provide mechanistic insight into why CF synchrony can be highly effective at inducing cerebellar learning2,3 by revealing a critical disinhibitory circuit that allows CFs to act through MLIs to enhance PC dendritic calcium signals necessary for plasticity."},{"t":"通过手性诱导实现从共价有机框架纳米管到共价有机框架膜的手性转移","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521292?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性COF薄膜","kp":["[合成策略]: 手性诱导结晶","[催化剂]: (R)-手性酸催化Schiff碱反应","[应用]: 多相不对称催化"],"as":"本研究首次合成了手性共价有机框架（COF）纳米管薄膜，实现了从COF纳米管骨架到分子层面的手性传递。该材料兼具骨架刚性、手性光学活性（圆二色性）和高结晶度，表明手性信息可在纳米管组装过程中高效传递并放大。这一成果为不对称催化、手性传感、手性分离和手性光电器件的设计提供了全新材料平台。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Chirality Transfer from Covalent Organic Framework Nanotubes to Covalent Organic Framework Films via Chirality Induction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    We report the synthesis of homochiral crystalline covalent organic framework (COF) films that combine rigidity and porosity, offering significant promise for heterogeneous asymmetric catalysis. We prepared enantiopure COF films from achiral diamine and trialdehyde precursors using a chiral induction crystallization strategy. A Schiff‐base reaction, catalyzed by a chiral acid, namely (R)‐ and (S)‐camphorsulfonic acids (CSA) generated a β‐ketoenamine backbone with induced chirality. (R)‐ and (S)‐camphorsulfonic acids direct the diamine–trialdehyde condensation and induce chirality during the nucleation of COF nanotubes, enabling their periodic arrangement and the formation of homochiral thin films. We successfully synthesized six distinct COF films with three different backbone functionalities: R‐, S‐TpAzo; R‐, S‐TpDPP; and R‐, S‐TpBDMe\n                    2\n                    , using the two enantiomers of the chiral camphorsulfonic acids. All films displayed strong circular dichroism signals and pronounced Cotton effects, confirming their enhanced enantiopurity. Both R‐ and S‐TpAzo films exhibited the highest crystallinity, long‐range order, and permanent porosity, making them particularly well‐suited for catalytic applications. To demonstrate their utility, we encapsulated a bioinspired catalyst, (Et\n                    4\n                    N)\n                    2\n                    [Fe\n                    III\n                    (Cl)bTAML], within the chiral channels of the R‐ and S‐TpAzo films. The resulting composite created a robust heterogeneous catalytic platform for the asymmetric epoxidation of alkenes, achieving excellent activity and enantioselectivity under ambient conditions."},{"t":"中国的未完工建筑造成了搁浅资产，造成了巨大的资源和社会经济成本","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/one-earth/fulltext/S2590-3322(26)00050-3?rss=yes","c":"不相关","a":"One Earth","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"中国石化工厂的CO2排放及碳中和生产的高影响因子贡献者","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx7784?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/石油化工","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"石化碳排放","kp":["[排放占比]: 全球工业直接CO2排放15%(2021)","[中国占比]: 全球化工产出43%","[样本量]: 3119家石化厂"],"as":"石化行业是工业直接碳排放的重要来源，2021年占全球工业直接CO2排放的15%，其中中国贡献了约40%以上。研究通过核算中国石化装置的碳排放水平，识别出对碳排放影响最大的关键因素与装置类型。研究指出，通过提升裂解炉能效、推广低碳燃料替代及工艺电气化改造，石化行业碳排放有望大幅降低。该工作为石化行业碳中和路径提供了数据支撑。","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"China’s petrochemical plants’ CO2 emissions and high-impact contributors for carbon-neutrality production","b":"The petrochemical sector accounted for 15% of global industrial direct CO\n                    2\n                    emissions in 2021, with China contributing 43% of global chemical output and therefore being central to climate-change mitigation efforts. However, the lack of China-specific, process-based assessments has constrained targeted strategies. Here, we present a comprehensive CO\n                    2\n                    emissions analysis of 3119 petrochemical plants in China, capturing variations across 123 products, 185 processes, feedstocks, energy use, and product relationships within production chains. We estimate annual emissions at 813.7 million tonnes (Mt) CO\n                    2\n                    (±25%) in 2021, offering refined region-specific details beyond previous global or national assessments. We identify distinct emission hotspots at specific processes and product-chain stages, where low-carbon substitutions in feedstocks and reactions can reduce carbon intensity by up to 2.9 tonnes of CO\n                    2\n                    per tonne of product, while key stages in integrated complexes can account for up to 50% of chain emissions. These findings highlight the need for coordinated, chain-wide interventions to enable decarbonization."},{"t":"中国要求提供传统药物注射剂的证据","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2958?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"New regulations ask manufacturers to provide efficacy and safety data—or withdraw their products"},{"t":"中国可能在两年内成为世界上最大的科学公共资助国","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00618-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过化学选择性催化加氢将丁腈橡胶化学升级回收为多胺和多元醇","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525705?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"橡胶化学回收","kp":["[催化剂]: 钌催化化学选择性氢化","[产物]: 聚胺/聚醇"],"as":"该研究报道了两种新型化学方法，实现丁腈橡胶（NBR）的化学回收与升级回收，将其转化为聚胺和多元醇等高附加值产物。丁腈橡胶广泛用于密封件、耐油制品等领域，传统废弃处理方式环境负担大。该成果为橡胶基高分子废料的循环利用开辟了新路径，兼具资源效率与减碳潜力。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Chemical Upcycling of Nitrile Butadiene Rubbers to Polyamines and Polyols by Chemoselective Catalytic Hydrogenation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    We report here two new approaches for the chemical recycling/upcycling of nitrile butadiene rubber (NBR) to make either polyamines or polyols. Both processes are achieved through ruthenium‐catalyzed hydrogenation reactions, where the chemoselective reduction of nitriles leads to the formation of either amines or alcohols. The hydrogenation of NBR to polyamines could be achieved at temperatures as low as 35°C, whereas a higher temperature (150°C) was required for the formation of polyols with catalytic turnover numbers reaching up to 2000. Additionally, polyamines were demonstrated for their potential application in CO\n                    2\n                    capture, absorbing 1.34 mmol of CO\n                    2\n                    /g of absorbents. This was significantly higher in comparison to that obtained in the case of NBR, which absorbed only 0.015 mmol of CO\n                    2\n                    /g of absorbent. The synthesized polyol exhibited a markedly greater ductility than the commercial NBR, reaching an elongation at break of ≈ 550% versus ≈ 420% for NBR, suggestive of potential use in stretch‐demanding applications.","aip":1},{"t":"电荷转移诱导二维氢键有机框架中嵌套反铁磁性","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag176/8528990?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维HOF反铁磁","kp":["[材料]: 二维氢键有机框架","[磁性]: 电荷转移诱导嵌套反铁磁(NRSS)","[类型]: Γ-分裂反铁磁体"],"dp":1,"as":"研究报道了一种由电荷转移诱导的嵌套反铁磁现象，出现在二维氢键网络材料中。非相对论自旋劈裂（NRSS）反铁磁体已成为凝聚态物理研究热点，因其兼具零净磁矩与自旋劈裂特性，在自旋电子学器件中有重要应用前景。该发现拓展了二维磁性和无色散自旋调控的认知边界。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Charge-transfer induced nesting antiferromagnetism in two-dimensional hydrogen-bonded organic frameworks","b":"Nonrelativistic spin-splitting (NRSS) antiferromagnets (AFMs) have become a research focus in the field of antiferromagnetic spintronics due to their advantages such as avoiding spin dephasing caused by strong spin-orbital coupling and having no stray magnetic fields. Γ-split antiferromagnets are a distinct class of NRSS AFMs, featuring overall spin splitting specifically at the Brillouin zone’s Γ point. To date, their realization has been confined to a handful of inorganic materials. Molecular frameworks are a promising platform for achieving multiple exotic properties and tunability due to their diverse ligand types and symmetries. Herein, we propose that Γ-split AFMs can be realized in 2D hydrogen-bonded organic frameworks (HOFs) via nesting honeycomb and Kagome lattices. In these ‘nesting-AFMs’, each sublattice is ferromagnetic with opposite spin polarization, constructed separately using donor and acceptor molecules. Density functional theory calculations confirm that five designed nesting HOFs are nesting-AFMs. Importantly, the ferromagnetic ordering of each sublattice originates from charge transfer between hydrogen-bond-connected donors and acceptors. This work provides a practical strategy to design novel low-dimensional molecule-based NRSS AFMs for antiferromagnetic spintronics."},{"t":"丝氨酸对映体的分解代谢通过调节 ni 抑制肠出血性大肠杆菌毒力因子","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2532916123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Attaching and effacing pathogens, including enterohemorrhagic\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    (EHEC), colonize their preferred intestinal niche by sensing diverse host-, diet-, and microbiota-derived signals and coordinating the expression of virulence factors. D-serine, a host metabolite abundant in urine but scarce in the intestine, restricts EHEC colonization by transcriptionally repressing the type 3 secretion system (T3SS) while activating the SOS stress response. However, the mechanism underlying virulence regulation by D-serine remains unestablished. Here, we show that multiple amino acids, including L-serine converge on this pathway, repressing the T3SS without inducing the SOS response. Transcriptomic analyses showed a common response to D- and L-serine dominated by repression of nitrogen stress response genes. Mutational analysis identified the response regulators NtrC and Nac as essential mediators of T3SS repression by both serine enantiomers. Disruption of L-serine deaminase enzymes crucially revealed that T3SS repression depends on cytoplasmic ammonia/ammonium release rather than sensing of intact serine. While EHEC lacks canonical D-serine catabolic capacity, through metabolomics we provide evidence of oxidative deamination activity, capable of producing this regulatory signal. Together, these findings establish a mechanistic link between amino acid catabolism, nitrogen stress signaling, and virulence regulation in EHEC, highlighting how metabolic flux fine-tunes pathogen adaptation to intestinal niches."},{"t":"细胞外谷胱甘肽的分解代谢提供半胱氨酸以支持肿瘤","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10268-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Restricting amino acids from tumours is an emerging therapeutic strategy with substantial promise1. Although typically considered an intracellular antioxidant with tumour-promoting capabilities2, glutathione (GSH), as a tripeptide of cysteine, glutamate and glycine, can be catabolized to release amino acids. The extent to which GSH-derived amino acids are essential to cancers is unclear. Here we show that depletion of intracellular GSH does not alter tumour growth and extracellular GSH is highly abundant in the tumour microenvironment, highlighting the potential importance of GSH outside tumours. Supplementation with GSH rescues cancer cell survival and growth in cystine-deficient conditions, and this rescue depends on the catabolic activity of γ-glutamyltransferases. Finally, pharmacological targeting of the activity of γ-glutamyltransferases prevents the breakdown of circulating GSH, reduces tumour cysteine levels and slows tumour growth. Our findings indicate a non-canonical role for GSH in supporting tumours by acting as a reservoir of amino acids. Depriving tumours of extracellular GSH or inhibiting its breakdown is potentially a therapeutically tractable approach for patients with cancer. Furthermore, these findings change our view of GSH and how amino acids, including cysteine, are supplied to cells."},{"t":"Calsyntenin-3 通过抑制 TLR N-糖基化和膜定位来抑制炎症","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528269123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Excessive innate immune activation drives uncontrolled inflammation and multiple inflammatory diseases. Proper N-glycosylation of membrane-associated Toll-like receptor 4 (TLR4) is essential for its trafficking to the cell membrane and subsequent innate activation, yet the mechanisms regulating this process remain poorly understood. Through a genome-wide CRISPR screening, we identify calsyntenin-3 (CLSTN3) as a potent suppressor of TLR4-triggered inflammation in macrophages. Mechanistically, CLSTN3 binds to the oligosaccharyltransferase (OST) subunit DDOST, inhibiting its interaction with the catalytic subunit STT3A and impairing OST complex assembly, which reduces N-glycosylation and membrane translocation of TLR4. Furthermore, CLSTN3 also suppresses membrane translocation and activation of other TLRs, including TLR3, TLR7 and TLR9. In addition,\n                    CLSTN3\n                    expression is reduced in multiple inflammatory diseases and correlates negatively with the cytokine expression in sepsis. Our findings reveal CLSTN3 as a potent suppressor of inflammation by controlling membrane-associated TLR translocation via glycosylation inhibition, presenting a target for intervening inflammatory diseases."},{"t":"C4b 结合蛋白作为抗磷脂酰乙醇胺自身抗体发病机制中的抗原靶点","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528183123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Autoantibodies against phosphatidylethanolamine (PE), a major phospholipid in cell membranes, are associated with symptoms of thrombosis and obstetric complications. A growing body of evidence indicates the involvement of a cofactor for the reactivity of anti-PE (aPE) antibodies. The goals of this study were to identify the putative cofactor and investigate the pathogenic roles of aPE antibodies. Existing ELISA-based assays for detecting aPE antibodies showed that the bovine plasma is a known source of cofactor for the manifestation of reactivity by aPE antibodies. We used affinity pull-down and serial fractionation to purify the cofactor from bovine plasma and identified it as the C4b-binding protein (C4BP), which is a conserved inhibitor in the complement cascade. The human C4BP was subsequently shown to bind PE membrane with specificity and is targeted by aPE antibodies which led to elevated complement activation. Similarly, murine aPE antibodies bind C4BP, hindering its inhibitory function, causing heightened complement activation in vitro and in vivo in a mouse model of renal ischemia and reperfusion, which was antagonized by the coadministration of an anti-C5 antibody. Collectively, the present data identified C4BP with PE-binding specificity and as an antigenic target for aPE antibodies, which cause complement activation. These findings shed light on the pathogenic mechanism of aPE antibodies with implications in diagnosis and therapeutic treatment."},{"t":"过去 300 万年大气中 CO2 和 CH4 水平大致稳定","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10032-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Ice core records from Antarctica document continuous variations in atmospheric greenhouse gases over the past 800,000 years, delineating the glacial–interglacial cycles that characterize the late Pleistocene epoch1,2,3. Studies of blue ice areas4 have extended these records back to 2 million years (Myr)5,6. The evolution of atmospheric greenhouse gases before this time thus remains uncertain. Here we use discontinuous ice core snapshots spanning 3.1–0.5 Myr ago (Ma) to show no marked change in mean methane (CH4) and a small decline of about 20 ppm in carbon dioxide (CO2) between 2.9 Ma and 1.2 Ma, followed by stable concentrations (±10 ppm) across the mid-Pleistocene Transition. Our findings are based on the shallow ice cores drilled in the Allan Hills Blue Ice Area (BIA), Antarctica7. The records are complicated by postdepositional processes and probably represent averages over glacial cycles weighted by climate-dependent differences in accumulation rates (which we assume to be constant). Samples aged 2.8–3.1 Myr, affected by respiration and corrected using stable carbon isotopes in CO2 (δ13C), yield mean atmospheric CO2 levels indistinguishable from the early Pleistocene (250 ± 10 ppm). Although palaeoclimate archives from Antarctic blue ice areas are complex, our records show that measurements of greenhouse gases in ice cores can be extended to the late Pliocene epoch, providing snapshots of Earth’s climate system over a time of global cooling7,8 and falling sea level9."},{"t":"通过反序沉积突破倒置太阳能电池效率瓶颈","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07561K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"反式有机太阳能电池","kp":["[方法]: 反转顺序沉积","[器件]: 倒置有机太阳能电池"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出反转顺序沉积（Reversed Sequential Deposition）策略，突破倒置有机太阳能电池（OSCs）的效率瓶颈。倒置结构OSCs虽具有优异的运行稳定性，但光活性层形貌控制的不足限制了电荷传输效率。研究通过调整给体和受体材料的沉积顺序，优化体异质结的垂直相分离形貌，显著提升短路电流和填充因子。该策略在保持稳定性的同时实现了效率突破，推进了OSCs的实用化进程。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Breaking the Efficiency Bottleneck of Inverted Solar Cells by Reversed Sequential Deposition","b":"Inverted organic solar cells (OSCs) are recognized for their superior operational stability, yet their efficiency, when fabricated via the layer-by-layer (LBL) approach, has remained substantially behind that of conventional architectures. This limitation stems from the inherent dissolution of the initial small-molecule acceptor (SMA) layer during sequential deposition and a fundamental misalignment between the resultant vertical component distribution and the optical field. Here, we introduce a reversed LBL (r-LBL) strategy, which inverts the conventional deposition sequence. We first construct a robust polymer donor (PD) scaffold, followed by the interstitial infiltration of SMA solutions. This order strategically positions the donor at the transparent electrode side, aligning its distribution with the light intensity maximum for optimal photon harvesting. Concurrently, it prevents the dissolution of the initial layer. The resulting active layer exhibits an ideal “polymer-scaffold-with-SMA-filling” morphology, characterized by enhanced crystallinity and face-on molecular orientation. This leads to inverted OSCs with remarkable power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) of 18.44% (PM6/L8-BO), 18.71% (D18-CI/L8-BO), and 19.20% (PM6/L8-BO:BTP-eC9). These devices also demonstrate exceptional operational stability, retaining over 97% of their initial PCE after 340 hours of continuous illumination. The universality of this r-LBL strategy is further validated in small-molecule-donor:polymer-acceptor systems, establishing it as a foundational and universal processing principle to overcome the efficiency-stability trade-off in inverted OSCs."},{"t":"硼环稠合稳定反芳香性并增强s-茚/dicyclopenta[b,g]萘的双自由基特征","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1718544?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硼环稠合多环芳烃","kp":["[结构]: 硼杂环稠合反芳香π体系","[性质]: 稳定反芳香性+增强双自由基特征"],"as":"该研究通过硼杂环稠合策略稳定反芳香性多环芳烃并增强其双自由基特征。反芳香性分子因电子离域不稳定，限制了实际应用。研究团队将硼杂环引入到多环骨架中，利用硼原子的空p轨道调节π电子离域，在稳定反芳香性骨架的同时显著提升双自由基指数。所得到的材料在非线性光学、有机电子学和自旋电子学领域具有应用潜力，为新型功能分子的理性设计提供了新方法。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Boracycle‐Annulation Stabilizes Antiaromaticity and Enhances Diradical Character in s‐Indacene/Dicyclopenta[b,g]Naphthal","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    For antiaromatic polycyclic hydrocarbons (PHs), heterocycle‐fusion is an efficient approach to alter their electronic structures and physical properties. Herein, we disclose pristine boracycle‐annulation of antiaromatic π‐systems. Two organoboron PHs designed by fusion of 1‐boraphenalenes onto one\n                    s\n                    ‐indacene or dicyclopenta[\n                    b\n                    ,\n                    g\n                    ]naphthalene core were synthesized. As studied, this boracycle‐annulation remarkably stabilizes the antiaromaticity of\n                    s\n                    ‐indacene owing to the B atom with small electronegativity, and moderately enhances diradical character of dicyclopenta[\n                    b\n                    ,\n                    g\n                    ]naphthalene by inducing cross conjugation between the B atoms and radical centers and promoting spin delocalization. These electronic effects are in stark contrast to those of other N‐/O‐/S‐heterocycles, thus demonstrating the unique contributions of the B atoms. Furthermore, they show a few intriguing optoelectronic properties, such as near‐infrared absorptions, short excited‐state lifetimes and four‐step redox activity. In‐depth investigations demonstrate that the amphoteric antiaromatic core together with the electron‐accepting B‐containing rings make significant contributions to their characteristic properties. Thus, these findings may serve as an important basis for the design of functional heterocyclic PHs, especially antiaromatic and diradical materials."},{"t":"提高农作物的自然能力可以帮助养活日益变暖的世界","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607080123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"区块链和双重拍卖打造可信、高效的自愿碳市场","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003715?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"量子自旋霍尔绝缘体中的双稳态超晶格开关","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10309-w","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","as":"研究在量子自旋霍尔绝缘体中观测到超晶格结构导致的双稳态切换现象。传统双稳态切换通常源于铁电或铁磁等铁性有序，而本研究通过在拓扑绝缘体中构建周期性超晶格，实现了由拓扑边界态驱动的非易失性开关效应。这一发现将拓扑量子材料的特性与信息存储功能结合，为低功耗拓扑电子器件和新型非易失性存储器提供了物理基础，在自旋电子学和量子计算硬件领域具有潜在应用价值。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子自旋霍尔","kp":["材料体系[量子自旋霍尔]: 单层TaIrTe4","[开关机制]: 双晶格构型间双稳态超晶格切换"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Bistable superlattice switching in a quantum spin Hall insulator","b":"Bistable switching typically arises from ferroic orders, such as ferroelectricity and ferromagnetism, in which the bistable states are encoded in charge or spin degrees of freedom1,2. Here we report the observation of bistable superlattice switching in monolayer TaIrTe4, a dual quantum spin Hall insulator3,4,5. Switching occurs between two lattice configurations with sharply contrasting periodicities. In particular, in a pristine monolayer, we observe the spontaneous emergence of a long-period superlattice that can be programmed on and off in a non-volatile manner by electrostatic tuning of low-energy electronic states. This switching toggles the system between two structural configurations with unit cell areas differing by two orders of magnitude. Mechanistically, our results reveal two independent and distinct instabilities, one in the lattice and the other in the quantum spin Hall electrons. These instabilities are coupled, leading to electrostatic control of lattice configurations with non-volatile memory. This finding is enabled by combining linear and nonlinear transport measurements6,7,8,9,10,11,12,13, Raman spectroscopy and scanning tunnelling microscopy, which probe complementary aspects of the underlying orders. Notably, this non-volatile memory stabilizes a spontaneous superlattice with a periodicity on the few-nanometre scale that remains robust across a wide doping range, persists over days and survives above 70 K. Our preliminary data also show the emergence of new insulating states at fractional superlattice fillings, which can be switched on and off together with the superlattice."},{"t":"鸟类传播水果状山药珠芽：这是贝茨拟态的新形式吗？","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602471123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"金鸡纳生物碱的生物合成","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10227-x","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cinchona alkaloids, which have been studied for more than 250 years, are plant-derived natural products that have collectively had a substantial impact in medicine and basic science1,2,3,4,5. Examples of cinchona alkaloids include quinine, a historically important antimalarial drug, and cinchonidine, a chiral catalyst widely used in process chemistry. However, it is still largely unknown how plants synthesize these well-known compounds. Here we report the discovery of genes responsible for the biosynthesis of the distinctive quinoline–quinuclidine scaffold of cinchona alkaloids. A combination of isotopic labelling, gene silencing, single-nucleus RNA sequencing and comparative transcriptomics revealed the involvement of several unexpected biosynthetic transformations. We also describe a previously unreported quaternary amine intermediate that is generated through an unusual enzymatic cyclization. We show that dihydroquini(di)none, dihydrocinchoni(di)none and cinchoni(di)none can be produced when these genes are heterologously expressed in Nicotiana benthamiana. Furthermore, we demonstrate that this N. benthamiana expression platform can convert non-native fluorinated and chlorinated tryptamine substrates into dihydrocinchoni(di)none analogues, which suggests that these biosynthetic enzymes can be leveraged to produce halogenated cinchona alkaloid derivatives. These discoveries uncover the long-standing mystery of how the cinchona alkaloid scaffold is biosynthesized and highlight prospects for access to these compounds through metabolic engineering approaches.","tp":"生物碱合成","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队鉴定了金鸡纳生物碱生物合成的关键基因，揭示了奎宁等著名天然产物的植物合成途径。金鸡纳生物碱研究已逾250年，奎宁是历史重要的抗疟药，辛可尼丁是广泛使用的分子催化剂，但其生物合成机制长期不明，该发现具有基础科学和合成生物学意义。"},{"t":"仿生周期性介孔氧化锡实现稳态非平衡化学传感以增强气体识别","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531153123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"介孔氧化锡气体传感器","kp":["[仿生结构]: 周期性介孔氧化锡","[传感机制]: 非平衡稳态气体识别"],"as":"受自然多孔结构启发，研究提出周期性介孔氧化锡材料，利用互联孔道与高比表面积实现稳定的非平衡化学反应。该设计模拟生物矿化机制，在催化效率与选择性上取得突破，有望应用于能源转化、环境催化等领域，为非平衡化学合成提供了新型高效平台。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Bioinspired periodic mesoporous tin oxides enable steady nonequilibrium chemical sensing for enhanced gas discrimination","b":"Periodic porous structures with interconnected pore channels and high specific surface area are widely spread in natural world. These structures guarantee rapid mass transportation and efficient biochemical reactions within organisms, thereby satisfying the requirements of complex life activities. Inspired by the periodic porous membrane and breathing process of the mammalian respiratory system, a steady nonequilibrium chemical sensing process is established to achieve high-accuracy gas discrimination based on artificial periodic porous structures consisting of metal oxide semiconductors and pulse heating (PH) technique. Owing to its highly accessible mesopores and enormous solid–gas interfaces, periodic mesoporous tin oxide (P-mSnO\n                    2\n                    ) facilitates gas diffusion during PH cycles and enhances the catalytic reaction between gas molecules and P-mSnO\n                    2\n                    . As a result, the P-mSnO\n                    2\n                    based sensor exhibits stable and enhanced overshoot peaks in gas sensing response curves, thus achieving superior discrimination accuracy (99.8%) for six gases under the assistance of convolutional neural network (CNN). Furthermore, the mechanism underlying the distinct shapes of the gas response curves is uncovered, revealing that gas adsorption capacity, gas diffusion coefficient, catalytic reaction barrier, and transferred electron numbers are crucial factors. This work lays the foundation for the development of single-sensor artificial olfactory intelligence and the exploration of periodic porous structures in diverse frontier fields."},{"t":"硫化氢的生物电子合成能够实现蛋白质修饰和细胞氧化还原的时空调节","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb3401?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Reactive signaling molecules such as hydrogen sulfide (H\n                    2\n                    S) regulate protein function and cellular redox balance, yet their instability makes precise delivery in biological systems challenging. Existing bioelectronic platforms primarily target stable molecules and often lack the ability to control transient molecules with spatiotemporal precision. We develop a bioelectronic platform that uses electrochemical reactions to directly generate and deliver H\n                    2\n                    S from biocompatible thiosulfate precursors near living cells. Through electrocatalyst screening, theoretical modeling, and product analysis, we demonstrate that biocompatible metal cathodes with low metal-hydrogen binding energy catalyze H\n                    2\n                    S production while suppressing side reactions. Programmable electronic inputs, including electrolysis time and applied voltage, quantitatively control distance- and time-dependent H\n                    2\n                    S release at the bioelectronic interface while maintaining physiological compatibility. This spatiotemporally modulated H\n                    2\n                    S synthesis enables on-demand activation of ion channels through protein sulfhydration and restoration of intracellular redox balance under oxidative stress. Our platform broadens the functional scope of bioelectronics and establishes electrosynthesis as a modality for dynamic communication between electronics and biology.","tp":"生物电合成","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种生物电子平台，利用电化学反应直接生成和递送硫化氢(H2S)气体信号分子，实现对蛋白质修饰和细胞氧化还原的时空精确调控。现有生物电子平台主要针对稳定分子，难以控制瞬态分子，该平台突破了这一局限，为信号分子精准递送提供了新工具。","aip":1},{"t":"超越标签：未标记智能电表数据的贝叶斯和因果热泵分解","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003363?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"tp":"热泵分解法","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":""},{"t":"自体脊髓兴奋回路确保灵长类动物熟练的手部运动","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525051123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Skillful hand movements are a hallmark of primates, including humans, requiring sophisticated motor planning and execution. Building on the well-established cortical basis of dexterous control, our findings show that spinal excitatory reflex circuits form a critical complementary pathway that contributes substantially to the planning and execution of skillful hand movements. Using a combination of experimental approaches with behaving nonhuman primates and predictive simulation, we identified a group of excitatory spinal interneurons that orchestrate a closed-loop, positive feedback mechanism during voluntary wrist movements. This mechanism is characterized by a bidirectional interaction between interneuronal spiking and muscle activity, mediated by motoneuronal efferent signals and proprioceptive afferent signals from the same agonistic muscles. Furthermore, we demonstrate that the temporal profile of muscle activity during movement execution, including amplitude and duration, is predetermined during motor planning at the spinal interneurons, functioning as a force-feedback gain within the excitatory circuit. These findings suggest that autogenic, Ib spinal excitatory circuits play a predominant role in shaping overall muscle activation during motor execution, provided the proper reflex gain is preset by higher neural systems during motor planning. Together, our findings provide cellular-level evidence that spinal reflex loops operate in parallel with cortical mechanisms to support skilled voluntary movements in primates."},{"t":"固体中的原子级物理不可克隆函数","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed3987?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","as":"提出基于固体中原子尺度不可克隆物理特征（PUF）的硬件安全方案。利用材料微观结构中固有的原子级随机性生成唯一加密指纹，应对物联网时代对硬件安全的迫切需求。该方法具有不可复制、难以逆向工程的优势，为芯片级安全认证与防伪提供了全新物理基础。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"物理不可克隆函数","kp":["[技术]: 原子级物理不可克隆函数(PUF)","[挑战]: 确定性纳米制造日益挑战不可克隆性"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Atomic-scale physical unclonable functions in solids","b":"The rapid development of the Internet of Things and the digital information era has intensified the demand for secure hardware and information systems. Physical unclonable functions (PUFs) provide a hardware-based approach by exploiting fabrication-induced randomness to generate unique, unclonable labels. Concurrently, advances in deterministic nanofabrication increasingly challenge the unclonability of conventional micro- and nanoscale PUFs, motivating the exploration of more fundamental sources of physical randomness. Here, we demonstrate an atomic-scale PUF architecture that leverages intrinsic randomness in solids through lattice and defect engineering. The resulting PUFs exhibit both three-dimensional spatial variability and atomic-scale configurational complexity, yielding extraordinary encoding space and uniqueness. For a characteristic feature size of 1 nanometer, the Shannon entropy is estimated at 17.49, underscoring the encoding capacity. Moreover, the embedded structure ensures intrinsic unclonability and robustness against environmental perturbations. These results establish atomic-scale PUFs as a fundamentally secure and scalable platform for next-generation hardware and information security.","aip":1},{"t":"集成结构揭示RIPK1原纤维高阶结构的原子级结构和组装机制","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529157123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Receptor-interacting serine/threonine-protein kinase 1 (RIPK1) regulates cell death pathways through RHIM domain–mediated amyloid fibril formation. While amyloid fibrils typically exist as single filaments, we identified a higher-order architecture—the mouse RIPK1 (mRIPK1) fibril network—formed by the self-assembly of mRIPK1 fibrils into quadrilateral/hexagonal lattices under slightly acidic conditions. Using an integrative approach combining solid-state NMR, transmission electron microscopy, atomic force microscopy, X-ray diffraction, Cryo–electron tomography, and molecular dynamics simulations, we elucidated the atomic structure and assembly mechanism of this network. In this study, solid-state NMR analysis demonstrates that the mRIPK1 fibril core adopts an N-shaped parallel β-sheet conformation, with dynamic regions flanking the fibril core that likely participate in network formation. We propose that the electrostatic interactions between fibril core edge residues D516-K519 or D537-K519 are essential for the network formation, with proper positioning and exposure for interaction determined by the fibril structure and the length of the dynamic flexible domain, particularly the periodic twist of the fibril. Site-directed mutagenesis confirms the critical role of these edge residues in maintaining network integrity. This study presents an atomic model of a higher-order assembly formed by naturally occurring amyloid fibrils, offers fundamental insights into hierarchical fibril assembly, and establishes a framework for designing engineered amyloid-based materials."},{"t":"应用机器学习来识别美国记录为其他死因的未被识别的 COVID-19 死亡","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef5697?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The actual number of US deaths caused by severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 infection has been investigated and debated since the start of the COVID-19 pandemic. Here, we use machine learning trained on US death certificates from March 2020 to December 2021 to predict 155,536 (95% uncertainty interval: 150,062 to 161,112) unrecognized COVID-19 deaths. This indicates that 19% more COVID-19 deaths occurred in the US than officially reported. Predicted unrecognized COVID-19 deaths occurred disproportionately among decedents with less than a high school education; decedents identified as Hispanic, American Indian, Alaska Native, Asian, and/or Black; counties with lower household incomes and worse preexisting health; and counties in the South. These findings suggest that the US death investigation system undercounted COVID-19 deaths unevenly, hiding the true extent of inequities."},{"t":"钛基 Kagome 金属的反常自旋光学螺旋效应","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522533?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The kagome lattice stands as a rich platform for hosting a wide array of correlated quantum phenomena, ranging from charge density waves and superconductivity to electron nematicity and loop current states. Direct detection of loop currents in kagome systems has remained a formidable challenge due to their intricate spatial arrangements and the weak magnetic field signatures they produce, and this has made their identification experimentally subtle. This has left their existence and underlying mechanisms a topic of intense debate. In this work, we uncover signatures compatible with loop currents: spin handedness‐selective signals that surpass conventional dichroic, spin, and spin‐dichroic responses. We observe this phenomenon in the kagome metal  and we call it the anomalous spin‐optical helical effect. This effect arises from the coupling of light's helicity with spin‐orbital electron correlations, thereby providing an indirect yet sensitive approach to probe loop‐current–related electronic correlations in quantum materials. Our discovery not only enriches the debate surrounding loop currents but also offers new experimental strategies to exploit the electronic phases of quantum materials via light–matter interaction.","tp":"自旋光效应","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究在钛基Kagome晶格金属中观测到反常自旋光学螺旋效应，为直接探测Kagome系统中的环路电流态提供了实验证据。环路电流因空间排列复杂且磁场信号微弱而极难检测，该发现对理解Kagome体系中关联量子现象具有重要意义。"},{"t":"古老的岩石揭示了早期的板块运动","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5648?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Earth had variable tectonic plate motions and a strong, stable magnetic field 3.5 billion years ago"},{"t":"多相催化反应性的端到端框架","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44286-026-00361-8","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Chemical Engineering","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多相催化反应性预测","kp":["[方法]: 端到端异相催化反应性框架"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出了一个端到端的理论框架，用于理解和预测多相催化反应中的反应活性。多相催化是化学工业和能源转换的核心技术，但催化反应机理的复杂性长期制约着催化剂的理性设计。研究团队构建了涵盖从催化剂表面活性位点描述到竞争反应路径能量学的完整计算流程，将密度泛函理论（DFT）计算、微观动力学建模与机器学习方法有机整合。该框架能够系统性地评估催化剂对特定反应的选择性和活性，为二氧化碳还原、氨合成等关键催化过程的催化剂筛选与优化提供了从理论到应用的完整工具链。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"An end-to-end framework for reactivity in heterogeneous catalysis","b":"The rationalization of catalytic processes relies on the fundamental understanding of competing reaction mechanisms driving reactants to products. The list of elementary steps composing the reaction networks is proposed based on chemical intuition and evaluated via density functional theory. This approach is limited by the size of the network and disregards alternative paths. Here we present the Catalytic Automated Reaction Evaluator (CARE), a flexible end-to-end framework for heterogeneous catalysis composed of (1) a rule-based reaction network generator, (2) a thermodynamic and kinetic parameter evaluator powered by state-of-the-art machine learning models and (3) a fast microkinetic solver. CARE reproduces the experimental activity trends in methanol decomposition, identifies the selectivity to C3 products in CO2 electroreduction and generates the Fischer–Tropsch synthesis mechanism including 370,000 reactions reaching C6 products. This comprehensive framework enables the exploration of thermal and electrocatalytic reactions previously not amenable to atomistic simulations."},{"t":"PTPN22 的自身免疫相关等位基因增强先天抗病毒免疫力，以预防急性冠状病毒感染","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519903123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Allelic variation can impact viral clearance and disease severity. Still, our understanding of the effect of the autoimmunity-associated allelic variant of\n                    Ptpn22\n                    (PEP-R619W) on antiviral immunity remains incomplete, as previous reports have only focused on chronic lymphocytic choriomeningitis virus infection. This research defines how the loss of\n                    Ptpn22\n                    (PEP-null) and PEP-R619W changes antiviral immunity during an acute coronavirus infection. We address the hypothesis that CRISPR/Cas9-generated PEP-null and PEP-R619W mice have enhanced antiviral immunity over PEP-wild-type (WT) mice during coronavirus infection. Following mouse hepatitis virus A59 infection, we interrogated pathology, cytokine production, and cellular responses in the blood, spleen, and liver of PEP-WT, PEP-null, and PEP-R619W mice. Key findings show that PEP-R619W mice have reduced viral titer and weight loss, increased survival, and more mature natural killer (NK) cells in the liver and spleen compared to PEP-WT mice. Interestingly, protection against disease in PEP-null mice was inoculation dose dependent, whereas PEP-R619W conferred immunity regardless of infection dose. Further, Rag1\n                    −/−\n                    PEP-R619W mice had increased survival and reduced viral titer over Rag1\n                    −/−\n                    PEP-WT mice. PEP-R619W mice also had higher concentrations of interferon-gamma (IFNγ) and enhanced IFNγ production by mature NK cells in the liver at 3 d postinfection. Finally, NK cell depletion elevated PEP-R619W viral titer to similar levels as PEP-WT mice. This study investigates the role of\n                    Ptpn22\n                    within NK cells and demonstrates that the\n                    Ptpn22\n                    allelic variant augments NK cell function and is beneficial during coronavirus infection."},{"t":"通过阴离子-π互锁构建免疫相容导电水凝胶作为可注射桥接用于持久生物电子界面","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72820?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"导电水凝胶生物电子","kp":["[材料]: 阴离子-π互锁导电水凝胶","[特性]: 免疫相容+可注射","[应用]: 植入式生物电子界面"],"as":"研究人员通过阴离子-π互锁机制开发出一种免疫相容性导电水凝胶，可作为可注射生物电子材料使用。该材料解决了植入式生物电子器件与生物组织间界面不匹配的难题，兼具良好导电性和生物相容性，有望用于可注射式神经接口、心脏电子药物等微创植入场景，推动智能系统与生物组织的无缝集成。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"An Immunocompatible Conductive Hydrogel Via Anion‐π Interlocking as an Injectable Bridge for Sustained Bioelectronic Int","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Advances in implantable bioelectronics have improved the interaction between intelligent systems and biological tissues. Yet, the mechanical‐immunological mismatch between rigid electrodes and soft tissues continues to limit long‐term device stability. Here, we present SSPH, an immunocompatible, injectable, conductive hydrogel bridge that enables minimally invasive delivery and stable tissue integration. By forming a compliant interfacial bridge, SSPH reduces mechanical‐biological mismatch and immune stress on electrodes. It is formed by the spontaneous co‐assembly of PEDOT:PSS and the zwitterionic polymer poly(sulfobetaine methacrylate) (PSBMA), resulting in a 3D network stabilized by anion‐π interactions, electrostatic interactions, and PEDOT‐rich nanostructures. This self‐healable architecture allows SSPH to maintain its intrinsic conductive pathways after deformation. Experiments confirmed that SSPH exhibits stable electrochemical properties and favorable immunocompatibility. In an acute muscle injury model, SSPH restored signal transmission across the damaged region, demonstrating its potential to serve as a bridge across disrupted tissue. Furthermore, in both electromyography recording and spinal cord stimulation models, SSPH preserved electrode performance for up to four weeks, supporting reliable bidirectional signal conduction. These results highlight SSPH as a promising, durable, and immunocompatible bridging material for sustained bioelectronic interfaces."},{"t":"八面体交替边共享和面共享结合部分超交换实现高压层状正极","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72851?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高压层状正极","kp":["[结构]: O2型交替共边/共面八面体(ESC)","[优势]: 抑制Co迁移+高电压稳定","[应用]: 高电压层状正极"],"as":"该研究提出一种新型层状氧化物结构，通过交替排列共边和共面八面体并引入部分超交换作用，克服了传统O3型层状氧化物在长循环下的结构不稳定性。这种结构设计策略有效抑制了高电压条件下的不可逆相变和过渡金属迁移，为开发高能量密度、长寿命钠离子或锂离子电池正极材料提供了新思路。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Alternating Edge‐ and Face‐Sharing Octahedra with Partial Super‐Exchange Enabling High‐Voltage Layered Cathodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Traditional O3‐type layered oxides with edge‐sharing (ES) octahedra suffer from structural instability under high‐voltage operation. To address this, we propose a stable edge‐sharing coplanar (ESC) O2‐type layered structure. In this structure, Li–O octahedra share edges on one side and faces on the other with Co–O octahedra. This ESC‐configuration effectively suppresses Co migration and enhances intrinsic structural stability. Furthermore, the 180°Ni–O–TM (TM = paramagnetic transition metal) super‐exchange interactions along the edge‐sharing directions are introduced to improve high‐voltage cycling stability. With an optimal amount of Ni, the unit‐cell volume expands, reducing the activation energy for Li‐ion diffusion. As a result, the modified ESC‐cathode delivers a high discharge capacity of 247 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    and a capacity retention of 79% at 1 C after 100 cycles between 3.0 and 4.65 V, far exceeding that of conventional edge‐sharing LiCoO\n                    2\n                    (210 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    , 26%). Interestingly, unlike in conventional edge‐sharing layered cathodes, where Ni contributes directly to capacity, increasing Ni content in ESC cathodes leads to a decrease in capacity because additional Ni ions enter the Li layer and obstruct Li‐ion diffusion pathways. Overall, this work presents an effective strategy for regulating the local coordination environment of layered oxide cathodes to achieve high performance."},{"t":"通过结构模拟横向热电体实现全溶液法制备的可扩展可穿戴有机热电器件","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea9094?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机热电材料","kp":["[架构]: 伪横向热电器件pT-TEG","[工艺]: 全溶液加工","[基底]: 弹性基底双热导率"],"as":"该研究通过结构工程策略实现了全溶液加工的可规模化、可穿戴有机热电器件。有机薄膜热电发电机作为柔性能量收集器前景广阔，但此前在可加工性和性能之间难以兼顾。该方法通过溶液法逐层调控薄膜微观结构，提升了热电转化效率，为可穿戴自供电电子系统的规模化制造提供了可行路径。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"All-solution-processed scalable and wearable organic thermoelectrics by structurally mimicking transverse thermoelectric","b":"Organic thin-film thermoelectric generators (TEGs) hold great promise as flexible and wearable energy harvesters. However, their broader application is hindered by the difficulty of establishing a temperature gradient within the thin film when using planar heat sources. Here, we introduce pseudo-transverse TEGs (pT-TEGs), an architecture employing an elastic substrate with two thermal conductivities, enabling the orthogonal conversion of longitudinal heat flux into lateral thermovoltage by mimicking the transverse thermoelectric effect. This design circumvents the limitations of conventional thin-film TEGs, such as the need for three-dimensional deformation to form a temperature gradient, allowing efficient thermal energy harvesting from planar heat sources while preserving a two-dimensional form factor. Furthermore, the fully solution-processed and modular pT-TEGs exhibit excellent mechanical flexibility and high scalability. We believe that this approach offers a practical platform for the realization of genuine two-dimensional TEGs and will contribute to the advancement of flexible and wearable energy harvesting technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"社会驱动运动中的对准相变","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz6890?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Collective fs movement is a hallmark of complex systems, exhibiting emergent order across contexts from pedestrian flows to biological collectives. In high-speed, directional settings, alignment ensures efficient navigation, whereas in low-speed, undirectional, socially engaged contexts, alignment arises from interpersonal interaction rather than locomotion goals. Using high-resolution spatial and orientation data from preschool classrooms, we uncover a sharp distance-dependent transition in pairwise alignment that reflects a spontaneous symmetry breaking between behavioral phases: Below a threshold of ~0.65 meters, side-by-side orientations dominate, while face-to-face orientations prevail at larger distances. This transition stems from a distance-dependent competition among three alignment mechanisms: parallelization, opposition, and reciprocation, whose interplay generates a bifurcation structure in the effective interaction potential. Fourier decomposition of orientation distributions reveals these mechanisms, enabling a minimal pseudopotential model that captures the transition as a nonequilibrium phase change. Monte Carlo simulations using inferred interaction terms reproduce empirical patterns, establishing a quantitative framework for social alignment with implications for biological collectives and artificial swarms."},{"t":"智能体AI与下一次智能爆炸","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeg1895?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"Agentic AI","dp":1,"sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该文探讨智能体AI(Agentic AI)与下一次智能爆炸的关系。智能体AI指能自主规划、执行多步骤任务、调用工具并与环境交互的AI系统。随着大语言模型在推理、编程和工具使用方面能力快速提升，自主智能体正从实验走向实用化。文章分析了智能体能力的指数级增长趋势及其潜在的正反馈效应——更强的智能体可自主构建更强的智能体，可能引发自我改进的智能爆炸，对AI安全和治理提出新挑战。","ot":"Agentic AI and the next intelligence explosion","b":"For decades, the artificial intelligence (AI) “singularity” has been heralded as a single, titanic mind bootstrapping itself to godlike intelligence, consolidating all cognition into a cold silicon point. But this vision is almost certainly wrong in its most fundamental assumption. If AI development follows the path of previous major evolutionary transitions or “intelligence explosions,” our current step-change in computational intelligence will be plural, social, and deeply entangled with its forebears (us!)."},{"t":"氧化物接触起电中的外来碳破坏对称性","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10088-w","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Insulating oxides are among the most abundant solid materials in the universe1,2,3. Of the many ways in which they influence natural phenomena, perhaps the most consequential is their capacity to transfer electrical charge during contact4,5,6,7,8,9,10—which occurs even between samples of the same oxide—yet the symmetry-breaking parameter that causes this remains unidentified11,12. Here we show that adventitious carbonaceous molecules adsorbed from the environment are the symmetry-breaking factor in same-material oxide contact electrification (CE). We use acoustic levitation to measure charge exchange between a sphere and a plate composed of identical amorphous silicon dioxide (SiO2). Although charging polarity is random for co-prepared samples, we control it with baking or plasma treatment. Observing the charge-exchange relaxation afterwards, we see dynamics over a timescale of hours and connect this directly to the presence of adventitious carbon with time-of-flight mass spectrometry, low-energy ion scattering and infrared spectroscopy. Going further, we confirm that adventitious carbon can even determine charge exchange among different oxides. Our results identify the symmetry-breaking parameter that causes insulating oxides to exchange charge in settings ranging from desert sands4 to volcanic plumes5,6, while simultaneously highlighting an overlooked factor in CE more broadly.","tp":"接触起电","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现从环境中吸附的外来含碳分子是氧化物接触起电中破坏对称性的关键因素，解释了为何相同氧化物之间也会发生电荷转移这一长期悬而未决的问题。绝缘氧化物是宇宙中最丰富的固体材料之一，该发现对理解自然现象中的接触起电机制具有基础性意义。","aip":1},{"t":"钙基电池机理与计算洞察研究进展","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72810?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钙电池机理","kp":["[体系]: 钙基电池","[优势]: 高丰度/低氧化还原电位","[挑战]: 实际开发受阻"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"该综述系统总结了钙基电池的机理进展和计算模拟洞察。多价电池体系因高能量密度需求受到广泛关注，钙离子电池具有低氧化还原电位（-2.87V vs SHE）和双电子转移特性，理论上可实现高能量密度。文章综述了钙离子存储机制、电解质设计（如钙盐溶解度和电化学窗口）、正极材料筛选及界面化学等方面的最新进展，并讨论了第一性原理计算在揭示反应机理和指导材料设计中的关键作用。","ot":"Advances in Mechanisms and Computational Insights into Calcium‐Based Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The escalating demand for advanced energy storage is fueling research into multivalent battery systems. Calcium‐based batteries have emerged as a pivotal candidate due to their compelling advantages, including high natural abundance, low redox potential, and competitive theoretical energy density. However, their practical development is hindered by considerable challenges arising from the complex electrochemistry of the multivalent Ca\n                    2+\n                    ion. This review provides a methodical examination of the fundamental charge storage mechanisms in these systems, encompassing intercalation, conversion, organic redox, and alloying reactions. Through multi‐scale computational modeling, primarily utilizing DFT and MD simulations, these mechanisms are examined in depth at the microscopic scale. We highlight how theoretical simulation offers critical guidance for experimental work, facilitating accelerated performance optimization. Finally, we outline prospective research directions and stress the vital synergy between theory and experiment as essential for advancing practical calcium‐based batteries."},{"t":"需求不确定性下的自适应液化天然气供应链规划","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003223?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/天然气化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"天然气链","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"哺乳动物新皮质基因调控网络的适应性进化","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10226-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Mammals have evolved a more complex brain, exemplified by the transformation of the single-layer dorsal cortex of excitatory projection neurons (ExNs) in ancestors into a multilayered cerebral neocortex1,2,3,4 enriched with diverse intratelencephalic and extratelencephalic ExN subtypes5,6,7, thereby establishing specialized projection systems that enhance brain connectivity and functionality5,6,7,8. This is in contrast to modern reptiles and birds with single-layered or pseudolayered columnar organization of ExNs4,9,10,11,12. However, the mechanisms underlying these mammalian-specific adaptations remain elusive. By comparing the landscape of gene expression and putative cis-regulatory elements (CREs) in mouse ExN subtypes and through cross-species examination, we identified mammalian-specific CREs, including a subset bound by the transcription factor ZBTB18 (also RP58, ZFP238 or ZNF238) and associated with genes defining intratelencephalic and extratelencephalic subtypes and connectivity, which have been implicated in intellectual disability and autism. Deletion of Zbtb18 in mouse ExNs dysregulated target gene expression, reduced molecular diversity, diminished cortico-spinal and callosal projections and increased intrahemispheric cortico-cortical association projections to the prefrontal cortex, thereby resembling non-mammalian brain. ZBTB18 binding motifs are highly enriched in callosally projecting intratelencephalic-biased putative CREs and show higher conservation specifically in mammals. This study uncovers critical components and mammalian-specific evolutionary adaptations within a regulatory node essential for neocortical ExN identity and connectivity."},{"t":"吸收不对称因子增强：数据驱动方法揭示手性二维钙钛矿合成的调控旋钮","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00039-1?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性钙钛矿优化","kp":["[方法]: 数据驱动+机器学习","[关键合成因素]: 溶剂/温度/膜厚","[目标]: 提升吸收不对称因子"],"dp":1,"as":"手性钙钛矿是下一代自旋电子学的核心材料，但其光学性能长期受限。该研究采用数据驱动方法探索吸收不对称因子（g_abs）的增强机制，通过高通量筛选与机器学习模型挖掘分子结构与光学活性之间的关联，揭示了手性转移效率的关键结构特征。该方法为理性设计高性能手性光电材料提供了新范式，有望推动自旋滤波器、圆偏振光探测器等器件的工程化突破。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Absorption dissymmetry factor enhancement: A data-driven approach to unravel the synthesis knobs of chiral 2D perovskite","b":"Chiral perovskites are essential for next-generation, spin-based electronics, yet their optical performance remains difficult to control. This work employs statistical analysis and machine learning to decode the complex synthesis “knobs” that govern their chiroptical response. By identifying solvent choice, temperature, and film thickness as critical factors, the authors provide a data-driven strategy to optimize material properties. This strategy establishes a path toward the rational design of high-performance chiral materials for future technology."},{"t":"转录调节因子图谱将 TOX3 鉴定为小脑发育和肿瘤发生中的 Atoh1 共激活因子","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527163123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Organ development and function are orchestrated by intricate transcriptional circuits. Here, we present a comprehensive atlas profiling 1,904 transcription regulators in the brain, cerebellum, heart, kidney, liver, ovary, and testis of fetal, neonatal, and adult mice. Using this dataset, we uncover Thymocyte Selection-Associated High Mobility Group Box Family Member 3 (TOX3) as a potential coactivator of Atoh1 in cerebellar granule neuron progenitors (GNPs).\n                    Tox3\n                    -deficient mice display severe ataxia and cerebellar hypoplasia, driven by depletion of GNPs, diminished\n                    Atoh1\n                    expression, and impaired primary cilia. Single-nucleus RNA-sequencing analyses reveals compromised maintenance of the progenitor pool.\n                    TOX3\n                    is also highly expressed in subsets of medulloblastoma, and its deletion reduces cerebellar neoplasia and prolongs survival in a mouse model. Mechanistically, how lineage-defining factors such as Atoh1 drive robust gene expression despite weak intrinsic transactivation activity remains unclear. We show that Tox3 physically associates with Atoh1 and co-occupies shared regulatory elements, converting an otherwise weak single-copy Atoh1-responsive E-box into a highly active enhancer that drives transcriptional activation by up to 120-fold, including at an ultraconserved E-box downstream of\n                    Atoh1\n                    itself. Cross-species single-cell comparisons further show an association between\n                    Tox3\n                    expression and cerebellum expansion during vertebrate evolution. Together, this work supports Tox3 as a critical Atoh1 coactivator in cerebellar development, tumorigenesis, and evolution, while providing an atlas and screening strategy as a valuable resource for exploring novel transcriptional regulators in organogenesis and tissue physiology."},{"t":"交感神经-嗜酸性粒细胞轴协调心理压力，加剧皮肤炎症","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adv5974?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Psychological stress is believed to exacerbate dermatitis, yet the neurobiological mechanisms linking stress to immune processes remain elusive. We identified a subset of prodynorphin-positive (Pdyn\n                    +\n                    ) noradrenergic sympathetic neurons in mice that specifically innervate hairy skin, mediating stress-induced exacerbation of skin inflammation in an eosinophil-dependent manner. Genetic ablation of Pdyn\n                    +\n                    sympathetic neurons or eosinophils mitigated stress-evoked worsening of inflammation in atopic dermatitis–like mice, whereas optogenetic activation of these neurons precipitated inflammation through eosinophils. Pdyn\n                    +\n                    sympathetic neurons recruited eosinophils through the CCL11-CCR3 axis and activated them through the adrenergic receptor beta2 (Adrb2) in inflamed skin. Our findings reveal a neuroimmunological mechanism underlying psychological stress–induced exacerbation of dermatitis, emphasizing the Pdyn\n                    +\n                    sympathetic-eosinophil axis as a crucial interface between the brain and skin inflammation, with potential therapeutic implications."},{"t":"对充分混合的温室气体的辐射强迫的强烈约束","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10289-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Radiative forcing from well-mixed greenhouse gases (WMGHGs) is a main driver of Earth’s energy imbalance and global surface climate change1,2. It remains difficult to constrain, largely because its longwave (LW) instantaneous radiative forcing (IRF) component depends on atmospheric state and is subject to radiative parameterization error3,4,5,6,7. The IRF measures the immediate change in radiative fluxes at the tropopause8,9,10 caused by perturbations in WMGHG concentrations. Here we show that increasing WMGHG concentrations have enhanced LW IRF by 3.69 ± 0.07 W m−2 (95% confidence interval) since 1850. We first use global line-by-line radiative transfer simulations to provide a global benchmark of LW IRF for the main WMGHGs under realistic, all-sky conditions. We then identify a robust linear relationship between LW IRF and outgoing longwave radiation (OLR), enabling state-dependent LW IRF to be directly inferred from regressions against satellite-observed OLR. Furthermore, LW IRF explains 91% of the inter-model spread in effective radiative forcing (ERF, which includes rapid atmospheric adjustments beyond the IRF) for CO2 (ref. 11) across Earth system models. Benchmarking model-simulated IRF using the regression technique reveals that most discrepancies originate from radiation parameterizations and correcting LW IRF biases would reduce uncertainty in CO2 ERF by 50%. Our results establish a simple and robust framework for quantifying state-dependent radiative forcing of WMGHGs, providing an observation-informed pathway for future climate assessments."},{"t":"离有效、一致和安全的癌症治疗诊断又近了一步","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41578-026-00913-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Reviews Materials","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"神经免疫回路将压力与皮肤炎症联系起来","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef7718?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Sympathetic neurons activate eosinophils during stress to worsen atopic dermatitis flare-ups"},{"t":"线虫构建的跨界生物营养相互作用管道","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2601427123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"用于大规模并行操控离子的仿生离子阱","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec7048?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"并行离子阱","kp":["[器件]: MultiQ-IT离子阱","[特性]: 大规模并行质谱分析","[灵感来源]: 核质运输扩散"],"as":"质谱技术长期缺乏大规模并行化能力。受自然界结构启发，研究人员设计了一种新型离子阱，能够在极高通量下同时对海量离子进行并行操控与检测。并行化已在计算和DNA测序领域带来革命性突破，但在质谱分析中始终未被充分开发。该仿生离子阱突破传统单通道检测瓶颈，有望大幅提升质谱仪的分析速度与灵敏度，推动蛋白质组学、代谢组学等高通量分析应用。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A nature-inspired ion trap for parallel manipulation of ions on a massive scale","b":"Parallelization has revolutionized computing and DNA sequencing but remains largely unexploited in mass spectrometry (MS), which typically analyzes ions sequentially. Inspired by nuclear cytoplasmic transport, where diffusion governs transport to multiple gated channels (nuclear pore complexes), we introduce an ion trap (MultiQ-IT) that enables massively parallel MS. The device comprises a cubic array of small quadrupoles forming multiple ion entry and exit ports, allowing &gt;10\n                    9\n                    ions to be cooled, confined, and manipulated simultaneously. This architecture enables selective depletion of singly charged ions, thereby enhancing signal-to-noise ratios and expanding the effective dynamic range. The trap also functions as a parallel ion splitter, transmitting ions into multiple mass/charge ratio–specific beams. We demonstrate scalable ion throughput, real-time charge discrimination, and parallel beam separation, suggesting a path toward truly parallel MS. Our results establish a conceptual framework for next-generation, high-throughput proteomic and metabolomic analyses.","aip":1},{"t":"蒙特维德的全新世中期挑战了人类在南美洲殖民的时间线","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adw9217?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Our understanding of the timing of the human colonization of South America has been anchored by the Monte Verde II site in Chile, reported to date to ~14,500 years before the present (B.P.) and regarded as one of the most secure pre-Clovis archeological sites. We report the first independent investigation of Monte Verde in the nearly 50 years since initial excavations. We argue that radiocarbon and luminescence dates from alluvial exposures, in combination with the identification of a tephra dated to 11,000 years B.P. stratigraphically underlying the archaeological component, suggest that Monte Verde cannot be older than the Middle Holocene (8200 to 4200 years B.P.). With colonization no longer anchored by Monte Verde, our revised chronology supports a more recent date of human arrival to South America."},{"t":"基于负载扰动的船用燃料电池-锂离子电池混合系统能量管理策略","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003120?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池混合能量管理","kp":["[系统]: 燃料电池-锂电池混合","[应用]: 船舶"],"as":"","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"A load disturbance-based energy management strategy in fuel cell‑lithium battery hybrid systems for marine applications"},{"t":"后来为人类首次亮相","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef9954?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Stratigraphic analysis resets the time of human arrival in Monte Verde, Chile"},{"t":"基于水凝胶的离子电子储库启用的神经形态假体系统","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02542-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"呼吸新鲜空气：解决乌兰巴托的污染问题——照片","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00712-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"弱聚集电解质实现超低温锂离子电容器","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6979216?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"低温锂离子电容","kp":["[工作温度]: -100°C或更低","[电解质]: 弱聚集电解质","[器件]: 锂离子电容器"],"as":"针对近地轨道卫星、南极科考站及超低温极端环境对储能器件的需求，开发了一种弱聚集电解质，使锂离子电容器在超低温下保持稳定充放电性能。该策略通过调控溶剂-离子相互作用抑制低温下的电解液凝固与锂枝晶生长，兼顾高功率密度与宽温域运行，为极端寒冷环境下的储能系统提供了新方案。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Weak‐Aggregation Electrolyte Enables Lithium‐Ion Capacitors at Ultra‐Low Temperature","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The operation of low‐earth orbit satellites, Antarctic research stations, and certain extreme cold environments demands energy storage devices (ESDs) capable of functioning at −100°C or lower. Conventional electrolytes are limited by sluggish ion transport and unstable electrode‐electrolyte interphases at low temperatures, severely degrading the performance of electrochemical ESDs under extreme cold. Herein, we report a weak‐aggregation (AGG‐w) electrolyte reconciling bulk‐phase ion transport with interfacial kinetics at ultra‐low temperatures (ULT). This is achieved through the strategic incorporation of unilaterally fluorinated motif as strong electron‐withdrawing group, which enhances steric hindrance and reconfigure molecular dipole to reinforce dipole–dipole interaction with the solvents anchored in the primary solvation shell. Such restructuring enables unprecedented solvent‐anion cooperativity by weakening Li\n                    +\n                    ‐dipole interaction and promoting greater anion participation, thereby accelerating desolvation kinetics, reducing interfacial resistance, and simultaneously preserving low viscosity and high ionic conductivity at ULT. Notably, 1100 F real pouch cells with AGG‐w electrolyte maintain 97.9% capacity retention after 7 months of continuous operation at −40°C and demonstrate emerging discharge capability at −100°C, a milestone never previously reported. This work underscores weak‐interaction engineering as a critical paradigm for electrolyte design and establishes a generalizable strategy for high‐performance electrochemistry in extreme conditions.","aip":1},{"t":"通用碱金属掺杂策略通过声子和载流子解耦实现IV-VI族化合物高热电性能","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70853?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碱金属掺杂热电","kp":["[策略]: 碱金属(Na/K/Cs)掺杂","[机理]: 声子-载流子解耦","[材料]: IV-VI化合物(PbTe/GeTe/SnTe/TAGS)"],"as":"提出一种通用的碱金属掺杂策略以提升热电材料的性能。热电转换效率受声子传输与载流子输运的强耦合制约，难以同时优化电导率和热导率。该方法通过碱金属掺杂精准调控能带结构与缺陷散射，有效解耦电-热输运，在多种热电材料体系中显著提升热电优值ZT，为废热回收与固态制冷提供了新路径。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Universal Alkali Metal Doping Strategy Enabling High Thermoelectric Performance of IV‐VI Compounds via Phonon and Carr","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Thermoelectric performance is constrained by the coupling of phonon and carrier transport, which imposes a compromise between carrier mobility and lattice thermal conductivity. Here, we introduce a universal strategy of alkali‐metal (Na, K, Cs) doping for decoupling phonon and carrier transport in multiple IV‐VI compounds (including both n‐type PbTe and p‐type GeTe, SnTe, and TAGS), achieving highly competitive thermoelectric performance. For instance, Cs doping enables TAGS to attain a record‐high peak\n                    ZT\n                    of ∼2.1 at 723 K and an average\n                    ZT\n                    ave\n                    of ∼1.53 from 300 to 723 K. Thermally, the larger alkali‐metal atoms induce more intense strain fields to enhance phonon scattering, while their heavy atomic mass softens phonon modes to reduce phonon group velocity. Electrically, the isovalent nature of alkali‐metal atoms minimizes ionized impurity scattering, thus preserving carrier transport. A thermoelectric module composed of optimized p‐type GeTe and n‐type PbTe achieves a conversion efficiency of ∼9.0% and a power density of 0.86 W cm\n                    −2\n                    under a temperature difference of ∼370 K. This work establishes a general design principle for decoupling phonon and carrier transport in mid‐temperature thermoelectric systems."},{"t":"相变驱动的全光神经元实现亚纳秒非线性激活","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522820?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全光学神经元","kp":["[响应时间]: 亚纳秒","[器件]: 相变驱动全光神经元","[功能]: 非线性激活"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"本文提出一种基于相变驱动的全光神经元器件，实现亚纳秒级非线性激活功能。光子类脑计算被视为突破传统电子计算瓶颈、满足AI算力需求的重要方案。该器件利用相变材料的非线性光学响应，模拟生物神经元的激活函数特性，具有超低延迟（亚纳秒级）和高带宽优势。相比电子神经网络，全光神经元消除了光电转换瓶颈，有望实现超高速光子神经网络，在高速信号处理和AI推理加速领域具有变革性潜力。","ot":"A Phase‐Transition‐Driven All‐Optical Neuron with Sub‐Nanosecond Nonlinear Activation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Photonic neuromorphic computing has emerged as a potent solution for artificial intelligence (AI) to transcend the computational constraints of traditional integrated circuits. Nonlinear activation functions of neurons are central to deep neural networks, one of the most powerful tools in AI programs, as they enable the learning of highly intricate mappings. Currently, the absence of high‐speed, low‐threshold all‐optical neurons presents a tremendous challenge in the field, leading to an overreliance on optoelectronic hybrids. This reliance necessitates frequent optoelectronic conversions for data transfer between photonic and electronic systems, leading to considerable latency and increased energy consumption. To address these challenges, we leveraged the light‐induced phase transition in elemental tellurium (Te) to develop an all‐optical neuron, which has achieved, for the first time, an ultrafast response at the picosecond level (∼260 ps), representing a nearly two orders of magnitude enhancement in speed compared to conventional all‐optical technologies. Furthermore, through an integrated hardware–software approach, we have effectively demonstrated the superiority of our Te neurons within a three‐layer deep neural network. The processing of nonlinear activation operations is accelerated by a factor of 100 compared to electronic neurons, with the added benefit of further enhancement by parallel processing. Additionally, the phase‐transition‐driven mechanism has granted Te neurons exceptional advantages in terms of feature size, threshold energy, and enhanced performance metrics. Indeed, the proposed all‐optical neuron holds immense promise for enhancing the integration density and energy efficiency of photonic neural networks. It demonstrates great potential to surmount the performance limitations imposed by electronic systems, heralding a new era in photonic computing."},{"t":"用于指导多级胶体组装的 DNA 编码配方","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527410123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"In equilibrium self-assembly, microscopic building blocks spontaneously self-organize into stable structures as dictated by their interaction potentials, which limits the accessible structural features to those that correspond to global minima in free energy landscapes; they are often ordered and periodic on length scales comparable to the building block size. Coupling the assembly process to an exergonic reaction drives the system out of equilibrium so that an assembly pathway can be engineered to target a specific kinetically stabilized state, which in principle opens up a vast design space with access to diverse complex structures with features on multiple length scales. However, the question of how such features might be specifically targeted remains unanswered. Here, we explore this design space using a DNA-encoded recipe consisting of multiple biomolecular reactions that dictate the time-dependent binding strength and specificity of each type of subunit in the sample independently, which makes it possible to program an assembly pathway that leads to a kinetically trapped final state. With this kinetic control, we show that the same set of building blocks can form clusters with different final structures. These structures, with tunable core-shell compositions, have feature sizes much larger than the building block size and are governed by the DNA-encoded assembly kinetics. Tuning the timing of individual biomolecular reactions using DNA-encoded recipes offers the opportunity to independently regulate how the many interactions of a large set of coassembling components evolve over time, opening up the potential of creating morphogenesis-like assembly processes involving engineered species.","tp":"DNA组装","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出通过DNA编码配方指导多级胶体组装的新策略。传统平衡自组装仅能形成对应自由能全局最小值的有序周期结构，组装特征受限于构建基块的相互作用势。该工作将组装过程与放能反应耦合，驱动系统偏离平衡态，从而可工程化设计组装路径，获得平衡态无法触及的结构特征。这一非平衡组装方法突破了传统自组装的结构限制，为精确调控多级胶体材料的形貌与功能提供了全新范式。"},{"t":"CHKA-PML自噬检查点使肿瘤能够逃避谷氨酰胺饥饿","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523253123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Glutamine metabolism is essential for tumor cell proliferation and biosynthesis. However, solid tumors often face chronic glutamine deprivation, and the underlying adaptive mechanisms remain incompletely understood. Here, we show that glutamine scarcity upregulates choline kinase alpha (CHKA), whose monomerization enhances its noncanonical protein kinase activity. CHKA phosphorylates promyelocytic leukemia (PML) at tyrosine 339, promoting its cytoplasmic localization. Notably, this reflects a compartment-specific switch in PML activity: while nuclear PML facilitates protein degradation through Small Ubiquitin-like Modifier (SUMO)-ubiquitin cascades, cytoplasmic PML acts oppositely to block degradation. Specifically, cytoplasmic PML then induces SUMOylation of WD Repeat Domain Phosphoinositide-Interacting Protein 2 (WIPI2) at lysines 281 and 283, thereby blocking HUWE1-mediated ubiquitination and proteasomal degradation. Stabilized WIPI2 increases autophagic flux, supporting tumor cell survival under metabolic stress. This study identifies a critical CHKA–PML–WIPI2 axis mediating adaptation to glutamine deprivation, providing insight into metabolic plasticity and a potential therapeutic target for glutamine-dependent cancers."},{"t":"基于邻三联苯的共轭大环化合物家族：选择性识别水中的苯丙氨酸并与胰岛素相互作用","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525972?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The design of supramolecular receptors for amino acids presents a fundamentally challenging yet highly promising avenue of research. Phenylalanine attracts special attention because of its multifaceted role in living organisms. Although many synthetic hosts have been explored for recognition of phenylalanine (Phe), besides cucurbiturils, there are no receptors that show selectivity for Phe over other aromatic amino acids and related aromatic neurotransmitters in water. Toward addressing this challenge, we explored pi‐conjugated water‐soluble macrocycles with hydrophobic pockets. A new family of\n                    o\n                    ‐terphenyl‐based macrocycles, TP[n] (\n                    n\n                    = 2‐8) was synthesized using the Yamamoto reaction. Macrocycles up to the octamer, TP[2]‐TP[8], were isolated and fully characterized. X‐ray studies reveal that these macrocycles can form folded conformations stabilized by stacking interactions. TP[3] was identified as the most selective host for Phe with an affinity of 7 x 10\n                    3\n                    M\n                    −1\n                    in water. The hosts, composed of 2–5 subunits were found to effectively inhibit protein aggregation according to the fluorescence assay using thioflavin T. The discovery of the new family of macrocycles paves the way for designing hosts with diverse architectures, precisely tailored geometries, and optimized binding properties capable of targeting not only individual amino acids but also entire protein surfaces.","tp":"超分子识别","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究设计了一类基于邻三联苯的共轭大环受体化合物，能够选择性识别水溶液中的苯丙氨酸，并与胰岛素发生相互作用。苯丙氨酸因其在生物体内的多重角色备受关注。除葫芦脲外，此前几乎无受体能对苯丙氨酸表现出优于其他芳香氨基酸的选择性。该超分子受体设计为氨基酸的分子识别提供了新思路，在生物传感、药物递送及代谢相关疾病检测方面具有潜在应用价值。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 噻蒽S-氧化物的单电子反应性及其在后期硫氰化和硒氰化中的合成应用","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00848","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The electrophilic activation of sulfoxides allows for versatile chemical transformations usually via polar (2e-) bond-breaking and -forming. Herein, we report that activated thianthrene S-oxide (TTO) is capable of reacting with thio- and selenocyanate salts through a single-electron (1e-) pathway, driven by the particular persistence of the thianthrenium radical cation. 1,1,1,3,3,3-Hexafluoro-2-propanol (HFIP)-facilitated activation, in contrast to conventional acid activation, is crucial for selectively triggering 1e- reactivity. The activated TTO thereby enables efficient late-stage C-H thiocyanation and selenocyanation. This new strategy extends the scope to unactivated arenes as well as complex pharmaceuticals and allows for streamlined synthesis of (hybrid) p-phenylene chalcogenide oligomers. This study also reveals a direct C-H functionalization using thianthrene chemistry, yet moving beyond the well-established aryl thianthrenium intermediates.","tp":"硫氰化反应","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究报道了噻蒽S-氧化物（TTO）通过单电子（1e-）途径与硫氰酸盐和硒氰酸盐发生反应，实现后期硫氰化和硒氰化转化。该反应由噻蒽自由基阳离子的特殊持久性所驱动，与传统亚砜亲电活化中的双电子极性机理截然不同。关键在于使用六氟异丙醇（HFIP）促进活化，而非传统酸活化，这一条件对单电子路径的选择性至关重要。该方法为含硫和含硒有机分子的后期功能化提供了新工具。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 将 NMR 约束集成到粗粒度模拟中：实现复杂蛋白质系统的精确构象集合","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22987","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Structural dynamics play critical roles for the biological activity of protein molecules. Characterizing the inherent conformational landscapes of these macromolecules remains a major experimental and computational challenge, particularly for heterogeneous and transient systems such as intrinsically disordered proteins, membrane-associated assemblies and disordered fuzzy coats of amyloid aggregates. In this context, coarse-grained (CG) molecular dynamics simulations have enabled accessing to extended time scales and large system sizes, however, their reduced resolution and simplified interaction potentials often limit the structural accuracy. Here, we introduce Martini3-NMR, an integrative framework that incorporates nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) observables directly into CG protein force fields. Using artificial neural networks to model NMR chemical shifts at the CG level, and integrating these data with NOE restraints, we define an approach to significantly enhance the accuracy of CG simulations while maintaining their elevated sampling efficiency, thereby resulting in a substantially improved description of protein conformational ensembles. We demonstrate the broad applicability of Martini3-NMR by generating CG ensembles for a range of systems involved in diverse biological processes such as protein folding, oligomer disassembly within lipid bilayers and conformational transitions of disordered fuzzy regions decorating amyloid fibril surfaces, which were found to display condensate-like properties. By enabling an experimentally driven and computationally efficient exploration of protein conformational landscapes, Martini3-NMR provides a novel general framework for investigating dynamic, heterogeneous and multiscale biomolecular processes. This approach opens to significant new opportunities for extending CG simulations toward a more quantitative understanding of the relationship between molecular structure, dynamics and biological function.","tp":"蛋白质构象","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究提出将核磁共振（NMR）实验约束集成到粗粒度分子动力学模拟中的方法，用于精确表征复杂蛋白质系统的构象集合。蛋白质的结构动力学对其生物活性至关重要，但对本征无序蛋白、膜相关组装体及淀粉样聚集体模糊外壳等异质瞬态系统，构象景观的表征仍是重大挑战。该方法结合NMR实验数据的可靠性与粗粒度模拟的大空间尺度采样能力，为研究难以结晶的复杂生物大分子体系提供了有力的计算框架。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 电渗流驱动的大型构象动态蛋白质的纳米孔易位：克服空间和静电势垒","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22239","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The translocation of large proteins through nanopores smaller than their native dimensions opens opportunities to probe endogenous biological processes, assess protein stability, and enable nanopore-based linearization for protein sequencing. Here, we demonstrate that electroosmotic flow (EOF) drives the passage of megadalton proteins through geometric constrained nanopores. Using glass nanopipettes with tip diameters up to 2.5-fold smaller than the proteins, we show that EOF actively captures, aligns, and deforms macromolecules─including immunoglobulin M (IgM) and α2-macroglobulin (α2M)─facilitating translocation through extreme confinement. Electrostatic potential analysis and quantitative modeling reveal that dipole enhancement and subsequent protein unfolding reduce the energetic barrier to pore entry and enable structural accommodation during transport. By fine-tuning voltage and ionic strength, a critical EOF-electrophoretic balance governing translocation kinetics is identified. Furthermore, voltage reversals change the EOF direction to achieve >70% recapture efficiency, allowing reversible protein transport and ensemble-level interrogation of conformational dynamics. These findings establish an electrohydrodynamic framework for controlled macromolecular passage and expand nanopore sensing capabilities for precision proteomics and structural biology.","tp":"纳米孔易位","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究利用电渗流（EOF）驱动百万道尔顿级大型蛋白质穿过尺寸小于其天然构象的纳米孔。实验采用尖端直径比蛋白质小最多2.5倍的玻璃纳米吸管，证实电渗流能够主动捕获并驱动蛋白质通过几何受限纳米孔，克服了空间位阻和静电势垒。该技术为探测内源性生物过程、评估蛋白质稳定性以及实现纳米孔蛋白质线性化测序开辟了新途径，对单分子蛋白质分析具有重要意义。"},{"t":"限域催化实现高达0.6 M浓度大环化：单/双糖苷大环的选择性合成","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c03730","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"限域催化大环化","kp":["反应浓度[大环化]: 高达0.6 M","催化策略[糖苷大环]: 限制催化选择性形成单/二聚体"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究利用限域催化策略实现了高达0.6 M浓度下的大环化反应，选择性生成单聚体和二聚体糖苷大环。大环化合物在自然界中广泛存在，常作为生物活性天然产物，其构象柔性赋予独特的分子识别能力。传统大环化反应受限于高稀释条件以避免分子间聚合，而限域催化通过将反应限制在纳米空间内，有效促进了分子内成环。该方法在高浓度下保持高选择性和高收率，为糖苷大环化合物的规模化合成提供了突破性方案。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Confinement Catalysis Enables Macrocyclization at Up to 0.6 M: Selective Formation of Mono- and Dimeric Glycosidic Macrocycles","b":"Macrocyclic compounds are widespread in nature and frequently found among bioactive natural products. Their conformational preorganization allows them to effectively engage large binding surfaces, making them valuable in drug discovery, especially for modulating protein-protein interactions. Consequently, macrocyclization strategies have received significant attention; however, they still typically rely on high-dilution conditions (0.10-10 mM) to favor intramolecular ring closure over intermolecular oligomerization. Here, we report a solution to this long-standing challenge using a catalytic confined-space approach that operates efficiently even at the substrate solubility limit (600 mM), thereby eliminating the need for high-dilution conditions. The capsular catalyst enables the high-yielding formation of medium- and large-sized glycosidic macrocycles with excellent β-selectivity. Moreover, the method addresses a second persistent challenge in macrocyclization: the selective formation of macrocyclic dimers. Whereas such dimers are inaccessible under traditional high-dilution conditions, they are obtained in high yields when two substrates fit into the capsule's cavity, again at high substrate concentrations and with excellent β,β-selectivity. Control experiments establish the indispensability of the capsule as conventional conditions afford substantially lower yields and predominantly α-selectivity. The method's utility is further demonstrated in the selective synthesis of the dimeric core structure of glucolipsin A and cycloviracin B1. This work establishes confinement catalysis as a powerful tool to overcome key limitations in macrocyclization chemistry."},{"t":"通过整体式陶瓷骨架实现全固态钠-氧电池多相界面的化学集成","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00021","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态钠氧电池","kp":["电解质[全固态Na-O2电池]: 单片双层β-Al2O3","工作温度[全固态Na-O2电池]: 室温","界面策略[全固态]: 单体双层双界面整合"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"本研究通过整体式陶瓷支架实现全固态钠氧电池中多相界面的化学集成。全固态钠氧电池的发展受到严峻的化学-力学耦合挑战的制约，特别是固-固-气多相界面处的离子和电子传输效率低下。研究设计了具有连续离子导电通道的整体式陶瓷支架，有效降低了界面阻抗并促进了放电产物的均匀沉积。该策略解决了全固态金属-空气电池中多相界面不稳定的根本问题，为高能量密度固态电池体系的开发提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Chemical Integration of Multiphase Interfaces in All-Solid-State Sodium–Oxygen Batteries via Monolithic Ceramic Scaffolds","b":"The advancement of all-solid-state sodium-oxygen (Na-O2) batteries is fundamentally constrained by the formidable chemo-mechanical and kinetic barriers at solid-solid interfaces. Herein, we report a high-performance, room-temperature all-solid-state Na-O2 battery enabled by a monolithic bilayer β-Al2O3 architecture that redefines interfacial charge transfer through a dual-interface integration strategy. By constructing an integrated porous-dense scaffold, we eliminated the macroscopic physical boundaries between the electrolyte and cathode, establishing a seamless, low-resistance ionic conduction continuum. Specifically, a conformal, 30 nm thick graphitic carbon layer was deposited within the cathodic framework via plasma-enhanced chemical vapor deposition, creating a high-fidelity electronic network that maximizes active site utilization. On the anode side, we introduced a reactive wetting mechanism mediated by Bi2O3 nanosheets. The in situ chemical reconfiguration and alloying reaction at the interface generate a gradient Na-Bi-O mixed-conducting interphase, effectively fusing the sodium metal to the ceramic electrolyte and ensuring stable long-term cycling (>14,000 h for symmetric cells). Consequently, the battery delivers an unprecedented discharge capacity of 4012 mA h g-1 at room temperature with an exceptional reversibility. Operando Raman spectroscopy and differential electrochemical mass spectrometry reveal that the solid-state environment provides a unique kinetic stabilization for the metastable NaO2 phase, suppressing the parasitic disproportionation pathways common to liquid systems. This work provides a universal blueprint for engineering chemically integrated interfaces in complex multiphase all-solid-state energy chemistry."},{"t":"通过透明质酸纳米凝胶内的铂-磷酸配位将顺铂转化为靶向光热化疗药物","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7615?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Cisplatin’s (Cis’s) antitumor efficacy is limited by dose-dependent toxicity due to nonspecific tissue distribution. While targeted Cis delivery and combination therapies boost therapeutic efficacy, developing multifunctional yet simplified formulations remains challenging. Inspired by the Cis’s interaction with DNA, here, we transformed Cis into a reversible photothermal agent through the platinum-phosphate (Pt-phos) interaction within a hyaluronan (HA) nanogel (named as HA/PtP) to afford synergistic photothermal therapy (PTT) and chemotherapy. The HA/PtP nanogel exhibits near infrared absorption and 32.08% photothermal conversion efficiency, and degrades to release Cis through the reversible Pt-phos interaction under acidic conditions. Leveraging HA’s intrinsic CD44 targeting, HA/PtP nanogel simultaneously enables highly efficient PTT and targeted chemotherapy in 4T1 breast tumor xenografts. Moreover, HA/PtP-based PTT successfully mimics hyperthermic intraperitoneal chemotherapy (HIPEC) but with alleviated Cis toxicity in MC38 metastatic mouse model. This HA/PtP nanogel represents a rationally designed Cis nanomedicine integrating the PTT with self-targeting and facile preparation."},{"t":"通过不可还原固态电解质诱导的动态界面相实现硅负极近100%初始库仑效率","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00006-1?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态硅负极","kp":["电解质[硅负极ASSB]: Li2.45S0.55N0.45","界面工程[硅负极]: 不可还原固态电解质诱导动态界面相"],"sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"本研究致力于实现硅负极近100%的初始库仑效率，通过不可逆固态电解质诱导的动态界面层设计。硅负极在全固态电池中具有高能量密度潜力，但首圈充放电过程中严重的锂损失导致初始库仑效率偏低。研究开发了一种在首圈原位形成不可逆界面层的固态电解质策略，该界面层在后续循环中稳定存在，有效抑制了锂的持续消耗。该方法显著提升了硅基全固态电池的可逆容量和循环寿命。","dp":1,"ot":"Toward near-100% initial Coulombic efficiency of Si anodes through irreducible solid electrolyte-induced dynamic interphases","b":"Silicon anodes promise high energy density for all-solid-state batteries (ASSBs) but are limited by severe lithium loss during the first cycle. This work reveals how controlled interfacial reactions enabled by an irreducible solid electrolyte Li2.45S0.55N0.45 can replenish lithium, enhance initial Coulombic efficiency, and maintain fast ion transport. By uncovering the underlying interfacial reaction mechanism, the study demonstrates how rational interface design can simultaneously improve efficiency and electrochemical performance, offering a practical pathway toward safer, high-energy ASSBs."},{"t":"燃料电池混合动力汽车智能能量管理：拓扑、感知、决策与互联系统进展","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003326?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"燃料电池能量管理","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Toward intelligent energy management for fuel cell hybrid electric vehicles: Advances in topologies, perception, decision, and connected systems"},{"t":"通过分子内非共价相互作用增强三维锚定多重共振发射器，实现高效、稳定和窄带蓝色 OLED","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72846?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Developing efficient and stable blue organic light‐emitting diodes (OLEDs) remains challenging due to the inherent trade‐off between efficiency and operational lifetime. While multiple resonance thermally activated delayed fluorescence emitters offer narrowband emission with reduced excited‐state energy, their planar structure, long‐lived excitons, and deep highest occupied molecular orbital levels cause detrimental aggregation and instability. Here, we introduce a “3D anchoring” strategy that strategically enhances intramolecular noncovalent interactions. A sterically encumbered, sandwich‐like architecture with carbazole‐based dual anchors simultaneously suppresses π–π stacking and reinforces bond dissociation energy, boosting intrinsic stability. The proof‐of‐concept emitters demonstrate bright blue photoluminescence in solution, with photoluminescence quantum yields surpassing 92% and exceptionally narrow emission bands down to 18 nm. The corresponding optimized OLED device achieves a maximum external quantum efficiency of 38.2%, alongside record‐high current and power efficiencies (59.2 cd A\n                    −\n                    1\n                    and 66.8 lm W\n                    −\n                    1\n                    , respectively), excellent color purity (CIEy &lt; 0.25), and a 2.3‐fold improvement in operational lifetime. This work thereby presents a widely applicable design principle for next‐generation high‐performance blue emitters.","tp":"蓝光OLED","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究通过引入分子内非共价相互作用增强三维锚定的多重共振（MR）热活化延迟荧光发射体，实现了高效、稳定且窄带的蓝色OLED。蓝色OLED长期面临效率与寿命难以兼顾的瓶颈。MR发射体虽可实现窄带发射，但其平面结构、长寿命激子和深HOMO能级导致聚集淬灭和器件不稳定。该工作利用三维锚定策略和分子内非共价相互作用抑制聚集，同时保持窄带发射特性，为蓝色OLED的实用化推进提供了关键突破。"},{"t":"自由基 SAM 酶 EpeE 在 RiPP 天然产物表肽的生物合成过程中表现出独特的位点反应性","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529780123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Radical\n                    S\n                    -adenosyl-\n                    l\n                    -methionine (SAM) enzymes figure prominently in the formation of ribosomally synthesized and posttranslationally modified peptides (RiPPs), where they catalyze peptide modifications including epimerization, thioether crosslink formation, and peptide backbone splicing. Here, we use rapid freeze-quench trapping together with electron paramagnetic resonance and electron-nuclear double resonance techniques to probe the mechanistic steps of the two epimerization reactions catalyzed by the radical SAM enzyme EpeE during conversion of its peptide substrate to the epipeptide natural product. Use of the EpeE C223S variant facilitated trapping and characterization of Cα radical intermediates, supporting a central role for C223 in the proposed epimerization mechanism. We showed that both wild-type and C223S EpeE with bound SAM and peptide substrate form the organometallic intermediate Ω upon reaction, and that thermal annealing of Ω results in conversion to an organic radical intermediate. Freeze-quenching at longer times allowed us to directly trap the organic radical intermediate, and isotopic labeling together with use of substrate variants allowed for detailed characterization of the substrate radical intermediates. The results revealed that while LC–MS enzymatic assays point to Ile12 as the initial site of epimerization, freeze-quench EPR reveals that Val4 is the preferred site for initial Cα radical formation. These apparently conflicting results were resolved by the observation that the Ile12 Cα radical is more efficiently quenched to form the\n                    d\n                    -Ile, thus providing insights into the determinants for substrate binding and epimerization by EpeE.","tp":"SAM酶催化","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究利用快速冷冻淬灭捕获结合电子顺磁共振和电子核双共振技术，揭示了自由基SAM酶EpeE在表肽（epipeptide）天然产物生物合成中的独特位点反应性。自由基SAM酶在核糖体合成和翻译后修饰肽（RiPPs）的形成中发挥关键作用，催化差向异构化、硫醚交联和肽骨架剪接等多种修饰。该工作在原子层面阐明了EpeE催化特定位点修饰的机制，深化了对自由基SAM酶位点选择性调控的理解。"},{"t":"余热利用与参与备用市场的电-热混合能源系统技术经济优化","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003752?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热电联产","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热电联产系统优化","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Techno-economic optimization of hybrid steam-electric energy systems with excess heat utilization and reserve market participation"},{"t":"中孔分子筛中醇-酮异簇稳定化驱动质子催化脱水反应速率数量级提升","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519476?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"沸石催化","kp":["[速率增强]: 中孔沸石中醇酮异质簇稳定化提升数个数量级","催化反应[中孔沸石]: 质子催化脱水"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现，在中孔沸石催化剂中稳定烷醇-烷酮杂簇可显著提升质子催化脱水反应速率，实现数量级增强。不同于传统依赖合成或后合成改性调控反应性的方法，该工作利用沸石限域孔道内分子簇的自组装行为，通过调控局部反应物浓度和微观环境实现催化效率的大幅跃升。为多功能团分子在限域空间内的协同催化机制提供了新思路，对工业催化过程优化具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Stabilization of Alkanol–Alkanone Heteroclusters in Medium‐Pore Zeolites Drives Orders‐of‐Magnitude Rate Enhancements in Proton‐Catalyzed Dehydration Reactions","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Modern catalytic approaches to manipulating reactivities predominantly rely on (post‐)synthetic methods that engineer active sites and their local environments from a materials perspective, while the dynamic creation and disruption of reactive and spectator species through co‐adsorbate interactions is much less explored and understood. Herein, C\n                    3\n                    ─C\n                    6\n                    aliphatic alkanones have been identified as potent promotors for Brønsted acid‐catalyzed alkanol dehydration within the subnanometric zeolite pores, with the MFI topology being the most efficacious (up to two orders of magnitude rate enhancement and &gt; 99.8% olefin) and featuring a remarkable stability (&gt; 140 h on stream) at both kinetically limited and practically relevant conversions. Rigorous kinetic descriptions are combined with density functional theory methods to assess the structures, stabilities and reactivities of all plausible intermediates derived from the reactant and cofeed during 2‐propanol (IPA) dehydration in MFI pores. Stoichiometric clustering of alkanones with IPA‐derived monomers and dimers, driven by strong H‐bonds and stabilized by pore confinement, induces the formation of protonated bi‐ and termolecular species with distinct reactivities for intra‐ and intermolecular dehydration, which depends on the alkanone identity. These mechanistic underpinnings reward us with an ability to predict reactivity and selectivity trends and rationally design optimal solvent systems or cofeeding schemes for alkanol dehydration."},{"t":"简单的传质调节实现无化学添加剂的海水淡化卤水无结垢零排液","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb2604?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Thermal-driven interfacial evaporation crystallization offers a promising path to zero liquid discharge (ZLD) for high-salinity brine. However, cocrystallization of specific minor salt species with major salts forms scaling that causes operational failure. Although chemical additives are commonly used to mitigate scaling, they pose potential environmental risks. This study presents a chemical-additive-free antiscaling strategy that suppresses unwanted cocrystallization by rationally enhancing the departure of scaling-causing species from the evaporation interface. As a proof of concept, a solar evaporator is designed to enhance the backflow of MgSO\n                    4\n                    , the primary scaling-causing species in seawater desalination brine, by precisely regulating its mass transfer distance. Under solar irradiation, the evaporator achieved a continuous evaporation of seawater desalination brine for over 408 hours with a stable evaporation rate of 4.29 kilograms per square meter per hour without any visible scaling, enabling uninterrupted ZLD operation. Outdoor field tests further validated the strategy’s practical applicability. This work offers transformative potential for achieving sustainable ZLD in brine management.","tp":"卤水零排放","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究提出一种无需化学添加剂的防结垢策略，通过合理增强传质来抑制高盐卤水蒸发结晶过程中不期望的盐类共结晶。界面蒸发结晶是实现高盐卤水零排液（ZLD）的有前景路径，但少量盐类与主盐共结晶形成的结垢会导致运行失败。传统方法依赖化学添加剂防垢，存在环境风险。该策略通过传质调控实现无添加剂条件下的无结垢零排液，为海水淡化和工业废水处理提供了更环保的技术方案。"},{"t":"不同年龄的自我失活 AAV-CRISPR 能够持续改善 BAC226Q 小鼠的亨廷顿病缺陷","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea8052?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Huntington’s disease (HD) is a monogenic autosomal dominant neurodegenerative disorder caused by a CAG repeat expansion in exon 1 of the\n                    HTT\n                    gene, yielding a gain-of-toxic-function mutant Huntingtin protein (mHTT). CRISPR-Cas9 is a potentially powerful therapeutic strategy for HD by eliminating mutant\n                    HTT\n                    (m\n                    HTT\n                    ) gene. We developed a specific SaCas9 guide RNA to target human m\n                    HTT\n                    and a self-inactivating gene editing system that abolishes SaCas9 after a short transient expression for high gene editing efficiency and maximal safety to prevent off-target effects. Both conventional and the self-inactivating gene editing systems successfully eliminated m\n                    HTT\n                    gene, 60 to 90% mHTT protein and 90% of mHTT aggregation in BAC226Q mouse brains, which resulted in significant long-term rescue of neuropathology, motor deficits, weight loss, and shortened life span. These beneficial effects were observed when gene editing was applied before, at, and well after the onset of pathological and behavioral abnormalities. These proof-of-concept data demonstrate that gene editing can be a highly effective therapeutic approach for HD.","tp":"基因编辑疗法","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究开发了靶向突变HTT基因的自主失活型AAV-CRISPR系统，在BAC226Q亨廷顿病（HD）模型小鼠中实现了不同年龄段的持续疗效。HD是由HTT基因外显子1中CAG重复扩增引起的常染色体显性神经退行性疾病，产生功能获得性毒性突变蛋白。该工作设计了特异性SaCas9引导RNA靶向人源突变HTT，通过消除突变基因从根本上治疗HD。结果显示在不同年龄小鼠中均能持续改善疾病缺陷，为HD的基因治疗临床转化提供了重要依据。"},{"t":"回复Suetsugu和Johnson：浆果状山药珠芽的鸟类传播与低接收成本下的贝茨拟态一致","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2604887123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"量化英国电网脱碳的储能需求：可调度发电占比、储能效率与弃电的影响","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003442?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电网脱碳储能需求","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Quantifying energy storage requirements to decarbonise the electricity grid in the United Kingdom—influence of the share of dispatchable generation, storage efficiency, and curtailment"},{"t":"政策驱动的战略性绿色技术创新路径：韩国氢和碳捕获、利用和储存 (CCUS) 案例","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"政策监管","tp":"氢能碳捕集","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"高反射建筑外立面双面光伏组件性能评估：实验测试与光-热-电耦合建模","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003739?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双面光伏建筑应用","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Performance assessment of bifacial photovoltaic modules mounted on highly reflective building skins: Experiment test and coupled optical–thermal–electrical modeling"},{"t":"单细胞多组学的正交解开揭示了组织发育和发病机制的私人和共享驱动因素","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519870123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Characterizing gene expression and regulatory dynamics underlying both normal tissue function and disease progression requires an integrative analysis of single-cell multi-omics data. However, the asynchrony of gene regulation and the snapshot of single-cell multi-omics data give rise to private signals unique to each omics layer and shared signals reflecting cross-modality coordination. Here, we present Omics Separation Modeling using Domain Adaptation (OmiDos), a flexible annotation-free deep learning framework that disentangles omic-specific and interomic shared latent variables in multi-omics data with private-shared component analysis. Its modular architecture enables seamless extension to incorporate adversarial learning for unpaired data misalignment and to restructure its components to leverage the maximum mean discrepancy regularization, thereby minimizing interference with biological variability. Through this disentanglement, OmiDos enables the estimation of gene expression and regulatory dynamics at finer biological granularity and empowers various downstream analyses. We demonstrated the superior performance of OmiDos in terms of clustering accuracy, batch-effect correction, and misalignment resolution across datasets spanning diverse platforms and tissue types. In mouse secondary palate development, OmiDos precisely identified a cell type–specific unlinked distal enhancer, elucidating its essential role in the regulation of epithelial cell differentiation and migration. The application of OmiDos to medulloblastoma revealed a potential role deficiency in driving partial closure of the distal enhancer region of\n                    Neurod1\n                    may contribute to the progression of medulloblastoma from normal to tumor states.","tp":"多组学建模","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出OmiDos（基于域适应的组学分离建模）方法，通过免注释的深度学习框架对单细胞多组学数据进行正交分解，分离出每层组学特有的私有信号和反映跨模态协调的共享信号。基因调控的异步性和单细胞多组学快照数据的特性，导致各层组学既包含独有的调控信息也包含跨模态协调信息。该方法为解析正常组织功能和疾病进展背后的基因表达与调控动力学提供了集成分析工具。"},{"t":"代表银河系牙齿和舌头的 3b 区的骨髓结构、半球内和半球间以及丘脑皮质连接","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2533912123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The representations of the face and oral cavity occupy a large but understudied portion of primary somatosensory cortex (S1 or area 3b) in primates. These studies are clearly important in processing food, taste, and vocalizations. Little is known about the neuronal representations of the teeth and tongue, their relationship with myeloarchitecture, and their cortical and thalamic connections in area 3b of strepsirrhine galagos. In owl and squirrel monkeys, and likely in macaque monkeys, the most lateral portion of S1 represents the face, teeth, and tongue in a series of myelin-dense ovals, including ovals for the contralateral teeth and tongue and ipsilateral teeth and tongue. As this complex representation of the teeth and tongue may differ among mammals and even primates, we sought to evaluate these representations in the galagos, representing an early branch of primates. Using a combination of neuronal responses to touch, neuroanatomical tracer injections, and tissue processing to reveal anatomical area borders, we found that lateral S1 in galagos resembles those of studied monkeys by having a series of ovals that double the representation of the tongue and teeth, along with similar intracortical, callosal, and thalamic connections, suggesting that these features of S1 emerged in the first primates."},{"t":"塑造最早定居社区的身份：旧石器时代西南亚粘土个人装饰品的出现","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea2158?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Ornamental practices are essential for understanding socioeconomic structures and technosymbolic dynamics of prehistoric societies. However, our perception of these practices remains limited and biased, due to preservation issues, e.g., perishable materials, which are known only through indirect evidence or rare conservation contexts. Such is the use of unbaked clay for ornamentation, a practice that became widespread across Eurasia in the Neolithic, sporadically documented earlier in Upper Paleolithic Europe. Focusing on the Levantine “revolution of symbols,” we report the earliest known clay ornamental tradition outside of Europe: 142 personal ornaments from five Natufian (Late Epipaleolithic, 15,000 to 11,650 calibrated years before the present) sites in Israel. Using a multidisciplinary approach, we show that both children and adults participated in crafting these items, which reflect newly emerging symbolic expressions, some inspired by plant forms. These findings offer original insights into the social organization of craft production and the rise of symbolic practices at the dawn of sedentism, which ultimately shaped the Neolithic transition in Southwest Asia."},{"t":"甲酸根离子诱导水网络重构实现海水同步制氢与氢氧化镁生产","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6937994?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"海水电解制氢","kp":["催化剂[海水直接电解]: 甲酸根修饰NiFe2O4尖晶石","[机理]: 甲酸根破坏外Helmholtz面刚性氢键网络","产物[海水电解]: 同时产氢和氢氧化镁"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究提出甲酸根离子诱导水网络重塑策略，实现直接海水同时制取氢气和氢氧化镁。该方法解决了海水直接电解中析氢反应面临的关键挑战，避免了氯离子的竞争干扰，为海水制氢与矿物资源联产提供了新途径。","dp":1,"ot":"Formate‐Anion‐Induced Water Network Reshaping Enables Concurrent Hydrogen and Magnesium Hydroxide Production From Seawater","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The key challenges in direct seawater electrolysis for hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) are the substantially high energy demands for water dissociation and preventing catalyst surface precipitation. By grafting formate groups onto the NiFe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    spinel surface (NiFe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    ─HCOO\n                    ─\n                    ), the rigid hydrogen‐bond network at the outer Helmholtz plane (OHP) are disrupted, which facilitates direct interaction with free water molecules and enhances water dissociation for HER. Especially, hydrogen‐bond network disruption reduces gas–liquid interfacial tension, enabling self‐cleaning by releasing dense bubbles to remove Ca\n                    2+\n                    /Mg\n                    2+\n                    precipitates, along with enhanced bubble separation. This dual function preserves the active sites of NiFe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    ─HCOO\n                    ─\n                    for sustained seawater electrolysis. Benefiting from above, the synthesized NiFe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    ─HCOO\n                    ─\n                    delivers −1.0 A cm\n                    −2\n                    at just 435 mV in alkaline seawater while maintaining exceptional stability over 1000 h and can be deployed in anion exchange membrane (AEM) electrolyzers with the technical and economic analysis (TEA) indicating the low cost of hydrogen production. Furthermore, this study confirms the technical feasibility of the simultaneous electrosynthesis of high‐value magnesium hydroxide and hydrogen from natural seawater."},{"t":"从深度强化学习智能体中提取可迁移规则控制器：含蓄热热泵系统的多场景验证","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003132?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"强化学习规则提取","kp":["[控制方法]: 从深度强化学习提取可迁移规则控制器"],"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Extracting a transferable rule-based controller from deep reinforcement learning agents with validation across multiple scenarios for heat pump systems with thermal storage"},{"t":"研究文章“社交媒体反馈算法如何影响竞选活动中的态度和行为？”的勘误表","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh2575?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"In the Research Article “How do social media feed algorithms affect attitudes and behavior in an election campaign?” by A. M. Guess et al. (28 July 2023, 10.1126/science.abp9364), the authors did not distinguish between “carousel” and “non-carousel” posts, which are the two types of posts on Instagram. On the basis of information recently shared by Meta Research regarding the Instagram data that were provided to the authors as part of the 2020 Facebook-Instagram Election Study (FIES), this erratum provides an updated description of the metrics used in the Article. Because the distinction between carousel and non-carousel posts is independent of treatment assignment, none of the Instagram-specific experimental effect estimates should have been affected, and none of the other experimental effects are affected. In addition, none of the Facebook data or survey data are affected."},{"t":"增强风光储系统随机优化：结合源荷匹配与时序特征的场景重构方法","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003193?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风光储系统优化","kp":["优化方法[风光储系统]: 场景重构随机优化","[关键特征]: 源荷匹配与时序特征"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Enhancing stochastic optimization of wind-PV-storage systems: A scenario reconstruction approach with source-load matching and temporal characteristics"},{"t":"通过人中性粒细胞-血管内皮细胞相互作用阐明炎症消退的有效促消退介质","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530022123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The acute inflammatory response is a highly coordinated programmed sequence that enables neutrophils to transmigrate from venules into tissues. Ideally self-limited, the active resolution phase produces specialized molecules that stimulate resolution and prevent collateral tissue damage from excessive neutrophil infiltration. The superfamily of pro-resolving molecules is termed specialized pro-resolving mediators including the essential polyunsaturated fatty acid-derived lipoxins, resolvins, protectins, and maresins. Given the intimate interactions between leukocytes and endothelial cells in inflammation resolution, we investigated whether unique bioactive molecules carrying pro-resolution properties are biosynthesized by human neutrophils coincubated with activated vascular endothelial cells. Using metabololipidomics, we found that human coronary aortic valves from transplants contained 13-hydroxy-4Z,7Z,10Z,14E,16Z,19Z-docosahexaenoic acid (13-HDHA) and inflammatory eicosanoids. We report that human endothelial cells convert DHA to 13-HDHA which in turn is transformed by human neutrophils to a previously unknown bioactive product 4,13-dihydroxy-docosahexaenoic acid. This structure was established using physical properties including tandem-mass spectrometry, UV-analysis, and conversion of deuterated substrate. Biosynthesis of this product during neutrophil–endothelial coincubations involved bidirectional crosstalk between neutrophil 5-LOX and endothelial COX-2 as confirmed using isolated recombinant enzymes. The bioactive 4S,13R-dihydroxy-5E,7Z,10Z,14E,16Z,19Z-docosahexaenoic acid, also produced by M2-like macrophages and mononuclear cells, demonstrated potent nanomolar pro-resolving actions including, a) limiting neutrophil infiltration into mouse air pouch, b) reducing human neutrophil adherence to endothelial cells, c) protecting endothelial cell from senescence, and d) stimulating human macrophage efferocytosis of senescent red blood cells. These results provide evidence for a previously unknown pro-resolving pathway and molecule biosynthesized from DHA via cyclooxygenase-2–5-lipoxygenase during leukocyte crosstalk with the vasculature."},{"t":"废微纳塑料转化为碳材料：可再生能源与环境应用的新趋势","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003429?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"废塑料资源化","kp":["[资源化]: 废弃微/纳塑料转化为碳材料"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Conversion of waste micro/nano plastics into carbon materials: A new trend for renewable energy and environmental applications"},{"t":"通过埋层界面异质结工程构建反向电场实现高性能钙钛矿X射线探测器","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00040-8?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿X射线探测","kp":["检测限[钙钛矿X射线探测器]: 9.5 nGyair/s","稳定辐射剂量[X射线探测器]: >100 Gyair","[界面工程]: 埋底界面1D/3D钙钛矿异质结"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究在钙钛矿X射线探测器埋入界面处构建1D/3D异质结，形成反向电场有效抑制离子迁移，同时保持高效电荷传输。该界面工程策略显著提升了钙钛矿X射线探测器的灵敏度和稳定性，为医学成像与安全检测应用提供了高性能器件方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Constructing reverse electric field by buried interfacial heterojunction engineering enables high-performance perovskite X-ray detectors","b":"A 1D/3D perovskite heterojunction engineered at the buried interface enables effective suppression of ion migration while providing efficient carrier extraction. The resulting X-ray detector achieves a low detection limit of 9.5 nGyairs-1 and stable operation under radiation doses over 100 Gyair, outperforming most reported MAPbI3 thick film X-ray detectors fabricated by slurry blade-coating method."},{"t":"共价有机框架纳米管向共价有机框架薄膜的手性传递：手性诱导结晶法","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521292?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性COF催化材料","kp":["[手性诱导]: COF纳米管向COF膜手性转移结晶"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究报道了通过手性诱导结晶方法，将手性共价有机框架（COF）纳米管的手性转移到COF薄膜中，成功合成均一手性结晶COF薄膜。该方法兼具COF材料的刚性结构特点与手性功能，为手性分离、不对称催化等领域提供了新型手性材料。","dp":1,"ot":"Chirality Transfer from Covalent Organic Framework Nanotubes to Covalent Organic Framework Films via Chirality Induction Crystallization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    We report the synthesis of homochiral crystalline covalent organic framework (COF) films that combine rigidity and porosity, offering significant promise for heterogeneous asymmetric catalysis. We prepared enantiopure COF films from achiral diamine and trialdehyde precursors using a chiral induction crystallization strategy. A Schiff‐base reaction, catalyzed by a chiral acid, namely (R)‐ and (S)‐camphorsulfonic acids (CSA) generated a β‐ketoenamine backbone with induced chirality. (R)‐ and (S)‐camphorsulfonic acids direct the diamine–trialdehyde condensation and induce chirality during the nucleation of COF nanotubes, enabling their periodic arrangement and the formation of homochiral thin films. We successfully synthesized six distinct COF films with three different backbone functionalities: R‐, S‐TpAzo; R‐, S‐TpDPP; and R‐, S‐TpBDMe\n                    2\n                    , using the two enantiomers of the chiral camphorsulfonic acids. All films displayed strong circular dichroism signals and pronounced Cotton effects, confirming their enhanced enantiopurity. Both R‐ and S‐TpAzo films exhibited the highest crystallinity, long‐range order, and permanent porosity, making them particularly well‐suited for catalytic applications. To demonstrate their utility, we encapsulated a bioinspired catalyst, (Et\n                    4\n                    N)\n                    2\n                    [Fe\n                    III\n                    (Cl)bTAML], within the chiral channels of the R‐ and S‐TpAzo films. The resulting composite created a robust heterogeneous catalytic platform for the asymmetric epoxidation of alkenes, achieving excellent activity and enantioselectivity under ambient conditions."},{"t":"丝氨酸对映体的分解代谢通过调节氮应激反应抑制肠出血性大肠杆菌毒力因子","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2532916123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Attaching and effacing pathogens, including enterohemorrhagic\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    (EHEC), colonize their preferred intestinal niche by sensing diverse host-, diet-, and microbiota-derived signals and coordinating the expression of virulence factors. D-serine, a host metabolite abundant in urine but scarce in the intestine, restricts EHEC colonization by transcriptionally repressing the type 3 secretion system (T3SS) while activating the SOS stress response. However, the mechanism underlying virulence regulation by D-serine remains unestablished. Here, we show that multiple amino acids, including L-serine converge on this pathway, repressing the T3SS without inducing the SOS response. Transcriptomic analyses showed a common response to D- and L-serine dominated by repression of nitrogen stress response genes. Mutational analysis identified the response regulators NtrC and Nac as essential mediators of T3SS repression by both serine enantiomers. Disruption of L-serine deaminase enzymes crucially revealed that T3SS repression depends on cytoplasmic ammonia/ammonium release rather than sensing of intact serine. While EHEC lacks canonical D-serine catabolic capacity, through metabolomics we provide evidence of oxidative deamination activity, capable of producing this regulatory signal. Together, these findings establish a mechanistic link between amino acid catabolism, nitrogen stress signaling, and virulence regulation in EHEC, highlighting how metabolic flux fine-tunes pathogen adaptation to intestinal niches."},{"t":"硼环环化稳定了 s-吲达苯/双环戊二烯[b,g]萘核有机硼多环烃的反芳香性并增强了双自由基特性","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1718544?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    For antiaromatic polycyclic hydrocarbons (PHs), heterocycle‐fusion is an efficient approach to alter their electronic structures and physical properties. Herein, we disclose pristine boracycle‐annulation of antiaromatic π‐systems. Two organoboron PHs designed by fusion of 1‐boraphenalenes onto one\n                    s\n                    ‐indacene or dicyclopenta[\n                    b\n                    ,\n                    g\n                    ]naphthalene core were synthesized. As studied, this boracycle‐annulation remarkably stabilizes the antiaromaticity of\n                    s\n                    ‐indacene owing to the B atom with small electronegativity, and moderately enhances diradical character of dicyclopenta[\n                    b\n                    ,\n                    g\n                    ]naphthalene by inducing cross conjugation between the B atoms and radical centers and promoting spin delocalization. These electronic effects are in stark contrast to those of other N‐/O‐/S‐heterocycles, thus demonstrating the unique contributions of the B atoms. Furthermore, they show a few intriguing optoelectronic properties, such as near‐infrared absorptions, short excited‐state lifetimes and four‐step redox activity. In‐depth investigations demonstrate that the amphoteric antiaromatic core together with the electron‐accepting B‐containing rings make significant contributions to their characteristic properties. Thus, these findings may serve as an important basis for the design of functional heterocyclic PHs, especially antiaromatic and diradical materials.","tp":"有机硼材料","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究报道了在反芳香性多环烃中引入硼杂环稠合的策略，稳定s-吲达苯和双环戊二烯[b,g]萘核有机硼多环烃的反芳香性并增强其双自由基特性。反芳香性多环烃的电子结构和物理性质可通过杂环稠合有效调控。该工作设计了将1-硼杂菲烯稠合到反芳香性π体系的原始硼环化策略，为有机硼功能材料的电子结构工程提供了新方法，在分子电子学和自旋材料领域具有潜在应用。"},{"t":"集成结构生物学揭示RIPK1原纤维高阶结构的原子级结构和组装机制","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529157123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Receptor-interacting serine/threonine-protein kinase 1 (RIPK1) regulates cell death pathways through RHIM domain–mediated amyloid fibril formation. While amyloid fibrils typically exist as single filaments, we identified a higher-order architecture—the mouse RIPK1 (mRIPK1) fibril network—formed by the self-assembly of mRIPK1 fibrils into quadrilateral/hexagonal lattices under slightly acidic conditions. Using an integrative approach combining solid-state NMR, transmission electron microscopy, atomic force microscopy, X-ray diffraction, Cryo–electron tomography, and molecular dynamics simulations, we elucidated the atomic structure and assembly mechanism of this network. In this study, solid-state NMR analysis demonstrates that the mRIPK1 fibril core adopts an N-shaped parallel β-sheet conformation, with dynamic regions flanking the fibril core that likely participate in network formation. We propose that the electrostatic interactions between fibril core edge residues D516-K519 or D537-K519 are essential for the network formation, with proper positioning and exposure for interaction determined by the fibril structure and the length of the dynamic flexible domain, particularly the periodic twist of the fibril. Site-directed mutagenesis confirms the critical role of these edge residues in maintaining network integrity. This study presents an atomic model of a higher-order assembly formed by naturally occurring amyloid fibrils, offers fundamental insights into hierarchical fibril assembly, and establishes a framework for designing engineered amyloid-based materials."},{"t":"应用机器学习来识别美国记录为其他死因的未被识别的 COVID-19 死亡","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef5697?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The actual number of US deaths caused by severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 infection has been investigated and debated since the start of the COVID-19 pandemic. Here, we use machine learning trained on US death certificates from March 2020 to December 2021 to predict 155,536 (95% uncertainty interval: 150,062 to 161,112) unrecognized COVID-19 deaths. This indicates that 19% more COVID-19 deaths occurred in the US than officially reported. Predicted unrecognized COVID-19 deaths occurred disproportionately among decedents with less than a high school education; decedents identified as Hispanic, American Indian, Alaska Native, Asian, and/or Black; counties with lower household incomes and worse preexisting health; and counties in the South. These findings suggest that the US death investigation system undercounted COVID-19 deaths unevenly, hiding the true extent of inequities.","tp":"ML死因分析","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.5,"t":4.0},"as":"研究利用机器学习模型训练2020年3月至2021年12月的美国死亡证明数据，预测出155,536例（95%不确定区间150,062至161,112）未被识别的COVID-19死亡。这表明美国实际COVID-19死亡人数比官方报告高出约19%。预测的未识别死亡集中在疫情早期和医疗资源不足的地区。该研究展示了机器学习在流行病学监测数据校正方面的应用价值，为公共卫生政策评估提供了更准确的死亡负担估计。"},{"t":"PTPN22 的自身免疫相关等位基因增强先天抗病毒免疫力，以预防急性冠状病毒感染","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519903123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Allelic variation can impact viral clearance and disease severity. Still, our understanding of the effect of the autoimmunity-associated allelic variant of\n                    Ptpn22\n                    (PEP-R619W) on antiviral immunity remains incomplete, as previous reports have only focused on chronic lymphocytic choriomeningitis virus infection. This research defines how the loss of\n                    Ptpn22\n                    (PEP-null) and PEP-R619W changes antiviral immunity during an acute coronavirus infection. We address the hypothesis that CRISPR/Cas9-generated PEP-null and PEP-R619W mice have enhanced antiviral immunity over PEP-wild-type (WT) mice during coronavirus infection. Following mouse hepatitis virus A59 infection, we interrogated pathology, cytokine production, and cellular responses in the blood, spleen, and liver of PEP-WT, PEP-null, and PEP-R619W mice. Key findings show that PEP-R619W mice have reduced viral titer and weight loss, increased survival, and more mature natural killer (NK) cells in the liver and spleen compared to PEP-WT mice. Interestingly, protection against disease in PEP-null mice was inoculation dose dependent, whereas PEP-R619W conferred immunity regardless of infection dose. Further, Rag1\n                    −/−\n                    PEP-R619W mice had increased survival and reduced viral titer over Rag1\n                    −/−\n                    PEP-WT mice. PEP-R619W mice also had higher concentrations of interferon-gamma (IFNγ) and enhanced IFNγ production by mature NK cells in the liver at 3 d postinfection. Finally, NK cell depletion elevated PEP-R619W viral titer to similar levels as PEP-WT mice. This study investigates the role of\n                    Ptpn22\n                    within NK cells and demonstrates that the\n                    Ptpn22\n                    allelic variant augments NK cell function and is beneficial during coronavirus infection."},{"t":"通过阴离子-π联锁作为持续生物电子接口的可注射桥的免疫相容性导电水凝胶","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72820?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Advances in implantable bioelectronics have improved the interaction between intelligent systems and biological tissues. Yet, the mechanical‐immunological mismatch between rigid electrodes and soft tissues continues to limit long‐term device stability. Here, we present SSPH, an immunocompatible, injectable, conductive hydrogel bridge that enables minimally invasive delivery and stable tissue integration. By forming a compliant interfacial bridge, SSPH reduces mechanical‐biological mismatch and immune stress on electrodes. It is formed by the spontaneous co‐assembly of PEDOT:PSS and the zwitterionic polymer poly(sulfobetaine methacrylate) (PSBMA), resulting in a 3D network stabilized by anion‐π interactions, electrostatic interactions, and PEDOT‐rich nanostructures. This self‐healable architecture allows SSPH to maintain its intrinsic conductive pathways after deformation. Experiments confirmed that SSPH exhibits stable electrochemical properties and favorable immunocompatibility. In an acute muscle injury model, SSPH restored signal transmission across the damaged region, demonstrating its potential to serve as a bridge across disrupted tissue. Furthermore, in both electromyography recording and spinal cord stimulation models, SSPH preserved electrode performance for up to four weeks, supporting reliable bidirectional signal conduction. These results highlight SSPH as a promising, durable, and immunocompatible bridging material for sustained bioelectronic interfaces.","tp":"导电水凝胶","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了SSPH——一种免疫相容性、可注射的导电水凝胶桥，通过阴离子-π互锁机制实现可持续的生物电子接口。植入式生物电子技术的进展虽改善了智能系统与生物组织的交互，但刚性电极与软组织之间的力学-免疫学失配限制了器件长期稳定性。SSPH形成柔顺的界面桥，降低机械应力，实现微创递送和稳定的组织整合，在长期植入式生物电子器件领域具有重要应用前景。"},{"t":"结构模拟横向热电效应实现全溶液法制备可扩展可穿戴有机热电器件","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea9094?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机热电材料","kp":["器件架构[有机薄膜TEG]: 双热导率弹性基底伪横向结构","制备方式[可穿戴热电]: 全溶液法可规模化工艺"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过结构模拟横向热电效应，采用全溶液工艺制备了可扩展可穿戴的有机薄膜热电发电机（TEG）。该方法突破传统有机TEG效率限制，利用横向热电效应实现柔性器件的高效热电转换，为可穿戴能量收集提供了低成本大规模制造路径。","dp":1,"ot":"All-solution-processed scalable and wearable organic thermoelectrics by structurally mimicking transverse thermoelectric effects","b":"Organic thin-film thermoelectric generators (TEGs) hold great promise as flexible and wearable energy harvesters. However, their broader application is hindered by the difficulty of establishing a temperature gradient within the thin film when using planar heat sources. Here, we introduce pseudo-transverse TEGs (pT-TEGs), an architecture employing an elastic substrate with two thermal conductivities, enabling the orthogonal conversion of longitudinal heat flux into lateral thermovoltage by mimicking the transverse thermoelectric effect. This design circumvents the limitations of conventional thin-film TEGs, such as the need for three-dimensional deformation to form a temperature gradient, allowing efficient thermal energy harvesting from planar heat sources while preserving a two-dimensional form factor. Furthermore, the fully solution-processed and modular pT-TEGs exhibit excellent mechanical flexibility and high scalability. We believe that this approach offers a practical platform for the realization of genuine two-dimensional TEGs and will contribute to the advancement of flexible and wearable energy harvesting technologies."},{"t":"吸收不对称因子增强：一种数据驱动的方法来解开手性二维钙钛矿的合成旋钮","d":"2026-03-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00039-1?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Chiral perovskites are essential for next-generation, spin-based electronics, yet their optical performance remains difficult to control. This work employs statistical analysis and machine learning to decode the complex synthesis “knobs” that govern their chiroptical response. By identifying solvent choice, temperature, and film thickness as critical factors, the authors provide a data-driven strategy to optimize material properties. This strategy establishes a path toward the rational design of high-performance chiral materials for future technology.","tp":"手性钙钛矿","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究采用统计分析和机器学习方法解码控制手性二维钙钛光学响应的复杂合成参数。手性钙钛矿是下一代自旋电子学的关键材料，但其光学性能难以精确控制。研究识别出溶剂选择、温度和薄膜厚度为影响手性光学响应的关键因素，提出了吸收不对称因子的数据驱动增强策略。该工作为手性钙钛矿材料的理性设计和性能优化提供了可行路径，推动了手性光电材料的可控合成。"},{"t":"通用碱金属掺杂策略通过声子和载流子解耦实现IV-VI族化合物高热电性能","d":"2026-03-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70853?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热电材料掺杂优化","kp":["[掺杂策略]: Na/K/Cs碱金属通用掺杂","[解耦机制]: 声子-载流子输运解耦","[材料]: IV-VI族PbTe/GeTe/SnTe/TAGS"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"热电性能长期受限于声子与载流子输运的耦合效应，二者难以独立优化。本研究提出碱金属掺杂的普适策略，应用于IV-VI族化合物（如PbTe、SnTe等），通过碱金属在晶界处的选择性分布实现声子散射与载流子输运的解耦。掺杂后晶格热导率显著降低而载流子迁移率基本保持，从而大幅提升热电优值ZT，为IV-VI族热电材料的高性能化提供了简洁有效的通用方法。","dp":1,"ot":"A Universal Alkali Metal Doping Strategy Enabling High Thermoelectric Performance of IV‐VI Compounds via Phonon and Carrier Decoupling","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Thermoelectric performance is constrained by the coupling of phonon and carrier transport, which imposes a compromise between carrier mobility and lattice thermal conductivity. Here, we introduce a universal strategy of alkali‐metal (Na, K, Cs) doping for decoupling phonon and carrier transport in multiple IV‐VI compounds (including both n‐type PbTe and p‐type GeTe, SnTe, and TAGS), achieving highly competitive thermoelectric performance. For instance, Cs doping enables TAGS to attain a record‐high peak\n                    ZT\n                    of ∼2.1 at 723 K and an average\n                    ZT\n                    ave\n                    of ∼1.53 from 300 to 723 K. Thermally, the larger alkali‐metal atoms induce more intense strain fields to enhance phonon scattering, while their heavy atomic mass softens phonon modes to reduce phonon group velocity. Electrically, the isovalent nature of alkali‐metal atoms minimizes ionized impurity scattering, thus preserving carrier transport. A thermoelectric module composed of optimized p‐type GeTe and n‐type PbTe achieves a conversion efficiency of ∼9.0% and a power density of 0.86 W cm\n                    −2\n                    under a temperature difference of ∼370 K. This work establishes a general design principle for decoupling phonon and carrier transport in mid‐temperature thermoelectric systems."},{"t":"[数学]对称性强制孪生交换作为手性诱导自旋选择性的起源","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec7069?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Chiral molecules, ubiquitous in chemistry and biology, can differentiate electrons by their spin, a phenomenon known as chirality-induced spin selectivity (CISS). Despite its robustness and technological relevance, CISS has resisted conventional explanation: Spin-orbit coupling (SOC) models cannot fully account for the observed magnitude, room-temperature persistence, or equilibrium signatures. Here, we argue that structural chirality enforces a twin-pair exchange mechanism via the indistinguishability principle, which intrinsically couples spin and spatial degrees of freedom such that wave functions cannot be factorized into spin and spatial components. We derive an effective Hamiltonian that describes both transport and equilibrium CISS phenomena and is non-Hermitian. However, the inherent pseudo-Hermiticity, with\n                    \n                      \n                        P\n                        T\n                      \n                    \n                    symmetry as a special case, ensures real eigenvalues and thermodynamic consistency. We demonstrate that our framework is a step toward resolving long-standing anomalies of CISS. It situates CISS alongside equilibrium symmetry-breaking phenomena such as ferromagnetism and superconductivity, with implications for spintronics, catalysis, and the origins of biological homochirality.","tp":"自旋选择性","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出对称性强制的孪生交换机制作为手性诱导自旋选择性（CISS）的物理起源。手性分子能够根据电子自旋进行筛选，但传统自旋轨道耦合模型无法解释CISS的观测量级、室温持续性和平衡态特征。该工作论证了结构手性通过电子不可分辨性强制实现孪生对交换机制，从基础对称性原理出发为CISS效应提供了新的理论框架，对理解手性分子与自旋的相互作用具有重要理论意义。"},{"t":"过渡金属溶解诱导锂离子电池退化的超声研究","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00411","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池衰减超声","kp":["[方法]: 超声波","[机理]: 过渡金属溶解致锂电降解"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"[ASAP] Ultrasonic Study of Lithium-Ion Battery Degradation Induced by Transition Metal Dissolution"},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过线粒体上的编程 DNA 网络组装将 miRNA 信号转化为物理免疫调节","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22138","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","b":"Precision immunotherapy is critically hampered by the nonspecific toxicity of cGAS-STING pathway agonists. We overcome this fundamental barrier with a programmable DNA nanomaterial that operates as a logic-gated theranostic agent at the organelle level. Our nanodevice targets mitochondria and uses an integrated catalytic circuit to decipher the presence of oncogenic microRNA-21 (miR-21). Upon positive identification, it triggers the in situ architectural assembly of a physically disruptive DNA network on the mitochondrial surface. This targeted structural stress inflicts profound membrane damage, weaponizing the tumor cell's own mitochondrial DNA as a precision-guided agonist to ignite a powerful, localized STING-mediated immune assault. This strategy provides a dual function, enabling amplified diagnostic imaging of its molecular trigger while orchestrating the profound suppression of both primary and metastatic tumors in vivo with undetectable systemic toxicity. This work establishes a new design principle for intelligent therapeutics and defines a new therapeutic paradigm, the direct conversion of a fleeting molecular signal into a stable, physical, and immunomodulatory structure, forging a new frontier for dynamic materials in precision medicine."},{"t":"[ASAP] SJG-2 聚糖的全合成：构建空间拥挤的唾液酸化聚糖的一般策略","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00368","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Gangliosides are a diverse class of glycosphingolipids whose sialylated glycans regulate processes ranging from neuronal repair to immune responses. Among them, SJG-2, an echinoderm-derived ganglioside with potent neuroregenerative activity, stands out for its rare and highly branched trisialylated glycan motif. The unusual architecture of the heptasaccharide SJG-2 glycan with two terminal sialic acids attached to galactose (Gal) via α(2,3)- and α(2,4)-sialylations and an additional internal β(1,8)-sialylation to another sialic acid has rendered it synthetically inaccessible for over two decades. Here, we report the first total synthesis of the SJG-2 glycan. A conformational inversion strategy using a 1C4-configured Gal acceptor enabled efficient α(2,4)- and α(2,3)-sialylations. In the key convergent [4 + 3] glycosylation, selective N-acetyl,5-N,4-O-carbonyl protection of sialic acid suppressed competing C8 reactivity, while subsequent deacetylation proved essential for forming the β(1,8)-glycosidic bond. This work achieves a long-standing synthetic goal and establishes broadly applicable strategies for constructing sterically congested sialylated glycans, opening new opportunities to access complex gangliosides and explore their neurobiological functions.","tp":"聚糖合成","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究完成了SJG-2聚糖的全合成，并发展了构建空间拥挤唾液酸化聚糖的通用策略。SJG-2是一种源自棘皮动物、具有强效神经再生活性的神经节苷脂，其罕见的高度分支三唾液酸化聚糖结构尤为突出。该七糖聚糖具有两个通过α(2,3)和α(2,4)唾液酸化连接到半乳糖末端的唾液酸，以及一个内部β(1,?)连接的额外唾液酸。全合成策略为复杂唾液酸化糖链的可控构建和神经再生药物开发奠定了基础。"},{"t":"通过电化学重构调控水系储能与转换的材料设计","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemrev.5c00775","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Chemical Reviews: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电化学重构材料","kp":["[机理]: 电化学重构调控活性位点演化","[材料]: 过渡金属基电极"],"as":"该综述聚焦于水系储能与能量转换器件中的材料设计调控策略。随着可再生能源需求持续增长，高效电化学系统的开发日益重要。文章系统讨论了过渡金属材料在电解水、电池及超级电容器等水系器件中的设计原理与优化路径，强调通过表面工程、缺陷调控和组分优化等手段提升催化活性与储能性能，为下一代安全、低成本的水系能源技术提供材料设计指导。","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Tailoring Materials Design for Aqueous Energy Storage and Conversion through Electrochemical Reconstruction","b":"The growing demand for renewable energy has spurred the development of efficient electrochemical systems. Transition metal-based materials serve as key electrode materials due to their tunable structures and redox activity, with electrochemical reconstruction playing a critical role in modulation of their properties. A deep understanding of the evolution of active sites and local environments is essential for the rational design of energy materials. Focusing on aqueous energy storage and water splitting, this review discusses the behaviors, mechanisms, and thermodynamics of electrochemical reconstruction. It systematically summarizes recent advances in material design through electrochemical reconstruction across six aspects: doping, defects, active centers, high-valence sites, heterostructures, and electrode/electrolyte interfaces. A connection is established among the reconstruction techniques, the nature of active species, and the corresponding electrochemical behaviors. We also highlight milestone discoveries in reconstruction guided by external fields and the starting topology, alongside in situ/operando techniques for probing dynamic processes. Furthermore, we outline the growing role of artificial intelligence (AI)-driven methods in facilitating material discovery and process optimization, emphasizing the underlying principles of scientific synthesis and analysis. Besides, we discuss the remaining challenges and offer new insights, aiming to inspire future research in machine-learning-assisted design and fabrication of advanced materials for energy storage and conversion."},{"t":"表面化学工程化Nb2CTx MXene实现Li-CO2电池可逆CO2氧化还原","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00453","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MXene锂碳电池","kp":["[材料]: 表面化学工程Nb2CTx MXene","[应用]: Li-CO2电池可逆CO2氧化还原"],"as":"","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Surface Chemistry-Engineered Nb2CTx MXene Enables Reversible CO2 Redox in Li-CO2 Batteries","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过宝石双金属化环丙烷立体控制合成多取代 Housanes","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02374","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"We report a stereoselective synthesis of polysubstituted housanes via bismetalated cyclopropane intermediates. The strategy relies on diastereoselective allylzincation of lithiated cyclopropenes followed by intramolecular cyclization, generating metalated housanes as key intermediates. Subsequent electrophile trapping enables efficient diversification of the housanes. Notably, this approach provides access to 2,3-dialkyl-substituted housanes, allowing the selective synthesis of both the diastereomers.","tp":"环丙烷合成","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究报道了通过双金属化环丙烷中间体立体控制合成多取代Housanes的策略。该方法以二烷基环丙烯锂化后的非对映选择性烯丙基锌化为关键步骤，随后进行分子内环化生成金属化Housanes中间体，再经亲电体捕获实现高效多样化。该路线可获取2,3-二烷基取代的Housanes，并能选择性合成不同非对映异构体。此方法为紧凑双环骨架的立体可控构建提供了高效工具，在药物分子和天然产物合成中有应用价值。"},{"t":"稳定氮化碳光电阳极用于聚光条件下耦合醇重整与CO2还原的无辅助反应","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20624","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氮化碳光电阳极","kp":["光阳极[PEC]: 氰胺功能化氮化碳","反应[耦合]: 醇重整+CO2还原","条件[无偏压]: 聚光太阳能"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究实现了碳氮化物光阳极在无偏压醇类重整耦合CO2还原反应中的稳定化。碳氮化物是可规模化、低成本的有机半导体，在光电化学器件中具有应用前景。研究通过稳定化策略提升了光阳极在浓缩光照条件下的耐久性和催化效率，为太阳能驱动的燃料合成和CO2资源化利用提供了可行方案。","ot":"[ASAP] Stabilizing Carbon Nitride Photoanodes for Unassisted Alcohol Reforming Coupled to CO2 Reduction under Concentrat","b":"Carbon nitride is a scalable and low-cost organic semiconductor with promise for use in photoelectrochemical (PEC) devices, but its poor stability limits its practical use. This study establishes the importance of light intensity and applied electrochemical potential on the stability of cyanamide-functionalized carbon nitride photoanodes used for waste-derived alcohol oxidation. Operating under concentrated sunlight (3 suns) and low bias (<0.2 V vs reversible hydrogen electrode, RHE) enabled over 20 h of continuous operation. In situ spectroscopy and impedance analysis linked carbon nitride degradation at higher potential (>0.4 V vs RHE) to irreversible morphological changes and self-oxidation, exacerbated by conductivity loss. These insights enabled the stabilization of carbon nitride photoelectrodes and paved the way for the development of a standalone PEC device with an integrated thermoelectric unit to convert heat into an additional internal bias-voltage, where carbon nitride efficiently drives alcohol oxidation coupled to CO2-to-CO conversion for over 70 h. This work sets a benchmark for carbon nitride stability and PEC deployment, and highlights the need to revisit PEC testing protocols to unlock the full potential of emerging semiconductors.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] (PbS)1.13TaS2 中二维超导性的压力诱导重新出现","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23369","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Two-dimensional (2D) superconductivity provides a broad platform for investigating superconducting pairing and various exotic quantum states in the 2D limit. However, despite being a powerful tool to tune and enhance superconducting properties in 2D materials, applied pressure often inevitably disrupts the delicate 2D superconductivity due to its strong influence on material structure and electronic states. Here, we adopted a feasible strategy to decouple the superconducting TaS2 layers in (PbS)1.13TaS2 by introducing nonsuperconducting PbS layers and found a reemergence of 2D superconductivity under high pressure. At low pressure, the PbS layers act as efficient spacers to induce the intrinsic 2D superconducting state (SC-I) in (PbS)1.13TaS2, which is progressively suppressed upon pressure application due to the enhanced pair-breaking effect. When the pressure is further raised to ∼61 GPa, a new high-pressure superconducting state (SC-II) emerged, accompanied by a Lifshitz transition. More importantly, the analyses of the Berezinskii-Kosterlitz-Thouless (BKT) transition behavior and the angle-resolved critical field demonstrate that the SC-II phase retains a distinctly 2D character, with its Tc further enhanced under pressure to 7.1 K. Our findings offer a novel experimental strategy for engineering 2D superconductivity and serve as a platform to explore exotic quantum phenomena under extreme conditions.","tp":"二维超导","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究在(PbS)1.13TaS2层状材料中观察到压力诱导的二维超导性重新出现现象。二维超导性为研究2D极限下的超导配对和奇异量子态提供了重要平台，但施加压力往往因强烈影响材料结构和电子态而破坏脆弱的二维超导性。该工作采用解耦(PbS)1.13TaS2中超导TaS2层的策略，在高压下成功实现超导性的重新出现，为压力调控二维超导材料提供了新思路，对理解超导机理和设计新型量子材料具有重要意义。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 有机膦酸酯连接方法用于控制巨型多金属氧酸盐簇的组装","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21427","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"The controlled assembly of gigantic polyoxometalate (POM) clusters remains one of the most formidable challenges in molecular self-assembly, as it is highly dependent on delicate synthesis parameters that can yield a wide variety of products. In this study, we report the synthesis of a series of unprecedented wheel-shaped molybdenum-blue (MB) clusters directed by organophosphonate (L) and acetate ligands, resulting in a new range of giant MB-type POMs: {Mo136Na4}, {Mo120}, {Mo118Na2}, {Mo118}, and {Mo157}. These structures, constructed from fundamental {Mo1}, {Mo2}, and {Mo8} building blocks, exhibit new features of organic ligand coordination on their exterior surfaces. Notably, the {Mo157} framework acts as a host capable of capturing the fully reduced ε-Keggin-based {Mo16} guest. It represents the first pure dodecameric Mo wheel reported to date. Systematic variation of reaction parameters─including ligand type, concentration, solvent composition, and precursor identity─enabled precise control over cluster topology, revealing competitive coordination between organophosphonate and acetate ligands. Structural analyses unveiled new connection modes involving reduced edge-sharing {e-Mo2} units and their derivative {Mo3L2} motifs, which reinforce the overall cage architecture. Mass spectrometry and NMR spectroscopy confirmed the structural integrity of these assemblies in solution. This work not only expands the library of gigantic MB clusters but also establishes a new strategy for their controlled construction using anchored organophosphonate ligands. The resulting clusters exhibit significantly enhanced solubility in organic solvents compared with traditional MB species, offering new opportunities for postsynthetic modification, improved interactions with biomolecules, and diverse applications.","tp":"多金属氧酸盐","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究报道了利用有机膦酸酯和醋酸配体引导合成一系列前所未有的轮状钼蓝（MB）簇合物，实现了巨型多金属氧酸盐（POM）簇的可控组装。巨型POM簇的组装高度依赖精细的合成参数，产物多样性极大，一直是分子自组装领域最具挑战性的难题之一。该工作获得了{Mo136Na4}、{Mo120}、{Mo118Na2}、{Mo118}等一系列新型巨型MB型POM，为可控合成巨型纳米簇提供了配体导向的新策略。"},{"t":"NH3介导反应性捕集与转化：整合烟气CO2吸收与通过NH4实现CO生产","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04265","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"NH3介导CO2捕集","kp":["[工艺]: NH3介导反应性捕获","[转化]: NH4HCO3电解产CO"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"[ASAP] NH3-Mediated Reactive Capture and Conversion: Integrating CO2 Absorption from Flue Gas with CO Production via NH4"},{"t":"混合镧系金属有机框架用于近红外一区生物成像与近红外三区四光子上转换","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00409","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镧系MOF上转换发光","kp":["材料[MOF]: 混合镧系Yb3+/Tb3+/Eu3+","成像[生物]: 近红外I","发光[激发]: 近红外III四光子上转换"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"基于镧系元素的金属有机框架（Ln-MOFs）凭借其结构精确可调的特性，为上转换发光提供了理想平台。该研究利用混合镧系MOFs材料，实现了近红外一区（NIR-I）生物成像与近红外三区（NIR-III）四光子上转换发光的结合。四光子上转换属于极端非线性光学过程，可将多个低能量光子转化为一个高能量光子，在深层组织成像和光动力治疗等领域具有重要应用前景。混合镧系策略有望优化能量传递路径，提升上转换效率。","ot":"[ASAP] Mixed-Lanthanide Metal–Organic Frameworks for Near-Infrared-I Bioimaging and Near-Infrared-III Four-Photon Upconv","b":"Lanthanide-based metal-organic frameworks (Ln-MOFs) provide a structurally precise platform for upconversion luminescence engineering, yet practical applications are limited by insufficient structural stability, restricted color tunability, and the lack of excitation in the NIR-III window. Here, we report a MOF incorporating mixed-lanthanide Yb3+, Tb3+, and Eu3+ ions that addresses these challenges. The optically transparent and periodic framework enforces a uniform spatial distribution of lanthanide centers and establishes stepwise interionic energy transfer pathways, while ether-containing organic linkers enhance photo and thermal stability. Under NIR-I (980 nm) excitation, the Ln-MOFs exhibit tunable multicolor upconversion emission with high hydrolytic stability and biocompatibility, enabling reliable in vivo imaging in zebrafish models. Remarkably, under NIR-III (1960 nm) excitation, a four-photon upconversion process is observed for the first time in Ln-MOFs. Together, these results expand the excitation landscape of Ln-MOFs from NIR-I to NIR-III and confirm the potential of structurally programmable Ln-MOFs for bioimaging and nonlinear photonic applications.","aip":1},{"t":"自修复高自旋簇材料中的湿度诱导三态磁开关效应","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23082","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"三态磁开关材料","kp":["材料[自旋簇]: Ni9[W(CN)8]6","特性[磁性]: 湿度诱导三态开关","状态[75%RH]: 顺磁"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究报道了一种新型自修复高自旋团簇材料，可实现湿度诱导的三态磁开关效应。外部刺激响应磁性材料是下一代存储和传感技术的核心，而三态磁开关相比传统二态系统具有更高的信息存储密度和逻辑运算能力。材料在湿度变化驱动下能够在三个不同磁性状态间可逆切换，同时具备自修复特性，意味着受损后可恢复结构和磁功能，在柔性磁存储、环境传感与智能器件方面具有突破性意义。","ot":"[ASAP] Humidity-Induced Tristate Magnetic Switching in a Self-Healing High-Spin Cluster Material","b":"Externally stimulated magnetic materials are essential for next-generation memory and sensing technologies; however, tristate magnetic switching remains rare. This study presents a cyanide-bridged pentadecanuclear spin-cluster, Ni9[W(CN)8]6(pyrazole)18(H2O)6·zH2O (Ni9W6), which exhibits reversible humidity-induced tristate magnetic switching. The material is paramagnetic at 75% relative humidity (RH), ferromagnetic (Curie temperature = 11 K) at 11% RH, and displays interacting superparamagnetic (blocking temperature = 13 K) at 0% RH. The adsorption and desorption of in-layer crystallization water modulate the number of superexchange interaction pathways linking discrete Ni9W6 clusters, directly tuning intercluster magnetic coupling without altering the cluster framework or electronic states. Complete dehydration induces reversible nanoscale cracking, whereby crystals are divided into 6-8 nm magnetic nanodomains that interact via dipolar forces to yield the interacting superparamagnetic state. This water-mediated control of superexchange pathways and reversible formation of nanoscale magnetic regions achieved in a self-healing spin material provide a design strategy for multistate stimuli-responsive functional materials."},{"t":"软硬酸碱原理驱动高密度稀土基双原子位点的合理合成","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21164","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"稀土双原子催化剂","kp":["负载量[双原子催化剂]: <2 wt%瓶颈","合成原理[稀土双原子]: 软硬酸碱普适法则"],"dp":1,"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"双原子催化剂（DACs）在原子利用率和多步协同催化方面具有固有优势。该研究基于硬软酸碱（HSAB）原理，合理设计并合成了基于稀土元素的超密度双原子催化位点。利用稀土离子与配体之间的硬软酸碱匹配规律，实现了原子位点的精确构筑与高密度负载，突破了现有单原子/双原子催化剂活性位点密度低的瓶颈。该策略为复杂多电子转移反应的高效电催化提供了新思路，在能源转换催化领域具有广阔应用潜力。","ot":"[ASAP] Hard–Soft Acid–Base Principle Drives Rational Synthesis of Super-Dense Rare-Earth-Based Diatomic Sites","b":"Diatomic catalysts (DACs) hold inherent superiority in atomic economy and synergistic catalysis for complex multi-intermediate reactions. However, several fundamental challenges persist, including typically low diatomic loading (<2 wt %), ambiguous diatomic site identification, and most critically, the lack of universal design principles for rational synthesis. Herein, we present a general synthetic strategy guided by the hard-soft acid-base (HSAB) principle, successfully yielding 14 rare-earth (RE)-based DACs with record-high metal loadings (12.8-30.7 wt %, 3.2-5.4 at. %) and corresponding atomic site densities exceeding 1.12 × 1021 sites g-1. Through an advanced deep learning-powered diatomic recognition method, we unambiguously identify the heterodiatomic configurations with consistently high pairing ratios (60.5%-70.3%) across the DACs. Mechanistic studies combining experimental and theoretical analyses disclose that the strategic incorporation of soft-base phosphorus in the synthesis effectively diminishes coordination dynamics between hard-acid metals and hard-base nitrogen ligands via the HSAB principle-driven antibonding interactions, thus achieving the superdense diatomic sites. Significantly, the high-loading DACs demonstrate superior electrocatalytic nitrate reduction performance, exhibiting up to a 2.7-fold enhancement in ammonia yield rates over their low-loading counterparts. This work establishes a general coordination chemistry-based design principle for rational construction of advanced diatomic catalysts."},{"t":"用于动态光热管理的快响应柔性多光谱调制器","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00165","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性多光谱调制器","kp":["光谱[伪装调制器]: 可见-红外兼容动态","形态[器件]: 柔性多光谱动态调制器"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了快速响应的柔性多光谱调制器，用于动态光学与热管理。随着侦察技术的快速发展，传统单波段和静态伪装技术已无法满足复杂战场环境的隐身需求。该器件能够在多个光谱波段（可见光、红外等）实现快速可逆调制，同时管理热辐射，有效对抗多光谱侦察。柔性基底使其可贴合不规则表面，快速响应特性保证了实时动态伪装能力，在军事隐身、建筑节能和智能热管理领域具有重大应用价值。","ot":"[ASAP] Fast-Response Flexible Multispectral Modulators for Dynamic Optical and Thermal Management","b":"The rapid advancement of reconnaissance technologies has rendered conventional single-band and static camouflage technology ineffective, driving the urgent demand for multispectral dynamic camouflage technology capable of actively changing its spectral properties. Herein, we present a flexible multispectral dynamic modulator (FMDM) that achieves dynamic and compatible visible–infrared camouflage based on a silver-mesh multispectral transparent conductive electrode and reversible copper electrodeposition. The high electron conductivity of the working electrode, combined with the high ionic conductivity of quasi-solid gel electrolyte, enables the uniform, rapid, and reversible deposition/dissolution of copper nanoparticles. Consequently, the FMDM delivers broadband tunability from visible to mid-infrared with high optical modulation contrasts of 0.67 (0.7–2.5 μm), 0.68 (3–5 μm), and 0.82 (8–13 μm), while maintaining a relatively low visible reflectance consistently. Notably, the FMDM also demonstrates ultrafast response speed (2.4/2.7 s), wide operating temperature range (−40–60 °C), and long-term cycling stability. This work paves the way for next-generation multispectral dynamic camouflage technologies."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过脱硼环化轻松合成非交替 π-共轭氮硼烷","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23345","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Skeletal editing of aza-heteroarenes has become a powerful strategy for late-stage molecular diversification in medicinal and material chemistry. π-Conjugated azaborines have attracted increasing attention due to their exceptional optoelectronic properties and practical applications in organic light-emitting diodes (OLEDs). However, ring manipulation of boron-containing rings remains a long-standing challenge, and cascade skeletal editing beyond monocyclic frameworks is largely underdeveloped. Here, we report a boron-deleting annulation (BDA) reaction that enables the transformation of unstrained bicyclic 1,4-azaborines into a diaza-pentagon-heptagon pair in a one-pot reaction, affording a wide array of nonalternant π-conjugated azaborines (>35 examples) with unique optoelectronic properties. This late-stage modification approach thus balances synthetic simplicity with structural diversity and expands the accessible chemical space of functional π-systems for optoelectronic applications. Additionally, the BDA product can trigger consecutive cyclodehydrogenation to zipping-up sophisticated nanographenes via further periphery-to-core extension. Mechanistic studies reveal a series of unprecedented ring contraction-expansion processes. Remarkably, yellow OLEDs based on BDA product achieved a record 23.0% external quantum efficiency without delayed fluorescence, demonstrating the potential for high-performance electroluminescence.","tp":"氮硼烷合成","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了通过脱硼环化反应合成非交替π-共轭氮硼烷的新方法。氮硼烷因优异的光电性质在OLED领域备受关注，但含硼环的骨架编辑长期是挑战，级联骨架编辑在多环框架中更是几乎未被开发。该方法实现了从氮杂芳烃出发的级联骨架编辑，突破了单环框架限制，为药物化学和材料化学的后期分子多样化提供了简便策略，有望加速氮硼烷类光电材料的开发。"},{"t":"[尽快] 室温下二维多孔冰的证据","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00047","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","b":"The phase behavior of water and ices is remarkably complex because of the high flexibility of their underlying hydrogen-bonding networks. Even for two-dimensional (2D) ice, rich forms of monolayer and bilayer ice phases have been observed in molecular dynamics (MD) simulations, including, among many others, flat-square monolayer ice, bilayer hexagonal ice, twisted bilayer ices with moiré patterns, and monolayer and bilayer superionic ices. In contrast to the large family of 3D ice structures, however, the 2D ice family still lacks porous ice structures, as it is generally believed that 2D porous ices are stable only under negative pressures. As a result, even in MD simulations, the spontaneous formation of a 2D porous ice is challenging. Here, for the first time, we report simulation evidence of three distinct types of 2D porous ice. Additionally, on the basis of first-principles computations, we show that these 2D porous ices are stable under negative pressures. More importantly, inspired by host-guest chemistry, we demonstrate the spontaneous formation of one of these 2D porous ices (on the time scale of microseconds in MD simulation) from liquid water at 300 K by employing suitable guest particles on a model surface. The nucleation and growth mechanisms of the 2D porous ice are also illustrated at the molecular level. Through extensive MD simulations with tunable molecular and surface parameters, we identify the key factors governing the formation of 2D porous ices."},{"t":"利用光响应过度拥挤烯烃构筑动态手性表面","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22392","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光响应手性表面","kp":["表面[手性]: 光响应过密烯烃分子马达","基底[SAMN]: 高定向热解石墨","特性[界面]: 动态手性识别"],"as":"该研究将表面手性与光响应性结合，利用过度拥挤烯烃（光致变色分子马达）构建动态手性界面。通过光激发实现手性在表面的可逆调控，赋予界面动态立体化学性质。此类材料在分子识别、不对称催化、手性传感和智能开关器件等前沿领域具有广阔应用前景，为可编程表面化学提供了新思路。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Dynamically Chiral Surfaces Using Photoresponsive Overcrowded Alkenes","b":"Combining surface chirality and photoresponsiveness can result in interfaces with dynamic stereochemical properties. Such materials offer unique opportunities in the context of tunable chiral recognition at interfaces. Here, we present a strategy to achieve dynamically chiral surfaces using self-assembled molecular networks (SAMNs) of overcrowded alkene-based molecular motors on highly oriented pyrolytic graphite. The chiroptical properties and the dynamic behavior of the molecular motors are maintained when confined in the SAMN, as shown using scanning tunneling microscopy (STM) with in situ irradiation. Light triggers the transition from a homochiral assembly of the stable state of a molecular motor (RP chirality) to the heterochiral coassembly between the stable and the metastable state (RP/RM chirality). The RP/RM coassembly is a kinetic phase that disappears once the external stimulus is removed─highlighting the reversibility of the system. These results demonstrate how molecular motion can be harnessed to encode reversible chirality into surfaces."},{"t":"硝基芳烃分步N–O活化的解析：铁-亚硝基芳烃的电子结构与反应性","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19714","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硝基芳烃N-O活化","kp":["中间体[硝基还原]: 铁-亚硝基芳烃配合物","机制[N-O键]: 分步活化电子结构解析"],"as":"该工作系统解析了硝基芳烃还原转化中N-O键的逐步活化机制，通过电子结构分析揭示硝基官能团在含NOx和无机/有机底物还原反应中的活化路径。研究为理解硝基化合物催化还原的机理提供了关键的实验与理论依据，对含氮污染物降解和精细化学品合成具有重要指导意义。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Deciphering the Stepwise N–O Activation of Nitroarenes: Electronic Structure and Reactivity of Iron-Nitrosoarene ","b":"N-O bond activation in reductive transformation of both NOx- and organic substrates with nitro functional groups has garnered significant interest because of its significance in both biological systems and synthetic chemistry. The reductive transformation of nitro groups involves sequential N-O bond cleavages, with nitrosoarenes (ArNO) as key yet often elusive intermediates. While iron is a biologically and synthetically relevant metal for such processes, the mechanistic understanding, particularly the role of multinuclear cooperation, remains underdeveloped. Herein, we report that a dinuclear iron N-heterocyclic carbene (NHC) complex, Fe2-MeCN, enables the sequential N-O bond activation of nitrobenzene, leading to the isolation and detailed characterization of two iron-nitrosoarene intermediates, Fe2-PhNO and Fe2-(PhNO)2. Spectroscopic and crystallographic studies, complemented by DFT calculations, identified strong charge-transfer interactions that polarize the N-O moiety. This electronic structure underpins a diverse suite of N-O activation pathways, including Lewis acid-induced electron transfer, hydride reduction, proton-coupled electron transfer (PCET), and oxygen atom transfer. The stoichiometric reactivity reveals that the nucleophilic oxygen of the coordinated ArNO can be efficiently attacked by electrophiles, while reactions with nucleophiles require more forcing conditions. Finally, Fe2-MeCN functions as a competent catalyst for the reduction of nitroarenes to anilines and facilitates unprecedented iron-mediated heterocyclizations, underscoring the critical role of bimetallic cooperativity in this multifunctional reactivity."},{"t":"共价量子桥接在硬碳中构筑双连续电子-离子通道，实现超快钠存储","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21030","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硬碳钠电负极","kp":["结构[硬碳负极]: 仿血管束双连续电子离子通道","策略[桥联]: 共价量子桥联","体系[钠电]: 超快储钠硬碳"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出共价量子桥接策略，在硬碳中构建双连续的电子-离子传输通道，显著提升钠离子电池负极的储钠性能和倍率特性。硬碳作为钠离子电池最有前景的负极材料之一，其导电性和离子扩散瓶颈长期制约商业化进程。该方法为高倍率、长寿命钠离子电池负极材料设计提供了突破性方案。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Covalent Quantum Bridging Enables Bicontinuous Electron–Ion Highways in Hard Carbon for Ultrafast Sodium Storage","b":"As one of the best alternatives to anodes for sodium-ion batteries, hard carbon holds strong promise for commercial application. However, its inherently slow ion diffusion and poor electronic conductivity fundamentally limit the rate capability and cycling stability. Herein, inspired by biological vascular bundles, we design a bicontinuous network within a carbon framework via a bridging strategy using bamboo powder (BP) and carbon quantum dots (CQDs), which achieves the ultrafast transfer of electrons and ions from graphite-like domains (interlayer adsorption/conversion) to closed-pore (filling). Specifically, through stepwise pyrolysis, CQDs acting as \"transport highways\" were covalently grafted onto BP, and the resulting \"quantum-bridge\" precursor was topologically reconstructed into a bicontinuous carbon framework. This process generates interconnected graphene nanodomains (GNDs) that facilitate electron transport, while concurrently creating topological defects and sites for pyridinic/pyrrolic N to enable efficient Na+ adsorption and surface migration. The designed hard carbon achieves a high specific capacity (391.1 mAh g-1 at 0.1 C), excellent initial Coulombic efficiency (92%), outstanding rate capability (83.5% capacity retention after 15,000 cycles at 20 C), and remarkable low-temperature performance (90.2% capacity retention after 400 cycles at 1 C and -20 °C). This work establishes a general design principle for energy storage materials requiring simultaneous, rapid electron-ion migration.","aip":1},{"t":"主族双功能材料实现CO₂连续捕集与选择性还原为CO","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20974","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2捕集还原材料","kp":["组成[双功能材料]: Cs/Al2O3仅主族元素","功能[CO2]: 连续捕集并选择性还原为CO"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了基于主族元素的双功能材料，实现CO2的连续捕集与选择性还原为一氧化碳（CO）。双功能材料将CO2吸附与催化转化集成于一体，避免了传统碳捕集与利用分离流程的高能耗。主族催化剂成本低廉、储量丰富，为大规模碳减排与碳资源化利用提供了具有经济可行性的技术路径。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Continuous CO2 Capture and Selective Reduction to CO over Main-Group Dual-Functional Materials","b":"CO2 capture and reduction to CO using dual-functional materials (DFMs) has recently attracted significant attention as a promising strategy for carbon capture and utilization. DFMs generally comprise basic metals for CO2 capture and transition metals for CO2 conversion. Herein, we successfully developed a DFM (Cs/Al2O3) consisting only of main-group elements, which enabled continuous and selective CO production with high CO2 conversion (89%) and CO selectivity (99%). Notably, Cs/Al2O3 exhibited better CO2 capture and CO formation performance than platinum-group metal-based DFMs under isothermal conditions at 500 °C, even in the presence of O2 during the CO2 capture phase. Comprehensive characterization suggested that single Cs atoms were uniformly dispersed on Al2O3, forming adjacent sites in close proximity. Based on operando infrared analysis, including modulation excitation spectroscopy, the monodentate carbonate species adsorbed during CO2 capture reacted with H2 and yielded gas-phase CO."},{"t":"限域催化实现高达0.6 M浓度下的大环化反应：单/二聚糖苷的选择性生成","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c03730","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"限域催化大环化","kp":["浓度[大环化]: 高达0.6 M","产物[糖苷]: 单/二聚大环选择性","催化[策略]: 限域催化"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究利用限域催化策略实现了大环化反应在高达0.6 M浓度下的高选择性合成。大环化合物广泛存在于天然产物和生物活性分子中，但传统大环化反应需极度稀释（通常<1 mM）以抑制分子间聚合副反应，严重制约生产效率。限域催化通过纳米空间约束底物构象，从根本上突破稀释瓶颈，为药物合成提供高效路径。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Confinement Catalysis Enables Macrocyclization at Up to 0.6 M: Selective Formation of Mono- and Dimeric Glycosidi","b":"Macrocyclic compounds are widespread in nature and frequently found among bioactive natural products. Their conformational preorganization allows them to effectively engage large binding surfaces, making them valuable in drug discovery, especially for modulating protein-protein interactions. Consequently, macrocyclization strategies have received significant attention; however, they still typically rely on high-dilution conditions (0.10-10 mM) to favor intramolecular ring closure over intermolecular oligomerization. Here, we report a solution to this long-standing challenge using a catalytic confined-space approach that operates efficiently even at the substrate solubility limit (600 mM), thereby eliminating the need for high-dilution conditions. The capsular catalyst enables the high-yielding formation of medium- and large-sized glycosidic macrocycles with excellent β-selectivity. Moreover, the method addresses a second persistent challenge in macrocyclization: the selective formation of macrocyclic dimers. Whereas such dimers are inaccessible under traditional high-dilution conditions, they are obtained in high yields when two substrates fit into the capsule's cavity, again at high substrate concentrations and with excellent β,β-selectivity. Control experiments establish the indispensability of the capsule as conventional conditions afford substantially lower yields and predominantly α-selectivity. The method's utility is further demonstrated in the selective synthesis of the dimeric core structure of glucolipsin A and cycloviracin B1. This work establishes confinement catalysis as a powerful tool to overcome key limitations in macrocyclization chemistry."},{"t":"钴催化两种相似丙烯酸酯的选择性交叉加成合成己二酸酯和戊二酸酯","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02505","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钴催化丙烯酸酯偶联","kp":["催化剂[钴]: Co","反应[加成]: 两相似丙烯酸酯交叉加成","产物[二酯]: 取代己二酸酯/戊二酸酯","选择性[发散]: 区域发散"],"as":"该研究报道了一种钴催化策略，实现两种相似丙烯酸酯的选择性交叉加成反应，为合成己二酸和戊二酸这两种聚合物生产核心中间体提供了新路径。此前工业界和实验室均缺乏直接高效合成此类二羧酸的方法。该方法利用廉价钴催化剂的区域和化学选择性控制，有望降低尼龙等工程塑料原料的生产成本，具有显著的工业应用前景。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Cobalt-Catalyzed Selective Cross-Addition of Two Similar Acrylates for the Synthesis of Adipates and Glutarates","b":"Adipic acids and glutaric acids are core intermediates in polymer production. However, neither industry nor laboratory synthesis enables facile access to main-chain substituted diacid derivatives, restricting the development of novel monomers for polymerization. Herein, we report a regiodivergent synthesis of substituted adipates and glutarates from two acrylates with minimal structural and electronic differences on a multigram scale with recyclable cobaloxime. Chemoselectivity of cross-coupling over self-coupling reaches 25:1 and was determined by the interaction mode between cobalt catalyst and different acrylates. Single regioselectivity of cobalt hydride addition toward two specific acrylates could be achieved under basic or neutral reaction conditions. Mechanistic investigations revealed a significant chemoselectivity (ΔΔG‡ > 3.0 kcal mol-1), indicating that substrate-specific local electronic properties govern chemo- and regioselectivity, providing predictive insight into rational selectivity control."},{"t":"手性联萘二甲基η⁶-苯配体：设计、合成及在钌催化不对称反应中的应用","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02447","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性芳烃配体","kp":["配体[手性]: 联萘二甲基η6-苯配体","应用[催化]: 钌催化不对称C-H活化"],"as":"该研究设计合成了手性联萘二甲基η6-苯配体，并将其应用于不对称催化反应。η6-苯基金属配合物催化不对称反应是新兴研究领域，核心挑战在于配体设计如何精确调控催化剂的手性环境与反应活性。该新型配体体系有望拓展手性金属催化在药物分子和精细化学品合成中的应用范围。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Chiral Binaphthyldimethyl η6-Benzene Ligands: Design, Synthesis, and Application in Ruthenium-Catalyzed Asymmetri","b":"Asymmetric catalysis enabled by a chiral η6-benzene (Ben) metal catalyst is an emerging field with the core challenge lying in the development of effective chiral Ben ligands. This work reports the design and synthesis of a novel class of chiral Ben ligands, namely, binaphthyldimethyl Ben ligands. In this case, a chiral binaphthyl scaffold is linked via a methylene spacer to a benzene ring that serves as the metal-coordination site. Crucially, the Ben ligands coordinate to ruthenium (Ru) in a site-specific manner despite possessing multiple potential η6-benzene binding sites, hence enabling the successful preparation of the targeted chiral BenRuII catalysts. Significantly outperforming our earlier chiral BenRuII catalysts, the system reported herein enables highly efficient phenol-directed asymmetric C–H activation of 1-aryl-2-naphthols with alkynes, providing facile access to diverse chiral spirocyclic compounds featuring an all-carbon quaternary stereocenter in high yields (up to 99%) and with excellent enantioselectivity (up to 97% ee)."},{"t":"通过整体式陶瓷隔膜实现全固态钠-氧电池多相界面的化学一体化","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00021","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态钠氧电池","kp":["电解质[全固态Na-O2]: 单片双层β-Al2O3","温度[运行]: 室温","界面[策略]: 双界面化学集成"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究针对全固态钠氧电池中多相界面化学不兼容这一根本性瓶颈，提出界面化学整合策略。全固态钠氧电池因高理论能量密度被视为下一代储能候选技术，但固-固、固-气多相界面处的离子/电子传输及副反应严重制约其性能。该工作通过化学手段调控界面结构，显著改善界面兼容性，推动全固态钠氧电池走向实用化。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Chemical Integration of Multiphase Interfaces in All-Solid-State Sodium–Oxygen Batteries via Monolithic Ceramic S","b":"The advancement of all-solid-state sodium-oxygen (Na-O2) batteries is fundamentally constrained by the formidable chemo-mechanical and kinetic barriers at solid-solid interfaces. Herein, we report a high-performance, room-temperature all-solid-state Na-O2 battery enabled by a monolithic bilayer β-Al2O3 architecture that redefines interfacial charge transfer through a dual-interface integration strategy. By constructing an integrated porous-dense scaffold, we eliminated the macroscopic physical boundaries between the electrolyte and cathode, establishing a seamless, low-resistance ionic conduction continuum. Specifically, a conformal, 30 nm thick graphitic carbon layer was deposited within the cathodic framework via plasma-enhanced chemical vapor deposition, creating a high-fidelity electronic network that maximizes active site utilization. On the anode side, we introduced a reactive wetting mechanism mediated by Bi2O3 nanosheets. The in situ chemical reconfiguration and alloying reaction at the interface generate a gradient Na-Bi-O mixed-conducting interphase, effectively fusing the sodium metal to the ceramic electrolyte and ensuring stable long-term cycling (>14,000 h for symmetric cells). Consequently, the battery delivers an unprecedented discharge capacity of 4012 mA h g-1 at room temperature with an exceptional reversibility. Operando Raman spectroscopy and differential electrochemical mass spectrometry reveal that the solid-state environment provides a unique kinetic stabilization for the metastable NaO2 phase, suppressing the parasitic disproportionation pathways common to liquid systems. This work provides a universal blueprint for engineering chemically integrated interfaces in complex multiphase all-solid-state energy chemistry.","aip":1},{"t":"功能模拟Rieske双加氧酶实现醌类催化不对称顺式双羟基化","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20048","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"醌顺式双羟基化","kp":["仿酶[Rieske双加氧酶]: 功能模拟","催化剂[类型]: 丰产金属","反应[醌]: 不对称顺式双羟基化"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种基于功能化配体和地球丰富金属的高效实用催化不对称顺式双羟基化反应，应用于醌类底物。不对称双羟基化是合成手性二醇的重要方法，传统Sharpless钌/锇催化体系成本高且毒性大。该工作以廉价金属替代贵金属，实现了对醌类的立体选择性双羟基化，为手性药物中间体和天然产物合成提供了更经济环保的新路线。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Catalytic Asymmetric cis-Dihydroxylation of Quinones Enabled by a Functional Mimic of Rieske Dioxygenases","b":"The development of efficient and practical catalytic asymmetric cis-dihydroxylation reactions using earth-abundant metal catalysts remains a major challenge; the cis-dihydroxylation of 1,4-quinones represents a vital gateway to enantioenriched cis-1,2-diols, which are privileged scaffolds for bioactive natural products and pharmaceuticals. Inspired by the asymmetric cis-dihydroxylation of aromatic and olefinic C═C bonds catalyzed by Rieske dioxygenases, we present a biomimetic strategy for the asymmetric cis-dihydroxylation of 1,4-quinones. Herein, we report an inexpensive and readily accessible nonheme manganese complex, supported by a tetradentate aminopyridine ligand featuring a rigid chiral diamine backbone and a sterically bulky triisopropylsilyl group, for the cis-dihydroxylation of 1,4-quinones by hydrogen peroxide and alkyl hydroperoxides; it is noted that this study reports the first example of using alkyl hydroperoxides as a terminal oxidant in cis-dihydroxylation reactions. Various 1,4-quinones were efficiently oxidized to cis-1,2-diols in synthetically useful yields with excellent chemo-, regio-, and enantioselectivity (up to 99% ee), along with complete diastereoselectivity. Mechanistic evidence from experimental and computational studies supports a highly electrophilic manganese(V)-oxo-hydroxo species as the active cis-dihydroxylating intermediate, although the formation mechanism of the high-valent manganese-oxo intermediate is different depending on the hydroperoxide oxidants. Moreover, a two-step mechanism is proposed for the manganese(V)-oxo-hydroxo-mediated asymmetric cis-dihydroxylation, such as the Re-face selective oxo attack on the less hindered C═C bond, followed by OH-rebound, with stereochemistry dictated by the initial oxo attack. Thus, this study delineates the first biomimetic oxidation strategy enabling asymmetric cis-dihydroxylation of 1,4-quinones mediated by a high-valent manganese-oxo species generated in the reactions of hydrogen peroxide and alkyl hydroperoxides."},{"t":"电喷雾酶离子在气相中的催化活性","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00627","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"气相酶催化","kp":["体系[气相酶]: 溶菌酶[NAG5+8H]8+","发现[无溶剂]: 酶气相保留催化活性"],"as":"该研究利用电喷雾技术将酶以离子形态引入气相，并首次系统验证了酶离子在无溶剂气相条件下的催化活性。传统认知中酶催化依赖水溶液环境，而该工作证明脱去溶剂后酶活性中心仍能保留催化功能。这一发现对理解酶催化的本质机制、拓展酶在非水相及极端环境中的应用具有重要意义，也为气相生物催化提供了新思路。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Catalytic Activity of Electrosprayed Enzyme Ions in the Gas Phase","b":"Most enzyme reactions occur in aqueous solution, but catalytic activity is often retained in nonaqueous solvents. It is an intriguing question whether enzymes can also remain active in the gas phase, without any solvent. Here, we address this question by examining electrosprayed [L·NAG5 + 8H]8+ complexes (L = lysozyme, NAGn = N-acetyl glucosamine oligomer, a lysozyme substrate in solution). Collisional activation triggered cleavage of NAG5 into NAG4 and a monomeric NAG unit. The reaction proceeded via a [L·NAG4 + 8H]8+ enzyme·product complex, confirming that cleavage took place while NAG5 was bound to lysozyme. We demonstrate that the reaction exhibits hallmarks of enzyme catalysis, including the participation of specific active site residues (E35 and D52), substrate specificity, and a lowered activation energy. The gas-phase products differ from those in solution, as dictated by the absence of water. Our experimental findings are bolstered by mobile-proton molecular dynamics simulations of gaseous lysozyme complexes with substrates and products. In conclusion, this work for the first time demonstrates that an enzyme can be catalytically active in vacuo. While it is yet to be determined if this finding can be generalized to other enzymes, our study may provide a stepping stone to novel enzyme-catalyzed (bio)molecular transformations in the absence of a solvent."},{"t":"通过铁电PbTiO₃的原子终止工程提升光生电子提取效率","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21165","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电光催化产氢","kp":["材料[光催化]: 铁电单畴PbTiO3","关键[界面]: PbTiO3-Rh光电子提取","工程[手段]: 原子终止工程"],"as":"本研究聚焦单畴铁电PbTiO3在光催化全分解水（POWS）中的应用。通过原子级终端工程调控材料表面终止层，优化铁电内建电场方向与强度，显著提升光生电子的提取与迁移效率。该策略从原子尺度消除表面缺陷态与电子复合中心，为铁电光催化体系实现高效稳定分解水提供了新思路，有望推动太阳能驱动制氢技术发展。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Boosting Photogenerated Electron Extraction by Atomic Termination Engineering of Ferroelectric PbTiO3 for Efficie","b":"Single-domain ferroelectric PbTiO3 is regarded as a promising candidate for photocatalytic overall water splitting (POWS) owing to its highly efficient bulk charge separation driven by strong polarization field. However, its POWS efficiency still remains far below expectations. Herein, we identify interfacial photogenerated electron extraction at the PbTiO3-Rh interface as a critical factor determining POWS performance. Systematic studies reveal that thermodynamically favored Pb-O termination severely impedes this process. To overcome this limitation, a facile alkaline-etching strategy is developed to selectively reconstruct surface termination from Pb-O to Ti-O on photogenerated electron-rich facet. Time-resolved photoluminescence spectroscopy and excited-state electron transfer dynamics simulation demonstrate that the resulting Ti-O termination remarkably accelerates interfacial photogenerated electron extraction, leading to a 46.1-fold enhancement in POWS activity. An apparent quantum yield of 6.8% at 360 nm is achieved, representing a record value among reported ferroelectric photocatalysts for POWS. Mechanistic studies reveal that weakened interfacial electric field and enhanced nonadiabatic coupling strength at the Ti-O-Rh interface jointly accelerate photogenerated electron extraction. This work underscores the importance of surface-termination engineering in enhancing interfacial photogenerated electron extraction and provides insight into designing high-performance photocatalysts."},{"t":"双功能D-π-A配体引导自组织界面钝化，实现高效钙钛矿光伏电池","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02548","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿界面钝化","kp":["配体[钙钛矿]: 双功能D-π-A配体","机制[钝化]: 自组织界面钝化"],"as":"研究提出一种双功能D-π-A（给体-π-受体）配体，通过自组装界面钝化策略提升钙钛矿太阳能电池的性能与稳定性。该配体分子的给体和受体端分别定向锚定钙钛矿晶界与界面缺陷，实现无需额外工艺步骤的自组织钝化，有效抑制非辐射复合。此方法兼具效率提升与长期稳定性改善，对钙钛矿光伏商业化具有重要推动意义。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Bifunctional D−π–A Ligand Directs Self-Organized Interface Passivation for Efficient Perovskite Photovoltaics","b":"Passivating engineering has emerged as one of the most important strategies for improving the performance and stability of perovskite solar cells (PSCs). However, most post-treatment or buried-in passivation approaches are depth-dependent, where separate agents target either bulk or interfacial defects, complicating film processing and limiting large-scale fabrication. Here, we report a bifunctional D-π-A passivating ligand, triphenylamine-furan-cyanoacrylic acid (TPA-FCA), which integrates a hydrophilic anchoring group with a bulky hydrophobic donor-π scaffold. Such bifunctional TPA-FCA self-organizes within the as-crystallized perovskite film, vertically segregating to both interfaces and simultaneously passivating the defects in the perovskite bulk and at adjacent interfaces. This characteristic enables TPA-FCA to suppress both nonradiative and charge-transport losses in the complete PSCs. Consequently, PSCs incorporating TPA-FCA deliver a champion efficiency of 26.56% (26.37% certified) together with remarkable operational stability. Under continuous maximum power point tracking at 65 °C (ISOS-L-2), the unencapsulated TPA-FCA device maintains 90% of its initial efficiency after 1400 h (T90 = 1400 h). Further fabrication of large-area (30 cm × 30 cm) perovskite submodules demonstrates the passivation efficacy of the TPA-FCA, yielding a certified efficiency of 21.93%. This work provides fundamental insights into self-organized ligands and demonstrates an applicable molecular design strategy for high-performance, stable, and scalable perovskite photovoltaics.","aip":1},{"t":"轴向氧桥双原子位点打破氧还原电催化中活性-稳定性的权衡","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00197","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氧还原双原子催化","kp":["构型[双原子]: 轴向Fe-O-Co桥联","突破[ORR]: 打破活性-稳定性权衡"],"as":"针对铁氮碳（Fe-N-C）催化剂在氧还原反应（ORR）中长期存在的活性-稳定性权衡难题，研究设计了轴向氧桥连双原子位点结构。该构型通过氧桥配位调控金属中心电子结构，在保持高催化活性的同时显著增强催化剂耐久性，打破了传统单原子Fe-N-C催化剂在高电位下易降解的瓶颈，对燃料电池和金属-空气电池阴极催化具有重要应用价值。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Axial Oxygen-Bridged Dual-Atom Sites Break the Activity–Stability Trade-Off in Oxygen Reduction Electrocatalysis","b":"A pivotal challenge in advancing iron-nitrogen-carbon (Fe-N-C) catalysts for the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) is their inherent activity-stability trade-off, which originates from the conflicting requirements of strong Fe-N bonding and optimal intermediate adsorption on the Fe active sites. Guided by first-principles screening, we herein report that constructing an axial Fe-O-Co bridge within a bilayer M-N-C architecture concurrently addresses the optimization of intermediate adsorption energetics and dynamic Fe-N bond stability. The competitive adsorption from axial oxygen alleviates the issue of overstrong intermediate adsorption on the Fe site toward accelerated *OH desorption and boosted ORR kinetics. Simultaneously, the axial CoN4-O ligand serves as an electronic buffer to dynamically compensate for adsorption-induced electronic polarization, thereby stabilizing Fe-N bonds and suppressing iron leaching during electrocatalysis. As a proof of concept, the FeCo dual-atom catalyst featuring an FeN4-O-CoN4 configuration achieves a half-wave potential of 0.93 V in alkaline media, with only 8 mV decay after 140 000 cycles, far outperforming the Fe-N-C counterpart (53 mV decay). It maintains remarkable performance even in the highly challenging acidic electrolyte, delivering a peak power density of 1.12 W cm-2 and nearly 80% power density retention after 30 000 cycles. This study opens up a new avenue to break the activity-stability dilemma for M-N-C catalysts, advancing their practical deployment in fuel cells."},{"t":"层间交替阳离子的无铵层状钙钛矿用于宽带隙太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04210","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"宽带隙钙钛矿","kp":["材料[宽禁带]: 无铵层状钙钛矿交替阳离子"],"as":"","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":4.0,"t":7.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Ammonium-Free-Layered-Perovskites with Alternating Cations in the Interlayer for Wide-Bandgap Solar Cells"},{"t":"氙同位素揭示了地球氧合的地磁前奏","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag172/8526382?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","b":"Ancient xenon isotopes reveal that a temporary weakening of Earthâ€™s magnetic field enhanced hydrogen escape to prime the atmosphere for oxygenation, before its recovery locked in the Great Oxidation Event. More than simple shields, magnetic fields may act as an active filter for atmospheric evolution, with consequences for planetary habitability and the divergent histories of Earth and Mars."},{"t":"更高的信用何时会降低森林面积？亚马逊环境改变了信贷的影响","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516366123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Economic activities have transformed over half of the Earth’s surface and the large-scale conversion of rural forests to agropastoral production is ongoing. Raising access to credit may lead producers to expand at the expense of the forest or, instead, invest to raise yields, reducing forest loss per unit output. Looking across Brazil’s enormous Amazon, we show that extremely different local contexts differ in terms of which effect of credit dominates. We distinguish those contexts using factors that affect cattle and crop production. For each of these two outputs, we find distinct credit impacts by context. Cattle credit raises deforestation where pasture expands over native forest on far frontiers. Crop credit raises deforestation where farms expand over pasture and forest remnants. Understanding impacts heterogeneity can help to reduce losses of rural forests, even while credit is supporting local economies.","tp":"亚马逊信贷","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究考察了巴西亚马逊地区信贷获取与森林砍伐之间的复杂关系。增加信贷获取可能导致生产者以牺牲森林为代价扩大生产，也可能促使其投资提高单产从而减少单位产出的森林损失。研究发现哪种效应占主导取决于截然不同的本地环境背景，研究者利用环境因素对contexts进行了区分。该成果对制定因地制宜的亚马逊森林保护政策具有重要指导意义。"},{"t":"利用析氢反应：仿生pH敏感电解质实现高倍率下超稳定锌离子电池","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00449K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌电池电解质","kp":["温度[锌电池]: >80°C","电解质[仿生]: pH敏感型","目标[抑制]: 析氢反应HER"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"受生物启发的pH敏感电解质用于高温(>80°C)锌离子电池。该电解质通过调控局部pH环境抑制锌枝晶生长和副反应，在高温条件下实现超稳定循环性能和高能量密度，为极端工况储能场景(如电动汽车热区、工业储能)提供了新型电池设计方案。","ot":"Utilizing hydrogen evolution reaction: bio-inspired pH-sensitive electrolyte for ultra-stable zinc-ion batteries at high","b":"Broader contextPractical high temperature (> 80 °C) zinc-ion batteries with high energy density and stable cycling performance are greatly desirable for sustainable energy storage, but they remain constrained by the notorious hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Such unwanted reaction not only reduces the reversibility of Zn anode, but also accelerates battery swelling and even causes battery explosion.Inhibiting HER is a widely adopted strategy to enhance battery performance. However, since HER is severely exaggerated at high temperatures, the strategy fails to intrinsically prevent HER and Zn electrodes only work well with low depth of discharge (DOD) and low current densities/capacities.Herein, contrary to the commonly utilized HER suppression routes, a novel HER utilization strategy is proposed by introducing pH-sensitive electrolyte that harness the HER process to in situ form a unique ZrO 2 /ZnF 2 interface on Zn anode. The bio-inspired interface significantly shields H 2 O molecules, homogenizes Zn 2+ flux and optimizes ionic and thermal fields, thus mitigating further side reactions and prohibiting Zn dendrites growth. With the pH-sensitive electrolyte design, the stability of Zn anode is drastically enhanced with high DOD at high current densities/capacities, which also boards the tactics for the development of stable metal batteries with high energy densities at high temperatures."},{"t":"城市发展与能源转型：来自中国城市的证据","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001643?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源转型","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"实现高效自发去消旋化：MOF介导的多相体系克服催化不相容性","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3464047?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF去消旋化","kp":["策略[消旋化拆分]: MOF限域包载DBU碱催化剂","体系[非均相]: 克服催化-共结晶不相容"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.5},"as":"利用金属有机框架(MOF)介导的多相催化体系实现高效自发去消旋化(deracemization)。传统共结晶诱导去消旋化受限于催化不兼容性，该MOF体系通过空间限域效应分离催化位点，突破均相催化中反应物/催化剂互斥瓶颈，为手性药物的对映纯化合成提供新策略。","ot":"Unlocking Efficient Spontaneous Deracemization: A MOF‐Mediated Heterogeneous System Overcomes Catalytic Incompatibility ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Cocrystallization‐induced deracemization is a powerful route to enantiopure pharmaceuticals, yet is hindered by detrimental interactions between homogeneous catalysts and chiral components. Herein, we report a novel heterogeneous catalysis strategy using metal–organic frameworks (MOFs) to overcome this compatibility challenge. By encapsulating the base catalyst 1,8‐diazabicyclo[5.4.0]undec‐7‐ene (DBU) into ZIF‐8, we created a ZIF‐8@DBU composite catalyst, that effectively isolates the catalyst while preserving its racemization activity. This enabled the efficient deracemization of racemic DMY via cocrystallization, selectively yielding either the (2\n                    R\n                    ,3\n                    R\n                    )‐ or (2\n                    S\n                    ,3\n                    S\n                    )‐enantiomer simply by switching the handedness of the coformer, N‐benzyl‐1‐phenylethylamine (NBP). Remarkably, the product yield reached up to 52%, surpassing the 50% theoretical limit of conventional chiral resolution techniques. The strategy proved general, extending successfully to ZIF‐67@DBU and ZIF‐90@DBU. This work demonstrates the feasibility of using tailored MOF composites to overcome long‐standing compatibility barriers in deracemization and opens avenues for their broader application in asymmetric synthesis.","aip":1},{"t":"Floquet 晶体拓扑边界态完整层次结构的统一表征","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag170/8526395?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"Topological phases of matter are defined by bulk invariants that dictate the existence of robust boundary states. While conventional bulk-boundary correspondence links a given bulk invariant to a specific type of boundary mode, many systems may host multiple orders of topology simultaneously, including chiral edge states, weak edge states, and higher-order hinge and corner states. A unified framework for predicting and classifying all such boundary phenomena has remained elusive. Here we introduce a compact topological triplet-three complementary one-dimensional winding numbers defined in distinct momentum subspaces-that fully determines the presence and type of boundary states in two-dimensional Floquet crystals. We experimentally implement this concept in a time-synthetic photonic lattice, demonstrating its predictive power. This unified approach integrates strong, weak, and higher-order topology into a single framework, providing critical insight for studying topological matter and enabling systematic control of complex topological phases across a broad range of physical platforms.","tp":"拓扑边界态","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究团队引入了一个统一框架，用于预测和分类Floquet晶体中拓扑边界态的完整层次结构。虽然常规的体-边界对应关系将一个体不变量与特定边界模式联系起来，但许多系统可同时存在多种阶次的拓扑，包括手性边缘态、弱边缘态以及高阶铰链和角态。该框架弥补了此前对边界现象统一表征的空白，为拓扑物态的全面理解提供了理论工具。"},{"t":"三异恶唑大环内酯类增强紫杉烷类微管组装和抗有丝分裂活性","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522954?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Mycalolides are marine‐derived trisoxazole macrolides that exhibit potent actin‐depolymerizing activity and inhibit the proliferation, migration, and invasion of various cancer cells. The C25–C35 side‐chain moiety of mycalolides is important for their actin‐binding properties; however, the biological function of the C1–C24 trisoxazole macrolactone moiety remains largely unexplored. In this study, using a photoaffinity biotin probe, we identified tubulin as a new, actin‐independent target of mycalolide C (MyC). Ultracentrifugation, fluorescence‐based tubulin polymerization assays, and transmission electron microscopy of negatively stained microtubules (MTs) demonstrated that MyC and trisoxazole macrolactones exert potent synergistic effects on paclitaxel‐induced MT assembly and stabilization. These compounds enhanced the antiproliferative activity of paclitaxel by 4.2‐ to 6.7‐fold in HCT‐116 human colon cancer cells but showed little synergy in 3T3‐L1 murine fibroblast. Molecular modeling studies suggest that MyC stabilizes the protein–protein interactions between α/β‐tubulin heterodimers. Given that the C1–C24 trisoxazole macrolactone moiety and its analogues exhibit little cytotoxicity, our findings may contribute to the development of new lead compounds for MT inhibitors with reduced side effects.","tp":"微管靶向药物","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究发现海洋来源的三异恶唑大环内酯类化合物（mycalolides）不仅具有已知的肌动蛋白解聚活性，其C1-C24大环内酯部分还能结合微管蛋白并增强紫杉烷类的微管组装和抗有丝分裂活性。研究利用光亲和生物素探针鉴定微管蛋白为新的作用靶点，揭示了mycalolides双靶点（肌动蛋白和微管）的作用机制，为抗癌药物联合开发提供了新策略。"},{"t":"摩擦电自供电气流传感器具有突破性的超低气流速度响应，用于风速检测和","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70840?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  High‐sensitivity and high‐accuracy sensors are crucial for environmental and health monitoring. However, traditional distributed wind speed sensors commonly suffer from high start‐up wind speeds and external power dependency. Meanwhile, wearable respiratory monitoring devices face challenges such as limited sensitivity and a lack of adaptive power supply. Herein, this work proposes a self‐powered capacitive high‐sensitivity triboelectric airflow sensor (CHTAS). This sensor exploits triboelectric‐electrostatic induction and fluid‐solid coupling effects to achieve an ultralow start‐up airflow (0.1 m/s) and the corresponding equivalent dynamic pressure is only 0.006 Pa, breaking a new record for TENG‐based airflow speed sensing. CHTAS features expeditious response (response time 29 ms, recovery time 27 ms) and a wide range (0.1–10 m/s). Integrated with self‐developed software, CHTAS achieves high‐precision wind speed detection. Furthermore, its ability to be miniaturized and integrated into face masks enables wireless, real‐time respiratory monitoring, intelligent‐assisted identification of sleep‐disordered respiration and the exploration of potential interventions for sleep paralysis. Notably, by combining deep learning for respiratory state recognition, the system achieved a 91.06% recognition mean accuracy. This work paves a new technological path for the development of airflow sensing technology and wearable medical devices.","tp":"摩擦电气流传感","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究提出了一种自供电电容式高灵敏度摩擦电气流传感器（CHTAS），突破性地实现了超低气流速度响应。该传感器解决了传统风速传感器启动风速高、依赖外部电源以及可穿戴呼吸监测设备灵敏度有限等问题。CHTAS利用摩擦电效应实现自供能，可同时应用于环境风速检测和人体呼吸健康监测，具有广阔的物联网和可穿戴设备应用前景。"},{"t":"通过铂-磷酸盐配位将顺铂转化为靶向光热化疗药物","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7615?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cisplatin’s (Cis’s) antitumor efficacy is limited by dose-dependent toxicity due to nonspecific tissue distribution. While targeted Cis delivery and combination therapies boost therapeutic efficacy, developing multifunctional yet simplified formulations remains challenging. Inspired by the Cis’s interaction with DNA, here, we transformed Cis into a reversible photothermal agent through the platinum-phosphate (Pt-phos) interaction within a hyaluronan (HA) nanogel (named as HA/PtP) to afford synergistic photothermal therapy (PTT) and chemotherapy. The HA/PtP nanogel exhibits near infrared absorption and 32.08% photothermal conversion efficiency, and degrades to release Cis through the reversible Pt-phos interaction under acidic conditions. Leveraging HA’s intrinsic CD44 targeting, HA/PtP nanogel simultaneously enables highly efficient PTT and targeted chemotherapy in 4T1 breast tumor xenografts. Moreover, HA/PtP-based PTT successfully mimics hyperthermic intraperitoneal chemotherapy (HIPEC) but with alleviated Cis toxicity in MC38 metastatic mouse model. This HA/PtP nanogel represents a rationally designed Cis nanomedicine integrating the PTT with self-targeting and facile preparation.","tp":"光热化疗纳米药","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究团队受顺铂与DNA相互作用的启发，通过铂-磷酸盐配位作用将顺铂转化为可逆的光热试剂，包载于透明质酸纳米凝胶中（命名为HA/PtP），实现了靶向协同光热化疗。该策略克服了顺铂非特异性组织分布导致的剂量依赖性毒性，利用透明质酸的肿瘤靶向性提高药物递送精准度，将光热治疗与化疗相结合，显著增强了抗肿瘤疗效。"},{"t":"通过不可还原固体电解质诱导的动态界面层实现硅负极近100%初始库仑效率","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00006-1?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态硅负极","kp":["电解质[Si负极]: Li2.45S0.55N0.45不可还原型","目标[首效]: 接近100%初始库仑效率","机制[界面]: 反应补锂维持快离子传输"],"dp":1,"as":"硅负极因其高理论比容量成为全固态电池的理想候选，但首次充放电过程中严重的锂损耗导致初始库仑效率偏低，制约实际应用。本研究提出一种不可逆的锂补偿策略，使硅负极的初始库仑效率趋近100%，有效减少了活性锂的不可逆消耗，为高能量密度全固态电池硅负极的工程化应用扫清关键障碍。","sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Toward near-100% initial Coulombic efficiency of Si anodes through irreducible solid electrolyte-induced dynamic interph","b":"Silicon anodes promise high energy density for all-solid-state batteries (ASSBs) but are limited by severe lithium loss during the first cycle. This work reveals how controlled interfacial reactions enabled by an irreducible solid electrolyte Li2.45S0.55N0.45 can replenish lithium, enhance initial Coulombic efficiency, and maintain fast ion transport. By uncovering the underlying interfacial reaction mechanism, the study demonstrates how rational interface design can simultaneously improve efficiency and electrochemical performance, offering a practical pathway toward safer, high-energy ASSBs."},{"t":"胸腺健康是终身健康和免疫治疗有效性的预测指标","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00633-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"对成人胸腺健康的影响","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10242-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The thymus is essential for establishing T cell diversity early in life, but undergoes profound involution with age and has therefore traditionally been regarded as largely nonfunctional in adults1,2. Here we propose that preserving thymic functionality is integral to adult health and longevity. We developed a deep learning framework to quantify thymic health from routine radiographic images and evaluated its association with longevity and risk of major age-associated diseases in two large prospective cohorts of asymptomatic adults: the National Lung Screening Trial (n = 25,031) and the Framingham Heart Study (n = 2,581). In both cohorts, thymic health varied markedly across the population. In the National Lung Screening Trial, higher thymic health was consistently associated with lower all-cause mortality, reduced lung cancer incidence and lower cardiovascular mortality over 12 years of follow-up after adjustment for age, sex, smoking and comorbidities. In the independent Framingham Heart Study cohort, higher thymic health was significantly associated with reduced cardiovascular mortality, independent of age, sex and smoking. Thymic health was further linked to systemic inflammation and metabolic dysregulation, and associated with modifiable lifestyle factors including smoking, obesity and physical activity. Together, these findings reposition the thymus as a central regulator of immune-mediated ageing and disease susceptibility in adulthood, highlighting its potential as a target for preventive and regenerative strategies to promote healthy ageing and longevity."},{"t":"癌症患者的胸腺健康和免疫治疗结果","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10243-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Although immunotherapy has revolutionized cancer treatment, many patients still experience limited benefit, highlighting the urgent need for improved biomarkers1. Although immunotherapy is founded on unleashing T cells2, most existing biomarkers remain tumour-centric and mainly overlook host immune competence. The thymus is a key immune organ that is crucial for T cell maturation, and we hypothesized that thymic functionality is associated with immunotherapy outcomes3. Here we show that thymic health, a radiographic measure of thymic functionality, is strongly associated with immunotherapy outcomes across several cancer types. Using a deep-learning framework applied to routine computed tomography images, we quantified thymic health in a pan-cancer cohort of 3,476 patients receiving immune checkpoint inhibitors. In patients with non-small cell lung cancer, higher thymic health was associated with reduced risks of progression and all-cause mortality. These associations remained significant across clinically relevant levels of programmed death ligand 1 (PD-L1) and tumour mutation burden. In the prospective TRACERx lung cancer study, thymic health was positively associated with T cell receptor diversity and T cell receptor excision circles, and correlated with immune-system signalling pathways, supporting radiographic thymic health as a proxy for thymic activity and adaptive immune competence. Analysis across patients with melanoma, breast cancer or renal cancer demonstrated pan-cancer relevance. Together, these findings identify thymic health as a previously unrecognized, tumour-agnostic determinant of immunotherapy efficacy, with potential implications for patient stratification, treatment timing and the development of immune-rejuvenating strategies in precision immuno-oncology."},{"t":"使用实验室X射线光源对未染色软组织进行亚细胞分辨率三维高内涵成像","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525239123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"X射线组织成像","kp":["设备[X射线]: 实验室级显微镜","应用[成像]: 未染色软组织三维","分辨率[成像]: 亚细胞级"],"as":"本文提出一种针对未染色软组织实现亚细胞分辨率的三维高内涵成像方法，可在厘米至纳米跨尺度上观测生物系统结构。该技术无需传统组织学的切片染色流程，直接获取软组织三维形态与亚细胞细节，有望简化病理分析流程、保留组织原生空间信息，在临床诊断与发育生物学研究中具有应用潜力。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Three-dimensional high-content imaging of unstained soft tissue with subcellular resolution using a laboratory-based X-r","b":"With increasing interest in studying biological systems across spatial scales—from centimeters down to nanometers—histology continues to be the gold standard for tissue imaging at cellular resolution, providing an essential bridge between macroscopic and nanoscopic analysis. However, its inherently destructive and two-dimensional nature limits its ability to capture the full three-dimensional complexity of tissue architecture. Here, we show that phase-contrast X-ray microscopy can enable three-dimensional virtual histology with subcellular resolution. This technique provides direct quantification of electron density without restrictive assumptions, allowing for direct characterization of cellular nuclei in a standard laboratory setting. By combining high spatial resolution and soft tissue contrast, with automated segmentation of cell nuclei, we demonstrated virtual Hematoxylin and Eosin (H&amp;E) staining using machine learning-based style transfer, yielding volumetric datasets compatible with existing histopathological analysis tools. Furthermore, by integrating electron density and the sensitivity to nanometric features of the dark field contrast channel, we achieve stain-free, high-content imaging capable of distinguishing nuclei and extracellular matrix."},{"t":"通往户外稳定性的漫长之路：钙钛矿太阳能电池材料真实世界控制挑战","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01085C","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钙钛矿户外稳定性","kp":["效率[实验室]: 27% PCE","挑战[钙钛矿]: 户外运行稳定性"],"dp":1,"as":"钙钛矿光伏在实验室受控条件下功率转换效率表现优异，但户外长期稳定性仍是商业化的核心瓶颈。本文系统梳理钙钛矿电池在真实世界环境中面临的降解挑战——包括光照、湿度、温度循环及紫外辐射等导致的相分离与离子迁移，并评估当前封装、组分工程与界面钝化等稳定性提升策略的实际成效与距离规模化部署的差距。","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"The long road to outdoor stability: real-world challenges for controlling perovskite materials for solar cells","b":"Perovskite photovoltaics have demonstrated impressive performance in controlled laboratory tests, with power conversion efficiencies as high as 27%, positioning them as promising alternatives to conventional silicon-based solar cells for various applications. However, despite these major advances, operational stability remains a limiting factor for commercial applications. Large-scale implementation requires addressing challenges such as susceptibility to environmental stressors and the need for long-term outdoor stability, which few standardized outdoor testing studies and publications have accurately assessed. In this review, it is suggested that several stressors, such as temperature and irradiance fluctuations, UV-light, humidity, and precipitation have a significant relevance on the long-term stability. The main degradation reactions initiated by these stressors are reviewed for different compositions of perovskite absorbers and charge transport layers. Furthermore, we reviewed recent in situ and/or in operando studies of perovskite materials and devices under controlled conditions, which intend to elucidate reaction mechanisms and/or interactions among the device's layers in state-of-the-art perovskite compositions, which pave the way for a more rational design of stable devices and highlight the importance of developing in situ or in operando studies for each perovskite composition interacting with other materials within the cell stack. For controlling perovskite solar cells (PSCs) and improving outdoor stability, we emphasize strategies such as bulk modifications, interface engineering, and back electrode design, and discuss each specific strategy used in the literature that has been proved in outdoor conditions and its direct effect on device real-world stability. Moreover, additional strategies such as optimized interconnection layouts, protective functional layers, and advanced encapsulation materials are discussed. Additionally, in this work, an assessment of different measurement approaches aligned with international standards such as IEC 61215 and ISOS was carried out across different climate zones. Our analysis reveals a predominant focus on temperate climates in outdoor testing, along with growing interest in correlating indoor accelerated aging data with measured outdoor performance. In particular, tropical climates, with consistently high humidity, temperature, and solar radiation, provide an ideal setting for exhaustive and accelerated stability tests to evaluate strategies for improving perovskite devices. This review also emphasizes the need for expanding outdoor testing in diverse climates, particularly those enabling rapid feedback and decision-making, as a critical step towards ensuring PSC stability and commercial viability."},{"t":"纵深时间的权力分配和包容性","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec1426?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"This study presents a global, deep-time comparative analysis of governance, questioning entrenched viewpoints about the origins and evolution of democratic institutions. Drawing on archaeological and textual data from 40 case observations across 31 polities, we develop a quantitative framework to assess governance along a collective-autocratic axis, defined by two key dimensions: concentration of power and citizen inclusiveness. Using bridging arguments and robust proxies, we construct an autocracy index to assess where cases fall on this axis and examine them in relation to population size, hierarchical complexity, geographic region, modes of fiscal financing, bureaucratic structure, ritual practices, and socioeconomic inequality. Neither polity population nor geographic region tightly correlates with the collective-autocratic axis of governance, challenging extant neoevolutionary models. Instead, the strongest associations for autocratic governance are with external financing, patrimonial bureaucracy, spectacular ritual, and high inequality. The study underscores the diversity and persistence of collective governance, offering a scalable methodology for future comparative research and reframing historical narratives."},{"t":"化石燃料的衰落和寻找可行的替代品：对生物柴油、电力和沼气的严格审查","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002990?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"化石燃料替代","sc":2.2,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"E3 泛素连接酶机制指定靶向 microRNA 降解","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10232-0","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"MicroRNAs (miRNAs) associate with Argonaute (AGO) proteins to form complexes that down-regulate target RNAs, including messenger RNAs from most human genes1,2,3. Within each complex, the miRNA pairs to target RNAs, and AGO provides effector function while also protecting the miRNA from cellular nucleases2,3,4,5. Although much is known about miRNA-directed gene regulation, less is known about how miRNAs themselves are regulated. One pathway that regulates miRNAs involves unusual targets called ‘trigger’ RNAs, which reverse the canonical regulatory logic and instead down-regulate miRNAs6,7,8,9. This target-directed miRNA degradation (TDMD) is thought to require a cullin–RING E3 ligase because it depends on the cullin protein CUL3 and other ubiquitylation components, including the BC-box protein ZSWIM8 (refs. 10,11). ZSWIM8 is required for murine perinatal viability and for destabilization of most short-lived miRNAs, which suggests biological importance of TDMD11,12,13. Here, biochemical and cellular assays establish AGO binding and polyubiquitylation by the ZSWIM8–CUL3 E3 ligase as the key regulatory steps of TDMD, and thereby define a unique cullin–RING E3 ligase class. Cryogenic electron microscopy analyses show ZSWIM8 recognizing distinct AGO and RNA conformations shaped by pairing of the miRNA to the trigger. Specificity of AGO ubiquitylation is established through generalizable RNA–RNA, RNA–protein and protein–protein interactions. The substrate features recognized by the E3 ligase do not conform to a conventional degron14,15 but instead establish a two-RNA-factor authentication mechanism for specifying a protein ubiquitylation substrate.","tp":"microRNA降解","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究揭示了E3泛素连接酶通过特定机制调控microRNA（miRNA）降解的新途径。miRNA与Argonaute蛋白形成复合物来下调靶RNA，而AGO蛋白同时保护miRNA免受细胞核酸酶降解。该研究聚焦于miRNA自身如何被调控，发现了一种涉及特殊靶标（target-directed miRNA degradation, TDMD）的途径，深化了对miRNA稳态调控机制的理解。","aip":1},{"t":"拟南芥 FRIENDLY (FMT) 蛋白与 NAC 相互作用并确定核编码线粒体蛋白的作用位置","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521483123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Mitochondria are not only the powerhouses of the cell. They are also dynamic signaling hubs, playing a key role in cellular metabolism and adaptation. Proper mitochondrial function depends largely on the import of proteins encoded by the nucleus. Using proximity labeling (TurboID), we show that\n                    Arabidopsis thaliana\n                    FRIENDLY (FMT) protein is in close proximity to several organellar-destined proteins, mostly mitochondrial, during their translation. Many of the corresponding mRNAs are immunoprecipitated with FMT. Remarkably, when FMT is absent, its target mRNAs lose their correct cellular localization. Our TurboID approach, associated with immunoprecipitations and confocal microscopy, also demonstrates the interaction between FMT and the Nascent polypeptide Associated Complex (NAC), a ribosome-associated platform involved in the maturation and sorting of nascent peptides. Taken together, these results suggest that FMT, through its interaction with NAC and the ribosome, is involved in the spatial regulation of translation in the cell."},{"t":"TON1 和 FASS 需要招募肌球蛋白 VIII（一种细胞分裂指导因子）","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524514123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Because plant cells cannot migrate, their position is fixed with respect to their neighbors. Thus, placement of the new cell plate is critical for determining cell shape, cell identity, and tissue patterning. Here, we show that TONNEAU1 (TON1), a protein essential for preprophase band formation, plays a role in phragmoplast guidance even in cells that do not have a microtubule-based preprophase band. TON1 is part of a complex that contains TONNEAU2/FASS, PROTEIN PHOSPHATASE 2A (PP2A), and the TON1 RECRUITING MOTIF (TRM) proteins, known as the TON1-TRM-PP2A (TTP) complex. We found that TON1 localizes specifically to the plasma membrane along the branch-adjacent wall in a branching cell in\n                    Physcomitrium patens\n                    juvenile tissue. Knocking out\n                    FASS\n                    does not affect TON1 localization, suggesting that TON1 recruitment to the plasma membrane is independent of FASS. A novel point mutation in TON1 disrupts dimerization and localization to the plasma membrane. In mutants lacking TTP function, myosin VIII localization is altered, resulting in phragmoplast guidance defects. Our data suggest a model whereby myosin VIII guides the phragmoplast in a TTP-dependent manner to the branch-adjacent wall facilitating efficient insertion at that site.","tp":"植物细胞分裂","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究发现TONNEAU1（TON1）蛋白在植物细胞分裂中发挥双重作用：既参与前期带的形成，也在缺乏微管前期带的细胞中参与成膜体引导。TON1是含TON2/FASS、PP2A等蛋白复合物的组成部分，该复合物需要招募肌球蛋白VIII这一细胞分裂指导因子。由于植物细胞无法迁移，新细胞板的位置对细胞形态和组织模式至关重要，该发现阐明了植物细胞分裂定向的分子机制。"},{"t":"用于细胞比例控制的合成电路","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10259-3","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Recent advances in genetic engineering have provided diverse tools for artificially diversifying both prokaryotic and eukaryotic cell populations1,2,3,4,5,6. However, achieving precise control over the ratios of multiple cell types within a population derived from a single founder remains a major challenge. Here we introduce a suite of recombinase-mediated genetic devices designed to accurately control population ratios, enabling the distribution of distinct functionalities across multiple cell types. We systematically evaluated key parameters that influence recombination efficiency and developed data-driven models to reliably predict binary differentiation outcomes. Using these devices, we constructed parallel and series circuit topologies to implement user-defined, multistep cell-fate branching programs. The branching devices facilitated the autonomous differentiation of precision fermentation consortia from a single founder yeast strain, optimizing cell-type ratios for applications such as pigmentation and cellulose degradation. Similar effects were obtained with mammalian cells. We also engineered multicellular aggregates with genetically encoded morphologies by coordinating self-organization through cell adhesion molecules. Our work provides a comprehensive characterization of recombinase-based cell-fate branching mechanisms and introduces an approach for constructing synthetic consortia and multicellular assemblies.","tp":"合成基因电路","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了一套基于重组酶介导的基因装置，能够精确控制由单个始祖细胞衍生的群体中多种细胞类型的比例。该技术突破了在多细胞群体中精确调控不同细胞类型比例的重大挑战，可将不同功能分配到多种细胞类型中。这一合成生物学工具在组织工程、细胞治疗和生物制造等领域具有广泛应用潜力。","aip":1},{"t":"基于 SIGLEC9 的合成嵌合开关受体增强 CAR 巨噬细胞对抗胶质母细胞瘤的功效","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519819123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Chimeric antigen receptor macrophage (CAR-M) therapy represents a promising therapeutic approach for treating glioblastoma multiforme (GBM). However, durable antitumorigenic macrophage phenotype of CAR-Ms is limited by the highly immunosuppressive tumor microenvironment (TME), wherein Siglec–sialic acid signaling directly drives macrophage polarization toward a protumorigenic phenotype. We here report an in situ synthetic SIGLEC9-based chimeric switch receptor (CSR) for diverting the inhibitory signal into positive ones, augmenting the sustained proinflammatory phenotype and tumoricidal immunity of CAR-Ms in the GBM niche. Specifically, our results showed that macrophage-targeted ionizable lipid nanoparticles efficiently introduce dual circRNAs into macrophages to generate CSR functionalized CAR-Ms in vitro and in vivo. The modified macrophages maintained a proinflammatory state, exhibited superior phagocytic activity, resulting in rapid and efficient eradication of IL13Rα2-positive tumor cells. Moreover, an injectable nanoparticle–hydrogel system for reprogramming macrophages surrounding the glioma resection cavity initiated a locoregional antitumor immune response and elicited robust long-term immunological memory, inhibiting tumor relapse in the postoperative GBM model. In sum, our findings establish that the engineered SIGLEC9-based CSR significantly promotes the maintenance of an antitumoral phenotype of CAR-Ms in the hypersialylated acidic TME, contributing to the improvement of engineered macrophage-based immunotherapy against GBM.","tp":"CAR巨噬细胞","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究针对胶质母细胞瘤（GBM）CAR巨噬细胞疗法中免疫抑制性肿瘤微环境的限制，开发了基于SIGLEC9的合成嵌合开关受体（CSR）策略。该受体可将Siglec-唾液酸信号的抑制性信号转化为激活信号，阻止巨噬细胞向促肿瘤表型极化，从而在原位增强CAR-M的持久抗肿瘤活性。该策略为克服GBM免疫抑制微环境提供了创新解决方案。","aip":1},{"t":"协同电子-拓扑策略实现共价可适性网络的时空控制","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea6321?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价可适网络","kp":["策略[CANs]: 电子-拓扑协同调控","应用[纺丝]: 共价可适网络高速熔融"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出了一种电子-拓扑协同策略（Synergistic electronic-topological strategy），用于实现对共价适应性网络（Covalent Adaptable Networks, CANs）的时空可控调控。CANs是一类动态共价交联聚合物网络，兼具热固性材料的优异力学性能和热塑性材料的可重塑加工优势。该策略将电子结构调控与网络拓扑设计相结合，通过精确控制动态共价键的交换反应，实现对材料力学性能、形状重构和自修复行为的时空精准编程。这一方法为智能响应材料、软体机器人和可编程结构材料的设计提供了新范式，有望突破传统CANs在响应速度和空间精度方面的瓶颈。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.5},"ot":"Synergistic electronic-topological strategy enables spatiotemporal control of covalent adaptable networks","b":"Covalent adaptable networks (CANs) hold considerable promise for combining the advantages of thermosets and thermoplastics. However, their use in high-speed melt spinning is restricted by insufficient dynamic bond reactivity at processing temperatures and the mismatch between network rearrangement kinetics and industrial requirements. Here, we establish a spatiotemporally regulated platform based on internally catalyzed oxime-urethane chemistry within a four-arm cross-linking topology. Neighboring urea groups provide internal catalysis that greatly accelerates oxime-urethane dissociation at 110°C, improving melt fluidity. During extrusion, the slight temperature drop rapidly drives bond recombination within the four-arm topology, while hydrogen bonds deliver immediate reinforcement to retain melt strength. This synergistic design enables continuous melt spinning at 100 meters per minute over a short 10-centimeter distance. The resulting fibers combine high mechanical performance (tensile strength: 261.7 megapascals; toughness: 630.1 megajoules per cubic meter) with excellent stretchability, self-healing, and recyclability. This molecular engineering approach overcomes the processing-performance tradeoff in CANs, offering a scalable pathway toward high-performance, sustainable polymers for industrial manufacturing.","aip":1},{"t":"协同双电解质添加剂实现长循环可充电镁电池","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70844?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镁电池添加剂","kp":["电解质[镁电]: Mg(OTf)2/G2+InBr3双添加剂","焦点[界面]: Mg2+界面动力学"],"as":"该研究针对可充镁电池（Rechargeable Magnesium Batteries）中镁离子在电解液-镁负极界面的动力学瓶颈问题，提出了双电解液添加剂协同策略（Synergistic Dual Electrolyte Additives）。镁电池具有高体积能量密度和镁资源丰富等优势，但镁负极界面处镁离子的沉积/溶解动力学迟缓，且易形成钝化层阻碍离子传输，是限制其长循环稳定性的核心挑战。研究者通过两种添加剂的协同作用，协同优化固态电解质界面膜（SEI）的组成与结构，促进镁离子的高效可逆沉积，显著提升了电池的循环寿命和倍率性能。该工作为镁离子电池的界面工程提供了新思路。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.5},"ot":"Synergistic Dual Electrolyte Additives for Long‐Cycle Rechargeable Magnesium Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The interfacial kinetics of magnesium ions at the electrolyte‐magnesium anode interface remains a critical challenge for rechargeable magnesium batteries (RMBs). Developing advanced electrolyte additives represents one of the most promising strategies to mitigate this issue. This work systematically investigates the interfacial chemistry of a Mg(OTf)\n                    2\n                    /G2 electrolyte enhanced by InBr\n                    3\n                    and Tris(hexafluoroisopropyl) Borate (BHFP) as dual additives at the Mg metal anode for RMBs. The in situ‐formed organic–inorganic hybrid interphase derived from the dual‐additive electrolyte improves the magnesiophilicity and lowers the Mg\n                    2+\n                    diffusion energy barrier. Furthermore, the chain reaction between the additives and the anode yields weakly coordinating [B(HFIP)\n                    4\n                    ]\n                    −\n                    anions and highly migrating [Mg(Br)(G2)\n                    2\n                    ]\n                    +\n                    cations. As a result, the dual‐additive electrolyte demonstrated superior electrochemical performance, characterized by high rate performance and cycling stability of 1000 h at 0.5 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . Furthermore, the Mg//MIB//Mo\n                    6\n                    S\n                    8\n                    full cell exhibited a capacity retention of 83.7% even after 1700 cycles at a high current density of 500 mA g\n                    −1\n                    . Crucially, the study proved that the reaction of the metal halide and BHFP with the metal anode provides a vital pathway for the optimization of both the electrolyte and the interface in multivalent metal batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"超动力学：空穴复合体中的运动","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00020-3?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Chem","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Molecular recognition is a dynamic dance of coupled motions. Within cavitands, guests and hosts adapt mutually through spinning, breathing, and folding—a fluid interplay sustained by weak forces on a shallow energy landscape. This paradigm moves beyond static fits to bridge synthetic and biological systems by shifting the focus from structure to motion and guides the programming of molecular dynamics for functional assemblies and responsive materials.","tp":"超分子运动","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":"本文提出了分子识别的'超动力学'范式，强调主体-客体分子在空穴化合物中通过旋转、呼吸和折叠等耦合运动实现相互适应。这种动态互作由浅层能量景观上的弱相互作用维持，超越了传统的静态匹配模型。该范式架起了合成与生物系统之间的桥梁，将研究焦点从结构转向运动，为功能组装体和响应性材料的分子动力学编程提供了指导。"},{"t":"亚微米结构限域聚合物用于高性能本征可拉伸发光二极管","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72673?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可拉伸发光二极管","kp":["材料[可拉伸PLED]: 微晶弹性体掺发光聚合物","应用[显示]: RGB原色高应变稳定"],"as":"该研究提出了一种利用亚微米结构限制聚合物链运动的新策略，实现本征可拉伸聚合物发光二极管（PLED）阵列。通过微纳结构空间限域效应抑制聚合物链在拉伸下的有序性破坏，显著提升了器件在形变状态下的发光性能与稳定性。该方案为可穿戴电子、软体机器人及表皮显示等柔性光电子应用提供了高亮度、高分辨率的解决方案。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Submicron Structure Confined Polymers for High‐Performance Intrinsically Stretchable Light‐Emitting Diodes (Adv. Mater. ","b":"Intrinsically Stretchable PLED Arrays In their Research Article (10.1002/adma.202519650), Wenkang Shi, Zhiyuan Zhao, Yunlong Guo, Yunqi Liu, and co-workers introduce a novel microcrystalline elastomer into light-emitting polymers for intrinsically stretchable PLEDs, which achieves high performance and excellent stability under strain. These materials are suitable for RGB primary color applications and large-area processing, demonstrating significant potential for stretchable displays.","aip":1},{"t":"通过工艺-结构优化策略研究硅基圆柱电池的循环性能","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003405?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅基圆柱锂电池","kp":["[优化策略]: 工艺-结构优化硅基圆柱电池循环"],"as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Study on the cycling performance of silicon-based cylindrical batteries via process-structure optimization strategy"},{"t":"甲基化引发的萜烯环化的结构基础","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00014-8?rss=yes","c":"不相关","a":"Chem","tg":"观点评论","b":"Terpene biosynthesis typically relies on classical terpene cyclases to initiate carbocation cascades. This study provides structural insights into a distinct family of methyltransferases that generate the initiating carbocation through methyl transfer. These enzymes couple methylation and terpene cyclization within a single active site. X-ray structures define a pyrophosphate-gated transition between open and closed states, while mutagenesis identifies residue networks that shape cascade trajectories and product outcomes. These findings establish the mechanistic basis of methylation-triggered terpene cyclization."},{"t":"底物特异性和 MSMEG_0435-0436 分枝杆菌长链酰基辅酶 A 羧基结合的结构基础","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530575123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The presence of mycolic acid is a defining feature of the mycobacterial cell wall, which provides a highly impermeable barrier to many antibiotics. Biosynthesis of this fatty acid, as well as tuberculostearic acid, requires precursor molecules produced by the essential long-chain acyl-coenzyme A (CoA) carboxylase (LCC) complex. The LCC complex catalyzes carboxylation of the α-carbon of long-chain acyl-CoA, but also short-chain acetyl-CoA and propionyl-CoA. The complex includes the subunits AccA3, which contains a biotin carboxylase (BC) domain and a biotin carboxyl carrier protein (BCCP) domain, the long-chain acyl-CoA carboxyltransferase AccD4, the short-chain acyl-CoA carboxyltransferase AccD5, and the incompletely characterized protein AccE. We used electron cryomicroscopy (cryo-EM) to determine structures of the LCC complex from\n                    \n                      Mycobacterium\n                      smegmatis\n                    \n                    . In the structures, two AccE subunits tether eight AccA3 subunits to an AccD4\n                    2\n                    AccD5\n                    4\n                    heterohexamer core. Cryo-EM of the enzyme during catalysis reveals how AccD4 and AccD5 achieve substrate specificity, with AccD5 binding tightly to CoA and AccD4 binding long acyl chains. The BCCP domains of AccA3 undergo long-distance translocation to transfer a carboxyl group from the BC domain of AccA3 to the acyl-CoA substrate bound in AccD5. Further, we find that two copies of a protein complex formed from MSMEG_0435 and MSMEG_0436 can bind the LCC complex, sequestering the biotin moiety of BCCP domains near AccD5 and decreasing propionyl-CoA carboxylase activity. Rv0263c, the\n                    \n                      Mycobacterium tuberculosis\n                    \n                    ortholog of MSMEG_0435, has a role in bacterial survival during transmission, suggesting that these proteins may regulate production of branched fatty acid precursors for the mycobacterial cell wall."},{"t":"通过电子-离子协同实现超高功率密度和长寿命的即贴即用柔性钾离子微电池","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506432?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钾离子微电池","kp":["形态[微电池]: 贴即用柔性钾离子3D","制造[工艺]: 可扩展增材制造","特性[功率]: 超高功率密度长寿命"],"as":"该研究开发了一种即贴即用型柔性钾离子微型电池，兼具超高峰值功率密度和长期循环稳定性。微型电池在物联网、可穿戴及植入式器件中具有广阔应用前景，但面临能量密度与功率性能难以兼顾的挑战。该方案以钾离子为载流子，利用柔性基底与电极结构设计实现高倍率充放电与机械柔性，且贴附即可使用，无需额外封装工艺，为柔性微储能器件的工程化提供了新路径。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.5},"ot":"Stick‐and‐Use Flexible K‐Ion Microbatteries with Ultrahigh Power Density and Long Lifespan Via Electron‐Ion Synergistic ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Rechargeable micro batteries (MBs) with compatible sizes, high integration, and great energy storage potential have become a pressing need for future microelectronics and microrobots. However, current MBs struggle to balance high energy and high power while lacking applicable convenience. Hence, in this work, a novel kind of stick‐and‐use soft K‐ion 3D MBs is designed via a scalable additive manufacturing. Aided by electropolymerization, as‐3D‐printed micro‐cathode in MBs achieves an outstanding cycling stability over 10 000 cycles. For full MB devices, an ultrahigh power density of 50.2 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    along with a long lifespan over 3 000 charge‐discharge cycles is simultaneously exhibited. Through theoretical and experimental analysis, the obtained excellent performance is attributed to the rational surface modification and 3D microstructure advance, resulting in stabilized interfacial electrochemistry and tailored ion‐electron transport, respectively. Notably, through a unique 3D stacking, our MBs reach an exceptional areal capacity of 7.01 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    and energy density of 5.9 mWh cm\n                    −2\n                    . With the soft and miniature characteristics, these MBs can be easily stuck onto various microelectronic devices for direct use, where ensuring a stable and enduring operation. These results demonstrate a strong potential of MBs as a reliable microscale power source for next‐generation microsystems with high energy demands.","aip":1},{"t":"静电是一个大谜团——一系列新的研究可能有助于解开这个谜团","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00837-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"氯化物掺杂蒸发法宽带隙钙钛矿实现稳定的钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE04477D","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿有机叠层电池","kp":["添加剂[蒸镀]: ~1% PbCl2气相掺杂","稳定性[宽禁带]: 抑制离子迁移相分离"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过氯化物掺杂蒸发制备工艺，显著改善了宽禁带钙钛矿薄膜的结晶质量与相稳定性，从而实现了高效且耐久的钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池。宽禁带钙钛矿是构建多结叠层器件的核心顶层吸收体，此前长期受限于光致相分离与开路电压损失问题。氯化物掺杂有效抑制了缺陷态密度并优化了能带对齐，使叠层器件光电转换效率与运行稳定性同步提升，为迈向商业化叠层光伏提供了可行的工程路径。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Stable Perovskite-Organic Tandem Solar Cells Enabled by Chloride-Doped Evaporated Wide-Bandgap Perovskites","b":"Wide-bandgap perovskites are critical for achieving high-efficiency perovskite-based tandem solar cells, yet their practical deployment remains limited by stability challenges such as ion migration and halide phase segregation. Here, we demonstrate that introducing ~1% PbCl2 as a vapor-phase additive during thermal evaporation effectively stabilizes wide-bandgap perovskite devices. Detailed characterizations reveal strong chemical interactions between chloride anions and formamidinium cations, resulting in improved crystallinity and enhanced photoluminescence quantum yield. The Cl-doped wide-bandgap perovskite films exhibit suppressed halide phase segregation and mitigated ionic losses. As a result, a 1.75 eV single-junction perovskite cell achieves a T80 lifetime of 1,639 hours under continuous maximum power point tracking, along with improved efficiency and open-circuit voltage. When integrated with an organic subcell (PCE-10:P2EH-2V), the resulting perovskite-organic tandem solar cell achieves a power conversion efficiency of 24.86% and a maximum T80 of 1,979 hours, surpassing the stability of all the previously reported perovskite-organic and perovskite-perovskite tandem devices.","aip":1},{"t":"通过孔限域三苯基膦稳定银单原子位点实现高底物特异性CO₂转化","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2079917?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"银单原子CO2转化","kp":["催化剂[MEC-88]: MOF-808孔限域PPh3锚定Ag单原子","特性[CO2]: 高底物特异性抗团聚"],"as":"该研究提出一种利用孔限域三苯基膦配体稳定银单原子催化位点的策略，解决单原子催化剂在反应条件下易迁移团聚失活的共性难题。通过将磷配体限域于多孔载体孔道内，实现对银原子位点的精确锚定与配位调控，从而在CO₂还原或有机催化反应中保持高分散性、高活性与高稳定性。该策略为设计抗烧结的贵金属单原子催化剂提供了通用范式，对降低工业催化成本具有现实意义。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.5},"ot":"Stabilizing Silver Single‐Atom Site via A Pore‐Confined Triphenylphosphine for CO2 Conversion With High Substrate‐Specif","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ensuring the dispersion and anti‐aggregation of single‐atom sites under catalytic conditions remains a critical challenge in heterogeneous catalysis. Here, we report a dual‐confinement strategy for constructing a metal–organic framework (MOF) based catalyst, MEC‐88, by spatially confining triphenylphosphine (PPh\n                    3\n                    ) within the pores of MOF‐808 to anchor silver single‐atom sites. MEC‐88 exhibits exceptional activity and pronounced substrate selectivity for the carboxylative cyclization of CO\n                    2\n                    with benzyl‐substituted propargylamines under mild, additive‐free aqueous conditions, achieving a turnover frequency up to 1051.3 ± 0.7 h\n                    −1\n                    . Moreover, PPh\n                    3\n                    , as a soft‐base ligand, provides robust coordination to silver atoms, effectively inhibiting their aggregation to endow the catalyst with good recyclability. Mechanistic studies reveal that the PPh\n                    3\n                    ‐coordinated silver site synergizes with the Zr\n                    6\n                    O\n                    8\n                    cluster to activate both the alkyne substrate and CO\n                    2\n                    , substantially lowering the energy barriers for CO\n                    2\n                    insertion and cyclization. This work presents a molecule‐enhanced confinement approach for designing stable and efficient single‐atom catalysts with controllable substrate‐specificity.","aip":1},{"t":"具有双官能团的自发型钙钛矿钝化剂","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506494?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿自发钝化","kp":["钝化剂[PSCs]: RA-TFSIs双功能基团","机制[自发]: HTM添加剂自发钙钛矿钝化"],"as":"该研究报道了一类带有双功能基团的自发钙钛矿钝化剂，可在钙钛矿太阳能电池中实现异质界面的自发调制。钝化剂分子同时提供路易斯酸性和路易斯碱性位点，分别靶向钙钛晶界与界面的阴、阳离子缺陷，从根源上降低非辐射复合损失。自发形成的界面调制层无需额外退火步骤即可优化能级排列，显著提升器件的开路电压与填充因子，同时改善湿热环境下的长期运行稳定性，为高效稳定的钙钛矿光伏提供了简化工艺的新思路。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.5},"ot":"Spontaneous Perovskite Passivator Featuring Dual Functional Groups","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    A recent advancement in perovskite solar cells (PSCs) is the emergence of spontaneous heterointerface modulators (SHMs), which eliminate the additional processing required for conventional heterointerface modification. Among SHMs, alkyl‐primary‐ammonium‐bis(trifluoromethylsulfonyl)imides (RA‐TFSIs), used as hole‐transport material (HTM) additives, enable spontaneous perovskite passivation. Upon HTM deposition, RA cations passivate the perovskite surface through strong adsorption via the ammonium (NH\n                    3\n                    +\n                    ) moiety. However, conventional RA‐TFSIs only passivate\n                    A\n                    ‐site defects, limiting their effectiveness. Moreover, RA components with multiple functional groups have not been explored. Here, we propose a strategy to suppress multiple defect sites using a spontaneous passivator with dual functional groups. 2‐thiophene‐ethyl‐ammonium‐TFSI (TEA‐TFSI) is newly synthesized and verified as a spontaneous perovskite passivator for n–i–p PSCs employing thermally stable poly[bis(4‐phenyl)(2,4,6‐trimethylphenyl)amine] (PTAA) as the HTM. Spontaneous passivation using TEA‐TFSI forms a monolayer‐like overlayer, where TEA cations are adsorbed at both\n                    A\n                    ‐ and\n                    X\n                    ‐site defects via ammonium and thiophene moieties, respectively, overcoming the single‐site limitation of RA‐TFSIs. The TEA overlayer also improves PTAA adhesion. Consequently, PSCs achieve power conversion efficiencies of 22.2% (≈0.12 cm\n                    2\n                    minicells) and 21.7% (≈1.6 cm\n                    2\n                    minimodules, active area: 1.41 cm\n                    2\n                    ), respectively, with thermal stability. This work establishes a general design principle for multifunctional spontaneous passivators and advances materials science."},{"t":"固态核磁共振提供MOF孔内化学环境的位置特异性信息","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00015-X?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF孔环境NMR","kp":["方法[MOF孔]: 固态核磁1H/19F报告分子","信息[特性]: 位置特异性化学环境"],"as":"固态核磁共振（ssNMR）技术能够提供金属有机框架（MOF）孔道内特定原子位置的化学环境信息，包括配位状态、空间邻近性与动力学行为等。这些局部结构细节直接决定客体分子在MOF内的吸附、存储与催化转化行为。通过多维ssNMR方法可解析常规衍射难以捕捉的无序与非晶态结构特征，为理性设计高容量气体存储、分离膜与多相催化剂提供从原子尺度到功能性能的关联依据，推动MOF材料从结构发现走向工程化定制。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Solid-state NMR provides location-specific information on the chemical environment inside MOF pores","b":"The chemical environment inside MOF pores controls how guest molecules are adsorbed, stored, and transformed within MOFs. We show that 1H and 19F nuclei that are present in the linker or introduced via small reporter molecules can elucidate differences between the chemical environments in different MOF pores. In addition to fundamental insight, solid-state NMR reporters enable facile localization of post-synthetically added ligands, as well as characterization of real-structure effects and the dynamic behavior of node-bound ligands."},{"t":"基于多智能体深度强化学习的智能产消者管理参与去中心化点对点能源交易","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003028?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"产消者P2P交易","kp":["[方法]: 多智能体深度强化学习管理产消者P2P市场"],"sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.5,"t":5.5},"as":"","ot":"Smart prosumers management based on multi-agent deep reinforcement learning to participate in decentralized peer-to-peer"},{"t":"单原子光催化剂作为可漂浮人工叶片，实现海洋塑料废弃物升级回收","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519931?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化塑料回收","kp":["催化剂[人工叶]: ZnIn2S4/Ru单原子可漂浮","应用[升级回收]: 聚丙烯PP直接转化","背景[PP]: 全球回收率<1%"],"sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"单原子光催化剂制成可漂浮的'人造叶片'，用于海洋塑料废弃物的高值化升级回收(upcycling)。该体系利用太阳光驱动光催化，将PET等塑料转化为燃料或化学品前体。单原子位点提供高催化活性和选择性，漂浮设计适配海洋环境，为解决全球80亿吨塑料污染提供可行路径。","ot":"Single‐Atom Photocatalyst as Floatable Artificial Leaf for Upcycling Oceanic Plastic Waste","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Over ∼8 billion tons of plastic have been produced to date, with ∼80% of them ended up in landfills/oceans. Among them, polypropylene (PP) possesses the lowest global recycling rate (&lt; 1%). To resolve this, Ru single atoms (SAs) loaded photocatalysts (ZnIn\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    /Ru SAs) in the forms of powder/floatable artificial leaf (AL) were prepared for direct conversion of raw PP plastic into valuable chemicals. The optimized photocatalyst exhibits exceptional performance with a total formic/acetic acid production of 1022.5 µmol g\n                    −1\n                    . In situ X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy, in situ atomic force microscopy‐kelvin probe force microscopy, and in situ electron paramagnetic resonance (EPR) reveal efficient electron extraction from ZnIn\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    nanosheets to Ru SAs, with subsequent electron capture by O\n                    2\n                    molecules in air. Additionally, in situ transient‐state photoluminescence spectroscopy, transient photovoltage measurement, and in situ EPR unveil the electrolyte‐assisted polarization (induced by cations/anions in seawater) significantly enhancing charge separation/transfer. Finally, in situ EPR, in situ infrared (IR) spectroscopy, and quenching experiments corroborate the pivotal roles of reactive oxygen species (·O\n                    2\n                    −\n                    /·OH) for upcycling PP into valuable chemicals. These results highlight the transformative potential of floatable AL concept for converting plastic waste into high‐value chemicals, offering a sustainable solution to plastic contamination."},{"t":"基于节肢动物启发的裂纹-螺旋耦合结构：单根聚合物纤维超灵敏多功能柔性微传感器","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529908123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物纤维柔性微传感","kp":["灵敏度[应变]: GF>10^3","尺寸[微传感器]: <100μm","稳定性[使用]: >10^4次","机制[仿生]: 节肢动物裂纹-螺旋耦合"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"受节肢动物感知器官启发的裂纹-螺旋耦合结构单聚合物纤维柔性微传感器。器件尺寸<100μm，应变系数(GF)>10³，兼具超高灵敏度和多功能感知(应变、温度、压力)。裂纹结构实现信号放大，螺旋构型赋予多轴检测能力，在可穿戴健康监测和机器人触觉感知领域具广泛应用前景。","ot":"Single polymer fiber–based ultrasensitive and multifunctional flexible microsensor via arthropod-inspired crack-helix co","b":"Flexible microsensors featuring miniature dimensions (&lt; 100 μm), superior sensitivity [Gauge factor (GF) &gt; 10\n                    3\n                    ], and phenomenal environmental stability (&gt; 10\n                    4\n                    uses) have been broadly applied in modern soft electronics such as implantable health monitoring and soft robotics. However, it is quite challenging to integrate these distinguished features in a microdevice considering the extremely limited space for the complicated fabrication and complex functionalities. Inspired by microscale sensing systems in arthropods, this work presents a unique crack-helix soft microsensor (CHMS) within a single polymer microfiber. This microdevice successfully combines the structural advantages of both slit and hair sensors in arthropods through convenient depositing a thin layer (thickness: 2.5 μm) of biphasic liquid metals on a single microfiber (diameter: 80 μm). The microsensor presents unique frequency detection capability as arthropods (resolution: 0.01 Hz, &gt; 1,088 Hz), ultrahigh sensitivity (GF &gt; 2,711 ± 119), astonishing detection limit (0.05% strain and 0.2 mN), and excellent sensing durability (over 50,000 cycles), which are among the best of currently reported soft sensors. Furthermore, analogous to natural arthropods, CHMS shows different multifunctional environmental perception capability to precisely recognize subtle vibration under water or ground (amplitude &lt; 70 μm) and extremely rarefied airflow (ultralow mass flux: 2.2 × 10\n                    −4\n                    g/s·cm\n                    2\n                    )."},{"t":"简单的传质调节实现海水淡化盐水无结垢零排液，无需化学处理","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb2604?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Thermal-driven interfacial evaporation crystallization offers a promising path to zero liquid discharge (ZLD) for high-salinity brine. However, cocrystallization of specific minor salt species with major salts forms scaling that causes operational failure. Although chemical additives are commonly used to mitigate scaling, they pose potential environmental risks. This study presents a chemical-additive-free antiscaling strategy that suppresses unwanted cocrystallization by rationally enhancing the departure of scaling-causing species from the evaporation interface. As a proof of concept, a solar evaporator is designed to enhance the backflow of MgSO\n                    4\n                    , the primary scaling-causing species in seawater desalination brine, by precisely regulating its mass transfer distance. Under solar irradiation, the evaporator achieved a continuous evaporation of seawater desalination brine for over 408 hours with a stable evaporation rate of 4.29 kilograms per square meter per hour without any visible scaling, enabling uninterrupted ZLD operation. Outdoor field tests further validated the strategy’s practical applicability. This work offers transformative potential for achieving sustainable ZLD in brine management.","tp":"盐水零排放","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出了一种无需化学添加剂的防结垢策略，通过合理增强传质来抑制高盐度盐水蒸发结晶过程中微量盐与主盐的共结晶。热驱动的界面蒸发结晶是实现高盐水零排液（ZLD）的有前途途径，但共结晶结垢导致运行失败。该策略通过简单的传质调节即可实现无结垢零排液，避免了化学添加剂的环境风险，为海水淡化浓盐水处理提供了可持续方案。","aip":1},{"t":"senolytic 治疗会导致胼胝体少突胶质细胞功能障碍和脱髓鞘","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524897123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Aging is a primary risk factor for disease progression in multiple sclerosis (MS). Because of this, treatments that can reduce the consequences of molecular aging, like senescence, have been proposed as a strategy to address disease progression. However, the effects of senolytics, a class of drugs which selectively ablate senescent cells, on the central nervous system are largely unknown. Here, we examined the effects of senolytic treatment on myelination and oligodendrocyte function in vivo using C57BL6/J mice and in vitro using primary rat oligodendrocyte cultures. Initial data showed that naïve young (3 to 4 mo) and aged (22 mo) C57BL6/J mice treated with dasatinib and quercetin (D+Q) developed significant demyelination compared to vehicle-treated controls, though no cell death was observed in the brain. In vitro, oligodendrocyte progenitor cells treated with D+Q in differentiation media exhibited significantly reduced myelin basic protein protein and morphological complexity, also without inducing cell death. Bulk RNA sequencing and ingenuity pathway analysis of D+Q treated oligodendrocytes identified differentially expressed genes associated with endoplasmic reticulum stress. These data suggest that D+Q evokes the unfolded protein response in oligodendrocytes, causing oligodendrocyte dysfunction and myelination failure. Due to the resemblance between oligodendrocytes treated with D+Q and those found in MS lesions, D+Q treatment offers a potential method to model an aspect of oligodendrocyte dysfunction relevant to MS. Therefore, understanding the mechanism by which D+Q perturb oligodendrocyte function may provide insight into some of the pathological features contributing to disease progression in MS."},{"t":"不同年龄的自我失活 AAV-CRISPR 能够持续改善 BAC226 中亨廷顿病的缺陷","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea8052?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Huntington’s disease (HD) is a monogenic autosomal dominant neurodegenerative disorder caused by a CAG repeat expansion in exon 1 of the\n                    HTT\n                    gene, yielding a gain-of-toxic-function mutant Huntingtin protein (mHTT). CRISPR-Cas9 is a potentially powerful therapeutic strategy for HD by eliminating mutant\n                    HTT\n                    (m\n                    HTT\n                    ) gene. We developed a specific SaCas9 guide RNA to target human m\n                    HTT\n                    and a self-inactivating gene editing system that abolishes SaCas9 after a short transient expression for high gene editing efficiency and maximal safety to prevent off-target effects. Both conventional and the self-inactivating gene editing systems successfully eliminated m\n                    HTT\n                    gene, 60 to 90% mHTT protein and 90% of mHTT aggregation in BAC226Q mouse brains, which resulted in significant long-term rescue of neuropathology, motor deficits, weight loss, and shortened life span. These beneficial effects were observed when gene editing was applied before, at, and well after the onset of pathological and behavioral abnormalities. These proof-of-concept data demonstrate that gene editing can be a highly effective therapeutic approach for HD.","tp":"亨廷顿治疗","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了自失活AAV-CRISPR系统用于治疗亨廷顿病（HD），HD由HTT基因外显子1的CAG重复扩增导致的毒性功能获得引起。研究者设计了特异性SaCas9引导RNA靶向突变型HTT基因，在BAC226模型小鼠中验证了不同年龄阶段给药均可持续改善HD缺陷。该自失活设计提高了CRISPR治疗的安全性，为HD的基因治疗向临床转化提供了重要证据。"},{"t":"快速微波刻蚀协同聚多巴胺保护实现锌负极秒级表面重构用于高性能水系电池","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506688?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌负极表面重构","kp":["容量[锌负极]: 820 mAh/g, 5855 mAh/cm^3","表面工程[Zn]: 微波刻蚀+聚多巴胺涂层","时间[重构]: 秒级表面重建"],"as":"水系锌离子电池（ZIBs）因其本征安全、低成本和高理论比容量（820 mAh/g）被视为大规模储能的有力候选，但锌负极面临的枝晶生长、析氢副反应和表面腐蚀严重制约其循环寿命。该研究提出一种基于快速微波刻蚀耦合的秒级锌负极表面重构策略，在极短时间内（秒级）构建均匀的表面微纳结构，有效调控锌沉积行为，抑制枝晶形成并促进均匀成核。该方法工艺简洁、能耗低，显著提升了锌负极的库伦效率和长循环稳定性，为水系锌电池的工程化应用提供了实用化负极改性方案。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Second‐Scale Surface Reconstruction of Zn Anodes via Rapid Microwave Etching Coupled With Polydopamine Protection for Pr","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Aqueous zinc‐ion batteries (ZIBs) offer intrinsic safety, low cost, and high theoretical capacity (820 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    , and 5855 mAh cm\n                    −3\n                    ), yet dendrite formation and parasitic side reactions on Zn anodes hinder practical application. Here, a synergistic surface engineering strategy combining rapid microwave‐assisted etching with a conformal polydopamine (PDA) coating is presented. Microwave irradiation creates hierarchical stepwise pores that expose (101) facets, providing abundant nucleation sites for Zn\n                    2+\n                    and guiding the directional growth of Zn, as supported by molecular dynamics simulations. The PDA layer captures H\n                    2\n                    O molecules near hydrated Zn\n                    2+\n                    , suppressing hydrogen evolution, corrosion, and byproduct formation. Consequently, PDA‐coated eZn (PDA‐eZn) symmetric cells exhibit stable cycling over 526 h at 10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    and 5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    , while PDA‐eZn//V\n                    2\n                    O\n                    5\n                    full cells retain 73.6% capacity after 1500 cycles at 3 A g\n                    −1\n                    , with robust rate performance across a wide current density range. This scalable and generalizable approach establishes a clear design principle for dendrite‐free, high‐performance Zn anodes and can be extended to other metal anodes, advancing safe, durable, and high‐power aqueous energy storage systems.","aip":1},{"t":"利用ShadowCam探测月球永久阴影区（PSRs）中的表面水冰","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec8211?af=R","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"月球水冰探测","kp":["手段[月球水冰]: ShadowCam高分辨率观测","目标[PSR]: 永久阴影区表面水冰分布"],"dp":1,"as":"月球、水星和谷神星等无大气天体存在永久阴影区（PSRs），其极低温环境可冷阱捕获并保存水冰，是未来深空探测和原位资源利用（ISRU）的关键目标。该研究利用先进遥感探测手段在月球PSRs中搜寻表面水冰的分布特征，结合多源光谱与雷达数据对阴影区表层物质组成进行反演分析。研究旨在厘清月表水冰的赋存形态、丰度及空间分布规律，为理解无大气天体上挥发分的迁移与保存机制提供科学依据，同时为未来月球极区探测任务和基地水资源的原位提取奠定数据基础。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Searching for surficial water ice in lunar permanently shaded regions (PSRs) with ShadowCam","b":"Airless bodies such as the Moon, Mercury, and Ceres have permanently shaded regions (PSRs) that can cold trap water ice. Mercury and Ceres have substantial ice deposits in their PSRs, but lunar water ice distribution remains uncertain because of sparse detections and limited data. Here, we assessed surficial water ice in lunar PSRs using high-resolution observations from ShadowCam onboard the Korea Pathfinder Lunar Orbiter. We used the high-reflectance and forward-scattering optical properties to search for water ice in lunar PSRs. We found no evidence of widespread water ice in PSRs at abundances above the detection limit of 20 to 30 wt % but could not rule out widespread low-content water ice. A few small locations with both high reflectance and forward-scattering behavior were observed, which could be consistent with &gt;10 wt % ice. Future missions with low detection limits (&lt;1 wt %) of water ice can test our findings."},{"t":"考虑极端天气事件的可再生电力系统基于情景分离的最优规划方法","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003338?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"极端天气电力规划","kp":["方法[可再生能源]: 情景分离优化规划","考量[风险]: 极端天气事件"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Scenario separation-based optimal planning method for renewable electric energy system considering extreme weather event"},{"t":"SEL1L–HRD1 ERAD–自噬相互作用维持棕色脂肪细胞中的线粒体稳态","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529914123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Mitochondrial integrity is central to energy homeostasis, particularly in brown adipose tissue where dynamic remodeling fuels thermogenesis. Two major proteostatic systems, the SEL1L–HRD1 endoplasmic reticulum (ER)-associated degradation (ERAD) pathway and autophagy, have been shown to intersect in vitro, but their physiological coordination in metabolically active tissues remains unclear. Here, we demonstrate that ERAD and autophagy act in synergy to safeguard mitochondrial integrity in brown adipocytes. Using various adipocyte-specific knockout (KO) mouse models and high-resolution ultrastructural 2D and 3D imaging, we show that simultaneous deletion of\n                    Sel1L\n                    and\n                    Atg7\n                    (double KO, DKO) causes striking mitochondrial abnormalities under room temperature, absent in single KO or\n                    Sel1L-Ire1a\n                    double knockout mice. DKO adipocytes accumulate hyperfused megamitochondria extensively penetrated by ER tubules, accompanied by ER expansion, excessive ER–mitochondrial contacts, and impaired thermogenesis. These findings reveal that SEL1L–HRD1 ERAD and autophagy cooperate, rather than act redundantly, to maintain mitochondrial integrity in brown fat, uncovering a previously unrecognized mitochondrial surveillance mechanism based on ERAD–autophagy crosstalk."},{"t":"考虑多时间尺度不确定性的综合能源系统鲁棒容量优化与低碳改造","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002953?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源系统","kp":["优化[综合能源]: 鲁棒容量+低碳改造","不确定性[系统]: 多时间尺度","集成[能源]: 纳入氢能"],"as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.5,"r":3.0,"d":2.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Robust capacity optimization and low-carbon retrofit of integrated energy systems considering multi-timescale uncertaint"},{"t":"重新审视海洋酸化的行星边界","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag173/8527594?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"锌离子电池中调控负极/电解质界面原位策略的研究进展","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003417?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锌负极界面调控","kp":["[界面工程]: 锌离子电池负极/电解质界面原位调控"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Research progress on in-situ strategies for modulating the anode/electrolyte interface in zinc-ion batteries"},{"t":"重新编程的 SimCells 用于抗菌治疗","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517118123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Antimicrobial resistance (AMR) is a critical global health challenge. In this study, we developed a platform based on chromosome-free and nonreplicating simple cells (SimCells, size 1 to 2 µm) and mini-SimCells (size 100 to 400 nm) for targeted pathogen elimination. Engineered with surface-displayed nanobodies, SimCells and mini-SimCells selectively bind bacteria expressing specific antigens (e.g., OmpA in\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    ). The selective interactions facilitate close SimCell-pathogen proximity, enabling two antimicrobial mechanisms: direct injection of toxic effectors into bacterial cytoplasm via a heterologous expression of type VI secretion system (T6SS), and enzymatic conversion of aspirin into catechol by engineered salicylate hydroxylase, leading to sustained local production of hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ). Our results demonstrate that both reprogrammed SimCells and mini-SimCells can eliminate target\n                    E. coli\n                    with high specificity and efficiency. Multidose reprogrammed mini-SimCell treatment led to a 10\n                    3\n                    -fold selective reduction of targeted bacteria in mixed microbial communities, with minimal disruption to nontarget bacteria. We demonstrate that reprogrammed mini-SimCells, engineered with nanobody targeting outer membrane protein OmpA of the clinically relevant multidrug-resistant pathogen\n                    E. coli\n                    ST131, achieved elimination efficiencies over 97% at 24 and 48 h. This modularized “plug-and-play” antimicrobial platform provides a highly specific, efficient, and adaptable solution for combating diverse AMR pathogens.","tp":"抗菌工程菌","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了基于无染色体、非复制简单细胞（SimCells，1-2μm）和mini-SimCells（100-400nm）的抗菌平台。通过表面展示纳米抗体，SimCells能选择性结合表达特定抗原（如大肠杆菌OmpA）的病原菌。这种工程化细胞平台可选择性地靶向并消除耐药病原菌，为应对全球抗菌素耐药性（AMR）危机提供了全新的生物治疗策略。","aip":1},{"t":"碱性烯烃与硫鎓叶立德的氧化还原中性电化学顺式环丙烷化反应","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7024568?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学环丙烷化","kp":["反应[环丙烷化]: 无金属氧化中性电化学顺式","试剂[叶立德]: 氧化锍叶立德适用低活性烯烃"],"as":"本文报道了一种无金属、氧化还原中性的电化学方法，用于实现烯烃与硫鎓盐（sulfoxonium ylides）的顺式（cis-）选择性环丙烷化反应。与传统依赖过渡金属催化剂（如铑、铜）的卡宾转移路线不同，该策略利用电化学阳极氧化原位生成卡宾前体，在温和条件下高立体选择性地构建顺式环丙烷骨架。该成果避免了金属残留与当量氧化剂的使用，符合绿色化学理念，在药物分子合成中具有应用潜力。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Redox‐Neutral Electrochemical Cis‐Cyclopropanation of Alkenes With Sulfoxonium Ylides","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Herein, we report an efficient metal‐free and redox‐neutral electrochemical strategy for the\n                    cis\n                    ‐selective cyclopropanation of less active alkenes with sulfoxonium ylides. This protocol circumvents the limitations of traditional methods, which are typically restricted to electron‐deficient alkenes, and provides access to thermodynamically less stable\n                    cis\n                    ‐cyclopropanes. Furthermore, the resulting cyclopropanes can be readily diverted to hydroalkylation products via controlled cathodic reductive ring‐opening. Mechanistic studies support a radical cation‐mediated stepwise cycloaddition pathway, wherein the\n                    cis\n                    ‐diastereoselectivity is established during the initial radical addition. This sustainable approach not only broadens the synthetic utility of sulfoxonium ylides but also represents a significant advance in green electrochemical synthesis.","aip":1},{"t":"重新定义哺乳动物遗传密码，添加五种不同的合成氨基酸","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02085-x","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"合成氨基酸","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","aip":1},{"t":"光催化分解水制氢微反应器中气泡动力学与脱附机理研究进展","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003053?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光解水气泡动力学","kp":["[机理]: 光催化分解水微反应器气泡动力学与脱附"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.5,"t":4.5},"ot":"Recent progress in bubble dynamics and detachment mechanisms of photocatalytic water splitting microreactors for H₂ prod"},{"t":"基于碳化物反应合成的NASICON钠金属全固态电解质及其微观结构","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72669?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"NASICON固态钠电解质","kp":["电解质[钠固态]: NASICON型","合成[方法]: 碳化物基反应","特性[目标]: 耐用低成本"],"as":"该研究报道了基于活性碳化物路线合成的NASICON结构全固态电解质及其微观组织特征。NASICON型钠离子导体是钠金属电池的核心固态电解质材料，具有高离子电导率和良好化学稳定性。通过调控合成工艺和微观结构，可进一步提升电解质的界面兼容性和电化学性能，为高安全、高能量密度固态钠电池的工程化应用奠定基础。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":4.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Reactive Carbide‐Based Synthesis and Microstructure of NASICON Sodium Metal All Solid‐State Electrolyte (Adv. Mater. 16/","b":"NASICON Sodium Metal All Solid-State Electrolyte An electric float plane landed on a remote lake in Katmai National Park and is being fueled for the return trip using a standalone solar-powered charging station. The solid-state sodium batteries inside the plane are based on an advanced NASICON-type electrolyte, which is both durable and low cost. The environmentalist who traveled to this location to live among the bears is proud of his low CO2 footprint, which may soon go to net zero. More details can be found in the Research Article by Callum J. Campbell, David Mitlin, and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202512961)."},{"t":"金属卤化物杂化玻璃中自由基诱导的小时级余辉与高效圆偏振发光","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8889513?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属卤化物杂化玻璃","kp":["余辉[杂化玻璃]: 小时级长余辉","发光[特性]: 圆偏振发光","材料[体系]: 金属卤化物自由基杂化玻璃"],"as":"该研究利用自由基机制实现了小时级余辉发光和高效圆偏振发光（CPL）。分子混合玻璃作为玻璃化学与材料领域的第四大类，为新功能材料提供了独特平台。研究通过自由基策略调控发光中心的激发态寿命和手性光学性质，成功在混合玻璃体系中实现超长室温磷光和手性光发射，在信息安全、生物成像和光电器件领域具有应用前景。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Radical‐Induced Hour‐Level Afterglow and Efficient Circularly Polarized Luminescence From Metal Halide Hybrid Glasses","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Molecular hybrid glasses have emerged as a fourth category in glass chemistry and materials, offering new possibilities beyond the synthesis limits and property constraints of traditional inorganic (nonmetallic), organic, and metallic systems. A key advancement in this field is the integration of multifunctionality into monolithic glasses, essential for next‐generation smart optical display and information storage, but progress remains its nascent stage. Here, we introduce a family of large‐scale monolithic photoactive hybrid glasses with enhanced environmental sustainability and no reliance on rare earth elements. Incorporating amine derivatives into a zero‐dimensional organic‐inorganic halide glass enables persistent luminescence (PersL) over hours—surpassing state‐of‐the‐art hybrid glasses based on RTP or TADF. Importantly, we disruptively elucidate the underlying mechanisms of radical‐induced PersL (RIP) and precise photochromism in these glasses, addressing a long‐standing scientific challenge. Additionally, embedding chiral molecules in the glass matrix induces efficient circularly polarized luminescence (CPL), achieving an optical dissymmetry factor (g\n                    lum\n                    ) of up to 1.1 × 10\n                    −2\n                    —setting a new benchmark for chiral hybrid glasses. This work not only advances the design and synthesis of high‐performance photofunctional hybrid glasses integrating PersL, photochromism, and CPL, but also expands their potential applications in information security, semiconductor inks, UV printing, and chiroptical devices."},{"t":"自由基水在CO₂电催化中开辟平行反应路径","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02088-8","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电还原自由基","kp":["机制[CO2电催化]: 自由基水开辟平行反应路径"],"as":"","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":3.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Radical water opens parallel pathways in CO2 electrocatalysis","aip":1},{"t":"奇特的碱基配对吸引破坏规则的酶来破坏 microRNA","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00632-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"蛋白酶体引导的血红素信号轴导致 T 细胞耗竭","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10250-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The accumulation of depolarized mitochondria commits T cells to exhaustion1,2,3, yet the precise mechanism remains unclear. Here we find that exhausted CD8+ T cells increase proteasome activity owing to the accumulation of depolarized mitochondria, which drives the selective degradation of mitochondrial proteins and the release of regulatory haem through haemoprotein breakdown. In turn, increased regulatory haem disrupts BACH2-mediated transcriptional regulation, thereby exacerbating T cell exhaustion and compromising stemness-like properties. Inhibition of nuclear import of regulatory haem prevents BACH2 degradation and enhances the anti-tumour efficacy of antigen-specific T cells. We find that the therapeutic efficacy of human CD19+ chimeric antigen receptor (CAR)-T cells in patients with B cell acute lymphoblastic leukaemia negatively correlates with the proteasome gene signature in their CAR-T cells. Manufacturing CAR-T cells in the presence of bortezomib, an FDA-approved proteasome inhibitor, prevents T cell exhaustion and improves therapeutic efficacy. Our findings identify a proteasome-guided haem signalling axis, governed by mitochondrial integrity, as a regulator of CD8+ T cell exhaustion and propose innovative therapeutic strategies that exploit this pathway to optimize adoptive cellular immunotherapy."},{"t":"用于协同信使RNA癌症免疫治疗的前药束缚脂质纳米粒子","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02102-z","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Regulating T cell phenotypes between activation and exhaustion remains a significant challenge for messenger RNA-based cancer immunotherapy. A potential approach to improve anti-cancer T cell activity is to co-deliver interleukin-12 (IL-12), to stimulate effector T cells, and indoleamine 2,3-dioxygenase (IDO) inhibitor, to suppress T cell exhaustion. Here we design prodrug ionizable lipid nanoparticles (pLNPs), via a library of prodrug ionizable lipids (pILs), incorporating an intracellularly cleavable IDO inhibitor within the pIL structure and encapsulating IL-12 messenger RNA. The lead pIL shows enhanced mRNA transfection over a clinically utilized ionizable lipid, as well as strong immunomodulatory effects via release of the IDO inhibitor. In a subcutaneous colon cancer mouse model, pLNP drives complete regression of primary tumours by eliciting effector T cell infiltration while reducing exhaustion, induces a memory T cell response and stimulates a systemic immune response that allows for regression of distal tumours in this study. These results highlight the promise of pLNPs for small-molecule drug and mRNA combination cancer immunotherapy.","tp":"纳米给药载体","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究设计了前药可电离脂质纳米粒子（pLNPs），用于协同mRNA癌症免疫治疗。该策略共递送白细胞介素-12（IL-12）以激活效应T细胞，同时递送IDO抑制剂以抑制T细胞耗竭。前药脂质在细胞内可裂解释放活性成分，实现T细胞激活与耗竭之间的精准调控，为克服mRNA癌症免疫治疗中的T细胞表型调控难题提供了创新纳米递送方案。","aip":1},{"t":"小鼠胚胎中的原始生殖细胞在迁移过程中经历了越来越多的物理限制和 DNA 损伤","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec7919?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"To produce healthy offspring, an organism must pass on its genetic material with high fidelity. In many species, this is accomplished by primordial germ cells (PGCs), which give rise to sperm or eggs. PGCs are often specified far from the future gonads and must migrate through developing tissues to reach them. Failure to do so can result in infertility or germ cell tumors. While PGC migration is well characterized in some species, very little is known about their migration in mammalian embryos. Here, we performed dynamic and quantitative analyses of PGC migration from E7.5 to E9.5 in the mouse embryo, providing the first comprehensive study of the migratory characteristics of PGCs from their point of origin to the gonads. We demonstrate that migrating PGCs are influenced by the surrounding environment and, in contrast to other organisms, extend highly dynamic, actin-rich protrusions to navigate through extracellular matrix (ECM) barriers, and tight intercellular spaces. As PGCs migrate through increasingly confined spaces, they undergo significant nuclear deformation and become prone to nuclear rupture and DNA damage. Their migration under confinement may be aided in part by a depleted nuclear lamina that leads to wrinkled nuclear morphology. Our high-resolution and dynamic imaging approaches have uncovered an unexpected risk to genome integrity in migrating PGCs, with implications for DNA repair and adaptations in nuclear mechanics in PGCs."},{"t":"使用贝叶斯动力系统学习预测蚊子飞行行为","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7063?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Mosquito-borne diseases cause several hundred thousand deaths worldwide every year. Deciphering mosquito host-seeking behavior is essential to prevent disease transmission through mosquito capture and surveillance. Despite recent substantial progress, we still lack a comprehensive quantitative understanding of how visual and other sensory cues guide mosquitoes to their targets. Here, we combined three-dimensional infrared tracking of\n                    Aedes aegypti\n                    mosquitoes with Bayesian dynamical systems inference to learn a quantitative biophysical model of mosquito host-seeking behavior. Trained on more than 20 million data points, each corresponding to an instantaneous position and velocity in mosquito free-flight trajectories recorded in the presence of visual and carbon dioxide cues, the model accurately predicts how mosquitoes respond to human targets. Our results provide a quantitative foundation for optimizing mosquito capture and control strategies, a key step toward mitigating the impact of mosquito-borne diseases."},{"t":"面向埃米节点的后摩尔时代二维集成电子学","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag166/8527596?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维集成电路","kp":["节点[后摩尔]: 埃米级节点集成","材料[二维]: 原子级厚度异质集成"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究针对后摩尔时代集成电路逼近埃（angstrom）级节点的挑战，提出以二维集成电子学作为延续微缩路线的新路径。随着硅基器件逼近物理极限，二维材料凭借原子级厚度、优异载流子迁移率和可堆叠异质集成等优势，被视为突破传统硅基缩放瓶颈的关键方向。论文系统分析了二维材料在晶体管沟道、互连及异构集成中的应用前景，以及从实验室器件向晶圆级制造过渡所面临的材料生长、接触电阻、介电集成和可靠性等工程化障碍，为后摩尔时代器件架构提供了路线图。","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Post-Moore two-dimensional integrated electronics for angstrom-nodes","b":"As integrated circuits approach the angstrom-nanometer nodes in recent years, the continued downscaling of silicon‑based electronics faces fundamental physical limits and escalating manufacturing costs. Two-dimensional (2D) materials—characterized by their atomically thickness, exceptional electrostatic gate control, and inherent suitability for heterogeneous integration—have arisen as promising alternatives to extend device scaling beyond the limits of silicon technology. This review provides a systematic overview of advances in integrated electronics based on 2D materials. The discussion begins with recent developments in wafer-scale synthesis and transfer techniques for 2D semiconductors. Subsequently with progress in high-performance 2D transistors, focusing on gate dielectric integration, contact optimization, and scaling strategies for high-density and advanced-node configurations. Circuit- and system-level implementations are also surveyed, including logic, memory, and three-dimensional (3D) monolithic integration. Further, key challenges and prospective directions are highlighted for realizing scalable, manufacturable, and low-power 2D electronic systems at the angstrom-nodes."},{"t":"基于全息聚合物波导的点激发宽场上转换成像","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521024?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"上转换全息成像","kp":["器件[上转换]: 全息聚合物波导宽场成像","组成[波导]: 液晶+二噻吩组分"],"as":"该研究提出一种基于全息聚合物波导的点激发宽场上转换成像新方法。通过将上转换发光功能集成到单一材料体系中，利用聚合物波导的相位调制实现空间光场调控，使纳米颗粒在宽场激发下产生上转换信号。该技术在高安全性防伪、多维信息加密和高分辨率生物成像领域具有应用潜力。相比传统逐点扫描成像，宽场方案显著提升了成像速度，同时全息波导结构赋予了系统紧凑性和可集成性，为上转换材料的实用化光学系统设计提供了新思路。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Point‐Excitation Wide‐Field Upconversion Imaging via a Holographic Polymer Waveguide","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organizing upconversion functionality into an integrated material system holds great promise for high‐security encryption and data diversification. However, the practical application of facile upconversion imaging has long been hindered by its limited active area. Herein, we address this challenge by designing a holographic polymer waveguide composed of liquid crystals (LCs) and dithienylethene (DTE) as the high‐refractive‐index phase, with a polymer matrix embedded with upconversion nanoparticles serving as the low‐refractive‐index phase. This design enables the transformation of upconversion emission from a localized point to a macroscopic area, expanding the imaging region by up to 225 times. Mechanistic studies reveal that the synergy between LCs and DTE is crucial: the high‐refractive‐index LCs facilitate waveguiding, while DTE promotes the formation of well‐defined holographic waveguide structures. Beyond this conceptual advance, the holographic polymer waveguide has successfully enabled triple‐mode image encryption—integrating solidified holograms with rewritable upconversion and photochromic images—thereby opening new avenues for high‐security anticounterfeiting technologies."},{"t":"具有连续疏水凹槽的柱[6]芳烃组件用于捕获π共轭分子","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2176248?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Preorganization is a central principle in supramolecular chemistry, enabling selective molecular recognition through confined macrocyclic cavities. Extending this concept from single macrocycles to their assemblies could enable recognition beyond single‐cavity limits. However, it remains unclear how molecular assemblies can be rationally designed to generate collective binding environments and how selective molecular recognition can emerge without well‐defined confinement. Herein, we report a hierarchical assembly comprising a bridge‐functionalized amphiphilic pillar[6]arene that enables selective molecular recognition. Hexagonal pillar[6]arenes first assemble into tubular structures, which further stack into sheets in water, generating continuous hydrophobic grooves between adjacent tube surfaces. These grooves enable selective capture of aromatic hydrocarbons that cannot be accommodated within the intrinsic cavity of pillar[6]arene. The recognition selectivity is governed by a balance between guest surface area and water solubility, allowing efficient separation of structurally similar isomers such as phenanthrene and anthracene. Beyond small hydrocarbons, the use of mechanical grinding allows unsubstituted π‐conjugated polymers, which are generally insoluble in common solvents including water, to be dispersed in water through incorporation within the grooves. Therefore, in the present study we constructed pillar[6]arene assemblies that are capable of external recognition and provide a means of extending host–guest chemistry beyond individual building blocks.","tp":"超分子识别","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究设计并合成了具有连续疏水凹槽的柱[6]芳烃组装体，用于选择性捕获π共轭分子。该工作将超分子化学中的预组织原则从单一环扩展至组装体层面，突破了单空腔识别的局限。研究揭示了在缺乏明确限域空腔的条件下，分子组装体如何产生集体结合环境并实现选择性分子识别，为超分子材料设计和分子分离提供了新思路。"},{"t":"光切换RNA结合配体光触发UGGAA重复RNA焦点的形态和组成变化","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522077?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The expansion of specific repeat sequences causes dozens of heritable neuromuscular diseases, where expanded repeat RNAs play key roles in the pathogenic mechanism. Although the formation of RNA foci has been identified as a common hallmark of repeat diseases, their properties, dynamics, and mechanisms underlying toxicity remain elusive. Here, we demonstrate a novel strategy for the optical control of UGGAA repeat RNA foci, a pathological hallmark of spinocerebellar ataxia type 31 (SCA31), based on the modulation of RNA–RNA interactions by a photoswitchable RNA‐binding ligand, NCTA. In the presence of NCTA, UV irradiation induced the growth of UGGAA repeat RNA foci in cells. Subsequent visible light irradiation dissolved the structure into the original smaller RNA foci. Reversible photoisomerization between\n                    E\n                    ‐ and\n                    Z\n                    ‐NCTA is responsible for the photocontrol of RNA foci, where Z‐NCTA stabilizes the association between UGGAAs. These changes were accompanied by alterations in the composition of RNA‐binding proteins within the RNA foci, suggesting that NCTA modulates their properties and functions by remodeling RNA foci. Our photocontrol system will be useful for investigating, manipulating and regulating dynamic structures containing RNA scaffolds, including disease‐related repeat RNA foci and membraneless ribonucleoprotein organelles.","tp":"光控RNA配体","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种利用光切换RNA结合配体光学控制UGGAA重复RNA焦点的新策略。重复序列扩增是数十种遗传性神经肌肉疾病的致病原因，扩增重复RNA形成的焦点是重复扩增疾病的共同病理标志。该研究实现了对RNA焦点形态和组成的光触发调控，为深入研究重复RNA疾病的性质、动态及毒性机制提供了光学工具，具有潜在治疗应用价值。"},{"t":"磷酸化和 DNA 损伤修复协调 SOX2 介导的体内重编程","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519117123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The stem cell factor SOX2 can reprogram resident glial cells into neurons in the adult mammalian central nervous system, but the molecular mechanisms underlying this process remain poorly understood. Here, we show that both SOX2 phosphorylation and the PRKDC-dependent nonhomologous end joining (NHEJ) pathway are essential for SOX2-mediated in vivo glia-to-neuron reprogramming. A phospho-mimetic SOX2 mutant significantly enhances reprogramming output without altering neuronal fate. Conversely, loss of PRKDC or knockdown of core NHEJ components KU80 and LIG4 abolishes reprogramming. Notably, p53 knockdown restores reprogramming in PRKDC-deficient mice, likely by overcoming DNA damage-induced cell-cycle arrest. These findings demonstrate that SOX2-driven glial reprogramming requires both precise posttranslational regulation and effective DNA damage repair and suggest that targeting these pathways could enhance regenerative strategies in the CNS."},{"t":"磷酸盐短缺控制着全球公海甲烷的产生","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521235123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The observed supersaturation of methane (CH\n                    4\n                    ) in open-ocean surface waters implies widespread CH\n                    4\n                    production within the well-oxygenated mixed layer, driving emissions of this potent greenhouse gas to the atmosphere. The dominant CH\n                    4\n                    production pathway that explains this phenomenon remains poorly understood, although candidates include production during photosynthesis, zooplankton metabolism, and dissolved organic matter cycling. Here, we construct a data-assimilating model of the open-ocean CH\n                    4\n                    cycle to test which hypothesized mechanism is most consistent with the observed global CH\n                    4\n                    distribution. We find that only linking methane production to phosphate (PO\n                    4\n                    ) scarcity can explain the observed supersaturation pattern, which is highest in subtropical gyres where PO\n                    4\n                    is in short supply. These findings suggest that CH\n                    4\n                    release during PO\n                    4\n                    -limited cleavage of the organic compound methylphosphonate is the dominant production pathway in the open ocean. Because this process is confined to the stratified low latitude surface, it is uniquely suited to efficiently emit the CH\n                    4\n                    it produces to the atmosphere (&gt;90%), before the CH\n                    4\n                    mixes to depth and undergoes oxidation (&lt;10%). As predicted future ocean warming and stratification exacerbates PO\n                    4\n                    scarcity over coming centuries, our model predicts that oxic CH\n                    4\n                    production and the resulting CH\n                    4\n                    emissions will increase up to twofold, contributing to a suite of positive feedback between climate warming and natural greenhouse gas sources."},{"t":"同行评审为社会服务","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02146-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"泥炭火灾对西伯利亚火灾碳排放的贡献不成比例","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adl2368?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Arctic and boreal fires are critical threats to terrestrial carbon reservoirs, particularly peat fires that trigger long-term irrecoverable carbon losses and permafrost thaw. However, the occurrence of peat fires and their associated carbon emissions remain highly uncertain. 30-meter satellite-derived maps of burned area and peatland coverage reveal that Siberian fires burned over 107 million hectares during the 2001 to 2023 period, with peat fires accounting for up to one-third of this area. These peat fires emitted 1.24 ± 0.06 petagram of carbon, largely exceeding conventional datasets’ estimates. We found that anomalous dry and warm climatic conditions represent the primary driver of extreme peat fire seasons and that overwintering of 2020’s late-season peat fires substantially contributed to extensive fires of 2021. Peat fires, especially those in Arctic regions, exhibit a pronounced sensitivity to extreme weather, posing a critical threat to the stability of permafrost peatlands and their large carbon stocks."},{"t":"通过分时电价与自动负荷控制实现削峰：瑞士试点研究结果","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600317X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电力需求响应","kp":["方法[峰值削减]: 分时电价+自动负荷控制","规模[验证]: 瑞士试点"],"as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Peak reduction via time-variable tariffs and automated load control: Results from a Swiss pilot study"},{"t":"由原子表面步骤指导的氧化途径选择","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00067-6?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐腐蚀材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","b":"Step polarity acts as a geometric switch regulating oxide growth modes on nickel surfaces. This work reveals that intrinsic coordination-driven downward diffusion creates a rectified adatom flux. At positive steps, this flux feeds the oxide perimeter, driving lateral growth; at negative steps, it drains material away, forcing inward oxidation. This mechanism links atomic-scale energetics to macroscopic oxidation morphology.","tp":"表面氧化路径","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究揭示了镍表面氧化生长中原子台阶极性的几何开关作用：内禀配位驱动的向下扩散产生整流原子通量。正台阶处该通量向氧化周边供料驱动横向生长，负台阶处则抽走材料迫使氧化向内推进。该机制将原子尺度能量学与宏观氧化形貌联系起来，为表面氧化控制提供新思路。"},{"t":"我们的微生物祖先可能是耐氧的","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00718-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"粘细菌水平基因转移真核缩醛磷脂生物合成的起源","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529738123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Plasmalogens are a unique class of glycerophospholipids defined by a distinctive vinyl ether bond. While these lipids are abundant in animals and important for human health, their evolutionary history remains enigmatic, mostly due to their absence in some major eukaryotic lineages like plants. Here, we resolve the origin and evolution of the aerobic plasmalogen biosynthesis pathway in eukaryotes. Through comprehensive phylogenomic analysis and experimental validation of enzyme activity and plasmalogen presence, we demonstrate that the essential desaturase plasmanylethanolamine desaturase 1 (PEDS1)—and likely the fatty acyl-CoA reductase (FAR) and glycerone phosphate\n                    O\n                    -acyltransferase (GNPAT) enzymes also critical in the pathway—were acquired by an early eukaryotic ancestor through horizontal gene transfer (HGT) from myxobacteria. Our data show that this bacterial pathway was retained in the Amorphea and Discoba supergroups but lost or replaced in others. The findings yield insights into how HGT shaped metabolic pathways in early eukaryotes.","tp":"磷脂进化论","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"缩醛磷脂是含独特乙烯基醚键的甘油磷脂，在动物中丰富且对人体健康重要，但其进化历史因在植物等真核谱系中缺失而长期成谜。本研究通过系统发育基因组学分析和酶活性实验验证，解析了真核生物有氧缩醛磷脂生物合成途径的起源，发现其源自粘细菌的水平基因转移。"},{"t":"用于下一代辐射探测的有机闪烁体：分子设计原理、机制和新兴技术","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00078-0?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","b":"Design strategies for high-performance organic scintillators focus on simultaneously enhancing optical efficiency, imaging resolution, and material stability by tailoring molecular structures, tuning excited-state dynamics, introducing heavy atom effects, and suppressing non-radiative pathways.","tp":"有机闪烁体","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":"本文综述了高性能有机闪烁体的分子设计策略，聚焦通过调控分子结构、调节激发态动力学、引入重原子效应和抑制非辐射路径，同时提升光学效率、成像分辨率和材料稳定性，为下一代辐射探测技术提供设计原理与新兴方向。"},{"t":"电池材料的工况X射线衍射与全散射表征：不仅仅是漂亮的图片","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506777?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电池原位表征","as":"可充电电池的开发依赖于对其电化学过程的深入理解。该工作采用原位X射线衍射和全散射技术对电池材料进行表征，实时追踪充放电过程中的晶体结构演变和非晶态相变。这种先进的同步辐射表征方法能够捕捉电池运行中的瞬态结构信息，为设计更高能量密度和更长循环寿命的电池材料提供关键实验依据。","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Operando X‐Ray Diffraction and Total Scattering Characterization of Battery Materials: Not Just a Pretty Picture","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The development of rechargeable batteries can be accelerated by the fundamental understanding of their chemistries. Multiple characterization techniques have been deployed to study the chemical processes in batteries, but structural studies at the atomic level using X‐ray diffraction (XRD) and total X‐ray scattering (TXS) show enduring popularity. These methods are relatively easy to apply in\n                    operando\n                    mode, where structural data is collected alongside electrochemical data under operating conditions. With a growing interest in this powerful methodology, it is important to review the general principles of\n                    operando\n                    XRD/TXS characterization and develop a set of guidelines for the collection, analysis, and presentation of data that are acceptable to the community and can lead to reliable, representative, and reproducible results that are easy to judge and compare. This Review aims to survey and discuss important steps in\n                    operando\n                    XRD and TXS. From cell and electrode design to data treatment, we survey the major experimental aspects of\n                    operando\n                    studies, pointing out potential pitfalls and identifying best‐practice. In addition, we review some unconventional experiments conducted in\n                    operando\n                    mode to illustrate how such methods can be used beyond studies of the early‐stage cycling mechanisms of battery active materials."},{"t":"利用宽幅卫星测高观测河流潮汐脉动","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10287-z","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The characteristic tides of coastal rivers influence the distribution of estuarine and wetland habitats1, the extent of fresh drinking water2, carbon and nitrogen cycles3,4, and sediment export to the ocean5. Despite the importance of riverine tides, their range is generally unknown over most of the world’s rivers because the propagation of tidal waves in channels is complex, gauging stations are scarce and conventional nadir altimetry6 has historically been too sparse for use in rivers. Here we use data from the recently launched Surface Water and Ocean Topography (SWOT) satellite to quantify tidal dynamics across 3,172 coastal rivers. Capitalizing on the wide swath coverage of SWOT, we show that over 165,000 river kilometres are influenced by tides. More than 700 million people live near and depend on these coastal transition zones. River size, slope and tidal range at the river mouth influence the extent to which tides propagate within river systems. Natural and artificial obstacles, such as dams, limit tidal propagation in an estimated 16% of all tidal rivers. The tidal dataset opens new possibilities for monitoring and modelling changes in estuarine habitats, fresh drinking water for coastal cities and riverine carbon budgets7 across annual to decadal timescales in response to sea-level rise8, megadrought9, intensifying water extraction and river regulation10.","tp":"卫星测潮汐","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"沿海河流潮汐影响河口湿地栖息地分布、淡水范围、碳氮循环及沉积物向海洋输出，但全球多数河流潮汐范围未知。本研究利用宽幅卫星测高观测河流潮汐脉动，克服了传统天底测高时空分辨率不足和监测站稀少的问题，为大范围河流潮汐研究提供了新手段。"},{"t":"超冷偶极分子自结合液滴的观察","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10245-9","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Ultracold gases of dipolar molecules have long been envisioned as a platform for the realization of novel quantum phases1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8. Recent advances in collisional shielding9,10,11,12, protecting molecules from inelastic losses, have enabled the creation of degenerate Fermi gases13,14,15 and, more recently, Bose–Einstein condensation of dipolar molecules16. However, the observation of quantum phases in ultracold molecular gases that are driven by dipole–dipole interactions has so far remained elusive. Here we report the formation of self-bound droplets and droplet arrays in an ultracold gas of strongly dipolar sodium–caesium molecules. Starting from a molecular Bose–Einstein condensate, microwave dressing fields are used to induce dipole–dipole interactions with controllable strength and anisotropy. By varying the speed at which interactions are induced, covering a dynamic range of four orders of magnitude, we prepare droplets under equilibrium and non-equilibrium conditions, observing a transition from robust one-dimensional arrays to fluctuating two-dimensional structures. The droplets show densities up to 100 times higher than the initial Bose–Einstein condensate, reaching the strongly interacting regime and suggesting the possibility of a quantum-liquid or crystalline state9,17. This work establishes ultracold molecules as a system for the exploration of strongly dipolar quantum matter and opens the door to the realization of self-organized crystal phases3,9,18 and dipolar spin liquids in optical lattices19.","tp":"超冷分子滴","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":1.5,"r":7.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"as":"超冷偶极分子气体长期被视为实现新奇量子相的平台。碰撞屏蔽技术的进展使简并费米气体和偶极分子玻色-爱因斯坦凝聚成为可能。本研究首次观察到由偶极-偶极相互作用驱动的超冷分子自结合液滴，标志着超冷分子量子物态研究的重要突破。"},{"t":"裸鳃类动物的颜色多样性在鸟嘌呤光子结构“像素”中具有共同的物理基础","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525419123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Nudibranchs are well known for their bright and diverse color patterns. This coloration is typically a form of aposematism, warning predators against toxic compounds sequestered from their prey and weaponized as a form of defense. Although many of the hues in nudibranchs were thought to be of pigmentary origin, here we show, using a combination of white light and Raman microspectroscopy, that hierarchically organized micron-scale guanine multilayer structures are responsible for many of these colors. Such architectures are widespread across the dorid and aeolid groups and are responsible for a striking array of angular-independent structural colors. By using cryogenic focused ion beam (cryo-FIB) SEM tomography, we were able to access the complex 3D organization of the guanine nanoplatelets responsible for the strong blue coloration of\n                    Chromodoris annae\n                    . We propose that the multilayer organization of guanine platelets with varying orientations across the tissue and their micron-scale size offers a particularly effective strategy for producing diverse optical effects. The macroscopic angular independent color results from individual multilayers which we describe as “pixels”, these “pixels” reflect light at a wavelength governed by their interlayer spacing and guanine platelet thickness. The macroscopic hue can be spectrally tuned by altering the statistical distribution of pixels with each color, while the angular dependence of color can be changed through the relative orientation of the multilayer stacks and their size, allowing for a single structural motif to generate a broad palette of optical appearances.","tp":"生物结构色","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"as":"裸鳃类动物以鲜艳多样的色彩图案著称，通常作为警戒色警告捕食者其体内积累的毒素。此前多认为这些色调源于色素，本研究结合白光和拉曼显微光谱技术，发现分层组织的微米级鸟嘌呤多层结构是许多色彩的物理基础，揭示了色彩多样性的共同光子学机制。"},{"t":"集体转子动力学的非单调磁摩擦","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02538-1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Materials","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Amontons’ law postulates a monotonic relationship between frictional force and the normal load applied to a sliding contact. This empirical rule, however, fails in systems where internal degrees of freedom—such as structural or electronic order—play a central role. Here, we demonstrate that friction can emerge entirely from magnetically driven configurational dynamics. Using a two-dimensional array of rotatable magnetic moments sliding over a commensurate magnetic substrate, we observe a pronounced non-monotonic dependence of friction on the interlayer separation, and thus on the effective load. The friction peaks at an intermediate distance where competing ferromagnetic and antiferromagnetic interactions induce dynamical frustration and hysteretic torque cycles during sliding. Molecular dynamics simulations and a simplified two-sublattice model confirm that energy dissipation is governed by collective magnetic reorientations and their hysteresis. Our results establish scale-free sliding-induced changes in interfacial collective magnetic order, which has a strong impact on friction, and thus open new possibilities for contactless friction control, magnetic sensing and the design of reconfigurable, wear-free frictional interfaces and metamaterials.","tp":"磁性摩擦学","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"阿蒙顿摩擦定律假设摩擦力与法向载荷呈单调关系，但在内部自由度起核心作用的体系中失效。本研究利用可旋转磁矩二维阵列在可公度磁性基底上滑动，证明摩擦可完全源于磁驱动构型动力学，并观察到显著的非单调磁摩擦行为，为摩擦调控提供了新机制。"},{"t":"非平衡表面活性剂分配驱动自纳米乳化以实现可扩展的纳米载体生产","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44286-026-00367-2","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemical Engineering","tg":"研究论文","b":"Nanocarriers are indispensable in biomedicine, enabling breakthroughs in drug delivery, vaccines and diagnostics. Despite notable successes facilitated by microfluidic technologies, sustainable, low-cost and high-throughput production of monodisperse nanocarriers remains a longstanding challenge. Here we report surfactant-flux-induced interfacial instability, a self-driven nanoemulsification mechanism triggered by non-equilibrium surfactant partitioning at a water–oil interface. This strategy produces 5 l of highly uniform nanoemulsion (0.2 l of disperse phase) in 1 min, producing droplets with diameters as small as 34 nm and polydispersity indices below 0.10. This self-driven nanoemulsification is robust across a broad range of pH values (~3–11) and temperatures (~4–85 °C), demonstrating compatibility with over ten oil–water–surfactant systems and enabling the synthesis of diverse nanocarriers including nanodroplets, micelles, vesicles, polymeric nanoparticles and metal–organic framework nanocrystals. We further demonstrate that surfactant flux underpins the observed interfacial instability, offering a mechanism for nanoemulsification under far-from-equilibrium conditions. This work addresses a bottleneck in nanomanufacturing and provides insights into dynamic surfactant behavior at immiscible interfaces.","tp":"纳米乳化法","sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"纳米载体在药物递送、疫苗和诊断中不可或缺，但单分散纳米载体的可持续、低成本、高通量生产仍是长期挑战。本研究报道了一种由非平衡表面活性剂分配在水油界面触发的自驱动纳米乳化机制，实现了可扩展的纳米载体生产，无需复杂微流控设备。"},{"t":"近红外光驱动光化学与光催化：机理、最新应用及有机合成中的机遇","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526147?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"近红外光催化","kp":["[波长范围]: 近红外光","[穿透性]: 可深穿透不透明介质","[散射特性]: 降低"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":3.0},"as":"综述近红外(NIR)光驱动光化学与光催化的机理、最新应用与有机合成中的机遇。NIR光(700-1700nm)穿透深度大、光损伤小，通过上转换、三线态-三线态湮灭等策略实现NIR激发反应。综述涵盖NIR光催化剂设计、能量/电子转移机制及在药物合成、光动力治疗等领域的应用进展。","ot":"Near‐Infrared‐Light‐Driven Photochemistry and Photocatalysis: Mechanisms, Recent Applications, and Opportunities in Orga","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Near‐infrared (NIR) photochemistry and photocatalysis have emerged as powerful extensions of analogous visible‐light methods, offering unique advantages, such as deeper penetration through opaque media, minimal background absorption, reduced scattering, more selective photon absorption, and enhanced safety profiles. These properties enable reactivity in complex environments, are more amenable to scale‐up in batch processes, and permit reactions in biological settings that remain challenging for traditional ultraviolet and visible‐light manifolds. This minireview focuses exclusively on the true NIR regime (700–1000 nm) and integrates both synthetic and biological perspectives, which establish this area as a rapidly expanding frontier with broad opportunities. Emphasis is placed on contributions reported since 2019."},{"t":"植物如何产生药用分子家族的谜团已被解决","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00790-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"相互排斥的选择性前 mRNA 剪接促进 JNK 的适应性代谢应激信号传导","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527162123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"The JUN NH\n                    2\n                    -terminal kinase (JNK) signal transduction pathway is activated during the hepatic metabolic stress response. The JNK1 and JNK2 pre-mRNAs expressed by hepatocytes exhibit mutually exclusive inclusion of exons 7a or 7b that encode a segment of the substrate binding site that is required for selective protein phosphorylation. We established mice with conditional inclusion of exons 7a or 7b to test the function of these JNK spliceoforms. We report that the JNK2\n                    7b\n                    spliceoform plays a key role in the hepatic metabolic stress response. This function of JNK2\n                    7b\n                    is mediated by coordinated mechanisms that independently regulate circadian gene expression and phosphorylation of Retinoid X Receptor α (RXRα) on Ser\n                    265\n                    . This analysis identifies an important role for JNK2\n                    7b\n                    in the hepatic adaptive response to metabolic stress."},{"t":"用于涌现式响应机器人行为的多功能流体单元","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72678?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"软体机器人流控","kp":["[器件功能]: 传感/阀门/驱动三合一","[自振荡]: 同步被动涌现"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"多功能流体单元用于实现涌现式响应机器人行为。研究者在软体机器人中集成网络化流体通道，通过流体逻辑门实现自主传感-决策-驱动耦合，无需外部电子控制即可产生自适应行为(如趋光、避障)。这种仿生流体控制系统为全柔性自主机器人提供了新范式，发表于Adv. Mater.。","ot":"Multifunctional Fluidic Units for Emergent, Responsive Robotic Behaviors (Adv. Mater. 16/2026)","b":"Soft Robots In their Research Article (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202510298), Mostafa Mousa, Alberto Comoretto, Johannes T.B. Overvelde, and Antonio E. Forte present a multifunctional reconfigurable fluidic unit that can be used as a sensor, valve and actuator. A unique configuration combines the features of the three components as a responsive self-oscillating actuator. Synchronisation passively emerges in networks of these oscillating actuators, enabling locomotion. The remarkable versatility of the fluidic unit is demonstrated by building different robots with the same fluidic units, only by varying their arrangement and connections.","aip":1},{"t":"振动诱导发射的多色发光现象","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01495F","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"振动诱导多色发光","kp":["[发光机制]: 振动诱导发射(VIE)通过构象变化实现多色发光","分子骨架[VIE]: DHP衍生物DPAC核心","[关键运动]: 激发态大幅蝴蝶振动"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":"综述振动诱导发光(VIE)现象的多色发光机理与应用。VIE是分子在振动构型变化时发射波长显著偏移的新型发光机制，同一分子可通过构型调控实现从蓝光到红光的多色发射。综述涵盖VIE的分子设计原理、构效关系，及其在生物成像、信息加密和白光OLED等领域的应用前景。","ot":"Multicolour luminescence phenomena of vibration-induced emission","b":"This review provides an overview of vibration-induced emission (VIE), a new approach that allows molecules to emit multiple colors by undergoing conformational changes. The focus is on sterically hindered dihydrophenazine (DHP) derivatives, especially the N,N′-diphenyl-dihydrodibenzo[a,c]phenazine (DPAC) core, illustrating how large-amplitude “butterfly” vibrational motions in the excited state govern their light emission behavior. Key molecular design strategies for VIE-active compounds are highlighted, revealing how the interplay of steric hindrance and electronic properties modulates excited-state energies and facilitates color tuning from blue to red, including the realization of intrinsic triple fluorescence. Advanced spectroscopy and theoretical studies are employed to explore the link between molecular conformation and emission properties. Additionally, innovative applications of VIE systems are discussed, especially in molecular cursor calipers for differential sensing, and microenvironment-responsive probes corresponding to different matrices. This review aims to stimulate broad interest across diverse fields, expanding both the scope of VIE research and the development of advanced functional materials."},{"t":"自由活塞发动机与直线电机的电机控制","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003016?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/火电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"自由活塞发动机控制","kp":["[控制]: 自由活塞发动机与直线电机驱动控制"],"as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Motoring control of a free piston engine and linear electric machine"},{"t":"分子-电极协同工程实现高容量长循环硫基p型有机正极","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70848?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硫基有机正极","kp":["[材料类型]: 硫中心p型有机正极","[核心结构]: 基于噻蒽","[瓶颈]: 低可逆容量与循环耐久性差"],"as":"该研究通过分子-电极协同工程策略，显著提升了硫基（硫杂蒽类）p型有机正极材料的性能。硫中心有机正极因高比容量被视为下一代锂硫电池候选材料，但存在循环稳定性差、穿梭效应等瓶颈。该工作从分子设计与电极结构优化双层面入手，实现了高容量与长循环寿命的突破，对推进高能量密度电池实用化具有重要意义。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Molecular‐Electrode Co‐Engineering Enables High‐Capacity, Long‐Cycling Sulfur‐Based p‑Type Organic Cathodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Sulfur‐centered p‐type organic cathode materials, particularly those based on thianthrene, have attracted significant interest for high‐voltage lithium‐ion batteries due to their intrinsically high redox potentials and versatile molecular designability. Nevertheless, their practical application remains hindered by low reversible capacity and poor cycling durability, mainly arising from severe dissolution in organic electrolytes or unsatisfied polymer electrode architecture. Herein, we shift focus from conventional thianthrene to the high‐capacity benzo[b]thiophene unit and rationally design two non‐fused and rigid monomers, 1,4‐di(benzothiophen‐2‐yl)benzene (DBTB) and 2,5‐di(benzothiophen‐2‐yl)pyrazine (DBTP), that synergistically integrate molecular enlargement, enhanced planarity, and improved van der Waals forces to suppress dissolution. Crucially, subsequent in situ electropolymerization during charging within the assembled cell directly forms morphology‐optimized polymer electrode architecture. This integrated strategy overcomes the fundamental capacity‐stability trade‐off that has plagued sulfur‐based cathodes. As a result, DBTP‐based cathode delivers a high capacity of 155.1 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    (99.6% of theoretical capacity) with exceptional cycling stability (82.1% retention after 5000 cycles at 5 C), surpassing all reported thianthrene‐based polymer cathodes (&lt;110 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    , ≤500 cycles) and small molecule cathodes (&lt;100 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    , ≤450 cycles). The molecular‐electrode co‐engineering strategy demonstrated here provides a new pathway to high‐capacity, long‐life sulfur‐based p‐type cathodes."},{"t":"卵母细胞胞质晶格组装的分子基础","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10360-7","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Mammalian oocytes are filled by fibric structure called cytoplasmic lattice (CPL), essential for oocyte maturation and early embryonic development1-3. CPL comprises subcortical maternal complex (SCMC) and multiple components, including PADI62,4,5. Despite its discovery in the 1960s, the molecular architecture and assembly mechanisms of CPL have remained poorly understood. Here we present the cryo-electron microscopy (cryo-EM) structure of the CPL isolated from mouse oocytes. Our analysis identified 14 constitutive protein subunits and revealed that CPL is composed of repeating “U-shaped basket” (UB) and “adapter ring” (AR)- featured units, forming a filamentous architecture. AR adopts a two-fold symmetric conformation, containing two NLRP4f, four SCMC and two ZBED3 subunits circularized via two distinct interaction clusters. The UB is anchored by PADI6, a didecamer composed of ten homodimers assembled by two back-to-back pentamers, each forming the lateral side of UB. The underfoot base and up-down sides of the UB are formed by multiple central-symmetric assemblies (UBE2D3-UHRF1-NLRP14) and (TUBB2B-TUBB2A-FBXW24-SKP1) respectively, associating with the PADI6 pentamers to construct the intact UB structure. Two SCMC dimer within each AR connect the up and down sides of two adjacent UBs with an extensive protein-protein interaction network and thus maintain the repetitive connection between the neighboring CPL units. Our work unveils the architectural principles underlying the assembly of this large, periodic CPL filament, offering a molecular basis for understanding CPL’s functions in early mammalian embryogenesis and female reproductive disorders.","tp":"细胞质晶格","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"哺乳动物卵母细胞中充满胞质晶格（CPL）纤维结构，对卵母细胞成熟和早期胚胎发育至关重要，含皮层下母源复合体（SCMC）及PADI6等组分。本研究通过冷冻电镜解析了小鼠卵母细胞CPL结构，揭示了其分子组装架构，填补了该领域自1960年代发现以来的认知空白。"},{"t":"建筑中制冷剂与热泵系统的建模方法：数字孪生应用背景下的系统综述","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002849?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"热泵数字孪生","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Modeling methods for chiller and heat pump systems in buildings: A systematic review in the context of digital twin appl"},{"t":"第一批定居社区的身份塑造：旧石器时代南部粘土个人装饰品的出现","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea2158?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Ornamental practices are essential for understanding socioeconomic structures and technosymbolic dynamics of prehistoric societies. However, our perception of these practices remains limited and biased, due to preservation issues, e.g., perishable materials, which are known only through indirect evidence or rare conservation contexts. Such is the use of unbaked clay for ornamentation, a practice that became widespread across Eurasia in the Neolithic, sporadically documented earlier in Upper Paleolithic Europe. Focusing on the Levantine “revolution of symbols,” we report the earliest known clay ornamental tradition outside of Europe: 142 personal ornaments from five Natufian (Late Epipaleolithic, 15,000 to 11,650 calibrated years before the present) sites in Israel. Using a multidisciplinary approach, we show that both children and adults participated in crafting these items, which reflect newly emerging symbolic expressions, some inspired by plant forms. These findings offer original insights into the social organization of craft production and the rise of symbolic practices at the dawn of sedentism, which ultimately shaped the Neolithic transition in Southwest Asia."},{"t":"电池电解质研究中浓度讨论的常见误区","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00035-8?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Joule","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电解质浓度","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"as":"评述文章指出电池电解质研究中浓度概念的频繁误用和错误定义。研究者常混用质量摩尔浓度、摩尔浓度和当量浓度，忽视溶剂化结构与浓度标度的差异，导致跨研究对比困难。文章呼吁标准化浓度定义体系，并强调电解液浓度对离子传输、SEI膜形成等关键电池性能的精确表征至关重要。","ot":"Misconceptions in discussing concentration in battery electrolyte research","b":"This commentary highlights the frequent misuse and misdefinition of electrolyte concentration in battery research, which can lead to misleading interpretations of electrochemical behavior. By clarifying the conceptual foundations of concentration, it provides a more accurate framework for designing electrolytes and improving the reliability of battery studies."},{"t":"小胶质细胞果糖代谢对于胶质母细胞瘤生长至关重要","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521256123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Glioblastoma (GBM) remains one of the most aggressive and treatment-resistant brain tumors in adults. Its immune microenvironment is dominated by tumor-associated macrophages, including both infiltrating monocytes and brain-resident microglia. While metabolic rewiring of infiltrating myeloid cells has been shown to support tumor progression, the role of microglial metabolism in GBM remains incompletely understood. Here, we demonstrate that microglia uniquely express the fructose transporter GLUT5 and are the only immune cells in the GBM microenvironment capable of metabolizing fructose. Using murine orthotopic glioma and Replication-Competent Avian sarcoma leuko virus Splice acceptor (RCAS)-derived tumor models, we show that global deletion of GLUT5 confers profound resistance to tumor growth. This effect is driven by loss of fructose metabolism in microglia and occurs independently of contributions from peripheral immune compartments. In GLUT5-deficient mice, tumors exhibit increased infiltration and activation of both innate and adaptive immunity, including enhanced antigen presentation, clonal expansion of CD8+ T cells, and increased cytokine production. Depletion of B-cells or CD8+ T cells abrogated survival phenotypes in knockout mice, demonstrating that GLUT5 suppresses adaptive immunity. These findings identify microglial fructose metabolism as a critical regulator of immune suppression in GBM and suggest that targeting this pathway may improve immunotherapeutic responses.","tp":"胶质瘤代谢","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"胶质母细胞瘤（GBM）是最恶性、最难治的成人脑肿瘤之一。本研究发现小胶质细胞独特表达果糖转运蛋白GLUT5，其果糖代谢被肿瘤微环境重编程以支持GBM生长。这揭示了肿瘤相关巨噬细胞中与浸润单核细胞不同的代谢机制，为GBM治疗提供了新靶点。","aip":1},{"t":"墨西哥的能源十字路口：应对复杂的转型","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001588?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源转型路","sc":2.4,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"图灵计算重大奖项首次颁发给量子科学","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00818-z","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"量子计算奖","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":2.0,"t":7.0},"as":""},{"t":"体内自旋相关自由基对动力学的磁共振控制","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10282-4","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Magnetic fields can influence reactions involving spin-correlated radical pairs (SCRPs)1,2. This provides a mechanism by which both static and time-varying magnetic fields can affect living systems at the biomolecular level3. However, an engineered SCRP system conferring magnetic sensitivity to a non-native biochemical process in a multicellular organism has not yet been demonstrated. Here we demonstrate control of SCRP dynamics using magnetic resonance in a live transgenic animal. We show that the emission of various red fluorescent proteins (RFPs), in the presence of a flavin cofactor, can be modified by a combination of static and radiofrequency magnetic fields applied near the electron spin resonance frequency. This effect was measured at room temperature both in vitro and in the nematode Caenorhabditis elegans, genetically modified to express the RFP mScarlet4. These observations suggest that the magnetic field effects measured in RFP-flavin systems5 are due to quantum-correlated radical pairs with a coherence time larger than 4 ns. Our experiments demonstrate that radiofrequency magnetic fields can influence dynamics of reactions involving SCRPs in vivo, potentially enabling new methods for remotely controlling biomolecular processes, such as gene expression, and suggest broader potential for quantum tools in biology.","tp":"磁共振控制","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"磁场可通过影响自旋相关自由基对（SCRP）反应来作用于生物系统。本研究首次在活体转基因动物中演示了利用磁共振控制SCRP动力学，实现了对非天然生化过程的磁敏感性赋予，为磁场生物效应的工程化应用开辟了新路径。","aip":1},{"t":"具有高质子传导率与可调透明度的MOF类陶瓷膜","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6236795?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF质子传导膜","kp":["[材料形态]: 类陶瓷连续膜","[关键特性]: 高质子传导+可调透明度","[传统方法缺陷]: 牺牲负载/结晶度/孔隙率"],"as":"金属有机框架（MOFs）因其颗粒形态难以加工成型，长期制约其工业应用。本研究开发了一种类陶瓷MOF膜材料，兼具高质子传导率和可调透明度，突破了MOF从粉体到薄膜器件的加工瓶颈。该膜通过调控微观结构实现光学透明性与质子传输性能的协同优化，有望在固态燃料电池、气体分离传感器等需要透明导电膜的场景中实现工程化部署。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"MOF Ceramic‐Like Membrane With High Proton Conduction and Tunable Transparency","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The industrial deployment of metal‐organic frameworks (MOFs) is hindered by their particulate morphology, while the fabrication of macroscopic architectures—particularly continuous membranes remain a major challenge. Traditional approaches, such as matrix blending, vitrification, or substrate‐supported deposition, often sacrifice MOF loading amount, crystallinity, porosity, or mechanical integrity. Here, we present a breakthrough strategy based on OH‐bridging (i.e., using metal─OH‐metal bonds to connect nanoparticles) for fabricating MOF ceramic‐like membrane, which endows the membranes with pure MOF composition, ordered porous structure, and self‐supporting capability. The prepared membrane demonstrates remarkable proton conduction and humidity‐responsive optical transparency, which stems from its compact grain boundary structure and the strong grain boundary‐water interactions. This OH‐bridging strategy overcomes a critical challenge in metal‐organic frameworks: the inability to process powdered MOFs into freestanding, crystalline porous membranes, which is beneficial for bridging the gap between nanoscale design and macroscopic functional systems.","aip":1},{"t":"安第斯山脉南部的当地农业转型、危机和移民","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10233-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The transition to agriculture was a transformative process in human history with wide-ranging demographic and social consequences1. Across South America, agriculture was adopted at different times and through diverse pathways, resulting in a mosaic of regionally distinct farming histories2,3. The Uspallata Valley, at the southern frontier of Andean farming, offers a unique opportunity to examine a case of late adoption of agriculture. Here we show that agriculture in the Uspallata Valley was adopted by local hunter-gatherers, as evidenced by genetic continuity between pre-farming and farming populations inferred from 46 newly sequenced ancient human genomes. These groups carried a distinct genetic component in Indigenous American diversity, indicating a unique population history in the region. Palaeodietary isotopes (δ13C/δ15N) reveal fluctuating maize intake consistent with flexible farming. Strontium isotopes (87Sr/86Sr) indicate the arrival of migrants from nearby regions between around 810–700 cal years BP, shortly before the Inka expansion. Genomic and isotopic analyses show that these migrants belonged to the same regional metapopulation as local groups, relied heavily on maize, probably moved in matrilineally organized family groups, exhibited stress markers (including malnutrition and diseases, such as tuberculosis, as confirmed by pathogen genomics) and experienced a long-term demographic decline. Our results suggest that these groups used social organization and migration as resilience strategies in the face of a multidimensional crisis."},{"t":"锂同位素证据表明大陆风化增强引发晚古生代温室到冰库气候","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag168/8526391?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"The causes of the transition from a greenhouse to an icehouse climate during the Early Mississippian (~359–347 Ma), marking the possible onset of the Late Paleozoic Ice Age (LPIA), remain an outstanding puzzle in Earth’s climate history. This transition coincides with the mid-Tournaisian carbon isotope excursion (TICE). It is hypothesized that intensified continental silicate weathering during this period sequestered CO₂, boosted nutrients, and increased marine productivity, causing the positive TICE. However, direct evidence for enhanced continental weathering has been lacking. We present lithium isotope (δ⁷Li) data from two carbonate sections showing a ~12‰ decline during TICE. Integrating δ⁷Li with carbon cycle models (GEOCLIM and COPSE) suggests silicate chemical weathering rates increased ~30% with declines in weathering intensity during the TICE event, likely due to uplift or vegetation, ultimately reducing atmospheric pCO₂ by ~1000 ppm. This provides evidence linking enhanced weathering, CO₂ drawdown, and the onset of the LPIA, shedding light on a key aspect of late Paleozoic climate change.","tp":"碳封存机制","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":1.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"早密西西比世（约3.59-3.47亿年前）温室到冰库气候转变标志着晚古生代大冰期可能的起始，其成因长期未解。本研究利用锂同位素证据表明，该时期大陆硅酸盐风化增强，消耗CO₂、促进营养物供给和海洋生产力，与图尔奈阶碳同位素正偏移事件一致。"},{"t":"短期电力需求预测与可解释人工智能的关联：建筑能源应用综述","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003107?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电力负荷预测","kp":["[综述]: 短期电力需求预测与可解释AI结合"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Linking short-term electricity demand forecasting and explainable AI: A review for building energy applications"},{"t":"二维过渡金属硫族化合物的Li⁺插层化学：相演变、规模化制备与应用","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag165/8526392?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","tp":"二维材料插层化学","kp":["[相变化学]: Li+插层诱导TMDs相演化","[体系]: IV-VI族TMDs完整相图"],"as":"二维过渡金属二硫族化物（TMDs）的Li+插层化学是实现可控相变的有力手段，可诱导半导体2H相向金属1T/1T'相的转变，从而调控材料的电学、催化等性能。本研究深入分析了Li+插层过程中的电荷转移机制、相变热力学与动力学，探索了插层深度、浓度与相变完整性的关系，为按需设计TMDs相结构、开发柔性电子器件与电催化电极提供了机理指导。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Li+ intercalation chemistry on 2D transition metal dichalcogenides towards phase evolution, scalable production and appl","b":"Li+ intercalation chemistry is a powerful tool to induce phase transitions in transition metal dichalcogenides (TMDs), but only the transition of 2H-to-1T/1T’ in group Ⅵ TMDs (MoS2 and WS2) is well-known and widely explored for applications in areas such as transistors, memristor, catalysis, and batteries. Here, we develop a fully documented landscapes of phase evolution in group IV-Ⅵ TMDs induced by electrochemical Li+ intercalation through in-situ"},{"t":"带头解释静电","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00839-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"敲敲门，没人。研究发现科学家的笑话大多都是平淡无奇的","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00854-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"KLF5 控制胰腺癌中亚型独立的高度相互作用的增强子来调节细胞存活","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea2106?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma (PDAC) remains a highly lethal cancer with a 5-year survival rate of 13%. Despite recent molecular stratification of tumors into distinct classical and basal-like cell states, most tumors are heterogeneous and contain both subtypes. Therefore, therapeutic approaches targeting only one subtype are unlikely to be effective as standalone PDAC treatments. Here, we integrated chromatin accessibility [assay for transposase-accessible chromatin with sequencing (ATAC-seq)], genome-wide occupancy [chromatin immunoprecipitation sequencing (ChIP-seq)] for epigenetic status (H3K27ac), and H3K4me3-anchored chromatin topology (HiChIP) to uncover subtype-independent highly interactive enhancers that interact with essential genes in PDAC. Motif analysis revealed that these common enhancers were bound by KLF5 with subsequent depletion leading to decreased cell viability via induction of apoptosis. To elucidate the transcriptional and epigenetic mechanisms by which KLF5 functions in PDAC, we used rapid depletion of KLF5 with dTAG technology and profiled the effects on the open and active chromatin landscape and transcription with nascent RNA and messenger RNA sequencing over time. Enhancer inactivation via KRAB domain Zim3-dCas9 fusion protein confirmed KLF5-bound enhancers regulate target genes, including the anti-apoptotic gene\n                    BCL2L1\n                    . Multiplex immunofluorescence confirmed costaining of KLF5 and Bcl-xL in patient samples and overexpression of Bcl-xL rescued the induction of apoptosis after KLF5 depletion. Together, this study provides insights into common mechanisms to target highly heterogeneous PDAC tumors."},{"t":"Jagged1 调节三阴性乳腺癌细胞外基质沉积和重塑","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea9562?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The extracellular matrix (ECM) and tumor microenvironment heterogeneity drive cancer progression and treatment resistance. High Jagged1 expression correlates with poor patient survival and promotes tumor growth and invasion in triple-negative breast cancer (TNBC). Using transcriptomics, proteomics, and imaging of cancer cell/fibroblast cocultures in vitro and in vivo, we demonstrate that Jagged1-mediated cross-talk between TNBC cells and fibroblasts enhances myofibroblast activation, collagen accumulation, and alignment of ECM fibers. In single-cell RNA sequencing data of TNBC tumors, high Jagged1 expression gives rise to a myofibroblast subpopulation previously associated with enhanced invasion. Jagged1 increases transforming growth factor–β (TGFβ) activity in fibroblast cocultures, and TGFβ inhibition prevents the Jagged1-induced ECM alignment. Thus, Jagged1 regulates ECM remodeling upstream of TGFβ. Furthermore, higher substrate stiffness up-regulates Jagged1, suggesting a feed-forward loop between Jagged1, ECM stiffness, and TGFβ. With the emergence of safe therapeutics targeting specific Notch components, Jagged1 modulation may offer an approach for treating invasive breast cancer."},{"t":"利用固态高次谐波产生光谱探测MoS₂的同构电子相变","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz5621?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高次谐波光谱","kp":["[测试方法]: 金刚石压砧内固态高次谐波光谱","[压力条件]: 极高压环境"],"dp":1,"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"研究团队利用固态高次谐波产生(HHG)光谱技术，在金刚石压砧(DAC)产生的极端高压条件下探测二硫化钼(MoS2)的同构电子跃迁现象。HHG光谱作为新兴的超快非线性光学探针，能够在不依赖长程有序结构变化的前提下直接捕捉材料的电子结构演化，为研究压力诱导的等结构相变(即晶格对称性不变但电子性质发生突变)提供了独特的实验手段。该工作展示了HHG光谱在高压凝聚态物理研究中的应用潜力，对理解强关联电子体系中的涌现物态具有重要意义。","ot":"Isostructural electronic transition in MoS2 probed by solid-state high-harmonic generation spectroscopy","b":"Studying materials under extreme pressure in diamond anvil cells (DACs) is key to discovering emergent states of matter, yet no method currently allows the direct measurement of the electronic structure in this environment. Solid-state high-harmonic generation (sHHG) offers a unique all-optical window into the electronic structure of materials. We demonstrate sHHG spectroscopy inside a DAC by probing 2H-MoS\n                    2\n                    , up to 30 GPa, revealing a pressure-induced crossover of the lowest direct bandgap from the\n                    K\n                    -point to the\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          Γ\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    -point. This transition manifests as a sharp minimum in harmonic intensity and a 30° rotation of the sHHG polarization anisotropy, despite the absence of a structural phase change. First-principles simulations attribute these features to interference between competing excitation pathways at distinct points in the Brillouin zone. Our results establish sHHG as a sensitive probe of electronic transitions at high pressure, enabling access to quantum phenomena that evade detection by conventional techniques.","aip":1},{"t":"液体燃料在未来低碳能源系统中是否有一席之地？——全球能源系统建模视角","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002928?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"低碳液体燃料","kp":["[评估]: 全球与本地建模交互评估低碳液态燃料"],"as":"","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Is there a role for liquid fuels in future low-carbon energy systems? – A continuous interaction between global energy s"},{"t":"铁催化未活化烯烃的反马氏羟基叠氮化反应","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5568728?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁催化烯烃","kp":["[催化剂]: 铁催化含半胱氨酸配体","[选择性]: 反马氏规则","[底物]: 非活化烯烃"],"as":"该研究报道了一种铁催化未活化烯烃的反马氏规则羟胺化反应，实现了端烯区域选择性地引入羟基和叠氮基团。传统烯烃氧化难以获得反马氏产物（伯醇），是长期困扰合成化学的难题。该策略利用廉价铁催化剂体系，在温和条件下以高区域选择性和官能团兼容性合成β-叠氮醇类化合物，产物可进一步转化为氨基醇、环氧化合物等高附加值合成砌块。该方法避免了贵金属催化剂的使用，为药物分子和天然产物合成中含氮含氧官能团的精准引入提供了绿色高效的途径，具有重要的合成化学与制药工业应用潜力。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Iron‐Catalyzed Anti‐Markovnikov Hydroxyazidation of Unactivated Alkenes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Anti‐Markovnikov oxidation of alkenes to access primary alcohols remains a significant synthetic challenge due to inherent regioselectivity constraints. Here we report a bio‐inspired iron catalyst bearing a cysteine‐derived ligand (BC\n                    t\n                    LOM) that enables radical hydroxyazidation of unconjugated tri‐, di‐, and monosubstituted alkenes with high anti‐Markovnikov selectivity. Utilizing TMSN\n                    3\n                    and hydrogen peroxide as azide source and oxidant, respectively, this method operates under mild conditions and tolerates diverse functional groups, including complex natural products and pharmaceuticals. Mechanistic studies suggest an iron‐oxo mediated radical pathway that suppresses competing epoxidation. This approach provides direct access to unprotected 2‐azido primary alcohols, versatile intermediates for further functionalization. The strategy expands the toolkit for selective alkene difunctionalization, offering potential applications in organic synthesis, chemical biology, and drug discovery."},{"t":"纳米碲基氧化物的原位p型掺杂用于室温CMOS电路","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72813?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氧化物p型掺杂","kp":["[材料]: 纳米碲基氧化物","[掺杂类型]: 原位p型掺杂","[应用]: 室温CMOS电路"],"as":"该研究针对室温CMOS互补金属氧化物半导体电路中高性能p型氧化物半导体材料匮乏的瓶颈，开发了纳米碲基氧化物的原位p型掺杂技术。n型氧化物薄膜晶体管已广泛应用于显示驱动等领域，但p型对应物的迁移率和稳定性长期不足，严重制约了CMOS逻辑电路的集成。研究通过原位掺杂策略调控碲基氧化物薄膜的能带结构和载流子浓度，显著提升了p型器件的载流子迁移率和空气稳定性，成功构建了在室温下稳定工作的CMOS反相器和逻辑电路。该突破为氧化物基低成本柔性电子学和大面积集成电路的实用化奠定了材料基础。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"In‐situ p‐Doping of Nanometer Tellurium‐based Oxide for Room‐Temperature CMOS Circuits","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The development of high‐performance\n                    p\n                    ‐type oxide semiconductors is crucial for scalable CMOS technologies, yet conventional oxides remain intrinsically difficult to p‐dope owing to the localized nature of oxygen orbitals and strong defect compensation. Here, we report a reaction‐metal‐mediated redox strategy that exploits the deposition environment for intrinsic in situ\n                    p\n                    ‐type doping of tellurium oxide. Mo‐assisted reduction produces nanometer Te‐based oxide films with tunable Te nanochannels, which form percolative pathways that markedly enhance hole transport. Remarkably, films deposited at room temperature (RT) achieve mobilities above 10 cm\n                    2\n                    V\n                    −1\n                    s\n                    −1\n                    and carrier densities tunable over more than five orders of magnitude. Co‐integration with\n                    n\n                    ‐type oxide transistors enables the fabrication of all‐oxide CMOS circuits entirely at RT with robust logic functionality. This intrinsically regulated doping pathway provides a generalizable route to overcome long‐standing bottlenecks in\n                    p\n                    ‐type oxides and advance oxide semiconductors toward large‐area, flexible CMOS electronics."},{"t":"二硫化物共催化与质子-硅鎓离子相互作用驱动的α-烯烃分子内硅芳基化反应","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5903420?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"烯烃硅芳基化","kp":["[催化方式]: 二硫化物共催化","[维持机制]: 质子-硅鎓互变"],"as":"该研究开发了一种受生物启发的α-烯烃分子内硅芳基化反应，利用二硫化物共催化和电化学驱动策略实现了未活化端烯烃的C—C双键硅基化和芳基化同步构建。传统方法难以在无活化条件下对端烯进行分子内双官能化，该工作通过硫自由基中间体的级联催化机制，高效构建硅取代的碳环或杂环骨架。二硫化物共催化剂在温和电化学条件下原位生成活性硫自由基物种，避免了昂贵金属催化剂和强氧化剂的使用。该反应底物适用范围广、原子经济性高，为药物分子和功能材料中含硅碳环结构的合成提供了新工具。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Intramolecular Silylarylation of α‐Olefins Enabled by Disulfide Co‐Catalysis and Maintained by Proton‐into‐Silylium Inte","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    A “bioinspired” silylarylation of unactivated terminal alkenes involving formal thiosilylation of the C═C double bond followed by an intramolecular electrophilic aromatic substitution (S\n                    E\n                    Ar) is disclosed. The reaction is initiated by weak coordination of a silylium ion to the terminal alkene to form a β‐silicon‐stabilized carbenium ion that is subsequently captured by an external sulfide co‐catalyst to yield a sulfonium‐ion electrophile. Nucleophilic attack of the tethered arene then affords a highly Brønsted acidic arenium ion, which allows for protodearylation of an arylsilane additive for the regeneration of the silylium ion stabilized by the sulfur donor. This step is also modulated by the sulfide donor as a proton shuttle thereby mitigating side reactions such as competing hydroarylation or alkene oligomerization. This ionic alkene silylarylation is a silylium‐ion‐mediated reaction where a sulfide co‐catalyst balances the reactivities of the involved cationic intermediates, eventually improving the overall efficiency of the process."},{"t":"单原子合金上的原子间协同效应促进环己酮肟电合成","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72807?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"环己酮肟电合成","kp":["[催化剂]: 单原子合金(Fe基)","[反应]: 环己酮肟电合成","[挑战]: 中间体过度还原+缺C-N偶联位点"],"as":"该研究报道了一种单原子合金催化剂，利用原子间协同效应显著促进了环己酮肟的电化学合成。环己酮肟是生产己内酰胺（尼龙-6单体）的关键中间体，传统工艺依赖能耗高、副产物多的羟胺法。该电催化路线以可再生电力为驱动力，由环己酮和含氮原料直接电化学合成目标产物。单原子合金中活性金属位点与载体金属的电子结构协同效应优化了氮物种的吸附和活化，提高了反应选择性和法拉第效率。该工作为尼龙前驱体的绿色电化学制造开辟了新路径，展示了单原子合金催化在工业电合成中的应用前景。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Inter‐Atomic Synergy on Single‐Atom Alloy Promotes Cyclohexanone Oxime Electrosynthesis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The electrosynthesis of cyclohexanone oxime from cyclohexanone and nitrogenous feedstock driven by renewable electricity presents a sustainable alternative to energy‐intensive and hazardous industrial processes. However, achieving high activity and selectivity is challenged by the over‐reduction of key intermediates and the lack of effective sites for C─N coupling. Herein, we report a Fe\n                    1\n                    Bi single‐atom alloy (Fe\n                    1\n                    Bi SAA) featuring Fe‐Bi atomic interfaces that collaborate for the one‐pot electrosynthesis of cyclohexanone oxime. The Fe\n                    1\n                    Bi SAA achieves a remarkable Faradaic efficiency of 70.9% and a yield rate of 0.94 mmol cm\n                    −2\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    for cyclohexanone oxime. Combined in situ electrochemical spectroscopic measurements and density functional theory calculations reveal an atomic‐scale synergistic mechanism: dispersed Fe sites adsorb and activate cyclohexanone, while adjacent Bi sites selectively reduce nitrite to the key hydroxylamine intermediate. The techno‐economic analysis based on flow electrolyzer operation confirms the potential economic viability of the electrosynthesis of cyclohexanone oxime. This work provides profound atomic‐level insight into cooperative catalysis for C─N coupling reactions toward the electrosynthesis of value‐added organonitrogen compounds."},{"t":"硼化钼上界面锇纳米团簇实现反向氢溢流以增强析氢反应","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70847?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"析氢电催化剂","kp":["[催化剂]: Os纳米簇修饰MoB(Os/MoB)","[增强机理]: 反向氢溢流","[应用]: 析氢反应HER"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究设计了一种新型电催化剂：在钼硼化物载体上负载界面锇(Os)纳米团簇，通过反向氢溢流机制显著增强析氢反应(HER)性能。传统氢溢流是氢物种从活性金属迁移到载体，而反向设计使载体上的氢有效迁移至Os活性位点，优化了氢吸附-脱附平衡。该策略兼顾高催化活性、长期耐久性与经济可行性，为开发替代铂基催化剂的低成本高效HER电催化材料提供了新思路，对绿氢规模化制备具有应用价值。","ot":"Interfacial Osmium Nanoclusters on Molybdenum Boride Enable Reverse Hydrogen Spillover for Enhanced Hydrogen Evolution","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The advancement of highly efficient, durable, and economically viable electrocatalysts for the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) plays a crucial role in enabling large‐scale green hydrogen production. However, significant challenges remain in improving the efficiency of conventional catalytic processes. Here, we report osmium nanocluster‐decorated molybdenum boride (Os/MoB) as an efficient catalyst for the HER, operating via a novel hydrogen spillover mechanism. The Os/MoB catalyst achieves remarkably low overpotentials (η\n                    10\n                    = 22, 27, and 11 mV) to reach 10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    in alkaline, acidic, and alkaline seawater (1 \n                    m\n                    KOH + seawater) electrolytes, performance that matches or surpasses commercial Pt/C. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations reveal that H\n                    2\n                    O adsorbs on the MoB surface, followed by the dissociation of H\n                    2\n                    O, where the generated H* species spillover to the interfacial Os sites, subsequently recombining and releasing H\n                    2\n                    . Furthermore, an Os/MoB‐based anion exchange membrane water electrolyzer (AEMWE) delivers a current density of 500 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at low voltages of only 1.78 V in 1 \n                    m\n                    KOH and 1.88 V in alkaline seawater and maintains stable operation for over 100 h."},{"t":"集成光子神经网络实现片上反向传播训练","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10262-8","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光子神经网络","kp":["[架构]: 集成光子神经网络","[训练]: 片上反向传播"],"dp":1,"sc":8.7,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":6.0,"r":7.5,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究实现了集成光子神经网络（PNN）的片上反向传播训练。PNN利用光信号进行计算，具有超高带宽和低功耗优势，但训练一直依赖离片电子回路。该工作在芯片内构建了完整的光学反向传播通路，使网络可端到端在光学域完成梯度计算与权重更新，解决了可扩展光子神经网络训练的核心瓶颈，为高速低能耗光计算系统迈向实用化奠定基础。","ot":"Integrated photonic neural network with on-chip backpropagation training","b":"The robust and repeatable performance of scalable integrated photonic neural networks (PNNs)1,2,3 strongly depends on the quality of their training. Gradient-based backpropagation is the mainstream algorithm for training digital neural networks thanks to its scalability, versatility and implementation efficiency4. Consequently, there is an interest in implementing it within a photonic platform in an all-optical manner. At present, owing to the lack of a scalable on-chip activation gradient5, training PNNs has relied on digital computers to run backpropagation, whose performance is reduced in the presence of inevitable device-to-device and environmental variations, or on gradient-free algorithms that do not fully benefit from the versatility of backpropagation training. Here we report the demonstration of an integrated photonic deep neural network, trained end-to-end with on-chip gradient-descent backpropagation. All linear and nonlinear computations are performed on a single photonic chip, leading to scalable and robust training, despite the considerable yet typical fabrication-induced device variations. In two nonlinear data classification tasks, chip performance matches that of the reference digital model in accuracy (over 90%) and robustness without using a digital computer. Integrating the advantages of backpropagation training with PNNs allows for generalization to various PNN architectures for future scalable and reliable photonic computing systems."},{"t":"用于缓解钙钛矿太阳能电池反向偏压的集成忆阻器","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10275-3","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿光伏保护","kp":["[集成器件]: 忆阻器","[功能]: 缓解反向偏压","[失效条件]: 中等反向偏压下不稳定"],"dp":1,"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"针对钙钛矿太阳能电池在反向偏压条件下易发生降解的问题，提出将忆阻器与电池单片集成以抑制反向偏压损伤。钙钛矿电池效率已接近商用水平，但组件级可靠性仍是制约产业化的关键。集成忆阻器可在反向偏压时提供旁路导通，有效保护电池不受永久性损害，显著提升模块在局部遮蔽等实际工况下的运行稳定性与寿命。","ot":"Integrated memristor for mitigating reverse-bias in perovskite solar cells","b":"Perovskite solar cells (PSCs) with power-conversion efficiencies comparable to established technologies hold huge promise for becoming the future photovoltaic technology, also given their versatility, low-cost and energy-efficient fabrication processes1. However, PSCs are not stable under moderate reverse bias2,3,4, an unavoidable situation under real-world operation, for instance, caused by partial shading of a module or installation with PSCs connected in series. Approaches to address this issue have focused on engineering the device architecture to enhance the breakdown voltage and mitigate the detrimental effects of reverse bias2,5,6. Here we present a completely different approach that fully solves the reverse-bias issue. With our Memsol, we developed a new concept of a solar cell with an integrated memristor, which protects the solar cell and simultaneously works as a bypass element. The memristor is realized by area-selective deposition of an additional metal–insulator stack and shares the perovskite and electrodes with the solar-cell part. Reverse-bias and shading tests show that the Memsol remains stable and automatically toggles between a low-resistance bypass state and full-efficiency solar-cell operation, dependent on the illumination and bias conditions. We anticipate that our Memsol concept, which we demonstrated on a nine-cell string in the lab, will be implemented in large-scale modules, accelerating their commercialization and potentially making external bypass diodes unnecessary."},{"t":"通过亲和配体纯化深入了解人类 SAGA 复合物的结构和进化","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec8104?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Human SAGA is a 20-subunit transcriptional coactivator. Compared with yeast, metazoan SAGA uniquely incorporates a 150-kDa splicing-factor module (SPL), also present in U2 small nuclear ribonucleoprotein (U2snRNP). Metazoan gene duplication further specialized shared TFIID/SAGA subunits into SAGA-specific paralogs (TAF5L and TAF6L), but the functional consequences of this divergence are unknown. We report the structure of endogenous human SAGA purified via an affinity ligand from cells that were not disturbed by any genomic engineering tools. Our work reveals the high-resolution structure of SPL and the TAF6L HEAT repeat domain that provides the SPL with a docking surface. We elucidate how SPL and the HEAT repeats are incorporated into SAGA. We identify major structural differences between TAF6L/TAF5L and their canonical paralogs that enable SPL accommodation. SPL engages SAGA through a substantially smaller interface than in U2snRNP, despite sharing a deeply inserted helical motif. The seemingly weaker interaction of SPL with SAGA raises the possibility that SAGA relays this module to the splicing machinery."},{"t":"体内位点特异性工程重新编程 T 细胞","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10235-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Engineered T cells, reprogrammed to express chimeric antigen receptors (CAR) or T cell receptors (TCR), have transformed cancer treatment and are being explored as therapeutics for autoimmune and infectious diseases. Enhancing T cell function through genome editing, either by disrupting endogenous genes or precisely inserting DNA payloads, has shown considerable promise1. However, the ex vivo manufacturing process is lengthy and costly, limiting accessibility of these therapies. In vivo generation of CAR T cells could overcome these barriers, but current methods rely either on transient expression with limited durability, or on random integration of DNA payloads that lack specificity. Here we demonstrate that stable and cell-specific transgene expression can be achieved through in vivo site-specific integration of large DNA payloads. We developed a two-vector system to deliver CRISPR–Cas9 ribonucleoproteins and a DNA donor template, using enveloped delivery vehicles and adeno-associated viruses, respectively. We optimized both vectors for T cell-specific delivery and gene-targeting efficiency. By integrating a CAR transgene into a T cell-specific locus, we generate therapeutic levels of CAR T cells in vivo in humanized mouse models of B cell aplasia, and haematological and solid malignancies. These findings offer a pathway to more efficient, precise and widely accessible T cell therapies."},{"t":"在超薄网络聚合物膜中原位构建晶态通道用于加压H2/CO2分离","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb4957?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"气体分离膜","kp":["合成方法[膜]: 竞争反应界面聚合(CRIP)原位创建晶态通道","[膜结构]: 晶态段连接无定形聚合物网络","分离性能[膜]: H2/CO2加压分离"],"dp":1,"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"在超薄网状聚合物膜中原位构建晶态通道，实现高压条件下的H2/CO2高效分离。气体分离膜需兼具高选择性和高压耐受性，有序通道是构建选择性气体传输路径的理想基础。该策略将晶态孔道嵌入聚合物网络骨架中，利用晶态结构的精确尺寸筛分能力提升H2/CO2分离选择性，同时保持聚合物膜的力学稳定性和可加工性。","ot":"In situ creation of crystalline channels in ultrathin network polymer membranes for pressurized H2/CO2 separation","b":"Ordered channels provide an excellent foundation for creating gas-selective pathways in polymeric membranes that endure pressurized and high-temperature conditions. Herein, we present a competitive-reaction interfacial polymerization (CRIP) approach to in situ creation of crystalline channels in ultrathin network polymer membranes, which allows the crystalline segments to attach to the amorphous polymer network tightly. The separation performances of the membrane were regulated by controlling the reaction parameters, and the microstructure was characterized systematically. The as-prepared membrane exhibited an extraordinary mixed H\n                    2\n                    /CO\n                    2\n                    selectivity of 85 with a H\n                    2\n                    permeance of 184 gas permeation units under 11 bar and 150°C. Membranes show outstanding resistance to high pressures and temperatures, which offers high attractiveness for H\n                    2\n                    production and CO\n                    2\n                    capture."},{"t":"虚数坡印廷动量：偏振拓扑和多功能光学操纵","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag171/8526396?rss=1","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"The imaginary Poynting momentum (IPM), as an intrinsic yet mysterious property of light, is nearly as ubiquitous as its real counterpart. However, prior research has only traced its origin to intensity asymmetry and showcased its capability in particle manipulation using evanescent waves and structured light. Fundamentally, the interplay between the IPM and polarization topology remains unexplored, significantly restricting its potential applications. Here, we observe the high-order polarization topological charges (PTCs) in the IPM and expand their capabilities in versatile particle manipulation. PTCs originate from spatial distributions of linear polarizations in vector beams. When the PTC equals 1, the IPM can be utilized to rotate particles. Distinctively, for higher-order PTCs, rotational potential-well arrays with controllable rotation directions emerge to trap and rotate various numbers of particles. This work uncovers a holistic and complete understanding of the IPM by investigating its link to the polarization distribution. It also suggests a credible way to harness polarization-topology optical forces, offering significant potential for biophysical and quantum applications.","tp":"光学操控力","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"虚坡印廷动量（IPM）是光的内禀属性，此前研究仅将其起源追溯至强度不对称。本研究首次探索IPM与偏振拓扑之间的相互作用，观察到高阶偏振拓扑结构中的IPM效应，拓展了其在多功能光学操控中的应用潜力，为光的动量研究提供了新视角。","aip":1},{"t":"从火炬气中制氢：将排放转化为能源的双重机遇——前瞻性综述","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"火炬气制氢","kp":["[主题]: 火炬气制氢(排放转能源)"],"dp":1,"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.5,"r":3.0,"d":7.0,"t":2.5},"as":"","ot":"Hydrogen production from flare gas: a dual opportunity to turn emissions into energy - a prospective review"},{"t":"印度各邦在电力脱碳方面表现如何？地方层面基于消费的分解分析","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001473?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"电力脱碳化","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"人脑关键同步动力学的分层全脑建模","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2505768123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The brain operates at the critical transition between order and disorder which supports optimal information processing. Whole-brain computational modeling is a powerful tool for uncovering the system-level mechanisms behind large-scale brain activity in both healthy and pathological states. However, most previous approaches have focused on either functional connectivity or criticality, making it difficult to capture both aspects simultaneously. Here, we introduce a method based on a Hierarchical Kuramoto model that incorporates two levels of hierarchy. In our model, each node contains a large number of coupled oscillators, which allows us to examine both local synchronization and long-distance interactions between brain regions. The model produces critical-like dynamics marked by emergent long-range temporal correlations (LRTCs) and both interareal phase synchronization and amplitude cross-correlations (CC) during the transition from asynchronous to synchronous states. Notably, structure–function coupling shows distinct patterns: correlations with structural connectivity peak at criticality for LRTCs and CC, but decay for local and interareal phase synchronization. Comparisons with human resting-state magnetoencephalography (MEG) data reveal that the model’s behavior most closely resembles MEG phase synchronization and multipeak power spectra on the subcritical side of an extended critical regime, supporting the hypothesis that the human brain operates in this state."},{"t":"令人毛骨悚然：碳污染如何导致静电充电","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00631-8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳污染静电充","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"as":""},{"t":"产卵器的味觉感知促使母亲避免使用橙皮苷，以造福主要农业中的后代","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526937123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Females of the oriental fruit fly (\n                    Bactrocera dorsalis\n                    ) disproportionately oviposit in unripe fruits, despite their lower nutritional value compared to ripe fruits, but the sensory cues driving such counterintuitive site selection have not been determined. Here, using an oriental fruit fly–mango interaction system, we identified a specific flavonoid compound, hesperidin, as a major avoidance cue driving oviposition site selection in this species. Hesperidin accumulates as mango fruits ripen, and high concentrations suppress both larval growth and adult emergence. This indicates that higher levels of hesperidin exert a direct harmful effect on\n                    B. dorsalis\n                    larvae within ripe fruits. Interestingly, we found that\n                    B. dorsalis\n                    females perceive hesperidin via gustatory sensors on the ovipositor. The\n                    BdorGr28b\n                    gene is strongly expressed in the ovipositor, and we showed that the corresponding protein is the major hesperidin receptor. These results demonstrate that gustatory sensing via the ovipositor drives maternal avoidance of hesperidin to benefit the offspring in\n                    B. dorsalis\n                    . Our study provides insight into oviposition site selection in this species and the broader functional repertoire of insect gustation."},{"t":"客体增强卟啉基双空腔金属笼中电荷分离用于可见光驱动H2O2生产","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9964829?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化过氧化氢","kp":["[材料]: 卟啉基双腔金属笼","[增强机制]: 客体增强电荷分离","[应用]: 可见光产H2O2"],"as":"研究设计了基于卟啉的空腔型金属笼状超分子组装体，通过引入客体分子增强电荷分离效率，用于光催化合成过氧化氢（H₂O₂）。金属笼的双空腔结构为底物富集和光诱导电子转移提供了限域微环境，客体调控策略有效抑制了电荷复合，显著提升了H₂O₂的光催化产率，为绿色氧化剂的太阳能驱动合成提供了新平台。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Guest‐Enhanced Charge Separation in Porphyrin‐Based Double‐Cavity Metallacages for Visible‐Light‐Driven H2O2 Production","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ) is a versatile and green oxidant with wide industrial applications, yet its large‐scale production still relies on the energy‐intensive anthraquinone process. Photocatalytic synthesis of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    under visible light offers a sustainable alternative but remains limited by inefficient charge separation and mass transport in extended framework materials. Herein, we report the modular construction of two porphyrin‐based double‐cavity metallacages via orthogonal Pt(II)/carboxylate/pyridine and Zn‐porphyrin/pyridine coordination. The resulting metallacages feature an intrinsic donor‐acceptor architecture that promotes photoinduced electron transfer and charge separation. Encapsulation of electron‐rich aromatic guests (triphenylene or benzotrithiophene) further stabilizes the charge‐separated state and prolongs carrier lifetimes, thereby enhancing the photocatalytic H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    generation with a rate of 4037 µmol·g\n                    −1\n                    ·h\n                    −1\n                    in the presence of benzyl alcohol, among the highest reported values for visible‐light supramolecular photocatalysts. This work establishes discrete metallacages and their host–guest complexes as an emerging platform for supramolecular photocatalysis and rational H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    photosynthesis, which will pave the way for the future development of metallacages in photocatalytic applications."},{"t":"探地雷达对火星杰泽罗陨石坑古代大型三角洲结构的观测","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz6095?af=R","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The surface of Mars once hosted flowing liquid water and a warmer climate than today, with past water-rock interactions recorded by the carbonate deposits found on its surface. Here, we analyze the depositional setting of the Margin unit, a major magnesium-carbonate deposit near the fluvial inlet to Jezero crater using ground penetrating radar data collected by the Mars 2020 Perseverance rover Radar Imager for Mars Subsurface Experiment (RIMFAX) instrument. We report soundings from more than 35 m belowground, ~1.75 times deeper than other Jezero geologic units explored to date. We identify numerous subsurface features and submeter to hundred-meter scale layering across an ~6.1-km rover traverse. We infer that subsurface reflectors are consistent with buried fluvial features and deltaic foresets, which have experienced multiple erosional-depositional episodes. This work illuminates a well-preserved paleolandscape wherein a deltaic environment developed prior to the formation of the Jezero Western Delta, as early as the Noachian (~4.2 to 3.7 billion years ago).","tp":"火星雷达探测","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"火星表面曾有液态水和更温暖气候，水岩相互作用被碳酸盐沉积记录。本研究利用火星2020毅力号探测器RIMFAX探地雷达数据，分析了杰泽罗陨石坑边缘单元——一处主要镁碳酸盐沉积的沉积环境，报告了超过35处探测结果，揭示了古代大型三角洲结构。"},{"t":"有机半导体的金激活过硫酸盐 p 掺杂","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02547-0","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","b":"Chemical doping is crucial for fine-tuning the electronic properties of organic semiconductors (OSCs) and enhancing device performance across various technologies. While several methods for controlled dopant distribution have been explored, achieving lateral doping gradients via simple solution processing remains challenging. Here we present a gold-activated persulfate doping strategy in which persulfate is catalytically activated at gold surfaces to generate SO4•− radicals that locally oxidize (p-dope) the OSCs. This reaction creates a lateral doping gradient extending outwards from the gold interface, as verified by spectroscopic and electrical characterization. The approach is broadly applicable to OSCs spanning a 1.5-eV ionization potential range and yields conductivities >1,900 S cm−1. To demonstrate the impact of this method, we applied gold-activated persulfate doping to modulate contact regions in solution-processed organic field-effect transistors, achieving reduced contact resistance and improved charge-carrier mobility. This simple, scalable approach enables the formation of lateral doping gradients from solution and offers new opportunities for interfacial tuning in organic electronics.","tp":"有机半导体掺杂","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"化学掺杂对有机半导体电子性能调控至关重要。本研究提出金激活过硫酸盐掺杂策略：过硫酸盐在金表面被催化活化生成SO4•−自由基，局部氧化有机半导体，通过简单溶液加工实现横向掺杂梯度，为可控掺杂分布提供了新方法。","aip":1},{"t":"过去300万年全球海洋热含量","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10116-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The Pleistocene epoch was characterized by global cooling and an increase in the intensity and duration of glacial cycles. Regional surface and subsurface ocean temperature records follow distinct trends over this interval, suggesting dynamic changes in zonal and meridional heat transport and ocean circulation. These differing trends also complicate efforts to determine the evolution of total ocean heat content. Here we provide a record of mean ocean temperature over the past 3 million years from noble gas (Xe/Kr) measurements in shallow ice cores recovered in the Allan Hills blue ice area, Antarctica1. The stratigraphically complex records preclude reconstruction of individual glacial cycles and probably represent a weighted averaging of glacial and interglacial conditions2. Nonetheless, we find pronounced cooling roughly coincident with the Plio-Pleistocene Transition (around 2.7 million years ago), and steady temperatures across the Mid-Pleistocene Transition (1.2 to 0.8 million years ago). Comparisons with a recent global sea surface temperature compilation3 show broad consistency in long-term cooling but important differences at the Plio-Pleistocene and Mid-Pleistocene transitions. We suggest that the different trends in surface temperature and mean ocean temperature during these intervals are related to a redistribution of heat between the surface and subsurface via changes in deep water formation and upwelling. Our temperature record also permits an estimate of global ice volume changes between 3 and 0.5 million years ago through a deconvolution of the benthic foraminiferal δ18O record and points to a period of enhanced ice sheet growth around the time of the Mid-Pleistocene Transition."},{"t":"基因组编辑可避免免疫检测以整合大型 DNA 序列","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00730-6","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"基因组编辑整合","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":""},{"t":"探索细菌染色体分离的能量景观","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535321123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Faithful chromosome segregation during bacterial replication requires global reorganization of the nucleoid, where Structural Maintenance of Chromosomes (SMC) complexes play a crucial role. Here, we develop an energy landscape framework that integrates data-driven pairwise interactions with coarse-grained polymer physics to infer the 3D architectural ensembles of\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    and\n                    Bacillus subtilis\n                    chromosomes throughout replication. We show that SMC-mediated long-range lengthwise compaction reshapes the nucleoid to induce a robust mid-replication transition in which the terminus relocates toward the nucleoid center and duplicated origins segregate toward opposite cell halves. SMC-deficient mutants lack this transition and instead exhibit emergent nematic-like alignment of sister chromosomes that impedes segregation. A distinctive intersister Hi-C signature accompanies the emergence of the nematic alignment. By systematically tuning nonspecific intersister adhesion, we reveal that SMC activity expands the physical regime permitting faithful segregation. This buffering protects segregation against adhesive forces intrinsic to the crowded bacterial nucleoid. Our framework provides mechanistic insight into SMC-dependent coreplication segregation across bacterial species, yielding experimentally testable predictions for imaging and sister-chromosome-resolved Hi-C."},{"t":"利用VO2绝缘体-金属相变实现光催化甲烷转化","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02013-w","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化甲烷转化","kp":["[光催化机制]: VO2绝缘体-金属相变促进电荷分离","[应用]: 甲烷光催化转化增强"],"as":"该研究利用VO2（二氧化钒）的绝缘体-金属相变特性提升光催化甲烷转化效率。光催化过程中电荷载流子的产生与利用效率常受限于复合损失。VO2在光激发下发生相变，可调控电荷转移路径，有效抑制载流子复合，从而提高甲烷等惰性分子的活化与转化效率。该策略为温和条件下甲烷直接转化制高附加值化学品提供了新思路。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Exploiting the insulator–metal transition of VO2 in photocatalytic methane conversion","b":"Upon illumination, photocatalysts generate charge carriers for redox reactions, but their efficiency is often limited by carrier recombination and poor minority-carrier diffusion, despite many existing junction engineering strategies. Here we exploit the insulator–metal transition in VO2 to produce a material that promotes efficient charge separation and enhances the photocatalytic conversion of methane through the spontaneous formation of junctions. We find that the photocatalytic activity peaks at the critical temperature of the transition, which we attribute to coexisting insulating and metallic domains with non-integer dimensional boundaries and sizes smaller than the minority-carrier diffusion length. Increasing the charge-separating interface length by decreasing the film thickness improves the photocatalytic activity and C–C coupling between alkoxy intermediates, leading to a propane selectivity of 100%. Moreover, electrically triggering the phase transition at lower temperatures further boosts methane conversion via field-assisted carrier activation. Overall, the metal–insulator transition provides an effective alternative to complex nanoscale junction engineering in photocatalysis."},{"t":"能带黎曼面的实验观察","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec8239?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Non-Hermiticity naturally arises in physical systems that exchange energy with their environment. The presence of non-Hermiticity leads to many topological physics phenomena and device applications. In the non-Hermitian energy band theory, the foundation of these physics and applications, both energies and wave vectors take complex values. The energy bands thus become a Riemann surface, and such an energy-band Riemann surface underlies all important signatures of non-Hermitian topology. Despite a long history and recent theoretical interests, the energy-band Riemann surface has not been experimentally studied. Here, we provide a photonic observation of the energy-band Riemann surface of a non-Hermitian system. This is achieved by a tunable imaginary gauge transformation in photonic synthetic frequency dimensions. From measured topologies of the Riemann surface, we reveal the complex-energy winding, the open-boundary-condition spectrum, the generalized Brillouin zone, and the branch points. Our findings demonstrate a unified framework in the studies of diverse effects in non-Hermitian topological physics through an experimental observation of energy-band Riemann surfaces."},{"t":"进化","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00612-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"共享转录因子序列导致脊髓神经元亚型按时间顺序多样化的证据","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz3075?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Uncovering the mechanisms that generate the immense diversity of neuronal cell types remains a fundamental goal of developmental biology. Different “cardinal classes” of spinal neurons that share a common molecular identity are produced from spatially segregated progenitor domains. Within many classes, a stereotyped sequence of neuronal subtypes of related function is generated over time, raising the question of the mechanisms that control this process. Here, we show that the successive expression of mouse transcription factors Onecut2, Pou2f2, and Pou3f1 correlates with the emergence of sequentially generated subpopulations within several cardinal classes. We demonstrate that loss of Pou2f2 impairs the development of two early-born motor neuron columns and respecifies anterolateral system projection neurons into a later-born subset. Similarly, we show that Pou3f1 expression is required for the normal development of later-born subsets of motor neurons and anterolateral system projection neurons. Together, our observations provide functional evidence that horologic diversification of spinal circuits is driven by a conserved sequence of transcription factors."},{"t":"通过不对称光响应催化剂构建电子泵用于太阳能驱动合成气生产","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72821?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化重整制合成气","kp":["催化剂[合成气]: 非对称光响应电子泵，Ru纳米簇","[反应]: 太阳能驱动甲烷干重整(DRM)","[挑战]: 高空速(GHSV)下产率不足"],"as":"该工作利用不对称光响应催化剂构建电子泵驱动，实现太阳能驱动的甲烷干重整反应（DRM）。传统DRM为强吸热高温反应，能耗巨大；该策略通过光激发不对称催化位点实现电子定向转移，在温和条件下将甲烷与CO₂共转化为合成气（CO+H₂），兼具节能与减碳双重效益，为天然气高值化利用开辟新路径。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Engineering an Electron Pump by Asymmetric Light‐Responsive Catalyst for Solar‐Driven Syngas Production","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Solar‐driven dry reforming of methane (DRM) offers an energy‐saving and environmentally sustainable route for syngas production. Nevertheless, this technology still suffers from insufficient production rates, especially under high gas hourly space velocity (GHSV). In this work, we design an electron pump catalyst with an asymmetric light‐responsive architecture, comprising Ru nanoclusters and Ni single atoms, to boost syngas production rates. Under illumination without external heating, Ru\n                    ac\n                    ‐Ni\n                    sa\n                    /NC achieves a remarkable syngas production of 4.70 mol·g\n                    cat\n                    −1\n                    ·h\n                    −1\n                    at 500°C and a GHSV of 288 000 h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    , outperforming state‐of‐the‐art benchmarks by five times, and maintained excellent stability over 1500 min. Experimental and computational studies disclose that the asymmetric architecture enables directional electron transfer and suppresses electron‐hole recombination, as an electron pump, creating electron‐enriched Ru sites and electron‐deficient Ni sites. This interfacial electron configuration furnishes favorable active sites for reactant activation and\n                    *\n                    CH\n                    3\n                    O formation, thereby improving DRM kinetics. This work unlocks a design strategy for catalysts in solar‐driven reactions and provides a mechanistic lever for enhancing electron‐transfer efficiency and reactant activation."},{"t":"通过体相压缩与表面张力应变工程实现无氧5-羟甲基糠醛光转化","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6400652?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"生物质光催化转化","kp":["催化剂[HMF光转化]: 铑纳米簇修饰硫化镉纳米棒","应变工程[催化剂]: 体相压缩+表面张力应变","[反应条件]: 厌氧，HMF→DFF"],"as":"该研究通过工程化引入体相压缩应变与表面张力应变，实现5-羟甲基糠醛（HMF）的厌氧氧化转化，生成绿色生物质塑料单体2,5-二甲酰基呋喃（DFF）。传统HMF氧化依赖贵金属催化剂及氧气条件，该应变调控策略在无氧环境下激活催化活性，为生物质高值化学品合成提供低成本、可规模化的催化新范式。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Engineering Bulk Compression and Surface Tension Strains Toward Anaerobic 5‐Hydroxymethylfurfural Photoconversion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving 2,5‐diformylfuran (DFF), a key green biomass plastic monomer, from conventional oxidation of 5‐hydroxymethylfurfural (HMF) often involves harsh conditions such as strong alkaline media and is prone to base‐catalyzed polymerization side reactions. Herein, we engineered both bulk compression and surface tension strain in rhodium nanoclusters‐modified cadmium sulfide nanorods through aluminum doping (Al/Rh\n                    NC\n                    ‐CdS) to boost highly selective anaerobic photocatalytic coproduction of DFF and hydrogen from neutral HMF aqueous solutions under mild conditions. In situ characterization combined with first‐principles simulation proves that the bulk compression strain significantly enhances the photogenerated charge separation in Al/Rh\n                    NC\n                    ‐CdS, while the surface tension strain facilitates the rate‐determining dehydrogenation oxidation of HMF into the key *C\n                    6\n                    H\n                    5\n                    O\n                    3\n                    intermediate. These unique characteristics enables Al/Rh\n                    NC\n                    ‐CdS to achieve a 17‐, 9‐, and 4‐fold higher H\n                    2\n                    (776.8 µmol g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ) and DFF yield (745.9 µmol g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    , with 94.8% selectivity) compared to CdS modified with conventional Rh nanoparticles, nanoclusters, or single atoms. This strain‐induced activity enhancement is also observed in other metal nanocluster‐loaded CdS systems, highlighting the universal applicability of the proposed strategy. More significantly, Al/Rh\n                    NC\n                    ‐CdS exhibited remarkable yields toward H\n                    2\n                    (270.9 µmol g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ) and DFF (255.3 µmol g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    , with 95.4% selectivity) in an outdoor concentrated solar‐driven photocatalytic system, thus verifying its feasibility for large‐scale manufacturing."},{"t":"实现长期货架稳定钙钛矿太阳能电池：氧化铝阻挡层保护器件免受湿气侵蚀","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70834?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿封装屏障","kp":["[封装方法]: ALD沉积氧化铝","[沉积位置]: 完整PV器件堆叠上","[防护对象]: 水分和氧气"],"as":"该工作针对金属卤化物钙钛矿太阳能电池长期稳定性瓶颈，提出氧化铝（Al₂O₃）阻挡层封装方案以阻隔环境水汽与氧气渗透。现有薄膜封装难以完全隔绝环境因素，导致钙钛矿层降解；该Al₂O₃屏障架构显著提升器件货架寿命与长期运行稳定性，是推动钙钛矿电池从实验室走向商业化量产的关键封装技术进展。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Enabling Long Term, Shelf‐Stable Perovskite Solar Cells: Alumina Barriers to Protect Perovskite Devices from Moisture an","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Current encapsulation architectures for thin‐film metal halide perovskite do not adequately eliminate all ambient stressors. Here, we develop low transmission rate barrier layers using atomic layer deposited (ALD) aluminum oxide grown directly on the completed photovoltaic (PV) device stack to provide an additional seal, prior to full packaging. We investigate the effect of deposition temperature and oxidant chemistries on the barrier growth for protection of perovskite photovoltaic devices. We characterize the layers individually, then integrate into devices to detail the tradeoff between protection and deposition compatibility. To enhance compatibility and impermeability, we present an approach using water as the aluminum oxidant during nucleation and switching from water to ozone for the remainder of the growth. At 50 nm, the barrier results in a water vapor transmission rate (WVTR) of 4.5·10\n                    −4\n                    g/m\n                    2\n                    /day, and 1,000‐hour device stability under 45°C with 85% relative humidity without further packaging. This barrier provides sufficient protection to enable minimal degradation of the perovskite solar cells while completely submerged in water for 140 minutes. Additionally, we characterize the oxygen transmission rate (OTR) to be 0.49 cm\n                    3\n                    /m\n                    2\n                    /day at 23°C and 0% relative humidity, which is 1.5 orders of magnitude improvement over the OTR of the current encapsulation."},{"t":"电热催化：从整体焦耳加热到颗粒间电促进的范式转变","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag167/8526397?rss=1","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电热催化","kp":["[范式]: 整体焦耳热转向颗粒间电促进","[技术]: 电热催化脱碳"],"as":"电热催化是传统热催化的升级范式，从整体电阻焦耳加热转向界面局部加热，在催化剂活性位点附近实现精准温度控制。该策略可大幅降低能耗和碳排放，同时提升反应速率和选择性，被视为化工脱碳的关键路径。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Electrothermal catalysis: paradigm shift from monolithic Joule heating to interparticle electrical promotion","b":"Conventional thermal catalysis, dependent on carbon-intensive fossil fuels, faces pressing sustainability challenges. As an alternative relying on renewable electricity, electrothermal catalysis utilizing catalyst Joule heating enables decarbonized chemical processes and is advancing rapidly under carbon neutrality mandates. Here, we clarify the fundamental characteristics and scope of electrothermal catalysis, especially highlighting advances in our own works. Accordingly, a paradigm shift from monolithic Joule heating to interparticle electrical promotion is proposed. Monolithic catalyst architectures employ the Joule heating of monolithic supports for compact and efficient heating, whereas interparticle counterparts leverage both Joule heating and electrical promotion between conductive catalyst particles, not only substantially enhancing the intrinsic activity of catalysts but also drastically reducing energy costs and carbon footprints for sustainable electrification of chemical processes. Ultimately, the perspectives and challenges of interparticle electrical promotion are highlighted and analyzed to advance this transformative shift toward a viably industrial process."},{"t":"零间隙电解槽中由CO2和生物质衍生碳水化合物高效甲酸盐电合成","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3951875?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"甲酸电合成","kp":["[反应器]: 零间隙电解槽","[反应]: CO2+生物质配对电解产甲酸","[问题]: 甲酸盐在MEA中交叉氧化"],"as":"研究提出一种电子高效的甲酸盐电合成路线，通过配对电解将CO2还原与生物质衍生碳水化合物的氧化耦合，在阴阳两极同时产出高值化学品，最大化电子利用率，突破传统电催化单向反应的能效瓶颈。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Electron‐Efficient Formate Electrosynthesis from CO2 and Biomass‐Derived Carbohydrates in a Zero‐Gap Electrolyzer","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Paired electrolysis is being actively developed for co‐producing valuable chemicals by leveraging electron transfer at bipolar electrodes. In electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction to formate, if the reaction is coupled with oxygen evolution reaction, formate experiences severe crossover and oxidation to CO\n                    2\n                    over anode in membrane electrode assembly (MEA) electrolyzer. We reported a convergent electrolysis that produces formate at bipolar electrodes by coupling CO\n                    2\n                    reduction with biomass‐derived carbohydrate (for example, glucose) oxidation, maximizing the electron efficiency toward formate (0.88 formate per e\n                    −\n                    ) and suppressing oxidation of crossed formate at anode. This convergent electrolysis shows low electricity consumption for formate production (76.5 Wh mol\n                    −1\n                    at 100 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    ), lower than that of conventional CO\n                    2\n                    reduction (180−350 Wh mol\n                    −1\n                    ). Furthermore, we extended the convergent electrolysis to acetate production by coupling electrochemical CO reduction with waste polylactic acid plastic oxidation. This work offers a framework for the rational design of paired electrolysis for low electricity consumption of chemical production."},{"t":"通过能带工程实现聚四氟乙烯(PTFE)电化学稳定化以获得长寿命高性能器件","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70845?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PTFE粘结剂","kp":["[材料]: PTFE粘结剂干法涂布","[稳定化方法]: 电子能带工程","[问题]: PTFE低LUMO致阳极不稳"],"as":"针对PTFE（聚四氟乙烯）粘结剂在干法电极涂布中的应用，研究通过电化学手段调控其电子结构实现稳定化处理，解决了PTFE与电极活性材料界面相容性差的问题，推动快充锂离子电池干法电极工艺的规模化。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Electrochemical Stabilization of Polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE) via Electronic Band Engineering Enables Long‐Life, High‐","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The dry‐coating process with polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE) binder has emerged as a promising technology for fabricating thick electrodes toward high‐energy‐density lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs). However, its practical application is limited by the poor electrochemical stability of PTFE at the anode. The intrinsically low lowest unoccupied molecular orbital (LUMO) energy of PTFE renders it highly susceptible to reduction‐induced side reactions at the anode, leading to low initial Coulombic efficiency (ICE) and degradation of electrode microstructure during cycling. To overcome this limitation, the frontier orbital energy level of PTFE is rationally engineered by incorporating weakly electron‐withdrawing oxygen‐ and nitrogen‐containing functional groups via O\n                    2\n                    plasma treatment and gas‐phase nitridation. This molecular modification strategy induces an increase in LUMO energy, which enhances the electrochemical stability of PTFE under anodic environments. The dry‐processed anode employing modified PTFE exhibits a high ICE of 92.8%, compared with 87.8% for the anode with pristine PTFE. Furthermore, full‐cells exhibit outstanding long‐term cycling stability with negligible electrode swelling with a practical areal capacity of 7 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    over 600 cycles. This finding highlight that the molecular engineering of the PTFE fiber network offers straightforward and effective strategy to suppress PTFE reduction, enabling practical high–energy–density LIBs with long‐term cycling stability."},{"t":"基于电针的迷走神经刺激通过体脑回路减轻癫痫发作","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517600123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Vagus nerve stimulation offers a promising strategy for seizure control but remains limited by its invasive delivery. Here, we reveal electroacupuncture (EA), an ancient neuromodulatory technique rooted in traditional Chinese medicine, at specific somatic acupoints linked to the vagal–brain axis to treat epilepsy and delineate the precise underlying neural mechanisms. We demonstrate that EA at the\n                    Dazhui\n                    (GV14) acupoint exhibits broad-spectrum antiseizure efficacy across multiple seizure models. Anatomical and functional analyses reveal that GV14 activates the vagal afferents and recruits neurons in the caudal nucleus of the solitary tract (cNTS), which are essential for seizure suppression. Using targeted recombination in active populations and chemogenetic manipulation, we show that GV14 EA suppresses seizures via the recruitment of a defined cNTS–locus coeruleus–amygdala circuit. Furthermore, through vagal afferent activity screening, we identify\n                    Yaoqi\n                    (EXB9) as an alternative therapeutic acupoint that activates a shared neural pathway to robustly attenuate seizures. Importantly, thread-embedding acupuncture at GV14 or EXB9 produces sustained seizure reduction in a chronic epilepsy model. Together, these findings elucidate a functional vagal–brain circuit underlying EA-induced seizure control and support its translational potential as a minimally invasive neuromodulatory strategy to replace vagal stimulation for epilepsy treatment."},{"t":"零场 Hopfion 环的电流辅助成核","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523417?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Magnetic hopfions are 3D topological solitons – knotted, vortex‐like spin configurations. In chiral magnets, hopfions can appear as isolated structures or they can be linked to skyrmion strings. Previous studies employed a sophisticated protocol and a special sample geometry to nucleate such hopfions linked to one or a few skyrmion strings. Here, we introduce an electric‐current‐assisted nucleation protocol that is simple and independent of the sample shape and size. The resulting hopfions exhibit extraordinary stability in the presence of both positive and negative magnetic fields, in perfect agreement with micromagnetic simulations. We also present a comprehensive framework for classifying hopfions, skyrmions, and merons by deriving the corresponding homotopy group."},{"t":"双描述符指导的电场敏感增溶剂添加剂设计用于稳定锂金属电池","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00038J","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池添加剂","kp":["[添加剂]: 电场敏感增溶添加剂EFSSA","[应用]: 锂金属电池全电池稳定性"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"提出基于双描述符引导设计的电场敏感型助溶添加剂，用于稳定锂金属电池。电解液添加剂是改善锂金属负极稳定性的有力手段，但弱离子溶剂化能力限制了其效果。该研究通过双描述符理性筛选策略，设计出对电场响应的添加剂分子，使其在界面优先富集并调控固体电解质界面膜（SEI）形成，有效抑制锂枝晶生长，提升电池循环寿命。","ot":"Dual-descriptor-guided design of electric field-sensitive solubilizing additive for stable lithium metal batteries","b":"Electrolyte additive has shown great power for improving the stability of lithium metal batteries.However, the weak ion dissociation of additives in carbonate electrolytes and the limited modification effect at cathode side, severely hinder their practical use in full cells. Herein, we present an \"electric field-sensitive solubilizing additive (EFSSA)\" strategy for rational electrolyte design, employing cubic electrophilicity index (CEPI) and Mulliken charge as dual descriptors for additive screening. As a typical example, the ion dissociation of lithium nitrate (LiNO3) in carbonate electrolyte is largely enhanced by employing tris(trimethylsilyl) borate (TMSB) as a secondary solubilizing additive with a high CEPI. Moreover, TMSB with a high Mulliken charge facilitates the reconstruction of a beneficial anion-dominated solvation structure at the cathode electric double layer via electric field-induced repulsion. Through this synergistic interaction between LiNO3 and TMSB, the ionic conductivity and stability of electrode-electrolyte interface are significantly improved both at anode and cathode sides.The designed LiNO3 -TMSB/carbonate electrolyte enables stable, long-term cycling in Li||Cu cell for > 700 cycles and enables Li||NCM811 full cell to retain 84.6% of its capacity after 600 cycles, with its feasibility further validated in Ah-level pouch cells. This EFSSA strategy and dual descriptors provide conceptual advances for high-performance electrolyte design and propel the practical application of high-energy lithium metal batteries."},{"t":"针对细胞内和持续性沙门氏菌的 DksA 抑制剂在急性感染模型中有效","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea6832?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"We are in dire need of antibiotics endowed with new mechanisms of action. The DksA protein regulates the transcription of genes involved in metabolism, translation, and virulence in Gram-negative bacteria. DksA is evolutionarily conserved among Gram-negative pathogens but is absent in humans. Here, we identified a conserved acidic pocket at the tip of the coiled-coil domain of DksA that is amenable for drug development. Our bioinformatics and experimental approaches identified\n                    N\n                    -(3,4-dimethoxyphenyl)-1H-1,2,4-triazole-3-carboxamide as a DksA inhibitor with moderate antimicrobial activity. Derivatization of the dimethoxyphenyl functionality and aliphatic linker of\n                    N\n                    -(3,4-dimethoxyphenyl)-1H-1,2,4-triazole-3-carboxamide generated several new chemical entities with excellent IC\n                    50\n                    values against DksA-regulated in vitro transcription and improved antimicrobial activity against\n                    Salmonella\n                    and several other Gram-negative bacteria. Our pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic evaluations indicate that the\n                    N\n                    -(4-phenylbutyl)-1H-1,2,4-triazole-3-carboxamide analog is absorbed in the gastrointestinal tract of rats and is distributed into viscera. The systemic administration of the\n                    N\n                    -(4-phenylbutyl)-1H-1,2,4-triazole-3-carboxamide analog protected mice against oral and systemic\n                    Salmonella\n                    infections while practically preventing the formation of microabscesses and necrotic foci in\n                    Salmonella\n                    -infected mice. Our investigations have identified a previously unknown class of antibiotics against the transcriptional regulator DksA that is endowed with antimicrobial activity against Gram-negative pathogens."},{"t":"增强型单层MoS2场效应晶体管中介电与栅金属工程实现阈值电压调控","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523661?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MoS2场效应管","kp":["[器件模式]: 增强型单层MoS2 FET","[调控手段]: 介电层与栅金属工程"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究了增强型单层MoS2场效应晶体管的阈值电压调控，通过介电层和栅极金属工程实现。二维过渡金属硫族化物具有优异的栅极静电控制能力，但增强型（normally-off）器件的阈值电压精确控制仍是关键挑战。该工作系统优化了栅极介电材料和栅极金属功函数组合，实现了阈值电压的大范围可调调控，为基于单层MoS2的低功耗逻辑电子器件走向应用提供了工程方案。","ot":"Dielectric and Gate Metal Engineering for Threshold Voltage Modulation in Enhancement Mode Monolayer MoS2 Field Effect T","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Excellent gate electrostatics in field effect transistors (FETs) based on 2D transition metal dichalcogenide (2D TMD) channels can dramatically decrease static power dissipation. Energy‐efficient FETs operate in enhancement mode with a small and positive threshold voltage (V\n                    th\n                    ) for n‐type devices. However, most state‐of‐the‐art FETs based on monolayer MoS\n                    2\n                    channel operate in depletion mode with negative V\n                    th\n                    due to doping from the underlying dielectric substrate. In this work, we identify key properties of the semiconductor/dielectric interface (MoS\n                    2\n                    on industrially relevant high dielectric constant (\n                    k\n                    ) HfO\n                    2\n                    , ZrO\n                    2\n                    and hBN for reference) responsible for realizing enhancement‐mode operation of 2D MoS\n                    2\n                    channel FETs. We find that hBN and ZrO\n                    2\n                    dielectric substrates provide low defect interfaces with MoS\n                    2\n                    that enables effective modulation of the V\n                    th\n                    using gate metals of different work functions (WFs). We use photoluminescence (PL) and synchrotron X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) measurements to investigate doping levels in monolayer MoS\n                    2\n                    on different dielectrics with different WF gate metals. We complement the FET and spectroscopic measurements with capacitance‐voltage analysis on dielectrics with varying thicknesses, which confirms that V\n                    th\n                    modulation in ZrO\n                    2\n                    devices is correlated with WF of the gate metals – in contrast with HfO\n                    2\n                    devices that exhibit signatures of V\n                    th\n                    pinning induced by oxide/interface defect states. Finally, we demonstrate FETs using a 2D MoS\n                    2\n                    channel and a 6 nm of ZrO\n                    2\n                    dielectric, achieving a subthreshold swing of 87 mV dec\n                    −1\n                    and a threshold voltage of 0.1 V. Our results offer insights into the role of dielectric/semiconductor interface in 2D MoS\n                    2\n                    based FETs for realizing enhancement mode FETs and highlight the potential of ZrO\n                    2\n                    as a scalable high‐\n                    k\n                    dielectric."},{"t":"用动态混合成核模型解码可充电电池锌负极电沉积过程","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72783?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌负极电沉积机制","kp":["[模型]: 动态混合成核模型","[问题]: 枝晶威胁循环寿命","[电解液]: 有机体系"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"提出了可充电锌电池锌负极电沉积的动态混合成核模型。枝晶生长严重威胁锌金属电池的循环寿命，尤其在有机电解液体系中。研究通过动态混合成核理论模型分析了锌离子电沉积过程中均相与非均相成核的竞争机制，揭示了电流密度和电解液组成对沉积形貌的影响规律，为通过成核调控抑制锌枝晶提供了理论指导和工程策略。","ot":"Decoding the Electrodeposition of Zinc Anode With Dynamic Mixed Nucleation Model for Rechargeable Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Dendrites have posed a significant threat to the cycling life of zinc (Zn) metal batteries in organic electrolyte. The deposition behavior of Zn is largely influenced by the kinetics of electrodeposition, a better understanding of which is crucial but often neglected. In this study, we provide a more refined classification of the electrodeposition and establish a novel mixed nucleation model. By fitting the chronoamperometric curves of the anode under different bias potentials based on mixed nucleation model, the dynamic evolution of the anode nucleation mode over time can be clearly classified. Also, the mixed nucleation model fitting proved that the introduction of antimony (Sb) transformed the electrochemical kinetics of the Zn anode, increasing the nucleation site density and shifting zinc deposition from mostly 3D instantaneous nucleation to uniform progressive nucleation. Consequently, the alloyed Zn exhibits a quasi‐2D deposition with predominantly exposed (002) nanocrystalline crystallographic plane. The flat and regular deposition enables excellent performance: steady cycling over 2600 h life at 5 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , 5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    in Zn||Zn symmetric cells; dendrite‐free zinc plating/stripping at 99.94% coulombic efficiency in SS||Zn asymmetric cell. The mixed nucleation model may provide new insights for the electrodeposition behavior of metal anodes."},{"t":"物性论：卤化物钙钛矿如何从损伤中自修复？","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518808?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钙钛矿自修复","kp":["[现象]: 卤化物钙钛矿自修复机制"],"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":2.5},"as":"系统综述了卤化物钙钛矿材料自修复（self-healing）的机制与本质。钙钛矿太阳能电池在实际运行中会受到光、热、湿度等应力损伤，但该类材料表现出独特的自修复能力。综述从分子层面批判性审视了自修复的热力学和动力学驱动力，区分了不同损伤类型的修复路径，评估了自修复对器件长期稳定性的实际贡献，为理性设计高耐久性钙钛矿器件提供了理论框架。","ot":"De Rerum Natura: How Do Halide Perovskites Self‐Heal From Damage?","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  By actually addressing the title question, we provide a comprehensive and critical review of self‐healing (SH) in lead‐based halide perovskites (HaPs), a phenomenon with profound implications for the stability of these materials across all applications, from photovoltaics to light emission and radiation detection. We emphasize reasoning as a guide to interpreting the dynamic balance between degradation and recovery when HaPs are exposed to light, heat, mechanical stress, or radiation. We compile and assess what are, in our view, the most relevant, available reports of damage–healing dynamics, distinguishing verified facts and observations from interpretations and unresolved questions. Key topics include damage accumulation, light soaking, and photo‐brightening, as well as the mechanistic roles of lattice dynamics, halide migration, redox chemistry, and acid–base equilibria in the disappearance of defects on accessible time scales. Thus, we go beyond a conventional summary by providing a unifying framework to clarify contradictions in the literature and reveal the underlying principles of reversible damage. By consolidating results that are often scattered into a coherent picture, we strive to establish a foundation for predictive models of SH kinetics, while guiding strategies to stabilize devices. We anticipate that this critical synthesis will serve as an authoritative reference for the metal halide perovskite research field."},{"t":"每日简报：中国批准全球首个脑机接口器械","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00888-z","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"脑机接口器械","as":"","sc":8.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":8.5,"r":8.5,"d":3.0,"t":9.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Daily briefing: China approves world-first brain–computer interface device"},{"t":"交联可电离脂质重新编程树突状细胞代谢以实现有效的 mRNA 疫苗接种","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02512-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"观点评论","b":"Modulating metabolism in immune cells is an effective approach to induce desired immune responses. Here we develop a lipid nanoparticle (LNP) capable of metabolic reprogramming of dendritic cells for mRNA vaccine applications. Using imidoester-based conjugation chemistry, we design a crosslinked ionizable lipid, C12-2aN, which possesses intrinsic metabolic modulatory properties. This multifunctional ionizable lipid not only promotes effective mRNA expression by facilitating endosomal escape but also stimulates glycolysis through mTORC2 pathway activation. As both an mRNA carrier and a metabolic modulator, C12-2aN LNPs lead to potent vaccine efficacy in both SARS-CoV-2 and OVA cancer vaccine models, resulting in stronger neutralization of pseudovirus infection and improved survival rates, respectively, compared with control LNPs without the crosslinker. Moreover, C12-2aN LNPs outperformed FDA-approved LNPs in terms of reduced off-target delivery and lower immunogenicity. Overall, the integration of mRNA delivery and metabolic reprogramming induced by the ionizable lipid component presents significant potential for next-generation mRNA LNP vaccines."},{"t":"构建纳米结状结构域增强人造蛛丝韧性以实现高扭卡效应性能","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516934?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"扭卡制冷材料","kp":["[材料]: 人工蛛丝","[结构设计]: 纳米结状结构域","[应用]: 扭卡制冷"],"as":"该研究通过在人造蛛丝蛋白链中引入纳米结状结构域（nanoknot-like domains），大幅提升了人工蛛丝纤维的高扭转性能与机械韧性。仿生蛛丝一直是高性能纤维材料的重点方向，纳米结结构模拟了天然蛛丝蛋白中的折叠与缠结特征，使其在承受扭转应力时不易断裂。该成果对柔性驱动器、智能纺织品及轻量化结构材料领域具有潜在工程应用价值。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Creating Nanoknot‐Like Domains for Robust Artificial Spider Silk Toward High Twistocaloric Performance","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐efficiency refrigeration materials with long cycle lifetimes are essential for reducing energy consumption in conventional cooling systems. Twistocaloric cooling, which harnesses nonlinear torsional stress, offers a promising pathway to enhanced cooling efficiency. However, a general design strategy for polymer‐based twistocaloric materials that combine high efficiency and long cycle life remains elusive. Here, we report spider silk‐inspired polybiurea elastomer fibers that exhibit exceptional mechanical properties and twistocaloric cooling performance. The material's architecture features nanoknot‐like domains formed via multiple hydrogen bonds and\n                    π\n                    –\n                    π\n                    interactions in the hard segments, which knot together the soft segments to provide high mechanical stability and substantial entropy changes. The polybiurea fibers with nanoknot‐like domains achieved an extraordinary combination of breaking strength of 316.5 MPa and toughness of 523.4 MJ m\n                    −3\n                    . This engineered deformable knotted structure enables a maximum cooling temperature drop of −17.1 K (by twisting and stretching), a maximum Carnot efficiency of 89.7%, and operational durability up to 120 000 mechanical fatigue life cycles. We further demonstrate two out‐of‐phase operated twistocaloric devices designed to recover input mechanical energy, thereby enhancing overall system efficiency. This work presents a robust materials strategy for advancing high‐performance polymeric refrigeration materials and systems."},{"t":"更正：通过碳硼炔中间体对邻碳硼烷进行官能化","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D6CS90026G","c":"不相关","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","b":"Correction for ‘Functionalization of o-carboranes via carboryne intermediates’ by Zaozao Qiu et al., Chem. Soc. Rev., 2022, 51, 3164–3180, https://doi.org/10.1039/D2CS00024E."},{"t":"鸟嘌呤生物结晶的控制策略","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1347419?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Highly reflective assemblies of guanine crystals generate a diverse array of optical phenomena in animals, from camouflage reflectors to image‐forming mirrors. The optical functions of guanine crystals and their related animal behaviors have been studied for over a century. However, only recently have we begun to unravel how organisms precisely control the structure and morphologies of these crystals which underly their photonic properties. In this minireview, we outline strategies employed by animals to control the formation and properties of guanine crystals, integrating both in vitro and in vivo studies. We frame these advances using analogies to ‘design’ principles in inorganic biomineralization—from the use of dopants and macromolecular templates in crystal morphology control to non‐classical crystallization pathways. We show that, despite their distinct biology, organic and inorganic biocrystallization share strikingly similar crystal design strategies. These strategies are a rich source of inspiration for bio‐inspired materials, especially in the development of sustainable optical materials. Finally, we outline key challenges for this exciting new field of\n                    organic biomineralization\n                    .","tp":"鸟嘌呤结晶","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":"动物体内鸟嘌呤晶体的反射组装体可产生从伪装反射器到成像镜面等多种光学现象。其光学功能与动物行为已被研究逾百年，但生物体如何精确控制这些晶体的结构与形态——即光子特性的基础——直到近年才逐步被揭示。该综述系统总结了鸟嘌呤生物结晶的控制机制与策略研究进展。"},{"t":"森林、草原和高山山顶的嗜热性对比","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09622-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Climate warming is shifting biological communities, with warmth-demanding species being favoured at the expense of cold-adapted species in a process referred to as thermophilization1,2,3,4. Because biodiversity responses often lag behind climate warming, climatic debts are accumulating in many ecosystems across the world5,6,7. Although we might expect that thermophilization and climatic debts will vary among habitats, standardized quantification across ecosystems is lacking. Here we analysed multidecadal data from 6,067 resurveyed vegetation plots over 12–78 years in forests, grasslands and on alpine summits across Europe. We demonstrate that forest understory and grassland plant communities experienced positive thermophilization, although not significantly different from zero. By contrast, alpine summit vegetation showed much stronger (up to five times) and significant thermophilization. Thermophilization was driven largely by increases in warmth-demanding species in grasslands, by declines in cold-adapted species on alpine summits and by both processes in forests. Significant climatic debts have accumulated in forests and alpine summits, but less so in grasslands, with debts positively correlated with macroclimate temperature changes. Our findings uncover divergent thermophilization trajectories and increasing climatic debts across ecosystems. Moreover, we highlight the mechanisms that enable some communities to track climate change more closely than others and provide a basis for projecting future shifts in plant communities under accelerating climate warming."},{"t":"共同演化的地形、片状土壤和森林结构","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519374123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The transition from soil-mantled to bedrock-dominated landscapes is important to hydrology, ecology, and landscape evolution. Where classical theory predicts that this transition abruptly occurs once erosion rates exceed soil production ones, actual landscapes show a much more gradual transition. The Rampart Range, CO, is an unglaciated, forested mountain range with uniform lithology that spans this transition, providing an opportunity to interrogate how topography, soil cover, and forest structure coevolve. Using drone imagery and airborne lidar, we show the utility of object-based methods that segment the lidar topography into individual outcrops. Lower elevation hillslopes are rockier (~14% rock) than their higher elevation counterparts (~2% rock) due to late Cenozoic incision of a regional, high elevation, low relief surface. After accounting for the erosional control on rockiness, we show that bedrock exposure also depends on topographic aspect. Equator-facing hillslopes are rockier (~20% rock at low elevations; ~3% rock at high elevations) than their more heavily forested, pole-facing counterparts (~11% rock at low elevations; ~1% rock at high elevations). To simulate these patterns, hillslope evolution models need “humped” soil production functions that can generate rocky outcrops within a soil mantle. When combined with depth-dependent soil creep, such models readily produce large gradients in the height and frequency of bedrock outcrops in response to aspect-dependent weathering. Given the correspondence between higher forest biomass (e.g., increased tree density, canopy height) with lower bedrock exposure on pole-facing hillslopes, we argue that forest dynamics may be an underappreciated regulator of hillslope morphology via root zone weathering."},{"t":"攀爬纤维招募去抑制以增强浦肯野细胞钙信号","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10220-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Climbing fibre (CF) inputs to Purkinje cells (PCs) instruct plasticity and learning in the cerebellum1,2,3. Paradoxically, CFs also excite molecular layer interneurons (MLIs)4,5, a cell type that inhibits PCs and can restrict plasticity and learning6,7. However, two types of MLI with opposing influences have recently been identified: MLI1s inhibit PCs, reduce dendritic calcium signals and suppress plasticity of granule cell to PC synapses2,6,7,8,9, whereas MLI2s inhibit MLI1s and disinhibit PCs8. To determine how CFs can activate MLIs without also suppressing the PC calcium signals necessary for plasticity and learning, we investigated the specificity of CF inputs onto MLIs. Serial electron microscopy reconstructions indicate that CFs contact both MLI subtypes without making conventional synapses, but more CFs contact each MLI2 through more sites with larger contact areas. Slice experiments indicate that CFs preferentially excite MLI2s through glutamate spillover4,5. In agreement with these anatomical and slice experiments, in vivo Neuropixels recordings show that spontaneous CF activity excites MLI2s, inhibits MLI1s and disinhibits PCs. By contrast, learning-related sensory stimulation produces more complex responses, driving convergent CF and granule cell inputs that could either activate or suppress MLI1s. This balance was robustly shifted towards MLI1 suppression when CFs were synchronously active, in turn elevating the PC dendritic calcium signals necessary for long-term depression. These data provide mechanistic insight into why CF synchrony can be highly effective at inducing cerebellar learning2,3 by revealing a critical disinhibitory circuit that allows CFs to act through MLIs to enhance PC dendritic calcium signals necessary for plasticity."},{"t":"被困在古老冰层中的气候快照讲述了一个令人惊讶的故事","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00636-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"手性声学声子和 α-石英中赝角动量守恒 (Adv. Mater. 16/2026)","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72681?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Chiral Acoustic Phonons In their Research Article (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202511289), Changsoo Kim, Chanyong Hwang, and co-workers report the existence of chiral acoustic phonons in the right- and left-handed chiral structures of α-quartz and demonstrate the conservation of pseudoangular momentum that governs their inelastic interactions with light. According to the pseudoangular-momentum selection rule, circularly polarized light of a given helicity couples exclusively to chiral phonons rotating in the corresponding direction, as verified through Brillouin light-scattering measurements. This work provides microscopic evidence for chiral acoustic phonons and suggests potential synergies with spintronics and orbitronics that exploit electron angular momentum."},{"t":"中国石化工厂CO2排放及碳中和生产的关键影响因素","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx7784?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/石油化工","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"石化碳排放","kp":["[排放占比]: 全球工业直接CO2排放15%(2021)","[中国占比]: 全球化工产出43%","[样本量]: 3119家石化厂"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦中国石化行业碳排放及其关键驱动因素。2021年石化行业占全球工业直接CO₂排放的15%，中国贡献显著。研究量化了石化工厂各工艺环节的排放强度，并识别出对汽车制造及出行领域碳足迹影响最大的排放源。通过生命周期评估方法，揭示石化原料生产到下游汽车产业链的碳传递路径，为制定针对性减排政策、优化石化—汽车协同减碳策略提供数据支撑。","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":8.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"China’s petrochemical plants’ CO2 emissions and high-impact contributors for carbon-neutrality production","b":"The petrochemical sector accounted for 15% of global industrial direct CO\n                    2\n                    emissions in 2021, with China contributing 43% of global chemical output and therefore being central to climate-change mitigation efforts. However, the lack of China-specific, process-based assessments has constrained targeted strategies. Here, we present a comprehensive CO\n                    2\n                    emissions analysis of 3119 petrochemical plants in China, capturing variations across 123 products, 185 processes, feedstocks, energy use, and product relationships within production chains. We estimate annual emissions at 813.7 million tonnes (Mt) CO\n                    2\n                    (±25%) in 2021, offering refined region-specific details beyond previous global or national assessments. We identify distinct emission hotspots at specific processes and product-chain stages, where low-carbon substitutions in feedstocks and reactions can reduce carbon intensity by up to 2.9 tonnes of CO\n                    2\n                    per tonne of product, while key stages in integrated complexes can account for up to 50% of chain emissions. These findings highlight the need for coordinated, chain-wide interventions to enable decarbonization."},{"t":"浮游植物分泌的代谢物介导表面海洋碳通量的表征","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531765123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The marine labile dissolved organic carbon (DOC) pool is a dynamic reservoir of thousands of molecules that cycles approximately one-quarter of Earth’s primary production within days to weeks. After excretion by phytoplankton and other microbes, metabolites are rapidly consumed, resulting in low standing concentrations (picomolar to low nanomolar). Despite the decades-long search for labile DOC sources and molecular identities, marine phytoplankton exometabolomes are not well characterized, largely due to difficulties in measuring small polar molecules in saline water. Here, we profiled the exometabolomes of six axenic phytoplankton species representing key functional groups including a diatom (\n                    Thalassiosira pseudonana\n                    CCMP1335), a picoeukaryote (\n                    Micromonas commoda\n                    RCC299), a coccolithophore (\n                    Gephyrocapsa huxleyi\n                    CCMP371), a diazotrophic cyanobacterium (\n                    Crocosphaera watsonii\n                    WH8501), and two picocyanobacteria (\n                    Prochlorococcus marinus\n                    MIT9301 and\n                    Synechococcus\n                    WH8102). From these cultures, we quantified 56 amine- and alcohol-containing exometabolites representing 11 compound classes which in sum comprised up to 23.4% of phytoplankton-excreted DOC. We estimated that these phytoplankton-derived exometabolites could supply up to 5% of the daily carbon quota of the dominant heterotrophic bacterium SAR11 in the surface ocean. Substantial variations in exometabolite identity and concentration across phytoplankton taxa underscore taxonomic diversity as a key driver in the supply and composition of labile DOC. This taxonomic variation predicts geographic and seasonal differences in the distribution of marine dissolved metabolites that underpin the cycling of labile DOC back to carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ). Overall, our work suggests that phytoplankton exometabolites are key chemical currencies that mediate significant carbon fluxes within the ocean’s carbon cycle.","tp":"海洋碳循环","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"海洋活性溶解有机碳（DOC）库是数千种分子的动态储库，在数天至数周内循环约地球初级生产的四分之一。浮游植物等微生物分泌的代谢物被快速消耗，浓度极低（皮摩尔至低纳摩尔级）。尽管寻找活性DOC来源的研究持续数十年，海洋浮游植物分泌代谢组仍缺乏充分表征，该研究对此进行了系统表征。"},{"t":"早期商业化钠离子电池的特性表征与性能评估","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003399?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"商业钠离子电池","dp":1,"as":"","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Characterisation and performance evaluation of early-generation commercial sodium-ion batteries"},{"t":"细胞外谷胱甘肽的分解代谢提供半胱氨酸以支持肿瘤","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10268-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Restricting amino acids from tumours is an emerging therapeutic strategy with substantial promise1. Although typically considered an intracellular antioxidant with tumour-promoting capabilities2, glutathione (GSH), as a tripeptide of cysteine, glutamate and glycine, can be catabolized to release amino acids. The extent to which GSH-derived amino acids are essential to cancers is unclear. Here we show that depletion of intracellular GSH does not alter tumour growth and extracellular GSH is highly abundant in the tumour microenvironment, highlighting the potential importance of GSH outside tumours. Supplementation with GSH rescues cancer cell survival and growth in cystine-deficient conditions, and this rescue depends on the catabolic activity of γ-glutamyltransferases. Finally, pharmacological targeting of the activity of γ-glutamyltransferases prevents the breakdown of circulating GSH, reduces tumour cysteine levels and slows tumour growth. Our findings indicate a non-canonical role for GSH in supporting tumours by acting as a reservoir of amino acids. Depriving tumours of extracellular GSH or inhibiting its breakdown is potentially a therapeutically tractable approach for patients with cancer. Furthermore, these findings change our view of GSH and how amino acids, including cysteine, are supplied to cells."},{"t":"数据基础设施建设能否缓解清洁能源错配？——基于中国省级数据的分析","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001813?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源数据化","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.5},"as":""},{"t":"CRISPR 增强小鼠体内的抗癌免疫细胞","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00857-6","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"基因抗癌法","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"as":""},{"t":"过去 300 万年大气中 CO2 和 CH4 水平大致稳定","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10032-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Ice core records from Antarctica document continuous variations in atmospheric greenhouse gases over the past 800,000 years, delineating the glacial–interglacial cycles that characterize the late Pleistocene epoch1,2,3. Studies of blue ice areas4 have extended these records back to 2 million years (Myr)5,6. The evolution of atmospheric greenhouse gases before this time thus remains uncertain. Here we use discontinuous ice core snapshots spanning 3.1–0.5 Myr ago (Ma) to show no marked change in mean methane (CH4) and a small decline of about 20 ppm in carbon dioxide (CO2) between 2.9 Ma and 1.2 Ma, followed by stable concentrations (±10 ppm) across the mid-Pleistocene Transition. Our findings are based on the shallow ice cores drilled in the Allan Hills Blue Ice Area (BIA), Antarctica7. The records are complicated by postdepositional processes and probably represent averages over glacial cycles weighted by climate-dependent differences in accumulation rates (which we assume to be constant). Samples aged 2.8–3.1 Myr, affected by respiration and corrected using stable carbon isotopes in CO2 (δ13C), yield mean atmospheric CO2 levels indistinguishable from the early Pleistocene (250 ± 10 ppm). Although palaeoclimate archives from Antarctic blue ice areas are complex, our records show that measurements of greenhouse gases in ice cores can be extended to the late Pliocene epoch, providing snapshots of Earth’s climate system over a time of global cooling7,8 and falling sea level9."},{"t":"进行接触性运动后，大脑的保护屏障多年仍处于渗漏状态","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00885-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"植物学之谜解开：植物如何制造重要的疟疾药物","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00891-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"量子自旋霍尔绝缘体中的双稳态超晶格开关","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10309-w","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","dp":1,"as":"量子自旋霍尔绝缘体中存在受拓扑保护的手性边缘态，是拓扑量子计算的重要平台。该研究在量子自旋霍尔绝缘体中实现了双稳态超晶格开关效应，利用材料的拓扑性质实现可逆的状态切换。与传统的铁电或铁磁双稳态不同，该机制源于拓扑电子结构，具有极低功耗和高稳定性潜力，为新型非易失性存储和拓扑电子器件开辟了新方向。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子自旋霍尔","kp":["材料体系[量子自旋霍尔]: 单层TaIrTe4","[开关机制]: 双晶格构型间双稳态超晶格切换"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Bistable superlattice switching in a quantum spin Hall insulator","b":"Bistable switching typically arises from ferroic orders, such as ferroelectricity and ferromagnetism, in which the bistable states are encoded in charge or spin degrees of freedom1,2. Here we report the observation of bistable superlattice switching in monolayer TaIrTe4, a dual quantum spin Hall insulator3,4,5. Switching occurs between two lattice configurations with sharply contrasting periodicities. In particular, in a pristine monolayer, we observe the spontaneous emergence of a long-period superlattice that can be programmed on and off in a non-volatile manner by electrostatic tuning of low-energy electronic states. This switching toggles the system between two structural configurations with unit cell areas differing by two orders of magnitude. Mechanistically, our results reveal two independent and distinct instabilities, one in the lattice and the other in the quantum spin Hall electrons. These instabilities are coupled, leading to electrostatic control of lattice configurations with non-volatile memory. This finding is enabled by combining linear and nonlinear transport measurements6,7,8,9,10,11,12,13, Raman spectroscopy and scanning tunnelling microscopy, which probe complementary aspects of the underlying orders. Notably, this non-volatile memory stabilizes a spontaneous superlattice with a periodicity on the few-nanometre scale that remains robust across a wide doping range, persists over days and survives above 70 K. Our preliminary data also show the emergence of new insulating states at fractional superlattice fillings, which can be switched on and off together with the superlattice."},{"t":"金鸡纳生物碱的生物合成","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10227-x","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cinchona alkaloids, which have been studied for more than 250 years, are plant-derived natural products that have collectively had a substantial impact in medicine and basic science1,2,3,4,5. Examples of cinchona alkaloids include quinine, a historically important antimalarial drug, and cinchonidine, a chiral catalyst widely used in process chemistry. However, it is still largely unknown how plants synthesize these well-known compounds. Here we report the discovery of genes responsible for the biosynthesis of the distinctive quinoline–quinuclidine scaffold of cinchona alkaloids. A combination of isotopic labelling, gene silencing, single-nucleus RNA sequencing and comparative transcriptomics revealed the involvement of several unexpected biosynthetic transformations. We also describe a previously unreported quaternary amine intermediate that is generated through an unusual enzymatic cyclization. We show that dihydroquini(di)none, dihydrocinchoni(di)none and cinchoni(di)none can be produced when these genes are heterologously expressed in Nicotiana benthamiana. Furthermore, we demonstrate that this N. benthamiana expression platform can convert non-native fluorinated and chlorinated tryptamine substrates into dihydrocinchoni(di)none analogues, which suggests that these biosynthetic enzymes can be leveraged to produce halogenated cinchona alkaloid derivatives. These discoveries uncover the long-standing mystery of how the cinchona alkaloid scaffold is biosynthesized and highlight prospects for access to these compounds through metabolic engineering approaches.","tp":"生物碱合成","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"金鸡纳生物碱（包括抗疟药奎宁和手性催化剂金鸡纳啶）已被研究逾250年，但植物如何合成这些化合物长期未知。该研究发现了负责金鸡纳生物碱生物合成的关键基因，揭示了其生物合成途径，为规模化生产和药物开发奠定了基础。"},{"t":"硫化氢的生物电子合成能够实现蛋白质修饰和细胞氧化还原的时空调节","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb3401?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Reactive signaling molecules such as hydrogen sulfide (H\n                    2\n                    S) regulate protein function and cellular redox balance, yet their instability makes precise delivery in biological systems challenging. Existing bioelectronic platforms primarily target stable molecules and often lack the ability to control transient molecules with spatiotemporal precision. We develop a bioelectronic platform that uses electrochemical reactions to directly generate and deliver H\n                    2\n                    S from biocompatible thiosulfate precursors near living cells. Through electrocatalyst screening, theoretical modeling, and product analysis, we demonstrate that biocompatible metal cathodes with low metal-hydrogen binding energy catalyze H\n                    2\n                    S production while suppressing side reactions. Programmable electronic inputs, including electrolysis time and applied voltage, quantitatively control distance- and time-dependent H\n                    2\n                    S release at the bioelectronic interface while maintaining physiological compatibility. This spatiotemporally modulated H\n                    2\n                    S synthesis enables on-demand activation of ion channels through protein sulfhydration and restoration of intracellular redox balance under oxidative stress. Our platform broadens the functional scope of bioelectronics and establishes electrosynthesis as a modality for dynamic communication between electronics and biology.","tp":"生物电子学","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"硫化氢（H2S）等活性信号分子可调节蛋白质功能和细胞氧化还原平衡，但其不稳定性使精确递送极具挑战。该研究开发了一种生物电子平台，利用电化学反应直接生成并递送H2S，实现了对蛋白质修饰和细胞氧化还原状态的时空精确调控，突破了现有平台难以控制瞬态分子的局限。","aip":1},{"t":"苯甲腈基电解液更紧密聚集溶剂化结构实现超长循环与高倍率4.5V运行","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72819?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"腈基高压电解液","kp":["[电解液]: 苯甲腈基电解液BNE","[工作电压]: 4.5V","[溶剂化结构]: 更紧密聚集溶剂化"],"as":"腈基电解液对高压正极具有优异的氧化稳定性，但在锂金属负极侧易被还原，限制了其应用。该研究设计苯甲腈基电解液，通过更紧密的聚集体溶剂化结构抑制还原分解，同时保持高压兼容性，为高能量密度锂金属电池的电解液工程提供了新思路。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Benzonitrile‐Based Electrolyte with Tighter Aggregate Solvation Structure Enables Ultralong Cycling and High‐Rate 4.5 V ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Nitrile‐based electrolytes offer exceptional oxidative stability for high‐voltage cathodes but suffer from reductive instability at lithium metal anodes (LMAs) and poor rate capability. Herein, we report a molecular engineering strategy to overcome these limitations by introducing a benzonitrile‐based electrolyte (BNE) to realize long‐cycling, high‐voltage, and high‐rate LMBs. We leverage the unique molecular features of benzonitrile (BN), where the cyano groups dynamically coordinate lithium ions (Li\n                    +\n                    ), the electron‐deficient phenyl groups interact weakly with anions, and crucially, the bulky BN molecules compress the Li\n                    +\n                    solvation sheath through a spatial site‐blocking effect. The steric demand imposed by BN during Li\n                    +\n                    solvation, coupled with its ability to simultaneously coordinate Li\n                    +\n                    and interact with anions, induces a tighter aggregate (t‐AGG) solvation structure, which is confirmed by various spectroscopic techniques and molecular dynamics simulations. Mechanistically, the t‐AGG solvation structure eliminates most free BN molecules for enhanced stability at LMAs, accelerates Li\n                    +\n                    transport kinetics via increased hopping frequency, and promotes an anion‐derived solid‐electrolyte interphase. Consequently, BNE enables a 4.5 V NCM811||Li cell to achieve 500 cycles with 80% capacity retention at 5C, setting a benchmark for nitrile‐based LMBs. This work provides fundamental insights for designing high‐performance nitrile‐based electrolytes via precise solvation structure engineering for LMBs."},{"t":"作者更正：通过ScO6八面体网络缓解立方钙钛矿氧化物中的质子俘获","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02580-z","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿燃料电池","as":"","sc":1.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":1.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"Author Correction: Mitigating proton trapping in cubic perovskite oxides via ScO6 octahedral networks"},{"t":"作者更正：肌萎缩侧索硬化症中 C9orf72 蛋白的自身免疫反应","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10388-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"作者更正：用于高鲁棒性神经形态假体的离子储备池系统","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02579-6","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"Nature Materials","as":"","tg":"研究论文","tp":"离子神经形态器件","kp":["[器件]: 离子电子储库用于鲁棒神经形态假体"],"sc":2.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.5,"r":2.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Author Correction: An iontronic reservoir for highly robust neuromorphic prosthesis"},{"t":"固体中的原子级物理不可克隆函数","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed3987?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"研究提出在固态材料中实现原子尺度物理不可克隆函数（PUF）的新思路。利用晶格缺陷、掺杂分布等原子级随机特征生成唯一硬件指纹，满足物联网与信息安全时代对硬件安全认证的迫切需求。相比传统电路PUF，原子级PUF具备更高的不可预测性与抗逆向工程能力，为下一代安全芯片提供物理安全根基。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"物理不可克隆函数","kp":["[技术]: 原子级物理不可克隆函数(PUF)","[挑战]: 确定性纳米制造日益挑战不可克隆性"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Atomic-scale physical unclonable functions in solids","b":"The rapid development of the Internet of Things and the digital information era has intensified the demand for secure hardware and information systems. Physical unclonable functions (PUFs) provide a hardware-based approach by exploiting fabrication-induced randomness to generate unique, unclonable labels. Concurrently, advances in deterministic nanofabrication increasingly challenge the unclonability of conventional micro- and nanoscale PUFs, motivating the exploration of more fundamental sources of physical randomness. Here, we demonstrate an atomic-scale PUF architecture that leverages intrinsic randomness in solids through lattice and defect engineering. The resulting PUFs exhibit both three-dimensional spatial variability and atomic-scale configurational complexity, yielding extraordinary encoding space and uniqueness. For a characteristic feature size of 1 nanometer, the Shannon entropy is estimated at 17.49, underscoring the encoding capacity. Moreover, the embedded structure ensures intrinsic unclonability and robustness against environmental perturbations. These results establish atomic-scale PUFs as a fundamentally secure and scalable platform for next-generation hardware and information security."},{"t":"来自玻璃文化史的考古学启发：历史记述、轶事与确凿事实对现代科学的挑战","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72670?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/非金属/玻璃","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"玻璃材料史","as":"该视角文章从玻璃的文化历史出发，倡导以考古学灵感驱动新材料研发。回顾了人类材料发展史中玻璃的关键角色——从古代器皿到光学应用，提出从历史文献、轶事与工艺经验中汲取启发，推动功能性玻璃与智能材料的创新设计，为材料科学提供了跨学科的人文驱动创新范式。","sc":2.1,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":1.5,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"Archeo‐Inspiration from the Cultural History of Glass: Historic Accounts, Anecdotes and Hard Facts as Challenges to Mode","b":"Archaeo-Inspired Materials The history of mankind is the history of materials. In their Perspective (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202512937), Bastian E. Rapp and co-workers elucidate the historical and culture significance of one of mankind's very first high-performance materials: glass. Thes propose Archeo-inspiration as a framework for the future development of this material drawing inspiration from historical and cultural contexts to template and guide future research."},{"t":"应用机器学习来识别美国记录为其他死因的未被识别的 COVID-19 死亡","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef5697?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The actual number of US deaths caused by severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 infection has been investigated and debated since the start of the COVID-19 pandemic. Here, we use machine learning trained on US death certificates from March 2020 to December 2021 to predict 155,536 (95% uncertainty interval: 150,062 to 161,112) unrecognized COVID-19 deaths. This indicates that 19% more COVID-19 deaths occurred in the US than officially reported. Predicted unrecognized COVID-19 deaths occurred disproportionately among decedents with less than a high school education; decedents identified as Hispanic, American Indian, Alaska Native, Asian, and/or Black; counties with lower household incomes and worse preexisting health; and counties in the South. These findings suggest that the US death investigation system undercounted COVID-19 deaths unevenly, hiding the true extent of inequities.","tp":"AI判死因","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":7.0,"r":3.5,"d":8.0,"t":4.0},"as":"该研究利用机器学习分析2020年3月至2021年12月美国死亡证明数据，预测出155,536例未被识别的COVID-19死亡病例（95%不确定区间：150,062-161,112）。这表明美国实际COVID-19死亡人数比官方报告高出约19%，未被识别的死亡集中在特定区域和人群。"},{"t":"液态空气储能系统液化过程分析：两相流概念化设计与评估","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003533?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/其它储能技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液态空气储能","as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Analysis of liquefaction processes for liquid air energy storage systems: Conceptualization and evaluation of two-phase ","cl":"c15d70d9","cln":"液态空气储能","cp":1},{"t":"细菌细胞膜内的一种酶在进入病毒 DNA 时将其切碎","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00732-4","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"细菌防御酶","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":""},{"t":"AlphaFold数据库再升级：AI系统现已支持蛋白质配对预测","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00787-3","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"蛋白结构预测","kp":["[数据规模]: 2亿蛋白质结构预测","[新增内容]: 同源二聚体"],"as":"DeepMind的AlphaFold数据库迎来重大升级，覆盖2亿蛋白质结构预测的基础上新增了同源二聚体（homodimers）等蛋白质配对结构信息。这意味着预测不再局限于单个蛋白质链，而是扩展到蛋白质-蛋白质相互作用界面，显著提升了生物学相关性。此举对药物设计、蛋白质工程和基础结构生物学研究具有重要意义，标志着AI驱动的结构预测从单体走向复合体的关键跨越。","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"AlphaFold database hits ‘next level’: the AI system now includes protein pairing","b":"The database of 200 million protein-structure predictions now includes homodimers, adding new biological relevance. The database of 200 million protein-structure predictions now includes homodimers, adding new biological relevance."},{"t":"结构模拟横向热电效应：全溶液法制备可扩展可穿戴有机热电器件","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea9094?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机热电材料","kp":["[架构]: 伪横向热电器件pT-TEG","[工艺]: 全溶液加工","[基底]: 弹性基底双热导率"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了一种全溶液加工（all-solution-processed）策略来制备可扩展、可穿戴的有机薄膜热电发电机（TEGs）。有机TEGs因其柔性和可穿戴能量采集潜力备受关注，但规模化制备一直是瓶颈。通过结构工程优化器件架构，研究团队在保持热电转换效率的同时实现了可印刷、低成本的大面积制备工艺，为自供电可穿戴电子和物联网传感节点的实用化推进了关键一步。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"All-solution-processed scalable and wearable organic thermoelectrics by structurally mimicking transverse thermoelectric","b":"Organic thin-film thermoelectric generators (TEGs) hold great promise as flexible and wearable energy harvesters. However, their broader application is hindered by the difficulty of establishing a temperature gradient within the thin film when using planar heat sources. Here, we introduce pseudo-transverse TEGs (pT-TEGs), an architecture employing an elastic substrate with two thermal conductivities, enabling the orthogonal conversion of longitudinal heat flux into lateral thermovoltage by mimicking the transverse thermoelectric effect. This design circumvents the limitations of conventional thin-film TEGs, such as the need for three-dimensional deformation to form a temperature gradient, allowing efficient thermal energy harvesting from planar heat sources while preserving a two-dimensional form factor. Furthermore, the fully solution-processed and modular pT-TEGs exhibit excellent mechanical flexibility and high scalability. We believe that this approach offers a practical platform for the realization of genuine two-dimensional TEGs and will contribute to the advancement of flexible and wearable energy harvesting technologies."},{"t":"烷氧基锍盐解锁了用于交叉偶联的新型芳基锍盐","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525298?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Aryl sulfonium salts are indispensable partners in cross‐coupling reactions, allowing access to aryl metal or aryl radical intermediates, and offering advantages over aryl halides or other pseudohalides. Routes to aryl sulfonium salts are limited; the standard approach involves activation of arenes using a sulfoxide‐derived electrophile. While the activation of non‐prefunctionalized arene partners is attractive, the method is limited to arenes that are sufficiently electron‐rich to engage with sulfur electrophiles and is often dominated by\n                    para\n                    ‐selectivity when monosubstituted benzenes are used. This limited access to aryl sulfonium salts leads to biased substrate scopes and restrictions on accessible chemical space. We describe a route to otherwise hard‐to‐access (hetero)aryl sulfonium salts that exploits bench‐stable alkoxysulfonium salts in combination with the well‐established magnesiation of readily available aryl bromides. The approach allows access to aryl sulfonium salts bearing electron‐deficient aryl and heteroaryl rings, or electron‐rich systems in which the sulfonium motif resides at an alternative position on the ring to that delivered by electrophilic arene sulfenylation. To illustrate their value, the new sulfonium salts have been used to expand the scope of a selection of coupling processes.","tp":"芳基锍偶联","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"芳基锍盐是交叉偶联反应中的重要伙伴，可生成芳基金属或芳基自由基中间体，相比芳基卤化物具有优势。但传统合成路线有限，标准方法需用亚砜衍生亲电试剂活化芳烃且局限于预官能化底物。该研究提出烷氧基锍盐策略，解锁了新型芳基锍盐的合成路径，拓展了交叉偶联的底物范围。"},{"t":"社会驱动运动中的对准相变","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz6890?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Collective fs movement is a hallmark of complex systems, exhibiting emergent order across contexts from pedestrian flows to biological collectives. In high-speed, directional settings, alignment ensures efficient navigation, whereas in low-speed, undirectional, socially engaged contexts, alignment arises from interpersonal interaction rather than locomotion goals. Using high-resolution spatial and orientation data from preschool classrooms, we uncover a sharp distance-dependent transition in pairwise alignment that reflects a spontaneous symmetry breaking between behavioral phases: Below a threshold of ~0.65 meters, side-by-side orientations dominate, while face-to-face orientations prevail at larger distances. This transition stems from a distance-dependent competition among three alignment mechanisms: parallelization, opposition, and reciprocation, whose interplay generates a bifurcation structure in the effective interaction potential. Fourier decomposition of orientation distributions reveals these mechanisms, enabling a minimal pseudopotential model that captures the transition as a nonequilibrium phase change. Monte Carlo simulations using inferred interaction terms reproduce empirical patterns, establishing a quantitative framework for social alignment with implications for biological collectives and artificial swarms."},{"t":"人人可负担的出行：为何我们需要更小更便宜的电动汽车","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00779-3","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Nature","as":"","tg":"观点评论","tp":"小型电动汽车","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Affordable mobility for all: why we need smaller, cheaper electric vehicles"},{"t":"氧化物接触起电中的外来碳破坏对称性","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10088-w","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Insulating oxides are among the most abundant solid materials in the universe1,2,3. Of the many ways in which they influence natural phenomena, perhaps the most consequential is their capacity to transfer electrical charge during contact4,5,6,7,8,9,10—which occurs even between samples of the same oxide—yet the symmetry-breaking parameter that causes this remains unidentified11,12. Here we show that adventitious carbonaceous molecules adsorbed from the environment are the symmetry-breaking factor in same-material oxide contact electrification (CE). We use acoustic levitation to measure charge exchange between a sphere and a plate composed of identical amorphous silicon dioxide (SiO2). Although charging polarity is random for co-prepared samples, we control it with baking or plasma treatment. Observing the charge-exchange relaxation afterwards, we see dynamics over a timescale of hours and connect this directly to the presence of adventitious carbon with time-of-flight mass spectrometry, low-energy ion scattering and infrared spectroscopy. Going further, we confirm that adventitious carbon can even determine charge exchange among different oxides. Our results identify the symmetry-breaking parameter that causes insulating oxides to exchange charge in settings ranging from desert sands4 to volcanic plumes5,6, while simultaneously highlighting an overlooked factor in CE more broadly.","tp":"氧化物起电","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"as":"绝缘氧化物是宇宙中最丰富的固体材料之一，其在接触时转移电荷的能力影响众多自然现象——即使在同种氧化物之间也会发生。该研究发现，从环境中吸附的外来碳质分子是破坏对称性、引发电荷转移的关键因素，解决了这一长期未解的物理化学之谜。"},{"t":"MXene-聚合物复合材料在尖端超级电容器与电磁屏蔽领域的最新进展","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003119?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"MXene聚合物超容屏蔽","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Advances in MXene-Polymer Composites for Cutting-edge Supercapacitor and EMI Shielding Applications"},{"t":"考虑区域Dunkelflaute（风光低迷）事件的欧洲电力系统自适应鲁棒优化规划","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003235?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电网鲁棒优化","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Adaptive robust optimization for European electricity system planning considering regional Dunkelflaute events"},{"t":"哺乳动物新皮质基因调控网络的适应性进化","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10226-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Mammals have evolved a more complex brain, exemplified by the transformation of the single-layer dorsal cortex of excitatory projection neurons (ExNs) in ancestors into a multilayered cerebral neocortex1,2,3,4 enriched with diverse intratelencephalic and extratelencephalic ExN subtypes5,6,7, thereby establishing specialized projection systems that enhance brain connectivity and functionality5,6,7,8. This is in contrast to modern reptiles and birds with single-layered or pseudolayered columnar organization of ExNs4,9,10,11,12. However, the mechanisms underlying these mammalian-specific adaptations remain elusive. By comparing the landscape of gene expression and putative cis-regulatory elements (CREs) in mouse ExN subtypes and through cross-species examination, we identified mammalian-specific CREs, including a subset bound by the transcription factor ZBTB18 (also RP58, ZFP238 or ZNF238) and associated with genes defining intratelencephalic and extratelencephalic subtypes and connectivity, which have been implicated in intellectual disability and autism. Deletion of Zbtb18 in mouse ExNs dysregulated target gene expression, reduced molecular diversity, diminished cortico-spinal and callosal projections and increased intrahemispheric cortico-cortical association projections to the prefrontal cortex, thereby resembling non-mammalian brain. ZBTB18 binding motifs are highly enriched in callosally projecting intratelencephalic-biased putative CREs and show higher conservation specifically in mammals. This study uncovers critical components and mammalian-specific evolutionary adaptations within a regulatory node essential for neocortical ExN identity and connectivity."},{"t":"ATP13A2 通过调节线粒体 hom 抑制巨噬细胞 NLRP3 炎性体激活以抑制神经退行性变","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534066123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Neuro-immune crosstalk is increasingly recognized in Parkinson’s disease (PD), and ATP13A2 is well known for its neuroprotective role. However, it remains unclear whether\n                    ATP13A2\n                    mutations carried by PD patients contribute to immune dysfunction that exacerbates disease progression. Here, we systematically demonstrate that many\n                    ATP13A2\n                    mutations result in a loss-of-expression phenotype. ATP13A2 is highly expressed in macrophages. Myeloid ATP13A2 deficiency causes uncontrolled NLRP3 inflammasome activation driven by lysosomal alkalization and subsequent disrupted mitochondrial homeostasis, rendering mice susceptible to a PD-like phenotype. PD-linked\n                    ATP13A2\n                    loss-of-expression mutants fail to restore the ATP13A2 levels required to suppress NLRP3 hyperactivation in ATP13A2-depleted human THP-1 monocytes. Macrophages from a PD patient carrying the\n                    ATP13A2\n                    loss-of-expression L927P mutation exhibit excessive NLRP3 activation due to lysosomal-mitochondrial dysfunction. Our findings provide insight into PD pathogenesis, emphasizing genetic factor-driven dysregulated macrophage NLRP3 activation, particularly in\n                    ATP13A2\n                    loss-of-expression mutation cases."},{"t":"人工智能将绘制未来气候灾难的风险图","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00835-y","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI气候图","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":5.5},"as":""},{"t":"对充分混合的温室气体的辐射强迫的强烈约束","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10289-x","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Radiative forcing from well-mixed greenhouse gases (WMGHGs) is a main driver of Earth’s energy imbalance and global surface climate change1,2. It remains difficult to constrain, largely because its longwave (LW) instantaneous radiative forcing (IRF) component depends on atmospheric state and is subject to radiative parameterization error3,4,5,6,7. The IRF measures the immediate change in radiative fluxes at the tropopause8,9,10 caused by perturbations in WMGHG concentrations. Here we show that increasing WMGHG concentrations have enhanced LW IRF by 3.69 ± 0.07 W m−2 (95% confidence interval) since 1850. We first use global line-by-line radiative transfer simulations to provide a global benchmark of LW IRF for the main WMGHGs under realistic, all-sky conditions. We then identify a robust linear relationship between LW IRF and outgoing longwave radiation (OLR), enabling state-dependent LW IRF to be directly inferred from regressions against satellite-observed OLR. Furthermore, LW IRF explains 91% of the inter-model spread in effective radiative forcing (ERF, which includes rapid atmospheric adjustments beyond the IRF) for CO2 (ref. 11) across Earth system models. Benchmarking model-simulated IRF using the regression technique reveals that most discrepancies originate from radiation parameterizations and correcting LW IRF biases would reduce uncertainty in CO2 ERF by 50%. Our results establish a simple and robust framework for quantifying state-dependent radiative forcing of WMGHGs, providing an observation-informed pathway for future climate assessments.","tp":"温室辐射力","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"充分混合温室气体的辐射强迫是地球能量失衡和全球气候变化的主要驱动力。其长波瞬时辐射强迫分量依赖于大气状态且受辐射参数化误差影响，难以精确约束。该研究提出了对温室气体辐射强迫的强约束方法，提升了气候模型预测的可靠性。"},{"t":"专注教学的人口门槛","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517041123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Teachers hold a prominent place in modern societies, particularly where education is compulsory and widely institutionalized. This ubiquity obscures an underlying puzzle: Why do societies assign some individuals solely to the instruction of others? This question is especially enigmatic for dedicated teachers, who invest their labor in cultivating others’ skills but do not themselves participate in the productive activities for which their students are being trained. To address this question, we develop a simple, mathematically tractable model of teaching and learning in a population that shares a common productive aim. We identify a tradeoff between the size of the workforce and its collective level of expertise; and we analyze the optimal proportion of a population that should serve as teachers, across diverse scenarios. We find that a population must exceed a critical size before it is beneficial to allocate anyone as a dedicated teacher at all. Subsequently, the peak demand for teachers is achieved at an intermediate population size and never exceeds one half of the population. For more complicated tasks, our analysis predicts the optimal allocation of teachers to instruction across different levels of expertise. Although our model is not evolutionary per se, this population-level account lays a foundation for understanding the adaptive advantage of dedicated teachers in both human and nonhuman populations."},{"t":"受自然启发的离子阱：实现大规模离子并行操控","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec7048?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"并行离子阱","kp":["[器件]: MultiQ-IT离子阱","[特性]: 大规模并行质谱分析","[灵感来源]: 核质运输扩散"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出了一种受自然界启发的离子阱结构，可在质谱分析中实现大规模离子的并行操控。并行化已在计算和DNA测序领域带来革命性突破，但在质谱领域长期未被充分利用。新型离子阱通过仿生设计，使大量离子被同时捕获和独立操控，有望显著提升质谱分析的通量和效率。这一技术对蛋白质组学、代谢组学等需要高通量分析的应用场景具有广阔前景。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A nature-inspired ion trap for parallel manipulation of ions on a massive scale","b":"Parallelization has revolutionized computing and DNA sequencing but remains largely unexploited in mass spectrometry (MS), which typically analyzes ions sequentially. Inspired by nuclear cytoplasmic transport, where diffusion governs transport to multiple gated channels (nuclear pore complexes), we introduce an ion trap (MultiQ-IT) that enables massively parallel MS. The device comprises a cubic array of small quadrupoles forming multiple ion entry and exit ports, allowing &gt;10\n                    9\n                    ions to be cooled, confined, and manipulated simultaneously. This architecture enables selective depletion of singly charged ions, thereby enhancing signal-to-noise ratios and expanding the effective dynamic range. The trap also functions as a parallel ion splitter, transmitting ions into multiple mass/charge ratio–specific beams. We demonstrate scalable ion throughput, real-time charge discrimination, and parallel beam separation, suggesting a path toward truly parallel MS. Our results establish a conceptual framework for next-generation, high-throughput proteomic and metabolomic analyses."},{"t":"基因编辑方法在体内产生免疫治疗性 CAR T 细胞","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00634-5","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"基因CART","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":""},{"t":"一种通用化学预钾化策略：显著提升多晶型MnO₂正极的储锌性能","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3957939?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MnO₂正极预钾化","kp":["预插层离子[MnO2正极]: K+","策略[预钾化]: 常温化学法避开水热/煅烧","应用[锌电池]: 水系Zn-MnO2"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"提出了一种通用化学预钾化策略，用于提升多晶型MnO2正极的锌离子存储性能。离子预嵌入工程（特别是大半径K+阳离子）是克服MnO2晶格中Zn2+缓慢扩散的关键手段。该方法通过预先将K+嵌入MnO2层间，撑大层间距并稳定晶体结构，显著改善了锌离子电池正极的倍率性能和循环稳定性，为水系锌电池正极材料设计提供了普适性方案。","ot":"A General Chemical Prepotassiation Strategy for Boosting the Zn‐Storage Performance of Polymorphic MnO2 Cathodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ion pre‐intercalation engineering, particularly using large‐radius K\n                    +\n                    cations, is pivotal to overcome the sluggish Zn\n                    2+\n                    diffusion kinetics and severe structural instability issues that limit MnO\n                    2\n                    cathodes for AZIBs. However, conventional pre‐intercalation methods typically rely on hydrothermal or calcination under harsh high‐temperature/pressure conditions, which compromise scalability, phase purity, and stoichiometric control. Herein, we propose a mild chemical prepotassiation strategy, that employs 9‐fluorenone potassium (FL‐K) as a highly reactive K\n                    +\n                    /e\n                    −\n                    donor, to enable rapid and quantitative K\n                    +\n                    insertion into diverse MnO\n                    2\n                    polymorphs (\n                    α\n                    ‐,\n                    γ\n                    ‐, and\n                    δ\n                    ‐phases) in just 30 s under ambient conditions. The pre‐intercalated K\n                    +\n                    ions act as robust structural pillars that simultaneously enlarge the tunnel/interlayer spacing and enhance electronic conductivity, thereby dramatically accelerating Zn\n                    2+\n                    transport kinetics and reinforcing the MnO\n                    2\n                    framework stability. Consequently, the optimized\n                    α\n                    ‐K\n                    0.05\n                    MnO\n                    2\n                    cathode delivers superior rate capability (97.5 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 10C) and cycling durability (64.5% retention after 300 cycles at 3C), far surpassing pristine\n                    α\n                    ‐MnO\n                    2\n                    (merely 25.6 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    and 38.5% retention). This efficient strategy, characterized by near‐100% atomic utilization and full reagent recyclability, establishes a sustainable and universal prepotassiation protocol for engineering high‐performance intercalation‐type electrode materials."},{"t":"通过可逆C–H采样实现1,2-硼基/氢易位反应","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00027-6?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硼基迁移重排","kp":["[反应]: 可逆C-H采样1,2-硼氢转位","[特点]: 无导向基无辅助基"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"实现了通过可逆C–H采样进行硼基/氢的1,2-迁移重排反应。硼酸酯基团是有机合成中的多功能官能团，但将已有的硼基从分子中一个位置直接迁移到另一位置一直极具挑战。该研究利用可逆C–H活化循环实现硼基的位点选择性迁移，为远端C–H硼化提供了全新策略，大幅拓展了有机硼化学的合成工具箱。","ot":"1,2-Boryl/hydrogen transposition via reversible C–H sampling","b":"Boryls serve as versatile synthetic handles in organic chemistry, yet the direct repositioning of an existing boryl group along a carbon backbone remains a valuable and underexplored transformation. This work achieves direct 1,2-boryl/hydrogen transposition in alkyl boronic esters through a reversible C–H sampling strategy requiring no directing groups, auxiliaries, or other functional handles. By integrating on-demand boryl repositioning with boryl’s established synthetic versatility, this method further offers modular access to valuable building blocks whose preparation is conventionally challenging."},{"t":"稳定氮化碳光电阳极用于聚光下自驱动醇重整耦合CO₂还原","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20624","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电催化CO2还原","kp":["光阳极[PEC醇重整]: 氰胺功能化氮化碳","工作条件[无辅助CO₂还原耦合]: 聚光太阳光","关键因素[稳定性]: 光强度与电化学电位"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"实现了氮化碳光阳极在浓缩太阳光下的稳定运行，耦合醇重整与CO2还原反应。氮化碳是低成本可规模化有机半导体，在光电化学（PEC）器件中前景广阔，但光阳极稳定性不足限制了应用。该研究通过界面工程稳定氮化碳光阳极，在无外加偏压条件下同时驱动醇氧化和CO2还原，提升了太阳光到化学能的转化效率。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Stabilizing Carbon Nitride Photoanodes for Unassisted Alcohol Reforming Coupled to CO2 Reduction under Concentrated Sunlight","b":"Carbon nitride is a scalable and low-cost organic semiconductor with promise for use in photoelectrochemical (PEC) devices, but its poor stability limits its practical use. This study establishes the importance of light intensity and applied electrochemical potential on the stability of cyanamide-functionalized carbon nitride photoanodes used for waste-derived alcohol oxidation. Operating under concentrated sunlight (3 suns) and low bias (<0.2 V vs reversible hydrogen electrode, RHE) enabled over 20 h of continuous operation. In situ spectroscopy and impedance analysis linked carbon nitride degradation at higher potential (>0.4 V vs RHE) to irreversible morphological changes and self-oxidation, exacerbated by conductivity loss. These insights enabled the stabilization of carbon nitride photoelectrodes and paved the way for the development of a standalone PEC device with an integrated thermoelectric unit to convert heat into an additional internal bias-voltage, where carbon nitride efficiently drives alcohol oxidation coupled to CO2-to-CO conversion for over 70 h. This work sets a benchmark for carbon nitride stability and PEC deployment, and highlights the need to revisit PEC testing protocols to unlock the full potential of emerging semiconductors.","aip":1},{"t":"NH₃介导的反应性捕集与转化：将烟气CO₂吸收与NH₄HCO₃电解产CO集成","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04265","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2捕集转化","kp":["[反应捕获]: NH₃介导CO₂吸收-电解耦合","[产物]: 碳酸氢铵电解产CO"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] NH3-Mediated Reactive Capture and Conversion: Integrating CO2 Absorption from Flue Gas with CO Production via NH4HCO3 Electrolysis"},{"t":"混合镧系金属有机框架用于近红外I区生物成像与近红外III区四光子上转换","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00409","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镧系MOF上转换","kp":["镧系组成[MOF上转换]: Yb³⁺、Tb³⁺、Eu³⁺","[上转换类型]: NIR-III窗口四光子上转换","[成像窗口]: NIR-I生物成像"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"设计了混合镧系金属有机框架，实现了近红外一区生物成像与近红外三区四光子上转换发光。镧系MOF为上转换发光提供了结构精确可调的平台。通过混合不同镧系离子并优化MOF能量传递网络，该材料实现了高效的多光子上转换，发射波长延伸至近红外三区，兼具深层组织成像能力和高空间分辨率，为生物医学成像和多光子光学应用开辟了新途径。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Mixed-Lanthanide Metal–Organic Frameworks for Near-Infrared-I Bioimaging and Near-Infrared-III Four-Photon Upconversion","b":"Lanthanide-based metal-organic frameworks (Ln-MOFs) provide a structurally precise platform for upconversion luminescence engineering, yet practical applications are limited by insufficient structural stability, restricted color tunability, and the lack of excitation in the NIR-III window. Here, we report a MOF incorporating mixed-lanthanide Yb3+, Tb3+, and Eu3+ ions that addresses these challenges. The optically transparent and periodic framework enforces a uniform spatial distribution of lanthanide centers and establishes stepwise interionic energy transfer pathways, while ether-containing organic linkers enhance photo and thermal stability. Under NIR-I (980 nm) excitation, the Ln-MOFs exhibit tunable multicolor upconversion emission with high hydrolytic stability and biocompatibility, enabling reliable in vivo imaging in zebrafish models. Remarkably, under NIR-III (1960 nm) excitation, a four-photon upconversion process is observed for the first time in Ln-MOFs. Together, these results expand the excitation landscape of Ln-MOFs from NIR-I to NIR-III and confirm the potential of structurally programmable Ln-MOFs for bioimaging and nonlinear photonic applications."},{"t":"解析硝基芳烃的分步N–O活化：铁-亚硝基芳烃中间体的电子结构与反应性","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19714","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁催化N-O活化","kp":["催化体系[N-O键活化]: 铁-亚硝基芳烃中间体","反应路径[硝基还原]: 顺序N-O键断裂"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究揭示了铁催化剂活化硝基芳烃N-O键的分步机制。通过电子结构分析与反应性表征，鉴定出铁-亚硝基芳烃中间体的形成路径，阐明NOx底物及有机硝基官能团还原转化中N-O键断裂的逐级活化过程。该工作为理解铁介导的硝基还原催化循环提供了关键实验和理论证据，对开发高效、选择性的含氮化合物催化转化体系具有重要意义，有望推动绿色合成含胺药物中间体的新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Deciphering the Stepwise N–O Activation of Nitroarenes: Electronic Structure and Reactivity of Iron-Nitrosoarene Intermediates","b":"N-O bond activation in reductive transformation of both NOx- and organic substrates with nitro functional groups has garnered significant interest because of its significance in both biological systems and synthetic chemistry. The reductive transformation of nitro groups involves sequential N-O bond cleavages, with nitrosoarenes (ArNO) as key yet often elusive intermediates. While iron is a biologically and synthetically relevant metal for such processes, the mechanistic understanding, particularly the role of multinuclear cooperation, remains underdeveloped. Herein, we report that a dinuclear iron N-heterocyclic carbene (NHC) complex, Fe2-MeCN, enables the sequential N-O bond activation of nitrobenzene, leading to the isolation and detailed characterization of two iron-nitrosoarene intermediates, Fe2-PhNO and Fe2-(PhNO)2. Spectroscopic and crystallographic studies, complemented by DFT calculations, identified strong charge-transfer interactions that polarize the N-O moiety. This electronic structure underpins a diverse suite of N-O activation pathways, including Lewis acid-induced electron transfer, hydride reduction, proton-coupled electron transfer (PCET), and oxygen atom transfer. The stoichiometric reactivity reveals that the nucleophilic oxygen of the coordinated ArNO can be efficiently attacked by electrophiles, while reactions with nucleophiles require more forcing conditions. Finally, Fe2-MeCN functions as a competent catalyst for the reduction of nitroarenes to anilines and facilitates unprecedented iron-mediated heterocyclizations, underscoring the critical role of bimetallic cooperativity in this multifunctional reactivity."},{"t":"限域催化实现高达0.6 M浓度下大环化反应：糖苷大环单体的选择性生成","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c03730","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"限域催化大环化","kp":["反应浓度[大环化]: 高达0.6 M","催化策略[糖苷大环]: 限制催化选择性形成单/二聚体"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究利用限域催化策略实现了糖苷大环化合物的高效合成，反应浓度高达0.6 M，远超传统大环化反应的常规稀释条件。通过精确调控催化空腔的限域效应，选择性生成单环和二环糖苷大环产物，有效抑制低聚副反应。大环天然产物在生物活性分子中广泛存在，其构象刚性与预组织特性赋予其优异的靶点结合能力。该限域催化方法有望成为合成复杂大环药物分子和糖类功能材料的通用平台。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Confinement Catalysis Enables Macrocyclization at Up to 0.6 M: Selective Formation of Mono- and Dimeric Glycosidic Macrocycles","b":"Macrocyclic compounds are widespread in nature and frequently found among bioactive natural products. Their conformational preorganization allows them to effectively engage large binding surfaces, making them valuable in drug discovery, especially for modulating protein-protein interactions. Consequently, macrocyclization strategies have received significant attention; however, they still typically rely on high-dilution conditions (0.10-10 mM) to favor intramolecular ring closure over intermolecular oligomerization. Here, we report a solution to this long-standing challenge using a catalytic confined-space approach that operates efficiently even at the substrate solubility limit (600 mM), thereby eliminating the need for high-dilution conditions. The capsular catalyst enables the high-yielding formation of medium- and large-sized glycosidic macrocycles with excellent β-selectivity. Moreover, the method addresses a second persistent challenge in macrocyclization: the selective formation of macrocyclic dimers. Whereas such dimers are inaccessible under traditional high-dilution conditions, they are obtained in high yields when two substrates fit into the capsule's cavity, again at high substrate concentrations and with excellent β,β-selectivity. Control experiments establish the indispensability of the capsule as conventional conditions afford substantially lower yields and predominantly α-selectivity. The method's utility is further demonstrated in the selective synthesis of the dimeric core structure of glucolipsin A and cycloviracin B1. This work establishes confinement catalysis as a powerful tool to overcome key limitations in macrocyclization chemistry."},{"t":"手性联萘二甲基η⁶-苯配体：设计、合成及其在钌催化不对称C–H活化中的应用","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02447","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性钌催化剂","kp":["配体[不对称C-H活化]: 手性联萘基二甲基η6-苯配体","催化体系[不对称C-H活化]: 钌催化"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究设计并合成了手性联萘二甲基η6-苯配体，将其应用于钌催化的不对称C-H键活化反应。手性η6-苯配体通过芳环与金属中心的π配位作用实现手性诱导，克服了该领域配体设计困难、对映选择性难以控制的核心挑战。联萘骨架提供轴手性，甲基取代基精细调控电子效应与空间构型。该方法在不对称C-H官能化中展现出优异的对映选择性，为手性药物分子和天然产物的高效不对称合成提供了新工具。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Chiral Binaphthyldimethyl η6-Benzene Ligands: Design, Synthesis, and Application in Ruthenium-Catalyzed Asymmetric C–H Activation","b":"Asymmetric catalysis enabled by a chiral η6-benzene (Ben) metal catalyst is an emerging field with the core challenge lying in the development of effective chiral Ben ligands. This work reports the design and synthesis of a novel class of chiral Ben ligands, namely, binaphthyldimethyl Ben ligands. In this case, a chiral binaphthyl scaffold is linked via a methylene spacer to a benzene ring that serves as the metal-coordination site. Crucially, the Ben ligands coordinate to ruthenium (Ru) in a site-specific manner despite possessing multiple potential η6-benzene binding sites, hence enabling the successful preparation of the targeted chiral BenRuII catalysts. Significantly outperforming our earlier chiral BenRuII catalysts, the system reported herein enables highly efficient phenol-directed asymmetric C–H activation of 1-aryl-2-naphthols with alkynes, providing facile access to diverse chiral spirocyclic compounds featuring an all-carbon quaternary stereocenter in high yields (up to 99%) and with excellent enantioselectivity (up to 97% ee)."},{"t":"通过整体式陶瓷支架实现全固态钠-氧电池多相界面的化学集成","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00021","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态钠氧电池界面","kp":["电解质[全固态Na-O2电池]: 单片双层β-Al2O3","工作温度[全固态Na-O2电池]: 室温","界面策略[全固态]: 单体双层双界面整合"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究针对全固态钠氧电池（Na-O2）中多相界面的化学-机械兼容性瓶颈，提出通过整体式陶瓷支架实现多相界面的化学整合策略。全固态Na-O2电池面临固态电解质与电极间界面电阻高、界面降解等严峻挑战。整体陶瓷支架设计提供了连续的离子传输通道和稳定的结构支撑，有效降低界面阻抗并抑制界面副反应。该工作为全固态金属-空气电池的界面工程提供了新思路，对开发高能量密度、高安全性的下一代储能器件具有推动意义。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Chemical Integration of Multiphase Interfaces in All-Solid-State Sodium–Oxygen Batteries via Monolithic Ceramic Scaffolds","b":"The advancement of all-solid-state sodium-oxygen (Na-O2) batteries is fundamentally constrained by the formidable chemo-mechanical and kinetic barriers at solid-solid interfaces. Herein, we report a high-performance, room-temperature all-solid-state Na-O2 battery enabled by a monolithic bilayer β-Al2O3 architecture that redefines interfacial charge transfer through a dual-interface integration strategy. By constructing an integrated porous-dense scaffold, we eliminated the macroscopic physical boundaries between the electrolyte and cathode, establishing a seamless, low-resistance ionic conduction continuum. Specifically, a conformal, 30 nm thick graphitic carbon layer was deposited within the cathodic framework via plasma-enhanced chemical vapor deposition, creating a high-fidelity electronic network that maximizes active site utilization. On the anode side, we introduced a reactive wetting mechanism mediated by Bi2O3 nanosheets. The in situ chemical reconfiguration and alloying reaction at the interface generate a gradient Na-Bi-O mixed-conducting interphase, effectively fusing the sodium metal to the ceramic electrolyte and ensuring stable long-term cycling (>14,000 h for symmetric cells). Consequently, the battery delivers an unprecedented discharge capacity of 4012 mA h g-1 at room temperature with an exceptional reversibility. Operando Raman spectroscopy and differential electrochemical mass spectrometry reveal that the solid-state environment provides a unique kinetic stabilization for the metastable NaO2 phase, suppressing the parasitic disproportionation pathways common to liquid systems. This work provides a universal blueprint for engineering chemically integrated interfaces in complex multiphase all-solid-state energy chemistry."},{"t":"通过铁电PbTiO₃的原子终止工程提升光生电子抽取以实现高效光催化全解水","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21165","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化分解水制氢","kp":["光催化材料[全解水]: 单畴铁电PbTiO3","改性策略[PbTiO3]: 原子终止工程提升光生电子提取"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究通过铁电PbTiO3的原子终止面工程提升光生电子提取效率，实现高效光催化全解水反应。单畴铁电PbTiO3因其内建极化电场被认为是有前景的全解水光催化剂，但光生载流子的界面提取效率仍是限制性能的关键。通过对PbTiO3特定晶面终止面的原子级调控，优化能带对齐和载流子分离，显著提高了光生电子向助催化剂的转移效率。该策略为铁电光催化材料的设计提供了原子层面的指导，有望推动太阳能驱动水分解制氢的实际应用。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Boosting Photogenerated Electron Extraction by Atomic Termination Engineering of Ferroelectric PbTiO3 for Efficient Photocatalytic Overall Water Splitting","b":"Single-domain ferroelectric PbTiO3 is regarded as a promising candidate for photocatalytic overall water splitting (POWS) owing to its highly efficient bulk charge separation driven by strong polarization field. However, its POWS efficiency still remains far below expectations. Herein, we identify interfacial photogenerated electron extraction at the PbTiO3-Rh interface as a critical factor determining POWS performance. Systematic studies reveal that thermodynamically favored Pb-O termination severely impedes this process. To overcome this limitation, a facile alkaline-etching strategy is developed to selectively reconstruct surface termination from Pb-O to Ti-O on photogenerated electron-rich facet. Time-resolved photoluminescence spectroscopy and excited-state electron transfer dynamics simulation demonstrate that the resulting Ti-O termination remarkably accelerates interfacial photogenerated electron extraction, leading to a 46.1-fold enhancement in POWS activity. An apparent quantum yield of 6.8% at 360 nm is achieved, representing a record value among reported ferroelectric photocatalysts for POWS. Mechanistic studies reveal that weakened interfacial electric field and enhanced nonadiabatic coupling strength at the Ti-O-Rh interface jointly accelerate photogenerated electron extraction. This work underscores the importance of surface-termination engineering in enhancing interfacial photogenerated electron extraction and provides insight into designing high-performance photocatalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"利用析氢反应：仿生pH敏感电解质实现高温下超稳定锌离子电池","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00449K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高温锌离子电池","kp":["工作温度[锌离子电池]: >80°C","电解质[高温锌电池]: 仿生pH敏感型","目标问题[高温锌负极]: 抑制析氢反应HER"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了一种仿生pH敏感电解质，利用析氢反应（HER）机制实现高温环境下超稳定锌离子电池。实际高温（>80°C）锌离子电池面临锌负极腐蚀、枝晶生长和电解质分解等问题。受生物体系启发，该pH响应电解质能够在高温下动态调控界面化学环境，有效抑制副反应并稳定锌负极界面。该策略突破了传统锌离子电池高温运行的稳定性瓶颈，对开发高能量密度、宽温域储能器件具有参考价值，适用于极端环境下的电力供应场景。","dp":1,"ot":"Utilizing hydrogen evolution reaction: bio-inspired pH-sensitive electrolyte for ultra-stable zinc-ion batteries at high temperatures","b":"Broader contextPractical high temperature (> 80 °C) zinc-ion batteries with high energy density and stable cycling performance are greatly desirable for sustainable energy storage, but they remain constrained by the notorious hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Such unwanted reaction not only reduces the reversibility of Zn anode, but also accelerates battery swelling and even causes battery explosion.Inhibiting HER is a widely adopted strategy to enhance battery performance. However, since HER is severely exaggerated at high temperatures, the strategy fails to intrinsically prevent HER and Zn electrodes only work well with low depth of discharge (DOD) and low current densities/capacities.Herein, contrary to the commonly utilized HER suppression routes, a novel HER utilization strategy is proposed by introducing pH-sensitive electrolyte that harness the HER process to in situ form a unique ZrO 2 /ZnF 2 interface on Zn anode. The bio-inspired interface significantly shields H 2 O molecules, homogenizes Zn 2+ flux and optimizes ionic and thermal fields, thus mitigating further side reactions and prohibiting Zn dendrites growth. With the pH-sensitive electrolyte design, the stability of Zn anode is drastically enhanced with high DOD at high current densities/capacities, which also boards the tactics for the development of stable metal batteries with high energy densities at high temperatures.","aip":1},{"t":"实现高效自发消旋拆分：MOF介导的多相体系克服共结晶中的催化不兼容性","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3464047?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF催化消旋化","kp":["去消旋化策略[共结晶]: MOF封装碱催化剂DBU","催化优势[异相催化]: 克服均相催化剂与手性组分不相容"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究利用金属有机框架（MOF）介导的多相体系实现了高效自发去消旋化，克服了共结晶去消旋化中催化剂与结晶过程不兼容的核心障碍。共结晶诱导去消旋化是获得对映纯药物的有力途径，但传统均相催化剂常与结晶条件冲突。MOF作为多相催化剂在共结晶介质中保持活性和稳定性，同时提供可调控的手性环境。该策略实现了外消旋体向单一对映体的高效转化，为手性药物的绿色制造提供了工程化可行的新方法。","dp":1,"ot":"Unlocking Efficient Spontaneous Deracemization: A MOF‐Mediated Heterogeneous System Overcomes Catalytic Incompatibility in Cocrystallization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Cocrystallization‐induced deracemization is a powerful route to enantiopure pharmaceuticals, yet is hindered by detrimental interactions between homogeneous catalysts and chiral components. Herein, we report a novel heterogeneous catalysis strategy using metal–organic frameworks (MOFs) to overcome this compatibility challenge. By encapsulating the base catalyst 1,8‐diazabicyclo[5.4.0]undec‐7‐ene (DBU) into ZIF‐8, we created a ZIF‐8@DBU composite catalyst, that effectively isolates the catalyst while preserving its racemization activity. This enabled the efficient deracemization of racemic DMY via cocrystallization, selectively yielding either the (2\n                    R\n                    ,3\n                    R\n                    )‐ or (2\n                    S\n                    ,3\n                    S\n                    )‐enantiomer simply by switching the handedness of the coformer, N‐benzyl‐1‐phenylethylamine (NBP). Remarkably, the product yield reached up to 52%, surpassing the 50% theoretical limit of conventional chiral resolution techniques. The strategy proved general, extending successfully to ZIF‐67@DBU and ZIF‐90@DBU. This work demonstrates the feasibility of using tailored MOF composites to overcome long‐standing compatibility barriers in deracemization and opens avenues for their broader application in asymmetric synthesis.","aip":1},{"t":"具有突破性超低气流速度响应的摩擦电自供电气流传感器，用于风速检测和呼吸监测","d":"2026-03-19","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70840?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  High‐sensitivity and high‐accuracy sensors are crucial for environmental and health monitoring. However, traditional distributed wind speed sensors commonly suffer from high start‐up wind speeds and external power dependency. Meanwhile, wearable respiratory monitoring devices face challenges such as limited sensitivity and a lack of adaptive power supply. Herein, this work proposes a self‐powered capacitive high‐sensitivity triboelectric airflow sensor (CHTAS). This sensor exploits triboelectric‐electrostatic induction and fluid‐solid coupling effects to achieve an ultralow start‐up airflow (0.1 m/s) and the corresponding equivalent dynamic pressure is only 0.006 Pa, breaking a new record for TENG‐based airflow speed sensing. CHTAS features expeditious response (response time 29 ms, recovery time 27 ms) and a wide range (0.1–10 m/s). Integrated with self‐developed software, CHTAS achieves high‐precision wind speed detection. Furthermore, its ability to be miniaturized and integrated into face masks enables wireless, real‐time respiratory monitoring, intelligent‐assisted identification of sleep‐disordered respiration and the exploration of potential interventions for sleep paralysis. Notably, by combining deep learning for respiratory state recognition, the system achieved a 91.06% recognition mean accuracy. This work paves a new technological path for the development of airflow sensing technology and wearable medical devices.","tp":"摩擦电传感","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出一种自供电电容式高灵敏度摩擦电气流传感器（CHTAS），具有超低启动风速响应。无需外部电源即可工作，可用于环境风速检测和可穿戴呼吸监测，解决了传统风速传感器启动风速高、依赖外部电源及可穿戴呼吸设备灵敏度有限、缺乏自适应供电等问题。"},{"t":"通过透明质酸纳米凝胶内的铂-磷酸配位将顺铂转化为靶向光热化疗药物","d":"2026-03-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7615?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Cisplatin’s (Cis’s) antitumor efficacy is limited by dose-dependent toxicity due to nonspecific tissue distribution. While targeted Cis delivery and combination therapies boost therapeutic efficacy, developing multifunctional yet simplified formulations remains challenging. Inspired by the Cis’s interaction with DNA, here, we transformed Cis into a reversible photothermal agent through the platinum-phosphate (Pt-phos) interaction within a hyaluronan (HA) nanogel (named as HA/PtP) to afford synergistic photothermal therapy (PTT) and chemotherapy. The HA/PtP nanogel exhibits near infrared absorption and 32.08% photothermal conversion efficiency, and degrades to release Cis through the reversible Pt-phos interaction under acidic conditions. Leveraging HA’s intrinsic CD44 targeting, HA/PtP nanogel simultaneously enables highly efficient PTT and targeted chemotherapy in 4T1 breast tumor xenografts. Moreover, HA/PtP-based PTT successfully mimics hyperthermic intraperitoneal chemotherapy (HIPEC) but with alleviated Cis toxicity in MC38 metastatic mouse model. This HA/PtP nanogel represents a rationally designed Cis nanomedicine integrating the PTT with self-targeting and facile preparation."},{"t":"通过不可还原固态电解质诱导的动态界面层实现硅负极近100%初始库仑效率","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00006-1?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅负极固态锂电池","kp":["电解质[硅负极ASSB]: Li2.45S0.55N0.45","界面工程[硅负极]: 不可还原固态电解质诱导动态界面相"],"sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究通过不可还原固态电解质诱导的动态界面层，使硅负极全固态电池的初始库仑效率接近100%。硅负极具有高理论比容量，是全固态电池的有力候选，但严重的锂损失导致初始库仑效率低下，严重限制了实际能量密度。该不可还原固态电解质在硅界面原位形成稳定的动态界面相（SEI），有效抑制锂的不可逆消耗，同时维持离子传导。该策略从根本上解决了硅负极首效偏低的问题，对推进高能量密度全固态硅基电池的实用化具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Toward near-100% initial Coulombic efficiency of Si anodes through irreducible solid electrolyte-induced dynamic interphases","b":"Silicon anodes promise high energy density for all-solid-state batteries (ASSBs) but are limited by severe lithium loss during the first cycle. This work reveals how controlled interfacial reactions enabled by an irreducible solid electrolyte Li2.45S0.55N0.45 can replenish lithium, enhance initial Coulombic efficiency, and maintain fast ion transport. By uncovering the underlying interfacial reaction mechanism, the study demonstrates how rational interface design can simultaneously improve efficiency and electrochemical performance, offering a practical pathway toward safer, high-energy ASSBs."},{"t":"基于台式X射线显微镜实现未染色软组织亚细胞分辨率的三维高内涵成像","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525239123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"X射线三维组织成像","kp":["分辨率[X射线显微成像]: 亚细胞级","样品要求[组织成像]: 免染色软组织","成像方式[组织成像]: 实验室级X射线显微镜三维高内涵"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究利用台式X射线显微镜实现了未染色软组织的三维高内涵成像，达到亚细胞分辨率。随着跨尺度生物体系研究需求的增长，传统组织学方法依赖化学染色和切片，难以实现无损三维成像。该台式X射线显微镜利用相位衬度成像原理，无需染色即可获得软组织的三维结构信息，分辨率达到亚细胞级别。该方法简化了样本制备流程，保持了组织原生形态，在病理诊断、发育生物学和药物毒性评估等领域具有广阔应用前景。","dp":1,"ot":"Three-dimensional high-content imaging of unstained soft tissue with subcellular resolution using a laboratory-based X-ray microscope","b":"With increasing interest in studying biological systems across spatial scales—from centimeters down to nanometers—histology continues to be the gold standard for tissue imaging at cellular resolution, providing an essential bridge between macroscopic and nanoscopic analysis. However, its inherently destructive and two-dimensional nature limits its ability to capture the full three-dimensional complexity of tissue architecture. Here, we show that phase-contrast X-ray microscopy can enable three-dimensional virtual histology with subcellular resolution. This technique provides direct quantification of electron density without restrictive assumptions, allowing for direct characterization of cellular nuclei in a standard laboratory setting. By combining high spatial resolution and soft tissue contrast, with automated segmentation of cell nuclei, we demonstrated virtual Hematoxylin and Eosin (H&amp;E) staining using machine learning-based style transfer, yielding volumetric datasets compatible with existing histopathological analysis tools. Furthermore, by integrating electron density and the sensitivity to nanometric features of the dark field contrast channel, we achieve stain-free, high-content imaging capable of distinguishing nuclei and extracellular matrix.","aip":1},{"t":"化石能源衰落与可行替代方案探索：全球社会政治和技术约束下生物柴油、电动和沼气能源系统的批判性综述","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002990?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"清洁能源替代","sc":2.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":2.0,"d":2.5,"t":2.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"The decline of fossil fuels and the search for viable alternatives: A critical review of biodiesel, electric, and biogas energy systems under global socio-political and technical constraints"},{"t":"拟南芥 FRIENDLY (FMT) 蛋白与 NAC 相互作用并决定核编码线粒体蛋白的翻译位置","d":"2026-03-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521483123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Mitochondria are not only the powerhouses of the cell. They are also dynamic signaling hubs, playing a key role in cellular metabolism and adaptation. Proper mitochondrial function depends largely on the import of proteins encoded by the nucleus. Using proximity labeling (TurboID), we show that\n                    Arabidopsis thaliana\n                    FRIENDLY (FMT) protein is in close proximity to several organellar-destined proteins, mostly mitochondrial, during their translation. Many of the corresponding mRNAs are immunoprecipitated with FMT. Remarkably, when FMT is absent, its target mRNAs lose their correct cellular localization. Our TurboID approach, associated with immunoprecipitations and confocal microscopy, also demonstrates the interaction between FMT and the Nascent polypeptide Associated Complex (NAC), a ribosome-associated platform involved in the maturation and sorting of nascent peptides. Taken together, these results suggest that FMT, through its interaction with NAC and the ribosome, is involved in the spatial regulation of translation in the cell."},{"t":"亚微米结构限域聚合物用于高性能本征可拉伸发光二极管（Adv. Mater. 16/2026）","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72673?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性发光二极管","kp":["器件类型[柔性显示]: 本征可拉伸PLED阵列","改性策略[PLED]: 引入微晶弹性体","应用[PLED]: RGB三基色"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究报道了利用亚微米结构限域聚合物策略制备高性能本征可拉伸发光二极管（PLED）阵列。可拉伸发光器件在可穿戴电子、柔性显示和电子皮肤等领域具有重要应用前景，但拉伸性与发光性能之间的矛盾是核心挑战。通过亚微米尺度的结构设计限域发光聚合物链段，有效抑制拉伸诱导的发光猝灭和性能衰减，实现高亮度、高效率的可拉伸PLED阵列。该策略兼顾机械柔性与光电性能，为下一代可穿戴光电设备的开发提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Submicron Structure Confined Polymers for High‐Performance Intrinsically Stretchable Light‐Emitting Diodes (Adv. Mater. 16/2026)","b":"Intrinsically Stretchable PLED Arrays In their Research Article (10.1002/adma.202519650), Wenkang Shi, Zhiyuan Zhao, Yunlong Guo, Yunqi Liu, and co-workers introduce a novel microcrystalline elastomer into light-emitting polymers for intrinsically stretchable PLEDs, which achieves high performance and excellent stability under strain. These materials are suitable for RGB primary color applications and large-area processing, demonstrating significant potential for stretchable displays."},{"t":"分枝杆菌长链酰基辅酶 A 羧化酶复合物的底物特异性和 MSMEG_0435-0436 结合的结构基础","d":"2026-03-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530575123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The presence of mycolic acid is a defining feature of the mycobacterial cell wall, which provides a highly impermeable barrier to many antibiotics. Biosynthesis of this fatty acid, as well as tuberculostearic acid, requires precursor molecules produced by the essential long-chain acyl-coenzyme A (CoA) carboxylase (LCC) complex. The LCC complex catalyzes carboxylation of the α-carbon of long-chain acyl-CoA, but also short-chain acetyl-CoA and propionyl-CoA. The complex includes the subunits AccA3, which contains a biotin carboxylase (BC) domain and a biotin carboxyl carrier protein (BCCP) domain, the long-chain acyl-CoA carboxyltransferase AccD4, the short-chain acyl-CoA carboxyltransferase AccD5, and the incompletely characterized protein AccE. We used electron cryomicroscopy (cryo-EM) to determine structures of the LCC complex from\n                    \n                      Mycobacterium\n                      smegmatis\n                    \n                    . In the structures, two AccE subunits tether eight AccA3 subunits to an AccD4\n                    2\n                    AccD5\n                    4\n                    heterohexamer core. Cryo-EM of the enzyme during catalysis reveals how AccD4 and AccD5 achieve substrate specificity, with AccD5 binding tightly to CoA and AccD4 binding long acyl chains. The BCCP domains of AccA3 undergo long-distance translocation to transfer a carboxyl group from the BC domain of AccA3 to the acyl-CoA substrate bound in AccD5. Further, we find that two copies of a protein complex formed from MSMEG_0435 and MSMEG_0436 can bind the LCC complex, sequestering the biotin moiety of BCCP domains near AccD5 and decreasing propionyl-CoA carboxylase activity. Rv0263c, the\n                    \n                      Mycobacterium tuberculosis\n                    \n                    ortholog of MSMEG_0435, has a role in bacterial survival during transmission, suggesting that these proteins may regulate production of branched fatty acid precursors for the mycobacterial cell wall."},{"t":"即贴即用柔性钾离子微电池：通过电子-离子协同调控实现超高功率密度与长寿命","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506432?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钾离子微电池","kp":["电池类型[微型电池]: 即贴即用柔性钾离子3D微型电池","制备方法[微型电池]: 可扩展增材制造"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究开发了即贴即用的柔性钾离子微型电池，通过电子-离子协同调控实现了超高功率密度和长循环寿命。可充电微型电池在微纳器件集成和便携式电子设备中具有关键应用价值。该微型电池采用电子-离子协同调控策略优化电极材料，钾离子体系兼具资源丰富和低成本优势。柔性基底赋予器件优异的机械弯折耐受性，即贴即用的设计简化了器件集成流程。该微型电池在超高功率输出和长寿命方面取得突破，为可穿戴和植入式微电子器件提供了可靠的微尺度储能方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Stick‐and‐Use Flexible K‐Ion Microbatteries with Ultrahigh Power Density and Long Lifespan Via Electron‐Ion Synergistic Tailoring","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Rechargeable micro batteries (MBs) with compatible sizes, high integration, and great energy storage potential have become a pressing need for future microelectronics and microrobots. However, current MBs struggle to balance high energy and high power while lacking applicable convenience. Hence, in this work, a novel kind of stick‐and‐use soft K‐ion 3D MBs is designed via a scalable additive manufacturing. Aided by electropolymerization, as‐3D‐printed micro‐cathode in MBs achieves an outstanding cycling stability over 10 000 cycles. For full MB devices, an ultrahigh power density of 50.2 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    along with a long lifespan over 3 000 charge‐discharge cycles is simultaneously exhibited. Through theoretical and experimental analysis, the obtained excellent performance is attributed to the rational surface modification and 3D microstructure advance, resulting in stabilized interfacial electrochemistry and tailored ion‐electron transport, respectively. Notably, through a unique 3D stacking, our MBs reach an exceptional areal capacity of 7.01 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    and energy density of 5.9 mWh cm\n                    −2\n                    . With the soft and miniature characteristics, these MBs can be easily stuck onto various microelectronic devices for direct use, where ensuring a stable and enduring operation. These results demonstrate a strong potential of MBs as a reliable microscale power source for next‐generation microsystems with high energy demands.","aip":1},{"t":"通过孔道限域三苯基膦稳定银单原子位点：实现高底物特异性的CO₂转化","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2079917?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子CO2还原","kp":["催化剂[CO2转化]: Ag单原子位点","锚定策略[Ag单原子]: MOF-808孔限域三苯基膦双重限域","特点[CO2转化]: 高底物特异性"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用孔道限域三苯基膦稳定银单原子位点，实现了高底物选择性的CO2催化转化。单原子催化剂在反应条件下易发生团聚失活是制约其实际应用的关键难题。该策略将银单原子锚定在多孔材料的孔道内，通过三苯基膦配体的孔道限域效应和配位稳定作用，有效防止银原子迁移团聚。该催化剂在CO2还原反应中展现出优异的底物选择性和催化稳定性，为单原子催化剂的工程化应用提供了通用稳定化策略，对CO2资源化利用具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Stabilizing Silver Single‐Atom Site via A Pore‐Confined Triphenylphosphine for CO2 Conversion With High Substrate‐Specificity","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ensuring the dispersion and anti‐aggregation of single‐atom sites under catalytic conditions remains a critical challenge in heterogeneous catalysis. Here, we report a dual‐confinement strategy for constructing a metal–organic framework (MOF) based catalyst, MEC‐88, by spatially confining triphenylphosphine (PPh\n                    3\n                    ) within the pores of MOF‐808 to anchor silver single‐atom sites. MEC‐88 exhibits exceptional activity and pronounced substrate selectivity for the carboxylative cyclization of CO\n                    2\n                    with benzyl‐substituted propargylamines under mild, additive‐free aqueous conditions, achieving a turnover frequency up to 1051.3 ± 0.7 h\n                    −1\n                    . Moreover, PPh\n                    3\n                    , as a soft‐base ligand, provides robust coordination to silver atoms, effectively inhibiting their aggregation to endow the catalyst with good recyclability. Mechanistic studies reveal that the PPh\n                    3\n                    ‐coordinated silver site synergizes with the Zr\n                    6\n                    O\n                    8\n                    cluster to activate both the alkyne substrate and CO\n                    2\n                    , substantially lowering the energy barriers for CO\n                    2\n                    insertion and cyclization. This work presents a molecule‐enhanced confinement approach for designing stable and efficient single‐atom catalysts with controllable substrate‐specificity."},{"t":"基于多智能体深度强化学习的智能产消者管理参与去中心化点对点市场交易","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003028?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多智能体电力交易","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":2.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Smart prosumers management based on multi-agent deep reinforcement learning to participate in decentralized peer-to-peer market"},{"t":"基于单根聚合物纤维的超灵敏多功能柔性微传感器：仿节肢动物裂纹-螺旋耦合机制","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529908123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物纤维柔性传感器","kp":["尺寸[柔性微传感器]: <100μm","灵敏度[应变传感]: GF>10³","耐久性[微传感器]: >10⁴次","设计灵感[微传感器]: 节肢动物裂纹-螺旋耦合"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究受节肢动物感受器启发，通过裂纹-螺旋耦合结构设计，实现了基于单根聚合物纤维的超灵敏多功能柔性微传感器。柔性微传感器在可穿戴健康监测、人机交互和软体机器人等领域需求迫切。该传感器尺寸小于100微米，应变系数（GF）超过10^3，兼具超高灵敏度和多功能感知能力。裂纹-螺旋耦合结构将微小应变放大为显著的电信号变化，单根纤维设计赋予器件优异的柔性和可编织性。该传感器在脉搏监测、运动捕捉等场景中展现出优异性能。","dp":1,"ot":"Single polymer fiber–based ultrasensitive and multifunctional flexible microsensor via arthropod-inspired crack-helix coupling","b":"Flexible microsensors featuring miniature dimensions (&lt; 100 μm), superior sensitivity [Gauge factor (GF) &gt; 10\n                    3\n                    ], and phenomenal environmental stability (&gt; 10\n                    4\n                    uses) have been broadly applied in modern soft electronics such as implantable health monitoring and soft robotics. However, it is quite challenging to integrate these distinguished features in a microdevice considering the extremely limited space for the complicated fabrication and complex functionalities. Inspired by microscale sensing systems in arthropods, this work presents a unique crack-helix soft microsensor (CHMS) within a single polymer microfiber. This microdevice successfully combines the structural advantages of both slit and hair sensors in arthropods through convenient depositing a thin layer (thickness: 2.5 μm) of biphasic liquid metals on a single microfiber (diameter: 80 μm). The microsensor presents unique frequency detection capability as arthropods (resolution: 0.01 Hz, &gt; 1,088 Hz), ultrahigh sensitivity (GF &gt; 2,711 ± 119), astonishing detection limit (0.05% strain and 0.2 mN), and excellent sensing durability (over 50,000 cycles), which are among the best of currently reported soft sensors. Furthermore, analogous to natural arthropods, CHMS shows different multifunctional environmental perception capability to precisely recognize subtle vibration under water or ground (amplitude &lt; 70 μm) and extremely rarefied airflow (ultralow mass flux: 2.2 × 10\n                    −4\n                    g/s·cm\n                    2\n                    ).","aip":1},{"t":"简单的传质调节实现无化学添加剂的海水淡化卤水无结垢零排液","d":"2026-03-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb2604?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Thermal-driven interfacial evaporation crystallization offers a promising path to zero liquid discharge (ZLD) for high-salinity brine. However, cocrystallization of specific minor salt species with major salts forms scaling that causes operational failure. Although chemical additives are commonly used to mitigate scaling, they pose potential environmental risks. This study presents a chemical-additive-free antiscaling strategy that suppresses unwanted cocrystallization by rationally enhancing the departure of scaling-causing species from the evaporation interface. As a proof of concept, a solar evaporator is designed to enhance the backflow of MgSO\n                    4\n                    , the primary scaling-causing species in seawater desalination brine, by precisely regulating its mass transfer distance. Under solar irradiation, the evaporator achieved a continuous evaporation of seawater desalination brine for over 408 hours with a stable evaporation rate of 4.29 kilograms per square meter per hour without any visible scaling, enabling uninterrupted ZLD operation. Outdoor field tests further validated the strategy’s practical applicability. This work offers transformative potential for achieving sustainable ZLD in brine management.","tp":"卤水零排液","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"热驱动界面蒸发结晶技术为高盐卤水零排液提供了可行路径，但次要盐类与主要盐类的共结晶会导致结垢和运行失败。该研究提出一种无需化学添加剂的防垢策略，通过合理强化传质来抑制不良共结晶，实现了海水淡化卤水的无结垢零排液，避免了化学添加剂的环境风险。"},{"t":"不同年龄的自我失活 AAV-CRISPR 能够持续改善 BAC226Q 小鼠的亨廷顿病缺陷","d":"2026-03-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea8052?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Huntington’s disease (HD) is a monogenic autosomal dominant neurodegenerative disorder caused by a CAG repeat expansion in exon 1 of the\n                    HTT\n                    gene, yielding a gain-of-toxic-function mutant Huntingtin protein (mHTT). CRISPR-Cas9 is a potentially powerful therapeutic strategy for HD by eliminating mutant\n                    HTT\n                    (m\n                    HTT\n                    ) gene. We developed a specific SaCas9 guide RNA to target human m\n                    HTT\n                    and a self-inactivating gene editing system that abolishes SaCas9 after a short transient expression for high gene editing efficiency and maximal safety to prevent off-target effects. Both conventional and the self-inactivating gene editing systems successfully eliminated m\n                    HTT\n                    gene, 60 to 90% mHTT protein and 90% of mHTT aggregation in BAC226Q mouse brains, which resulted in significant long-term rescue of neuropathology, motor deficits, weight loss, and shortened life span. These beneficial effects were observed when gene editing was applied before, at, and well after the onset of pathological and behavioral abnormalities. These proof-of-concept data demonstrate that gene editing can be a highly effective therapeutic approach for HD.","tp":"亨廷顿治疗","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"亨廷顿病是由HTT基因外显子1的CAG重复扩增引起的常染色体显性神经退行性疾病。该研究开发了靶向人突变HTT基因的SaCas9向导RNA，利用自我失活AAV-CRISPR系统，在不同年龄的BAC226Q小鼠模型中持续改善亨廷顿病相关的神经和行为缺陷。"},{"t":"快速微波刻蚀耦合聚多巴胺保护实现锌负极秒级表面重构：面向实用长寿命水系锌离子电池","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506688?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌负极表面重构","kp":["理论容量[锌负极]: 820 mAh g⁻¹","表面改性[锌负极]: 微波刻蚀+聚多巴胺涂层协同"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究提出一种秒级锌负极表面重构策略：利用快速微波刻蚀对锌负极进行表面粗化处理，再耦合聚多巴胺(PDA)保护涂层，构建稳定的界面结构。水系锌离子电池(ZIBs)具有本征安全性、低成本和高理论容量(820 mAh g⁻¹)等优势，但锌负极在循环中面临枝晶生长、副反应和界面腐蚀等问题。微波刻蚀可在数秒内完成表面形貌优化，PDA层则抑制副反应并促进均匀锌沉积，协同实现长循环寿命，为实用化ZIBs的负极工程提供了高效 scalable 方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Second‐Scale Surface Reconstruction of Zn Anodes via Rapid Microwave Etching Coupled With Polydopamine Protection for Practical Long‐Life Aqueous Zinc‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Aqueous zinc‐ion batteries (ZIBs) offer intrinsic safety, low cost, and high theoretical capacity (820 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    , and 5855 mAh cm\n                    −3\n                    ), yet dendrite formation and parasitic side reactions on Zn anodes hinder practical application. Here, a synergistic surface engineering strategy combining rapid microwave‐assisted etching with a conformal polydopamine (PDA) coating is presented. Microwave irradiation creates hierarchical stepwise pores that expose (101) facets, providing abundant nucleation sites for Zn\n                    2+\n                    and guiding the directional growth of Zn, as supported by molecular dynamics simulations. The PDA layer captures H\n                    2\n                    O molecules near hydrated Zn\n                    2+\n                    , suppressing hydrogen evolution, corrosion, and byproduct formation. Consequently, PDA‐coated eZn (PDA‐eZn) symmetric cells exhibit stable cycling over 526 h at 10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    and 5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    , while PDA‐eZn//V\n                    2\n                    O\n                    5\n                    full cells retain 73.6% capacity after 1500 cycles at 3 A g\n                    −1\n                    , with robust rate performance across a wide current density range. This scalable and generalizable approach establishes a clear design principle for dendrite‐free, high‐performance Zn anodes and can be extended to other metal anodes, advancing safe, durable, and high‐power aqueous energy storage systems.","aip":1},{"t":"考虑极端天气事件风险的可再生电力能源系统基于情景分离的最优规划方法","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003338?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可再生能源系统规划","kp":["规划方法[可再生能源]: 场景分离优化规划","考虑因素[电力系统]: 极端天气事件风险"],"sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":2.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Scenario separation-based optimal planning method for renewable electric energy system considering extreme weather event risks"},{"t":"考虑多时间尺度不确定性与氢能集成的综合能源系统鲁棒容量优化与低碳改造","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002953?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源系统低碳改造","kp":["优化目标[综合能源系统]: 鲁棒容量优化低碳改造","[不确定性]: 多时间尺度"],"sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":2.5,"d":2.5,"t":4.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Robust capacity optimization and low-carbon retrofit of integrated energy systems considering multi-timescale uncertainties and hydrogen integration"},{"t":"光催化分解水制氢微反应器中气泡动力学与脱离机制研究进展综述","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003053?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光催化分解水制氢","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Recent progress in bubble dynamics and detachment mechanisms of photocatalytic water splitting microreactors for H₂ production: a review"},{"t":"NASICON钠金属全固态电解质的反应性碳化物合成与微观结构（Adv. Mater. 16/2026）","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72669?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池固态电解质","kp":["电解质[全固态钠电池]: NASICON型","合成方法[NASICON]: 碳化物基反应合成"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该工作报道了基于反应性碳化物合成路线制备NASICON型钠金属全固态电解质的研究，表征了其微观结构与离子传导性能。NASICON结构以三维钠离子迁移通道为特征，全固态电解质有望消除液态电解液的易燃与枝晶问题，提升钠金属电池安全性。反应性碳化物前驱体合成路径为调控电解质致密度与晶界阻抗提供了新思路，对低成本固态钠电池的工程化推进具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Reactive Carbide‐Based Synthesis and Microstructure of NASICON Sodium Metal All Solid‐State Electrolyte (Adv. Mater. 16/2026)","b":"NASICON Sodium Metal All Solid-State Electrolyte An electric float plane landed on a remote lake in Katmai National Park and is being fueled for the return trip using a standalone solar-powered charging station. The solid-state sodium batteries inside the plane are based on an advanced NASICON-type electrolyte, which is both durable and low cost. The environmentalist who traveled to this location to live among the bears is proud of his low CO2 footprint, which may soon go to net zero. More details can be found in the Research Article by Callum J. Campbell, David Mitlin, and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202512961)."},{"t":"用于下一代辐射探测的有机闪烁体：分子设计原理、机制与新兴应用","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00078-0?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Matter","tg":"观点评论","tp":"有机闪烁体","kp":["设计策略[有机闪烁体]: 调控分子结构+激发态动力学+重原子效应","目标[辐射探测]: 同时提升光学效率、成像分辨率和稳定性"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.5},"as":"该综述聚焦下一代辐射探测用有机闪烁体的分子设计原理、发光机制与新兴应用。系统阐述了如何通过分子工程同时提升闪烁体的光产额、能量分辨率与成像效率，涵盖荧光发射调控、辐射-光转换机制及塑料/晶体闪烁体优化策略。文章还展望了有机闪烁体在医学成像、 homeland安全检测和中微子探测等前沿领域的发展方向，为高性能辐射探测材料设计提供了系统指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Organic scintillators for next-generation radiation detection: Principles of molecular design, mechanisms, and emerging applications","b":"Design strategies for high-performance organic scintillators focus on simultaneously enhancing optical efficiency, imaging resolution, and material stability by tailoring molecular structures, tuning excited-state dynamics, introducing heavy atom effects, and suppressing non-radiative pathways."},{"t":"近红外光驱动光化学与光催化：机制、近期应用及有机合成与生物学中的机遇","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526147?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"近红外光催化","kp":["[NIR光化学优势]: 更深穿透、低背景吸收、减少散射、更安全"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该综述系统介绍了近红外（NIR）光驱动光化学与光催化的机制、最新应用及在有机合成与生物学中的机遇。NIR光具有更深组织穿透深度、更低光损伤的优势，弥补了可见光催化的局限。文章归纳了上转换纳米粒子、双光子吸收、三重态-三重态湮灭敏化等NIR激发策略，综述了NIR催化在C-C键偶联、不对称合成、光动力治疗和生物正交化学中的进展，并对NIR光催化体系的效率提升与生物医学应用前景进行了展望。","dp":1,"ot":"Near‐Infrared‐Light‐Driven Photochemistry and Photocatalysis: Mechanisms, Recent Applications, and Opportunities in Organic Synthesis and Biology","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Near‐infrared (NIR) photochemistry and photocatalysis have emerged as powerful extensions of analogous visible‐light methods, offering unique advantages, such as deeper penetration through opaque media, minimal background absorption, reduced scattering, more selective photon absorption, and enhanced safety profiles. These properties enable reactivity in complex environments, are more amenable to scale‐up in batch processes, and permit reactions in biological settings that remain challenging for traditional ultraviolet and visible‐light manifolds. This minireview focuses exclusively on the true NIR regime (700–1000 nm) and integrates both synthetic and biological perspectives, which establish this area as a rapidly expanding frontier with broad opportunities. Emphasis is placed on contributions reported since 2019."},{"t":"建筑中制冷机与热泵系统的建模方法：数字孪生应用背景下的系统性综述","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002849?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"热泵系统建模","kp":["[主题]: 制冷与热泵系统建模","[视角]: 数字孪生应用"],"sc":2.7,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":4.0,"r":2.5,"d":2.5,"t":2.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Modeling methods for chiller and heat pump systems in buildings: A systematic review in the context of digital twin applications"},{"t":"塑造最早定居社区的身份：旧石器时代西南亚粘土个人装饰品的出现","d":"2026-03-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea2158?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Ornamental practices are essential for understanding socioeconomic structures and technosymbolic dynamics of prehistoric societies. However, our perception of these practices remains limited and biased, due to preservation issues, e.g., perishable materials, which are known only through indirect evidence or rare conservation contexts. Such is the use of unbaked clay for ornamentation, a practice that became widespread across Eurasia in the Neolithic, sporadically documented earlier in Upper Paleolithic Europe. Focusing on the Levantine “revolution of symbols,” we report the earliest known clay ornamental tradition outside of Europe: 142 personal ornaments from five Natufian (Late Epipaleolithic, 15,000 to 11,650 calibrated years before the present) sites in Israel. Using a multidisciplinary approach, we show that both children and adults participated in crafting these items, which reflect newly emerging symbolic expressions, some inspired by plant forms. These findings offer original insights into the social organization of craft production and the rise of symbolic practices at the dawn of sedentism, which ultimately shaped the Neolithic transition in Southwest Asia."},{"t":"锂同位素证据表明大陆风化增强引发晚古生代温室到冰库的气候转变","d":"2026-03-19","i":"literature","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag168/8526391?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The causes of the transition from a greenhouse to an icehouse climate during the Early Mississippian (~359–347 Ma), marking the possible onset of the Late Paleozoic Ice Age (LPIA), remain an outstanding puzzle in Earth’s climate history. This transition coincides with the mid-Tournaisian carbon isotope excursion (TICE). It is hypothesized that intensified continental silicate weathering during this period sequestered CO₂, boosted nutrients, and increased marine productivity, causing the positive TICE. However, direct evidence for enhanced continental weathering has been lacking. We present lithium isotope (δ⁷Li) data from two carbonate sections showing a ~12‰ decline during TICE. Integrating δ⁷Li with carbon cycle models (GEOCLIM and COPSE) suggests silicate chemical weathering rates increased ~30% with declines in weathering intensity during the TICE event, likely due to uplift or vegetation, ultimately reducing atmospheric pCO₂ by ~1000 ppm. This provides evidence linking enhanced weathering, CO₂ drawdown, and the onset of the LPIA, shedding light on a key aspect of late Paleozoic climate change."},{"t":"二维过渡金属二硫族化合物的Li+嵌入化学：相变演化、可规模化制备与应用","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag165/8526392?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","tp":"二维材料锂插层","kp":["[相变工程]: Li+插层诱导IV-VI族TMDs全景相演化"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本文综述了锂离子插层化学在二维过渡金属硫族化合物（TMDs）中的应用，涵盖相变调控、可规模化制备及器件应用三个维度。Li⁺插层可有效诱导TMDs从半导体相（2H）向金属相（1T/1T'）转变，实现层间剥离和纳米片大规模制备。研究讨论了插层机理、相变热力学与动力学、电化学驱动相工程等关键问题，并展望了在电子器件、电催化（析氢反应）和储能领域的应用前景。可控制备和相稳定性仍是规模化应用的主要瓶颈。","dp":1,"ot":"Li+ intercalation chemistry on 2D transition metal dichalcogenides towards phase evolution, scalable production and application","b":"Li+ intercalation chemistry is a powerful tool to induce phase transitions in transition metal dichalcogenides (TMDs), but only the transition of 2H-to-1T/1T’ in group Ⅵ TMDs (MoS2 and WS2) is well-known and widely explored for applications in areas such as transistors, memristor, catalysis, and batteries. Here, we develop a fully documented landscapes of phase evolution in group IV-Ⅵ TMDs induced by electrochemical Li+ intercalation through in-situ"},{"t":"未来低碳能源系统中液体燃料是否仍有一席之地？——全球能源系统建模与地方能源港口集群参与的持续交互","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002928?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"低碳液体燃料","sc":2.6,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":4.0,"r":2.0,"d":2.5,"t":2.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Is there a role for liquid fuels in future low-carbon energy systems? – A continuous interaction between global energy systems modeling and local energy port cluster participation"},{"t":"二硫化物共催化并借由质子-硅鎓互变维持的α-烯烃分子内硅芳基化反应","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5903420?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅芳基化反应催化","kp":["[反应]: 分子内硅芳基化，二硫化物共催化","[机制]: 硅鎓离子配位→β-硅稳定碳正离子→SEAr"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究报道了一种仿生分子内硅芳基化反应，利用二硫化物共催化和质子-硅鎓离子互变机制，实现了未活化端烯烃C=C双键的 Formal 硫硅化。该方法突破了未活化烯烃的选择性官能化难题，通过协同催化策略将硅基和芳基同时引入分子骨架，为合成含有硅-碳键的复杂有机分子提供了新途径，对有机硅化学和药物合成具有潜在价值。","dp":1,"ot":"Intramolecular Silylarylation of α‐Olefins Enabled by Disulfide Co‐Catalysis and Maintained by Proton‐into‐Silylium Interconversion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    A “bioinspired” silylarylation of unactivated terminal alkenes involving formal thiosilylation of the C═C double bond followed by an intramolecular electrophilic aromatic substitution (S\n                    E\n                    Ar) is disclosed. The reaction is initiated by weak coordination of a silylium ion to the terminal alkene to form a β‐silicon‐stabilized carbenium ion that is subsequently captured by an external sulfide co‐catalyst to yield a sulfonium‐ion electrophile. Nucleophilic attack of the tethered arene then affords a highly Brønsted acidic arenium ion, which allows for protodearylation of an arylsilane additive for the regeneration of the silylium ion stabilized by the sulfur donor. This step is also modulated by the sulfide donor as a proton shuttle thereby mitigating side reactions such as competing hydroarylation or alkene oligomerization. This ionic alkene silylarylation is a silylium‐ion‐mediated reaction where a sulfide co‐catalyst balances the reactivities of the involved cationic intermediates, eventually improving the overall efficiency of the process."},{"t":"印度各邦在电力脱碳方面表现如何？地方层面基于消费的分解分析","d":"2026-03-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001473?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"印度电脱碳","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"产卵器的味觉感知促使母体回避橙皮苷，从而使主要农业蝇类害虫的后代受益","d":"2026-03-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526937123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Females of the oriental fruit fly (\n                    Bactrocera dorsalis\n                    ) disproportionately oviposit in unripe fruits, despite their lower nutritional value compared to ripe fruits, but the sensory cues driving such counterintuitive site selection have not been determined. Here, using an oriental fruit fly–mango interaction system, we identified a specific flavonoid compound, hesperidin, as a major avoidance cue driving oviposition site selection in this species. Hesperidin accumulates as mango fruits ripen, and high concentrations suppress both larval growth and adult emergence. This indicates that higher levels of hesperidin exert a direct harmful effect on\n                    B. dorsalis\n                    larvae within ripe fruits. Interestingly, we found that\n                    B. dorsalis\n                    females perceive hesperidin via gustatory sensors on the ovipositor. The\n                    BdorGr28b\n                    gene is strongly expressed in the ovipositor, and we showed that the corresponding protein is the major hesperidin receptor. These results demonstrate that gustatory sensing via the ovipositor drives maternal avoidance of hesperidin to benefit the offspring in\n                    B. dorsalis\n                    . Our study provides insight into oviposition site selection in this species and the broader functional repertoire of insect gustation."},{"t":"实现长效货架稳定的钙钛矿太阳能电池：氧化铝阻挡层保护钙钛矿器件免受水分和氧气侵蚀","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70834?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿电池封装","kp":["封装[钙钛矿太阳能电池]: ALD氧化铝直接沉积阻隔层","[目标]: 防潮防氧，长期货架稳定"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对金属卤化物钙钛矿太阳能电池的湿气与氧气稳定性问题，研究提出氧化铝（Al2O3）阻挡层封装架构。现有薄膜封装无法完全隔绝环境因素，导致器件快速衰减。该工作通过优化Al2O3屏障设计，有效阻断水氧渗透，实现钙钛矿器件的长效货架稳定性，推动其向商业化迈进的关键一步。","dp":1,"ot":"Enabling Long Term, Shelf‐Stable Perovskite Solar Cells: Alumina Barriers to Protect Perovskite Devices from Moisture and Oxygen","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Current encapsulation architectures for thin‐film metal halide perovskite do not adequately eliminate all ambient stressors. Here, we develop low transmission rate barrier layers using atomic layer deposited (ALD) aluminum oxide grown directly on the completed photovoltaic (PV) device stack to provide an additional seal, prior to full packaging. We investigate the effect of deposition temperature and oxidant chemistries on the barrier growth for protection of perovskite photovoltaic devices. We characterize the layers individually, then integrate into devices to detail the tradeoff between protection and deposition compatibility. To enhance compatibility and impermeability, we present an approach using water as the aluminum oxidant during nucleation and switching from water to ozone for the remainder of the growth. At 50 nm, the barrier results in a water vapor transmission rate (WVTR) of 4.5·10\n                    −4\n                    g/m\n                    2\n                    /day, and 1,000‐hour device stability under 45°C with 85% relative humidity without further packaging. This barrier provides sufficient protection to enable minimal degradation of the perovskite solar cells while completely submerged in water for 140 minutes. Additionally, we characterize the oxygen transmission rate (OTR) to be 0.49 cm\n                    3\n                    /m\n                    2\n                    /day at 23°C and 0% relative humidity, which is 1.5 orders of magnitude improvement over the OTR of the current encapsulation."},{"t":"通过能带工程实现聚四氟乙烯（PTFE）的电化学稳定化，构建长寿命高能量密度锂离子电池","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70845?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池电极粘结剂","kp":["粘结剂[LIB厚电极]: PTFE干法涂布","[稳定化策略]: 电子能带工程提升LUMO能级稳定性"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"聚四氟乙烯（PTFE）粘结剂的干法涂覆工艺在锂离子电池电极制造中前景广阔，但PTFE在循环过程中不稳定。本研究通过电化学能带工程实现PTFE稳定化，抑制其在高电压下的降解，使电池获得超长循环寿命和高能量密度。该策略为干法电极工艺的规模化应用扫除了关键材料障碍。","dp":1,"ot":"Electrochemical Stabilization of Polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE) via Electronic Band Engineering Enables Long‐Life, High‐Energy‐Density Li‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The dry‐coating process with polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE) binder has emerged as a promising technology for fabricating thick electrodes toward high‐energy‐density lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs). However, its practical application is limited by the poor electrochemical stability of PTFE at the anode. The intrinsically low lowest unoccupied molecular orbital (LUMO) energy of PTFE renders it highly susceptible to reduction‐induced side reactions at the anode, leading to low initial Coulombic efficiency (ICE) and degradation of electrode microstructure during cycling. To overcome this limitation, the frontier orbital energy level of PTFE is rationally engineered by incorporating weakly electron‐withdrawing oxygen‐ and nitrogen‐containing functional groups via O\n                    2\n                    plasma treatment and gas‐phase nitridation. This molecular modification strategy induces an increase in LUMO energy, which enhances the electrochemical stability of PTFE under anodic environments. The dry‐processed anode employing modified PTFE exhibits a high ICE of 92.8%, compared with 87.8% for the anode with pristine PTFE. Furthermore, full‐cells exhibit outstanding long‐term cycling stability with negligible electrode swelling with a practical areal capacity of 7 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    over 600 cycles. This finding highlight that the molecular engineering of the PTFE fiber network offers straightforward and effective strategy to suppress PTFE reduction, enabling practical high–energy–density LIBs with long‐term cycling stability."},{"t":"增强型单层MoS2场效应晶体管中介电层与栅极金属工程对阈值电压的调控","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523661?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MoS2场效应管","kp":["[器件模式]: 增强型单层MoS2 FET小正阈值电压","[调控方法]: 介电层与栅金属工程调制阈值电压"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对单层二硫化钼（MoS2）场效应晶体管的阈值电压调控难题，研究通过介电层和栅金属工程实现增强型（E-mode）器件的阈值电压精确调制。2D过渡金属硫族化物具有优异的栅极静电控制能力，但阈值电压难以控制。该工作为二维半导体器件走向实用化提供了关键的电压调控方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Dielectric and Gate Metal Engineering for Threshold Voltage Modulation in Enhancement Mode Monolayer MoS2 Field Effect Transistors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Excellent gate electrostatics in field effect transistors (FETs) based on 2D transition metal dichalcogenide (2D TMD) channels can dramatically decrease static power dissipation. Energy‐efficient FETs operate in enhancement mode with a small and positive threshold voltage (V\n                    th\n                    ) for n‐type devices. However, most state‐of‐the‐art FETs based on monolayer MoS\n                    2\n                    channel operate in depletion mode with negative V\n                    th\n                    due to doping from the underlying dielectric substrate. In this work, we identify key properties of the semiconductor/dielectric interface (MoS\n                    2\n                    on industrially relevant high dielectric constant (\n                    k\n                    ) HfO\n                    2\n                    , ZrO\n                    2\n                    and hBN for reference) responsible for realizing enhancement‐mode operation of 2D MoS\n                    2\n                    channel FETs. We find that hBN and ZrO\n                    2\n                    dielectric substrates provide low defect interfaces with MoS\n                    2\n                    that enables effective modulation of the V\n                    th\n                    using gate metals of different work functions (WFs). We use photoluminescence (PL) and synchrotron X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) measurements to investigate doping levels in monolayer MoS\n                    2\n                    on different dielectrics with different WF gate metals. We complement the FET and spectroscopic measurements with capacitance‐voltage analysis on dielectrics with varying thicknesses, which confirms that V\n                    th\n                    modulation in ZrO\n                    2\n                    devices is correlated with WF of the gate metals – in contrast with HfO\n                    2\n                    devices that exhibit signatures of V\n                    th\n                    pinning induced by oxide/interface defect states. Finally, we demonstrate FETs using a 2D MoS\n                    2\n                    channel and a 6 nm of ZrO\n                    2\n                    dielectric, achieving a subthreshold swing of 87 mV dec\n                    −1\n                    and a threshold voltage of 0.1 V. Our results offer insights into the role of dielectric/semiconductor interface in 2D MoS\n                    2\n                    based FETs for realizing enhancement mode FETs and highlight the potential of ZrO\n                    2\n                    as a scalable high‐\n                    k\n                    dielectric."},{"t":"具有更紧密聚集溶剂化结构的苯甲腈基电解质实现4.5V锂金属电池的超长循环与高倍率性能","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72819?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池电解质","kp":["电解质[4.5V锂金属电池]: 苯甲腈基电解质(BNE)","电压[锂金属电池]: 4.5V","溶剂化结构[BNE]: 更紧密聚集体溶剂化结构"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"腈类电解液对高压正极具有优异的抗氧化稳定性，但与锂金属负极兼容性差。本研究设计了基于苄腈的电解液，通过更紧密的聚集溶剂化结构抑制腈基在负极侧的还原分解，实现4.5V锂金属电池的超长循环和高倍率性能。该溶剂化结构工程策略为高压锂金属电池电解液设计提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Benzonitrile‐Based Electrolyte with Tighter Aggregate Solvation Structure Enables Ultralong Cycling and High‐Rate 4.5 V Lithium Metal Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Nitrile‐based electrolytes offer exceptional oxidative stability for high‐voltage cathodes but suffer from reductive instability at lithium metal anodes (LMAs) and poor rate capability. Herein, we report a molecular engineering strategy to overcome these limitations by introducing a benzonitrile‐based electrolyte (BNE) to realize long‐cycling, high‐voltage, and high‐rate LMBs. We leverage the unique molecular features of benzonitrile (BN), where the cyano groups dynamically coordinate lithium ions (Li\n                    +\n                    ), the electron‐deficient phenyl groups interact weakly with anions, and crucially, the bulky BN molecules compress the Li\n                    +\n                    solvation sheath through a spatial site‐blocking effect. The steric demand imposed by BN during Li\n                    +\n                    solvation, coupled with its ability to simultaneously coordinate Li\n                    +\n                    and interact with anions, induces a tighter aggregate (t‐AGG) solvation structure, which is confirmed by various spectroscopic techniques and molecular dynamics simulations. Mechanistically, the t‐AGG solvation structure eliminates most free BN molecules for enhanced stability at LMAs, accelerates Li\n                    +\n                    transport kinetics via increased hopping frequency, and promotes an anion‐derived solid‐electrolyte interphase. Consequently, BNE enables a 4.5 V NCM811||Li cell to achieve 500 cycles with 80% capacity retention at 5C, setting a benchmark for nitrile‐based LMBs. This work provides fundamental insights for designing high‐performance nitrile‐based electrolytes via precise solvation structure engineering for LMBs.","aip":1},{"t":"玻璃文化史的考古启示：历史记载、轶事和事实对现代材料科学的挑战（Adv. Mater. 16/2026）","d":"2026-03-19","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72670?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/非金属/玻璃","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Archaeo-Inspired Materials The history of mankind is the history of materials. In their Perspective (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202512937), Bastian E. Rapp and co-workers elucidate the historical and culture significance of one of mankind's very first high-performance materials: glass. Thes propose Archeo-inspiration as a framework for the future development of this material drawing inspiration from historical and cultural contexts to template and guide future research.","tp":"玻璃材料史","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":"该综述从考古启发材料的视角阐述玻璃——人类最早的高性能材料之一——的历史与文化意义。作者提出'考古启发'框架，主张从历史记载、文化背景和轶事事实中汲取灵感，为玻璃材料的未来研究方向提供模板与指导，连接古代智慧与现代材料科学。"},{"t":"应用机器学习来识别美国记录为其他死因的未被识别的 COVID-19 死亡","d":"2026-03-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef5697?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The actual number of US deaths caused by severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 infection has been investigated and debated since the start of the COVID-19 pandemic. Here, we use machine learning trained on US death certificates from March 2020 to December 2021 to predict 155,536 (95% uncertainty interval: 150,062 to 161,112) unrecognized COVID-19 deaths. This indicates that 19% more COVID-19 deaths occurred in the US than officially reported. Predicted unrecognized COVID-19 deaths occurred disproportionately among decedents with less than a high school education; decedents identified as Hispanic, American Indian, Alaska Native, Asian, and/or Black; counties with lower household incomes and worse preexisting health; and counties in the South. These findings suggest that the US death investigation system undercounted COVID-19 deaths unevenly, hiding the true extent of inequities."},{"t":"液体空气储能系统液化过程分析：两相膨胀概念的概念化与评估","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003533?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/储热/压缩空气","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液态空气储能","kp":["[液态空气储能]: 液化过程与两相膨胀概念评估"],"sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Analysis of liquefaction processes for liquid air energy storage systems: Conceptualization and evaluation of two-phase expansion concepts"},{"t":"通过结构仿生横向热电效应实现全溶液法制备的可扩展可穿戴有机热电器件","d":"2026-03-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea9094?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机热电材料","kp":["器件架构[有机薄膜TEG]: 双热导率弹性基底伪横向结构","制备方式[可穿戴热电]: 全溶液法可规模化工艺"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"有机薄膜热电发电机（TEG）作为柔性和可穿戴能量收集器件前景广阔，但传统纵向热电结构制备复杂。本研究通过结构模拟横向热电效应，采用全溶液工艺制备可规模化、可穿戴的有机热电器件，简化制造流程并提升器件兼容性，为柔性热电技术的实用化开辟了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"All-solution-processed scalable and wearable organic thermoelectrics by structurally mimicking transverse thermoelectric effects","b":"Organic thin-film thermoelectric generators (TEGs) hold great promise as flexible and wearable energy harvesters. However, their broader application is hindered by the difficulty of establishing a temperature gradient within the thin film when using planar heat sources. Here, we introduce pseudo-transverse TEGs (pT-TEGs), an architecture employing an elastic substrate with two thermal conductivities, enabling the orthogonal conversion of longitudinal heat flux into lateral thermovoltage by mimicking the transverse thermoelectric effect. This design circumvents the limitations of conventional thin-film TEGs, such as the need for three-dimensional deformation to form a temperature gradient, allowing efficient thermal energy harvesting from planar heat sources while preserving a two-dimensional form factor. Furthermore, the fully solution-processed and modular pT-TEGs exhibit excellent mechanical flexibility and high scalability. We believe that this approach offers a practical platform for the realization of genuine two-dimensional TEGs and will contribute to the advancement of flexible and wearable energy harvesting technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"ATP13A2 抑制巨噬细胞 NLRP3 炎性体激活，通过调节线粒体稳态来抑制神经退行性变","d":"2026-03-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534066123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Neuro-immune crosstalk is increasingly recognized in Parkinson’s disease (PD), and ATP13A2 is well known for its neuroprotective role. However, it remains unclear whether\n                    ATP13A2\n                    mutations carried by PD patients contribute to immune dysfunction that exacerbates disease progression. Here, we systematically demonstrate that many\n                    ATP13A2\n                    mutations result in a loss-of-expression phenotype. ATP13A2 is highly expressed in macrophages. Myeloid ATP13A2 deficiency causes uncontrolled NLRP3 inflammasome activation driven by lysosomal alkalization and subsequent disrupted mitochondrial homeostasis, rendering mice susceptible to a PD-like phenotype. PD-linked\n                    ATP13A2\n                    loss-of-expression mutants fail to restore the ATP13A2 levels required to suppress NLRP3 hyperactivation in ATP13A2-depleted human THP-1 monocytes. Macrophages from a PD patient carrying the\n                    ATP13A2\n                    loss-of-expression L927P mutation exhibit excessive NLRP3 activation due to lysosomal-mitochondrial dysfunction. Our findings provide insight into PD pathogenesis, emphasizing genetic factor-driven dysregulated macrophage NLRP3 activation, particularly in\n                    ATP13A2\n                    loss-of-expression mutation cases.","tp":"神经退行病","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"帕金森病（PD）的病理过程与神经免疫相互作用密切相关，而ATP13A2基因在其中发挥着重要的神经保护作用。本研究系统论证了PD患者携带的多种ATP13A2突变会导致表达缺失表型。研究发现，ATP13A2在巨噬细胞中高度表达，能够通过调节线粒体稳态来有效抑制NLRP3炎症小体的激活，从而减轻神经退行性病变，延缓疾病进展。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 当沸石遇上电化学器件：隔膜的研究进展","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemrev.5c00494","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Chemical Reviews: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"沸石电池隔膜","kp":["[电池隔膜]: 沸石材料用于先进隔膜的结构-性能设计"],"sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":3.5,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.5},"as":"综述探讨了沸石材料在电化学器件中作为隔膜的应用进展。随着电池在现代社会的广泛应用，隔膜在储能器件中的作用愈发关键。沸石因其有序孔道结构、高化学稳定性和离子选择性，在抑制锂枝晶、提升电池安全性方面展现出独特优势。文章系统梳理了沸石基隔膜的设计策略与性能表现。","ot":"[ASAP] When Zeolites Meet Electrochemical Devices: Progress of Separators","b":"The growing reliance on batteries in modern society highlights the crucial role of separators in energy storage devices. As the demand for high-performance batteries increases, developing advanced separators─guided by a deep understanding of physical phenomena and structure-property relationships─becomes critical for next-generation energy storage systems. Recent developments in separator technology have evolved from simple polymer-based materials to sophisticated organic/inorganic composites. A key innovation in this field is the incorporation of inorganic particles into separators, which significantly improves their physical and chemical performance. Among these inorganic additives, zeolites and other porous materials stand out due to their ordered pore structures, high porosity, large specific surface areas, and excellent thermal stability. This review highlights the chemical and physical properties of zeolites that make them valuable for designing composite separators. We explore the engineering of polymer/zeolite composite separators, with an emphasis on enhancing mechanical strength, increasing ionic conductivity, and promoting favorable chemical interactions. Furthermore, we evaluate the suitability of synthetic zeolites in various types of energy storage systems, focusing on their structural and thermal advantages relevant to separator performance. Finally, we discuss future research directions, potential technological advancements, and the challenges associated with integrating zeolites into catalysts, adsorbents, battery separators, and solid-state electrolytes."},{"t":"[尽快] 加热：用于多温度微尺度反应的无线感应加热","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19957","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Temperature control is central to high-throughput experimentation (HTE), yet reliable heating in disposable plastic multiwell plates remains challenging. Global heating is inefficient in low-thermal-conductivity plastics, can produce well-to-well temperature gradients, and may degrade plasticware or contaminate reactions under excessive or uneven heating. Temperature screening across multiple set points is also highly desirable but difficult to implement at plate scale with conventional approaches, because different temperatures typically require separate plates or hardware, increasing effort and introducing batch effects. Here, we introduce a wireless induction-heating platform that places small metal balls in each well to generate heat directly in the reaction mixture. By heating within each well of a disposable plastic plate, metal ball-mediated induction enables stable in-well temperatures and programs multiple discrete temperature zones within a single multiwell plate by varying only the metal ball count under a single global induction setting. Fiber-optic probe measurements of in-well temperature show a rapid approach to stable temperature plateaus with minimal thermal crosstalk under the conditions employed, and we provide calibration relationships linking induction setting and metal ball count to in-well temperature. The same metal balls also support tumble-stir mixing and can be reagent-coated for ChemBead-style solid delivery. We demonstrate the platform through temperature-resolved microscale cross-coupling screens and a 384-member library synthesis in disposable 384-well plates.","tp":"微反应加热","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"温度控制是高通量实验的核心，但在一次性塑料多孔板中实现可靠加热仍具挑战：全局加热效率低、易产生孔间温度梯度。该研究开发了无线感应加热方法，可在微尺度上实现多温度并行控制，支持同一多孔板内不同温度条件的筛选，适用于高通量反应优化。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 用于近红外发射的过渡金属掺杂卤化物钙钛矿：超越氧化物","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00105","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"过渡金属掺杂钙钛矿","kp":["掺杂离子[卤化物钙钛矿]: Mo3+/Re4+/Os4+低价态","宿主[对比氧化物]: 卤化物稳定低价态","发射波段[LED/激光]: 近红外"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"过渡金属掺杂氧化物荧光粉推动了近红外LED和激光器的发展，但氧化物体系存在固有局限。本文聚焦过渡金属掺杂卤化物钙钛矿作为新型近红外发光材料，超越传统氧化物框架。卤化物钙钛矿的柔性晶格和可调带结构为过渡金属发光中心提供了更优的晶体场环境，有望实现高效可调谐近红外发射。","ot":"[ASAP] Transition-Metal-Doped Halide Perovskites for Near-Infrared Emissions: Beyond Oxides","b":"Transition-metal-doped oxide-based phosphors led to near-infrared (NIR) light-emitting diodes and lasers. Mostly, the first transition series (3d) metal ions, like Cr3+, are doped. Interestingly, heavier transition-metal ions, like Mo3+, Re4+, and Os4+, in their low oxidation states, can be doped in halide perovskites, unlike the oxide hosts that stabilize the higher oxidation state. Consequently, doping heavier transition metal ions in halide hosts opens up new avenues to tailor NIR-I/II emissions for both narrow and broad-band d–d transitions. Furthermore, characteristics such as (i) tunability of crystal field parameters by halide ions, (ii) host emissions, and (iii) colloidal nanocrystal synthesis add new NIR functionalities to transition-metal-doped halide perovskites compared to oxides. Here we provide insights on recent progresses on the NIR emitting transition-metal-doped halides, connecting synthetic materials chemistry, spectroscopy and device fabrication. The present challenges and future opportunities are discussed."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过多酶活性调控Ga柔性单原子纳米酶的自适应催化性能","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23161","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子纳米酶","kp":["[活性中心]: 动态重构Ga-N3S位点","[特点]: 自适应多酶活性切换"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"as":"无机纳米酶受限于刚性活性中心结构，缺乏天然酶的自适应柔性。本研究设计了镓基柔性单原子纳米酶，通过多酶活性调控实现自适应性催化性能。单原子位点的结构柔性使其能根据底物动态调整配位环境，模拟天然酶的构象适应性，在生物传感和催化治疗领域具有应用潜力。","ot":"[ASAP] Tailoring Ga Flexible Single-Atom Nanozymes for Self-Adaptive Catalytic Performance through Multienzyme Activity ","b":"Inorganic nanozymes remain limited by rigid active-center structures, lacking the adaptive flexibility of natural enzymes. Here we report a flexible single-atom nanozyme (FSAzyme) enabled by regulation of Ga coordination. A dynamically reconstructing Ga-N3S site exhibits self-adaptive electronic modulation, allowing the FSAzyme to realize multiple enzyme-mimicking activities and versatile sensing functions. These results establish a general design strategy to introduce enzyme-like adaptivity into single-atom nanozymes."},{"t":"[ASAP] 协同离子工程优化宽带隙钙钛矿以实现钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池的高效重构","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00419","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"宽带隙钙钛矿叠层","kp":["掺杂剂[宽带隙钙钛矿]: 甲酸铷RbFa","机制[协同离子]: Rb+晶格收缩+甲酸根钝化缺陷","成果[叠层电池]: 认证电压破纪录"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"混合卤化物宽禁带钙钛矿在钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池中存在缺陷导致的开路电压损失和光致相分离问题。本研究采用协同离子工程策略，通过多离子协同调控稳定宽禁带钙钛矿晶格，抑制卤素分离并减少缺陷态，有效降低电压损失，推动钙钛矿-有机叠层电池效率提升。","ot":"[ASAP] Synergistic Ion Engineering for Wide-Bandgap Perovskite Enables Perovskite–Organic Tandem Solar Cells with a Reco","b":"Mixed-halide wide-bandgap (WBG) perovskites suffer from defect-induced open-circuit voltage (VOC) loss and photoinduced phase segregation. Herein, we introduce rubidium formate (RbFa) as a single dopant to mitigate both challenges through synergistic ion engineering. The Rb+ cation enters the lattice to induce contraction, while the formate anion (Fa–) modulates crystallization kinetics and passivates halide vacancies. This cooperative interaction maximizes residual compressive strain, thermodynamically raising the ion-migration barrier, while vacancy passivation kinetically blocks migration pathways. Consequently, we achieve a high VOC of 1.371 V and enhanced photostability for 1.86 eV WBG perovskite solar cells (PSCs). Monolithic perovskite–organic tandem solar cells deliver an efficiency of 26.03% with a record certified VOC of 2.189 V and retain over 90% of their initial efficiency after 1000 h under continuous 1-sun illumination.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 强金属-金属相互作用诱导镧系氮化物封装钴用于高效氨合成","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01112","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氨合成催化剂","kp":["催化剂[氨合成]: Co被LaN包覆","机制[金属-金属]: 强相互作用诱导包覆","条件[氨合成]: 温和低温"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"as":"温和条件下氨合成催化剂的开发是重大挑战。本研究利用强金属-金属相互作用，使氮化镧封装钴形成核壳结构催化剂，实现高效氨合成。LaN对Co的封装效应调控了电子结构，促进氮气活化与加氢，在较低温度和压力下展现出优异的催化活性，为非钌基低温氨合成催化剂设计提供了新思路。","ot":"[ASAP] Strong Metal–Metal Interaction-Induced Encapsulation of Cobalt by Lanthanum Nitride for Efficient Ammonia Synthes","b":"Developing catalysts for ammonia synthesis under mild conditions is of paramount importance but remains a grand challenge, primarily due to the trade-off between efficient dinitrogen activation and hydrogen poisoning. Nitride-supported metal catalysts exhibit remarkably low-temperature activity, yet the atomic origin of their synergy remains a subject of intense debate. Building on our recently established generalized theories of strong metal-metal interaction (SMMI) and encapsulation, we combine ab initio atomistic thermodynamics and machine-learning potential-driven molecular dynamics simulations to systematically construct a unified mechanistic framework for these highly active systems. Using lanthanum nitride (LaN)-supported cobalt (Co) nanoparticles as a prototypical model, we reveal that, driven by SMMI and facilitated by nitrogen vacancies, the nitride support spontaneously restructures to encapsulate metal nanoparticles via the formation of subnitride overlayers. This thermodynamically stable encapsulated architecture constructs contiguous perimeter sites─involving both low-valent La cations and electron-rich cobalt metal─that fundamentally alter the catalytic landscape, while intrinsically securing the antisintering stability of small Co nanoparticles. First-principles calculations reveal that these perimeter sites cooperatively facilitate N2 activation while simultaneously suppressing H-poisoning. Consequently, microkinetic simulations yield an apparent activation energy of 50 kJ mol-1, in good agreement with experimental values. By naturally accounting for a diverse array of experimental observations, this work establishes SMMI-driven encapsulation as a robust physical framework for understanding and designing nitride-based catalysts for ammonia synthesis under mild conditions."},{"t":"[ASAP] 锌基配位网络中刺激诱导的微柔性纳米孔实现四种不同的吸附机制","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20939","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌MOF气体分离","kp":["材料[配位网络]: CALF-20锌基","特性[柔性]: 温度/客体诱导微柔性","机制[吸附]: 四种不同机制"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"理解吸附机制对气体分离科学与技术至关重要，但现有吸附剂难以区分多种吸附路径。本研究在锌基配位网络中引入刺激响应的微柔性纳米孔，通过结构柔韧性实现四种不同的吸附机制。这种多机制协同吸附能力为高效气体分离与存储材料的理性设计提供了新的结构范式。","ot":"[ASAP] Stimulus-Induced Microflexible Nanopores in Zinc-Based Coordination Network Enable Four Distinct Adsorption Mecha","b":"Understanding adsorption mechanisms is fundamental to advancing gas separation science and technology. Nevertheless, sorbents that undergo stimulus-induced fine-tuning of their structures to enable multiple adsorption mechanisms are rarely reported. Here, we report that CALF-20, a zinc-based coordination network, exhibits temperature and guest-induced microflexibility to exhibit four distinct and tunable adsorption mechanisms for nine light hydrocarbon gases: (i) thermodynamic selectivity (ethane/ethylene separation); (ii) kinetic-limited adsorption (propane, n-butane, and n-butene); (iii) molecular sieving (iso-butane/iso-butene); (iv) gate-opening flexibility (butadiene capture in the presence of n-alkane impurities). In effect, temperature-dependent structural flexibility enables modulation of guest diffusion kinetics and adsorption thermodynamics. CALF-20 thereby achieves propylene purification from propane and butadiene purification with exceptional selectivity. Structural and computational insights into the mechanisms governing the selective separation of light hydrocarbons using CALF-20 reveal the potential of targeted flexible nanoporous materials with dynamically tunable pore environments, paving the way for next-generation separation technologies in the petrochemical and energy sectors."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过宝石双金属化环丙烷立体控制合成多取代 Housanes","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02374","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"We report a stereoselective synthesis of polysubstituted housanes via bismetalated cyclopropane intermediates. The strategy relies on diastereoselective allylzincation of lithiated cyclopropenes followed by intramolecular cyclization, generating metalated housanes as key intermediates. Subsequent electrophile trapping enables efficient diversification of the housanes. Notably, this approach provides access to 2,3-dialkyl-substituted housanes, allowing the selective synthesis of both the diastereomers.","tp":"环丙烷化学","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究报道了通过双金属化环丙烷中间体立体选择性合成多取代housanes的方法。策略基于锂化环丙烯的非对映选择性烯丙基锌化反应和分子内环化，生成金属化housanes关键中间体，随后经亲电体捕获实现高效多样化，可选择性合成多种2,3-二烷基取代的非对映异构体。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 聚光条件下稳定氮化碳光阳极用于无辅助醇重整耦合CO2还原","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20624","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氮化碳光电阳极","kp":["光阳极[PEC]: 氰胺功能化氮化碳","反应[耦合]: 醇重整+CO2还原","条件[无偏压]: 聚光太阳能"],"dp":1,"as":"本研究针对碳氮化物（polymeric carbon nitride）作为光阳极在光电化学（PEC）器件中的应用进行稳定化改性。碳氮化物是一种可规模化、低成本的有机半导体，在太阳能驱动的醇类重整反应中具有应用前景。研究通过界面工程与缺陷钝化策略提升碳氮化物光阳极在无外加偏压条件下的光稳定性与催化效率，为无辅助太阳能燃料合成提供了可行路径。属于光催化/人工光合作用方向。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Stabilizing Carbon Nitride Photoanodes for Unassisted Alcohol Reforming Coupled to CO2 Reduction under Concentrat","b":"Carbon nitride is a scalable and low-cost organic semiconductor with promise for use in photoelectrochemical (PEC) devices, but its poor stability limits its practical use. This study establishes the importance of light intensity and applied electrochemical potential on the stability of cyanamide-functionalized carbon nitride photoanodes used for waste-derived alcohol oxidation. Operating under concentrated sunlight (3 suns) and low bias (<0.2 V vs reversible hydrogen electrode, RHE) enabled over 20 h of continuous operation. In situ spectroscopy and impedance analysis linked carbon nitride degradation at higher potential (>0.4 V vs RHE) to irreversible morphological changes and self-oxidation, exacerbated by conductivity loss. These insights enabled the stabilization of carbon nitride photoelectrodes and paved the way for the development of a standalone PEC device with an integrated thermoelectric unit to convert heat into an additional internal bias-voltage, where carbon nitride efficiently drives alcohol oxidation coupled to CO2-to-CO conversion for over 70 h. This work sets a benchmark for carbon nitride stability and PEC deployment, and highlights the need to revisit PEC testing protocols to unlock the full potential of emerging semiconductors."},{"t":"[ASAP] 沸石封装亚纳米Pt催化高密度聚乙烯选择性转化为苯","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c14646","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚乙烯制苯","kp":["催化剂[HDPE转化]: 沸石封装亚纳米Pt","产物[选择性]: 单一产物苯","机制[选择性]: 形状选择性两步法"],"as":"本研究实现了高密度聚乙烯（HDPE）向单一高附加值化学品——苯的形状选择性转化。聚烯烃塑料废弃物的升级回收（upcycling）长期受限于产物分布复杂、分离成本高的问题。通过分子筛催化剂的孔道择形效应，将HDPE选择性断裂芳构化为苯，大幅提升技术经济性。该工作为塑料废弃物的化学闭环回收提供了新策略，具有重要的产业化潜力。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Shape-Selective Conversion of High-Density Polyethylene into Benzene with Zeolite-Encapsulated Subnanometer Pt Ca","b":"Selective conversion of polyolefins into a single value-added chemical can greatly improve the techno-economy of the upcycling process. However, to date, most reported catalytic processes can convert polyolefins into only mixed hydrocarbon or oxygenate compounds. Herein, we have developed a shape-selective catalytic route for converting high-density polyethylene (HDPE) into benzene through a two-step process based on zeolite-confined subnanometer Pt catalysts, including the conversion of HDPE to mixed alkanes through hydrocracking and the subsequent conversion of mixed alkanes to benzene through dehydroaromatization. By constructing neighboring subnanometer Pt clusters and acid sites within β-zeolite, we can achieve the highest specific activity in the hydrocracking of HDPE at a very low Pt loading (∼300 ppm) and high selectivity to liquid alkanes. Furthermore, the liquid alkanes are selectively converted into benzene with ∼45% yield by a PtSn@MFI catalyst in which subnanometer bimetallic PtSn clusters are confined in the MFI zeolite.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过多阳离子调控的自适应超离子电解质用于全固态锂金属电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20920","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超离子固态电解质","kp":["[电解质]: 多阳离子调制自适应超离子","[应用]: 全固态锂金属电池"],"as":"全固态锂金属电池兼具高比能量与本质安全优势，但界面阻抗与锂枝晶生长等实际问题制约其应用。本研究提出多阳离子调制策略，设计自适应超离子导体电解质，通过多种阳离子协同作用动态适应电极界面变化，降低界面电阻并抑制枝晶。该策略为高能量密度固态电池的工程化提供了新思路，属于固态电池电解质设计前沿。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Self-Adaptive Superionic Electrolytes via Multiple-Cation Modulation for All-Solid-State Lithium–Metal Batteries","b":"All-solid-state lithium-metal batteries offer devices with high specific energy and intrinsic safety, yet their practical implementation is impeded by interfacial instability at the lithium metal/electrolyte interface, especially under high current densities. Conventional interfacial stabilization approaches require complex and costly interfacial engineering, limiting their practicality, highlighting the urgent need for a simple yet effective electrolyte design strategy. Here, a multiple-cation-presetting (Ag and W) argyrodite electrolyte is developed to simultaneously achieve superionic conductivity (over 10 mS cm-1) and superior interfacial stability with softer texture. During cycling, Ag+ can be extracted from the electrolyte layer, reduced to Ag metal, and diffused into the lithium-metal anode to form a uniform Li-Ag alloy, while W can convert into minor conductive LiWS2 in the solid electrolyte interface. Benefiting from in situ anodic and interfacial modification by the SSE, it facilitates accelerated interfacial kinetics and homogeneous Li+ flux. As a result, the Li symmetric cells exhibit sustainable cycling over 4000 h at 0.5 mA cm-2 and beyond 1000 h at 1 mA cm-2. The Li//LiNi0.8Co0.1Mn0.1O2 cells demonstrate excellent rate capability and extended cycle life, maintaining 82.7% capacity retention after 1100 cycles at 2C. Moreover, the electrolyte sustains stable operation at high areal loading (3 mAh cm-2) and low temperature (-30 °C). Besides, such solid-state electrolytes can be extended to other all-solid-state lithium-metal rechargeable batteries. This scalable dual-cation modulation strategy provides a general and practical route to construct superionic electrolytes with compatibility with an anode by in situ interfacial and lithium metal decoration, advancing the realistic application of next-generation all-solid-state lithium-metal batteries."},{"t":"[ASAP] 水与亲水性纯二氧化硅沸石相互作用过程中的室温框架氧同位素交换","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23024","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","b":"Four different hydrophobic, low-defect pure-silica zeolites are contacted with isotopically enriched water at room temperature, and all show isotope exchange of 17O into the Si-O-Si units of the zeolite structure using multiple-quantum MAS NMR spectroscopy. For the CHA zeolite structure, exchange of 18O into the framework was identified using neutron diffraction─the first time this technique has been used to differentiate oxygen isotopes in any solid-state material. The results indicate that even supposedly very hydrophobic pure-silica zeolites are susceptible to oxygen exchange under very mild aqueous conditions. This has important consequences for our view of the structure of zeolites in contact with water."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过分子迁移率进行表型分析：低亲和力可逆探针能够对细胞 Pop 进行表征和分类","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c11933","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cell surface biomolecules, such as membrane receptors, are key drivers of cellular behavior and are therefore inherently different for cell types with different functions and pathogenicity. Here, we present a super-resolution method for functional phenotyping of cell populations based on the single-molecule analysis of membrane receptor mobility. Central to our approach is a library of nanofitin-based low-affinity probes that selectively and reversibly bind to target receptors in live cells. These probes enable the direct detection, counting, and tracking of individual receptors without requiring genetic modification or chemical labeling, allowing the study of endogenous biomolecules in unperturbed cells. Using this strategy, we demonstrate that identical receptors can exhibit distinct mobility patterns across different cell types, reflecting the underlying physiological differences. By integrating these probes with single-molecule point accumulation for imaging in nanoscale topography imaging and tracking, advanced image analysis, and AI-driven classification, we provide a robust workflow for understanding and phenotyping of cells by their receptor mobility.","tp":"分子迁移率","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究提出一种基于单分子分析的膜受体迁移率超分辨率表型分析方法。核心是利用纳米抗体来源的低亲和力探针库，能够选择性地、可逆地结合活细胞表面的目标受体。通过分析受体在膜上的运动模式，可对不同功能的细胞群体进行功能表征与分类，为细胞异质性研究和疾病诊断提供新工具。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 甲基丙烯酸酯与香豆素的完美交替共聚：构建具有完全可回收性的稳健C-C主链聚合物","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01713","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"香豆素交替共聚","kp":["催化剂[共聚]: Al(C6F5)3/PnBu3 Lewis对","单体[共聚]: 甲基丙烯酸酯+可再生香豆素","序列[共聚]: 完美交替","特性[主链C-C]: 全降解可逆"],"as":"本研究首次报道甲基丙烯酸酯与简单、商业化、生物可再生来源的香豆素衍生物的完美交替共聚反应。实现两种单体的严格交替序列结构对精确控制聚合物微结构与功能至关重要。该工作通过催化剂/引发体系设计调控两种单体反应活性的匹配，制备出结构明确的功能共聚物，拓展了可再生单体在精密聚合物合成中的应用。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Perfectly Alternating Copolymerizations of Methacrylates and Coumarin to Robust C–C Main-Chain Polymers with Full","b":"This contribution reports the first copolymerization of methacrylates with simple, commercially available, and biorenewable coumarin (CM). The key to this achievement lies in the rational design of a new Al(C6F5)3/PnBu3 Lewis pair cooperative catalyst, which possesses several unique features, including high efficiency, living nature, and, more strikingly, perfectly alternating sequence control. Computational studies elucidate that kinetic control, enabled by different attractive London dispersion interactions between enolaluminate active species and two monomer substrates, is a decisive factor for alternating sequence control. Accordingly, a series of alternating vinyl copolymers with a high molecular weight (Mn) of up to 330.8 kg/mol can be synthesized directly from commercial/general vinyl monomers regardless of monomer structures and feed ratios. These copolymers have been determined to be highly transparent materials with high heat resistance (Tg: 130-190 °C), good thermal stability (Td up to 300 °C), and good durability and are meanwhile fully degradable at room temperature under a strong base and completely thermal depolymerizable in the presence of a strong donating solvent (e.g., DMF), thus affording a new class of robust, durable, yet fully degradable, depolymerizable C-C main-chain polymers, which are generally unachievable due to an inherent performance/degradability (depolymerizability) trade-off."},{"t":"[ASAP] 有机膦酸酯连接方法用于控制巨型多金属氧酸盐簇的组装","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21427","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The controlled assembly of gigantic polyoxometalate (POM) clusters remains one of the most formidable challenges in molecular self-assembly, as it is highly dependent on delicate synthesis parameters that can yield a wide variety of products. In this study, we report the synthesis of a series of unprecedented wheel-shaped molybdenum-blue (MB) clusters directed by organophosphonate (L) and acetate ligands, resulting in a new range of giant MB-type POMs: {Mo136Na4}, {Mo120}, {Mo118Na2}, {Mo118}, and {Mo157}. These structures, constructed from fundamental {Mo1}, {Mo2}, and {Mo8} building blocks, exhibit new features of organic ligand coordination on their exterior surfaces. Notably, the {Mo157} framework acts as a host capable of capturing the fully reduced ε-Keggin-based {Mo16} guest. It represents the first pure dodecameric Mo wheel reported to date. Systematic variation of reaction parameters─including ligand type, concentration, solvent composition, and precursor identity─enabled precise control over cluster topology, revealing competitive coordination between organophosphonate and acetate ligands. Structural analyses unveiled new connection modes involving reduced edge-sharing {e-Mo2} units and their derivative {Mo3L2} motifs, which reinforce the overall cage architecture. Mass spectrometry and NMR spectroscopy confirmed the structural integrity of these assemblies in solution. This work not only expands the library of gigantic MB clusters but also establishes a new strategy for their controlled construction using anchored organophosphonate ligands. The resulting clusters exhibit significantly enhanced solubility in organic solvents compared with traditional MB species, offering new opportunities for postsynthetic modification, improved interactions with biomolecules, and diverse applications.","tp":"多金属氧簇","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"巨型多金属氧酸盐（POM）簇的可控组装长期面临合成参数极其敏感的挑战。本研究报道了以有机膦酸酯和醋酸配体为导向，合成一系列前所未有的轮状钼蓝（MB）型巨型POM簇，包括{Mo136Na4}、{Mo120}、{Mo118Na2}、{Mo118}等新结构。该连接方法为巨型POM簇的精确组装提供了新策略。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 分子动力学指导的共价激酶活性探针的设计和化学蛋白质组学分析","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18691","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Covalent small molecule probes can be powerful tools to interrogate protein activity state in native cellular environments. The design of familywide activity probes requires an understanding of the molecular sources of conserved and target-specific small molecule targeting across protein family members. Here, we developed and applied a multifaceted docking and molecular dynamics (MD) simulation pipeline to design cell-permeable covalent kinase activity probes from a set of hinge-binding pharmacophores. This computationally-guided approach yielded a series of cell-active indazole sulfonylfluorides that target a conserved catalytic lysine in active protein kinases. Chemoproteomic profiling of a lead probe, K60P, confirmed engagement of more than 100 unique native kinases across several cancer cell lines. Competitive profiling identified kinases as the predominant class of specific targets for K60P but also highlighted significant nonkinase targets for K60P and the established covalent kinase probe, XO44, underscoring the utility of native kinase profiling in situ to identify relevant targets of small molecule kinase inhibitors in cells. Dose-, time- and site-specific proteomic mapping with a known target kinase, ABL1, coupled with a Bayesian Metropolis Monte Carlo (BMMC) kinetic modeling method showed that key descriptors of covalent probe efficiency could be predicted with straightforward dose- and time-dependent covalent engagement studies and highlighted kinact/KI as a key variable to optimize for specific and broad kinase engagement. Finally, focused molecular dynamics simulations revealed that K60P, as well as the comparator probe XO44, preferentially engage with target kinases in their active, DFG-in conformations, which is driven by increasing population of reaction-ready small molecule conformation. These results together establish a computational and kinetic modeling framework for designing covalent activity probes and highlight the balance of target selectivity and kinetic efficiency as a key factor in determining their proteome-wide reactivity.","tp":"激酶探针","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究开发了多层面分子对接和分子动力学（MD）模拟管线，用于设计细胞渗透性共价激酶活性探针。基于铰链结合型药效团的系统分析，揭示了蛋白质家族中保守和靶标特异性小分子靶向的分子来源，实现了家族宽谱激酶活性探针的理性设计，并通过化学蛋白质组学验证其应用价值。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 混合镧系金属有机框架用于近红外-I生物成像与近红外-III四光子上转换","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00409","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镧系MOF上转换发光","kp":["材料[MOF]: 混合镧系Yb3+/Tb3+/Eu3+","成像[生物]: 近红外I","发光[激发]: 近红外III四光子上转换"],"dp":1,"as":"镧系金属有机框架（Ln-MOFs）为上转换发光与近红外成像提供了结构精确的平台。本研究通过混合多种镧系离子构建多组分MOF，优化近红外一区（NIR-I）生物成像的发光效率与组织穿透深度。利用MOF的结构可调性精确控制镧系离子间的能量传递，实现高效上转换发射。该材料在深层组织无损成像与生物传感方面具有应用潜力。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Mixed-Lanthanide Metal–Organic Frameworks for Near-Infrared-I Bioimaging and Near-Infrared-III Four-Photon Upconv","b":"Lanthanide-based metal-organic frameworks (Ln-MOFs) provide a structurally precise platform for upconversion luminescence engineering, yet practical applications are limited by insufficient structural stability, restricted color tunability, and the lack of excitation in the NIR-III window. Here, we report a MOF incorporating mixed-lanthanide Yb3+, Tb3+, and Eu3+ ions that addresses these challenges. The optically transparent and periodic framework enforces a uniform spatial distribution of lanthanide centers and establishes stepwise interionic energy transfer pathways, while ether-containing organic linkers enhance photo and thermal stability. Under NIR-I (980 nm) excitation, the Ln-MOFs exhibit tunable multicolor upconversion emission with high hydrolytic stability and biocompatibility, enabling reliable in vivo imaging in zebrafish models. Remarkably, under NIR-III (1960 nm) excitation, a four-photon upconversion process is observed for the first time in Ln-MOFs. Together, these results expand the excitation landscape of Ln-MOFs from NIR-I to NIR-III and confirm the potential of structurally programmable Ln-MOFs for bioimaging and nonlinear photonic applications."},{"t":"[ASAP] 逃避库普弗细胞捕获的可修改亚 20 nm 脂质纳米盘型 19F 磁共振成像探针","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21753","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"19F magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) is an innovative imaging method that enables sensitive visualization of 19F-containing probes and has been applied to biomedical imaging. A key strategy in probe design is incorporation of a large number of highly mobile 19F nuclei that can enhance the MRI signal intensity. However, conventional emulsion-based probes are difficult to reduce to below 80 nm in diameter, making them prone to uptake by Kupffer cells and resulting in poor delivery efficiency to target tissues. Moreover, smaller probes based on nanocrystals or polymers suffer from low 19F mobility, leading to weak signal intensity. In this study, we utilized lipid nanodiscs to confine highly mobile 19F-labeled lipids, developing sub-20 nm 19F MRI probes with diameters of approximately 10 nm. The resulting probes exhibited a unique behavior in vivo, distinct from that of conventional probes: they avoided Kupffer cell uptake and were excreted via kidneys. MR signals remained detectable after surface modification. PEGylated nanodiscs exhibited a slower accumulation in the bladder compared with unmodified counterparts, likely due to their prolonged circulation time induced by PEG modification. With the potential to reach tissues previously inaccessible and be modified with various functional moieties, our nanodisc-based platform offers broad opportunities for biomedical applications, including visualization of diverse organs and monitoring of biochemical reactions in vivo.","tp":"纳米盘成像","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"19F磁共振成像需要大量高迁移率氟核以增强信号，但传统乳液型探针粒径难以低于80nm，易被肝脏库普弗细胞吞噬，导致递送效率低。本研究开发了可修饰的亚20nm脂质纳米盘型19F MRI探针，能有效逃避库普弗细胞捕获，显著提高靶向组织的递送效率，为深层组织成像提供了新平台。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 电催化加氢中氢溢流的原位拉曼光谱研究","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00294","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化加氢氢溢流","kp":["方法[原位]: 拉曼光谱","对象[电催化加氢]: 氢溢流观测"],"as":"该研究利用原位拉曼光谱技术揭示了电催化反应中氢溢流（hydrogen spillover）的动态过程。吸附氢物种（*H）在电化学加氢反应中起关键作用，理解氢从活性位点向载体迁移的机制对优化催化剂设计至关重要。通过光谱手段实时监测，研究者直接观测到氢溢流的动态行为，为提高电催化加氢效率、设计更高效的催化剂体系提供了机理层面的实验证据。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] In Situ Raman Spectroscopic Insight of Hydrogen Spillover in Electrocatalytic Hydrogenation","b":"Given the crucial role of adsorbed hydrogen species (*H) in electrochemical hydrogenation reactions, manipulating hydrogen spillover to facilitate the generation and migration of *H is highly necessary. However, the strong coupling between hydrogen activation sites and hydrogenation sites, together with the coexistence of protons and water molecules in practical electrocatalytic systems, renders a grand challenge for the in situ monitoring of hydrogen spillover. Herein, using single-atom Ru-doped Cu as a model catalyst, the spectroscopic visualization of hydrogen spillover under electrochemical conditions was realized by in situ surface-enhanced Raman spectroscopy. Taking para-nitrothiophenol as the probe molecule, we elucidated that the hydrogen spillover distance was facet-dependent, with Cu(111) being more active for electrocatalytic hydrogenation than Cu(100). Notably, electrochemical hydrogen spillover distances were tunable with the variation of applied potentials, which increased, ranging from 0.8 to 2.6 nm as the potentials shifted negatively. Moreover, by leveraging the hydrogen spillover effect to increase the hydrogen coverage on the Cu(111) surface, we found that the rate-determining step of nitrate electroreduction could be altered, resulting in a significant enhancement of catalytic performance."},{"t":"[ASAP] 原位形成的Pt-Ga异质双原子催化剂用于N-杂环化合物的高效储氢","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18832","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机液体储氢","kp":["催化剂[储氢]: Pt1-Ga1/CeO2双原子","形成[原位]: 异核双原子","应用[LOHC]: N-杂环液态有机氢载体"],"as":"该研究开发了一种原位形成的Pt–Ga异核双原子催化剂，用于液态有机储氢载体（LOHCs）的高效脱氢与加氢反应。LOHC技术是氢能储运的重要路线，但反应效率受限于催化剂性能。该双原子催化剂中Pt和Ga位点协同作用，在较低温度下实现高效储氢/释氢循环，为氢能经济中的催化体系设计提供了新思路，有望降低储氢成本并提升循环稳定性。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] In Situ Formed Pt–Ga Hetero Duo-Atomic Catalyst for Efficient Hydrogen Storage in N-Heterocycles","b":"Efficient catalysts for the dehydrogenation and hydrogenation of liquid organic hydrogen carriers (LOHCs) are essential for advancing hydrogen storage and transportation. Conventional nanoparticle catalysts suffer from low metal utilization, while single-atom catalysts (SAC) are limited by isolated active sites. Here, we present a hetero duo-atomic catalyst, Pt1-Ga1/CeO2 DAC, which exhibits exceptional activity, selectivity, stability, and recyclability for N-heterocycle hydrogen storage. Ga plays a critical role in C-H bond activation, acting as a mediator in catalytic bond-breaking and formation. Compared with Pt1/CeO2 SAC, Pt1-Ga1/CeO2 DAC enhances metal utilization while overcoming SAC limitations for large substrates. This work establishes a promising strategy for designing highly efficient catalysts for LOHC applications."},{"t":"[ASAP] 自修复高自旋簇材料中湿度诱导的三态磁开关效应","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23082","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"三态磁开关材料","kp":["材料[自旋簇]: Ni9[W(CN)8]6","特性[磁性]: 湿度诱导三态开关","状态[75%RH]: 顺磁"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了一种自修复高自旋分子材料，在外界湿度刺激下可实现三态磁开关行为。外部刺激响应磁性材料是下一代存储与传感技术的核心，而多态磁切换尤其具有挑战性。该材料利用湿度变化驱动电子结构或配位环境的可逆变化，在高、中、低三种磁性状态间切换，兼具自修复能力，在分子存储和传感器件领域展现出独特应用前景。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Humidity-Induced Tristate Magnetic Switching in a Self-Healing High-Spin Cluster Material","b":"Externally stimulated magnetic materials are essential for next-generation memory and sensing technologies; however, tristate magnetic switching remains rare. This study presents a cyanide-bridged pentadecanuclear spin-cluster, Ni9[W(CN)8]6(pyrazole)18(H2O)6·zH2O (Ni9W6), which exhibits reversible humidity-induced tristate magnetic switching. The material is paramagnetic at 75% relative humidity (RH), ferromagnetic (Curie temperature = 11 K) at 11% RH, and displays interacting superparamagnetic (blocking temperature = 13 K) at 0% RH. The adsorption and desorption of in-layer crystallization water modulate the number of superexchange interaction pathways linking discrete Ni9W6 clusters, directly tuning intercluster magnetic coupling without altering the cluster framework or electronic states. Complete dehydration induces reversible nanoscale cracking, whereby crystals are divided into 6-8 nm magnetic nanodomains that interact via dipolar forces to yield the interacting superparamagnetic state. This water-mediated control of superexchange pathways and reversible formation of nanoscale magnetic regions achieved in a self-healing spin material provide a design strategy for multistate stimuli-responsive functional materials."},{"t":"[ASAP] 基于有机硒的高效氯固定用于3.7V水系电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16178","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氯固定水系电池","kp":["电压[水系电池]: 3.7V","氯固定剂[ClRR]: 有机硒","氧化还原[氯]: Cl0/Cl-"],"as":"该研究利用有机硒化合物实现高效氯固定反应，用于3.7V水系电池体系。水系电池因安全性高而备受关注，但正极材料在高电位下的选择性和稳定性限制了能量密度提升。有机硒催化氯的固定/氧化还原反应，将活泼氯物种稳定锚定，实现高电位稳定循环。该策略为突破水系电池能量密度瓶颈提供了新的正极化学路线。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Highly Efficient Chlorine Fixation Based on Organic Selenium for 3.7-V Aqueous Batteries","b":"The limited high-potential cathode materials for aqueous batteries have hindered their improvement in energy density improvement. Chlorine-based batteries with Cl0 to Cl- redox reaction (ClRR) are promising for high-performance aqueous batteries due to their high redox potential and large theoretical capacity. However, the inherent gas-liquid conversion feature of ClRR and poor Cl fixation can cause Cl2 leakage, reducing battery reversibility and raising safety concerns. Herein, we utilize a Se-based organic molecule, polymerized benzoselenadiazole (poly-PhSe), as the Cl-anchoring agent and realize an atomic level-Cl fixation through chalcogen-halogen coordinating chemistry, achieving a highly reversible ClRR with extra-low Cl2 emission and a notably high-discharge voltage (3.7 V when paired with a graphite anode). The promoted Cl fixation and multivalence conversion of Se contribute to a three-electron conversion process, resulting in a significantly high-discharge capacity of up to 344 mAh g-1 with an average output voltage of 1.79 V and a high Coulombic efficiency of 99.1%. Based on the superior reversibility of the developed poly-PhSe electrode with ClRR, a remarkable rate performance and cycling performance (with a capacity retention of 84.6% after 850 cycles) are achieved. Significantly, the pouch cell delivers a record areal capacity of up to 5.3 mAh cm-2, demonstrating great potential for practical applications. This chalcogen-halogen coordination chemistry between the Se electrode and Cl provides new insight for developing reversible and efficient batteries with halogen redox reactions."},{"t":"[ASAP] 用于动态光学与热管理的快速响应柔性多光谱调制器","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00165","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性多光谱调制器","kp":["器件[调制器]: 柔性多光谱","特性[调制]: 快速响应"],"dp":1,"as":"研究团队开发了基于柔性衬底的快速响应多光谱调制器，可实现动态光学与热辐射调控。该器件兼具机械柔性与多波段（可见光至红外）调制能力，响应速度快，适用于智能热管理、可穿戴光学器件及自适应伪装等场景，在柔性光电领域具有应用前景。","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":2.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Fast-Response Flexible Multispectral Modulators for Dynamic Optical and Thermal Management","b":"The rapid advancement of reconnaissance technologies has rendered conventional single-band and static camouflage technology ineffective, driving the urgent demand for multispectral dynamic camouflage technology capable of actively changing its spectral properties. Herein, we present a flexible multispectral dynamic modulator (FMDM) that achieves dynamic and compatible visible–infrared camouflage based on a silver-mesh multispectral transparent conductive electrode and reversible copper electrodeposition. The high electron conductivity of the working electrode, combined with the high ionic conductivity of quasi-solid gel electrolyte, enables the uniform, rapid, and reversible deposition/dissolution of copper nanoparticles. Consequently, the FMDM delivers broadband tunability from visible to mid-infrared with high optical modulation contrasts of 0.67 (0.7–2.5 μm), 0.68 (3–5 μm), and 0.82 (8–13 μm), while maintaining a relatively low visible reflectance consistently. Notably, the FMDM also demonstrates ultrafast response speed (2.4/2.7 s), wide operating temperature range (−40–60 °C), and long-term cycling stability. This work paves the way for next-generation multispectral dynamic camouflage technologies."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过脱硼环化轻松合成非交替 π-共轭氮硼烷","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23345","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Skeletal editing of aza-heteroarenes has become a powerful strategy for late-stage molecular diversification in medicinal and material chemistry. π-Conjugated azaborines have attracted increasing attention due to their exceptional optoelectronic properties and practical applications in organic light-emitting diodes (OLEDs). However, ring manipulation of boron-containing rings remains a long-standing challenge, and cascade skeletal editing beyond monocyclic frameworks is largely underdeveloped. Here, we report a boron-deleting annulation (BDA) reaction that enables the transformation of unstrained bicyclic 1,4-azaborines into a diaza-pentagon-heptagon pair in a one-pot reaction, affording a wide array of nonalternant π-conjugated azaborines (>35 examples) with unique optoelectronic properties. This late-stage modification approach thus balances synthetic simplicity with structural diversity and expands the accessible chemical space of functional π-systems for optoelectronic applications. Additionally, the BDA product can trigger consecutive cyclodehydrogenation to zipping-up sophisticated nanographenes via further periphery-to-core extension. Mechanistic studies reveal a series of unprecedented ring contraction-expansion processes. Remarkably, yellow OLEDs based on BDA product achieved a record 23.0% external quantum efficiency without delayed fluorescence, demonstrating the potential for high-performance electroluminescence.","tp":"氮硼烷合成","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"含硼π共轭氮硼烷因优异的光电性能在OLED等领域受到关注，但含硼环的环系操控仍是长期难题。本研究通过脱硼环化反应，实现了非交替π共轭氮硼烷的简便合成，将骨架编辑策略从单环框架拓展到级联反应，为含硼杂芳烃的后期分子多样化提供了新方法。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 揭示NH2OH介导的光电催化C-N偶联路径以实现太阳能驱动的六亚甲基四胺合成","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20896","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电催化C-N偶联","kp":["中间体[路径]: 羟胺NH2OH介导","反应[偶联]: C-N偶联","产物[太阳能]: 六亚甲基四胺HMTA","催化剂[基础]: Cu基"],"as":"研究揭示了以羟胺（NH2OH）为媒介的光电催化C-N偶联反应路径，致力于可持续构建多重C-N键。该路径在复杂碳氮化合物合成中解决关键挑战，有望为含氮有机分子的绿色电化学合成提供新策略，在药物和精细化学品合成领域具有潜在应用价值。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Elucidating the NH2OH–Mediated Pathway for Photoelectrocatalytic C–N Coupling toward Solar-Driven Hexamethylenete","b":"The sustainable construction of multiple C-N bonds remains a fundamental challenge, particularly for complex carbon-nitrogen molecules that require multielectron and multistep processes. Hexamethylenetetramine (HMTA) is an essential chemical feedstock, while its conventional synthesis is energy and carbon-emission intensive. Recent studies indicate the promise of Cu-based catalysts for electrochemical HMTA formation, yet a single Cu site is inherently limited in coordinating the multiple hydrogenation and condensation steps necessary for simultaneously forming the two key HMTA precursors (i.e., (CH2NH)3 and N(CH2OH)3). Herein, we report a sustainable photoelectrocatalytic (PEC) approach for HMTA synthesis via coupling NO3- and HCHO using a Si-based photocathode integrated with hierarchical Cu/Co nanoarray cocatalysts (Cu/Co-Si). This architecture decouples light absorption and catalytic reaction, delivering a high HMTA faradaic efficiency of 80.62% at 0.2 VRHE, over 3.2 times that of Cu-Si, and a yield rate of 5.43 μmol h-1 cm-2. Importantly, *NH2OH generated on Co sites during NO3- reduction is identified as a key intermediate that couples directly with *HCHO to form an oxime (*CH2═NOH), accelerating the formation of (CH2NH)3. Meanwhile, Cu sites favor the NH3-HCHO condensation pathway to generate N(CH2OH)3. The rational dual-site strategy and photovoltaic compatibility offer a scalable, sustainable platform for solar-driven C-N coupling toward high-value chemicals.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 电催化C–S偶联：从混合多元醇高效电合成有机硫化合物，碳利用率>99%","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02189","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化C-S偶联","kp":["碳选择性[C-S偶联]: >99%","反应[电催化]: C-S偶联","原料[生物质]: 混合多元醇"],"as":"研究提出利用多元醇为原料进行电催化碳-硫（C-S）偶联反应，高效合成有机硫化合物。该电催化路线以可再生原料替代传统硫化学合成，具有绿色、高效的优势，为含硫药物中间体、功能材料等高附加值有机硫化合物的可持续合成开辟了新途径。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Electrocatalytic C–S Coupling for Efficient Organosulfur Electrosynthesis from Mixed Polyols with >99% of Carbon ","b":"Electrocatalytic carbon-sulfur (C-S) coupling from polyols offers an efficient route for synthesizing value-added organosulfur compounds under mild conditions. Despite some existing results, their performance, including carbon selectivity and Faradaic efficiency (FE), is far behind what is expected for practical application, especially from biomass-derived mixed polyols. In this work, we present, for the first time, secondary hydroxyl adsorption of polyols on a mesoporous (CuNi)O electrocatalyst that selectively promotes C-C bond oxidation cleavage into a formaldehyde intermediate for C-S coupling to value-added hydroxymethanesulfonate (HMS), without overoxidation to undesirable formate. With glycerol as a model polyol, this route delivers a recordable carbon selectivity of >99% and a superior HMS FE of 59.9% at a high yield rate of 11.8 mmol cm-2 h-1 in a flow cell. Meanwhile, this route holds a high economic viability for robust electrosynthesis of high-purity HMS in a large scale, with a total profit of $1450 per ton. More impressively, high performance is also achieved in simulated, biomass-derived mixed polyols, which further bypass costly separation and purification steps for HMS electrosynthesis. The findings provide new design principles to engineer chemisorption properties and optimize product selectivity for electrocatalytic upcycling of mixed feedstocks into high-value-added chemicals.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 利用光响应过拥挤烯烃构建动态手性表面","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22392","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光响应手性表面","kp":["表面[手性]: 光响应过密烯烃分子马达","基底[SAMN]: 高定向热解石墨","特性[界面]: 动态手性识别"],"dp":1,"as":"研究将表面手性与光响应性结合，利用过度拥挤烯烃分子构建动态手性表面。该界面在光照下可实现立体化学性质的可逆调控，产生动态手性特征。此类智能手性界面在不对称催化、手性传感、智能分子开关及仿生材料等领域展现出广阔的应用前景。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Dynamically Chiral Surfaces Using Photoresponsive Overcrowded Alkenes","b":"Combining surface chirality and photoresponsiveness can result in interfaces with dynamic stereochemical properties. Such materials offer unique opportunities in the context of tunable chiral recognition at interfaces. Here, we present a strategy to achieve dynamically chiral surfaces using self-assembled molecular networks (SAMNs) of overcrowded alkene-based molecular motors on highly oriented pyrolytic graphite. The chiroptical properties and the dynamic behavior of the molecular motors are maintained when confined in the SAMN, as shown using scanning tunneling microscopy (STM) with in situ irradiation. Light triggers the transition from a homochiral assembly of the stable state of a molecular motor (RP chirality) to the heterochiral coassembly between the stable and the metastable state (RP/RM chirality). The RP/RM coassembly is a kinetic phase that disappears once the external stimulus is removed─highlighting the reversibility of the system. These results demonstrate how molecular motion can be harnessed to encode reversible chirality into surfaces."},{"t":"[ASAP] 共价前导肽探针揭示核糖体肽生物合成中的簇外酶","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00510","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Genome-based analyses have enabled widespread discovery and biosynthetic annotation of ribosomally synthesized and post-translationally modified peptides (RiPPs) pathways, yet often fail to capture all participating enzymes, particularly those encoded outside canonical biosynthetic gene clusters. In this study, leveraging the central role of leader peptides (LPs) in RiPP enzyme-substrate recognition, we developed a substrate-guided chemical-proteomic strategy using covalent LP probes to directly identify LP-binding enzymes from native proteomes. Using the LctA-LctM and PatE-LynD systems, we demonstrate that LP probes carrying a photo-cross-linker engage enzymes at their authentic LP-recognition sites while preserving full catalytic competence. Application of this strategy to a model strain Streptomyces sparsogenes uncovered lanthipeptide synthetases encoded outside canonical biosynthetic gene clusters and revealed graded cross-cluster activities among multiple RiPP pathways. This work establishes a proof-of-concept model platform for proteome-level discovery of LP-binding RiPP enzymes and highlights cross-cluster enzymatic crosstalk as a latent mechanism for structural diversification.","tp":"肽生物合成","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"基因组学分析虽广泛发现了核糖体合成和翻译后修饰肽（RiPPs）途径，但常遗漏编码在经典生物合成基因簇之外的参与酶。本研究利用先导肽在RiPP酶-底物识别中的核心作用，开发了基于共价先导肽探针的底物导向化学蛋白质组学策略，直接捕获并鉴定簇外酶，填补了RiPP生物合成解析的空白。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 共沉积策略实现锡铅钙钛矿太阳能电池中稳定的内置电场","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00210","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锡铅钙钛矿电池","kp":["策略[Sn-Pb钙钛矿]: 共沉积","特性[内建电场]: 稳定"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":2.5,"t":7.0},"as":"","ot":"[ASAP] Codeposition Strategy Enables Stable Built-In Electric Field in Sn–Pb Perovskite Solar Cells"},{"t":"[ASAP] 钴催化两种相似丙烯酸酯的选择性交叉加成合成己二酸酯和戊二酸酯","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02505","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钴催化丙烯酸酯偶联","kp":["催化剂[钴]: Co","反应[加成]: 两相似丙烯酸酯交叉加成","产物[二酯]: 取代己二酸酯/戊二酸酯","选择性[发散]: 区域发散"],"dp":1,"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"as":"己二酸和戊二酸是聚合物生产中的核心中间体，但目前工业和实验室均缺乏两种相似丙烯酸酯的选择性交叉加成方法。本研究开发钴催化策略，实现两种结构相似丙烯酸酯的选择性交叉加成反应，高效合成己二酸酯和戊二酸酯。该突破填补了饱和二元羧酸酯合成方法的空白，对聚酯材料上游单体生产具有重要意义。","ot":"[ASAP] Cobalt-Catalyzed Selective Cross-Addition of Two Similar Acrylates for the Synthesis of Adipates and Glutarates","b":"Adipic acids and glutaric acids are core intermediates in polymer production. However, neither industry nor laboratory synthesis enables facile access to main-chain substituted diacid derivatives, restricting the development of novel monomers for polymerization. Herein, we report a regiodivergent synthesis of substituted adipates and glutarates from two acrylates with minimal structural and electronic differences on a multigram scale with recyclable cobaloxime. Chemoselectivity of cross-coupling over self-coupling reaches 25:1 and was determined by the interaction mode between cobalt catalyst and different acrylates. Single regioselectivity of cobalt hydride addition toward two specific acrylates could be achieved under basic or neutral reaction conditions. Mechanistic investigations revealed a significant chemoselectivity (ΔΔG‡ > 3.0 kcal mol-1), indicating that substrate-specific local electronic properties govern chemo- and regioselectivity, providing predictive insight into rational selectivity control."},{"t":"[ASAP] 间位DNA组装体的催化重构","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01421","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"DNA纳米组装","kp":["[DNA纳米机器人]: toehold介导链置换实现结构重配置"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究提出一种受生物启发的Meta-DNA组装体的催化重构策略。仿生纳米机器人需要自主结构重构以适应环境信号，研究通过DNA纳米技术实现组装体的可编程构型变换，利用催化反应驱动结构级联重排。这一方法突破了传统DNA组装静态结构的限制，为智能纳米器件在生物传感、药物递送等领域的动态响应应用提供了新范式。","ot":"[ASAP] Catalytic Reconfiguration of Meta-DNA Assemblies","b":"Bioinspired nanorobots rely on autonomous structural reconfiguration to adapt to environmental cues, yet achieving such behavior remains difficult due to an intrinsic trade-off between structural robustness and rapid responsiveness. Here, we present a reconfiguration strategy that leverages toehold-mediated strand displacement reactions within structurally stable meta-DNA (M-DNA) assemblies. Coupling this strategy with cooperative DNA catalysis accelerates reconfiguration by more than an order of magnitude, reducing the reconfiguration time from over 12 h to less than 2 h and achieving a maximum rate constant of 1.88 × 105 M-1 s-1. Molecular dynamics simulations reveal that M-DNA catalytic reconfiguration occurs via cooperative multivalent pathways, enabling efficient strand displacement and structural reconfiguration. Furthermore, by integrating modular design with catalytic acceleration, we achieve rapid and programmable reconfigurations across hierarchical M-DNA assemblies. This strategy overcomes the intrinsic trade-off between structural robustness and dynamic adaptability in submicron DNA assemblies, establishing a generalizable principle for engineering adaptive biomimetic nanostructures."},{"t":"[ASAP] 线性全无机配体桥联的双金属体系：最长的全无机全sp杂化链","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21478","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全无机sp链","kp":["链结构[最长]: 全无机全sp链","构建[WNN]: 1,3-卤硼化","双金属[配合物]: 同/异核"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究报道了由线性全无机配体桥接的双金属配合物，构建出迄今最长的全无机sp杂化原子链。虽然碳的sp链合成相对成熟，但在纯无机体系中构建长链sp杂化结构几乎是未知领域。该成果拓展了无机化学的成键理论边界，为新型一维无机功能材料的理性设计奠定了基础，在分子导线和纳米电子学方面具有潜在应用价值。","ot":"[ASAP] Bimetallics Spanned by Linear All-Inorganic Ligands: The Longest Inorganic, All-sp Chains","b":"The construction of longer chains of sp-hybridized atoms, while relatively facile for carbon, is essentially unknown in the absence of carbon. Our recent results with the 1,3-haloboration of the [WNN] fragment of a Chatt-type complex are herein utilized in the synthesis of homo- and heterobimetallic complexes spanned by long all-inorganic sp chains. Notably, this includes structural confirmation of the longest sp-hybridized inorganic chain ever constructed, in a bimetallic complex with a six-atom all-sp {NNBBNN} bridging ligand."},{"t":"[ASAP] Mg-MOF-74中水吸附的原子级模型：结构与等温线的量子化学预测","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01686","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"该研究构建了Mg-MOF-74水吸附的原子级理论模型，采用量子化学计算方法对水分子在金属有机框架内的吸附行为进行预测。Mg-MOF-74因具有不饱和金属位点而成为水收集领域备受关注的材料，准确预测其吸附热力学和动力学特性对设计高效集水MOF至关重要。研究通过量子化学先验计算弥补了传统力场在水-金属配位相互作用描述上的不足，为基于MOF的大气取水技术提供了可靠的理论设计工具。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF水吸附","kp":["吸附结构[Mg-MOF-74水吸附]: DFT预测n=1-5分子/Mg²⁺"],"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":3.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Atomistic Model for Water Adsorption in Mg-MOF-74: Quantum Chemical Prediction of Structures and Isotherms","b":"The design of improved metal-organic frameworks (MOFs) for water harvesting requires the reliable prediction of adsorption isotherms, i.e., Gibbs free energies of adsorption, with no other input than the atomic positions. We employ density functional theory (DFT) and show that, in Mg-MOF-74, well-defined adsorption structures exist for water loadings of n = 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5 molecules per Mg2+ ion. The first water molecule attaches to the open metal site, while on adsorption of subsequent molecules, structures with an increasing number of hydrogen bonds per molecule form: dimers (n = 2), chains in pore direction (n = 3), and a monolayer on the pore wall (n = 4). For n = 5, a tube-like stack of water trimers connected to the monolayer fills the pore completely, and all water molecules are 4-fold coordinated. For isotherm predictions, we use a Multisite Langmuir model with Gibbs free energies of -33, -19, -13, -10, and -21 kJ/mol for the steps leading to adsorption states with n = 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5 molecules, respectively. The close agreement of the predicted total isotherm with experiment corresponds to an accuracy of ±2 kJ/mol for Gibbs free energies. This is achieved only after adding \"high-level\" Coupled Cluster corrections (0, 3, 9, 8, and 11 kJ/mol for n = 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5, respectively) to the DFT energies. We show that the large variations observed between different experimental isotherms can be explained by sample imperfections or incomplete evacuation of samples before isotherm measurements."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过质子分辨NMR与从头计算模拟实现氧化物表面界面水的原子尺度mapping","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18863","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氧化物界面水NMR","kp":["方法[界面水]: 1H MAS核磁+从头算","对象[氧化物]: 固液界面水分子结构","分辨率[映射]: 原子尺度"],"as":"该研究利用质子相关的高分辨率表征技术实现了对氧化物表面界面水分子结构的原子级映射。固体-液体界面处水分子的排列方式直接影响催化反应、能源转换及电化学器件的性能，但长期以来受限于分辨率难以精确观测。研究揭示了界面氢键网络拓扑结构，为理解电催化反应机理、设计高效电化学界面提供了关键的结构基础。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Atomic-Scale Mapping of Interfacial Water on Oxide Surfaces via Proton-Resolved NMR and Ab Initio Simulations","b":"Understanding the molecular structure of water at solid–liquid interfaces is essential for advancing catalysis, energy conversion, and environmental technologies. However, directly characterizing interfacial water species in excess liquid water remains a major experimental challenge. Here, we introduce a new strategy that combines high-resolution 1H magic-angle spinning (MAS) nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) spectroscopy with first-principles molecular dynamics simulations to resolve and assign the chemical environments of interfacial water and hydroxyl species on hydrated titanium dioxide (TiO2) nanoparticles. Using partial proton–deuteron exchange and fast MAS techniques, we achieve site-specific detection of surface-bound H2O and OH groups at the solid–liquid interface. This enables a detailed atomistic assessment of surface hydration states under ambient conditions. Our results reveal that the fully hydrated anatase (101) TiO2 surfaces are positively protonated and exhibit hydrophobic behavior, a counterintuitive finding with significant implications for interfacial reactivity. The approach developed in this work is widely applicable for unraveling complex hydration structures at oxide–water interfaces with molecular resolution.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 用于体内高对比度成像的自激活循环放大近红外声余辉探头","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01285","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Afterglow luminescence offers a promising strategy for ultrasensitive bioimaging by eliminating tissue autofluorescence and providing a high signal-to-background ratio (SBR). However, afterglow probes face several limitations, including limited luminescence brightness, short half-life, imperfect luminescent mechanisms, and reliance on preirradiation with low-penetration light. Herein, we develop a novel self-activating cyclic amplification near-infrared (NIR) sonoafterglow nanoprobe (3SCe-NP) based on a rationally engineered bis(diarylethenyl)terthiophene scaffold, which demonstrates an ∼270-fold enhancement in afterglow intensity and a 7-fold extension in half-life compared to the commonly used 2-methoxy-5-(2'-ethylhexyloxy)-1,4-phenylenevinylene (MEH-PPV). The probe functions as an integrated single-molecule entity unifying the roles of a highly efficient sonosensitizer and an NIR afterglow emitter, which overcomes the drawbacks of weak afterglow brightness, complex fabrication, and poor reproducibility inherent in multicomponent systems. Furthermore, compared to previously reported single-reactive-site afterglow systems, the multireactive-site architecture of 3SCe-NP enables more extensive interactions with self-generated, multitype reactive oxygen species (ROS), creating a high density of chemical defects. This results in dramatically enhanced energy storage capacity and, consequently, a greatly intensified and sustained NIR afterglow upon ultrasound stimulation. Additionally, we uncovered a unique self-amplification mechanism that facilitates sustained ROS generation even after ultrasound cessation, thereby establishing a cyclic oxidation process that overcomes the constraint of conventional consumable afterglow probes relying on a single, depletable ROS. This nanoprobe achieves a high SBR, deep-tissue penetration, and rechargeable capability for longitudinal tumor imaging in vivo. We further demonstrated its utility by constructing an activatable sonoafterglow probe for monitoring immunotherapy responses, offering a useful tool for biomedical imaging.","tp":"声余辉成像","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"余辉发光通过消除组织自发荧光可实现高信噪比生物成像，但现有探针面临亮度低、半衰期短和依赖低穿透力光预辐照等限制。本研究开发了自激活循环放大近红外声余辉纳米探针（3SCe-NP），利用超声激活和循环信号放大机制，无需光预辐照即可实现体内高对比度成像。"},{"t":"[ASAP] DNA 编程钾离子磁共振传感器","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22582","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Disrupted potassium (K+) homeostasis is an early biochemical hallmark of altered membrane potential, electrolyte imbalance, and malignant transformation, yet in vivo K+ mapping remains unrealized. Optical sensors can report K+ fluctuations but lack the penetration depth required for deep-tissue imaging. Although magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) enables noninvasive, high-resolution visualization of biochemical processes, no contrast agent has achieved K+-dependent modulation of relaxivity, precluding true K+-selective MRI. Here we report a mechanistically defined K+-activated magnetic resonance sensor (KMRS) that translates G-quadruplex folding into magnetic relaxation control. KMRS links a Gd-DOTA reporter to an iron oxide (IO) quencher through a K+-selective DNA linker. In the low-K+ state, the short Gd-IO distance enforces strong dipolar coupling that suppresses spin fluctuations and minimizes longitudinal relaxivity (r1). K+ binding induces G-quadruplex formation, increases interparticle separation, restores Gd-centered rotational dynamics, and yields a pronounced enhancement in r1 value. This mechanism-driven MRI activation enables deep-tissue visualization of pathological K+ elevations, supporting early detection of malignant foci and ion-based discrimination between tumor and benign tissues. The design establishes a generalizable framework for engineering ion-responsive MRI probes.","tp":"磁共振传感","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"钾离子稳态失衡是膜电位改变、电解质失衡和恶性转化的重要早期标志，但活体K+空间mapping尚未实现。光学传感器缺乏深层组织穿透力，而MRI虽能无创高分辨成像，却无K+响应型对比剂。本研究设计了DNA编程的钾离子磁共振传感器，首次实现了K+依赖的弛豫率调控，为活体钾离子检测开辟了新途径。"},{"t":"氙同位素揭示了地球氧合的地磁前奏","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag172/8526382?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Ancient xenon isotopes reveal that a temporary weakening of Earthâ€™s magnetic field enhanced hydrogen escape to prime the atmosphere for oxygenation, before its recovery locked in the Great Oxidation Event. More than simple shields, magnetic fields may act as an active filter for atmospheric evolution, with consequences for planetary habitability and the divergent histories of Earth and Mars."},{"t":"为什么官方统计危机很重要——以及如何解决它","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00838-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"更高的信用何时会降低森林面积？亚马逊环境改变了信贷的影响","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516366123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Economic activities have transformed over half of the Earth’s surface and the large-scale conversion of rural forests to agropastoral production is ongoing. Raising access to credit may lead producers to expand at the expense of the forest or, instead, invest to raise yields, reducing forest loss per unit output. Looking across Brazil’s enormous Amazon, we show that extremely different local contexts differ in terms of which effect of credit dominates. We distinguish those contexts using factors that affect cattle and crop production. For each of these two outputs, we find distinct credit impacts by context. Cattle credit raises deforestation where pasture expands over native forest on far frontiers. Crop credit raises deforestation where farms expand over pasture and forest remnants. Understanding impacts heterogeneity can help to reduce losses of rural forests, even while credit is supporting local economies.","tp":"亚马逊信贷","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":4.0},"as":"提高信贷获取能力可能促使生产者在亚马逊扩张农业而加剧森林损失，也可能激励其投资提高单产从而减少森林破坏。研究基于巴西亚马逊大规模数据表明，不同地方情境下信贷的主导效应截然不同，并利用环境因子区分这些情境。该发现对精准设计森林保护与农业信贷政策具有重要意义。"},{"t":"当人工雷击时","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00643-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"利用析氢反应：仿生pH敏感电解质实现高温下超稳定锌离子电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00449K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌离子电池电解质","kp":["温度[锌电池]: >80°C","电解质[仿生]: pH敏感型","目标[抑制]: 析氢反应HER"],"dp":1,"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究受生物启发，设计了一种pH敏感电解质用于高温（>80°C）锌离子电池，实现超稳定循环。利用析氢反应（HER）机制调控电解质行为，通过pH响应策略抑制锌负极在高温下的副反应和枝晶生长。该策略突破了传统锌离子电池高温性能瓶颈，在高能量密度和长循环稳定性方面取得显著提升，为极端工况储能应用开辟新路径。","ot":"Utilizing hydrogen evolution reaction: bio-inspired pH-sensitive electrolyte for ultra-stable zinc-ion batteries at high","b":"Broader contextPractical high temperature (> 80 °C) zinc-ion batteries with high energy density and stable cycling performance are greatly desirable for sustainable energy storage, but they remain constrained by the notorious hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Such unwanted reaction not only reduces the reversibility of Zn anode, but also accelerates battery swelling and even causes battery explosion.Inhibiting HER is a widely adopted strategy to enhance battery performance. However, since HER is severely exaggerated at high temperatures, the strategy fails to intrinsically prevent HER and Zn electrodes only work well with low depth of discharge (DOD) and low current densities/capacities.Herein, contrary to the commonly utilized HER suppression routes, a novel HER utilization strategy is proposed by introducing pH-sensitive electrolyte that harness the HER process to in situ form a unique ZrO 2 /ZnF 2 interface on Zn anode. The bio-inspired interface significantly shields H 2 O molecules, homogenizes Zn 2+ flux and optimizes ionic and thermal fields, thus mitigating further side reactions and prohibiting Zn dendrites growth. With the pH-sensitive electrolyte design, the stability of Zn anode is drastically enhanced with high DOD at high current densities/capacities, which also boards the tactics for the development of stable metal batteries with high energy densities at high temperatures.","aip":1},{"t":"通过氧空位与硼掺杂协同效应激活潜在钛活性中心以加速反应","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4505904?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池电催化","kp":["材料[双缺陷]: TiO2(B掺杂+氧空位)","应用[锂硫]: 硫氧化还原加速","机制[协同]: 解锁潜在Ti活性中心"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究通过在单一电催化剂中同时引入氧空位和硼掺杂的双重缺陷工程，协同激活钛基材料中潜在的催化活性中心。多重缺陷的精确调控优化了活性位点的电子结构和吸附能，从而加速催化反应动力学。该策略为通过缺陷工程设计高效电催化剂提供了新思路，在电催化析氢、析氧或CO₂还原等能源转化反应中具有重要应用潜力。","ot":"Unlocking Latent Titanium Active Centers Through the Synergistic Effect of Oxygen Vacancies and Boron Doping for Acceler","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The introduction of multiple defects into a single electrocatalyst enables precise modulation of active centers electronic states, thereby accelerating sulfur reduction kinetics in lithium‐sulfur batteries. However, the individual roles and cooperative interactions of such defects remain elusive. Herein, we engineered a dual‐defect TiO\n                    2\n                    incorporating boron doping and oxygen vacancies to synergistically activate Ti centers. Calculations reveal that the coexistence of both defects under heterojunction structure markedly enhances the Ti 3d occupied electronic states below the Fermi level, which is absent in pristine and single‐defect counterparts. Such a shift corresponds to the transition from the initial 3d\n                    0\n                    (Ti\n                    4+\n                    ) to the 3d\n                    1\n                    (Ti\n                    3+\n                    ) configuration, primarily introducing occupied electrons into the t\n                    2g\n                    orbitals. This phenomenon reflects a unique synergistic activation of Ti sites, rather than a mere additive effect of individual defects. Therefore, the dual‐defect system synergistically enhances polysulfides anchoring at Ti sites and promotes interfacial charge transfer, enabling superior lithium‐sulfur battery performance (a low decay‐rate of 0.045% over 1000 cycles under excess lithium conditions). Based on the enhanced sulfur reduction kinetics, we further assembled silicon‐sulfur full cells. This novel battery system exhibits exceptional stability and safety, maintaining stable cycling for 1000 cycles under limited lithium supply (1.5 NP ratio, 3.5 mg\n                    s\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    )."},{"t":"Floquet 晶体拓扑边界态完整层次结构的统一表征","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag170/8526395?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Topological phases of matter are defined by bulk invariants that dictate the existence of robust boundary states. While conventional bulk-boundary correspondence links a given bulk invariant to a specific type of boundary mode, many systems may host multiple orders of topology simultaneously, including chiral edge states, weak edge states, and higher-order hinge and corner states. A unified framework for predicting and classifying all such boundary phenomena has remained elusive. Here we introduce a compact topological triplet-three complementary one-dimensional winding numbers defined in distinct momentum subspaces-that fully determines the presence and type of boundary states in two-dimensional Floquet crystals. We experimentally implement this concept in a time-synthetic photonic lattice, demonstrating its predictive power. This unified approach integrates strong, weak, and higher-order topology into a single framework, providing critical insight for studying topological matter and enabling systematic control of complex topological phases across a broad range of physical platforms.","tp":"拓扑边界态","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"拓扑物相由体不变量定义，但许多系统可同时存在多阶拓扑态，包括手性边缘态、弱边缘态及高阶铰链和角态。现有体-界对应关系只能关联单一不变量与特定边界模式，缺乏统一框架。本研究提出了一套统一表征方法，能够完整预测和分类Floquet晶体中所有层级的拓扑边界态。"},{"t":"水下文化遗产和极端事件：气候变化下的风暴影响","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523844123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Extreme weather events cause severe ecological disruptions to the marine environment and socioeconomic impacts, while also endangering the evidences of human history resting underwater. Storms, in particular, generate high-intensity currents that lead to substantial material loss and textural alteration. We present a quantitative risk assessment of underwater cultural heritage exposed to storm events, considering climate change and the vulnerability of historical stone materials. We monitored the amount, rate, and patterns of stone erosion through innovative flume simulations and surface three-dimensional modeling, investigating its changes with time, current velocity, and properties of the materials and suspended sediments. The experimental results were combined with global models of storms and ocean currents under present and future climate, accounting for projected changes in storm intensity and frequency, climate scenarios, geographic settings, and seabed environments. Our findings show that even a single storm may result in irreversible damage to historical surfaces, erasing key morphological and textural features and compromising their legibility—especially in global hotspots such as tropical regions. In a future dominated by high greenhouse gas emissions and increasing extreme events, the vulnerability of archaeological stone could locally rise to more than double present levels. Extreme events and climate change pose major threats to the preservation of underwater cultural heritage and its historical, touristic, educational, and scientific values, requiring the development of long-term adaptation and protection strategies."},{"t":"调节空穴选择性材料端基以抑制倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池中的非辐射复合","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8473744?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿空穴传输","kp":["[空穴传输层]: 调节端基基团","[非辐射复合]: 抑制界面能级失配"],"as":"该研究针对钙钛矿太阳能电池（PSCs）中空穴选择性材料界面非辐射复合损失严重的核心瓶颈，通过调控空穴传输材料端基（Terminal Groups）的分子结构来抑制非辐射复合。优化端基设计可改善界面能级匹配与缺陷钝化效果，从而显著降低能量损失，提升器件开路电压和光电转换效率。该策略为高效稳定钙钛矿电池的界面工程提供了新思路。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Tuning Terminal Groups of Hole‐Selective Materials to Suppress Nonradiative Recombination in Inverted Perovskite Solar C","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The performance of perovskite solar cells (PSCs) is critically constrained by nonradiative recombination at the perovskite/charge‐extraction interfaces, which limits their approach to the thermodynamic efficiency limit. Although extensive efforts have focused on passivating surface defects, the role of interfacial energy‐level mismatch in driving nonradiative losses remains insufficiently understood. In this work, we investigate the impact of valence band maximum (VBM) offsets between hole‐selective layers and perovskites on the nonradiative recombination losses in PSCs by tailoring the terminal groups of hole‐selective materials (HSMs). Our findings reveal that the minimized energetic barrier at the hole‐selective interface is conducive to achieving the maximum quasi‐Fermi level splitting (QFLS) in perovskites. Through precise energy‐level alignment at the buried HSM/perovskite interface via terminal group engineering, we achieved high power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 26.88% and 21.87% for PSCs based on 1.53 and 1.72 eV perovskites, respectively, with open‐circuit voltage (\n                    V\n                    OC\n                    ) value reaching 95% and 91% of their Shockley‐Queisser limit, respectively. Our results provide valuable insights for designing hole‐selective molecules and elucidating the relationship between nonradiative recombination losses and energy level alignment across different perovskite compositions."},{"t":"改进载流子与光子管理的三结太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10385-y","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"三结叠层太阳能电池","kp":["器件[叠层]: 钙钛矿-硅三结","添加剂[非挥发性]: 4-羟基亚苄醇","目标[双瓶颈]: 顶电池VOC+中电池光电流"],"dp":1,"as":"钙钛矿-硅三结叠层光伏器件在双结器件基础上可进一步提升光电转换效率，但面临载流子管理与光子管理复杂化的挑战。该研究提出改进的载流子输运与光子俘获策略，优化三结电池中各子电池的带隙匹配、电流匹配及光管理结构，以减少寄生吸收和电压损失。该工作为突破单结与双结理论效率极限提供了可行的工程路径。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Triple-junction solar cells with improved carrier and photon management","b":"Perovskite-silicon triple-junction photovoltaics offer efficiency gains beyond dual-junction devices, but at the expense of added complexity (1). Here, we address two key bottlenecks in perovskite-silicon-based triple-junction solar cells: reduced open-circuit voltage in the wide-bandgap top-cell and limited photocurrent generation in the middle-cell (1, 2). A non-volatile additive, 4-hydroxybenzylamine, regulates wide-bandgap perovskite crystallization and passivates defects, promoting oriented growth and suppressing non-radiative recombination. Together with improved energy-level alignment, this yields open-circuit voltages of up to 1.405 V and enhanced stability. To overcome the current limitations in the middle-cell, a three-step deposition strategy enables the formation of thick, low-bandgap perovskite absorbers while preserving microstructural integrity and enhancing electron extraction. In addition, low-refractive-index SiOx nanoparticles that accumulate in the front valleys of the textured silicon bottom-cell act as an optical middle-reflector, enhancing light absorption in the middle-cell. These advances are then combined in 1 cm² perovskite-perovskite-silicon devices, achieving a certified efficiency of 30.02%."},{"t":"在高稳定性金属有机框架中通过完全分子筛分机制从八氟丙烷中痕量捕获六氟丙烯","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6037453?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF氟碳气体分离","kp":["材料[MOF]: Ni-pca-pyz","机制[分离]: 完全分子筛分","分离[对象]: 从C3F8除微量C3F6"],"as":"该研究利用多孔吸附剂实现对八氟丙烷（C₃F₈）中微量六氟丙烯（C₃F₆）杂质的深度去除。八氟丙烷是半导体工业中重要的刻蚀与清洗气体，其中痕量杂质严重影响工艺良率。作者通过完整分子层面机制研究，设计了具有选择性捕获能力的新型多孔材料，实现对目标杂质的高效精准分离，为电子特气的高纯度纯化提供了材料化学新方案。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Trace Capture Hexafluoropropylene From Octafluoropropane via Complete Molecular Sieving Mechanism in a Highly Robust Met","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Deep removal of trace hexafluoropropylene (C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    ) impurity from octafluoropropane (C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    8\n                    ) using porous adsorbents is highly promising, but the field still suffers from the lack of benchmark adsorbents capable of overcoming the inherent trade‐off between adsorption capacity and uptake ratio. Herein, we report a highly robust metal−organic framework, Ni‐pca‐pyz, which features an electrostatic‐potential complementary surface and molecular‐sieving channel tailored for C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    , realizes the optimal accommodation of C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    and complete exclusion of C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    8\n                    . Ni‐pca‐pyz exhibits a record‐high C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    /C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    8\n                    uptake ratio (137.6), coupled with exceptional C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    adsorption capacity (55.02 cm\n                    3\n                    g\n                    −1\n                    ) at 298 K and 1.0 bar. Kinetic analysis further confirms negligible adsorption of C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    8\n                    (0.36 cm\n                    3\n                    g\n                    −1\n                    ) in Ni‐pca‐pyz, and effective diffusion coefficient for C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    is 9.29 × 10\n                    −5\n                    s\n                    −1\n                    at 298 K. Molecular simulations and in situ Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy (FTIR) elucidate the synergetic effect of pore confinement, and surface electrostatic complementarity confers high recognition of C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    through multiple hydrogen bonding interactions. The column breakthrough experiments validate the efficient removal of trace C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    from C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    8\n                    , affording an excellent C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    8\n                    productivity of 2.06 × 10\n                    3\n                    L kg\n                    −1\n                    (purity exceeding 99.999%). With its outstanding stability, recyclability, and low‐cost precursors, Ni‐pca‐pyz provides an ideal platform for industrial perfluorinated electronic specialty gases (ESGs) purification."},{"t":"利用N₂单元电子储库的双氮钛配合物催化氢膦化反应","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525132?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钛双氮配合物磷氢化","kp":["催化剂[钛]: 双氮配合物","反应[加氢膦化]: 烯烃","机制[电子库]: N2单元电子储库"],"as":"该研究聚焦钛双氮（N₂）配合物催化的氢膦化反应。金属双氮配合物是模拟Haber-Bosch氨合成法的重要化合物类别，研究团队利用其N₂单元的独特反应性，将其拓展应用于C-P键的催化构建。这一策略将廉价丰产金属钛与氮气活化学相结合，为有机膦化合物的绿色合成提供了新路径，有望减少对贵金属催化剂的依赖，在药物分子和功能材料的制备中具有应用潜力。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Titanium Dinitrogen Complex Catalyzed Hydrophosphination Leveraging the N2‐Unit Electron Reservoir","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Metal dinitrogen complexes, a prominent class of compounds in the mimic of Haber–Bosch NH\n                    3\n                    manufacture, have been prevalently adopted for N\n                    2\n                    functionalization to form N‐X (X = H, C, Si, etc.) bonds through the stoichiometric reactions with acids and electrophilic reagents. The discovery of alternative application of these complexes beyond aforementioned N\n                    2\n                    functionalization is highly desirable but remains elusive. In this work, we demonstrated that a titanium dinitrogen complex exhibits catalytic potential in the hydrophosphination of alkenes with an outstanding substrate compatibility and a turnover number of 743 was achieved. Mechanistic studies showed that the end‐on bridging dinitrogen unit (N\n                    2\n                    ‐unit) of the Ti\n                    III\n                    complex could be replaced with diphenylphosphine to form a catalytically active Ti\n                    II\n                    species, with the concurrent extrusion of a free N\n                    2\n                    molecule that was probed by\n                    15\n                    N NMR spectroscopy. Thus, each N\n                    2\n                    ‐unit virtually serves as an electron reservoir providing electrons to metal centers to give catalytically active low‐valent metal species. This reaction represents a rare example of adopting a metal dinitrogen complex as a precatalyst in organic transformations and the introduction of N\n                    2\n                    ‐unit electron reservoir (NER) concept provides a novel and effective strategy for the invoking of low‐valent metal species for catalytic applications."},{"t":"使用实验室X射线源对未染色软组织进行亚细胞分辨率的三维高内涵成像","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525239123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"X射线组织成像","kp":["设备[X射线]: 实验室级显微镜","应用[成像]: 未染色软组织三维","分辨率[成像]: 亚细胞级"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种无需染色即可对软组织进行三维高内涵成像的技术，实现了从厘米级到纳米级跨尺度的亚细胞分辨率观测。传统组织学依赖染色标记，流程复杂且可能引入伪影。该无标记方法突破这一局限，能够在保持组织天然状态下获取三维形态学信息，对病理诊断、发育生物学和药物筛选等场景具有重要意义，为多尺度生物系统研究提供了新的成像范式。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Three-dimensional high-content imaging of unstained soft tissue with subcellular resolution using a laboratory-based X-r","b":"With increasing interest in studying biological systems across spatial scales—from centimeters down to nanometers—histology continues to be the gold standard for tissue imaging at cellular resolution, providing an essential bridge between macroscopic and nanoscopic analysis. However, its inherently destructive and two-dimensional nature limits its ability to capture the full three-dimensional complexity of tissue architecture. Here, we show that phase-contrast X-ray microscopy can enable three-dimensional virtual histology with subcellular resolution. This technique provides direct quantification of electron density without restrictive assumptions, allowing for direct characterization of cellular nuclei in a standard laboratory setting. By combining high spatial resolution and soft tissue contrast, with automated segmentation of cell nuclei, we demonstrated virtual Hematoxylin and Eosin (H&amp;E) staining using machine learning-based style transfer, yielding volumetric datasets compatible with existing histopathological analysis tools. Furthermore, by integrating electron density and the sensitivity to nanometric features of the dark field contrast channel, we achieve stain-free, high-content imaging capable of distinguishing nuclei and extracellular matrix."},{"t":"α-突触核蛋白蛋白稳定网络及其在帕金森病中的转化应用","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513317123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Parkinson’s disease (PD) is a debilitating neurodegenerative condition that results in a loss of mobility and muscle control. A neuropathological hallmark of PD is the presence of aberrant inclusions, known as Lewy pathology, of which α-synuclein (α-Syn) is a major component. The accumulation of α-Syn may be due to an imbalance in the proteostasis system regulating α-Syn. To investigate this hypothesis, we delineated the proteostasis network (PN) of α-Syn in the human\n                    substantia nigra\n                    at the proteomic and transcriptomic level. We then defined an α-Syn proteostasis activity score (PAS) that quantifiably describes the relative activity of the α-Syn PN in promoting or inhibiting α-Syn aggregation. We report a corresponding PAS signature indicative of disease state, age-of-death in PD patients, and brain regional vulnerability to α-Syn aggregation in PD and healthy brains. After establishing the relevance of our network to PD, we developed a transcriptome-derived network model as an operational digital twin of the α-Syn PN in human\n                    substantia nigra\n                    cells from single-cell data and used it to prioritize candidate targets for PD. We then further showed the application of the α-Syn PN toward facilitating drug repurposing. Overall, this proof-of-concept study illustrates how our computational framework can identify and prioritize putative therapeutic targets and repurposing candidates for PD, providing testable hypotheses for experimental validation."},{"t":"陆上风电升级再供电加速美国能源转型的潜力","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521050123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","as":"该研究评估了美国陆上风电场改造升级（repowering）对加速能源转型的潜力。随着老旧风机效率下降，用更大容量、更高效率的新型机组替换原有设备可显著提升发电量。研究分析了改造带来的装机容量提升、土地利用优化及经济性改善，探讨了政策障碍与电网接入挑战。结论认为大规模陆上风电改造有望帮助美国满足更高的电力清洁化需求，是缩短能源转型周期的有效杠杆。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风电技改升级","kp":["[风电技改]: 升级现有机组提升容量减少用地"],"sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":6.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"The potential for onshore wind repowering to hasten the energy transition in the United States","b":"This study explores whether repowering onshore wind farms will help the United States (US) meet a much larger share of its current electricity demand with wind. Repowering upgrades existing wind farms with new turbines, increasing wind-farm capacity and electricity generation, with less new land requirements than greenfield projects. We analyze the US Wind Turbine Database and project the potential of US wind repowering under different scenarios. Results show that repowering alone could more than double the current US onshore wind nameplate capacity, from 153 GW to ~314 GW, at existing farms. The resulting annual onshore wind electricity generation could increase from 453 TWh in 2024 to ~911 TWh for the same weather year after repowering the fleet. Repowering could allow onshore wind to meet 21%, instead of 10.5%, of 2024 US electricity demand. Repowering is a potential multi-billion-dollar industry in the United States."},{"t":"拟南芥 FRIENDLY (FMT) 蛋白与 NAC 相互作用并确定核编码线粒体蛋白的作用位置","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521483123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Mitochondria are not only the powerhouses of the cell. They are also dynamic signaling hubs, playing a key role in cellular metabolism and adaptation. Proper mitochondrial function depends largely on the import of proteins encoded by the nucleus. Using proximity labeling (TurboID), we show that\n                    Arabidopsis thaliana\n                    FRIENDLY (FMT) protein is in close proximity to several organellar-destined proteins, mostly mitochondrial, during their translation. Many of the corresponding mRNAs are immunoprecipitated with FMT. Remarkably, when FMT is absent, its target mRNAs lose their correct cellular localization. Our TurboID approach, associated with immunoprecipitations and confocal microscopy, also demonstrates the interaction between FMT and the Nascent polypeptide Associated Complex (NAC), a ribosome-associated platform involved in the maturation and sorting of nascent peptides. Taken together, these results suggest that FMT, through its interaction with NAC and the ribosome, is involved in the spatial regulation of translation in the cell."},{"t":"TON1 和 FASS 需要招募肌球蛋白 VIII（一种细胞分裂指导因子）","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524514123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Because plant cells cannot migrate, their position is fixed with respect to their neighbors. Thus, placement of the new cell plate is critical for determining cell shape, cell identity, and tissue patterning. Here, we show that TONNEAU1 (TON1), a protein essential for preprophase band formation, plays a role in phragmoplast guidance even in cells that do not have a microtubule-based preprophase band. TON1 is part of a complex that contains TONNEAU2/FASS, PROTEIN PHOSPHATASE 2A (PP2A), and the TON1 RECRUITING MOTIF (TRM) proteins, known as the TON1-TRM-PP2A (TTP) complex. We found that TON1 localizes specifically to the plasma membrane along the branch-adjacent wall in a branching cell in\n                    Physcomitrium patens\n                    juvenile tissue. Knocking out\n                    FASS\n                    does not affect TON1 localization, suggesting that TON1 recruitment to the plasma membrane is independent of FASS. A novel point mutation in TON1 disrupts dimerization and localization to the plasma membrane. In mutants lacking TTP function, myosin VIII localization is altered, resulting in phragmoplast guidance defects. Our data suggest a model whereby myosin VIII guides the phragmoplast in a TTP-dependent manner to the branch-adjacent wall facilitating efficient insertion at that site."},{"t":"基于 SIGLEC9 的合成嵌合开关受体增强 CAR 巨噬细胞对抗胶质母细胞瘤的功效","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519819123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Chimeric antigen receptor macrophage (CAR-M) therapy represents a promising therapeutic approach for treating glioblastoma multiforme (GBM). However, durable antitumorigenic macrophage phenotype of CAR-Ms is limited by the highly immunosuppressive tumor microenvironment (TME), wherein Siglec–sialic acid signaling directly drives macrophage polarization toward a protumorigenic phenotype. We here report an in situ synthetic SIGLEC9-based chimeric switch receptor (CSR) for diverting the inhibitory signal into positive ones, augmenting the sustained proinflammatory phenotype and tumoricidal immunity of CAR-Ms in the GBM niche. Specifically, our results showed that macrophage-targeted ionizable lipid nanoparticles efficiently introduce dual circRNAs into macrophages to generate CSR functionalized CAR-Ms in vitro and in vivo. The modified macrophages maintained a proinflammatory state, exhibited superior phagocytic activity, resulting in rapid and efficient eradication of IL13Rα2-positive tumor cells. Moreover, an injectable nanoparticle–hydrogel system for reprogramming macrophages surrounding the glioma resection cavity initiated a locoregional antitumor immune response and elicited robust long-term immunological memory, inhibiting tumor relapse in the postoperative GBM model. In sum, our findings establish that the engineered SIGLEC9-based CSR significantly promotes the maintenance of an antitumoral phenotype of CAR-Ms in the hypersialylated acidic TME, contributing to the improvement of engineered macrophage-based immunotherapy against GBM."},{"t":"结构与界面稳定粘结剂工程实现NCM811正极在4.6V下高倍率性能","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70842?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高镍正极粘结剂","kp":["工作电压[NCM811正极]: 4.6V","粘结剂[高压正极]: 碱木质素交联共聚物PNAL"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过结构工程和界面稳定型粘结剂设计，使NCM811正极在4.6V高压下实现高倍率性能。高压正极可提升锂金属电池能量密度，但高压运行易引发界面副反应和结构退化。研究通过优化粘结剂的分子结构，增强正极材料与电解质界面的化学稳定性，有效抑制过渡金属溶解和界面阻抗增长，为高能量密度锂电池的商业化提供了关键解决方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Structure and Interfacial‐Stable Binder Engineering Enables High‐Rate Capability of NCM811 Cathodes at 4.6 V","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐voltage cathodes improve the energy density of lithium metal batteries (LMBs). However, cathodes constructed by high‐nickel layered oxide severely suffer from structural degradation and interfacial instability under high‐voltage condition. Herein, an alkali lignin cross‐linked acrylonitrile and acrylic acid copolymer is developed as 3D cathode binder (PNAL), which effectively scavenges oxygen radicals generated under high‐voltage, suppresses the irreversible dissolution of transition metal ions, and stabilizes both the electrode‐electrolyte interface and the cathode structure. As a result, the PNAL‐based LiNi\n                    0.8\n                    Mn\n                    0.1\n                    Co\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    LMB achieve a high‐capacity retention of 75.7% after 300 cycles at 4.6 V under 3C. Furthermore, an Ah‐scale pouch cell fabricated by PNAL delivers an energy density of 376.5 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    and retains 81.7% capacity after 100 cycles at 4.6 V. This work provides a promising binder strategy to construct high‐voltage cathodes for next‐generation LMBs."},{"t":"CUB2 结构域在肠肽酶介导的胰蛋白酶原激活中的作用的结构见解","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521394123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Elucidating the structure and function of enteropeptidase (EP) is essential for advancing our understanding of its biological significance, particularly in regulating trypsinogen activation. Using cryo-EM and enzymatic activity, we uncovered the significance of the CUB2 domain in mediating the cleavage of macromolecular substrates. We identified crucial binding loops and key residues for EP’s proteolytic function. The mutation E574A enhanced the proteolytic activity of EP, whereas the mutation N619A diminished its cleavage efficiency, highlighting the importance of surface-charged interactions in modulating EP’s activity. A proteolytic cycle was proposed to deepen our understanding of the trypsinogen activation by EP. This work offers valuable insights into the molecular mechanisms underlying EP’s interaction with its substrate, and opens up avenues for therapeutically modulating EP-mediated proteolysis."},{"t":"甲基化引发的萜烯环化的结构基础","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00014-8?rss=yes","c":"不相关","a":"Chem","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Terpene biosynthesis typically relies on classical terpene cyclases to initiate carbocation cascades. This study provides structural insights into a distinct family of methyltransferases that generate the initiating carbocation through methyl transfer. These enzymes couple methylation and terpene cyclization within a single active site. X-ray structures define a pyrophosphate-gated transition between open and closed states, while mutagenesis identifies residue networks that shape cascade trajectories and product outcomes. These findings establish the mechanistic basis of methylation-triggered terpene cyclization."},{"t":"底物特异性和 MSMEG_0435-0436 分枝杆菌长链酰基辅酶 A 羧基结合的结构基础","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530575123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The presence of mycolic acid is a defining feature of the mycobacterial cell wall, which provides a highly impermeable barrier to many antibiotics. Biosynthesis of this fatty acid, as well as tuberculostearic acid, requires precursor molecules produced by the essential long-chain acyl-coenzyme A (CoA) carboxylase (LCC) complex. The LCC complex catalyzes carboxylation of the α-carbon of long-chain acyl-CoA, but also short-chain acetyl-CoA and propionyl-CoA. The complex includes the subunits AccA3, which contains a biotin carboxylase (BC) domain and a biotin carboxyl carrier protein (BCCP) domain, the long-chain acyl-CoA carboxyltransferase AccD4, the short-chain acyl-CoA carboxyltransferase AccD5, and the incompletely characterized protein AccE. We used electron cryomicroscopy (cryo-EM) to determine structures of the LCC complex from\n                    \n                      Mycobacterium\n                      smegmatis\n                    \n                    . In the structures, two AccE subunits tether eight AccA3 subunits to an AccD4\n                    2\n                    AccD5\n                    4\n                    heterohexamer core. Cryo-EM of the enzyme during catalysis reveals how AccD4 and AccD5 achieve substrate specificity, with AccD5 binding tightly to CoA and AccD4 binding long acyl chains. The BCCP domains of AccA3 undergo long-distance translocation to transfer a carboxyl group from the BC domain of AccA3 to the acyl-CoA substrate bound in AccD5. Further, we find that two copies of a protein complex formed from MSMEG_0435 and MSMEG_0436 can bind the LCC complex, sequestering the biotin moiety of BCCP domains near AccD5 and decreasing propionyl-CoA carboxylase activity. Rv0263c, the\n                    \n                      Mycobacterium tuberculosis\n                    \n                    ortholog of MSMEG_0435, has a role in bacterial survival during transmission, suggesting that these proteins may regulate production of branched fatty acid precursors for the mycobacterial cell wall."},{"t":"固态NMR提供MOF孔内化学环境的位置特异性信息","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00015-X?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF孔环境NMR","kp":["方法[MOF孔]: 固态核磁1H/19F报告分子","信息[特性]: 位置特异性化学环境"],"dp":1,"as":"研究利用固态核磁共振（NMR）技术获取金属有机框架（MOF）孔道内部化学环境的位点特异性信息。MOF孔道内的化学环境决定了客体分子在其中的吸附、存储与转化行为，该方法可为深入理解MOF的微观化学微环境提供高分辨率表征手段。","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Solid-state NMR provides location-specific information on the chemical environment inside MOF pores","b":"The chemical environment inside MOF pores controls how guest molecules are adsorbed, stored, and transformed within MOFs. We show that 1H and 19F nuclei that are present in the linker or introduced via small reporter molecules can elucidate differences between the chemical environments in different MOF pores. In addition to fundamental insight, solid-state NMR reporters enable facile localization of post-synthetically added ligands, as well as characterization of real-structure effects and the dynamic behavior of node-bound ligands."},{"t":"基于节肢动物启发的裂纹-螺旋耦合单聚合物纤维超灵敏多功能柔性微传感器","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529908123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物纤维柔性微传感","kp":["灵敏度[应变]: GF>10^3","尺寸[微传感器]: <100μm","稳定性[使用]: >10^4次","机制[仿生]: 节肢动物裂纹-螺旋耦合"],"dp":1,"as":"受节肢动物感觉器官启发，研发出基于单根聚合物纤维的超灵敏多功能柔性微传感器。器件尺寸小于100微米，灵敏度因子（GF）超过10³，兼具微小化、高灵敏与多功能特性，在柔性电子、健康监测等领域具有应用潜力。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Single polymer fiber–based ultrasensitive and multifunctional flexible microsensor via arthropod-inspired crack-helix co","b":"Flexible microsensors featuring miniature dimensions (&lt; 100 μm), superior sensitivity [Gauge factor (GF) &gt; 10\n                    3\n                    ], and phenomenal environmental stability (&gt; 10\n                    4\n                    uses) have been broadly applied in modern soft electronics such as implantable health monitoring and soft robotics. However, it is quite challenging to integrate these distinguished features in a microdevice considering the extremely limited space for the complicated fabrication and complex functionalities. Inspired by microscale sensing systems in arthropods, this work presents a unique crack-helix soft microsensor (CHMS) within a single polymer microfiber. This microdevice successfully combines the structural advantages of both slit and hair sensors in arthropods through convenient depositing a thin layer (thickness: 2.5 μm) of biphasic liquid metals on a single microfiber (diameter: 80 μm). The microsensor presents unique frequency detection capability as arthropods (resolution: 0.01 Hz, &gt; 1,088 Hz), ultrahigh sensitivity (GF &gt; 2,711 ± 119), astonishing detection limit (0.05% strain and 0.2 mN), and excellent sensing durability (over 50,000 cycles), which are among the best of currently reported soft sensors. Furthermore, analogous to natural arthropods, CHMS shows different multifunctional environmental perception capability to precisely recognize subtle vibration under water or ground (amplitude &lt; 70 μm) and extremely rarefied airflow (ultralow mass flux: 2.2 × 10\n                    −4\n                    g/s·cm\n                    2\n                    )."},{"t":"共享能力构成了鳃弓和成对鳍系列同源性的基础","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529365123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The origin of paired fins is an unresolved controversy in vertebrate evolutionary biology. Karl Gegenbaur famously proposed that paired fins evolved by the transformation of a gill arch, but this hypothesis remains largely unsupported by the fossil record. Also, seemingly at odds with gill arch-paired fin serial homology are their distinct embryonic origins from neural crest and lateral plate mesoderm, respectively. We have previously shown that skate gill arch skeletal elements may derive solely from neural crest, or from a mixture of neural crest and mesoderm, and we have shown that skate gill arches and jawed vertebrate fins/limbs share several molecular patterning mechanisms. Here, we show in the little skate (\n                    Leucoraja erinacea\n                    ) that neural crest and lateral plate mesoderm-derived mesenchyme are developmentally equivalent and interchangeable in the pharyngeal arches and fin buds. Using heterotopic transplantation experiments, we find that neural crest cells can contribute to the typically mesoderm-derived fin skeleton, and that lateral plate mesodermal mesenchyme can contribute to the typically neural crest-derived jaw skeleton. These findings point to shared skeletogenic competence of neural crest and mesoderm-derived mesenchyme at the head–trunk interface. We argue that this shared competence accounts for the anatomical and developmental parallels of the gill arch and paired fin/limb skeletons and forms the basis of their serial homology."},{"t":"senolytic 治疗会导致胼胝体少突胶质细胞功能障碍和脱髓鞘","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524897123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Aging is a primary risk factor for disease progression in multiple sclerosis (MS). Because of this, treatments that can reduce the consequences of molecular aging, like senescence, have been proposed as a strategy to address disease progression. However, the effects of senolytics, a class of drugs which selectively ablate senescent cells, on the central nervous system are largely unknown. Here, we examined the effects of senolytic treatment on myelination and oligodendrocyte function in vivo using C57BL6/J mice and in vitro using primary rat oligodendrocyte cultures. Initial data showed that naïve young (3 to 4 mo) and aged (22 mo) C57BL6/J mice treated with dasatinib and quercetin (D+Q) developed significant demyelination compared to vehicle-treated controls, though no cell death was observed in the brain. In vitro, oligodendrocyte progenitor cells treated with D+Q in differentiation media exhibited significantly reduced myelin basic protein protein and morphological complexity, also without inducing cell death. Bulk RNA sequencing and ingenuity pathway analysis of D+Q treated oligodendrocytes identified differentially expressed genes associated with endoplasmic reticulum stress. These data suggest that D+Q evokes the unfolded protein response in oligodendrocytes, causing oligodendrocyte dysfunction and myelination failure. Due to the resemblance between oligodendrocytes treated with D+Q and those found in MS lesions, D+Q treatment offers a potential method to model an aspect of oligodendrocyte dysfunction relevant to MS. Therefore, understanding the mechanism by which D+Q perturb oligodendrocyte function may provide insight into some of the pathological features contributing to disease progression in MS."},{"t":"自焚纳米治疗与白蛋白引导肿瘤靶向氧化应激放大光动力疗法","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524115?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Conventional photosensitizers suffer from intrinsic limitations in photodynamic therapy (PDT), including poor tumor selectivity, rapid systemic clearance, and inefficient reactive oxygen species (ROS) generation in the hypoxic tumor microenvironment. Herein, we report a self‐immolative nanotheranostic (SINT) that integrates albumin‐guided transport with tumor microenvironment‐activated cascade degradation, achieving covalent tumor anchoring, sustained retention, and simultaneous activation of fluorescence imaging and PDT. SINT is composed of a self‐immolative polymer backbone bearing New Indocyanine Green (NIG) and maleimide (MI) functional groups. After intravenous injection, the MI groups covalently bind to the Cys34 residues of circulating albumin, forming an albumin‐enriched corona that enhances tumor targeting. In acidic tumor conditions, SINT undergoes self‐immolation to generate an azaquinone methide‐NIG (AQM‐NIG) intermediate. This electrophilic species reacts with thiol‐containing biomolecules, leading to covalent anchoring within tumor tissues, disruption of intracellular redox homeostasis, and amplified PDT efficiency. Pharmacokinetic analyses revealed that tumor accumulation of SINT was 7.75‐fold higher than that of NIG at 24 h post‐injection, and over 48% of the maximal fluorescence persisted after 96 h. The prolonged retention and amplified oxidative stress enabled complete tumor suppression without recurrence in murine models."},{"t":"第二代结晶海绵能够在标准化条件下对多种材料进行一致的结构分析","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524615?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Crystallization is typically highly sensitive to even minor structural differences in target molecules. As a result, obtaining crystals of complex compounds often requires extensive trial‐and‐error experiments for each target molecule. We recently reported a second‐generation crystalline sponge (2G‐CS), in which a coordination cage is fixed within a crystal lattice. In the 2G‐CS, target molecules are first encapsulated within the cage in solution, followed by salt formation with a symmetry‐mismatched polyanion, leading to the formation of single crystals suitable for structure analysis. However, practical implementation still requires case‐by‐case optimization of crystallization conditions. In this study, we demonstrate that combining the cage with a specific polyanion enables crystallization of a wide range of structurally distinct guest molecules under a single set of standardized conditions. In a test set comprising 39 guest molecules, 31 cases (80%) were successfully crystallized using the same conditions. These examples include polar, medium‐sized, and structurally complex molecules, most of which are of pharmaceutical interest. Crystal structures showed that the polyanion induced a predominant packing type for cages and anions in crystals. We suggest that this recurrent packing type may contribute to the ability to obtain crystals under standardized conditions despite variations in guest structures.","tp":"结晶海绵法","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"传统结晶对分子结构差异高度敏感，复杂化合物结晶常需大量试错实验。本研究报道了第二代结晶海绵（2G-CS），其配位笼固定在晶格内部，目标分子先在溶液中被笼包裹再形成盐晶体。该方法在标准化条件下实现了对多种材料的一致性结构分析，大幅降低了单晶X射线衍射分析的门槛。"},{"t":"SEL1L–HRD1 ERAD–自噬相互作用维持棕色脂肪细胞中的线粒体稳态","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529914123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Mitochondrial integrity is central to energy homeostasis, particularly in brown adipose tissue where dynamic remodeling fuels thermogenesis. Two major proteostatic systems, the SEL1L–HRD1 endoplasmic reticulum (ER)-associated degradation (ERAD) pathway and autophagy, have been shown to intersect in vitro, but their physiological coordination in metabolically active tissues remains unclear. Here, we demonstrate that ERAD and autophagy act in synergy to safeguard mitochondrial integrity in brown adipocytes. Using various adipocyte-specific knockout (KO) mouse models and high-resolution ultrastructural 2D and 3D imaging, we show that simultaneous deletion of\n                    Sel1L\n                    and\n                    Atg7\n                    (double KO, DKO) causes striking mitochondrial abnormalities under room temperature, absent in single KO or\n                    Sel1L-Ire1a\n                    double knockout mice. DKO adipocytes accumulate hyperfused megamitochondria extensively penetrated by ER tubules, accompanied by ER expansion, excessive ER–mitochondrial contacts, and impaired thermogenesis. These findings reveal that SEL1L–HRD1 ERAD and autophagy cooperate, rather than act redundantly, to maintain mitochondrial integrity in brown fat, uncovering a previously unrecognized mitochondrial surveillance mechanism based on ERAD–autophagy crosstalk."},{"t":"铑催化烯炔及二烯炔与丙烯酰胺的化学发散性平行动力学拆分与去对称化","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9965825?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铑催化动力学拆分","kp":["[化学发散动力学拆分]: Rh催化","底物[PKR]: 外消旋1,6-烯炔与α-氟代丙烯酰胺"],"as":"报道了铑催化炔烃和二烯炔的化学发散性平行动力学拆分与去对称化反应。该方法实现了对结构多样的三维分子的对映选择性合成，为解决有机化学中不对称构建复杂立体结构的挑战提供了新策略。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Rh‐Catalyzed Chemodivergent Parallel Kinetic Resolution and Desymmetrization of Enynes and Dienynes with Acrylamides","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Catalytic enantioselective synthesis of structurally diverse 3D molecules remains a central challenge in organic chemistry. Intermolecular chemodivergent parallel kinetic resolution (PKR) of racemic substrates through C─C bond formation using a single catalyst to yield distinct products is rare. Here, we report Rh‐catalyzed chemodivergent PKR of racemic 1,6‐enynes with α‐fluoroacrylamides or mixtures of different acrylamides, proceeding via [2+2+2] cycloaddition and C–H alkylation to afford structurally and stereochemically distinct products with high selectivity under mild conditions. Additionally, substituent‐dependent enantioselective desymmetrization of symmetric dienynes was achieved. Computational studies revealed that, depending on the stereochemistry of the 1,6‐enyne, steric repulsion between the ligand and the enyne favors a compact C–H activation transition state, whereas its absence favors a C═C insertion transition state involving a smaller bond dissociation energy. These findings establish a versatile catalytic platform for the selective generation of 3D molecular complexity, advancing diversity‐oriented synthesis from racemic or symmetric precursors."},{"t":"重新思考人工智能在调查研究中的作用：从威胁到协作","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00862-9","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"智能调研法","sc":2.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"重新编程的 SimCells 用于抗菌治疗","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517118123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Antimicrobial resistance (AMR) is a critical global health challenge. In this study, we developed a platform based on chromosome-free and nonreplicating simple cells (SimCells, size 1 to 2 µm) and mini-SimCells (size 100 to 400 nm) for targeted pathogen elimination. Engineered with surface-displayed nanobodies, SimCells and mini-SimCells selectively bind bacteria expressing specific antigens (e.g., OmpA in\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    ). The selective interactions facilitate close SimCell-pathogen proximity, enabling two antimicrobial mechanisms: direct injection of toxic effectors into bacterial cytoplasm via a heterologous expression of type VI secretion system (T6SS), and enzymatic conversion of aspirin into catechol by engineered salicylate hydroxylase, leading to sustained local production of hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ). Our results demonstrate that both reprogrammed SimCells and mini-SimCells can eliminate target\n                    E. coli\n                    with high specificity and efficiency. Multidose reprogrammed mini-SimCell treatment led to a 10\n                    3\n                    -fold selective reduction of targeted bacteria in mixed microbial communities, with minimal disruption to nontarget bacteria. We demonstrate that reprogrammed mini-SimCells, engineered with nanobody targeting outer membrane protein OmpA of the clinically relevant multidrug-resistant pathogen\n                    E. coli\n                    ST131, achieved elimination efficiencies over 97% at 24 and 48 h. This modularized “plug-and-play” antimicrobial platform provides a highly specific, efficient, and adaptable solution for combating diverse AMR pathogens.","tp":"合成抗菌胞","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对抗生素耐药性这一全球健康挑战，本研究开发了基于无染色体、非复制型简单细胞（SimCells，1-2μm）及微型SimCells（100-400nm）的抗菌平台。通过表面展示纳米抗体，这些工程化细胞能选择性结合表达特定抗原（如大肠杆菌OmpA）的病原菌，实现靶向病原体清除，为对抗AMR提供了新策略。","aip":1},{"t":"理性量子力学：用量子计算机检验量子理论","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523350123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子力学基本理论","kp":["[Hilbert空间]: 复数离散化处理","[薛定谔方程]: 测量时不修改"],"as":"受John Wheeler的\"万物源于比特\"理念启发，利用量子计算机对量子理论本身进行实验检验。研究探索希尔伯特空间的连续性本质，通过\"理性量子力学\"框架验证量子力学基本假设，推动对量子理论基础问题的实验探索。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Rational quantum mechanics: Testing quantum theory with quantum computers","b":"Motivated in part by John Wheeler’s assertion that the continuum nature of Hilbert Space conceals the “it-from-bit” information-theoretic character of the quantum wavefunction, a theory of quantum physics (Rational Quantum Mechanics–RaQM) is proposed based on a specific discretization of complex Hilbert Space. The Schrödinger equation is not modified in RaQM, even during measurement. However, the bases in which the quantum state is defined must satisfy certain rational-number constraints. These constraints lead to the notion of finite qubit information capacity\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          N\n                          \n                            max\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    : For any\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          N\n                          &gt;\n                          \n                            N\n                            \n                              max\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    qubit state, there is insufficient information in the\n                    \n                      \n                        N\n                      \n                    \n                    qubits (linearly growing in\n                    \n                      \n                        N\n                      \n                    \n                    ) to allocate even one bit to each of all\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            2\n                            \n                              N\n                              +\n                              1\n                            \n                          \n                          −\n                          2\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    continuum degrees of freedom (exponentially growing in\n                    \n                      \n                        N\n                      \n                    \n                    ) associated with quantum mechanics/theory (QM, where\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            N\n                            \n                              max\n                            \n                          \n                          =\n                          ∞\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    ). It is proposed that the discretization of Hilbert Space in RaQM is due to gravity, hence QM is the (singular) continuum limit of RaQM at\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          G\n                          =\n                          0\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    . On this basis, it is estimated that\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          N\n                          \n                            max\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    lies between about 200 and 400 for current qubit technologies, and will never exceed 1,000. While QM and RaQM are experimentally indistinguishable for small numbers of qubits, RaQM predicts that the exponential advantage of quantum algorithms which, like Shor’s, require bases with maximal\n                    \n                      \n                        N\n                      \n                    \n                    -qubit superposition/entanglement, will have saturated at 1,000 perfect qubits. Hence, insofar as a classical computer will never factor a 2,048-bit RSA integer, RaQM predicts that a quantum computer will not either. This predicted breakdown of QM could be testable in less than 5 y."},{"t":"量化英国电网脱碳的储能需求——可再生能源份额的影响","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003442?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电网脱碳储能配置","kp":["[研究对象]: 英国电网脱碳储能需求"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Quantifying energy storage requirements to decarbonise the electricity grid in the United Kingdom—influence of the share"},{"t":"使用氧化氘和高分辨率质谱对新脑脂质合成进行定量和定位","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524636?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Myelin is the lipid‐rich membrane that surrounds neuronal axons and is essential for neurological function in vertebrates. The development of therapeutics that stimulate myelin repair to treat demyelinating disorders such as multiple sclerosis is hampered by the inability to distinguish newly synthesised from pre‐existing myelin. This study aimed to develop a method to quantify and localise new myelin lipid synthesis in the mouse brain. Deuterium oxide was administered for two weeks in the drinking water of mice fed normal chow, chow containing the demyelinating toxin cuprizone, or during spontaneous remyelination following cuprizone withdrawal. Liquid chromatography‐tandem mass spectrometry and mass spectrometry imaging were used to quantify and localise the newly synthesised, deuterated lipids. While most glycerophospholipids were constitutively deuterated, deuteration of myelin‐enriched sulfatides, hexosylceramides, and phosphatidylethanolamine plasmalogens was only apparent during remyelination. Most deuterium atoms were found in the fatty acyl chains, indicative of de novo lipid synthesis. Deuterated hexosylceramide and phosphatidylethanolamine plasmalogen species were localised primarily to the corpus callosum, the white matter tract that is most heavily affected by cuprizone. The method described herein provides the means to quantify and spatially profile dynamic lipid synthesis across diverse biological contexts, including understanding myelin homeostasis and preclinical evaluation of remyelinating therapeutics.","tp":"脑脂质定量","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"髓鞘是包绕神经轴突的富含脂质的膜结构，对脊椎动物神经功能至关重要。多发性硬化等脱髓鞘疾病的治疗研发受限于无法区分新合成与已存在的髓鞘。本研究建立了利用氧化氘（重水）标记结合高分辨率质谱，定量和定位小鼠脑中新髓鞘脂质合成的方法，为髓鞘修复疗法评估提供了关键工具。"},{"t":"伪零间隙流动式水系Zn-CO₂电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70835?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌二氧化碳电池","kp":["[电极间距]: 伪零间距","催化剂[Zn-CO2电池]: 碳包覆氧化铋","结构[AZCB]: 流动式气体扩散电极"],"as":"开发了一种伪零间隙流动式水系锌-二氧化碳电池（AZCB）。该电池在发电的同时可将CO₂转化为有价值的化学品，研究通过优化电池结构与流动设计，提升了Zn-CO₂电池的电化学性能与CO₂转化效率。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Pseudo‐Zero‐Gap Flow‐Type Aqueous Zn‐CO2 Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Aqueous Zn‐CO\n                    2\n                    batteries (AZCBs) generate electricity and convert CO\n                    2\n                    into valuable products simultaneously, while their development is limited due to poor mass transport, low reactivity, etc. Therefore, we develop AZCBs featuring flowing CO\n                    2\n                    gases and electrolytes, gas‐diffusion cathodes, and especially a pseudo‐zero interelectrode distance. By employing carbon‐coated bismuth oxides (Bi\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    /C) as the cathode in a pseudo‐zero‐gap AZCB, a record‐high peak power density of 67.0 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    @current density of 117.5 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    is achieved, together with excellent cycling performance over 600 cycles. Specifically, the near‐zero distance greatly promotes hydroxide ion transport and CO\n                    2\n                    diffusion by establishing an enhanced concentration gradient at the reaction interface of CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction. Theoretical simulations further indicate preferred formate production is due to the lower energy barrier compared to the CO pathway, because of the favorable\n                    *\n                    O@Bi adsorption via the\n                    *\n                    OCHO intermediate. Significantly, the developed AZCBs operate efficiently and stably in a simulated Martian atmosphere, which is promising for future Human exploration of Mars, providing a potential solution for simultaneous energy generation and feedstock production in the challenging environment.","aip":1},{"t":"可编程凝聚层-膜相互作用直接影响膜化原始细胞的内部和集体组织","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525899?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  In eukaryotic cells, membraneless organelles reorganize through regulated interactions with the plasma membrane and its underlying cortex, where cytoskeletal coupling and inner‐leaflet biochemistry tune condensate positioning, wetting, and function. Recreating such adaptive, cortex‐mediated control in synthetic systems remains a challenge, requiring a chassis that combines interfacial programmability with the mechanical resilience necessary to withstand the osmotic and electrostatic stresses of bottom‐up assembly. Here, we introduce polysaccharidosomes (P‐somes); semipermeable, mechanically robust protocells that function as membrane‐programmable chassis for directing coacervate–membrane coupling. By establishing a thin, cortex‐like protein layer on the inner membrane leaflet via template‐directed assembly, we demonstrate that in situ protein succinylation enables precise tuning of surface charge and coacervate–membrane wetting. Together with the systematic variation of membrane building blocks, this platform allows for fine control over coacervate wetting, morphology, and spatial organization. The uptake of external DNA adds a second tier of regulation: on nonpassivated membranes, DNA‐reconfigured coacervates generate interfacial protrusions that bridge neighboring P‐somes to promote tissue‐like clustering, whereas on passivated membranes, they coalesce into a single, nonwetting, nucleus‐like droplet centered within the lumen. This membrane–cortex‐inspired framework integrates mechanical resilience with chemical programmability, providing a scalable route to constructing membranized protocells with self‐organizing interiors and emergent collective behaviors.","tp":"凝聚层组装","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"真核细胞中无膜细胞器通过与质膜及皮层的可调控相互作用进行重组，实现位置和功能调控。在合成体系中重建这种适应性控制仍是挑战。本研究设计了可编程凝聚层-膜相互作用体系，通过调节界面可编程性与机械强度，直接塑造膜化原始细胞的内部组织和集体行为，推进了合成细胞构建。"},{"t":"面向城市微电网经济优化的隐私保护P2P能源交易","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002989?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微电网P2P交易","kp":["[技术]: 隐私保护P2P交易","[应用]: 城市微电网经济优化"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Privacy-preserving P2P energy trading for economic optimization in urban microgrids"},{"t":"政策驱动的战略性绿色技术创新路径：氢和碳捕获、利用案例","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"绿色创新路","sc":1.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"英国价格上涨后能源负担能力的政策设计挑战","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001941?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源可负担","sc":1.6,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"平面锂沉积与溶解实现实用的无负极软包电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10402-0","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无负极锂金属电池","kp":["器件[AFLMB]: 无负极锂金属电池","形态[实用]: 软包电池","机制[关键]: 平面Li沉积/溶解"],"dp":1,"as":"通过实现平坦的锂沉积与溶解，推动了无负极锂金属电池（AFLMBs）在实用化软包电池中的应用。无负极设计省去了负极活性材料，显著提升能量密度，平坦沉积策略有效抑制锂枝晶生长，提升电池循环寿命与安全性。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Planar Li deposition and dissolution enable practical anode-free pouch cells","b":"Anode-free lithium metal batteries (AFLMBs), which are manufactured without anode active material, offer great potential for high-energy-density, low-cost energy storage. However, AFLMBs face a long-standing challenge of short lifespan due to the harsh conditions of lacking excess Li-resource and an anode host1-8. This issue is associated with uneven Li deposition/dissolution, rooted in the micro-heterogeneity and mechanical fragility of solid electrolyte interphase (SEI)9. Here we report a practical 500 Wh kg–1-level AFLMB with enhanced lifespan, achieved using a crossover-coupled electrolyte. The electrolyte triggers crossover-coupled interfacial reactions that generate a B–F-based polymer-rich SEI at the anode while suppressing gas evolution at the cathode. The resulting SEI exhibits sub-nanometer homogeneity, high flexibility, and rapid Li-ion transport, and it spontaneously develops a self-adaptive mesh-film structure that ensures uniform ion flux and large-volume-change accommodation, thereby realizing reversible planar Li deposition/dissolution of 5.6 mAh cm–2. Consequently, a 2.7 Ah AFLMB (508 Wh kg–1, 1668 Wh L–1) without any host-material coating demonstrates stable cycling for 100 cycles at 100% depth of discharge (DoD) and 250 cycles at 80% DoD, with 80% capacity retention and a high-power output of 2650 W kg–1 at 96 Wh kg–1. These findings establish crossover-coupled interphase chemistry and address the inherent structural instability of host-free electrodes, advancing the practical implementation of AFLMBs.","aip":1},{"t":"磷酸化和 DNA 损伤修复协调 SOX2 介导的体内重编程","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519117123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The stem cell factor SOX2 can reprogram resident glial cells into neurons in the adult mammalian central nervous system, but the molecular mechanisms underlying this process remain poorly understood. Here, we show that both SOX2 phosphorylation and the PRKDC-dependent nonhomologous end joining (NHEJ) pathway are essential for SOX2-mediated in vivo glia-to-neuron reprogramming. A phospho-mimetic SOX2 mutant significantly enhances reprogramming output without altering neuronal fate. Conversely, loss of PRKDC or knockdown of core NHEJ components KU80 and LIG4 abolishes reprogramming. Notably, p53 knockdown restores reprogramming in PRKDC-deficient mice, likely by overcoming DNA damage-induced cell-cycle arrest. These findings demonstrate that SOX2-driven glial reprogramming requires both precise posttranslational regulation and effective DNA damage repair and suggest that targeting these pathways could enhance regenerative strategies in the CNS."},{"t":"磷酸盐短缺控制着全球公海甲烷的产生","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521235123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The observed supersaturation of methane (CH\n                    4\n                    ) in open-ocean surface waters implies widespread CH\n                    4\n                    production within the well-oxygenated mixed layer, driving emissions of this potent greenhouse gas to the atmosphere. The dominant CH\n                    4\n                    production pathway that explains this phenomenon remains poorly understood, although candidates include production during photosynthesis, zooplankton metabolism, and dissolved organic matter cycling. Here, we construct a data-assimilating model of the open-ocean CH\n                    4\n                    cycle to test which hypothesized mechanism is most consistent with the observed global CH\n                    4\n                    distribution. We find that only linking methane production to phosphate (PO\n                    4\n                    ) scarcity can explain the observed supersaturation pattern, which is highest in subtropical gyres where PO\n                    4\n                    is in short supply. These findings suggest that CH\n                    4\n                    release during PO\n                    4\n                    -limited cleavage of the organic compound methylphosphonate is the dominant production pathway in the open ocean. Because this process is confined to the stratified low latitude surface, it is uniquely suited to efficiently emit the CH\n                    4\n                    it produces to the atmosphere (&gt;90%), before the CH\n                    4\n                    mixes to depth and undergoes oxidation (&lt;10%). As predicted future ocean warming and stratification exacerbates PO\n                    4\n                    scarcity over coming centuries, our model predicts that oxic CH\n                    4\n                    production and the resulting CH\n                    4\n                    emissions will increase up to twofold, contributing to a suite of positive feedback between climate warming and natural greenhouse gas sources."},{"t":"药物行为分析识别斑马鱼自闭症基因相关表型的抑制因子","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518846123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Pharmaco-behavioral screens in scalable in vivo systems have critical advantages for drug discovery relevant to large-effect autism spectrum disorder (ASD) genes. Here, we establish a database and open-source website of the behavioral signatures of 520 US Food and Drug Administration (FDA)-approved drugs using high-throughput assays of basic sensory processing and arousal behaviors in larval zebrafish. By leveraging the behavioral profiles of 9 large-effect ASD gene mutants, we identify enrichment of pharmacological mechanisms that anticorrelate with subgroups of ASD genes with shared behavioral phenotypes. Screening of anticorrelating drugs in mutants of two ASD genes,\n                    SCN2A\n                    and\n                    DYRK1A\n                    , uncovers compounds that suppress mutant behavioral phenotypes. We identify estropipate, an estrogen receptor agonist, and paclitaxel, a microtubule inhibitor, as the top suppressors in\n                    scn1lab\n                    and\n                    dyrk1a\n                    mutants, respectively, and levocarnitine (LEVO), a mitochondrial modulator and carnitine supplement, as a top suppressor of both mutant behavioral phenotypes. Finally, we find that LEVO rescues regional brain activity deficits and dysregulated lipid metabolic pathways in mutants, as well as signaling deficits in human pluripotent stem cell–derived glutamatergic neurons carrying mutations in\n                    SCN2A\n                    and\n                    DYRK1A\n                    , demonstrating conservation of drug rescue across systems. Therefore, our study establishes a pharmaco-behavioral resource for precision medicine-based drug discovery, illuminating targets relevant to large-effect ASD genes."},{"t":"面向航空应用的新型PEMFC-GT混合系统性能表征与技术经济评估","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003211?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"航空燃料电池混合动力","kp":["[系统架构]: PEMFC-燃气轮机混合动力系统(航空应用)"],"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Performance characterization and techno-economic assessment of a novel PEMFC-GT hybrid system for aircraft applications "},{"t":"安装在高反射建筑表皮上的双面光伏组件性能评估：实验测试与模拟","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003739?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双面光伏建筑表皮","kp":["[组件]: 双面光伏组件","[应用]: 高反射建筑表皮"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Performance assessment of bifacial photovoltaic modules mounted on highly reflective building skins: Experiment test and"},{"t":"合作伙伴对资源的偏好适应收入和性别经济不平等","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527295123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"For over three decades, scholars have contested whether sex differences in ideal partner preferences for age, resources, and physical attractiveness result chiefly from evolution or cultural gender inequality. Here, we test a perspective compatible with each of these competing views: partner preferences for resources adapt strategically, such that they become stronger for the sex that is poorer and individuals who are poorer, as such preferences are more useful to these individuals. Our preregistered experiment placed 602 people from five countries in one of 45 virtual ecologies, varying participants’ personal income and their local gender economic inequality. Results show that people exhibit stronger ideal partner preferences for resources when they are poorer and when their sex is poorer. This pattern was evident in three different measures of stated partner preferences for resources, namely, ranked preferences and rated preferences for resource-relevant traits (e.g., whether a potential partner has a good job), and importance placed on dating or marrying up, financially. Preferences regarding age gaps were, surprisingly, unaffected, even though older age is associated with access to resources in naturally varying populations. Consistent with our theoretical perspective, which expects ideal partner preferences will adapt primarily to environmental variables that alter the fitness of those preferences, sex differences in stated preferences for physical attractiveness in romantic partners were largely unaffected. These results are discussed in the context of behavioral ecology, which offers a framework to interpret both our results and the mixed findings of past literature."},{"t":"痕量水驱动的氧致结构重组实现柔性固态电解质中快速锂离子传输","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506748?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性固态电解质","kp":["电解质[固态电池]: 镓基卤化物2LiCl-GaF3","[微量水]: 增强快离子传输"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用痕量水引发的氧驱动结构重组，在一种柔性固体电解质中实现快速锂离子传输。固体电解质的吸湿性长期被视为关键弱点，但本研究反将其转化为优势——痕量水促进结构重组形成更有利于Li⁺迁移的通道。该策略颠覆了传统认知，为开发兼具高离子电导率和环境稳定性的柔性固态电解质材料开辟了新思路，在柔性电池和可穿戴设备中具应用前景。","ot":"Oxygen‐Driven Structural Reorganization by Trace Water Enabling Fast Li‐Ion Transport in a Pliable Solid Electrolyte","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The hygroscopic property of solid electrolytes has long been regarded as a critical weakness, as exposure to ambient humidity typically induces decomposition and a loss of ionic conductivity. In this study, we reveal a counterintuitive yet constructive role of trace water in enhancing ion transport in a gallium‐based pliable halide solid electrolyte. Controlled exposure of 2LiCl–GaF\n                    3\n                    to trace amounts of water introduces oxygen into the structure and reorganizes the local environments around gallium and lithium. This oxygen‐driven structural reconfiguration forms Ga–O and Li–O linkages and diversifies the local environment of gallium by converting its coordination from sixfold to fourfold. It reduces the average Li–anion binding strength and flattens the Li‐ion migration energy landscape, resulting in enhanced Li‐ion transport. These changes collectively increase the ionic conductivity by more than two orders of magnitude, from 10\n                    −2\n                    mS cm\n                    −1\n                    to over 3 mS cm\n                    −1\n                    , while imparting amorphous and deformable characteristics to the 2LiCl‐GaF\n                    3\n                    electrolyte. This study demonstrates that the interaction between trace water and complex anion frameworks can be harnessed to simultaneously tailor structural and transport properties, offering a new design strategy for high‐performance oxyhalide solid electrolytes.","aip":1},{"t":"由原子表面步骤指导的氧化途径选择","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00067-6?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐腐蚀材料","a":"Matter","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Step polarity acts as a geometric switch regulating oxide growth modes on nickel surfaces. This work reveals that intrinsic coordination-driven downward diffusion creates a rectified adatom flux. At positive steps, this flux feeds the oxide perimeter, driving lateral growth; at negative steps, it drains material away, forcing inward oxidation. This mechanism links atomic-scale energetics to macroscopic oxidation morphology.","tp":"镍表面氧化","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究揭示了原子表面台阶极性作为调控镍表面氧化生长模式的几何开关机制。固有配位驱动的向下扩散产生整流原子通量：在正台阶处该通量向氧化前沿供料驱动横向生长，在负台阶处则排走材料迫使向内氧化。该机制将原子尺度能量学与宏观氧化形貌直接关联。"},{"t":"粘细菌水平基因转移真核缩醛磷脂生物合成的起源","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529738123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Plasmalogens are a unique class of glycerophospholipids defined by a distinctive vinyl ether bond. While these lipids are abundant in animals and important for human health, their evolutionary history remains enigmatic, mostly due to their absence in some major eukaryotic lineages like plants. Here, we resolve the origin and evolution of the aerobic plasmalogen biosynthesis pathway in eukaryotes. Through comprehensive phylogenomic analysis and experimental validation of enzyme activity and plasmalogen presence, we demonstrate that the essential desaturase plasmanylethanolamine desaturase 1 (PEDS1)—and likely the fatty acyl-CoA reductase (FAR) and glycerone phosphate\n                    O\n                    -acyltransferase (GNPAT) enzymes also critical in the pathway—were acquired by an early eukaryotic ancestor through horizontal gene transfer (HGT) from myxobacteria. Our data show that this bacterial pathway was retained in the Amorphea and Discoba supergroups but lost or replaced in others. The findings yield insights into how HGT shaped metabolic pathways in early eukaryotes."},{"t":"用于下一代辐射探测的有机闪烁体：分子设计原理、机制和新兴技术","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00078-0?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Matter","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Design strategies for high-performance organic scintillators focus on simultaneously enhancing optical efficiency, imaging resolution, and material stability by tailoring molecular structures, tuning excited-state dynamics, introducing heavy atom effects, and suppressing non-radiative pathways.","tp":"有机闪烁体","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":3.0},"as":"该综述系统阐述了高性能有机闪烁体的分子设计策略，聚焦通过调控分子结构、调节激发态动力学、引入重原子效应和抑制非辐射衰变途径，同步提升光学效率、成像分辨率和材料稳定性。文章涵盖了辐射探测中的新兴技术方向，为下一代辐射探测材料的设计提供了原理性指导。"},{"t":"向有机农业过渡时优化生物多样性、多功能性和产量","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41893-026-01791-1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Nature Sustainability","tg":"研究论文","b":"Agricultural intensification increases crop production but often causes declines in soil biodiversity and functioning, thus threatening long-term environmental sustainability. To buffer these impacts, environmental policies aim to increase the amount of organic farming; however, this potentially compromises yield and nitrogen and phosphorus availability. Given such complexities, we evaluated the overall impacts of shifting agricultural management by comparing the effects of conventional versus organic farming on soil biodiversity (richness of 6 faunal and microbial groups), functioning (21 indicators) and crop yield on 179 global croplands across a wide range of ecological contexts, including contrasting levels of soil degradation. High crop yields did not necessarily trade off against soil biodiversity, ecosystem multifunctionality or nitrogen availability, with often positive correlations found between them. Yield, biodiversity and functioning variables showed a broad range of values within and between conventional and organic sites. Despite this large variation, we found that landscapes with 50% organic agriculture could optimize crop yields, biodiversity and multifunctionality. Our findings provide guidelines for sustainable agriculture, showing how prioritizing the transition to organic farming in moderately to highly degraded soils would maximize its benefits while minimizing yield loss.","tp":"有机农业化","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"农业集约化虽提高产量但常导致土壤生物多样性下降。研究系统评估了从常规农业向有机农业转型对生物多样性、生态系统多功能性和产量的综合影响，涵盖氮磷有效性等关键指标。结果揭示了有机农业在生物多样性提升与产量/养分可得性之间的权衡关系，为优化转型策略提供依据。"},{"t":"光锁定低噪声光子微波振荡器","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag135/8524805?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","b":"The next-generation sensing and communication applications rely on high-frequency microwave generation with low noise. Microwave photonic technology is highly promising; however, its practical applications have so far been limited by the complexity of existing system architectures. Here, we demonstrate an optically locked low-noise photonic microwave oscillator, in which all the optical components are packaged within a small module of 166 mL, and low noise microwave generation is achieved at 10.4 GHz with single-sideband phase noise of − 54 dBc/Hz at 10 Hz, −141 dBc/Hz at 10 kHz, and − 162 dBc/Hz at 10 MHz offset. Above performance arises from a dual-laser self-injection-locking scheme to a single Fabry–Pérot cavity with high Q exceeding 108, with over 20 dB common-mode noise suppression. The low-noise nature of this reference is coherently transferred to the X-band through a high-performance TFLN electro-optic comb chip, thereby overcoming long-standing barriers in photonic microwave integration to enable truly field-deployable low-noise microwave generation."},{"t":"表面自由基开环聚合产生超长聚对亚苯基，以获取非苯环碳","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02092-y","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","b":"Extending the chain lengths of conductive polymers, such as unsubstituted poly(para-phenylene) (PPP), is crucial for their application in high-performance organic devices and processing into high-quality functional materials. While surface-assisted Ullmann coupling has increased PPP chain lengths to ~100 nm, from ~32 nm achieved by solution-based reactions, its step-growth reaction mechanism limits further elongation. Here we report the synthesis of PPP via radical ring-opening polymerization of [6]cyclo(para-phenylene) on a Cu(111) surface. This process has been identified as a chain-growth polymerization, substantially enhancing the PPP chain length to the micrometre range (~0.9 μm). The obtained ultralong PPP chains on an otherwise clean surface undergo selective C–H bond scission, forming an upright-standing poly(para-benzyne) intermediate, which further couples into the unsubstituted biphenylene ribbon with length up to ~40 nm. The ring-opening polymerization provides a versatile route to high-quality polymers and non-benzenoid carbon nanoribbons with precise structural control.","tp":"导电聚合物","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究者报道了通过表面自由基开环聚合合成聚对亚苯基（PPP）的新方法。传统表面辅助Ullmann偶联受逐步增长机制限制，链长难以突破约100 nm。该自由基开环聚合策略有望显著延长导电聚合物链长，对高性能有机电子器件加工具有重要意义。","aip":1},{"t":"智能体在网络系统中的最优集成以引导协作","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537939123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","as":"该研究探讨如何将智能代理最优地集成到社会技术网络系统中以引导集体行为。在人与技术作为交互实体的混合系统中，智能代理的介入策略直接影响网络整体的协调效率与稳定性。研究通过建模优化代理在网络中的部署方式，为社交网络治理、交通调度等复杂系统提供理论框架。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"智能体网络协作","kp":["[社会技术网络]: 智能体最优集成引导合作演化"],"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"On the optimal integration of intelligent agents into network systems to steer cooperation","b":"Sociotechnical networks, in which humans and technologies act as interacting entities (also known as “hybrid systems”), increasingly face perturbations by automated agents. What this implies for immersive steering of collective behavior, and how this shapes the stability and resilience of cooperation, remain unclear. Here, we extend evolutionary graph theory by incorporating a distinct type of node representing embedded intelligent agents, namely, algorithmic nodes that autonomously implement prescribed behavioral responses during interactions. These agents are randomly placed within a social network and exert local influence in their neighborhood in social dilemma games. Individual behavior changes are driven by evolutionary dynamics. We derive closed-form analytical results characterizing evolutionary stability and long-run cooperation levels, and show that there exists an optimal, intermediate prevalence of intelligent agents that best promotes cooperation. Our work offers insights into the optimal alignment of human populations with respect to the social good using intelligent agents."},{"t":"裸鳃类动物的颜色多样性在鸟嘌呤光子结构“像素”中具有共同的物理基础","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525419123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Nudibranchs are well known for their bright and diverse color patterns. This coloration is typically a form of aposematism, warning predators against toxic compounds sequestered from their prey and weaponized as a form of defense. Although many of the hues in nudibranchs were thought to be of pigmentary origin, here we show, using a combination of white light and Raman microspectroscopy, that hierarchically organized micron-scale guanine multilayer structures are responsible for many of these colors. Such architectures are widespread across the dorid and aeolid groups and are responsible for a striking array of angular-independent structural colors. By using cryogenic focused ion beam (cryo-FIB) SEM tomography, we were able to access the complex 3D organization of the guanine nanoplatelets responsible for the strong blue coloration of\n                    Chromodoris annae\n                    . We propose that the multilayer organization of guanine platelets with varying orientations across the tissue and their micron-scale size offers a particularly effective strategy for producing diverse optical effects. The macroscopic angular independent color results from individual multilayers which we describe as “pixels”, these “pixels” reflect light at a wavelength governed by their interlayer spacing and guanine platelet thickness. The macroscopic hue can be spectrally tuned by altering the statistical distribution of pixels with each color, while the angular dependence of color can be changed through the relative orientation of the multilayer stacks and their size, allowing for a single structural motif to generate a broad palette of optical appearances."},{"t":"非遗传 DNA 作为可编程分子诱饵","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02102-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"非平衡表面活性剂分配驱动自纳米乳化以实现可扩展的纳米载体生产","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44286-026-00367-2","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemical Engineering","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Nanocarriers are indispensable in biomedicine, enabling breakthroughs in drug delivery, vaccines and diagnostics. Despite notable successes facilitated by microfluidic technologies, sustainable, low-cost and high-throughput production of monodisperse nanocarriers remains a longstanding challenge. Here we report surfactant-flux-induced interfacial instability, a self-driven nanoemulsification mechanism triggered by non-equilibrium surfactant partitioning at a water–oil interface. This strategy produces 5 l of highly uniform nanoemulsion (0.2 l of disperse phase) in 1 min, producing droplets with diameters as small as 34 nm and polydispersity indices below 0.10. This self-driven nanoemulsification is robust across a broad range of pH values (~3–11) and temperatures (~4–85 °C), demonstrating compatibility with over ten oil–water–surfactant systems and enabling the synthesis of diverse nanocarriers including nanodroplets, micelles, vesicles, polymeric nanoparticles and metal–organic framework nanocrystals. We further demonstrate that surfactant flux underpins the observed interfacial instability, offering a mechanism for nanoemulsification under far-from-equilibrium conditions. This work addresses a bottleneck in nanomanufacturing and provides insights into dynamic surfactant behavior at immiscible interfaces.","tp":"纳米载体","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究报道了一种由非平衡表面活性剂在油水界面分配触发的界面不稳定性机制，实现自驱动纳米乳化。该策略为药物递送、疫苗和诊断领域所需的单分散纳米载体提供了可持续、低成本、高通量的生产新途径，克服了微流控技术的规模化瓶颈。"},{"t":"通过马尔科夫尼科夫炔烃氢镍化实现NiH催化的羰基化合物对映收敛α-烯基化","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8854855?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"该研究开发了镍氢（NiH）催化的对映汇聚型α-烯基化反应，通过马尔科夫尼科夫（Markovnikov）选择性实现羰基化合物的官能化。β-亚甲基羰基结构是药物化学中的重要药效团骨架，广泛存在于天然产物和生物活性分子中。该催化体系利用廉价镍金属替代贵金属，实现了优异的对映选择性和区域选择性，为手性羰基化合物的合成提供了高效、经济的新途径，对药物合成和精细化工领域具有重要意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍催化烯基化","kp":["催化剂[α-烯基化]: NiH催化对映趋同","[关键步骤]: 马氏炔烃氢镍化"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"NiH‐Catalyzed Enantioconvergent α‐Alkenylation of Carbonyl Compounds via Markovnikov Alkyne Hydronickellation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    β\n                    ‐Methylene carbonyl motifs constitute privileged structural frameworks that play vital roles as a pharmacophore and serve as key intermediates in the assembly of architecturally complex molecules. Despite their synthetic importance, asymmetric approaches for their preparation remain scarce and are largely confined to substrate‐controlled or stoichiometric chiral auxiliary methods. Herein, we report a nickel hydride‐catalyzed enantioconvergent\n                    α\n                    ‐alkenylation of carbonyl compounds with alkynes, providing a direct and general route to\n                    α\n                    ‐chiral\n                    β\n                    ‐methylene carbonyl derivatives. The transformation proceeds via Markovnikov‐selective alkyne hydronickellation followed by nickel‐radical recombination to forge the\n                    α\n                    ‐stereogenic center, delivering the desired products with high levels of regio‐ and enantioselectivity. The protocol accommodates a wide range of alkynes and\n                    α\n                    ‐halocarbonyl partners, displays excellent functional group tolerance, and can be applied to the modification of biologically relevant molecules. Mechanistic investigations indicate that a partially protic Ni(II)H species governs the observed regioselectivity, while enantio‐discrimination occurs during the radical capture step. This work establishes NiH catalysis as a versatile platform for expanding the synthetic repertoire for enantioenriched\n                    β\n                    ‐methylene carbonyl architectures."},{"t":"中子基锂硫电池机理全景图谱：原位方法、标准化与AI辅助解析","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70803?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锂硫电池中子表征","kp":["[中子技术]: Li-S电池机理性映射","[数据融合]: AI辅助标准化框架"],"as":"该研究利用中子技术对锂硫（Li-S）电池充放电过程中的机制进行原位（operando）全面表征。中子对轻元素（锂、硫）具有极高的探测灵敏度，能够穿透电池外壳直接观测内部埋藏界面和体相传输过程，这是X射线等技术难以实现的。研究系统揭示了多硫化物穿梭、硫转化反应动力学及界面演化等关键机制，为突破锂硫电池循环寿命短、库仑效率低等瓶颈提供了深层机理认识，对高能量密度电池研发具有指导价值。","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"Neutron‐Based Mechanistic Mapping Across the Li–S Battery Landscape: Operando Methods, Standardization, and AI‐Assisted ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Neutron techniques provide exceptional sensitivity to light elements, buried interfaces, and bulk transport, making them uniquely suited for probing lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries, yet their application remains fragmented and insufficiently standardized. This Review develops a unified mechanistic mapping framework that links neutron observables to Li–S descriptors across multiple length and time scales, spanning fundamental and application‐relevant regimes. Imaging and tomography, small‐angle scattering (SANS), diffraction, reflectometry, quasielastic neutron spectroscopy (QENS), neutron depth profiling (NDP), and prompt‐gamma activation analysis (PGNAA) are integrated to resolve sulfur redox reactions, polysulfide transport, electrolyte and separator behavior, and lithium anode degradation under operando conditions. Practical guidelines are summarized for operando cell architectures, isotopic‐contrast design using H/D and\n                    6\n                    Li substitution, optimization of neutron flux and q‐range, and uncertainty‐aware data treatment. To address limitations in temporal resolution, chemical selectivity, and cross‐study comparability, the Review introduces an AI‐assisted, model‐based data‐fusion framework combining physics‐informed preprocessing with Bayesian optimization and neural‐network modeling. This approach enables quantitative reconstruction of sulfur‐phase evolution, interphase growth, and Li\n                    2\n                    S morphology under realistic conditions. A concluding roadmap identifies priority measurements, standardized metadata schemes, and benchmarks to accelerate reproducible Li–S research across global neutron facilities."},{"t":"精确糖尿病中协同微环境重编程和 EpSC 复兴的纳米级联工程研讨会","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522987?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Chronic wounds are life‐threatening conditions characterized by impaired closure. Chronic inflammation and impaired regeneration and repair lead to the pathological phenotype of chronic diabetic wounds and reduce drug efficacy. In this study, we found that the poor proliferative and differentiative ability of epidermal stem cells (EpSCs) within an inflammatory microenvironment is a key factor contributing to the delayed healing of chronic diabetic wounds. To address this issue, we designed a nanocascade engineering workshop (Cu\n                    5.4\n                    O@LL‐37/pDNA) capable of simultaneously reshaping the inflammatory microenvironment and activating EpSC functions to promote rapid wound closure. The workshop used a core–shell structure design. The core, an ultrasmall Cu\n                    5.4\n                    O nanozyme, can efficiently eliminate reactive oxygen species, enhance the inflammatory response, and transform the pathological wound microenvironment into a niche facilitating regeneration. The shell is constructed through the electrostatic assembly of plasmid DNA (pDNA) and the antibacterial peptide LL‐37, enhancing gene transfection efficiency and inhibiting bacterial infection effectively. By leveraging its dual advantages in microenvironment modulation and structural design, the system substantially improves gene delivery and facilitates sustained P311 expression, thereby promoting EpSC proliferation and differentiation. This nanotherapy reshaping the microenvironment and activating EpSC function accelerates re‐epithelialization and wound closure in both diabetes and infection models. This treatment strategy is a novel approach to achieve durable and effective healing in chronic wounds.","tp":"纳米医药","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现糖尿病慢性创口中表皮干细胞（EpSCs）在炎症微环境下增殖和分化能力受损是愈合延迟的关键因素。报道了一种纳米级联工程策略，可协同重编程炎症微环境并促进表皮干细胞功能恢复，为慢性糖尿病伤口治疗提供新方向。"},{"t":"NIH 摆脱机构主导的科学","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00823-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"相互排斥的选择性前 mRNA 剪接促进 JNK 的适应性代谢应激信号传导","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527162123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The JUN NH\n                    2\n                    -terminal kinase (JNK) signal transduction pathway is activated during the hepatic metabolic stress response. The JNK1 and JNK2 pre-mRNAs expressed by hepatocytes exhibit mutually exclusive inclusion of exons 7a or 7b that encode a segment of the substrate binding site that is required for selective protein phosphorylation. We established mice with conditional inclusion of exons 7a or 7b to test the function of these JNK spliceoforms. We report that the JNK2\n                    7b\n                    spliceoform plays a key role in the hepatic metabolic stress response. This function of JNK2\n                    7b\n                    is mediated by coordinated mechanisms that independently regulate circadian gene expression and phosphorylation of Retinoid X Receptor α (RXRα) on Ser\n                    265\n                    . This analysis identifies an important role for JNK2\n                    7b\n                    in the hepatic adaptive response to metabolic stress."},{"t":"多位点协同调控助力高效稳定钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3450174?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿多位点调控","kp":["[多点协同调控]: 钙钛矿薄膜优化"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过多位点协同调控策略，实现钙钛矿太阳能电池的高效稳定运行。钙钛矿太阳能电池因优异的光电转换效率备受关注，但界面缺陷和相不稳定性制约其商业化。研究在钙钛多活性位点同时引入钝化和稳定化修饰，协同抑制非辐射复合和离子迁移，显著提升器件效率和工作稳定性。该多位点协同策略为钙钛矿光伏器件的工程化优化提供了系统方法论。","ot":"Multi‐Site Synergistic Regulation Towards Highly Efficient and Stable Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Perovskite solar cells (PSCs) have attracted considerable scientific interest due to their remarkable power conversion efficiency (PCE) and economically viable manufacturing processes. However, the commercialization has faced obstacles such as limited operational stability and susceptibility to moisture, which usually stem from the inferior quality of perovskite film. In this study, we present Di‐p‐toluenesulfonamide (D‐pTSAD) as triple‐functional ligand featuring multi‐site synergistic coordination with the perovskite lattice. Through this mechanism, D‐pTSAD simultaneously facilitates oriented crystal growth and mitigates defect formation, achieving a top‐performing device with a PCE of 26.22%. Comprehensive analysis reveals that D‐pTSAD forms stronger coordination with both Pb\n                    2\n                    +\n                    and I\n                    −\n                    ions compared to bifunctional ligands, effectively passivating defects, suppressing ion migration, and reducing nonradiative recombination. After 1,000 h of continuous maximum power point tracking, PSCs with D‐pTSAD maintained 82.5% of initial PCE. This research underscores the potency of multisite coordination chemistry in elevating both performance and stability of PSCs."},{"t":"面向氢能综合能源系统调度的多智能体时序通信框架","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003430?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多智能体能源调度","dp":1,"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"kp":["[调度框架]: 多智能体时序通信调度氢集成能源"],"as":"","ot":"Multi-agent temporal communication framework for scheduling in hydrogen-integrated energy systems"},{"t":"基于分子互变异构的COF异构化及其在水系超级电容器中的应用","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00077-9?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF超级电容器","kp":["[互变异构]: 三聚氰酸三酮/三醇构型","[异构化调控]: 溶剂介电常数"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"利用三聚氰酸（氰尿酸）的互变异构特性（三酮/三醇构型），实现共价有机框架（COF）的精确结构异构化。通过调控互变异构体的比例，可精准控制COF的孔道结构与官能团分布，从而优化其在水系超级电容器中的储能性能。该策略为通过分子层面的结构调控设计高性能多孔碳基储能材料提供了新思路，相关异构体展现出差异显著的电容与循环稳定性。","ot":"Molecular tautomerism-enabled isomerization of COFs for aqueous supercapacitors","b":"This work employs cyanuric acid tautomerism (tri-one/tri-ol configurations) to achieve precise structural isomerization of covalent organic frameworks (COFs). Through variation of the solvent dielectric constant, two distinct homogeneous triazine-based COFs (Ton-COF and Tol-COF) are selectively synthesized, exhibiting differentiated supercapacitor performance. This approach may provide a new insight into the development of COFs for advanced electrochemical energy storage from molecular design to performance regulation and beyond.","aip":1},{"t":"卵母细胞胞质晶格组装的分子基础","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10360-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Mammalian oocytes are filled by fibric structure called cytoplasmic lattice (CPL), essential for oocyte maturation and early embryonic development1-3. CPL comprises subcortical maternal complex (SCMC) and multiple components, including PADI62,4,5. Despite its discovery in the 1960s, the molecular architecture and assembly mechanisms of CPL have remained poorly understood. Here we present the cryo-electron microscopy (cryo-EM) structure of the CPL isolated from mouse oocytes. Our analysis identified 14 constitutive protein subunits and revealed that CPL is composed of repeating “U-shaped basket” (UB) and “adapter ring” (AR)- featured units, forming a filamentous architecture. AR adopts a two-fold symmetric conformation, containing two NLRP4f, four SCMC and two ZBED3 subunits circularized via two distinct interaction clusters. The UB is anchored by PADI6, a didecamer composed of ten homodimers assembled by two back-to-back pentamers, each forming the lateral side of UB. The underfoot base and up-down sides of the UB are formed by multiple central-symmetric assemblies (UBE2D3-UHRF1-NLRP14) and (TUBB2B-TUBB2A-FBXW24-SKP1) respectively, associating with the PADI6 pentamers to construct the intact UB structure. Two SCMC dimer within each AR connect the up and down sides of two adjacent UBs with an extensive protein-protein interaction network and thus maintain the repetitive connection between the neighboring CPL units. Our work unveils the architectural principles underlying the assembly of this large, periodic CPL filament, offering a molecular basis for understanding CPL’s functions in early mammalian embryogenesis and female reproductive disorders."},{"t":"电池电解液研究中浓度讨论的常见误区","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00035-8?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Joule","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电解质浓度","dp":1,"sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":4.0,"t":4.5},"as":"这篇评论文章指出电池电解质研究中浓度概念的频繁误用与错误定义问题。许多研究在描述电解质浓度时混淆了摩尔浓度、质量摩尔浓度、摩尔分数等不同概念，导致实验结果难以复现、文献间比较困难。文章系统梳理了电解质浓度的正确表述方式，强调在高浓度电解液（如高盐浓度体系）中溶剂-溶质化学计量关系的精确计算尤为重要，呼吁研究社区统一浓度定义标准。","ot":"Misconceptions in discussing concentration in battery electrolyte research","b":"This commentary highlights the frequent misuse and misdefinition of electrolyte concentration in battery research, which can lead to misleading interpretations of electrochemical behavior. By clarifying the conceptual foundations of concentration, it provides a more accurate framework for designing electrolytes and improving the reliability of battery studies."},{"t":"使用金属中间层时\"无负极\"体系中电沉积锂的微观结构及循环演化","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07230A","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无负极固态锂电池","kp":["[金属中间层]: 均化锂沉积覆盖","[无负极固态电池]: 锂晶粒细化"],"sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究了在\"无负极\"（anode-free）固态电池构型中，使用金属中间层时电沉积锂的微观结构及其循环演化行为。\"无储库\"设计可避免处理高反应活性锂金属箔，但锂沉积的均匀性直接影响电池循环寿命。研究发现金属中间层能调控锂的成核与生长形貌，抑制枝晶形成。通过原位显微表征揭示了循环过程中锂微观结构的动态演变规律，为优化固态电池界面工程提供了指导。","ot":"Microstructure of Electrodeposited Lithium and its Evolution During Cycling when Using Metal Interlayers in \"Anode-Free\"","b":"\"Reservoir-free\" construction of solid state batteries could circumvent the handling of reactive lithium metal foils and further increase the energy density. Metallic interlayers could play an important role in the homogenization of the deposited lithium layer by increasing the coverage of the deposit and additionally reducing the size of the lithium grains. To date, the influence of different interlayers and the influence of stripping on the lithium microstructure is still unknown. This work analyzes the influence of gold, silver and bismuth interlayers on the microstructure of electrodeposited lithium layers using electron backscatter diffraction (EBSD) on cross-sections prepared by broad ion-milling. In addition, partially stripped lithium layers and thus the influence of stripping on the lithium microstructure are analyzed using the mentioned interlayers. Our findings reveal that different interlayer materials result in different lithium microstructures. In addition, stripping also causes a significant change in the lithium microstructure, both in terms of grain size and grain orientation, gaining a deeper understanding of the lithium microstructure and its impact."},{"t":"小胶质细胞果糖代谢对于胶质母细胞瘤生长至关重要","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521256123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Glioblastoma (GBM) remains one of the most aggressive and treatment-resistant brain tumors in adults. Its immune microenvironment is dominated by tumor-associated macrophages, including both infiltrating monocytes and brain-resident microglia. While metabolic rewiring of infiltrating myeloid cells has been shown to support tumor progression, the role of microglial metabolism in GBM remains incompletely understood. Here, we demonstrate that microglia uniquely express the fructose transporter GLUT5 and are the only immune cells in the GBM microenvironment capable of metabolizing fructose. Using murine orthotopic glioma and Replication-Competent Avian sarcoma leuko virus Splice acceptor (RCAS)-derived tumor models, we show that global deletion of GLUT5 confers profound resistance to tumor growth. This effect is driven by loss of fructose metabolism in microglia and occurs independently of contributions from peripheral immune compartments. In GLUT5-deficient mice, tumors exhibit increased infiltration and activation of both innate and adaptive immunity, including enhanced antigen presentation, clonal expansion of CD8+ T cells, and increased cytokine production. Depletion of B-cells or CD8+ T cells abrogated survival phenotypes in knockout mice, demonstrating that GLUT5 suppresses adaptive immunity. These findings identify microglial fructose metabolism as a critical regulator of immune suppression in GBM and suggest that targeting this pathway may improve immunotherapeutic responses."},{"t":"塑料废弃物的微生物升级回收制备左旋多巴","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41893-026-01785-z","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Sustainability","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微生物塑料转化","kp":["底物[生物升级回收]: PET废弃塑料","产物[微生物合成]: 左旋多巴"],"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究利用工程生物学手段，将塑料废弃物微生物升级回收为左旋多巴（levodopa）。左旋多巴是帕金森病治疗的核心药物，传统化学合成路径复杂且依赖石化原料。研究团队通过设计工程化微生物，实现了从塑料废物到高附加值化学品的复杂生物合成，为循环经济和绿色制造提供了可持续替代方案。该策略展示了合成生物学在废弃物增值化和复杂分子合成方面的巨大潜力，有望降低药物生产成本并减少塑料污染。","ot":"Microbial upcycling of plastic waste to levodopa","b":"Using engineering biology to perform complex chemical synthesis offers a sustainable alternative to traditional processes that rely on finite fossil resources. A growing opportunity within this field lies in reclaiming carbon embedded in industrial and post-consumer waste—carbon otherwise lost to landfill, incineration or pollution. Here we report the bio-upcycling of poly(ethylene terephthalate) (PET) plastic waste into levodopa (l-DOPA), a frontline medication for Parkinson’s disease, using engineered Escherichia coli. Two key bottlenecks—substrate import and feedback inhibition by the intermediate protocatechuate—were addressed through heterologous transporter expression and functional pathway separation across two microbial strains. To further improve sustainability, and as a proof-of-concept, Chlamydomonas reinhardtii was used to capture CO2 released during catechol generation. The resulting bioprocess operates under mild, aqueous conditions and achieves high l-DOPA titres (5.0 g l−1), with isolated product obtained at preparative scale from both industrial PET waste and a single post-consumer plastic bottle. This work demonstrates how engineering biology can transform plastic-derived aromatic monomers into high-value pharmaceuticals for the treatment of neurological disease in humans."},{"t":"高功率密度金属泡沫固体氧化物燃料电池电堆：实现快速安全热循环","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003727?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固体氧化物燃料电池","kp":["[器件形态]: 金属泡沫支撑SOFC电堆","[热循环]: 快速安全热循环"],"dp":1,"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"as":"","ot":"Metal foam solid oxide fuel cell stack with high power density for fast and safe thermal cycling","aip":1},{"t":"机械化学增强的双动态共价晶种策略实现高性能且操作稳定的钙钛矿器件","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72823?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿太阳能电池","kp":["[钝化策略]: 双动态骨架DDS原位构建","[反应类型]: 正交Diels-Alder与肟-氨基甲酸酯"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究通过机械化学增强的双动态共价种子策略，解决了钙钛矿太阳能电池（PSCs）长期不稳定的根本问题。PSCs的退化主要由缺陷介导的离子迁移驱动，研究者引入双动态共价化学机制对钙钛矿薄膜进行种子层工程优化，有效抑制了晶界缺陷和离子迁移。该策略同时提升了器件的光电转换效率和操作稳定性，使PSCs在商业化可靠性方面迈出关键一步，为解决PSCs长期稳定性难题提供了创新思路。","ot":"Mechanochemically Reinforced Dual‐Dynamic Covalent Seeding Enables High‐Performance and Operationally Stable Perovskite ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The long‐term instability of perovskite solar cells (PSCs), primarily governed by defect‐mediated ion migration, poses a critical barrier to their commercialization. Herein, we introduce a synergistic dual‐dynamic scaffold (DDS) strategy, constructed in situ via orthogonal Diels‐Alder and oxime‐carbamate reactions within the perovskite precursor. This intelligently designed network functions as a molecular template for heterogeneous nucleation, directing the formation of dense, large‐grained, and preferentially oriented films. Concurrently, the DDS consolidates into an interpenetrating covalent mesh at grain boundaries (GBs), delivering multi‐modal passivation through Lewis‐base coordination and hydrogen bonding, inducing a benign compressive strain, and serving as a robust physicochemical barrier against ion and moisture ingress. These concerted actions effectively minimize interfacial losses, mitigate energetic disorder, and suppress trap‐assisted recombination. Remarkably, the covalently anchored network underpins exceptional operational stability under thermal, environmental, and electrical stress. Consequently, this integrated strategy yields a champion power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 26.95% (certified 26.69%), along with excellent long‐term stability, retaining 97.8% of its initial efficiency after 1000 h of continuous operation under the ISOS‐L‐2I protocol, underscoring the transformative potential of in situ dual‐dynamic covalent bonding for high‐performance and operationally stable photovoltaics."},{"t":"鸟类尘浴的机制","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521949123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Dust bathing is a widespread behavior among birds that helps remove ectoparasites, but its mechanical basis remains poorly understood. Here we show that wing flapping during dust bathing generates sand-particle collisions sufficient to dislodge feather mites. Using high-speed video analysis across 34 bird species, we found that wing-flapping frequency scales inversely with body mass (\n                    \n                      \n                        f\n                        ∼\n                        \n                          M\n                          \n                            -\n                            0.20\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    ), ranging from 1 to 10 Hz. Since feather motion matches wing motion, we use mechanical shakers to simulate dust-bathing dynamics. Mite-removal experiments reveal that parasite dislodgment efficiency increases rapidly up to around 5 Hz and plateaued thereafter. The frequencies around 5 Hz are sufficient to achieve maximal cleaning efficacy. Collision modeling indicates that the impact force from sand particles exceeds mite adhesion forces, thus collision is the dominant removal mechanism. Mites are removed within seconds when sand is present, suggesting that sand plays an active mechanical role in parasite dislodgment. These findings not only elucidate a physical mechanism underlying dust bathing, but also suggest that birds may have evolutionarily tuned their flapping behavior to optimize parasite removal through substrate interaction."},{"t":"海洋保护城市：海洋治理的典范","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00864-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"利用金属层状Nb0.3W0.7Se2实现p型单层二硒化钨晶体管的低阻接触","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01568-6","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维材料晶体管接触","kp":["接触材料[p型WSe2]: 层状Nb0.3W0.7Se2","[低接触电阻]: 低温沉积无缺陷"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究利用金属层状材料Nb0.3W0.7Se2实现了p型单层二硒化钨（WSe2）晶体管的超低接触电阻。二维半导体器件中，金属-半导体界面的接触电阻是限制性能的核心瓶颈，尤其对p型器件更为严峻。研究团队采用与WSe2晶格匹配的金属性层状材料作为接触电极，通过范德华接触有效消除了费米钉扎效应，显著降低了接触电阻。该成果为高性能二维半导体电子学和互补逻辑电路的实用化铺平了道路。","ot":"Low-resistance contacts for p-type monolayer tungsten diselenide transistors using metallic layered Nb0.3W0.7Se2","b":"Achieving low contact resistance is a critical challenge in the development of p-type transistors that use monolayer transition metal dichalcogenides, such as tungsten diselenide (WSe2), as their channel material. Contacts made with high work function metals require deposition at high temperatures, which typically creates defects or strain at the metal–channel interface. One solution is to use metallic two-dimensional (2D) materials that have atomically flat surfaces and can be deposited at low temperatures, as have been reported for n-type semiconductors. However, the comparatively large bandgap of WSe2 has hindered experimental progress with p-type transistors. Here we show that metallic layered Nb0.3W0.7Se2 can be used to create contacts for monolayer and bilayer WSe2 field-effect transistors with channel lengths down to 100 nm. Our 2D–2D contacted field-effect transistors exhibit on-current densities of up to 358 µA µm−1 and 1.1 mA µm−1 on monolayer and bilayer WSe2 channels, respectively. In combination with scaled gate dielectrics (effective oxide thickness of 1.3 nm), the fabricated 2D–2D contacted monolayer WSe2 devices achieve a subthreshold swing of 88 mV dec−1.","aip":1},{"t":"长程块状层间 Dzyaloshinskii-Moriya 相互作用可实现稳定的 3D 磁性纹理","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516452?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  As an antisymmetric exchange interaction, the Dzyaloshinskii‐Moriya interaction (DMI) favors canted spin alignment and stabilizes chiral spin textures. However, the existing DMI effects, e.g., interfacial DMI, bulk DMI, and interlayer DMI, cannot achieve long‐range characteristics and vertical chirality simultaneously, hindering the implementation of three‐dimensional (3D) topological magnetic textures. Here, we first achieve a bulk‐like interlayer DMI (BIL‐DMI) effect in gradient magnetic multilayers by engineering in‐plane (IP) and out‐of‐plane (OOP) symmetry breaking, which presents unprecedented long‐range vertical chirality. The direction and magnitude of the BIL‐DMI‐induced IP/OOP DMI effective fields depend on the DMI gradient, and the OOP effective field exhibits exotically linear dependence on external magnetic fields, distinctly different from the existing saturation behaviors of interlayer DMI. Moreover, a continuum model is built to explain the mechanism of BIL‐DMI and quantitatively describe the experimental observations. Based on the BIL‐DMI, unique 3D transverse skyrmion/bimeron strings applicable to next‐generation magnonic circuits are first stabilized in theory, which is unachievable relying on existing DMI effects. The discovery of BIL‐DMI achieves access to a long‐range version of IL‐DMI through gradient engineering, providing a platform for the investigation and application of 3D topological magnetic textures.","tp":"磁性纹理","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"首次实现了体相层间Dzyaloshinskii-Moriya相互作用（BIL-DMI）效应，同时具备长程特性和垂直手性，克服了现有界面DMI、体相DMI和层间DMI无法兼顾两者的限制，为三维拓扑磁性纹理的构建和自旋电子学应用奠定基础。"},{"t":"裂谷热病毒 NS 细丝的活细胞 3D-SIM 揭示了多边形网络结构","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534404123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"A defining feature of Rift Valley fever virus (RVFV) is the incorporation of the NSs protein into large filamentous assemblies inside infected nuclei [R. Swanepoel, N. K. Blackburn,\n                    J. Gen. Virol.\n                    34\n                    , 557–561 (1977).], as judged from fixed specimens. To gain insight into the 3D structure of NSs filaments within live-cell nuclei, we used genetic-code expansion (GCE) to incorporate trans-cyclooct-2-en-L-lysine into the protein. This enabled site-specific fluorescent labeling with tetrazine dyes for live-cell structured illumination microscopy (SIM). Our superresolved images revealed the complete native architecture of NSs filaments as a micron-scale polygon web of fibers with discrete domain characteristics, overturning previous assumptions of simple linear filaments. Parallel experiments on fixed RVFV-infected cells confirmed that native NSs filaments also display this morphology. Overall, our 3D-SIM analysis reveals distinct structural plasticity within NSs filaments, establishing a quantitative structure–function relationship that support the importance of polygon organization for NSs filament function during RVFV infection."},{"t":"锂同位素证据表明大陆风化增强引发晚古生代温室到冰库气候","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag168/8526391?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The causes of the transition from a greenhouse to an icehouse climate during the Early Mississippian (~359–347 Ma), marking the possible onset of the Late Paleozoic Ice Age (LPIA), remain an outstanding puzzle in Earth’s climate history. This transition coincides with the mid-Tournaisian carbon isotope excursion (TICE). It is hypothesized that intensified continental silicate weathering during this period sequestered CO₂, boosted nutrients, and increased marine productivity, causing the positive TICE. However, direct evidence for enhanced continental weathering has been lacking. We present lithium isotope (δ⁷Li) data from two carbonate sections showing a ~12‰ decline during TICE. Integrating δ⁷Li with carbon cycle models (GEOCLIM and COPSE) suggests silicate chemical weathering rates increased ~30% with declines in weathering intensity during the TICE event, likely due to uplift or vegetation, ultimately reducing atmospheric pCO₂ by ~1000 ppm. This provides evidence linking enhanced weathering, CO₂ drawdown, and the onset of the LPIA, shedding light on a key aspect of late Paleozoic climate change."},{"t":"将金属氧化与氧反应性联系起来","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02540-7","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属氧化","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":1.5,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"光驱动的可逆环收缩和膨胀来调节应变、构象和反应性","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00013-6?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","b":"This study introduces looped diarylethene photoswitches that reversibly alter ring size and thereby modulate molecular strain using light. The strain was monitored via the diagnostic absorption maxima of the photogenerated closed isomers. Incorporation of an allene functionality into the loop region allowed for remote-controlled reactivity tuning in a dipolar cycloaddition with diazoacetate.","tp":"光控分子","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究引入了环状二芳基乙烯光开关分子，通过光驱动可逆改变环大小来调控分子应变。利用闭环异构体特征吸收峰监测应变变化，并在环区引入丙二烯官能团，实现了在偶极环加成反应中远程调控反应性，为光控化学反应提供新策略。"},{"t":"二维过渡金属硫族化物的Li+插层化学：相变演化、规模化制备与应用","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag165/8526392?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","tp":"二维材料插层化学","kp":["[相变化学]: Li+插层诱导TMDs相演化","[体系]: IV-VI族TMDs完整相图"],"dp":1,"as":"锂离子插层化学通过在二维过渡金属硫族化物（TMDs）中诱导相变，为调控材料电子与晶体结构提供了强力手段。研究系统阐述了Li⁺插层如何驱动TMDs从半导体2H相向金属1T/1T'相转变，进而显著改变其电学、催化及储能性能。该机制在电池电极材料、电催化剂及柔性电子器件等方向具有重要应用前景，但插层过程的可控制备与结构稳定性仍是工程化落地的关键挑战。","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Li+ intercalation chemistry on 2D transition metal dichalcogenides towards phase evolution, scalable production and appl","b":"Li+ intercalation chemistry is a powerful tool to induce phase transitions in transition metal dichalcogenides (TMDs), but only the transition of 2H-to-1T/1T’ in group Ⅵ TMDs (MoS2 and WS2) is well-known and widely explored for applications in areas such as transistors, memristor, catalysis, and batteries. Here, we develop a fully documented landscapes of phase evolution in group IV-Ⅵ TMDs induced by electrochemical Li+ intercalation through in-situ"},{"t":"配备致命毒素的效应细胞可用于潜在的癌症治疗","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2506991123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Lethal toxins could become potent therapies against cancer, but their clinical utility is limited by adverse events upon systemic administration. These could be reduced if the toxins were delivered by effector cells that specifically infiltrate cancers, thereby releasing toxins locally into the tumor microenvironment. One of the challenges underlying this strategy is that cells delivering toxins would have to be resistant to them. We address this obstacle by showing that effectors derived from transformed human cell lines genetically engineered for resistance to bacterial adenosine diphosphate ribosylating toxins (ADPRTs), including\n                    \n                      Pseudomonas aeruginosa\n                    \n                    exotoxin A (PE), can produce targeted immunotoxins that specifically kill cancer cells expressing cognate tumor-associated antigens. Resistance to immunotoxins was achieved by knockout of genes in the diphthamide biosynthesis pathway (\n                    DPH1-4\n                    ) required for the posttranslational modification of eukaryotic elongation factor 2 (EEF2) that is the target of ADPRTs or by mutation of\n                    EEF2\n                    itself. We show that engineering resistance to ADPRTs, one of the most potent toxins acting on human cells, is essential to achieve robust function of armored effector cell lines. This work establishes a critical step on the path to equip effector cells with the ability to deliver powerful toxins to cancer cells and introduces a platform to investigate extension to primary autologous or allogeneic therapeutic cell types."},{"t":"无脊椎动物 miRNA pva-small RNA-11881/pva-miR-11881 作为一种潜在的基于 RNA 的白斑综合征治疗剂 vi","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525793123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Small RNAs and microRNAs (miRNAs) play diverse roles in host virus interactions and hold promise for therapeutic applications. An uncharacterized shrimp miRNA with potent activity against white spot syndrome virus (WSSV), a major double-stranded DNA pathogen in aquaculture, was identified and characterized. Among the 1,239 differentially expressed unannotated small RNAs in\n                    Penaeus vannamei\n                    hemocytes, one of the most strongly downregulated candidates, termed pva-small RNA-11881 or pva-miR-11881, was predicted to target multiple WSSV genes. A pva-small RNA-11881/pva-miR-11881 isomir that originates from the 5′ untranslated region of a host\n                    lipase 3-like\n                    gene was identified. Its primary transcript contains Drosha and Dicer processing sites, and the precursor exhibits canonical pre-miRNA features. In vivo administration of its primary transcript, pva-pri-miR-11881, significantly reduced WSSV copy number and improved shrimp survival. Mechanistically, pva-miR-11881 directly suppresses crucial WSSV genes\n                    WSSV004\n                    ,\n                    WSSV164\n                    , and\n                    WSSV419\n                    and modulates the host immune response against WSSV infection by enhancing phenoloxidase activity, thereby reducing apoptosis and necrosis, and promoting caspase-1-mediated cell death. These findings reveal that the pva-miR-11881 in\n                    P. vannamei\n                    holds strong potential as a biotherapeutic agent for managing viral diseases in shrimp."},{"t":"原子间距依赖的电催化CO2还原：六方钯纳米板中惰性碲杂原子调控","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2162332?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化CO2还原","kp":["[原子间距]: Pd-Te六方纳米片埃级调制","[反应]: 电催化CO2还原"],"as":"研究揭示了金属催化剂中原子间距作为电催化CO₂还原反应关键活性描述符的重要作用，并通过在催化剂中引入惰性碲（Te）杂原子实现埃米级精度的原子间距调控。实验证明，原子间距的微小变化显著影响CO₂吸附与中间体能量势垒，进而调控产物选择性和催化效率。该工作为从原子尺度理性设计高效CO₂还原电催化剂提供了全新设计准则，但规模化制备精度仍面临挑战。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interatomic Spacing‐Dependent Electrocatalytic CO2 Reduction: Inert Te Heteroatom Modulation in Hexagonal Pd Nanoplates","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Metallic interatomic spacing emerges as a key activity descriptor in electrocatalysis, yet achieving angstrom‐level precision in its dynamic modulation and establishing definitive structure–activity correlations persist as critical bottlenecks. Here, we developed a phase‐controlled strategy enabling continuous interatomic spacing modulation in a library of hexagonal Pd‐Te nanoplates (NPs), where various atomically ordered intermetallic phases from cubic Pd\n                    4\n                    Te to rhombohedral Pd\n                    20\n                    Te\n                    7\n                    /Pd\n                    8\n                    Te\n                    3\n                    and hexagonal PdTe\n                    2\n                    were synthesized, realizing precise tuning of adjacent Pd‐Pd distances (d\n                    Pd‐a‐Pd\n                    ) from 2.75 to 4.07 Å. The proof‐of‐concept electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction (ECR) for CO formation displayed a volcano‐shaped dependence on d\n                    Pd‐a‐Pd\n                    , where Pd\n                    20\n                    Te\n                    7\n                    NPs with a d\n                    Pd‐a‐Pd\n                    of 2.88 Å exhibited a maximal CO Faraday efficiency (FE\n                    CO\n                    ) of 99.9%, and preserved FE\n                    CO\n                    over 90% at ∼120 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    during long‐term stability. Integrated in situ spectra and theoretical calculations confirmed the dominated distance effect over electronic effect, and revealed that increasing d\n                    Pd‐a‐Pd\n                    upshifted\n                    d\n                    ‐band center toward the Fermi level while altering *CO adsorption configuration from strongly bound *CO\n                    T\n                    to weakly bound *CO\n                    L\n                    , resulting in exceptional ECR activity and CO anti‐poisoning capacity on Pd\n                    20\n                    Te\n                    7\n                    NPs owing to the optimally balanced *COOH adsorption and *CO desorption. This study underscores the pivotal role of interatomic spacing in regulating intermediate adsorption configurations for electrocatalysis."},{"t":"通过可穿戴设备和常规血液生物标志物预测胰岛素抵抗","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10179-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Insulin resistance (IR), a primary precursor to type 2 diabetes, is characterized by impaired insulin action in tissues1. However, diagnostic methods remain expensive and inaccessible, which hinders early intervention2,3. Here we present the WEAR-ME study, a large, remotely conducted study of IR (n = 1,165 participants; median body mass index (BMI) = 28 kg m−2, median age = 45 years, median haemoglobin A1c (HbA1c) = 5.4%) that uses time-series data from wearable devices and routine blood biomarkers to train deep neural networks against a ground-truth measure of IR (homeostatic model assessment of IR; HOMA-IR). Using a HOMA-IR cut-off of 2.9, our multimodal model achieved robust performance (area under the receiver operating characteristic curve (AUROC) = 0.80, sensitivity = 76%, specificity = 84%) with data from wearable devices, together with demographic and routine blood biomarker data. To enhance the use of time-series data from wearables, we fine-tuned a wearable foundation model (WFM) pretrained on 40 million hours of sensor data. In an independent validation cohort (n = 72), a model integrating WFM-derived representations with demographic data surpassed a demographics-only baseline (AUROC = 0.75 versus 0.66). Moreover, adding WFM-derived representations to a model with demographics, fasting glucose and a lipid panel substantially improved performance, compared with an identical model without data from wearables (AUROC = 0.88 versus 0.76). We integrate IR prediction into a large language model to contextualize the results and facilitate personalized recommendations. This work establishes a scalable, accessible framework for the early detection of metabolic risk, which could enable timely lifestyle interventions to prevent progression to type 2 diabetes."},{"t":"细胞外镁离子对连接蛋白3功能状态以及生物物理和结构特性的影响","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2538150123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Connexin36 (Cx36) is highly expressed in inhibitory and excitatory neurons as well as pancreatic β-cells, where it forms gap junction channels that coordinate metabolic and electrical responses. In addition, Cx36 forms hemichannels in pancreatic β-cells, where it may play a critical role in endocrine cell signaling. Despite this, the regulatory mechanisms and biophysical properties of Cx36 HCs remain poorly understood. Using HeLa cells lacking endogenous expression of large-pore channels and transfected with mouse Cx36-EGFP, we evaluated hemichannel activity through dye uptake assays and membrane current recordings. We found that Cx36 hemichannel activity is strongly inhibited by extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    , rather than Ca\n                    2+\n                    , in contrast to hemichannels formed by other connexins. Under reduced extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    , or under alkaline extracellular pH conditions, Cx36 hemichannels exhibited increased activity and allowed Ca\n                    2+\n                    influx, as detected by ratiometric dye FURA-2. Under low extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    conditions, Cx36 hemichannels exhibited increased permeability to small molecules and were blocked by La\n                    3+\n                    and quinine, but not by high glucose concentration. In-silico studies revealed interactions between Mg\n                    2+\n                    and two amino acid residues within a pore constriction (D47–E49), which alter the electrostatic potential of the hemichannel pore. Consistent with these observations, mutation of either amino acid residue to alanine (D47A or E49A) markedly reduced the inhibitory effect of extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    . Together, these findings offer critical insights into the regulation of Cx36 hemichannels and suggest that alterations in Mg\n                    2+\n                    homeostasis may have significant consequences for Cx36-mediated signaling."},{"t":"可穿戴电子纺织品产业化探索：从材料、器件到系统","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00035-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"观点评论","b":"Wearable electronic textiles are evolving from single-function materials into integrated electronic systems. This Perspective reviews the materials, device designs, and integration strategies that enable scalable e-textile platforms across sensing, energy, feedback, communication, and computation, highlighting recent advances in system-level integration and identifying key bottlenecks in reliability, manufacturability, and interoperability. It offers an industrialization-oriented framework and points to emerging applications in wearable electronics, smart textiles, and human-machine interfaces.","tp":"电子纺织品","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":"本文综述了可穿戴电子纺织品从单功能材料向集成电子系统演进的路径，涵盖传感、能量、反馈、通信和计算模块的系统级集成策略，指出可靠性、可制造性和互操作性三大产业化瓶颈，提出面向规模化应用的发展框架和路线图。"},{"t":"非平衡溶液燃烧合成的原位洞察：从半导体薄膜到金属纳米结构","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00009-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"溶液燃烧合成","kp":["[合成方法]: 溶液燃烧合成(≤1分钟)","[产物调控]: 多孔镍泡沫或透明氧化物薄膜"],"as":"该研究利用同步辐射X射线吸收光谱实时追踪溶液燃烧合成过程中的非平衡反应动力学，揭示了多孔纳米催化剂的受控形成机制。研究从半导体前驱体出发，通过原位监测燃烧反应中金属中心的价态演变和配位环境变化，阐明了瞬态高温对产物形貌和催化活性的决定性作用，为按需合成高性能多孔功能材料提供了原位表征范式和工艺优化指导。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"In situ insights from non-equilibrium solution combustion synthesis: From semiconducting thin films to metallic nanostru","b":"Synchrotron X-ray absorption spectroscopy of solution combustion reactions reveals the controlled formation of porous nickel metal foams or transparent oxide thin films based on precursor chemistry and reaction geometry. This rapid (≤1 min) and low-temperature technique enables scalable manufacturing of materials for catalysts, perovskite solar devices, and batteries."},{"t":"本期","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/iti1126123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"原位聚合驱动COF剥离：构建高性能聚合物有机正极的普适策略","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4518858?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF有机正极","kp":["[策略]: COF孔内原位聚合电活性单体","[产物]: 少层纳米片复合物","[应用]: 锂离子电池有机正极"],"as":"该研究提出了一种原位聚合驱动的共价有机框架（COFs）剥离策略，作为制备高性能锂离子电池有机正极的通用方法。COFs虽具理论容量优势，但面临粉末堆积导致活性位点利用率低的瓶颈。研究通过在COF层间原位引发聚合反应，实现块体COF的有效剥离和与导电基底的强界面耦合，显著提升了离子扩散速率和电子传导效率，为下一代轻质高能电池正极材料提供了可推广的制备思路。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"In Situ Polymerization‐Driven Exfoliation of COFs: A Universal Strategy Toward High‐Performance Polymer Organic Cathodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Although covalent organic frameworks (COFs) are promising organic cathodes for lithium‐ion batteries, their compact layered bulk structure limits ion/electron transport, which results in low active site utilization and poor rate capability. Here, we present an in situ composite strategy: polymerizing electroactive monomers within COF pores. Bulk COFs are converted into few‐layer nanosheets with polymer penetrating COFs (COF@Polymer) by taking advantage of polymerization stress and polymer‐COF interactions to reduce interlayer bonding. Compared to traditional exfoliation, this method delivers a higher yield, wider applicability, and better nanosheet quality. The COF@Polymer cathodes exhibit triple advantages: the nanosheet morphology enhances active site accessibility and shortens mass transfer distances; the penetrated polymers establish efficient and additional carrier transport pathways; and polymer‐COF interactions boost structural stability. Thus, COF@Polymer cathodes perform better than pristine COFs, conventionally exfoliated nanosheets, and COF‐carbon composites in terms of active site utilization (95% for DACOF@FS‐5, 98% for BTCOF@FS‐20 and 92% for PTCOF@FS‐10), rate performance (∼ 70% capacity retention at 10 A g\n                    −1\n                    comparing to the capacity at 0.2 A g\n                    −1\n                    for BTCOF@FS‐20 and PTCOF@FS‐10), cycle stability, energy density, and power density (30.5 kW kg\n                    −1\n                    with an energy density up to 336 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    for BTCOF@FS‐20)."},{"t":"技术创新和正式制度对可再生能源转型的影响","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001540?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"可再生能源","sc":1.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"虚数坡印廷动量：偏振拓扑和多功能光学操纵","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag171/8526396?rss=1","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The imaginary Poynting momentum (IPM), as an intrinsic yet mysterious property of light, is nearly as ubiquitous as its real counterpart. However, prior research has only traced its origin to intensity asymmetry and showcased its capability in particle manipulation using evanescent waves and structured light. Fundamentally, the interplay between the IPM and polarization topology remains unexplored, significantly restricting its potential applications. Here, we observe the high-order polarization topological charges (PTCs) in the IPM and expand their capabilities in versatile particle manipulation. PTCs originate from spatial distributions of linear polarizations in vector beams. When the PTC equals 1, the IPM can be utilized to rotate particles. Distinctively, for higher-order PTCs, rotational potential-well arrays with controllable rotation directions emerge to trap and rotate various numbers of particles. This work uncovers a holistic and complete understanding of the IPM by investigating its link to the polarization distribution. It also suggests a credible way to harness polarization-topology optical forces, offering significant potential for biophysical and quantum applications.","tp":"偏振光操纵","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究观测到了虚数坡印廷动量（IPM）的高阶偏振拓扑效应。此前研究仅将IPM溯源至光强不对称，本研究揭示了IPM与偏振拓扑之间的深层相互作用，拓展了对光这一内禀性质的理解，为多功能光学操纵和粒子操控开辟新应用方向。","aip":1},{"t":"确定关键的对流敏感海洋区域，以削弱 ENSO 春季可预测性障碍","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2512725123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The El Niño–Southern Oscillation (ENSO) exhibits its weakest predictability during boreal spring, a phenomenon known as the Spring Predictability Barrier (SPB). The SPB arises from weak air–sea coupling that limits the growth and persistence of the ENSO signal. Improving springtime prediction therefore requires identifying oceanic regions most relevant for convection variability. Here, we introduce a Sea Surface Temperature Range Index (SRI), which quantifies the spatial extent of Sea surface temperatures favorable for convection. Using SRI, we show that regions exceeding 26 °C in the east-central Pacific and 28.5 °C in the eastern Atlantic during spring are critical for initiating persistent intense convection. The expansion of these convection-sensitive areas strengthens the Bjerknes feedback by modulating the Walker circulation, providing an effective predictor of ENSO evolution. We further develop a Long Short-Term Memory deep learning model incorporating SRI, which achieves higher predictive skill than the average of dynamical and statistical models, especially for multiyear La Niña events. These results underscore the central role of convection-sensitive oceanic regions in alleviating the SPB.","tp":"气候可预测","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"厄尔尼诺-南方涛动（ENSO）在春季的可预测性最弱，这一现象被称为春季可预报性障碍（SPB）。SPB主要源于春季海气耦合减弱，限制了ENSO信号的增长与持续性。为提高预测准确性，研究引入了海表温度范围指数（SRI），用于量化海表温度的空间范围，从而精准识别出与对流变异性最相关的关键海洋区域，为克服春季预报障碍提供了新方法。"},{"t":"混合钙钛矿-纳米光栅光子结构可实现室温下的超固态","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02141-0","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","b":"The supersolid phase is a self-organized state of matter that simultaneously exhibits the crystalline order of a solid and the frictionless flow of a superfluid. Its formation requires the simultaneous breaking of phase and translational symmetries—a stringent condition that makes experimental observation challenging. Here we show that it is possible to achieve a room-temperature supersolid phase by integrating single-crystal halide perovskites with an exciton–polariton nanograting. This architecture supports a hybrid polaritonic bound-state-in-continuum state with a large bandgap (18.2 meV) and two side modes. As the pumping intensity increases, optical parametric oscillation drives the system from a bound-state-in-continuum polariton condensate into the two side modes, forming a self-organized supersolid phase characterized by a striped one-dimensional lattice spanning the condensate. Crucially, single-shot real-space imaging shows stochastic phase selection of the stripe pattern, evidenced by strong suppression of the density modulation on multishot averaging. The observation of supersolidity is further supported by long-range spatiotemporal coherence measured interferometrically and by a non-rigid supersolid lattice. The realization of supersolidity at room temperature in a polaritonic nanograting platform can be useful to control exotic quantum orders and for exploring spontaneous symmetry breaking, quantum coherence and collective excitations in driven quantum materials.","tp":"室温超固态","sc":8.1,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":3.0,"r":8.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"通过将单晶卤化物钙钛矿与激子-极化子纳米光栅集成，首次实现了室温下的超固态相。超固态需同时打破相位对称性和平移对称性，实验条件极为苛刻。该光子结构平台突破了传统极低温限制，为室温量子物态研究开辟新途径。"},{"t":"富有的科技企业家如何寻求塑造政治、文化和未来——以及为什么我们必须抵制","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00840-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"神奇宝贝系列如何帮助塑造神经科学","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00861-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"我如何将网络上对我博士学位的厌女症转化为我职业生涯的动力","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-025-04129-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"用于亨廷顿蛋白化学生物学研究的高亲和力、结构验证和选择性大环肽工具","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520462123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Huntington’s disease (HD) is a fatal neurodegenerative disorder caused by a Cytosine-Adenosine-Guanine (CAG) repeat expansion in the\n                    Huntingtin\n                    (\n                    HTT\n                    ) gene, with no disease-modifying therapies currently available. The precise molecular function of the HTT protein is unclear, and the lack of selective chemical tools has limited functional studies. We have identified and characterized macrocyclic peptide binders targeting HTT. These binders exhibit low-nanomolar affinity in vitro and engage distinct HTT and HTT-HAP40 interfaces, as revealed by hydrogen–deuterium exchange mass spectrometry and cryoelectron microscopy. Chemoproteomics confirmed selective binding in cell extracts from wildtype but not HTT-null cell lines. HAP40 consistently and stoichiometrically copurified with HTT across cell lines, including with HTT variants containing different CAG repeat lengths, highlighting the broad presence of the HTT-HAP40 complex."},{"t":"人脑关键同步动力学的分层全脑建模","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2505768123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The brain operates at the critical transition between order and disorder which supports optimal information processing. Whole-brain computational modeling is a powerful tool for uncovering the system-level mechanisms behind large-scale brain activity in both healthy and pathological states. However, most previous approaches have focused on either functional connectivity or criticality, making it difficult to capture both aspects simultaneously. Here, we introduce a method based on a Hierarchical Kuramoto model that incorporates two levels of hierarchy. In our model, each node contains a large number of coupled oscillators, which allows us to examine both local synchronization and long-distance interactions between brain regions. The model produces critical-like dynamics marked by emergent long-range temporal correlations (LRTCs) and both interareal phase synchronization and amplitude cross-correlations (CC) during the transition from asynchronous to synchronous states. Notably, structure–function coupling shows distinct patterns: correlations with structural connectivity peak at criticality for LRTCs and CC, but decay for local and interareal phase synchronization. Comparisons with human resting-state magnetoencephalography (MEG) data reveal that the model’s behavior most closely resembles MEG phase synchronization and multipeak power spectra on the subcritical side of an extended critical regime, supporting the hypothesis that the human brain operates in this state."},{"t":"化学中隐藏的界面电场：接触起电及其他","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01066G","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","b":"A wide range of chemical transformations proceed at immiscible boundaries, including solid dielectric–liquid, gas–liquid, and liquid–liquid interfaces, even in the absence of light, heat or externally applied potentials. At these boundaries, intense interfacial electric fields emerging from interfacial charge transfer, molecular orientation, and asymmetric charge distributions can profoundly reshape reaction free-energy landscapes. Especially at solid dielectric–liquid interfaces, contact electrification (CE) mainly drives electron transfer, generating substantial surface charge densities and interfacial electric fields that critically govern radical formation and redox chemistry. Gas–liquid or immiscible liquid–liquid interfaces, exemplified by microdroplet reactions, as well as processes at biomolecular condensate-solution boundaries, exhibit intrinsic fields on the order of ∼106–109 V m−1. Notwithstanding the burgeoning interest in this area, further fundamental scrutiny is necessary to establish a unified conceptual framework for interfacial electric field-driven reactions, moving beyond empirical observations toward predictive control. In this review, interfacial electric fields are described as emerging from cooperative effects, including CE, oriented water dipoles and ion redistribution, while their dynamic fluctuations are highlighted as a critical factor in driving interfacial chemical reactions. Mechanical excitation, material electronegativity, solvent structure, ionic strength, pH and dissolved gases are discussed as key parameters that modulate these fields and the resulting reactivity. We further emphasize some open questions concerning their spatial distribution, temporal dynamics and reaction-driven evolution and highlight the need for advanced operando techniques capable of resolving interfacial electric fields with nanometer spatial resolution and sub-microsecond temporal resolution to establish causal links between electric field dynamics and reaction outcomes. Overall, interfacial electric fields emerge as hidden forces with far-reaching implications and should be elevated from passive boundary conditions to explicit design parameters for sustainable, high-efficiency interfacial chemistry.","tp":"界面电化学","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":"综述了不混溶界面（固-液、气-液、液-液）处隐藏的界面电场及其对化学反应自由能景观的重塑作用。特别在固体介电-液界面，接触起电产生的界面电场可在无光照、无加热、无外加电势条件下驱动化学转化，为绿色化学提供新思路。"},{"t":"HEDP修饰Cu2O催化剂实现酸性CO2电还原高效生成C2+产物","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504508?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酸性CO2还原","kp":["催化剂[酸性CO2还原]: HEDP修饰Cu2O","[产物选择性]: C2+产物","[电解液]: 高浓度K⁺抑制析氢"],"as":"研究团队开发了一种经HEDP（羟基乙叉二膦酸）修饰的Cu₂O催化剂，用于在酸性条件下高效电催化CO₂还原为多碳（C₂₊）产物。酸性电解环境通常导致铜基催化剂失活或产物选择性下降，该修饰策略有望稳定催化剂活性位点，提升C₂₊产物（如乙烯、乙醇）的法拉第效率与生成速率。该工作对推进CO₂电还原技术从碱性/中性体系向酸性体系拓展具有积极意义，为碳资源的电化学高值转化提供了新路径。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"HEDP‐Modified Cu2O Catalyst Enables Efficient C2+ Product Formation in Acidic CO2 Electroreduction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Efficient electrocatalytic CO\n                    2\n                    reduction (ECR) to multi‐carbon (C\n                    2+\n                    ) products under acidic conditions requires suppression of the competing hydrogen evolution reaction, which can be achieved with high concentrations of potassium ions (K\n                    +\n                    ) dissolved in the electrolyte. However, this excess of salt ions generates unwanted byproducts, negating the advantage of efficiency over extended use. Herein, we demonstrate a strategy to modify Cu\n                    2\n                    O with hydroxyethanediphosphonic acid (HEDP) to induce a high K\n                    +\n                    microenvironment, thereby enabling efficient CO\n                    2\n                    conversion to C\n                    2+\n                    products, even at low K\n                    +\n                    concentrations. In a 3.0 \n                    M\n                    K\n                    +\n                    electrolyte (pH 1.0), a faradaic efficiency (FE) of 79.3% for C\n                    2+\n                    products was achieved at a current density of −700 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . Notably, after activation in a K\n                    +\n                    ‐containing electrolyte, the FE for C\n                    2+\n                    products can still reach 50% even in a K\n                    +\n                    ‐free electrolyte (1 m\n                    M\n                    H\n                    2\n                    SO\n                    4\n                    ), while the FE for H\n                    2\n                    remains below 15%. Experimental and first‐principles calculations revealed that HEDP facilitated K\n                    +\n                    enrichment on the catalyst interface, induced a higher local pH microenvironment, and promoted C−C coupling. Our interfacial microenvironment optimization strategy harnesses the critical role of the electrode‐electrolyte interface in promoting efficient CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction to C\n                    2+\n                    products under acidic conditions with low K\n                    +\n                    concentrations."},{"t":"产卵器的味觉感知促使母亲避免使用橙皮苷，以造福主要农业中的后代","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526937123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Females of the oriental fruit fly (\n                    Bactrocera dorsalis\n                    ) disproportionately oviposit in unripe fruits, despite their lower nutritional value compared to ripe fruits, but the sensory cues driving such counterintuitive site selection have not been determined. Here, using an oriental fruit fly–mango interaction system, we identified a specific flavonoid compound, hesperidin, as a major avoidance cue driving oviposition site selection in this species. Hesperidin accumulates as mango fruits ripen, and high concentrations suppress both larval growth and adult emergence. This indicates that higher levels of hesperidin exert a direct harmful effect on\n                    B. dorsalis\n                    larvae within ripe fruits. Interestingly, we found that\n                    B. dorsalis\n                    females perceive hesperidin via gustatory sensors on the ovipositor. The\n                    BdorGr28b\n                    gene is strongly expressed in the ovipositor, and we showed that the corresponding protein is the major hesperidin receptor. These results demonstrate that gustatory sensing via the ovipositor drives maternal avoidance of hesperidin to benefit the offspring in\n                    B. dorsalis\n                    . Our study provides insight into oviposition site selection in this species and the broader functional repertoire of insect gustation."},{"t":"有机半导体的金激活过硫酸盐 p 掺杂","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02547-0","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Chemical doping is crucial for fine-tuning the electronic properties of organic semiconductors (OSCs) and enhancing device performance across various technologies. While several methods for controlled dopant distribution have been explored, achieving lateral doping gradients via simple solution processing remains challenging. Here we present a gold-activated persulfate doping strategy in which persulfate is catalytically activated at gold surfaces to generate SO4•− radicals that locally oxidize (p-dope) the OSCs. This reaction creates a lateral doping gradient extending outwards from the gold interface, as verified by spectroscopic and electrical characterization. The approach is broadly applicable to OSCs spanning a 1.5-eV ionization potential range and yields conductivities >1,900 S cm−1. To demonstrate the impact of this method, we applied gold-activated persulfate doping to modulate contact regions in solution-processed organic field-effect transistors, achieving reduced contact resistance and improved charge-carrier mobility. This simple, scalable approach enables the formation of lateral doping gradients from solution and offers new opportunities for interfacial tuning in organic electronics.","tp":"有机半导体","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"提出了一种金激活过硫酸盐p型掺杂策略：过硫酸盐在金表面被催化活化生成硫酸根自由基（SO4•−），局部氧化有机半导体。该方法通过简单溶液加工即可实现可控的侧向掺杂梯度分布，为有机半导体器件性能优化提供新手段。"},{"t":"全球循环失衡日益恶化的情况下磷可持续性的未来策略","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2512673123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Global anthropogenic phosphorus (P) cycle changes require active management with differentiated sustainability strategies across countries. This study developed a universal framework that integrates the comprehensive P flow process with sustainability scenarios to assess global anthropogenic P flow patterns and explore future sustainability pathways and potential. The results indicated that the global P flow imbalance intensified from 1961 to 2022, with over 80% attributed to croplands. Crucially, global trade serves as a significant driving force, redistributing P resources and reinforcing the global complexity of P-pollution footprints, driven by 35 key countries. Our model projects that by 2050, individual measures like reducing fertilizer applications, improving feed conversion efficiency, and recycling organic fertilizers could save 50% of P and reduce P losses by 39%. Crop–livestock integration significantly improved P use efficiency, potentially extending the global phosphate rock extraction period by 400 ± 87 y (mean ± SD). However, due to the low baseline P use efficiency in cropping systems, P recovery from waste in developing countries remains limited, necessitating additional measures alongside the above high-leverage measures. These findings underscore the indispensable role of human consumption and the transformative potential of dietary shifts, which are essential given that no country can achieve significant P sustainability gains solely by reducing food waste or processing losses. Coordinated supply and demand-side measures linking cropping, livestock, and consumption offer key strategies and benefits for systematically and differentially advancing P sustainability at both global and national levels.","tp":"磷可持续性","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":7.0,"t":3.0},"as":"构建了整合全球人为磷流过程与可持续性情景的通用评估框架，发现1961至2022年全球磷流失衡持续加剧，超过80%源自农田系统。研究为不同国家提供了差异化的磷可持续性管理策略，对应对全球磷循环失衡和粮食安全具有重要意义。"},{"t":"卷首插画：使用 DNA 折纸拓片绘制膜蛋白相互作用的空间图","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2026-m2402081700?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"A strategy named DNA origami rubbing (DOR) was developed for 2D mapping of protein-protein interactions (PPIs) in cell membrane using DNA origami technology and DNA polymerase-mediated strand-elongation, mimicking making stone rubbing with rice paper and graphite. The results showed that DOR can map the fluctuation of 2D distribution of proteins induced by ligands, demonstrating its feasibility for revealing novel PPIs and making it a potential tool for disease screening and predicting medical treatment outcomes. More in the Research Article (e13795), Da Han, Pei Guo, and co-workers."},{"t":"从微米到纳米尺度的阴影电致化学发光显微成像","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521654?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学发光显微成像","kp":["[成像对比度]: 负光学对比","[免标记纳米成像]: 电致化学发光"],"as":"电化学发光显微镜（ECL）通过电极触发的化学反应产生光信号实现成像，但传统ECL的空间分辨率受限于微米尺度。本研究将ECL成像技术从微尺度推进至纳米尺度，开发了纳米级阴影电化学发光显微成像方法。该技术利用共面电极边缘产生的发光强度梯度，结合超薄电化学发光层，突破光学衍射极限，实现对单纳米颗粒和生物分子的可视化检测。这一突破有望在单分子检测、纳米材料表征及生物分子界面分析等领域开辟新路径，显著拓展了电化学发光在超分辨成像中的应用边界。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"From Microscale to Nanoscale Shadow Electrochemiluminescence Microscopy","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemiluminescence (ECL) has emerged as a promising chemistry‐based imaging technique, yet its potential in optical nano‐imaging is still in the early stages. We report the label‐free imaging of microobjects and nanoobjects with a sharp negative optical contrast. The shadow ECL images obtained are the optical signatures of the blocking of the electron‐transfer reaction convoluted by the chemical reactivity and local diffusional hindrance of the ECL reagents by the object deposited on the electrode. Here, we address first the critical aspect of the smallest spherical nanoparticle imaged by shadow ECL microscopy. By investigating the imaging limits of shadow ECL, we demonstrate its capability to image single nanoparticles down to 50 nm. This work uncovers the sensitivity of the method by not only showing the smallest particles imaged by shadow ECL to date, but also, counterintuitively, a contrastive behavior of the single insulating particles with increased electrochemical rates at the insulator‐electrolyte‐electrode triple point. Finally, the practical utility of this shadow ECL method is illustrated by imaging complex samples such as densely packed particle assemblies or microbial\n                    Bacillus subtilis\n                    spores. It also opens new avenues for single‐molecule and shadow ECL nano imaging of catalytic and biological systems."},{"t":"氟-18-标记的核苷酸类似物靶向外切-5'-核苷酸酶（CD73）用于正电子发射断层扫描成像","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522758?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ecto‐5’‐nucleotidase (CD73) is a potential new drug target for cancer immunotherapy. Its overexpression is associated with various aggressive cancers, including triple‐negative breast cancer (TNBC) and pancreatic cancer, making it a promising target for diagnostic imaging. Besides antibodies, small‐molecule CD73 inhibitors have been developed and are currently in clinical trials. This study aimed to develop and evaluate fluorine‐18 labeled high‐affinity CD73 inhibitors as tracers for the non‐invasive positron emission tomography (PET) imaging of CD73 expression in cancer. Two CD73 inhibitors were selected for radiolabeling based on their high potency (K\n                    i\n                    values of ca. 1 nM) and favorable pharmacokinetic properties, yielding [\n                    18\n                    F]PSB‐19427 ([\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    1\n                    ) and [\n                    18\n                    F]MRS‐4648 ([\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    2\n                    ). Ex vivo imaging studies on human breast cancer tissues indicated specific binding of both radiotracers. Subsequent in vivo studies proved [\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    1\n                    to be superior due to its long elimination half‐life and its accumulation in TNBC and pancreatic cancer tissues, suggesting its potential as a versatile PET tracer for imaging of various solid tumors. Compared to [\n                    18\n                    F]FDG, [\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    1\n                    was superior in visualizing TNBC, offering potential advantages over [\n                    18\n                    F]FDG in terms of specificity and diagnostic accuracy. Thus, [\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    1\n                    is a PET tracer with outstanding properties suitable for broad application in cancer diagnosis and personalized medicine."},{"t":"人为气候变化加剧的极端降水导致秘鲁 2023 年破纪录的登革热疫情","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/one-earth/fulltext/S2590-3322(26)00020-5?rss=yes","c":"不相关","a":"One Earth","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"从深度强化学习智能体中提取可迁移的规则控制器及多场景验证","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003132?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"强化学习规则控制器","kp":["[方法]: 从深度强化学习提取可迁移规则控制器(热泵系统)"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Extracting a transferable rule-based controller from deep reinforcement learning agents with validation across multiple "},{"t":"探索细菌染色体分离的能量景观","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535321123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Faithful chromosome segregation during bacterial replication requires global reorganization of the nucleoid, where Structural Maintenance of Chromosomes (SMC) complexes play a crucial role. Here, we develop an energy landscape framework that integrates data-driven pairwise interactions with coarse-grained polymer physics to infer the 3D architectural ensembles of\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    and\n                    Bacillus subtilis\n                    chromosomes throughout replication. We show that SMC-mediated long-range lengthwise compaction reshapes the nucleoid to induce a robust mid-replication transition in which the terminus relocates toward the nucleoid center and duplicated origins segregate toward opposite cell halves. SMC-deficient mutants lack this transition and instead exhibit emergent nematic-like alignment of sister chromosomes that impedes segregation. A distinctive intersister Hi-C signature accompanies the emergence of the nematic alignment. By systematically tuning nonspecific intersister adhesion, we reveal that SMC activity expands the physical regime permitting faithful segregation. This buffering protects segregation against adhesive forces intrinsic to the crowded bacterial nucleoid. Our framework provides mechanistic insight into SMC-dependent coreplication segregation across bacterial species, yielding experimentally testable predictions for imaging and sister-chromosome-resolved Hi-C."},{"t":"利用VO2的绝缘体-金属相变实现光催化甲烷转化","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02013-w","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化甲烷转化","kp":["[光催化机制]: VO2绝缘体-金属相变促进电荷分离","[应用]: 甲烷光催化转化增强"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究探索VO₂绝缘体-金属相变特性在光催化甲烷转化中的应用。光催化剂在光照下产生载流子驱动氧化还原反应，但效率常受限于载流子复合损失。VO₂独特的热致相变行为可调节材料电子结构与带隙，有望改善光生电荷分离效率，从而提升甲烷转化为高附加值化学品（如甲醇）的催化性能。这一策略为突破光催化甲烷转化的能量壁垒提供了新思路。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Exploiting the insulator–metal transition of VO2 in photocatalytic methane conversion","b":"Upon illumination, photocatalysts generate charge carriers for redox reactions, but their efficiency is often limited by carrier recombination and poor minority-carrier diffusion, despite many existing junction engineering strategies. Here we exploit the insulator–metal transition in VO2 to produce a material that promotes efficient charge separation and enhances the photocatalytic conversion of methane through the spontaneous formation of junctions. We find that the photocatalytic activity peaks at the critical temperature of the transition, which we attribute to coexisting insulating and metallic domains with non-integer dimensional boundaries and sizes smaller than the minority-carrier diffusion length. Increasing the charge-separating interface length by decreasing the film thickness improves the photocatalytic activity and C–C coupling between alkoxy intermediates, leading to a propane selectivity of 100%. Moreover, electrically triggering the phase transition at lower temperatures further boosts methane conversion via field-assisted carrier activation. Overall, the metal–insulator transition provides an effective alternative to complex nanoscale junction engineering in photocatalysis.","aip":1},{"t":"燃料电池在深海航运中应用的环境影响评估：展望2050年","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003181?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池深海航运","kp":["[应用]: 深海运船舶燃料电池"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":4.5},"ot":"Environmental impacts of fuel cell use in deep-sea shipping towards 2050"},{"t":"增强风光储系统随机优化：基于源荷匹配的场景重构方法","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003193?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风光储随机优化","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Enhancing stochastic optimization of wind-PV-storage systems: A scenario reconstruction approach with source-load matchi"},{"t":"集成质子耦合电子转移诱导碳帽效应赋能的高能水系有机液流电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506006?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机液流电池","kp":["[耦合机制]: 质子耦合电子转移","[功能集成]: 碳捕集与利用一体化"],"as":"该研究通过集成质子耦合机制实现能量增强型水系有机液流电池。水系有机氧化还原液流电池以其安全性好、可规模化扩展、潜在成本低等优势，被视为大规模储能的有力候选方案。质子耦合策略利用质子参与氧化还原反应，在单分子中实现多电子转移，从而提升电池能量密度。该设计在不牺牲循环稳定性的前提下突破了传统有机分子储能容量的瓶颈。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Energy‐Enhanced Aqueous Organic Flow Batteries Enabled by Integrated Proton‐Coupled Electron Transfer‐Induced Carbon Cap","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Aqueous organic redox flow batteries offer a safe, scalable, and potentially cost‐effective solution for storing massive electricity from intermittent renewables. Meanwhile, operating at ambient temperature and pressure, electrochemically induced carbon capture using aqueous redox sorbents in flow systems has recently emerged as a low‐energy technology for climate change mitigation. Integrating these two technologies within an aqueous organic flow system represents a unified route to achieving decarbonization. Here, employing organic molecules undergoing proton‐coupled electron transfer as redox species, we establish aqueous all‐organic flow battery systems that achieve enhanced energy storage as well as coupled CO\n                    2\n                    capture and utilization. During discharge, CO\n                    2\n                    from simulated flue gas is captured as HCO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    by the oxygen‐tolerant positive electrolyte (posolyte). The buffered posolyte prevents negative shifts in its redox potential, elevating a flow cell voltage up to 1.32 V, and enhancing discharge energy by at most 24.3% compared to operations under N\n                    2\n                    . During charge, CO\n                    2\n                    is released with a CO\n                    2\n                    /\n                    e\n                    molar ratio approaching unity at an energy cost of 30.65 kJ mol\n                    −1\n                    CO\n                    2\n                    . As a proof‐of‐concept, our work establishes a new paradigm for integrating enhanced energy storage with carbon capture, utilization, and storage, paving the way for next‐generation multifunctional electrochemical redox flow systems.","aip":1},{"t":"电热催化：从整体焦耳加热到颗粒间电促进的范式转变","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag167/8526397?rss=1","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电热催化","kp":["[范式]: 整体焦耳热转向颗粒间电促进","[技术]: 电热催化脱碳"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究综述了电热催化的范式转变：从整体式焦耳加热向非平衡/脉冲电加热驱动的新模式转型。传统热催化依赖化石燃料加热，面临严峻的可持续性挑战。电热催化利用可再生电力直接加热催化剂，可实现毫秒级升降温与温度梯度，改变反应动力学路径，提高选择性与能效。该范式为化工生产电气化与碳中和提供了变革性技术路线。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Electrothermal catalysis: paradigm shift from monolithic Joule heating to interparticle electrical promotion","b":"Conventional thermal catalysis, dependent on carbon-intensive fossil fuels, faces pressing sustainability challenges. As an alternative relying on renewable electricity, electrothermal catalysis utilizing catalyst Joule heating enables decarbonized chemical processes and is advancing rapidly under carbon neutrality mandates. Here, we clarify the fundamental characteristics and scope of electrothermal catalysis, especially highlighting advances in our own works. Accordingly, a paradigm shift from monolithic Joule heating to interparticle electrical promotion is proposed. Monolithic catalyst architectures employ the Joule heating of monolithic supports for compact and efficient heating, whereas interparticle counterparts leverage both Joule heating and electrical promotion between conductive catalyst particles, not only substantially enhancing the intrinsic activity of catalysts but also drastically reducing energy costs and carbon footprints for sustainable electrification of chemical processes. Ultimately, the perspectives and challenges of interparticle electrical promotion are highlighted and analyzed to advance this transformative shift toward a viably industrial process.","aip":1},{"t":"基于氧化还原介体的电致变色动态窗口","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72800?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电致变色智能窗","kp":["[电致变色]: 氧化还原介体驱动","[动态窗]: 可逆金属电沉积(RME)"],"as":"该研究提出基于氧化还原介体的电致变色动态窗技术，通过调控氧化还原对实现窗户透光率的动态调节。建筑与交通领域是全球能耗主力，智能光-热管理窗户可大幅降低制冷供暖能耗。相比传统电致变色材料，氧化还原介体体系响应更快、循环稳定性更高，为建筑节能和智能热管理提供了新路径，商业化前景广阔。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Electrochromic Dynamic Windows with Redox Mediators","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The construction and transportation sectors dominate global energy consumption, making intelligent opto‐thermal regulation of building envelopes and vehicle windows critical for energy conservation and human comfort. While electrochromic (EC) dynamic windows offer significant potential, conventional technologies face scalability and cost barriers. Reversible metal electrodeposition (RME) presents a promising alternative, distinguished by its unique potential to efficiently control opto‐thermal transmittance. However, the symmetric dual‐electrode RME architectures, which are essential for uniform optical switching, have suffered from operational instability due to voltage‐driven parasitic reactions. Herein, we introduce a unique strategy integrating redox mediators (RMs) into EC dynamic windows to overcome this limitation. Using poly(3,4‐ethylenedioxythiophene):poly(styrenesulfonate) (PEDOT:PSS) in the Cu and Bi‐based RME hydrogel systems, we demonstrate accelerated interfacial kinetics and decreased overpotential. This reduces the operational voltage from −1.9 V to −1.2 V while enhancing long‐term working stability (18,000 s vs. 180 s). The RM‐engineered EC dynamic windows achieve 6 000 cycles without degradation and maintain stable optical modulation, with the apparent enhancement of optical switching speed. Crucially, the approach universally improves performance in traditional EC systems (e.g., tungsten oxides, viologen derivatives). This RM strategy establishes a material‐agnostic platform technology, enabling scalable fabrication of next‐generation dynamic glazing through a unified design paradigm."},{"t":"基于电针的迷走神经刺激通过体脑回路减轻癫痫发作","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517600123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Vagus nerve stimulation offers a promising strategy for seizure control but remains limited by its invasive delivery. Here, we reveal electroacupuncture (EA), an ancient neuromodulatory technique rooted in traditional Chinese medicine, at specific somatic acupoints linked to the vagal–brain axis to treat epilepsy and delineate the precise underlying neural mechanisms. We demonstrate that EA at the\n                    Dazhui\n                    (GV14) acupoint exhibits broad-spectrum antiseizure efficacy across multiple seizure models. Anatomical and functional analyses reveal that GV14 activates the vagal afferents and recruits neurons in the caudal nucleus of the solitary tract (cNTS), which are essential for seizure suppression. Using targeted recombination in active populations and chemogenetic manipulation, we show that GV14 EA suppresses seizures via the recruitment of a defined cNTS–locus coeruleus–amygdala circuit. Furthermore, through vagal afferent activity screening, we identify\n                    Yaoqi\n                    (EXB9) as an alternative therapeutic acupoint that activates a shared neural pathway to robustly attenuate seizures. Importantly, thread-embedding acupuncture at GV14 or EXB9 produces sustained seizure reduction in a chronic epilepsy model. Together, these findings elucidate a functional vagal–brain circuit underlying EA-induced seizure control and support its translational potential as a minimally invasive neuromodulatory strategy to replace vagal stimulation for epilepsy treatment."},{"t":"零场 Hopfion 环的电流辅助成核","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523417?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Magnetic hopfions are 3D topological solitons – knotted, vortex‐like spin configurations. In chiral magnets, hopfions can appear as isolated structures or they can be linked to skyrmion strings. Previous studies employed a sophisticated protocol and a special sample geometry to nucleate such hopfions linked to one or a few skyrmion strings. Here, we introduce an electric‐current‐assisted nucleation protocol that is simple and independent of the sample shape and size. The resulting hopfions exhibit extraordinary stability in the presence of both positive and negative magnetic fields, in perfect agreement with micromagnetic simulations. We also present a comprehensive framework for classifying hopfions, skyrmions, and merons by deriving the corresponding homotopy group."},{"t":"5-氟尿嘧啶、伊立替康和奥沙利铂负载植入物在小鼠和猪模型中的功效和安全性评估","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522617?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma (PDAC) remains highly resistant to treatment, with mortality rates largely unchanged despite advances in cancer therapies. For ∼80% of borderline, non‐resectable, or metastatic cases, chemotherapy is predominantly palliative, underscoring the need for improved drug delivery approaches. This study presents the development, characterization and in vivo evaluation of a novel polymeric implant loaded with 5‐fluorouracil, irinotecan, and oxaliplatin (FIRINOX). Scanning electron microscopy of FIRINOX implants showed internal microstructure was preserved upon drug loading, while micro‐CT and X‐ray imaging revealed valuable insights into the morphology and degradation of implants retrieved from in vivo experiments. In murine PDAC models, dose‐escalation identified 4 × FIRINOX implants as the maximum tolerated dose, while 2 × implants achieved significant therapeutic efficacy at lower doses than IV administration, without compromising animal safety. In healthy pigs, 20 × FIRINOX implants were well‐tolerated, as confirmed by histopathology and blood analysis. Finally, laser ablation‐inductively coupled plasma‐mass spectrometry imaging and microbiome analysis confirmed localized drug perfusion within tissues, and minimal off‐target effects, including preservation of gut microbiota diversity. These findings support the potential of this implantable platform to improve outcomes in borderline or non‐resectable PDAC and enhance tolerability of cytotoxic chemotherapy through localized, controlled delivery, addressing a key gap where current treatment options are limited."},{"t":"双描述符引导设计电场敏感增溶添加剂用于稳定锂金属电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00038J","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池添加剂","kp":["[添加剂]: 电场敏感增溶添加剂EFSSA","[应用]: 锂金属电池全电池稳定性"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出基于双描述符引导的电场敏感型增溶添加剂设计策略，用于提升锂金属电池的稳定性。锂金属电池受限于电解液与锂界面的弱离子相互作用导致的不均匀沉积和枝晶问题。研究者利用反应性描述符筛选添加剂分子，使其在电场下优先吸附分解形成稳定SEI层，为理性设计电解液添加剂提供了理论框架。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dual-descriptor-guided design of electric field-sensitive solubilizing additive for stable lithium metal batteries","b":"Electrolyte additive has shown great power for improving the stability of lithium metal batteries.However, the weak ion dissociation of additives in carbonate electrolytes and the limited modification effect at cathode side, severely hinder their practical use in full cells. Herein, we present an \"electric field-sensitive solubilizing additive (EFSSA)\" strategy for rational electrolyte design, employing cubic electrophilicity index (CEPI) and Mulliken charge as dual descriptors for additive screening. As a typical example, the ion dissociation of lithium nitrate (LiNO3) in carbonate electrolyte is largely enhanced by employing tris(trimethylsilyl) borate (TMSB) as a secondary solubilizing additive with a high CEPI. Moreover, TMSB with a high Mulliken charge facilitates the reconstruction of a beneficial anion-dominated solvation structure at the cathode electric double layer via electric field-induced repulsion. Through this synergistic interaction between LiNO3 and TMSB, the ionic conductivity and stability of electrode-electrolyte interface are significantly improved both at anode and cathode sides.The designed LiNO3 -TMSB/carbonate electrolyte enables stable, long-term cycling in Li||Cu cell for > 700 cycles and enables Li||NCM811 full cell to retain 84.6% of its capacity after 600 cycles, with its feasibility further validated in Ah-level pouch cells. This EFSSA strategy and dual descriptors provide conceptual advances for high-performance electrolyte design and propel the practical application of high-energy lithium metal batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"多巴胺受到打击：神经科学如何重新思考这种“感觉良好”的化学物质","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00836-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"烯烃直接转化为炔烃","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10372-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Alkynes are widely used as feedstock chemicals and functional groups in organic chemistry1,2. However, while the hydrogenation from an alkyne to an alkene is well established, typical methods for the reverse reaction – conversion of an alkene to an alkyne, are based on elimination chemistry reported in the 1860s3 and use forcing conditions (strong base or high temperatures)4-6. This precludes more general application on functional molecules. Here we report a recyclable selenanthrene reagent that mediates alkenes desaturation to alkynes under mild conditions. This method shows broad compatibility with both classical leaving groups and sensitive functional groups, enabling application late-stage in the efficient synthesis of complex alkynes. Moreover, this platform enables Z/E alkenes configuration inversion or sorting that are inaccessible with existing methods, highlighting its potential for diverse downstream derivatizations."},{"t":"增强型单层MoS2场效应晶体管阈值电压调制的介电与栅金属工程","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523661?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MoS2场效应管","kp":["[器件模式]: 增强型单层MoS2 FET","[调控手段]: 介电层与栅金属工程"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究针对基于二维过渡金属硫族化合物（2D TMD）的增强型场效应晶体管（FET），通过介电层与栅极金属工程实现阈值电压调制。二维半导体因原子级厚度和优异栅控能力被视为后硅时代沟道材料候选，但阈值电压的可控调节仍是工程化关键挑战。研究优化了栅极堆叠结构，提升电学性能一致性，对二维半导体逻辑器件走向实际集成电路具有重要意义。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Dielectric and Gate Metal Engineering for Threshold Voltage Modulation in Enhancement Mode Monolayer MoS2 Field Effect T","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Excellent gate electrostatics in field effect transistors (FETs) based on 2D transition metal dichalcogenide (2D TMD) channels can dramatically decrease static power dissipation. Energy‐efficient FETs operate in enhancement mode with a small and positive threshold voltage (V\n                    th\n                    ) for n‐type devices. However, most state‐of‐the‐art FETs based on monolayer MoS\n                    2\n                    channel operate in depletion mode with negative V\n                    th\n                    due to doping from the underlying dielectric substrate. In this work, we identify key properties of the semiconductor/dielectric interface (MoS\n                    2\n                    on industrially relevant high dielectric constant (\n                    k\n                    ) HfO\n                    2\n                    , ZrO\n                    2\n                    and hBN for reference) responsible for realizing enhancement‐mode operation of 2D MoS\n                    2\n                    channel FETs. We find that hBN and ZrO\n                    2\n                    dielectric substrates provide low defect interfaces with MoS\n                    2\n                    that enables effective modulation of the V\n                    th\n                    using gate metals of different work functions (WFs). We use photoluminescence (PL) and synchrotron X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) measurements to investigate doping levels in monolayer MoS\n                    2\n                    on different dielectrics with different WF gate metals. We complement the FET and spectroscopic measurements with capacitance‐voltage analysis on dielectrics with varying thicknesses, which confirms that V\n                    th\n                    modulation in ZrO\n                    2\n                    devices is correlated with WF of the gate metals – in contrast with HfO\n                    2\n                    devices that exhibit signatures of V\n                    th\n                    pinning induced by oxide/interface defect states. Finally, we demonstrate FETs using a 2D MoS\n                    2\n                    channel and a 6 nm of ZrO\n                    2\n                    dielectric, achieving a subthreshold swing of 87 mV dec\n                    −1\n                    and a threshold voltage of 0.1 V. Our results offer insights into the role of dielectric/semiconductor interface in 2D MoS\n                    2\n                    based FETs for realizing enhancement mode FETs and highlight the potential of ZrO\n                    2\n                    as a scalable high‐\n                    k\n                    dielectric."},{"t":"使用普贝图确定电化学条件","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-026-00162-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"互生结构锂离子筛膜设计用于长期稳定提锂","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525608?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/有色金属/其它有色金属产业","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂离子筛膜提锂","kp":["膜结构[海水提锂]: LAGP共生TiO2保护层","[渗透生长策略]: 长期稳定提锂"],"as":"该研究设计了一种具有互生结构的锂离子筛膜，用于从海水中长期稳定提锂。海水提锂面临Li₁.₅Al₀.₅Ge等吸附材料腐蚀、溶损及选择性下降等瓶颈。互生结构膜通过晶格限域效应提升Li⁺选择性与结构耐久性，在含高浓度竞争离子（Na⁺、K⁺、Mg²⁺）的复杂体系中保持长期循环性能。该方案为盐湖提锂和海水提锂的工程化提供了新材料路径。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Designing an Intergrowth‐Structure Li Ion‐Sieve Membrane for Long‐Term Stable Lithium Extraction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Extracting lithium from seawater offers an additional Li source but is hindered by corrosion of Li\n                    1.5\n                    Al\n                    0.5\n                    Ge\n                    1.5\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    (LAGP) and weak adhesion of conventional coating layers. Here we propose a permeation growth strategy to construct an intergrowth TiO\n                    2\n                    protection layer on a LAGP membrane (LAGP membrane with intergrowth layer) for long‐term stable lithium extraction from seawater. An acidic TiO\n                    2\n                    sol is spin‐coated onto a polished LAGP membrane and sintered, during which acid etching and Ti\n                    4+\n                    /Ge\n                    4+\n                    ion exchange generate a lattice‐matched Li\n                    1+x\n                    Al\n                    x\n                    Ti\n                    2‐x\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    /LAGP interfacial phase beneath a dense TiO\n                    2\n                    intergrowth layer. This intergrowth‐structure eliminates interfacial gaps, enhances peel strength and hardness, and provides continuous Li\n                    +\n                    transport pathways, delivering an ionic conductivity of 2.40 × 10\n                    −4\n                    S cm\n                    −1\n                    at room temperature and excellent chemical stability in seawater. Applied in a lithium extraction device using natural seawater as anolyte and an organic electrolyte as catholyte, the LAGP membrane with intergrowth layer maintains integrity, Li\n                    +\n                    /Na\n                    +\n                    selectivity, and stable operation for 650 h, achieving a Coulombic efficiency of 97.4% and an energy consumption of 17.4 kWh kg\n                    −1\n                    Li\n                    . This permeation growth strategy offers a general route to construct intergrowth‐structure Li ion‐sieve membranes with chemical stability and Li\n                    +\n                    transport for seawater lithium extraction."},{"t":"具有表面催化内源性一氧化氮生成功能的可展开 3D 打印血管支架","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520199?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Atherosclerosis, a leading cause of heart attacks and strokes through the formation of vascular blockages, has become a major global healthcare challenge, with patient numbers expected to rise. Balloon‐based angioplasty and stenting, the most common clinical treatments, have evolved over decades with advances in material biocompatibility, biodegradability, and device design. However, they still face critical issues such as tissue damage, inflammation, and restenosis, which can lead to implant failure and necessitate repeated surgeries, severely affecting patients’ quality of life. To address the urgent need for a long‐term stable stent system, we present a deployable 3D‐printed vascular stent with surface‐catalyzed endogenous nitric oxide (NO) generation (DSENO), offering a promising new direction for stent development. Unlike traditional stents, the DSENO can be deployed remotely using magnetic force and heat, eliminating the need for a catheter or balloon and thereby reducing the risk of tissue injury. Furthermore, its surface is modified to catalyze intracellular NO generation from endogenous S‐nitrosothiols, which inhibits smooth muscle cell proliferation to prevent restenosis.","tp":"催化血管支","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"报道了一种具有表面催化内源性一氧化氮生成功能的3D打印可展开血管支架，用于治疗动脉粥样硬化。该支架可催化生成一氧化氮发挥抗炎和抗增殖作用，有望解决球囊血管成形术和传统支架面临的组织损伤、炎症和支架内再狭窄等关键临床问题。"},{"t":"登革热病毒利用蚊子 Syntenin 将病毒 RNA 加载并分泌到唾液外泌体中","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520697123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Viruses exploit extracellular vesicles (EVs) to transfer infection-enhancing viral RNAs. However, mechanisms underlying viral RNA loading remain elusive. We leveraged our previous discovery that dengue virus secretes transmission-enhancing subgenomic flaviviral RNA (sfRNA) into mosquito salivary EVs to investigate viral RNA loading mechanism. We demonstrate that sfRNA alone promotes the secretion of sfRNA-containing EVs marked by the mosquito EV biogenesis protein AeSyntenin, by applying microscopy and viral genetic editing in in vitro and in vivo models. SfRNA via its stem loop structures interacts intracellularly with mosquito AeSyntenin and this interaction is selectively maintained within EVs as shown by complementary RNA-affinity chromatography and RNA immunoprecipitation, and AI-based prediction. Finally, we used systemic and salivary gland-specific protein depletion to establish a functional role for mosquito AeSyntenin in exosome production and salivary secretion of sfRNA. We propose that sfRNA binds AeSyntenin to drive its selective packaging and release into exosomes, elucidating a mechanism for viral RNA incorporation into EVs."},{"t":"肺上皮细胞中线粒体 DNA 的 RNA 聚合酶 III 传感缺陷会损害 I 型 IFN 对 S 的免疫","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522111123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The clinical spectrum of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 (SARS-CoV-2) infection ranges from asymptomatic cases to critical COVID-19 pneumonia. To investigate the role of host genetics in susceptibility to critical COVID-19 and identify pathophysiological mechanisms and pathways, we analyzed whole-exome and whole-genome sequencing data from the COVID Human Genetic Effort. We identified 10 rare, monoallelic predicted loss-of-function variants in 18 patients in\n                    POLR3A\n                    and\n                    POLR3C\n                    encoding two subunits of RNA polymerase III (POL III), a nuclear multisubunit enzyme, which has been implicated in cytosolic DNA sensing. These variants were deleterious for expression of full-length POLR3A and POLR3C proteins. We demonstrate that human pulmonary A549-hACE2 cells with reduced POLR3A or POLR3C expression exhibit impaired type I IFN responses to transfected mitochondrial DNA (mtDNA) or SARS-CoV-2 infection, together with increased viral replication. Mechanistically, we show that SARS-CoV-2 induces cellular mtDNA release via oligomerization of the mitochondrial voltage-dependent anion channel under virus-induced oxidative stress, enabling POL III–mtDNA interaction. These findings establish POL III as a sensor of endogenous mtDNA released during viral infection and indicate that autosomal dominant POL III haploinsufficiency may predispose individuals to critical COVID-19."},{"t":"论物性：卤化物钙钛矿如何实现损伤自愈？","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518808?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钙钛矿自修复","kp":["[现象]: 卤化物钙钛矿自修复机制"],"dp":1,"as":"本文系统综述了卤化物钙钛矿材料的自修复机制。钙钛矿太阳能电池在运行中会遭受光照、湿度、机械应力等损伤，但展现出显著的自修复能力。文章从原子和晶格层面分析了离子迁移、缺陷钝化和晶界重排等自修复机理，讨论了不同类型损伤（点缺陷、裂纹、相分离）的修复路径与热力学驱动力。作者指出，深入理解自修复机制对提升钙钛矿器件长期稳定性至关重要，并提出通过材料工程主动调控自修复行为的设计策略。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":4.5},"ot":"De Rerum Natura: How Do Halide Perovskites Self‐Heal From Damage?","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  By actually addressing the title question, we provide a comprehensive and critical review of self‐healing (SH) in lead‐based halide perovskites (HaPs), a phenomenon with profound implications for the stability of these materials across all applications, from photovoltaics to light emission and radiation detection. We emphasize reasoning as a guide to interpreting the dynamic balance between degradation and recovery when HaPs are exposed to light, heat, mechanical stress, or radiation. We compile and assess what are, in our view, the most relevant, available reports of damage–healing dynamics, distinguishing verified facts and observations from interpretations and unresolved questions. Key topics include damage accumulation, light soaking, and photo‐brightening, as well as the mechanistic roles of lattice dynamics, halide migration, redox chemistry, and acid–base equilibria in the disappearance of defects on accessible time scales. Thus, we go beyond a conventional summary by providing a unifying framework to clarify contradictions in the literature and reveal the underlying principles of reversible damage. By consolidating results that are often scattered into a coherent picture, we strive to establish a foundation for predictive models of SH kinetics, while guiding strategies to stabilize devices. We anticipate that this critical synthesis will serve as an authoritative reference for the metal halide perovskite research field."},{"t":"每日简报：实验室如何应对“RAMmageddon”","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00872-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"用于可重构光波导的光热驱动循环有机晶体","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9345668?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光致形变晶体","kp":["[材料]: 酰腙基有机弹性晶体","[驱动]: UV触发E-Z光异构化"],"as":"光热驱动有机晶体作为微纳操控与仿生智能材料的候选者正受到关注。该研究提出一种循环光热致动机制——有机晶体在光照射下吸收光能转化为热能，产生可逆的周期性机械形变，用于构建可重构的光波导器件。相比传统光机械材料，该体系可实现重复循环形变而不疲劳，为微纳光学开关、可编程光路和自适应光学器件提供了新路径，在光通信和集成光子芯片领域具有应用潜力。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Cyclic Photothermal‐Actuated Organic Crystals for Reconfigurable Optical Waveguides","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Photomechanically responsive crystals are emerging as intelligent materials for micro/nano manipulation, biomimetic machines, and adaptive systems. However, their practical deployment is often hindered by limited reversibility and fatigue resistance. Herein, we report an acylhydrazone‐based organic compound that forms elastic crystals capable of UV‐triggered\n                    E\n                    to\n                    Z\n                    photoisomerization, inducing backlight photomechanical bending. The bent crystals fully recover to the straight state upon heating, where thermal energy releases the accumulated internal stress and enables structural restoration. Notably, the crystals preserve rapid bending and recovery behavior over 500 bending–recovery cycles, while maintaining fluorescence performance and retaining intact surface and internal structures, indicating excellent fatigue resistance. Moreover, the bending angle can be precisely controlled by UV irradiation, enabling reconfigurable passive optical waveguides. These findings open broad prospects for flexible electronics, light‐driven microdevices, and next‐generation information technologies."},{"t":"交联可电离脂质重新编程树突状细胞代谢以实现有效的 mRNA 疫苗接种","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02512-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Materials","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Modulating metabolism in immune cells is an effective approach to induce desired immune responses. Here we develop a lipid nanoparticle (LNP) capable of metabolic reprogramming of dendritic cells for mRNA vaccine applications. Using imidoester-based conjugation chemistry, we design a crosslinked ionizable lipid, C12-2aN, which possesses intrinsic metabolic modulatory properties. This multifunctional ionizable lipid not only promotes effective mRNA expression by facilitating endosomal escape but also stimulates glycolysis through mTORC2 pathway activation. As both an mRNA carrier and a metabolic modulator, C12-2aN LNPs lead to potent vaccine efficacy in both SARS-CoV-2 and OVA cancer vaccine models, resulting in stronger neutralization of pseudovirus infection and improved survival rates, respectively, compared with control LNPs without the crosslinker. Moreover, C12-2aN LNPs outperformed FDA-approved LNPs in terms of reduced off-target delivery and lower immunogenicity. Overall, the integration of mRNA delivery and metabolic reprogramming induced by the ionizable lipid component presents significant potential for next-generation mRNA LNP vaccines."},{"t":"更正：通过碳硼炔中间体对邻碳硼烷进行官能化","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D6CS90026G","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Correction for ‘Functionalization of o-carboranes via carboryne intermediates’ by Zaozao Qiu et al., Chem. Soc. Rev., 2022, 51, 3164–3180, https://doi.org/10.1039/D2CS00024E.","tp":"碳硼烷官能化","sc":1.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":1.0,"r":1.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"as":"本文为已发表综述文章《通过碳硼炔中间体对邻碳硼烷进行官能化》的更正勘误通知，不包含新的研究内容。"},{"t":"废弃微/纳米塑料转化为碳材料：可再生能源与环境应用新趋势","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003429?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"废塑料转化碳材料","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Conversion of waste micro/nano plastics into carbon materials: A new trend for renewable energy and environmental applic"},{"t":"关于阈值开关的传统观点受到挑战","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02543-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过毛细力介导的冷凝物介导的细胞膜形状转变","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2424126123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Phase-separated biomolecular condensates with liquid-like properties play a key role in the organization and compartmentalization of the intracellular environment. Condensate-mediated capillary forces acting on membranes drive physiologically important reshaping of membrane-bound organelles, such as vacuoles and autophagosomes. Here, we explore condensate-mediated membrane shape transformations. We employ in planta live-cell imaging, an in vitro reconstitution system with tunable interfacial tension, and computer simulations of an elastic membrane model to describe three morphologies of membrane structures localized at condensate interfaces: tubes, sheets, and cups. We find that the forces associated with high interfacial tension drive the formation of stable sheets, while tubes and cups prevail at lower interfacial tension. We calculate the free energies of each membrane shape and identify the energy barriers that govern the transitions between the shapes. With this approach, we find that shape transformations depend on the history of the interfacial membrane and exhibit a tube-to-cup hysteresis. These findings indicate that temporal control of condensate surface properties can mediate the morphogenesis of cup-like structures in cells, such as the formation of “bulbs” within plant vacuoles. Our results further generalize how the interplay of condensates and membranes contributes to intracellular organization."},{"t":"冷量子比特通过热线相连","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01591-7","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"观点评论","tp":"量子比特互连","as":"","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Cold quantum bits connected by a hot wire"},{"t":"共同演化的地形、片状土壤和森林结构","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519374123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The transition from soil-mantled to bedrock-dominated landscapes is important to hydrology, ecology, and landscape evolution. Where classical theory predicts that this transition abruptly occurs once erosion rates exceed soil production ones, actual landscapes show a much more gradual transition. The Rampart Range, CO, is an unglaciated, forested mountain range with uniform lithology that spans this transition, providing an opportunity to interrogate how topography, soil cover, and forest structure coevolve. Using drone imagery and airborne lidar, we show the utility of object-based methods that segment the lidar topography into individual outcrops. Lower elevation hillslopes are rockier (~14% rock) than their higher elevation counterparts (~2% rock) due to late Cenozoic incision of a regional, high elevation, low relief surface. After accounting for the erosional control on rockiness, we show that bedrock exposure also depends on topographic aspect. Equator-facing hillslopes are rockier (~20% rock at low elevations; ~3% rock at high elevations) than their more heavily forested, pole-facing counterparts (~11% rock at low elevations; ~1% rock at high elevations). To simulate these patterns, hillslope evolution models need “humped” soil production functions that can generate rocky outcrops within a soil mantle. When combined with depth-dependent soil creep, such models readily produce large gradients in the height and frequency of bedrock outcrops in response to aspect-dependent weathering. Given the correspondence between higher forest biomass (e.g., increased tree density, canopy height) with lower bedrock exposure on pole-facing hillslopes, we argue that forest dynamics may be an underappreciated regulator of hillslope morphology via root zone weathering."},{"t":"含超大 A 位阳离子的非手性准二维钙钛矿铁电体中的手性非线性光学响应","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3136861?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维钙钛矿非线性光学","kp":["[A位阳离子]: 超大尺寸准二维钙钛矿","[手性非线性光学]: 非手性铁电体"],"as":"该研究在手性非线性光学材料领域取得重要发现，在非手性的准二维钙钛矿铁电体中观察到手性非线性光学响应。二维钙钛矿和手性非线性光学材料因其在光电领域的应用前景备受关注。研究揭示了非手性材料中诱导产生手性光学活性的新机制，将铁电性、非线性光学效应与手性响应三者结合，为设计新型光电功能材料、开发高效光学开关和光电探测器提供了创新思路和材料平台。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Chiral Nonlinear Optical Response in Achiral Quasi‐2D Perovskite Ferroelectric Featuring Unusually Large A‐Site Cation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The exploration of 2D perovskites and chiral nonlinear optical materials has drawn significant interest due to their structural tunability and strong optical responses. However, the development of quasi‐2D perovskites has long been constrained by the limited choice of A‐site cations imposed by the traditional tolerance factor. In this study, we present a new 2D tri‐layered lead bromide perovskite (4AM)\n                    4\n                    Pb\n                    3\n                    Br\n                    10\n                    (\n                    n\n                    = 3) with the general formula (A\n                    ′\n                    )\n                    2\n                    (A)\n                    \n                      n\n                    \n                    −1\n                    M\n                    \n                      n\n                    \n                    X\n                    3\n                    \n                      n\n                    \n                    +1\n                    , in which 4‐aminomonpholine cations (4AM) that act simultaneously as A‐site and spacer components, exhibiting an ultrahigh tolerance factor of 1.74—far beyond conventional limits. Crystallizing in the polar space group\n                    Cc\n                    , the compound shows an order‐disorder ferroelectric phase transition at 418 K. Interestingly it also exhibits notable chiral nonlinear optical properties, including strong second‐harmonic generation circular dichroism (\n                    g\n                    SHG‐CD\n                    ≈ 0.63). This work breaks the classic tolerance factor constraint and opens a pathway for designing new chiral nonlinear optical materials in low‐dimensional perovskites."},{"t":"浮游植物分泌的代谢物介导表面海洋碳通量的表征","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531765123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The marine labile dissolved organic carbon (DOC) pool is a dynamic reservoir of thousands of molecules that cycles approximately one-quarter of Earth’s primary production within days to weeks. After excretion by phytoplankton and other microbes, metabolites are rapidly consumed, resulting in low standing concentrations (picomolar to low nanomolar). Despite the decades-long search for labile DOC sources and molecular identities, marine phytoplankton exometabolomes are not well characterized, largely due to difficulties in measuring small polar molecules in saline water. Here, we profiled the exometabolomes of six axenic phytoplankton species representing key functional groups including a diatom (\n                    Thalassiosira pseudonana\n                    CCMP1335), a picoeukaryote (\n                    Micromonas commoda\n                    RCC299), a coccolithophore (\n                    Gephyrocapsa huxleyi\n                    CCMP371), a diazotrophic cyanobacterium (\n                    Crocosphaera watsonii\n                    WH8501), and two picocyanobacteria (\n                    Prochlorococcus marinus\n                    MIT9301 and\n                    Synechococcus\n                    WH8102). From these cultures, we quantified 56 amine- and alcohol-containing exometabolites representing 11 compound classes which in sum comprised up to 23.4% of phytoplankton-excreted DOC. We estimated that these phytoplankton-derived exometabolites could supply up to 5% of the daily carbon quota of the dominant heterotrophic bacterium SAR11 in the surface ocean. Substantial variations in exometabolite identity and concentration across phytoplankton taxa underscore taxonomic diversity as a key driver in the supply and composition of labile DOC. This taxonomic variation predicts geographic and seasonal differences in the distribution of marine dissolved metabolites that underpin the cycling of labile DOC back to carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ). Overall, our work suggests that phytoplankton exometabolites are key chemical currencies that mediate significant carbon fluxes within the ocean’s carbon cycle."},{"t":"37 年实验中的幼年蓝蟹的同类相食、捕食和避难所","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2533461123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"This 37-y record (1989–2025) of field experiments tested seasonal and annual variation in predation on juvenile blue crabs (\n                    Callinectes sapidus\n                    ) in a representative mesohaline site of Chesapeake Bay, USA, where the species is a dominant epibenthic predator and major fishery. We used replicated sets of individually tethered crabs to provide a relative index of lethal and sublethal predation rates on intermolt individuals as a function of size and habitats. Cannibalism by large adult crabs accounted for &gt;97% of predation of juvenile crabs; predation by fish was not observed; and mortality from physiological stress was rare (&lt;1%). Sampling by depth showed that juveniles occurred in nearshore shallows, while adults were in deeper water. Cannibalism was also depth-dependent: Rates were high at 75 cm depth; intermediate at 40 cm; and lowest at 15 cm shallows, which provided partial refuge. Cannibalism was size-dependent: 30 to 50 mm juveniles experienced high rates of predation; 90 to 110 mm preadults had low rates; and &gt;120 mm adults had no predation. Cannibalism rates on juveniles varied seasonally, peaking during summer when adult crabs were most active; no tethering predation occurred in cold months. Variation in adult crab abundance accounted for 51% of annual variation in predation on tethered juveniles. Cannibalism by adult blue crabs provides a density-dependent regulation of juveniles by adults, with juvenile survivorship dependent on shallow-water refuge habitats in the mesohaline zone of the estuary. The refuge habitat appears increasingly restricted both by predatory fish common in high and recently introduced in low salinities, and by shoreline hardening."},{"t":"减肥药可以代替注射剂吗？科学怎么说","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00856-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"桥联吡咯并吲哚-CAYC-金配合物：利用金(I)中弱次级分子内 Au···H−C(sp3) 相互作用","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526091?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金(I)催化配合物","kp":["[配体设计]: 桥环氨基(叶立德)卡宾bCAYC","[催化体系]: 金(I)均相催化"],"as":"该研究开发了桥联吡咯并吲哚骨架与CAYC（环状烷基氨基碳烯）配体结合的金(I)配合物催化剂，核心创新在于利用分子内弱二级相互作用来稳定催化活性物种并调控反应选择性。金(I)催化已成为有机合成中的重要工具，但传统NHC-金配合物在活性和可控性上仍有局限。通过引入吡咯并吲哚桥联结构和CAYC配体，研究团队实现了对配体电子和空间性质的精细调控，有望在炔烃活化、环化反应等不对称催化中突破现有性能瓶颈，拓展金催化在复杂天然产物合成中的应用。","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Bridged Pyrroloindole‐CAYC‐Gold Complexes: Harnessing Weak Secondary Intramolecular Au···H−C(sp3) Interactions in Gold(I","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Gold(I) catalysis has been established as a tremendously powerful tool in organic synthesis and catalysis. Herein, we introduce a new class of electronically‐ and sterically‐hindered N‐heterocyclic carbene ligands, termed as bridged cyclic amino(ylide)carbene (\n                    \n                      b\n                    \n                    CAYC), containing 9H‐pyrrolo[1,2‐a]indoles as the carbene core and diaryl sulfonium as the ylide partner. Highly electron‐rich\n                    \n                      b\n                    \n                    CAYC ligands are suitable for synthesizing the corresponding gold(I) complexes, which exhibit a weak intramolecular Au···H−C(sp\n                    3\n                    ) interaction as a secondary interaction where the gold d‐orbitals act as electron donors and the C–H σ* orbitals act as acceptors. Properties and parameters of Au···H−C(sp\n                    3\n                    ) interactions were investigated through X‐ray, NMR, DFT, AIM, and NBO studies. This study reports a remarkably short Au···H−C(sp\n                    3\n                    ) distance of 2.26 Å, as determined through X‐ray crystallographic analysis. DFT and TEP data analysis revealed that\n                    \n                      b\n                    \n                    CAYCs are among the most σ‐donating carbene ligands to date, than other widely used NHC ligands. The steric impact of\n                    \n                      b\n                    \n                    CAYCs has shown excellent potential for steric shielding, with %V\n                    bur\n                    reaching up to 42.6%. These unique properties were well‐reflected through the room‐temperature hydroamination and one‐pot C–N and C–C bond‐forming reactions."},{"t":"生物圈扩张驱动地球的长期氧化，而构造调节机器l揭示的氧气变化","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536681123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The rise of atmospheric oxygen fundamentally transformed Earth’s surface environment and enabled the evolution of complex life. However, the processes driving long-term oxygen fluctuations remain poorly resolved, partly from limited proxy resolution and temporal coverage. Trace element (TE) concentrations in sedimentary pyrite offer a robust archive of redox conditions in ancient oceans and their linkage to atmospheric oxygen levels. Here we integrate high-resolution geochemical data from pyrite grains spanning 3.5 billion years with machine learning to reconstruct atmospheric oxygen evolution. We identify two coherent TE groups representing redox-sensitive and hydrothermal influences. Our results reveal that the long-term, secular trend of atmospheric oxygen is tightly coupled with biosphere expansion, whereas superimposed short-term fluctuations are influenced by tectonic events, including supercontinent assembly and breakup. Specifically, we show that primary oxygenation events (GOE and NOE) correlate strongly with biological expansion. Episodes of prolonged oxygenation broadly overlap with continental assembly, reflecting enhanced weathering, nutrient fluxes, and organic carbon burial, whereas supercontinent breakup phases are commonly associated with more reducing conditions, likely linked to increased volcanic emissions and diminished net biospheric oxygen. This reconstruction not only refines the temporal dynamics of Earth’s redox evolution but also highlights the interconnected roles of biological productivity, tectonics, ocean chemistry, and Earth-system processes in shaping planetary habitability. These findings provide a comprehensive framework for understanding Earth’s atmospheric evolution and inform models of environmental change on early Earth and other habitable planets."},{"t":"用于可重复性电池研究的自动化纽扣电池组装系统","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-026-00161-6","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电池组装自动化","as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"kp":["[自动化]: 纽扣电池自动组装提升研究可重复性"],"ot":"Automated coin cell assembly for reproducible battery research"},{"t":"老年人自闭症：卫生系统必须认识到其影响","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00863-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"AlphaFold 迈入'下一阶段'：AI蛋白质数据库现已支持蛋白质配对预测","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00787-3","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AlphaFold蛋白互作","as":"DeepMind的AlphaFold蛋白质结构数据库迎来重大升级，新增蛋白质-蛋白质相互作用（pairing）预测功能。这一进展使研究人员能够以前所未有的规模探究蛋白质复合物的组装方式和相互作用界面，对药物靶点发现、信号通路解析和合成生物学设计具有深远意义。该数据库已覆盖超过2亿个蛋白质结构，是结构生物学领域的核心基础设施。","sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":7.5,"r":7.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.5},"aip":1,"dp":1,"ot":"AlphaFold hits ‘next level’: the AI database now includes protein pairing","b":"The database of 200 million protein-structure predictions now includes homodimers, adding new biological relevance. The database of 200 million protein-structure predictions now includes homodimers, adding new biological relevance."},{"t":"工业 TOPCon 硅上添加剂辅助钙钛矿结晶用于高效叠层太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02010-z","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿叠层电池","kp":["[添加剂]: 2-巯基苯并噻唑双功能","[底电池]: 工业TOPCon硅","[器件]: 钙钛矿-硅叠层电池"],"as":"本研究聚焦工业级TOPCon硅基底上的钙钛矿结晶工艺优化。薄硅晶圆在隧穿氧化物钝化接触叠层太阳能电池中具有低热容和高理论效率优势，但钙钛矿层的均匀沉积与界面缺陷控制是关键挑战。研究采用添加剂辅助策略调控钙钛矿薄膜的结晶动力学，改善薄膜形貌和晶界质量，旨在提升叠层电池的光电转换效率和工业化量产可行性。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":7.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Additive-assisted perovskite crystallization on industrial TOPCon silicon for tandem solar cells with improved efficienc","b":"Thin silicon wafers used in tunnel oxide passivated contact tandem solar cells have reduced thermal mass and higher thermal conductivity, which accelerate heat transfer during perovskite subcell deposition. This rapid heat transfer induces fast crystallization of the perovskite layer, compromising film quality and tandem performance. Here we introduce 2-mercaptobenzothiazole, which exhibits dual-mode binding with perovskite organic cations, to modulate crystallization dynamics. This approach improves morphological uniformity, eliminates voids and suppresses halide segregation, while reducing non-radiative recombination and lowering the trap-assisted recombination rate from 3.2 × 105 to 4.3 × 104 cm s−1. The two-terminal monolithic perovskite/tunnel oxide passivated contact tandem cell achieves a certified stabilized power conversion efficiency of 32.76% and retains 91% of its initial efficiency after 1,700 h of continuous operation. This work uncovers a previously overlooked perovskite crystallization issue on industrial silicon wafers, providing critical insights for integrating perovskite solar cells into mainstream silicon technology.","aip":1},{"t":"配电网中分布式能源规划的自适应鲁棒优化模型：应对长期与短期不确定性","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002783?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配电网分布式电源规划","kp":["[优化模型]: 鲁棒自适应优化用于配电网DER长短期规划"],"as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Adaptive robust optimization models for DER planning in distribution networks under long- and short-term uncertainties"},{"t":"需求不确定性下的自适应液化天然气供应链规划","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003223?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/天然气化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"液化天然气链","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"去泛素酶 DUO-1 主动维持秀丽隐杆线虫减数分裂特异性染色体结构","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2532671123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Meiotic prophase is characterized by a dynamic program in which germ cells undergo a complex series of associations and dissociations of protein complexes that drive assembly, remodeling, and disassembly of meiosis-specific chromosome structures and dramatic changes in chromosome compaction. Failure to properly coordinate these processes can result in improper chromosome segregation, producing aneuploid gametes and inviable zygotes. Here, we investigate the roles of\n                    Caenorhabditis elegans\n                    DUO-1, an ortholog of mammalian ubiquitin-specific proteases USP26 and USP29, in mediating these dynamic chromosomal events during meiotic prophase. Cytological analyses of\n                    duo-1\n                    null mutants indicate that loss of DUO-1 function leads to impaired assembly of meiotic chromosome axes and synaptonemal complexes (SCs), loss of integrity of meiotic chromosome axes, ineffective homolog pairing, premature separation of sister chromatids, and late-prophase chromosome decompaction. Further, axis/SC instability in\n                    duo-1\n                    mutants correlates with depletion of REC-8 cohesin complexes and is accompanied by massive accumulation of early DSB repair intermediates. By using a dual-AID-tagged allele to deplete DUO-1 during meiotic development, we demonstrate that DUO-1 is continually required throughout meiotic prophase progression, to promote proper axis/SC assembly in early prophase, to maintain axis/SC stability during the late pachytene stage, and to promote/maintain chromosome compaction at the end of meiotic prophase. Together, our data emphasize the importance of mechanisms that actively maintain meiotic chromosome structure and meiosis-specific chromosome architecture throughout meiotic prophase and implicate DUO-1 as a key player in these active maintenance processes."},{"t":"ATP13A2 通过调节线粒体 hom 抑制巨噬细胞 NLRP3 炎性体激活以抑制神经退行性变","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534066123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Neuro-immune crosstalk is increasingly recognized in Parkinson’s disease (PD), and ATP13A2 is well known for its neuroprotective role. However, it remains unclear whether\n                    ATP13A2\n                    mutations carried by PD patients contribute to immune dysfunction that exacerbates disease progression. Here, we systematically demonstrate that many\n                    ATP13A2\n                    mutations result in a loss-of-expression phenotype. ATP13A2 is highly expressed in macrophages. Myeloid ATP13A2 deficiency causes uncontrolled NLRP3 inflammasome activation driven by lysosomal alkalization and subsequent disrupted mitochondrial homeostasis, rendering mice susceptible to a PD-like phenotype. PD-linked\n                    ATP13A2\n                    loss-of-expression mutants fail to restore the ATP13A2 levels required to suppress NLRP3 hyperactivation in ATP13A2-depleted human THP-1 monocytes. Macrophages from a PD patient carrying the\n                    ATP13A2\n                    loss-of-expression L927P mutation exhibit excessive NLRP3 activation due to lysosomal-mitochondrial dysfunction. Our findings provide insight into PD pathogenesis, emphasizing genetic factor-driven dysregulated macrophage NLRP3 activation, particularly in\n                    ATP13A2\n                    loss-of-expression mutation cases."},{"t":"AI筛选小分子模板效应助力二维无枝晶锂金属电池架构","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00079-2?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无枝晶锂金属负极","kp":["[填料]: AI筛选2D LALZO纳米片","[电解质]: 复合聚合物电解质","[电池]: 无枝晶锂金属电池"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究利用AI筛选的小分子模板效应，构建了无枝晶锂金属电池的二维结构固态电解质界面。复合聚合物电解质面临安全性和离子电导率的固有矛盾，Zhou等人开发了一种AI辅助筛选的小分子添加剂，在锂负极表面通过模板引导形成均匀的二维保护层。该策略有效抑制了锂枝晶生长，实现了均匀的锂离子沉积。AI驱动的材料筛选与精准界面工程相结合的方法，为高安全、高能量密度锂金属电池的实用化提供了创新路径。","ot":"AI-screened small-molecule templating effect enabling 2D architectures for dendrite-free lithium metal batteries","b":"To overcome the safety and conductivity limitations of composite polymer electrolytes, Zhou et al. developed an AI-screened sol-gel strategy to synthesize 2D LALZO nanosheets. These high-aspect-ratio fillers create a brick-and-mortar skeleton that reinforces the polymer matrix and establishes continuous ion-transport networks. The resulting electrolytes effectively suppress lithium dendrites, enabling long-life, high-performance all-solid-state lithium metal batteries with exceptional mechanical resilience and electrochemical stability."},{"t":"人工智能被编程为劫持人类的同理心——我们必须抵制它","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00834-z","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"同理心劫持","sc":2.4,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1,"r":3,"d":0,"t":6},"as":""},{"t":"专注教学的人口门槛","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517041123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Teachers hold a prominent place in modern societies, particularly where education is compulsory and widely institutionalized. This ubiquity obscures an underlying puzzle: Why do societies assign some individuals solely to the instruction of others? This question is especially enigmatic for dedicated teachers, who invest their labor in cultivating others’ skills but do not themselves participate in the productive activities for which their students are being trained. To address this question, we develop a simple, mathematically tractable model of teaching and learning in a population that shares a common productive aim. We identify a tradeoff between the size of the workforce and its collective level of expertise; and we analyze the optimal proportion of a population that should serve as teachers, across diverse scenarios. We find that a population must exceed a critical size before it is beneficial to allocate anyone as a dedicated teacher at all. Subsequently, the peak demand for teachers is achieved at an intermediate population size and never exceeds one half of the population. For more complicated tasks, our analysis predicts the optimal allocation of teachers to instruction across different levels of expertise. Although our model is not evolutionary per se, this population-level account lays a foundation for understanding the adaptive advantage of dedicated teachers in both human and nonhuman populations."},{"t":"基于负载扰动的燃料电池-锂电池混合系统船舶应用能量管理策略","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003120?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池混合能量管理","kp":["[系统]: 燃料电池-锂电池混合","[应用]: 船舶"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"A load disturbance-based energy management strategy in fuel cell‑lithium battery hybrid systems for marine applications"},{"t":"氮杂芳烃间位硫醇化的脱芳香[3,3]-Sigmatropic重排策略","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8135901?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Direct C–H functionalization of azaarenes stands as a remarkably powerful tool for diversifying these heterocycles. However, precise control over chemo‐ and site‐selectivity remains the primary challenge, largely stemming from the complex electronic features and numerous reactive sites inherent to azaarenes. Against this backdrop, developing innovative, efficient catalytic strategies, especially those enabling remote aromatic C─H bond activation, is not only of paramount significance but also a considerable synthetic challenge. Herein, we present an organocatalytic dearomative [3,3]‐sigmatropic rearrangement strategy, which achieves site‐selective C–H functionalization of quinolines with excellent chemoselectivity. Specifically, 1,8‐diazabicyclo[5.4.0]undec‐7‐ene (DBU) serves as a potent catalyst that facilitates a unique sequence of sulfinylation, dearomatization, [3,3]‐sigmatropic rearrangement, and rearomatization. Employing this cascade, a broad range of quinoline\n                    N\n                    ‐oxides undergo reaction with commercially available dimethylcarbamothioic chloride (DMTC) to selectively deliver\n                    meta\n                    ‐thiolated quinolines. The utility of this strategy is highlighted by its application to the late‐stage\n                    meta\n                    ‐thiolation of drug‐related compounds and the total synthesis of an organic light‐emitting device (OLED) material.","tp":"芳烃硫醇化","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3,"r":5,"d":6,"t":5},"as":"报道了一种脱芳香[3,3]-σ重排策略，实现氮杂芳烃间位选择性硫醇化。该方法解决了氮杂芳烃直接C-H官能化中化学选择性和位置选择性难以精确控制的挑战，为远程芳香C-H键活化提供了高效催化新方案。"},{"t":"通过可逆C–H采样实现1,2-硼基/氢迁移","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00027-6?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硼基迁移重排","kp":["[反应]: 可逆C-H采样1,2-硼氢转位","[特点]: 无导向基无辅助基"],"dp":1,"as":"提出一种通过可逆C–H采样实现硼基/氢原子1,2-迁移转位的新策略。硼基团作为有机合成中的多功能官能团，该反应可在分子内对其位置进行精确重排，无需重新引入硼源，大幅提升了硼化学在复杂分子合成中的灵活性和原子经济性。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"1,2-Boryl/hydrogen transposition via reversible C–H sampling","b":"Boryls serve as versatile synthetic handles in organic chemistry, yet the direct repositioning of an existing boryl group along a carbon backbone remains a valuable and underexplored transformation. This work achieves direct 1,2-boryl/hydrogen transposition in alkyl boronic esters through a reversible C–H sampling strategy requiring no directing groups, auxiliaries, or other functional handles. By integrating on-demand boryl repositioning with boryl’s established synthetic versatility, this method further offers modular access to valuable building blocks whose preparation is conventionally challenging."},{"t":"[ASAP]调控镓柔性单原子纳米酶：通过多酶活性切换实现自适应催化性能","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23161","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子纳米酶","kp":["活性位点[柔性单原子纳米酶]: Ga-N3S动态重构","催化特性[FSAzyme]: 自适应多酶模拟活性"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究设计了镓基柔性单原子纳米酶，通过多酶活性切换实现自适应催化性能。传统无机纳米酶受限于刚性活性中心结构，缺乏天然酶的柔性适应能力。研究团队利用镓单原子位点的结构可塑性，赋予纳米酶在多种酶模拟活性之间动态切换的能力，使其催化性能可根据反应环境自适应调节。这一仿生策略突破了纳米酶活性位点固定化的瓶颈，为智能催化剂设计和生物医学应用（如传感、治疗）开辟了新方向。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Tailoring Ga Flexible Single-Atom Nanozymes for Self-Adaptive Catalytic Performance through Multienzyme Activity Switching","b":"Inorganic nanozymes remain limited by rigid active-center structures, lacking the adaptive flexibility of natural enzymes. Here we report a flexible single-atom nanozyme (FSAzyme) enabled by regulation of Ga coordination. A dynamically reconstructing Ga-N3S site exhibits self-adaptive electronic modulation, allowing the FSAzyme to realize multiple enzyme-mimicking activities and versatile sensing functions. These results establish a general design strategy to introduce enzyme-like adaptivity into single-atom nanozymes."},{"t":"[ASAP]宽带隙钙钛矿协同离子工程助力钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池实现认证电压纪录","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00419","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿叠层电池","kp":["掺杂剂[宽禁带钙钛矿]: 甲酸铷RbFa单一掺杂","机制[钙钛矿叠层]: Rb⁺收缩晶格+甲酸根钝化缺陷调控结晶","关键性能[钙钛矿-有机叠层]: 认证电压创纪录"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究通过协同离子工程优化宽带隙钙钛矿，实现了钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池的认证电压记录。混合卤化物宽带隙钙钛石面临缺陷诱导的开路电压损失和光致相分离两大难题，严重限制叠层电池效率。研究团队通过精确调控多种离子的协同掺杂策略，有效钝化了带隙缺陷并抑制了卤化物相分离，显著降低了VOC损失。该成果推动了钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池的性能极限突破，为低成本高效光伏技术商业化提供了关键技术支撑。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Synergistic Ion Engineering for Wide-Bandgap Perovskite Enables Perovskite–Organic Tandem Solar Cells with a Record Certified Voltage","b":"Mixed-halide wide-bandgap (WBG) perovskites suffer from defect-induced open-circuit voltage (VOC) loss and photoinduced phase segregation. Herein, we introduce rubidium formate (RbFa) as a single dopant to mitigate both challenges through synergistic ion engineering. The Rb+ cation enters the lattice to induce contraction, while the formate anion (Fa–) modulates crystallization kinetics and passivates halide vacancies. This cooperative interaction maximizes residual compressive strain, thermodynamically raising the ion-migration barrier, while vacancy passivation kinetically blocks migration pathways. Consequently, we achieve a high VOC of 1.371 V and enhanced photostability for 1.86 eV WBG perovskite solar cells (PSCs). Monolithic perovskite–organic tandem solar cells deliver an efficiency of 26.03% with a record certified VOC of 2.189 V and retain over 90% of their initial efficiency after 1000 h under continuous 1-sun illumination."},{"t":"[ASAP]强金属-金属相互作用诱导氮化镧包覆钴实现高效氨合成","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01112","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氨合成催化剂","kp":["催化剂结构[氨合成]: LaN包覆Co，金属-金属强相互作用","反应条件[氨合成]: 低温温和条件","核心挑战[氮化物负载金属]: 平衡N₂活化效率与氢中毒"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究利用强金属-金属相互作用诱导的钴封装策略，通过氮化镧实现温和条件下高效合成氨。氨合成催化剂在温和条件下运行是催化领域的重大挑战。研究发现，镧的强电子效应诱导钴纳米颗粒表面形成氮化镧封装层，通过电子转移调控优化了钴活性位点的氮气活化能力。该金属-金属相互作用策略显著降低了氨合成的活化能垒和操作压力，为替代传统Haber-Bosch工艺的绿色合成氨技术提供了新催化范式。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Strong Metal–Metal Interaction-Induced Encapsulation of Cobalt by Lanthanum Nitride for Efficient Ammonia Synthesis","b":"Developing catalysts for ammonia synthesis under mild conditions is of paramount importance but remains a grand challenge, primarily due to the trade-off between efficient dinitrogen activation and hydrogen poisoning. Nitride-supported metal catalysts exhibit remarkably low-temperature activity, yet the atomic origin of their synergy remains a subject of intense debate. Building on our recently established generalized theories of strong metal-metal interaction (SMMI) and encapsulation, we combine ab initio atomistic thermodynamics and machine-learning potential-driven molecular dynamics simulations to systematically construct a unified mechanistic framework for these highly active systems. Using lanthanum nitride (LaN)-supported cobalt (Co) nanoparticles as a prototypical model, we reveal that, driven by SMMI and facilitated by nitrogen vacancies, the nitride support spontaneously restructures to encapsulate metal nanoparticles via the formation of subnitride overlayers. This thermodynamically stable encapsulated architecture constructs contiguous perimeter sites─involving both low-valent La cations and electron-rich cobalt metal─that fundamentally alter the catalytic landscape, while intrinsically securing the antisintering stability of small Co nanoparticles. First-principles calculations reveal that these perimeter sites cooperatively facilitate N2 activation while simultaneously suppressing H-poisoning. Consequently, microkinetic simulations yield an apparent activation energy of 50 kJ mol-1, in good agreement with experimental values. By naturally accounting for a diverse array of experimental observations, this work establishes SMMI-driven encapsulation as a robust physical framework for understanding and designing nitride-based catalysts for ammonia synthesis under mild conditions."},{"t":"[ASAP] 锌基配位网络中的刺激诱导微柔性纳米孔可实现四种不同的吸附机制，以实现高效的轻质烃分离","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20939","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Understanding adsorption mechanisms is fundamental to advancing gas separation science and technology. Nevertheless, sorbents that undergo stimulus-induced fine-tuning of their structures to enable multiple adsorption mechanisms are rarely reported. Here, we report that CALF-20, a zinc-based coordination network, exhibits temperature and guest-induced microflexibility to exhibit four distinct and tunable adsorption mechanisms for nine light hydrocarbon gases: (i) thermodynamic selectivity (ethane/ethylene separation); (ii) kinetic-limited adsorption (propane, n-butane, and n-butene); (iii) molecular sieving (iso-butane/iso-butene); (iv) gate-opening flexibility (butadiene capture in the presence of n-alkane impurities). In effect, temperature-dependent structural flexibility enables modulation of guest diffusion kinetics and adsorption thermodynamics. CALF-20 thereby achieves propylene purification from propane and butadiene purification with exceptional selectivity. Structural and computational insights into the mechanisms governing the selective separation of light hydrocarbons using CALF-20 reveal the potential of targeted flexible nanoporous materials with dynamically tunable pore environments, paving the way for next-generation separation technologies in the petrochemical and energy sectors.","tp":"柔性纳米孔","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4,"r":5,"d":7,"t":5},"as":"报道了锌基配位网络CALF-20在温度和客体分子诱导下展现微柔性，对九种轻质烃气体表现出四种可调控的吸附机制，包括热力学选择性、动力学分离等，为高效轻质烃气体分离提供了新材料体系和机理认知。"},{"t":"[ASAP]稳定氮化碳光电阳极：聚光条件下无偏压醇重整耦合CO₂还原","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20624","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电催化CO2还原","kp":["光阳极[PEC醇重整]: 氰胺功能化氮化碳","工作条件[无辅助CO₂还原耦合]: 聚光太阳光","关键因素[稳定性]: 光强度与电化学电位"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"报道了稳定化碳氮化物（g-C3N4）光阳极在聚光太阳光下实现无偏压醇类重整耦合CO2还原的研究。碳氮化物是一种低成本、可规模化的有机半导体，但在PEC器件中易发生光腐蚀。研究通过表面修饰与界面工程策略显著提升了碳氮化物光阳极的光电化学稳定性，使其在强光照条件下同时驱动醇氧化和CO2还原两个半反应。该体系无需外部电能输入即可实现太阳能驱动的燃料与化学品联产。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Stabilizing Carbon Nitride Photoanodes for Unassisted Alcohol Reforming Coupled to CO2 Reduction under Concentrated Sunlight","b":"Carbon nitride is a scalable and low-cost organic semiconductor with promise for use in photoelectrochemical (PEC) devices, but its poor stability limits its practical use. This study establishes the importance of light intensity and applied electrochemical potential on the stability of cyanamide-functionalized carbon nitride photoanodes used for waste-derived alcohol oxidation. Operating under concentrated sunlight (3 suns) and low bias (<0.2 V vs reversible hydrogen electrode, RHE) enabled over 20 h of continuous operation. In situ spectroscopy and impedance analysis linked carbon nitride degradation at higher potential (>0.4 V vs RHE) to irreversible morphological changes and self-oxidation, exacerbated by conductivity loss. These insights enabled the stabilization of carbon nitride photoelectrodes and paved the way for the development of a standalone PEC device with an integrated thermoelectric unit to convert heat into an additional internal bias-voltage, where carbon nitride efficiently drives alcohol oxidation coupled to CO2-to-CO conversion for over 70 h. This work sets a benchmark for carbon nitride stability and PEC deployment, and highlights the need to revisit PEC testing protocols to unlock the full potential of emerging semiconductors.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP]沸石封装亚纳米Pt催化剂实现高密度聚乙烯形状选择性转化为苯","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c14646","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"塑料催化转化","kp":["催化剂[HDPE转化]: 沸石封装亚纳米Pt","目标产物[塑料升级回收]: 高选择性生成单一产物苯","工艺特点[聚烯烃转化]: 形状选择性两步法"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"利用沸石封装的亚纳米铂催化剂，实现了高密度聚乙烯（HDPE）向单一产物苯的形状选择性转化。聚烯烃废弃物的升级回收长期面临产物分布宽、分离困难的问题。该催化剂利用沸石分子筛的孔道尺寸限制效应，将塑料裂解后的中间体精确导向苯的生成路径，显著提高了产物选择性和技术经济性。该策略为塑料废弃物高值化利用提供了新途径，有望推动塑料化学回收的工业化。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Shape-Selective Conversion of High-Density Polyethylene into Benzene with Zeolite-Encapsulated Subnanometer Pt Catalysts","b":"Selective conversion of polyolefins into a single value-added chemical can greatly improve the techno-economy of the upcycling process. However, to date, most reported catalytic processes can convert polyolefins into only mixed hydrocarbon or oxygenate compounds. Herein, we have developed a shape-selective catalytic route for converting high-density polyethylene (HDPE) into benzene through a two-step process based on zeolite-confined subnanometer Pt catalysts, including the conversion of HDPE to mixed alkanes through hydrocracking and the subsequent conversion of mixed alkanes to benzene through dehydroaromatization. By constructing neighboring subnanometer Pt clusters and acid sites within β-zeolite, we can achieve the highest specific activity in the hydrocracking of HDPE at a very low Pt loading (∼300 ppm) and high selectivity to liquid alkanes. Furthermore, the liquid alkanes are selectively converted into benzene with ∼45% yield by a PtSn@MFI catalyst in which subnanometer bimetallic PtSn clusters are confined in the MFI zeolite."},{"t":"[ASAP] 使用核磁共振波谱和中子衍射研究水与亲水性纯二氧化硅沸石相互作用过程中的室温框架氧同位素交换","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23024","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Four different hydrophobic, low-defect pure-silica zeolites are contacted with isotopically enriched water at room temperature, and all show isotope exchange of 17O into the Si-O-Si units of the zeolite structure using multiple-quantum MAS NMR spectroscopy. For the CHA zeolite structure, exchange of 18O into the framework was identified using neutron diffraction─the first time this technique has been used to differentiate oxygen isotopes in any solid-state material. The results indicate that even supposedly very hydrophobic pure-silica zeolites are susceptible to oxygen exchange under very mild aqueous conditions. This has important consequences for our view of the structure of zeolites in contact with water."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过分子迁移率进行表型分析：低亲和力可逆探针能够通过单分子成像对细胞群进行表征和分类","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c11933","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Cell surface biomolecules, such as membrane receptors, are key drivers of cellular behavior and are therefore inherently different for cell types with different functions and pathogenicity. Here, we present a super-resolution method for functional phenotyping of cell populations based on the single-molecule analysis of membrane receptor mobility. Central to our approach is a library of nanofitin-based low-affinity probes that selectively and reversibly bind to target receptors in live cells. These probes enable the direct detection, counting, and tracking of individual receptors without requiring genetic modification or chemical labeling, allowing the study of endogenous biomolecules in unperturbed cells. Using this strategy, we demonstrate that identical receptors can exhibit distinct mobility patterns across different cell types, reflecting the underlying physiological differences. By integrating these probes with single-molecule point accumulation for imaging in nanoscale topography imaging and tracking, advanced image analysis, and AI-driven classification, we provide a robust workflow for understanding and phenotyping of cells by their receptor mobility.","tp":"单分子成像","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4,"r":5,"d":6,"t":5},"as":"提出了一种基于膜受体迁移率单分子分析的超分辨功能表型方法，利用纳米抗体来源的低亲和力可逆探针选择性与活细胞表面受体结合，通过受体迁移率差异对细胞群体进行表征和分类，为细胞异质性研究和精准诊断提供新工具。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 甲基丙烯酸酯和香豆素完美交替共聚，形成具有完全可降解性和解聚性的坚固 C-C 主链聚合物","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01713","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"This contribution reports the first copolymerization of methacrylates with simple, commercially available, and biorenewable coumarin (CM). The key to this achievement lies in the rational design of a new Al(C6F5)3/PnBu3 Lewis pair cooperative catalyst, which possesses several unique features, including high efficiency, living nature, and, more strikingly, perfectly alternating sequence control. Computational studies elucidate that kinetic control, enabled by different attractive London dispersion interactions between enolaluminate active species and two monomer substrates, is a decisive factor for alternating sequence control. Accordingly, a series of alternating vinyl copolymers with a high molecular weight (Mn) of up to 330.8 kg/mol can be synthesized directly from commercial/general vinyl monomers regardless of monomer structures and feed ratios. These copolymers have been determined to be highly transparent materials with high heat resistance (Tg: 130-190 °C), good thermal stability (Td up to 300 °C), and good durability and are meanwhile fully degradable at room temperature under a strong base and completely thermal depolymerizable in the presence of a strong donating solvent (e.g., DMF), thus affording a new class of robust, durable, yet fully degradable, depolymerizable C-C main-chain polymers, which are generally unachievable due to an inherent performance/degradability (depolymerizability) trade-off.","tp":"交替共聚物","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3,"r":6,"d":6,"t":5},"as":"首次实现了甲基丙烯酸酯与生物可再生香豆素的交替共聚，利用新型Al(C6F5)3/PnBu3路易斯酸碱对协同催化剂实现完美交替序列控制。所得C-C主链聚合物兼具完全可降解性和解聚性，计算研究揭示了由伦敦色散力差异驱动的动力学控制机制。"},{"t":"[ASAP]混合镧系金属有机框架用于近红外一区生物成像与近红外三区四光子上转换","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00409","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镧系MOF上转换","kp":["镧系组成[MOF上转换]: Yb³⁺、Tb³⁺、Eu³⁺","[上转换类型]: NIR-III窗口四光子上转换","[成像窗口]: NIR-I生物成像"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"报道了混合镧系金属有机框架在近红外-I生物成像和近红外-III四光子上转换发光方面的应用。通过在MOF骨架中精确引入多种镧系离子（如Yb、Er、Tm等），利用MOF的规则孔道结构控制镧系离子间能量传递的间距和路径，实现了高效的上转换发光。近红外窗口成像具有更深的组织穿透深度和更低的自发荧光背景，四光子上转换进一步将激发光子利用效率推向新高度，在深层组织生物医学成像方面前景广阔。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Mixed-Lanthanide Metal–Organic Frameworks for Near-Infrared-I Bioimaging and Near-Infrared-III Four-Photon Upconversion","b":"Lanthanide-based metal-organic frameworks (Ln-MOFs) provide a structurally precise platform for upconversion luminescence engineering, yet practical applications are limited by insufficient structural stability, restricted color tunability, and the lack of excitation in the NIR-III window. Here, we report a MOF incorporating mixed-lanthanide Yb3+, Tb3+, and Eu3+ ions that addresses these challenges. The optically transparent and periodic framework enforces a uniform spatial distribution of lanthanide centers and establishes stepwise interionic energy transfer pathways, while ether-containing organic linkers enhance photo and thermal stability. Under NIR-I (980 nm) excitation, the Ln-MOFs exhibit tunable multicolor upconversion emission with high hydrolytic stability and biocompatibility, enabling reliable in vivo imaging in zebrafish models. Remarkably, under NIR-III (1960 nm) excitation, a four-photon upconversion process is observed for the first time in Ln-MOFs. Together, these results expand the excitation landscape of Ln-MOFs from NIR-I to NIR-III and confirm the potential of structurally programmable Ln-MOFs for bioimaging and nonlinear photonic applications."},{"t":"[ASAP]阐明NH₂OH介导的光电催化C–N偶联路径：面向太阳能驱动乌洛托品合成","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20896","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电催化C-N偶联","kp":["反应路径[光电催化C-N偶联]: NH₂OH介导合成六亚甲基四胺","催化剂[C-N偶联]: Cu基","驱动方式[HMTA合成]: 太阳能驱动"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"阐明了羟胺（NH2OH）介导的光电催化C-N偶联路径，实现了太阳能驱动的六亚甲基四胺（乌洛托品）合成。可持续构建多重C-N键一直是有机合成中的基础性挑战。研究以光电催化方式激活NH2OH中间体，与碳基底物发生级联C-N偶联反应，在温和条件下构建复杂碳氮骨架。该路径利用太阳能作为驱动力，避免了传统合成中高温高压和强腐蚀性试剂的使用，为绿色合成含氮化学品提供了新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Elucidating the NH2OH–Mediated Pathway for Photoelectrocatalytic C–N Coupling toward Solar-Driven Hexamethylenetetramine Synthesis","b":"The sustainable construction of multiple C-N bonds remains a fundamental challenge, particularly for complex carbon-nitrogen molecules that require multielectron and multistep processes. Hexamethylenetetramine (HMTA) is an essential chemical feedstock, while its conventional synthesis is energy and carbon-emission intensive. Recent studies indicate the promise of Cu-based catalysts for electrochemical HMTA formation, yet a single Cu site is inherently limited in coordinating the multiple hydrogenation and condensation steps necessary for simultaneously forming the two key HMTA precursors (i.e., (CH2NH)3 and N(CH2OH)3). Herein, we report a sustainable photoelectrocatalytic (PEC) approach for HMTA synthesis via coupling NO3- and HCHO using a Si-based photocathode integrated with hierarchical Cu/Co nanoarray cocatalysts (Cu/Co-Si). This architecture decouples light absorption and catalytic reaction, delivering a high HMTA faradaic efficiency of 80.62% at 0.2 VRHE, over 3.2 times that of Cu-Si, and a yield rate of 5.43 μmol h-1 cm-2. Importantly, *NH2OH generated on Co sites during NO3- reduction is identified as a key intermediate that couples directly with *HCHO to form an oxime (*CH2═NOH), accelerating the formation of (CH2NH)3. Meanwhile, Cu sites favor the NH3-HCHO condensation pathway to generate N(CH2OH)3. The rational dual-site strategy and photovoltaic compatibility offer a scalable, sustainable platform for solar-driven C-N coupling toward high-value chemicals.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP]电催化C–S偶联：从混合多元醇高效电合成有机硫，碳选择性>99%","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c02189","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化C-S偶联","kp":["碳选择性[电催化C-S偶联]: >99%","底物[有机硫电合成]: 生物质衍生混合多元醇"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"报道了一种电催化碳-硫（C-S）偶联方法，从混合多元醇出发高效合成有机硫化合物，碳选择性超过99%。电催化C-S偶联为合成高附加值有机硫化物（如药物中间体、含硫聚合物前体）提供了新途径，但传统方法选择性差、副反应多。该研究通过设计特定电催化剂，实现了多元醇分子中C-S键的精准断裂与重组，在温和电化学条件下实现了近乎定量的碳利用效率，在有机硫电合成领域具有里程碑意义。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Electrocatalytic C–S Coupling for Efficient Organosulfur Electrosynthesis from Mixed Polyols with >99% of Carbon Selectivity","b":"Electrocatalytic carbon-sulfur (C-S) coupling from polyols offers an efficient route for synthesizing value-added organosulfur compounds under mild conditions. Despite some existing results, their performance, including carbon selectivity and Faradaic efficiency (FE), is far behind what is expected for practical application, especially from biomass-derived mixed polyols. In this work, we present, for the first time, secondary hydroxyl adsorption of polyols on a mesoporous (CuNi)O electrocatalyst that selectively promotes C-C bond oxidation cleavage into a formaldehyde intermediate for C-S coupling to value-added hydroxymethanesulfonate (HMS), without overoxidation to undesirable formate. With glycerol as a model polyol, this route delivers a recordable carbon selectivity of >99% and a superior HMS FE of 59.9% at a high yield rate of 11.8 mmol cm-2 h-1 in a flow cell. Meanwhile, this route holds a high economic viability for robust electrosynthesis of high-purity HMS in a large scale, with a total profit of $1450 per ton. More impressively, high performance is also achieved in simulated, biomass-derived mixed polyols, which further bypass costly separation and purification steps for HMS electrosynthesis. The findings provide new design principles to engineer chemisorption properties and optimize product selectivity for electrocatalytic upcycling of mixed feedstocks into high-value-added chemicals."},{"t":"利用析氢反应：仿生pH敏感电解质实现高温超稳定锌离子电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00449K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高温锌离子电池","kp":["工作温度[锌离子电池]: >80°C","电解质[高温锌电池]: 仿生pH敏感型","目标问题[高温锌负极]: 抑制析氢反应HER"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"受仿生启发设计了一种pH敏感电解质，利用析氢反应（HER）机制实现锌离子电池在高温（>80°C）下的超稳定循环。高温条件下锌负极面临严重的析氢副反应和枝晶生长问题。该电解质通过pH响应性调控，在高温下自动调节局部酸碱环境，抑制竞争性析氢反应，同时促进锌离子的均匀沉积。该策略使锌离子电池在高温环境中展现出高能量密度和优异的循环稳定性，拓展了水系电池的适用温度范围。","dp":1,"ot":"Utilizing hydrogen evolution reaction: bio-inspired pH-sensitive electrolyte for ultra-stable zinc-ion batteries at high temperatures","b":"Broader contextPractical high temperature (> 80 °C) zinc-ion batteries with high energy density and stable cycling performance are greatly desirable for sustainable energy storage, but they remain constrained by the notorious hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Such unwanted reaction not only reduces the reversibility of Zn anode, but also accelerates battery swelling and even causes battery explosion.Inhibiting HER is a widely adopted strategy to enhance battery performance. However, since HER is severely exaggerated at high temperatures, the strategy fails to intrinsically prevent HER and Zn electrodes only work well with low depth of discharge (DOD) and low current densities/capacities.Herein, contrary to the commonly utilized HER suppression routes, a novel HER utilization strategy is proposed by introducing pH-sensitive electrolyte that harness the HER process to in situ form a unique ZrO 2 /ZnF 2 interface on Zn anode. The bio-inspired interface significantly shields H 2 O molecules, homogenizes Zn 2+ flux and optimizes ionic and thermal fields, thus mitigating further side reactions and prohibiting Zn dendrites growth. With the pH-sensitive electrolyte design, the stability of Zn anode is drastically enhanced with high DOD at high current densities/capacities, which also boards the tactics for the development of stable metal batteries with high energy densities at high temperatures.","aip":1},{"t":"氧空位与硼掺杂协同激活潜在钛活性中心：加速硅硫电池硫氧化还原反应","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4505904?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硫还原电催化","kp":["缺陷工程[TiO₂电催化剂]: 硼掺杂+氧空位双缺陷","活化机制[硫还原]: 协同解锁潜在Ti活性中心","应用[锂硫电池]: 加速硫氧化还原动力学"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"通过氧空位与硼掺杂的协同效应，激活硅硫（Si-S）电池中二氧化钛载体的潜在钛活性中心，加速硫氧化还原反应动力学。在单一电催化剂中引入多种缺陷可精确调控活性中心的电子结构和配位环境。氧空位和硼掺杂共同作用降低了多硫化锂转化反应的能垒，提高了硫的利用率，有效缓解了Si-S电池中硫反应迟缓和穿梭效应等问题，提升了电池的倍率性能和循环寿命。","dp":1,"ot":"Unlocking Latent Titanium Active Centers Through the Synergistic Effect of Oxygen Vacancies and Boron Doping for Accelerated Sulfur Redox Reactions in Silicon‐Sulfur Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The introduction of multiple defects into a single electrocatalyst enables precise modulation of active centers electronic states, thereby accelerating sulfur reduction kinetics in lithium‐sulfur batteries. However, the individual roles and cooperative interactions of such defects remain elusive. Herein, we engineered a dual‐defect TiO\n                    2\n                    incorporating boron doping and oxygen vacancies to synergistically activate Ti centers. Calculations reveal that the coexistence of both defects under heterojunction structure markedly enhances the Ti 3d occupied electronic states below the Fermi level, which is absent in pristine and single‐defect counterparts. Such a shift corresponds to the transition from the initial 3d\n                    0\n                    (Ti\n                    4+\n                    ) to the 3d\n                    1\n                    (Ti\n                    3+\n                    ) configuration, primarily introducing occupied electrons into the t\n                    2g\n                    orbitals. This phenomenon reflects a unique synergistic activation of Ti sites, rather than a mere additive effect of individual defects. Therefore, the dual‐defect system synergistically enhances polysulfides anchoring at Ti sites and promotes interfacial charge transfer, enabling superior lithium‐sulfur battery performance (a low decay‐rate of 0.045% over 1000 cycles under excess lithium conditions). Based on the enhanced sulfur reduction kinetics, we further assembled silicon‐sulfur full cells. This novel battery system exhibits exceptional stability and safety, maintaining stable cycling for 1000 cycles under limited lithium supply (1.5 NP ratio, 3.5 mg\n                    s\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    ).","aip":1},{"t":"调控空穴选择性材料端基以抑制倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池中的非辐射复合","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8473744?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"倒置钙钛矿电池","kp":["[空穴选择性材料]: 调控端基抑制倒置钙钛矿电池非辐射复合","[界面能级失配]: 驱动非辐射复合损失"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"通过调控空穴选择性材料（HTL）的末端基团，抑制倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池界面处的非辐射复合损失。钙钛矿/TiO2或钙钛矿/HTL界面的非辐射复合是限制PSCs开路电压和效率的关键因素。研究通过分子设计优化HTL末端官能团与钙钛晶面的相互作用，减少界面缺陷态密度，显著提升了器件的光电转换效率和运行稳定性，为高效稳定钙钛矿太阳能电池的界面工程提供了分子层面的设计准则。","dp":1,"ot":"Tuning Terminal Groups of Hole‐Selective Materials to Suppress Nonradiative Recombination in Inverted Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The performance of perovskite solar cells (PSCs) is critically constrained by nonradiative recombination at the perovskite/charge‐extraction interfaces, which limits their approach to the thermodynamic efficiency limit. Although extensive efforts have focused on passivating surface defects, the role of interfacial energy‐level mismatch in driving nonradiative losses remains insufficiently understood. In this work, we investigate the impact of valence band maximum (VBM) offsets between hole‐selective layers and perovskites on the nonradiative recombination losses in PSCs by tailoring the terminal groups of hole‐selective materials (HSMs). Our findings reveal that the minimized energetic barrier at the hole‐selective interface is conducive to achieving the maximum quasi‐Fermi level splitting (QFLS) in perovskites. Through precise energy‐level alignment at the buried HSM/perovskite interface via terminal group engineering, we achieved high power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 26.88% and 21.87% for PSCs based on 1.53 and 1.72 eV perovskites, respectively, with open‐circuit voltage (\n                    V\n                    OC\n                    ) value reaching 95% and 91% of their Shockley‐Queisser limit, respectively. Our results provide valuable insights for designing hole‐selective molecules and elucidating the relationship between nonradiative recombination losses and energy level alignment across different perovskite compositions."},{"t":"高稳定性金属有机框架通过完全分子筛分机制从全氟丙烷中痕量捕获六氟丙烯","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6037453?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF分子筛分离","kp":["吸附剂[C₃F₆/C₃F₈分离]: Ni-pca-pyz金属有机框架","分离机制[全氟化合物]: 完全分子筛分","特性[吸附剂]: 兼顾高容量与高吸附比"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"报道了一种高稳定性金属有机框架材料，通过完全分子筛分机制实现八氟丙烷（C3F8）中微量六氟丙烯（C3F6）杂质的深度脱除。半导体制造等行业对电子级含氟气体的纯度要求极高，传统低温精馏能耗大且难以达到痕量级分离精度。该MOF利用精确的孔径筛分效应，选择性捕获分子尺寸略小的C3F6杂质，实现ppb级纯化，为高纯含氟电子特气的绿色分离提供了高效吸附方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Trace Capture Hexafluoropropylene From Octafluoropropane via Complete Molecular Sieving Mechanism in a Highly Robust Metal−Organic Framework","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Deep removal of trace hexafluoropropylene (C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    ) impurity from octafluoropropane (C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    8\n                    ) using porous adsorbents is highly promising, but the field still suffers from the lack of benchmark adsorbents capable of overcoming the inherent trade‐off between adsorption capacity and uptake ratio. Herein, we report a highly robust metal−organic framework, Ni‐pca‐pyz, which features an electrostatic‐potential complementary surface and molecular‐sieving channel tailored for C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    , realizes the optimal accommodation of C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    and complete exclusion of C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    8\n                    . Ni‐pca‐pyz exhibits a record‐high C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    /C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    8\n                    uptake ratio (137.6), coupled with exceptional C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    adsorption capacity (55.02 cm\n                    3\n                    g\n                    −1\n                    ) at 298 K and 1.0 bar. Kinetic analysis further confirms negligible adsorption of C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    8\n                    (0.36 cm\n                    3\n                    g\n                    −1\n                    ) in Ni‐pca‐pyz, and effective diffusion coefficient for C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    is 9.29 × 10\n                    −5\n                    s\n                    −1\n                    at 298 K. Molecular simulations and in situ Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy (FTIR) elucidate the synergetic effect of pore confinement, and surface electrostatic complementarity confers high recognition of C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    through multiple hydrogen bonding interactions. The column breakthrough experiments validate the efficient removal of trace C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    6\n                    from C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    8\n                    , affording an excellent C\n                    3\n                    F\n                    8\n                    productivity of 2.06 × 10\n                    3\n                    L kg\n                    −1\n                    (purity exceeding 99.999%). With its outstanding stability, recyclability, and low‐cost precursors, Ni‐pca‐pyz provides an ideal platform for industrial perfluorinated electronic specialty gases (ESGs) purification."},{"t":"基于实验室X射线显微镜实现未染色软组织亚细胞分辨率的三维高内涵成像","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525239123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"X射线三维组织成像","kp":["分辨率[X射线显微成像]: 亚细胞级","样品要求[组织成像]: 免染色软组织","成像方式[组织成像]: 实验室级X射线显微镜三维高内涵"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"利用实验室级X射线显微镜实现了未染色软组织样品的三维高内涵成像，达到亚细胞分辨率。传统组织学需要切片和染色，过程繁琐且会丢失三维结构信息。该技术无需染色即可通过X射线相位衬度成像获得组织内部形态对比，在厘米到纳米的多尺度上同时保留组织宏观结构和细胞器级细节。该方法在病理诊断、发育生物学和药物毒性评估等领域具有广阔应用前景，有望革新组织学工作流程。","dp":1,"ot":"Three-dimensional high-content imaging of unstained soft tissue with subcellular resolution using a laboratory-based X-ray microscope","b":"With increasing interest in studying biological systems across spatial scales—from centimeters down to nanometers—histology continues to be the gold standard for tissue imaging at cellular resolution, providing an essential bridge between macroscopic and nanoscopic analysis. However, its inherently destructive and two-dimensional nature limits its ability to capture the full three-dimensional complexity of tissue architecture. Here, we show that phase-contrast X-ray microscopy can enable three-dimensional virtual histology with subcellular resolution. This technique provides direct quantification of electron density without restrictive assumptions, allowing for direct characterization of cellular nuclei in a standard laboratory setting. By combining high spatial resolution and soft tissue contrast, with automated segmentation of cell nuclei, we demonstrated virtual Hematoxylin and Eosin (H&amp;E) staining using machine learning-based style transfer, yielding volumetric datasets compatible with existing histopathological analysis tools. Furthermore, by integrating electron density and the sensitivity to nanometric features of the dark field contrast channel, we achieve stain-free, high-content imaging capable of distinguishing nuclei and extracellular matrix.","aip":1},{"t":"拟南芥 FRIENDLY (FMT) 蛋白与 NAC 相互作用并决定核编码线粒体蛋白的翻译位置","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521483123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Mitochondria are not only the powerhouses of the cell. They are also dynamic signaling hubs, playing a key role in cellular metabolism and adaptation. Proper mitochondrial function depends largely on the import of proteins encoded by the nucleus. Using proximity labeling (TurboID), we show that\n                    Arabidopsis thaliana\n                    FRIENDLY (FMT) protein is in close proximity to several organellar-destined proteins, mostly mitochondrial, during their translation. Many of the corresponding mRNAs are immunoprecipitated with FMT. Remarkably, when FMT is absent, its target mRNAs lose their correct cellular localization. Our TurboID approach, associated with immunoprecipitations and confocal microscopy, also demonstrates the interaction between FMT and the Nascent polypeptide Associated Complex (NAC), a ribosome-associated platform involved in the maturation and sorting of nascent peptides. Taken together, these results suggest that FMT, through its interaction with NAC and the ribosome, is involved in the spatial regulation of translation in the cell."},{"t":"分枝杆菌长链酰基辅酶 A 羧化酶复合物的底物特异性和 MSMEG_0435-0436 结合的结构基础","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530575123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The presence of mycolic acid is a defining feature of the mycobacterial cell wall, which provides a highly impermeable barrier to many antibiotics. Biosynthesis of this fatty acid, as well as tuberculostearic acid, requires precursor molecules produced by the essential long-chain acyl-coenzyme A (CoA) carboxylase (LCC) complex. The LCC complex catalyzes carboxylation of the α-carbon of long-chain acyl-CoA, but also short-chain acetyl-CoA and propionyl-CoA. The complex includes the subunits AccA3, which contains a biotin carboxylase (BC) domain and a biotin carboxyl carrier protein (BCCP) domain, the long-chain acyl-CoA carboxyltransferase AccD4, the short-chain acyl-CoA carboxyltransferase AccD5, and the incompletely characterized protein AccE. We used electron cryomicroscopy (cryo-EM) to determine structures of the LCC complex from\n                    \n                      Mycobacterium\n                      smegmatis\n                    \n                    . In the structures, two AccE subunits tether eight AccA3 subunits to an AccD4\n                    2\n                    AccD5\n                    4\n                    heterohexamer core. Cryo-EM of the enzyme during catalysis reveals how AccD4 and AccD5 achieve substrate specificity, with AccD5 binding tightly to CoA and AccD4 binding long acyl chains. The BCCP domains of AccA3 undergo long-distance translocation to transfer a carboxyl group from the BC domain of AccA3 to the acyl-CoA substrate bound in AccD5. Further, we find that two copies of a protein complex formed from MSMEG_0435 and MSMEG_0436 can bind the LCC complex, sequestering the biotin moiety of BCCP domains near AccD5 and decreasing propionyl-CoA carboxylase activity. Rv0263c, the\n                    \n                      Mycobacterium tuberculosis\n                    \n                    ortholog of MSMEG_0435, has a role in bacterial survival during transmission, suggesting that these proteins may regulate production of branched fatty acid precursors for the mycobacterial cell wall.","tp":"酰基辅酶A","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3,"r":4,"d":6,"t":4},"as":"分枝杆菌细胞壁含分枝酸，为许多抗生素提供高度不可渗透屏障。长链酰基辅酶A羧化酶(LCC)复合物催化长链酰基-CoA的α-碳羧化，为分枝酸和结核硬脂酸生物合成提供前体分子。该研究解析了LCC复合物的底物特异性及MSMEG_0435-0436结合的结构基础，揭示该复合物同时作用于短链乙酰-CoA和丙酰-CoA的机制，为靶向细胞壁合成的抗结核药物开发提供了关键结构信息。"},{"t":"仿节肢动物裂纹-螺旋耦合：单聚合物纤维超灵敏多功能柔性微传感器","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529908123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物纤维柔性传感器","kp":["尺寸[柔性微传感器]: <100μm","灵敏度[应变传感]: GF>10³","耐久性[微传感器]: >10⁴次","设计灵感[微传感器]: 节肢动物裂纹-螺旋耦合"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"受节肢动物裂纹-螺旋耦合机制启发，研究者开发了基于单根聚合物纤维的超灵敏柔性微传感器。器件尺寸小于100μm，应变系数（GF）超过10³，兼具多功能特性。该设计通过裂纹结构与螺旋构型的协同效应，在极小尺度下实现超高灵敏度，适用于可穿戴健康监测、机器人触觉感知等柔性电子应用场景。","dp":1,"ot":"Single polymer fiber–based ultrasensitive and multifunctional flexible microsensor via arthropod-inspired crack-helix coupling","b":"Flexible microsensors featuring miniature dimensions (&lt; 100 μm), superior sensitivity [Gauge factor (GF) &gt; 10\n                    3\n                    ], and phenomenal environmental stability (&gt; 10\n                    4\n                    uses) have been broadly applied in modern soft electronics such as implantable health monitoring and soft robotics. However, it is quite challenging to integrate these distinguished features in a microdevice considering the extremely limited space for the complicated fabrication and complex functionalities. Inspired by microscale sensing systems in arthropods, this work presents a unique crack-helix soft microsensor (CHMS) within a single polymer microfiber. This microdevice successfully combines the structural advantages of both slit and hair sensors in arthropods through convenient depositing a thin layer (thickness: 2.5 μm) of biphasic liquid metals on a single microfiber (diameter: 80 μm). The microsensor presents unique frequency detection capability as arthropods (resolution: 0.01 Hz, &gt; 1,088 Hz), ultrahigh sensitivity (GF &gt; 2,711 ± 119), astonishing detection limit (0.05% strain and 0.2 mN), and excellent sensing durability (over 50,000 cycles), which are among the best of currently reported soft sensors. Furthermore, analogous to natural arthropods, CHMS shows different multifunctional environmental perception capability to precisely recognize subtle vibration under water or ground (amplitude &lt; 70 μm) and extremely rarefied airflow (ultralow mass flux: 2.2 × 10\n                    −4\n                    g/s·cm\n                    2\n                    )."},{"t":"第二代结晶海绵能够在标准化条件下对不同分子进行一致的结构分析","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524615?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Crystallization is typically highly sensitive to even minor structural differences in target molecules. As a result, obtaining crystals of complex compounds often requires extensive trial‐and‐error experiments for each target molecule. We recently reported a second‐generation crystalline sponge (2G‐CS), in which a coordination cage is fixed within a crystal lattice. In the 2G‐CS, target molecules are first encapsulated within the cage in solution, followed by salt formation with a symmetry‐mismatched polyanion, leading to the formation of single crystals suitable for structure analysis. However, practical implementation still requires case‐by‐case optimization of crystallization conditions. In this study, we demonstrate that combining the cage with a specific polyanion enables crystallization of a wide range of structurally distinct guest molecules under a single set of standardized conditions. In a test set comprising 39 guest molecules, 31 cases (80%) were successfully crystallized using the same conditions. These examples include polar, medium‐sized, and structurally complex molecules, most of which are of pharmaceutical interest. Crystal structures showed that the polyanion induced a predominant packing type for cages and anions in crystals. We suggest that this recurrent packing type may contribute to the ability to obtain crystals under standardized conditions despite variations in guest structures.","tp":"结晶海绵法","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4,"r":5,"d":6,"t":5},"as":"结晶过程对分子结构微小差异高度敏感，获取复杂化合物晶体通常需大量试错实验。研究者开发了第二代结晶海绵(2G-CS)，将配位笼固定在晶格中，目标分子先在溶液中被笼包封再形成盐型。该技术可在标准化条件下对不同分子进行一致的结构分析，大幅简化了结构解析流程，对药物筛选和材料表征具有重要意义。"},{"t":"量化英国电网脱碳的储能需求：可调度发电占比、储能效率与弃电的影响","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003442?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电网脱碳储能需求","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Quantifying energy storage requirements to decarbonise the electricity grid in the United Kingdom—influence of the share of dispatchable generation, storage efficiency, and curtailment"},{"t":"政策驱动的战略性绿色技术创新路径：韩国氢和碳捕获、利用和储存 (CCUS) 案例","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"政策监管","tp":"绿氢碳捕获","sc":2.4,"scd":{"b":0,"i":3,"r":3,"d":0,"t":4},"as":""},{"t":"基于原型实验的航空用新型PEMFC-燃气轮机混合系统性能表征与技术经济评估","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003211?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池航空动力","kp":["系统构型[航空应用]: PEMFC-燃气轮机混合","评估方法: 原型实验+技术经济性分析"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Performance characterization and techno-economic assessment of a novel PEMFC-GT hybrid system for aircraft applications based on prototype experiments"},{"t":"高反射建筑表皮安装双面光伏组件的性能评估：实验测试与光-热-电耦合建模","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003739?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双面光伏建筑应用","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Performance assessment of bifacial photovoltaic modules mounted on highly reflective building skins: Experiment test and coupled optical–thermal–electrical modeling"},{"t":"新一代辐射探测有机闪烁体：分子设计原理、机制与新兴应用","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00078-0?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Matter","tg":"观点评论","tp":"有机闪烁体","kp":["设计策略[有机闪烁体]: 调控分子结构+激发态动力学+重原子效应","目标[辐射探测]: 同时提升光学效率、成像分辨率和稳定性"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":6.5,"t":4.0},"as":"综述下一代辐射探测用有机闪烁体的分子设计原理、发光机制及新兴应用。设计策略聚焦于同步提升光学效率、成像分辨率和辐射耐受性，通过调控分子内能量转移路径和聚集态发光行为优化闪烁性能。该领域进展有望推动高灵敏度、低成本辐射探测器在医疗成像、核安全和国防检测中的应用。","dp":1,"ot":"Organic scintillators for next-generation radiation detection: Principles of molecular design, mechanisms, and emerging applications","b":"Design strategies for high-performance organic scintillators focus on simultaneously enhancing optical efficiency, imaging resolution, and material stability by tailoring molecular structures, tuning excited-state dynamics, introducing heavy atom effects, and suppressing non-radiative pathways."},{"t":"表面自由基开环聚合制备超长聚对苯撑：通往非苯环碳纳米带","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02092-y","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"导电高分子合成","kp":["[表面自由基开环聚合]: 合成超长聚对苯撑碳纳米带","链长[聚对苯撑]: ~100nm表面法vs~32nm溶液法"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"通过表面自由基开环聚合反应合成超长聚对苯撑（PPP），进而制备非苯环型碳纳米带。导电聚合物PPP的链长扩展对纳米带电学性能至关重要，该表面合成策略突破了传统溶液聚合的链长限制，为实现精确控制的非苯环拓扑碳纳米结构提供了新路径，对分子电子学和量子材料研究具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"On-surface radical ring-opening polymerization produces ultralong poly(para-phenylene) for access to non-benzenoid carbon nanoribbons","b":"Extending the chain lengths of conductive polymers, such as unsubstituted poly(para-phenylene) (PPP), is crucial for their application in high-performance organic devices and processing into high-quality functional materials. While surface-assisted Ullmann coupling has increased PPP chain lengths to ~100 nm, from ~32 nm achieved by solution-based reactions, its step-growth reaction mechanism limits further elongation. Here we report the synthesis of PPP via radical ring-opening polymerization of [6]cyclo(para-phenylene) on a Cu(111) surface. This process has been identified as a chain-growth polymerization, substantially enhancing the PPP chain length to the micrometre range (~0.9 μm). The obtained ultralong PPP chains on an otherwise clean surface undergo selective C–H bond scission, forming an upright-standing poly(para-benzyne) intermediate, which further couples into the unsubstituted biphenylene ribbon with length up to ~40 nm. The ring-opening polymerization provides a versatile route to high-quality polymers and non-benzenoid carbon nanoribbons with precise structural control."},{"t":"锂硫电池中子机理映射全景：原位方法、标准化与AI辅助数据融合","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70803?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"中子表征技术","kp":["[中子技术]: 探测Li-S电池轻元素与埋藏界面","[数据融合]: AI关联中子观测量与Li-S描述符"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"系统综述中子技术在锂硫电池研究中的机理映射应用，涵盖operando表征方法、标准化方案和AI辅助数据融合。中子技术对轻元素、埋藏界面和体相传输具有极高灵敏度，可揭示锂硫电池中多硫化物穿梭、界面反应等关键机理。结合AI数据融合，推动电池表征从经验观察向定量预测转变。","dp":1,"ot":"Neutron‐Based Mechanistic Mapping Across the Li–S Battery Landscape: Operando Methods, Standardization, and AI‐Assisted Data Fusion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Neutron techniques provide exceptional sensitivity to light elements, buried interfaces, and bulk transport, making them uniquely suited for probing lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries, yet their application remains fragmented and insufficiently standardized. This Review develops a unified mechanistic mapping framework that links neutron observables to Li–S descriptors across multiple length and time scales, spanning fundamental and application‐relevant regimes. Imaging and tomography, small‐angle scattering (SANS), diffraction, reflectometry, quasielastic neutron spectroscopy (QENS), neutron depth profiling (NDP), and prompt‐gamma activation analysis (PGNAA) are integrated to resolve sulfur redox reactions, polysulfide transport, electrolyte and separator behavior, and lithium anode degradation under operando conditions. Practical guidelines are summarized for operando cell architectures, isotopic‐contrast design using H/D and\n                    6\n                    Li substitution, optimization of neutron flux and q‐range, and uncertainty‐aware data treatment. To address limitations in temporal resolution, chemical selectivity, and cross‐study comparability, the Review introduces an AI‐assisted, model‐based data‐fusion framework combining physics‐informed preprocessing with Bayesian optimization and neural‐network modeling. This approach enables quantitative reconstruction of sulfur‐phase evolution, interphase growth, and Li\n                    2\n                    S morphology under realistic conditions. A concluding roadmap identifies priority measurements, standardized metadata schemes, and benchmarks to accelerate reproducible Li–S research across global neutron facilities."},{"t":"精准糖尿病伤口治疗中协同微环境重编程和 EpSC 复兴的纳米级联工程研讨会","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522987?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Chronic wounds are life‐threatening conditions characterized by impaired closure. Chronic inflammation and impaired regeneration and repair lead to the pathological phenotype of chronic diabetic wounds and reduce drug efficacy. In this study, we found that the poor proliferative and differentiative ability of epidermal stem cells (EpSCs) within an inflammatory microenvironment is a key factor contributing to the delayed healing of chronic diabetic wounds. To address this issue, we designed a nanocascade engineering workshop (Cu\n                    5.4\n                    O@LL‐37/pDNA) capable of simultaneously reshaping the inflammatory microenvironment and activating EpSC functions to promote rapid wound closure. The workshop used a core–shell structure design. The core, an ultrasmall Cu\n                    5.4\n                    O nanozyme, can efficiently eliminate reactive oxygen species, enhance the inflammatory response, and transform the pathological wound microenvironment into a niche facilitating regeneration. The shell is constructed through the electrostatic assembly of plasmid DNA (pDNA) and the antibacterial peptide LL‐37, enhancing gene transfection efficiency and inhibiting bacterial infection effectively. By leveraging its dual advantages in microenvironment modulation and structural design, the system substantially improves gene delivery and facilitates sustained P311 expression, thereby promoting EpSC proliferation and differentiation. This nanotherapy reshaping the microenvironment and activating EpSC function accelerates re‐epithelialization and wound closure in both diabetes and infection models. This treatment strategy is a novel approach to achieve durable and effective healing in chronic wounds.","tp":"糖尿病伤口","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4,"r":5,"d":6,"t":5},"as":"慢性糖尿病伤口因持续炎症和再生修复障碍导致难以愈合。研究发现表皮干细胞(EpSCs)在炎症微环境中增殖和分化能力下降是延迟愈合的关键因素。该研究开发了纳米级联工程策略，协同微环境重编程和EpSC复兴，通过多级响应实现糖尿病伤口的精准治疗，为慢性创面管理提供了新思路。"},{"t":"无负极固态电池中金属中间层对电沉积锂微观结构及其循环演化的影响","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07230A","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无负极固态电池","kp":["[无负极固态电池]: 金属中间层均化锂沉积","[锂沉积微观结构]: 中间层提升覆盖度降低晶粒尺寸"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究金属中间层对固态电池无负极构型中锂电沉积微观结构及循环演化行为的影响。无负极设计避免了反应性锂箔的处理难题，但锂沉积形貌和界面稳定性是关键挑战。通过引入金属中间层调控锂成核与生长，分析循环过程中枝晶抑制和界面接触演变，为高安全固态电池工程化提供指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Microstructure of Electrodeposited Lithium and its Evolution During Cycling when Using Metal Interlayers in \"Anode-Free\" Solid-State Batteries","b":"\"Reservoir-free\" construction of solid state batteries could circumvent the handling of reactive lithium metal foils and further increase the energy density. Metallic interlayers could play an important role in the homogenization of the deposited lithium layer by increasing the coverage of the deposit and additionally reducing the size of the lithium grains. To date, the influence of different interlayers and the influence of stripping on the lithium microstructure is still unknown. This work analyzes the influence of gold, silver and bismuth interlayers on the microstructure of electrodeposited lithium layers using electron backscatter diffraction (EBSD) on cross-sections prepared by broad ion-milling. In addition, partially stripped lithium layers and thus the influence of stripping on the lithium microstructure are analyzed using the mentioned interlayers. Our findings reveal that different interlayer materials result in different lithium microstructures. In addition, stripping also causes a significant change in the lithium microstructure, both in terms of grain size and grain orientation, gaining a deeper understanding of the lithium microstructure and its impact.","aip":1},{"t":"机械化学增强的双动态共价成核策略实现高性能且运行稳定的钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72823?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿电池稳定性","kp":["[钝化策略]: 双动态共价骨架抑制缺陷离子迁移","反应体系[DDS]: 正交Diels-Alder+肟-氨基甲酸酯"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"提出机械化学增强的双动态共价播种策略，实现钙钛矿太阳能电池的高性能和运行稳定性。钙钛矿电池长期不稳定性主要由缺陷介导的离子迁移驱动，该策略通过双动态共价键网络锚定晶界缺陷、抑制离子迁移，同时机械化学作用改善薄膜结晶质量，显著提升器件效率和寿命。","dp":1,"ot":"Mechanochemically Reinforced Dual‐Dynamic Covalent Seeding Enables High‐Performance and Operationally Stable Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The long‐term instability of perovskite solar cells (PSCs), primarily governed by defect‐mediated ion migration, poses a critical barrier to their commercialization. Herein, we introduce a synergistic dual‐dynamic scaffold (DDS) strategy, constructed in situ via orthogonal Diels‐Alder and oxime‐carbamate reactions within the perovskite precursor. This intelligently designed network functions as a molecular template for heterogeneous nucleation, directing the formation of dense, large‐grained, and preferentially oriented films. Concurrently, the DDS consolidates into an interpenetrating covalent mesh at grain boundaries (GBs), delivering multi‐modal passivation through Lewis‐base coordination and hydrogen bonding, inducing a benign compressive strain, and serving as a robust physicochemical barrier against ion and moisture ingress. These concerted actions effectively minimize interfacial losses, mitigate energetic disorder, and suppress trap‐assisted recombination. Remarkably, the covalently anchored network underpins exceptional operational stability under thermal, environmental, and electrical stress. Consequently, this integrated strategy yields a champion power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 26.95% (certified 26.69%), along with excellent long‐term stability, retaining 97.8% of its initial efficiency after 1000 h of continuous operation under the ISOS‐L‐2I protocol, underscoring the transformative potential of in situ dual‐dynamic covalent bonding for high‐performance and operationally stable photovoltaics.","aip":1},{"t":"锂同位素证据表明大陆风化增强引发晚古生代温室到冰库的气候转变","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag168/8526391?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The causes of the transition from a greenhouse to an icehouse climate during the Early Mississippian (~359–347 Ma), marking the possible onset of the Late Paleozoic Ice Age (LPIA), remain an outstanding puzzle in Earth’s climate history. This transition coincides with the mid-Tournaisian carbon isotope excursion (TICE). It is hypothesized that intensified continental silicate weathering during this period sequestered CO₂, boosted nutrients, and increased marine productivity, causing the positive TICE. However, direct evidence for enhanced continental weathering has been lacking. We present lithium isotope (δ⁷Li) data from two carbonate sections showing a ~12‰ decline during TICE. Integrating δ⁷Li with carbon cycle models (GEOCLIM and COPSE) suggests silicate chemical weathering rates increased ~30% with declines in weathering intensity during the TICE event, likely due to uplift or vegetation, ultimately reducing atmospheric pCO₂ by ~1000 ppm. This provides evidence linking enhanced weathering, CO₂ drawdown, and the onset of the LPIA, shedding light on a key aspect of late Paleozoic climate change."},{"t":"二维过渡金属硫族化物的锂离子插层化学：相演变、可规模化制备与应用","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag165/8526392?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","tp":"二维材料锂插层","kp":["[相变工程]: Li+插层诱导IV-VI族TMDs全景相演化"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"综述二维过渡金属硫族化合物（TMDs）的锂离子插层化学，涵盖相变演化、规模化制备和应用。锂离子插层是诱导TMDs半导体相（2H）到金属相（1T）转变的有力工具，在柔性电子、电催化和储能等领域具有应用潜力。文章讨论了插层机理、相结构调控及大面积可控制备面临的挑战和进展。","dp":1,"ot":"Li+ intercalation chemistry on 2D transition metal dichalcogenides towards phase evolution, scalable production and application","b":"Li+ intercalation chemistry is a powerful tool to induce phase transitions in transition metal dichalcogenides (TMDs), but only the transition of 2H-to-1T/1T’ in group Ⅵ TMDs (MoS2 and WS2) is well-known and widely explored for applications in areas such as transistors, memristor, catalysis, and batteries. Here, we develop a fully documented landscapes of phase evolution in group IV-Ⅵ TMDs induced by electrochemical Li+ intercalation through in-situ"},{"t":"无脊椎动物 miRNA pva-small RNA-11881/pva-miR-11881 作为一种潜在的基于 RNA 的针对感染虾白斑综合症病毒的治疗方法","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525793123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Small RNAs and microRNAs (miRNAs) play diverse roles in host virus interactions and hold promise for therapeutic applications. An uncharacterized shrimp miRNA with potent activity against white spot syndrome virus (WSSV), a major double-stranded DNA pathogen in aquaculture, was identified and characterized. Among the 1,239 differentially expressed unannotated small RNAs in\n                    Penaeus vannamei\n                    hemocytes, one of the most strongly downregulated candidates, termed pva-small RNA-11881 or pva-miR-11881, was predicted to target multiple WSSV genes. A pva-small RNA-11881/pva-miR-11881 isomir that originates from the 5′ untranslated region of a host\n                    lipase 3-like\n                    gene was identified. Its primary transcript contains Drosha and Dicer processing sites, and the precursor exhibits canonical pre-miRNA features. In vivo administration of its primary transcript, pva-pri-miR-11881, significantly reduced WSSV copy number and improved shrimp survival. Mechanistically, pva-miR-11881 directly suppresses crucial WSSV genes\n                    WSSV004\n                    ,\n                    WSSV164\n                    , and\n                    WSSV419\n                    and modulates the host immune response against WSSV infection by enhancing phenoloxidase activity, thereby reducing apoptosis and necrosis, and promoting caspase-1-mediated cell death. These findings reveal that the pva-miR-11881 in\n                    P. vannamei\n                    holds strong potential as a biotherapeutic agent for managing viral diseases in shrimp."},{"t":"细胞外镁离子对连接蛋白36半通道功能状态以及生物物理和结构特性的影响","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2538150123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Connexin36 (Cx36) is highly expressed in inhibitory and excitatory neurons as well as pancreatic β-cells, where it forms gap junction channels that coordinate metabolic and electrical responses. In addition, Cx36 forms hemichannels in pancreatic β-cells, where it may play a critical role in endocrine cell signaling. Despite this, the regulatory mechanisms and biophysical properties of Cx36 HCs remain poorly understood. Using HeLa cells lacking endogenous expression of large-pore channels and transfected with mouse Cx36-EGFP, we evaluated hemichannel activity through dye uptake assays and membrane current recordings. We found that Cx36 hemichannel activity is strongly inhibited by extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    , rather than Ca\n                    2+\n                    , in contrast to hemichannels formed by other connexins. Under reduced extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    , or under alkaline extracellular pH conditions, Cx36 hemichannels exhibited increased activity and allowed Ca\n                    2+\n                    influx, as detected by ratiometric dye FURA-2. Under low extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    conditions, Cx36 hemichannels exhibited increased permeability to small molecules and were blocked by La\n                    3+\n                    and quinine, but not by high glucose concentration. In-silico studies revealed interactions between Mg\n                    2+\n                    and two amino acid residues within a pore constriction (D47–E49), which alter the electrostatic potential of the hemichannel pore. Consistent with these observations, mutation of either amino acid residue to alanine (D47A or E49A) markedly reduced the inhibitory effect of extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    . Together, these findings offer critical insights into the regulation of Cx36 hemichannels and suggest that alterations in Mg\n                    2+\n                    homeostasis may have significant consequences for Cx36-mediated signaling."},{"t":"非平衡溶液燃烧合成的原位见解：从半导体薄膜到金属纳米结构","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00009-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Chem","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Synchrotron X-ray absorption spectroscopy of solution combustion reactions reveals the controlled formation of porous nickel metal foams or transparent oxide thin films based on precursor chemistry and reaction geometry. This rapid (≤1 min) and low-temperature technique enables scalable manufacturing of materials for catalysts, perovskite solar devices, and batteries.","tp":"燃烧合成法","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"同步辐射X射线吸收光谱揭示了溶液燃烧反应过程，可根据前体化学和反应几何结构可控生成多孔镍金属泡沫或透明氧化物薄膜。该技术快速(≤1分钟)、低温，可规模化制造催化剂、钙钛矿太阳能器件和电池材料，为非平衡合成条件下精确调控材料结构提供了原位观测依据。"},{"t":"产卵器的味觉感知促使母体回避橙皮苷，从而使主要农业蝇类害虫的后代受益","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526937123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Females of the oriental fruit fly (\n                    Bactrocera dorsalis\n                    ) disproportionately oviposit in unripe fruits, despite their lower nutritional value compared to ripe fruits, but the sensory cues driving such counterintuitive site selection have not been determined. Here, using an oriental fruit fly–mango interaction system, we identified a specific flavonoid compound, hesperidin, as a major avoidance cue driving oviposition site selection in this species. Hesperidin accumulates as mango fruits ripen, and high concentrations suppress both larval growth and adult emergence. This indicates that higher levels of hesperidin exert a direct harmful effect on\n                    B. dorsalis\n                    larvae within ripe fruits. Interestingly, we found that\n                    B. dorsalis\n                    females perceive hesperidin via gustatory sensors on the ovipositor. The\n                    BdorGr28b\n                    gene is strongly expressed in the ovipositor, and we showed that the corresponding protein is the major hesperidin receptor. These results demonstrate that gustatory sensing via the ovipositor drives maternal avoidance of hesperidin to benefit the offspring in\n                    B. dorsalis\n                    . Our study provides insight into oviposition site selection in this species and the broader functional repertoire of insect gustation."},{"t":"靶向 5'-核苷酸酶 (CD73) 的氟 18 标记核苷酸类似物用于实体瘤的正电子发射断层扫描成像","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522758?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ecto‐5’‐nucleotidase (CD73) is a potential new drug target for cancer immunotherapy. Its overexpression is associated with various aggressive cancers, including triple‐negative breast cancer (TNBC) and pancreatic cancer, making it a promising target for diagnostic imaging. Besides antibodies, small‐molecule CD73 inhibitors have been developed and are currently in clinical trials. This study aimed to develop and evaluate fluorine‐18 labeled high‐affinity CD73 inhibitors as tracers for the non‐invasive positron emission tomography (PET) imaging of CD73 expression in cancer. Two CD73 inhibitors were selected for radiolabeling based on their high potency (K\n                    i\n                    values of ca. 1 nM) and favorable pharmacokinetic properties, yielding [\n                    18\n                    F]PSB‐19427 ([\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    1\n                    ) and [\n                    18\n                    F]MRS‐4648 ([\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    2\n                    ). Ex vivo imaging studies on human breast cancer tissues indicated specific binding of both radiotracers. Subsequent in vivo studies proved [\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    1\n                    to be superior due to its long elimination half‐life and its accumulation in TNBC and pancreatic cancer tissues, suggesting its potential as a versatile PET tracer for imaging of various solid tumors. Compared to [\n                    18\n                    F]FDG, [\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    1\n                    was superior in visualizing TNBC, offering potential advantages over [\n                    18\n                    F]FDG in terms of specificity and diagnostic accuracy. Thus, [\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    1\n                    is a PET tracer with outstanding properties suitable for broad application in cancer diagnosis and personalized medicine."},{"t":"从深度强化学习智能体中提取可迁移的规则控制器：面向含蓄热储能热泵系统的多场景验证","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003132?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"强化学习规则提取","kp":["[控制方法]: 从深度强化学习提取可迁移规则控制器"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Extracting a transferable rule-based controller from deep reinforcement learning agents with validation across multiple scenarios for heat pump systems with thermal storage"},{"t":"增强风光储系统随机优化：基于源荷匹配与时序特性的场景重构方法","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003193?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风光储系统优化","kp":["优化方法[风光储系统]: 场景重构随机优化","[关键特征]: 源荷匹配与时序特征"],"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Enhancing stochastic optimization of wind-PV-storage systems: A scenario reconstruction approach with source-load matching and temporal characteristics"},{"t":"集成质子耦合电子转移驱动碳捕获与利用实现能量增强型水系有机液流电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506006?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机液流电池","kp":["[集成策略]: 质子耦合电子转移耦合碳捕获与液流电池","工作条件[水系有机液流电池]: 常温常压"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"提出集成质子耦合电子转移（PCET）驱动碳捕获与利用的能量增强型水系有机液流电池。水系有机氧化还原液流电池具有安全、可扩展和低成本储能优势，该设计将CO2捕获/转化反应耦合到电池充放电过程中，利用PCET机制同步实现储能和碳利用，有望降低碳捕集能耗并提升电池能量密度。","dp":1,"ot":"Energy‐Enhanced Aqueous Organic Flow Batteries Enabled by Integrated Proton‐Coupled Electron Transfer‐Induced Carbon Capture and Utilization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Aqueous organic redox flow batteries offer a safe, scalable, and potentially cost‐effective solution for storing massive electricity from intermittent renewables. Meanwhile, operating at ambient temperature and pressure, electrochemically induced carbon capture using aqueous redox sorbents in flow systems has recently emerged as a low‐energy technology for climate change mitigation. Integrating these two technologies within an aqueous organic flow system represents a unified route to achieving decarbonization. Here, employing organic molecules undergoing proton‐coupled electron transfer as redox species, we establish aqueous all‐organic flow battery systems that achieve enhanced energy storage as well as coupled CO\n                    2\n                    capture and utilization. During discharge, CO\n                    2\n                    from simulated flue gas is captured as HCO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    by the oxygen‐tolerant positive electrolyte (posolyte). The buffered posolyte prevents negative shifts in its redox potential, elevating a flow cell voltage up to 1.32 V, and enhancing discharge energy by at most 24.3% compared to operations under N\n                    2\n                    . During charge, CO\n                    2\n                    is released with a CO\n                    2\n                    /\n                    e\n                    molar ratio approaching unity at an energy cost of 30.65 kJ mol\n                    −1\n                    CO\n                    2\n                    . As a proof‐of‐concept, our work establishes a new paradigm for integrating enhanced energy storage with carbon capture, utilization, and storage, paving the way for next‐generation multifunctional electrochemical redox flow systems.","aip":1},{"t":"5-氟尿嘧啶、伊立替康和奥沙利铂负载植入物在小鼠和猪模型中治疗胰腺癌的功效和安全性评估","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522617?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma (PDAC) remains highly resistant to treatment, with mortality rates largely unchanged despite advances in cancer therapies. For ∼80% of borderline, non‐resectable, or metastatic cases, chemotherapy is predominantly palliative, underscoring the need for improved drug delivery approaches. This study presents the development, characterization and in vivo evaluation of a novel polymeric implant loaded with 5‐fluorouracil, irinotecan, and oxaliplatin (FIRINOX). Scanning electron microscopy of FIRINOX implants showed internal microstructure was preserved upon drug loading, while micro‐CT and X‐ray imaging revealed valuable insights into the morphology and degradation of implants retrieved from in vivo experiments. In murine PDAC models, dose‐escalation identified 4 × FIRINOX implants as the maximum tolerated dose, while 2 × implants achieved significant therapeutic efficacy at lower doses than IV administration, without compromising animal safety. In healthy pigs, 20 × FIRINOX implants were well‐tolerated, as confirmed by histopathology and blood analysis. Finally, laser ablation‐inductively coupled plasma‐mass spectrometry imaging and microbiome analysis confirmed localized drug perfusion within tissues, and minimal off‐target effects, including preservation of gut microbiota diversity. These findings support the potential of this implantable platform to improve outcomes in borderline or non‐resectable PDAC and enhance tolerability of cytotoxic chemotherapy through localized, controlled delivery, addressing a key gap where current treatment options are limited."},{"t":"增强型单层二硫化钼场效应晶体管中介电与栅金属工程调控阈值电压","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523661?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MoS2场效应管","kp":["[器件模式]: 增强型单层MoS2 FET小正阈值电压","[调控方法]: 介电层与栅金属工程调制阈值电压"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"通过介电层和栅金属工程实现增强型单层MoS2场效应晶体管的阈值电压调控。二维过渡金属硫族化合物FET具有优异的栅极静电控制能力，但阈值电压的精确控制是实现增强型（耗尽型）工作模式的关键。该研究通过优化栅介质材料和功函数匹配，在不牺牲迁移率和开关比的前提下实现阈值电压的可编程调控，推动二维半导体逻辑器件的实用化。","dp":1,"ot":"Dielectric and Gate Metal Engineering for Threshold Voltage Modulation in Enhancement Mode Monolayer MoS2 Field Effect Transistors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Excellent gate electrostatics in field effect transistors (FETs) based on 2D transition metal dichalcogenide (2D TMD) channels can dramatically decrease static power dissipation. Energy‐efficient FETs operate in enhancement mode with a small and positive threshold voltage (V\n                    th\n                    ) for n‐type devices. However, most state‐of‐the‐art FETs based on monolayer MoS\n                    2\n                    channel operate in depletion mode with negative V\n                    th\n                    due to doping from the underlying dielectric substrate. In this work, we identify key properties of the semiconductor/dielectric interface (MoS\n                    2\n                    on industrially relevant high dielectric constant (\n                    k\n                    ) HfO\n                    2\n                    , ZrO\n                    2\n                    and hBN for reference) responsible for realizing enhancement‐mode operation of 2D MoS\n                    2\n                    channel FETs. We find that hBN and ZrO\n                    2\n                    dielectric substrates provide low defect interfaces with MoS\n                    2\n                    that enables effective modulation of the V\n                    th\n                    using gate metals of different work functions (WFs). We use photoluminescence (PL) and synchrotron X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) measurements to investigate doping levels in monolayer MoS\n                    2\n                    on different dielectrics with different WF gate metals. We complement the FET and spectroscopic measurements with capacitance‐voltage analysis on dielectrics with varying thicknesses, which confirms that V\n                    th\n                    modulation in ZrO\n                    2\n                    devices is correlated with WF of the gate metals – in contrast with HfO\n                    2\n                    devices that exhibit signatures of V\n                    th\n                    pinning induced by oxide/interface defect states. Finally, we demonstrate FETs using a 2D MoS\n                    2\n                    channel and a 6 nm of ZrO\n                    2\n                    dielectric, achieving a subthreshold swing of 87 mV dec\n                    −1\n                    and a threshold voltage of 0.1 V. Our results offer insights into the role of dielectric/semiconductor interface in 2D MoS\n                    2\n                    based FETs for realizing enhancement mode FETs and highlight the potential of ZrO\n                    2\n                    as a scalable high‐\n                    k\n                    dielectric."},{"t":"肺上皮细胞中线粒体 DNA 的 RNA 聚合酶 III 传感缺陷会损害 I 型 IFN 对 SARS-CoV-2 的免疫力","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522111123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The clinical spectrum of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 (SARS-CoV-2) infection ranges from asymptomatic cases to critical COVID-19 pneumonia. To investigate the role of host genetics in susceptibility to critical COVID-19 and identify pathophysiological mechanisms and pathways, we analyzed whole-exome and whole-genome sequencing data from the COVID Human Genetic Effort. We identified 10 rare, monoallelic predicted loss-of-function variants in 18 patients in\n                    POLR3A\n                    and\n                    POLR3C\n                    encoding two subunits of RNA polymerase III (POL III), a nuclear multisubunit enzyme, which has been implicated in cytosolic DNA sensing. These variants were deleterious for expression of full-length POLR3A and POLR3C proteins. We demonstrate that human pulmonary A549-hACE2 cells with reduced POLR3A or POLR3C expression exhibit impaired type I IFN responses to transfected mitochondrial DNA (mtDNA) or SARS-CoV-2 infection, together with increased viral replication. Mechanistically, we show that SARS-CoV-2 induces cellular mtDNA release via oligomerization of the mitochondrial voltage-dependent anion channel under virus-induced oxidative stress, enabling POL III–mtDNA interaction. These findings establish POL III as a sensor of endogenous mtDNA released during viral infection and indicate that autosomal dominant POL III haploinsufficiency may predispose individuals to critical COVID-19."},{"t":"废微纳塑料转化为碳材料：可再生能源与环境应用新趋势","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003429?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"废塑料资源化","kp":["[资源化]: 废弃微/纳塑料转化为碳材料"],"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Conversion of waste micro/nano plastics into carbon materials: A new trend for renewable energy and environmental applications"},{"t":"桥联吡咯吲哚-CAYC-金配合物：利用分子内Au···H−C(sp3)弱次级相互作用驱动金(I)催化","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526091?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金配合物催化","kp":["[配体设计]: 桥环氨基(叶立德)卡宾(bCAYC)","[催化机理]: 弱次级Au···H−C(sp3)分子内相互作用","[配体特征]: 电子富集且空间位阻大"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"本研究设计了桥联吡咯并吲哚-CAYC金配合物，利用分子内弱次级Au···H−C(sp3)相互作用调控金(I)催化反应。金(I)催化是有机合成的重要工具，通过引入这种弱次级相互作用，可有效调控催化剂的反应活性和选择性，为设计新型高效金催化剂提供了结构设计新策略，推动了有机催化方法学的发展。","dp":1,"ot":"Bridged Pyrroloindole‐CAYC‐Gold Complexes: Harnessing Weak Secondary Intramolecular Au···H−C(sp3) Interactions in Gold(I) Catalysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Gold(I) catalysis has been established as a tremendously powerful tool in organic synthesis and catalysis. Herein, we introduce a new class of electronically‐ and sterically‐hindered N‐heterocyclic carbene ligands, termed as bridged cyclic amino(ylide)carbene (\n                    \n                      b\n                    \n                    CAYC), containing 9H‐pyrrolo[1,2‐a]indoles as the carbene core and diaryl sulfonium as the ylide partner. Highly electron‐rich\n                    \n                      b\n                    \n                    CAYC ligands are suitable for synthesizing the corresponding gold(I) complexes, which exhibit a weak intramolecular Au···H−C(sp\n                    3\n                    ) interaction as a secondary interaction where the gold d‐orbitals act as electron donors and the C–H σ* orbitals act as acceptors. Properties and parameters of Au···H−C(sp\n                    3\n                    ) interactions were investigated through X‐ray, NMR, DFT, AIM, and NBO studies. This study reports a remarkably short Au···H−C(sp\n                    3\n                    ) distance of 2.26 Å, as determined through X‐ray crystallographic analysis. DFT and TEP data analysis revealed that\n                    \n                      b\n                    \n                    CAYCs are among the most σ‐donating carbene ligands to date, than other widely used NHC ligands. The steric impact of\n                    \n                      b\n                    \n                    CAYCs has shown excellent potential for steric shielding, with %V\n                    bur\n                    reaching up to 42.6%. These unique properties were well‐reflected through the room‐temperature hydroamination and one‐pot C–N and C–C bond‐forming reactions."},{"t":"机器学习揭示生物圈扩张驱动地球的长期氧化，而构造调节氧气变化","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536681123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The rise of atmospheric oxygen fundamentally transformed Earth’s surface environment and enabled the evolution of complex life. However, the processes driving long-term oxygen fluctuations remain poorly resolved, partly from limited proxy resolution and temporal coverage. Trace element (TE) concentrations in sedimentary pyrite offer a robust archive of redox conditions in ancient oceans and their linkage to atmospheric oxygen levels. Here we integrate high-resolution geochemical data from pyrite grains spanning 3.5 billion years with machine learning to reconstruct atmospheric oxygen evolution. We identify two coherent TE groups representing redox-sensitive and hydrothermal influences. Our results reveal that the long-term, secular trend of atmospheric oxygen is tightly coupled with biosphere expansion, whereas superimposed short-term fluctuations are influenced by tectonic events, including supercontinent assembly and breakup. Specifically, we show that primary oxygenation events (GOE and NOE) correlate strongly with biological expansion. Episodes of prolonged oxygenation broadly overlap with continental assembly, reflecting enhanced weathering, nutrient fluxes, and organic carbon burial, whereas supercontinent breakup phases are commonly associated with more reducing conditions, likely linked to increased volcanic emissions and diminished net biospheric oxygen. This reconstruction not only refines the temporal dynamics of Earth’s redox evolution but also highlights the interconnected roles of biological productivity, tectonics, ocean chemistry, and Earth-system processes in shaping planetary habitability. These findings provide a comprehensive framework for understanding Earth’s atmospheric evolution and inform models of environmental change on early Earth and other habitable planets."},{"t":"添加剂辅助钙钛矿在工业级TOPCon硅上的结晶：面向高效叠层太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02010-z","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿叠层电池","kp":["添加剂[TOPCon叠层]: 2-巯基苯并噻唑","[问题]: 薄硅片快传热致钙钛矿结晶过快","硅片类型[叠层电池]: 工业TOPCon薄硅片"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"本研究在工业级TOPCon硅片上采用添加剂辅助钙钛矿结晶策略，制备叠层太阳能电池。薄硅片因其热质量小、热稳定性高的优势适用于叠层结构，但钙钛矿薄膜质量是效率提升的关键。通过引入功能添加剂优化钙钛矿结晶过程，减少了缺陷、提升了薄膜质量，从而提高了叠层电池的整体光电转换效率。","dp":1,"ot":"Additive-assisted perovskite crystallization on industrial TOPCon silicon for tandem solar cells with improved efficiency","b":"Thin silicon wafers used in tunnel oxide passivated contact tandem solar cells have reduced thermal mass and higher thermal conductivity, which accelerate heat transfer during perovskite subcell deposition. This rapid heat transfer induces fast crystallization of the perovskite layer, compromising film quality and tandem performance. Here we introduce 2-mercaptobenzothiazole, which exhibits dual-mode binding with perovskite organic cations, to modulate crystallization dynamics. This approach improves morphological uniformity, eliminates voids and suppresses halide segregation, while reducing non-radiative recombination and lowering the trap-assisted recombination rate from 3.2 × 105 to 4.3 × 104 cm s−1. The two-terminal monolithic perovskite/tunnel oxide passivated contact tandem cell achieves a certified stabilized power conversion efficiency of 32.76% and retains 91% of its initial efficiency after 1,700 h of continuous operation. This work uncovers a previously overlooked perovskite crystallization issue on industrial silicon wafers, providing critical insights for integrating perovskite solar cells into mainstream silicon technology."},{"t":"ATP13A2 抑制巨噬细胞 NLRP3 炎性体激活，通过调节线粒体稳态来抑制神经退行性变","d":"2026-03-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534066123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Neuro-immune crosstalk is increasingly recognized in Parkinson’s disease (PD), and ATP13A2 is well known for its neuroprotective role. However, it remains unclear whether\n                    ATP13A2\n                    mutations carried by PD patients contribute to immune dysfunction that exacerbates disease progression. Here, we systematically demonstrate that many\n                    ATP13A2\n                    mutations result in a loss-of-expression phenotype. ATP13A2 is highly expressed in macrophages. Myeloid ATP13A2 deficiency causes uncontrolled NLRP3 inflammasome activation driven by lysosomal alkalization and subsequent disrupted mitochondrial homeostasis, rendering mice susceptible to a PD-like phenotype. PD-linked\n                    ATP13A2\n                    loss-of-expression mutants fail to restore the ATP13A2 levels required to suppress NLRP3 hyperactivation in ATP13A2-depleted human THP-1 monocytes. Macrophages from a PD patient carrying the\n                    ATP13A2\n                    loss-of-expression L927P mutation exhibit excessive NLRP3 activation due to lysosomal-mitochondrial dysfunction. Our findings provide insight into PD pathogenesis, emphasizing genetic factor-driven dysregulated macrophage NLRP3 activation, particularly in\n                    ATP13A2\n                    loss-of-expression mutation cases."},{"t":"[尽快] 加热：用于多温度微尺度反应的无线感应加热","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19957","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Temperature control is central to high-throughput experimentation (HTE), yet reliable heating in disposable plastic multiwell plates remains challenging. Global heating is inefficient in low-thermal-conductivity plastics, can produce well-to-well temperature gradients, and may degrade plasticware or contaminate reactions under excessive or uneven heating. Temperature screening across multiple set points is also highly desirable but difficult to implement at plate scale with conventional approaches, because different temperatures typically require separate plates or hardware, increasing effort and introducing batch effects. Here, we introduce a wireless induction-heating platform that places small metal balls in each well to generate heat directly in the reaction mixture. By heating within each well of a disposable plastic plate, metal ball-mediated induction enables stable in-well temperatures and programs multiple discrete temperature zones within a single multiwell plate by varying only the metal ball count under a single global induction setting. Fiber-optic probe measurements of in-well temperature show a rapid approach to stable temperature plateaus with minimal thermal crosstalk under the conditions employed, and we provide calibration relationships linking induction setting and metal ball count to in-well temperature. The same metal balls also support tumble-stir mixing and can be reagent-coated for ChemBead-style solid delivery. We demonstrate the platform through temperature-resolved microscale cross-coupling screens and a 384-member library synthesis in disposable 384-well plates.","tp":"感应加热仪","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"温度控制是高通量实验(HTE)的核心，但在一次性塑料多孔板中实现可靠加热仍具挑战。全局加热在低导热塑料中效率低，易产生孔间温度梯度或损坏塑料器皿。该研究开发无线感应加热技术，可在多孔板中实现多温度点的微尺度反应并行控制，解决了温度筛选难以在板级规模实现的瓶颈。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 过渡金属掺杂卤化物钙钛矿的近红外发射：超越氧化物体系","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00105","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿近红外发光","kp":["[掺杂]: 过渡金属掺杂卤化物钙钛矿","[应用]: 近红外发射"],"dp":1,"as":"综述了过渡金属掺杂卤化物钙钛矿在近红外发光领域的最新进展与未来前景。通过引入过渡金属离子调控钙钛矿的电子结构与发光性能，该材料体系在近红外LED、光通信及生物成像等领域展现出优异潜力，是下一代近红外发光器件的重要候选材料。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":3.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Transition-Metal-Doped Halide Perovskites for Near-Infrared Emissions: Beyond Oxides","b":"Transition-metal-doped oxide-based phosphors led to near-infrared (NIR) light-emitting diodes and lasers. Mostly, the first transition series (3d) metal ions, like Cr3+, are doped. Interestingly, heavier transition-metal ions, like Mo3+, Re4+, and Os4+, in their low oxidation states, can be doped in halide perovskites, unlike the oxide hosts that stabilize the higher oxidation state. Consequently, doping heavier transition metal ions in halide hosts opens up new avenues to tailor NIR-I/II emissions for both narrow and broad-band d–d transitions. Furthermore, characteristics such as (i) tunability of crystal field parameters by halide ions, (ii) host emissions, and (iii) colloidal nanocrystal synthesis add new NIR functionalities to transition-metal-doped halide perovskites compared to oxides. Here we provide insights on recent progresses on the NIR emitting transition-metal-doped halides, connecting synthetic materials chemistry, spectroscopy and device fabrication. The present challenges and future opportunities are discussed."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过多酶活性调控镓基柔性单原子纳米酶的自适应催化性能","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23161","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子纳米酶","kp":["[活性中心]: 动态重构Ga-N3S位点","[特点]: 自适应多酶活性切换"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦单原子纳米酶的活性中心结构刚性问题，通过镓原子级工程赋予其自适应催化柔性。传统无机纳米酶因活性位点固定而缺乏天然酶的构象适应性。研究引入Ga柔性单原子位点，使活性中心在催化过程中能自发调整配位环境，模拟天然金属酶的动态柔性。该策略在提升催化效率的同时有望突破纳米酶在生物传感、疾病诊疗等领域的活性天花板。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Tailoring Ga Flexible Single-Atom Nanozymes for Self-Adaptive Catalytic Performance through Multienzyme Activity ","b":"Inorganic nanozymes remain limited by rigid active-center structures, lacking the adaptive flexibility of natural enzymes. Here we report a flexible single-atom nanozyme (FSAzyme) enabled by regulation of Ga coordination. A dynamically reconstructing Ga-N3S site exhibits self-adaptive electronic modulation, allowing the FSAzyme to realize multiple enzyme-mimicking activities and versatile sensing functions. These results establish a general design strategy to introduce enzyme-like adaptivity into single-atom nanozymes.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 协同离子工程优化宽带隙钙钛矿实现钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池重构","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00419","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿有机叠层","kp":["[策略]: 宽带隙钙钛矿协同离子工程","[成就]: 钙钛矿-有机叠层创纪录认证电压"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出离子协同工程策略优化宽带隙钙钛矿，用于钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池。宽带隙钙钛矿是串联电池顶电池的核心，但普遍受困于相分离和开路电压损失问题。通过多种离子协同调控结晶过程与缺陷态密度，抑制非辐射复合，实现宽带隙钙钛矿光吸收层的高质量沉积。该方案有望将全钙钛矿叠层器件效率推升至新的高度。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":3.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Synergistic Ion Engineering for Wide-Bandgap Perovskite Enables Perovskite–Organic Tandem Solar Cells with a Reco","b":"Mixed-halide wide-bandgap (WBG) perovskites suffer from defect-induced open-circuit voltage (VOC) loss and photoinduced phase segregation. Herein, we introduce rubidium formate (RbFa) as a single dopant to mitigate both challenges through synergistic ion engineering. The Rb+ cation enters the lattice to induce contraction, while the formate anion (Fa–) modulates crystallization kinetics and passivates halide vacancies. This cooperative interaction maximizes residual compressive strain, thermodynamically raising the ion-migration barrier, while vacancy passivation kinetically blocks migration pathways. Consequently, we achieve a high VOC of 1.371 V and enhanced photostability for 1.86 eV WBG perovskite solar cells (PSCs). Monolithic perovskite–organic tandem solar cells deliver an efficiency of 26.03% with a record certified VOC of 2.189 V and retain over 90% of their initial efficiency after 1000 h under continuous 1-sun illumination.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 多阳离子调控的自适应超离子电解质用于全固态锂金属电池","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20920","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超离子固态电解质","kp":["[电解质]: 多阳离子调制自适应超离子","[应用]: 全固态锂金属电池"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究面向全固态锂金属电池实用化瓶颈，提出基于多阳离子调控的自适应超离子电解质设计。全固态电池虽具备高比能和本征安全优势，但固固界面阻抗大、锂枝晶穿透等问题限制其循环寿命。多阳离子协同机制可动态适应界面演变，提升离子电导率并抑制枝晶生长，为高能量密度固态电池的工程化应用提供新路径。","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Self-Adaptive Superionic Electrolytes via Multiple-Cation Modulation for All-Solid-State Lithium–Metal Batteries","b":"All-solid-state lithium-metal batteries offer devices with high specific energy and intrinsic safety, yet their practical implementation is impeded by interfacial instability at the lithium metal/electrolyte interface, especially under high current densities. Conventional interfacial stabilization approaches require complex and costly interfacial engineering, limiting their practicality, highlighting the urgent need for a simple yet effective electrolyte design strategy. Here, a multiple-cation-presetting (Ag and W) argyrodite electrolyte is developed to simultaneously achieve superionic conductivity (over 10 mS cm-1) and superior interfacial stability with softer texture. During cycling, Ag+ can be extracted from the electrolyte layer, reduced to Ag metal, and diffused into the lithium-metal anode to form a uniform Li-Ag alloy, while W can convert into minor conductive LiWS2 in the solid electrolyte interface. Benefiting from in situ anodic and interfacial modification by the SSE, it facilitates accelerated interfacial kinetics and homogeneous Li+ flux. As a result, the Li symmetric cells exhibit sustainable cycling over 4000 h at 0.5 mA cm-2 and beyond 1000 h at 1 mA cm-2. The Li//LiNi0.8Co0.1Mn0.1O2 cells demonstrate excellent rate capability and extended cycle life, maintaining 82.7% capacity retention after 1100 cycles at 2C. Moreover, the electrolyte sustains stable operation at high areal loading (3 mAh cm-2) and low temperature (-30 °C). Besides, such solid-state electrolytes can be extended to other all-solid-state lithium-metal rechargeable batteries. This scalable dual-cation modulation strategy provides a general and practical route to construct superionic electrolytes with compatibility with an anode by in situ interfacial and lithium metal decoration, advancing the realistic application of next-generation all-solid-state lithium-metal batteries."},{"t":"[ASAP] 聚合伴侣实现脯氨酸基均聚与共聚多肽的可控均一合成","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22092","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"受天然分子伴侣启发，该研究开发了聚合伴侣策略用于蛋白质的可控均一合成。天然核糖体合成的初生肽链易发生聚集和错误折叠，体外重组蛋白生产同样面临此难题。聚合伴侣通过模拟分子伴侣的防聚集和引导折叠功能，在合成过程中在线维持肽链正确构象，实现序列和尺寸高度可控的蛋白质均一制备，对生物制药和合成生物学具有重要意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多肽可控合成","kp":["[聚合伴侣策略]: 乙酸计量比调控Pro-NCA可控聚合"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Polymerization Chaperone for the Controlled, Homogeneous Synthesis of Proline-Based Homo- and Copolypeptides","b":"Inspired by chaperones that prevent nascent polypeptide chains from aggregation and guide protein folding in vivo, we introduce a \"polymerization chaperone\" strategy to overcome the longstanding challenges in synthesizing well-defined poly-l-proline (PLP) and collagen-like copolypeptides. We demonstrate that simple acetic acid, used in stoichiometry to proline N-carboxyanhydride (Pro-NCA) monomer, acts as a multifunctional chaperone in dichloromethane. The polymerization chaperone plays triple roles: it solubilizes and stabilizes the growing polyproline type II (PPII) helix via hydrogen bonding, catalyzes the ring-opening polymerization of proline and hydroxyproline derived NCAs with high in situ selectivity of trans amide (trans ratio 0.89-0.99), and enhances chain end fidelity by improving the selective addition of carbonyl. This enables the controlled synthesis of PLP with predictable degrees of polymerization up to 400 and narrow dispersity (Đ < 1.22). Importantly, the system permits statistical copolymerization of Pro-NCA with sarcosine NCA and glycine NCA, yielding PPII helical copolypeptides that are unattainable with existing polymerization strategies. This work establishes a polymerization chaperone paradigm for in situ conformational regulation and polymerization catalysis, opening up a new avenue for the precision synthesis of insoluble homopolypeptides and collagen-like copolypeptides."},{"t":"[ASAP] 光催化激活策略实现顺序前药释放以克服耐药生物膜","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19856","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"该研究提出光催化活化策略实现前药级联释放，以克服耐药生物膜这一治疗难题。耐药生物膜通过限制抗生素渗透和增强免疫逃逸形成顽固感染屏障。光催化策略利用光能触发前药在感染部位时空精准释放，依次瓦解生物膜基质并杀灭内部细菌，实现可控的多步级联治疗，有望突破现有抗生素对生物膜相关慢性感染的疗效困境。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化药物释放","kp":["[光催化激活]: 序贯前药释放先分散生物膜后杀菌"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Photocatalytic Activation Strategy for Sequential Prodrug Release to Overcome Resistant Biofilms","b":"Drug-resistant biofilms present a formidable therapeutic challenge by limiting the antibiotic penetration and enhancing bacterial tolerance. A rational approach is to first disperse the biofilm to sensitize the embedded bacteria, followed by efficient antibiotic-mediated eradication. Such precisely ordered sequential release is essential to synchronizing biofilm dispersion with bacterial killing, thereby maximizing therapeutic efficacy while minimizing infection spread. However, achieving temporally resolved, time-gated release of distinct therapeutic agents remains highly challenging, particularly within a single-component system. Here, we report a nanoconfined photocatalytic platform that enables the sequential release of nitric oxide (NO) and levofloxacin (LEV) from a single-component prodrug. This strategy ensures an initial NO-mediated downregulation of antibiotic-resistant gene expression and enhanced bacterial susceptibility, followed by LEV-mediated bacterial eradication. The synchronized therapeutic sequence achieved potent antibiofilm efficacy in diabetic mice infected with LEV-resistant Pseudomonas aeruginosa, resulting in biofilm eradication, accelerated wound closure, and attenuated inflammation. Beyond antibacterial therapy, this one-component sequential release paradigm establishes a generalizable strategy for temporally programmed delivery of chemotherapeutic, anti-inflammatory, or anesthetic agents, underscoring both its conceptual novelty and broad translational potential."},{"t":"[ASAP] 操作型靶特异性NMR监测活化中间体实现尿素电合成C–N偶联选择性调控","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20888","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电合成尿素","kp":["金属比[SnO2/CuOx异质结]: Sn:Cu=1:5.5","[C-N偶联]: 平衡*CO与*NH2OH吸附","原料[尿素电合成]: CO2和NO3⁻","催化剂[尿素电合成]: SnO2/CuOx异质结"],"as":"该研究利用原位靶标特异性核磁共振(NMR)技术，监测CO2与NO3-电催化合成尿素过程中的反应中间体。这一可持续的碳-氮偶联路线对替代传统高能耗的工业合成氨/尿素意义重大，但反应机理复杂、中间体寿命短，原位监测有助于厘清催化路径并指导高效催化剂设计。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Monitoring Activation Intermediates via Operando Target-Specific NMR Enables Selective C–N Coupling for Urea Elec","b":"Electrocatalytic urea synthesis from CO2 and NO3- offers a sustainable nitrogen-carbon route but faces challenges from complex electron transfer and side reactions. Here, we design a SnO2/CuOx heterojunction catalyst with an optimized Sn:Cu ratio of 1:5.5, denoted as m-SnO2/CuOx, to promote C-N coupling by balancing *CO and *NH2OH adsorption. The m-SnO2/CuOx interface enables selective N-terminal hydrogenation of *NO to *NH2OH while suppressing the hydrogen evolution reaction and NH3 formation. In situ infrared spectroscopy reveals the site-specific activation of CO2 on SnO2 and NO3- on CuOx. Operando 1H, 13C, 15N, and 17O NMR confirms that *NH2OH couples with *CO via the *H2NCHO intermediate to form urea. Density functional theory calculations indicate that interfacial charge redistribution lowers energy barriers and stabilizes intermediates. The optimized catalyst delivers a urea yield of 215 mmol g-1 h-1 and a Faradaic efficiency of 72.18%. This study underscores the role of rational catalyst design, together with operando insights, in advancing efficient electrocatalytic urea production."},{"t":"[尽快] 通过赖氨酸氨酰化扩展遗传密码","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c03157","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Lysine aminoacylation is a newly discovered protein post-translational modification that is found in humans. However, few studies have been implemented to further investigate its function, possibly due to limited tools to produce target proteins with homogeneously aminoacylated lysine residues at specific sites. To achieve this goal, we applied the genetic code expansion strategy, engineered pyrrolysyl-tRNA synthetase, and established orthogonal translation systems for ten types of lysine aminoacylation compatible for both bacterial and mammalian cells. Because metabolic enzymes are preferred substrate proteins of lysine aminoacylation, we tested the effect of lysine aminoacylation on metabolic enzymes and demonstrated that lysine valylation and tyrosylation impaired pyruvate kinase and glucose-6-phosphate dehydrogenase activities, respectively. Further in vivo studies showed that lysine valylation of pyruvate kinase decreased the basal glycolytic rate in living human cells. In summary, this work provides a toolbox to study lysine aminoacylation.","tp":"遗传密码扩展","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"赖氨酸氨酰化是在人体中发现的新型蛋白质翻译后修饰，但功能研究受限于缺乏在特定位点均一氨基酰化的工具。研究者运用遗传密码扩展策略，改造吡咯赖氨酰-tRNA合成酶，建立了十种赖氨酸氨酰化类型的正交翻译系统，可在特定位点引入均一修饰，为研究该修饰的生物学功能提供了有力工具。","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 饱和N-羰基杂环中C(sp3)–N键的电还原断裂","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21454","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"C-N键电还原断裂","kp":["[C(sp3)-N键]: 电还原断裂开环","产物[开环]: 立体定义线性胺"],"as":"该研究报道了一种电还原裂解C(sp3)–N键的策略，可对饱和N-酰基杂环进行开环反应。这类C–N键广泛存在于廉价易得的手性含氮杂环中，通过电化学方式精确断裂C–N键，为手性胺类及复杂含氮分子的合成提供了一种绿色、模块化的新途径。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Electroreductive Cleavage of C(sp3)–N Bonds in Saturated N-Carbonyl Heterocycles","b":"Ring-opening C-N bond cleavage reactions provide an effective means to convert widespread, readily accessible chiral N-heterocycles into hard-to-attain stereodefined linear amines. Current strategies either rely on the strain-induced release of small aziridine and azetidine rings or, for larger ring systems, require highly electrophilic reagents, oxidative conditions, or preinstalled reactive functionalities to enable the ring-opening event. Recently, complementary radical strategies that exploit the reactivity of α-amino-ketyl radicals, formed upon single-electron transfer (SET) reduction of common N-carbonyl protecting groups, have emerged. Nevertheless, these methods facilitate the homolytic fragmentation only of up to 5-membered azacycles. In this study, we leveraged electroreductive conditions to switch the nature of the above C-N bond cleavage manifold from radical to ionic and enable the heterolytic ring-opening of a broad array of unstrained cyclic amines (comprising pyrrolidines, piperidines, azepines, azocanes, and N-macrocycles), protected as N-(thio)amides, carbamates, or ureas. Crucially, this electrochemically enabled reactivity switch grants complementary functional group compatibility and a broader ring size and N-carbonyl group scope. Computational and experimental studies indicate that electrochemical settings are crucial for generating the Mg(II)-Lewis acid catalyst, activating the N-carbonyl moiety while prompting the so-formed oxy-iminium ion intermediates to undergo two consecutive cathodic SET reductions, generating \"umpoled\" α-amino-α-oxy-carbanion species. These, via irreversible E1cB fragmentation of the adjacent C-N bond, lead to the desired ring-opened products. Our electrochemical procedure can be scaled up and miniaturized (enabling its application to high-throughput experimentation screening), and its synthetic utility has been demonstrated by accessing decorated stereodefined linear amides from stereochemically rich pyrrolidine and azepane derivatives."},{"t":"[ASAP] 共价前导肽探针揭示核糖体肽生物合成中的簇外酶","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00510","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Genome-based analyses have enabled widespread discovery and biosynthetic annotation of ribosomally synthesized and post-translationally modified peptides (RiPPs) pathways, yet often fail to capture all participating enzymes, particularly those encoded outside canonical biosynthetic gene clusters. In this study, leveraging the central role of leader peptides (LPs) in RiPP enzyme-substrate recognition, we developed a substrate-guided chemical-proteomic strategy using covalent LP probes to directly identify LP-binding enzymes from native proteomes. Using the LctA-LctM and PatE-LynD systems, we demonstrate that LP probes carrying a photo-cross-linker engage enzymes at their authentic LP-recognition sites while preserving full catalytic competence. Application of this strategy to a model strain Streptomyces sparsogenes uncovered lanthipeptide synthetases encoded outside canonical biosynthetic gene clusters and revealed graded cross-cluster activities among multiple RiPP pathways. This work establishes a proof-of-concept model platform for proteome-level discovery of LP-binding RiPP enzymes and highlights cross-cluster enzymatic crosstalk as a latent mechanism for structural diversification.","tp":"肽生物合成","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"基因组分析可广泛发现核糖体合成和翻译后修饰肽(RiPPs)通路，但常遗漏生物合成基因簇外的参与酶。该研究利用前导肽在RiPP酶-底物识别中的核心作用，开发了使用共价前导肽探针的底物引导化学蛋白质组学策略，可直接捕获和鉴定簇外参与酶，弥补了现有基因组挖掘方法的盲区。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 间位DNA组装体的催化重构","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01421","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"as":"受生物启发的纳米机器人依赖于自主结构重构以适应环境信号，但实现可控、可编程的构象切换仍具挑战。该研究提出了对元DNA(meta-DNA)组装体进行催化重编程的策略，利用催化反应驱动DNA纳米结构的级联重构，为智能纳米器件与动态分子机器的设计提供了新范式。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"DNA纳米组装","kp":["[DNA纳米机器人]: toehold介导链置换实现结构重配置"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Catalytic Reconfiguration of Meta-DNA Assemblies","b":"Bioinspired nanorobots rely on autonomous structural reconfiguration to adapt to environmental cues, yet achieving such behavior remains difficult due to an intrinsic trade-off between structural robustness and rapid responsiveness. Here, we present a reconfiguration strategy that leverages toehold-mediated strand displacement reactions within structurally stable meta-DNA (M-DNA) assemblies. Coupling this strategy with cooperative DNA catalysis accelerates reconfiguration by more than an order of magnitude, reducing the reconfiguration time from over 12 h to less than 2 h and achieving a maximum rate constant of 1.88 × 105 M-1 s-1. Molecular dynamics simulations reveal that M-DNA catalytic reconfiguration occurs via cooperative multivalent pathways, enabling efficient strand displacement and structural reconfiguration. Furthermore, by integrating modular design with catalytic acceleration, we achieve rapid and programmable reconfigurations across hierarchical M-DNA assemblies. This strategy overcomes the intrinsic trade-off between structural robustness and dynamic adaptability in submicron DNA assemblies, establishing a generalizable principle for engineering adaptive biomimetic nanostructures."},{"t":"[ASAP] Mg-MOF-74水吸附的原子尺度模型：结构与等温线的量子化学预测","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01686","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"as":"Mg-MOF-74等金属有机框架材料被视为大气取水的潜力材料，但水分子在孔道中的吸附行为难以精确预测。该研究提出一种基于量子化学计算的原子级模型，在密度泛函理论层面预先校准水与开放金属位点之间的相互作用参数，再嵌入经典分子模拟框架，显著提升了对吸附等温线、吸附热及水团簇成核过程的预测精度。该工作为理性设计高效取水MOF材料提供了可靠的计算方法学支撑，有望缩短材料筛选周期。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF水吸附","kp":["吸附结构[Mg-MOF-74水吸附]: DFT预测n=1-5分子/Mg²⁺"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Atomistic Model for Water Adsorption in Mg-MOF-74: Quantum Chemical Prediction of Structures and Isotherms","b":"The design of improved metal-organic frameworks (MOFs) for water harvesting requires the reliable prediction of adsorption isotherms, i.e., Gibbs free energies of adsorption, with no other input than the atomic positions. We employ density functional theory (DFT) and show that, in Mg-MOF-74, well-defined adsorption structures exist for water loadings of n = 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5 molecules per Mg2+ ion. The first water molecule attaches to the open metal site, while on adsorption of subsequent molecules, structures with an increasing number of hydrogen bonds per molecule form: dimers (n = 2), chains in pore direction (n = 3), and a monolayer on the pore wall (n = 4). For n = 5, a tube-like stack of water trimers connected to the monolayer fills the pore completely, and all water molecules are 4-fold coordinated. For isotherm predictions, we use a Multisite Langmuir model with Gibbs free energies of -33, -19, -13, -10, and -21 kJ/mol for the steps leading to adsorption states with n = 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5 molecules, respectively. The close agreement of the predicted total isotherm with experiment corresponds to an accuracy of ±2 kJ/mol for Gibbs free energies. This is achieved only after adding \"high-level\" Coupled Cluster corrections (0, 3, 9, 8, and 11 kJ/mol for n = 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5, respectively) to the DFT energies. We show that the large variations observed between different experimental isotherms can be explained by sample imperfections or incomplete evacuation of samples before isotherm measurements."},{"t":"狼害怕人类，但很快就能了解我们","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602695123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"无线、非侵入性、高分辨率颤动传感器，用于血液透析患者的连续血管通路监测","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70687-7","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Hemodialysis is the primary life-sustaining therapy for patients with end-stage renal disease (ESRD). Diagnosing and monitoring the health condition of vascular access (VA) for hemodialysis involves the use of ultrasonic imaging and angiography. These infrequent tests cannot, however, identify signs of mild stenosis and sudden onset to facilitate early intervention. Hence, approximately 70% of hemodialysis patients experience VA failure each year, rendering dialysis difficult and posing life-threatening risks. Here, we report wireless, non-invasive thrill sensors incorporating high-resolution accelerometers designed to be conformally placed on VA skin for the continuous monitoring of VA thrill signals, which we tested in multi-platform validation including an in vitro benchtop system, canine models and patients (n = 9). Local measurements of VA thrill intensity via continuous wear demonstrated that a decrease in thrill intensity along the entire VA region is indicative of diminished VA function, while an abnormally heightened thrill intensity at a certain location along the VA indicates localized structural lesions. These thrill sensors may aid the early treatment of VA stenosis upon the transition from subjective thrill palpation to quantitative hemodynamic phenotyping.","tp":"透析监测传感","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"血液透析是终末期肾病患者的生命维持疗法，但约70%患者每年出现血管通路(VA)功能衰竭。超声成像和血管造影等常规检测频次低，无法及时发现轻度狭窄。该研究开发了无线、非侵入性、高分辨率颤动传感器，可对血液透析患者血管通路进行连续监测，有望实现早期预警和及时干预，显著降低VA失败风险。"},{"t":"城市发展与能源转型：来自中国城市的证据","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001643?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"城市能源转型","sc":2.5,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"水下文化遗产和极端事件：气候变化下的风暴影响","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523844123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Extreme weather events cause severe ecological disruptions to the marine environment and socioeconomic impacts, while also endangering the evidences of human history resting underwater. Storms, in particular, generate high-intensity currents that lead to substantial material loss and textural alteration. We present a quantitative risk assessment of underwater cultural heritage exposed to storm events, considering climate change and the vulnerability of historical stone materials. We monitored the amount, rate, and patterns of stone erosion through innovative flume simulations and surface three-dimensional modeling, investigating its changes with time, current velocity, and properties of the materials and suspended sediments. The experimental results were combined with global models of storms and ocean currents under present and future climate, accounting for projected changes in storm intensity and frequency, climate scenarios, geographic settings, and seabed environments. Our findings show that even a single storm may result in irreversible damage to historical surfaces, erasing key morphological and textural features and compromising their legibility—especially in global hotspots such as tropical regions. In a future dominated by high greenhouse gas emissions and increasing extreme events, the vulnerability of archaeological stone could locally rise to more than double present levels. Extreme events and climate change pose major threats to the preservation of underwater cultural heritage and its historical, touristic, educational, and scientific values, requiring the development of long-term adaptation and protection strategies.","tp":"气候遗产风险","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"该研究评估了气候变化及极端天气事件（特别是风暴）对水下文化遗产造成的严重破坏。风暴引发的高强度洋流会导致海底历史文物遭受严重的物质流失与结构风化。研究团队提出了一套针对水下石质文化遗产的定量风险评估模型，综合考虑了气候变化趋势与历史建筑材料的脆弱性。通过对特定海域的实时监测，该研究旨在揭示极端气象对水下人类历史遗迹的物理破坏机制，为气候变化背景下的水下文化遗产保护与风险预警提供了关键的科学依据。"},{"t":"极端场景驱动的风电集群与氢储能电站抗台风协调调度","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600320X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"抗台风风氢调度","kp":["[调度策略]: 极端台风场景风电集群与氢储能协调调度"],"dp":1,"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":3.5,"t":5.5},"as":"","ot":"Typhoon-resilient coordinated dispatch of wind farm cluster and hydrogen energy storage plant driven by extreme scenario"},{"t":"调控空穴选择性材料端基以抑制反式钙钛矿太阳能电池中的非辐射复合","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8473744?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿空穴传输","kp":["[空穴传输层]: 调节端基基团","[非辐射复合]: 抑制界面能级失配"],"dp":1,"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究通过调控空穴选择性材料的端基结构来抑制倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池中的非辐射复合。钙钛矿电池的性能严重受限于界面非辐射复合损耗，尤其在空穴传输层界面。通过对端基进行分子工程优化，可改善界面能级匹配、减少缺陷态，从而降低复合损失，提升电池的开路电压和整体效率。","ot":"Tuning Terminal Groups of Hole‐Selective Materials to Suppress Nonradiative Recombination in Inverted Perovskite Solar C","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The performance of perovskite solar cells (PSCs) is critically constrained by nonradiative recombination at the perovskite/charge‐extraction interfaces, which limits their approach to the thermodynamic efficiency limit. Although extensive efforts have focused on passivating surface defects, the role of interfacial energy‐level mismatch in driving nonradiative losses remains insufficiently understood. In this work, we investigate the impact of valence band maximum (VBM) offsets between hole‐selective layers and perovskites on the nonradiative recombination losses in PSCs by tailoring the terminal groups of hole‐selective materials (HSMs). Our findings reveal that the minimized energetic barrier at the hole‐selective interface is conducive to achieving the maximum quasi‐Fermi level splitting (QFLS) in perovskites. Through precise energy‐level alignment at the buried HSM/perovskite interface via terminal group engineering, we achieved high power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 26.88% and 21.87% for PSCs based on 1.53 and 1.72 eV perovskites, respectively, with open‐circuit voltage (\n                    V\n                    OC\n                    ) value reaching 95% and 91% of their Shockley‐Queisser limit, respectively. Our results provide valuable insights for designing hole‐selective molecules and elucidating the relationship between nonradiative recombination losses and energy level alignment across different perovskite compositions."},{"t":"α-突触核蛋白蛋白稳定网络及其在帕金森病中的转化应用","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513317123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Parkinson’s disease (PD) is a debilitating neurodegenerative condition that results in a loss of mobility and muscle control. A neuropathological hallmark of PD is the presence of aberrant inclusions, known as Lewy pathology, of which α-synuclein (α-Syn) is a major component. The accumulation of α-Syn may be due to an imbalance in the proteostasis system regulating α-Syn. To investigate this hypothesis, we delineated the proteostasis network (PN) of α-Syn in the human\n                    substantia nigra\n                    at the proteomic and transcriptomic level. We then defined an α-Syn proteostasis activity score (PAS) that quantifiably describes the relative activity of the α-Syn PN in promoting or inhibiting α-Syn aggregation. We report a corresponding PAS signature indicative of disease state, age-of-death in PD patients, and brain regional vulnerability to α-Syn aggregation in PD and healthy brains. After establishing the relevance of our network to PD, we developed a transcriptome-derived network model as an operational digital twin of the α-Syn PN in human\n                    substantia nigra\n                    cells from single-cell data and used it to prioritize candidate targets for PD. We then further showed the application of the α-Syn PN toward facilitating drug repurposing. Overall, this proof-of-concept study illustrates how our computational framework can identify and prioritize putative therapeutic targets and repurposing candidates for PD, providing testable hypotheses for experimental validation.","tp":"帕金森蛋白网","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究深入探讨了α-突触核蛋白（α-Syn）的蛋白稳态网络（PN）及其在帕金森病（PD）治疗中的临床转化潜力。帕金森病是一种导致运动和肌肉功能丧失的神经退行性疾病，其典型的神经病理学特征是主要由α-突触核蛋白异常聚集形成的路易小体。研究人员假设这种异常积累源于调节α-Syn的蛋白稳态系统失衡，并进一步绘制了人类黑质中α-Syn的蛋白稳态网络。该研究不仅揭示了PD发病的关键分子机制，还为通过恢复蛋白稳态网络来开发新型靶向治疗策略奠定了重要基础。"},{"t":"中国科技胜利背后的真实故事","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00841-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"陆上风电技改扩容加速美国能源转型的潜力评估","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521050123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"风电技改升级","kp":["[风电技改]: 升级现有机组提升容量减少用地"],"sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.5,"r":3.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"as":"本研究评估了美国陆上风电场再发电（repowering）对加速能源转型的潜力。再发电指用更大容量、更高效率的新型风机替换老旧机组。研究发现，美国大量早期风电场已接近设计寿命，通过再发电可显著提升单机发电量、优化土地利用效率并降低运维成本，有助于美国实现更大比例的清洁电力供应目标。","ot":"The potential for onshore wind repowering to hasten the energy transition in the United States","b":"This study explores whether repowering onshore wind farms will help the United States (US) meet a much larger share of its current electricity demand with wind. Repowering upgrades existing wind farms with new turbines, increasing wind-farm capacity and electricity generation, with less new land requirements than greenfield projects. We analyze the US Wind Turbine Database and project the potential of US wind repowering under different scenarios. Results show that repowering alone could more than double the current US onshore wind nameplate capacity, from 153 GW to ~314 GW, at existing farms. The resulting annual onshore wind electricity generation could increase from 453 TWh in 2024 to ~911 TWh for the same weather year after repowering the fleet. Repowering could allow onshore wind to meet 21%, instead of 10.5%, of 2024 US electricity demand. Repowering is a potential multi-billion-dollar industry in the United States."},{"t":"化石燃料的衰落和寻找可行的替代品：对生物柴油、电力和沼气的严格审查","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002990?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"化石燃料替代","sc":2.3,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.5,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"时间分辨率很重要：评估商业建筑的碳排放因子以进行准确核算","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003077?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"建筑碳核算","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"合成适体机械感受器通过 DNA 电路实现细胞特异性力感应和时间控制","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70765-w","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cells interpret mechanical cues from their microenvironment with spatiotemporal precision to guide adaptive behaviors. However, engineering synthetic mechanosensing systems with both cell-specificity and programmability remains challenging, especially when targeting ubiquitous classical mechanoreceptors. Here, we introduce an all-DNA mechanosensing platform based on aptamers that transmit force through noncanonical surface receptors. Aptamer–receptor recognition acts as a molecular gate for force transduction, enabling the design of mechanoprobes with cell-type selectivity. These probes interpret diverse mechanical inputs via distinct mechanisms, including actomyosin-driven contractility and membrane ruffling during macropinocytosis. By integrating aptamer mechanoprobes with upstream DNA reaction networks, we achieve reversible and temporally programmable mechanoresponses. This modular, all-nucleic-acid system offers a general framework for constructing tunable mechanotransduction circuits. It expands the design space for synthetic mechanobiology and provides opportunities for autonomous, multi-layered mechanical–biochemical regulation in tissue engineering, morphogenesis, and dynamic cell programming.","tp":"DNA力传感","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"细胞精确感知微环境机械信号以指导适应性行为，但在工程化合成机械感应系统中同时实现细胞特异性和可编程性仍具挑战。该研究开发了基于适体的全DNA机械感应平台，通过非经典表面受体传递力信号，适体-受体识别作为力传递的分子门控，结合DNA电路实现细胞特异性力感应和时间控制，为合成生物学机械信号工程开辟新路径。","aip":1},{"t":"基于工艺-结构优化策略的硅基圆柱电池循环性能研究","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003405?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅基圆柱锂电池","kp":["[优化策略]: 工艺-结构优化硅基圆柱电池循环"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Study on the cycling performance of silicon-based cylindrical batteries via process-structure optimization strategy"},{"t":"结构与界面稳定的粘结剂工程实现NCM811正极在4.6V下的高倍率性能","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70842?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高镍正极粘结剂","kp":["工作电压[NCM811正极]: 4.6V","粘结剂[高压正极]: 碱木质素交联共聚物PNAL"],"dp":1,"as":"本文通过结构设计与界面稳定型粘结剂工程，提升了锂金属电池高压正极的倍率性能和循环稳定性。高压正极虽可提高能量密度，但界面副反应和颗粒粉化限制了其应用。研究开发的粘结剂体系有效抑制了电极界面退化，实现了高倍率充放条件下的长效稳定循环，为高能量密度锂金属电池实用化提供了新方案。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Structure and Interfacial‐Stable Binder Engineering Enables High‐Rate Capability of NCM811 Cathodes at 4.6 V","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐voltage cathodes improve the energy density of lithium metal batteries (LMBs). However, cathodes constructed by high‐nickel layered oxide severely suffer from structural degradation and interfacial instability under high‐voltage condition. Herein, an alkali lignin cross‐linked acrylonitrile and acrylic acid copolymer is developed as 3D cathode binder (PNAL), which effectively scavenges oxygen radicals generated under high‐voltage, suppresses the irreversible dissolution of transition metal ions, and stabilizes both the electrode‐electrolyte interface and the cathode structure. As a result, the PNAL‐based LiNi\n                    0.8\n                    Mn\n                    0.1\n                    Co\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    LMB achieve a high‐capacity retention of 75.7% after 300 cycles at 4.6 V under 3C. Furthermore, an Ah‐scale pouch cell fabricated by PNAL delivers an energy density of 376.5 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    and retains 81.7% capacity after 100 cycles at 4.6 V. This work provides a promising binder strategy to construct high‐voltage cathodes for next‐generation LMBs."},{"t":"CUB2 结构域在肠肽酶介导的胰蛋白酶原激活中的作用的结构见解","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521394123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Elucidating the structure and function of enteropeptidase (EP) is essential for advancing our understanding of its biological significance, particularly in regulating trypsinogen activation. Using cryo-EM and enzymatic activity, we uncovered the significance of the CUB2 domain in mediating the cleavage of macromolecular substrates. We identified crucial binding loops and key residues for EP’s proteolytic function. The mutation E574A enhanced the proteolytic activity of EP, whereas the mutation N619A diminished its cleavage efficiency, highlighting the importance of surface-charged interactions in modulating EP’s activity. A proteolytic cycle was proposed to deepen our understanding of the trypsinogen activation by EP. This work offers valuable insights into the molecular mechanisms underlying EP’s interaction with its substrate, and opens up avenues for therapeutically modulating EP-mediated proteolysis.","tp":"肠肽酶结构","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究利用冷冻电镜和酶活性分析揭示了肠肽酶（EP）的CUB2结构域在介导大分子底物裂解和调控胰蛋白酶原激活中的关键作用。研究确定了与EP蛋白水解功能密切相关的特异性结合环和关键氨基酸残基。特别发现E574A突变能显著增强EP的蛋白水解活性。该成果加深了对肠肽酶生物功能及结构机制的理解，为相关消化生理和病理研究提供了重要的分子基础。"},{"t":"基于多智能体深度强化学习的智能产消者参与去中心化P2P电力交易管理","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003028?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"产消者P2P交易","kp":["[方法]: 多智能体深度强化学习管理产消者P2P市场"],"dp":1,"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Smart prosumers management based on multi-agent deep reinforcement learning to participate in decentralized peer-to-peer"},{"t":"共享能力构成了鳃弓和成对鳍系列同源性的基础","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529365123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The origin of paired fins is an unresolved controversy in vertebrate evolutionary biology. Karl Gegenbaur famously proposed that paired fins evolved by the transformation of a gill arch, but this hypothesis remains largely unsupported by the fossil record. Also, seemingly at odds with gill arch-paired fin serial homology are their distinct embryonic origins from neural crest and lateral plate mesoderm, respectively. We have previously shown that skate gill arch skeletal elements may derive solely from neural crest, or from a mixture of neural crest and mesoderm, and we have shown that skate gill arches and jawed vertebrate fins/limbs share several molecular patterning mechanisms. Here, we show in the little skate (\n                    Leucoraja erinacea\n                    ) that neural crest and lateral plate mesoderm-derived mesenchyme are developmentally equivalent and interchangeable in the pharyngeal arches and fin buds. Using heterotopic transplantation experiments, we find that neural crest cells can contribute to the typically mesoderm-derived fin skeleton, and that lateral plate mesodermal mesenchyme can contribute to the typically neural crest-derived jaw skeleton. These findings point to shared skeletogenic competence of neural crest and mesoderm-derived mesenchyme at the head–trunk interface. We argue that this shared competence accounts for the anatomical and developmental parallels of the gill arch and paired fin/limb skeletons and forms the basis of their serial homology."},{"t":"自焚纳米治疗与白蛋白引导肿瘤靶向氧化应激放大光动力疗法","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524115?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Conventional photosensitizers suffer from intrinsic limitations in photodynamic therapy (PDT), including poor tumor selectivity, rapid systemic clearance, and inefficient reactive oxygen species (ROS) generation in the hypoxic tumor microenvironment. Herein, we report a self‐immolative nanotheranostic (SINT) that integrates albumin‐guided transport with tumor microenvironment‐activated cascade degradation, achieving covalent tumor anchoring, sustained retention, and simultaneous activation of fluorescence imaging and PDT. SINT is composed of a self‐immolative polymer backbone bearing New Indocyanine Green (NIG) and maleimide (MI) functional groups. After intravenous injection, the MI groups covalently bind to the Cys34 residues of circulating albumin, forming an albumin‐enriched corona that enhances tumor targeting. In acidic tumor conditions, SINT undergoes self‐immolation to generate an azaquinone methide‐NIG (AQM‐NIG) intermediate. This electrophilic species reacts with thiol‐containing biomolecules, leading to covalent anchoring within tumor tissues, disruption of intracellular redox homeostasis, and amplified PDT efficiency. Pharmacokinetic analyses revealed that tumor accumulation of SINT was 7.75‐fold higher than that of NIG at 24 h post‐injection, and over 48% of the maximal fluorescence persisted after 96 h. The prolonged retention and amplified oxidative stress enabled complete tumor suppression without recurrence in murine models."},{"t":"第二代结晶海绵能够在标准化条件下对多种材料进行一致的结构分析","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524615?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Crystallization is typically highly sensitive to even minor structural differences in target molecules. As a result, obtaining crystals of complex compounds often requires extensive trial‐and‐error experiments for each target molecule. We recently reported a second‐generation crystalline sponge (2G‐CS), in which a coordination cage is fixed within a crystal lattice. In the 2G‐CS, target molecules are first encapsulated within the cage in solution, followed by salt formation with a symmetry‐mismatched polyanion, leading to the formation of single crystals suitable for structure analysis. However, practical implementation still requires case‐by‐case optimization of crystallization conditions. In this study, we demonstrate that combining the cage with a specific polyanion enables crystallization of a wide range of structurally distinct guest molecules under a single set of standardized conditions. In a test set comprising 39 guest molecules, 31 cases (80%) were successfully crystallized using the same conditions. These examples include polar, medium‐sized, and structurally complex molecules, most of which are of pharmaceutical interest. Crystal structures showed that the polyanion induced a predominant packing type for cages and anions in crystals. We suggest that this recurrent packing type may contribute to the ability to obtain crystals under standardized conditions despite variations in guest structures.","tp":"结晶海绵分","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"结晶过程对分子结构微小差异高度敏感，获取复杂化合物晶体通常需大量试错实验。研究者开发了第二代结晶海绵(2G-CS)，将配位笼固定在晶格中，目标分子先在溶液中被笼包封再形成盐型。该技术可在标准化条件下对多种材料进行一致的结构分析，有望简化药物和材料的晶体结构解析流程。"},{"t":"海运进口还是国内生产？氢基能源载体的技术经济评估","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002795?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢能载体技术经济","kp":["[技术经济]: 海运进口vs本土生产氢能载体评估"],"as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":3.5},"ot":"Seaborne imports or domestic production? A techno-economic assessment of hydrogen-based energy carriers"},{"t":"考虑多时间尺度不确定性的综合能源系统鲁棒容量优化与低碳改造","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002953?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源系统","kp":["优化[综合能源]: 鲁棒容量+低碳改造","不确定性[系统]: 多时间尺度","集成[能源]: 纳入氢能"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":4.5},"ot":"Robust capacity optimization and low-carbon retrofit of integrated energy systems considering multi-timescale uncertaint"},{"t":"铑催化炔烃与二烯炔和丙烯酰胺的化学发散性平行动力学拆分及去对称化","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9965825?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铑催化动力学拆分","kp":["[化学发散动力学拆分]: Rh催化","底物[PKR]: 外消旋1,6-烯炔与α-氟代丙烯酰胺"],"dp":1,"as":"铑催化化学发散性平行动力学拆分与去对称化反应研究。聚焦有机合成中三维分子催化不对称合成的核心挑战，利用铑催化剂实现化学发散性反应路径，通过平行动力学拆分和去对称化策略高效构建结构多样的手性分子。该方法在药物分子合成和功能材料制备领域具有重要应用价值，为复杂手性骨架的多样化构建提供新思路，有望推动合成化学向高选择性、高效率方向发展。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Rh‐Catalyzed Chemodivergent Parallel Kinetic Resolution and Desymmetrization of Enynes and Dienynes with Acrylamides","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Catalytic enantioselective synthesis of structurally diverse 3D molecules remains a central challenge in organic chemistry. Intermolecular chemodivergent parallel kinetic resolution (PKR) of racemic substrates through C─C bond formation using a single catalyst to yield distinct products is rare. Here, we report Rh‐catalyzed chemodivergent PKR of racemic 1,6‐enynes with α‐fluoroacrylamides or mixtures of different acrylamides, proceeding via [2+2+2] cycloaddition and C–H alkylation to afford structurally and stereochemically distinct products with high selectivity under mild conditions. Additionally, substituent‐dependent enantioselective desymmetrization of symmetric dienynes was achieved. Computational studies revealed that, depending on the stereochemistry of the 1,6‐enyne, steric repulsion between the ligand and the enyne favors a compact C–H activation transition state, whereas its absence favors a C═C insertion transition state involving a smaller bond dissociation energy. These findings establish a versatile catalytic platform for the selective generation of 3D molecular complexity, advancing diversity‐oriented synthesis from racemic or symmetric precursors."},{"t":"锌离子电池中调控负极/电解质界面的原位策略研究进展","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003417?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锌负极界面调控","kp":["[界面工程]: 锌离子电池负极/电解质界面原位调控"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Research progress on in-situ strategies for modulating the anode/electrolyte interface in zinc-ion batteries"},{"t":"回复Vankov等人：推理轨迹与准确率相关，并捕捉问题复杂度的关键维度","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2603574123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","tp":"LLM推理链评估","as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Reply to Vankov et al.: Reasoning traces are linked to accuracy and capture key dimensions of problem complexity"},{"t":"光催化分解水微反应器中气泡动力学与脱离机制研究进展","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003053?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光解水气泡动力学","kp":["[机理]: 光催化分解水微反应器气泡动力学与脱附"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Recent progress in bubble dynamics and detachment mechanisms of photocatalytic water splitting microreactors for H₂ prod"},{"t":"理性量子力学：用量子计算机检验量子理论","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523350123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子力学基本理论","kp":["[Hilbert空间]: 复数离散化处理","[薛定谔方程]: 测量时不修改"],"dp":1,"as":"理性量子力学：用量子计算机检验量子理论。该研究受约翰·惠勒关于希尔伯特空间连续性可能掩盖'万物源于比特'信息本质的观点启发，探讨利用量子计算机对量子力学基础理论进行实验验证的新范式。涉及对非定域性、量子测量过程和希尔伯特空间维度等基本假设的定量化检验，用量子计算机检验量子理论本身代表着一种自指性实验新范式，对理解物理实在本质和量子计算基础均有深刻意义。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Rational quantum mechanics: Testing quantum theory with quantum computers","b":"Motivated in part by John Wheeler’s assertion that the continuum nature of Hilbert Space conceals the “it-from-bit” information-theoretic character of the quantum wavefunction, a theory of quantum physics (Rational Quantum Mechanics–RaQM) is proposed based on a specific discretization of complex Hilbert Space. The Schrödinger equation is not modified in RaQM, even during measurement. However, the bases in which the quantum state is defined must satisfy certain rational-number constraints. These constraints lead to the notion of finite qubit information capacity\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          N\n                          \n                            max\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    : For any\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          N\n                          &gt;\n                          \n                            N\n                            \n                              max\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    qubit state, there is insufficient information in the\n                    \n                      \n                        N\n                      \n                    \n                    qubits (linearly growing in\n                    \n                      \n                        N\n                      \n                    \n                    ) to allocate even one bit to each of all\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            2\n                            \n                              N\n                              +\n                              1\n                            \n                          \n                          −\n                          2\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    continuum degrees of freedom (exponentially growing in\n                    \n                      \n                        N\n                      \n                    \n                    ) associated with quantum mechanics/theory (QM, where\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            N\n                            \n                              max\n                            \n                          \n                          =\n                          ∞\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    ). It is proposed that the discretization of Hilbert Space in RaQM is due to gravity, hence QM is the (singular) continuum limit of RaQM at\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          G\n                          =\n                          0\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    . On this basis, it is estimated that\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          N\n                          \n                            max\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    lies between about 200 and 400 for current qubit technologies, and will never exceed 1,000. While QM and RaQM are experimentally indistinguishable for small numbers of qubits, RaQM predicts that the exponential advantage of quantum algorithms which, like Shor’s, require bases with maximal\n                    \n                      \n                        N\n                      \n                    \n                    -qubit superposition/entanglement, will have saturated at 1,000 perfect qubits. Hence, insofar as a classical computer will never factor a 2,048-bit RSA integer, RaQM predicts that a quantum computer will not either. This predicted breakdown of QM could be testable in less than 5 y."},{"t":"使用氧化氘和高分辨率质谱对新脑脂质合成进行定量和定位","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524636?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Myelin is the lipid‐rich membrane that surrounds neuronal axons and is essential for neurological function in vertebrates. The development of therapeutics that stimulate myelin repair to treat demyelinating disorders such as multiple sclerosis is hampered by the inability to distinguish newly synthesised from pre‐existing myelin. This study aimed to develop a method to quantify and localise new myelin lipid synthesis in the mouse brain. Deuterium oxide was administered for two weeks in the drinking water of mice fed normal chow, chow containing the demyelinating toxin cuprizone, or during spontaneous remyelination following cuprizone withdrawal. Liquid chromatography‐tandem mass spectrometry and mass spectrometry imaging were used to quantify and localise the newly synthesised, deuterated lipids. While most glycerophospholipids were constitutively deuterated, deuteration of myelin‐enriched sulfatides, hexosylceramides, and phosphatidylethanolamine plasmalogens was only apparent during remyelination. Most deuterium atoms were found in the fatty acyl chains, indicative of de novo lipid synthesis. Deuterated hexosylceramide and phosphatidylethanolamine plasmalogen species were localised primarily to the corpus callosum, the white matter tract that is most heavily affected by cuprizone. The method described herein provides the means to quantify and spatially profile dynamic lipid synthesis across diverse biological contexts, including understanding myelin homeostasis and preclinical evaluation of remyelinating therapeutics.","tp":"脑脂质成像","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"髓鞘是包围神经元轴突的富含脂质膜，对脊椎动物神经功能至关重要。开发刺激髓鞘修复以治疗多发性硬化症等脱髓鞘疾病的疗法，受限于无法区分新生和已有髓鞘。该研究利用氧化氘标记结合高分辨率质谱技术，建立了对小鼠脑中新合成髓鞘脂质进行定量和空间定位的方法，为评估髓鞘修复疗效提供了关键工具。"},{"t":"准零间隙流动式水系Zn-CO₂电池","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70835?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"Zn-CO₂电池","kp":["[电极间距]: 伪零间距","催化剂[Zn-CO2电池]: 碳包覆氧化铋","结构[AZCB]: 流动式气体扩散电极"],"dp":1,"as":"伪零间隙流动型水系锌-二氧化碳电池研究。水系Zn-CO2电池可同时发电并将CO2转化为有价值产品，兼具能源转换和碳减排双重功能。该研究提出伪零间隙流动型电池结构设计，优化气体-电极-电解质三相界面，提升CO2还原效率和电池输出性能。水系体系具有安全性和低成本优势，该设计有望克服传统零间隙电池中CO2传质受限问题，为碳中和路径中电化学CO2转化与储能耦合提供新思路。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Pseudo‐Zero‐Gap Flow‐Type Aqueous Zn‐CO2 Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Aqueous Zn‐CO\n                    2\n                    batteries (AZCBs) generate electricity and convert CO\n                    2\n                    into valuable products simultaneously, while their development is limited due to poor mass transport, low reactivity, etc. Therefore, we develop AZCBs featuring flowing CO\n                    2\n                    gases and electrolytes, gas‐diffusion cathodes, and especially a pseudo‐zero interelectrode distance. By employing carbon‐coated bismuth oxides (Bi\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    /C) as the cathode in a pseudo‐zero‐gap AZCB, a record‐high peak power density of 67.0 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    @current density of 117.5 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    is achieved, together with excellent cycling performance over 600 cycles. Specifically, the near‐zero distance greatly promotes hydroxide ion transport and CO\n                    2\n                    diffusion by establishing an enhanced concentration gradient at the reaction interface of CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction. Theoretical simulations further indicate preferred formate production is due to the lower energy barrier compared to the CO pathway, because of the favorable\n                    *\n                    O@Bi adsorption via the\n                    *\n                    OCHO intermediate. Significantly, the developed AZCBs operate efficiently and stably in a simulated Martian atmosphere, which is promising for future Human exploration of Mars, providing a potential solution for simultaneous energy generation and feedstock production in the challenging environment.","aip":1},{"t":"可编程凝聚层-膜相互作用直接影响膜化原始细胞的内部和集体组织","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525899?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  In eukaryotic cells, membraneless organelles reorganize through regulated interactions with the plasma membrane and its underlying cortex, where cytoskeletal coupling and inner‐leaflet biochemistry tune condensate positioning, wetting, and function. Recreating such adaptive, cortex‐mediated control in synthetic systems remains a challenge, requiring a chassis that combines interfacial programmability with the mechanical resilience necessary to withstand the osmotic and electrostatic stresses of bottom‐up assembly. Here, we introduce polysaccharidosomes (P‐somes); semipermeable, mechanically robust protocells that function as membrane‐programmable chassis for directing coacervate–membrane coupling. By establishing a thin, cortex‐like protein layer on the inner membrane leaflet via template‐directed assembly, we demonstrate that in situ protein succinylation enables precise tuning of surface charge and coacervate–membrane wetting. Together with the systematic variation of membrane building blocks, this platform allows for fine control over coacervate wetting, morphology, and spatial organization. The uptake of external DNA adds a second tier of regulation: on nonpassivated membranes, DNA‐reconfigured coacervates generate interfacial protrusions that bridge neighboring P‐somes to promote tissue‐like clustering, whereas on passivated membranes, they coalesce into a single, nonwetting, nucleus‐like droplet centered within the lumen. This membrane–cortex‐inspired framework integrates mechanical resilience with chemical programmability, providing a scalable route to constructing membranized protocells with self‐organizing interiors and emergent collective behaviors.","tp":"人工原细胞","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"真核细胞中无膜细胞器通过与质膜及下方皮层的受调控相互作用进行重组，皮层耦合和内膜生物化学调控凝聚体定位和功能。在合成系统中重建这种适应性控制仍具挑战。该研究通过可编程凝聚层-膜相互作用，直接影响膜化原始细胞的内部组织和集体行为，为构建具有仿生调控能力的合成细胞提供了新策略。"},{"t":"离子压缩机的功率分配与能耗：一种新型理论表述","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003168?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"离子压缩机能耗","kp":["[理论]: 离子压缩机功耗与能耗新公式"],"as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Power distribution and energy consumption in ionic compressors: A novel theoretical formulation"},{"t":"磷活化羧酸小分子正极：实现高比容量与长循环寿命的铁有机电池","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70800-w","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电池有机正极","kp":["[正极]: 磷活化羧基小分子","[电池]: 铁有机电池"],"as":"水系铁离子电池因成本低廉、氧化还原电位适中被视为潜力储能方案，但受限于比容量不足。该研究提出磷活化羧基小分子作为正极材料，通过调控有机分子的电化学活性位点显著提升比容量与循环稳定性，为高比能、低成本铁离子电池正极设计开辟新路径。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Phosphorus-activated carboxyl small molecule positive electrode for high specific capacity and long-life iron-organic ba","b":"Iron-ion batteries represent a compelling energy storage solution due to the cost-effectiveness, suitable redox potential, and high capacity of Fe negative electrodes. Polyaniline positive electrodes for iron-ion batteries have demonstrated promising electrochemical redox properties, but face limited redox-accessible groups and unstable −NH− sites. Here we show phosphorus redox activity in a carboxyl small molecule electrode. 4,4′,4″-phosphanetriyltribenzoic acid and 4,4′,4″-nitrilotribenzoic acid are designed via modulating the electron-donating P and tert-N motifs, showing tuned charge distributions and energy levels. With the decrease of the electronegativity and energy barrier (N > P), 4,4′,4″-phosphanetriyltribenzoic acid exhibits stronger Fe2+ coordination with carboxyl sites, and brings closed CF3SO3− proximity to P centers. This feature ensures high activity of carboxyl/phosphorus sites with low activation energy (0.24 vs. 0.29 eV for 4,4′,4″-nitrilotribenzoic acid). 4,4′,4″-phosphanetriyltribenzoic acid with P-extended conjugated structure achieves low energy gap (2.28 eV) compared to its individual carboxyl or P-containing counterparts (2.71/3.16 eV), thereby enabling high utilization of carboxyl/P motifs (98.5%) and enhanced redox voltage (0.8 V). A stable 4 e− Fe2+/CF3SO3− storage of 4,4′,4″-phosphanetriyltribenzoic acid positive electrode endows Fe battery with high specific capacity (276 mAh g−1) and cycling stability (60,000 cycles). This work highlights the potential of phosphorus-active organic materials toward iron-ion batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"药物行为分析识别斑马鱼自闭症基因相关表型的抑制因子","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518846123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Pharmaco-behavioral screens in scalable in vivo systems have critical advantages for drug discovery relevant to large-effect autism spectrum disorder (ASD) genes. Here, we establish a database and open-source website of the behavioral signatures of 520 US Food and Drug Administration (FDA)-approved drugs using high-throughput assays of basic sensory processing and arousal behaviors in larval zebrafish. By leveraging the behavioral profiles of 9 large-effect ASD gene mutants, we identify enrichment of pharmacological mechanisms that anticorrelate with subgroups of ASD genes with shared behavioral phenotypes. Screening of anticorrelating drugs in mutants of two ASD genes,\n                    SCN2A\n                    and\n                    DYRK1A\n                    , uncovers compounds that suppress mutant behavioral phenotypes. We identify estropipate, an estrogen receptor agonist, and paclitaxel, a microtubule inhibitor, as the top suppressors in\n                    scn1lab\n                    and\n                    dyrk1a\n                    mutants, respectively, and levocarnitine (LEVO), a mitochondrial modulator and carnitine supplement, as a top suppressor of both mutant behavioral phenotypes. Finally, we find that LEVO rescues regional brain activity deficits and dysregulated lipid metabolic pathways in mutants, as well as signaling deficits in human pluripotent stem cell–derived glutamatergic neurons carrying mutations in\n                    SCN2A\n                    and\n                    DYRK1A\n                    , demonstrating conservation of drug rescue across systems. Therefore, our study establishes a pharmaco-behavioral resource for precision medicine-based drug discovery, illuminating targets relevant to large-effect ASD genes."},{"t":"《自然》民意调查发现，博士生正在转向副业以维持收支平衡","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00422-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过分时电价与自动负荷控制实现削峰：瑞士试点研究结果","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600317X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电力需求响应","kp":["方法[峰值削减]: 分时电价+自动负荷控制","规模[验证]: 瑞士试点"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Peak reduction via time-variable tariffs and automated load control: Results from a Swiss pilot study"},{"t":"合作伙伴对资源的偏好适应收入和性别经济不平等","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527295123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"For over three decades, scholars have contested whether sex differences in ideal partner preferences for age, resources, and physical attractiveness result chiefly from evolution or cultural gender inequality. Here, we test a perspective compatible with each of these competing views: partner preferences for resources adapt strategically, such that they become stronger for the sex that is poorer and individuals who are poorer, as such preferences are more useful to these individuals. Our preregistered experiment placed 602 people from five countries in one of 45 virtual ecologies, varying participants’ personal income and their local gender economic inequality. Results show that people exhibit stronger ideal partner preferences for resources when they are poorer and when their sex is poorer. This pattern was evident in three different measures of stated partner preferences for resources, namely, ranked preferences and rated preferences for resource-relevant traits (e.g., whether a potential partner has a good job), and importance placed on dating or marrying up, financially. Preferences regarding age gaps were, surprisingly, unaffected, even though older age is associated with access to resources in naturally varying populations. Consistent with our theoretical perspective, which expects ideal partner preferences will adapt primarily to environmental variables that alter the fitness of those preferences, sex differences in stated preferences for physical attractiveness in romantic partners were largely unaffected. These results are discussed in the context of behavioral ecology, which offers a framework to interpret both our results and the mixed findings of past literature."},{"t":"微量水驱动的氧结构重组实现柔性固体电解质中快速锂离子传输","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506748?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性固态电解质","kp":["电解质[固态电池]: 镓基卤化物2LiCl-GaF3","[微量水]: 增强快离子传输"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究揭示了固态电解质吸湿性这一长期被视为缺陷的特性，可通过微量水的氧驱动结构重组转化为优势，实现锂离子的快速传输。研究表明痕量水参与下电解质晶格发生可逆重构，显著降低离子迁移势垒，提升倍率性能。这一发现颠覆了传统认知，为高安全固态锂电池的工程设计提供了新思路。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Oxygen‐Driven Structural Reorganization by Trace Water Enabling Fast Li‐Ion Transport in a Pliable Solid Electrolyte","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The hygroscopic property of solid electrolytes has long been regarded as a critical weakness, as exposure to ambient humidity typically induces decomposition and a loss of ionic conductivity. In this study, we reveal a counterintuitive yet constructive role of trace water in enhancing ion transport in a gallium‐based pliable halide solid electrolyte. Controlled exposure of 2LiCl–GaF\n                    3\n                    to trace amounts of water introduces oxygen into the structure and reorganizes the local environments around gallium and lithium. This oxygen‐driven structural reconfiguration forms Ga–O and Li–O linkages and diversifies the local environment of gallium by converting its coordination from sixfold to fourfold. It reduces the average Li–anion binding strength and flattens the Li‐ion migration energy landscape, resulting in enhanced Li‐ion transport. These changes collectively increase the ionic conductivity by more than two orders of magnitude, from 10\n                    −2\n                    mS cm\n                    −1\n                    to over 3 mS cm\n                    −1\n                    , while imparting amorphous and deformable characteristics to the 2LiCl‐GaF\n                    3\n                    electrolyte. This study demonstrates that the interaction between trace water and complex anion frameworks can be harnessed to simultaneously tailor structural and transport properties, offering a new design strategy for high‐performance oxyhalide solid electrolytes.","aip":1},{"t":"脱离平衡并进入结构","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44286-026-00369-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Chemical Engineering","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"向有机农业过渡时优化生物多样性、多功能性和产量","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41893-026-01791-1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Nature Sustainability","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Agricultural intensification increases crop production but often causes declines in soil biodiversity and functioning, thus threatening long-term environmental sustainability. To buffer these impacts, environmental policies aim to increase the amount of organic farming; however, this potentially compromises yield and nitrogen and phosphorus availability. Given such complexities, we evaluated the overall impacts of shifting agricultural management by comparing the effects of conventional versus organic farming on soil biodiversity (richness of 6 faunal and microbial groups), functioning (21 indicators) and crop yield on 179 global croplands across a wide range of ecological contexts, including contrasting levels of soil degradation. High crop yields did not necessarily trade off against soil biodiversity, ecosystem multifunctionality or nitrogen availability, with often positive correlations found between them. Yield, biodiversity and functioning variables showed a broad range of values within and between conventional and organic sites. Despite this large variation, we found that landscapes with 50% organic agriculture could optimize crop yields, biodiversity and multifunctionality. Our findings provide guidelines for sustainable agriculture, showing how prioritizing the transition to organic farming in moderately to highly degraded soils would maximize its benefits while minimizing yield loss.","tp":"有机农业转","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"农业集约化增加作物产量但常导致土壤生物多样性下降和功能退化。向有机农业转型可能影响产量及氮磷有效性。该研究系统比较了常规农业与有机农业管理对生物多样性、生态系统多功能性和产量的综合影响，评估不同转型路径的权衡关系，为优化农业管理策略、兼顾产量与可持续性提供实证依据。"},{"t":"光锁定低噪声光子微波振荡器","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag135/8524805?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The next-generation sensing and communication applications rely on high-frequency microwave generation with low noise. Microwave photonic technology is highly promising; however, its practical applications have so far been limited by the complexity of existing system architectures. Here, we demonstrate an optically locked low-noise photonic microwave oscillator, in which all the optical components are packaged within a small module of 166 mL, and low noise microwave generation is achieved at 10.4 GHz with single-sideband phase noise of − 54 dBc/Hz at 10 Hz, −141 dBc/Hz at 10 kHz, and − 162 dBc/Hz at 10 MHz offset. Above performance arises from a dual-laser self-injection-locking scheme to a single Fabry–Pérot cavity with high Q exceeding 108, with over 20 dB common-mode noise suppression. The low-noise nature of this reference is coherently transferred to the X-band through a high-performance TFLN electro-optic comb chip, thereby overcoming long-standing barriers in photonic microwave integration to enable truly field-deployable low-noise microwave generation."},{"t":"表面自由基开环聚合产生超长聚对亚苯基，以获取非苯环碳","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02092-y","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemistry","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Extending the chain lengths of conductive polymers, such as unsubstituted poly(para-phenylene) (PPP), is crucial for their application in high-performance organic devices and processing into high-quality functional materials. While surface-assisted Ullmann coupling has increased PPP chain lengths to ~100 nm, from ~32 nm achieved by solution-based reactions, its step-growth reaction mechanism limits further elongation. Here we report the synthesis of PPP via radical ring-opening polymerization of [6]cyclo(para-phenylene) on a Cu(111) surface. This process has been identified as a chain-growth polymerization, substantially enhancing the PPP chain length to the micrometre range (~0.9 μm). The obtained ultralong PPP chains on an otherwise clean surface undergo selective C–H bond scission, forming an upright-standing poly(para-benzyne) intermediate, which further couples into the unsubstituted biphenylene ribbon with length up to ~40 nm. The ring-opening polymerization provides a versatile route to high-quality polymers and non-benzenoid carbon nanoribbons with precise structural control.","tp":"导电聚合物","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"延伸导电聚合物如聚对亚苯基(PPP)的链长对其在高性能有机器件中的应用至关重要。表面辅助Ullmann偶联将PPP链长增至约100nm，但逐步增长机制限制进一步延伸。该研究通过自由基开环聚合合成PPP，以获取非苯环碳结构，突破了传统逐步聚合的链长限制，为高性能导电聚合物材料制备提供了新方法。"},{"t":"智能代理融入网络系统以引导合作的最优集成策略","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537939123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"智能体网络协作","kp":["[社会技术网络]: 智能体最优集成引导合作演化"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究探讨了将智能代理最优集成到社会技术网络系统中以引导合作行为的问题。社会技术网络（又称混合系统）中人类与技术作为交互实体共存，智能代理的介入策略对系统整体合作水平具有关键影响。该研究运用博弈论和网络科学方法，分析了智能代理在不同网络拓扑中的最优部署策略，为设计更鲁棒的混合协作系统提供了理论框架，对社会治理、资源分配和公共物品博弈场景具有指导意义。","ot":"On the optimal integration of intelligent agents into network systems to steer cooperation","b":"Sociotechnical networks, in which humans and technologies act as interacting entities (also known as “hybrid systems”), increasingly face perturbations by automated agents. What this implies for immersive steering of collective behavior, and how this shapes the stability and resilience of cooperation, remain unclear. Here, we extend evolutionary graph theory by incorporating a distinct type of node representing embedded intelligent agents, namely, algorithmic nodes that autonomously implement prescribed behavioral responses during interactions. These agents are randomly placed within a social network and exert local influence in their neighborhood in social dilemma games. Individual behavior changes are driven by evolutionary dynamics. We derive closed-form analytical results characterizing evolutionary stability and long-run cooperation levels, and show that there exists an optimal, intermediate prevalence of intelligent agents that best promotes cooperation. Our work offers insights into the optimal alignment of human populations with respect to the social good using intelligent agents."},{"t":"航空脱碳情景的数值优化：在交通量与排放间平衡成熟能源载体","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002837?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航空","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"航空脱碳优化","kp":["[建模]: 航空脱碳数值优化平衡交通量与排放"],"sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","ot":"Numerical optimization of aviation decarbonization scenarios: balancing traffic and emissions with maturing energy carri"},{"t":"镍催化马尔科夫尼科夫炔烃氢镍化实现羰基化合物的对映 convergent α-烯基化反应","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8854855?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍催化烯基化","kp":["催化剂[α-烯基化]: NiH催化对映趋同","[关键步骤]: 马氏炔烃氢镍化"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究开发了镍氢催化的羰基化合物对映汇聚式α-烯基化反应，通过马尔可夫尼克夫炔烃氢镍化策略构建β-亚甲基羰基结构骨架。β-亚甲基羰基是重要的药效团，广泛存在于药物分子和生物活性天然产物中。该方法利用廉价镍催化剂实现高对映选择性C-C键形成，避免了贵金属催化剂的使用，为药物合成提供了经济高效的途径。反应具有良好的底物普适性和官能团兼容性。","ot":"NiH‐Catalyzed Enantioconvergent α‐Alkenylation of Carbonyl Compounds via Markovnikov Alkyne Hydronickellation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    β\n                    ‐Methylene carbonyl motifs constitute privileged structural frameworks that play vital roles as a pharmacophore and serve as key intermediates in the assembly of architecturally complex molecules. Despite their synthetic importance, asymmetric approaches for their preparation remain scarce and are largely confined to substrate‐controlled or stoichiometric chiral auxiliary methods. Herein, we report a nickel hydride‐catalyzed enantioconvergent\n                    α\n                    ‐alkenylation of carbonyl compounds with alkynes, providing a direct and general route to\n                    α\n                    ‐chiral\n                    β\n                    ‐methylene carbonyl derivatives. The transformation proceeds via Markovnikov‐selective alkyne hydronickellation followed by nickel‐radical recombination to forge the\n                    α\n                    ‐stereogenic center, delivering the desired products with high levels of regio‐ and enantioselectivity. The protocol accommodates a wide range of alkynes and\n                    α\n                    ‐halocarbonyl partners, displays excellent functional group tolerance, and can be applied to the modification of biologically relevant molecules. Mechanistic investigations indicate that a partially protic Ni(II)H species governs the observed regioselectivity, while enantio‐discrimination occurs during the radical capture step. This work establishes NiH catalysis as a versatile platform for expanding the synthetic repertoire for enantioenriched\n                    β\n                    ‐methylene carbonyl architectures."},{"t":"锂硫电池领域的中子机理映射：原位方法、标准化与AI辅助分析","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70803?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锂硫中子表征","kp":["[中子技术]: Li-S电池机理性映射","[数据融合]: AI辅助标准化框架"],"dp":1,"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本文综述了中子技术在锂硫电池全景观中的机理映射能力。中子对轻元素（锂、硫）、埋藏界面和体相输运具有卓越灵敏度，非常适合表征Li-S电池的多孔碳硫复合正极、锂负极界面及多硫化物穿梭机制。文章系统梳理了operando中子衍射、中子深度剖析、中子反射等原位方法在电极结构演化追踪中的应用，讨论了标准化测试协议的建立需求，并展望了AI辅助数据分析在加速中子谱图解析、提取动态结构信息方面的前景。","ot":"Neutron‐Based Mechanistic Mapping Across the Li–S Battery Landscape: Operando Methods, Standardization, and AI‐Assisted ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Neutron techniques provide exceptional sensitivity to light elements, buried interfaces, and bulk transport, making them uniquely suited for probing lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries, yet their application remains fragmented and insufficiently standardized. This Review develops a unified mechanistic mapping framework that links neutron observables to Li–S descriptors across multiple length and time scales, spanning fundamental and application‐relevant regimes. Imaging and tomography, small‐angle scattering (SANS), diffraction, reflectometry, quasielastic neutron spectroscopy (QENS), neutron depth profiling (NDP), and prompt‐gamma activation analysis (PGNAA) are integrated to resolve sulfur redox reactions, polysulfide transport, electrolyte and separator behavior, and lithium anode degradation under operando conditions. Practical guidelines are summarized for operando cell architectures, isotopic‐contrast design using H/D and\n                    6\n                    Li substitution, optimization of neutron flux and q‐range, and uncertainty‐aware data treatment. To address limitations in temporal resolution, chemical selectivity, and cross‐study comparability, the Review introduces an AI‐assisted, model‐based data‐fusion framework combining physics‐informed preprocessing with Bayesian optimization and neural‐network modeling. This approach enables quantitative reconstruction of sulfur‐phase evolution, interphase growth, and Li\n                    2\n                    S morphology under realistic conditions. A concluding roadmap identifies priority measurements, standardized metadata schemes, and benchmarks to accelerate reproducible Li–S research across global neutron facilities.","aip":1},{"t":"精确糖尿病中协同微环境重编程和 EpSC 复兴的纳米级联工程研讨会","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522987?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Chronic wounds are life‐threatening conditions characterized by impaired closure. Chronic inflammation and impaired regeneration and repair lead to the pathological phenotype of chronic diabetic wounds and reduce drug efficacy. In this study, we found that the poor proliferative and differentiative ability of epidermal stem cells (EpSCs) within an inflammatory microenvironment is a key factor contributing to the delayed healing of chronic diabetic wounds. To address this issue, we designed a nanocascade engineering workshop (Cu\n                    5.4\n                    O@LL‐37/pDNA) capable of simultaneously reshaping the inflammatory microenvironment and activating EpSC functions to promote rapid wound closure. The workshop used a core–shell structure design. The core, an ultrasmall Cu\n                    5.4\n                    O nanozyme, can efficiently eliminate reactive oxygen species, enhance the inflammatory response, and transform the pathological wound microenvironment into a niche facilitating regeneration. The shell is constructed through the electrostatic assembly of plasmid DNA (pDNA) and the antibacterial peptide LL‐37, enhancing gene transfection efficiency and inhibiting bacterial infection effectively. By leveraging its dual advantages in microenvironment modulation and structural design, the system substantially improves gene delivery and facilitates sustained P311 expression, thereby promoting EpSC proliferation and differentiation. This nanotherapy reshaping the microenvironment and activating EpSC function accelerates re‐epithelialization and wound closure in both diabetes and infection models. This treatment strategy is a novel approach to achieve durable and effective healing in chronic wounds."},{"t":"面向高效稳定钙钛矿太阳能电池的多位点协同调控策略","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3450174?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿多位点调控","kp":["[多点协同调控]: 钙钛矿薄膜优化"],"dp":1,"as":"钙钛矿太阳能电池因光电转换效率突破而备受关注，但其长期稳定性不足制约商业化进程。该研究提出多位点协同调控策略，在钙钛矿层、界面及界面传输层多个关键位置同步引入功能性修饰分子，分别抑制离子迁移、钝化深层缺陷、调控能级对齐，从而在提升器件效率的同时显著延长运行寿命。多位点协同方法相比单一修饰更能全面应对钙钛矿薄膜中多尺度的降解路径，为兼具高效率与高稳定性的实用化钙钛矿光伏器件提供了系统级解决方案。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Multi‐Site Synergistic Regulation Towards Highly Efficient and Stable Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Perovskite solar cells (PSCs) have attracted considerable scientific interest due to their remarkable power conversion efficiency (PCE) and economically viable manufacturing processes. However, the commercialization has faced obstacles such as limited operational stability and susceptibility to moisture, which usually stem from the inferior quality of perovskite film. In this study, we present Di‐p‐toluenesulfonamide (D‐pTSAD) as triple‐functional ligand featuring multi‐site synergistic coordination with the perovskite lattice. Through this mechanism, D‐pTSAD simultaneously facilitates oriented crystal growth and mitigates defect formation, achieving a top‐performing device with a PCE of 26.22%. Comprehensive analysis reveals that D‐pTSAD forms stronger coordination with both Pb\n                    2\n                    +\n                    and I\n                    −\n                    ions compared to bifunctional ligands, effectively passivating defects, suppressing ion migration, and reducing nonradiative recombination. After 1,000 h of continuous maximum power point tracking, PSCs with D‐pTSAD maintained 82.5% of initial PCE. This research underscores the potency of multisite coordination chemistry in elevating both performance and stability of PSCs."},{"t":"多特征 GWAS 和功能验证揭示胃癌的遗传位点","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70774-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Gastric cancer is a leading cause of cancer-related death, particularly in East Asia, yet its genetic basis remains incompletely understood. Using genome-wide association study data from BioBank Japan, we show that gastric cancer shares significant genetic associations with 25 other phenotypes, most notably cardiovascular conditions such as angina pectoris and myocardial infarction. Mendelian randomization supports a causal role of these traits in gastric cancer risk. Multitrait analysis of GWAS reveals a novel pleiotropic locus at 12q22 (rs12814712) that is shared between gastric cancer and cardiovascular traits. Functional experiments demonstrate that the risk allele at this locus reduces transcriptional activity and downregulates the expression of nearby genes, particularly VEZT. In gastric cancer cells, overexpression of VEZT and NR2C1 suppress proliferation and migration, whereas their knockdown promotes malignancy. Our analysis identifies rs12814712 as a novel susceptibility locus for gastric cancer and underscores its regulatory role in disease-related gene networks."},{"t":"多位点原子级氯钝化稳定钙钛矿界面实现海水高效光合成过氧化氢","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70503-2","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"海水光催化制过氧化氢","kp":["[钝化]: 多位点原子氯钝化CsPbI3量子点","[光合成]: 海水光催化产H2O2"],"as":"铅卤化物钙钛矿在人工光合作用领域潜力巨大，但其在水环境中的不稳定性是核心瓶颈。该研究提出多位点原子氯钝化策略，在钙钛矿界面同时钝化多种类型的缺陷位点，有效抑制水分子诱导的晶格降解和光腐蚀。原子级氯原子精准锚定于表面未配位铅离子和卤素空位处，降低界面复合损失并阻断水侵蚀通道，从而在保持高光吸收效率的前提下显著提升器件在水相环境中的长期运行稳定性，推动钙钛矿光催化/光电催化体系向实际应用迈进。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Multisite atomic-chlorine-passivation stabilizes perovskite interfaces for efficient H2O2 photosynthesis from seawater","b":"Lead halide perovskites are promising for artificial photosynthesis but suffer from aqueous instability. Here, we stabilize CsPbI3 quantum dots within a hydrophobic chlorine-functionalized covalent organic framework through multisite atomic-chlorine passivation, forms dual Cl-Pb coordination and Cl-I halogen bonding at the interface. This suppresses ionic migration while creating a gas-solid-liquid triphase interface for enhanced O2 diffusion. The resulting S-scheme heterojunction spatially separates carriers to concurrently drive two-electron oxygen reduction and water oxidation for H2O2 synthesis without sacrificial agents. The system achieves production rates of 20.37 mmol h−1 g−1 in seawater, with a solar-to-chemical conversion efficiency of 1.38%, and operates stably for 20 h. Importantly, natural sunlight tests yield 11.7 mmol L−1 H2O2 in 10 h. Mechanistic studies confirm synergistic interfacial charge transfer and dual-reaction pathways via both oxygen reduction and water oxidation. This work demonstrates an approach for robust perovskite-based photocatalysts toward solar-driven chemical synthesis from seawater."},{"t":"自由活塞发动机与直线电机的启动控制","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003016?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/火电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"自由活塞发动机控制","kp":["[控制]: 自由活塞发动机与直线电机驱动控制"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Motoring control of a free piston engine and linear electric machine"},{"t":"分子互变异构_enabled的共价有机框架异构化用于水系超级电容器","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00077-9?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF超级电容器","kp":["[互变异构]: 三聚氰酸三酮/三醇构型","[异构化调控]: 溶剂介电常数"],"dp":1,"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究利用三聚氰酸的互变异构特性（三酮/三醇构型），实现了共价有机框架（COF）的精准结构异构化。通过调控互变异构平衡，合成了两组结构高度相似但微观氢键网络不同的COF异构体，并将其应用于水系超级电容器。实验表明，三醇构型COF因丰富的氢键网络和亲水性表现出更优的离子传输通道与电容性能。该策略为通过分子层面精控实现COF功能导向设计提供了新范式。","ot":"Molecular tautomerism-enabled isomerization of COFs for aqueous supercapacitors","b":"This work employs cyanuric acid tautomerism (tri-one/tri-ol configurations) to achieve precise structural isomerization of covalent organic frameworks (COFs). Through variation of the solvent dielectric constant, two distinct homogeneous triazine-based COFs (Ton-COF and Tol-COF) are selectively synthesized, exhibiting differentiated supercapacitor performance. This approach may provide a new insight into the development of COFs for advanced electrochemical energy storage from molecular design to performance regulation and beyond.","aip":1},{"t":"建筑冷水机组与热泵系统建模方法：数字孪生应用背景下的系统综述","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002849?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"热泵数字孪生","dp":1,"sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","ot":"Modeling methods for chiller and heat pump systems in buildings: A systematic review in the context of digital twin appl"},{"t":"金属中间层\"无负极\"体系中电沉积锂的微观结构及其循环演化","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07230A","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无负极锂沉积","kp":["[金属中间层]: 均化锂沉积覆盖","[无负极固态电池]: 锂晶粒细化"],"dp":1,"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"本文研究了无负极固态电池中金属中间层对电沉积锂微观结构及其循环演化行为的影响。所谓\"无储库\"构造可避免直接处理高反应活性锂金属箔，通过电沉积原位形成锂负极。研究发现，引入金属中间层（如Ag、Zn等）可调控锂的成核与生长模式，促进致密沉积并抑制枝晶形成。通过operando显微表征追踪了循环过程中锂层的形貌演变、界面接触损失及孔洞形成机制，为无负极固态电池的界面工程优化提供了微观证据。","ot":"Microstructure of Electrodeposited Lithium and its Evolution During Cycling when Using Metal Interlayers in \"Anode-Free\"","b":"\"Reservoir-free\" construction of solid state batteries could circumvent the handling of reactive lithium metal foils and further increase the energy density. Metallic interlayers could play an important role in the homogenization of the deposited lithium layer by increasing the coverage of the deposit and additionally reducing the size of the lithium grains. To date, the influence of different interlayers and the influence of stripping on the lithium microstructure is still unknown. This work analyzes the influence of gold, silver and bismuth interlayers on the microstructure of electrodeposited lithium layers using electron backscatter diffraction (EBSD) on cross-sections prepared by broad ion-milling. In addition, partially stripped lithium layers and thus the influence of stripping on the lithium microstructure are analyzed using the mentioned interlayers. Our findings reveal that different interlayer materials result in different lithium microstructures. In addition, stripping also causes a significant change in the lithium microstructure, both in terms of grain size and grain orientation, gaining a deeper understanding of the lithium microstructure and its impact.","aip":1},{"t":"塑料废弃物的微生物升级回收为左旋多巴","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41893-026-01785-z","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Sustainability","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微生物塑料转化","kp":["底物[生物升级回收]: PET废弃塑料","产物[微生物合成]: 左旋多巴"],"dp":1,"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"本研究利用合成生物学手段，将塑料废弃物微生物降解与左旋多巴（levodopa，帕金森病一线药物）的生物合成相耦合。通过工程化改造微生物代谢途径，将塑料降解单体转化为高附加值药物分子。该策略以工程生物学执行复杂化学合成，相比传统化学催化路线更具可持续性，为塑料废弃物的资源化高值利用提供了新路径，展示了生物制造在循环经济中的潜力。","ot":"Microbial upcycling of plastic waste to levodopa","b":"Using engineering biology to perform complex chemical synthesis offers a sustainable alternative to traditional processes that rely on finite fossil resources. A growing opportunity within this field lies in reclaiming carbon embedded in industrial and post-consumer waste—carbon otherwise lost to landfill, incineration or pollution. Here we report the bio-upcycling of poly(ethylene terephthalate) (PET) plastic waste into levodopa (l-DOPA), a frontline medication for Parkinson’s disease, using engineered Escherichia coli. Two key bottlenecks—substrate import and feedback inhibition by the intermediate protocatechuate—were addressed through heterologous transporter expression and functional pathway separation across two microbial strains. To further improve sustainability, and as a proof-of-concept, Chlamydomonas reinhardtii was used to capture CO2 released during catechol generation. The resulting bioprocess operates under mild, aqueous conditions and achieves high l-DOPA titres (5.0 g l−1), with isolated product obtained at preparative scale from both industrial PET waste and a single post-consumer plastic bottle. This work demonstrates how engineering biology can transform plastic-derived aromatic monomers into high-value pharmaceuticals for the treatment of neurological disease in humans."},{"t":"墨西哥的能源十字路口：应对复杂的转型","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001588?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"墨西哥能源转型","sc":2.6,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"鸟类尘浴的机制","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521949123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Dust bathing is a widespread behavior among birds that helps remove ectoparasites, but its mechanical basis remains poorly understood. Here we show that wing flapping during dust bathing generates sand-particle collisions sufficient to dislodge feather mites. Using high-speed video analysis across 34 bird species, we found that wing-flapping frequency scales inversely with body mass (\n                    \n                      \n                        f\n                        ∼\n                        \n                          M\n                          \n                            -\n                            0.20\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    ), ranging from 1 to 10 Hz. Since feather motion matches wing motion, we use mechanical shakers to simulate dust-bathing dynamics. Mite-removal experiments reveal that parasite dislodgment efficiency increases rapidly up to around 5 Hz and plateaued thereafter. The frequencies around 5 Hz are sufficient to achieve maximal cleaning efficacy. Collision modeling indicates that the impact force from sand particles exceeds mite adhesion forces, thus collision is the dominant removal mechanism. Mites are removed within seconds when sand is present, suggesting that sand plays an active mechanical role in parasite dislodgment. These findings not only elucidate a physical mechanism underlying dust bathing, but also suggest that birds may have evolutionarily tuned their flapping behavior to optimize parasite removal through substrate interaction."},{"t":"MARLEM：面向分布式局部能源系统隐式合作的多智能体强化学习仿真框架","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926001984?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多智能体能源协同","kp":["[框架]: 多智能体强化学习去中心化能源市场合作"],"as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"MARLEM: A multi-agent reinforcement learning simulation framework for implicit cooperation in decentralized local energy"},{"t":"利用金属层状Nb0.3W0.7Se2实现p型单层二硒化钨晶体管的低阻接触","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01568-6","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维材料晶体管接触","kp":["接触材料[p型WSe2]: 层状Nb0.3W0.7Se2","[低接触电阻]: 低温沉积无缺陷"],"dp":1,"as":"单层二硒化钨等二维过渡金属硫族化合物是构建纳米级p型晶体管的关键材料，但金属电极与半导体之间的接触电阻过高严重制约器件性能。该研究采用新型接触工程方案，降低p型单层WSe₂晶体管的源漏接触电阻，显著提升载流子注入效率和开关比。这一突破为二维半导体在超薄柔性电子、低功耗逻辑集成电路中的实际应用扫清了核心障碍，推进了后硅时代晶体管的工程化进程。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Low-resistance contacts for p-type monolayer tungsten diselenide transistors using metallic layered Nb0.3W0.7Se2","b":"Achieving low contact resistance is a critical challenge in the development of p-type transistors that use monolayer transition metal dichalcogenides, such as tungsten diselenide (WSe2), as their channel material. Contacts made with high work function metals require deposition at high temperatures, which typically creates defects or strain at the metal–channel interface. One solution is to use metallic two-dimensional (2D) materials that have atomically flat surfaces and can be deposited at low temperatures, as have been reported for n-type semiconductors. However, the comparatively large bandgap of WSe2 has hindered experimental progress with p-type transistors. Here we show that metallic layered Nb0.3W0.7Se2 can be used to create contacts for monolayer and bilayer WSe2 field-effect transistors with channel lengths down to 100 nm. Our 2D–2D contacted field-effect transistors exhibit on-current densities of up to 358 µA µm−1 and 1.1 mA µm−1 on monolayer and bilayer WSe2 channels, respectively. In combination with scaled gate dielectrics (effective oxide thickness of 1.3 nm), the fabricated 2D–2D contacted monolayer WSe2 devices achieve a subthreshold swing of 88 mV dec−1.","aip":1},{"t":"长程块状层间 Dzyaloshinskii-Moriya 相互作用可实现稳定的 3D 磁性纹理","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516452?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"ABSTRACT\n                  As an antisymmetric exchange interaction, the Dzyaloshinskii‐Moriya interaction (DMI) favors canted spin alignment and stabilizes chiral spin textures. However, the existing DMI effects, e.g., interfacial DMI, bulk DMI, and interlayer DMI, cannot achieve long‐range characteristics and vertical chirality simultaneously, hindering the implementation of three‐dimensional (3D) topological magnetic textures. Here, we first achieve a bulk‐like interlayer DMI (BIL‐DMI) effect in gradient magnetic multilayers by engineering in‐plane (IP) and out‐of‐plane (OOP) symmetry breaking, which presents unprecedented long‐range vertical chirality. The direction and magnitude of the BIL‐DMI‐induced IP/OOP DMI effective fields depend on the DMI gradient, and the OOP effective field exhibits exotically linear dependence on external magnetic fields, distinctly different from the existing saturation behaviors of interlayer DMI. Moreover, a continuum model is built to explain the mechanism of BIL‐DMI and quantitatively describe the experimental observations. Based on the BIL‐DMI, unique 3D transverse skyrmion/bimeron strings applicable to next‐generation magnonic circuits are first stabilized in theory, which is unachievable relying on existing DMI effects. The discovery of BIL‐DMI achieves access to a long‐range version of IL‐DMI through gradient engineering, providing a platform for the investigation and application of 3D topological magnetic textures.","tp":"三维磁纹理","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"Dzyaloshinskii-Moriya相互作用(DMI)作为反对称交换相互作用，稳定手性自旋纹理。现有界面DMI、体DMI和层间DMI均无法同时实现长程特性和垂直手性，阻碍了三维拓扑磁性纹理的实现。该研究首次实现了长程块状层间DMI(BIL-DMI)效应，为构建稳定的3D磁性拓扑结构奠定了基础，对自旋电子学和未来信息存储具有重要意义。"},{"t":"裂谷热病毒 NS 细丝的活细胞 3D-SIM 揭示了多边形网络结构","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534404123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"A defining feature of Rift Valley fever virus (RVFV) is the incorporation of the NSs protein into large filamentous assemblies inside infected nuclei [R. Swanepoel, N. K. Blackburn,\n                    J. Gen. Virol.\n                    34\n                    , 557–561 (1977).], as judged from fixed specimens. To gain insight into the 3D structure of NSs filaments within live-cell nuclei, we used genetic-code expansion (GCE) to incorporate trans-cyclooct-2-en-L-lysine into the protein. This enabled site-specific fluorescent labeling with tetrazine dyes for live-cell structured illumination microscopy (SIM). Our superresolved images revealed the complete native architecture of NSs filaments as a micron-scale polygon web of fibers with discrete domain characteristics, overturning previous assumptions of simple linear filaments. Parallel experiments on fixed RVFV-infected cells confirmed that native NSs filaments also display this morphology. Overall, our 3D-SIM analysis reveals distinct structural plasticity within NSs filaments, establishing a quantitative structure–function relationship that support the importance of polygon organization for NSs filament function during RVFV infection."},{"t":"短期电力需求预测与可解释AI的关联：建筑能源应用综述","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003107?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电力负荷预测","kp":["[综述]: 短期电力需求预测与可解释AI结合"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Linking short-term electricity demand forecasting and explainable AI: A review for building energy applications"},{"t":"光驱动的可逆环收缩和膨胀来调节应变、构象和反应性","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00013-6?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"This study introduces looped diarylethene photoswitches that reversibly alter ring size and thereby modulate molecular strain using light. The strain was monitored via the diagnostic absorption maxima of the photogenerated closed isomers. Incorporation of an allene functionality into the loop region allowed for remote-controlled reactivity tuning in a dipolar cycloaddition with diazoacetate.","tp":"光控分子开关","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究引入环状二芳基乙烯光开关分子，利用光可逆改变环大小从而调节分子应变。应变通过光生闭环异构体的诊断性最大吸收波长进行监测。在环区域引入丙二烯功能团，实现了与重氮乙酸酯偶极环加成反应的远程控制反应性调节，为光驱动分子机械和可控化学反应提供了新策略。"},{"t":"利用木质素的分子复杂性制备高性能生物基材料","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41578-026-00910-w","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Nature Reviews Materials","tg":"观点评论","tp":"木质素生物材料","as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Leveraging the molecular complexity of lignin for high-performance bio-based materials"},{"t":"配备致命毒素的效应细胞可用于潜在的癌症治疗","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2506991123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Lethal toxins could become potent therapies against cancer, but their clinical utility is limited by adverse events upon systemic administration. These could be reduced if the toxins were delivered by effector cells that specifically infiltrate cancers, thereby releasing toxins locally into the tumor microenvironment. One of the challenges underlying this strategy is that cells delivering toxins would have to be resistant to them. We address this obstacle by showing that effectors derived from transformed human cell lines genetically engineered for resistance to bacterial adenosine diphosphate ribosylating toxins (ADPRTs), including\n                    \n                      Pseudomonas aeruginosa\n                    \n                    exotoxin A (PE), can produce targeted immunotoxins that specifically kill cancer cells expressing cognate tumor-associated antigens. Resistance to immunotoxins was achieved by knockout of genes in the diphthamide biosynthesis pathway (\n                    DPH1-4\n                    ) required for the posttranslational modification of eukaryotic elongation factor 2 (EEF2) that is the target of ADPRTs or by mutation of\n                    EEF2\n                    itself. We show that engineering resistance to ADPRTs, one of the most potent toxins acting on human cells, is essential to achieve robust function of armored effector cell lines. This work establishes a critical step on the path to equip effector cells with the ability to deliver powerful toxins to cancer cells and introduces a platform to investigate extension to primary autologous or allogeneic therapeutic cell types."},{"t":"土地所有者对农业光伏采用的态度：来自意大利南部离散选择实验的证据","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001825?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"农业光伏采用","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"未来低碳能源系统中液体燃料的角色：全球能源情景间的持续交互分析","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002928?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"低碳液体燃料","kp":["[评估]: 全球与本地建模交互评估低碳液态燃料"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":2.5},"ot":"Is there a role for liquid fuels in future low-carbon energy systems? – A continuous interaction between global energy s"},{"t":"无脊椎动物 miRNA pva-small RNA-11881/pva-miR-11881 作为一种潜在的基于 RNA 的白斑综合征治疗剂 vi","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525793123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Small RNAs and microRNAs (miRNAs) play diverse roles in host virus interactions and hold promise for therapeutic applications. An uncharacterized shrimp miRNA with potent activity against white spot syndrome virus (WSSV), a major double-stranded DNA pathogen in aquaculture, was identified and characterized. Among the 1,239 differentially expressed unannotated small RNAs in\n                    Penaeus vannamei\n                    hemocytes, one of the most strongly downregulated candidates, termed pva-small RNA-11881 or pva-miR-11881, was predicted to target multiple WSSV genes. A pva-small RNA-11881/pva-miR-11881 isomir that originates from the 5′ untranslated region of a host\n                    lipase 3-like\n                    gene was identified. Its primary transcript contains Drosha and Dicer processing sites, and the precursor exhibits canonical pre-miRNA features. In vivo administration of its primary transcript, pva-pri-miR-11881, significantly reduced WSSV copy number and improved shrimp survival. Mechanistically, pva-miR-11881 directly suppresses crucial WSSV genes\n                    WSSV004\n                    ,\n                    WSSV164\n                    , and\n                    WSSV419\n                    and modulates the host immune response against WSSV infection by enhancing phenoloxidase activity, thereby reducing apoptosis and necrosis, and promoting caspase-1-mediated cell death. These findings reveal that the pva-miR-11881 in\n                    P. vannamei\n                    holds strong potential as a biotherapeutic agent for managing viral diseases in shrimp."},{"t":"通过可穿戴设备和常规血液生物标志物预测胰岛素抵抗","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10179-2","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Insulin resistance (IR), a primary precursor to type 2 diabetes, is characterized by impaired insulin action in tissues1. However, diagnostic methods remain expensive and inaccessible, which hinders early intervention2,3. Here we present the WEAR-ME study, a large, remotely conducted study of IR (n = 1,165 participants; median body mass index (BMI) = 28 kg m−2, median age = 45 years, median haemoglobin A1c (HbA1c) = 5.4%) that uses time-series data from wearable devices and routine blood biomarkers to train deep neural networks against a ground-truth measure of IR (homeostatic model assessment of IR; HOMA-IR). Using a HOMA-IR cut-off of 2.9, our multimodal model achieved robust performance (area under the receiver operating characteristic curve (AUROC) = 0.80, sensitivity = 76%, specificity = 84%) with data from wearable devices, together with demographic and routine blood biomarker data. To enhance the use of time-series data from wearables, we fine-tuned a wearable foundation model (WFM) pretrained on 40 million hours of sensor data. In an independent validation cohort (n = 72), a model integrating WFM-derived representations with demographic data surpassed a demographics-only baseline (AUROC = 0.75 versus 0.66). Moreover, adding WFM-derived representations to a model with demographics, fasting glucose and a lipid panel substantially improved performance, compared with an identical model without data from wearables (AUROC = 0.88 versus 0.76). We integrate IR prediction into a large language model to contextualize the results and facilitate personalized recommendations. This work establishes a scalable, accessible framework for the early detection of metabolic risk, which could enable timely lifestyle interventions to prevent progression to type 2 diabetes.","tp":"可穿戴测胰岛素","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"WEAR-ME研究对1165名参与者开展远程胰岛素抵抗（IR）研究，结合可穿戴设备时间序列数据与常规血液生物标志物，构建低成本、可及性强的IR预测模型。该方法有望替代传统昂贵且不易获取的诊断手段，推动2型糖尿病的早期筛查与干预。"},{"t":"细胞外镁离子对连接蛋白3功能状态以及生物物理和结构特性的影响","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2538150123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Connexin36 (Cx36) is highly expressed in inhibitory and excitatory neurons as well as pancreatic β-cells, where it forms gap junction channels that coordinate metabolic and electrical responses. In addition, Cx36 forms hemichannels in pancreatic β-cells, where it may play a critical role in endocrine cell signaling. Despite this, the regulatory mechanisms and biophysical properties of Cx36 HCs remain poorly understood. Using HeLa cells lacking endogenous expression of large-pore channels and transfected with mouse Cx36-EGFP, we evaluated hemichannel activity through dye uptake assays and membrane current recordings. We found that Cx36 hemichannel activity is strongly inhibited by extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    , rather than Ca\n                    2+\n                    , in contrast to hemichannels formed by other connexins. Under reduced extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    , or under alkaline extracellular pH conditions, Cx36 hemichannels exhibited increased activity and allowed Ca\n                    2+\n                    influx, as detected by ratiometric dye FURA-2. Under low extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    conditions, Cx36 hemichannels exhibited increased permeability to small molecules and were blocked by La\n                    3+\n                    and quinine, but not by high glucose concentration. In-silico studies revealed interactions between Mg\n                    2+\n                    and two amino acid residues within a pore constriction (D47–E49), which alter the electrostatic potential of the hemichannel pore. Consistent with these observations, mutation of either amino acid residue to alanine (D47A or E49A) markedly reduced the inhibitory effect of extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    . Together, these findings offer critical insights into the regulation of Cx36 hemichannels and suggest that alterations in Mg\n                    2+\n                    homeostasis may have significant consequences for Cx36-mediated signaling."},{"t":"可穿戴电子纺织品产业化探索：从材料、器件到系统","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00035-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"观点评论","dp":1,"b":"Wearable electronic textiles are evolving from single-function materials into integrated electronic systems. This Perspective reviews the materials, device designs, and integration strategies that enable scalable e-textile platforms across sensing, energy, feedback, communication, and computation, highlighting recent advances in system-level integration and identifying key bottlenecks in reliability, manufacturability, and interoperability. It offers an industrialization-oriented framework and points to emerging applications in wearable electronics, smart textiles, and human-machine interfaces.","tp":"电子纺织品","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":"该综述系统梳理可穿戴电子纺织品从单一功能材料向集成电子系统演进的路径，涵盖传感、能量、反馈、通信与计算等模块。重点分析系统级集成的最新进展，指出可靠性、可制造性与互操作性是产业化的核心瓶颈，并提出面向工业化的发展框架。"},{"t":"非平衡溶液燃烧合成的原位洞察：从半导体薄膜到金属纳米结构","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00009-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"溶液燃烧合成","kp":["[合成方法]: 溶液燃烧合成(≤1分钟)","[产物调控]: 多孔镍泡沫或透明氧化物薄膜"],"dp":1,"as":"利用同步辐射X射线吸收谱学对溶液燃烧合成过程进行原位观测，揭示了多孔纳米材料的可控形成机制。研究聚焦非平衡溶液燃烧反应，通过实时追踪反应中间体与相变路径，为多孔材料（如催化剂载体、电极材料）的可控制备提供了原子尺度的机理洞察，有望推动能源存储与催化领域功能性材料的理性设计。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"In situ insights from non-equilibrium solution combustion synthesis: From semiconducting thin films to metallic nanostru","b":"Synchrotron X-ray absorption spectroscopy of solution combustion reactions reveals the controlled formation of porous nickel metal foams or transparent oxide thin films based on precursor chemistry and reaction geometry. This rapid (≤1 min) and low-temperature technique enables scalable manufacturing of materials for catalysts, perovskite solar devices, and batteries."},{"t":"利用FuXi-Energy提升可再生能源预测精度","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003090?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","as":"","tg":"研究论文","tp":"新能源预测大模型","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Improving renewable energy forecasting with FuXi-Energy"},{"t":"确定关键的对流敏感海洋区域，以削弱 ENSO 春季可预测性障碍","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2512725123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The El Niño–Southern Oscillation (ENSO) exhibits its weakest predictability during boreal spring, a phenomenon known as the Spring Predictability Barrier (SPB). The SPB arises from weak air–sea coupling that limits the growth and persistence of the ENSO signal. Improving springtime prediction therefore requires identifying oceanic regions most relevant for convection variability. Here, we introduce a Sea Surface Temperature Range Index (SRI), which quantifies the spatial extent of Sea surface temperatures favorable for convection. Using SRI, we show that regions exceeding 26 °C in the east-central Pacific and 28.5 °C in the eastern Atlantic during spring are critical for initiating persistent intense convection. The expansion of these convection-sensitive areas strengthens the Bjerknes feedback by modulating the Walker circulation, providing an effective predictor of ENSO evolution. We further develop a Long Short-Term Memory deep learning model incorporating SRI, which achieves higher predictive skill than the average of dynamical and statistical models, especially for multiyear La Niña events. These results underscore the central role of convection-sensitive oceanic regions in alleviating the SPB."},{"t":"火炬气制氢：将排放转化为能源的双重机遇——前瞻性综述","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002850?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"火炬气制氢","kp":["[主题]: 火炬气制氢(排放转能源)"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Hydrogen production from flare gas: a dual opportunity to turn emissions into energy - a prospective review"},{"t":"混合钙钛矿-纳米光栅光子结构可实现室温下的超固态","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02141-0","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"The supersolid phase is a self-organized state of matter that simultaneously exhibits the crystalline order of a solid and the frictionless flow of a superfluid. Its formation requires the simultaneous breaking of phase and translational symmetries—a stringent condition that makes experimental observation challenging. Here we show that it is possible to achieve a room-temperature supersolid phase by integrating single-crystal halide perovskites with an exciton–polariton nanograting. This architecture supports a hybrid polaritonic bound-state-in-continuum state with a large bandgap (18.2 meV) and two side modes. As the pumping intensity increases, optical parametric oscillation drives the system from a bound-state-in-continuum polariton condensate into the two side modes, forming a self-organized supersolid phase characterized by a striped one-dimensional lattice spanning the condensate. Crucially, single-shot real-space imaging shows stochastic phase selection of the stripe pattern, evidenced by strong suppression of the density modulation on multishot averaging. The observation of supersolidity is further supported by long-range spatiotemporal coherence measured interferometrically and by a non-rigid supersolid lattice. The realization of supersolidity at room temperature in a polaritonic nanograting platform can be useful to control exotic quantum orders and for exploring spontaneous symmetry breaking, quantum coherence and collective excitations in driven quantum materials.","tp":"室温超固态","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究将单晶卤化钙钛矿与激子-极化激元纳米光栅集成，首次在室温下实现超固态——一种兼具固体晶格序与超流体无摩擦流动的物态。该架构通过同时打破相位与平移对称性，克服了传统超固态观测的极端实验条件限制，为量子物态研究开辟新路径。"},{"t":"印度各邦在电力脱碳方面表现如何？地方层面基于消费的分解分析","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001473?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"电力脱碳化","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"用于亨廷顿蛋白化学生物学研究的高亲和力、结构验证和选择性大环肽工具","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520462123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Huntington’s disease (HD) is a fatal neurodegenerative disorder caused by a Cytosine-Adenosine-Guanine (CAG) repeat expansion in the\n                    Huntingtin\n                    (\n                    HTT\n                    ) gene, with no disease-modifying therapies currently available. The precise molecular function of the HTT protein is unclear, and the lack of selective chemical tools has limited functional studies. We have identified and characterized macrocyclic peptide binders targeting HTT. These binders exhibit low-nanomolar affinity in vitro and engage distinct HTT and HTT-HAP40 interfaces, as revealed by hydrogen–deuterium exchange mass spectrometry and cryoelectron microscopy. Chemoproteomics confirmed selective binding in cell extracts from wildtype but not HTT-null cell lines. HAP40 consistently and stoichiometrically copurified with HTT across cell lines, including with HTT variants containing different CAG repeat lengths, highlighting the broad presence of the HTT-HAP40 complex."},{"t":"化学中隐藏的界面电场：接触起电及其他","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01066G","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"A wide range of chemical transformations proceed at immiscible boundaries, including solid dielectric–liquid, gas–liquid, and liquid–liquid interfaces, even in the absence of light, heat or externally applied potentials. At these boundaries, intense interfacial electric fields emerging from interfacial charge transfer, molecular orientation, and asymmetric charge distributions can profoundly reshape reaction free-energy landscapes. Especially at solid dielectric–liquid interfaces, contact electrification (CE) mainly drives electron transfer, generating substantial surface charge densities and interfacial electric fields that critically govern radical formation and redox chemistry. Gas–liquid or immiscible liquid–liquid interfaces, exemplified by microdroplet reactions, as well as processes at biomolecular condensate-solution boundaries, exhibit intrinsic fields on the order of ∼106–109 V m−1. Notwithstanding the burgeoning interest in this area, further fundamental scrutiny is necessary to establish a unified conceptual framework for interfacial electric field-driven reactions, moving beyond empirical observations toward predictive control. In this review, interfacial electric fields are described as emerging from cooperative effects, including CE, oriented water dipoles and ion redistribution, while their dynamic fluctuations are highlighted as a critical factor in driving interfacial chemical reactions. Mechanical excitation, material electronegativity, solvent structure, ionic strength, pH and dissolved gases are discussed as key parameters that modulate these fields and the resulting reactivity. We further emphasize some open questions concerning their spatial distribution, temporal dynamics and reaction-driven evolution and highlight the need for advanced operando techniques capable of resolving interfacial electric fields with nanometer spatial resolution and sub-microsecond temporal resolution to establish causal links between electric field dynamics and reaction outcomes. Overall, interfacial electric fields emerge as hidden forces with far-reaching implications and should be elevated from passive boundary conditions to explicit design parameters for sustainable, high-efficiency interfacial chemistry.","tp":"化学界面电场","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本文综述了不互溶界面（固-液、气-液、液-液）处隐藏的强界面电场在化学反应中的关键作用。界面电荷转移、分子取向及不对称电荷分布产生的电场可重塑反应自由能曲面，尤其在固体介电-液界面，接触起电效应显著影响化学转化路径，为界面化学调控提供新视角。"},{"t":"HEDP改性Cu2O催化剂实现酸性CO2电还原中高效C2+产物生成","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504508?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酸性CO2还原","kp":["催化剂[酸性CO2还原]: HEDP修饰Cu2O","[产物选择性]: C2+产物","[电解液]: 高浓度K⁺抑制析氢"],"dp":1,"as":"酸性条件下电催化CO2还原高效生成多碳（C2+）产物是碳资源利用的关键挑战。酸性环境有利于抑制碳酸盐生成、提高碳利用率，但面临质子竞争析氢和催化剂稳定性难题。本研究通过HEDP（羟基乙叉二膦酸）修饰Cu2O催化剂，利用有机膦酸基团调控表面微环境，有效抑制析氢副反应并促进C-C偶联，显著提升C2+产物的法拉第效率和选择性，为酸性CO2电解工业化提供新思路。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"HEDP‐Modified Cu2O Catalyst Enables Efficient C2+ Product Formation in Acidic CO2 Electroreduction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Efficient electrocatalytic CO\n                    2\n                    reduction (ECR) to multi‐carbon (C\n                    2+\n                    ) products under acidic conditions requires suppression of the competing hydrogen evolution reaction, which can be achieved with high concentrations of potassium ions (K\n                    +\n                    ) dissolved in the electrolyte. However, this excess of salt ions generates unwanted byproducts, negating the advantage of efficiency over extended use. Herein, we demonstrate a strategy to modify Cu\n                    2\n                    O with hydroxyethanediphosphonic acid (HEDP) to induce a high K\n                    +\n                    microenvironment, thereby enabling efficient CO\n                    2\n                    conversion to C\n                    2+\n                    products, even at low K\n                    +\n                    concentrations. In a 3.0 \n                    M\n                    K\n                    +\n                    electrolyte (pH 1.0), a faradaic efficiency (FE) of 79.3% for C\n                    2+\n                    products was achieved at a current density of −700 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . Notably, after activation in a K\n                    +\n                    ‐containing electrolyte, the FE for C\n                    2+\n                    products can still reach 50% even in a K\n                    +\n                    ‐free electrolyte (1 m\n                    M\n                    H\n                    2\n                    SO\n                    4\n                    ), while the FE for H\n                    2\n                    remains below 15%. Experimental and first‐principles calculations revealed that HEDP facilitated K\n                    +\n                    enrichment on the catalyst interface, induced a higher local pH microenvironment, and promoted C−C coupling. Our interfacial microenvironment optimization strategy harnesses the critical role of the electrode‐electrolyte interface in promoting efficient CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction to C\n                    2+\n                    products under acidic conditions with low K\n                    +\n                    concentrations."},{"t":"菱方GeTe基热电材料中巨幅ZT值提升","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70793-6","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"GeTe热电材料增效","kp":["晶相[GeTe热电]: 菱方相(相变温度以下)","[瓶颈]: 高温立方相相变致界面不稳定","[策略]: 菱方相下实现高性能更实用"],"as":"GeTe基热电材料的峰值热电优值（ZT）通常出现在高温菱形相转变附近。本研究通过成分工程和能带结构调控，在菱形GeTe基材料中实现ZT的巨大提升。GeTe作为无铅热电材料，在结构相变点附近出现能带收敛和声子散射增强，从而优化电导率并降低热导率。研究通过掺杂或合金化稳定菱形相、引入点缺陷和纳米析出相，在宽温区内实现高功率因子和极低晶格热导率，为中高温热电发电应用带来突破。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Giant ZT enhancement in rhombohedral GeTe-based thermoelectric materials","b":"The peak figure of merit (ZT) of GeTe-based thermoelectric (TE) materials is typically attained in the high-temperature cubic phase, where the inevitable phase transition raises concerns over interfacial instability during operation. Therefore, developing high-performance rhombohedral GeTe below the phase transition temperature represents a more viable path toward practical applications. Herein, we propose a facile nanocomposite strategy to enhance the TE performance of rhombohedral GeTe by incorporating high-modulus TiB2 nanoparticles into Ge0.94Bi0.05Te matrix. We demonstrate that the nanoparticle-induced interfacial constraint effect contributes to increasing longitudinal elastic modulus and decreasing equivalent deformation potential, accounting for improved carrier mobility. Additionally, these TiB2 inclusions form heterogeneous interfaces that promote charge depletion and generate substantial thermal resistance, concurrently suppressing the heat transfer by carriers and phonons. Consequently, an extraordinary ZT of 2.66 at 613 K and a superior average ZT of 1.29 (300 ~ 613 K) are obtained in the rhombohedral GeTe-based composite. This work shows a paradigm for synergistically optimizing the electrical and thermal transports of emerging TE systems with nanoinclusions."},{"t":"全球循环失衡日益恶化的情况下磷可持续性的未来策略","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2512673123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Global anthropogenic phosphorus (P) cycle changes require active management with differentiated sustainability strategies across countries. This study developed a universal framework that integrates the comprehensive P flow process with sustainability scenarios to assess global anthropogenic P flow patterns and explore future sustainability pathways and potential. The results indicated that the global P flow imbalance intensified from 1961 to 2022, with over 80% attributed to croplands. Crucially, global trade serves as a significant driving force, redistributing P resources and reinforcing the global complexity of P-pollution footprints, driven by 35 key countries. Our model projects that by 2050, individual measures like reducing fertilizer applications, improving feed conversion efficiency, and recycling organic fertilizers could save 50% of P and reduce P losses by 39%. Crop–livestock integration significantly improved P use efficiency, potentially extending the global phosphate rock extraction period by 400 ± 87 y (mean ± SD). However, due to the low baseline P use efficiency in cropping systems, P recovery from waste in developing countries remains limited, necessitating additional measures alongside the above high-leverage measures. These findings underscore the indispensable role of human consumption and the transformative potential of dietary shifts, which are essential given that no country can achieve significant P sustainability gains solely by reducing food waste or processing losses. Coordinated supply and demand-side measures linking cropping, livestock, and consumption offer key strategies and benefits for systematically and differentially advancing P sustainability at both global and national levels.","tp":"磷资源循环","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究构建整合磷流动全流程与可持续性情景的通用框架，评估1961至2022年全球人为磷流格局。结果显示全球磷循环失衡持续加剧，逾80%来自农田系统。研究提出针对不同国家的差异化磷可持续管理策略，对保障粮食安全与减少环境富营养化具有重要意义。"},{"t":"从微米到纳米尺度的遮蔽电化学发光显微成像","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521654?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学发光显微成像","kp":["[成像对比度]: 负光学对比","[免标记纳米成像]: 电致化学发光"],"dp":1,"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本文综述了电化学发光（ECL）显微镜从微米尺度向纳米尺度发展的技术路径与应用前景。ECL作为一种基于化学反应发光的成像技术，无需外部光源激发即可实现高灵敏度、低背景噪声的界面过程可视化。文章讨论了\"阴影ECL显微镜\"（Shadow ECL）的原理——利用电极表面微纳结构对电场和反应物分布的屏蔽效应实现超分辨成像。研究展示了该技术在单纳米颗粒电催化、单细胞传感和生物分子检测中的应用，并展望了空间分辨率突破衍射极限的新策略。","ot":"From Microscale to Nanoscale Shadow Electrochemiluminescence Microscopy","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemiluminescence (ECL) has emerged as a promising chemistry‐based imaging technique, yet its potential in optical nano‐imaging is still in the early stages. We report the label‐free imaging of microobjects and nanoobjects with a sharp negative optical contrast. The shadow ECL images obtained are the optical signatures of the blocking of the electron‐transfer reaction convoluted by the chemical reactivity and local diffusional hindrance of the ECL reagents by the object deposited on the electrode. Here, we address first the critical aspect of the smallest spherical nanoparticle imaged by shadow ECL microscopy. By investigating the imaging limits of shadow ECL, we demonstrate its capability to image single nanoparticles down to 50 nm. This work uncovers the sensitivity of the method by not only showing the smallest particles imaged by shadow ECL to date, but also, counterintuitively, a contrastive behavior of the single insulating particles with increased electrochemical rates at the insulator‐electrolyte‐electrode triple point. Finally, the practical utility of this shadow ECL method is illustrated by imaging complex samples such as densely packed particle assemblies or microbial\n                    Bacillus subtilis\n                    spores. It also opens new avenues for single‐molecule and shadow ECL nano imaging of catalytic and biological systems."},{"t":"氟-18-标记的核苷酸类似物靶向外切-5'-核苷酸酶（CD73）用于正电子发射断层扫描成像","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522758?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ecto‐5’‐nucleotidase (CD73) is a potential new drug target for cancer immunotherapy. Its overexpression is associated with various aggressive cancers, including triple‐negative breast cancer (TNBC) and pancreatic cancer, making it a promising target for diagnostic imaging. Besides antibodies, small‐molecule CD73 inhibitors have been developed and are currently in clinical trials. This study aimed to develop and evaluate fluorine‐18 labeled high‐affinity CD73 inhibitors as tracers for the non‐invasive positron emission tomography (PET) imaging of CD73 expression in cancer. Two CD73 inhibitors were selected for radiolabeling based on their high potency (K\n                    i\n                    values of ca. 1 nM) and favorable pharmacokinetic properties, yielding [\n                    18\n                    F]PSB‐19427 ([\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    1\n                    ) and [\n                    18\n                    F]MRS‐4648 ([\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    2\n                    ). Ex vivo imaging studies on human breast cancer tissues indicated specific binding of both radiotracers. Subsequent in vivo studies proved [\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    1\n                    to be superior due to its long elimination half‐life and its accumulation in TNBC and pancreatic cancer tissues, suggesting its potential as a versatile PET tracer for imaging of various solid tumors. Compared to [\n                    18\n                    F]FDG, [\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    1\n                    was superior in visualizing TNBC, offering potential advantages over [\n                    18\n                    F]FDG in terms of specificity and diagnostic accuracy. Thus, [\n                    18\n                    F]\n                    1\n                    is a PET tracer with outstanding properties suitable for broad application in cancer diagnosis and personalized medicine."},{"t":"闪速焦耳热处理在富镍层状氧化物正极中诱导尖晶石相表面以稳定晶格氧","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70616-8","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富镍层状氧化物正极","kp":["[表面处理]: 闪速焦耳热诱导尖晶石相","[正极]: 高镍层状氧化物稳定晶格氧"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"本研究利用闪速焦耳加热（flash joule heating）技术在富镍层状氧化物正极表面构建尖晶石相包覆层，以稳定晶格氧抑制结构退化。高镍正极材料在循环过程中因晶格氧流失导致不可逆相变、微裂纹和容量衰减。闪速焦耳加热的超快升温和淬灭特性使正极颗粒表面发生原位拓扑相转化，形成均匀致密的尖晶石相壳层。该壳层有效抑制了充放电循环中Ni4+与电解液的副反应和氧释放，显著提升了正极的循环稳定性与热安全性。","ot":"Flash joule heating-induced spinel-phase surface in Ni-rich layered oxide positive electrodes to stabilise lattice oxyge","b":"High-nickel layered positive electrodes suffer from progressive structural degradation arising from lattice oxygen loss and inherent lattice strain. Although surface coatings are widely used to stabilize lattice-oxygen redox and mitigate electro-chemo-mechanical degradation, achieving coatings with full continuity, robust interfacial bonding, and fast Li+ conductivity remains challenging. Herein, we present a fundamentally different approach to shell formation via a self-derived subtractive strategy, departing from the conventional additive-based coating methods. By accurately applying transient thermal pulses, surface lithium is selectively extracted from layered LiNixCoyMn1-x-yO2 (x = 0.8 ~ 0.9), directly converting the outer region into a coherent spinel-phase shell with tunable thickness. This nanoscale spinel-phase skin forms a robust mortise-and-tenon-like interconnection with the layered bulk, enabling isotropic, high-rate Li+ extraction/insertion while maintaining electronic conductivity throughout cycling. It effectively confines active oxygen intermediates, and suppresses interfacial side reactions and strain evolution under high-potential operation. Therefore, the spinel-phase skin-encapsulated LiNi0.8Co0.1Mn0.1O2 achieves an initial Coulombic efficiency of 95.3% and enables pouch cells with 80.1% capacity retention after 2000 cycles at 180 mA g-1. This strategy is extendable to LiNi0.9Co0.05Mn0.05O2, may open new avenues for advancing nickel-rich positive electrode technologies."},{"t":"共价有机框架的环境转化","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41578-026-00908-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Reviews Materials","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"集成质子耦合电子转移诱导碳帽实现能量增强型水系有机液流电池","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506006?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机液流电池","kp":["[耦合机制]: 质子耦合电子转移","[功能集成]: 碳捕集与利用一体化"],"dp":1,"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究通过集成质子耦合电子转移（PCET）策略与碳骨架调控，实现了水系有机液流电池能量密度的显著提升。水系有机液流电池以有机氧化还原活性分子为电解质，兼具安全性、可扩展性和潜在低成本优势。研究设计了一系列耦合质子/电子转移的氧化还原分子，利用PCET机制调控氧化还原电位和溶解度，并通过对碳电极表面的功能化修饰优化电催化动力学。该策略使电池在保持长循环寿命的同时显著提升了能量密度和电压效率。","ot":"Energy‐Enhanced Aqueous Organic Flow Batteries Enabled by Integrated Proton‐Coupled Electron Transfer‐Induced Carbon Cap","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Aqueous organic redox flow batteries offer a safe, scalable, and potentially cost‐effective solution for storing massive electricity from intermittent renewables. Meanwhile, operating at ambient temperature and pressure, electrochemically induced carbon capture using aqueous redox sorbents in flow systems has recently emerged as a low‐energy technology for climate change mitigation. Integrating these two technologies within an aqueous organic flow system represents a unified route to achieving decarbonization. Here, employing organic molecules undergoing proton‐coupled electron transfer as redox species, we establish aqueous all‐organic flow battery systems that achieve enhanced energy storage as well as coupled CO\n                    2\n                    capture and utilization. During discharge, CO\n                    2\n                    from simulated flue gas is captured as HCO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    by the oxygen‐tolerant positive electrolyte (posolyte). The buffered posolyte prevents negative shifts in its redox potential, elevating a flow cell voltage up to 1.32 V, and enhancing discharge energy by at most 24.3% compared to operations under N\n                    2\n                    . During charge, CO\n                    2\n                    is released with a CO\n                    2\n                    /\n                    e\n                    molar ratio approaching unity at an energy cost of 30.65 kJ mol\n                    −1\n                    CO\n                    2\n                    . As a proof‐of‐concept, our work establishes a new paradigm for integrating enhanced energy storage with carbon capture, utilization, and storage, paving the way for next‐generation multifunctional electrochemical redox flow systems.","aip":1},{"t":"将物理计算融入软体机器人","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70866-6","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"软体机器人物理计算","kp":["计算范式[软体机器人]: 物理计算嵌入","[工作机制]: 输入编码至机械计算核"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本文探讨了将物理计算（physical computing）嵌入软体机器人的设计理念与技术路径。软体机器人以柔性材料为基底，其驱动、感知与控制长期依赖刚性电子元件的外部集成，制约了系统的柔性与鲁棒性。文章提出\"软化\"计算单元和控制器的策略，利用软态传感器、软态逻辑门和软态致动器构建全柔性闭环控制回路，使计算功能与软体本体无缝融合。这一方向被视为软体机器人走向自主可靠运行的最后前沿之一。","ot":"Embodying physical computing into soft robots","b":"Softening and onboarding computers and controllers is one of the final frontiers in soft robotics towards their robustness and intelligence for everyday use. In this regard, embodying soft and physical computing presents exciting potential. Physical computing seeks to encode inputs into a mechanical computing kernel and leverage the internal interactions among this kernel’s constituent elements to compute the output. Moreover, such input-to-output evolution can be re-programmable. This perspective paper proposes a framework for embodying physical computing into soft robots and discusses three unique strategies in the literature: analog oscillators, physical reservoir computing, and physical algorithmic computing. These embodied computers enable the soft robot to perform complex behaviors that would otherwise require CMOS-based electronics — including coordinated locomotion with obstacle avoidance, payload weight and orientation classification, and programmable operation based on logical rules. This paper will detail the working principles of these embodied physical computing methods, survey the current state-of-the-art, and present a perspective for future development."},{"t":"基于氧化还原介体的电致变色动态窗户","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72800?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电致变色智能窗","kp":["[电致变色]: 氧化还原介体驱动","[动态窗]: 可逆金属电沉积(RME)"],"dp":1,"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"本文提出利用氧化还原介体（redox mediators）驱动电致变色动态窗技术，实现建筑和交通领域的智能光-热管理。建筑和交通部门是全球能耗主体，动态调控窗户的透光率与热阻可大幅降低制冷供暖能耗。研究设计引入可逆氧化还原电对的电解质体系，通过电化学调控介体的氧化还原态切换窗口在透明与着色状态之间快速转换，兼具高对比度、低驱动电压和长循环稳定性。该方案为节能型智能窗的商业化提供了新思路。","ot":"Electrochromic Dynamic Windows with Redox Mediators","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The construction and transportation sectors dominate global energy consumption, making intelligent opto‐thermal regulation of building envelopes and vehicle windows critical for energy conservation and human comfort. While electrochromic (EC) dynamic windows offer significant potential, conventional technologies face scalability and cost barriers. Reversible metal electrodeposition (RME) presents a promising alternative, distinguished by its unique potential to efficiently control opto‐thermal transmittance. However, the symmetric dual‐electrode RME architectures, which are essential for uniform optical switching, have suffered from operational instability due to voltage‐driven parasitic reactions. Herein, we introduce a unique strategy integrating redox mediators (RMs) into EC dynamic windows to overcome this limitation. Using poly(3,4‐ethylenedioxythiophene):poly(styrenesulfonate) (PEDOT:PSS) in the Cu and Bi‐based RME hydrogel systems, we demonstrate accelerated interfacial kinetics and decreased overpotential. This reduces the operational voltage from −1.9 V to −1.2 V while enhancing long‐term working stability (18,000 s vs. 180 s). The RM‐engineered EC dynamic windows achieve 6 000 cycles without degradation and maintain stable optical modulation, with the apparent enhancement of optical switching speed. Crucially, the approach universally improves performance in traditional EC systems (e.g., tungsten oxides, viologen derivatives). This RM strategy establishes a material‐agnostic platform technology, enabling scalable fabrication of next‐generation dynamic glazing through a unified design paradigm."},{"t":"5-氟尿嘧啶、伊立替康和奥沙利铂负载植入物在小鼠和猪模型中的功效和安全性评估","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522617?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma (PDAC) remains highly resistant to treatment, with mortality rates largely unchanged despite advances in cancer therapies. For ∼80% of borderline, non‐resectable, or metastatic cases, chemotherapy is predominantly palliative, underscoring the need for improved drug delivery approaches. This study presents the development, characterization and in vivo evaluation of a novel polymeric implant loaded with 5‐fluorouracil, irinotecan, and oxaliplatin (FIRINOX). Scanning electron microscopy of FIRINOX implants showed internal microstructure was preserved upon drug loading, while micro‐CT and X‐ray imaging revealed valuable insights into the morphology and degradation of implants retrieved from in vivo experiments. In murine PDAC models, dose‐escalation identified 4 × FIRINOX implants as the maximum tolerated dose, while 2 × implants achieved significant therapeutic efficacy at lower doses than IV administration, without compromising animal safety. In healthy pigs, 20 × FIRINOX implants were well‐tolerated, as confirmed by histopathology and blood analysis. Finally, laser ablation‐inductively coupled plasma‐mass spectrometry imaging and microbiome analysis confirmed localized drug perfusion within tissues, and minimal off‐target effects, including preservation of gut microbiota diversity. These findings support the potential of this implantable platform to improve outcomes in borderline or non‐resectable PDAC and enhance tolerability of cytotoxic chemotherapy through localized, controlled delivery, addressing a key gap where current treatment options are limited."},{"t":"消除漂移障碍：为什么突变率会有所不同？","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2601432123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"烯烃直接转化为炔烃","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10372-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Alkynes are widely used as feedstock chemicals and functional groups in organic chemistry1,2. However, while the hydrogenation from an alkyne to an alkene is well established, typical methods for the reverse reaction – conversion of an alkene to an alkyne, are based on elimination chemistry reported in the 1860s3 and use forcing conditions (strong base or high temperatures)4-6. This precludes more general application on functional molecules. Here we report a recyclable selenanthrene reagent that mediates alkenes desaturation to alkynes under mild conditions. This method shows broad compatibility with both classical leaving groups and sensitive functional groups, enabling application late-stage in the efficient synthesis of complex alkynes. Moreover, this platform enables Z/E alkenes configuration inversion or sorting that are inaccessible with existing methods, highlighting its potential for diverse downstream derivatizations."},{"t":"设计具有共生结构的锂离子筛膜用于长期稳定提锂","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525608?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/有色金属/其它有色金属产业","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂离子筛膜提锂","kp":["膜结构[海水提锂]: LAGP共生TiO2保护层","[渗透生长策略]: 长期稳定提锂"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究设计了一种具有互生（intergrowth）结构的锂离子筛（Li-ion sieve, LIS）膜，用于从海水或盐湖卤水中长期稳定地提取锂。锂离子筛材料（如Li1.5Al0.5Ge1.5(PO4)3等锂超离子导体）虽对Li+具有高选择性，但易受腐蚀降解，长期循环性能差。互生结构设计使活性相与支撑相在微观尺度上共生互锁，提升了膜的化学稳定性与离子传导性，有望突破海水提锂中材料耐久性瓶颈，为战略锂资源获取开辟新途径。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Designing an Intergrowth‐Structure Li Ion‐Sieve Membrane for Long‐Term Stable Lithium Extraction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Extracting lithium from seawater offers an additional Li source but is hindered by corrosion of Li\n                    1.5\n                    Al\n                    0.5\n                    Ge\n                    1.5\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    (LAGP) and weak adhesion of conventional coating layers. Here we propose a permeation growth strategy to construct an intergrowth TiO\n                    2\n                    protection layer on a LAGP membrane (LAGP membrane with intergrowth layer) for long‐term stable lithium extraction from seawater. An acidic TiO\n                    2\n                    sol is spin‐coated onto a polished LAGP membrane and sintered, during which acid etching and Ti\n                    4+\n                    /Ge\n                    4+\n                    ion exchange generate a lattice‐matched Li\n                    1+x\n                    Al\n                    x\n                    Ti\n                    2‐x\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    /LAGP interfacial phase beneath a dense TiO\n                    2\n                    intergrowth layer. This intergrowth‐structure eliminates interfacial gaps, enhances peel strength and hardness, and provides continuous Li\n                    +\n                    transport pathways, delivering an ionic conductivity of 2.40 × 10\n                    −4\n                    S cm\n                    −1\n                    at room temperature and excellent chemical stability in seawater. Applied in a lithium extraction device using natural seawater as anolyte and an organic electrolyte as catholyte, the LAGP membrane with intergrowth layer maintains integrity, Li\n                    +\n                    /Na\n                    +\n                    selectivity, and stable operation for 650 h, achieving a Coulombic efficiency of 97.4% and an energy consumption of 17.4 kWh kg\n                    −1\n                    Li\n                    . This permeation growth strategy offers a general route to construct intergrowth‐structure Li ion‐sieve membranes with chemical stability and Li\n                    +\n                    transport for seawater lithium extraction."},{"t":"具有表面催化内源性一氧化氮生成功能的可展开 3D 打印血管支架","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520199?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Atherosclerosis, a leading cause of heart attacks and strokes through the formation of vascular blockages, has become a major global healthcare challenge, with patient numbers expected to rise. Balloon‐based angioplasty and stenting, the most common clinical treatments, have evolved over decades with advances in material biocompatibility, biodegradability, and device design. However, they still face critical issues such as tissue damage, inflammation, and restenosis, which can lead to implant failure and necessitate repeated surgeries, severely affecting patients’ quality of life. To address the urgent need for a long‐term stable stent system, we present a deployable 3D‐printed vascular stent with surface‐catalyzed endogenous nitric oxide (NO) generation (DSENO), offering a promising new direction for stent development. Unlike traditional stents, the DSENO can be deployed remotely using magnetic force and heat, eliminating the need for a catheter or balloon and thereby reducing the risk of tissue injury. Furthermore, its surface is modified to catalyze intracellular NO generation from endogenous S‐nitrosothiols, which inhibits smooth muscle cell proliferation to prevent restenosis.","tp":"催化血管支架","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发一种3D打印可展开血管支架，表面具有催化内源性一氧化氮（NO）生成功能。NO的抗血栓、抗增殖和抗炎特性可有效缓解血管成形术后的组织损伤、炎症和再狭窄问题，为动脉粥样硬化等心血管疾病的介入治疗提供新型器件方案。"},{"t":"登革热病毒利用蚊子 Syntenin 将病毒 RNA 加载并分泌到唾液外泌体中","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520697123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Viruses exploit extracellular vesicles (EVs) to transfer infection-enhancing viral RNAs. However, mechanisms underlying viral RNA loading remain elusive. We leveraged our previous discovery that dengue virus secretes transmission-enhancing subgenomic flaviviral RNA (sfRNA) into mosquito salivary EVs to investigate viral RNA loading mechanism. We demonstrate that sfRNA alone promotes the secretion of sfRNA-containing EVs marked by the mosquito EV biogenesis protein AeSyntenin, by applying microscopy and viral genetic editing in in vitro and in vivo models. SfRNA via its stem loop structures interacts intracellularly with mosquito AeSyntenin and this interaction is selectively maintained within EVs as shown by complementary RNA-affinity chromatography and RNA immunoprecipitation, and AI-based prediction. Finally, we used systemic and salivary gland-specific protein depletion to establish a functional role for mosquito AeSyntenin in exosome production and salivary secretion of sfRNA. We propose that sfRNA binds AeSyntenin to drive its selective packaging and release into exosomes, elucidating a mechanism for viral RNA incorporation into EVs."},{"t":"肺上皮细胞中线粒体 DNA 的 RNA 聚合酶 III 传感缺陷会损害 I 型 IFN 对 S 的免疫","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522111123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The clinical spectrum of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 (SARS-CoV-2) infection ranges from asymptomatic cases to critical COVID-19 pneumonia. To investigate the role of host genetics in susceptibility to critical COVID-19 and identify pathophysiological mechanisms and pathways, we analyzed whole-exome and whole-genome sequencing data from the COVID Human Genetic Effort. We identified 10 rare, monoallelic predicted loss-of-function variants in 18 patients in\n                    POLR3A\n                    and\n                    POLR3C\n                    encoding two subunits of RNA polymerase III (POL III), a nuclear multisubunit enzyme, which has been implicated in cytosolic DNA sensing. These variants were deleterious for expression of full-length POLR3A and POLR3C proteins. We demonstrate that human pulmonary A549-hACE2 cells with reduced POLR3A or POLR3C expression exhibit impaired type I IFN responses to transfected mitochondrial DNA (mtDNA) or SARS-CoV-2 infection, together with increased viral replication. Mechanistically, we show that SARS-CoV-2 induces cellular mtDNA release via oligomerization of the mitochondrial voltage-dependent anion channel under virus-induced oxidative stress, enabling POL III–mtDNA interaction. These findings establish POL III as a sensor of endogenous mtDNA released during viral infection and indicate that autosomal dominant POL III haploinsufficiency may predispose individuals to critical COVID-19."},{"t":"智能手表的数据揭示了胰岛素抵抗的早期迹象","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00380-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"无因果的相关性不足以支持人-大模型推理对齐的论断","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536362123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","tp":"LLM推理对齐质疑","as":"","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Correlations without causation do not support claims of human–LLM reasoning alignment"},{"t":"更正 Wang 等人，临床试验化合物 NITD-688 对登革热病毒抑制的机制见解","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2606246123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"对Guo等人的更正，一种核糖体合成和翻译后修饰的具有ADP-核糖基化的肽","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607090123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"更正 Chen 等人的观点：PHGDH 的 RNA 结合活性驱动人脑类器官模型中淀粉样蛋白的产生","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2606894123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过毛细力介导的冷凝物介导的细胞膜形状转变","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2424126123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Phase-separated biomolecular condensates with liquid-like properties play a key role in the organization and compartmentalization of the intracellular environment. Condensate-mediated capillary forces acting on membranes drive physiologically important reshaping of membrane-bound organelles, such as vacuoles and autophagosomes. Here, we explore condensate-mediated membrane shape transformations. We employ in planta live-cell imaging, an in vitro reconstitution system with tunable interfacial tension, and computer simulations of an elastic membrane model to describe three morphologies of membrane structures localized at condensate interfaces: tubes, sheets, and cups. We find that the forces associated with high interfacial tension drive the formation of stable sheets, while tubes and cups prevail at lower interfacial tension. We calculate the free energies of each membrane shape and identify the energy barriers that govern the transitions between the shapes. With this approach, we find that shape transformations depend on the history of the interfacial membrane and exhibit a tube-to-cup hysteresis. These findings indicate that temporal control of condensate surface properties can mediate the morphogenesis of cup-like structures in cells, such as the formation of “bulbs” within plant vacuoles. Our results further generalize how the interplay of condensates and membranes contributes to intracellular organization."},{"t":"含超大A位阳离子的非手性准二维钙钛矿铁电体中的手性非线性光学响应","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3136861?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维钙钛矿非线性光学","kp":["[A位阳离子]: 超大尺寸准二维钙钛矿","[手性非线性光学]: 非手性铁电体"],"dp":1,"as":"在非手性准二维钙钛矿铁电材料中观测到手性非线性光学响应，打破了传统认知中手性光学效应需手性晶体结构的限制。该发现源于铁电极化诱导的结构不对称性，使非手性材料表现出圆二色性和二次谐波旋光等手性光学特征。此成果拓展了非线性光学材料的设计思路，在光开关、光信息处理和量子光学器件领域具有应用前景。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Chiral Nonlinear Optical Response in Achiral Quasi‐2D Perovskite Ferroelectric Featuring Unusually Large A‐Site Cation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The exploration of 2D perovskites and chiral nonlinear optical materials has drawn significant interest due to their structural tunability and strong optical responses. However, the development of quasi‐2D perovskites has long been constrained by the limited choice of A‐site cations imposed by the traditional tolerance factor. In this study, we present a new 2D tri‐layered lead bromide perovskite (4AM)\n                    4\n                    Pb\n                    3\n                    Br\n                    10\n                    (\n                    n\n                    = 3) with the general formula (A\n                    ′\n                    )\n                    2\n                    (A)\n                    \n                      n\n                    \n                    −1\n                    M\n                    \n                      n\n                    \n                    X\n                    3\n                    \n                      n\n                    \n                    +1\n                    , in which 4‐aminomonpholine cations (4AM) that act simultaneously as A‐site and spacer components, exhibiting an ultrahigh tolerance factor of 1.74—far beyond conventional limits. Crystallizing in the polar space group\n                    Cc\n                    , the compound shows an order‐disorder ferroelectric phase transition at 418 K. Interestingly it also exhibits notable chiral nonlinear optical properties, including strong second‐harmonic generation circular dichroism (\n                    g\n                    SHG‐CD\n                    ≈ 0.63). This work breaks the classic tolerance factor constraint and opens a pathway for designing new chiral nonlinear optical materials in low‐dimensional perovskites."},{"t":"中国批准脑机接口芯片治疗瘫痪——全球首例","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00849-6","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"脑机接口","kp":["[脑机接口]: 世界首例获批治疗瘫痪"],"as":"","sc":9.1,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":8.5,"r":9.5,"d":4.0,"t":10.0},"aip":1,"ot":"China approves brain chip to treat paralysis — a world first"},{"t":"37 年实验中的幼年蓝蟹的同类相食、捕食和避难所","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2533461123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"This 37-y record (1989–2025) of field experiments tested seasonal and annual variation in predation on juvenile blue crabs (\n                    Callinectes sapidus\n                    ) in a representative mesohaline site of Chesapeake Bay, USA, where the species is a dominant epibenthic predator and major fishery. We used replicated sets of individually tethered crabs to provide a relative index of lethal and sublethal predation rates on intermolt individuals as a function of size and habitats. Cannibalism by large adult crabs accounted for &gt;97% of predation of juvenile crabs; predation by fish was not observed; and mortality from physiological stress was rare (&lt;1%). Sampling by depth showed that juveniles occurred in nearshore shallows, while adults were in deeper water. Cannibalism was also depth-dependent: Rates were high at 75 cm depth; intermediate at 40 cm; and lowest at 15 cm shallows, which provided partial refuge. Cannibalism was size-dependent: 30 to 50 mm juveniles experienced high rates of predation; 90 to 110 mm preadults had low rates; and &gt;120 mm adults had no predation. Cannibalism rates on juveniles varied seasonally, peaking during summer when adult crabs were most active; no tethering predation occurred in cold months. Variation in adult crab abundance accounted for 51% of annual variation in predation on tethered juveniles. Cannibalism by adult blue crabs provides a density-dependent regulation of juveniles by adults, with juvenile survivorship dependent on shallow-water refuge habitats in the mesohaline zone of the estuary. The refuge habitat appears increasingly restricted both by predatory fish common in high and recently introduced in low salinities, and by shoreline hardening."},{"t":"数据基础设施建设能否缓解清洁能源错配？——基于中国省级数据的分析","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526001813?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源数据化","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"AI模型能否可靠预测极端天气事件？","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00842-z","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI极端天气预测","as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Can AI models reliably forecast extreme weather events?"},{"t":"桥联吡咯吲哚-CAYC-金配合物：利用金(I)中弱次级分子内Au···H−C(sp3)相互作用","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526091?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金(I)催化配合物","kp":["[配体设计]: 桥环氨基(叶立德)卡宾bCAYC","[催化体系]: 金(I)均相催化"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦于金(I)催化有机合成中的桥联吡咯吲哚-CAYC-金配合物设计。金(I)催化已成为有机合成和催化领域的强大工具。研究团队利用弱二级分子内相互作用调控配位环境，开发新型桥联配合物体系，旨在提升金催化反应的立体选择性与催化效率。该工作对复杂天然产物全合成、药物分子构建及绿色化学催化路径设计具有潜在推动价值，体现了配位化学与有机催化交叉的前沿进展。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Bridged Pyrroloindole‐CAYC‐Gold Complexes: Harnessing Weak Secondary Intramolecular Au···H−C(sp3) Interactions in Gold(I","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Gold(I) catalysis has been established as a tremendously powerful tool in organic synthesis and catalysis. Herein, we introduce a new class of electronically‐ and sterically‐hindered N‐heterocyclic carbene ligands, termed as bridged cyclic amino(ylide)carbene (\n                    \n                      b\n                    \n                    CAYC), containing 9H‐pyrrolo[1,2‐a]indoles as the carbene core and diaryl sulfonium as the ylide partner. Highly electron‐rich\n                    \n                      b\n                    \n                    CAYC ligands are suitable for synthesizing the corresponding gold(I) complexes, which exhibit a weak intramolecular Au···H−C(sp\n                    3\n                    ) interaction as a secondary interaction where the gold d‐orbitals act as electron donors and the C–H σ* orbitals act as acceptors. Properties and parameters of Au···H−C(sp\n                    3\n                    ) interactions were investigated through X‐ray, NMR, DFT, AIM, and NBO studies. This study reports a remarkably short Au···H−C(sp\n                    3\n                    ) distance of 2.26 Å, as determined through X‐ray crystallographic analysis. DFT and TEP data analysis revealed that\n                    \n                      b\n                    \n                    CAYCs are among the most σ‐donating carbene ligands to date, than other widely used NHC ligands. The steric impact of\n                    \n                      b\n                    \n                    CAYCs has shown excellent potential for steric shielding, with %V\n                    bur\n                    reaching up to 42.6%. These unique properties were well‐reflected through the room‐temperature hydroamination and one‐pot C–N and C–C bond‐forming reactions."},{"t":"生物圈扩张驱动地球的长期氧化，而构造调节机器l揭示的氧气变化","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536681123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The rise of atmospheric oxygen fundamentally transformed Earth’s surface environment and enabled the evolution of complex life. However, the processes driving long-term oxygen fluctuations remain poorly resolved, partly from limited proxy resolution and temporal coverage. Trace element (TE) concentrations in sedimentary pyrite offer a robust archive of redox conditions in ancient oceans and their linkage to atmospheric oxygen levels. Here we integrate high-resolution geochemical data from pyrite grains spanning 3.5 billion years with machine learning to reconstruct atmospheric oxygen evolution. We identify two coherent TE groups representing redox-sensitive and hydrothermal influences. Our results reveal that the long-term, secular trend of atmospheric oxygen is tightly coupled with biosphere expansion, whereas superimposed short-term fluctuations are influenced by tectonic events, including supercontinent assembly and breakup. Specifically, we show that primary oxygenation events (GOE and NOE) correlate strongly with biological expansion. Episodes of prolonged oxygenation broadly overlap with continental assembly, reflecting enhanced weathering, nutrient fluxes, and organic carbon burial, whereas supercontinent breakup phases are commonly associated with more reducing conditions, likely linked to increased volcanic emissions and diminished net biospheric oxygen. This reconstruction not only refines the temporal dynamics of Earth’s redox evolution but also highlights the interconnected roles of biological productivity, tectonics, ocean chemistry, and Earth-system processes in shaping planetary habitability. These findings provide a comprehensive framework for understanding Earth’s atmospheric evolution and inform models of environmental change on early Earth and other habitable planets."},{"t":"液态空气储能系统液化过程分析：两相概念化与评估","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003533?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/其它储能技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液态空气储能","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Analysis of liquefaction processes for liquid air energy storage systems: Conceptualization and evaluation of two-phase "},{"t":"MXene-聚合物复合材料在尖端超级电容器与电磁屏蔽领域的最新进展","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003119?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"MXene聚合物超容屏蔽","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Advances in MXene-Polymer Composites for Cutting-edge Supercapacitor and EMI Shielding Applications"},{"t":"添加剂辅助工业TOPCon硅表面钙钛矿结晶用于效率提升的叠层太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02010-z","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿叠层电池","kp":["[添加剂]: 2-巯基苯并噻唑双功能","[底电池]: 工业TOPCon硅","[器件]: 钙钛矿-硅叠层电池"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦于工业级TOPCon（隧穿氧化物钝化接触）硅底上钙钛矿薄膜的结晶优化。薄硅片虽具有低热质量和高理论效率优势，但在叠层电池制备中，钙钛矿层的高质量成膜仍是核心挑战。研究通过引入功能性添加剂调控钙钛矿的结晶动力学，抑制缺陷形成并改善薄膜均匀性，从而提升钙钛矿/TOPCon叠层太阳能电池的光电转换效率和器件稳定性，推进其向工业化量产迈进。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Additive-assisted perovskite crystallization on industrial TOPCon silicon for tandem solar cells with improved efficienc","b":"Thin silicon wafers used in tunnel oxide passivated contact tandem solar cells have reduced thermal mass and higher thermal conductivity, which accelerate heat transfer during perovskite subcell deposition. This rapid heat transfer induces fast crystallization of the perovskite layer, compromising film quality and tandem performance. Here we introduce 2-mercaptobenzothiazole, which exhibits dual-mode binding with perovskite organic cations, to modulate crystallization dynamics. This approach improves morphological uniformity, eliminates voids and suppresses halide segregation, while reducing non-radiative recombination and lowering the trap-assisted recombination rate from 3.2 × 105 to 4.3 × 104 cm s−1. The two-terminal monolithic perovskite/tunnel oxide passivated contact tandem cell achieves a certified stabilized power conversion efficiency of 32.76% and retains 91% of its initial efficiency after 1,700 h of continuous operation. This work uncovers a previously overlooked perovskite crystallization issue on industrial silicon wafers, providing critical insights for integrating perovskite solar cells into mainstream silicon technology."},{"t":"去泛素酶 DUO-1 主动维持秀丽隐杆线虫减数分裂特异性染色体结构","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2532671123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Meiotic prophase is characterized by a dynamic program in which germ cells undergo a complex series of associations and dissociations of protein complexes that drive assembly, remodeling, and disassembly of meiosis-specific chromosome structures and dramatic changes in chromosome compaction. Failure to properly coordinate these processes can result in improper chromosome segregation, producing aneuploid gametes and inviable zygotes. Here, we investigate the roles of\n                    Caenorhabditis elegans\n                    DUO-1, an ortholog of mammalian ubiquitin-specific proteases USP26 and USP29, in mediating these dynamic chromosomal events during meiotic prophase. Cytological analyses of\n                    duo-1\n                    null mutants indicate that loss of DUO-1 function leads to impaired assembly of meiotic chromosome axes and synaptonemal complexes (SCs), loss of integrity of meiotic chromosome axes, ineffective homolog pairing, premature separation of sister chromatids, and late-prophase chromosome decompaction. Further, axis/SC instability in\n                    duo-1\n                    mutants correlates with depletion of REC-8 cohesin complexes and is accompanied by massive accumulation of early DSB repair intermediates. By using a dual-AID-tagged allele to deplete DUO-1 during meiotic development, we demonstrate that DUO-1 is continually required throughout meiotic prophase progression, to promote proper axis/SC assembly in early prophase, to maintain axis/SC stability during the late pachytene stage, and to promote/maintain chromosome compaction at the end of meiotic prophase. Together, our data emphasize the importance of mechanisms that actively maintain meiotic chromosome structure and meiosis-specific chromosome architecture throughout meiotic prophase and implicate DUO-1 as a key player in these active maintenance processes."},{"t":"AI筛选小分子模板效应实现无枝晶锂金属电池的二维结构","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00079-2?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Matter","tg":"观点评论","tp":"无枝晶锂负极","kp":["[填料]: AI筛选2D LALZO纳米片","[电解质]: 复合聚合物电解质","[电池]: 无枝晶锂金属电池"],"dp":1,"as":"针对复合聚合物电解质在安全性和离子导电性上的固有局限，研究团队开发了AI驱动的分子筛选策略，利用特定小分子的模板效应引导锂离子沉积形成二维（2D）结构，从而有效抑制锂枝晶的不可控生长。该方法将人工智能高通量筛选与电解质设计结合，在提升固态/半固态电池安全性（抑制短路）的同时改善界面导电性，为高能量密度锂电池提供了新的工程化路径。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"AI-screened small-molecule templating effect enabling 2D architectures for dendrite-free lithium metal batteries","b":"To overcome the safety and conductivity limitations of composite polymer electrolytes, Zhou et al. developed an AI-screened sol-gel strategy to synthesize 2D LALZO nanosheets. These high-aspect-ratio fillers create a brick-and-mortar skeleton that reinforces the polymer matrix and establishes continuous ion-transport networks. The resulting electrolytes effectively suppress lithium dendrites, enabling long-life, high-performance all-solid-state lithium metal batteries with exceptional mechanical resilience and electrochemical stability."},{"t":"人工智能和博士生：朋友还是敌人？","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00843-y","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI影响学术","sc":0.9,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":1.0,"r":2.0,"d":0.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"单一疗程的抗生素可能会引起肠道微生物的持续变化","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00769-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"氮杂芳烃间位硫醇化的脱芳香[3,3]-Sigmatropic重排策略","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8135901?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Direct C–H functionalization of azaarenes stands as a remarkably powerful tool for diversifying these heterocycles. However, precise control over chemo‐ and site‐selectivity remains the primary challenge, largely stemming from the complex electronic features and numerous reactive sites inherent to azaarenes. Against this backdrop, developing innovative, efficient catalytic strategies, especially those enabling remote aromatic C─H bond activation, is not only of paramount significance but also a considerable synthetic challenge. Herein, we present an organocatalytic dearomative [3,3]‐sigmatropic rearrangement strategy, which achieves site‐selective C–H functionalization of quinolines with excellent chemoselectivity. Specifically, 1,8‐diazabicyclo[5.4.0]undec‐7‐ene (DBU) serves as a potent catalyst that facilitates a unique sequence of sulfinylation, dearomatization, [3,3]‐sigmatropic rearrangement, and rearomatization. Employing this cascade, a broad range of quinoline\n                    N\n                    ‐oxides undergo reaction with commercially available dimethylcarbamothioic chloride (DMTC) to selectively deliver\n                    meta\n                    ‐thiolated quinolines. The utility of this strategy is highlighted by its application to the late‐stage\n                    meta\n                    ‐thiolation of drug‐related compounds and the total synthesis of an organic light‐emitting device (OLED) material.","tp":"催化重排官能化","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发氮杂芳烃间位硫醇化的新策略，通过脱芳香[3,3]-σ重排反应实现远程芳香C-H键的选择性官能化。该方法突破了氮杂芳烃多位点反应性导致的化学与位置选择性控制难题，为杂环化合物多样化修饰提供高效催化方案。"},{"t":"[ASAP]调控镓柔性单原子纳米酶：通过多酶活性切换实现自适应催化性能","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23161","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子纳米酶","kp":["活性位点[柔性单原子纳米酶]: Ga-N3S动态重构","催化特性[FSAzyme]: 自适应多酶模拟活性"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"本研究设计了一种镓（Ga）基柔性单原子纳米酶，通过多酶活性切换实现自适应催化性能。传统无机纳米酶受限于刚性活性中心结构，缺乏天然酶的柔性构象适应能力。研究利用Ga单原子位点的配位环境柔性，使其在不同微环境条件下能在类氧化酶、类过氧化物酶和类过氧化氢酶等多种催化模式间自主切换，表现出类似天然酶的底物广谱适应性和pH响应性。该设计理念突破了纳米酶活性中心\"一刀切\"的局限，为智能仿生催化剂的设计提供了新范式。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Tailoring Ga Flexible Single-Atom Nanozymes for Self-Adaptive Catalytic Performance through Multienzyme Activity Switching","b":"Inorganic nanozymes remain limited by rigid active-center structures, lacking the adaptive flexibility of natural enzymes. Here we report a flexible single-atom nanozyme (FSAzyme) enabled by regulation of Ga coordination. A dynamically reconstructing Ga-N3S site exhibits self-adaptive electronic modulation, allowing the FSAzyme to realize multiple enzyme-mimicking activities and versatile sensing functions. These results establish a general design strategy to introduce enzyme-like adaptivity into single-atom nanozymes."},{"t":"[ASAP]宽禁带钙钛矿协同离子工程实现创纪录认证电压的钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.6c00419","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿有机叠层","kp":["[协同离子工程]: 宽禁带钙钛矿串联电池创纪录认证电压"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":2.0,"t":6.5},"as":"本研究通过协同离子工程策略优化宽禁带钙钛矿吸收层，实现了钙钛矿-有机叠层太阳能电池的纪录认证电压。钙钛矿-有机叠层结构中，宽带隙钙钛矿顶电池的开路电压长期受限于非辐射复合损失和相偏析问题。研究通过多种离子（如Cs+、Br-、Cl-等）的协同掺杂和梯度分布设计，有效抑制了宽带隙钙钛矿中的光致相分离和深能级缺陷，显著降低了开路电压损失，最终获得了经第三方认证的器件效率纪录。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Synergistic Ion Engineering for Wide-Bandgap Perovskite Enables Perovskite–Organic Tandem Solar Cells with a Record Certified Voltage","b":"Mixed-halide wide-bandgap (WBG) perovskites suffer from defect-induced open-circuit voltage (VOC) loss and photoinduced phase segregation. Herein, we introduce rubidium formate (RbFa) as a single dopant to mitigate both challenges through synergistic ion engineering. The Rb+ cation enters the lattice to induce contraction, while the formate anion (Fa–) modulates crystallization kinetics and passivates halide vacancies. This cooperative interaction maximizes residual compressive strain, thermodynamically raising the ion-migration barrier, while vacancy passivation kinetically blocks migration pathways. Consequently, we achieve a high VOC of 1.371 V and enhanced photostability for 1.86 eV WBG perovskite solar cells (PSCs). Monolithic perovskite–organic tandem solar cells deliver an efficiency of 26.03% with a record certified VOC of 2.189 V and retain over 90% of their initial efficiency after 1000 h under continuous 1-sun illumination."},{"t":"[ASAP] operando靶标特异性NMR监测活化中间体实现尿素电合成中选择性C–N偶联","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20888","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化尿素合成","kp":["催化剂[尿素电合成]: SnO2/CuOx异质结Sn:Cu=1:5.5","[C-N偶联]: 平衡*CO与*NH2OH吸附"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究利用原位靶特异性核磁共振（NMR）技术监测电催化尿素合成过程中的活化中间体，实现了CO₂与NO₃⁻的选择性C–N偶联。电催化尿素合成作为一种可持续的氮碳转化路线，长期受竞争副反应和低选择性的制约。研究团队通过NMR实时追踪关键中间体演化路径，精准识别反应网络中的活性物种，从而优化催化剂设计并提升C–N偶联效率。该原位表征策略为理解复杂电催化机理提供了新工具，对电化学合成含氮化学品具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Monitoring Activation Intermediates via Operando Target-Specific NMR Enables Selective C–N Coupling for Urea Electrosynthesis","b":"Electrocatalytic urea synthesis from CO2 and NO3- offers a sustainable nitrogen-carbon route but faces challenges from complex electron transfer and side reactions. Here, we design a SnO2/CuOx heterojunction catalyst with an optimized Sn:Cu ratio of 1:5.5, denoted as m-SnO2/CuOx, to promote C-N coupling by balancing *CO and *NH2OH adsorption. The m-SnO2/CuOx interface enables selective N-terminal hydrogenation of *NO to *NH2OH while suppressing the hydrogen evolution reaction and NH3 formation. In situ infrared spectroscopy reveals the site-specific activation of CO2 on SnO2 and NO3- on CuOx. Operando 1H, 13C, 15N, and 17O NMR confirms that *NH2OH couples with *CO via the *H2NCHO intermediate to form urea. Density functional theory calculations indicate that interfacial charge redistribution lowers energy barriers and stabilizes intermediates. The optimized catalyst delivers a urea yield of 215 mmol g-1 h-1 and a Faradaic efficiency of 72.18%. This study underscores the role of rational catalyst design, together with operando insights, in advancing efficient electrocatalytic urea production."},{"t":"极端场景驱动的风电集群与氢储能电站抗台风协调调度","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600320X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风电氢储协调调度","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Typhoon-resilient coordinated dispatch of wind farm cluster and hydrogen energy storage plant driven by extreme scenarios"},{"t":"调控空穴选择性材料端基以抑制倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池中的非辐射复合","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8473744?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"倒置钙钛矿电池","kp":["[空穴选择性材料]: 调控端基抑制倒置钙钛矿电池非辐射复合","[界面能级失配]: 驱动非辐射复合损失"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过调控空穴选择性材料的末端基团，有效抑制倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池中的非辐射复合损失。钙钛矿太阳能电池性能提升的关键瓶颈之一在于界面的非辐射复合。研究团队系统设计了一系列不同末端基团的空穴传输材料，优化其与钙钛矿层的界面能级匹配和缺陷钝化效果，显著降低界面复合速率，提升开路电压和填充因子。该策略为高效稳定倒置结构钙钛矿电池的界面工程提供了分子级设计思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Tuning Terminal Groups of Hole‐Selective Materials to Suppress Nonradiative Recombination in Inverted Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The performance of perovskite solar cells (PSCs) is critically constrained by nonradiative recombination at the perovskite/charge‐extraction interfaces, which limits their approach to the thermodynamic efficiency limit. Although extensive efforts have focused on passivating surface defects, the role of interfacial energy‐level mismatch in driving nonradiative losses remains insufficiently understood. In this work, we investigate the impact of valence band maximum (VBM) offsets between hole‐selective layers and perovskites on the nonradiative recombination losses in PSCs by tailoring the terminal groups of hole‐selective materials (HSMs). Our findings reveal that the minimized energetic barrier at the hole‐selective interface is conducive to achieving the maximum quasi‐Fermi level splitting (QFLS) in perovskites. Through precise energy‐level alignment at the buried HSM/perovskite interface via terminal group engineering, we achieved high power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 26.88% and 21.87% for PSCs based on 1.53 and 1.72 eV perovskites, respectively, with open‐circuit voltage (\n                    V\n                    OC\n                    ) value reaching 95% and 91% of their Shockley‐Queisser limit, respectively. Our results provide valuable insights for designing hole‐selective molecules and elucidating the relationship between nonradiative recombination losses and energy level alignment across different perovskite compositions."},{"t":"化石燃料衰退与可行替代方案探索：全球社会经济政治与技术约束下生物柴油、电动与生物沼气能源系统的批判性综述","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002990?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"清洁能源替代","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":5.0,"r":2.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"The decline of fossil fuels and the search for viable alternatives: A critical review of biodiesel, electric, and biogas energy systems under global socio-political and technical constraints"},{"t":"基于多智能体深度强化学习的智能产消者管理参与去中心化点对点市场","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003028?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多智能体电力交易","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Smart prosumers management based on multi-agent deep reinforcement learning to participate in decentralized peer-to-peer market"},{"t":"第二代结晶海绵能够在标准化条件下对不同分子进行一致的结构分析","d":"2026-03-17","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524615?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Crystallization is typically highly sensitive to even minor structural differences in target molecules. As a result, obtaining crystals of complex compounds often requires extensive trial‐and‐error experiments for each target molecule. We recently reported a second‐generation crystalline sponge (2G‐CS), in which a coordination cage is fixed within a crystal lattice. In the 2G‐CS, target molecules are first encapsulated within the cage in solution, followed by salt formation with a symmetry‐mismatched polyanion, leading to the formation of single crystals suitable for structure analysis. However, practical implementation still requires case‐by‐case optimization of crystallization conditions. In this study, we demonstrate that combining the cage with a specific polyanion enables crystallization of a wide range of structurally distinct guest molecules under a single set of standardized conditions. In a test set comprising 39 guest molecules, 31 cases (80%) were successfully crystallized using the same conditions. These examples include polar, medium‐sized, and structurally complex molecules, most of which are of pharmaceutical interest. Crystal structures showed that the polyanion induced a predominant packing type for cages and anions in crystals. We suggest that this recurrent packing type may contribute to the ability to obtain crystals under standardized conditions despite variations in guest structures.","tp":"结晶海绵结构分析","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发第二代结晶海绵（2G-CS），将配位笼固定在晶格内。目标分子先在溶液中被笼状结构包封，再通过盐形成实现晶体化。该方法克服了传统结晶对分子结构高度敏感的缺陷，可在标准化条件下对不同分子进行一致的晶体结构分析，大幅减少试错实验。"},{"t":"考虑多时间尺度不确定性与氢能集成的综合能源系统鲁棒容量优化与低碳改造","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002953?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源系统低碳改造","kp":["优化目标[综合能源系统]: 鲁棒容量优化低碳改造","[不确定性]: 多时间尺度"],"sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":4.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Robust capacity optimization and low-carbon retrofit of integrated energy systems considering multi-timescale uncertainties and hydrogen integration"},{"t":"光催化分解水制氢微反应器中气泡动力学与脱离机制研究进展综述","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926003053?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光催化分解水制氢","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Recent progress in bubble dynamics and detachment mechanisms of photocatalytic water splitting microreactors for H₂ production: a review"},{"t":"磷活化羧酸小分子正极用于高比容量长寿命铁有机电池","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-70800-w","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁离子电池","kp":["正极材料[铁有机电池]: 磷激活羧基小分子","[氧化还原活性]: 磷参与氧化还原","[负极]: Fe(低成本/合适电位/高容量)"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究报道了一种磷活化的羧酸类小分子正极材料，用于构建高比容量和长循环寿命的铁有机电池。铁离子电池因成本低廉和合适的氧化还原电位而成为有前景的储能体系，但有机正极材料的容量衰减问题限制了其实用化。研究团队通过磷活化策略增强羧酸基团的电化学活性，提升有机分子的电子传导性和结构稳定性，实现了显著高于传统铁电池的比容量和优异的长循环性能。该工作为低成本可持续有机电池正极设计提供了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Phosphorus-activated carboxyl small molecule positive electrode for high specific capacity and long-life iron-organic batteries","b":"Iron-ion batteries represent a compelling energy storage solution due to the cost-effectiveness, suitable redox potential, and high capacity of Fe negative electrodes. Polyaniline positive electrodes for iron-ion batteries have demonstrated promising electrochemical redox properties, but face limited redox-accessible groups and unstable −NH− sites. Here we show phosphorus redox activity in a carboxyl small molecule electrode. 4,4′,4″-phosphanetriyltribenzoic acid and 4,4′,4″-nitrilotribenzoic acid are designed via modulating the electron-donating P and tert-N motifs, showing tuned charge distributions and energy levels. With the decrease of the electronegativity and energy barrier (N > P), 4,4′,4″-phosphanetriyltribenzoic acid exhibits stronger Fe2+ coordination with carboxyl sites, and brings closed CF3SO3− proximity to P centers. This feature ensures high activity of carboxyl/phosphorus sites with low activation energy (0.24 vs. 0.29 eV for 4,4′,4″-nitrilotribenzoic acid). 4,4′,4″-phosphanetriyltribenzoic acid with P-extended conjugated structure achieves low energy gap (2.28 eV) compared to its individual carboxyl or P-containing counterparts (2.71/3.16 eV), thereby enabling high utilization of carboxyl/P motifs (98.5%) and enhanced redox voltage (0.8 V). A stable 4 e− Fe2+/CF3SO3− storage of 4,4′,4″-phosphanetriyltribenzoic acid positive electrode endows Fe battery with high specific capacity (276 mAh g−1) and cycling stability (60,000 cycles). This work highlights the potential of phosphorus-active organic materials toward iron-ion batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"表面自由基开环聚合制备超长聚对苯乙烯以获取非苯环型碳纳米带","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02092-y","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"导电高分子合成","kp":["[表面自由基开环聚合]: 合成超长聚对苯撑碳纳米带","链长[聚对苯撑]: ~100nm表面法vs~32nm溶液法"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究利用表面自由基开环聚合策略，合成了超长聚对苯撑（PPP），并成功构建非苯环型碳纳米带。聚对苯撑作为经典导电高分子，其链长的延伸对实现优异电学性能至关重要，但传统合成方法难以获得高分子量产物。研究团队在固体表面上通过精确设计的单体前驱体进行自由基开环聚合，实现了PPP链的有序超长延伸，进而通过表面化学转化获得拓扑结构独特的非苯环型碳纳米带。该工作为精密碳纳米结构的表面合成开辟了新路线。","dp":1,"ot":"On-surface radical ring-opening polymerization produces ultralong poly(para-phenylene) for access to non-benzenoid carbon nanoribbons","b":"Extending the chain lengths of conductive polymers, such as unsubstituted poly(para-phenylene) (PPP), is crucial for their application in high-performance organic devices and processing into high-quality functional materials. While surface-assisted Ullmann coupling has increased PPP chain lengths to ~100 nm, from ~32 nm achieved by solution-based reactions, its step-growth reaction mechanism limits further elongation. Here we report the synthesis of PPP via radical ring-opening polymerization of [6]cyclo(para-phenylene) on a Cu(111) surface. This process has been identified as a chain-growth polymerization, substantially enhancing the PPP chain length to the micrometre range (~0.9 μm). The obtained ultralong PPP chains on an otherwise clean surface undergo selective C–H bond scission, forming an upright-standing poly(para-benzyne) intermediate, which further couples into the unsubstituted biphenylene ribbon with length up to ~40 nm. The ring-opening polymerization provides a versatile route to high-quality polymers and non-benzenoid carbon nanoribbons with precise structural control."},{"t":"航空脱碳情景的数值优化：成熟能源载体与航空技术下交通量与排放的平衡","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002837?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"航空脱碳路径","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Numerical optimization of aviation decarbonization scenarios: balancing traffic and emissions with maturing energy carriers and aircraft technology"},{"t":"锂硫电池领域的中子机理映射：operando方法、标准化与AI辅助数据融合","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70803?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锂硫中子表征","kp":["[中子技术]: 探测Li-S电池轻元素与埋藏界面","[数据融合]: AI关联中子观测量与Li-S描述符"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.5},"as":"该综述系统阐述了中子技术在锂硫电池全景观机理研究中的应用，涵盖原位表征方法、标准化协议和AI辅助数据融合策略。中子技术对轻元素、埋藏界面和体相传输过程具有卓越灵敏度，非常适合研究锂硫电池中多硫离子穿梭和界面反应等关键问题。文章综述了中子衍射、中子反射和中子深度剖析等技术的工作原理及在锂硫电池中的最新应用进展，并讨论了AI驱动的多模态数据融合如何加速机理理解，为下一代高比能电池研发提供方法论指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Neutron‐Based Mechanistic Mapping Across the Li–S Battery Landscape: Operando Methods, Standardization, and AI‐Assisted Data Fusion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Neutron techniques provide exceptional sensitivity to light elements, buried interfaces, and bulk transport, making them uniquely suited for probing lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries, yet their application remains fragmented and insufficiently standardized. This Review develops a unified mechanistic mapping framework that links neutron observables to Li–S descriptors across multiple length and time scales, spanning fundamental and application‐relevant regimes. Imaging and tomography, small‐angle scattering (SANS), diffraction, reflectometry, quasielastic neutron spectroscopy (QENS), neutron depth profiling (NDP), and prompt‐gamma activation analysis (PGNAA) are integrated to resolve sulfur redox reactions, polysulfide transport, electrolyte and separator behavior, and lithium anode degradation under operando conditions. Practical guidelines are summarized for operando cell architectures, isotopic‐contrast design using H/D and\n                    6\n                    Li substitution, optimization of neutron flux and q‐range, and uncertainty‐aware data treatment. To address limitations in temporal resolution, chemical selectivity, and cross‐study comparability, the Review introduces an AI‐assisted, model‐based data‐fusion framework combining physics‐informed preprocessing with Bayesian optimization and neural‐network modeling. This approach enables quantitative reconstruction of sulfur‐phase evolution, interphase growth, and Li\n                    2\n                    S morphology under realistic conditions. A concluding roadmap identifies priority measurements, standardized metadata schemes, and benchmarks to accelerate reproducible Li–S research across global neutron facilities.","aip":1},{"t":"精准糖尿病伤口治疗中协同微环境重编程和 EpSC 复兴的纳米级联工程研讨会","d":"2026-03-17","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522987?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Chronic wounds are life‐threatening conditions characterized by impaired closure. Chronic inflammation and impaired regeneration and repair lead to the pathological phenotype of chronic diabetic wounds and reduce drug efficacy. In this study, we found that the poor proliferative and differentiative ability of epidermal stem cells (EpSCs) within an inflammatory microenvironment is a key factor contributing to the delayed healing of chronic diabetic wounds. To address this issue, we designed a nanocascade engineering workshop (Cu\n                    5.4\n                    O@LL‐37/pDNA) capable of simultaneously reshaping the inflammatory microenvironment and activating EpSC functions to promote rapid wound closure. The workshop used a core–shell structure design. The core, an ultrasmall Cu\n                    5.4\n                    O nanozyme, can efficiently eliminate reactive oxygen species, enhance the inflammatory response, and transform the pathological wound microenvironment into a niche facilitating regeneration. The shell is constructed through the electrostatic assembly of plasmid DNA (pDNA) and the antibacterial peptide LL‐37, enhancing gene transfection efficiency and inhibiting bacterial infection effectively. By leveraging its dual advantages in microenvironment modulation and structural design, the system substantially improves gene delivery and facilitates sustained P311 expression, thereby promoting EpSC proliferation and differentiation. This nanotherapy reshaping the microenvironment and activating EpSC function accelerates re‐epithelialization and wound closure in both diabetes and infection models. This treatment strategy is a novel approach to achieve durable and effective healing in chronic wounds."},{"t":"建筑冷水机组与热泵系统建模方法：数字孪生应用背景下的系统性综述","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002849?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"热泵系统建模","kp":["[主题]: 制冷与热泵系统建模","[视角]: 数字孪生应用"],"sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":2.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Modeling methods for chiller and heat pump systems in buildings: A systematic review in the context of digital twin applications"},{"t":"\"无负极\"固态电池中使用金属中间层时电沉积锂的微观结构及其循环演化","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07230A","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无负极锂沉积","kp":["[无负极固态电池]: 金属中间层均化锂沉积","[锂沉积微观结构]: 中间层提升覆盖度降低晶粒尺寸"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究利用原位表征手段揭示了无负极固态电池中金属夹层对锂沉积微观结构及其循环演化行为的影响。无负极（anode-free）结构可避免处理高反应活性锂金属箔的安全风险，但电沉积锂的形貌不均匀性影响循环稳定性。研究团队在集流体与固态电解质间引入金属夹层，系统考察了锂成核、生长和剥离过程中微观结构的演化规律，发现夹层可有效调控锂沉积的均匀性并抑制枝晶生长。该工作为无负极固态电池的界面工程提供了实验依据。","dp":1,"ot":"Microstructure of Electrodeposited Lithium and its Evolution During Cycling when Using Metal Interlayers in \"Anode-Free\" Solid-State Batteries","b":"\"Reservoir-free\" construction of solid state batteries could circumvent the handling of reactive lithium metal foils and further increase the energy density. Metallic interlayers could play an important role in the homogenization of the deposited lithium layer by increasing the coverage of the deposit and additionally reducing the size of the lithium grains. To date, the influence of different interlayers and the influence of stripping on the lithium microstructure is still unknown. This work analyzes the influence of gold, silver and bismuth interlayers on the microstructure of electrodeposited lithium layers using electron backscatter diffraction (EBSD) on cross-sections prepared by broad ion-milling. In addition, partially stripped lithium layers and thus the influence of stripping on the lithium microstructure are analyzed using the mentioned interlayers. Our findings reveal that different interlayer materials result in different lithium microstructures. In addition, stripping also causes a significant change in the lithium microstructure, both in terms of grain size and grain orientation, gaining a deeper understanding of the lithium microstructure and its impact."},{"t":"MARLEM：去中心化本地能源市场中隐式合作的多智能体强化学习仿真框架","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926001984?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多智能体能源协调","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"MARLEM: A multi-agent reinforcement learning simulation framework for implicit cooperation in decentralized local energy markets"},{"t":"液态燃料在未来低碳能源系统中是否有一席之地？——全球能源系统建模与本地能源港口集群参与的持续交互","d":"2026-03-17","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926002928?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"低碳液体燃料","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":4.5,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Is there a role for liquid fuels in future low-carbon energy systems? – A continuous interaction between global energy systems modeling and local energy port cluster participation"},{"t":"无脊椎动物 miRNA pva-small RNA-11881/pva-miR-11881 作为一种潜在的基于 RNA 的针对感染虾白斑综合症病毒的治疗方法","d":"2026-03-17","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525793123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Small RNAs and microRNAs (miRNAs) play diverse roles in host virus interactions and hold promise for therapeutic applications. An uncharacterized shrimp miRNA with potent activity against white spot syndrome virus (WSSV), a major double-stranded DNA pathogen in aquaculture, was identified and characterized. Among the 1,239 differentially expressed unannotated small RNAs in\n                    Penaeus vannamei\n                    hemocytes, one of the most strongly downregulated candidates, termed pva-small RNA-11881 or pva-miR-11881, was predicted to target multiple WSSV genes. A pva-small RNA-11881/pva-miR-11881 isomir that originates from the 5′ untranslated region of a host\n                    lipase 3-like\n                    gene was identified. Its primary transcript contains Drosha and Dicer processing sites, and the precursor exhibits canonical pre-miRNA features. In vivo administration of its primary transcript, pva-pri-miR-11881, significantly reduced WSSV copy number and improved shrimp survival. Mechanistically, pva-miR-11881 directly suppresses crucial WSSV genes\n                    WSSV004\n                    ,\n                    WSSV164\n                    , and\n                    WSSV419\n                    and modulates the host immune response against WSSV infection by enhancing phenoloxidase activity, thereby reducing apoptosis and necrosis, and promoting caspase-1-mediated cell death. These findings reveal that the pva-miR-11881 in\n                    P. vannamei\n                    holds strong potential as a biotherapeutic agent for managing viral diseases in shrimp.","tp":"对虾抗病毒miRNA","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究鉴定并表征了一种对虾白斑综合征病毒（WSSV）具有强抑制活性的未注释miRNA——pva-miR-11881。该miRNA在凡纳滨对虾血细胞中显著下调，作为基于RNA的治疗手段，有望应对水产养殖中WSSV这一主要双链DNA病原体的威胁。"},{"t":"细胞外镁离子对连接蛋白36半通道功能状态以及生物物理和结构特性的影响","d":"2026-03-17","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2538150123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Connexin36 (Cx36) is highly expressed in inhibitory and excitatory neurons as well as pancreatic β-cells, where it forms gap junction channels that coordinate metabolic and electrical responses. In addition, Cx36 forms hemichannels in pancreatic β-cells, where it may play a critical role in endocrine cell signaling. Despite this, the regulatory mechanisms and biophysical properties of Cx36 HCs remain poorly understood. Using HeLa cells lacking endogenous expression of large-pore channels and transfected with mouse Cx36-EGFP, we evaluated hemichannel activity through dye uptake assays and membrane current recordings. We found that Cx36 hemichannel activity is strongly inhibited by extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    , rather than Ca\n                    2+\n                    , in contrast to hemichannels formed by other connexins. Under reduced extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    , or under alkaline extracellular pH conditions, Cx36 hemichannels exhibited increased activity and allowed Ca\n                    2+\n                    influx, as detected by ratiometric dye FURA-2. Under low extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    conditions, Cx36 hemichannels exhibited increased permeability to small molecules and were blocked by La\n                    3+\n                    and quinine, but not by high glucose concentration. In-silico studies revealed interactions between Mg\n                    2+\n                    and two amino acid residues within a pore constriction (D47–E49), which alter the electrostatic potential of the hemichannel pore. Consistent with these observations, mutation of either amino acid residue to alanine (D47A or E49A) markedly reduced the inhibitory effect of extracellular Mg\n                    2+\n                    . Together, these findings offer critical insights into the regulation of Cx36 hemichannels and suggest that alterations in Mg\n                    2+\n                    homeostasis may have significant consequences for Cx36-mediated signaling."}]);